},"biography":"**생애.** 2126년 세대. 구로·금천 공단 조합에서 자랐다. 공방 원로들은 규격 없는 개조를 내치며 가르쳤다. 경비대가 공방을 제압하면 공방 제작 조합은 군수 공장이 된다. 대림 기숙은 이 조합 안의 숙소다.\n**관직.** 품계 조합장. 직함은 공방 제작 조합 조합장. 생업 별명은 제작평의회 중재자.\n**가문.** 진주 강씨 구로 공방가. 관리인. 부품 도면함이 이 가문의 열쇠다.\n**관계.** 한재목에게 펌프 부품을 댄다. 정호준과 기술 공개 범위를 다툰다. 백온의 난민 시민권을 지지한다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 공방 제작 조정\n- 품계: 조합장\n- 직함: 공방 제작 조합 조합장\n- 업무 위치: 구로5동.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"최한결","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"펌프·차륜 부품 공급 계약"},{"from":"정시우","type":"스승과 제자","to":"강민서","basis":"제작 규격을 중재자에게 제자로 배움"},{"from":"김나율","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"교환 설계를 조합 현장에서 집행"},{"from":"이강묵","type":"경쟁","to":"강민서","basis":"군수 독점과 중재 권한을 겨룸"},{"from":"박소언","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"공정 분할을 건물조합에서 받침"},{"from":"박하율","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"필요 부품을 서남 규격으로 공급받음"},{"from":"신보람","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":""},{"from":"윤초아","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"복구복무 시민권 문안을 참고"},{"from":"조우찬","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"수리 규격을 작업반에 적용"},{"from":"여시온","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"강민서의 공방 제작 조합 평의회 선언을 구로 골목에 붙이며"},{"from":"란민준","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"강민서의 자발적 성인 복구복무 문안을 참고하며"},{"from":"단건우","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"강민서의 수리 규격을 문안에 옮기며"},{"from":"근우람","type":"맹세","to":"강민서","basis":"강민서의 복구복무 시민권 연대를 증언의 바탕으로 삼고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0030', 'c815-acbd-c8fc-912d', '{"id":"person-0030","name":"Jeong Siu","title":"Cheonwang Base Production Elder","position":"Cheonwang Base Production Elder","characterId":"K030","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Pump Maintenance & Gauging","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#Inmul-Jeong-Siu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0030","birthDate":"2069-05-17","birthday":"05-17","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":14,"effective":14},"learning":{"base":13,"effective":13},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k030-pump-shaft-repair","name":"Pump-shaft repair","rating":70},{"id":"k030-component-measuring","name":"Dispatch component measurement","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"k030-no-unmeasured-modification","name":"Reject unmeasured modifications","description":"Treats improvised changes outside standards as accident risks.","behavior":"Treats improvised changes outside standards as accident risks.","stress":"That the guards would carve separate munitions-only screws, and the civil repair network would lose compatibility overnight.","relationship":"Near a standards apprentice to Gang Minseo, allied in wheels with Choi Hangyeol, the Free City train master, and permitting no standards revision without Jang Wooseok''s record stamps.","effects":[]},{"id":"k030-compatible-civilian-repair","name":"Maintain civilian compatibility","description":"Matches wheel and pump tolerances and rejects unrecorded revisions.","behavior":"Matches wheel and pump tolerances and rejects unrecorded revisions.","stress":"That the guards would carve separate munitions-only screws, and the civil repair network would lose compatibility overnight.","relationship":"Near a standards apprentice to Gang Minseo, allied in wheels with Choi Hangyeol, the Free City train master, and permitting no standards revision without Jang Wooseok''s record stamps.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Worn-shaft replacement and dispatch measurement support proficiency. A completed universal compatibility ledger and new-machine invention are unconfirmed.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41370-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K030","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41370-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c815-acbd-c8fc-912d","name":"Gyeongju Jeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c815-acbd-c8fc-912d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":5,"Force":-5,"Material":35,"Communal":40,"Principle":10,"Public":40,"Eligibility":50,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":30},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":5,"Display":15,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Pump Maintenance & Gauging","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Cheonwang Base Production Elder","Work Location":"Oryu 2-dong. At the Cheonwang Base in Oryu 2-dong, Jeong Siu measures the worn shaft of a stalled pump and matches it to the drawings. Until the measurement seal is stamped, he does not open that part''s shipment slot on Pyo Yedam''s siding dispatch board, and he sends the specification revision record to Jang Useok.","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 5 | Force −5 | Material 35 | Communal 40 | Principle 10 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 50 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 30","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly −30 | Risk 5 | Display 15 | Persistence −5 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up in the Sinjeong Rail Depot. The post of Cheonwang Base Fabrication Elder opened after a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Work location: Oryu 2-dong. At the Cheonwang Base in Oryu 2-dong, Jeong Siu measures the worn shaft of a stalled pump and matches it to the drawings. Until the measurement seal is stamped, he does not open that part''s shipment slot on Pyo Yedam''s siding dispatch board, and he sends the specification revision record to Jang Useok.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Cheonwang Base Production Elder. He stamps a measurement seal on every part shipped, and modified parts without a seal are not admitted to the Cheonwang siding.","Anecdote":"In 2125 he disassembled a stalled pump, ground down just one worn shaft, and got it running again. Because of this, his signature for the post of Cheonwang Base Fabrication Elder was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"With Gang Minseo, close to a standards master-pupil relationship; in a wheel alliance with Free City Train Chief Choe Hangyeol; permits no revision of standards without Jang Useok''s record seal.","Ambition":"To fix the compatibility table for wheel and pump screws across all of Seoul into a single Cheonwang ledger, forming the backbone of the Workshop Production Guild.","Fear":"The Guard Corps cutting munitions-only screws separately, so that the civilian repair network becomes incompatible overnight.","Intervention":"By bringing in the measured tolerances of a sealed screw, one can break the Elder''s seal, or by finding the hidden drawings of a screw made exclusively for military use, one can expose the split in the standards."},"biography":"Taciturn, he remembers people by the tolerance of their fingertips. He sees improvised modifications that are not in the specification not as talent but as seeds of accidents.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Pump Maintenance & Gauging\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Cheonwang Base Production Elder\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up in the Sinjeong Rail Depot. The post of Cheonwang Base Fabrication Elder opened after a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Work location: Oryu 2-dong. At the Cheonwang Base in Oryu 2-dong, Jeong Siu measures the worn shaft of a stalled pump and matches it to the drawings. Until the measurement seal is stamped, he does not open that part''s shipment slot on Pyo Yedam''s siding dispatch board, and he sends the specification revision record to Jang Useok.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Cheonwang Base Production Elder. He stamps a measurement seal on every part shipped, and modified parts without a seal are not admitted to the Cheonwang siding.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 he disassembled a stalled pump, ground down just one worn shaft, and got it running again. Because of this, his signature for the post of Cheonwang Base Fabrication Elder was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** With Gang Minseo, close to a standards master-pupil relationship; in a wheel alliance with Free City Train Chief Choe Hangyeol; permits no revision of standards without Jang Useok''s record seal.\n\n**Ambition.** To fix the compatibility table for wheel and pump screws across all of Seoul into a single Cheonwang ledger, forming the backbone of the Workshop Production Guild.\n\n**Fear.** The Guard Corps cutting munitions-only screws separately, so that the civilian repair network becomes incompatible overnight.\n\n**Intervention.** By bringing in the measured tolerances of a sealed screw, one can break the Elder''s seal, or by finding the hidden drawings of a screw made exclusively for military use, one can expose the split in the standards.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 5 | Force −5 | Material 35 | Communal 40 | Principle 10 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 50 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 30\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly −30 | Risk 5 | Display 15 | Persistence −5 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jeong Siu","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Gang Minseo","basis":"Learns fabrication standards under the Arbiter as a pupil"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Choe Dain","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jeong Siu","basis":"Bound to the chair''s measurement through tolerance mentorship"},{"from":"Jang Useok","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Siu","basis":"Verifies the measurement seal against the standards ledger"},{"from":"Heo Daon","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jeong Siu","basis":"Is bound to Jeong Siu through tolerance mentorship, and"},{"from":"Pyo Gangho","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Siu","basis":"Protects Jeong Siu''s measurement seal with verification messages, and"},{"from":"Pyo Yedam","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Siu","basis":"Ties dispatch to Jeong Siu''s measurement seal, and"},{"from":"Bae Ongyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Siu","basis":"Separates Jeong Siu''s elder authority from compensation, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0030","name":"정시우","title":"천왕기지 제작원로","position":"천왕기지 제작원로","characterId":"K030","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"펌프 정비·계측","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-정시우","detailRoute":"/people/person-0030","birthDate":"2069-05-17","birthday":"05-17","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":14,"effective":14},"learning":{"base":13,"effective":13},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k030-pump-shaft-repair","name":"펌프 축 수리","rating":70},{"id":"k030-component-measuring","name":"출고 부품 계측","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"k030-no-unmeasured-modification","name":"미계측 개조 거부","description":"규격 없는 임시 개조를 사고의 씨앗으로 본다.","behavior":"규격 없는 임시 개조를 사고의 씨앗으로 본다.","stress":"경비대가 군수 전용 나사를 따로 깎아 민간 수리망이 하루아침에 호환 불능이 되는 것.","relationship":"강민서와는 규격의 스승과 제자에 가깝고, 자유도시 열차장 최한결과 차륜 동맹이며, 장우석의 기록 날인 없이 규격 개정을 허용하지 않는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k030-compatible-civilian-repair","name":"민간 호환 유지","description":"차륜과 펌프의 공차를 맞추고 기록 없는 개정을 거부한다.","behavior":"차륜과 펌프의 공차를 맞추고 기록 없는 개정을 거부한다.","stress":"경비대가 군수 전용 나사를 따로 깎아 민간 수리망이 하루아침에 호환 불능이 되는 것.","relationship":"강민서와는 규격의 스승과 제자에 가깝고, 자유도시 열차장 최한결과 차륜 동맹이며, 장우석의 기록 날인 없이 규격 개정을 허용하지 않는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"마모 축 교체와 출고 계측이 숙련의 근거다. 전역 호환 원장 완성이나 신기계 발명은 확인되지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41370-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K030","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41370-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c815-acbd-c8fc-912d","name":"경주 정씨","crest":"clan-crests/c815-acbd-c8fc-912d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":5,"무력":-5,"물질":35,"공동":40,"원칙":10,"공개":40,"자격":50,"분산":15,"변혁":30},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-30,"위험":5,"과시":15,"지속":-5,"지향":"이성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"펌프 정비·계측","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"천왕기지 제작원로","업무 위치":"오류2동. 정시우는 오류2동 천왕기지에서 정지한 펌프의 마모 축을 재어 도면과 맞춘다. 계측 도장을 찍기 전에는 표예담의 유치배차판에 그 부품의 출고 칸을 열지 않고 장우석에게 규격 개정 기록을 보낸다.","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 5 | 무력 −5 | 물질 35 | 공동 40 | 원칙 10 | 공개 40 | 자격 50 | 분산 15 | 변혁 30","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −30 | 위험 5 | 과시 15 | 지속 −5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 천왕기지 제작원로 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 오류2동. 정시우는 오류2동 천왕기지에서 정지한 펌프의 마모 축을 재어 도면과 맞춘다. 계측 도장을 찍기 전에는 표예담의 유치배차판에 그 부품의 출고 칸을 열지 않고 장우석에게 규격 개정 기록을 보낸다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 천왕기지 제작원로. 출고 부품마다 계측 도장을 찍고, 도장 없는 개조품은 천왕 유치선에 들이지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 정지했던 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 갈아 다시 돌렸다. 이 일로 천왕기지 제작원로 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"강민서와는 규격의 스승과 제자에 가깝고, 자유도시 열차장 최한결과 차륜 동맹이며, 장우석의 기록 날인 없이 규격 개정을 허용하지 않는다.","야망":"서울 전역 차륜·펌프 나사의 호환표를 천왕 원장 하나로 고정해 공방 제작 조합의 뼈대를 만든다.","공포":"경비대가 군수 전용 나사를 따로 깎아 민간 수리망이 하루아침에 호환 불능이 되는 것.","개입":"봉인 나사의 실측 공차를 가져와 원로의 봉인을 풀거나, 군수 전용 나사의 숨은 도면을 찾아 규격 분열을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"과묵하고 손끝의 공차로 사람을 기억한다. 규격서에 없는 임시 개조를 재능이 아니라 사고의 씨앗으로 본다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 펌프 정비·계측\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 천왕기지 제작원로\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 천왕기지 제작원로 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 오류2동. 정시우는 오류2동 천왕기지에서 정지한 펌프의 마모 축을 재어 도면과 맞춘다. 계측 도장을 찍기 전에는 표예담의 유치배차판에 그 부품의 출고 칸을 열지 않고 장우석에게 규격 개정 기록을 보낸다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 천왕기지 제작원로. 출고 부품마다 계측 도장을 찍고, 도장 없는 개조품은 천왕 유치선에 들이지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 정지했던 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 갈아 다시 돌렸다. 이 일로 천왕기지 제작원로 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 강민서와는 규격의 스승과 제자에 가깝고, 자유도시 열차장 최한결과 차륜 동맹이며, 장우석의 기록 날인 없이 규격 개정을 허용하지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 서울 전역 차륜·펌프 나사의 호환표를 천왕 원장 하나로 고정해 공방 제작 조합의 뼈대를 만든다.\n\n**공포.** 경비대가 군수 전용 나사를 따로 깎아 민간 수리망이 하루아침에 호환 불능이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 봉인 나사의 실측 공차를 가져와 원로의 봉인을 풀거나, 군수 전용 나사의 숨은 도면을 찾아 규격 분열을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 5 | 무력 −5 | 물질 35 | 공동 40 | 원칙 10 | 공개 40 | 자격 50 | 분산 15 | 변혁 30\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −30 | 위험 5 | 과시 15 | 지속 −5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"정시우","type":"스승과 제자","to":"강민서","basis":"제작 규격을 중재자에게 제자로 배움"}],"incoming":[{"from":"최다인","type":"스승과 제자","to":"정시우","basis":"공차 지도로 회장 계측에 묶임"},{"from":"장우석","type":"계약","to":"정시우","basis":"계측 도장을 규격 원장에서 검증"},{"from":"허다온","type":"스승과 제자","to":"정시우","basis":"정시우에게 공차 지도로 묶여 있고"},{"from":"표강호","type":"계약","to":"정시우","basis":"정시우의 계측 도장을 검증 전갈로 지키며"},{"from":"표예담","type":"계약","to":"정시우","basis":"정시우의 계측 도장에 배차를 묶으며"},{"from":"배온결","type":"계약","to":"정시우","basis":"정시우의 원로 권한을 보상과 분리하고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0031', 'ae40-ad11-c0b0-91d1', '{"id":"person-0031","name":"Kim Nayul","title":"Guro Labor Union Clerk","position":"Guro Labor Union Clerk","characterId":"K031","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Shift Records","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#person-gim-nayul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0031","birthDate":"2090-09-13","birthday":"09-13","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k031-labor-register-check","name":"Labor-register crosscheck","rating":65},{"id":"k031-fire-register-rescue","name":"Fire register recovery","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k031-public-skill-points","name":"Publish skill scores","description":"Treats foremen hiding skill scores as enemies of the union.","behavior":"Treats foremen hiding skill scores as enemies of the union.","stress":"That the guards would pen strike workshops behind barrier gates and use the union roster as a military registry.","relationship":"An alliance executing Gang Minseo''s exchange design in the field, backing Baek On''s refugee citizenship demand with the union vote, and holding a grudge against I Gangmuk''s hardline mobilization orders.","effects":[]},{"id":"k031-labor-not-military","name":"Boundary of labor records","description":"Supports citizenship demands and resents coercive mobilization.","behavior":"Supports citizenship demands and resents coercive mobilization.","stress":"That the guards would pen strike workshops behind barrier gates and use the union roster as a military registry.","relationship":"An alliance executing Gang Minseo''s exchange design in the field, backing Baek On''s refugee citizenship demand with the union vote, and holding a grudge against I Gangmuk''s hardline mobilization orders.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Overnight register comparison and saving a register in a fire are evidence. Supports citizenship solidarity while excluding unregistered labor from motions.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41390-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K031","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41390-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ae40-ad11-c0b0-91d1","name":"Gwangsan Gim Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ae40-ad11-c0b0-91d1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":10,"Force":-15,"Material":45,"Communal":40,"Principle":5,"Public":30,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-5,"Display":20,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Shift Records","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Guro Labor Union Clerk","Work Location":"Guro 2-dong. At the Guro 2-dong Labor Union blackboard, Gim Nayul cross-checks the shift roster against Baek On''s citizenship list.","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 10 | Force −15 | Material 45 | Communal 40 | Principle 5 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 60 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 20","Desires":"Craving −5 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −5 | Display 20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up on duty in the waiting hall. The post of Guro Labor Union Clerk opened through a substitute duty shift covering an unexcused absence.\n- Work location: Guro 2-dong. At the Guro 2-dong Labor Union blackboard, Gim Nayul cross-checks the shift roster against Baek On''s citizenship list.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Guro Labor Union Clerk. She writes work-crew shifts and skill scores on the public blackboard, and she does not put labor lacking citizenship registration on the Guild Council agenda.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"An ally who carries out Gang Minseo''s exchange design on the ground, supports Baek On''s demand for refugee citizenship with union votes, and holds a grudge against I Gangmuk''s hardline mobilization order.","Ambition":"To enter the winter care places for the neighbors'' children in the ledger first, so that even in a winter short of hands the children can stay together in one room.","Fear":"That the Guard Corps will confine strike workshops behind blast doors and rewrite the union roster as a military household register.","Intervention":"By protecting the skill roster of the strike workshop, one can pass Gim Nayul''s citizenship proposal, or by exposing the manipulation of the sabotage list, one can shake her clerkship."},"biography":"Gentle in debate, but she spends nights cross-checking the sabotage list after a consensus is reached. She regards foremen who hide skill scores as enemies of the union.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Shift Records\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Guro Labor Union Clerk\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up on duty in the waiting hall. The post of Guro Labor Union Clerk opened through a substitute duty shift covering an unexcused absence.\n- Work location: Guro 2-dong. At the Guro 2-dong Labor Union blackboard, Gim Nayul cross-checks the shift roster against Baek On''s citizenship list.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. She writes work-crew shifts and skill scores on the public blackboard, and she does not put labor lacking citizenship registration on the Guild Council agenda.\n\n**Relations.** An ally who carries out Gang Minseo''s exchange design on the ground, supports Baek On''s demand for refugee citizenship with union votes, and holds a grudge against I Gangmuk''s hardline mobilization order.\n\n**Ambition.** To enter the winter care places for the neighbors'' children in the ledger first, so that even in a winter short of hands the children can stay together in one room.\n\n**Fear.** That the Guard Corps will confine strike workshops behind blast doors and rewrite the union roster as a military household register.\n\n**Intervention.** By protecting the skill roster of the strike workshop, one can pass Gim Nayul''s citizenship proposal, or by exposing the manipulation of the sabotage list, one can shake her clerkship.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 10 | Force −15 | Material 45 | Communal 40 | Principle 5 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 60 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −5 | Display 20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Kim Nayul","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Minseo","basis":"Enforces exchange designs at the guild worksite"},{"from":"Kim Nayul","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":"Supports refugee citizenship with union votes"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bak Haeun","type":"Contract","to":"Kim Nayul","basis":""},{"from":"Son Tayeon","type":"Contract","to":"Kim Nayul","basis":"Gim Nayul checks the actual shifts and registrations so that the same person does not remain as two laborers."},{"from":"Cha Donghwan","type":"Contract","to":"Kim Nayul","basis":"Cha Donghwan relays to Gim Nayul the time and personnel records of the Guard Corps who demanded the list. Gim Nayul checks the shifts and citizenship registrations and examines the traces of the restoration-service list having been used as a copy of the military household register."},{"from":"Cha Yewon","type":"Contract","to":"Kim Nayul","basis":"Cha Yewon hands Gim Nayul a copy of the restoration-service workers'' citizenship lines, matched against the original registry. Gim Nayul checks the actual shift and registration records and separates the labor records to be put on the Council agenda from the military household register copy the Guard Corps demands."},{"from":"Gu Chansol","type":"Contract","to":"Kim Nayul","basis":"A contract that ties Gim Nayul''s skill roster to freight permits, and"},{"from":"Je Haon","type":"Contract","to":"Kim Nayul","basis":"A contract that fixes Gim Nayul''s clerk roster as the ledger, and"},{"from":"Go Morae","type":"Contract","to":"Kim Nayul","basis":"Separates Gim Nayul''s union clerkship from the sentence of refusal, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0031","name":"김나율","title":"구로 노동조합 서기","position":"구로 노동조합 서기","characterId":"K031","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"교대 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-김나율","detailRoute":"/people/person-0031","birthDate":"2090-09-13","birthday":"09-13","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k031-labor-register-check","name":"노동 명부 대조","rating":65},{"id":"k031-fire-register-rescue","name":"화재 장부 회수","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k031-public-skill-points","name":"숙련 점수 공개","description":"숙련 점수를 숨긴 반장을 조합의 적으로 본다.","behavior":"숙련 점수를 숨긴 반장을 조합의 적으로 본다.","stress":"경비대가 파업 공방을 차단문으로 가두고 조합 명부를 군사호적으로 바꿔 쓰는 것.","relationship":"강민서의 교환 설계를 현장에서 집행하는 동맹이고, 백온의 난민 시민권 요구를 조합 표로 지지하며, 이강묵의 강경 동원령에는 원한을 품는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k031-labor-not-military","name":"노동 명부의 경계","description":"시민권 요구를 지지하고 강경 동원에 원한을 남긴다.","behavior":"시민권 요구를 지지하고 강경 동원에 원한을 남긴다.","stress":"경비대가 파업 공방을 차단문으로 가두고 조합 명부를 군사호적으로 바꿔 쓰는 것.","relationship":"강민서의 교환 설계를 현장에서 집행하는 동맹이고, 백온의 난민 시민권 요구를 조합 표로 지지하며, 이강묵의 강경 동원령에는 원한을 품는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"밤샘 명부 대조와 화재에서 장부를 구한 선택이 근거다. 시민권 연대를 지지하지만 미등록 노동을 안건에 올리지 않는 제한도 있다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41390-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K031","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41390-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ae40-ad11-c0b0-91d1","name":"광산 김씨","crest":"clan-crests/ae40-ad11-c0b0-91d1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":10,"무력":-15,"물질":45,"공동":40,"원칙":5,"공개":30,"자격":60,"분산":20,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":-20,"위험":-5,"과시":20,"지속":-15,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"교대 기록","품계":"조합원","직함":"구로 노동조합 서기","업무 위치":"구로2동. 김나율은 구로2동 노동조합 칠판에서 교대 명부와 백온의 시민권 명단을 대조한다.","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 10 | 무력 −15 | 물질 45 | 공동 40 | 원칙 5 | 공개 30 | 자격 60 | 분산 20 | 변혁 20","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −5 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 구로 노동조합 서기 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로2동. 김나율은 구로2동 노동조합 칠판에서 교대 명부와 백온의 시민권 명단을 대조한다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 구로 노동조합 서기. 작업반 교대와 숙련 점수를 공개 칠판에 쓰고, 시민권 미등록 노동은 길드 평의회 안건으로 올리지 않는다.","일화":"","관계":"강민서의 교환 설계를 현장에서 집행하는 동맹이고, 백온의 난민 시민권 요구를 조합 표로 지지하며, 이강묵의 강경 동원령에는 원한을 품는다.","야망":"공방 곁 거처에서 이웃 아이들의 겨울 돌봄 자리를 먼저 장부에 올려, 일손이 모자란 겨울에도 아이들이 한 방에서 지내게 한다.","공포":"경비대가 파업 공방을 차단문으로 가두고 조합 명부를 군사호적으로 바꿔 쓰는 것.","개입":"파업 공방의 숙련 명부를 지켜 김나율의 시민권안을 통과시키거나, 태업 명단 조작을 밝혀 서기직을 흔들 수 있다."},"biography":"토론에서는 온화하나 합의 뒤의 태업 명단을 밤새 대조한다. 숙련 점수를 숨기는 반장을 조합의 적으로 본다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 교대 기록\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 구로 노동조합 서기\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 구로 노동조합 서기 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로2동. 김나율은 구로2동 노동조합 칠판에서 교대 명부와 백온의 시민권 명단을 대조한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 구로 노동조합 서기. 작업반 교대와 숙련 점수를 공개 칠판에 쓰고, 시민권 미등록 노동은 길드 평의회 안건으로 올리지 않는다.\n\n**관계.** 강민서의 교환 설계를 현장에서 집행하는 동맹이고, 백온의 난민 시민권 요구를 조합 표로 지지하며, 이강묵의 강경 동원령에는 원한을 품는다.\n\n**야망.** 공방 곁 거처에서 이웃 아이들의 겨울 돌봄 자리를 먼저 장부에 올려, 일손이 모자란 겨울에도 아이들이 한 방에서 지내게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 경비대가 파업 공방을 차단문으로 가두고 조합 명부를 군사호적으로 바꿔 쓰는 것.\n\n**개입.** 파업 공방의 숙련 명부를 지켜 김나율의 시민권안을 통과시키거나, 태업 명단 조작을 밝혀 서기직을 흔들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 10 | 무력 −15 | 물질 45 | 공동 40 | 원칙 5 | 공개 30 | 자격 60 | 분산 20 | 변혁 20\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −5 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"김나율","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"교환 설계를 조합 현장에서 집행"},{"from":"김나율","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":"난민 시민권을 조합 표로 지지"}],"incoming":[{"from":"박하은","type":"계약","to":"김나율","basis":""},{"from":"손타연","type":"계약","to":"김나율","basis":"김나율은 실제 교대와 등록을 확인해 같은 사람이 두 명의 노동 인원으로 남지 않게 한다."},{"from":"차동환","type":"계약","to":"김나율","basis":"차동환은 명단을 요구한 경비대의 시각·인원 기록을 김나율에게 전한다. 김나율은 교대와 시민권 등록을 확인해 복구복무 명단이 군사호적 사본으로 쓰인 흔적을 살핀다."},{"from":"차예원","type":"계약","to":"김나율","basis":"차예원은 등기 원본과 맞춘 복구복무자 시민권 줄의 사본을 김나율에게 넘긴다. 김나율은 실제 교대·등록 기록을 확인해 평의회 안건에 올릴 노동 기록과 경비대가 요구하는 군사호적 사본을 구분한다."},{"from":"구찬솔","type":"계약","to":"김나율","basis":"김나율의 숙련 명부를 화물 허가에 묶는 계약이고"},{"from":"제하온","type":"계약","to":"김나율","basis":"김나율의 서기 명부를 원장으로 고정하는 계약이고"},{"from":"고모래","type":"계약","to":"김나율","basis":"김나율의 조합 서기와 거부 문장을 나누고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0032', 'c774-acbd-c8fc-674e', '{"id":"person-0032","name":"I Gangmuk","title":"Geumcheon Guard Captain","position":"Geumcheon Guard Captain","characterId":"K032","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Guard & Patrol","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#Person-I-Gangmuk","detailRoute":"/people/person-0032","birthDate":"2084-12-02","birthday":"12-02","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":11,"effective":11}},"skills":[{"id":"k032-unauthorized-crosser-restraint","name":"Unauthorized-crosser restraint","rating":60},{"id":"k032-security-code-change","name":"Security-passcode change","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k032-speed-over-deliberation","name":"Speed before deliberation","description":"Lowers barriers when discussion runs long.","behavior":"Lowers barriers when discussion runs long.","stress":"That the labor union would stop parts releases, the guards would hold empty barrier gates, and the outskirts would be pierced by looting.","relationship":"Seeing Gang Minseo as the needed mediator but competing over the munitions monopoly, trading barrier-gate tactics with Jang Seogyun, the Amsa officer, and holding a roster grudge with Kim Nayul.","effects":[]},{"id":"k032-selective-responsibility","name":"Responsibility for troops’ families","description":"Provides for subordinates’ families but reads union delays as betrayal.","behavior":"Provides for subordinates’ families but reads union delays as betrayal.","stress":"That the labor union would stop parts releases, the guards would hold empty barrier gates, and the outskirts would be pierced by looting.","relationship":"Seeing Gang Minseo as the needed mediator but competing over the munitions monopoly, trading barrier-gate tactics with Jang Seogyun, the Amsa officer, and holding a roster grudge with Kim Nayul.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Apprehension, code changes, and council-bypassing mobilization are evidence. Militarizing ambition is retained without granting large-scale war victories.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41410-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K032","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41410-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c774-acbd-c8fc-674e","name":"Gyeongju I Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c774-acbd-c8fc-674e.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-30,"Openness":20,"Force":-15,"Material":30,"Communal":50,"Principle":5,"Public":30,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":30},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-30,"Display":20,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Guard & Patrol","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Geumcheon Guard Captain","Work Location":"Gasan-dong. At the Gasan-dong barrier gate, I Gangmuk matches the night patrol password tags against the workshop entry records. When he demands a separate release of military supplies, he runs up against the double contract of Chae Riul, who holds Kim Nayul''s citizenship register, and he passes the barrier-gate tactics records to Jang Seogyun.","Values":"Authority −30 | Openness 20 | Force −15 | Material 30 | Community 50 | Principle 5 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 55 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 30","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Amsa guard post. The post of Geumcheon Guard Captain opened up after he caught an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- Workplace: Gasan-dong. At the Gasan-dong barrier gate, I Gangmuk matches the night patrol password tags against the workshop entry records. When he demands a separate release of military supplies, he runs up against the double contract of Chae Riul, who holds Kim Nayul''s citizenship register, and he passes the barrier-gate tactics records to Jang Seogyun.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Geumcheon Guard Captain. He publishes his public-order results on the street bulletin board, but keeps the emergency mobilization password only in the officer''s notebook, bypassing the Guild Council.","Anecdote":"In 2125 he caught a night-time unauthorized river crosser and changed the guard password tags. Because of this, his signature for the post of Geumcheon Guard Captain was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"He sees Gang Minseo as a necessary mediator but competes with him over the military supply monopoly, trades barrier-gate tactics with Amsa officer Jang Seogyun, and holds a grudge with Kim Nayul over the register.","Ambition":"To form a separate repair line for roofs and stoves from spare hands, so that no dwelling is left waiting for repairs through the winter.","Fear":"The labor union halts parts shipments, so the guard corps guards only empty barrier gates and is overrun by outer-district looting.","Intervention":"You can hand the secret weapons-production notebook over to the Guild Council, or justify his mobilization order by jointly stopping the outer-district looting."},"biography":"He regards speed as justice, and when debate drags on he drops the barrier gate first. He takes responsibility for his subordinates'' family rations, but reads the union''s delays as betrayal.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Occupation: Guard & Patrol\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Geumcheon Guard Captain\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Amsa guard post. The post of Geumcheon Guard Captain opened up after he caught an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- Workplace: Gasan-dong. At the Gasan-dong barrier gate, I Gangmuk matches the night patrol password tags against the workshop entry records. When he demands a separate release of military supplies, he runs up against the double contract of Chae Riul, who holds Kim Nayul''s citizenship register, and he passes the barrier-gate tactics records to Jang Seogyun.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Geumcheon Guard Captain. He publishes his public-order results on the street bulletin board, but keeps the emergency mobilization password only in the officer''s notebook, bypassing the Guild Council.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 he caught a night-time unauthorized river crosser and changed the guard password tags. Because of this, his signature for the post of Geumcheon Guard Captain was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** He sees Gang Minseo as a necessary mediator but competes with him over the military supply monopoly, trades barrier-gate tactics with Amsa officer Jang Seogyun, and holds a grudge with Kim Nayul over the register.\n\n**Ambition.** To form a separate repair line for roofs and stoves from spare hands, so that no dwelling is left waiting for repairs through the winter.\n\n**Fear.** The labor union halts parts shipments, so the guard corps guards only empty barrier gates and is overrun by outer-district looting.\n\n**Intervention.** You can hand the secret weapons-production notebook over to the Guild Council, or justify his mobilization order by jointly stopping the outer-district looting.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −30 | Openness 20 | Force −15 | Material 30 | Community 50 | Principle 5 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 55 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 30\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Polyamorous\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K029","name":"Gang Minseo","relationKind":"direct-liege","ownerTerm":"Direct Superior","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K032","members":[{"personId":"K041","name":"Chae Riul"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"I Gangmuk","type":"Rivalry","to":"Gang Minseo","basis":"Contests the munitions monopoly and arbitration authority"},{"from":"I Gangmuk","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Seogyun","basis":"Trading Barrier-Gate Tactics with a Godeok Officer"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Jang Seogyun","type":"Contract","to":"I Gangmuk","basis":"Trading Barrier-Gate Tactics with the Seonam Guard"},{"from":"Chae Riul","type":"Command","to":"I Gangmuk","basis":"A double contract in which he takes I Gangmuk''s barrier-gate command while guarding Kim Nayul''s citizenship register"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0032","name":"이강묵","title":"금천 경비대장","position":"금천 경비대장","characterId":"K032","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"경비·순찰","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-이강묵","detailRoute":"/people/person-0032","birthDate":"2084-12-02","birthday":"12-02","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":11,"effective":11}},"skills":[{"id":"k032-unauthorized-crosser-restraint","name":"무단 도하자 검거","rating":60},{"id":"k032-security-code-change","name":"경비 암호패 변경","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k032-speed-over-deliberation","name":"토론보다 속도","description":"토론이 길어지면 차단문을 내린다.","behavior":"토론이 길어지면 차단문을 내린다.","stress":"노동조합이 부품 출고를 멈춰 경비대가 빈 차단문만 지키다 외곽 약탈에 뚫리는 것.","relationship":"강민서를 필요한 중재자로 보나 군수 독점에서는 경쟁하고, 암사 장교 장석윤과 차단문 전술을 거래하며, 김나율과는 명부를 둘러싼 원한이다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k032-selective-responsibility","name":"부하 가족의 책임","description":"부하 가족 배급은 챙기지만 조합 지연은 배신으로 읽는다.","behavior":"부하 가족 배급은 챙기지만 조합 지연은 배신으로 읽는다.","stress":"노동조합이 부품 출고를 멈춰 경비대가 빈 차단문만 지키다 외곽 약탈에 뚫리는 것.","relationship":"강민서를 필요한 중재자로 보나 군수 독점에서는 경쟁하고, 암사 장교 장석윤과 차단문 전술을 거래하며, 김나율과는 명부를 둘러싼 원한이다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"무단 도하 검거와 암호 변경, 평의회를 우회한 동원이 근거다. 강경한 군사화 야망을 남기되 실제 대규모 전쟁 승리를 발급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41410-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K032","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41410-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c774-acbd-c8fc-674e","name":"경주 이씨","crest":"clan-crests/c774-acbd-c8fc-674e.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-30,"개방":20,"무력":-15,"물질":30,"공동":50,"원칙":5,"공개":30,"자격":55,"분산":15,"변혁":30},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-20,"위험":-30,"과시":20,"지속":-10,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"경비·순찰","품계":"조합원","직함":"금천 경비대장","업무 위치":"가산동. 이강묵은 가산동 차단문 앞에서 야간 순찰 암호패와 공방 출입 기록을 맞춘다. 군수 물량의 별도 반출을 요구할 때에는 김나율의 시민권 명부를 맡은 채리울의 이중 계약과 부딪히고, 장석윤에게는 차단문 전술 기록을 돌린다.","가치관":"권위 −30 | 개방 20 | 무력 −15 | 물질 30 | 공동 50 | 원칙 5 | 공개 30 | 자격 55 | 분산 15 | 변혁 30","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 금천 경비대장 자리는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 가산동. 이강묵은 가산동 차단문 앞에서 야간 순찰 암호패와 공방 출입 기록을 맞춘다. 군수 물량의 별도 반출을 요구할 때에는 김나율의 시민권 명부를 맡은 채리울의 이중 계약과 부딪히고, 장석윤에게는 차단문 전술 기록을 돌린다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 금천 경비대장. 치안 실적을 거리 게시판에 공개하지만, 비상 동원 암호는 장교 수첩에만 남겨 길드 평의회를 우회한다.","일화":"2125년 야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡아 경비 암호패를 갈았다. 이 일로 금천 경비대장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"강민서를 필요한 중재자로 보나 군수 독점에서는 경쟁하고, 암사 장교 장석윤과 차단문 전술을 거래하며, 김나율과는 명부를 둘러싼 원한이다.","야망":"남는 일손으로 지붕과 난로 수리 줄을 따로 꾸려, 겨울 동안 수리가 늦는 거처가 없도록 한다.","공포":"노동조합이 부품 출고를 멈춰 경비대가 빈 차단문만 지키다 외곽 약탈에 뚫리는 것.","개입":"비밀 무기 생산 수첩을 길드 평의회에 넘기거나, 외곽 약탈을 함께 막아 그의 동원령을 정당화할 수 있다."},"biography":"속도를 정의로 여기고, 토론이 길어지면 차단문부터 내린다. 부하 가족의 배급은 책임지되 조합 쪽 지연은 배신으로 읽는다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 경비·순찰\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 금천 경비대장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 금천 경비대장 자리는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 가산동. 이강묵은 가산동 차단문 앞에서 야간 순찰 암호패와 공방 출입 기록을 맞춘다. 군수 물량의 별도 반출을 요구할 때에는 김나율의 시민권 명부를 맡은 채리울의 이중 계약과 부딪히고, 장석윤에게는 차단문 전술 기록을 돌린다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 금천 경비대장. 치안 실적을 거리 게시판에 공개하지만, 비상 동원 암호는 장교 수첩에만 남겨 길드 평의회를 우회한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡아 경비 암호패를 갈았다. 이 일로 금천 경비대장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 강민서를 필요한 중재자로 보나 군수 독점에서는 경쟁하고, 암사 장교 장석윤과 차단문 전술을 거래하며, 김나율과는 명부를 둘러싼 원한이다.\n\n**야망.** 남는 일손으로 지붕과 난로 수리 줄을 따로 꾸려, 겨울 동안 수리가 늦는 거처가 없도록 한다.\n\n**공포.** 노동조합이 부품 출고를 멈춰 경비대가 빈 차단문만 지키다 외곽 약탈에 뚫리는 것.\n\n**개입.** 비밀 무기 생산 수첩을 길드 평의회에 넘기거나, 외곽 약탈을 함께 막아 그의 동원령을 정당화할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −30 | 개방 20 | 무력 −15 | 물질 30 | 공동 50 | 원칙 5 | 공개 30 | 자격 55 | 분산 15 | 변혁 30\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K029","name":"강민서","relationKind":"direct-liege","ownerTerm":"직속 상관","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K032","members":[{"personId":"K041","name":"채리울"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"이강묵","type":"경쟁","to":"강민서","basis":"군수 독점과 중재 권한을 겨룸"},{"from":"이강묵","type":"계약","to":"장석윤","basis":"차단문 전술을 고덕 장교와 거래"}],"incoming":[{"from":"장석윤","type":"계약","to":"이강묵","basis":"차단문 전술을 서남 경비와 거래"},{"from":"채리울","type":"지휘","to":"이강묵","basis":"이강묵의 차단문 지휘를 받되 김나율의 시민권 명부를 지키는 이중 계약이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0033', 'bc15-bc00-c591', '{"id":"person-0033","name":"Bak Soeon","title":"Guro Building Guild Representative","position":"Guro Building Guild Representative","characterId":"K033","rank":"Guild Master","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Waiting Hall Duty","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#Person-Park-Soeon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0033","birthDate":"2098-09-12","birthday":"09-12","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k033-work-shift-negotiation","name":"Work-shift negotiation","rating":65},{"id":"k033-building-bids","name":"Building-bid administration","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k033-safety-not-bargaining","name":"Safety outside bargaining","description":"Does not bargain over roof or trunk-line safety.","behavior":"Does not bargain over roof or trunk-line safety.","stress":"That a work lamp leaking light during roof repair draws outside machines, and the accident becomes the pretext for abducting guild members and demanding ransom.","relationship":"An alliance backing the workshop guild''s work division on the building side, matching ledgers with the food guild''s fuel tables, and clashing whenever pulling repair hands away delayed roof work.","effects":[]},{"id":"k033-homes-before-draft","name":"Protect home repairs","description":"Contests engineering drafts that take workers from roof repairs.","behavior":"Contests engineering drafts that take workers from roof repairs.","stress":"That a work lamp leaking light during roof repair draws outside machines, and the accident becomes the pretext for abducting guild members and demanding ransom.","relationship":"An alliance backing the workshop guild''s work division on the building side, matching ledgers with the food guild''s fuel tables, and clashing whenever pulling repair hands away delayed roof work.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Negotiates overnight with a slow-down crew and administers public bids. Fixed repair lotteries remain a goal, and a title alone grants no building trade skill.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41170-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K033","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc15-bc00-c591","name":"Miryang Bak Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc15-bc00-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-55,"Openness":15,"Force":-5,"Material":35,"Communal":40,"Principle":0,"Public":30,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":30,"Display":-20,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Waiting Hall Duty","Rank":"Guild Master","Title":"Guro Building Guild Representative","Work Location":"Guro 3-dong. Park Soeon gathers the Guro 3-dong Building Association''s applications for roof and household power repairs and makes the lottery order public. When a demand comes to divert hands to one side first, she separately records the materials the next shift will use, and she consults the fuel ledger to set the work order of the assigned workshops.","Values":"Authority −55 | Openness 15 | Force −5 | Material 35 | Community 40 | Principle 0 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 40 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness −40 | Risk 30 | Display −20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Unspecified | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Raised on waiting-hall duty. The post of Guro Building Guild Representative opened through a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Work location: Guro 3-dong. Bak So-eon gathers the Guro 3-dong Building Guild''s roof and residential power repair applications and discloses the lottery order. If a demand comes to divert hands to one side first, she separately records the materials the next shift will use, then checks the fuel ledger to set the work order of the assigned workshops.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Master. Title: Guro Building Guild Representative. Power equipment and pump installations are put out to open bidding building by building, and the winning workshop must share its skill scores with the labor union.","Anecdote":"In 2125 she spent a night negotiating terms with a slowdown work crew and opened the next shift. For this, her signature for the post of Guro Building Guild Representative was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"An ally who backs the workshop guild''s work division from the buildings'' side, she matches ledgers with the food guild''s fuel tables, and she clashes whenever pulling repair hands away delays roof work.","Ambition":"Fix the repair order of workshop buildings and residential shells by guild lottery, so that munitions work crews cannot seize residential power first.","Fear":"That a work lamp leaking light during roof repair draws outside machines, and the accident becomes the pretext for abducting members and demanding ransom.","Intervention":"She can obtain replacement stove parts to break the seal, or expose the bid-rigging ledger to reopen the guild lottery."},"biography":"She enjoys practical gain, but never makes the safety of roofs and main power lines a bargaining chip. She long remembers anyone who looks down on residents'' votes compared with skilled workers.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Waiting Hall Duty\n- Rank: Guild Master\n- Title: Guro Building Guild Representative\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Raised on waiting-hall duty. The post of Guro Building Guild Representative opened through a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Work location: Guro 3-dong. Bak So-eon gathers the Guro 3-dong Building Guild''s roof and residential power repair applications and discloses the lottery order. If a demand comes to divert hands to one side first, she separately records the materials the next shift will use, then checks the fuel ledger to set the work order of the assigned workshops.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Master. Title: Guro Building Guild Representative. Power equipment and pump installations are put out to open bidding building by building, and the winning workshop must share its skill scores with the labor union.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 she spent a night negotiating terms with a slowdown work crew and opened the next shift. For this, her signature for the post of Guro Building Guild Representative was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** An ally who backs the workshop guild''s work division from the buildings'' side, she matches ledgers with the food guild''s fuel tables, and she clashes whenever pulling repair hands away delays roof work.\n\n**Ambition.** Fix the repair order of workshop buildings and residential shells by guild lottery, so that munitions work crews cannot seize residential power first.\n\n**Fear.** That a work lamp leaking light during roof repair draws outside machines, and the accident becomes the pretext for abducting members and demanding ransom.\n\n**Intervention.** She can obtain replacement stove parts to break the seal, or expose the bid-rigging ledger to reopen the guild lottery.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −55 | Openness 15 | Force −5 | Material 35 | Communal 40 | Principle 0 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 45 | Dispersion 40 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Monopoly −40 | Risk 30 | Display −20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation None | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K029","name":"Gang Minseo","relationKind":"direct-liege","ownerTerm":"Direct Superior","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K033","members":[{"personId":"K049","name":"Byeon Jua"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bak Soeon","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Minseo","basis":"Backs the process division at the building guild"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gu Chansol","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Soeon","basis":"Dispatching building repair materials to Bak So-eon first,"},{"from":"Myeong Dahae","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Soeon","basis":"Watching the results of Bak So-eon''s roof repair lottery together at the market pillar,"},{"from":"Byeon Jua","type":"Command","to":"Bak Soeon","basis":"Receiving direction to enforce Bak So-eon''s bid results by circuit color,"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0033","name":"박소언","title":"구로 건물조합 대표","position":"구로 건물조합 대표","characterId":"K033","rank":"조합장","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"대합실 당직","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-박소언","detailRoute":"/people/person-0033","birthDate":"2098-09-12","birthday":"09-12","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k033-work-shift-negotiation","name":"작업반 교대 협의","rating":65},{"id":"k033-building-bids","name":"건물 입찰 운영","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k033-safety-not-bargaining","name":"안전은 흥정 밖","description":"지붕과 전력 간선 안전을 흥정거리로 삼지 않는다.","behavior":"지붕과 전력 간선 안전을 흥정거리로 삼지 않는다.","stress":"지붕 보수 때 새어 나간 작업등이 바깥 기계를 불러들이고, 그 사고를 구실로 조합원이 납치되어 몸값을 요구받는 것.","relationship":"공방 조합의 작업 분할을 건물 쪽에서 받쳐 주는 동맹이고, 식량 조합의 연료표와 장부를 맞대며, 수리 일손을 먼저 빼 가는 일이 지붕 공사를 늦출 때 충돌한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k033-homes-before-draft","name":"주거 수리 보호","description":"공병 차출이 지붕 공사를 빼앗을 때 충돌한다.","behavior":"공병 차출이 지붕 공사를 빼앗을 때 충돌한다.","stress":"지붕 보수 때 새어 나간 작업등이 바깥 기계를 불러들이고, 그 사고를 구실로 조합원이 납치되어 몸값을 요구받는 것.","relationship":"공방 조합의 작업 분할을 건물 쪽에서 받쳐 주는 동맹이고, 식량 조합의 연료표와 장부를 맞대며, 수리 일손을 먼저 빼 가는 일이 지붕 공사를 늦출 때 충돌한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"태업 작업반과 밤새 조건을 나누고 공개 입찰을 운영한다. 수리 순서 추첨 고정은 목표이며 건설 전문 숙련은 직함으로 주지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41170-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K033","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc15-bc00-c591","name":"밀양 박씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc15-bc00-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-55,"개방":15,"무력":-5,"물질":35,"공동":40,"원칙":0,"공개":30,"자격":45,"분산":40,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-40,"위험":30,"과시":-20,"지속":-15,"지향":"무성향","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"대합실 당직","품계":"조합장","직함":"구로 건물조합 대표","업무 위치":"구로3동. 박소언은 구로3동 건물조합의 지붕과 민가 전력 수리 신청을 모아 추첨 순서를 밝힌다. 일손을 한쪽으로 먼저 돌리려는 요구가 오면 다음 교대가 쓸 자재를 따로 적고 연료 장부를 보고 맡은 공방의 작업 순서를 정한다.","가치관":"권위 −55 | 개방 15 | 무력 −5 | 물질 35 | 공동 40 | 원칙 0 | 공개 30 | 자격 45 | 분산 40 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −40 | 위험 30 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 구로 건물조합 대표 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로3동. 박소언은 구로3동 건물조합의 지붕과 민가 전력 수리 신청을 모아 추첨 순서를 밝힌다. 일손을 한쪽으로 먼저 돌리려는 요구가 오면 다음 교대가 쓸 자재를 따로 적고 연료 장부를 보고 맡은 공방의 작업 순서를 정한다.","관직":"품계 조합장. 직함은 구로 건물조합 대표. 전력 장치와 펌프 설치를 건물 단위로 공개 입찰하고, 낙찰 공방은 숙련 점수를 노동조합과 공유해야 한다.","일화":"2125년 태업 작업반과 밤새 조건을 나눠 다음 교대를 열었다. 이 일로 구로 건물조합 대표 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"공방 조합의 작업 분할을 건물 쪽에서 받쳐 주는 동맹이고, 식량 조합의 연료표와 장부를 맞대며, 수리 일손을 먼저 빼 가는 일이 지붕 공사를 늦출 때 충돌한다.","야망":"공방 건물과 주거 쉘의 수리 순서를 조합 추첨으로 고정해, 군수 작업반이 민가 전력을 선점하지 못하게 한다.","공포":"지붕 보수 때 새어 나간 작업등이 바깥 기계를 불러들이고, 그 사고를 구실로 조합원이 납치되어 몸값을 요구받는 것.","개입":"대체 난로 부품을 구해 봉인을 풀거나, 입찰 담합 장부를 폭로해 조합 추첨을 다시 열 수 있다."},"biography":"실리를 즐기되 지붕과 전력 간선의 안전을 흥정거리로 삼지 않는다. 숙련공보다 거주 표를 얕보는 사람을 오래 기억한다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 대합실 당직\n- 품계: 조합장\n- 직함: 구로 건물조합 대표\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 구로 건물조합 대표 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로3동. 박소언은 구로3동 건물조합의 지붕과 민가 전력 수리 신청을 모아 추첨 순서를 밝힌다. 일손을 한쪽으로 먼저 돌리려는 요구가 오면 다음 교대가 쓸 자재를 따로 적고 연료 장부를 보고 맡은 공방의 작업 순서를 정한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합장. 직함은 구로 건물조합 대표. 전력 장치와 펌프 설치를 건물 단위로 공개 입찰하고, 낙찰 공방은 숙련 점수를 노동조합과 공유해야 한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 태업 작업반과 밤새 조건을 나눠 다음 교대를 열었다. 이 일로 구로 건물조합 대표 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 공방 조합의 작업 분할을 건물 쪽에서 받쳐 주는 동맹이고, 식량 조합의 연료표와 장부를 맞대며, 수리 일손을 먼저 빼 가는 일이 지붕 공사를 늦출 때 충돌한다.\n\n**야망.** 공방 건물과 주거 쉘의 수리 순서를 조합 추첨으로 고정해, 군수 작업반이 민가 전력을 선점하지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 지붕 보수 때 새어 나간 작업등이 바깥 기계를 불러들이고, 그 사고를 구실로 조합원이 납치되어 몸값을 요구받는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대체 난로 부품을 구해 봉인을 풀거나, 입찰 담합 장부를 폭로해 조합 추첨을 다시 열 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −55 | 개방 15 | 무력 −5 | 물질 35 | 공동 40 | 원칙 0 | 공개 30 | 자격 45 | 분산 40 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −40 | 위험 30 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K029","name":"강민서","relationKind":"direct-liege","ownerTerm":"직속 상관","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K033","members":[{"personId":"K049","name":"변주아"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"박소언","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"공정 분할을 건물조합에서 받침"}],"incoming":[{"from":"구찬솔","type":"계약","to":"박소언","basis":"박소언의 건물 수리 자재를 우선 배차하며"},{"from":"명다해","type":"계약","to":"박소언","basis":"박소언의 지붕 수리 추첨 결과를 시장 기둥에서 함께 본다"},{"from":"변주아","type":"지휘","to":"박소언","basis":"박소언의 입찰 결과를 회로 색으로 집행하는 지휘를 받고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0034', 'cd5c-c218-c131-5d14', '{"id":"person-0034","name":"Choe Dain","title":"Engineer Work Crew Foreman","position":"Engineer Work Crew Foreman","characterId":"K034","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Waiting Hall Duty","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#person-Choe-Da-in","detailRoute":"/people/person-0034","birthDate":"2091-02-06","birthday":"02-06","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"k034-crew-negotiation","name":"Crew-condition negotiation","rating":65},{"id":"k034-barrier-track-repair","name":"Barrier and track repair","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k034-seal-before-night-draft","name":"Seal before night draft","description":"Follows armed night drafts only after the council seal.","behavior":"Follows armed night drafts only after the council seal.","stress":"That when self-grown food ran out, engineers would turn into ration requisition squads, and repair labor''s citizenship would vanish.","relationship":"Bound to Jeong Siwoo as a machine-shop apprentice, approving I Gangmuk''s night formations only at the last, and sharing squads with Park Soeon''s roof-work crews.","effects":[]},{"id":"k034-restoration-not-requisition","name":"Restoration without requisition","description":"Seeks to preserve restoration workers’ citizenship.","behavior":"Seeks to preserve restoration workers’ citizenship.","stress":"That when self-grown food ran out, engineers would turn into ration requisition squads, and repair labor''s citizenship would vanish.","relationship":"Bound to Jeong Siwoo as a machine-shop apprentice, approving I Gangmuk''s night formations only at the last, and sharing squads with Park Soeon''s roof-work crews.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Condition negotiation, repairs, and tolerance learning are confirmed. Engineering formation does not establish exceptional personal combat or conquest.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41430-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K034","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41430-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd5c-c218-c131-5d14","name":"Choe clan of Suseong","crest":"clan-crests/cd5c-c218-c131-5d14.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":5,"Force":-5,"Material":30,"Communal":35,"Principle":15,"Public":20,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":-30,"Display":-25,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Waiting Hall Duty","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Engineer Work Crew Foreman","Work Location":"Oryu 2-dong. In Oryu 2-dong, Choe Da-in reads out to the work crew the repair order for the frozen southwest track and blast gates. Until Jeong Si-u''s measured tolerances come out, he does not fit parts from the Cheonwang side, and he writes down the roof construction personnel withdrawn from Bak So-eon and hands them over to the next day shift.","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 5 | Force −5 | Material 30 | Communal 35 | Principle 15 | Transparency 20 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 20","Desires":"Craving −5 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −30 | Display −25 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Multi-partner"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Raised on waiting-hall duty. The post of Engineer Crew Chief opened through a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Work location: Oryu 2-dong. In Oryu 2-dong, Choe Da-in reads out to the work crew the repair order for the frozen southwest track and blast gates. Until Jeong Si-u''s measured tolerances come out, he does not fit parts from the Cheonwang side, and he writes down the roof construction personnel withdrawn from Bak So-eon and hands them over to the next day shift.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Engineer Work Crew Foreman. Blast gate and track repairs are disclosed on the day shift, and night armed requisitions are obeyed only with the seal of the Guild Council.","Anecdote":"In 2125 he spent a night negotiating terms with a slowdown work crew and opened the next shift. For this, his signature for the post of Engineer Crew Chief was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"He is bound to Jeong Si-u as a tolerance teacher-and-pupil, approves I Gang-muk''s night deployments only at the very last, and shares workforce and work crews with Bak So-eon''s roof construction.","Ambition":"To form a snow-clearing crew so that goods can keep moving along the southwest outer rail line even in winter, keeping the track open.","Fear":"That their own food runs out, the engineers turn into a provisions-requisition squad, and the citizenship of restoration labor disappears.","Intervention":"He can join the outer track repairs to help Choe Da-in lay the standard, or leave the provisions-requisition order as evidence to block the work crew vote."},"biography":"Bold and quick-handed, he looks at welded seams rather than rank badges. He hates orders to leave a finished blast gate open for political bargaining.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Occupation: Waiting Hall Duty\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Engineer Work Crew Foreman\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Raised on waiting-hall duty. The post of Engineer Crew Chief opened through a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Work location: Oryu 2-dong. In Oryu 2-dong, Choe Da-in reads out to the work crew the repair order for the frozen southwest track and blast gates. Until Jeong Si-u''s measured tolerances come out, he does not fit parts from the Cheonwang side, and he writes down the roof construction personnel withdrawn from Bak So-eon and hands them over to the next day shift.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Engineer Work Crew Foreman. Blast gate and track repairs are disclosed on the day shift, and night armed requisitions are obeyed only with the seal of the Guild Council.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 he spent a night negotiating terms with a slowdown work crew and opened the next shift. For this, his signature for the post of Engineer Crew Chief was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** He is bound to Jeong Si-u as a tolerance teacher-and-pupil, approves I Gang-muk''s night deployments only at the very last, and shares workforce and work crews with Bak So-eon''s roof construction.\n\n**Ambition.** To form a snow-clearing crew so that goods can keep moving along the southwest outer rail line even in winter, keeping the track open.\n\n**Fear.** That their own food runs out, the engineers turn into a provisions-requisition squad, and the citizenship of restoration labor disappears.\n\n**Intervention.** He can join the outer track repairs to help Choe Da-in lay the standard, or leave the provisions-requisition order as evidence to block the work crew vote.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 5 | Force −5 | Material 30 | Communal 35 | Principle 15 | Transparency 20 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −30 | Display −25 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Choe Dain","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jeong Siu","basis":"Bound to the chair''s measurement through tolerance mentorship"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Heo Daon","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Dain","basis":"Putting wheels to Choe Da-in''s engineer work crew,"},{"from":"Myeong Soi","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Choe Dain","basis":"Bound to Choe Da-in as a tolerance teacher-and-pupil and sharing the outer track laying,"},{"from":"Gi Pilho","type":"Rivalry","to":"Choe Dain","basis":"Contending with Choe Da-in''s engineer work crew over the dispatch order,"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0034","name":"최다인","title":"공병 작업반장","position":"공병 작업반장","characterId":"K034","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"대합실 당직","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-최다인","detailRoute":"/people/person-0034","birthDate":"2091-02-06","birthday":"02-06","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"k034-crew-negotiation","name":"작업반 조건 협의","rating":65},{"id":"k034-barrier-track-repair","name":"차단문·선로 보수","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k034-seal-before-night-draft","name":"야간 차출의 도장","description":"야간 무장 차출은 평의회 도장 뒤에 따른다.","behavior":"야간 무장 차출은 평의회 도장 뒤에 따른다.","stress":"자체 식량이 바닥나 공병이 군량 징발대로 바뀌고 복구 노동의 시민권이 사라지는 것.","relationship":"정시우에게 공차 지도로 묶여 있고, 이강묵의 야간 편성을 마지막에야 승인하며, 박소언의 지붕 공사 인력과 작업반을 나눠 쓴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k034-restoration-not-requisition","name":"복구를 징발로 바꾸지 않는다","description":"복구 노동의 시민권을 지키려 한다.","behavior":"복구 노동의 시민권을 지키려 한다.","stress":"자체 식량이 바닥나 공병이 군량 징발대로 바뀌고 복구 노동의 시민권이 사라지는 것.","relationship":"정시우에게 공차 지도로 묶여 있고, 이강묵의 야간 편성을 마지막에야 승인하며, 박소언의 지붕 공사 인력과 작업반을 나눠 쓴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"조건 협의와 보수 수행, 공차 학습이 확인된다. 공병 편성을 개인 전투 탁월함이나 무력 정복 실적으로 읽지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41430-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K034","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41430-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd5c-c218-c131-5d14","name":"수성 최씨","crest":"clan-crests/cd5c-c218-c131-5d14.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":5,"무력":-5,"물질":30,"공동":35,"원칙":15,"공개":20,"자격":60,"분산":20,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":0,"위험":-30,"과시":-25,"지속":30,"지향":"이성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"대합실 당직","품계":"조합원","직함":"공병 작업반장","업무 위치":"오류2동. 최다인은 오류2동에서 결빙한 남서 선로와 차단문의 보수 순서를 작업반에 읽어 준다. 정시우의 실측 공차가 나오기 전에는 천왕 쪽 부품을 끼우지 않고, 박소언에게 빠지는 지붕 공사 인원을 적어 다음 낮 교대로 넘긴다.","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 5 | 무력 −5 | 물질 30 | 공동 35 | 원칙 15 | 공개 20 | 자격 60 | 분산 20 | 변혁 20","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 0 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −25 | 지속 30 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 공병 작업반장 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 오류2동. 최다인은 오류2동에서 결빙한 남서 선로와 차단문의 보수 순서를 작업반에 읽어 준다. 정시우의 실측 공차가 나오기 전에는 천왕 쪽 부품을 끼우지 않고, 박소언에게 빠지는 지붕 공사 인원을 적어 다음 낮 교대로 넘긴다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 공병 작업반장. 차단문과 선로 보수를 낮 교대에 공개하고, 야간 무장 차출은 길드 평의회의 도장이 있어야 따른다.","일화":"2125년 태업 작업반과 밤새 조건을 나눠 다음 교대를 열었다. 이 일로 공병 작업반장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"정시우에게 공차 지도로 묶여 있고, 이강묵의 야간 편성을 마지막에야 승인하며, 박소언의 지붕 공사 인력과 작업반을 나눠 쓴다.","야망":"겨울에도 남서 외곽 선로를 따라 짐이 오가도록 눈 치우는 팀을 꾸려 선로를 열어 둔다.","공포":"자체 식량이 바닥나 공병이 군량 징발대로 바뀌고 복구 노동의 시민권이 사라지는 것.","개입":"외곽 선로 보수에 동행해 최다인의 표준 깔기를 돕거나, 군량 징발 명령을 증거로 남겨 작업반 투표를 막을 수 있다."},"biography":"대담하고 손빠르며 계급 배지보다 용접 이음을 본다. 완성된 차단문을 정치 협상용으로 열어 두라는 명령을 싫어한다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 대합실 당직\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 공병 작업반장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 공병 작업반장 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 오류2동. 최다인은 오류2동에서 결빙한 남서 선로와 차단문의 보수 순서를 작업반에 읽어 준다. 정시우의 실측 공차가 나오기 전에는 천왕 쪽 부품을 끼우지 않고, 박소언에게 빠지는 지붕 공사 인원을 적어 다음 낮 교대로 넘긴다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 공병 작업반장. 차단문과 선로 보수를 낮 교대에 공개하고, 야간 무장 차출은 길드 평의회의 도장이 있어야 따른다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 태업 작업반과 밤새 조건을 나눠 다음 교대를 열었다. 이 일로 공병 작업반장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 정시우에게 공차 지도로 묶여 있고, 이강묵의 야간 편성을 마지막에야 승인하며, 박소언의 지붕 공사 인력과 작업반을 나눠 쓴다.\n\n**야망.** 겨울에도 남서 외곽 선로를 따라 짐이 오가도록 눈 치우는 팀을 꾸려 선로를 열어 둔다.\n\n**공포.** 자체 식량이 바닥나 공병이 군량 징발대로 바뀌고 복구 노동의 시민권이 사라지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 외곽 선로 보수에 동행해 최다인의 표준 깔기를 돕거나, 군량 징발 명령을 증거로 남겨 작업반 투표를 막을 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 5 | 무력 −5 | 물질 30 | 공동 35 | 원칙 15 | 공개 20 | 자격 60 | 분산 20 | 변혁 20\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 0 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −25 | 지속 30 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"최다인","type":"스승과 제자","to":"정시우","basis":"공차 지도로 회장 계측에 묶임"}],"incoming":[{"from":"허다온","type":"계약","to":"최다인","basis":"최다인의 공병 작업반에 차륜을 대며"},{"from":"명소이","type":"스승과 제자","to":"최다인","basis":"최다인에게 공차 지도로 묶여 외곽 깔기를 나누고"},{"from":"기필호","type":"경쟁","to":"최다인","basis":"최다인의 공병 작업반과 출고 순서를 다투고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0035', 'c7a5-d765-b355', '{"id":"person-0035","name":"Jang Useok","title":"Repair Standards Audit Recorder","position":"Repair Standards Audit Recorder","characterId":"K035","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Standards Records & Auditing","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"polity:daejeon","stateName":"Daejeon","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#person-Jang-U-seok","detailRoute":"/people/person-0035","birthDate":"2071-01-15","birthday":"01-15","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k035-standard-audit","name":"Standard-revision auditing","rating":70},{"id":"k035-seal-crosscheck","name":"Measurement-seal crosscheck","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k035-emergency-deadline","name":"Three days even in emergencies","description":"Redistributes emergency revisions with a three-day remeasurement deadline.","behavior":"Redistributes emergency revisions with a three-day remeasurement deadline.","stress":"That one forged gauging seal would void the whole Cheonwang ledger and the fabrication alliance would split under parts blockades.","relationship":"A contract verifying Jeong Siwoo''s gauging seals, consulting Jeong Yura''s exit-condition wording, and trying to push I Gangmuk''s cipher mobilization notebook outside the ledger.","effects":[]},{"id":"k035-parallel-copies","name":"Copies to both sides","description":"Sends copies to the council and workshops together.","behavior":"Sends copies to the council and workshops together.","stress":"That one forged gauging seal would void the whole Cheonwang ledger and the fabrication alliance would split under parts blockades.","relationship":"A contract verifying Jeong Siwoo''s gauging seals, consulting Jeong Yura''s exit-condition wording, and trying to push I Gangmuk''s cipher mobilization notebook outside the ledger.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Attached audit conditions to an unmeasured revision and checked seals. Records constrain emergency power, without guaranteeing detection of every forgery.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c7a5-d765-b355","name":"Heungdeok Jang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c7a5-d765-b355.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":15,"Force":-15,"Material":35,"Communal":30,"Principle":35,"Public":35,"Eligibility":50,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":30},"desire":{"Longing":-20,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":35,"Display":-15,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Unaffiliated (formerly Daejeon Bloc; power shift 2026-10-22)","Livelihood":"Standards Records & Auditing","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Repair Standards Audit Recorder","Residence and Work Location":"Resides within the Oryu 2-dong administrative district and works at the daily-supply cargo handover and rationing window in the Cheonwang Station concourse. This grants no housing or bed rights and no exclusive occupancy, and it is not a Seoul title or holding grant or a confirmation of landlessness.","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 15 | Force −15 | Materialism 35 | Communal 30 | Principle 35 | Publicity 35 | Qualification 50 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 30","Desires":"Craving −20 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 35 | Display −15 | Persistence 25 | Orientation Heterosexual | Bonding Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the generation of 2126. Raised at the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Repair Standards Audit Recorder opened after a single line was deleted from a double ledger.\n- Jang Useok, raised at the Seoul Station registry office, sends standards copies to both the Guild Council and the workshops from the audit window at Cheonwang. She reverses emergency revisions made without remeasurement by attaching a three-day deadline, and cross-checks Jeong Siu''s measurement seal. Her former superior is preserved as Min Ungi. The Daejeon Jung-gu holding claim was dissolved by the power shift of 2026-10-22.\n- Residence and work location: Resides within the Oryu 2-dong administrative district and works at the daily-supply cargo handover and rationing window in the Cheonwang Station concourse. This grants no housing or bed rights and no exclusive occupancy, and it is not a Seoul title or holding grant or a confirmation of landlessness.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Repair Standards Audit Recorder. She distributes standards copies to the Guild Council and the workshops at the same time, and insists that even an emergency revision is void without remeasurement within three days.","Anecdote":"A standards revision citing a military-supply emergency circulates among the workshops first, with no remeasurement record. Jang Useok attaches an audit clause stating the three-day deadline, reissues the standards copies to the Guild Council and the workshops simultaneously, and begins by cross-checking Jeong Siu''s measurement seal.","Relationships":"A contract to verify Jeong Siu''s measurement seal; she consults Jeong Yura''s termination-condition sentences and seeks to push I Gangmuk''s cipher-mobilization notebook out of the ledger.","Ambition":"She wants every standards revision to carry an audit seal and a termination condition, so that standards do not vanish under the pretext of a military-supply emergency.","Fear":"The fear that a single forged measurement seal will void the entire Cheonwang ledger and split the standards system into parts blockades.","Intervention":"She can trace the manufacturing workshop of a defective part, or catch whoever forged an audit seal, to establish the Recorder''s authority."},"biography":"Principled, and hates blanks in a sentence. She calls elders who do not enter verbally agreed compatibility into the ledger enemies of the standards.\n\n- Affiliation: Unaffiliated (formerly Daejeon Bloc; power shift 2026-10-22)\n- Livelihood: Standards Records & Auditing\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Repair Standards Audit Recorder\n**Life.** Born in the generation of 2126. Raised at the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Repair Standards Audit Recorder opened after a single line was deleted from a double ledger.\n- Jang Useok, raised at the Seoul Station registry office, sends standards copies to both the Guild Council and the workshops from the audit window at Cheonwang. She reverses emergency revisions made without remeasurement by attaching a three-day deadline, and cross-checks Jeong Siu''s measurement seal. Her former superior is preserved as Min Ungi. The Daejeon Jung-gu holding claim was dissolved by the power shift of 2026-10-22.\n- Residence and work location: Resides within the Oryu 2-dong administrative district and works at the daily-supply cargo handover and rationing window in the Cheonwang Station concourse. This grants no housing or bed rights and no exclusive occupancy, and it is not a Seoul title or holding grant or a confirmation of landlessness.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Repair Standards Audit Recorder. She distributes standards copies to the Guild Council and the workshops at the same time, and insists that even an emergency revision is void without remeasurement within three days.\n\n**Anecdote.** A standards revision citing a military-supply emergency circulates among the workshops first, with no remeasurement record. Jang Useok attaches an audit clause stating the three-day deadline, reissues the standards copies to the Guild Council and the workshops simultaneously, and begins by cross-checking Jeong Siu''s measurement seal.\n\n**Relationships.** A contract to verify Jeong Siu''s measurement seal; she consults Jeong Yura''s termination-condition sentences and seeks to push I Gangmuk''s cipher-mobilization notebook out of the ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** She wants every standards revision to carry an audit seal and a termination condition, so that standards do not vanish under the pretext of a military-supply emergency.\n\n**Fear.** The fear that a single forged measurement seal will void the entire Cheonwang ledger and split the standards system into parts blockades.\n\n**Intervention.** She can trace the manufacturing workshop of a defective part, or catch whoever forged an audit seal, to establish the Recorder''s authority.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 15 | Force −15 | Materialism 35 | Communal 30 | Principle 35 | Publicity 35 | Qualification 50 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 30\n- Desires: Craving −20 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 35 | Display −15 | Persistence 25 | Orientation Heterosexual | Bonding Polyamorous\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1008","name":"Min Ung-gi","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"Direct Subordinate","courtId":"court:K1008","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jang Useok","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Siu","basis":"Verifies the measurement seal against the standards ledger"},{"from":"Jang Useok","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Yura","basis":"Consults the termination-condition sentences in the audit ledger"},{"from":"Jang Useok","type":"Contract","to":"I Ilseop","basis":"Returns the audit and remeasurement results for the parts standards copies"}],"incoming":[{"from":"I Ilseop","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Useok","basis":"Requests an audit of the sub-workshop parts standards copies to be submitted to the council"},{"from":"Heo Paseo","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Useok","basis":"The Lung Bureau hands Jang Useok a list of modified parts without drawing-cabinet numbers. Jang Useok checks the measurement seals and remeasurement records so that out-of-spec parts do not hide behind blank numbers in the shipping list."},{"from":"Pyo Gangho","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Useok","basis":"A contract to deliver Jang Useok''s audit seal in the field,"},{"from":"Je Haon","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Useok","basis":"cross-verifies Jang Useok''s standards seal against skill scores,"},{"from":"Jong Maru","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Useok","basis":"enters defect lists into Jang Useok''s repair standards ledger,"},{"from":"Bae Ongyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Useok","basis":"aligns Jang Useok''s standards ledger with the rationing columns,"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0035","name":"장우석","title":"수리규격 감사기록관","position":"수리규격 감사기록관","characterId":"K035","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"규격 기록·감사","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"polity:daejeon","stateName":"대전","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-장우석","detailRoute":"/people/person-0035","birthDate":"2071-01-15","birthday":"01-15","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k035-standard-audit","name":"규격 개정 감수","rating":70},{"id":"k035-seal-crosscheck","name":"계측 도장 대조","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k035-emergency-deadline","name":"비상에도 사흘","description":"재측정 없는 비상 개정에 사흘 기한을 적어 재배포한다.","behavior":"재측정 없는 비상 개정에 사흘 기한을 적어 재배포한다.","stress":"위조 계측 도장 하나가 천왕 원장 전체를 무효로 만들어 규격 체계가 부품 봉쇄로 쪼개지는 것.","relationship":"정시우의 계측 도장을 검증하는 계약이고, 정유라의 종료 조건 문장을 참고하며, 이강묵의 암호 동원 수첩을 원장 밖으로 밀어내려 한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k035-parallel-copies","name":"함께 받는 사본","description":"평의회와 공방에 사본을 동시에 보낸다.","behavior":"평의회와 공방에 사본을 동시에 보낸다.","stress":"위조 계측 도장 하나가 천왕 원장 전체를 무효로 만들어 규격 체계가 부품 봉쇄로 쪼개지는 것.","relationship":"정시우의 계측 도장을 검증하는 계약이고, 정유라의 종료 조건 문장을 참고하며, 이강묵의 암호 동원 수첩을 원장 밖으로 밀어내려 한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"재측정 없는 개정에 감사 문구를 붙이고 계측 도장을 대조했다. 기록으로 비상 권한을 제한하는 강점이 있으나 모든 위조를 잡는 능력은 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c7a5-d765-b355","name":"흥덕 장씨","crest":"clan-crests/c7a5-d765-b355.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":15,"무력":-15,"물질":35,"공동":30,"원칙":35,"공개":35,"자격":50,"분산":25,"변혁":30},"desire":{"갈망":-20,"독점":-20,"위험":35,"과시":-15,"지속":25,"지향":"이성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"무소속(전 대전계; 2026-10-22 세력 이동)","생업":"규격 기록·감사","품계":"조합원","직함":"수리규격 감사기록관","거주·업무 위치":"오류2동 행정동 범위 거주, 천왕역 대합실의 생활 화물 인계·배급 창구 업무. 주택·침상 권리와 독점 점유를 부여하지 않으며 서울 직위·영지 수여나 무토지 확정이 아니다.","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 15 | 무력 −15 | 물질 35 | 공동 30 | 원칙 35 | 공개 35 | 자격 50 | 분산 25 | 변혁 30","욕망":"갈망 −20 | 독점 −20 | 위험 35 | 과시 −15 | 지속 25 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 수리규격 감사기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 서울역 등기소에서 자란 장우석은 천왕의 감사 창구에서 규격 사본을 길드 평의회와 공방에 함께 보낸다. 재측정 없는 비상 개정을 사흘 기한으로 되돌리고 정시우의 계측 도장을 대조한다. 전 상관은 민웅기로 보존한다. 대전 중구 영지 문장은 2026-10-22 세력 이동으로 해소하였다.\n- 거주·업무 위치: 오류2동 행정동 범위 거주, 천왕역 대합실의 생활 화물 인계·배급 창구 업무. 주택·침상 권리와 독점 점유를 부여하지 않으며 서울 직위·영지 수여나 무토지 확정이 아니다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 수리규격 감사기록관. 규격 사본을 길드 평의회와 공방에 동시에 배포하고, 비상 개정도 사흘 안의 재측정 없이는 무효라고 못 박는다.","일화":"군수 비상을 이유로 든 규격 개정안이 재측정 기록 없이 공방에 먼저 돈다. 장우석은 사흘 기한을 적은 감사 문구를 붙여 규격 사본을 길드 평의회와 공방에 동시에 다시 내고, 정시우의 계측 도장부터 대조한다.","관계":"정시우의 계측 도장을 검증하는 계약이고, 정유라의 종료 조건 문장을 참고하며, 이강묵의 암호 동원 수첩을 원장 밖으로 밀어내려 한다.","야망":"자유도시의 모든 개정에 감사 날인과 종료 조건을 붙여, 군수 비상 핑계로 규격이 사라지지 않게 한다.","공포":"위조 계측 도장 하나가 천왕 원장 전체를 무효로 만들어 규격 체계가 부품 봉쇄로 쪼개지는 것.","개입":"결함 부품의 제조 공방을 추적하거나, 감사 날인을 위조한 자를 잡아 기록관의 권한을 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"원칙적이고 문장의 빈칸을 증오한다. 구두로 합의한 호환을 원장에 올리지 않는 원로를 규격의 적으로 부른다.\n\n- 소속: 무소속(전 대전계; 2026-10-22 세력 이동)\n- 생업: 규격 기록·감사\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 수리규격 감사기록관\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 수리규격 감사기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 서울역 등기소에서 자란 장우석은 천왕의 감사 창구에서 규격 사본을 길드 평의회와 공방에 함께 보낸다. 재측정 없는 비상 개정을 사흘 기한으로 되돌리고 정시우의 계측 도장을 대조한다. 전 상관은 민웅기로 보존한다. 대전 중구 영지 문장은 2026-10-22 세력 이동으로 해소하였다.\n- 거주·업무 위치: 오류2동 행정동 범위 거주, 천왕역 대합실의 생활 화물 인계·배급 창구 업무. 주택·침상 권리와 독점 점유를 부여하지 않으며 서울 직위·영지 수여나 무토지 확정이 아니다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 수리규격 감사기록관. 규격 사본을 길드 평의회와 공방에 동시에 배포하고, 비상 개정도 사흘 안의 재측정 없이는 무효라고 못 박는다.\n\n**일화.** 군수 비상을 이유로 든 규격 개정안이 재측정 기록 없이 공방에 먼저 돈다. 장우석은 사흘 기한을 적은 감사 문구를 붙여 규격 사본을 길드 평의회와 공방에 동시에 다시 내고, 정시우의 계측 도장부터 대조한다.\n\n**관계.** 정시우의 계측 도장을 검증하는 계약이고, 정유라의 종료 조건 문장을 참고하며, 이강묵의 암호 동원 수첩을 원장 밖으로 밀어내려 한다.\n\n**야망.** 모든 규격 개정에 감사 날인과 종료 조건을 붙여, 군수 비상 핑계로 규격이 사라지지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 계측 도장 하나가 천왕 원장 전체를 무효로 만들어 규격 체계가 부품 봉쇄로 쪼개지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 결함 부품의 제조 공방을 추적하거나, 감사 날인을 위조한 자를 잡아 기록관의 권한을 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 15 | 무력 −15 | 물질 35 | 공동 30 | 원칙 35 | 공개 35 | 자격 50 | 분산 25 | 변혁 30\n- 욕망: 갈망 −20 | 독점 −20 | 위험 35 | 과시 −15 | 지속 25 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1008","name":"민웅기","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"직속 부하","courtId":"court:K1008","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"장우석","type":"계약","to":"정시우","basis":"계측 도장을 규격 원장에서 검증"},{"from":"장우석","type":"계약","to":"정유라","basis":"종료 조건 문장을 감사 원장에 참고"},{"from":"장우석","type":"계약","to":"이일섭","basis":"부품 규격 사본의 감사와 재측정 결과를 돌려준다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"이일섭","type":"계약","to":"장우석","basis":"평의회에 제출할 분공방 부품 규격 사본의 감사를 의뢰한다"},{"from":"허파서","type":"계약","to":"장우석","basis":"허파서는 도면함 번호 없는 개조 부품 목록을 장우석에게 넘긴다. 장우석은 계측 도장과 재측정 기록을 확인해 규격 밖 부품이 출고 목록의 빈 번호로 숨지 않게 한다."},{"from":"표강호","type":"계약","to":"장우석","basis":"장우석의 감사 날인을 현장에서 배달하는 계약이고"},{"from":"제하온","type":"계약","to":"장우석","basis":"장우석의 규격 날인과 숙련 점수를 교차검증하며"},{"from":"종마루","type":"계약","to":"장우석","basis":"장우석의 수리규격 원장에 불량 목록을 올리고"},{"from":"배온결","type":"계약","to":"장우석","basis":"장우석의 규격 원장과 배급 칸을 맞추며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0036', 'c784-c870-c591-6797', '{"id":"person-0036","name":"Im Chaewon","title":"Protective Suit Trade Representative","position":"Protective Suit Trade Representative","characterId":"K036","rank":"Guild Master","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Waiting Hall Duty","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#person-im-chaewon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0036","birthDate":"2096-11-16","birthday":"11-16","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k036-filter-verification","name":"Filter-performance verification","rating":60},{"id":"k036-witness-confrontation","name":"Witness confrontation","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k036-protective-stock-access","name":"Access to protective supplies","description":"Avoids officers hoarding protective clothes as spoils.","behavior":"Avoids officers hoarding protective clothes as spoils.","stress":"That the Guro work squads would be left in cold and dust.","relationship":"Sharing filter performance verification as an ally with Choi Eunjae, the Magok certification officer, taking the protective process in Gang Minseo''s process division, and competing for raw materials with Han Somi''s leather workshops.","effects":[]},{"id":"k036-samples-before-priority","name":"Samples before priority allocation","description":"Allows military priority only when disaster samples meet the stated condition.","behavior":"Allows military priority only when disaster samples meet the stated condition.","stress":"That the Guro work squads would be left in cold and dust.","relationship":"Sharing filter performance verification as an ally with Choi Eunjae, the Magok certification officer, taking the protective process in Gang Minseo''s process division, and competing for raw materials with Han Somi''s leather workshops.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Filter-verification cooperation and public confrontation are confirmed. Observing stitches is not expanded into a sewing career.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41190-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K036","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c784-c870-c591-6797","name":"Joyang Im Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c784-c870-c591-6797.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-45,"Openness":10,"Force":-20,"Material":50,"Communal":35,"Principle":5,"Public":30,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":25},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-5,"Display":-20,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Waiting Hall Duty","Rank":"Guild Master","Title":"Protective Suit Trade Representative","Work Location":"Guro 3-dong. Im Chaewon writes the seam condition and shipment quantity of winter protective suits on the Guro 3-dong protective suit trade blackboard. He records military-supply priority allocation only when Choe Eunjae''s filter verification samples exceed the standard, and separately hands over the medical-use shipment to Jin Uram.","Values":"Authority −45 | Openness 10 | Force −20 | Materialism 50 | Communal 35 | Principle 5 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 55 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 25","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −5 | Display −20 | Persistence −5 | Orientation Heterosexual | Bonding Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the generation of 2126. Raised on waiting-hall duty. The post of Protective Suit Trade Representative opened through a substitute duty shift covering an unexcused absence.\n- Work location: Guro 3-dong. Im Chaewon writes the seam condition and shipment quantity of winter protective suits on the Guro 3-dong protective suit trade blackboard. He records military-supply priority allocation only when Choe Eunjae''s filter verification samples exceed the standard, and separately hands over the medical-use shipment to Jin Uram.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Master. Title: Protective Suit Trade Representative. Writes shipment quantities on the guild blackboard, and allows military priority allocation only when the disaster-prevention samples exceed the standard.","Anecdote":"In 2125, when the accounts of two witnesses diverged, convened a public confrontation. Because of this, the signature for the post of Protective Suit Guild Representative was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Shares an alliance on filter performance verification with Choe Eunjae, the Magok Certifier; takes charge of the protective process in Gang Minseo''s process division; and competes with Han Somi''s leather workshop over raw material exchange.","Ambition":"Opens the protective suit and filter standards to the medical crews and entrance-barrier repair crews as well, so that recovery servicemembers can breathe as citizens even when they are not in military uniform.","Fear":"The fear that the Guro work crews will be abandoned in cold and dust.","Intervention":"Can change the direction of the guild vote by securing substitute fabric, or by exposing the filters hidden in the military supply warehouse."},"biography":"Practical, and gauges danger by the spacing of stitches. Avoids officers who pile up protective suits like war trophies as if they were a calamity.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Waiting Hall Duty\n- Rank: Guild Master\n- Title: Protective Suit Trade Representative\n**Life.** Born in the generation of 2126. Raised on waiting-hall duty. The post of Protective Suit Trade Representative opened through a substitute duty shift covering an unexcused absence.\n- Work location: Guro 3-dong. Im Chaewon writes the seam condition and shipment quantity of winter protective suits on the Guro 3-dong protective suit trade blackboard. He records military-supply priority allocation only when Choe Eunjae''s filter verification samples exceed the standard, and separately hands over the medical-use shipment to Jin Uram.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Master. Title: Protective Suit Trade Representative. Writes shipment quantities on the guild blackboard, and allows military priority allocation only when the disaster-prevention samples exceed the standard.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, when the accounts of two witnesses diverged, convened a public confrontation. Because of this, the signature for the post of Protective Suit Guild Representative was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Shares an alliance on filter performance verification with Choe Eunjae, the Magok Certifier; takes charge of the protective process in Gang Minseo''s process division; and competes with Han Somi''s leather workshop over raw material exchange.\n\n**Ambition.** Opens the protective suit and filter standards to the medical crews and entrance-barrier repair crews as well, so that recovery servicemembers can breathe as citizens even when they are not in military uniform.\n\n**Fear.** The fear that the Guro work crews will be abandoned in cold and dust.\n\n**Intervention.** Can change the direction of the guild vote by securing substitute fabric, or by exposing the filters hidden in the military supply warehouse.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −45 | Openness 10 | Force −20 | Materialism 50 | Communal 35 | Principle 5 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 55 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 25\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk −5 | Display −20 | Endurance −5 | Orientation opposite-sex | Union contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Im Chaewon","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Eunjae","basis":"Shares protective filter performance verification"},{"from":"Im Chaewon","type":"Rivalry","to":"Han Somi","basis":"Competes with the leather workshop over protective fabric raw materials"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Yu Haeun","type":"Rivalry","to":"Im Chaewon","basis":"Competition over protective fabric and leather raw materials"},{"from":"Choe Eunjae","type":"Contract","to":"Im Chaewon","basis":"Entrusts filter verification to the protective suit guild"},{"from":"Jin Uram","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Im Chaewon","basis":"Is close to a disciple who applies Im Chaewon''s filter standards to medical care, and"},{"from":"Je Munseok","type":"Contract","to":"Im Chaewon","basis":"Matches Im Chaewon''s protective suit shipments to medical quantities, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0036","name":"임채원","title":"방호복 직능 대표","position":"방호복 직능 대표","characterId":"K036","rank":"조합장","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"대합실 당직","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-임채원","detailRoute":"/people/person-0036","birthDate":"2096-11-16","birthday":"11-16","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k036-filter-verification","name":"필터 성능 검증","rating":60},{"id":"k036-witness-confrontation","name":"증언 대질","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k036-protective-stock-access","name":"방호 물자 접근","description":"방호복을 전리품처럼 쌓아 두는 장교를 피한다.","behavior":"방호복을 전리품처럼 쌓아 두는 장교를 피한다.","stress":"구로 작업반이 추위와 분진 속에 방치되는 것.","relationship":"마곡 인증관 최은재와 필터 성능 검증을 동맹으로 나누고, 강민서의 공정 분할에서 방호 공정을 맡으며, 한소미의 가죽 공방과 원자재 교환을 경쟁한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k036-samples-before-priority","name":"표본 뒤 우선 배정","description":"군수 배정은 방재 표본이 기준을 넘을 때만 허용한다.","behavior":"군수 배정은 방재 표본이 기준을 넘을 때만 허용한다.","stress":"구로 작업반이 추위와 분진 속에 방치되는 것.","relationship":"마곡 인증관 최은재와 필터 성능 검증을 동맹으로 나누고, 강민서의 공정 분할에서 방호 공정을 맡으며, 한소미의 가죽 공방과 원자재 교환을 경쟁한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"필터 검증 협력과 공개 대질이 확인된다. 바느질 관찰을 실제 봉제 수행 경력으로 확대하지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41190-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K036","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c784-c870-c591-6797","name":"조양 임씨","crest":"clan-crests/c784-c870-c591-6797.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-45,"개방":10,"무력":-20,"물질":50,"공동":35,"원칙":5,"공개":30,"자격":55,"분산":25,"변혁":25},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":-10,"위험":-5,"과시":-20,"지속":-5,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"대합실 당직","품계":"조합장","직함":"방호복 직능 대표","업무 위치":"구로3동. 임채원은 구로3동 방호복 직능 칠판에 겨울 방호복의 봉합 상태와 출고 수량을 적는다. 최은재의 필터 검증 표본이 기준을 넘은 때에만 군수 우선 배정을 기록하고, 진우람에게 진료용 출고분을 따로 인계한다.","가치관":"권위 −45 | 개방 10 | 무력 −20 | 물질 50 | 공동 35 | 원칙 5 | 공개 30 | 자격 55 | 분산 25 | 변혁 25","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −5 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 방호복 직능 대표 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로3동. 임채원은 구로3동 방호복 직능 칠판에 겨울 방호복의 봉합 상태와 출고 수량을 적는다. 최은재의 필터 검증 표본이 기준을 넘은 때에만 군수 우선 배정을 기록하고, 진우람에게 진료용 출고분을 따로 인계한다.","관직":"품계 조합장. 직함은 방호복 직능 대표. 출고 수량을 조합 칠판에 쓰고, 군수 우선 배정은 방재 표본이 기준을 넘을 때만 허용한다.","일화":"2125년 증인 두 명의 말이 갈라지자 공개 대질을 열었다. 이 일로 방호복 직능 대표 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"마곡 인증관 최은재와 필터 성능 검증을 동맹으로 나누고, 강민서의 공정 분할에서 방호 공정을 맡으며, 한소미의 가죽 공방과 원자재 교환을 경쟁한다.","야망":"방호복과 필터 규격을 의료반과 출입구 방벽 보수반까지 열어, 복구복무자가 군복이 아니어도 시민으로 숨 쉬게 한다.","공포":"구로 작업반이 추위와 분진 속에 방치되는 것.","개입":"대체 원단을 구하거나, 군수 창고에 숨긴 필터를 폭로해 직능 투표의 방향을 바꿀 수 있다."},"biography":"실용적이고 바느질 간격으로 위험을 가늠한다. 방호복을 전리품처럼 쌓아 두는 장교를 재앙처럼 피한다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 대합실 당직\n- 품계: 조합장\n- 직함: 방호복 직능 대표\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 방호복 직능 대표 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로3동. 임채원은 구로3동 방호복 직능 칠판에 겨울 방호복의 봉합 상태와 출고 수량을 적는다. 최은재의 필터 검증 표본이 기준을 넘은 때에만 군수 우선 배정을 기록하고, 진우람에게 진료용 출고분을 따로 인계한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합장. 직함은 방호복 직능 대표. 출고 수량을 조합 칠판에 쓰고, 군수 우선 배정은 방재 표본이 기준을 넘을 때만 허용한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 증인 두 명의 말이 갈라지자 공개 대질을 열었다. 이 일로 방호복 직능 대표 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 마곡 인증관 최은재와 필터 성능 검증을 동맹으로 나누고, 강민서의 공정 분할에서 방호 공정을 맡으며, 한소미의 가죽 공방과 원자재 교환을 경쟁한다.\n\n**야망.** 방호복과 필터 규격을 의료반과 출입구 방벽 보수반까지 열어, 복구복무자가 군복이 아니어도 시민으로 숨 쉬게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 구로 작업반이 추위와 분진 속에 방치되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대체 원단을 구하거나, 군수 창고에 숨긴 필터를 폭로해 직능 투표의 방향을 바꿀 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −45 | 개방 10 | 무력 −20 | 물질 50 | 공동 35 | 원칙 5 | 공개 30 | 자격 55 | 분산 25 | 변혁 25\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −5 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"임채원","type":"계약","to":"최은재","basis":"방호 필터 성능 검증을 나눔"},{"from":"임채원","type":"경쟁","to":"한소미","basis":"가죽 공방과 방호 원단 원자재를 겨룸"}],"incoming":[{"from":"유하은","type":"경쟁","to":"임채원","basis":"방호 원단·가죽 원자재 경쟁"},{"from":"최은재","type":"계약","to":"임채원","basis":"필터 검증을 방호 직능에 맡음"},{"from":"진우람","type":"스승과 제자","to":"임채원","basis":"임채원의 필터 규격을 진료에 적용하는 제자에 가깝고"},{"from":"제문석","type":"계약","to":"임채원","basis":"임채원의 방호 출고를 진료 수량에 맞추며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0037', 'd55c-ccad-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0037","name":"Han Jion","title":"Geumcheon Food Distribution Officer","position":"Geumcheon Food Distribution Officer","characterId":"K037","rank":"Guild Master","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Ration Duty Officer","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#inmul-hanjion","detailRoute":"/people/person-0037","birthDate":"2093-01-23","birthday":"01-23","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k037-food-loss-allocation","name":"At-risk food allocation","rating":65},{"id":"k037-well-ration-posting","name":"Well and ration posting","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k037-full-pots-first","name":"Pots before dispatch","description":"Checks pots and food stores first even on celebrated parts-dispatch days.","behavior":"Checks pots and food stores first even on celebrated parts-dispatch days.","stress":"That a season''s crop failure and a cold snap would overlap, and labor gangs would sweep through civilian homes to collect food.","relationship":"Matching ledgers with the building association''s fuel reserve tables, receiving the refugee column from the south into dwellings, and jointly watching the food share of the workshop guild.","effects":[]},{"id":"k037-inclusive-convoy","name":"Inclusive convoy","description":"Includes cooperative families and refugee records in supply convoys.","behavior":"Includes cooperative families and refugee records in supply convoys.","stress":"That a season''s crop failure and a cold snap would overlap, and labor gangs would sweep through civilian homes to collect food.","relationship":"Matching ledgers with the building association''s fuel reserve tables, receiving the refugee column from the south into dwellings, and jointly watching the food share of the workshop guild.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Distributing spoiling grain and publishing pot and storehouse stock support management. Linking repair hands to long-term food supplies remains an ambition.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11545-S02","name":{"ko":"Geumcheon-gu District Directly Held Territory"},"holderPersonId":"K037","directLiegePersonId":"K029","stateId":"S02","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1154551000","name":"Gasan-dong"},{"id":"region:1154561000","name":"Doksan 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1154562000","name":"Doksan 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1154563000","name":"Doksan 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1154564000","name":"Doksan 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1154567000","name":"Siheung 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1154568000","name":"Siheung 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1154569000","name":"Siheung 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1154570000","name":"Siheung 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1154571000","name":"Siheung 5-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11545-S02","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11545-S02","name":"Geumcheon-gu District","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K037","basis":"Opening administrative scale group gu:11545(district) Distribution · Decisive candidate selection","stateId":"S02","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1154551000","region:1154561000","region:1154562000","region:1154563000","region:1154564000","region:1154567000","region:1154568000","region:1154569000","region:1154570000","region:1154571000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s02","name":"Free City","holderPersonId":"K029"}}],"clan":{"id":"d55c-ccad-c8fc","name":"Han Clan of Cheongju","crest":"clan-crests/d55c-ccad-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-40,"Openness":5,"Force":-15,"Material":50,"Communal":35,"Principle":10,"Public":30,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-10,"Display":5,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Ration Duty Officer","Rank":"Guild Master","Title":"Geumcheon Food Distribution Officer","Work Location":"Doksan 1-dong. Han Jion counts the frozen grain store and the grain loss tables together in front of the Doksan 1-dong food pot. She demands a signature on the civilian minimum for the winter food reserve, and hands the building association the fuel reserve slips so that the firewood for the next pot can be calculated.","Values":"Authority −40 | Openness 5 | Force −15 | Materialism 50 | Communal 35 | Principle 10 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving 45 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Endurance 5 | Orientation none | Union polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up on waiting hall duty. The post in charge of Geumcheon food sharing opened after she stood a substitute shift at the food pot for an absent colleague on a cold night.\n- Workplace: Doksan 1-dong. Han Jion counts the frozen grain store and the grain loss tables together in front of the Doksan 1-dong food pot. She demands a signature on the civilian minimum for the winter food reserve, and hands the building association the fuel reserve slips so that the firewood for the next pot can be calculated.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Master. Title: Geumcheon Food Distribution Officer. Publicly discloses the food pots and storehouse stock every day, and has guild members'' families and the refugee roster ride along on outlying procurement columns.","Anecdote":"In 2125, distributed the grain that had begun to rot first and made the loss ledger public. Because of this, her signature for the post in charge of Geumcheon food sharing was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Matches ledgers with the building association''s fuel reserve tables, receives the refugee column from the south into dwellings, and jointly monitors the food share of the workshop guild.","Ambition":"Ties the workshop guild''s repair hands to long-term food supplies, making up for the lack of production of its own through a guild agreement.","Fear":"That a season of crop failure and cold snap will coincide, and bands of workers will sweep through civilian homes to requisition grain.","Intervention":"Can escort a procurement column to fill the pots, or find the secret order for the military grain requisition and pass the citizen representative''s motion to halt it."},"biography":"Compassionate, but does not forgive number games played on an empty stomach. Even on a day when part shipments are being boasted about, checks the food stores and food pots first.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Ration Duty Officer\n- Rank: Guild Master\n- Title: Geumcheon Food Distribution Officer\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up on waiting hall duty. The post in charge of Geumcheon food sharing opened after she stood a substitute shift at the food pot for an absent colleague on a cold night.\n- Workplace: Doksan 1-dong. Han Jion counts the frozen grain store and the grain loss tables together in front of the Doksan 1-dong food pot. She demands a signature on the civilian minimum for the winter food reserve, and hands the building association the fuel reserve slips so that the firewood for the next pot can be calculated.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Master. Title: Geumcheon Food Distribution Officer. Publicly discloses the food pots and storehouse stock every day, and has guild members'' families and the refugee roster ride along on outlying procurement columns.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, distributed the grain that had begun to rot first and made the loss ledger public. Because of this, her signature for the post in charge of Geumcheon food sharing was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Matches ledgers with the building association''s fuel reserve tables, receives the refugee column from the south into dwellings, and jointly monitors the food share of the workshop guild.\n\n**Ambition.** Ties the workshop guild''s repair hands to long-term food supplies, making up for the lack of production of its own through a guild agreement.\n\n**Fear.** That a season of crop failure and cold snap will coincide, and bands of workers will sweep through civilian homes to requisition grain.\n\n**Intervention.** Can escort a procurement column to fill the pots, or find the secret order for the military grain requisition and pass the citizen representative''s motion to halt it.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −40 | Openness 5 | Force −15 | Materialism 50 | Communal 35 | Principle 10 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Endurance 5 | Orientation none | Union polyamorous\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K029","name":"Gang Minseo","relationKind":"direct-liege","ownerTerm":"Direct Superior","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K037","members":[{"personId":"K047","name":"Myeong Dahae"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Han Jion","type":"Debt","to":"Han Jae-mok","basis":"Debt incurred by taking parts for repairing the winter food cauldron in advance"},{"from":"Han Jion","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":"Checks the roll of refugees arriving from the south against the roll of people taken captive"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gim Doha","type":"Contract","to":"Han Jion","basis":"Exchanges food for refugees with news of shutter checks"},{"from":"Jin Uram","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Han Jion","basis":"Opens compulsory meal service when Han Jion''s ration pot runs empty, and"},{"from":"Byeon Siram","type":"Contract","to":"Han Jion","basis":"Keeps Han Jion''s ration pot in one corner of the waiting hall, and"},{"from":"Myeong Dahae","type":"Command","to":"Han Jion","basis":"Is a contract that enforces Han Jion''s civilian minimum by the number of pots, and"},{"from":"Ryu Gyeore","type":"Contract","to":"Han Jion","basis":"Connects Han Jion''s food distribution and refugee roll to the winter lodging beds, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0037","name":"한지온","title":"금천 식량 나눔 담당","position":"금천 식량 나눔 담당","characterId":"K037","rank":"조합장","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"배급 당직","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-한지온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0037","birthDate":"2093-01-23","birthday":"01-23","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k037-food-loss-allocation","name":"손실 식량 배분","rating":65},{"id":"k037-well-ration-posting","name":"우물·배급 게시","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k037-full-pots-first","name":"출고보다 솥","description":"부품 출고를 자랑하는 날에도 솥과 식량 창고를 먼저 본다.","behavior":"부품 출고를 자랑하는 날에도 솥과 식량 창고를 먼저 본다.","stress":"한 계절의 흉작과 한파가 겹쳐 일손 무리가 식량을 걷으러 민가를 훑는 것.","relationship":"건물 조합의 연료 비축표와 장부를 맞대고, 남쪽에서 올라온 피난 행렬을 거처로 맞으며, 공방 조합의 식량 몫을 함께 감시한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k037-inclusive-convoy","name":"함께 타는 행렬","description":"조달 행렬에 조합 가족과 난민 명부를 함께 싣는다.","behavior":"조달 행렬에 조합 가족과 난민 명부를 함께 싣는다.","stress":"한 계절의 흉작과 한파가 겹쳐 일손 무리가 식량을 걷으러 민가를 훑는 것.","relationship":"건물 조합의 연료 비축표와 장부를 맞대고, 남쪽에서 올라온 피난 행렬을 거처로 맞으며, 공방 조합의 식량 몫을 함께 감시한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"부패하는 곡물의 배분과 솥·창고 공개가 운영 근거다. 수리 일손을 장기 식량 공급과 묶는 약속은 아직 야망이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11545-S02","name":{"ko":"금천구 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K037","directLiegePersonId":"K029","stateId":"S02","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1154551000","name":"가산동"},{"id":"region:1154561000","name":"독산1동"},{"id":"region:1154562000","name":"독산2동"},{"id":"region:1154563000","name":"독산3동"},{"id":"region:1154564000","name":"독산4동"},{"id":"region:1154567000","name":"시흥1동"},{"id":"region:1154568000","name":"시흥2동"},{"id":"region:1154569000","name":"시흥3동"},{"id":"region:1154570000","name":"시흥4동"},{"id":"region:1154571000","name":"시흥5동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11545-S02","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11545-S02","name":"금천구","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K037","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11545(district) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S02","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1154551000","region:1154561000","region:1154562000","region:1154563000","region:1154564000","region:1154567000","region:1154568000","region:1154569000","region:1154570000","region:1154571000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s02","name":"자유도시","holderPersonId":"K029"}}],"clan":{"id":"d55c-ccad-c8fc","name":"청주 한씨","crest":"clan-crests/d55c-ccad-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-40,"개방":5,"무력":-15,"물질":50,"공동":35,"원칙":10,"공개":30,"자격":45,"분산":25,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-10,"위험":-10,"과시":5,"지속":5,"지향":"무성향","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"배급 당직","품계":"조합장","직함":"금천 식량 나눔 담당","업무 위치":"독산1동. 한지온은 독산1동 식량 솥 앞에서 얼어붙은 곡물 창고와 곡물 손실표를 함께 센다. 겨울 식량 비축에는 시민 최저선의 서명을 요구하고, 건물 조합에는 연료 비축표를 넘겨 다음 솥의 땔감을 계산하게 한다.","가치관":"권위 −40 | 개방 5 | 무력 −15 | 물질 50 | 공동 35 | 원칙 10 | 공개 30 | 자격 45 | 분산 25 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 5 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 금천 식량 나눔 담당 자리는 한파 밤 결근자 대신 식량 솥 당직을 선 일로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 독산1동. 한지온은 독산1동 식량 솥 앞에서 얼어붙은 곡물 창고와 곡물 손실표를 함께 센다. 겨울 식량 비축에는 시민 최저선의 서명을 요구하고, 건물 조합에는 연료 비축표를 넘겨 다음 솥의 땔감을 계산하게 한다.","관직":"품계 조합장. 직함은 금천 식량 나눔 담당. 식량 솥과 창고 재고를 매일 공개하고, 외곽 조달 행렬에는 조합원 가족과 피난민 명부를 함께 태운다.","일화":"2125년 썩기 시작한 곡물을 먼저 나눠 주고 손실 장부를 공개했다. 이 일로 금천 식량 나눔 담당 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"건물 조합의 연료 비축표와 장부를 맞대고, 남쪽에서 올라온 피난 행렬을 거처로 맞으며, 공방 조합의 식량 몫을 함께 감시한다.","야망":"공방 조합의 수리 일손을 장기 식량 공급과 묶어, 자체 생산이 없는 약점을 조합 합의로 메운다.","공포":"한 계절의 흉작과 한파가 겹쳐 일손 무리가 식량을 걷으러 민가를 훑는 것.","개입":"조달 행렬을 호송해 솥을 채우거나, 군량 징발 밀지를 찾아 시민대표의 중지안을 통과시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"자비롭지만 공복 상태의 숫자 놀음을 용서하지 않는다. 부품 출고를 자랑하는 날에도 식량 창고와 식량 솥을 먼저 확인한다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 배급 당직\n- 품계: 조합장\n- 직함: 금천 식량 나눔 담당\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 금천 식량 나눔 담당 자리는 한파 밤 결근자 대신 식량 솥 당직을 선 일로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 독산1동. 한지온은 독산1동 식량 솥 앞에서 얼어붙은 곡물 창고와 곡물 손실표를 함께 센다. 겨울 식량 비축에는 시민 최저선의 서명을 요구하고, 건물 조합에는 연료 비축표를 넘겨 다음 솥의 땔감을 계산하게 한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합장. 직함은 금천 식량 나눔 담당. 식량 솥과 창고 재고를 매일 공개하고, 외곽 조달 행렬에는 조합원 가족과 피난민 명부를 함께 태운다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 썩기 시작한 곡물을 먼저 나눠 주고 손실 장부를 공개했다. 이 일로 금천 식량 나눔 담당 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 건물 조합의 연료 비축표와 장부를 맞대고, 남쪽에서 올라온 피난 행렬을 거처로 맞으며, 공방 조합의 식량 몫을 함께 감시한다.\n\n**야망.** 공방 조합의 수리 일손을 장기 식량 공급과 묶어, 자체 생산이 없는 약점을 조합 합의로 메운다.\n\n**공포.** 한 계절의 흉작과 한파가 겹쳐 일손 무리가 식량을 걷으러 민가를 훑는 것.\n\n**개입.** 조달 행렬을 호송해 솥을 채우거나, 군량 징발 밀지를 찾아 시민대표의 중지안을 통과시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −40 | 개방 5 | 무력 −15 | 물질 50 | 공동 35 | 원칙 10 | 공개 30 | 자격 45 | 분산 25 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 5 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K029","name":"강민서","relationKind":"direct-liege","ownerTerm":"직속 상관","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K037","members":[{"personId":"K047","name":"명다해"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"한지온","type":"빚","to":"한재목","basis":"겨울 식량솥 수리 부품을 먼저 받아 쓰고 진 빚"},{"from":"한지온","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":"남쪽에서 온 피난민 명부를 붙잡혀 간 사람의 명부와 맞대어 봄"}],"incoming":[{"from":"김도하","type":"계약","to":"한지온","basis":"피난 온 사람들의 식량과 셔터 점검 소식을 맞바꿈"},{"from":"진우람","type":"스승과 제자","to":"한지온","basis":"한지온의 배급 솥이 비면 의무 배식을 열며"},{"from":"변시람","type":"계약","to":"한지온","basis":"한지온의 배급 솥을 대합실 한쪽에 두며"},{"from":"명다해","type":"지휘","to":"한지온","basis":"한지온의 시민 최저선을 솥 수로 집행하는 계약이고"},{"from":"류겨레","type":"계약","to":"한지온","basis":"한지온의 식량 배분과 피난민 명부를 겨울 숙소 잠자리에 연결하고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0038', 'd5c8-d0dc-c778-8a31', '{"id":"person-0038","name":"Heo Daon","title":"Cheonwang Base Wheel Mechanic","position":"Cheonwang Base Wheel Mechanic","characterId":"K038","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Wheel Maintenance","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"polity:daejeon","stateName":"Daejeon","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#inmul-heodaon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0038","birthDate":"2076-10-24","birthday":"10-24","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k038-wheel-measuring","name":"Wheel measurement","rating":65},{"id":"k038-defect-rejection","name":"Defect rejection","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k038-test-not-talk","name":"Brake tests before words","description":"Checks standards and brake tests rather than improvised shaving.","behavior":"Checks standards and brake tests rather than improvised shaving.","stress":"That the guards would carve separate munitions-only screws, and the civil repair network would lose compatibility overnight.","relationship":"Bound to Jeong Siwoo as a tolerance apprentice, supplying wheels to Choi Dain''s engineering squads, and splitting sealing and wheels by contract with Choi Hangyeol''s Sinjeong repair trains.","effects":[]},{"id":"k038-shared-components","name":"Compatible-component responsibility","description":"Keeps unsealed modifications out of the sidings.","behavior":"Keeps unsealed modifications out of the sidings.","stress":"That the guards would carve separate munitions-only screws, and the civil repair network would lose compatibility overnight.","relationship":"Bound to Jeong Siwoo as a tolerance apprentice, supplying wheels to Choi Dain''s engineering squads, and splitting sealing and wheels by contract with Choi Hangyeol''s Sinjeong repair trains.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Tolerance learning, wheel measurement, and defect returns support the profile, without mastery of every pump repair or invention.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d5c8-d0dc-c778-8a31","name":"Taein Heo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d5c8-d0dc-c778-8a31.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":10,"Force":-15,"Material":45,"Communal":45,"Principle":10,"Public":40,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":30},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":20,"Risk":30,"Display":-25,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Unaffiliated (formerly Daejeon Bloc; power shift 2026-10-22)","Livelihood":"Wheel Maintenance","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Cheonwang Base Wheel Mechanic","Residence and Work Location":"Resides within the Oryu 2-dong administrative district and works at the daily-supply cargo handover and rationing window in the Cheonwang Station concourse. This grants no housing or bed rights and no exclusive occupancy, and it is not a Seoul title or holding grant or a confirmation of landlessness.","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 10 | Force −15 | Materialism 45 | Communal 45 | Principle 10 | Transparency 40 | Qualification 60 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation 30","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly 20 | Risk 30 | Display −25 | Endurance 5 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Multiple partners"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at Sinjeong Depot. The post of wheel mechanic at Cheonwang Base opened through a defect report made just before a derailment.\n- Heo Daon, who grew up at Sinjeong Depot, is a wheel mechanic in the Cheonwang living area. Preserves the 2125 incident of sending back a defective part just before shipment and the principle of refusing modified parts without a measurement stamp. Continues contracts with the Seoul internal maintenance table, Choe Dain, and Choe Hangyeol. The description of the Daedeok-gu domain is resolved by the 2026-10-22 faction shift, and the direct relationship with Min Ungi is maintained.\n- Residence/work location: resides within the Oryu 2-dong administrative district; works at the living-freight handover and rationing counter in the Cheonwang Station concourse. No housing or bed rights or exclusive occupancy are granted, and this is neither a Seoul rank or domain grant nor a confirmation of landlessness.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Cheonwang Base Wheel Mechanic. Stamps a measurement mark on every wheel shipped, and does not let modified parts without a stamp into the siding.","Anecdote":"In 2125, sent back a box of defective parts just before shipment. Because of this, his signature for the post of wheel mechanic at Cheonwang Base was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Bound to Jeong Siu as a tolerance master-and-apprentice, supplies wheels to Choe Dain''s engineer work crew, and divides sealing and wheels by contract with Choe Hangyeol''s Sinjeong maintenance train.","Ambition":"To record the compatible dimensions of train-wheel screws on a single maintenance table, so that any workshop can repair them when winter breakdowns hit.","Fear":"The Guard Corps cutting munitions-only screws separately, so that the civilian repair network becomes incompatible overnight.","Intervention":"Can bring in the measured tolerances of sealed screws to break the seal, or find the hidden drawings of military-only screws to expose the split in the standards."},"biography":"Remembers people by their tolerances, and sees makeshift trimming not in the specifications as the seed of an accident. Speaks little and answers with a brake test.\n\n- Affiliation: Unaffiliated (formerly Daejeon Bloc; power shift 2026-10-22)\n- Livelihood: Wheel Maintenance\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Cheonwang Base Wheel Mechanic\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at Sinjeong Depot. The post of wheel mechanic at Cheonwang Base opened through a defect report made just before a derailment.\n- Heo Daon, who grew up at Sinjeong Depot, is a wheel mechanic in the Cheonwang living area. Preserves the 2125 incident of sending back a defective part just before shipment and the principle of refusing modified parts without a measurement stamp. Continues contracts with the Seoul internal maintenance table, Choe Dain, and Choe Hangyeol. The description of the Daedeok-gu domain is resolved by the 2026-10-22 faction shift, and the direct relationship with Min Ungi is maintained.\n- Residence/work location: resides within the Oryu 2-dong administrative district; works at the living-freight handover and rationing counter in the Cheonwang Station concourse. No housing or bed rights or exclusive occupancy are granted, and this is neither a Seoul rank or domain grant nor a confirmation of landlessness.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Cheonwang Base Wheel Mechanic. Stamps a measurement mark on every wheel shipped, and does not let modified parts without a stamp into the siding.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, sent back a box of defective parts just before shipment. Because of this, his signature for the post of wheel mechanic at Cheonwang Base was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Bound to Jeong Siu as a tolerance master-and-apprentice, supplies wheels to Choe Dain''s engineer work crew, and divides sealing and wheels by contract with Choe Hangyeol''s Sinjeong maintenance train.\n\n**Ambition.** To record the compatible dimensions of train-wheel screws on a single maintenance table, so that any workshop can repair them when winter breakdowns hit.\n\n**Fear.** The Guard Corps cutting munitions-only screws separately, so that the civilian repair network becomes incompatible overnight.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in the measured tolerances of sealed screws to break the seal, or find the hidden drawings of military-only screws to expose the split in the standards.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 10 | Force −15 | Materialism 45 | Communal 45 | Principle 10 | Transparency 40 | Qualification 60 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation 30\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly 20 | Risk 30 | Display −25 | Endurance 5 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Multiple partners\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1008","name":"Min Ung-gi","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"Direct Subordinate","courtId":"court:K1008","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Heo Daon","type":"Contract","to":"I Ilseop","basis":"Sends the wheel inspection records so that shipped parts can be checked together."},{"from":"Heo Daon","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jeong Siu","basis":"Is bound to Jeong Siu through tolerance mentorship, and"},{"from":"Heo Daon","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Dain","basis":"Putting wheels to Choe Da-in''s engineer work crew,"}],"incoming":[{"from":"I Ilseop","type":"Contract","to":"Heo Daon","basis":"Cross-checks the measured values of the branch workshop''s shipped parts against the wheel inspection records."},{"from":"Myeong Soi","type":"Contract","to":"Heo Daon","basis":"Replaces sleepers in time with Heo Daon''s wheel test run,"},{"from":"Pyo Yedam","type":"Contract","to":"Heo Daon","basis":"Vouches for Heo Daon''s wheel shipment on the dispatch board,"},{"from":"Byeon Jua","type":"Command","to":"Heo Daon","basis":"Lends only the late-night frequency for Heo Daon''s test run,"},{"from":"Eom Nuri","type":"Contract","to":"Heo Daon","basis":"Transfers the cracks into Heo Daon''s wheel maintenance log,"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0038","name":"허다온","title":"천왕기지 차륜 정비사","position":"천왕기지 차륜 정비사","characterId":"K038","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"차륜 정비","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"polity:daejeon","stateName":"대전","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-허다온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0038","birthDate":"2076-10-24","birthday":"10-24","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k038-wheel-measuring","name":"차륜 계측","rating":65},{"id":"k038-defect-rejection","name":"불량품 반환","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k038-test-not-talk","name":"말보다 제동 시험","description":"임시 깎기보다 규격과 제동 시험을 확인한다.","behavior":"임시 깎기보다 규격과 제동 시험을 확인한다.","stress":"경비대가 군수 전용 나사를 따로 깎아 민간 수리망이 하루아침에 호환 불능이 되는 것.","relationship":"정시우에게 공차 지도로 묶여 있고, 최다인의 공병 작업반에 차륜을 대며, 최한결의 신정 보수열차와 밀봉·차륜을 계약으로 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k038-shared-components","name":"호환 부품 책임","description":"도장 없는 개조품은 유치선에 들이지 않는다.","behavior":"도장 없는 개조품은 유치선에 들이지 않는다.","stress":"경비대가 군수 전용 나사를 따로 깎아 민간 수리망이 하루아침에 호환 불능이 되는 것.","relationship":"정시우에게 공차 지도로 묶여 있고, 최다인의 공병 작업반에 차륜을 대며, 최한결의 신정 보수열차와 밀봉·차륜을 계약으로 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"공차 학습과 차륜 계측, 불량품 반환이 근거다. 모든 펌프 수리를 숙달했다거나 발명했다는 경력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d5c8-d0dc-c778-8a31","name":"태인 허씨","crest":"clan-crests/d5c8-d0dc-c778-8a31.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":10,"무력":-15,"물질":45,"공동":45,"원칙":10,"공개":40,"자격":60,"분산":30,"변혁":30},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":20,"위험":30,"과시":-25,"지속":5,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"무소속(전 대전계; 2026-10-22 세력 이동)","생업":"차륜 정비","품계":"조합원","직함":"천왕기지 차륜 정비사","거주·업무 위치":"오류2동 행정동 범위 거주, 천왕역 대합실의 생활 화물 인계·배급 창구 업무. 주택·침상 권리와 독점 점유를 부여하지 않으며 서울 직위·영지 수여나 무토지 확정이 아니다.","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 10 | 무력 −15 | 물질 45 | 공동 45 | 원칙 10 | 공개 40 | 자격 60 | 분산 30 | 변혁 30","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 20 | 위험 30 | 과시 −25 | 지속 5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 천왕기지 차륜 정비사 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 신정 차량기지에서 자란 허다온은 천왕 생활권의 차륜 정비사다. 2125년 출고 직전 불량 부품을 돌려보낸 일과 계측 도장 없는 개조품을 거부하는 원칙을 보존한다. 서울 내부 정비표·최다인·최한결과의 계약을 이어 간다. 대덕구 영지 서술은 2026-10-22 세력 이동으로 해소하고 민웅기 직속 관계는 유지한다.\n- 거주·업무 위치: 오류2동 행정동 범위 거주, 천왕역 대합실의 생활 화물 인계·배급 창구 업무. 주택·침상 권리와 독점 점유를 부여하지 않으며 서울 직위·영지 수여나 무토지 확정이 아니다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 천왕기지 차륜 정비사. 출고 차륜마다 계측 도장을 찍고, 도장 없는 개조품은 유치선에 들이지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 천왕기지 차륜 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"정시우에게 공차 지도로 묶여 있고, 최다인의 공병 작업반에 차륜을 대며, 최한결의 신정 보수열차와 밀봉·차륜을 계약으로 나눈다.","야망":"열차 바퀴 나사의 호환 치수를 한 장의 정비표에 적어 두어, 겨울 고장에도 아무 공방이나 고칠 수 있게 한다.","공포":"경비대가 군수 전용 나사를 따로 깎아 민간 수리망이 하루아침에 호환 불능이 되는 것.","개입":"봉인 나사의 실측 공차를 가져와 봉인을 풀거나, 군수 전용 나사의 숨은 도면을 찾아 규격 분열을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"공차로 사람을 기억하고, 규격서에 없는 임시 깎기를 사고의 씨앗으로 본다. 말수는 적고 제동 시험으로 대답한다.\n\n- 소속: 무소속(전 대전계; 2026-10-22 세력 이동)\n- 생업: 차륜 정비\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 천왕기지 차륜 정비사\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 천왕기지 차륜 정비사 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 신정 차량기지에서 자란 허다온은 천왕 생활권의 차륜 정비사다. 2125년 출고 직전 불량 부품을 돌려보낸 일과 계측 도장 없는 개조품을 거부하는 원칙을 보존한다. 서울 내부 정비표·최다인·최한결과의 계약을 이어 간다. 대덕구 영지 서술은 2026-10-22 세력 이동으로 해소하고 민웅기 직속 관계는 유지한다.\n- 거주·업무 위치: 오류2동 행정동 범위 거주, 천왕역 대합실의 생활 화물 인계·배급 창구 업무. 주택·침상 권리와 독점 점유를 부여하지 않으며 서울 직위·영지 수여나 무토지 확정이 아니다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 천왕기지 차륜 정비사. 출고 차륜마다 계측 도장을 찍고, 도장 없는 개조품은 유치선에 들이지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 천왕기지 차륜 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 정시우에게 공차 지도로 묶여 있고, 최다인의 공병 작업반에 차륜을 대며, 최한결의 신정 보수열차와 밀봉·차륜을 계약으로 나눈다.\n\n**야망.** 열차 바퀴 나사의 호환 치수를 한 장의 정비표에 적어 두어, 겨울 고장에도 아무 공방이나 고칠 수 있게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 경비대가 군수 전용 나사를 따로 깎아 민간 수리망이 하루아침에 호환 불능이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 봉인 나사의 실측 공차를 가져와 봉인을 풀거나, 군수 전용 나사의 숨은 도면을 찾아 규격 분열을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 10 | 무력 −15 | 물질 45 | 공동 45 | 원칙 10 | 공개 40 | 자격 60 | 분산 30 | 변혁 30\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 20 | 위험 30 | 과시 −25 | 지속 5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1008","name":"민웅기","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"직속 부하","courtId":"court:K1008","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"허다온","type":"계약","to":"이일섭","basis":"출고 부품을 함께 확인하도록 차륜 검사 기록을 보낸다"},{"from":"허다온","type":"스승과 제자","to":"정시우","basis":"정시우에게 공차 지도로 묶여 있고"},{"from":"허다온","type":"계약","to":"최다인","basis":"최다인의 공병 작업반에 차륜을 대며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"이일섭","type":"계약","to":"허다온","basis":"차륜 검사 기록으로 분공방 출고 부품의 계측값을 대조한다"},{"from":"명소이","type":"계약","to":"허다온","basis":"허다온의 차륜 시운전에 맞춰 침목을 갈아 끼우며"},{"from":"표예담","type":"계약","to":"허다온","basis":"허다온의 차륜 출고를 배차판에서 보증하고"},{"from":"변주아","type":"지휘","to":"허다온","basis":"허다온의 시운전에 심야 주파수만 빌려 준다"},{"from":"엄누리","type":"계약","to":"허다온","basis":"허다온의 차륜 정비 일지에 균열을 옮기고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0039', 'ad6c-b2a5-c131', '{"id":"person-0039","name":"Gu Chansol","title":"Guro Tool Market Logistics Merchant","position":"Guro Tool Market Logistics Merchant","characterId":"K039","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Tool Logistics Trading","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"polity:daejeon","stateName":"Daejeon","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#person-gu-chansol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0039","birthDate":"2086-10-29","birthday":"10-29","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k039-cargo-priority","name":"Repair-material scheduling","rating":60},{"id":"k039-loss-disclosure","name":"Loss disclosure","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k039-roof-nails-apart","name":"Keep roof nails separate","description":"Does not mix roof nails into military crates.","behavior":"Does not mix roof nails into military crates.","stress":"That if the fuel of the winter market warehouse were cut, freight would become a hostage of whoever holds the fuel.","relationship":"A contract binding freight permits to Kim Nayul''s proficiency roster, dispatching Park Soeon''s building-repair materials first, and clashing whenever I Gangmuk''s double locks shut the warehouse.","effects":[]},{"id":"k039-skill-record-cargo","name":"Skill records and cargo","description":"Separately unloads cargo of foremen hiding skill scores.","behavior":"Separately unloads cargo of foremen hiding skill scores.","stress":"That if the fuel of the winter market warehouse were cut, freight would become a hostage of whoever holds the fuel.","relationship":"A contract binding freight permits to Kim Nayul''s proficiency roster, dispatching Park Soeon''s building-repair materials first, and clashing whenever I Gangmuk''s double locks shut the warehouse.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Reflects checking crate weights, prioritizing home-repair materials, and disclosing losses. Expanded logistics permission is not assumed.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6c-b2a5-c131","name":"Neungseong Gu Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ad6c-b2a5-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":15,"Force":-20,"Material":60,"Communal":40,"Principle":-10,"Public":30,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":10,"Display":20,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Unaffiliated (formerly Daejeon Bloc; power shift 2026-10-22)","Livelihood":"Tool Logistics Trading","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Guro Tool Market Logistics Merchant","Residence and Work Location":"Resides within the Guro 5-dong administrative district; works at the living-freight handover and rationing counter in the Guro Station concourse. No housing or bed rights or exclusive occupancy are granted, and this is neither a Seoul rank or domain grant nor a confirmation of landlessness.","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 15 | Force −20 | Materialism 60 | Communal 40 | Principle −10 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 55 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 20","Desires":"Craving 35 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 10 | Display 20 | Endurance 30 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Noryangjin wharf. The post of logistics merchant at the Guro Tool Market opened through the public disclosure of a scale recheck.\n- Gu Chansol, who grew up at the Noryangjin wharf, handles the transport of tools and repair materials in the Guro living area. Preserves the 2125 incident of distributing the grain first and disclosing the loss ledger, the dealings with Kim Nayul and Bak Soeon, and the conflict over Yi Gangmuk''s warehouse blockade. The Daejeon Seo-gu domain was resolved by the 2026-10-22 faction shift.\n- Residence/work location: resides within the Guro 5-dong administrative district; works at the living-freight handover and rationing counter in the Guro Station concourse. No housing or bed rights or exclusive occupancy are granted, and this is neither a Seoul rank or domain grant nor a confirmation of landlessness.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Guro Tool Market Logistics Merchant. Posts shipped crates on the labor union blackboard, and does not put transport without citizenship registration on the Guild Council agenda.","Anecdote":"In 2125, handed out grain that had begun to rot first and disclosed the loss ledger. Because of this, his signature for the post of logistics merchant at the Guro Tool Market was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"A contract binding Kim Nayul''s skill roster to freight permits; gives priority dispatch to Bak Soeon''s building repair materials; and clashes with Yi Gangmuk when his double lock seals the warehouse.","Ambition":"Bind the transport of tools and power equipment to the union lottery ledger so that military work crews cannot preempt civilian repairs.","Fear":"That once the winter market warehouse''s fuel is cut, logistics will become a hostage of whoever holds the fuel.","Intervention":"Can protect the strike workshop''s skill roster to push its permit through, or expose the tampering with box weights to shake the logistics counter."},"biography":"Reads deception from the weight of a box, and sets down the freight of foremen who hide skill scores in the alleys rather than at the berth. Enjoys practical gain, but does not mix roof nails into military crates.\n\n- Affiliation: Unaffiliated (formerly Daejeon Bloc; power shift 2026-10-22)\n- Livelihood: Tool Logistics Trading\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Guro Tool Market Logistics Merchant\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Noryangjin wharf. The post of logistics merchant at the Guro Tool Market opened through the public disclosure of a scale recheck.\n- Gu Chansol, who grew up at the Noryangjin wharf, handles the transport of tools and repair materials in the Guro living area. Preserves the 2125 incident of distributing the grain first and disclosing the loss ledger, the dealings with Kim Nayul and Bak Soeon, and the conflict over Yi Gangmuk''s warehouse blockade. The Daejeon Seo-gu domain was resolved by the 2026-10-22 faction shift.\n- Residence/work location: resides within the Guro 5-dong administrative district; works at the living-freight handover and rationing counter in the Guro Station concourse. No housing or bed rights or exclusive occupancy are granted, and this is neither a Seoul rank or domain grant nor a confirmation of landlessness.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Guro Tool Market Logistics Merchant. Posts shipped crates on the labor union blackboard, and does not put transport without citizenship registration on the Guild Council agenda.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, handed out grain that had begun to rot first and disclosed the loss ledger. Because of this, his signature for the post of logistics merchant at the Guro Tool Market was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** A contract binding Kim Nayul''s skill roster to freight permits; gives priority dispatch to Bak Soeon''s building repair materials; and clashes with Yi Gangmuk when his double lock seals the warehouse.\n\n**Ambition.** Bind the transport of tools and power equipment to the union lottery ledger so that military work crews cannot preempt civilian repairs.\n\n**Fear.** That once the winter market warehouse''s fuel is cut, logistics will become a hostage of whoever holds the fuel.\n\n**Intervention.** Can protect the strike workshop''s skill roster to push its permit through, or expose the tampering with box weights to shake the logistics counter.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 15 | Force −20 | Materialism 60 | Communal 40 | Principle −10 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 55 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 10 | Display 20 | Endurance 30 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding None\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1008","name":"Min Ung-gi","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"Direct Subordinate","courtId":"court:K1008","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gu Chansol","type":"Contract","to":"I Ilseop","basis":"Returns the part-transport records to be matched against the branch workshop''s grain loss ledger."},{"from":"Gu Chansol","type":"Contract","to":"Kim Nayul","basis":"A contract that ties Gim Nayul''s skill roster to freight permits, and"},{"from":"Gu Chansol","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Soeon","basis":"Dispatching building repair materials to Bak So-eon first,"}],"incoming":[{"from":"I Ilseop","type":"Contract","to":"Gu Chansol","basis":"Cross-checks the First Branch Workshop''s grain loss ledger against the part-transport records."},{"from":"Chae Riul","type":"Contract","to":"Gu Chansol","basis":"Backs Gu Chansol''s blockade of tool shipments out with patrols."},{"from":"Byeon Siram","type":"Contract","to":"Gu Chansol","basis":"Placing Gu Chansol''s tool wagon in the platform turn order and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0039","name":"구찬솔","title":"구로 공구시장 물류상","position":"구로 공구시장 물류상","characterId":"K039","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"공구 물류 거래","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"polity:daejeon","stateName":"대전","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-구찬솔","detailRoute":"/people/person-0039","birthDate":"2086-10-29","birthday":"10-29","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k039-cargo-priority","name":"수리 자재 배차","rating":60},{"id":"k039-loss-disclosure","name":"손실 공개","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k039-roof-nails-apart","name":"지붕 못은 따로","description":"지붕 못을 군수 상자에 섞지 않는다.","behavior":"지붕 못을 군수 상자에 섞지 않는다.","stress":"겨울 시장 창고의 연료가 끊기면 물류가 연료를 쥔 쪽의 볼모가 되는 것.","relationship":"김나율의 숙련 명부를 화물 허가에 묶는 계약이고, 박소언의 건물 수리 자재를 우선 배차하며, 이강묵의 이중 자물쇠가 창고를 잠글 때 충돌한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k039-skill-record-cargo","name":"숙련 명부와 화물","description":"숙련 점수를 숨기는 반장의 화물을 따로 내린다.","behavior":"숙련 점수를 숨기는 반장의 화물을 따로 내린다.","stress":"겨울 시장 창고의 연료가 끊기면 물류가 연료를 쥔 쪽의 볼모가 되는 것.","relationship":"김나율의 숙련 명부를 화물 허가에 묶는 계약이고, 박소언의 건물 수리 자재를 우선 배차하며, 이강묵의 이중 자물쇠가 창고를 잠글 때 충돌한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"상자 무게 확인과 민가 수리 자재 우선 배차, 손실 공개를 반영했다. 물류 허가가 확대되었다고 단정하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6c-b2a5-c131","name":"능성 구씨","crest":"clan-crests/ad6c-b2a5-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":15,"무력":-20,"물질":60,"공동":40,"원칙":-10,"공개":30,"자격":55,"분산":10,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":-10,"위험":10,"과시":20,"지속":30,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"무소속(전 대전계; 2026-10-22 세력 이동)","생업":"공구 물류 거래","품계":"조합원","직함":"구로 공구시장 물류상","거주·업무 위치":"구로5동 행정동 범위 거주, 구로역 대합실의 생활 화물 인계·배급 창구 업무. 주택·침상 권리와 독점 점유를 부여하지 않으며 서울 직위·영지 수여나 무토지 확정이 아니다.","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 60 | 공동 40 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 30 | 자격 55 | 분산 10 | 변혁 20","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 −10 | 위험 10 | 과시 20 | 지속 30 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 구로 공구시장 물류상 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 노량진 선창에서 자란 구찬솔은 구로 생활권에서 공구·수리 자재 운송을 맡는다. 2125년 곡물을 먼저 배분하고 손실 장부를 공개한 일, 김나율·박소언과의 거래와 이강묵의 창고 봉쇄 갈등을 보존한다. 대전 서구 영지는 2026-10-22 세력 이동으로 해소하였다.\n- 거주·업무 위치: 구로5동 행정동 범위 거주, 구로역 대합실의 생활 화물 인계·배급 창구 업무. 주택·침상 권리와 독점 점유를 부여하지 않으며 서울 직위·영지 수여나 무토지 확정이 아니다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 구로 공구시장 물류상. 출고 상자를 노동조합 칠판에 공개하고, 시민권 미등록 운송은 길드 평의회 안건으로 올리지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 썩기 시작한 곡물을 먼저 나눠 주고 손실 장부를 공개했다. 이 일로 구로 공구시장 물류상 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"김나율의 숙련 명부를 화물 허가에 묶는 계약이고, 박소언의 건물 수리 자재를 우선 배차하며, 이강묵의 이중 자물쇠가 창고를 잠글 때 충돌한다.","야망":"공구와 전력 장치의 운송을 조합 추첨 원장으로 묶어 군수 작업반이 민가 수리를 선점하지 못하게 한다.","공포":"겨울 시장 창고의 연료가 끊기면 물류가 연료를 쥔 쪽의 볼모가 되는 것.","개입":"파업 공방의 숙련 명부를 지켜 그의 허가를 통과시키거나, 상자 무게 조작을 밝혀 물류 창구를 흔들 수 있다."},"biography":"상자 무게로 속임수를 읽고, 숙련 점수를 숨기는 반장의 화물은 선석이 아니라 골목에 내려 놓는다. 실리를 즐기되 지붕 못을 군수 상자에 섞지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 무소속(전 대전계; 2026-10-22 세력 이동)\n- 생업: 공구 물류 거래\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 구로 공구시장 물류상\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 구로 공구시장 물류상 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 노량진 선창에서 자란 구찬솔은 구로 생활권에서 공구·수리 자재 운송을 맡는다. 2125년 곡물을 먼저 배분하고 손실 장부를 공개한 일, 김나율·박소언과의 거래와 이강묵의 창고 봉쇄 갈등을 보존한다. 대전 서구 영지는 2026-10-22 세력 이동으로 해소하였다.\n- 거주·업무 위치: 구로5동 행정동 범위 거주, 구로역 대합실의 생활 화물 인계·배급 창구 업무. 주택·침상 권리와 독점 점유를 부여하지 않으며 서울 직위·영지 수여나 무토지 확정이 아니다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 구로 공구시장 물류상. 출고 상자를 노동조합 칠판에 공개하고, 시민권 미등록 운송은 길드 평의회 안건으로 올리지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 썩기 시작한 곡물을 먼저 나눠 주고 손실 장부를 공개했다. 이 일로 구로 공구시장 물류상 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 김나율의 숙련 명부를 화물 허가에 묶는 계약이고, 박소언의 건물 수리 자재를 우선 배차하며, 이강묵의 이중 자물쇠가 창고를 잠글 때 충돌한다.\n\n**야망.** 공구와 전력 장치의 운송을 조합 추첨 원장으로 묶어 군수 작업반이 민가 수리를 선점하지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 겨울 시장 창고의 연료가 끊기면 물류가 연료를 쥔 쪽의 볼모가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 파업 공방의 숙련 명부를 지켜 그의 허가를 통과시키거나, 상자 무게 조작을 밝혀 물류 창구를 흔들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 60 | 공동 40 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 30 | 자격 55 | 분산 10 | 변혁 20\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 −10 | 위험 10 | 과시 20 | 지속 30 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1008","name":"민웅기","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"직속 부하","courtId":"court:K1008","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"구찬솔","type":"계약","to":"이일섭","basis":"분공방의 곡물 손실 장부와 맞출 부품 운송 기록을 돌려준다"},{"from":"구찬솔","type":"계약","to":"김나율","basis":"김나율의 숙련 명부를 화물 허가에 묶는 계약이고"},{"from":"구찬솔","type":"계약","to":"박소언","basis":"박소언의 건물 수리 자재를 우선 배차하며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"이일섭","type":"계약","to":"구찬솔","basis":"제1분공방의 곡물 손실 장부를 부품 운송 기록과 대조한다"},{"from":"채리울","type":"계약","to":"구찬솔","basis":"구찬솔의 공구 반출 봉쇄를 순찰로 받친다"},{"from":"변시람","type":"계약","to":"구찬솔","basis":"구찬솔의 공구 화차를 승강장 순번에 올리고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0040', 'c9c4-d48d-ae30', '{"id":"person-0040","name":"Jin Uram","title":"Geumcheon Workshop Neurosurgeon","position":"Geumcheon Workshop Neurosurgeon","characterId":"K040","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Workshop Medical Care and Neural-Link Surgery","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#person-jin-uram","detailRoute":"/people/person-0040","birthDate":"2078-09-22","birthday":"09-22","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k040-medicine-distribution","name":"Medicine distribution","rating":60},{"id":"k040-filter-clinic-allocation","name":"Filter and clinic allocation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k040-care-before-spoils","name":"Care before spoils","description":"Avoids filter-hoarding officers and opens medical meals when rations run out.","behavior":"Avoids filter-hoarding officers and opens medical meals when rations run out.","stress":"That filter fabric would pile up in one place and the Geumcheon work crews would be left in dust and cold.","relationship":"Near an apprentice applying Im Chaewon''s filter standards to care, opening duty meals whenever Han Jion''s ration pot ran empty, and locking releases whenever Choi Eunjae''s filter certification stamp lapsed.","effects":[]},{"id":"k040-certified-release","name":"Release after certification","description":"Blocks filter release without certification seals.","behavior":"Blocks filter release without certification seals.","stress":"That filter fabric would pile up in one place and the Geumcheon work crews would be left in dust and cold.","relationship":"Near an apprentice applying Im Chaewon''s filter standards to care, opening duty meals whenever Han Jion''s ration pot ran empty, and locking releases whenever Choi Eunjae''s filter certification stamp lapsed.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Medicine allocation and applying filter standards are confirmed. Observing dust coughs does not grant advanced surgery or research proficiency.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41590-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K040","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c4-d48d-ae30","name":"Pungi Jin Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c9c4-d48d-ae30.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":15,"Force":-40,"Material":30,"Communal":35,"Principle":20,"Public":30,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":-10,"Display":-5,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Workshop Medical Care and Neural-Link Surgery","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Geumcheon Workshop Neurosurgeon","Work Location":"Gasan-dong. On Gasan-dong workshop clinic duty, Jin Uram checks the protective-suit filter numbers of dust patients. If Im Chaewon''s dispatch slip and Choe Eunjae''s certification stamp do not match, they hold that lot, and they record the number of medical meals served on days when Han Jion''s ration pot is empty.","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 15 | Force −40 | Material 30 | Communal 35 | Principle 20 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness 40 | Risk −10 | Display −5 | Persistence −10 | Orientation same-sex | Union none"},"sections":{"Life":"Born into the 2126 generation. Raised at the Jegi-dong infirmary. The post of Geumcheon Workshop Medic opened up through the discovery of a fake medicine seal.\n- Work location: Gasan-dong. On Gasan-dong workshop clinic duty, Jin Uram checks the protective-suit filter numbers of dust patients. If Im Chaewon''s dispatch slip and Choe Eunjae''s certification stamp do not match, they hold that lot, and they record the number of medical meals served on days when Han Jion''s ration pot is empty.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Geumcheon Workshop Neurosurgeon. Writes the number of patients treated and filter dispatches on the same blackboard, and allows priority allocation to the quartermaster only when the disaster-prevention sample exceeds the threshold.","Anecdote":"In 2125, during a medicine shortage, they halved the prescribed amounts and shared them out to everyone. Because of this, the signature for the post of Geumcheon Workshop Medic went into the ledger.","Relationships":"Close to a disciple who applies Im Chaewon''s filter standards to treatment, opens a medical meal service when Han Jion''s ration pot runs empty, and locks dispatch when Choe Eunjae''s filter certification stamp is missing.","Ambition":"Gets protective filters and workshop care to all workshop hands, so that they can breathe even in winter dust.","Fear":"The filter fabric piling up in only one place, leaving the Geumcheon work crews abandoned in dust and cold.","Intervention":"Can find substitute fabric, or expose the filters hidden in the quartermaster warehouse to turn the direction of the vote."},"biography":"Hears dust coughs before welding sparks, and avoids officers who stockpile protective filters like spoils as if they were a calamity. Merciful, but does not forgive number games played on an empty stomach.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Workshop Medical Care and Neural-Link Surgery\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Geumcheon Workshop Neurosurgeon\n**Life.** Born into the 2126 generation. Raised at the Jegi-dong infirmary. The post of Geumcheon Workshop Medic opened up through the discovery of a fake medicine seal.\n- Work location: Gasan-dong. On Gasan-dong workshop clinic duty, Jin Uram checks the protective-suit filter numbers of dust patients. If Im Chaewon''s dispatch slip and Choe Eunjae''s certification stamp do not match, they hold that lot, and they record the number of medical meals served on days when Han Jion''s ration pot is empty.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Geumcheon Workshop Neurosurgeon. Writes the number of patients treated and filter dispatches on the same blackboard, and allows priority allocation to the quartermaster only when the disaster-prevention sample exceeds the threshold.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, during a medicine shortage, they halved the prescribed amounts and shared them out to everyone. Because of this, the signature for the post of Geumcheon Workshop Medic went into the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Close to a disciple who applies Im Chaewon''s filter standards to treatment, opens a medical meal service when Han Jion''s ration pot runs empty, and locks dispatch when Choe Eunjae''s filter certification stamp is missing.\n\n**Ambition.** Gets protective filters and workshop care to all workshop hands, so that they can breathe even in winter dust.\n\n**Fear.** The filter fabric piling up in only one place, leaving the Geumcheon work crews abandoned in dust and cold.\n\n**Intervention.** Can find substitute fabric, or expose the filters hidden in the quartermaster warehouse to turn the direction of the vote.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 15 | Force −40 | Material 30 | Communal 35 | Principle 20 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Possessiveness 40 | Risk −10 | Display −5 | Persistence −10 | Orientation same-sex | Union none\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jin Uram","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Im Chaewon","basis":"Is close to a disciple who applies Im Chaewon''s filter standards to medical care, and"},{"from":"Jin Uram","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Han Jion","basis":"Opens compulsory meal service when Han Jion''s ration pot runs empty, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Je Munseok","type":"Contract","to":"Jin Uram","basis":"Splitting Jin Uram''s Geumcheon medical duty from patient transfers and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0040","name":"진우람","title":"금천 공방 신경외과의","position":"금천 공방 신경외과의","characterId":"K040","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"공방 진료·신경 연결 수술","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-진우람","detailRoute":"/people/person-0040","birthDate":"2078-09-22","birthday":"09-22","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k040-medicine-distribution","name":"약재 분배","rating":60},{"id":"k040-filter-clinic-allocation","name":"필터·진료 배분","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k040-care-before-spoils","name":"전리품보다 진료","description":"필터를 쌓아 두는 장교를 피하고 배급이 비면 의무 배식을 연다.","behavior":"필터를 쌓아 두는 장교를 피하고 배급이 비면 의무 배식을 연다.","stress":"필터 원단이 한 곳에만 쌓여 금천 작업반이 분진과 한기 속에 방치되는 것.","relationship":"임채원의 필터 규격을 진료에 적용하는 제자에 가깝고, 한지온의 배급 솥이 비면 의무 배식을 열며, 최은재의 필터 인증 도장이 떨어지면 출고를 잠근다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k040-certified-release","name":"인증 뒤 출고","description":"인증 도장이 없으면 필터 출고를 잠근다.","behavior":"인증 도장이 없으면 필터 출고를 잠근다.","stress":"필터 원단이 한 곳에만 쌓여 금천 작업반이 분진과 한기 속에 방치되는 것.","relationship":"임채원의 필터 규격을 진료에 적용하는 제자에 가깝고, 한지온의 배급 솥이 비면 의무 배식을 열며, 최은재의 필터 인증 도장이 떨어지면 출고를 잠근다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"약재 배분과 필터 규격 적용이 확인된다. 분진 기침 관찰을 고난도 수술이나 전문 연구 숙련으로 환산하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41590-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K040","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c4-d48d-ae30","name":"풍기 진씨","crest":"clan-crests/c9c4-d48d-ae30.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":15,"무력":-40,"물질":30,"공동":35,"원칙":20,"공개":30,"자격":45,"분산":25,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":40,"위험":-10,"과시":-5,"지속":-10,"지향":"동성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"공방 진료·신경 연결 수술","품계":"조합원","직함":"금천 공방 신경외과의","업무 위치":"가산동. 진우람은 가산동 공방 진료 당직에서 분진 환자의 방호복 필터 번호를 확인한다. 임채원의 출고표와 최은재의 인증 도장이 맞지 않으면 그 물량을 보류하고, 한지온의 배급솥이 비는 날의 의무 배식 수를 적는다.","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 15 | 무력 −40 | 물질 30 | 공동 35 | 원칙 20 | 공개 30 | 자격 45 | 분산 25 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 40 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −5 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 금천 공방의무원 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 가산동. 진우람은 가산동 공방 진료 당직에서 분진 환자의 방호복 필터 번호를 확인한다. 임채원의 출고표와 최은재의 인증 도장이 맞지 않으면 그 물량을 보류하고, 한지온의 배급솥이 비는 날의 의무 배식 수를 적는다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 금천 공방 신경외과의. 진료 인원과 필터 출고를 같은 칠판에 쓰고, 군수 우선 배정은 방재 표본이 기준을 넘을 때만 허용한다.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 금천 공방의무원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"임채원의 필터 규격을 진료에 적용하는 제자에 가깝고, 한지온의 배급 솥이 비면 의무 배식을 열며, 최은재의 필터 인증 도장이 떨어지면 출고를 잠근다.","야망":"방호 필터와 공방 진료를 공방 일꾼 모두에게 돌려 겨울 분진 속에서도 숨 쉬게 한다.","공포":"필터 원단이 한 곳에만 쌓여 금천 작업반이 분진과 한기 속에 방치되는 것.","개입":"대체 원단을 구하거나, 군수 창고에 숨긴 필터를 폭로해 투표의 방향을 바꿀 수 있다."},"biography":"분진 기침을 용접 불꽃보다 먼저 듣고, 방호 필터를 전리품처럼 쌓는 장교를 재앙처럼 피한다. 자비롭지만 공복 상태의 숫자 놀음을 용서하지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 공방 진료·신경 연결 수술\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 금천 공방 신경외과의\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 금천 공방의무원 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 가산동. 진우람은 가산동 공방 진료 당직에서 분진 환자의 방호복 필터 번호를 확인한다. 임채원의 출고표와 최은재의 인증 도장이 맞지 않으면 그 물량을 보류하고, 한지온의 배급솥이 비는 날의 의무 배식 수를 적는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 금천 공방 신경외과의. 진료 인원과 필터 출고를 같은 칠판에 쓰고, 군수 우선 배정은 방재 표본이 기준을 넘을 때만 허용한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 금천 공방의무원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 임채원의 필터 규격을 진료에 적용하는 제자에 가깝고, 한지온의 배급 솥이 비면 의무 배식을 열며, 최은재의 필터 인증 도장이 떨어지면 출고를 잠근다.\n\n**야망.** 방호 필터와 공방 진료를 공방 일꾼 모두에게 돌려 겨울 분진 속에서도 숨 쉬게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 필터 원단이 한 곳에만 쌓여 금천 작업반이 분진과 한기 속에 방치되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대체 원단을 구하거나, 군수 창고에 숨긴 필터를 폭로해 투표의 방향을 바꿀 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 15 | 무력 −40 | 물질 30 | 공동 35 | 원칙 20 | 공개 30 | 자격 45 | 분산 25 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 40 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −5 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"진우람","type":"스승과 제자","to":"임채원","basis":"임채원의 필터 규격을 진료에 적용하는 제자에 가깝고"},{"from":"진우람","type":"스승과 제자","to":"한지온","basis":"한지온의 배급 솥이 비면 의무 배식을 열며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"제문석","type":"계약","to":"진우람","basis":"진우람의 금천 의무와 환자 이송을 나누고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0041', 'cc44-d3c9-ac15', '{"id":"person-0041","name":"Chae Riul","title":"Guro Workshop Patrol Squad Leader","position":"Guro Workshop Patrol Squad Leader","characterId":"K041","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Workshop Patrol","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#person-chae-riul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0041","birthDate":"2076-04-12","birthday":"04-12","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"k041-patrol-route","name":"Patrol-route administration","rating":60},{"id":"k041-training-report-review","name":"Training-report review","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k041-dual-authorization","name":"Dual authorization","description":"Follows night drafts only with both civilian records and guard codes.","behavior":"Follows night drafts only with both civilian records and guard codes.","stress":"That the labor union would stop parts releases, the patrol would hold empty barrier gates, and the outskirts would be pierced by looting.","relationship":"A double contract taking I Gangmuk''s barrier-gate command while protecting Kim Nayul''s citizenship roster, and backing Gu Chansol''s tool-export blockade with patrols.","effects":[]},{"id":"k041-delay-not-betrayal","name":"Delay is not betrayal","description":"Does not interpret union delays as betrayal.","behavior":"Does not interpret union delays as betrayal.","stress":"That the labor union would stop parts releases, the patrol would hold empty barrier gates, and the outskirts would be pierced by looting.","relationship":"A double contract taking I Gangmuk''s barrier-gate command while protecting Kim Nayul''s citizenship roster, and backing Gu Chansol''s tool-export blockade with patrols.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Reopens training reports and binds patrols to a dual contract. Being shown holding a gun does not establish accuracy or battle victories.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc44-d3c9-ac15","name":"Pyeonggang Chae Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cc44-d3c9-ac15.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":0,"Force":0,"Material":40,"Communal":50,"Principle":10,"Public":25,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":25},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-40,"Display":-5,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Workshop Patrol","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Guro Workshop Patrol Squad Leader","Work Location":"Guro 2-dong. Chae Riul posts a winter barrier-gate shift table on the patrol route between the Guro 2-dong workshops. While taking I Gangmuk''s barrier-gate command, under the contract to protect Kim Nayul''s citizenship register, they route anything beyond tool removal to Gu Chansol as records.","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 0 | Force 0 | Material 40 | Communal 50 | Principle 10 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 25","Desires":"Craving −10 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk −40 | Display −5 | Persistence 35 | Orientation opposite-sex | Union contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born into the 2126 generation. Raised at the Amsa guard post. The post of Guro Workshop Patrol Squad Leader opened up after catching an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- Work location: Guro 2-dong. Chae Riul posts a winter barrier-gate shift table on the patrol route between the Guro 2-dong workshops. While taking I Gangmuk''s barrier-gate command, under the contract to protect Kim Nayul''s citizenship register, they route anything beyond tool removal to Gu Chansol as records.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Guro Workshop Patrol Squad Leader. Makes daytime patrol routes public, but follows night armed drafts only when both Kim Nayul''s register and I Gangmuk''s passcode are present.","Anecdote":"In 2125, when the first report turned out wrong during a bridge-raid drill, they reopened the observation car. Because of this, the signature for the post of Guro Workshop Patrol Squad Leader went into the ledger.","Relationships":"A dual contract of taking command of the barrier gates from I Gangmuk while protecting Kim Nayul''s citizenship register, and backing Gu Chansol''s blockade of tool removal with patrols.","Ambition":"Binds workshop patrols under the seal of the Guild Council, so that the guard corps cannot lock in striking workshops.","Fear":"The labor union halting parts dispatch, leaving the patrol guarding only empty barrier gates until it is broken through by raiders from the outskirts.","Intervention":"Can justify their dual contract by helping to stop the raids from the outskirts, or hand a secret weapons production notebook to the Guild Council to have the squad leader replaced."},"biography":"Suspects the blanks in the sabotage list before the rust on the barrier gates, and does not lower the gun in front of the tool warehouse even when debates drag on. Takes responsibility for subordinates'' family rations, but does not read delay on the union side as betrayal.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Workshop Patrol\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Guro Workshop Patrol Squad Leader\n**Life.** Born into the 2126 generation. Raised at the Amsa guard post. The post of Guro Workshop Patrol Squad Leader opened up after catching an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- Work location: Guro 2-dong. Chae Riul posts a winter barrier-gate shift table on the patrol route between the Guro 2-dong workshops. While taking I Gangmuk''s barrier-gate command, under the contract to protect Kim Nayul''s citizenship register, they route anything beyond tool removal to Gu Chansol as records.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Guro Workshop Patrol Squad Leader. Makes daytime patrol routes public, but follows night armed drafts only when both Kim Nayul''s register and I Gangmuk''s passcode are present.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, when the first report turned out wrong during a bridge-raid drill, they reopened the observation car. Because of this, the signature for the post of Guro Workshop Patrol Squad Leader went into the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** A dual contract of taking command of the barrier gates from I Gangmuk while protecting Kim Nayul''s citizenship register, and backing Gu Chansol''s blockade of tool removal with patrols.\n\n**Ambition.** Binds workshop patrols under the seal of the Guild Council, so that the guard corps cannot lock in striking workshops.\n\n**Fear.** The labor union halting parts dispatch, leaving the patrol guarding only empty barrier gates until it is broken through by raiders from the outskirts.\n\n**Intervention.** Can justify their dual contract by helping to stop the raids from the outskirts, or hand a secret weapons production notebook to the Guild Council to have the squad leader replaced.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 0 | Force 0 | Material 40 | Communal 50 | Principle 10 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 25\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk −40 | Display −5 | Persistence 35 | Orientation opposite-sex | Union contract cohabitation\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K032","name":"I Gangmuk","courtId":"court:K032","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Chae Riul","type":"Command","to":"I Gangmuk","basis":"A double contract in which he takes I Gangmuk''s barrier-gate command while guarding Kim Nayul''s citizenship register"},{"from":"Chae Riul","type":"Contract","to":"Gu Chansol","basis":"Backs Gu Chansol''s blockade of tool shipments out with patrols."}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0041","name":"채리울","title":"구로 공방 순찰대 조장","position":"구로 공방 순찰대 조장","characterId":"K041","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"공방 순찰","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-채리울","detailRoute":"/people/person-0041","birthDate":"2076-04-12","birthday":"04-12","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"k041-patrol-route","name":"순찰 경로 운영","rating":60},{"id":"k041-training-report-review","name":"훈련 보고 재검토","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k041-dual-authorization","name":"이중 확인 차출","description":"시민권 명부와 경비 암호가 함께 있어야 야간 차출에 따른다.","behavior":"시민권 명부와 경비 암호가 함께 있어야 야간 차출에 따른다.","stress":"노동조합이 부품 출고를 멈춰 순찰대가 빈 차단문만 지키다 외곽 약탈에 뚫리는 것.","relationship":"이강묵의 차단문 지휘를 받되 김나율의 시민권 명부를 지키는 이중 계약이고, 구찬솔의 공구 반출 봉쇄를 순찰로 받친다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k041-delay-not-betrayal","name":"지연은 배신이 아니다","description":"조합 지연을 배신으로 읽지 않는다.","behavior":"조합 지연을 배신으로 읽지 않는다.","stress":"노동조합이 부품 출고를 멈춰 순찰대가 빈 차단문만 지키다 외곽 약탈에 뚫리는 것.","relationship":"이강묵의 차단문 지휘를 받되 김나율의 시민권 명부를 지키는 이중 계약이고, 구찬솔의 공구 반출 봉쇄를 순찰로 받친다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"훈련 보고를 다시 열고 순찰을 이중 계약에 묶는다. 총을 지닌 장면을 실전 명중이나 교전 승리로 발급하지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc44-d3c9-ac15","name":"평강 채씨","crest":"clan-crests/cc44-d3c9-ac15.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":0,"무력":0,"물질":40,"공동":50,"원칙":10,"공개":25,"자격":45,"분산":15,"변혁":25},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":-20,"위험":-40,"과시":-5,"지속":35,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"공방 순찰","품계":"조합원","직함":"구로 공방 순찰대 조장","업무 위치":"구로2동. 채리울은 구로2동 공방 사이 순찰 노선에 겨울 차단문 교대표를 붙인다. 이강묵의 차단문 지휘를 받으면서도 김나율의 시민권 명부를 지키기로 한 계약에 따라 공구 반출 이상을 구찬솔에게 기록으로 돌린다.","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 0 | 무력 0 | 물질 40 | 공동 50 | 원칙 10 | 공개 25 | 자격 45 | 분산 15 | 변혁 25","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −40 | 과시 −5 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 구로 공방 순찰대 조장 자리는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로2동. 채리울은 구로2동 공방 사이 순찰 노선에 겨울 차단문 교대표를 붙인다. 이강묵의 차단문 지휘를 받으면서도 김나율의 시민권 명부를 지키기로 한 계약에 따라 공구 반출 이상을 구찬솔에게 기록으로 돌린다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 구로 공방 순찰대 조장. 주간 순찰 경로를 공개하되, 야간 무장 차출은 김나율의 명부와 이강묵의 암호가 동시에 있어야 따른다.","일화":"2125년 교량 습격 훈련에서 최초 보고가 틀리자 참관 칸을 다시 열었다. 이 일로 구로 공방 순찰대 조장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"이강묵의 차단문 지휘를 받되 김나율의 시민권 명부를 지키는 이중 계약이고, 구찬솔의 공구 반출 봉쇄를 순찰로 받친다.","야망":"공방 순찰을 길드 평의회의 도장 아래 묶어, 경비대가 파업 공방을 가두지 못하게 한다.","공포":"노동조합이 부품 출고를 멈춰 순찰대가 빈 차단문만 지키다 외곽 약탈에 뚫리는 것.","개입":"외곽 약탈을 함께 막아 그의 이중 계약을 정당화하거나, 비밀 병기 생산 수첩을 길드 평의회에 넘겨 조장을 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"차단문 녹보다 태업 명단의 빈칸을 먼저 의심하고, 토론이 길어져도 공구 창고 앞에서 총을 내리지 않는다. 부하 가족의 배급은 책임지되 조합 쪽 지연을 배신으로 읽지는 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 공방 순찰\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 구로 공방 순찰대 조장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 구로 공방 순찰대 조장 자리는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로2동. 채리울은 구로2동 공방 사이 순찰 노선에 겨울 차단문 교대표를 붙인다. 이강묵의 차단문 지휘를 받으면서도 김나율의 시민권 명부를 지키기로 한 계약에 따라 공구 반출 이상을 구찬솔에게 기록으로 돌린다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 구로 공방 순찰대 조장. 주간 순찰 경로를 공개하되, 야간 무장 차출은 김나율의 명부와 이강묵의 암호가 동시에 있어야 따른다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 교량 습격 훈련에서 최초 보고가 틀리자 참관 칸을 다시 열었다. 이 일로 구로 공방 순찰대 조장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 이강묵의 차단문 지휘를 받되 김나율의 시민권 명부를 지키는 이중 계약이고, 구찬솔의 공구 반출 봉쇄를 순찰로 받친다.\n\n**야망.** 공방 순찰을 길드 평의회의 도장 아래 묶어, 경비대가 파업 공방을 가두지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 노동조합이 부품 출고를 멈춰 순찰대가 빈 차단문만 지키다 외곽 약탈에 뚫리는 것.\n\n**개입.** 외곽 약탈을 함께 막아 그의 이중 계약을 정당화하거나, 비밀 병기 생산 수첩을 길드 평의회에 넘겨 조장을 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 0 | 무력 0 | 물질 40 | 공동 50 | 원칙 10 | 공개 25 | 자격 45 | 분산 15 | 변혁 25\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −40 | 과시 −5 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K032","name":"이강묵","courtId":"court:K032","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"채리울","type":"지휘","to":"이강묵","basis":"이강묵의 차단문 지휘를 받되 김나율의 시민권 명부를 지키는 이중 계약이고"},{"from":"채리울","type":"계약","to":"구찬솔","basis":"구찬솔의 공구 반출 봉쇄를 순찰로 받친다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0042', 'd45c-c2e0-cc3d', '{"id":"person-0042","name":"Pyo Gangho","title":"Production Standards Courier","position":"Production Standards Courier","characterId":"K042","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Standards Document Delivery","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#Person-Pyo-Gangho","detailRoute":"/people/person-0042","birthDate":"2076-01-01","birthday":"01-01","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k042-standard-message-delivery","name":"Standard-message delivery","rating":65},{"id":"k042-attack-register-salvage","name":"Attack register salvage","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k042-remeasurement-notice","name":"Remeasurement notice first","description":"Does not deliver emergency revisions without remeasurement notice.","behavior":"Does not deliver emergency revisions without remeasurement notice.","stress":"That one forged gauging seal would void the whole Cheonwang ledger and the courier network would become the parts blockade''s horn.","relationship":"A contract delivering Jang Wooseok''s audit stamps in the field, guarding Jeong Siwoo''s gauging seals with verification dispatches, and carrying Gang Minseo''s exchange design only under seal.","effects":[]},{"id":"k042-life-record-first","name":"Life records first","description":"Protects the life register before cargo during an attack.","behavior":"Protects the life register before cargo during an attack.","stress":"That one forged gauging seal would void the whole Cheonwang ledger and the courier network would become the parts blockade''s horn.","relationship":"A contract delivering Jang Wooseok''s audit stamps in the field, guarding Jeong Siwoo''s gauging seals with verification dispatches, and carrying Gang Minseo''s exchange design only under seal.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Standard-notice delivery and record protection during attack are evidence. No armed escort victory or document-authoring career is added.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44150-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K042","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44150-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d45c-c2e0-cc3d","name":"Sinchang Pyo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d45c-c2e0-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":25,"Force":-5,"Material":40,"Communal":45,"Principle":10,"Public":40,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":20,"Display":-30,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Standards Document Delivery","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Production Standards Courier","Work Location":"Guro 5-dong. Pyo Gangho counts the seal numbers on the standards copies she will take to the Guro 5-dong Guild Council. If Jang Useok''s audit seal and Jeong Siu''s measuring seal do not match, she does not unseal the copy of Kang Minseo''s exchange design and sends the confirmation dispatch back.","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 25 | Force −5 | Material 40 | Communal 45 | Principle 10 | Publicity 40 | Credentials 55 | Dispersion 25 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 20 | Display −30 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Positive | Bond None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the generation of 2126. Grew up on the Sinnae Interchange watch. The Manufacturing Standards Courier post opened up after she stopped a ticketless departing train.\n- Workplace: Guro 5-dong. Pyo Gangho counts the seal numbers on the standards copies she will take to the Guro 5-dong Guild Council. If Jang Useok''s audit seal and Jeong Siu''s measuring seal do not match, she does not unseal the copy of Kang Minseo''s exchange design and sends the confirmation dispatch back.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Production Standards Courier. She delivers standards copies to the guild council and the workshops at the same time, and does not run even an emergency revision unless a re-measurement notice has come within three days.","Anecdote":"In 2125, she was caught in a raid during an escort and secured the ledger of persons before the cargo. Because of this, the signature for the Manufacturing Standards Courier post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"She holds a contract to deliver Jang Useok''s audit seals on site, protects Jeong Siu''s measuring seals with verification dispatches, and carries Kang Minseo''s exchange designs only while they remain sealed.","Ambition":"To post every change notice for the workshops'' repair order on a single board, so that the order cannot be quietly changed under the pretext of a winter emergency.","Fear":"A single forged measuring seal invalidating the entire Cheonwang ledger, turning the courier network into a bugle call for a parts blockade.","Intervention":"She can track the workshop that made a defective part, or catch whoever forged a dispatch seal and bring the courier network to a halt."},"biography":"She memorizes the measurement figures on the standards copies, and calls any elder who does not enter a verbally agreed compatibility into the ledger an enemy of the standard. When the sealing cord gets wet, she sets out again.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Standards Document Delivery\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Production Standards Courier\n**Life.** Born in the generation of 2126. Grew up on the Sinnae Interchange watch. The Manufacturing Standards Courier post opened up after she stopped a ticketless departing train.\n- Workplace: Guro 5-dong. Pyo Gangho counts the seal numbers on the standards copies she will take to the Guro 5-dong Guild Council. If Jang Useok''s audit seal and Jeong Siu''s measuring seal do not match, she does not unseal the copy of Kang Minseo''s exchange design and sends the confirmation dispatch back.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Production Standards Courier. She delivers standards copies to the guild council and the workshops at the same time, and does not run even an emergency revision unless a re-measurement notice has come within three days.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, she was caught in a raid during an escort and secured the ledger of persons before the cargo. Because of this, the signature for the Manufacturing Standards Courier post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** She holds a contract to deliver Jang Useok''s audit seals on site, protects Jeong Siu''s measuring seals with verification dispatches, and carries Kang Minseo''s exchange designs only while they remain sealed.\n\n**Ambition.** To post every change notice for the workshops'' repair order on a single board, so that the order cannot be quietly changed under the pretext of a winter emergency.\n\n**Fear.** A single forged measuring seal invalidating the entire Cheonwang ledger, turning the courier network into a bugle call for a parts blockade.\n\n**Intervention.** She can track the workshop that made a defective part, or catch whoever forged a dispatch seal and bring the courier network to a halt.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 25 | Force −5 | Material 40 | Communal 45 | Principle 10 | Publicity 40 | Credentials 55 | Dispersion 25 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 20 | Display −30 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Positive | Bond None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Pyo Gangho","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Useok","basis":"A contract to deliver Jang Useok''s audit seal in the field,"},{"from":"Pyo Gangho","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Siu","basis":"Protects Jeong Siu''s measurement seal with verification messages, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Yeo Sion","type":"Contract","to":"Pyo Gangho","basis":"Dividing routes with Pyo Gangho''s standards courier road, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0042","name":"표강호","title":"제작규격 전령","position":"제작규격 전령","characterId":"K042","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"규격 문서 전달","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-표강호","detailRoute":"/people/person-0042","birthDate":"2076-01-01","birthday":"01-01","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k042-standard-message-delivery","name":"규격 전갈 전달","rating":65},{"id":"k042-attack-register-salvage","name":"습격 장부 회수","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k042-remeasurement-notice","name":"재측정 통지 먼저","description":"통지가 없으면 비상 개정도 전달하지 않는다.","behavior":"통지가 없으면 비상 개정도 전달하지 않는다.","stress":"위조 계측 도장 하나가 천왕 원장 전체를 무효로 만들어 전령망이 부품 봉쇄의 나팔이 되는 것.","relationship":"장우석의 감사 날인을 현장에서 배달하는 계약이고, 정시우의 계측 도장을 검증 전갈로 지키며, 강민서의 교환 설계를 봉인 상태로만 나른다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k042-life-record-first","name":"인명 기록 먼저","description":"습격 중 화물보다 인명 장부를 챙긴다.","behavior":"습격 중 화물보다 인명 장부를 챙긴다.","stress":"위조 계측 도장 하나가 천왕 원장 전체를 무효로 만들어 전령망이 부품 봉쇄의 나팔이 되는 것.","relationship":"장우석의 감사 날인을 현장에서 배달하는 계약이고, 정시우의 계측 도장을 검증 전갈로 지키며, 강민서의 교환 설계를 봉인 상태로만 나른다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"규격 통지 전달과 습격 중 기록 보호가 근거다. 무장 호위 승리나 문서 저술 경력은 추가하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44150-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K042","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44150-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d45c-c2e0-cc3d","name":"신창 표씨","crest":"clan-crests/d45c-c2e0-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":25,"무력":-5,"물질":40,"공동":45,"원칙":10,"공개":40,"자격":55,"분산":25,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":10,"위험":20,"과시":-30,"지속":35,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"규격 문서 전달","품계":"조합원","직함":"제작규격 전령","업무 위치":"구로5동. 표강호는 구로5동 길드 평의회로 가져갈 규격 사본의 봉인 번호를 센다. 장우석의 감사 날인과 정시우의 계측 도장이 어긋나면 강민서의 교환 설계 사본을 풀지 않고 확인 전갈을 되돌린다.","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 25 | 무력 −5 | 물질 40 | 공동 45 | 원칙 10 | 공개 40 | 자격 55 | 분산 25 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 10 | 위험 20 | 과시 −30 | 지속 35 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 제작규격 전령 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로5동. 표강호는 구로5동 길드 평의회로 가져갈 규격 사본의 봉인 번호를 센다. 장우석의 감사 날인과 정시우의 계측 도장이 어긋나면 강민서의 교환 설계 사본을 풀지 않고 확인 전갈을 되돌린다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 제작규격 전령. 규격 사본을 길드 평의회와 공방에 동시에 배달하고, 비상 개정도 사흘 안의 재측정 통지가 없으면 달리지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 호송 도중 습격을 만나 화물보다 인명 장부부터 챙겼다. 이 일로 제작규격 전령 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"장우석의 감사 날인을 현장에서 배달하는 계약이고, 정시우의 계측 도장을 검증 전갈로 지키며, 강민서의 교환 설계를 봉인 상태로만 나른다.","야망":"공방의 수리 순서 변경 통지를 모두 한 게시판에 올려 겨울 비상을 핑계로 순서가 조용히 바뀌지 않게 한다.","공포":"위조 계측 도장 하나가 천왕 원장 전체를 무효로 만들어 전령망이 부품 봉쇄의 나팔이 되는 것.","개입":"결함 부품의 제조 공방을 추적하거나, 전갈 날인을 위조한 자를 잡아 전령망을 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"규격 사본의 계측 숫자를 외우고, 구두로 합의한 호환을 원장에 올리지 않는 원로를 규격의 적으로 부른다. 봉인 끈이 젖으면 다시 떠난다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 규격 문서 전달\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 제작규격 전령\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 제작규격 전령 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로5동. 표강호는 구로5동 길드 평의회로 가져갈 규격 사본의 봉인 번호를 센다. 장우석의 감사 날인과 정시우의 계측 도장이 어긋나면 강민서의 교환 설계 사본을 풀지 않고 확인 전갈을 되돌린다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 제작규격 전령. 규격 사본을 길드 평의회와 공방에 동시에 배달하고, 비상 개정도 사흘 안의 재측정 통지가 없으면 달리지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 호송 도중 습격을 만나 화물보다 인명 장부부터 챙겼다. 이 일로 제작규격 전령 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 장우석의 감사 날인을 현장에서 배달하는 계약이고, 정시우의 계측 도장을 검증 전갈로 지키며, 강민서의 교환 설계를 봉인 상태로만 나른다.\n\n**야망.** 공방의 수리 순서 변경 통지를 모두 한 게시판에 올려 겨울 비상을 핑계로 순서가 조용히 바뀌지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 계측 도장 하나가 천왕 원장 전체를 무효로 만들어 전령망이 부품 봉쇄의 나팔이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 결함 부품의 제조 공방을 추적하거나, 전갈 날인을 위조한 자를 잡아 전령망을 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 25 | 무력 −5 | 물질 40 | 공동 45 | 원칙 10 | 공개 40 | 자격 55 | 분산 25 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 10 | 위험 20 | 과시 −30 | 지속 35 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"표강호","type":"계약","to":"장우석","basis":"장우석의 감사 날인을 현장에서 배달하는 계약이고"},{"from":"표강호","type":"계약","to":"정시우","basis":"정시우의 계측 도장을 검증 전갈로 지키며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"여시온","type":"계약","to":"표강호","basis":"표강호의 규격 전령로와 경로를 나누고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0043', 'ba85-c5f0-c548', '{"id":"person-0043","name":"Myeong Soi","title":"Southwest Outer Line Scout","position":"Southwest Outer Line Scout","characterId":"K043","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Waiting Hall Duty","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#Person-Myeong-Soi","detailRoute":"/people/person-0043","birthDate":"2095-11-12","birthday":"11-12","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k043-sleeper-replacement","name":"Sleeper replacement","rating":60},{"id":"k043-route-guidance","name":"Bypass guidance","rating":60},{"id":"k043-witness-hearing","name":"Witness hearing","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k043-visible-restoration","name":"Visible track restoration","description":"Publishes daytime repairs and demands seals for armed night surveys.","behavior":"Publishes daytime repairs and demands seals for armed night surveys.","stress":"That when self-grown food ran out, the survey squad would turn into a ration requisition squad, and repair labor''s citizenship would vanish.","relationship":"Bound to Choi Dain as a machine-shop apprentice, sharing outer laying work, swapping sleepers to Heo Daon''s wheel trial hours, and guiding Han Jion''s procurement columns along bypasses.","effects":[]},{"id":"k043-crack-before-rank","name":"Cracks before rank","description":"Reads bypass feasibility from sleeper cracks.","behavior":"Reads bypass feasibility from sleeper cracks.","stress":"That when self-grown food ran out, the survey squad would turn into a ration requisition squad, and repair labor''s citizenship would vanish.","relationship":"Bound to Choi Dain as a machine-shop apprentice, sharing outer laying work, swapping sleepers to Heo Daon''s wheel trial hours, and guiding Han Jion''s procurement columns along bypasses.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Sleeper replacement and convoy guidance are performed work. Tolerance learning does not imply designing entire railways or conquest.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44180-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K043","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44180-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ba85-c5f0-c548","name":"Yeonan Myeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ba85-c5f0-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":15,"Force":-20,"Material":35,"Communal":35,"Principle":10,"Public":30,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":30},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":35,"Display":0,"Sustained":15,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Waiting Hall Duty","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Southwest Outer Line Scout","Work Location":"Oryu 2-dong. At Oryu 2-dong, Myeong Soi marks the southwest track sleepers heaved up by winter ice and enters them in the survey log. Before Heo Daon''s wheel trial run passes, Myeong Soi tells Choe Dain the section to be replaced, and gives Han Jion''s ration cart only the detour inside Seoul.","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 15 | Force −20 | Material 35 | Communal 35 | Principle 10 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 30","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 35 | Display 0 | Endurance 15 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Contractual Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 cohort. Raised on waiting-hall duty. The post of Southwest Outer Track Surveyor opened through a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence.\n- Workplace: Oryu 2-dong. At Oryu 2-dong, Myeong Soi marks the southwest track sleepers heaved up by winter ice and enters them in the survey log. Before Heo Daon''s wheel trial run passes, Myeong Soi tells Choe Dain the section to be replaced, and gives Han Jion''s ration cart only the detour inside Seoul.","Offices":"Rank: Guild member. Title: Southwest Outer Line Scout. Posts track repairs publicly on the day shift, and follows night armed surveys only when they bear the seal of the Guild Council.","Anecdote":"In 2125, when the accounts of two witnesses diverged, held a public confrontation. Because of this, the signature for the post of Southwest Outer Track Surveyor entered the ledger.","Relationships":"Bound to Choe Dain as a pupil in tolerances, he shares the laying of the outer line; he replaces sleepers in time with Heo Daon''s wheel test runs, and guides Han Jion''s procurement convoy onto the detour.","Ambition":"To build a survey ledger of the outer track''s sleeper conditions walked and recorded firsthand, so that the route stays open even in winter.","Fear":"Their own food running out, the scouting parties turning into requisition squads, and the citizenship of repair labor disappearing.","Intervention":"You can accompany an outer-track survey to help Myeong Soi lay the standard, or leave the provisions-requisition order as evidence to block the vote."},"biography":"Reads cracks in the sleepers to tell whether a detour is possible, and hates orders to leave a finished blocking gate open for political bargaining. Bold and quick-handed.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Waiting Hall Duty\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Southwest Outer Line Scout\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 cohort. Raised on waiting-hall duty. The post of Southwest Outer Track Surveyor opened through a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence.\n- Workplace: Oryu 2-dong. At Oryu 2-dong, Myeong Soi marks the southwest track sleepers heaved up by winter ice and enters them in the survey log. Before Heo Daon''s wheel trial run passes, Myeong Soi tells Choe Dain the section to be replaced, and gives Han Jion''s ration cart only the detour inside Seoul.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild member. Title: Southwest Outer Line Scout. Posts track repairs publicly on the day shift, and follows night armed surveys only when they bear the seal of the Guild Council.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, when the accounts of two witnesses diverged, held a public confrontation. Because of this, the signature for the post of Southwest Outer Track Surveyor entered the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Bound to Choe Dain as a pupil in tolerances, he shares the laying of the outer line; he replaces sleepers in time with Heo Daon''s wheel test runs, and guides Han Jion''s procurement convoy onto the detour.\n\n**Ambition.** To build a survey ledger of the outer track''s sleeper conditions walked and recorded firsthand, so that the route stays open even in winter.\n\n**Fear.** Their own food running out, the scouting parties turning into requisition squads, and the citizenship of repair labor disappearing.\n\n**Intervention.** You can accompany an outer-track survey to help Myeong Soi lay the standard, or leave the provisions-requisition order as evidence to block the vote.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 15 | Force −20 | Material 35 | Communal 35 | Principle 10 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 30\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 35 | Display 0 | Endurance 15 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Contractual Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Myeong Soi","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Choe Dain","basis":"Bound to Choe Da-in as a tolerance teacher-and-pupil and sharing the outer track laying,"},{"from":"Myeong Soi","type":"Contract","to":"Heo Daon","basis":"Replaces sleepers in time with Heo Daon''s wheel test run,"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Seong Rahyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Myeong Soi","basis":"Seong Rahyeon tells Myeong Soi where messages have stopped because of flood closures. Myeong Soi surveys the tracks and sleepers to confirm whether a detour is possible, and keeps the work crews from going down unverified routes."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0043","name":"명소이","title":"남서 외곽선로 탐사원","position":"남서 외곽선로 탐사원","characterId":"K043","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"대합실 당직","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-명소이","detailRoute":"/people/person-0043","birthDate":"2095-11-12","birthday":"11-12","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k043-sleeper-replacement","name":"침목 교체","rating":60},{"id":"k043-route-guidance","name":"우회로 안내","rating":60},{"id":"k043-witness-hearing","name":"증언 대질","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k043-visible-restoration","name":"공개 선로 복구","description":"낮 교대 보수는 공개하고 야간 무장 탐사는 도장을 요구한다.","behavior":"낮 교대 보수는 공개하고 야간 무장 탐사는 도장을 요구한다.","stress":"자체 식량이 바닥나 탐사조가 군량 징발대로 바뀌고 복구 노동의 시민권이 사라지는 것.","relationship":"최다인에게 공차 지도로 묶여 외곽 깔기를 나누고, 허다온의 차륜 시운전에 맞춰 침목을 갈아 끼우며, 한지온의 조달 행렬을 우회로로 안내한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k043-crack-before-rank","name":"균열부터 확인","description":"침목 균열로 우회 가능 여부를 읽는다.","behavior":"침목 균열로 우회 가능 여부를 읽는다.","stress":"자체 식량이 바닥나 탐사조가 군량 징발대로 바뀌고 복구 노동의 시민권이 사라지는 것.","relationship":"최다인에게 공차 지도로 묶여 외곽 깔기를 나누고, 허다온의 차륜 시운전에 맞춰 침목을 갈아 끼우며, 한지온의 조달 행렬을 우회로로 안내한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"침목 교체와 행렬 안내는 실제 업무다. 공차를 배운 관계를 반영하되 철도 전체 설계나 정복 경험으로 늘리지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44180-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K043","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44180-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ba85-c5f0-c548","name":"연안 명씨","crest":"clan-crests/ba85-c5f0-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":15,"무력":-20,"물질":35,"공동":35,"원칙":10,"공개":30,"자격":45,"분산":25,"변혁":30},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":-10,"위험":35,"과시":0,"지속":15,"지향":"유동","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"대합실 당직","품계":"조합원","직함":"남서 외곽선로 탐사원","업무 위치":"오류2동. 명소이는 오류2동에서 겨울 얼음에 들뜬 남서 선로 침목을 표시해 탐사 일지에 남긴다. 허다온의 차륜 시운전이 지나기 전 최다인에게 교체 구간을 알려 주고, 한지온의 배급 수레에는 서울 내부 우회로만 전한다.","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 35 | 공동 35 | 원칙 10 | 공개 30 | 자격 45 | 분산 25 | 변혁 30","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 −10 | 위험 35 | 과시 0 | 지속 15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 남서 외곽선로 탐사원 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 오류2동. 명소이는 오류2동에서 겨울 얼음에 들뜬 남서 선로 침목을 표시해 탐사 일지에 남긴다. 허다온의 차륜 시운전이 지나기 전 최다인에게 교체 구간을 알려 주고, 한지온의 배급 수레에는 서울 내부 우회로만 전한다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 남서 외곽선로 탐사원. 낮 교대에 선로 보수를 공개하고, 야간 무장 탐사는 길드 평의회의 도장이 있어야 따른다.","일화":"2125년 증인 두 명의 말이 갈라지자 공개 대질을 열었다. 이 일로 남서 외곽선로 탐사원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"최다인에게 공차 지도로 묶여 외곽 깔기를 나누고, 허다온의 차륜 시운전에 맞춰 침목을 갈아 끼우며, 한지온의 조달 행렬을 우회로로 안내한다.","야망":"외곽 선로의 침목 상태를 직접 걸어 적는 탐사 장부를 만들어 겨울에도 길이 이어지게 한다.","공포":"자체 식량이 바닥나 탐사조가 군량 징발대로 바뀌고 복구 노동의 시민권이 사라지는 것.","개입":"외곽 선로 탐사에 동행해 명소이의 표준 깔기를 돕거나, 군량 징발 명령을 증거로 남겨 투표를 막을 수 있다."},"biography":"침목의 균열로 우회 가능 여부를 읽고, 완성된 차단문을 정치 협상용으로 열어 두라는 명령을 싫어한다. 대담하고 손빠르다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 대합실 당직\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 남서 외곽선로 탐사원\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 남서 외곽선로 탐사원 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 오류2동. 명소이는 오류2동에서 겨울 얼음에 들뜬 남서 선로 침목을 표시해 탐사 일지에 남긴다. 허다온의 차륜 시운전이 지나기 전 최다인에게 교체 구간을 알려 주고, 한지온의 배급 수레에는 서울 내부 우회로만 전한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 남서 외곽선로 탐사원. 낮 교대에 선로 보수를 공개하고, 야간 무장 탐사는 길드 평의회의 도장이 있어야 따른다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 증인 두 명의 말이 갈라지자 공개 대질을 열었다. 이 일로 남서 외곽선로 탐사원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 최다인에게 공차 지도로 묶여 외곽 깔기를 나누고, 허다온의 차륜 시운전에 맞춰 침목을 갈아 끼우며, 한지온의 조달 행렬을 우회로로 안내한다.\n\n**야망.** 외곽 선로의 침목 상태를 직접 걸어 적는 탐사 장부를 만들어 겨울에도 길이 이어지게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 자체 식량이 바닥나 탐사조가 군량 징발대로 바뀌고 복구 노동의 시민권이 사라지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 외곽 선로 탐사에 동행해 명소이의 표준 깔기를 돕거나, 군량 징발 명령을 증거로 남겨 투표를 막을 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 35 | 공동 35 | 원칙 10 | 공개 30 | 자격 45 | 분산 25 | 변혁 30\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 −10 | 위험 35 | 과시 0 | 지속 15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"명소이","type":"스승과 제자","to":"최다인","basis":"최다인에게 공차 지도로 묶여 외곽 깔기를 나누고"},{"from":"명소이","type":"계약","to":"허다온","basis":"허다온의 차륜 시운전에 맞춰 침목을 갈아 끼우며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"성라현","type":"계약","to":"명소이","basis":"성라현은 침수 폐쇄로 전갈이 멈춘 위치를 명소이에게 알린다. 명소이는 선로·침목을 조사해 우회 가능 여부를 확인하고 작업반이 미확인 길로 가지 않게 한다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0044', 'c81c-ce60-c6d0', '{"id":"person-0044","name":"Je Haon","title":"Skill Point Ledger Recorder","position":"Skill Point Ledger Recorder","characterId":"K044","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Mastery Score Records","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#inmul-jehaon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0044","birthDate":"2095-09-03","birthday":"09-03","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k044-skill-register-crosscheck","name":"Skill-ledger crosscheck","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k044-preserve-original","name":"Protect the original entry","description":"In the forged-seal anecdote burns copies while preserving the original entry.","behavior":"In the forged-seal anecdote burns copies while preserving the original entry.","stress":"That the guards would pen strike workshops in and use the union roster as a military registry.","relationship":"A contract fixing Kim Nayul''s clerk roster in the ledger, cross-verifying Jang Wooseok''s standards stamps and proficiency scores, and backing Baek On''s refugee citizenship demand with records.","effects":[]},{"id":"k044-civilian-ledger","name":"Citizenship and skill ledger","description":"Transfers clerical registers into records and supports refugee citizenship.","behavior":"Transfers clerical registers into records and supports refugee citizenship.","stress":"That the guards would pen strike workshops in and use the union roster as a military registry.","relationship":"A contract fixing Kim Nayul''s clerk roster in the ledger, cross-verifying Jang Wooseok''s standards stamps and proficiency scores, and backing Baek On''s refugee citizenship demand with records.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Ledger comparison and a forged-seal anecdote are evidence. The wording does not establish who discovered the forgery, so detection skill is not issued.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41210-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K044","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41210-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c81c-ce60-c6d0","name":"Je Clan of Chilwon","crest":"clan-crests/c81c-ce60-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":15,"Force":-20,"Material":40,"Communal":45,"Principle":35,"Public":30,"Eligibility":50,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":30},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":-10,"Display":0,"Sustained":-20,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Mastery Score Records","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Skill Point Ledger Recorder","Work Location":"Guro 2-dong. At Guro 2-dong, Je Haon lays out Kim Nayul''s shift and citizenship roster side by side with the skill-point ledger. If a forged seal is found, Je Haon preserves the original column and sends the result of checking it against Jang Useok''s standard seal to the duty post that handles Baek On''s list.","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 15 | Force −20 | Material 40 | Communal 45 | Principle 35 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 50 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 30","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −10 | Display 0 | Endurance −20 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 cohort. Raised at the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Skill-Point Ledger Archivist opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Workplace: Guro 2-dong. At Guro 2-dong, Je Haon lays out Kim Nayul''s shift and citizenship roster side by side with the skill-point ledger. If a forged seal is found, Je Haon preserves the original column and sends the result of checking it against Jang Useok''s standard seal to the duty post that handles Baek On''s list.","Offices":"Rank: Guild member. Title: Skill Point Ledger Recorder. Copies work-crew shifts and skill points onto the public blackboard, and does not enter labor without citizenship registration on the Guild Council''s agenda ledger.","Anecdote":"In 2125, when a forged seal was exposed, burned the copy and guarded the original column. Because of this, the signature for the post of Skill-Point Ledger Archivist entered the ledger.","Relationships":"A contract fixing Kim Nayul''s clerk roster as the ledger; it cross-verifies Jang Useok''s standard seals against skill points, and supports Baek On''s demand for refugee citizenship through records.","Ambition":"To enter workshop hands'' skills and health records in the same ledger, so that injured workers do not lose their work in winter.","Fear":"That the guard corps imprisons the strike workshops and rewrites the guild roster into a military household register.","Intervention":"You can protect the skill roster and push the citizenship bill through, or expose the manipulation of the sabotage list and shake the archivist''s standing."},"biography":"Principled, and hates blanks in a sentence. Never pushes the figures of the clerk who collates the sabotage list through the night out of the ledger.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Mastery Score Records\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Skill Point Ledger Recorder\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 cohort. Raised at the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Skill-Point Ledger Archivist opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Workplace: Guro 2-dong. At Guro 2-dong, Je Haon lays out Kim Nayul''s shift and citizenship roster side by side with the skill-point ledger. If a forged seal is found, Je Haon preserves the original column and sends the result of checking it against Jang Useok''s standard seal to the duty post that handles Baek On''s list.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild member. Title: Skill Point Ledger Recorder. Copies work-crew shifts and skill points onto the public blackboard, and does not enter labor without citizenship registration on the Guild Council''s agenda ledger.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, when a forged seal was exposed, burned the copy and guarded the original column. Because of this, the signature for the post of Skill-Point Ledger Archivist entered the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** A contract fixing Kim Nayul''s clerk roster as the ledger; it cross-verifies Jang Useok''s standard seals against skill points, and supports Baek On''s demand for refugee citizenship through records.\n\n**Ambition.** To enter workshop hands'' skills and health records in the same ledger, so that injured workers do not lose their work in winter.\n\n**Fear.** That the guard corps imprisons the strike workshops and rewrites the guild roster into a military household register.\n\n**Intervention.** You can protect the skill roster and push the citizenship bill through, or expose the manipulation of the sabotage list and shake the archivist''s standing.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 15 | Force −20 | Material 40 | Communal 45 | Principle 35 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 50 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 30\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −10 | Display 0 | Endurance −20 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Je Haon","type":"Contract","to":"Kim Nayul","basis":"A contract that fixes Gim Nayul''s clerk roster as the ledger, and"},{"from":"Je Haon","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Useok","basis":"cross-verifies Jang Useok''s standards seal against skill scores,"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0044","name":"제하온","title":"숙련점수 원장 기록관","position":"숙련점수 원장 기록관","characterId":"K044","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"숙련점수 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-제하온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0044","birthDate":"2095-09-03","birthday":"09-03","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k044-skill-register-crosscheck","name":"숙련 원장 교차검증","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k044-preserve-original","name":"원본 칸을 지킨다","description":"위조 도장 일화에서 사본을 불사르고 원본 칸을 지킨다.","behavior":"위조 도장 일화에서 사본을 불사르고 원본 칸을 지킨다.","stress":"경비대가 파업 공방을 가두고 조합 명부를 군사호적으로 바꿔 쓰는 것.","relationship":"김나율의 서기 명부를 원장으로 고정하는 계약이고, 장우석의 규격 날인과 숙련 점수를 교차검증하며, 백온의 난민 시민권 요구를 기록으로 지지한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k044-civilian-ledger","name":"시민권과 숙련의 원장","description":"서기 명부를 기록에 옮기고 난민 시민권 요구를 지지한다.","behavior":"서기 명부를 기록에 옮기고 난민 시민권 요구를 지지한다.","stress":"경비대가 파업 공방을 가두고 조합 명부를 군사호적으로 바꿔 쓰는 것.","relationship":"김나율의 서기 명부를 원장으로 고정하는 계약이고, 장우석의 규격 날인과 숙련 점수를 교차검증하며, 백온의 난민 시민권 요구를 기록으로 지지한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"원장 대조와 위조 도장 일화가 근거다. 위조를 자신이 발견했는지는 문장이 모호해 탐지 숙련은 발급하지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41210-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K044","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41210-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c81c-ce60-c6d0","name":"칠원 제씨","crest":"clan-crests/c81c-ce60-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":15,"무력":-20,"물질":40,"공동":45,"원칙":35,"공개":30,"자격":50,"분산":15,"변혁":30},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-35,"위험":-10,"과시":0,"지속":-20,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"숙련점수 기록","품계":"조합원","직함":"숙련점수 원장 기록관","업무 위치":"구로2동. 제하온은 구로2동에서 김나율의 교대·시민권 명부를 숙련점수 원장과 나란히 펼친다. 위조 도장이 발견되면 원본 칸을 보존하고 장우석의 규격 날인과 대조한 결과를 백온의 명단을 맡은 당직으로 보낸다.","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 40 | 공동 45 | 원칙 35 | 공개 30 | 자격 50 | 분산 15 | 변혁 30","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 0 | 지속 −20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 숙련점수 원장 기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로2동. 제하온은 구로2동에서 김나율의 교대·시민권 명부를 숙련점수 원장과 나란히 펼친다. 위조 도장이 발견되면 원본 칸을 보존하고 장우석의 규격 날인과 대조한 결과를 백온의 명단을 맡은 당직으로 보낸다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 숙련점수 원장 기록관. 작업반 교대와 숙련 점수를 공개 칠판에 옮기고, 시민권 미등록 노동은 길드 평의회 안건 원장에 올리지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 위조 도장을 들켜 사본을 불사르고 원본 칸을 지켰다. 이 일로 숙련점수 원장 기록관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"김나율의 서기 명부를 원장으로 고정하는 계약이고, 장우석의 규격 날인과 숙련 점수를 교차검증하며, 백온의 난민 시민권 요구를 기록으로 지지한다.","야망":"공방 일꾼들의 숙련과 건강 기록을 같은 장부에 올려 부상자가 겨울에도 일자리를 잃지 않게 한다.","공포":"경비대가 파업 공방을 가두고 조합 명부를 군사호적으로 바꿔 쓰는 것.","개입":"숙련 명부를 지켜 시민권안을 통과시키거나, 태업 명단 조작을 밝혀 기록관을 흔들 수 있다."},"biography":"원칙적이고 문장의 빈칸을 증오한다. 태업 명단을 밤새 대조하는 서기의 숫자를 원장 밖으로 밀어내지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 숙련점수 기록\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 숙련점수 원장 기록관\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 숙련점수 원장 기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로2동. 제하온은 구로2동에서 김나율의 교대·시민권 명부를 숙련점수 원장과 나란히 펼친다. 위조 도장이 발견되면 원본 칸을 보존하고 장우석의 규격 날인과 대조한 결과를 백온의 명단을 맡은 당직으로 보낸다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 숙련점수 원장 기록관. 작업반 교대와 숙련 점수를 공개 칠판에 옮기고, 시민권 미등록 노동은 길드 평의회 안건 원장에 올리지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 위조 도장을 들켜 사본을 불사르고 원본 칸을 지켰다. 이 일로 숙련점수 원장 기록관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 김나율의 서기 명부를 원장으로 고정하는 계약이고, 장우석의 규격 날인과 숙련 점수를 교차검증하며, 백온의 난민 시민권 요구를 기록으로 지지한다.\n\n**야망.** 공방 일꾼들의 숙련과 건강 기록을 같은 장부에 올려 부상자가 겨울에도 일자리를 잃지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 경비대가 파업 공방을 가두고 조합 명부를 군사호적으로 바꿔 쓰는 것.\n\n**개입.** 숙련 명부를 지켜 시민권안을 통과시키거나, 태업 명단 조작을 밝혀 기록관을 흔들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 40 | 공동 45 | 원칙 35 | 공개 30 | 자격 50 | 분산 15 | 변혁 30\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 0 | 지속 −20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"제하온","type":"계약","to":"김나율","basis":"김나율의 서기 명부를 원장으로 고정하는 계약이고"},{"from":"제하온","type":"계약","to":"장우석","basis":"장우석의 규격 날인과 숙련 점수를 교차검증하며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0045', 'bcc0-cd08-acc4', '{"id":"person-0045","name":"Byeon Siram","title":"Guro Concourse Stationmaster","position":"Guro Concourse Stationmaster","characterId":"K045","rank":"Audit","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Waiting Hall Duty","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#inmul-byeonsiram","detailRoute":"/people/person-0045","birthDate":"2067-12-08","birthday":"12-08","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k045-station-counter","name":"Station-counter administration","rating":65},{"id":"k045-public-referral","name":"Public-counter referral","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k045-civil-registration-first","name":"Registration counter first","description":"Admits military freight after the release counter closes.","behavior":"Admits military freight after the release counter closes.","stress":"That the concourse queue register is quietly altered and a patient who should see the doctor first is pushed to the back of the line.","relationship":"Putting tool-car goods into the platform order, placing the food pots at one end of the concourse, and receiving the western food-train bypass at Guro.","effects":[]},{"id":"k045-no-private-favor","name":"Reject private favors","description":"Redirects favors to public counters.","behavior":"Redirects favors to public counters.","stress":"That the concourse queue register is quietly altered and a patient who should see the doctor first is pushed to the back of the line.","relationship":"Putting tool-car goods into the platform order, placing the food pots at one end of the concourse, and receiving the western food-train bypass at Guro.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Reflects refusal of favors and management of ration and dispatch counters. Prioritizing timetable gaps can also put people second.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcc0-cd08-acc4","name":"Byeon Clan of Chogye","crest":"clan-crests/bcc0-cd08-acc4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":5,"Force":-5,"Material":40,"Communal":35,"Principle":20,"Public":25,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":20,"Risk":-15,"Display":20,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Waiting Hall Duty","Rank":"Audit","Title":"Guro Concourse Stationmaster","Work Location":"Guro 5-dong. At the Guro 5-dong concourse, Byeon Siram puts the tool wagon into the public platform queue. When the food pots and a food train overlap, Byeon Siram splits the winter release slots and hands them to the next window shift, and redirects private favors to public intake.","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 5 | Force −5 | Material 40 | Communal 35 | Principle 20 | Publicness 25 | Credentials 45 | Dispersion 15 | Reform 20","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly 20 | Risk −15 | Display 20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up on concourse duty. The post of Guro Concourse Stationmaster opened through a replacement shift after an unexcused absence.\n- Work location: Guro 5-dong. At the Guro 5-dong concourse, Byeon Siram puts the tool wagon into the public platform queue. When the food pots and a food train overlap, Byeon Siram splits the winter release slots and hands them to the next window shift, and redirects private favors to public intake.","Offices":"Rank: Audit. Title: Guro Concourse Stationmaster. Publishes the concourse rations and the release window every day, and attaches munitions wagons only after the release window has closed.","Anecdote":"In 2125, sent a private favor back and redirected it to the public window. Because of this, the signature for the post of Guro Concourse Stationmaster entered the ledger.","Relationships":"Put tool-car goods into the platform queue, keep the food pots on one side of the concourse, and receive the western food-train detour at Guro.","Ambition":"To make the Guro concourse the face-to-face window where parts release and food sharing are all recorded under one roof.","Fear":"That the concourse queue register is quietly altered and a patient who should see the doctor first is pushed to the back of the line.","Intervention":"Can find replacement heating parts and break the seal, or expose the window collusion ledger and reopen the station lottery."},"biography":"Reads the size of a work crew from platform dust, and cannot tolerate orders that push food trains back on account of rank. Fills the blanks in the timetable before people.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Waiting Hall Duty\n- Rank: Audit\n- Title: Guro Concourse Stationmaster\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up on concourse duty. The post of Guro Concourse Stationmaster opened through a replacement shift after an unexcused absence.\n- Work location: Guro 5-dong. At the Guro 5-dong concourse, Byeon Siram puts the tool wagon into the public platform queue. When the food pots and a food train overlap, Byeon Siram splits the winter release slots and hands them to the next window shift, and redirects private favors to public intake.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Audit. Title: Guro Concourse Stationmaster. Publishes the concourse rations and the release window every day, and attaches munitions wagons only after the release window has closed.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, sent a private favor back and redirected it to the public window. Because of this, the signature for the post of Guro Concourse Stationmaster entered the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Put tool-car goods into the platform queue, keep the food pots on one side of the concourse, and receive the western food-train detour at Guro.\n\n**Ambition.** To make the Guro concourse the face-to-face window where parts release and food sharing are all recorded under one roof.\n\n**Fear.** That the concourse queue register is quietly altered and a patient who should see the doctor first is pushed to the back of the line.\n\n**Intervention.** Can find replacement heating parts and break the seal, or expose the window collusion ledger and reopen the station lottery.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 5 | Force −5 | Material 40 | Communal 35 | Principle 20 | Publicness 25 | Credentials 45 | Dispersion 15 | Reform 20\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly 20 | Risk −15 | Display 20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Byeon Siram","type":"Contract","to":"Han Jion","basis":"Keeps Han Jion''s ration pot in one corner of the waiting hall, and"},{"from":"Byeon Siram","type":"Contract","to":"Gu Chansol","basis":"Placing Gu Chansol''s tool wagon in the platform turn order and"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0045","name":"변시람","title":"구로 대합실 역장","position":"구로 대합실 역장","characterId":"K045","rank":"감사","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"대합실 당직","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-변시람","detailRoute":"/people/person-0045","birthDate":"2067-12-08","birthday":"12-08","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k045-station-counter","name":"대합실 창구 운영","rating":65},{"id":"k045-public-referral","name":"공개 창구 안내","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k045-civil-registration-first","name":"등록 창구 먼저","description":"출고 창구가 닫힌 뒤 군수 화차를 붙인다.","behavior":"출고 창구가 닫힌 뒤 군수 화차를 붙인다.","stress":"대합실 순번 명부가 몰래 고쳐져, 의사에게 먼저 가야 할 환자가 대기열 뒤로 밀리는 것.","relationship":"공구 화차 짐을 승강장 순번에 올리고, 식량 솥을 대합실 한쪽에 두며, 서쪽에서 오는 식량 열차 우회를 구로에서 받는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k045-no-private-favor","name":"사적 청탁 거절","description":"청탁을 공개 창구로 돌린다.","behavior":"청탁을 공개 창구로 돌린다.","stress":"대합실 순번 명부가 몰래 고쳐져, 의사에게 먼저 가야 할 환자가 대기열 뒤로 밀리는 것.","relationship":"공구 화차 짐을 승강장 순번에 올리고, 식량 솥을 대합실 한쪽에 두며, 서쪽에서 오는 식량 열차 우회를 구로에서 받는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"청탁 거절과 배급·출고 창구 운영을 반영했다. 시간표를 메우는 성향은 사람을 뒤로 미루는 긴장도 남긴다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcc0-cd08-acc4","name":"초계 변씨","crest":"clan-crests/bcc0-cd08-acc4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":5,"무력":-5,"물질":40,"공동":35,"원칙":20,"공개":25,"자격":45,"분산":15,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":20,"위험":-15,"과시":20,"지속":-10,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"대합실 당직","품계":"감사","직함":"구로 대합실 역장","업무 위치":"구로5동. 변시람은 구로5동 대합실에서 공구 화차를 공개 승강장 순번에 올린다. 식량 솥과 식량 열차가 겹치면 겨울 출고 칸을 나누어 다음 창구 당직에 넘기고 사적 청탁은 공개 접수로 돌린다.","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 5 | 무력 −5 | 물질 40 | 공동 35 | 원칙 20 | 공개 25 | 자격 45 | 분산 15 | 변혁 20","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 20 | 위험 −15 | 과시 20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 구로 대합실 역장 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로5동. 변시람은 구로5동 대합실에서 공구 화차를 공개 승강장 순번에 올린다. 식량 솥과 식량 열차가 겹치면 겨울 출고 칸을 나누어 다음 창구 당직에 넘기고 사적 청탁은 공개 접수로 돌린다.","관직":"품계 감사. 직함은 구로 대합실 역장. 대합실 배급과 출고 창구를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 출고 창구가 닫힌 뒤에만 붙인다.","일화":"2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 일로 구로 대합실 역장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"공구 화차 짐을 승강장 순번에 올리고, 식량 솥을 대합실 한쪽에 두며, 서쪽에서 오는 식량 열차 우회를 구로에서 받는다.","야망":"구로 대합실을 부품 출고·식량 나눔이 한 지붕에서 기록되는 대면 창구로 만든다.","공포":"대합실 순번 명부가 몰래 고쳐져, 의사에게 먼저 가야 할 환자가 대기열 뒤로 밀리는 것.","개입":"대체 난방 부품을 구해 봉인을 풀거나, 창구 담합 장부를 폭로해 역 추첨을 다시 열 수 있다."},"biography":"승강장 분진으로 작업반 규모를 읽고, 식량 열차를 서열 때문에 미루라는 명령을 참지 못한다. 시간표의 빈칸을 사람보다 먼저 메운다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 대합실 당직\n- 품계: 감사\n- 직함: 구로 대합실 역장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 구로 대합실 역장 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로5동. 변시람은 구로5동 대합실에서 공구 화차를 공개 승강장 순번에 올린다. 식량 솥과 식량 열차가 겹치면 겨울 출고 칸을 나누어 다음 창구 당직에 넘기고 사적 청탁은 공개 접수로 돌린다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 감사. 직함은 구로 대합실 역장. 대합실 배급과 출고 창구를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 출고 창구가 닫힌 뒤에만 붙인다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 일로 구로 대합실 역장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 공구 화차 짐을 승강장 순번에 올리고, 식량 솥을 대합실 한쪽에 두며, 서쪽에서 오는 식량 열차 우회를 구로에서 받는다.\n\n**야망.** 구로 대합실을 부품 출고·식량 나눔이 한 지붕에서 기록되는 대면 창구로 만든다.\n\n**공포.** 대합실 순번 명부가 몰래 고쳐져, 의사에게 먼저 가야 할 환자가 대기열 뒤로 밀리는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대체 난방 부품을 구해 봉인을 풀거나, 창구 담합 장부를 폭로해 역 추첨을 다시 열 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 5 | 무력 −5 | 물질 40 | 공동 35 | 원칙 20 | 공개 25 | 자격 45 | 분산 15 | 변혁 20\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 20 | 위험 −15 | 과시 20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"변시람","type":"계약","to":"한지온","basis":"한지온의 배급 솥을 대합실 한쪽에 두며"},{"from":"변시람","type":"계약","to":"구찬솔","basis":"구찬솔의 공구 화차를 승강장 순번에 올리고"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0046', 'd45c-c2e0-cc3d', '{"id":"person-0046","name":"Pyo Yedam","title":"Cheonwang Base Siding Dispatch Officer","position":"Cheonwang Base Siding Dispatch Officer","characterId":"K046","rank":"Audit","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Siding Dispatch","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#character-pyo-yedam","detailRoute":"/people/person-0046","birthDate":"2083-02-13","birthday":"02-13","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k046-siding-dispatch","name":"Siding dispatch","rating":65},{"id":"k046-defective-parts-return","name":"Defective-parts return","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k046-measured-cargo-only","name":"Measured cargo only","description":"Keeps unmeasured military modifications outside the sidings.","behavior":"Keeps unmeasured military modifications outside the sidings.","stress":"That when the Yongsan transfer clogged, the Cheonwang siding would fill, and repair trains and food trains would be trapped at once.","relationship":"Guaranteeing Heo Daon''s wheel releases on the dispatch board, binding dispatches to Jeong Siwoo''s gauging seals, and splitting the relay window and outer trains with Park Taegyeom.","effects":[]},{"id":"k046-no-disguised-freight","name":"Reject disguised freight","description":"Refuses to disguise repair materials as military freight.","behavior":"Refuses to disguise repair materials as military freight.","stress":"That when the Yongsan transfer clogged, the Cheonwang siding would fill, and repair trains and food trains would be trapped at once.","relationship":"Guaranteeing Heo Daon''s wheel releases on the dispatch board, binding dispatches to Jeong Siwoo''s gauging seals, and splitting the relay window and outer trains with Park Taegyeom.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Returns faulty parts before dispatch and ties scheduling to measurement seals. Operations are supported, not railway construction.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44210-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K046","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44210-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d45c-c2e0-cc3d","name":"Sinchang Pyo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d45c-c2e0-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":15,"Force":-5,"Material":35,"Communal":35,"Principle":15,"Public":40,"Eligibility":50,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":25},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-25,"Display":-25,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Siding Dispatch","Rank":"Audit","Title":"Cheonwang Base Siding Dispatch Officer","Work Location":"Oryu 2-dong. At the Cheonwang Base holding-track dispatch board in Oryu 2-dong, Pyo Yedam writes down Heo Daon''s wheel release together with the inspection times for the frozen track. Boxes missing Jeong Siu''s gauging seal are sent back just before release, and a corrected dispatch sheet goes to Park Taegyeom''s relay window.","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 15 | Force −5 | Material 35 | Communal 35 | Principle 15 | Publicness 40 | Credentials 50 | Dispersion 30 | Reform 25","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −25 | Display −25 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: None | Union: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Sinjeong rolling-stock depot. The post of Cheonwang Base Holding-Track Dispatch Chief opened through a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Work location: Oryu 2-dong. At the Cheonwang Base holding-track dispatch board in Oryu 2-dong, Pyo Yedam writes down Heo Daon''s wheel release together with the inspection times for the frozen track. Boxes missing Jeong Siu''s gauging seal are sent back just before release, and a corrected dispatch sheet goes to Park Taegyeom''s relay window.","Offices":"Rank: Audit. Title: Cheonwang Base Siding Dispatch Officer. Publishes the maintenance, engineering, and ration order every day, and pushes unsealed munitions conversions outside the holding tracks.","Anecdote":"In 2125, sent a box of defective parts back just before release. Because of this, the signature for the post of Cheonwang Base Holding-Track Dispatch Chief entered the ledger.","Relationships":"Vouches for Heo Daon''s wheel releases on the dispatch board, ties dispatch to Jeong Siu''s gauging seal, and shares the relay window and outer-line trains with Park Taegyeom.","Ambition":"To turn the Cheonwang holding tracks into a circulating dispatch on which only freight bearing an inspection mark moves, and so become the center of the line''s records.","Fear":"That if the Yongsan transfer is blocked, the Cheonwang holding tracks fill up and the repair train and the food train are trapped at the same time.","Intervention":"Can find replacement wheels to keep the circulating dispatch alive, or expose the smuggling ledger of the blockaded holding tracks."},"biography":"Reads a train''s lies from track vibration, and takes orders to disguise repair supplies as munitions wagons as an insult. Taciturn, and remembers for a long time any combination that breaks a release time.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Siding Dispatch\n- Rank: Audit\n- Title: Cheonwang Base Siding Dispatch Officer\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Sinjeong rolling-stock depot. The post of Cheonwang Base Holding-Track Dispatch Chief opened through a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Work location: Oryu 2-dong. At the Cheonwang Base holding-track dispatch board in Oryu 2-dong, Pyo Yedam writes down Heo Daon''s wheel release together with the inspection times for the frozen track. Boxes missing Jeong Siu''s gauging seal are sent back just before release, and a corrected dispatch sheet goes to Park Taegyeom''s relay window.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Audit. Title: Cheonwang Base Siding Dispatch Officer. Publishes the maintenance, engineering, and ration order every day, and pushes unsealed munitions conversions outside the holding tracks.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, sent a box of defective parts back just before release. Because of this, the signature for the post of Cheonwang Base Holding-Track Dispatch Chief entered the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Vouches for Heo Daon''s wheel releases on the dispatch board, ties dispatch to Jeong Siu''s gauging seal, and shares the relay window and outer-line trains with Park Taegyeom.\n\n**Ambition.** To turn the Cheonwang holding tracks into a circulating dispatch on which only freight bearing an inspection mark moves, and so become the center of the line''s records.\n\n**Fear.** That if the Yongsan transfer is blocked, the Cheonwang holding tracks fill up and the repair train and the food train are trapped at the same time.\n\n**Intervention.** Can find replacement wheels to keep the circulating dispatch alive, or expose the smuggling ledger of the blockaded holding tracks.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 15 | Force −5 | Material 35 | Communal 35 | Principle 15 | Publicness 40 | Credentials 50 | Dispersion 30 | Reform 25\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −25 | Display −25 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: None | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Pyo Yedam","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Siu","basis":"Ties dispatch to Jeong Siu''s measurement seal, and"},{"from":"Pyo Yedam","type":"Contract","to":"Heo Daon","basis":"Vouches for Heo Daon''s wheel shipment on the dispatch board,"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Han Hyeonu","type":"Contract","to":"Pyo Yedam","basis":"Han Hyeonu carries the work crew''s transfer messages to Pyo Yedam''s holding-track dispatch board. On finding a departure without a dispatch sheet, Han Hyeonu reports what the missing signature covers, so that no unverified train cuts into the maintenance, engineering, and ration order Pyo Yedam has published."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0046","name":"표예담","title":"천왕기지 유치배차 실무장","position":"천왕기지 유치배차 실무장","characterId":"K046","rank":"감사","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"유치선 배차","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-표예담","detailRoute":"/people/person-0046","birthDate":"2083-02-13","birthday":"02-13","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k046-siding-dispatch","name":"유치선 배차","rating":65},{"id":"k046-defective-parts-return","name":"불량품 반환","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k046-measured-cargo-only","name":"도장 화물만","description":"계측 없는 군수 개조를 유치선 밖으로 밀어낸다.","behavior":"계측 없는 군수 개조를 유치선 밖으로 밀어낸다.","stress":"용산 환승이 막히면 천왕 유치선이 가득 차 보수 열차와 식량 열차가 동시에 갇히는 것.","relationship":"허다온의 차륜 출고를 배차판에서 보증하고, 정시우의 계측 도장에 배차를 묶으며, 박태겸의 중계 창구와 외곽 열차를 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k046-no-disguised-freight","name":"위장 화물 거절","description":"수리 물자를 군수 화차로 위장하지 않는다.","behavior":"수리 물자를 군수 화차로 위장하지 않는다.","stress":"용산 환승이 막히면 천왕 유치선이 가득 차 보수 열차와 식량 열차가 동시에 갇히는 것.","relationship":"허다온의 차륜 출고를 배차판에서 보증하고, 정시우의 계측 도장에 배차를 묶으며, 박태겸의 중계 창구와 외곽 열차를 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"출고 직전 불량품을 반환하고 계측 도장에 배차를 묶는다. 운행 기술은 인정하지만 철도 건설 경력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44210-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K046","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44210-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d45c-c2e0-cc3d","name":"신창 표씨","crest":"clan-crests/d45c-c2e0-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":15,"무력":-5,"물질":35,"공동":35,"원칙":15,"공개":40,"자격":50,"분산":30,"변혁":25},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-10,"위험":-25,"과시":-25,"지속":35,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"유치선 배차","품계":"감사","직함":"천왕기지 유치배차 실무장","업무 위치":"오류2동. 표예담은 오류2동 천왕기지 유치선 배차판에 허다온의 차륜 출고와 결빙 선로 점검 시각을 함께 적는다. 정시우의 계측 도장이 빠진 상자는 출고 직전에 되돌리고 박태겸의 중계 창구에 수정된 배차표를 보낸다.","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 15 | 무력 −5 | 물질 35 | 공동 35 | 원칙 15 | 공개 40 | 자격 50 | 분산 30 | 변혁 25","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −25 | 지속 35 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 천왕기지 유치배차 실무장 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 오류2동. 표예담은 오류2동 천왕기지 유치선 배차판에 허다온의 차륜 출고와 결빙 선로 점검 시각을 함께 적는다. 정시우의 계측 도장이 빠진 상자는 출고 직전에 되돌리고 박태겸의 중계 창구에 수정된 배차표를 보낸다.","관직":"품계 감사. 직함은 천왕기지 유치배차 실무장. 정비·공병·배급 순서를 매일 공개하고, 도장 없는 군수 개조는 유치선 바깥으로 밀어낸다.","일화":"2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 천왕기지 유치배차 실무장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"허다온의 차륜 출고를 배차판에서 보증하고, 정시우의 계측 도장에 배차를 묶으며, 박태겸의 중계 창구와 외곽 열차를 나눈다.","야망":"천왕 유치선을 검사 표식이 붙은 화물만 오가는 순환 배차로 만들어 유치선 기록의 중심이 된다.","공포":"용산 환승이 막히면 천왕 유치선이 가득 차 보수 열차와 식량 열차가 동시에 갇히는 것.","개입":"대체 차륜을 구해 순환 배차를 살리거나, 봉쇄 유치선의 밀반출 장부를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"선로 진동으로 열차의 거짓을 읽고, 수리 물자를 군수 화차로 위장하는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 과묵하고 출고 시각을 어기는 조합을 오래 기억한다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 유치선 배차\n- 품계: 감사\n- 직함: 천왕기지 유치배차 실무장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 천왕기지 유치배차 실무장 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 오류2동. 표예담은 오류2동 천왕기지 유치선 배차판에 허다온의 차륜 출고와 결빙 선로 점검 시각을 함께 적는다. 정시우의 계측 도장이 빠진 상자는 출고 직전에 되돌리고 박태겸의 중계 창구에 수정된 배차표를 보낸다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 감사. 직함은 천왕기지 유치배차 실무장. 정비·공병·배급 순서를 매일 공개하고, 도장 없는 군수 개조는 유치선 바깥으로 밀어낸다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 천왕기지 유치배차 실무장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 허다온의 차륜 출고를 배차판에서 보증하고, 정시우의 계측 도장에 배차를 묶으며, 박태겸의 중계 창구와 외곽 열차를 나눈다.\n\n**야망.** 천왕 유치선을 검사 표식이 붙은 화물만 오가는 순환 배차로 만들어 유치선 기록의 중심이 된다.\n\n**공포.** 용산 환승이 막히면 천왕 유치선이 가득 차 보수 열차와 식량 열차가 동시에 갇히는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대체 차륜을 구해 순환 배차를 살리거나, 봉쇄 유치선의 밀반출 장부를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 15 | 무력 −5 | 물질 35 | 공동 35 | 원칙 15 | 공개 40 | 자격 50 | 분산 30 | 변혁 25\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −25 | 지속 35 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"표예담","type":"계약","to":"정시우","basis":"정시우의 계측 도장에 배차를 묶으며"},{"from":"표예담","type":"계약","to":"허다온","basis":"허다온의 차륜 출고를 배차판에서 보증하고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"한현우","type":"계약","to":"표예담","basis":"한현우는 작업반의 환승 전갈을 표예담의 유치선 배차판까지 전달한다. 배차표 없는 출발을 발견하면 서명이 빠진 내용을 알려, 표예담이 공개한 정비·공병·배급 순서에 확인되지 않은 열차가 끼어들지 않게 한다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0047', 'ba85-c5f0-c548', '{"id":"person-0047","name":"Myeong Dahae","title":"Geumcheon Ration Pot Market Broker","position":"Geumcheon Ration Pot Market Broker","characterId":"K047","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Ration Pot Operations","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#character-myeong-dahae","detailRoute":"/people/person-0047","birthDate":"2088-07-15","birthday":"07-15","age":38,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k047-pot-inventory","name":"Ration-pot inventory","rating":60},{"id":"k047-supply-counter-demand","name":"Supply-counter demands","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k047-pots-before-exports","name":"Pots before exports","description":"Ties export wagons and demands rations when ladles disappear.","behavior":"Ties export wagons and demands rations when ladles disappear.","stress":"That empty pots past three days would turn the work squads'' market ladles into requisition batons.","relationship":"Links food trades between shops and neighboring families in the Doksan 1-dong market, and counts winter stock together with the building shutter-check watch.","effects":[]},{"id":"k047-numbered-pots","name":"Numbered pots","description":"Removes pots without lid numbers from the brokerage table.","behavior":"Removes pots without lid numbers from the brokerage table.","stress":"That empty pots past three days would turn the work squads'' market ladles into requisition batons.","relationship":"Links food trades between shops and neighboring families in the Doksan 1-dong market, and counts winter stock together with the building shutter-check watch.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Stopped export wagons and demanded barge rations after three ladles vanished. Physical supply checks are a strength, without granting food production.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41110-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K047","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ba85-c5f0-c548","name":"Yeonan Myeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ba85-c5f0-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-40,"Openness":5,"Force":-15,"Material":50,"Communal":45,"Principle":-10,"Public":40,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":25},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-25,"Display":5,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Ration Pot Operations","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Geumcheon Ration Pot Market Broker","Work Location":"Doksan 1-dong. Myeong Dahae counts the food left in each pot in the Doksan 1-dong underground market and matches it against each shop''s ledger. When carts run late in the tunnel, Myeong Dahae tells the shops that winter stock has shrunk, and checks the entrance gaps together with the shutter-check watch.","Values":"Authority −40 | Openness 5 | Force −15 | Material 50 | Communal 45 | Principle −10 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 25 | Transformation 25","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −25 | Display 5 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Fluid | Bond None"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up in the alleys of the Doksan 1-dong market. The post of market food broker opened when he covered a shutter-check shift on a night of bitter cold.\n- Work location: Doksan 1-dong. Myeong Dahae counts the food left in each pot in the Doksan 1-dong underground market and matches it against each shop''s ledger. When carts run late in the tunnel, Myeong Dahae tells the shops that winter stock has shrunk, and checks the entrance gaps together with the shutter-check watch.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Geumcheon Ration Pot Market Broker. No fire is lit under a pot without a lid number, and outer carts are sent only after the ladles have been released from the pillar.","Anecdote":"When the ladles of three Geumcheon pots vanished on the same morning, Myeong Dahae tied the wheels of the repair export carts to the market and demanded barge rations at the window.","Relationships":"Myeong Dahae links food trades between shops and neighboring families in the Doksan 1-dong market, and counts winter stock together with the building shutter-check watch.","Ambition":"By letting only pots stamped with lid numbers receive fire, Myeong Dahae aims to keep the market from ever seeing the day repair exports come before the ladle count.","Fear":"That the work crews will turn the market''s ladles into requisition rods once an empty pot goes past three days.","Intervention":"Can tie the missing ladles back to the pillar, or put before the market the issuer of the note asking to release the export cart wheels."},"biography":"If the ladle marks differ from pot to pot, the ledger numbers are folded away, and pots whose lid numbers have been erased are pulled from the brokerage table. When a crop-failure note circulates, the ladles are kept tied to the pillar.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Ration Pot Operations\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Geumcheon Ration Pot Market Broker\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up in the alleys of the Doksan 1-dong market. The post of market food broker opened when he covered a shutter-check shift on a night of bitter cold.\n- Work location: Doksan 1-dong. Myeong Dahae counts the food left in each pot in the Doksan 1-dong underground market and matches it against each shop''s ledger. When carts run late in the tunnel, Myeong Dahae tells the shops that winter stock has shrunk, and checks the entrance gaps together with the shutter-check watch.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Geumcheon Ration Pot Market Broker. No fire is lit under a pot without a lid number, and outer carts are sent only after the ladles have been released from the pillar.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the ladles of three Geumcheon pots vanished on the same morning, Myeong Dahae tied the wheels of the repair export carts to the market and demanded barge rations at the window.\n\n**Relations.** Myeong Dahae links food trades between shops and neighboring families in the Doksan 1-dong market, and counts winter stock together with the building shutter-check watch.\n\n**Ambition.** By letting only pots stamped with lid numbers receive fire, Myeong Dahae aims to keep the market from ever seeing the day repair exports come before the ladle count.\n\n**Fear.** That the work crews will turn the market''s ladles into requisition rods once an empty pot goes past three days.\n\n**Intervention.** Can tie the missing ladles back to the pillar, or put before the market the issuer of the note asking to release the export cart wheels.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −40 | Openness 5 | Force −15 | Material 50 | Communal 45 | Principle −10 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 25 | Transformation 25\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −25 | Display 5 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Fluid | Bond None\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K037","name":"Han Jion","courtId":"court:K037","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Myeong Dahae","type":"Command","to":"Han Jion","basis":"Is a contract that enforces Han Jion''s civilian minimum by the number of pots, and"},{"from":"Myeong Dahae","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Soeon","basis":"Watching the results of Bak So-eon''s roof repair lottery together at the market pillar,"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0047","name":"명다해","title":"금천 배급솥 시장 중개인","position":"금천 배급솥 시장 중개인","characterId":"K047","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"배급솥 운영","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-명다해","detailRoute":"/people/person-0047","birthDate":"2088-07-15","birthday":"07-15","age":38,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k047-pot-inventory","name":"배급 솥 재고 확인","rating":60},{"id":"k047-supply-counter-demand","name":"배급 창구 요구","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k047-pots-before-exports","name":"수출보다 솥","description":"국자가 사라지면 수출 수레를 묶고 배급을 요구한다.","behavior":"국자가 사라지면 수출 수레를 묶고 배급을 요구한다.","stress":"빈 솥이 사흘을 넘기면 작업반이 시장 국자를 징발 막대로 바꾸는 것.","relationship":"독산1동 시장 가게들과 이웃 가족 사이에서 식량 거래를 잇고, 건물 셔터 점검 당번과 함께 겨울 재고를 센다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k047-numbered-pots","name":"번호 있는 솥","description":"뚜껑 번호 없는 솥은 중개 테이블에서 뺀다.","behavior":"뚜껑 번호 없는 솥은 중개 테이블에서 뺀다.","stress":"빈 솥이 사흘을 넘기면 작업반이 시장 국자를 징발 막대로 바꾸는 것.","relationship":"독산1동 시장 가게들과 이웃 가족 사이에서 식량 거래를 잇고, 건물 셔터 점검 당번과 함께 겨울 재고를 센다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"국자 세 개의 소실에 수출 수레를 묶고 바지선 배급을 요구했다. 실물 배급 확인은 강점이며 식량 생산을 새로 부여하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41110-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K047","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ba85-c5f0-c548","name":"연안 명씨","crest":"clan-crests/ba85-c5f0-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-40,"개방":5,"무력":-15,"물질":50,"공동":45,"원칙":-10,"공개":40,"자격":60,"분산":25,"변혁":25},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":-20,"위험":-25,"과시":5,"지속":30,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"배급솥 운영","품계":"조합원","직함":"금천 배급솥 시장 중개인","업무 위치":"독산1동. 명다해는 독산1동 지하 시장에서 솥마다 남은 식량을 세어 가게별 장부와 맞춘다. 수레가 터널에서 늦으면 겨울 재고가 줄었음을 가게들에 알리고, 셔터 점검 당번과 함께 출입구 틈을 확인한다.","가치관":"권위 −40 | 개방 5 | 무력 −15 | 물질 50 | 공동 45 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 40 | 자격 60 | 분산 25 | 변혁 25","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −25 | 과시 5 | 지속 30 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 독산1동 시장 골목에서 자랐다. 시장 식량 중개인 자리는 한파 밤의 셔터 점검 당번을 대신 맡으며 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 독산1동. 명다해는 독산1동 지하 시장에서 솥마다 남은 식량을 세어 가게별 장부와 맞춘다. 수레가 터널에서 늦으면 겨울 재고가 줄었음을 가게들에 알리고, 셔터 점검 당번과 함께 출입구 틈을 확인한다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 금천 배급솥 시장 중개인. 뚜껑 번호가 없는 솥은 불을 피우지 않고, 외곽 수레는 국자가 기둥에서 풀린 뒤에만 보낸다.","일화":"금천 솥 세 개의 국자가 같은 아침 사라지자 명다해는 수리 수출 수레의 바퀴를 시장에 묶고 바지선 배급을 창구에 요구했다.","관계":"독산1동 시장 가게들과 이웃 가족 사이에서 식량 거래를 잇고, 건물 셔터 점검 당번과 함께 겨울 재고를 센다.","야망":"뚜껑 번호가 찍힌 솥만 불을 받게 해, 수리 수출이 국자 수보다 앞서는 날을 시장에서 막는다.","공포":"빈 솥이 사흘을 넘기면 작업반이 시장 국자를 징발 막대로 바꾸는 것.","개입":"사라진 국자를 기둥에 다시 묶거나, 수출 수레 바퀴를 풀어 달라는 쪽지의 발주자를 시장에 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"국자 자국이 솥마다 다르면 장부 숫자를 접고, 뚜껑 번호가 지워진 솥은 중개 테이블에서 뺀다. 흉작 쪽지가 돌면 국자를 기둥에 묶어 둔다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 배급솥 운영\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 금천 배급솥 시장 중개인\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 독산1동 시장 골목에서 자랐다. 시장 식량 중개인 자리는 한파 밤의 셔터 점검 당번을 대신 맡으며 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 독산1동. 명다해는 독산1동 지하 시장에서 솥마다 남은 식량을 세어 가게별 장부와 맞춘다. 수레가 터널에서 늦으면 겨울 재고가 줄었음을 가게들에 알리고, 셔터 점검 당번과 함께 출입구 틈을 확인한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 금천 배급솥 시장 중개인. 뚜껑 번호가 없는 솥은 불을 피우지 않고, 외곽 수레는 국자가 기둥에서 풀린 뒤에만 보낸다.\n\n**일화.** 금천 솥 세 개의 국자가 같은 아침 사라지자 명다해는 수리 수출 수레의 바퀴를 시장에 묶고 바지선 배급을 창구에 요구했다.\n\n**관계.** 독산1동 시장 가게들과 이웃 가족 사이에서 식량 거래를 잇고, 건물 셔터 점검 당번과 함께 겨울 재고를 센다.\n\n**야망.** 뚜껑 번호가 찍힌 솥만 불을 받게 해, 수리 수출이 국자 수보다 앞서는 날을 시장에서 막는다.\n\n**공포.** 빈 솥이 사흘을 넘기면 작업반이 시장 국자를 징발 막대로 바꾸는 것.\n\n**개입.** 사라진 국자를 기둥에 다시 묶거나, 수출 수레 바퀴를 풀어 달라는 쪽지의 발주자를 시장에 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −40 | 개방 5 | 무력 −15 | 물질 50 | 공동 45 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 40 | 자격 60 | 분산 25 | 변혁 25\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −25 | 과시 5 | 지속 30 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K037","name":"한지온","courtId":"court:K037","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"명다해","type":"지휘","to":"한지온","basis":"한지온의 시민 최저선을 솥 수로 집행하는 계약이고"},{"from":"명다해","type":"계약","to":"박소언","basis":"박소언의 지붕 수리 추첨 결과를 시장 기둥에서 함께 본다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0048', 'c81c-ce60-c6d0', '{"id":"person-0048","name":"Je Munseok","title":"Guro Dust Clinic Surgeon","position":"Guro Dust Clinic Surgeon","characterId":"K048","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Dust Treatment and Surgery","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#inmul-je-munseok","detailRoute":"/people/person-0048","birthDate":"2097-05-13","birthday":"05-13","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k048-surgery","name":"Surgery","rating":70},{"id":"k048-patient-filter-schedule","name":"Patient and filter scheduling","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k048-continue-in-blackout","name":"Continue surgery in blackout","description":"Continued surgery by handset light during a blackout.","behavior":"Continued surgery by handset light during a blackout.","stress":"","relationship":"Splitting patient transfers with Jin Uram''s Geumcheon care, matching Im Chaewon''s protective releases to care volumes, and helping Ryu Eunbi''s drug-efficacy verification with Guro specimens.","effects":[]},{"id":"k048-medical-record-boundary","name":"Boundary of medical records","description":"Rejects demands to turn medical records into military registers.","behavior":"Rejects demands to turn medical records into military registers.","stress":"","relationship":"Splitting patient transfers with Jin Uram''s Geumcheon care, matching Im Chaewon''s protective releases to care volumes, and helping Ryu Eunbi''s drug-efficacy verification with Guro specimens.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Surgery during a blackout explicitly supports a learned skill. Also coordinates transfers and filter schedules, without assuming outcomes or mastery of all medicine.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44230-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K048","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44230-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c81c-ce60-c6d0","name":"Je Clan of Chilwon","crest":"clan-crests/c81c-ce60-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":10,"Force":-25,"Material":40,"Communal":40,"Principle":25,"Public":25,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":5,"Display":25,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Dust Treatment and Surgery","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Guro Dust Clinic Surgeon","Work Location":"Guro 3-dong. Je Munseok records the drugs given to patients and the times mobile phones were used during the winter blackout at the Guro 3-dong Dust Clinic. Je Munseok circulates the Geumcheon transfer tables to Jin Uram and cross-checks Im Chaewon''s protective-suit issue counts against Ryu Eunbi''s Guro samples.","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 10 | Force −25 | Material 40 | Communal 40 | Principle 25 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation 20","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 5 | Display 25 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Unaligned | Bond Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Raised at the Jegi-dong infirmary. The post of chief medical officer at the Guro Dust Clinic opened through a counterfeit-drug seal.\n- Work location: Guro 3-dong. Je Munseok records the drugs given to patients and the times mobile phones were used during the winter blackout at the Guro 3-dong Dust Clinic. Je Munseok circulates the Geumcheon transfer tables to Jin Uram and cross-checks Im Chaewon''s protective-suit issue counts against Ryu Eunbi''s Guro samples.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Guro Dust Clinic Surgeon. Patient severity and filter replacement cycles are posted together, and no medicine without a certification stamp is admitted to the cabinet.","Anecdote":"In 2125, when the power failed during surgery, the blade kept moving under the light of a mobile phone. Because of this, the signature for the post of chief medical officer at the Guro Dust Clinic was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Shares Jin Uram''s Geumcheon medical duty and patient transfers, matches Im Chaewon''s protective-gear issuance to clinic quantities, and assists Ryu Eunbi''s efficacy verification with Guro samples.","Ambition":"Opens dust treatment and filter exchange to the medical crews and entrance-barrier repair crews as well, so that recovery-service workers can breathe as citizens even when not in military uniform.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can bring the original records of a replication experiment to open the medicine cabinet, or expose a workshop that hid a nondisclosed purchase clause."},"biography":"Gauges the danger of a protective suit by its stitch spacing, and pushes officers who demand clinic records as a military roster out the door. Practical and quick with the hands.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Dust Treatment and Surgery\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Guro Dust Clinic Surgeon\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Raised at the Jegi-dong infirmary. The post of chief medical officer at the Guro Dust Clinic opened through a counterfeit-drug seal.\n- Work location: Guro 3-dong. Je Munseok records the drugs given to patients and the times mobile phones were used during the winter blackout at the Guro 3-dong Dust Clinic. Je Munseok circulates the Geumcheon transfer tables to Jin Uram and cross-checks Im Chaewon''s protective-suit issue counts against Ryu Eunbi''s Guro samples.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Guro Dust Clinic Surgeon. Patient severity and filter replacement cycles are posted together, and no medicine without a certification stamp is admitted to the cabinet.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, when the power failed during surgery, the blade kept moving under the light of a mobile phone. Because of this, the signature for the post of chief medical officer at the Guro Dust Clinic was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Shares Jin Uram''s Geumcheon medical duty and patient transfers, matches Im Chaewon''s protective-gear issuance to clinic quantities, and assists Ryu Eunbi''s efficacy verification with Guro samples.\n\n**Ambition.** Opens dust treatment and filter exchange to the medical crews and entrance-barrier repair crews as well, so that recovery-service workers can breathe as citizens even when not in military uniform.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring the original records of a replication experiment to open the medicine cabinet, or expose a workshop that hid a nondisclosed purchase clause.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 10 | Force −25 | Material 40 | Communal 40 | Principle 25 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 5 | Display 25 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Unaligned | Bond Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Je Munseok","type":"Contract","to":"Im Chaewon","basis":"Matches Im Chaewon''s protective suit shipments to medical quantities, and"},{"from":"Je Munseok","type":"Contract","to":"Jin Uram","basis":"Splitting Jin Uram''s Geumcheon medical duty from patient transfers and"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0048","name":"제문석","title":"구로 분진진료소 외과의","position":"구로 분진진료소 외과의","characterId":"K048","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"분진 진료·수술","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-제문석","detailRoute":"/people/person-0048","birthDate":"2097-05-13","birthday":"05-13","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k048-surgery","name":"수술","rating":70},{"id":"k048-patient-filter-schedule","name":"환자·필터 일정","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k048-continue-in-blackout","name":"정전 중 수술 지속","description":"정전에도 손전화 불빛 아래 수술을 계속했다.","behavior":"정전에도 손전화 불빛 아래 수술을 계속했다.","stress":"","relationship":"진우람의 금천 의무와 환자 이송을 나누고, 임채원의 방호 출고를 진료 수량에 맞추며, 류은비의 약효 검증을 구로 표본으로 돕는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k048-medical-record-boundary","name":"진료 기록의 경계","description":"진료 기록을 군수 명부로 달라는 요구를 거절한다.","behavior":"진료 기록을 군수 명부로 달라는 요구를 거절한다.","stress":"","relationship":"진우람의 금천 의무와 환자 이송을 나누고, 임채원의 방호 출고를 진료 수량에 맞추며, 류은비의 약효 검증을 구로 표본으로 돕는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"정전 중 수술 수행은 명시된 기술 근거다. 환자 이송과 필터 일정도 운영하나 수술 결과나 모든 의학 분야의 숙련은 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44230-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K048","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44230-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c81c-ce60-c6d0","name":"칠원 제씨","crest":"clan-crests/c81c-ce60-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":10,"무력":-25,"물질":40,"공동":40,"원칙":25,"공개":25,"자격":60,"분산":10,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":40,"위험":5,"과시":25,"지속":20,"지향":"무성향","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"분진 진료·수술","품계":"조합원","직함":"구로 분진진료소 외과의","업무 위치":"구로3동. 제문석은 구로3동 분진진료소에서 겨울 정전 중 환자에게 쓴 약과 손전화 사용 시각을 기록한다. 진우람에게 금천 이송표를 돌리고 임채원의 방호복 출고 수와 류은비의 구로 표본을 대조한다.","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 40 | 공동 40 | 원칙 25 | 공개 25 | 자격 60 | 분산 10 | 변혁 20","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 40 | 위험 5 | 과시 25 | 지속 20 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 구로 분진진료소 의무장 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로3동. 제문석은 구로3동 분진진료소에서 겨울 정전 중 환자에게 쓴 약과 손전화 사용 시각을 기록한다. 진우람에게 금천 이송표를 돌리고 임채원의 방호복 출고 수와 류은비의 구로 표본을 대조한다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 구로 분진진료소 외과의. 환자 중증도와 필터 교체 주기를 함께 게시하고, 인증 도장 없는 약은 약장에 들이지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 수술 중 정전이 되자 손전화 아래에서 칼을 계속했다. 이 일로 구로 분진진료소 의무장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"진우람의 금천 의무와 환자 이송을 나누고, 임채원의 방호 출고를 진료 수량에 맞추며, 류은비의 약효 검증을 구로 표본으로 돕는다.","야망":"분진 진료와 필터 교환을 의료반과 출입구 방벽 보수반까지 열어 복구복무자가 군복이 아니어도 시민으로 숨 쉬게 한다.","공포":"","개입":"재현 실험의 원본 기록을 가져와 약장을 열거나, 비공개 구매 조항을 숨긴 공방을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"바느질 간격으로 방호복의 위험을 가늠하고, 진료 기록을 군수 명부로 달라는 장교를 문으로 밀어낸다. 실용적이고 손이 빠르다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 분진 진료·수술\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 구로 분진진료소 외과의\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 구로 분진진료소 의무장 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로3동. 제문석은 구로3동 분진진료소에서 겨울 정전 중 환자에게 쓴 약과 손전화 사용 시각을 기록한다. 진우람에게 금천 이송표를 돌리고 임채원의 방호복 출고 수와 류은비의 구로 표본을 대조한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 구로 분진진료소 외과의. 환자 중증도와 필터 교체 주기를 함께 게시하고, 인증 도장 없는 약은 약장에 들이지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 수술 중 정전이 되자 손전화 아래에서 칼을 계속했다. 이 일로 구로 분진진료소 의무장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 진우람의 금천 의무와 환자 이송을 나누고, 임채원의 방호 출고를 진료 수량에 맞추며, 류은비의 약효 검증을 구로 표본으로 돕는다.\n\n**야망.** 분진 진료와 필터 교환을 의료반과 출입구 방벽 보수반까지 열어 복구복무자가 군복이 아니어도 시민으로 숨 쉬게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 재현 실험의 원본 기록을 가져와 약장을 열거나, 비공개 구매 조항을 숨긴 공방을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 40 | 공동 40 | 원칙 25 | 공개 25 | 자격 60 | 분산 10 | 변혁 20\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 40 | 위험 5 | 과시 25 | 지속 20 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"제문석","type":"계약","to":"임채원","basis":"임채원의 방호 출고를 진료 수량에 맞추며"},{"from":"제문석","type":"계약","to":"진우람","basis":"진우람의 금천 의무와 환자 이송을 나누고"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0049', 'bcc0-c6d0-c8fc-908a', '{"id":"person-0049","name":"Byeon Jua","title":"Guro Power Trunk Line Generation Operations Chief","position":"Guro Power Trunk Line Generation Operations Chief","characterId":"K049","rank":"Audit","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Power Plant Operation","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#inmul-byeon-jua","detailRoute":"/people/person-0049","birthDate":"2087-07-20","birthday":"07-20","age":39,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k049-frequency-load-control","name":"Frequency and load control","rating":65},{"id":"k049-load-chart-recording","name":"Load-chart recording","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k049-civilian-pump-line","name":"Civilian pumps first","description":"Raises military circuits only after civilian pump needles stabilize.","behavior":"Raises military circuits only after civilian pump needles stabilize.","stress":"That the frequency below the red thread lasting past three days would mean the light and heat of the turning generator handle draw outside machines in.","relationship":"Under command to execute Park Soeon''s bid results by circuit color, lending Heo Daon only the night frequency. Whenever I Gangmuk''s night formations drained a civilian circuit, she lowered the handle.","effects":[]},{"id":"k049-visible-limit","name":"Visible minimum","description":"Lowers the handle when frequency falls below the red thread.","behavior":"Lowers the handle when frequency falls below the red thread.","stress":"That the frequency below the red thread lasting past three days would mean the light and heat of the turning generator handle draw outside machines in.","relationship":"Under command to execute Park Soeon''s bid results by circuit color, lending Heo Daon only the night frequency. Whenever I Gangmuk''s night formations drained a civilian circuit, she lowered the handle.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Lowering military circuits and taking the load chart to the counter support the strengths. No generator invention or ownership is claimed.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44250-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K049","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44250-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcc0-c6d0-c8fc-908a","name":"Wonju Byeon Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bcc0-c6d0-c8fc-908a.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-30,"Openness":15,"Force":-5,"Material":50,"Communal":35,"Principle":20,"Public":25,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":25},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":30,"Display":-25,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Power Plant Operation","Rank":"Audit","Title":"Guro Power Trunk Line Generation Operations Chief","Work Location":"Guro 3-dong. Byeon Jua first checks the usage of civilian pumps and winter heating circuits on the Guro 3-dong power trunk load table. If the munitions circuit''s frequency drops, Byeon lowers the handle and hands Bak Soeon a revised load table and Heo Daon only the permitted late-night test-run hours.","Values":"Authority −30 | Openness 15 | Force −5 | Material 50 | Communal 35 | Principle 20 | Publicity 25 | Credentials 55 | Dispersal 30 | Transformation 25","Desires":"Longing 0 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 30 | Display −25 | Persistence −5 | Orientation same-sex | Union non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up on concourse watch duty. The post of Guro Power Trunk Generation Operations Chief opened through a substitute watch after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Work location: Guro 3-dong. Byeon Jua first checks the usage of civilian pumps and winter heating circuits on the Guro 3-dong power trunk load table. If the munitions circuit''s frequency drops, Byeon lowers the handle and hands Bak Soeon a revised load table and Heo Daon only the permitted late-night test-run hours.","Offices":"Rank: Audit. Title: Guro Power Trunk Line Generation Operations Chief. Marks the frequency floor on the gauge with a red thread, and raises the munitions circuit only after the civilian pump needle has stabilized.","Anecdote":"When the frequency needle fell below the red thread, Byeon Jua lowered the munitions circuit and carried the load table to the ration window.","Relationships":"Takes direction from Bak Soeon, who enforces bid results by circuit color, and lends Heo Daon only the late-night frequency for test runs. Lowers the handle if I Gangmuk''s night schedule drops the civilian circuits.","Ambition":"Divides the frequency floor with a red thread so that the workshops and the shells do not stop on the same night, and keeps the munitions circuit from swallowing the civilian pumps.","Fear":"That the frequency under the red thread lasting beyond three days would mean the light and heat of the turning generator handle draw outside machines in.","Intervention":"Can borrow a circuit that will steady the civilian pump needle, or lay out at the window the munitions line hidden in the load table."},"biography":"Stops speaking and grips the breaker handle if the frequency needle drops even one notch. Does not write the munitions work crew''s late-night requests outside the load table.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Occupation: Power Plant Operation\n- Rank: Audit\n- Title: Guro Power Trunk Line Generation Operations Chief\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up on concourse watch duty. The post of Guro Power Trunk Generation Operations Chief opened through a substitute watch after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Work location: Guro 3-dong. Byeon Jua first checks the usage of civilian pumps and winter heating circuits on the Guro 3-dong power trunk load table. If the munitions circuit''s frequency drops, Byeon lowers the handle and hands Bak Soeon a revised load table and Heo Daon only the permitted late-night test-run hours.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Audit. Title: Guro Power Trunk Line Generation Operations Chief. Marks the frequency floor on the gauge with a red thread, and raises the munitions circuit only after the civilian pump needle has stabilized.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the frequency needle fell below the red thread, Byeon Jua lowered the munitions circuit and carried the load table to the ration window.\n\n**Relations.** Takes direction from Bak Soeon, who enforces bid results by circuit color, and lends Heo Daon only the late-night frequency for test runs. Lowers the handle if I Gangmuk''s night schedule drops the civilian circuits.\n\n**Ambition.** Divides the frequency floor with a red thread so that the workshops and the shells do not stop on the same night, and keeps the munitions circuit from swallowing the civilian pumps.\n\n**Fear.** That the frequency under the red thread lasting beyond three days would mean the light and heat of the turning generator handle draw outside machines in.\n\n**Intervention.** Can borrow a circuit that will steady the civilian pump needle, or lay out at the window the munitions line hidden in the load table.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −30 | Openness 15 | Force −5 | Material 50 | Communal 35 | Principle 20 | Publicity 25 | Credentials 55 | Dispersal 30 | Transformation 25\n- Desires: Longing 0 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 30 | Display −25 | Persistence −5 | Orientation same-sex | Union non-exclusive\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K033","name":"Bak Soeon","courtId":"court:K033","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Byeon Jua","type":"Command","to":"Bak Soeon","basis":"Receiving direction to enforce Bak So-eon''s bid results by circuit color,"},{"from":"Byeon Jua","type":"Command","to":"Heo Daon","basis":"Lends only the late-night frequency for Heo Daon''s test run,"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0049","name":"변주아","title":"구로 전력간선 발전운전장","position":"구로 전력간선 발전운전장","characterId":"K049","rank":"감사","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"발전 설비 운전","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-변주아","detailRoute":"/people/person-0049","birthDate":"2087-07-20","birthday":"07-20","age":39,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k049-frequency-load-control","name":"주파수·부하 조정","rating":65},{"id":"k049-load-chart-recording","name":"부하표 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k049-civilian-pump-line","name":"민가 펌프 먼저","description":"펌프 바늘이 안정된 뒤 군수 회로를 올린다.","behavior":"펌프 바늘이 안정된 뒤 군수 회로를 올린다.","stress":"빨간 실 아래의 주파수가 사흘을 넘기면 발전 손잡이를 돌리는 불빛과 열이 바깥 기계를 불러들이는 것.","relationship":"박소언의 입찰 결과를 회로 색으로 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 허다온의 시운전에 심야 주파수만 빌려 준다. 이강묵의 야간 편성이 민가 회로를 빼면 손잡이를 내린다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k049-visible-limit","name":"보이는 최저선","description":"주파수 바늘이 빨간 실 아래로 떨어지면 손잡이를 내린다.","behavior":"주파수 바늘이 빨간 실 아래로 떨어지면 손잡이를 내린다.","stress":"빨간 실 아래의 주파수가 사흘을 넘기면 발전 손잡이를 돌리는 불빛과 열이 바깥 기계를 불러들이는 것.","relationship":"박소언의 입찰 결과를 회로 색으로 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 허다온의 시운전에 심야 주파수만 빌려 준다. 이강묵의 야간 편성이 민가 회로를 빼면 손잡이를 내린다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"군수 회로를 내리고 부하표를 창구에 가져간 행동이 강점의 근거다. 발전 설비를 창안하거나 소유했다고 주장하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44250-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K049","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44250-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcc0-c6d0-c8fc-908a","name":"원주 변씨","crest":"clan-crests/bcc0-c6d0-c8fc-908a.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-30,"개방":15,"무력":-5,"물질":50,"공동":35,"원칙":20,"공개":25,"자격":55,"분산":30,"변혁":25},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":10,"위험":30,"과시":-25,"지속":-5,"지향":"동성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"발전 설비 운전","품계":"감사","직함":"구로 전력간선 발전운전장","업무 위치":"구로3동. 변주아는 구로3동 전력간선 부하표에서 민가 펌프와 겨울 난방 회로의 사용량을 먼저 확인한다. 군수 회로의 주파수가 내려가면 손잡이를 내리고 박소언에게 수정 부하표를, 허다온에게는 허용된 심야 시운전 시각만 건넨다.","가치관":"권위 −30 | 개방 15 | 무력 −5 | 물질 50 | 공동 35 | 원칙 20 | 공개 25 | 자격 55 | 분산 30 | 변혁 25","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 10 | 위험 30 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 구로 전력간선 발전운전장 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로3동. 변주아는 구로3동 전력간선 부하표에서 민가 펌프와 겨울 난방 회로의 사용량을 먼저 확인한다. 군수 회로의 주파수가 내려가면 손잡이를 내리고 박소언에게 수정 부하표를, 허다온에게는 허용된 심야 시운전 시각만 건넨다.","관직":"품계 감사. 직함은 구로 전력간선 발전운전장. 주파수 최저선을 빨간 실로 계기판에 표시하고, 군수 회로는 민가 펌프 바늘이 안정된 뒤에만 올린다.","일화":"주파수 바늘이 빨간 실 아래로 떨어지자 변주아는 군수 회로를 내리고 배급 창구에 부하표를 들고 갔다.","관계":"박소언의 입찰 결과를 회로 색으로 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 허다온의 시운전에 심야 주파수만 빌려 준다. 이강묵의 야간 편성이 민가 회로를 빼면 손잡이를 내린다.","야망":"주파수 최저선을 빨간 실로 나눠 공방과 쉘이 같은 밤에 멈추지 않게 하고, 군수 회로가 민가 펌프를 삼키지 못하게 한다.","공포":"빨간 실 아래의 주파수가 사흘을 넘기면 발전 손잡이를 돌리는 불빛과 열이 바깥 기계를 불러들이는 것.","개입":"민가 펌프 바늘이 안정될 회로를 빌려 오거나, 부하표에 숨은 군수 줄을 창구에 펼 수 있다."},"biography":"주파수 바늘이 한 칸만 내려가도 말을 멈추고 차단기 손잡이를 잡는다. 군수 작업반의 심야 청을 부하표 바깥에 적지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 발전 설비 운전\n- 품계: 감사\n- 직함: 구로 전력간선 발전운전장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 구로 전력간선 발전운전장 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로3동. 변주아는 구로3동 전력간선 부하표에서 민가 펌프와 겨울 난방 회로의 사용량을 먼저 확인한다. 군수 회로의 주파수가 내려가면 손잡이를 내리고 박소언에게 수정 부하표를, 허다온에게는 허용된 심야 시운전 시각만 건넨다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 감사. 직함은 구로 전력간선 발전운전장. 주파수 최저선을 빨간 실로 계기판에 표시하고, 군수 회로는 민가 펌프 바늘이 안정된 뒤에만 올린다.\n\n**일화.** 주파수 바늘이 빨간 실 아래로 떨어지자 변주아는 군수 회로를 내리고 배급 창구에 부하표를 들고 갔다.\n\n**관계.** 박소언의 입찰 결과를 회로 색으로 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 허다온의 시운전에 심야 주파수만 빌려 준다. 이강묵의 야간 편성이 민가 회로를 빼면 손잡이를 내린다.\n\n**야망.** 주파수 최저선을 빨간 실로 나눠 공방과 쉘이 같은 밤에 멈추지 않게 하고, 군수 회로가 민가 펌프를 삼키지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 빨간 실 아래의 주파수가 사흘을 넘기면 발전 손잡이를 돌리는 불빛과 열이 바깥 기계를 불러들이는 것.\n\n**개입.** 민가 펌프 바늘이 안정될 회로를 빌려 오거나, 부하표에 숨은 군수 줄을 창구에 펼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −30 | 개방 15 | 무력 −5 | 물질 50 | 공동 35 | 원칙 20 | 공개 25 | 자격 55 | 분산 30 | 변혁 25\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 10 | 위험 30 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K033","name":"박소언","courtId":"court:K033","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"변주아","type":"지휘","to":"박소언","basis":"박소언의 입찰 결과를 회로 색으로 집행하는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"변주아","type":"지휘","to":"허다온","basis":"허다온의 시운전에 심야 주파수만 빌려 준다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0050', 'c885-c601-c554', '{"id":"person-0050","name":"Jong Maru","title":"Counterfeit Pump Parts Victims'' Representative","position":"Counterfeit Pump Parts Victims'' Representative","characterId":"K050","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Pump Maintenance","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#inmul-jongmaru","detailRoute":"/people/person-0050","birthDate":"2072-11-25","birthday":"11-25","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k050-pump-shaft-repair","name":"Pump-shaft repair","rating":65},{"id":"k050-defect-register","name":"Defect-list recording","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k050-joint-assessment","name":"Joint assessment","description":"Opens assessment only before both union and auditor.","behavior":"Opens assessment only before both union and auditor.","stress":"That a counterfeit packing burst in a generator fuel pump on a winter night, sparks and heat leaked out, the heat drew outside machines, and that accident became a munitions squad''s forced-mobilization pretext.","relationship":"Raising the defect list onto Jang Wooseok''s repair-standards ledger, and testifying to the two ends of the same counterfeit parts with Ryu Dain of Ttukseom.","effects":[]},{"id":"k050-seal-not-price","name":"A seal is not a price","description":"Does not forgive traders pricing a standards seal as a purchase.","behavior":"Does not forgive traders pricing a standards seal as a purchase.","stress":"That a counterfeit packing burst in a generator fuel pump on a winter night, sparks and heat leaked out, the heat drew outside machines, and that accident became a munitions squad''s forced-mobilization pretext.","relationship":"Raising the defect list onto Jang Wooseok''s repair-standards ledger, and testifying to the two ends of the same counterfeit parts with Ryu Dain of Ttukseom.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Shaft replacement and shared custody of victim and component records are evidence. References to workers’ fingers do not establish a personal injury assessment.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41220-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K050","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41220-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c885-c601-c554","name":"Jong Clan of Yeongam","crest":"clan-crests/c885-c601-c554.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-45,"Openness":20,"Force":-5,"Material":35,"Communal":35,"Principle":5,"Public":40,"Eligibility":80,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":25},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-5,"Risk":-20,"Display":-10,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Pump Maintenance","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Counterfeit Pump Parts Victims'' Representative","Work Location":"Guro 2-dong. Jong Maru records the wear surface of the counterfeit pump shaft recovered from the Guro 2-dong generator room against Jang Useok''s Repair Standards Ledger. Jong hands Gang Minseo the victim list and the results of the sealed-box inspection, and awaits the same part number confirmed by Ryu Dain of Ttukseom.","Values":"Authority −45 | Openness 20 | Force −5 | Material 35 | Communal 35 | Principle 5 | Publicity 40 | Credentials 80 | Dispersal 25 | Transformation 25","Desires":"Longing 25 | Monopoly −5 | Risk −20 | Display −10 | Persistence 25 | Orientation none | Union contractual cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Sinjeong Rolling Stock Depot. The post of Representative of Counterfeit Pump Part Victims opened through a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Work location: Guro 2-dong. Jong Maru records the wear surface of the counterfeit pump shaft recovered from the Guro 2-dong generator room against Jang Useok''s Repair Standards Ledger. Jong hands Gang Minseo the victim list and the results of the sealed-box inspection, and awaits the same part number confirmed by Ryu Dain of Ttukseom.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Counterfeit Pump Parts Victims'' Representative. Places the victim roster and the recovered parts in the same sealed box, and opens the appraisal only when the labor union and the standards auditor view it at the same time.","Anecdote":"In 2125, Jong took apart a stalled pump and ground down just one worn shaft to get it running again. Because of this, the signature for the post of Representative of Counterfeit Pump Part Victims was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Enters the defect list in Jang Useok''s Repair Standards Ledger, and testifies with Ryu Dain of Ttukseom to both ends of the same counterfeit part.","Ambition":"Posts the manufacturing workshops and distribution routes of defective pump parts to the public ledger, so that repair standards do not become a shield for counterfeit seals.","Fear":"That a counterfeit packing bursts in a generator fuel pump on a winter night, sparks and heat leak out and draw outside machines, and the accident becomes the pretext for forced mobilization by the munitions work crews.","Intervention":"Can find the original plate of the counterfeit seal to back a halt to its shipments, or expose evidence that a workshop not on the roster was slipped in."},"biography":"Reads the vibration of defective wheels with the fingertips, and does not forgive merchants who name a standards seal by the price paid for it. Checks the warehouse seal before a skilled worker''s fingers.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Pump Maintenance\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Counterfeit Pump Parts Victims'' Representative\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Sinjeong Rolling Stock Depot. The post of Representative of Counterfeit Pump Part Victims opened through a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Work location: Guro 2-dong. Jong Maru records the wear surface of the counterfeit pump shaft recovered from the Guro 2-dong generator room against Jang Useok''s Repair Standards Ledger. Jong hands Gang Minseo the victim list and the results of the sealed-box inspection, and awaits the same part number confirmed by Ryu Dain of Ttukseom.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Counterfeit Pump Parts Victims'' Representative. Places the victim roster and the recovered parts in the same sealed box, and opens the appraisal only when the labor union and the standards auditor view it at the same time.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, Jong took apart a stalled pump and ground down just one worn shaft to get it running again. Because of this, the signature for the post of Representative of Counterfeit Pump Part Victims was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Enters the defect list in Jang Useok''s Repair Standards Ledger, and testifies with Ryu Dain of Ttukseom to both ends of the same counterfeit part.\n\n**Ambition.** Posts the manufacturing workshops and distribution routes of defective pump parts to the public ledger, so that repair standards do not become a shield for counterfeit seals.\n\n**Fear.** That a counterfeit packing bursts in a generator fuel pump on a winter night, sparks and heat leak out and draw outside machines, and the accident becomes the pretext for forced mobilization by the munitions work crews.\n\n**Intervention.** Can find the original plate of the counterfeit seal to back a halt to its shipments, or expose evidence that a workshop not on the roster was slipped in.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −45 | Openness 20 | Force −5 | Material 35 | Communal 35 | Principle 5 | Publicity 40 | Credentials 80 | Dispersal 25 | Transformation 25\n- Desires: Longing 25 | Monopoly −5 | Risk −20 | Display −10 | Persistence 25 | Orientation none | Union contractual cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jong Maru","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Useok","basis":"enters defect lists into Jang Useok''s repair standards ledger,"},{"from":"Jong Maru","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Da-in","basis":"Testifies with Ryu Dain of Ttukseom to both ends of the same counterfeit part"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ryu Da-in","type":"Contract","to":"Jong Maru","basis":"Testifies with Jong Maru of Guro to both ends of the same counterfeit part, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0050","name":"종마루","title":"가짜 펌프 부품 피해자 대표","position":"가짜 펌프 부품 피해자 대표","characterId":"K050","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"펌프 정비","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-종마루","detailRoute":"/people/person-0050","birthDate":"2072-11-25","birthday":"11-25","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k050-pump-shaft-repair","name":"펌프 축 수리","rating":65},{"id":"k050-defect-register","name":"불량 목록 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k050-joint-assessment","name":"함께 여는 감정","description":"노동조합과 감사관이 함께 볼 때 감정을 연다.","behavior":"노동조합과 감사관이 함께 볼 때 감정을 연다.","stress":"가짜 패킹이 겨울 밤 발전기 연료 펌프에서 터져 불꽃과 열이 새고, 그 열이 바깥 기계를 불러 군수 작업반의 강제 동원 명분이 되는 것.","relationship":"장우석의 수리규격 원장에 불량 목록을 올리고, 뚝섬의 류다인과 같은 가짜 부품의 양쪽 끝을 증언한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k050-seal-not-price","name":"도장은 가격이 아니다","description":"규격 도장을 산 가격으로 부르는 상인을 용서하지 않는다.","behavior":"규격 도장을 산 가격으로 부르는 상인을 용서하지 않는다.","stress":"가짜 패킹이 겨울 밤 발전기 연료 펌프에서 터져 불꽃과 열이 새고, 그 열이 바깥 기계를 불러 군수 작업반의 강제 동원 명분이 되는 것.","relationship":"장우석의 수리규격 원장에 불량 목록을 올리고, 뚝섬의 류다인과 같은 가짜 부품의 양쪽 끝을 증언한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"축 교체와 피해·부품 기록의 공동 보관이 근거다. 손가락 손상을 암시하는 문장을 실제 신체 손상 판정으로 바꾸지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41220-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K050","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41220-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c885-c601-c554","name":"영암 종씨","crest":"clan-crests/c885-c601-c554.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-45,"개방":20,"무력":-5,"물질":35,"공동":35,"원칙":5,"공개":40,"자격":80,"분산":25,"변혁":25},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-5,"위험":-20,"과시":-10,"지속":25,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"펌프 정비","품계":"조합원","직함":"가짜 펌프 부품 피해자 대표","업무 위치":"구로2동. 종마루는 구로2동 발전실에서 회수한 가짜 펌프 축의 마모 면을 장우석의 수리규격 원장에 맞춰 기록한다. 강민서에게 피해자 목록과 봉인함 열람 결과를 넘기고 뚝섬의 류다인이 확인한 같은 부품 번호를 기다린다.","가치관":"권위 −45 | 개방 20 | 무력 −5 | 물질 35 | 공동 35 | 원칙 5 | 공개 40 | 자격 80 | 분산 25 | 변혁 25","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −5 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −10 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 가짜 펌프 부품 피해자 대표 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로2동. 종마루는 구로2동 발전실에서 회수한 가짜 펌프 축의 마모 면을 장우석의 수리규격 원장에 맞춰 기록한다. 강민서에게 피해자 목록과 봉인함 열람 결과를 넘기고 뚝섬의 류다인이 확인한 같은 부품 번호를 기다린다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 가짜 펌프 부품 피해자 대표. 피해 명부와 회수 부품을 같은 봉인함에 넣고, 감정은 노동조합과 규격 감사관이 동시에 볼 때만 연다.","일화":"2125년 정지했던 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 갈아 다시 돌렸다. 이 일로 가짜 펌프 부품 피해자 대표 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"장우석의 수리규격 원장에 불량 목록을 올리고, 뚝섬의 류다인과 같은 가짜 부품의 양쪽 끝을 증언한다.","야망":"불량 펌프 부품의 제조 공방과 유통 경로를 공개 원장에 올려, 수리 규격이 가짜 도장의 방패가 되지 않게 한다.","공포":"가짜 패킹이 겨울 밤 발전기 연료 펌프에서 터져 불꽃과 열이 새고, 그 열이 바깥 기계를 불러 군수 작업반의 강제 동원 명분이 되는 것.","개입":"가짜 도장 원판을 찾아 그의 출고 중지를 뒷받침하거나, 명부에 없는 공방을 끼워 넣은 증거를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"불량 차륜의 진동을 손끝으로 읽고, 규격 도장을 산 가격으로 부르는 상인을 용서하지 않는다. 숙련공의 손가락보다 창고 봉인을 먼저 확인한다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 펌프 정비\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 가짜 펌프 부품 피해자 대표\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 가짜 펌프 부품 피해자 대표 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로2동. 종마루는 구로2동 발전실에서 회수한 가짜 펌프 축의 마모 면을 장우석의 수리규격 원장에 맞춰 기록한다. 강민서에게 피해자 목록과 봉인함 열람 결과를 넘기고 뚝섬의 류다인이 확인한 같은 부품 번호를 기다린다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 가짜 펌프 부품 피해자 대표. 피해 명부와 회수 부품을 같은 봉인함에 넣고, 감정은 노동조합과 규격 감사관이 동시에 볼 때만 연다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 정지했던 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 갈아 다시 돌렸다. 이 일로 가짜 펌프 부품 피해자 대표 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 장우석의 수리규격 원장에 불량 목록을 올리고, 뚝섬의 류다인과 같은 가짜 부품의 양쪽 끝을 증언한다.\n\n**야망.** 불량 펌프 부품의 제조 공방과 유통 경로를 공개 원장에 올려, 수리 규격이 가짜 도장의 방패가 되지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 가짜 패킹이 겨울 밤 발전기 연료 펌프에서 터져 불꽃과 열이 새고, 그 열이 바깥 기계를 불러 군수 작업반의 강제 동원 명분이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 가짜 도장 원판을 찾아 그의 출고 중지를 뒷받침하거나, 명부에 없는 공방을 끼워 넣은 증거를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −45 | 개방 20 | 무력 −5 | 물질 35 | 공동 35 | 원칙 5 | 공개 40 | 자격 80 | 분산 25 | 변혁 25\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −5 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −10 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"종마루","type":"계약","to":"장우석","basis":"장우석의 수리규격 원장에 불량 목록을 올리고"},{"from":"종마루","type":"계약","to":"류다인","basis":"뚝섬의 류다인과 같은 가짜 부품의 양쪽 끝을 증언한다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"류다인","type":"계약","to":"종마루","basis":"구로의 종마루와 같은 가짜 부품의 양쪽 끝을 증언하고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0051', 'ace0-d55c-c591', '{"id":"person-0051","name":"Go Morae","title":"Restoration Service Refusal Testimony Clerk","position":"Restoration Service Refusal Testimony Clerk","characterId":"K051","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Testimony Records","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#inmul-gomorae","detailRoute":"/people/person-0051","birthDate":"2101-12-06","birthday":"12-06","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k051-refusal-testimony","name":"Refusal-testimony recording","rating":60},{"id":"k051-register-recovery","name":"Life-register recovery","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k051-unsigned-refusal","name":"Unsigned refusal","description":"Withholds signature when family registration has gaps.","behavior":"Withholds signature when family registration has gaps.","stress":"That refusal testimony would turn into a deserters'' list, and that list would become the Amsa officer network''s requisition grounds.","relationship":"Sharing refusal wording with Kim Nayul''s union clerk.","effects":[]},{"id":"k051-no-military-filing","name":"Do not file military registers","description":"Separates refusal testimony from military register forms.","behavior":"Separates refusal testimony from military register forms.","stress":"That refusal testimony would turn into a deserters'' list, and that list would become the Amsa officer network''s requisition grounds.","relationship":"Sharing refusal wording with Kim Nayul''s union clerk.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Joint testimony recording and saving a fire register are confirmed. A voluntary-service charter remains a goal, not an enacted right.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44270-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K051","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44270-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ace0-d55c-c591","name":"Hanyang Go Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ace0-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":0,"Force":-20,"Material":50,"Communal":45,"Principle":5,"Public":25,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":25},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":-25,"Display":-5,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Testimony Records","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Restoration Service Refusal Testimony Clerk","Work Location":"Guro 2-dong. In Guro 2-dong, Go Morae takes down refusal testimonies against Recovery Service registration beside Kim Nayul''s shift roster.","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 0 | Force −20 | Material 50 | Communal 45 | Principle 5 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 40 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 25","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly 40 | Risk −25 | Display −5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union None"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post of Recovery Service refusal testimony clerk opened up as a substitute watch for an unexcused shift absence.\n- Work location: Guro 2-dong. In Guro 2-dong, Go Morae takes down refusal testimonies against Recovery Service registration beside Kim Nayul''s shift roster.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Restoration Service Refusal Testimony Clerk. Records testimony only when the labor union clerk and the civic representative hear it together, and does not file military household register forms even when they are received.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Shares refusal statements with Kim Nayul''s union clerk.","Ambition":"To leave voluntary adult Recovery Service and civil-rights contracts in the union charter, so that separated family registration cannot pass the Guild Council.","Fear":"The fear that a refusal testimony will be turned into a deserter list, and that the list will become the grounds for requisition by the Amsa Officer Network.","Intervention":"Can recover the family register to prove their refusal, or find the person who altered the testimony into a deserter list and replace the clerk."},"biography":"Stops the pen at blanks in family-unit registration rosters, and underlines at length any sentence that turns skill into military status. Never raises a voice, but leaves the signature line blank.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Testimony Records\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Restoration Service Refusal Testimony Clerk\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post of Recovery Service refusal testimony clerk opened up as a substitute watch for an unexcused shift absence.\n- Work location: Guro 2-dong. In Guro 2-dong, Go Morae takes down refusal testimonies against Recovery Service registration beside Kim Nayul''s shift roster.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Records testimony only when the labor union clerk and the civic representative hear it together, and does not file military household register forms even when they are received.\n\n**Relationships.** Shares refusal statements with Kim Nayul''s union clerk.\n\n**Ambition.** To leave voluntary adult Recovery Service and civil-rights contracts in the union charter, so that separated family registration cannot pass the Guild Council.\n\n**Fear.** The fear that a refusal testimony will be turned into a deserter list, and that the list will become the grounds for requisition by the Amsa Officer Network.\n\n**Intervention.** Can recover the family register to prove their refusal, or find the person who altered the testimony into a deserter list and replace the clerk.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 0 | Force −20 | Material 50 | Communal 45 | Principle 5 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 40 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 25\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 40 | Risk −25 | Display −5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Go Morae","type":"Contract","to":"Kim Nayul","basis":"Separates Gim Nayul''s union clerkship from the sentence of refusal, and"},{"from":"Go Morae","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0051","name":"고모래","title":"복구복무 거부 증언 서기","position":"복구복무 거부 증언 서기","characterId":"K051","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"증언 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-고모래","detailRoute":"/people/person-0051","birthDate":"2101-12-06","birthday":"12-06","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k051-refusal-testimony","name":"거부 증언 기록","rating":60},{"id":"k051-register-recovery","name":"인명 장부 회수","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k051-unsigned-refusal","name":"비워 둔 서명","description":"가족 등록 빈칸을 보면 서명하지 않는다.","behavior":"가족 등록 빈칸을 보면 서명하지 않는다.","stress":"거부 증언이 탈주 명단으로 바뀌고, 그 명단이 암사 장교망의 징발 근거가 되는 것.","relationship":"김나율의 조합 서기와 거부 문장을 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k051-no-military-filing","name":"군사호적을 철하지 않는다","description":"거부 증언과 군사용 호적 양식을 구분한다.","behavior":"거부 증언과 군사용 호적 양식을 구분한다.","stress":"거부 증언이 탈주 명단으로 바뀌고, 그 명단이 암사 장교망의 징발 근거가 되는 것.","relationship":"김나율의 조합 서기와 거부 문장을 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"공동 증언 기록과 화재 장부 보호가 확인된다. 자발적 복무 헌장은 목표이며 이미 통과한 권리로 쓰지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44270-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K051","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44270-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ace0-d55c-c591","name":"한양 고씨","crest":"clan-crests/ace0-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":0,"무력":-20,"물질":50,"공동":45,"원칙":5,"공개":25,"자격":40,"분산":20,"변혁":25},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":40,"위험":-25,"과시":-5,"지속":0,"지향":"이성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"증언 기록","품계":"조합원","직함":"복구복무 거부 증언 서기","업무 위치":"구로2동.","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 0 | 무력 −20 | 물질 50 | 공동 45 | 원칙 5 | 공개 25 | 자격 40 | 분산 20 | 변혁 25","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 40 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −5 | 지속 0 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 복구복무 거부 증언 서기 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로2동.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 복구복무 거부 증언 서기. 증언은 노동조합 서기와 시민대표가 함께 들을 때만 기록하고, 군사용 호적 양식은 받아도 철하지 않는다.","일화":"","관계":"김나율의 조합 서기와 거부 문장을 나눈다.","야망":"자발적 성인 복구복무와 시민권 계약을 조합 헌장에 남겨, 가족 분리 등록이 길드 평의회를 통과하지 못하게 한다.","공포":"거부 증언이 탈주 명단으로 바뀌고, 그 명단이 암사 장교망의 징발 근거가 되는 것.","개입":"가족 명부를 되찾아 그의 거부를 증명하거나, 증언을 탈주 명단으로 고친 자를 찾아 서기를 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"가족 단위 등록 명부의 빈칸을 보면 펜을 멈추고, 숙련을 병적으로 바꾸는 문장을 오래 밑줄 친다. 큰소리는 내지 않되 서명란은 비워 둔다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 증언 기록\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 복구복무 거부 증언 서기\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 복구복무 거부 증언 서기 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로2동.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 복구복무 거부 증언 서기. 증언은 노동조합 서기와 시민대표가 함께 들을 때만 기록하고, 군사용 호적 양식은 받아도 철하지 않는다.\n\n**관계.** 김나율의 조합 서기와 거부 문장을 나눈다.\n\n**야망.** 자발적 성인 복구복무와 시민권 계약을 조합 헌장에 남겨, 가족 분리 등록이 길드 평의회를 통과하지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 거부 증언이 탈주 명단으로 바뀌고, 그 명단이 암사 장교망의 징발 근거가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 가족 명부를 되찾아 그의 거부를 증명하거나, 증언을 탈주 명단으로 고친 자를 찾아 서기를 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 0 | 무력 −20 | 물질 50 | 공동 45 | 원칙 5 | 공개 25 | 자격 40 | 분산 20 | 변혁 25\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 40 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −5 | 지속 0 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"고모래","type":"계약","to":"김나율","basis":"김나율의 조합 서기와 거부 문장을 나누고"},{"from":"고모래","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0052', 'bc30-bd84-c131-88f5', '{"id":"person-0052","name":"Bae Ongyeol","title":"Merit Reward Ledger Clerk","position":"Merit Reward Ledger Clerk","characterId":"K052","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Reward Ledger Records","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#inmul-baeongyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0052","birthDate":"2071-01-08","birthday":"01-08","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k052-reward-ledger","name":"Reward-ledger recording","rating":60},{"id":"k052-witness-confrontation","name":"Witness confrontation","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k052-temporary-reward","name":"Temporary rewards","description":"Does not enter hereditary offices as rewards in the main text.","behavior":"Does not enter hereditary offices as rewards in the main text.","stress":"That excessive hereditary rights would split the council, and the guards would fill that gap with a munitions dictatorship.","relationship":"Separating Jeong Siwoo''s elder authority from compensation, matching ration columns with Jang Wooseok''s standards ledger, and consulting Han Somi''s workshop compensation demands while refusing heredity.","effects":[]},{"id":"k052-three-party-seal","name":"Three-party seal","description":"Requires labor, building, and guard seals together.","behavior":"Requires labor, building, and guard seals together.","stress":"That excessive hereditary rights would split the council, and the guards would fill that gap with a munitions dictatorship.","relationship":"Separating Jeong Siwoo''s elder authority from compensation, matching ration columns with Jang Wooseok''s standards ledger, and consulting Han Somi''s workshop compensation demands while refusing heredity.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Separate merit and material records and witness confrontation support the profile. Distinguishing elder powers from rewards does not establish completed abolition of heredity.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41270-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K052","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc30-bd84-c131-88f5","name":"Bunseong Bae Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc30-bd84-c131-88f5.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":15,"Force":-5,"Material":45,"Communal":30,"Principle":35,"Public":40,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-25,"Risk":-30,"Display":-15,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Reward Ledger Records","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Merit Reward Ledger Clerk","Work Location":"Guro 5-dong. In the Guro 5-dong council, Bae Ongyeol collates the reward ledger jointly sealed by the labor, building, and guard representatives. Without moving Jeong Siu''s measurement authority into the reward column, Bae Ongyeol receives Han Somi''s workshop demand and then hands the result, matched against Jang Useok''s ration records, to the next clerk.","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 15 | Force −5 | Material 45 | Communal 30 | Principle 35 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 45 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 20","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly −25 | Risk −30 | Display −15 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union Monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post of Meritorious Service Reward Ledger Clerk opened up as a substitute watch for an unexcused shift absence.\n- Work location: Guro 5-dong. In the Guro 5-dong council, Bae Ongyeol collates the reward ledger jointly sealed by the labor, building, and guard representatives. Without moving Jeong Siu''s measurement authority into the reward column, Bae Ongyeol receives Han Somi''s workshop demand and then hands the result, matched against Jang Useok''s ration records, to the next clerk.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Merit Reward Ledger Clerk. The reward ledger is valid only when the labor, building, and guard parties seal it simultaneously, and hereditary wording is written only in the margin and never entered in the main text.","Anecdote":"In 2125, when two witnesses'' accounts diverged, Bae Ongyeol opened a public confrontation. Because of this, the signature for the post of Meritorious Service Reward Ledger Clerk was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Separates Jeong Siu''s elder authority from rewards, matches Jang Useok''s standards ledger against the ration columns, and consults Han Somi''s workshop reward demand while refusing heredity.","Ambition":"Even for those who did great service, leaves only a season''s share of food and fuel rather than an office, so that Free City work does not become a hereditary seat for a few.","Fear":"The fear that excessive hereditary rights will split the Guild Council, and that the Guard Corps will fill the resulting vacuum with a quartermaster dictatorship.","Intervention":"Can bring in the skill-point ledger and push through the time-limited ration proposal, or expose the hidden hereditary marginal note and bring down the ledger clerk."},"biography":"Writes down the ration claims made right after the founding, separating them into merit and supplies, and strikes through any hereditary column that is left blank. Does not treat the reward feast as the end of the work.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Reward Ledger Records\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Merit Reward Ledger Clerk\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post of Meritorious Service Reward Ledger Clerk opened up as a substitute watch for an unexcused shift absence.\n- Work location: Guro 5-dong. In the Guro 5-dong council, Bae Ongyeol collates the reward ledger jointly sealed by the labor, building, and guard representatives. Without moving Jeong Siu''s measurement authority into the reward column, Bae Ongyeol receives Han Somi''s workshop demand and then hands the result, matched against Jang Useok''s ration records, to the next clerk.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Merit Reward Ledger Clerk. The reward ledger is valid only when the labor, building, and guard parties seal it simultaneously, and hereditary wording is written only in the margin and never entered in the main text.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, when two witnesses'' accounts diverged, Bae Ongyeol opened a public confrontation. Because of this, the signature for the post of Meritorious Service Reward Ledger Clerk was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Separates Jeong Siu''s elder authority from rewards, matches Jang Useok''s standards ledger against the ration columns, and consults Han Somi''s workshop reward demand while refusing heredity.\n\n**Ambition.** Even for those who did great service, leaves only a season''s share of food and fuel rather than an office, so that Free City work does not become a hereditary seat for a few.\n\n**Fear.** The fear that excessive hereditary rights will split the Guild Council, and that the Guard Corps will fill the resulting vacuum with a quartermaster dictatorship.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in the skill-point ledger and push through the time-limited ration proposal, or expose the hidden hereditary marginal note and bring down the ledger clerk.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 15 | Force −5 | Materialism 45 | Communal 30 | Principle 35 | Transparency 40 | Credentials 45 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Longing 30 | Possessiveness −25 | Risk −30 | Display −15 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bae Ongyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Siu","basis":"Separates Jeong Siu''s elder authority from compensation, and"},{"from":"Bae Ongyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Useok","basis":"aligns Jang Useok''s standards ledger with the rationing columns,"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0052","name":"배온결","title":"공신 보상 원장 서기","position":"공신 보상 원장 서기","characterId":"K052","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"보상 원장 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-배온결","detailRoute":"/people/person-0052","birthDate":"2071-01-08","birthday":"01-08","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k052-reward-ledger","name":"보상 원장 기록","rating":60},{"id":"k052-witness-confrontation","name":"증언 대질","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k052-temporary-reward","name":"한시 보상","description":"보상을 세습 관직으로 본문에 올리지 않는다.","behavior":"보상을 세습 관직으로 본문에 올리지 않는다.","stress":"과도한 세습권이 길드 평의회를 쪼개고, 그 공백을 경비대가 군수독재로 메우는 것.","relationship":"정시우의 원로 권한을 보상과 분리하고, 장우석의 규격 원장과 배급 칸을 맞추며, 한소미의 공방 보상 요구를 참고하되 세습은 거절한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k052-three-party-seal","name":"삼자의 날인","description":"노동·건물·경비의 동시 날인을 요구한다.","behavior":"노동·건물·경비의 동시 날인을 요구한다.","stress":"과도한 세습권이 길드 평의회를 쪼개고, 그 공백을 경비대가 군수독재로 메우는 것.","relationship":"정시우의 원로 권한을 보상과 분리하고, 장우석의 규격 원장과 배급 칸을 맞추며, 한소미의 공방 보상 요구를 참고하되 세습은 거절한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"공로·물자 분리 기록과 대질이 근거다. 원로 권한과 보상을 나누지만 세습 폐지 완료를 주장하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41270-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K052","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc30-bd84-c131-88f5","name":"분성 배씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc30-bd84-c131-88f5.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":15,"무력":-5,"물질":45,"공동":30,"원칙":35,"공개":40,"자격":45,"분산":20,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-25,"위험":-30,"과시":-15,"지속":35,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"보상 원장 기록","품계":"조합원","직함":"공신 보상 원장 서기","업무 위치":"구로5동. 배온결은 구로5동 평의회에서 노동·건물·경비 대표가 함께 날인한 보상 원장을 대조한다. 정시우의 계측 권한을 보상 칸에 옮기지 않고 한소미의 공방 요구를 접수한 뒤 장우석의 배급 기록과 맞춘 결과를 다음 서기에게 넘긴다.","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 15 | 무력 −5 | 물질 45 | 공동 30 | 원칙 35 | 공개 40 | 자격 45 | 분산 20 | 변혁 20","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −25 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −15 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 공신 보상 원장 서기 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로5동. 배온결은 구로5동 평의회에서 노동·건물·경비 대표가 함께 날인한 보상 원장을 대조한다. 정시우의 계측 권한을 보상 칸에 옮기지 않고 한소미의 공방 요구를 접수한 뒤 장우석의 배급 기록과 맞춘 결과를 다음 서기에게 넘긴다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 공신 보상 원장 서기. 보상 원장은 노동·건물·경비 삼자가 동시에 날인해야 유효하고, 세습 문구는 난외에만 적힌 채 본문에 올리지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 증인 두 명의 말이 갈라지자 공개 대질을 열었다. 이 일로 공신 보상 원장 서기 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"정시우의 원로 권한을 보상과 분리하고, 장우석의 규격 원장과 배급 칸을 맞추며, 한소미의 공방 보상 요구를 참고하되 세습은 거절한다.","야망":"큰 공을 세운 사람에게도 직책이 아니라 한 철치 식량과 연료 몫만 남겨, 자유도시의 일이 몇몇 사람의 세습 자리가 되지 않게 한다.","공포":"과도한 세습권이 길드 평의회를 쪼개고, 그 공백을 경비대가 군수독재로 메우는 것.","개입":"숙련 점수 장부를 가져와 한시 배급안을 통과시키거나, 숨겨진 세습 난외를 폭로해 원장 서기를 끌어내릴 수 있다."},"biography":"창건 직후의 배급권 요구를 공로와 물자로 나눠 적고, 세습 칸이 비어 있으면 줄을 그어 지운다. 보상 잔치를 일의 끝으로 보지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 보상 원장 기록\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 공신 보상 원장 서기\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 공신 보상 원장 서기 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로5동. 배온결은 구로5동 평의회에서 노동·건물·경비 대표가 함께 날인한 보상 원장을 대조한다. 정시우의 계측 권한을 보상 칸에 옮기지 않고 한소미의 공방 요구를 접수한 뒤 장우석의 배급 기록과 맞춘 결과를 다음 서기에게 넘긴다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 공신 보상 원장 서기. 보상 원장은 노동·건물·경비 삼자가 동시에 날인해야 유효하고, 세습 문구는 난외에만 적힌 채 본문에 올리지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 증인 두 명의 말이 갈라지자 공개 대질을 열었다. 이 일로 공신 보상 원장 서기 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 정시우의 원로 권한을 보상과 분리하고, 장우석의 규격 원장과 배급 칸을 맞추며, 한소미의 공방 보상 요구를 참고하되 세습은 거절한다.\n\n**야망.** 큰 공을 세운 사람에게도 직책이 아니라 한 철치 식량과 연료 몫만 남겨, 자유도시의 일이 몇몇 사람의 세습 자리가 되지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 과도한 세습권이 길드 평의회를 쪼개고, 그 공백을 경비대가 군수독재로 메우는 것.\n\n**개입.** 숙련 점수 장부를 가져와 한시 배급안을 통과시키거나, 숨겨진 세습 난외를 폭로해 원장 서기를 끌어내릴 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 15 | 무력 −5 | 물질 45 | 공동 30 | 원칙 35 | 공개 40 | 자격 45 | 분산 20 | 변혁 20\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −25 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −15 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"배온결","type":"계약","to":"정시우","basis":"정시우의 원로 권한을 보상과 분리하고"},{"from":"배온결","type":"계약","to":"장우석","basis":"장우석의 규격 원장과 배급 칸을 맞추며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0053', 'b958-bb38-d654-67f3', '{"id":"person-0053","name":"Ryu Gyeore","title":"Refugee Reception Messenger","position":"Refugee Reception Messenger","characterId":"K053","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Reception Document Delivery","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#inmul-ryugyeore","detailRoute":"/people/person-0053","birthDate":"2099-03-16","birthday":"03-16","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k053-refugee-message","name":"Refugee admission messages","rating":60},{"id":"k053-register-salvage","name":"Attack register salvage","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k053-children-before-cargo","name":"Children’s rations before parts","description":"Rejects exchanging admissions for parts payments.","behavior":"Rejects exchanging admissions for parts payments.","stress":"That people who do not return from the tunnel freeze to death, and the news of kidnapped family survives only as rumor.","relationship":"Gathers food from the Doksan 1-dong market shops for the lodging, and turns news from the tunnel patrol watch into bed assignments.","effects":[]},{"id":"k053-joint-admission","name":"Joint admission notes","description":"Does not carry guard-only passes.","behavior":"Does not carry guard-only passes.","stress":"That people who do not return from the tunnel freeze to death, and the news of kidnapped family survives only as rumor.","relationship":"Gathers food from the Doksan 1-dong market shops for the lodging, and turns news from the tunnel patrol watch into bed assignments.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Issues joint admission notices, convoy connections, and record protection during attack. Complete refugee admission success and armed escort victories are unconfirmed.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44710-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K053","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44710-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b958-bb38-d654-67f3","name":"Munhwa Ryu Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b958-bb38-d654-67f3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-50,"Openness":35,"Force":-15,"Material":35,"Communal":60,"Principle":20,"Public":35,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-30,"Display":-15,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Reception Document Delivery","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Refugee Reception Messenger","Work Location":"Doksan 1-dong. At the Doksan 1-dong winter lodging window, Ryu Gyeore cross-checks the names of people who crossed the tunnel with the market''s food shares. She takes slips from those looking for family and passes them to the tunnel patrol watch.","Values":"Authority −50 | Openness 35 | Force −15 | Materialism 35 | Communal 60 | Principle 20 | Transparency 35 | Credentials 45 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Longing 45 | Possessiveness 10 | Risk −30 | Display −15 | Persistence 40 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 cohort. Grew up on watch duty at the Sinnae transfer station. The post of Refugee Intake Courier opened up when she stopped a ticketless departure train.\n- Workplace: Doksan 1-dong. At the Doksan 1-dong winter lodging window, Ryu Gyeore cross-checks the names of people who crossed the tunnel with the market''s food shares. She takes slips from those looking for family and passes them to the tunnel patrol watch.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Refugee Reception Messenger. An intake slip is valid only when the citizen representatives and the labor union stamp it together, and a Guard Corps-only pass is never put in the courier''s bag.","Anecdote":"In 2125, caught in a raid during a convoy, she secured the ledger of people before the cargo. As a result, the signature of the Refugee Intake Courier post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Gathers food from the Doksan 1-dong market shops for the lodging, hands the names of people who crossed the tunnel to the patrol watch, and carries slips from those seeking family across the tunnel.","Ambition":"Opens a night''s bed and a hot morning soup for people who crossed the tunnel through a duty lottery, so that receiving strangers does not harden into the burden of a few.","Fear":"That people who do not return from the tunnel freeze to death, and that the news of kidnapped family survives only as rumor.","Intervention":"Can secure a night''s food and a handful of fuel to open a bed for an arrival, or expose whoever sold news of a kidnapping for a price and cut off that route."},"biography":"Counts the children''s ration tins before the footprints of the intake procession inside Seoul, and hears the proposal to trade intake for payment for parts as an insult. Keeps routes short and conveys refusals clearly.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Occupation: Reception Document Delivery\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Refugee Reception Messenger\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 cohort. Grew up on watch duty at the Sinnae transfer station. The post of Refugee Intake Courier opened up when she stopped a ticketless departure train.\n- Workplace: Doksan 1-dong. At the Doksan 1-dong winter lodging window, Ryu Gyeore cross-checks the names of people who crossed the tunnel with the market''s food shares. She takes slips from those looking for family and passes them to the tunnel patrol watch.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Refugee Reception Messenger. An intake slip is valid only when the citizen representatives and the labor union stamp it together, and a Guard Corps-only pass is never put in the courier''s bag.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, caught in a raid during a convoy, she secured the ledger of people before the cargo. As a result, the signature of the Refugee Intake Courier post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Gathers food from the Doksan 1-dong market shops for the lodging, hands the names of people who crossed the tunnel to the patrol watch, and carries slips from those seeking family across the tunnel.\n\n**Ambition.** Opens a night''s bed and a hot morning soup for people who crossed the tunnel through a duty lottery, so that receiving strangers does not harden into the burden of a few.\n\n**Fear.** That people who do not return from the tunnel freeze to death, and that the news of kidnapped family survives only as rumor.\n\n**Intervention.** Can secure a night''s food and a handful of fuel to open a bed for an arrival, or expose whoever sold news of a kidnapping for a price and cut off that route.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −50 | Openness 35 | Force −15 | Materialism 35 | Communal 60 | Principle 20 | Transparency 35 | Credentials 45 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Longing 45 | Possessiveness 10 | Risk −30 | Display −15 | Persistence 40 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ryu Gyeore","type":"Contract","to":"Han Jion","basis":"Connects Han Jion''s food distribution and refugee roll to the winter lodging beds, and"},{"from":"Ryu Gyeore","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":"meets Baek On''s southward march from the Geumcheon side"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0053","name":"류겨레","title":"난민 수용 전령","position":"난민 수용 전령","characterId":"K053","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"수용 문서 전달","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-류겨레","detailRoute":"/people/person-0053","birthDate":"2099-03-16","birthday":"03-16","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k053-refugee-message","name":"난민 수용 전갈","rating":60},{"id":"k053-register-salvage","name":"습격 장부 회수","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k053-children-before-cargo","name":"부품보다 아이 배급","description":"수용을 부품 대금과 바꾸자는 제안을 거절한다.","behavior":"수용을 부품 대금과 바꾸자는 제안을 거절한다.","stress":"터널에서 돌아오지 못한 사람이 얼어 죽고, 납치된 가족의 소식이 소문으로만 남는 것.","relationship":"독산1동 시장 가게들에서 식량을 모아 숙소에 잇고, 터널 순찰 당번이 전하는 소식을 잠자리 안내로 옮긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k053-joint-admission","name":"공동 수용 쪽지","description":"경비대 단독 통행증을 가방에 넣지 않는다.","behavior":"경비대 단독 통행증을 가방에 넣지 않는다.","stress":"터널에서 돌아오지 못한 사람이 얼어 죽고, 납치된 가족의 소식이 소문으로만 남는 것.","relationship":"독산1동 시장 가게들에서 식량을 모아 숙소에 잇고, 터널 순찰 당번이 전하는 소식을 잠자리 안내로 옮긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"공동 수용 쪽지와 행렬 연결, 습격 중 장부 보호를 발급했다. 피난민 전체의 수용 성공이나 무장 호위 승리는 확인되지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44710-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K053","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44710-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b958-bb38-d654-67f3","name":"문화 류씨","crest":"clan-crests/b958-bb38-d654-67f3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-50,"개방":35,"무력":-15,"물질":35,"공동":60,"원칙":20,"공개":35,"자격":45,"분산":10,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":10,"위험":-30,"과시":-15,"지속":40,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"수용 문서 전달","품계":"조합원","직함":"난민 수용 전령","업무 위치":"독산1동. 류겨레는 독산1동 겨울 숙소 창구에서 터널을 건너온 사람들의 이름과 시장 식량 몫을 대조한다. 가족을 찾는 쪽지를 받아 터널 순찰 당번에게 전한다.","가치관":"권위 −50 | 개방 35 | 무력 −15 | 물질 35 | 공동 60 | 원칙 20 | 공개 35 | 자격 45 | 분산 10 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −15 | 지속 40 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 난민 수용 전령 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 독산1동. 류겨레는 독산1동 겨울 숙소 창구에서 터널을 건너온 사람들의 이름과 시장 식량 몫을 대조한다. 가족을 찾는 쪽지를 받아 터널 순찰 당번에게 전한다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 난민 수용 전령. 수용 쪽지는 시민대표와 노동조합이 함께 찍어야 유효하고, 경비대 단독 통행증은 전령 가방에 넣지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 호송 도중 습격을 만나 화물보다 인명 장부부터 챙겼다. 이 일로 난민 수용 전령 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"독산1동 시장 가게들에서 식량을 모아 숙소에 잇고, 터널을 건너온 사람들의 이름을 순찰 당번에게 넘기며, 가족을 찾는 쪽지를 터널 너머로 실어 나른다.","야망":"터널을 건너온 사람들의 하룻밤 잠자리와 아침 더운 국을 당번 추첨으로 열어, 낯선 이를 받는 일이 몇몇 사람의 몫으로 굳지 않게 한다.","공포":"터널에서 돌아오지 못한 사람이 얼어 죽고, 납치된 가족의 소식이 소문으로만 남는 것.","개입":"하룻밤 식량과 연료 한 줌을 구해 건너온 이의 잠자리를 열거나, 납치 소식을 값에 팔아넘긴 자를 밝혀 그 길을 끊을 수 있다."},"biography":"서울 안 수용 행렬의 발자국 수보다 아이 배급통을 먼저 세고, 수용을 부품 대금과 바꾸자는 제안을 모욕으로 듣는다. 경로는 짧게, 거절은 분명하게 전한다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 수용 문서 전달\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 난민 수용 전령\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 난민 수용 전령 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 독산1동. 류겨레는 독산1동 겨울 숙소 창구에서 터널을 건너온 사람들의 이름과 시장 식량 몫을 대조한다. 가족을 찾는 쪽지를 받아 터널 순찰 당번에게 전한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 난민 수용 전령. 수용 쪽지는 시민대표와 노동조합이 함께 찍어야 유효하고, 경비대 단독 통행증은 전령 가방에 넣지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 호송 도중 습격을 만나 화물보다 인명 장부부터 챙겼다. 이 일로 난민 수용 전령 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 독산1동 시장 가게들에서 식량을 모아 숙소에 잇고, 터널을 건너온 사람들의 이름을 순찰 당번에게 넘기며, 가족을 찾는 쪽지를 터널 너머로 실어 나른다.\n\n**야망.** 터널을 건너온 사람들의 하룻밤 잠자리와 아침 더운 국을 당번 추첨으로 열어, 낯선 이를 받는 일이 몇몇 사람의 몫으로 굳지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 터널에서 돌아오지 못한 사람이 얼어 죽고, 납치된 가족의 소식이 소문으로만 남는 것.\n\n**개입.** 하룻밤 식량과 연료 한 줌을 구해 건너온 이의 잠자리를 열거나, 납치 소식을 값에 팔아넘긴 자를 밝혀 그 길을 끊을 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −50 | 개방 35 | 무력 −15 | 물질 35 | 공동 60 | 원칙 20 | 공개 35 | 자격 45 | 분산 10 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −15 | 지속 40 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"류겨레","type":"계약","to":"한지온","basis":"한지온의 식량 배분과 피난민 명부를 겨울 숙소 잠자리에 연결하고"},{"from":"류겨레","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":"백온의 남하를 금천 쪽에서 맞으며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0054', 'c5c4-c601-c6d4', '{"id":"person-0054","name":"Eom Nuri","title":"Succession Trial Parts Appraisal Artisan","position":"Succession Trial Parts Appraisal Artisan","characterId":"K054","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Parts Appraisal","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#inmul-eomnuri","detailRoute":"/people/person-0054","birthDate":"2100-05-11","birthday":"05-11","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k054-wheel-crack-inspection","name":"Wheel-crack inspection","rating":65},{"id":"k054-defect-rejection","name":"Defect rejection","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k054-paired-assessment","name":"Paired assessment","description":"Maintains cross-assessment by two workers.","behavior":"Maintains cross-assessment by two workers.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k054-reject-night-approval","name":"Reject night approval","description":"Rejects lone night dispatch and whispered night approval.","behavior":"Rejects lone night dispatch and whispered night approval.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Succession Trial Parts Appraisal Artisan.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44760-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K054","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44760-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5c4-c601-c6d4","name":"Yeongwol Eom Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c5c4-c601-c6d4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":15,"Force":-10,"Material":55,"Communal":40,"Principle":10,"Public":35,"Eligibility":65,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":30},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-30,"Display":-30,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Parts Appraisal","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Succession Trial Parts Appraisal Artisan","Work Location":"Oryu 2-dong. At Cheonwang Depot in Oryu 2-dong, Eom Nuri measures the crack locations recorded in Heo Daon''s wheel log. ","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 15 | Force −10 | Material 55 | Communal 40 | Principle 10 | Transparency 35 | Qualification 65 | Dispersion 15 | Transformation 30","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness 10 | Risk −30 | Display −30 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at Sinjeong Depot. The post of Succession Trial Parts Appraisal Artisan opened after he reported a defect just before a derailment.\n- Workplace: Oryu 2-dong. At Cheonwang Depot in Oryu 2-dong, Eom Nuri measures the crack locations recorded in Heo Daon''s wheel log. ","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Succession Trial Parts Appraisal Artisan. Appraisals are done crosswise by two artisans, and he refuses solo night shipments even when requested by the siding supervisor.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"You can escort the cracked part to Changdong to confirm his appraisal, or find whoever forged the night shipment log and isolate the artisan."},"biography":"He stays silent, but leaves defective parts on the workbench.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Parts Appraisal\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Succession Trial Parts Appraisal Artisan\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at Sinjeong Depot. The post of Succession Trial Parts Appraisal Artisan opened after he reported a defect just before a derailment.\n- Workplace: Oryu 2-dong. At Cheonwang Depot in Oryu 2-dong, Eom Nuri measures the crack locations recorded in Heo Daon''s wheel log. \n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Succession Trial Parts Appraisal Artisan. Appraisals are done crosswise by two artisans, and he refuses solo night shipments even when requested by the siding supervisor.\n\n**Intervention.** You can escort the cracked part to Changdong to confirm his appraisal, or find whoever forged the night shipment log and isolate the artisan.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 15 | Force −10 | Material 55 | Communal 40 | Principle 10 | Transparency 35 | Qualification 65 | Dispersion 15 | Transformation 30\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness 10 | Risk −30 | Display −30 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Eom Nuri","type":"Contract","to":"Heo Daon","basis":"Transfers the cracks into Heo Daon''s wheel maintenance log,"},{"from":"Eom Nuri","type":"Contract","to":"Yi Hong-won","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0054","name":"엄누리","title":"후계시험 부품 감정 직공","position":"후계시험 부품 감정 직공","characterId":"K054","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"부품 감정","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-엄누리","detailRoute":"/people/person-0054","birthDate":"2100-05-11","birthday":"05-11","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k054-wheel-crack-inspection","name":"차륜 균열 확인","rating":65},{"id":"k054-defect-rejection","name":"불량품 반환","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k054-paired-assessment","name":"둘이 하는 감정","description":"두 직공의 교차 감정을 고수한다.","behavior":"두 직공의 교차 감정을 고수한다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k054-reject-night-approval","name":"밤의 합격 거절","description":"단독 야간 출고와 밤 합격 도장 요구를 거절한다.","behavior":"단독 야간 출고와 밤 합격 도장 요구를 거절한다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 후계시험 부품 감정 직공.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44760-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K054","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44760-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5c4-c601-c6d4","name":"영월 엄씨","crest":"clan-crests/c5c4-c601-c6d4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":15,"무력":-10,"물질":55,"공동":40,"원칙":10,"공개":35,"자격":65,"분산":15,"변혁":30},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":10,"위험":-30,"과시":-30,"지속":20,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"부품 감정","품계":"조합원","직함":"후계시험 부품 감정 직공","업무 위치":"오류2동. 엄누리는 오류2동 천왕기지에서 허다온의 차륜 일지에 적힌 균열 부위를 실측한다. ","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 15 | 무력 −10 | 물질 55 | 공동 40 | 원칙 10 | 공개 35 | 자격 65 | 분산 15 | 변혁 30","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −30 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 후계시험 부품 감정 직공 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 오류2동. 엄누리는 오류2동 천왕기지에서 허다온의 차륜 일지에 적힌 균열 부위를 실측한다. ","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 후계시험 부품 감정 직공. 감정은 두 직공이 교차로 하고, 야간 단독 출고는 유치선 감독의 요청이어도 거부한다.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"균열 부품을 창동까지 호송해 그의 감정을 확정하거나, 야간 출고 일지를 위조한 자를 찾아 직공을 고립시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"침묵하되 불량품은 작업대 위에 남겨 둔다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 부품 감정\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 후계시험 부품 감정 직공\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 후계시험 부품 감정 직공 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 오류2동. 엄누리는 오류2동 천왕기지에서 허다온의 차륜 일지에 적힌 균열 부위를 실측한다. \n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 후계시험 부품 감정 직공. 감정은 두 직공이 교차로 하고, 야간 단독 출고는 유치선 감독의 요청이어도 거부한다.\n\n**개입.** 균열 부품을 창동까지 호송해 그의 감정을 확정하거나, 야간 출고 일지를 위조한 자를 찾아 직공을 고립시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 15 | 무력 −10 | 물질 55 | 공동 40 | 원칙 10 | 공개 35 | 자격 65 | 분산 15 | 변혁 30\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −30 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"엄누리","type":"계약","to":"허다온","basis":"허다온의 차륜 정비 일지에 균열을 옮기고"},{"from":"엄누리","type":"계약","to":"이홍원","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0055', 'c5ec-d568-c591', '{"id":"person-0055","name":"Yeo Sion","title":"Crafting Charter Messenger","position":"Crafting Charter Messenger","characterId":"K055","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Charter Copy Delivery","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#person-yeosion","detailRoute":"/people/person-0055","birthDate":"2079-06-17","birthday":"06-17","age":47,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k055-charter-delivery","name":"Charter-copy delivery","rating":60},{"id":"k055-snow-passage-clearing","name":"Snow-blocked passage clearing","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k055-three-copies","name":"Three copies","description":"Does not start delivery with only one copy.","behavior":"Does not start delivery with only one copy.","stress":"That the charter copies would be withdrawn with ratification as bait, and the council would fall to Seoul Station politics'' subordinate work squad.","relationship":"Splitting routes with Pyo Gangho''s standards courier line, pasting Gang Minseo''s Fabrication Council declaration in the Guro alleys, and taking Yun Seorin''s ratification demands only after posting.","effects":[]},{"id":"k055-practice-before-declaration","name":"Declarations matching practice","description":"Delays delivery when declarations contradict workshop rules.","behavior":"Delays delivery when declarations contradict workshop rules.","stress":"That the charter copies would be withdrawn with ratification as bait, and the council would fall to Seoul Station politics'' subordinate work squad.","relationship":"Splitting routes with Pyo Gangho''s standards courier line, pasting Gang Minseo''s Fabrication Council declaration in the Guro alleys, and taking Yun Seorin''s ratification demands only after posting.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Cleared a snow-blocked passage to move injured people first and delivered charter copies. Distinguishes the goal of publication before ratification from performed deliveries.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44770-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K055","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44770-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5ec-d568-c591","name":"Hamyang Yeo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c5ec-d568-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":20,"Force":-10,"Material":35,"Communal":35,"Principle":10,"Public":55,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":10,"Display":-5,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Charter Copy Delivery","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Crafting Charter Messenger","Work Location":"Guro 5-dong. Yeo Sion first checks the seals and dates on the three copies of the Fabrication Charter to be posted in the alleys of Guro 5-dong. She splits the route with Pyo Gangho''s standards courier road and posts Gang Minseo''s council declaration, and only then hands the copy of the ratification demand to Yun Seorin.","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 20 | Force −10 | Material 35 | Communal 35 | Principle 10 | Transparency 55 | Qualification 45 | Dispersion 25 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness −40 | Risk 10 | Display −5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Same-sex | Union None"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up on duty at the Sinnae transfer station. The post of Fabrication Charter Herald opened after she stopped a ticketless departing train.\n- Workplace: Guro 5-dong. Yeo Sion first checks the seals and dates on the three copies of the Fabrication Charter to be posted in the alleys of Guro 5-dong. She splits the route with Pyo Gangho''s standards courier road and posts Gang Minseo''s council declaration, and only then hands the copy of the ratification demand to Yun Seorin.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Crafting Charter Messenger. The Labor Union, the Building Union, and the Guard Corps each receive one copy, and a delivery with only one copy left does not depart.","Anecdote":"In 2125 she cleared a transfer passage blocked by heavy snow and moved the injured first. Because of this, her signature for the post of Fabrication Charter Herald was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"She splits routes with Pyo Gangho''s standards courier road, posts Gang Minseo''s Guild Council declaration in the Guro alleys, and accepts Yun Seorin''s ratification demand only after posting.","Ambition":"She will post the repair standards and restoration-labor citizenship of the independent charter on the union bulletin boards before Records Office ratification, so that the debt of legitimacy cannot swallow the rules of production.","Fear":"That the charter copies will be recalled with ratification as bait, and the Guild Council will fall to being a subordinate work crew of Seoul Station politics.","Intervention":"You can recover the recalled copy and finish the posting, or reveal that the wording on the three copies differs and have the herald replaced."},"biography":"She trusts the charter copies over flags, and if the wording of a declaration conflicts with workshop rules, she delays delivery by a day. She makes her route public and does not hide the order of items in her bag.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Charter Copy Delivery\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Crafting Charter Messenger\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up on duty at the Sinnae transfer station. The post of Fabrication Charter Herald opened after she stopped a ticketless departing train.\n- Workplace: Guro 5-dong. Yeo Sion first checks the seals and dates on the three copies of the Fabrication Charter to be posted in the alleys of Guro 5-dong. She splits the route with Pyo Gangho''s standards courier road and posts Gang Minseo''s council declaration, and only then hands the copy of the ratification demand to Yun Seorin.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Crafting Charter Messenger. The Labor Union, the Building Union, and the Guard Corps each receive one copy, and a delivery with only one copy left does not depart.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 she cleared a transfer passage blocked by heavy snow and moved the injured first. Because of this, her signature for the post of Fabrication Charter Herald was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** She splits routes with Pyo Gangho''s standards courier road, posts Gang Minseo''s Guild Council declaration in the Guro alleys, and accepts Yun Seorin''s ratification demand only after posting.\n\n**Ambition.** She will post the repair standards and restoration-labor citizenship of the independent charter on the union bulletin boards before Records Office ratification, so that the debt of legitimacy cannot swallow the rules of production.\n\n**Fear.** That the charter copies will be recalled with ratification as bait, and the Guild Council will fall to being a subordinate work crew of Seoul Station politics.\n\n**Intervention.** You can recover the recalled copy and finish the posting, or reveal that the wording on the three copies differs and have the herald replaced.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 20 | Force −10 | Material 35 | Communal 35 | Principle 10 | Transparency 55 | Qualification 45 | Dispersion 25 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Possessiveness −40 | Risk 10 | Display −5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Same-sex | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yeo Sion","type":"Contract","to":"Pyo Gangho","basis":"Dividing routes with Pyo Gangho''s standards courier road, and"},{"from":"Yeo Sion","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Minseo","basis":"Posting Gang Minseo''s Workshop Production Guild council declaration in the Guro alleys"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0055","name":"여시온","title":"제작헌장 전령","position":"제작헌장 전령","characterId":"K055","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"헌장 사본 전달","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-여시온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0055","birthDate":"2079-06-17","birthday":"06-17","age":47,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k055-charter-delivery","name":"헌장 사본 전달","rating":60},{"id":"k055-snow-passage-clearing","name":"폭설 통로 개방","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k055-three-copies","name":"세 장의 사본","description":"한 장만 남은 전달은 출발하지 않는다.","behavior":"한 장만 남은 전달은 출발하지 않는다.","stress":"인준을 미끼로 헌장 사본이 회수되고, 길드 평의회가 서울역 정치의 하위 작업반으로 떨어지는 것.","relationship":"표강호의 규격 전령로와 경로를 나누고, 강민서의 길드 평의회 선언을 구로 골목에 붙이며, 윤서린의 인준 요구를 게시 이후에만 받는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k055-practice-before-declaration","name":"규칙과 맞는 선언","description":"선언이 작업장 규칙과 다르면 전달을 미룬다.","behavior":"선언이 작업장 규칙과 다르면 전달을 미룬다.","stress":"인준을 미끼로 헌장 사본이 회수되고, 길드 평의회가 서울역 정치의 하위 작업반으로 떨어지는 것.","relationship":"표강호의 규격 전령로와 경로를 나누고, 강민서의 길드 평의회 선언을 구로 골목에 붙이며, 윤서린의 인준 요구를 게시 이후에만 받는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"폭설 통로를 뚫어 부상자를 먼저 옮기고 헌장 사본을 배달했다. 인준 전 게시의 목표와 실제 전달을 구분했다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44770-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K055","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44770-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5ec-d568-c591","name":"함양 여씨","crest":"clan-crests/c5ec-d568-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":20,"무력":-10,"물질":35,"공동":35,"원칙":10,"공개":55,"자격":45,"분산":25,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-40,"위험":10,"과시":-5,"지속":0,"지향":"동성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"헌장 사본 전달","품계":"조합원","직함":"제작헌장 전령","업무 위치":"구로5동. 여시온은 구로5동 골목에 붙일 제작헌장 세 사본의 봉인과 날짜를 먼저 확인한다. 표강호의 규격 전령로와 길을 나누고 강민서의 평의회 선언을 게시한 뒤에야 윤서린에게 인준 요구 사본을 넘긴다.","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 20 | 무력 −10 | 물질 35 | 공동 35 | 원칙 10 | 공개 55 | 자격 45 | 분산 25 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −40 | 위험 10 | 과시 −5 | 지속 0 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 제작헌장 전령 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로5동. 여시온은 구로5동 골목에 붙일 제작헌장 세 사본의 봉인과 날짜를 먼저 확인한다. 표강호의 규격 전령로와 길을 나누고 강민서의 평의회 선언을 게시한 뒤에야 윤서린에게 인준 요구 사본을 넘긴다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 제작헌장 전령. 사본은 노동조합·건물조합·경비대가 각각 한 장씩 받고, 한 장만 남은 전달은 출발하지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 폭설에 막힌 환승 통로를 뚫어 부상자를 먼저 옮겼다. 이 일로 제작헌장 전령 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"표강호의 규격 전령로와 경로를 나누고, 강민서의 길드 평의회 선언을 구로 골목에 붙이며, 윤서린의 인준 요구를 게시 이후에만 받는다.","야망":"독자 헌장의 수리 규격과 복구 노동 시민권을 기록청 인준 이전에 조합 게시판에 붙여, 법통 빚이 생산 규칙을 삼키지 못하게 한다.","공포":"인준을 미끼로 헌장 사본이 회수되고, 길드 평의회가 서울역 정치의 하위 작업반으로 떨어지는 것.","개입":"회수된 사본을 되찾아 게시를 끝내거나, 세 장의 문구가 서로 다름을 밝혀 전령을 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"깃발보다 헌장 사본을 믿고, 선언 문구가 작업장 규칙과 어긋나면 전달을 하루 미룬다. 경로는 공개하고 가방 속 순서는 숨기지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 헌장 사본 전달\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 제작헌장 전령\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 제작헌장 전령 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로5동. 여시온은 구로5동 골목에 붙일 제작헌장 세 사본의 봉인과 날짜를 먼저 확인한다. 표강호의 규격 전령로와 길을 나누고 강민서의 평의회 선언을 게시한 뒤에야 윤서린에게 인준 요구 사본을 넘긴다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 제작헌장 전령. 사본은 노동조합·건물조합·경비대가 각각 한 장씩 받고, 한 장만 남은 전달은 출발하지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 폭설에 막힌 환승 통로를 뚫어 부상자를 먼저 옮겼다. 이 일로 제작헌장 전령 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 표강호의 규격 전령로와 경로를 나누고, 강민서의 길드 평의회 선언을 구로 골목에 붙이며, 윤서린의 인준 요구를 게시 이후에만 받는다.\n\n**야망.** 독자 헌장의 수리 규격과 복구 노동 시민권을 기록청 인준 이전에 조합 게시판에 붙여, 법통 빚이 생산 규칙을 삼키지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 인준을 미끼로 헌장 사본이 회수되고, 길드 평의회가 서울역 정치의 하위 작업반으로 떨어지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 회수된 사본을 되찾아 게시를 끝내거나, 세 장의 문구가 서로 다름을 밝혀 전령을 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 20 | 무력 −10 | 물질 35 | 공동 35 | 원칙 10 | 공개 55 | 자격 45 | 분산 25 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −40 | 위험 10 | 과시 −5 | 지속 0 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"여시온","type":"계약","to":"표강호","basis":"표강호의 규격 전령로와 경로를 나누고"},{"from":"여시온","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"강민서의 공방 제작 조합 평의회 선언을 구로 골목에 붙이며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0056', 'ae30-d589-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0056","name":"Gi Pilho","title":"Fabrication Logistics","position":"Fabrication Logistics","characterId":"K056","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Waiting Hall Duty","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#person-gipilho","detailRoute":"/people/person-0056","birthDate":"2099-10-24","birthday":"10-24","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k056-materials-dispatch","name":"Materials dispatch management","rating":65},{"id":"k056-skill-posting","name":"Skill-score posting","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k056-public-order-before-dispatch","name":"Dispatch after public ordering","description":"Defers requests arriving before lottery and skill publication.","behavior":"Defers requests arriving before lottery and skill publication.","stress":"That the haul carts would turn into carts for weapon crates, and the parts bins become collateral in bargains to swap people.","relationship":"Matches the release order of parts crates with the mechanics of the depot workshop, and loads food bins together with market traders.","effects":[]},{"id":"k056-repair-not-ammunition","name":"Protect repair supplies","description":"Locks secret military compartments with generator output.","behavior":"Locks secret military compartments with generator output.","stress":"That the haul carts would turn into carts for weapon crates, and the parts bins become collateral in bargains to swap people.","relationship":"Matches the release order of parts crates with the mechanics of the depot workshop, and loads food bins together with market traders.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Rejected early dispatch and set order after publishing skill scores. Seeks a mutual-repair supply table without granting ammunition or equipment.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44790-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K056","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44790-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ae30-d589-c8fc","name":"Haengju Gi Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ae30-d589-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":15,"Force":-10,"Material":40,"Communal":50,"Principle":10,"Public":40,"Eligibility":50,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":0,"Display":-10,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Waiting Hall Duty","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Fabrication Logistics","Work Location":"Guro 3-dong. On the Guro 3-dong logistics blackboard, Gi Pilho first writes down the winter parts needed for civilian power and skilled-worker shifts. If Choe Dain''s engineer work crew demands release before the lottery, he waits for the skill scores to be posted and separately seals a parts slot to exchange with Gi Bareum.","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 15 | Force −10 | Material 40 | Communal 50 | Principle 10 | Transparency 40 | Qualification 50 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving 40 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 0 | Display −10 | Endurance −15 | Orientation None | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The Fabrication Logistics post opened as a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Work location: Guro 3-dong. On the Guro 3-dong logistics blackboard, Gi Pilho first writes down the winter parts needed for civilian power and skilled-worker shifts. If Choe Dain''s engineer work crew demands release before the lottery, he waits for the skill scores to be posted and separately seals a parts slot to exchange with Gi Bareum.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Fabrication Logistics. Logistics releases are made only after the Guild Council lottery and the disclosure of skill scores, and the secret munitions compartment is locked along with the power output.","Anecdote":"Choe Dain''s engineer work crew demands logistics release ahead of the Guild Council lottery. Gi Pilho sets the release order only after posting the skill scores, and, keeping the secret munitions compartment locked along with the power output, moves the parts slot to be exchanged with Gi Bareum onto the supply ticket.","Relationships":"He matches the release order of parts crates with the mechanics of the depot workshop, and loads food bins together with market traders.","Ambition":"","Fear":"That the haul carts will turn into carts for weapon crates, and the parts bins become collateral in bargains to swap people.","Intervention":"Can justify his seal by filling the mutual-repair-rights supplies, or expose the hidden ammunition compartment and have the logistics officer replaced."},"biography":"Counts skilled workers'' shift hours before the number of toolboxes. Speaks of practical gain, but does not pull civilian power into logistics.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Waiting Hall Duty\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Fabrication Logistics\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The Fabrication Logistics post opened as a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Work location: Guro 3-dong. On the Guro 3-dong logistics blackboard, Gi Pilho first writes down the winter parts needed for civilian power and skilled-worker shifts. If Choe Dain''s engineer work crew demands release before the lottery, he waits for the skill scores to be posted and separately seals a parts slot to exchange with Gi Bareum.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Fabrication Logistics. Logistics releases are made only after the Guild Council lottery and the disclosure of skill scores, and the secret munitions compartment is locked along with the power output.\n\n**Anecdote.** Choe Dain''s engineer work crew demands logistics release ahead of the Guild Council lottery. Gi Pilho sets the release order only after posting the skill scores, and, keeping the secret munitions compartment locked along with the power output, moves the parts slot to be exchanged with Gi Bareum onto the supply ticket.\n\n**Relations.** He matches the release order of parts crates with the mechanics of the depot workshop, and loads food bins together with market traders.\n\n**Fear.** That the haul carts will turn into carts for weapon crates, and the parts bins become collateral in bargains to swap people.\n\n**Intervention.** Can justify his seal by filling the mutual-repair-rights supplies, or expose the hidden ammunition compartment and have the logistics officer replaced.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 15 | Force −10 | Material 40 | Communal 50 | Principle 10 | Transparency 40 | Qualification 50 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 0 | Display −10 | Endurance −15 | Orientation None | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gi Pilho","type":"Rivalry","to":"Choe Dain","basis":"Contending with Choe Da-in''s engineer work crew over the dispatch order,"},{"from":"Gi Pilho","type":"Contract","to":"Gi Bareum","basis":"Swap parts cars with Gi Bareum of the Western Convoy"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0056","name":"기필호","title":"제작 병참","position":"제작 병참","characterId":"K056","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"대합실 당직","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-기필호","detailRoute":"/people/person-0056","birthDate":"2099-10-24","birthday":"10-24","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k056-materials-dispatch","name":"병참 출고 관리","rating":65},{"id":"k056-skill-posting","name":"숙련 점수 게시","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k056-public-order-before-dispatch","name":"공개 순서 뒤 출고","description":"추첨과 숙련 공개 전에 들어온 요구를 미룬다.","behavior":"추첨과 숙련 공개 전에 들어온 요구를 미룬다.","stress":"운반 수레가 무기 상자를 싣는 수레로 바뀌고, 부품 칸이 사람을 맞바꾸는 흥정의 담보가 되는 것.","relationship":"차량기지 공방의 정비공들과 부품 상자의 출고 순서를 맞추고, 시장 상인들과 식량 칸을 나눠 싣는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k056-repair-not-ammunition","name":"수리 물자를 지킨다","description":"비밀 군수 칸을 출력과 함께 잠근다.","behavior":"비밀 군수 칸을 출력과 함께 잠근다.","stress":"운반 수레가 무기 상자를 싣는 수레로 바뀌고, 부품 칸이 사람을 맞바꾸는 흥정의 담보가 되는 것.","relationship":"차량기지 공방의 정비공들과 부품 상자의 출고 순서를 맞추고, 시장 상인들과 식량 칸을 나눠 싣는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"조기 출고 요구를 거부하고 숙련 공개 뒤 순서를 정했다. 상호 수리권의 물자표를 지향하지만 탄약·장비를 발급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-44790-S02","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K056","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-44790-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K029"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ae30-d589-c8fc","name":"행주 기씨","crest":"clan-crests/ae30-d589-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":15,"무력":-10,"물질":40,"공동":50,"원칙":10,"공개":40,"자격":50,"분산":30,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":10,"위험":0,"과시":-10,"지속":-15,"지향":"무성향","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"자유도시","생업":"대합실 당직","품계":"조합원","직함":"제작 병참","업무 위치":"구로3동. 기필호는 구로3동 병참 칠판에 민가 전력과 숙련공 교대에 필요한 겨울 부품을 먼저 적는다. 최다인의 공병 작업반이 추첨 전에 출고를 요구하면 숙련점수 게시를 기다리고 기바름과 교환할 부품 칸을 따로 봉한다.","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 15 | 무력 −10 | 물질 40 | 공동 50 | 원칙 10 | 공개 40 | 자격 50 | 분산 30 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 10 | 위험 0 | 과시 −10 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 제작 병참 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로3동. 기필호는 구로3동 병참 칠판에 민가 전력과 숙련공 교대에 필요한 겨울 부품을 먼저 적는다. 최다인의 공병 작업반이 추첨 전에 출고를 요구하면 숙련점수 게시를 기다리고 기바름과 교환할 부품 칸을 따로 봉한다.","관직":"품계 조합원. 직함은 제작 병참. 병참 출고는 길드 평의회 추첨과 숙련 점수 공개 뒤에만 하고, 비밀 군수 칸은 발전 출력과 함께 잠근다.","일화":"최다인의 공병 작업반이 길드 평의회 추첨보다 먼저 병참 출고를 요구한다. 기필호는 숙련 점수를 게시한 뒤에야 출고 순서를 정하고, 비밀 군수 칸은 발전 출력과 함께 잠가 둔 채 기바름과 바꿀 부품 칸을 물자표에 옮긴다.","관계":"차량기지 공방의 정비공들과 부품 상자의 출고 순서를 맞추고, 시장 상인들과 식량 칸을 나눠 싣는다.","야망":"","공포":"운반 수레가 무기 상자를 싣는 수레로 바뀌고, 부품 칸이 사람을 맞바꾸는 흥정의 담보가 되는 것.","개입":"상호 수리권 물자를 채워 그의 봉인을 정당화하거나, 숨겨진 탄약칸을 폭로해 병참을 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"공구 상자 수보다 숙련공의 교대 시간을 먼저 센다. 실리를 말하되 민가 전력을 병참으로 빼지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 생업: 대합실 당직\n- 품계: 조합원\n- 직함: 제작 병참\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 제작 병참 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 업무 위치: 구로3동. 기필호는 구로3동 병참 칠판에 민가 전력과 숙련공 교대에 필요한 겨울 부품을 먼저 적는다. 최다인의 공병 작업반이 추첨 전에 출고를 요구하면 숙련점수 게시를 기다리고 기바름과 교환할 부품 칸을 따로 봉한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 조합원. 직함은 제작 병참. 병참 출고는 길드 평의회 추첨과 숙련 점수 공개 뒤에만 하고, 비밀 군수 칸은 발전 출력과 함께 잠근다.\n\n**일화.** 최다인의 공병 작업반이 길드 평의회 추첨보다 먼저 병참 출고를 요구한다. 기필호는 숙련 점수를 게시한 뒤에야 출고 순서를 정하고, 비밀 군수 칸은 발전 출력과 함께 잠가 둔 채 기바름과 바꿀 부품 칸을 물자표에 옮긴다.\n\n**관계.** 차량기지 공방의 정비공들과 부품 상자의 출고 순서를 맞추고, 시장 상인들과 식량 칸을 나눠 싣는다.\n\n**공포.** 운반 수레가 무기 상자를 싣는 수레로 바뀌고, 부품 칸이 사람을 맞바꾸는 흥정의 담보가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 상호 수리권 물자를 채워 그의 봉인을 정당화하거나, 숨겨진 탄약칸을 폭로해 병참을 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 15 | 무력 −10 | 물질 40 | 공동 50 | 원칙 10 | 공개 40 | 자격 50 | 분산 30 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 10 | 위험 0 | 과시 −10 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"기필호","type":"경쟁","to":"최다인","basis":"최다인의 공병 작업반과 출고 순서를 다투고"},{"from":"기필호","type":"계약","to":"기바름","basis":"서부 호송의 기바름과 부품 칸을 교환한다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0057', 'c815-c9c4-c8fc-912d', '{"id":"person-0057","name":"Jeong Hojun","title":"Arc Life Safety Research Director","position":"Arc Life Safety Research Director","characterId":"K057","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Life Safety Research","gender":"Male","stage":"Key","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#Person-Jeong-Hojun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0057","birthDate":"2101-05-14","birthday":"05-14","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":15,"effective":15},"learning":{"base":16,"effective":16},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k057-specimen-review","name":"Specimen-seal review","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"k057-trait-1","name":"Life Safety Research","description":"Forgery of records is forbidden.","behavior":"Forgery of records is forbidden.","stress":"Acts on a suspect specimen before an audit request arrives.","relationship":"Distinguishes Jeong Seoon’s post as family head from his research responsibility.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He removed a clause binding researchers to hereditary work and moved specimens into common property. He opened a suspect drug specimen before an audit request. His research remit is separate from Jeong Seoon’s post as family head, and disclosure remains disputed with Gang Minseo.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c815-c9c4-c8fc-912d","name":"Jinju Jeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c815-c9c4-c8fc-912d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":30,"Force":-40,"Material":10,"Communal":-10,"Principle":50,"Public":50,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-30,"Display":-40,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Life Safety Research","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Arc Life Safety Research Director","Work Location":"Daechi 1-dong administrative district scope. Preserves the inspection key at Daechi''s ownerless land and the steward role of the Daechi Saengmyeong Clan; proposes a reference point for handing over inspection records, with no grant of ownerless land. Does not fix a residence or exact facility boundaries and grants no new rank, holding, or tenure."},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 generation. A hand on the field test line at the Yangjae headquarters, 12 Heolleung-ro, Seocho-gu. Around 2026 that yard was already running humanoids, and when cloud learning died, the maintenance family kept the trade name. Forgery of records is forbidden. The Jeong family passes on the post of family head, and the family head at the opening is Jeong Seoon. The family head’s seat opened through the family’s own line. It reads as the same habit as Jeong Yura''s termination condition. If Gang Minseo locks the standard, the Yangjae ledger cannot keep up. With the Daechi Saengmyeong Clan''s inspection key left in Daechi''s ownerless land, they dispute the scope of disclosure.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Arc Life Safety Research Director. Occupation: Life Safety Research.","Anecdote":"When the fake drug sample came into the Yangjae archive, Jeong Hojun opened the seal before the audit request from the City Hall side. The opened seal touched Ryu Eunbi''s bed roster.","Houses":"Jinju Jeong clan. An ordinary citizen family that has passed down the ledger of food bins and fuel cans and the shutter-check sheets from one family member to the next.","Relationships":"Public contract with Jeong Yura. Dispute with Gang Minseo over the scope of disclosure.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Life Safety Research\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Arc Life Safety Research Director\n- Work location: Yangjae 2-dong administrative district scope. Preserves the Yangjae headquarters field tests and the Yangjae archive''s life records; proposes a dong-level subdivision of the headquarters research work reference point. Does not fix a residence or exact facility boundaries and grants no new rank, holding, or tenure.\n- Work location: Daechi 1-dong administrative district scope. Preserves the inspection key at Daechi''s ownerless land and the steward role of the Daechi Saengmyeong Clan; proposes a reference point for handing over inspection records, with no grant of ownerless land."},"biography":"**Life.** Born in the 2126 generation. A hand on the field test line at the Yangjae headquarters, 12 Heolleung-ro, Seocho-gu. Around 2026 that yard was already running humanoids, and when cloud learning died, the maintenance family kept the trade name. Forgery of records is forbidden. The Jeong family passes on the post of family head, and the family head at the opening is Jeong Seoon. The family head’s seat opened through the family’s own line. It reads as the same habit as Jeong Yura''s termination condition. If Gang Minseo locks the standard, the Yangjae ledger cannot keep up. With the Daechi Saengmyeong Clan''s inspection key left in Daechi''s ownerless land, they dispute the scope of disclosure.\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Arc Life Safety Research Director. Occupation: Life Safety Research.\n**Anecdote.** When the fake drug sample came into the Yangjae archive, Jeong Hojun opened the seal before the audit request from the City Hall side. The opened seal touched Ryu Eunbi''s bed roster.\n**Clan.** Jinju Jeong clan. An ordinary citizen family that has passed down the ledger of food bins and fuel cans and the shutter-check sheets from one family member to the next.\n**Relations.** Public contract with Jeong Yura. Dispute with Gang Minseo over the scope of disclosure.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Life Safety Research\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Arc Life Safety Research Director\n- Work location: Yangjae 2-dong administrative district scope. Preserves the Yangjae headquarters field tests and the Yangjae archive''s life records; proposes a dong-level subdivision of the headquarters research work reference point. Does not fix a residence or exact facility boundaries and grants no new rank, holding, or tenure.\n- Work location: Daechi 1-dong administrative district scope. Preserves the inspection key at Daechi''s ownerless land and the steward role of the Daechi Saengmyeong Clan; proposes a reference point for handing over inspection records, with no grant of ownerless land.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"Jeong Seoon","type":"Command","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"The family head of the Arc has separated out the life safety research responsibility"},{"from":"Jeong Harin","type":"Command","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Enforces the life safety check on site"},{"from":"Choe Eunjae","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Co-designs the scope of the public contract"},{"from":"Gim Doha","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Completes the three-part deliberation on the residents'' side"},{"from":"Bak Jinsol","type":"Oath","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Keeps the knowledge-sharing oath by carrying out seed stock"},{"from":"Im Sion","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Moves replication records into the ledger"},{"from":"Song Jaemin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Supports relaying public materials"},{"from":"Jin Chaeon","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Learning Jeong Hojun''s safety-review principles as his disciple"},{"from":"Pyo Jian","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Delivers Jeong Hojun''s one-line replication before the bell tolls"},{"from":"Dong Saegyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Moves Jeong Hojun''s implementation time into the column beside the loss table"},{"from":"U Daon","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Making Jeong Hojun''s safety review a condition of the convoy"},{"from":"Bae Seoyul","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Demanding verification of Jeong Hojun''s drug efficacy"},{"from":"Tak Eunsol","type":"Oath","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Setting Jeong Hojun''s public record of food and fuel counts as the standard for the witness stand"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0057","name":"정호준","title":"Arc 생명안전 연구책임자","position":"Arc 생명안전 연구책임자","characterId":"K057","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"생명안전 연구","gender":"남성","stage":"주요","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-정호준","detailRoute":"/people/person-0057","birthDate":"2101-05-14","birthday":"05-14","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":15,"effective":15},"learning":{"base":16,"effective":16},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k057-specimen-review","name":"표본 봉인 검토","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"k057-trait-1","name":"생명안전 연구","description":"기록 위조는 금지된다.","behavior":"기록 위조는 금지된다.","stress":"감사 요청을 기다리지 않고 의심 표본에 대응한다.","relationship":"정서온의 가문 수장 권한과 자신의 연구 책임을 구분한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"연구자를 세습 직능에 묶는 조항을 지우고 표본을 공동재산으로 옮겼다. 가짜 약 표본은 감사 요청 전에 봉인을 열었다. 정서온의 가문 수장직과 별개로 연구를 맡으며 공개 범위에서는 강민서와 충돌한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c815-c9c4-c8fc-912d","name":"진주 정씨","crest":"clan-crests/c815-c9c4-c8fc-912d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"권위":-20,"개방":30,"무력":-40,"물질":10,"공동":-10,"원칙":50,"공개":50,"자격":60,"분산":20,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-10,"위험":-30,"과시":-40,"지속":20,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"생명안전 연구","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"Arc 생명안전 연구책임자","업무 위치":"대치1동 행정동 범위. 대치 무주지의 검사 키와 대치생명가 관리인 역할 보존; 검사 기록 인계 기준점 제안, 무주지 수여 없음. 거주지나 정확한 시설 경계를 확정하지 않으며 새 직위·영지·점유권을 부여하지 않는다."},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 서초구 헌릉로 12 양재 본사 현장 시험 라인의 손. 약 2026년 그 마당은 이미 휴머노이드를 굴렸고, 구름 학습이 죽자 정비 가문이 상호를 남겼다. 기록 위조는 금지된다. 정씨 수장 가문은 가문 수장 자리를 잇고, 개막의 가문 수장은 정서온이다. 가문 수장 자리는 가문 내력으로 열렸다. 정유라의 종료조건과 같은 버릇으로 읽힌다. 강민서가 규격을 잠그면 양재 원장이 따라가지 못한다. 대치생명가의 검사 키는 대치 무주지에 남긴 채로, 공개 범위를 두고 다툰다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 Arc 생명안전 연구책임자. 생업은 생명안전 연구.","일화":"가짜 약 표본이 양재 서고에 들어왔을 때, 정호준은 시청 쪽 감사 요청보다 먼저 봉인을 열었다. 열린 봉인이 류은비의 침상 명부와 맞닿았다.","가문":"진주 정씨 집안. 식량 통과 연료 통 수를 적은 장부와 셔터 점검표를 가족이 돌려 가며 지켜 온 평범한 시민 집안이다.","관계":"정유라와 공개 계약. 강민서와 공개 범위 다툼.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 생명안전 연구\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: Arc 생명안전 연구책임자\n- 업무 위치: 양재2동 행정동 범위. 양재 본사 현장 시험·양재 서고 생애 보존; 본사 연구 업무 기준점의 동 세분 제안. 거주지나 정확한 시설 경계를 확정하지 않으며 새 직위·영지·점유권을 부여하지 않는다.\n- 업무 위치: 대치1동 행정동 범위. 대치 무주지의 검사 키와 대치생명가 관리인 역할 보존; 검사 기록 인계 기준점 제안, 무주지 수여 없음."},"biography":"**생애.** 2126년 세대. 서초구 헌릉로 12 양재 본사 현장 시험 라인의 손. 약 2026년 그 마당은 이미 휴머노이드를 굴렸고, 구름 학습이 죽자 정비 가문이 상호를 남겼다. 기록 위조는 금지된다. 정씨 수장 가문은 가문 수장 자리를 잇고, 개막의 가문 수장은 정서온이다. 가문 수장 자리는 가문 내력으로 열렸다. 정유라의 종료조건과 같은 버릇으로 읽힌다. 강민서가 규격을 잠그면 양재 원장이 따라가지 못한다. 대치생명가의 검사 키는 대치 무주지에 남긴 채로, 공개 범위를 두고 다툰다.\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 Arc 생명안전 연구책임자. 생업은 생명안전 연구.\n**일화.** 가짜 약 표본이 양재 서고에 들어왔을 때, 정호준은 시청 쪽 감사 요청보다 먼저 봉인을 열었다. 열린 봉인이 류은비의 침상 명부와 맞닿았다.\n**가문.** 진주 정씨 집안. 식량 통과 연료 통 수를 적은 장부와 셔터 점검표를 가족이 돌려 가며 지켜 온 평범한 시민 집안이다.\n**관계.** 정유라와 공개 계약. 강민서와 공개 범위 다툼.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 생명안전 연구\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: Arc 생명안전 연구책임자\n- 업무 위치: 양재2동 행정동 범위. 양재 본사 현장 시험·양재 서고 생애 보존; 본사 연구 업무 기준점의 동 세분 제안. 거주지나 정확한 시설 경계를 확정하지 않으며 새 직위·영지·점유권을 부여하지 않는다.\n- 업무 위치: 대치1동 행정동 범위. 대치 무주지의 검사 키와 대치생명가 관리인 역할 보존; 검사 기록 인계 기준점 제안, 무주지 수여 없음.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"정서온","type":"지휘","to":"정호준","basis":"아크 가문 수장이 생명안전 연구책임을 분리해 둠"},{"from":"정하린","type":"지휘","to":"정호준","basis":"생명안전 점검권을 현장에서 집행"},{"from":"최은재","type":"스승과 제자","to":"정호준","basis":"공개 계약 범위를 함께 설계"},{"from":"김도하","type":"계약","to":"정호준","basis":"삼원 심의를 주민 쪽에서 완성"},{"from":"박진솔","type":"맹세","to":"정호준","basis":"지식 공유 맹세를 종자 반출로 지킴"},{"from":"임시온","type":"계약","to":"정호준","basis":"재현 기록을 원장으로 옮김"},{"from":"송재민","type":"계약","to":"정호준","basis":"공개 자료 중계를 지지"},{"from":"진채온","type":"스승과 제자","to":"정호준","basis":"정호준의 안전심사 원칙을 제자로 배우며"},{"from":"표지안","type":"계약","to":"정호준","basis":"정호준의 재현 한 줄을 종 울림 전에 전한다"},{"from":"동새결","type":"계약","to":"정호준","basis":"정호준의 이행 시간을 손실표 옆칸에 옮긴다"},{"from":"우다온","type":"계약","to":"정호준","basis":"정호준의 안전심사를 호송 조건으로 삼으며"},{"from":"배서율","type":"계약","to":"정호준","basis":"정호준의 약효 검증을 요구하며"},{"from":"탁은솔","type":"맹세","to":"정호준","basis":"정호준의 식량·연료 수량 공개 기록을 증인석의 기준으로 둔다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0058', 'c815-acbd-c8fc-912d', '{"id":"person-0058","name":"Jeong Harin","title":"Life Safety Examiner","position":"Life Safety Examiner","characterId":"K058","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Safety Sample Examination","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#Person-Jeong-Harin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0058","birthDate":"2072-11-16","birthday":"11-16","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sample","name":"Sample-record review","rating":65},{"id":"save-register","name":"Emergency preservation of personnel registers","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"reproducible-records-first","name":"Reproducible Records First","description":"Jeong Harin bases safety judgments on reproducible experimental records rather than authority.","behavior":"He requires reproducible records for every deployment and technical certification and checks sample seals even during urgent meetings.","stress":"If review records risk becoming military oversight documents, he may place greater weight on verifiable records and independent safety review.","relationship":"He may draw on his sample-exchange arrangement with Park Nuri when medicine samples need verification.","effects":[]},{"id":"lock-down-removal-under-pressure","name":"Lock Down Removal Under Pressure","description":"Jeong Harin places safety standards and removal vetoes above pressure from the research lead.","behavior":"He locks down removal when standards are unmet, even if the life-safety research lead presses him.","stress":"He may resist surrendering the safety-review veto.","relationship":"If Bae Ujin demands military oversight, he may oppose it through his veto-enforcement alliance with Jeong Hojun.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He requires reproducible records and preserved personnel registers during a fire. Safety judgment is supported, not combat rescue or an invented research license.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c815-acbd-c8fc-912d","name":"Gyeongju Jeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c815-acbd-c8fc-912d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":20,"Force":-40,"Material":10,"Communal":-5,"Principle":55,"Public":30,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":-35,"Display":-10,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Safety Sample Examination","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Life Safety Examiner","Duty":"Daechi 1-dong. Jeong Harin checks the Daechi sample escort records and halts release if verification data is missing.","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 20 | Force −40 | Materialism 10 | Communal −5 | Principle 55 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 40 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −35 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Fluid | Attachment None"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Raised on concourse watch duty. Jeong Harin cross-checks safety review records against release-lock logs to present reproducibility evidence to Jeong Hojun.\n- Duty: Yangjae 1-dong.\n- Duty: Daechi 1-dong. Jeong Harin checks the Daechi sample escort records and halts release if verification data is missing.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Life Safety Examiner. He demands reproducible experiment records for every dispatch and technical certification, and locks release of anything below standard even when the Life Safety Research Director presses him.","Anecdote":"In the 2125 History Fire, he was the one who carried out the casualty ledger first.","Relationships":"He is the ally who enforces Jeong Hojun''s veto in the field, holds a contract to exchange medicine samples with Yeongdeungpo Supervisor Park Nuri, and bears a grudge against Bae Ujin''s demand for military oversight.","Ambition":"He aims to raise the Safety Reviewer''s veto to the first clause of the Director of the Seoul Joint Technology Institute, voiding any deal that uses researchers as hostages.","Fear":"That review records will be turned into military oversight documents.","Intervention":"He can escort contaminated samples to the Daechi laboratory to back up a refusal, or find omissions in the review records to close a dispatch deal."},"biography":"His principles are harder than bone, and he regards authority that has not been reproduced as more dangerous than any experiment. Even in emergency meetings he checks the sample seal stickers first.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Safety Sample Examination\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Life Safety Examiner\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Raised on concourse watch duty. Jeong Harin cross-checks safety review records against release-lock logs to present reproducibility evidence to Jeong Hojun.\n- Duty: Yangjae 1-dong.\n- Duty: Daechi 1-dong. Jeong Harin checks the Daechi sample escort records and halts release if verification data is missing.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Life Safety Examiner. He demands reproducible experiment records for every dispatch and technical certification, and locks release of anything below standard even when the Life Safety Research Director presses him.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the 2125 History Fire, he was the one who carried out the casualty ledger first.\n\n**Relations.** He is the ally who enforces Jeong Hojun''s veto in the field, holds a contract to exchange medicine samples with Yeongdeungpo Supervisor Park Nuri, and bears a grudge against Bae Ujin''s demand for military oversight.\n\n**Ambition.** He aims to raise the Safety Reviewer''s veto to the first clause of the Director of the Seoul Joint Technology Institute, voiding any deal that uses researchers as hostages.\n\n**Fear.** That review records will be turned into military oversight documents.\n\n**Intervention.** He can escort contaminated samples to the Daechi laboratory to back up a refusal, or find omissions in the review records to close a dispatch deal.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 20 | Force −40 | Materialism 10 | Communal −5 | Principle 55 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 40 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −35 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Fluid | Attachment None\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1005","name":"Jeong Seoon","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"Direct Subordinate","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K058","members":[{"personId":"K068","name":"Jin Chaeon"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jeong Harin","type":"Command","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Enforces the life safety check on site"},{"from":"Jeong Harin","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Nu-ri","basis":"Exchanges medicine samples with Yeongdeungpo"},{"from":"Jeong Harin","type":"Grudge","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Grudge Over the Military Oversight Demand"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Yi Bomgyeol","type":"Command","to":"Jeong Harin","basis":"Backing the Reviewer''s Veto with Force"},{"from":"Yu Bayeong","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Harin","basis":"Yu Bayeong informs Jeong Harin of the blank safety review seal box on a seed release request form and hands over the relevant records. Jeong Harin confirms the reproducible review basis, so that a request bearing only the resident representative''s seal is not processed as grounds for release."},{"from":"Jin Chaeon","type":"Command","to":"Jeong Harin","basis":"She is the ally who enforces Jeong Harin''s veto on the medical side, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0058","name":"정하린","title":"생명안전 심사관","position":"생명안전 심사관","characterId":"K058","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"안전 표본 심사","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-정하린","detailRoute":"/people/person-0058","birthDate":"2072-11-16","birthday":"11-16","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sample","name":"표본 기록 심사","rating":65},{"id":"save-register","name":"위기 인명 장부 보존","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"reproducible-records-first","name":"재현 기록 우선","description":"정하린은 권위보다 재현 가능한 실험 기록을 안전 판단의 근거로 삼는다.","behavior":"모든 파견과 기술 인증에 재현 기록을 요구하고 긴급 회의에서도 표본 봉인을 먼저 확인한다.","stress":"심사 기록이 군사 감독 문서로 바뀔 우려가 있다면 검증 기록과 안전심사의 독립성을 더 중시할 수 있다.","relationship":"약재 표본의 검증이 필요하다면 박누리와의 표본 교환을 활용할 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"lock-down-removal-under-pressure","name":"독촉에 반출 잠금","description":"정하린은 책임자의 독촉보다 안전 기준과 반출 거부권을 우선한다.","behavior":"기준 미달이면 생명안전 연구책임자가 독촉해도 반출을 잠근다.","stress":"안전심사 거부권을 양보하지 않으려 할 수 있다.","relationship":"배우진이 군사감독을 요구한다면 정호준과의 거부권 집행 동맹을 바탕으로 반대할 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"재현 기록을 요구하고 화재 때 인명 장부를 보존했다. 반복 안전 판단을 반영하되 구조 전투나 연구 면허를 만들지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c815-acbd-c8fc-912d","name":"경주 정씨","crest":"clan-crests/c815-acbd-c8fc-912d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":20,"무력":-40,"물질":10,"공동":-5,"원칙":55,"공개":30,"자격":40,"분산":10,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":35,"위험":-35,"과시":-10,"지속":35,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"안전 표본 심사","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"생명안전 심사관","업무":"대치1동. 정하린은 대치 표본 호송 기록을 확인하고 검증 자료가 빠지면 반출을 멈춘다.","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 20 | 무력 −40 | 물질 10 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 55 | 공개 30 | 자격 40 | 분산 10 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 35 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 정하린은 안전심사 기록과 반출 잠금 내역을 대조해 정호준에게 재현 근거를 제시한다.\n- 업무: 양재1동.\n- 업무: 대치1동. 정하린은 대치 표본 호송 기록을 확인하고 검증 자료가 빠지면 반출을 멈춘다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 생명안전 심사관. 모든 파견과 기술 인증에 재현 가능한 실험 기록을 요구하고, 기준 미달이면 생명안전 연구책임자의 독촉이 있어도 반출을 잠근다.","일화":"2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다.","관계":"정호준의 거부권을 현장에서 집행하는 동맹이고, 영등포 감독 박누리와 약재 표본을 교환하는 계약이며, 배우진의 군사감독 요구에는 원한을 품는다.","야망":"안전심사관의 거부권을 서울 공동기술원장의 첫 조항으로 올려 연구자를 인질로 쓰는 거래를 무효로 만든다.","공포":"심사 기록이 군사 감독 문서로 바뀌는 것.","개입":"오염 표본을 대치 실험실까지 호송해 거부를 뒷받침하거나, 심사 기록 누락을 찾아 파견 거래를 성사시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"원칙이 뼈보다 단단하고, 재현되지 않은 권위를 실험보다 위험하게 본다. 긴급 회의에서도 표본 봉인 스티커를 먼저 확인한다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 안전 표본 심사\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 생명안전 심사관\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 정하린은 안전심사 기록과 반출 잠금 내역을 대조해 정호준에게 재현 근거를 제시한다.\n- 업무: 양재1동.\n- 업무: 대치1동. 정하린은 대치 표본 호송 기록을 확인하고 검증 자료가 빠지면 반출을 멈춘다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 생명안전 심사관. 모든 파견과 기술 인증에 재현 가능한 실험 기록을 요구하고, 기준 미달이면 생명안전 연구책임자의 독촉이 있어도 반출을 잠근다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다.\n\n**관계.** 정호준의 거부권을 현장에서 집행하는 동맹이고, 영등포 감독 박누리와 약재 표본을 교환하는 계약이며, 배우진의 군사감독 요구에는 원한을 품는다.\n\n**야망.** 안전심사관의 거부권을 서울 공동기술원장의 첫 조항으로 올려 연구자를 인질로 쓰는 거래를 무효로 만든다.\n\n**공포.** 심사 기록이 군사 감독 문서로 바뀌는 것.\n\n**개입.** 오염 표본을 대치 실험실까지 호송해 거부를 뒷받침하거나, 심사 기록 누락을 찾아 파견 거래를 성사시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 20 | 무력 −40 | 물질 10 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 55 | 공개 30 | 자격 40 | 분산 10 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 35 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1005","name":"정서온","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"직속 부하","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K058","members":[{"personId":"K068","name":"진채온"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"정하린","type":"지휘","to":"정호준","basis":"생명안전 점검권을 현장에서 집행"},{"from":"정하린","type":"계약","to":"박누리","basis":"약재 표본을 영등포와 교환"},{"from":"정하린","type":"원한","to":"배우진","basis":"군사감독 요구에 대한 원한"}],"incoming":[{"from":"이봄결","type":"지휘","to":"정하린","basis":"심사관 거부권을 무력으로 받침"},{"from":"유바영","type":"계약","to":"정하린","basis":"유바영은 종자 출고 요청서의 빈 안전심사 날인 칸을 정하린에게 알리고 해당 기록을 넘긴다. 정하린은 재현 가능한 심사 근거를 확인해, 주민대표 날인만 있는 요청이 반출 근거로 처리되지 않게 한다."},{"from":"진채온","type":"지휘","to":"정하린","basis":"정하린의 거부권을 진료 쪽에서 집행하는 동맹이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0059', 'cd5c-d574-c8fc-5d14', '{"id":"person-0059","name":"Choe Eunjae","title":"Technical Certification Councilor","position":"Technical Certification Councilor","characterId":"K059","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Technical Certification and Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#Person-Choe-Eunjae","detailRoute":"/people/person-0059","birthDate":"2097-03-18","birthday":"03-18","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"certify","name":"Certification-clause review","rating":65},{"id":"referral","name":"Public-channel referral","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"no-secret-clauses","name":"No Secret Clauses","description":"Choi Eunjae treats certification as a process bound to open terms rather than a bargaining asset.","behavior":"She leaves certification copies with the Daechi archive and refuses to stamp secret performance clauses.","stress":"She may enforce open ledgers and disclosed terms more strictly.","relationship":"She may cooperate with Jeong Hojun and incorporate Jeong Yura’s technology-sharing language when this broadens contract transparency.","effects":[]},{"id":"attention-to-on-site-faults","name":"Attention to On-Site Faults","description":"Choi Eunjae’s curiosity lingers longer on a broken on-site pump than on gaps in a performance sheet.","behavior":"She spends time examining broken pumps and undertakes filter verification for Im Chaewon.","stress":"She may be more wary of certification that ignores actual site conditions.","relationship":"She may rely on her verification alliance with Im Chaewon when a filter’s actual performance needs checking.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She designs disclosure boundaries and retains certification copies on both sides. Interest in broken pumps supports curiosity, not repair skill.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd5c-d574-c8fc-5d14","name":"Haeju Choe Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cd5c-d574-c8fc-5d14.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":30,"Force":-40,"Material":10,"Communal":5,"Principle":50,"Public":50,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":0,"Display":-5,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Technical Certification and Verification","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Technical Certification Councilor","Duty":"Daechi 1-dong. Choe Eunjae checks Jeraon''s receipt records to confirm that the same copy has arrived at the Daechi Archive.","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 30 | Force −40 | Material 10 | Communal 5 | Principle 50 | Transparency 50 | Qualification 55 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving 35 | Monopoly −15 | Risk 0 | Display −5 | Persistence −15 | Orientation None | Union Non-monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 generation. Raised on waiting-hall duty. Choe Eunjae matches the certified copies against the public test records, and holds back any seal that still carries a non-public clause.\n- Duty: Yangjae 1-dong.\n- Duty: Daechi 1-dong. Choe Eunjae checks Jeraon''s receipt records to confirm that the same copy has arrived at the Daechi Archive.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Technical Certification Councilor. Leaves a certified copy at the Daechi Archive, and withholds the seal if there is a non-public performance clause.","Anecdote":"In 2125, returned a private solicitation and redirected it to the public window.","Relationships":"Is close to a master-and-disciple bond with Jeong Hojun in designing the scope of public contracts, takes on the filter verification of Seoul Defense Representative Im Chaewon as an ally, and draws Jeong Yura''s technology-sharing wording into the certification clauses.","Ambition":"Gathers machine-body repair records into one public ledger so anyone can see before next winter where spare parts run short, and handles the day-to-day work of that ledger.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can bring in the original records of a reproduction experiment to restore a certification, or persuade or expose a councilor who has hidden a non-public clause."},"biography":"Curious, but despises anyone who uses a certification seal as a bargaining chip. Spends longer looking at broken pumps in the field than at the blanks in a performance table.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Technical Certification and Verification\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Technical Certification Councilor\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 generation. Raised on waiting-hall duty. Choe Eunjae matches the certified copies against the public test records, and holds back any seal that still carries a non-public clause.\n- Duty: Yangjae 1-dong.\n- Duty: Daechi 1-dong. Choe Eunjae checks Jeraon''s receipt records to confirm that the same copy has arrived at the Daechi Archive.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Technical Certification Councilor. Leaves a certified copy at the Daechi Archive, and withholds the seal if there is a non-public performance clause.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, returned a private solicitation and redirected it to the public window.\n\n**Relationships.** Is close to a master-and-disciple bond with Jeong Hojun in designing the scope of public contracts, takes on the filter verification of Seoul Defense Representative Im Chaewon as an ally, and draws Jeong Yura''s technology-sharing wording into the certification clauses.\n\n**Ambition.** Gathers machine-body repair records into one public ledger so anyone can see before next winter where spare parts run short, and handles the day-to-day work of that ledger.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in the original records of a reproduction experiment to restore a certification, or persuade or expose a councilor who has hidden a non-public clause.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 30 | Force −40 | Material 10 | Communal 5 | Principle 50 | Transparency 50 | Qualification 55 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Monopoly −15 | Risk 0 | Display −5 | Persistence −15 | Orientation None | Union Non-monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Choe Eunjae","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Co-designs the scope of the public contract"},{"from":"Choe Eunjae","type":"Contract","to":"Im Chaewon","basis":"Entrusts filter verification to the protective suit guild"},{"from":"Choe Eunjae","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Yura","basis":"Draws the technology-sharing wording into the certification clauses"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Im Chaewon","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Eunjae","basis":"Shares protective filter performance verification"},{"from":"Yu Minho","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Eunjae","basis":"Ties outer-district dispatch to the certification seal"},{"from":"Heo Seogyeom","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Eunjae","basis":"Locks down shipments if Choe Eunjae''s certification seal lapses, and"},{"from":"Je Raon","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Choe Eunjae","basis":"Is close to a master-and-disciple bond in moving Choe Eunjae''s certification scope onto the ledger, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0059","name":"최은재","title":"기술인증 평의원","position":"기술인증 평의원","characterId":"K059","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"기술 인증·검증","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-최은재","detailRoute":"/people/person-0059","birthDate":"2097-03-18","birthday":"03-18","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"certify","name":"인증 조항 검토","rating":65},{"id":"referral","name":"공개 창구 안내","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"no-secret-clauses","name":"비공개 조항 거부","description":"최은재는 인증을 흥정 수단이 아니라 공개 조건에 묶인 절차로 본다.","behavior":"인증 사본을 대치 서고에 남기고 비공개 성능 조항이 있으면 날인을 거부한다.","stress":"공개 원장과 조건 공개를 더 엄격히 지킬 수 있다.","relationship":"계약의 공개 범위를 넓힐 수 있다면 정호준과 협력하고 정유라의 기술공유 문장을 인증 조항에 반영할 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"attention-to-on-site-faults","name":"현장 고장 관심","description":"최은재의 호기심은 성능표의 빈칸보다 현장에서 고장 난 펌프에 더 오래 머문다.","behavior":"고장 난 펌프를 오래 살피고 임채원의 필터 검증을 맡는다.","stress":"현장 상태를 외면하는 인증에 더 경계할 수 있다.","relationship":"필터의 실제 성능을 확인해야 한다면 임채원과의 검증 동맹을 활용할 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"공개 계약 범위를 설계하고 인증 사본을 양쪽에 남긴다. 고장 펌프를 살피는 호기심은 반영하나 수리 숙련은 부여하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd5c-d574-c8fc-5d14","name":"해주 최씨","crest":"clan-crests/cd5c-d574-c8fc-5d14.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":30,"무력":-40,"물질":10,"공동":5,"원칙":50,"공개":50,"자격":55,"분산":10,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":-15,"위험":0,"과시":-5,"지속":-15,"지향":"무성향","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"기술 인증·검증","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"기술인증 평의원","업무":"대치1동. 최은재는 대치 서고에 같은 사본이 도착했는지 제라온의 인수 기록으로 확인한다.","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 30 | 무력 −40 | 물질 10 | 공동 5 | 원칙 50 | 공개 50 | 자격 55 | 분산 10 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 −15 | 위험 0 | 과시 −5 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 최은재는 인증 사본과 공개 시험 기록을 맞추고 비공개 조항이 남은 도장은 보류한다.\n- 업무: 양재1동.\n- 업무: 대치1동. 최은재는 대치 서고에 같은 사본이 도착했는지 제라온의 인수 기록으로 확인한다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 기술인증 평의원. 인증 사본을 대치 서고에 남기고, 비공개 성능 조항이 있으면 도장을 찍지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다.","관계":"정호준과 공개 계약 범위를 설계하는 스승과 제자에 가깝고, 서울 방호 대표 임채원의 필터 검증을 동맹으로 맡으며, 정유라의 기술공유 문장을 인증 조항에 끌어들인다.","야망":"기계 몸 수리 기록을 하나의 공개 장부로 모아, 다음 겨울 전에 예비 부품이 모자라는 곳을 누구나 볼 수 있게 하고 그 장부의 실무를 맡는다.","공포":"","개입":"재현 실험의 원본 기록을 가져와 인증을 복구하거나, 비공개 조항을 숨긴 평의원을 설득·폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"호기심이 많으나 인증 도장을 흥정 밑천으로 쓰는 사람을 경멸한다. 성능표의 빈칸보다 현장의 고장난 펌프를 더 오래 본다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 기술 인증·검증\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 기술인증 평의원\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 최은재는 인증 사본과 공개 시험 기록을 맞추고 비공개 조항이 남은 도장은 보류한다.\n- 업무: 양재1동.\n- 업무: 대치1동. 최은재는 대치 서고에 같은 사본이 도착했는지 제라온의 인수 기록으로 확인한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 기술인증 평의원. 인증 사본을 대치 서고에 남기고, 비공개 성능 조항이 있으면 도장을 찍지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다.\n\n**관계.** 정호준과 공개 계약 범위를 설계하는 스승과 제자에 가깝고, 서울 방호 대표 임채원의 필터 검증을 동맹으로 맡으며, 정유라의 기술공유 문장을 인증 조항에 끌어들인다.\n\n**야망.** 기계 몸 수리 기록을 하나의 공개 장부로 모아, 다음 겨울 전에 예비 부품이 모자라는 곳을 누구나 볼 수 있게 하고 그 장부의 실무를 맡는다.\n\n**개입.** 재현 실험의 원본 기록을 가져와 인증을 복구하거나, 비공개 조항을 숨긴 평의원을 설득·폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 30 | 무력 −40 | 물질 10 | 공동 5 | 원칙 50 | 공개 50 | 자격 55 | 분산 10 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 −15 | 위험 0 | 과시 −5 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"최은재","type":"스승과 제자","to":"정호준","basis":"공개 계약 범위를 함께 설계"},{"from":"최은재","type":"계약","to":"임채원","basis":"필터 검증을 방호 직능에 맡음"},{"from":"최은재","type":"계약","to":"정유라","basis":"기술공유 문장을 인증 조항에 끌어들임"}],"incoming":[{"from":"임채원","type":"계약","to":"최은재","basis":"방호 필터 성능 검증을 나눔"},{"from":"유민호","type":"계약","to":"최은재","basis":"인증 도장에 외곽 배차를 묶음"},{"from":"허서겸","type":"계약","to":"최은재","basis":"최은재의 인증 도장이 떨어지면 출고를 잠그며"},{"from":"제라온","type":"스승과 제자","to":"최은재","basis":"최은재의 인증 범위를 원장으로 옮기는 스승과 제자에 가깝고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0060', 'c774-c5f0-c548-674e', '{"id":"person-0060","name":"Yi Bomgyeol","title":"Disaster Prevention Chief","position":"Disaster Prevention Chief","characterId":"K060","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Disaster Alert & Lockdown","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#inmul-ibomgyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0060","birthDate":"2088-09-24","birthday":"09-24","age":38,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"alarm","name":"Alarm and closure coordination","rating":65},{"id":"hearing","name":"Witness confrontation","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"alarm-based-decisions","name":"Alarm-Based Decisions","description":"Lee Bomgyeol acts boldly but follows unmanned-monitor alarms before human intuition.","behavior":"He shares alarm zones with resident representatives and does not deploy to the outskirts without Im Sion’s monitoring records.","stress":"If blockade teams risk turning toward imprisoning researchers, he may give greater weight to deployment evidence and shared alarms.","relationship":"When an outer-area deployment needs justification, he may rely on Im Sion’s records while protecting Kim Doha’s evacuation routes.","effects":[]},{"id":"release-conditions-observed","name":"Release Conditions Observed","description":"Lee Bomgyeol ties blockade release to sample approval by the safety reviewer.","behavior":"He announces blockade release only when the safety reviewer’s samples pass.","stress":"If the blockade network risks becoming a tool for confining researchers, he may seek to keep release decisions bound to safety-review conditions.","relationship":"Without Jeong Harin’s sample approval, he may uphold the reviewer’s veto rather than lift the blockade independently.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He shares alarms and releases closures only after samples pass. Field coordination is evident; armed support does not establish elite personal combat.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c774-c5f0-c548-674e","name":"Yeonan I Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c774-c5f0-c548-674e.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":30,"Force":-30,"Material":20,"Communal":-5,"Principle":40,"Public":30,"Eligibility":35,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":-40,"Display":-25,"Sustained":-20,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Disaster Alert & Lockdown","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Disaster Prevention Chief","Duty":"Godeok 1-dong. I Bomgyeol checks gate alarms against Kim Doha''s evacuation routes and does not announce the lifting of a lockdown before Jeong Harin''s sample passes.","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material 20 | Communal −5 | Principle 40 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 35 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving 40 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −40 | Display −25 | Persistence −20 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 generation. Raised on waiting-hall duty. I Bomgyeol checks gate alarms against Kim Doha''s evacuation routes and does not announce the lifting of a lockdown before Jeong Harin''s sample passes.\n- Duty: Godeok 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Disaster Prevention Chief. Shares alarm zones with the residents'' representative, and declares a lockdown lifted only at the same moment the safety examiner''s sample passes.","Anecdote":"In 2125, when two witnesses'' accounts diverged, opened a public confrontation.","Relationships":"Stands in a command relationship that backs Jeong Harin''s veto with force, protects Kim Doha''s residents'' evacuation routes by oath, and does not dispatch to the outer districts without Im Sion''s monitoring records.","Ambition":"Binds the Godeok gate and the research buildings into a single Disaster Prevention Corps lockdown network, making the abduction of engineers physically impossible.","Fear":"That the facility lockdown squad will turn toward confining researchers, making the Joint Technology Ledger another name for a prison.","Intervention":"Can bring evidence of a foiled abduction to justify a lockdown, or expose records of the lockdown squad confining researchers."},"biography":"Bold, but follows the alarms of the unmanned monitors ahead of human intuition. Takes no pride in a lockdown, and regards a late lockdown as a sin.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Disaster Alert & Lockdown\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Disaster Prevention Chief\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 generation. Raised on waiting-hall duty. I Bomgyeol checks gate alarms against Kim Doha''s evacuation routes and does not announce the lifting of a lockdown before Jeong Harin''s sample passes.\n- Duty: Godeok 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Disaster Prevention Chief. Shares alarm zones with the residents'' representative, and declares a lockdown lifted only at the same moment the safety examiner''s sample passes.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, when two witnesses'' accounts diverged, opened a public confrontation.\n\n**Relationships.** Stands in a command relationship that backs Jeong Harin''s veto with force, protects Kim Doha''s residents'' evacuation routes by oath, and does not dispatch to the outer districts without Im Sion''s monitoring records.\n\n**Ambition.** Binds the Godeok gate and the research buildings into a single Disaster Prevention Corps lockdown network, making the abduction of engineers physically impossible.\n\n**Fear.** That the facility lockdown squad will turn toward confining researchers, making the Joint Technology Ledger another name for a prison.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring evidence of a foiled abduction to justify a lockdown, or expose records of the lockdown squad confining researchers.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material 20 | Communal −5 | Principle 40 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 35 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −40 | Display −25 | Persistence −20 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Monogamous\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1005","name":"Jeong Seoon","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"Direct Subordinate","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K060","members":[{"personId":"K069","name":"Chae Bom"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yi Bomgyeol","type":"Command","to":"Jeong Harin","basis":"Backing the Reviewer''s Veto with Force"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Chae Bom","type":"Command","to":"Yi Bomgyeol","basis":"Receives orders to keep trimming, at the gate, the wick of the lockdown lamp that I Bomgyeol lit,"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0060","name":"이봄결","title":"방재대장","position":"방재대장","characterId":"K060","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"방재 경보·봉쇄","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-이봄결","detailRoute":"/people/person-0060","birthDate":"2088-09-24","birthday":"09-24","age":38,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"alarm","name":"경보·봉쇄 조정","rating":65},{"id":"hearing","name":"증인 대질 진행","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"alarm-based-decisions","name":"경보에 따른 결단","description":"이봄결은 대담하게 움직이되 사람의 직감보다 무인 감시기의 경보를 따른다.","behavior":"경보 구간을 주민대표와 공유하고 임시온의 감시 기록 없이는 외곽 출동을 하지 않는다.","stress":"봉쇄조가 연구자를 가두는 쪽으로 돌아설 우려가 있다면 출동 근거와 경보 공유를 더 중시할 수 있다.","relationship":"외곽 출동의 근거가 필요하다면 임시온의 감시 기록에 의존하고 김도하의 대피 경로를 지키려 할 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"release-conditions-observed","name":"해제 조건 준수","description":"이봄결은 봉쇄 해제를 안전심사관의 표본 합격에 묶는다.","behavior":"안전심사관의 표본이 합격하는 때에만 봉쇄 해제를 선언한다.","stress":"봉쇄망이 연구자를 가두는 장치가 될 우려가 있다면 해제 판단을 안전심사 조건에 계속 묶으려 할 수 있다.","relationship":"정하린의 표본 판정이 내려지지 않았다면 그 거부권을 받치며 독자적으로 봉쇄를 풀지 않을 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"경보를 공유하고 표본 합격 뒤에만 봉쇄를 푼다. 현장 조직은 확인되지만 무력 지원 표현만으로 고급 개인 전투를 부여하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c774-c5f0-c548-674e","name":"연안 이씨","crest":"clan-crests/c774-c5f0-c548-674e.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":30,"무력":-30,"물질":20,"공동":-5,"원칙":40,"공개":30,"자격":35,"분산":15,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":5,"위험":-40,"과시":-25,"지속":-20,"지향":"동성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"방재 경보·봉쇄","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"방재대장","업무":"고덕1동. 이봄결은 관문 경보를 김도하의 대피 경로에 대조하고 정하린의 표본 합격 전에는 봉쇄 해제를 알리지 않는다.","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 20 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 40 | 공개 30 | 자격 35 | 분산 15 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 5 | 위험 −40 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 이봄결은 관문 경보를 김도하의 대피 경로에 대조하고 정하린의 표본 합격 전에는 봉쇄 해제를 알리지 않는다.\n- 업무: 고덕1동.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 방재대장. 경보 구간을 주민대표와 공유하고, 봉쇄 해제는 안전심사관의 표본 합격과 동시에만 선언한다.","일화":"2125년 증인 두 명의 말이 갈라지자 공개 대질을 열었다.","관계":"정하린의 거부권을 무력으로 받치는 지휘 관계이고, 김도하의 주민 대피 경로를 맹세로 지키며, 임시온의 감시 기록 없이는 외곽 출동을 하지 않는다.","야망":"고덕 관문과 연구동을 방재대 단일 봉쇄망으로 묶어, 기술자 납치가 물리적으로 불가능하게 만든다.","공포":"시설 봉쇄조가 연구자를 가두는 쪽으로 돌아서 공동기술원장이 감옥의 다른 이름이 되는 것.","개입":"납치 미수 증거를 가져와 봉쇄를 정당화하거나, 봉쇄조가 연구자를 가둔 기록을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"대담하되 무인 감시기의 경보를 사람의 직감보다 먼저 따른다. 봉쇄를 자랑으로 여기지 않고, 늦은 봉쇄를 죄로 여긴다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 방재 경보·봉쇄\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 방재대장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 이봄결은 관문 경보를 김도하의 대피 경로에 대조하고 정하린의 표본 합격 전에는 봉쇄 해제를 알리지 않는다.\n- 업무: 고덕1동.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 방재대장. 경보 구간을 주민대표와 공유하고, 봉쇄 해제는 안전심사관의 표본 합격과 동시에만 선언한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 증인 두 명의 말이 갈라지자 공개 대질을 열었다.\n\n**관계.** 정하린의 거부권을 무력으로 받치는 지휘 관계이고, 김도하의 주민 대피 경로를 맹세로 지키며, 임시온의 감시 기록 없이는 외곽 출동을 하지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 고덕 관문과 연구동을 방재대 단일 봉쇄망으로 묶어, 기술자 납치가 물리적으로 불가능하게 만든다.\n\n**공포.** 시설 봉쇄조가 연구자를 가두는 쪽으로 돌아서 공동기술원장이 감옥의 다른 이름이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 납치 미수 증거를 가져와 봉쇄를 정당화하거나, 봉쇄조가 연구자를 가둔 기록을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 20 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 40 | 공개 30 | 자격 35 | 분산 15 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 5 | 위험 −40 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1005","name":"정서온","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"직속 부하","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K060","members":[{"personId":"K069","name":"채봄"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"이봄결","type":"지휘","to":"정하린","basis":"심사관 거부권을 무력으로 받침"}],"incoming":[{"from":"채봄","type":"지휘","to":"이봄결","basis":"이봄결이 켠 봉쇄 등잔의 심지를 관문에서 이어 깎는 지휘를 받고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0061', 'ae40-ac15-b989-91d1', '{"id":"person-0061","name":"Gim Doha","title":"Daechi-Godeok Residents'' Representative","position":"Daechi-Godeok Residents'' Representative","characterId":"K061","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Waiting Hall Duty","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#inmul-gimdoha","detailRoute":"/people/person-0061","birthDate":"2097-04-07","birthday":"04-07","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"water-board","name":"Shutter-check notice board management","rating":60},{"id":"trade","name":"Logistics under disclosed terms","rating":55},{"id":"referral","name":"Public-channel referral","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"minimum-living-standards","name":"Minimum Living Standards","description":"Kim Doha puts residents’ winter food and fuel minimums ahead of research output.","behavior":"She stops meetings when ration sheets are empty and puts ration-pot counts to a vote before research deployment numbers.","stress":"If word spreads that outside machines, drawn by light and heat, are nearing the alleys, she may demand light control and shutter checks even before the food and fuel minimums.","relationship":"When rumors of kidnapping and hostages spread, she syncs contact chains with neighboring families but agrees not to spread where people live.","effects":[]},{"id":"public-channels-first","name":"Public Channels First","description":"Kim Doha favors publicly reviewable procedures over private requests.","behavior":"She redirects private requests to public channels and posts evacuation routes and the shutter inspection times openly.","stress":"If the risk of neighbors being taken hostage grows, she may place greater weight on public notices and residents’ gatherings.","relationship":"She may strengthen her alliance with Jeong Hojun when residents’ part of the deliberation can be completed openly.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"When the food bins run low she stops meetings and counts out what can be shared first. Shutter-check sheets and food notices are her strengths; she has no military or combat experience.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11500-S03","name":{"ko":"Gangseo-gu District Directly Held Territory"},"holderPersonId":"K061","directLiegePersonId":"K029","stateId":"S03","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1150051000","name":"Yeomchang-dong"},{"id":"region:1150052000","name":"Deungchon 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1150053000","name":"Deungchon 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1150053500","name":"Deungchon 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1150054000","name":"Hwagok 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1150055000","name":"Hwagok 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1150056000","name":"Hwagok 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1150057000","name":"Hwagok 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1150059000","name":"Hwagok-bondong"},{"id":"region:1150059100","name":"Hwagok 6-dong"},{"id":"region:1150059300","name":"Hwagok 8-dong"},{"id":"region:1150060300","name":"Gayang 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1150060400","name":"Gayang 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1150060500","name":"Gayang 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1150061100","name":"Balsan 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1150061500","name":"Ujangsan-dong"},{"id":"region:1150062000","name":"Gonghang-dong"},{"id":"region:1150063000","name":"Banghwa 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1150064000","name":"Banghwa 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1150064100","name":"Banghwa 3-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11500-S03","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11500-S03","name":"Gangseo-gu District","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K061","basis":"Opening administrative scale group gu:11500(district) allocation · decisive candidate selection","stateId":"S03","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1150051000","region:1150052000","region:1150053000","region:1150053500","region:1150054000","region:1150055000","region:1150056000","region:1150057000","region:1150059000","region:1150059100","region:1150059300","region:1150060300","region:1150060400","region:1150060500","region:1150061100","region:1150061500","region:1150062000","region:1150063000","region:1150064000","region:1150064100"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s02","name":"Arc","holderPersonId":"K029"}}],"clan":{"id":"ae40-ac15-b989-91d1","name":"Gangneung Gim Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ae40-ac15-b989-91d1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":15,"Force":-25,"Material":0,"Communal":0,"Principle":60,"Public":40,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":20,"Display":30,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Waiting Hall Duty","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Daechi-Godeok Residents'' Representative","Duty":"Godeok 1-dong. Gim Doha aligns the Godeok Gate evacuation routes with Chae Bom''s patrol flags and postpones the decision to open until the residents return.","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 15 | Force −25 | Material 0 | Communal 0 | Principle 60 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 40 | Dispersion 25 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 20 | Display 30 | Endurance −10 | Orientation same-sex | Bonding multiple"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Raised on waiting-hall duty beside the Hwagok underground passage. Gim Doha posts shutter-check results and the number of food bins on the platform wall, and before the night patrol asks neighboring families how much fuel they have left.\n- Duty: Daechi 4-dong.\n- Duty: Godeok 1-dong. Gim Doha aligns the Godeok Gate evacuation routes with Chae Bom''s patrol flags and postpones the decision to open until the residents return.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Daechi-Godeok Residents'' Representative. She posts evacuation passages and shutter-check results publicly, and brings the number of food bins to the residents’ gathering before the number of research personnel.","Anecdote":"In 2125, returned a private solicitation and redirected it to the public window.","Relationships":"Shares winter food and fuel with neighboring families, takes turns on check duty, and joins in when a household suffers a kidnapping on the road.","Ambition":"Aims to let the residents’ gathering set the food and fuel minimum so that, however long the winter runs, the village is not held hostage.","Fear":"That on the day winter food and fuel run out, neighboring families will be taken hostage in exchange for something to eat.","Intervention":"She can break the dispatch freeze by arranging a substitute food convoy, or strengthen the residents'' veto by uncovering the secret agreement to hand over the register."},"biography":"She speaks of practical gain, but asks about the fuel left in neighbors’ kitchens before research talk. Even on days she shows off her knowledge, she halts the meeting if the food bins run empty.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Waiting Hall Duty\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Daechi-Godeok Residents'' Representative\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Raised on waiting-hall duty beside the Hwagok underground passage. Gim Doha posts shutter-check results and the number of food bins on the platform wall, and before the night patrol asks neighboring families how much fuel they have left.\n- Duty: Daechi 4-dong.\n- Duty: Godeok 1-dong. Gim Doha aligns the Godeok Gate evacuation routes with Chae Bom''s patrol flags and postpones the decision to open until the residents return.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Daechi-Godeok Residents'' Representative. She posts evacuation passages and shutter-check results publicly, and brings the number of food bins to the residents’ gathering before the number of research personnel.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, returned a private solicitation and redirected it to the public window.\n\n**Relations.** Shares winter food and fuel with neighboring families, takes turns on check duty, and joins in when a household suffers a kidnapping on the road.\n\n**Ambition.** Aims to let the residents’ gathering set the food and fuel minimum so that, however long the winter runs, the village is not held hostage.\n\n**Fear.** That on the day winter food and fuel run out, neighboring families will be taken hostage in exchange for something to eat.\n\n**Intervention.** She can break the dispatch freeze by arranging a substitute food convoy, or strengthen the residents'' veto by uncovering the secret agreement to hand over the register.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 15 | Force −25 | Material 0 | Communal 0 | Principle 60 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 40 | Dispersion 25 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 20 | Display 30 | Endurance −10 | Orientation same-sex | Bonding multiple\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1005","name":"Jeong Seoon","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"Direct Subordinate","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K061","members":[{"personId":"K073","name":"Byeon Taeon"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gim Doha","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Completes the three-part deliberation on the residents'' side"},{"from":"Gim Doha","type":"Contract","to":"Han Jion","basis":"Exchanges food for refugees with news of shutter checks"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Chae Bom","type":"Oath","to":"Gim Doha","basis":"He swears to hold back the whistle until Gim Doha''s flag returns from the alley"},{"from":"Byeon Taeon","type":"Command","to":"Gim Doha","basis":"Enforcing Gim Doha''s residents'' veto at the concourse, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0061","name":"김도하","title":"대치·고덕 주민대표","position":"대치·고덕 주민대표","characterId":"K061","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"대합실 당직","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-김도하","detailRoute":"/people/person-0061","birthDate":"2097-04-07","birthday":"04-07","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"water-board","name":"셔터 점검 게시판 운영","rating":60},{"id":"trade","name":"공개 조건 물류 거래","rating":55},{"id":"referral","name":"공개 창구 안내","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"minimum-living-standards","name":"생활 최저선","description":"김도하는 연구 성과보다 주민의 겨울 식량과 연료 최저선을 우선한다.","behavior":"배급표가 비면 회의를 멈추고 연구 파견 인원보다 배급 솥 숫자를 먼저 표결에 올린다.","stress":"밖의 기계가 불빛과 열에 끌려 골목 가까이 온다는 소식이 돌면, 식량·연료 최저선보다 먼저 불빛 단속과 셔터 점검을 요구할 수 있다.","relationship":"납치와 인질 소문이 돌면 이웃 가족과 연락망을 맞추되, 사는 집의 위치는 함부로 퍼뜨리지 않기로 한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"public-channels-first","name":"공개 창구 우선","description":"김도하는 사적 청탁보다 주민이 확인할 수 있는 공개 절차를 중시한다.","behavior":"사적 청탁을 공개 창구로 돌리고 대피 경로와 셔터 점검 시각을 공개 게시한다.","stress":"이웃이 인질로 잡혀 갈 우려가 커지면 공개 게시와 주민 모임을 더 중시할 수 있다.","relationship":"주민 쪽 심의를 공개적으로 완성할 수 있다면 정호준과의 동맹을 강화할 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"식량 통이 비면 회의를 멈추고 나눠 줄 양부터 센다. 셔터 점검표와 식량 게시가 강점이며 군사·전투 경력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11500-S03","name":{"ko":"강서구 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K061","directLiegePersonId":"K029","stateId":"S03","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1150051000","name":"염창동"},{"id":"region:1150052000","name":"등촌1동"},{"id":"region:1150053000","name":"등촌2동"},{"id":"region:1150053500","name":"등촌3동"},{"id":"region:1150054000","name":"화곡1동"},{"id":"region:1150055000","name":"화곡2동"},{"id":"region:1150056000","name":"화곡3동"},{"id":"region:1150057000","name":"화곡4동"},{"id":"region:1150059000","name":"화곡본동"},{"id":"region:1150059100","name":"화곡6동"},{"id":"region:1150059300","name":"화곡8동"},{"id":"region:1150060300","name":"가양1동"},{"id":"region:1150060400","name":"가양2동"},{"id":"region:1150060500","name":"가양3동"},{"id":"region:1150061100","name":"발산1동"},{"id":"region:1150061500","name":"우장산동"},{"id":"region:1150062000","name":"공항동"},{"id":"region:1150063000","name":"방화1동"},{"id":"region:1150064000","name":"방화2동"},{"id":"region:1150064100","name":"방화3동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11500-S03","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11500-S03","name":"강서구","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K061","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11500(district) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S03","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1150051000","region:1150052000","region:1150053000","region:1150053500","region:1150054000","region:1150055000","region:1150056000","region:1150057000","region:1150059000","region:1150059100","region:1150059300","region:1150060300","region:1150060400","region:1150060500","region:1150061100","region:1150061500","region:1150062000","region:1150063000","region:1150064000","region:1150064100"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s02","name":"Arc","holderPersonId":"K029"}}],"clan":{"id":"ae40-ac15-b989-91d1","name":"강릉 김씨","crest":"clan-crests/ae40-ac15-b989-91d1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":15,"무력":-25,"물질":0,"공동":0,"원칙":60,"공개":40,"자격":40,"분산":25,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":10,"위험":20,"과시":30,"지속":-10,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"대합실 당직","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"대치·고덕 주민대표","업무":"고덕1동. 김도하는 고덕 관문 대피 경로를 채봄의 순찰 깃발과 맞추고 주민이 돌아올 때까지 개방 결정을 미룬다.","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 15 | 무력 −25 | 물질 0 | 공동 0 | 원칙 60 | 공개 40 | 자격 40 | 분산 25 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 10 | 위험 20 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 화곡 지하 통로 옆 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 김도하는 승강장 벽에 셔터 점검 결과와 식량 통 수를 게시하고, 야간 순찰 전에 이웃 가족의 연료 남은 양을 묻는다.\n- 업무: 대치4동.\n- 업무: 고덕1동. 김도하는 고덕 관문 대피 경로를 채봄의 순찰 깃발과 맞추고 주민이 돌아올 때까지 개방 결정을 미룬다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 대치·고덕 주민대표. 대피 통로와 셔터 점검 결과를 공개 게시하고, 연구 인원 수보다 식량 통 수를 먼저 주민 모임에 올린다.","일화":"2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다.","관계":"이웃 가족과 겨울 식량·연료를 서로 나누고 점검 당번을 번갈아 서며, 이동 중 납치를 당한 집이 생기면 함께 나선다.","야망":"주민 모임이 식량·연료 최저선을 정하게 해, 겨울이 길어져도 마을이 볼모가 되지 않게 한다.","공포":"겨울 식량과 연료가 바닥난 날, 먹을 것을 대가로 이웃 가족이 인질로 끌려가는 것.","개입":"대체 식량 호송을 성사시켜 파견 동결을 풀거나, 명부 양도 밀약을 찾아 주민 거부권을 강화할 수 있다."},"biography":"실리를 말하되 연구 이야기보다 이웃 부엌에 남은 연료를 먼저 묻는다. 지식을 자랑하는 날에도 식량 통이 비면 회의를 중단시킨다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 대합실 당직\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 대치·고덕 주민대표\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 화곡 지하 통로 옆 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 김도하는 승강장 벽에 셔터 점검 결과와 식량 통 수를 게시하고, 야간 순찰 전에 이웃 가족의 연료 남은 양을 묻는다.\n- 업무: 대치4동.\n- 업무: 고덕1동. 김도하는 고덕 관문 대피 경로를 채봄의 순찰 깃발과 맞추고 주민이 돌아올 때까지 개방 결정을 미룬다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 대치·고덕 주민대표. 대피 통로와 셔터 점검 결과를 공개 게시하고, 연구 인원 수보다 식량 통 수를 먼저 주민 모임에 올린다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다.\n\n**관계.** 이웃 가족과 겨울 식량·연료를 서로 나누고 점검 당번을 번갈아 서며, 이동 중 납치를 당한 집이 생기면 함께 나선다.\n\n**야망.** 주민 모임이 식량·연료 최저선을 정하게 해, 겨울이 길어져도 마을이 볼모가 되지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 겨울 식량과 연료가 바닥난 날, 먹을 것을 대가로 이웃 가족이 인질로 끌려가는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대체 식량 호송을 성사시켜 파견 동결을 풀거나, 명부 양도 밀약을 찾아 주민 거부권을 강화할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 15 | 무력 −25 | 물질 0 | 공동 0 | 원칙 60 | 공개 40 | 자격 40 | 분산 25 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 10 | 위험 20 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1005","name":"정서온","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"직속 부하","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K061","members":[{"personId":"K073","name":"변태온"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"김도하","type":"계약","to":"정호준","basis":"삼원 심의를 주민 쪽에서 완성"},{"from":"김도하","type":"계약","to":"한지온","basis":"피난 온 사람들의 식량과 셔터 점검 소식을 맞바꿈"}],"incoming":[{"from":"채봄","type":"맹세","to":"김도하","basis":"김도하의 깃발이 골목에서 돌아올 때까지 호각을 참기로 맹세한다"},{"from":"변태온","type":"지휘","to":"김도하","basis":"김도하의 주민 거부권을 대합실에서 집행하고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0062', 'c720-ac15-b989', '{"id":"person-0062","name":"Yu Minho","title":"Godeok Base Stabling and Dispatch Chief","position":"Godeok Base Stabling and Dispatch Chief","characterId":"K062","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Siding Dispatch","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#inmul-yu-minho","detailRoute":"/people/person-0062","birthDate":"2102-06-01","birthday":"06-01","age":24,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"dispatch","name":"Freight-car sequencing","rating":65},{"id":"parts","name":"Defective-parts dispatch inspection","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"no-disguised-cargo","name":"No Disguised Cargo","description":"Yu Minho rejects orders to disguise research materials as military cargo.","behavior":"He withholds suspected weapons wagons unless both certification stamps and review seals are present.","stress":"","relationship":"He may maintain certification-linked dispatch cooperation with Choi Eunjae.","effects":[]},{"id":"transparent-dispatch","name":"Transparent Dispatch","description":"Yu Minho makes dispatch reviewable by publishing the order of research, disaster-response, and resident cargo.","behavior":"He publishes cargo order daily and returned a defective-parts box identified just before shipment.","stress":"He may seek to preserve published priorities and certification standards.","relationship":"Kim Doha’s demands to prioritize household-ration wagons may create tension over the published dispatch order.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He publishes freight order and returns defective boxes. Track vibration imagery is not supernatural perception; dispatch and inspection are supported.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c720-ac15-b989","name":"Gangneung Yu Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c720-ac15-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-5,"Openness":25,"Force":-35,"Material":20,"Communal":5,"Principle":45,"Public":30,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":5,"Display":5,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Siding Dispatch","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Godeok Base Stabling and Dispatch Chief","Duty":"Godeok 1-dong. At Godeok Base, Yu Minho publishes the order of research, disaster-prevention, and residents'' cargo, and does not couple any suspect wagon that lacks Choe Eunjae''s certification and Jeong Harin''s review.","Values":"Authority −5 | Openness 25 | Force −35 | Material 20 | Communal 5 | Principle 45 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly −40 | Risk 5 | Display 5 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Heterosexual | Union Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"2126 generation. Grew up at Sinjeong Depot. Yu Minho publishes the order of research, disaster-prevention, and residents'' cargo at Godeok Base, and does not couple any suspect wagon that lacks Choe Eunjae''s certification and Jeong Harin''s review.\n- Duties: Godeok 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Godeok Base Stabling and Dispatch Chief. Publishes the order of research, disaster-prevention, and residents'' cargo daily, and does not release a suspected weapons wagon unless it has both a certification stamp and a review seal.","Anecdote":"In 2125, sent back a box of defective parts just before release.","Relationships":"A contract tying dispatch to Choe Eunjae''s certification stamp; shares dispatch time with Bak Taegyeom''s Seoul relay window; and contends with Kim Doha''s pressure to prioritize residential ration wagons.","Ambition":"To turn western Seoul''s transport and the Godeok stabling tracks so that only technically certified cargo travels, becoming an artery of the Joint Technical Ledger.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can expose the real owner of a disguised wagon."},"biography":"Taciturn, reads a train''s lies through the vibration of the rails. Hears an order to disguise research supplies as a military supply wagon as an insult.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Siding Dispatch\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Godeok Base Stabling and Dispatch Chief\n**Life.** 2126 generation. Grew up at Sinjeong Depot. Yu Minho publishes the order of research, disaster-prevention, and residents'' cargo at Godeok Base, and does not couple any suspect wagon that lacks Choe Eunjae''s certification and Jeong Harin''s review.\n- Duties: Godeok 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Godeok Base Stabling and Dispatch Chief. Publishes the order of research, disaster-prevention, and residents'' cargo daily, and does not release a suspected weapons wagon unless it has both a certification stamp and a review seal.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, sent back a box of defective parts just before release.\n\n**Relationships.** A contract tying dispatch to Choe Eunjae''s certification stamp; shares dispatch time with Bak Taegyeom''s Seoul relay window; and contends with Kim Doha''s pressure to prioritize residential ration wagons.\n\n**Ambition.** To turn western Seoul''s transport and the Godeok stabling tracks so that only technically certified cargo travels, becoming an artery of the Joint Technical Ledger.\n\n**Intervention.** Can expose the real owner of a disguised wagon.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −5 | Openness 25 | Force −35 | Material 20 | Communal 5 | Principle 45 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly −40 | Risk 5 | Display 5 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Heterosexual | Union Monogamous\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1005","name":"Jeong Seoon","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"Direct Subordinate","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K062","members":[{"personId":"K074","name":"Heo Miri"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yu Minho","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Eunjae","basis":"Ties outer-district dispatch to the certification seal"},{"from":"Yu Minho","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Splits the relay window and outbound trains"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Heo Seogyeom","type":"Contract","to":"Yu Minho","basis":"A contract that backs Yu Minho''s dispatch order with maintenance, and"},{"from":"Heo Miri","type":"Command","to":"Yu Minho","basis":"Receives command to enforce Yu Minho''s dispatch order with stabling chalk, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0062","name":"유민호","title":"고덕기지 유치·배차장","position":"고덕기지 유치·배차장","characterId":"K062","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"유치선 배차","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-유민호","detailRoute":"/people/person-0062","birthDate":"2102-06-01","birthday":"06-01","age":24,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"dispatch","name":"화차 순서 조정","rating":65},{"id":"parts","name":"불량 부품 출고 검사","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"no-disguised-cargo","name":"위장 화물 거부","description":"유민호는 연구 물자를 군수 화차로 위장하는 지시를 용납하지 않는다.","behavior":"무기가 의심되는 화차는 인증 도장과 심사 봉인이 모두 없으면 출고하지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"최은재의 인증에 배차를 묶는 협력을 유지할 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"transparent-dispatch","name":"배차 공개","description":"유민호는 연구·방재·주민 화물의 순서를 공개해 배차를 검증 가능하게 한다.","behavior":"화물 순서를 매일 공개하고 출고 직전 확인된 불량 부품 상자를 되돌려 보낸다.","stress":"공개 순서와 인증 기준을 유지하려 할 수 있다.","relationship":"김도하가 민가 배급 화차의 우선을 요구한다면 공개 배차 순서를 둘러싼 긴장이 생길 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"화물 순서를 매일 공개하고 불량 상자를 반송했다. 선로 진동 비유를 초감각으로 읽지 않고 실제 배차와 점검만 평가한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c720-ac15-b989","name":"강릉 유씨","crest":"clan-crests/c720-ac15-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-5,"개방":25,"무력":-35,"물질":20,"공동":5,"원칙":45,"공개":30,"자격":30,"분산":10,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-40,"위험":5,"과시":5,"지속":-15,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"유치선 배차","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"고덕기지 유치·배차장","업무":"고덕1동. 유민호는 고덕기지에서 연구·방재·주민 화물의 순서를 공개하고 최은재의 인증과 정하린의 심사가 빠진 의심 화차는 붙이지 않는다.","가치관":"권위 −5 | 개방 25 | 무력 −35 | 물질 20 | 공동 5 | 원칙 45 | 공개 30 | 자격 30 | 분산 10 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −40 | 위험 5 | 과시 5 | 지속 −15 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 유민호는 고덕기지에서 연구·방재·주민 화물의 순서를 공개하고 최은재의 인증과 정하린의 심사가 빠진 의심 화차는 붙이지 않는다.\n- 업무: 고덕1동.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 고덕기지 유치·배차장. 연구·방재·주민 화물의 순서를 매일 공개하고, 무기 의심 화차는 인증 도장과 심사 봉인이 둘 다 없으면 출고하지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다.","관계":"최은재의 인증 도장에 배차를 묶는 계약이고, 박태겸의 서울 중계 창구와 배차 시간을 나누며, 김도하의 민가 배급 화차를 우선하라는 압력과 경쟁한다.","야망":"서울 서부 교통과 고덕 유치선을 기술 인증 화물만 오가게 하여 공동기술원장의 동맥이 된다.","공포":"","개입":"위장 화차의 실화주를 밝힐 수 있다."},"biography":"과묵하고 선로 진동으로 열차의 거짓을 읽는다. 연구 물자를 군수 화차로 위장하는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 유치선 배차\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 고덕기지 유치·배차장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 유민호는 고덕기지에서 연구·방재·주민 화물의 순서를 공개하고 최은재의 인증과 정하린의 심사가 빠진 의심 화차는 붙이지 않는다.\n- 업무: 고덕1동.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 고덕기지 유치·배차장. 연구·방재·주민 화물의 순서를 매일 공개하고, 무기 의심 화차는 인증 도장과 심사 봉인이 둘 다 없으면 출고하지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다.\n\n**관계.** 최은재의 인증 도장에 배차를 묶는 계약이고, 박태겸의 서울 중계 창구와 배차 시간을 나누며, 김도하의 민가 배급 화차를 우선하라는 압력과 경쟁한다.\n\n**야망.** 서울 서부 교통과 고덕 유치선을 기술 인증 화물만 오가게 하여 공동기술원장의 동맥이 된다.\n\n**개입.** 위장 화차의 실화주를 밝힐 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −5 | 개방 25 | 무력 −35 | 물질 20 | 공동 5 | 원칙 45 | 공개 30 | 자격 30 | 분산 10 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −40 | 위험 5 | 과시 5 | 지속 −15 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K1005","name":"정서온","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"직속 부하","effectiveYear":2126},"court":{"id":"court:K062","members":[{"personId":"K074","name":"허미리"}]},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"유민호","type":"계약","to":"최은재","basis":"인증 도장에 외곽 배차를 묶음"},{"from":"유민호","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"중계 창구와 외곽 열차를 나눔"}],"incoming":[{"from":"허서겸","type":"계약","to":"유민호","basis":"유민호의 배차 순서를 정비로 받치는 계약이고"},{"from":"허미리","type":"지휘","to":"유민호","basis":"유민호의 배차 순서를 유치 분필로 집행하는 지휘를 받고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0063', 'bc15-bc00-c591', '{"id":"person-0063","name":"Bak Jinsol","title":"Original Seed Vault Climate Software Chief","position":"Original Seed Vault Climate Software Chief","characterId":"K063","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Climate-Control Software for the Government''s Original Seed Vault","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#inmul-bakjinsol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0063","birthDate":"2067-11-09","birthday":"11-09","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"seed","name":"Temperature and seed-release checks","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"no-record-gaps","name":"No Record Gaps","description":"Park Jinsol tolerates no gaps in seed-preservation temperature and humidity records.","behavior":"She leaves boxes with interrupted temperature logs untouched even under wartime requisition and requires two approvals for release.","stress":"If power loss threatens to turn the repository into a plunder storehouse, she may enforce temperature logs and release conditions more strictly.","relationship":"If Jeong Harin locks down removal, she may follow that decision in accordance with the dual-approval rule.","effects":[]},{"id":"no-seed-trading","name":"No Seed Trading","description":"Park Jinsol views seeds as a shared preservation asset rather than military bargaining stock.","behavior":"She rejects treating seeds as military bargaining stock and seeks to establish the seed ledger as a public asset.","stress":"She may prioritize preservation controls over trade.","relationship":"She may turn hostile if Nam Yungyeong’s price ledger begins assigning market prices to seeds.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Original Seed Vault Climate Software Chief.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc15-bc00-c591","name":"Miryang Bak Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc15-bc00-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-5,"Openness":20,"Force":-30,"Material":0,"Communal":0,"Principle":55,"Public":30,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":30,"Display":15,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Climate-Control Software for the Government''s Original Seed Vault","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Original Seed Vault Climate Software Chief","Duty":"Daechi 1-dong. Bak Jinsol judges the release of seed boxes only after cross-checking the vault temperature log against the two seals of the residents'' representative and the safety review.","Values":"Authority −5 | Openness 20 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Communal 0 | Principle 55 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 0 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 30 | Display 15 | Persistence −5 | Orientation Bisexual | Union None"},"sections":{"Life":"2126 generation. Grew up on waiting-room duty. Bak Jinsol judges the release of seed boxes only after cross-checking the vault temperature log against the two seals of the residents'' representative and the safety review.\n- Duties: Daechi 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Original Seed Vault Climate Software Chief. Recognizes release only with the double seal of the residents'' representative and the safety review, and does not touch a box whose temperature log has been cut off, even under a wartime requisition document.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Upholds Jeong Hojun''s knowledge-sharing oath on the seed side, submits to Jeong Harin''s removal lock, and turns to resentment if Nam Yungyeong''s price ledger begins to set seed market prices.","Ambition":"To raise the seed ledger to a public asset of the Joint Technical Ledger, so that no negotiating party can monopolize the genes of a year''s harvest.","Fear":"That if a power outage kills the cold storage, the vault will turn into a plunder warehouse.","Intervention":"By matching Bak Jinsol''s cold-storage voltage chart against each box''s temperature log, you can confirm grounds for halting unverified seed removal."},"biography":"Patient and tolerates not even one blank cell in the temperature-humidity records. Sees anyone who calls seeds a bargaining chip for military provisions as a thief.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Climate-Control Software for the Government''s Original Seed Vault\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Original Seed Vault Climate Software Chief\n**Life.** 2126 generation. Grew up on waiting-room duty. Bak Jinsol judges the release of seed boxes only after cross-checking the vault temperature log against the two seals of the residents'' representative and the safety review.\n- Duties: Daechi 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Original Seed Vault Climate Software Chief. Recognizes release only with the double seal of the residents'' representative and the safety review, and does not touch a box whose temperature log has been cut off, even under a wartime requisition document.\n\n**Relationships.** Upholds Jeong Hojun''s knowledge-sharing oath on the seed side, submits to Jeong Harin''s removal lock, and turns to resentment if Nam Yungyeong''s price ledger begins to set seed market prices.\n\n**Ambition.** To raise the seed ledger to a public asset of the Joint Technical Ledger, so that no negotiating party can monopolize the genes of a year''s harvest.\n\n**Fear.** That if a power outage kills the cold storage, the vault will turn into a plunder warehouse.\n\n**Intervention.** By matching Bak Jinsol''s cold-storage voltage chart against each box''s temperature log, you can confirm grounds for halting unverified seed removal.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −5 | Openness 20 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Communal 0 | Principle 55 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 0 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 30 | Display 15 | Persistence −5 | Orientation Bisexual | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bak Jinsol","type":"Oath","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Keeps the knowledge-sharing oath by carrying out seed stock"},{"from":"Bak Jinsol","type":"Grudge","to":"Nam Yun-gyeong","basis":"Grudge over pricing seeds in the price ledger"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Yang Reum-tae","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Jinsol","basis":"Yang Reumtae hands Bak Jinsol the times and box numbers of the severed temperature-humidity records. Bak Jinsol checks those boxes so that supplies from the stretch without a temperature log are not passed along as a normal release."},{"from":"Gwak Gangho","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Jinsol","basis":"Gwak Gangho reads aloud, in front of Bak Jinsol, a copy in which the seed records have been cross-checked against the list to be entered in the Joint Technical Ledger. Bak Jinsol verifies the items and preservation records so that the seed prices in the price ledger and the actual storage list are not mixed up."},{"from":"Seo Dolseo","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Jinsol","basis":"Seo Dolseo reports to Bak Jinsol the boxes whose temperature logs were cut off and their removal-lock numbers. Bak Jinsol checks the preservation records of those boxes so that unverified boxes are not released, even with a wartime requisition document."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0063","name":"박진솔","title":"원종 보존고 온습도 전산 책임자","position":"원종 보존고 온습도 전산 책임자","characterId":"K063","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"정부 원종 보존고 온습도 전산 관리","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-박진솔","detailRoute":"/people/person-0063","birthDate":"2067-11-09","birthday":"11-09","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"seed","name":"온습도·종자 출고 확인","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"no-record-gaps","name":"기록 공백 불허","description":"박진솔은 종자 보존의 온습도 기록에 한 칸의 공백도 허용하지 않는다.","behavior":"온도 로그가 끊긴 상자는 전시 징발 문서가 있어도 손대지 않고 출고에는 이중 날인을 요구한다.","stress":"전력 단절이 보존고를 약탈 창고로 만들 우려가 있다면 온도 로그와 반출 조건을 더 엄격히 지킬 수 있다.","relationship":"정하린이 반출을 잠근다면 이중 날인 원칙에 따라 그 결정을 따를 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"no-seed-trading","name":"종자 거래 거부","description":"박진솔은 종자를 군량 협상물이 아닌 공동의 보존 자산으로 본다.","behavior":"씨앗을 군량 협상물로 부르는 태도를 배척하고 종자 원장을 공개 자산으로 올리려 한다.","stress":"거래보다 보존 통제를 우선할 수 있다.","relationship":"남윤경의 가격 원장이 종자 시세를 매기기 시작한다면 적대적으로 돌아설 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 원종 보존고 온습도 전산 책임자.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc15-bc00-c591","name":"밀양 박씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc15-bc00-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-5,"개방":20,"무력":-30,"물질":0,"공동":0,"원칙":55,"공개":30,"자격":45,"분산":0,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-20,"위험":30,"과시":15,"지속":-5,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"정부 원종 보존고 온습도 전산 관리","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"원종 보존고 온습도 전산 책임자","업무":"대치1동. 박진솔은 보존고 온도 로그와 주민대표·안전심사의 두 날인을 대조한 뒤에야 종자 상자 출고를 판단한다.","가치관":"권위 −5 | 개방 20 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 0 | 원칙 55 | 공개 30 | 자격 45 | 분산 0 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −20 | 위험 30 | 과시 15 | 지속 −5 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 박진솔은 보존고 온도 로그와 주민대표·안전심사의 두 날인을 대조한 뒤에야 종자 상자 출고를 판단한다.\n- 업무: 대치1동.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 원종 보존고 온습도 전산 책임자. 출고는 주민대표와 안전심사의 이중 날인만 인정하고, 전시 징발 문서라도 온도 로그가 끊긴 상자에는 손을 대지 않는다.","일화":"","관계":"정호준의 지식 공유 맹세를 종자 쪽에서 지키고, 정하린의 반출 잠금에 복종하며, 남윤경의 가격 원장이 종자 시세를 매기기 시작하면 원한으로 돌아선다.","야망":"종자 원장을 공동기술원장의 공개 자산으로 올려, 어느 교섭 상대도 한 해 농사의 유전자를 독점하지 못하게 한다.","공포":"전력 단절로 냉온고가 죽으면 보존고가 약탈 창고로 바뀌는 것.","개입":"박진솔의 냉온고 전압표와 상자별 온도 로그를 맞춰 미확인 종자 반출을 멈추는 근거를 확인할 수 있다."},"biography":"인내심이 길고 온습도 기록의 한 칸 빈칸도 용납하지 않는다. 씨앗을 군량 협상물로 부르는 사람을 도둑으로 본다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 정부 원종 보존고 온습도 전산 관리\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 원종 보존고 온습도 전산 책임자\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 박진솔은 보존고 온도 로그와 주민대표·안전심사의 두 날인을 대조한 뒤에야 종자 상자 출고를 판단한다.\n- 업무: 대치1동.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 원종 보존고 온습도 전산 책임자. 출고는 주민대표와 안전심사의 이중 날인만 인정하고, 전시 징발 문서라도 온도 로그가 끊긴 상자에는 손을 대지 않는다.\n\n**관계.** 정호준의 지식 공유 맹세를 종자 쪽에서 지키고, 정하린의 반출 잠금에 복종하며, 남윤경의 가격 원장이 종자 시세를 매기기 시작하면 원한으로 돌아선다.\n\n**야망.** 종자 원장을 공동기술원장의 공개 자산으로 올려, 어느 교섭 상대도 한 해 농사의 유전자를 독점하지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 전력 단절로 냉온고가 죽으면 보존고가 약탈 창고로 바뀌는 것.\n\n**개입.** 박진솔의 냉온고 전압표와 상자별 온도 로그를 맞춰 미확인 종자 반출을 멈추는 근거를 확인할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −5 | 개방 20 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 0 | 원칙 55 | 공개 30 | 자격 45 | 분산 0 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −20 | 위험 30 | 과시 15 | 지속 −5 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"박진솔","type":"맹세","to":"정호준","basis":"지식 공유 맹세를 종자 반출로 지킴"},{"from":"박진솔","type":"원한","to":"남윤경","basis":"종자 시세를 가격 원장에 매기는 원한"}],"incoming":[{"from":"양름태","type":"계약","to":"박진솔","basis":"양름태는 끊긴 온습도 기록의 시각과 상자 번호를 박진솔에게 넘긴다. 박진솔은 해당 상자를 확인해 온도 로그가 없는 구간의 물자가 정상 출고로 넘어가지 않게 한다."},{"from":"곽강호","type":"계약","to":"박진솔","basis":"곽강호는 종자 기록과 공동기술원장에 올릴 목록을 대조한 사본을 박진솔 앞에서 읽는다. 박진솔은 품목과 보존 기록을 확인해 가격 원장의 종자 시세와 실제 보관 목록이 뒤섞이지 않게 한다."},{"from":"서돌서","type":"계약","to":"박진솔","basis":"서돌서는 온도 로그가 끊긴 상자와 반출 잠금 번호를 박진솔에게 올린다. 박진솔은 그 상자의 보존 기록을 확인해 전시 징발 문서가 있어도 미확인 상자를 출고하지 않는다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0064', 'c7a5-b2e8-c591-5f35', '{"id":"person-0064","name":"Jang Yerin","title":"Daechi Machine-Body Maintenance Duty","position":"Daechi Machine-Body Maintenance Duty","characterId":"K064","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Machine-Body Inspection and Repair","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#Person-Jang-Yerin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0064","birthDate":"2100-08-03","birthday":"08-03","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"water-test","name":"Sampling and reagent records","rating":65},{"id":"sample","name":"Sample-record review","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"one-pass-is-not-enough","name":"One Pass Is Not Enough","description":"Jang Yerin does not trust a machine body to be safe just because it moved once.","behavior":"He records sampling times and reagent lots and cross-checks Yeongdeungpo samples with Park Nuri.","stress":"If someone whose body stalls during an inspection gap might be found in an outside passage in midwinter, he may give greater weight to repeated inspections and cross-checks.","relationship":"He may draw on his sample-cross-checking alliance with Park Nuri when test reliability needs strengthening.","effects":[]},{"id":"inspection-over-schedules","name":"Inspection Over Schedules","description":"Jang Yerin persistently protects testing cycles against reductions demanded by political schedules.","behavior":"He tears up notes asking to shorten inspection cycles and immediately recommends that a body stop going outside when joint damage exceeds the limit.","stress":"He may seek to sustain verification despite scheduling pressure.","relationship":"While awaiting Han Somi’s sensor repairs, he may prioritize cooperation needed to keep the testing network operating.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He records sampling times and reagent lots and designed alternate verification. Repeated testing and alternatives are strengths, not a medical career.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c7a5-b2e8-c591-5f35","name":"Danyang Jang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c7a5-b2e8-c591-5f35.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-5,"Openness":30,"Force":-35,"Material":10,"Communal":-5,"Principle":45,"Public":40,"Eligibility":50,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-30,"Display":20,"Sustained":15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Machine-Body Inspection and Repair","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Daechi Machine-Body Maintenance Duty","Duty":"Daechi 1-dong. Jang Yerin checks Daechi residents’ machine-body joint wear and spare-part numbers against the inspection sheets, and recommends that any body exceeding the limit stop going outside.","Values":"Authority −5 | Openness 30 | Force −35 | Material 10 | Communal −5 | Principle 45 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 50 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Persistence 15 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up in the Daechi underground inspection room. Jang Yerin checks Daechi residents’ machine-body joint wear and spare-part numbers against the inspection sheets, and recommends that any body exceeding the limit stop going outside.\n- Duty: Daechi 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Daechi Machine-Body Maintenance Duty. Leaves inspection times and part numbers in a ledger anyone can read, and immediately recommends that any body exceeding the limit stop going outside.","Anecdote":"In 2125, refused permission to enter the sealed zone and designed a bypass verification.","Relationships":"Cross-checks inspection results with the maintenance staff of neighboring settlements, shares spare parts when sensor parts run short, and hesitates over whom to show the original inspection records.","Ambition":"To bind the machine-body inspection cycles of Daechi and neighboring settlements into a single public ledger, so that shortages of parts can be seen before winter.","Fear":"That inspections will stop, so that people whose bodies stall are found first in the winter outside passages and kidnappers exploit the gap.","Intervention":"Can bring sensor parts from Ttukseom to restore the testing network, or expose the note meant to hide the halt recommendation."},"biography":"Skeptical and tenacious; does not trust a machine body just because it moved once. Tears up the note telling him to shorten the inspection cycle to fit the winter schedule.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Machine-Body Inspection and Repair\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Daechi Machine-Body Maintenance Duty\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up in the Daechi underground inspection room. Jang Yerin checks Daechi residents’ machine-body joint wear and spare-part numbers against the inspection sheets, and recommends that any body exceeding the limit stop going outside.\n- Duty: Daechi 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Daechi Machine-Body Maintenance Duty. Leaves inspection times and part numbers in a ledger anyone can read, and immediately recommends that any body exceeding the limit stop going outside.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, refused permission to enter the sealed zone and designed a bypass verification.\n\n**Relationships.** Cross-checks inspection results with the maintenance staff of neighboring settlements, shares spare parts when sensor parts run short, and hesitates over whom to show the original inspection records.\n\n**Ambition.** To bind the machine-body inspection cycles of Daechi and neighboring settlements into a single public ledger, so that shortages of parts can be seen before winter.\n\n**Fear.** That inspections will stop, so that people whose bodies stall are found first in the winter outside passages and kidnappers exploit the gap.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring sensor parts from Ttukseom to restore the testing network, or expose the note meant to hide the halt recommendation.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −5 | Openness 30 | Force −35 | Material 10 | Communal −5 | Principle 45 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 50 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Persistence 15 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jang Yerin","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Nu-ri","basis":"Cross-verifies Yeongdeungpo samples"},{"from":"Jang Yerin","type":"Contract","to":"Han Somi","basis":"Entrusted the repair of the testing sensors to the Seongsu workshop"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Go Choyun","type":"Oath","to":"Jang Yerin","basis":"Backing Jang Yerin''s testing network operations with testimony,"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0064","name":"장예린","title":"대치 기계 몸 정비 담당","position":"대치 기계 몸 정비 담당","characterId":"K064","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"기계 몸 점검·수리","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-장예린","detailRoute":"/people/person-0064","birthDate":"2100-08-03","birthday":"08-03","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"water-test","name":"표본·시약 기록","rating":65},{"id":"sample","name":"표본 기록 심사","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"one-pass-is-not-enough","name":"한 번의 합격 불신","description":"장예린은 기계 몸이 한 번 움직였다는 이유만으로 안전하다고 믿지 않는다.","behavior":"표본 채취 시각과 시약 로트를 기록하고 박누리의 영등포 표본과 교차검증한다.","stress":"점검 공백 사이에 몸이 멈춘 사람이 한겨울 바깥 통로에서 발견될 우려가 있다면 반복 점검과 교차 확인을 더 중시할 수 있다.","relationship":"검사 결과의 신뢰성을 높여야 한다면 박누리와의 표본 교차검증 동맹을 활용할 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"inspection-over-schedules","name":"일정보다 검사","description":"장예린은 정치 일정에 맞춘 검사 축소보다 검증 주기를 지키는 데 집요하다.","behavior":"점검 주기를 줄이라는 쪽지를 찢고, 관절 손상이 기준을 넘으면 그 몸의 외출 중단을 바로 권고한다.","stress":"일정 압박에도 검증을 유지하려 할 수 있다.","relationship":"한소미의 센서 수리를 기다리는 상황이라면 검사망 유지에 필요한 협력을 중시할 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"표본 채취 시각과 시약 로트를 기록하고 봉인 구역의 우회 검증을 설계했다. 반복 검사와 대안 설계가 강점이며 의사 경력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c7a5-b2e8-c591-5f35","name":"단양 장씨","crest":"clan-crests/c7a5-b2e8-c591-5f35.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-5,"개방":30,"무력":-35,"물질":10,"공동":-5,"원칙":45,"공개":40,"자격":50,"분산":20,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":-30,"위험":-30,"과시":20,"지속":15,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"기계 몸 점검·수리","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"대치 기계 몸 정비 담당","업무":"대치1동. 장예린은 대치 거주자의 기계 몸 관절 마모와 예비 부품 번호를 점검표에 맞춰 보고, 기준을 넘은 몸은 외출 중단을 권고한다.","가치관":"권위 −5 | 개방 30 | 무력 −35 | 물질 10 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 45 | 공개 40 | 자격 50 | 분산 20 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대치 지하 점검실에서 자랐다. 장예린은 대치 거주자의 기계 몸 관절 마모와 예비 부품 번호를 점검표에 맞춰 보고, 기준을 넘은 몸은 외출 중단을 권고한다.\n- 업무: 대치1동.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 대치 기계 몸 정비 담당. 점검 시각과 부품 번호를 누구나 볼 수 있는 장부에 남기고, 기준을 넘는 몸은 외출 중단을 바로 권고한다.","일화":"2125년 봉인 구역 진입 허가를 거절하고 우회 검증을 설계했다.","관계":"이웃 거주지의 정비 담당과 점검 결과를 교차 확인하는 사이이고, 센서에 쓸 부품이 모자라 서로 남는 부품을 나누며, 점검 원본을 누구에게 보일지 망설인다.","야망":"대치와 이웃 거주지의 기계 몸 점검 주기를 하나의 공개 장부로 묶어, 부품이 어디서 모자라는지 겨울 전에 알 수 있게 한다.","공포":"점검이 멈추면 몸이 멈춘 사람이 먼저 겨울 바깥 통로에서 발견되고, 그 빈틈을 납치범이 노리는 것.","개입":"센서 부품을 뚝섬에서 가져와 검사망을 복구하거나, 중단 권고를 숨기려는 쪽지를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"회의적이고 끈질기며 한 번 움직였다는 이유로 기계 몸을 믿지 않는다. 겨울 일정에 맞춰 점검 주기를 줄이라는 쪽지를 찢어 버린다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 기계 몸 점검·수리\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 대치 기계 몸 정비 담당\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대치 지하 점검실에서 자랐다. 장예린은 대치 거주자의 기계 몸 관절 마모와 예비 부품 번호를 점검표에 맞춰 보고, 기준을 넘은 몸은 외출 중단을 권고한다.\n- 업무: 대치1동.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 대치 기계 몸 정비 담당. 점검 시각과 부품 번호를 누구나 볼 수 있는 장부에 남기고, 기준을 넘는 몸은 외출 중단을 바로 권고한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 봉인 구역 진입 허가를 거절하고 우회 검증을 설계했다.\n\n**관계.** 이웃 거주지의 정비 담당과 점검 결과를 교차 확인하는 사이이고, 센서에 쓸 부품이 모자라 서로 남는 부품을 나누며, 점검 원본을 누구에게 보일지 망설인다.\n\n**야망.** 대치와 이웃 거주지의 기계 몸 점검 주기를 하나의 공개 장부로 묶어, 부품이 어디서 모자라는지 겨울 전에 알 수 있게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 점검이 멈추면 몸이 멈춘 사람이 먼저 겨울 바깥 통로에서 발견되고, 그 빈틈을 납치범이 노리는 것.\n\n**개입.** 센서 부품을 뚝섬에서 가져와 검사망을 복구하거나, 중단 권고를 숨기려는 쪽지를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −5 | 개방 30 | 무력 −35 | 물질 10 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 45 | 공개 40 | 자격 50 | 분산 20 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"장예린","type":"계약","to":"박누리","basis":"영등포 표본을 교차검증"},{"from":"장예린","type":"계약","to":"한소미","basis":"검사 센서 수리를 성수 공방에 맡김"}],"incoming":[{"from":"고초윤","type":"맹세","to":"장예린","basis":"장예린의 검사망 운영을 증언으로 받치고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0065', 'c784-d3c9-d0dd-6797', '{"id":"person-0065","name":"Im Sion","title":"Research Records and Communications Archive Auditor","position":"Research Records and Communications Archive Auditor","characterId":"K065","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Research Records Audit","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#Person-Im-Sion","detailRoute":"/people/person-0065","birthDate":"2068-06-08","birthday":"06-08","age":58,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"audit","name":"Access-permit provenance audit","rating":65},{"id":"seal","name":"Seal and copy comparison","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stop-without-enough-witnesses","name":"Stop Without Enough Witnesses","description":"Im Sion requires two independent witnesses rather than allowing access on a safety-review stamp alone.","behavior":"She stops access supported by only one witness and traces the access permit’s issuance route.","stress":"If a forged permit could turn the archive into propaganda material, she may enforce witness requirements and issuance checks more strictly.","relationship":"She may refuse an access request lacking sufficient witnesses even when the requester shares Jeong Hojun’s reproducible-record principle.","effects":[]},{"id":"independent-original-preservation","name":"Independent Original Preservation","description":"Im Sion seeks to preserve verifiable originals separately from military oversight and propaganda uses.","behavior":"She moves military oversight documents to an external separate box and retains monitoring records as blockade evidence.","stress":"If forged documents threaten the verifiability of knowledge, she may prioritize original preservation and auditable lending records.","relationship":"She may cooperate with Choi Jiwoo when original preservation is threatened despite differences over publication timing.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She stopped access with missing witnesses and traced permit issuance. Record controls and provenance checks are supported, not cryptanalysis.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c784-d3c9-d0dd-6797","name":"Pyeongtaek Im Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c784-d3c9-d0dd-6797.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":20,"Force":-30,"Material":5,"Communal":-5,"Principle":70,"Public":45,"Eligibility":35,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-10,"Display":0,"Sustained":15,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Research Records Audit","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Research Records and Communications Archive Auditor","Duty":"Yangjae 1-dong. Im Sion matches the archive''s loan times against the viewing records of two independent witnesses, and if witnesses are short, she does not open the document.","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 20 | Force −30 | Material 5 | Communal −5 | Principle 70 | Publicity 45 | Qualification 35 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk −10 | Display 0 | Persistence 15 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Raised at the Seoul Station Registry. Im Sion matches the archive''s loan times against the viewing records of two independent witnesses, and if witnesses are short, she does not open the document.\n- Post: Yangjae 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Research Records and Communications Archive Auditor. A viewing requires two independent witnesses and a safety-review seal, and military oversight documents are driven out to a side locker outside the archive.","Anecdote":"A viewing pass bearing the safety-review seal but only one independent witness arrives at the Communications Archive counter. Im Sion halts the viewing and traces the pass''s issuance route back upstream, and moves the military oversight documents that came with it to a side locker outside the archive.","Relationships":"A contract that transfers Jeong Hojun''s principle of reproducible records into the ledger; she differs from Choe Jiu only on the timing of disclosure and is otherwise an ally in preserving originals; and she keeps Yi Bomgyeol''s surveillance records as evidence of the lockdown.","Ambition":"To turn access to research materials from a hostage exchange into an auditable loan ledger, and so open the archive of the Joint Technology Ledger.","Fear":"That a single forged viewing pass will turn the entire archive into a negotiator''s propaganda material and bring down verifiable knowledge.","Intervention":"She can recover the original key and reopen the archive, or expose the issuer of the forged viewing pass and shake the auditor''s standing."},"biography":"Cold and precise, she remembers even the loan time of a cryptographic key. She calls the unrecorded exchange of technology gifts theft, not diplomacy.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Research Records Audit\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Research Records and Communications Archive Auditor\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Raised at the Seoul Station Registry. Im Sion matches the archive''s loan times against the viewing records of two independent witnesses, and if witnesses are short, she does not open the document.\n- Post: Yangjae 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Research Records and Communications Archive Auditor. A viewing requires two independent witnesses and a safety-review seal, and military oversight documents are driven out to a side locker outside the archive.\n\n**Anecdote.** A viewing pass bearing the safety-review seal but only one independent witness arrives at the Communications Archive counter. Im Sion halts the viewing and traces the pass''s issuance route back upstream, and moves the military oversight documents that came with it to a side locker outside the archive.\n\n**Relations.** A contract that transfers Jeong Hojun''s principle of reproducible records into the ledger; she differs from Choe Jiu only on the timing of disclosure and is otherwise an ally in preserving originals; and she keeps Yi Bomgyeol''s surveillance records as evidence of the lockdown.\n\n**Ambition.** To turn access to research materials from a hostage exchange into an auditable loan ledger, and so open the archive of the Joint Technology Ledger.\n\n**Fear.** That a single forged viewing pass will turn the entire archive into a negotiator''s propaganda material and bring down verifiable knowledge.\n\n**Intervention.** She can recover the original key and reopen the archive, or expose the issuer of the forged viewing pass and shake the auditor''s standing.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 20 | Force −30 | Material 5 | Communal −5 | Principle 70 | Publicity 45 | Qualification 35 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk −10 | Display 0 | Persistence 15 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Im Sion","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Moves replication records into the ledger"},{"from":"Im Sion","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Allied in preserving originals, differing only on disclosure timing"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Pyo Jian","type":"Contract","to":"Im Sion","basis":"a contract that carries Im Sion''s loan times over into pouch weight, and"},{"from":"Je Raon","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Im Sion","basis":"backing Im Sion''s viewing lock with records,"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0065","name":"임시온","title":"연구기록·통신서고 감사관","position":"연구기록·통신서고 감사관","characterId":"K065","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"연구기록 감사","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-임시온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0065","birthDate":"2068-06-08","birthday":"06-08","age":58,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"audit","name":"열람증 발급 경로 감사","rating":65},{"id":"seal","name":"봉인·사본 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stop-without-enough-witnesses","name":"증인 부족에 중지","description":"임시온은 안전심사 날인만으로 열람을 허용하지 않고 독립 증인 두 명을 요구한다.","behavior":"증인이 한 명뿐인 열람을 멈추고 열람증의 발급 경로를 추적한다.","stress":"위조 열람증이 서고를 선전 자료로 바꿀 우려가 있다면 증인 요건과 발급 경로 확인을 더 엄격히 할 수 있다.","relationship":"열람 요청이 증인 요건을 채우지 못한다면 정호준의 재현 기록 원칙을 공유하더라도 허용하지 않을 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"independent-original-preservation","name":"원본 독립 보존","description":"임시온은 검증 가능한 원본을 군사 감독과 선전 용도에서 분리해 보존하려 한다.","behavior":"군사 감독 문서를 서고 바깥 별치함으로 옮기고 감시 기록을 봉쇄 증거로 보관한다.","stress":"위조 문서가 지식의 검증 가능성을 무너뜨릴 위험이 있다면 원본 보존과 감사 가능한 대여 기록을 우선할 수 있다.","relationship":"공개 시점에 의견이 달라도 원본 보존이 위협받는다면 최지우와 협력할 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"증인이 부족한 열람을 중지하고 발급 경로를 조사했다. 기록 통제와 추적을 평가하며 암호 해독 능력은 추가하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c784-d3c9-d0dd-6797","name":"평택 임씨","crest":"clan-crests/c784-d3c9-d0dd-6797.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":20,"무력":-30,"물질":5,"공동":-5,"원칙":70,"공개":45,"자격":35,"분산":5,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-15,"위험":-10,"과시":0,"지속":15,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"연구기록 감사","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"연구기록·통신서고 감사관","업무":"양재1동. 임시온은 서고 대여 시각과 두 독립 증인의 열람 기록을 맞추고 증인이 모자라면 문서를 열지 않는다.","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 20 | 무력 −30 | 물질 5 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 70 | 공개 45 | 자격 35 | 분산 5 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −10 | 과시 0 | 지속 15 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 임시온은 서고 대여 시각과 두 독립 증인의 열람 기록을 맞추고 증인이 모자라면 문서를 열지 않는다.\n- 업무: 양재1동.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 연구기록·통신서고 감사관. 열람은 두 명의 독립 증인과 안전심사 날인이 있어야 하고, 군사 감독 문서는 서고 바깥 별치함으로 쫓아낸다.","일화":"안전심사 날인은 찍혔으나 독립 증인이 한 명뿐인 열람증이 통신서고 창구에 들어온다. 임시온은 열람을 멈추고 열람증의 발급 경로를 거슬러 오르며, 함께 딸려 온 군사 감독 문서는 서고 바깥 별치함으로 옮긴다.","관계":"정호준의 재현 기록 원칙을 원장으로 옮기는 계약이고, 최지우와 공개 시점만 다를 뿐 원본 보존에서는 동맹이며, 이봄결의 감시 기록을 봉쇄 증거로 보관한다.","야망":"연구자료 열람을 인질 교환이 아니라 감사 가능한 대여 원장으로 바꿔 공동기술원장의 서고를 연다.","공포":"한 장의 위조 열람증이 서고 전체를 교섭자의 선전 자료로 만들고, 검증 가능한 지식이 무너지는 것.","개입":"원본 키를 회수해 서고를 다시 열거나, 위조 열람증의 발급자를 밝혀 감사관을 흔들 수 있다."},"biography":"냉정하고 암호 키의 대여 시각까지 기억한다. 기록되지 않은 기술 선물 교환을 외교가 아니라 절도로 부른다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 연구기록 감사\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 연구기록·통신서고 감사관\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 임시온은 서고 대여 시각과 두 독립 증인의 열람 기록을 맞추고 증인이 모자라면 문서를 열지 않는다.\n- 업무: 양재1동.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 연구기록·통신서고 감사관. 열람은 두 명의 독립 증인과 안전심사 날인이 있어야 하고, 군사 감독 문서는 서고 바깥 별치함으로 쫓아낸다.\n\n**일화.** 안전심사 날인은 찍혔으나 독립 증인이 한 명뿐인 열람증이 통신서고 창구에 들어온다. 임시온은 열람을 멈추고 열람증의 발급 경로를 거슬러 오르며, 함께 딸려 온 군사 감독 문서는 서고 바깥 별치함으로 옮긴다.\n\n**관계.** 정호준의 재현 기록 원칙을 원장으로 옮기는 계약이고, 최지우와 공개 시점만 다를 뿐 원본 보존에서는 동맹이며, 이봄결의 감시 기록을 봉쇄 증거로 보관한다.\n\n**야망.** 연구자료 열람을 인질 교환이 아니라 감사 가능한 대여 원장으로 바꿔 공동기술원장의 서고를 연다.\n\n**공포.** 한 장의 위조 열람증이 서고 전체를 교섭자의 선전 자료로 만들고, 검증 가능한 지식이 무너지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 원본 키를 회수해 서고를 다시 열거나, 위조 열람증의 발급자를 밝혀 감사관을 흔들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 20 | 무력 −30 | 물질 5 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 70 | 공개 45 | 자격 35 | 분산 5 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −10 | 과시 0 | 지속 15 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"임시온","type":"계약","to":"정호준","basis":"재현 기록을 원장으로 옮김"},{"from":"임시온","type":"계약","to":"최지우","basis":"원본 보존 동맹, 공개 시점만 다름"}],"incoming":[{"from":"표지안","type":"계약","to":"임시온","basis":"임시온의 대여 시각을 주머니 무게로 옮기는 계약이고"},{"from":"제라온","type":"스승과 제자","to":"임시온","basis":"임시온의 열람 잠금을 기록으로 받치며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0066', 'd5c8-ae40-d574-8a31', '{"id":"person-0066","name":"Heo Seogyeom","title":"Godeok Base Research Vehicle Mechanic","position":"Godeok Base Research Vehicle Mechanic","characterId":"K066","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Research Vehicle Maintenance","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#Person-Heo-Seogyeom","detailRoute":"/people/person-0066","birthDate":"2067-01-29","birthday":"01-29","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"vehicle","name":"Research-vehicle release checks","rating":65},{"id":"parts","name":"Defective-parts dispatch inspection","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"recheck-before-shipment","name":"Recheck Before Shipment","description":"Heo Seogyeom checks test-run records and certification requirements thoroughly before research vehicles leave.","behavior":"He checks both certification stamps and review seals and returned a defective-parts box just before shipment.","stress":"He may block uncertified departures more firmly.","relationship":"If Choi Eunjae’s certification stamp is missing, he may lock shipment even while supporting Yu Minho’s dispatch.","effects":[]},{"id":"no-disguised-military-supplies","name":"No Disguised Military Supplies","description":"Heo Seogyeom rejects military disguises for research materials and modifications suspected of weapon use.","behavior":"He pushes vehicles with suspected weapons modifications outside the sidings.","stress":"","relationship":"He may continue supporting Yu Minho through certified research-vehicle maintenance.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He checks trial records and certification and returns defective parts. Research-vehicle maintenance is supported, not railway construction or combat techniques.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d5c8-ae40-d574-8a31","name":"Gimhae Heo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d5c8-ae40-d574-8a31.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":20,"Force":-40,"Material":15,"Communal":5,"Principle":55,"Public":35,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":20,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-35,"Display":-20,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Research Vehicle Maintenance","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Godeok Base Research Vehicle Mechanic","Duty":"Godeok 1-dong. Heo Seogyeom re-examines the braking records of vehicles released from Godeok Depot and will not put them on Yu Minho''s dispatch sheet until the certification stamp and the review seal have come together.","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 20 | Force −40 | Material 15 | Communal 5 | Principle 55 | Publicity 35 | Qualification 55 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 20 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk −35 | Display −20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Same-sex | Union None"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Raised at the Sinjeong Rolling Stock Depot. Heo Seogyeom re-examines the braking records of vehicles released from Godeok Depot and will not put them on Yu Minho''s dispatch sheet until the certification stamp and the review seal have come together.\n- Post: Godeok 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Godeok Base Research Vehicle Mechanic. Requires both a certification stamp and a review seal for every released vehicle, and pushes modifications suspected of being weapons out past the holding track.","Anecdote":"In 2125, sent back a box of defective parts just before release.","Relationships":"A contract that supports Yu Minho''s dispatch order through maintenance; he locks a release when Choe Eunjae''s certification stamp falls away; and he exchanges Gunja braking parts.","Ambition":"To put the maintenance cycle of research vehicles on the Godeok holding track into the same ledger as technology-certified freight and become a wheel of the Joint Technology Ledger.","Fear":"","Intervention":"He can expose the true owner of a disguised freight car, or obtain substitute braking parts and finish the re-inspection."},"biography":"He remembers people by chassis number and hears an order to disguise research materials as military freight cars as an insult. He tolerates not even a single blank in a test-run log.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Research Vehicle Maintenance\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Godeok Base Research Vehicle Mechanic\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Raised at the Sinjeong Rolling Stock Depot. Heo Seogyeom re-examines the braking records of vehicles released from Godeok Depot and will not put them on Yu Minho''s dispatch sheet until the certification stamp and the review seal have come together.\n- Post: Godeok 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Godeok Base Research Vehicle Mechanic. Requires both a certification stamp and a review seal for every released vehicle, and pushes modifications suspected of being weapons out past the holding track.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, sent back a box of defective parts just before release.\n\n**Relations.** A contract that supports Yu Minho''s dispatch order through maintenance; he locks a release when Choe Eunjae''s certification stamp falls away; and he exchanges Gunja braking parts.\n\n**Ambition.** To put the maintenance cycle of research vehicles on the Godeok holding track into the same ledger as technology-certified freight and become a wheel of the Joint Technology Ledger.\n\n**Intervention.** He can expose the true owner of a disguised freight car, or obtain substitute braking parts and finish the re-inspection.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 20 | Force −40 | Material 15 | Communal 5 | Principle 55 | Publicity 35 | Qualification 55 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 20 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk −35 | Display −20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Same-sex | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Heo Seogyeom","type":"Contract","to":"Yu Minho","basis":"A contract that backs Yu Minho''s dispatch order with maintenance, and"},{"from":"Heo Seogyeom","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Eunjae","basis":"Locks down shipments if Choe Eunjae''s certification seal lapses, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Heo Miri","type":"Command","to":"Heo Seogyeom","basis":"backing Heo Seogyeom''s re-inspection in front of the bay"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0066","name":"허서겸","title":"고덕기지 연구차량 정비사","position":"고덕기지 연구차량 정비사","characterId":"K066","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"연구차량 정비","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-허서겸","detailRoute":"/people/person-0066","birthDate":"2067-01-29","birthday":"01-29","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"vehicle","name":"연구차량 출고 확인","rating":65},{"id":"parts","name":"불량 부품 출고 검사","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"recheck-before-shipment","name":"출고 전 재확인","description":"허서겸은 연구차량 출고 전에 시운전 기록과 인증 요건을 빈틈없이 확인한다.","behavior":"인증 도장과 심사 봉인을 함께 확인하고 출고 직전 불량 부품 상자를 반송했다.","stress":"인증이 없는 출고를 더 단호히 막을 수 있다.","relationship":"최은재의 인증 도장이 빠진다면 유민호의 배차를 지원하는 관계라도 출고를 잠글 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"no-disguised-military-supplies","name":"군수 위장 불허","description":"허서겸은 연구 물자의 군수 위장과 병기가 의심되는 개조를 거부한다.","behavior":"병기가 의심되는 개조 차량을 유치선 바깥으로 밀어낸다.","stress":"","relationship":"인증된 연구차량 정비로 유민호와 협력을 이어갈 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"시운전 빈칸과 인증을 확인하고 불량 부품을 반송한다. 연구차량 정비 업무에 한정하며 철도 건설이나 전투 기술은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d5c8-ae40-d574-8a31","name":"김해 허씨","crest":"clan-crests/d5c8-ae40-d574-8a31.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":20,"무력":-40,"물질":15,"공동":5,"원칙":55,"공개":35,"자격":55,"분산":10,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":20,"독점":-30,"위험":-35,"과시":-20,"지속":-10,"지향":"동성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"연구차량 정비","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"고덕기지 연구차량 정비사","업무":"고덕1동. 허서겸은 고덕기지 출고 차량의 제동 기록을 다시 보고 인증 도장과 심사 봉인이 모이기 전에는 유민호의 배차표에 올리지 않는다.","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 20 | 무력 −40 | 물질 15 | 공동 5 | 원칙 55 | 공개 35 | 자격 55 | 분산 10 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 20 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 허서겸은 고덕기지 출고 차량의 제동 기록을 다시 보고 인증 도장과 심사 봉인이 모이기 전에는 유민호의 배차표에 올리지 않는다.\n- 업무: 고덕1동.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 고덕기지 연구차량 정비사. 출고 차량마다 인증 도장과 심사 봉인을 함께 받고, 병기 의심 개조는 유치선 바깥으로 밀어낸다.","일화":"2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다.","관계":"유민호의 배차 순서를 정비로 받치는 계약이고, 최은재의 인증 도장이 떨어지면 출고를 잠그며, 군자 제동 부품을 교환한다.","야망":"고덕 유치선의 연구차량 보수 주기를 기술 인증 화물과 같은 원장에 올려 공동기술원장의 바퀴가 된다.","공포":"","개입":"위장 화차의 실화주를 밝히거나, 대체 제동 부품을 구해 재검색을 끝낼 수 있다."},"biography":"차대 번호로 사람을 기억하고, 연구 물자를 군수 화차로 위장하는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 시운전 일지의 한 칸 빈칸도 용납하지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 연구차량 정비\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 고덕기지 연구차량 정비사\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 허서겸은 고덕기지 출고 차량의 제동 기록을 다시 보고 인증 도장과 심사 봉인이 모이기 전에는 유민호의 배차표에 올리지 않는다.\n- 업무: 고덕1동.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 고덕기지 연구차량 정비사. 출고 차량마다 인증 도장과 심사 봉인을 함께 받고, 병기 의심 개조는 유치선 바깥으로 밀어낸다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다.\n\n**관계.** 유민호의 배차 순서를 정비로 받치는 계약이고, 최은재의 인증 도장이 떨어지면 출고를 잠그며, 군자 제동 부품을 교환한다.\n\n**야망.** 고덕 유치선의 연구차량 보수 주기를 기술 인증 화물과 같은 원장에 올려 공동기술원장의 바퀴가 된다.\n\n**개입.** 위장 화차의 실화주를 밝히거나, 대체 제동 부품을 구해 재검색을 끝낼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 20 | 무력 −40 | 물질 15 | 공동 5 | 원칙 55 | 공개 35 | 자격 55 | 분산 10 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 20 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"허서겸","type":"계약","to":"유민호","basis":"유민호의 배차 순서를 정비로 받치는 계약이고"},{"from":"허서겸","type":"계약","to":"최은재","basis":"최은재의 인증 도장이 떨어지면 출고를 잠그며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"허미리","type":"지휘","to":"허서겸","basis":"허서겸의 재검색을 칸 앞에서 받친다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0067', 'ad6c-b2a5-c131', '{"id":"person-0067","name":"Gu Yeonjae","title":"Daechi Certified Cargo Merchant","position":"Daechi Certified Cargo Merchant","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Certified Cargo Trading","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"S03","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0067","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":4,"effective":4},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":5,"effective":5},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}}}}', '{"id":"person-0067","name":"구연재","title":"대치 인증화물 물류상","position":"대치 인증화물 물류상","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"인증화물 물류 거래","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"S03","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0067","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":4,"effective":4},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":5,"effective":5},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0068', 'c9c4-d48d-ae30', '{"id":"person-0068","name":"Jin Chaeon","title":"Laboratory Wing Safety Medic","position":"Laboratory Wing Safety Medic","characterId":"K068","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Laboratory Wing First Aid","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#Person-Jin-Chaeon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0068","birthDate":"2078-09-23","birthday":"09-23","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"dose","name":"Scarce-medicine allocation","rating":60},{"id":"sample","name":"Sample-record review","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"reproducible-prescriptions-first","name":"Reproducible Prescriptions First","description":"Jin Chaeon trusts verification records and reagent seals over unreproduced prescriptions.","behavior":"She requires reproducible experimental records for deployed care and locks removal despite pressure when standards are unmet.","stress":"If care records risk becoming military oversight documents, she may give greater weight to safety checks and clinical veto enforcement.","relationship":"When drug effects need verification, she may send laboratory samples to Ryu Eunbi and enforce Jeong Harin’s veto in care.","effects":[]},{"id":"shared-shortfall-allocation","name":"Shared Shortfall Allocation","description":"Jin Chaeon handled a medicine shortage by sharing the shortfall across everyone rather than reserving supplies for a few.","behavior":"During a medicine shortage, she halved prescription quantities and distributed them to everyone.","stress":"If care risks being tied to deals that hold researchers hostage, she may be wary of using allocation as bargaining leverage.","relationship":"If scarce medicine must be allocated, she may choose shared distribution within the safety standards she shares with Jeong Harin.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She requires reproducible records for care and shared scarce medicine. Allocation and safety checks are supported, not surgery or drug manufacture.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c4-d48d-ae30","name":"Pungi Jin Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c9c4-d48d-ae30.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":40,"Force":-40,"Material":10,"Communal":5,"Principle":70,"Public":40,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":0,"Display":15,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Laboratory Wing First Aid","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Laboratory Wing Safety Medic","Duty":"Yangjae 2-dong. Jin Chaeon matches the laboratory wing''s clinical records against Jeong Harin''s safety review materials and halts the release of prescriptions that have not been reproduced.","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 40 | Force −40 | Material 10 | Communal 5 | Principle 70 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 45 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Longing −5 | Monopoly 30 | Risk 0 | Display 15 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Heterosexual | Bonding: Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born into the 2126 generation. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. Jin Chaeon matches the laboratory wing''s clinical records against Jeong Harin''s safety review materials and halts the release of prescriptions that have not been reproduced.\n- Duty: Yangjae 2-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Laboratory Wing Safety Medic. Demands reproducible experiment records for every dispatched treatment, and locks the release of supplies when the standard is not met, even when the Head Researcher of Life Safety presses for it.","Anecdote":"In 2125, during a medicine shortage, halved the prescription amounts and shared them out to everyone.","Relationships":"An ally who enforces Jeong Harin''s veto on the clinical side, learns Jeong Hojun''s safety review principles as a student learns from a teacher, and sends laboratory wing samples for Ryu Eunbi''s drug efficacy verification.","Ambition":"Aims to place the epidemic-prevention records of dispatched researchers as the first clause of the Joint Technical Ledger, nullifying clinical deals that use researchers as hostages.","Fear":"Fears that clinical records will be turned into military oversight documents.","Intervention":"Can escort contaminated samples to the laboratory wing to back up a veto, or find omissions in clinical records to close a dispatch deal."},"biography":"Sees prescriptions that have not been reproduced as more dangerous than experiments, and even in an emergency meeting checks the reagent seal sticker first. Principle is harder than bone.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Laboratory Wing First Aid\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Laboratory Wing Safety Medic\n**Life.** Born into the 2126 generation. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. Jin Chaeon matches the laboratory wing''s clinical records against Jeong Harin''s safety review materials and halts the release of prescriptions that have not been reproduced.\n- Duty: Yangjae 2-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Laboratory Wing Safety Medic. Demands reproducible experiment records for every dispatched treatment, and locks the release of supplies when the standard is not met, even when the Head Researcher of Life Safety presses for it.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, during a medicine shortage, halved the prescription amounts and shared them out to everyone.\n\n**Relations.** An ally who enforces Jeong Harin''s veto on the clinical side, learns Jeong Hojun''s safety review principles as a student learns from a teacher, and sends laboratory wing samples for Ryu Eunbi''s drug efficacy verification.\n\n**Ambition.** Aims to place the epidemic-prevention records of dispatched researchers as the first clause of the Joint Technical Ledger, nullifying clinical deals that use researchers as hostages.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that clinical records will be turned into military oversight documents.\n\n**Intervention.** Can escort contaminated samples to the laboratory wing to back up a veto, or find omissions in clinical records to close a dispatch deal.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 40 | Force −40 | Material 10 | Communal 5 | Principle 70 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 45 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Longing −5 | Monopoly 30 | Risk 0 | Display 15 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Heterosexual | Bonding: Monogamous\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K058","name":"Jeong Harin","courtId":"court:K058","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jin Chaeon","type":"Command","to":"Jeong Harin","basis":"She is the ally who enforces Jeong Harin''s veto on the medical side, and"},{"from":"Jin Chaeon","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Learning Jeong Hojun''s safety-review principles as his disciple"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0068","name":"진채온","title":"실험동 안전의무원","position":"실험동 안전의무원","characterId":"K068","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"실험동 응급 처치","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-진채온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0068","birthDate":"2078-09-23","birthday":"09-23","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"dose","name":"부족 약재 배분","rating":60},{"id":"sample","name":"표본 기록 심사","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"reproducible-prescriptions-first","name":"재현 처방 우선","description":"진채온은 재현되지 않은 처방보다 검증 기록과 시약 봉인을 신뢰한다.","behavior":"파견 진료에 재현 가능한 실험 기록을 요구하고 기준 미달이면 독촉에도 반출을 잠근다.","stress":"진료 기록이 군사 감독 문서로 바뀔 우려가 있다면 안전 확인과 진료 쪽 거부권을 더 중시할 수 있다.","relationship":"약효의 검증이 필요하다면 류은비에게 실험동 표본을 보내고 정하린의 거부권을 진료에서 집행할 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"shared-shortfall-allocation","name":"부족분 공동 배분","description":"진채온은 약재 부족을 일부의 독점보다 모두가 나눠 감당하는 방식으로 처리했다.","behavior":"약재가 부족한 때 처방량을 반으로 나누어 모두에게 배분했다.","stress":"진료가 연구자를 인질로 쓰는 거래에 묶일 우려가 있다면 배분을 거래 수단으로 삼는 데 경계할 수 있다.","relationship":"부족 약재를 배분해야 한다면 정하린과 공유하는 안전 기준 안에서 공동 배분을 택할 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"재현 기록을 진료 조건으로 삼고 부족 약재를 나눴다. 처방 배분과 안전 확인에 한정하고 외과 수술이나 약품 제조는 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c4-d48d-ae30","name":"풍기 진씨","crest":"clan-crests/c9c4-d48d-ae30.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":40,"무력":-40,"물질":10,"공동":5,"원칙":70,"공개":40,"자격":45,"분산":5,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":30,"위험":0,"과시":15,"지속":5,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"실험동 응급 처치","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"실험동 안전의무원","업무":"양재2동. 진채온은 실험동 진료 기록을 정하린의 안전심사 자료와 맞추고 재현되지 않은 처방의 반출을 멈춘다.","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 40 | 무력 −40 | 물질 10 | 공동 5 | 원칙 70 | 공개 40 | 자격 45 | 분산 5 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 30 | 위험 0 | 과시 15 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 진채온은 실험동 진료 기록을 정하린의 안전심사 자료와 맞추고 재현되지 않은 처방의 반출을 멈춘다.\n- 업무: 양재2동.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 실험동 안전의무원. 모든 파견 진료에 재현 가능한 실험 기록을 요구하고, 기준 미달이면 생명안전 연구책임자의 독촉이 있어도 반출을 잠근다.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다.","관계":"정하린의 거부권을 진료 쪽에서 집행하는 동맹이고, 정호준의 안전심사 원칙을 제자로 배우며, 류은비의 약효 검증에 실험동 표본을 보낸다.","야망":"연구자 파견 인원의 방역 기록을 공동기술원장의 첫 조항으로 올려 연구자를 인질로 쓰는 진료 거래를 무효로 만든다.","공포":"진료 기록이 군사 감독 문서로 바뀌는 것.","개입":"오염 표본을 실험동까지 호송해 거부를 뒷받침하거나, 진료 기록 누락을 찾아 파견 거래를 성사시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"재현되지 않은 처방을 실험보다 위험하게 보고, 긴급 회의에서도 시약 봉인 스티커를 먼저 확인한다. 원칙이 뼈보다 단단하다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 실험동 응급 처치\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 실험동 안전의무원\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 진채온은 실험동 진료 기록을 정하린의 안전심사 자료와 맞추고 재현되지 않은 처방의 반출을 멈춘다.\n- 업무: 양재2동.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 실험동 안전의무원. 모든 파견 진료에 재현 가능한 실험 기록을 요구하고, 기준 미달이면 생명안전 연구책임자의 독촉이 있어도 반출을 잠근다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다.\n\n**관계.** 정하린의 거부권을 진료 쪽에서 집행하는 동맹이고, 정호준의 안전심사 원칙을 제자로 배우며, 류은비의 약효 검증에 실험동 표본을 보낸다.\n\n**야망.** 연구자 파견 인원의 방역 기록을 공동기술원장의 첫 조항으로 올려 연구자를 인질로 쓰는 진료 거래를 무효로 만든다.\n\n**공포.** 진료 기록이 군사 감독 문서로 바뀌는 것.\n\n**개입.** 오염 표본을 실험동까지 호송해 거부를 뒷받침하거나, 진료 기록 누락을 찾아 파견 거래를 성사시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 40 | 무력 −40 | 물질 10 | 공동 5 | 원칙 70 | 공개 40 | 자격 45 | 분산 5 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 30 | 위험 0 | 과시 15 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K058","name":"정하린","courtId":"court:K058","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"진채온","type":"지휘","to":"정하린","basis":"정하린의 거부권을 진료 쪽에서 집행하는 동맹이고"},{"from":"진채온","type":"스승과 제자","to":"정호준","basis":"정호준의 안전심사 원칙을 제자로 배우며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0069', 'cc44-d3c9-ac15', '{"id":"person-0069","name":"Chae Bom","title":"Godeok Gate Patrol Squad Leader","position":"Godeok Gate Patrol Squad Leader","characterId":"K069","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Gate Patrol","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#inmul-chaebom","detailRoute":"/people/person-0069","birthDate":"2094-03-08","birthday":"03-08","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"patrol","name":"Lamp and flag patrol coordination","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"wait-for-the-flag-s-return","name":"Wait for the Flag''s Return","description":"Chae Bom treats the resident flag’s return as a prerequisite for opening the gate.","behavior":"He sounds the gate-opening whistle only after the flag returns to the alley entrance.","stress":"If the research building might be bolted from inside before the flag returns, he may resist opening without confirmed return.","relationship":"If Kim Doha’s flag remains in the alley, he may withhold the whistle in keeping with his pledge to her.","effects":[]},{"id":"check-the-wick-first","name":"Check the Wick First","description":"Chae Bom attends to lamp wicks and lighting conditions before bold intervention.","behavior":"He sets patrol intervals by oil level, remeasures dark sections, and lit every lamp during a threat.","stress":"If darkness threatens the flag’s return from an alley, he may check lamp conditions and patrol spacing more closely.","relationship":"When extending Lee Bomgyeol’s blockade at the gate, he may maintain the wicks without lengthening the lamp line before Im Sion’s sealed note arrives.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He coordinates patrols and gate opening through lamps and flags. Vigilance under threat is documented, not battle victories or weapon ownership.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc44-d3c9-ac15","name":"Pyeonggang Chae Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cc44-d3c9-ac15.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":5,"Force":-5,"Material":15,"Communal":0,"Principle":50,"Public":45,"Eligibility":35,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":10,"Display":-10,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Gate Patrol","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Godeok Gate Patrol Squad Leader","Duty":"Godeok 1-dong. Chae Bom re-measures the lantern spacing at Godeok Gate and does not blow the opening whistle until Kim Doha''s residents'' flag has returned from the alley.","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 5 | Force −5 | Material 15 | Communal 0 | Principle 50 | Publicity 45 | Qualification 35 | Dispersion 0 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 25 | Possessiveness 40 | Risk 10 | Display −10 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Opposite sex | Bonding: Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up at the Amsa guard post. Chae Bom re-measures the lamp spacing at the Godeok gate and does not blow the opening whistle until Kim Doha''s resident flag has returned from the alley.\n- Duty: Godeok 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Godeok Gate Patrol Squad Leader. He re-measures unlit sections with a patrol tape, and blows the gate-opening whistle only after the flag has returned to the mouth of the alley.","Anecdote":"When a cart from outside the fence targeted the research bay, Chae Bom lit every lamp and sent out only the flags first.","Relationships":"He takes orders to trim, from the gate onward, the wicks of the blockade lamps lit by I Bomgyeol, and he swears to hold his whistle until Kim Doha''s flag returns from the alley. He does not extend the lamp line until Im Sion''s sealed note reaches the gate.","Ambition":"He fills the space between the gate and the research building with lamp spacing so that abduction carts cannot slip out between the flags.","Fear":"That the research building''s bolt gets fastened from inside before the flag returns from an unlit alley.","Intervention":"He can read the fence''s wheel ruts overlaid on the lamp spacing, or extend the patrol line of a bolt fastened from the inside toward the resident flags."},"biography":"He sets patrol intervals by the oil level of the gate lamps, and calls any alley where the resident flag cannot be seen an accident zone. He trims the lamp wick before showing boldness.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Gate Patrol\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Godeok Gate Patrol Squad Leader\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up at the Amsa guard post. Chae Bom re-measures the lamp spacing at the Godeok gate and does not blow the opening whistle until Kim Doha''s resident flag has returned from the alley.\n- Duty: Godeok 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Godeok Gate Patrol Squad Leader. He re-measures unlit sections with a patrol tape, and blows the gate-opening whistle only after the flag has returned to the mouth of the alley.\n\n**Anecdote.** When a cart from outside the fence targeted the research bay, Chae Bom lit every lamp and sent out only the flags first.\n\n**Relations.** He takes orders to trim, from the gate onward, the wicks of the blockade lamps lit by I Bomgyeol, and he swears to hold his whistle until Kim Doha''s flag returns from the alley. He does not extend the lamp line until Im Sion''s sealed note reaches the gate.\n\n**Ambition.** He fills the space between the gate and the research building with lamp spacing so that abduction carts cannot slip out between the flags.\n\n**Fear.** That the research building''s bolt gets fastened from inside before the flag returns from an unlit alley.\n\n**Intervention.** He can read the fence''s wheel ruts overlaid on the lamp spacing, or extend the patrol line of a bolt fastened from the inside toward the resident flags.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 5 | Force −5 | Materialism 15 | Communal 0 | Principle 50 | Transparency 45 | Qualification 35 | Decentralization 0 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Possessiveness 40 | Risk 10 | Display −10 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Opposite sex | Bonding: Non-exclusive\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K060","name":"Yi Bomgyeol","courtId":"court:K060","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Chae Bom","type":"Command","to":"Yi Bomgyeol","basis":"Receives orders to keep trimming, at the gate, the wick of the lockdown lamp that I Bomgyeol lit,"},{"from":"Chae Bom","type":"Oath","to":"Gim Doha","basis":"He swears to hold back the whistle until Gim Doha''s flag returns from the alley"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0069","name":"채봄","title":"고덕 관문 순찰대 조장","position":"고덕 관문 순찰대 조장","characterId":"K069","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"관문 순찰","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-채봄","detailRoute":"/people/person-0069","birthDate":"2094-03-08","birthday":"03-08","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"patrol","name":"등잔·깃발 순찰 조정","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"wait-for-the-flag-s-return","name":"깃발 귀환 대기","description":"채봄은 주민 깃발의 귀환을 관문 개방보다 앞선 확인 조건으로 삼는다.","behavior":"깃발이 골목 입구로 돌아온 뒤에만 관문 개방 호각을 분다.","stress":"깃발이 돌아오기 전에 연구동 빗장이 안에서 걸릴 우려가 있다면 귀환 확인 없이 개방하지 않으려 할 수 있다.","relationship":"김도하의 깃발이 아직 골목에 있다면 그와의 맹세에 따라 호각을 참을 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"check-the-wick-first","name":"심지부터 점검","description":"채봄은 대담한 대응보다 등잔 심지와 조명 상태를 먼저 챙긴다.","behavior":"기름 높이로 순찰 간격을 정하고 꺼진 구간을 다시 재며 위협 때 등잔을 모두 밝혔다.","stress":"어두운 골목에서 깃발이 돌아오지 못할 우려가 있다면 등잔 상태와 순찰 간격을 더 세밀히 확인할 수 있다.","relationship":"이봄결의 봉쇄를 관문에서 이어야 한다면 등잔 심지를 관리하되 임시온의 봉함 쪽지 전에는 등잔 줄을 늘리지 않을 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"등잔과 주민 깃발로 순찰과 관문 개방을 조정했다. 위협 때의 경계 행동은 확인되나 전투 승리나 무장 보유는 확인되지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc44-d3c9-ac15","name":"평강 채씨","crest":"clan-crests/cc44-d3c9-ac15.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":5,"무력":-5,"물질":15,"공동":0,"원칙":50,"공개":45,"자격":35,"분산":0,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":40,"위험":10,"과시":-10,"지속":5,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"관문 순찰","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"고덕 관문 순찰대 조장","업무":"고덕1동. 채봄은 고덕 관문의 등잔 간격을 다시 재고 김도하의 주민 깃발이 골목에서 돌아오기 전에는 개방 호각을 불지 않는다.","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 5 | 무력 −5 | 물질 15 | 공동 0 | 원칙 50 | 공개 45 | 자격 35 | 분산 0 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 40 | 위험 10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 채봄은 고덕 관문의 등잔 간격을 다시 재고 김도하의 주민 깃발이 골목에서 돌아오기 전에는 개방 호각을 불지 않는다.\n- 업무: 고덕1동.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 고덕 관문 순찰대 조장. 등잔이 꺼진 구간은 순찰 줄자로 다시 재고, 관문을 여는 호각은 깃발이 골목 입구로 돌아온 뒤에만 분다.","일화":"울타리 밖 수레가 연구 칸을 노리자 채봄은 등잔을 모두 밝히고 깃발만 먼저 내보냈다.","관계":"이봄결이 켠 봉쇄 등잔의 심지를 관문에서 이어 깎는 지휘를 받고, 김도하의 깃발이 골목에서 돌아올 때까지 호각을 참기로 맹세한다. 임시온의 봉함 쪽지가 관문에 닿기 전에는 등잔 줄을 늘리지 않는다.","야망":"등잔 간격으로 관문과 연구동 사이를 메워, 납치 수레가 깃발 사이로 새지 않게 한다.","공포":"등잔이 꺼진 골목에서 깃발이 돌아오기 전에 연구동 빗장이 안에서 걸리는 것.","개입":"울타리 바퀴 자국을 등잔 간격과 겹쳐 읽거나, 안에서 걸린 빗장의 순찰 줄을 주민 깃발 쪽에 펼 수 있다."},"biography":"관문 등잔의 기름 높이로 순찰 간격을 정하고, 주민 깃발이 안 보이는 골목을 사고 구간으로 부른다. 대담함보다 등잔 심지를 먼저 깎는다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 관문 순찰\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 고덕 관문 순찰대 조장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 채봄은 고덕 관문의 등잔 간격을 다시 재고 김도하의 주민 깃발이 골목에서 돌아오기 전에는 개방 호각을 불지 않는다.\n- 업무: 고덕1동.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 고덕 관문 순찰대 조장. 등잔이 꺼진 구간은 순찰 줄자로 다시 재고, 관문을 여는 호각은 깃발이 골목 입구로 돌아온 뒤에만 분다.\n\n**일화.** 울타리 밖 수레가 연구 칸을 노리자 채봄은 등잔을 모두 밝히고 깃발만 먼저 내보냈다.\n\n**관계.** 이봄결이 켠 봉쇄 등잔의 심지를 관문에서 이어 깎는 지휘를 받고, 김도하의 깃발이 골목에서 돌아올 때까지 호각을 참기로 맹세한다. 임시온의 봉함 쪽지가 관문에 닿기 전에는 등잔 줄을 늘리지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 등잔 간격으로 관문과 연구동 사이를 메워, 납치 수레가 깃발 사이로 새지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 등잔이 꺼진 골목에서 깃발이 돌아오기 전에 연구동 빗장이 안에서 걸리는 것.\n\n**개입.** 울타리 바퀴 자국을 등잔 간격과 겹쳐 읽거나, 안에서 걸린 빗장의 순찰 줄을 주민 깃발 쪽에 펼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 5 | 무력 −5 | 물질 15 | 공동 0 | 원칙 50 | 공개 45 | 자격 35 | 분산 0 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 40 | 위험 10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K060","name":"이봄결","courtId":"court:K060","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"채봄","type":"지휘","to":"이봄결","basis":"이봄결이 켠 봉쇄 등잔의 심지를 관문에서 이어 깎는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"채봄","type":"맹세","to":"김도하","basis":"김도하의 깃발이 골목에서 돌아올 때까지 호각을 참기로 맹세한다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0070', 'd45c-c2e0-cc3d', '{"id":"person-0070","name":"Pyo Jian","title":"Hierophant''s Office Courier","position":"Hierophant''s Office Courier","characterId":"K070","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Sealed Document Delivery","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11650","stateName":"Seocho-gu","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#inmul-pyojian","detailRoute":"/people/person-0070","birthDate":"2087-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":39,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"message","name":"Sealed-message delivery and checks","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"cross-check-before-delivery","name":"Cross-Check Before Delivery","description":"Pyo Jian proceeds with delivery only when the message bell and sealed-pouch weight agree.","behavior":"She logs pouch weight and bell time and halts departure or ringing when a discrepancy appears.","stress":"If a forged pouch could turn a copy into propaganda text, she may place greater weight on cross-checking before delivery.","relationship":"When lending times and delivery records must align, she may compare Im Sion’s records with pouch weights.","effects":[]},{"id":"circumvent-oversight-wording","name":"Circumvent Oversight Wording","description":"Pyo Jian does not carry messages containing military oversight wording directly into the archive.","behavior":"When military oversight wording appears, she redirects her route to the review counter instead of the archive.","stress":"If reproducible experiments risk becoming propaganda slogans, she may resist delivering oversight wording without review.","relationship":"If an original is damaged, she may take the same stand as Choi Jiwoo despite differences over publication timing.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She compares pouch weight and bell times and redirects oversight papers to review. Delivery accuracy and observation are supported, not covert operations.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11650-S03","name":{"ko":"Seocho-gu Arc District Directly Held Land"},"holderPersonId":"K070","directLiegePersonId":"K029","stateId":"S03","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1165052000","name":"Seocho 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1165065100","name":"Yangjae 1-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11650-S03","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11650-S03","name":"Seocho-gu Arc District","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K070","basis":"Opening administrative-scale group gu:11650(district) allocation · deterministic candidate selection","stateId":"S03","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1165052000","region:1165065100"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s02","name":"Arc","holderPersonId":"K029"}}],"clan":{"id":"d45c-c2e0-cc3d","name":"Sinchang Pyo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d45c-c2e0-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":40,"Force":-35,"Material":20,"Communal":-5,"Principle":65,"Public":70,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":20,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":40,"Display":-15,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Sealed Document Delivery","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Hierophant''s Office Courier","Duty":"Daechi 1-dong. If the voice record of a pouch that reached Daechi has a broken passage, Pyo Jian halts the bell and leaves only a cross-check message.","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 40 | Force −35 | Materialism 20 | Communal −5 | Principle 65 | Transparency 70 | Qualification 60 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 20 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk 40 | Display −15 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up on the Sinnae transfer duty shift. Pyo Jian records the weight of the Hierophant''s office courier''s sealed pouch and the time of the dispatch bell, and cross-checks them against Im Sion''s lending times.\n- Duty: Yangjae 1-dong.\n- Duty: Daechi 1-dong. If the voice record of a pouch that reached Daechi has a broken passage, Pyo Jian halts the bell and leaves only a cross-check message.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Hierophant''s Office Courier. She records pouch weight and bell time in the courier log, and when military supervision wording appears she turns her steps toward the review window rather than the archive.","Anecdote":"When the severed breath continued even inside the Daechi pouch, Pyo Jian halted the bell and left only a cross-check message.","Relationships":"Her contract carries Im Sion''s lending times over into pouch weight, and she delivers Jeong Hojun''s single replication line before the bell rings. Even if Choe Jiu delays disclosure, she stands at the same door if the original would be damaged.","Ambition":"So that the reading message is not tied to the hostage-exchange time, she lets only pouches stamped with the arrival bell cross the archive threshold.","Fear":"That a forged pouch turns a copy into a broadcast script, and that a replication experiment turns into slogan sentences.","Intervention":"She can set a pouch containing the severed breath down at the review window, or have the log of a courier who halted the bell read overlaid on the broadcast script."},"biography":"She does not leave the gate if the ring of the message bell differs from the weight of the sealed pouch. She calls an archive opened only by word of mouth an empty wick, not diplomacy.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Sealed Document Delivery\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Hierophant''s Office Courier\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up on the Sinnae transfer duty shift. Pyo Jian records the weight of the Hierophant''s office courier''s sealed pouch and the time of the dispatch bell, and cross-checks them against Im Sion''s lending times.\n- Duty: Yangjae 1-dong.\n- Duty: Daechi 1-dong. If the voice record of a pouch that reached Daechi has a broken passage, Pyo Jian halts the bell and leaves only a cross-check message.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Hierophant''s Office Courier. She records pouch weight and bell time in the courier log, and when military supervision wording appears she turns her steps toward the review window rather than the archive.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the severed breath continued even inside the Daechi pouch, Pyo Jian halted the bell and left only a cross-check message.\n\n**Relations.** Her contract carries Im Sion''s lending times over into pouch weight, and she delivers Jeong Hojun''s single replication line before the bell rings. Even if Choe Jiu delays disclosure, she stands at the same door if the original would be damaged.\n\n**Ambition.** So that the reading message is not tied to the hostage-exchange time, she lets only pouches stamped with the arrival bell cross the archive threshold.\n\n**Fear.** That a forged pouch turns a copy into a broadcast script, and that a replication experiment turns into slogan sentences.\n\n**Intervention.** She can set a pouch containing the severed breath down at the review window, or have the log of a courier who halted the bell read overlaid on the broadcast script.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 40 | Force −35 | Materialism 20 | Communal −5 | Principle 65 | Transparency 70 | Qualification 60 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 20 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk 40 | Display −15 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Pyo Jian","type":"Contract","to":"Im Sion","basis":"a contract that carries Im Sion''s loan times over into pouch weight, and"},{"from":"Pyo Jian","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Delivers Jeong Hojun''s one-line replication before the bell tolls"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0070","name":"표지안","title":"교주실 전령","position":"교주실 전령","characterId":"K070","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"봉함 문서 전달","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11650","stateName":"서초구","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-표지안","detailRoute":"/people/person-0070","birthDate":"2087-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":39,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"message","name":"봉함 전갈 전달·대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"cross-check-before-delivery","name":"전달 전 교차 확인","description":"표지안은 전갈의 종 울림과 봉함 주머니 무게가 맞아야 전달을 진행한다.","behavior":"주머니 무게와 종 시각을 일지에 남기고 불일치가 있으면 출발이나 종 울림을 멈춘다.","stress":"위조 주머니가 사본을 선전 원고로 바꿀 위험이 있다면 전달 전에 교차 확인을 더 중시할 수 있다.","relationship":"대여 시각과 전달 기록을 맞춰야 한다면 임시온의 기록과 주머니 무게를 대조할 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"circumvent-oversight-wording","name":"감독 문구 우회","description":"표지안은 군사 감독 문구가 든 전갈을 서고로 곧장 전달하지 않는다.","behavior":"군사 감독 문구가 보이면 서고 대신 심사 창구로 걸음 방향을 바꾼다.","stress":"재현 실험이 선전 구호로 바뀔 우려가 있다면 감독 문구를 심사 없이 전달하지 않으려 할 수 있다.","relationship":"공개 시점에 차이가 있어도 원본이 훼손된다면 최지우와 같은 입장에서 대응할 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"주머니 무게와 종 시각을 대조하고 감독 문서를 심사 창구로 돌린다. 전달 정확성과 관찰을 평가하며 은밀 공작 경력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11650-S03","name":{"ko":"서초구 Arc 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K070","directLiegePersonId":"K029","stateId":"S03","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1165052000","name":"서초2동"},{"id":"region:1165065100","name":"양재1동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11650-S03","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11650-S03","name":"서초구 Arc","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K070","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11650(district) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S03","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1165052000","region:1165065100"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s02","name":"Arc","holderPersonId":"K029"}}],"clan":{"id":"d45c-c2e0-cc3d","name":"신창 표씨","crest":"clan-crests/d45c-c2e0-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":40,"무력":-35,"물질":20,"공동":-5,"원칙":65,"공개":70,"자격":60,"분산":15,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":20,"독점":5,"위험":40,"과시":-15,"지속":-15,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"봉함 문서 전달","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"교주실 전령","업무":"대치1동. 표지안은 대치에 닿은 주머니의 음성 기록에 끊긴 대목이 있으면 종을 멈추고 교차 확인 전갈만 남긴다.","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 40 | 무력 −35 | 물질 20 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 65 | 공개 70 | 자격 60 | 분산 15 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 20 | 독점 5 | 위험 40 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 표지안은 교주실 전령의 봉함 주머니 무게와 발송 종 시각을 남기고 임시온의 대여 시각과 대조한다.\n- 업무: 양재1동.\n- 업무: 대치1동. 표지안은 대치에 닿은 주머니의 음성 기록에 끊긴 대목이 있으면 종을 멈추고 교차 확인 전갈만 남긴다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 교주실 전령. 주머니 무게와 종 시각을 전령 일지에 남기고, 군사 감독 문구가 보이면 걸음 방향을 서고가 아니라 심사 창구로 돌린다.","일화":"잘린 숨이 대치 주머니 안에서도 이어지자 표지안은 종을 멈추고 교차 확인 전갈만 남겼다.","관계":"임시온의 대여 시각을 주머니 무게로 옮기는 계약이고, 정호준의 재현 한 줄을 종 울림 전에 전한다. 최지우이 공개를 미뤄도 원본이 훼손되면 같은 문에 선다.","야망":"열람 전갈이 인질 교환 시각에 묶이지 않게, 도착 종이 찍힌 주머니만 서고 문턱을 넘게 한다.","공포":"위조 주머니가 사본을 방송 원고로 만들고, 재현 실험이 구호 문장으로 바뀌는 것.","개입":"잘린 숨이 담긴 주머니를 심사 창구에 내려놓거나, 종을 멈춘 전령의 일지를 방송 원고와 겹쳐 읽게 할 수 있다."},"biography":"전갈 종의 울림과 봉함 주머니 무게가 다르면 문을 나서지 않는다. 구두로만 열린 서고를 외교가 아니라 빈 심지로 부른다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 봉함 문서 전달\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 교주실 전령\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 표지안은 교주실 전령의 봉함 주머니 무게와 발송 종 시각을 남기고 임시온의 대여 시각과 대조한다.\n- 업무: 양재1동.\n- 업무: 대치1동. 표지안은 대치에 닿은 주머니의 음성 기록에 끊긴 대목이 있으면 종을 멈추고 교차 확인 전갈만 남긴다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 교주실 전령. 주머니 무게와 종 시각을 전령 일지에 남기고, 군사 감독 문구가 보이면 걸음 방향을 서고가 아니라 심사 창구로 돌린다.\n\n**일화.** 잘린 숨이 대치 주머니 안에서도 이어지자 표지안은 종을 멈추고 교차 확인 전갈만 남겼다.\n\n**관계.** 임시온의 대여 시각을 주머니 무게로 옮기는 계약이고, 정호준의 재현 한 줄을 종 울림 전에 전한다. 최지우이 공개를 미뤄도 원본이 훼손되면 같은 문에 선다.\n\n**야망.** 열람 전갈이 인질 교환 시각에 묶이지 않게, 도착 종이 찍힌 주머니만 서고 문턱을 넘게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 주머니가 사본을 방송 원고로 만들고, 재현 실험이 구호 문장으로 바뀌는 것.\n\n**개입.** 잘린 숨이 담긴 주머니를 심사 창구에 내려놓거나, 종을 멈춘 전령의 일지를 방송 원고와 겹쳐 읽게 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 40 | 무력 −35 | 물질 20 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 65 | 공개 70 | 자격 60 | 분산 15 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 20 | 독점 5 | 위험 40 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"표지안","type":"계약","to":"임시온","basis":"임시온의 대여 시각을 주머니 무게로 옮기는 계약이고"},{"from":"표지안","type":"계약","to":"정호준","basis":"정호준의 재현 한 줄을 종 울림 전에 전한다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0071', 'ba85-c5f0-c548', '{"id":"person-0071","name":"Myeong Haesol","title":"Western Outskirts Airstrip Explorer","position":"Western Outskirts Airstrip Explorer","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Outskirts Coordinates and Fissure Survey","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"S03","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0071","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}}}}', '{"id":"person-0071","name":"명해솔","title":"서부 외곽 활주로터 탐사원","position":"서부 외곽 활주로터 탐사원","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"외곽 좌표·균열 조사","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"S03","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0071","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0072', 'c81c-ce60-c6d0', '{"id":"person-0072","name":"Je Raon","title":"Technology Certification Copy Archivist","position":"Technology Certification Copy Archivist","characterId":"K072","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Certification Copy Recording","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#inmul-jeraon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0072","birthDate":"2095-07-18","birthday":"07-18","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"seal","name":"Seal and copy comparison","rating":60},{"id":"accounts","name":"Payment ledger reconciliation","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"persistent-date-checking","name":"Persistent Date Checking","description":"Jeraon values agreement between ledger dates and records over verbal assurances.","behavior":"Jeraon persistently compares dates and condemns leaving verbal agreements out of the ledger.","stress":"Concern that a forged access pass could turn the archive into propaganda may heighten Jeraon''s emphasis on checking dates.","relationship":"When transferring Choi Eunjae''s certification scope, Jeraon may prioritize ledger entries over verbal trust.","effects":[]},{"id":"protect-original-fields","name":"Protect Original Fields","description":"Jeraon favors preserving original record fields over retaining copies exposed as forged.","behavior":"In the forged-stamp incident, Jeraon burned the copies and protected the original fields.","stress":"","relationship":"When supporting Im Sion''s access restrictions, Jeraon may treat preservation of original records as a condition of cooperation.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She compares dates and discarded a copy after a forged seal was exposed, preserving the original slot. Unclear responsibility prevents assuming a forgery-expert career.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c81c-ce60-c6d0","name":"Je Clan of Chilwon","crest":"clan-crests/c81c-ce60-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":20,"Force":-20,"Material":15,"Communal":5,"Principle":65,"Public":40,"Eligibility":70,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-5,"Risk":0,"Display":0,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"None","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Certification Copy Recording","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Technology Certification Copy Archivist","Duty":"Daechi 1-dong. Jeraon confirms receipt of certified copies by the Daechi Archive and withholds the completion seal if it is missing.","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 20 | Force −20 | Material 15 | Communal 5 | Principle 65 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 70 | Decentralization 0 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness −5 | Risk 0 | Display 0 | Endurance 30 | Orientation None | Union None"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. Jeraon confirms receipt of certified copies by the Daechi Archive and withholds the completion seal if it is missing.\n- Duties: Daechi 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Technology Certification Copy Archivist. Leaves certified copies at the Daechi Archive, and does not stamp the seal if there is an undisclosed performance clause.","Anecdote":"In 2125, exposed a forged seal, burned the copy, and protected the original column.","Relationships":"Is close to a disciple who moves Choe Eunjae''s certification scope into the ledger, backs Im Sion''s reading lock with records, and draws Jeong Yura''s technology-sharing clause into the certification provisions.","Ambition":"Moves medicine, communications, and pump certification into the public ledger to become the records window of the Joint Technology Ledger.","Fear":"A single forged reading pass turning the entire archive into a negotiator''s propaganda material.","Intervention":"Can bring in the original records of reproduction experiments to restore certification, or expose council members who hid undisclosed clauses."},"biography":"Despises those who use certification seals as bargaining chips, and calls council members who do not enter verbal agreements in the ledger thieves. Cold, and relentless in cross-checking dates.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Certification Copy Recording\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Technology Certification Copy Archivist\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. Jeraon confirms receipt of certified copies by the Daechi Archive and withholds the completion seal if it is missing.\n- Duties: Daechi 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Technology Certification Copy Archivist. Leaves certified copies at the Daechi Archive, and does not stamp the seal if there is an undisclosed performance clause.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, exposed a forged seal, burned the copy, and protected the original column.\n\n**Relations.** Is close to a disciple who moves Choe Eunjae''s certification scope into the ledger, backs Im Sion''s reading lock with records, and draws Jeong Yura''s technology-sharing clause into the certification provisions.\n\n**Ambition.** Moves medicine, communications, and pump certification into the public ledger to become the records window of the Joint Technology Ledger.\n\n**Fear.** A single forged reading pass turning the entire archive into a negotiator''s propaganda material.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in the original records of reproduction experiments to restore certification, or expose council members who hid undisclosed clauses.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 20 | Force −20 | Material 15 | Communal 5 | Principle 65 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 70 | Decentralization 0 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Possessiveness −5 | Risk 0 | Display 0 | Endurance 30 | Orientation None | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Je Raon","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Choe Eunjae","basis":"Is close to a master-and-disciple bond in moving Choe Eunjae''s certification scope onto the ledger, and"},{"from":"Je Raon","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Im Sion","basis":"backing Im Sion''s viewing lock with records,"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0072","name":"제라온","title":"기술인증 사본 기록관","position":"기술인증 사본 기록관","characterId":"K072","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"인증 사본 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-제라온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0072","birthDate":"2095-07-18","birthday":"07-18","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"seal","name":"봉인·사본 대조","rating":60},{"id":"accounts","name":"지급 장부 대조","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"persistent-date-checking","name":"날짜 집요한 대조","description":"제라온은 말로 된 합의보다 원장에 남은 날짜와 기록의 일치를 중시한다.","behavior":"날짜를 집요하게 대조하고 구두 합의를 원장에 남기지 않는 행위를 비난한다.","stress":"위조 열람증이 서고를 선전 자료로 바꿀 우려가 커지면 기록의 날짜 대조를 더욱 중시할 수 있다.","relationship":"최은재의 인증 범위를 옮길 때도 구두 신뢰보다 원장에 남기는 내용을 중시할 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"protect-original-fields","name":"원본 칸 지키기","description":"제라온은 위조가 드러난 사본보다 원본의 기록 칸을 지키는 쪽을 택한다.","behavior":"위조 도장이 드러난 사건에서 사본을 불사르고 원본 칸을 지켰다.","stress":"","relationship":"임시온의 열람 잠금을 뒷받침할 때 원본 기록의 보존을 협력의 기준으로 삼을 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"날짜를 대조하고 위조 도장이 드러난 사본을 버리며 원본 칸을 지켰다. 위조 사건의 책임은 불분명해 탐지 전문가로 확장하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c81c-ce60-c6d0","name":"칠원 제씨","crest":"clan-crests/c81c-ce60-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":20,"무력":-20,"물질":15,"공동":5,"원칙":65,"공개":40,"자격":70,"분산":0,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-5,"위험":0,"과시":0,"지속":30,"지향":"무성향","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"인증 사본 기록","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"기술인증 사본 기록관","업무":"대치1동. 제라온은 대치 서고의 인증 사본 수령을 확인하고 빠졌으면 완료 날인을 보류한다.","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 20 | 무력 −20 | 물질 15 | 공동 5 | 원칙 65 | 공개 40 | 자격 70 | 분산 0 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −5 | 위험 0 | 과시 0 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 제라온은 대치 서고의 인증 사본 수령을 확인하고 빠졌으면 완료 날인을 보류한다.\n- 업무: 대치1동.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 기술인증 사본 기록관. 인증 사본을 대치 서고에 남기고, 비공개 성능 조항이 있으면 날인을 찍지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 위조 도장을 들켜 사본을 불사르고 원본 칸을 지켰다.","관계":"최은재의 인증 범위를 원장으로 옮기는 제자에 가깝고, 임시온의 열람 잠금을 기록으로 받치며, 정유라의 기술공유 문장을 인증 조항에 끌어들인다.","야망":"의약·통신·펌프 인증을 공개 원장으로 옮겨 공동기술원장의 기록 창구가 된다.","공포":"위조 열람증 한 장이 서고 전체를 교섭자의 선전 자료로 만드는 것.","개입":"재현 실험의 원본 기록을 가져와 인증을 복구하거나, 비공개 조항을 숨긴 평의원을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"인증 도장을 흥정 밑천으로 쓰는 사람을 경멸하고, 구두 합의를 원장에 올리지 않는 평의원을 절도로 부른다. 냉정하고 날짜를 집요하게 대조한다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 인증 사본 기록\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 기술인증 사본 기록관\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 제라온은 대치 서고의 인증 사본 수령을 확인하고 빠졌으면 완료 날인을 보류한다.\n- 업무: 대치1동.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 기술인증 사본 기록관. 인증 사본을 대치 서고에 남기고, 비공개 성능 조항이 있으면 날인을 찍지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 위조 도장을 들켜 사본을 불사르고 원본 칸을 지켰다.\n\n**관계.** 최은재의 인증 범위를 원장으로 옮기는 제자에 가깝고, 임시온의 열람 잠금을 기록으로 받치며, 정유라의 기술공유 문장을 인증 조항에 끌어들인다.\n\n**야망.** 의약·통신·펌프 인증을 공개 원장으로 옮겨 공동기술원장의 기록 창구가 된다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 열람증 한 장이 서고 전체를 교섭자의 선전 자료로 만드는 것.\n\n**개입.** 재현 실험의 원본 기록을 가져와 인증을 복구하거나, 비공개 조항을 숨긴 평의원을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 20 | 무력 −20 | 물질 15 | 공동 5 | 원칙 65 | 공개 40 | 자격 70 | 분산 0 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −5 | 위험 0 | 과시 0 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"제라온","type":"스승과 제자","to":"최은재","basis":"최은재의 인증 범위를 원장으로 옮기는 스승과 제자에 가깝고"},{"from":"제라온","type":"스승과 제자","to":"임시온","basis":"임시온의 열람 잠금을 기록으로 받치며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0073', 'bcc0-c6d0-c8fc-908a', '{"id":"person-0073","name":"Byeon Taeon","title":"Daechi Waiting Hall Stationmaster","position":"Daechi Waiting Hall Stationmaster","characterId":"K073","rank":"Department Head","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Waiting Hall Duty","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#inmul-byeon-taeon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0073","birthDate":"2097-07-25","birthday":"07-25","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"water-board","name":"Waiting-hall notice board management","rating":60},{"id":"dispatch","name":"Freight-car sequencing","rating":55},{"id":"referral","name":"Public-channel referral","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"water-trains-first","name":"Food First","description":"Byeon Taeon places residents’ food and fuel allocation ahead of transit cargo.","behavior":"He unloads food crates before other cargo and stops departure announcements when the count of fuel cans falls short.","stress":"If word comes that machines drawn by light and heat are approaching from the winter outside, he may give greater weight to platform light control and closing the shutters.","relationship":"If cargo bound for other settlements overlaps with residents’ food, he may uphold the principle of putting food crates first.","effects":[]},{"id":"face-to-face-transparency","name":"Face-to-Face Transparency","description":"Byeon Taeon treats the waiting room as a face-to-face channel for openly enforcing residents’ rights.","behavior":"He sends private requests to public channels and posts evacuation routes and the shutter inspection times.","stress":"If rumors of hostages spread in the waiting hall, he may seek to recheck announcement wording and entry checks at the public counter.","relationship":"He may sustain cooperation through the waiting-room counter when he can enforce Kim Doha’s resident veto on site.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He unloads food crates first and redirects favors to the public counter. Waiting-hall operations and broadcast checks are his strengths; he has no combat command experience.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcc0-c6d0-c8fc-908a","name":"Wonju Byeon Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bcc0-c6d0-c8fc-908a.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":15,"Force":-30,"Material":15,"Communal":10,"Principle":60,"Public":30,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":-30,"Display":0,"Sustained":15,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Waiting Hall Duty","Rank":"Department Head","Title":"Daechi Waiting Hall Stationmaster","Duty":"Daechi 1-dong. Byeon Taeon first posts the number of food bins and the remaining fuel on the Daechi Waiting Hall blackboard, and does not broadcast departures until the shutter check is finished.","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 15 | Force −30 | Material 15 | Communal 10 | Principle 60 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 5 | Transformation 20","Desires":"Craving 45 | Possessiveness −35 | Risk −30 | Display 0 | Endurance 15 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up on waiting hall duty. Byeon Taeon first posts the number of food bins and the remaining fuel on the Daechi Waiting Hall blackboard, and does not broadcast departures until the shutter check is finished.\n- Duties: Daechi 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Department Head. Title: Daechi Waiting Hall Stationmaster. Publicly posts evacuation routes and the shutter inspection times, and puts the number of ration pots ahead of the number of research dispatch personnel in the vote broadcast.","Anecdote":"In 2125, returned a private solicitation and redirected it to the public window.","Relationships":"Matches food counts with neighboring families at the waiting hall, receives and counts fuel arriving from other settlements at the Daechi platform, and shares patrol times with the shutter-check watch on winter nights.","Ambition":"Make the Daechi waiting hall a gateway hub where food and fuel minimums and machine-body parts exchange take place under one roof.","Fear":"That on a day when winter food and fuel are cut off, the waiting hall roster falls into kidnappers’ hands.","Intervention":"Can break the window freeze by arranging a substitute food convoy, or strengthen the residents'' veto by uncovering the secret roster-transfer pact."},"biography":"Asks about the fuel left in kitchens before research talk, and even on days of showing off knowledge halts the broadcast if the food count is short. Speaks of practical gain, but never places transit cargo ahead of residents’ food.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Waiting Hall Duty\n- Rank: Department Head\n- Title: Daechi Waiting Hall Stationmaster\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up on waiting hall duty. Byeon Taeon first posts the number of food bins and the remaining fuel on the Daechi Waiting Hall blackboard, and does not broadcast departures until the shutter check is finished.\n- Duties: Daechi 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Department Head. Title: Daechi Waiting Hall Stationmaster. Publicly posts evacuation routes and the shutter inspection times, and puts the number of ration pots ahead of the number of research dispatch personnel in the vote broadcast.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, returned a private solicitation and redirected it to the public window.\n\n**Relations.** Matches food counts with neighboring families at the waiting hall, receives and counts fuel arriving from other settlements at the Daechi platform, and shares patrol times with the shutter-check watch on winter nights.\n\n**Ambition.** Make the Daechi waiting hall a gateway hub where food and fuel minimums and machine-body parts exchange take place under one roof.\n\n**Fear.** That on a day when winter food and fuel are cut off, the waiting hall roster falls into kidnappers’ hands.\n\n**Intervention.** Can break the window freeze by arranging a substitute food convoy, or strengthen the residents'' veto by uncovering the secret roster-transfer pact.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 15 | Force −30 | Material 15 | Communal 10 | Principle 60 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 5 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Possessiveness −35 | Risk −30 | Display 0 | Persistence 15 | Orientation same-sex | Union contract cohabitation\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K061","name":"Gim Doha","courtId":"court:K061","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Byeon Taeon","type":"Command","to":"Gim Doha","basis":"Enforcing Gim Doha''s residents'' veto at the concourse, and"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0073","name":"변태온","title":"대치 대합실 역장","position":"대치 대합실 역장","characterId":"K073","rank":"부장","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"대합실 당직","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-변태온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0073","birthDate":"2097-07-25","birthday":"07-25","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"water-board","name":"대합실 게시판 운영","rating":60},{"id":"dispatch","name":"화차 순서 조정","rating":55},{"id":"referral","name":"공개 창구 안내","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"water-trains-first","name":"식량 먼저","description":"변태온은 이동 화물보다 주민의 식량과 연료 배분을 앞세운다.","behavior":"식량 상자를 다른 화물보다 먼저 내리고, 연료 통 수가 비면 출발 방송을 중단한다.","stress":"겨울 바깥에서 빛과 열에 끌린 기계가 다가온다는 소식이 있으면 승강장 불빛 단속과 셔터 닫기를 더 중시할 수 있다.","relationship":"다른 거주지로 가는 화물과 주민 식량이 겹치면 식량 상자를 앞에 두는 원칙을 지키려 할 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"face-to-face-transparency","name":"대면 공개","description":"변태온은 대합실을 주민 권리가 공개적으로 집행되는 대면 창구로 본다.","behavior":"사적 청탁을 공개 창구로 보내고 대피 경로와 셔터 점검 시각을 게시한다.","stress":"인질 소문이 대합실에 돌면 방송 문구와 출입 확인을 공개 창구에서 다시 확인하려 할 수 있다.","relationship":"김도하의 주민 거부권을 현장에서 집행할 수 있다면 대합실 창구를 통한 협력을 유지할 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"식량 상자를 먼저 내리고 청탁은 공개 창구로 보낸다. 대합실 운영과 방송 점검이 강점이며 전투 지휘 경력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcc0-c6d0-c8fc-908a","name":"원주 변씨","crest":"clan-crests/bcc0-c6d0-c8fc-908a.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":15,"무력":-30,"물질":15,"공동":10,"원칙":60,"공개":30,"자격":45,"분산":5,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-35,"위험":-30,"과시":0,"지속":15,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"대합실 당직","품계":"부장","직함":"대치 대합실 역장","업무":"대치1동. 변태온은 대치 대합실 칠판에 식량 통 수와 연료 남은 양을 먼저 쓰고, 셔터 점검이 끝나기 전에는 출발을 방송하지 않는다.","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 15 | 무력 −30 | 물질 15 | 공동 10 | 원칙 60 | 공개 30 | 자격 45 | 분산 5 | 변혁 20","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −30 | 과시 0 | 지속 15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 변태온은 대치 대합실 칠판에 식량 통 수와 연료 남은 양을 먼저 쓰고, 셔터 점검이 끝나기 전에는 출발을 방송하지 않는다.\n- 업무: 대치1동.","관직":"품계 부장. 직함은 대치 대합실 역장. 대피 통로와 셔터 점검 결과를 공개 게시하고, 연구 인원 수보다 식량 통 수를 먼저 방송에 올린다.","일화":"2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다.","관계":"대합실 이웃 가족과 식량 숫자를 맞춰 보고, 다른 거주지에서 오는 연료를 대치 승강장에서 받아 세며, 겨울 야간에는 셔터 점검 당번과 순찰 시각을 나눈다.","야망":"대치 대합실을 식량·연료 최저선과 기계 몸 부품 교환이 한 지붕 아래서 이루어지는 관문 허브로 만든다.","공포":"겨울 식량과 연료가 막힌 날, 대합실 명부가 납치범 손에 넘어가는 것.","개입":"대체 식량 호송을 성사시켜 창구 동결을 풀거나, 명부 양도 밀약을 찾아 주민 거부권을 강화할 수 있다."},"biography":"연구 이야기보다 부엌에 남은 연료를 먼저 묻고, 지식을 자랑하는 날에도 식량 수가 비면 방송을 중단시킨다. 실리를 말하되 이동 화물을 주민 식량보다 앞에 두지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 대합실 당직\n- 품계: 부장\n- 직함: 대치 대합실 역장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 변태온은 대치 대합실 칠판에 식량 통 수와 연료 남은 양을 먼저 쓰고, 셔터 점검이 끝나기 전에는 출발을 방송하지 않는다.\n- 업무: 대치1동.\n\n**관직.** 품계 부장. 직함은 대치 대합실 역장. 대피 통로와 셔터 점검 결과를 공개 게시하고, 연구 인원 수보다 식량 통 수를 먼저 방송에 올린다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다.\n\n**관계.** 대합실 이웃 가족과 식량 숫자를 맞춰 보고, 다른 거주지에서 오는 연료를 대치 승강장에서 받아 세며, 겨울 야간에는 셔터 점검 당번과 순찰 시각을 나눈다.\n\n**야망.** 대치 대합실을 식량·연료 최저선과 기계 몸 부품 교환이 한 지붕 아래서 이루어지는 관문 허브로 만든다.\n\n**공포.** 겨울 식량과 연료가 막힌 날, 대합실 명부가 납치범 손에 넘어가는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대체 식량 호송을 성사시켜 창구 동결을 풀거나, 명부 양도 밀약을 찾아 주민 거부권을 강화할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 15 | 무력 −30 | 물질 15 | 공동 10 | 원칙 60 | 공개 30 | 자격 45 | 분산 5 | 변혁 20\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −30 | 과시 0 | 지속 15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K061","name":"김도하","courtId":"court:K061","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"변태온","type":"지휘","to":"김도하","basis":"김도하의 주민 거부권을 대합실에서 집행하고"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0074', 'd5c8-c591-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0074","name":"Heo Miri","title":"Godeok Base Stabling Operations Chief","position":"Godeok Base Stabling Operations Chief","characterId":"K074","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Stabling Track Cargo Sorting and Dispatch","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#person-heo-miri","detailRoute":"/people/person-0074","birthDate":"2101-04-04","birthday":"04-04","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"dispatch","name":"Freight-car sequencing","rating":60},{"id":"seal","name":"Seal and copy comparison","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stop-on-conflicting-markings","name":"Stop on Conflicting Markings","description":"Heo Miri prioritizes verification over departure when cargo markings and seals conflict.","behavior":"She stopped the eastbound departure whistle when a sample wagon’s sealing cord overlapped its medical marking.","stress":"She may resist letting conflicting markings pass unchecked.","relationship":"She may support Heo Seogyeom’s reinspection at the wagon when cargo markings require verification.","effects":[]},{"id":"fields-over-words","name":"Fields Over Words","description":"Heo Miri trusts wagon numbers and chalk-coded uses more than verbal cargo labels.","behavior":"She rewrites wagon numbers nightly and refuses to place messages relabeling weapons as research samples beside the chalk markings.","stress":"She may insist that uncertified cargo remain only on the gravel sidings.","relationship":"Kim Doha’s pressure to advance household wagons may cause friction over chalk coding and dispatch enforcement.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She halted a car with conflicting medical marks and seals. Classification and anomaly judgment are documented, not judicial authority or combat experience.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d5c8-c591-cc9c","name":"Heo of Yangcheon","crest":"clan-crests/d5c8-c591-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-5,"Openness":10,"Force":-35,"Material":5,"Communal":0,"Principle":40,"Public":50,"Eligibility":35,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":-20,"Display":25,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Stabling Track Cargo Sorting and Dispatch","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Godeok Base Stabling Operations Chief","Duty":"Godeok 1-dong. At the Godeok Depot holding track, Heo Miri leaves chalk marks on suspect freight cars and cuts off the dispatch whistle until Heo Seogyeom''s re-inspection is finished.","Values":"Authority −5 | Openness 10 | Force −35 | Material 5 | Communal 0 | Principle 40 | Transparency 50 | Qualification 35 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving −5 | Possessiveness 0 | Risk −20 | Display 25 | Persistence 5 | Orientation same-sex | Union none"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up at the Sinjeong Rolling Stock Depot. At the Godeok Depot holding track, Heo Miri leaves chalk marks on suspect freight cars and cuts off the dispatch whistle until Heo Seogyeom''s re-inspection is finished.\n- Post: Godeok 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Godeok Base Stabling Operations Chief. Divides car uses by chalk color, and pushes any car smelling of weapons toward the holding-track ballast before its tag is removed.","Anecdote":"When the seal cord on a sample car standing on the Godeok Depot holding track overlapped with a medical marking, Heo Miri cut off the outbound whistle within Seoul and left only the chalk for a re-inspection car.","Relationships":"Takes direction from Yu Minho, enforcing his dispatch order with holding chalk, and backs Heo Seogyeom''s re-inspection in front of the car. Contends over chalk colors with Kim Doha''s pressure to put residential cars first.","Ambition":"Make freight without a certification tag stand only on the holding ballast, so that the Head of the Joint Technology Institute does not stake his neck on a military supply line.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can post the order slip of a tagless car next to the holding chalk, or hand over to the Three-Party Deliberation the hand that blocked an uncertified dispatch."},"biography":"Sorts out disguised supplies by the oil smell of freight cars, and never lets a message telling her to call weapons research samples be posted next to the holding chalk. She spares her words, busy rewriting car numbers every night.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Stabling Track Cargo Sorting and Dispatch\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Godeok Base Stabling Operations Chief\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 generation. Grew up at the Sinjeong Rolling Stock Depot. At the Godeok Depot holding track, Heo Miri leaves chalk marks on suspect freight cars and cuts off the dispatch whistle until Heo Seogyeom''s re-inspection is finished.\n- Post: Godeok 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Godeok Base Stabling Operations Chief. Divides car uses by chalk color, and pushes any car smelling of weapons toward the holding-track ballast before its tag is removed.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the seal cord on a sample car standing on the Godeok Depot holding track overlapped with a medical marking, Heo Miri cut off the outbound whistle within Seoul and left only the chalk for a re-inspection car.\n\n**Relations.** Takes direction from Yu Minho, enforcing his dispatch order with holding chalk, and backs Heo Seogyeom''s re-inspection in front of the car. Contends over chalk colors with Kim Doha''s pressure to put residential cars first.\n\n**Ambition.** Make freight without a certification tag stand only on the holding ballast, so that the Head of the Joint Technology Institute does not stake his neck on a military supply line.\n\n**Intervention.** Can post the order slip of a tagless car next to the holding chalk, or hand over to the Three-Party Deliberation the hand that blocked an uncertified dispatch.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −5 | Openness 10 | Force −35 | Material 5 | Communal 0 | Principle 40 | Transparency 50 | Qualification 35 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Possessiveness 0 | Risk −20 | Display 25 | Persistence 5 | Orientation same-sex | Union none\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K062","name":"Yu Minho","courtId":"court:K062","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Heo Miri","type":"Command","to":"Yu Minho","basis":"Receives command to enforce Yu Minho''s dispatch order with stabling chalk, and"},{"from":"Heo Miri","type":"Command","to":"Heo Seogyeom","basis":"backing Heo Seogyeom''s re-inspection in front of the bay"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0074","name":"허미리","title":"고덕기지 유치 실무장","position":"고덕기지 유치 실무장","characterId":"K074","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"유치선 화물 구분·배차","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-03#인물-허미리","detailRoute":"/people/person-0074","birthDate":"2101-04-04","birthday":"04-04","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"dispatch","name":"화차 순서 조정","rating":60},{"id":"seal","name":"봉인·사본 대조","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stop-on-conflicting-markings","name":"표시 충돌에 정지","description":"허미리는 화물의 표시와 봉인이 맞지 않으면 출발보다 확인을 우선한다.","behavior":"시료 칸의 봉인끈이 의료 표시와 겹치자 동부행 출발 호각을 끊었다.","stress":"충돌하는 표시를 그대로 통과시키지 않으려 할 수 있다.","relationship":"화물 표시의 재확인이 필요하다면 허서겸의 재검색을 칸 앞에서 지원할 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"fields-over-words","name":"말보다 칸 구분","description":"허미리는 화물을 부르는 말보다 칸 번호와 분필 색의 용도 구분을 중시한다.","behavior":"칸 번호를 밤마다 다시 쓰고 병기를 연구 시료로 부르라는 전갈을 분필 옆에 붙이지 않는다.","stress":"인증 없는 화물을 유치 자갈에만 세우려 할 수 있다.","relationship":"김도하가 민가 칸을 앞세우라고 압박한다면 분필 색과 배차 집행을 둘러싸고 마찰이 생길 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"의료 표시와 봉인끈이 충돌한 칸의 출발을 멈췄다. 칸 구분과 이상 판단은 확인되지만 사법권이나 전투 경력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d5c8-c591-cc9c","name":"양천 허씨","crest":"clan-crests/d5c8-c591-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-5,"개방":10,"무력":-35,"물질":5,"공동":0,"원칙":40,"공개":50,"자격":35,"분산":10,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":0,"위험":-20,"과시":25,"지속":5,"지향":"동성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"유치선 화물 구분·배차","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"고덕기지 유치 실무장","업무":"고덕1동. 허미리는 고덕기지 유치선에서 의심 화차의 분필 표시를 남기고 허서겸의 재검색이 끝날 때까지 출고 호각을 끊는다.","가치관":"권위 −5 | 개방 10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 5 | 공동 0 | 원칙 40 | 공개 50 | 자격 35 | 분산 10 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 0 | 위험 −20 | 과시 25 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 허미리는 고덕기지 유치선에서 의심 화차의 분필 표시를 남기고 허서겸의 재검색이 끝날 때까지 출고 호각을 끊는다.\n- 업무: 고덕1동.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 고덕기지 유치 실무장. 분필 색으로 칸 용도를 나누고, 병기 냄새가 나는 칸은 꼬리표를 떼기 전에 유치선 자갈 쪽으로 민다.","일화":"고덕기지 유치선에 선 시료 칸의 봉인끈이 의료 표시와 겹치자 허미리는 서울 안의 반출 호각을 끊고 재검색 칸 분필만 남겼다.","관계":"유민호의 배차 순서를 유치 분필로 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 허서겸의 재검색을 칸 앞에서 받친다. 김도하의 민가 칸을 앞세우라는 압력과 분필 색을 다툰다.","야망":"인증 꼬리표가 없는 화물은 유치 자갈에만 세우게 해, 공동기술원장이 군수 줄에 목을 맡기지 않게 한다.","공포":"","개입":"꼬리표가 없는 칸의 발주 쪽지를 유치 분필 옆에 붙이거나, 인증 없는 출고를 막은 손을 삼원 심의에 넘길 수 있다."},"biography":"화물 칸의 기름 냄새로 위장 물자를 가리고, 병기를 연구 시료로 부르라는 전갈을 유치 분필 옆에 붙이지 않는다. 칸 번호를 밤마다 다시 쓰느라 말을 아낀다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 유치선 화물 구분·배차\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 고덕기지 유치 실무장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 허미리는 고덕기지 유치선에서 의심 화차의 분필 표시를 남기고 허서겸의 재검색이 끝날 때까지 출고 호각을 끊는다.\n- 업무: 고덕1동.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 고덕기지 유치 실무장. 분필 색으로 칸 용도를 나누고, 병기 냄새가 나는 칸은 꼬리표를 떼기 전에 유치선 자갈 쪽으로 민다.\n\n**일화.** 고덕기지 유치선에 선 시료 칸의 봉인끈이 의료 표시와 겹치자 허미리는 서울 안의 반출 호각을 끊고 재검색 칸 분필만 남겼다.\n\n**관계.** 유민호의 배차 순서를 유치 분필로 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 허서겸의 재검색을 칸 앞에서 받친다. 김도하의 민가 칸을 앞세우라는 압력과 분필 색을 다툰다.\n\n**야망.** 인증 꼬리표가 없는 화물은 유치 자갈에만 세우게 해, 공동기술원장이 군수 줄에 목을 맡기지 않게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 꼬리표가 없는 칸의 발주 쪽지를 유치 분필 옆에 붙이거나, 인증 없는 출고를 막은 손을 삼원 심의에 넘길 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −5 | 개방 10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 5 | 공동 0 | 원칙 40 | 공개 50 | 자격 35 | 분산 10 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 0 | 위험 −20 | 과시 25 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K062","name":"유민호","courtId":"court:K062","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"허미리","type":"지휘","to":"유민호","basis":"유민호의 배차 순서를 유치 분필로 집행하는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"허미리","type":"지휘","to":"허서겸","basis":"허서겸의 재검색을 칸 앞에서 받친다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
