"무력":-15,"물질":30,"공동":30,"원칙":20,"공개":-20,"자격":35,"분산":15,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":-35,"위험":-15,"과시":30,"지속":35,"지향":"무성향","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"기록 보관·열람 기록","품계":"교사","직함":"공방 서기","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 10 | 무력 −15 | 물질 30 | 공동 30 | 원칙 20 | 공개 −20 | 자격 35 | 분산 15 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −15 | 과시 30 | 지속 35 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 고은하는 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 고은하는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 공방 서기 자리를 맡았다.\n- 고은하의 공방 서기 업무는 암사1동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 교사. 직함은 공방 서기.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"잉크가 마르기 전에는 평의회에 올리지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 기록 보관·열람 기록\n- 품계: 교사\n- 직함: 공방 서기\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 고은하는 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 고은하는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 공방 서기 자리를 맡았다.\n- 고은하의 공방 서기 업무는 암사1동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 교사. 직함은 공방 서기.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 10 | 무력 −15 | 물질 30 | 공동 30 | 원칙 20 | 공개 −20 | 자격 35 | 분산 15 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −15 | 과시 30 | 지속 35 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"고은하","type":"계약","to":"한소미","basis":""},{"from":"고은하","type":"계약","to":"류한뫼","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"류한뫼","type":"맹세","to":"고은하","basis":"암사 공방 서기 고은하와 쪽수를 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0111', 'bc30-d765-d574-88f5', '{"id":"person-0111","name":"Bae Na-gyeong","title":"Food Ledger Copy Reconciliation Clerk","position":"Food Ledger Copy Reconciliation Clerk","characterId":"K110","rank":"Teacher","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Cross-Checking Food Ledger Copies","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-04#person-bae-nagyeong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0111","birthDate":"2072-02-06","birthday":"02-06","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"contract","name":"Food-ledger copy reconciliation","rating":60},{"id":"closure","name":"Hazardous-route closure","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"reject-one-sided-extension-files","name":"Reject One-Sided Extension Files","description":"Bae Nagyeong does not accept a one-sided or deputy stamp as sufficient grounds for a contract extension.","behavior":"They distinguish the two sides'' copies by ink color, refuse to file one-sided extensions, and erase wording that calls a deputy stamp an extension.","stress":"","relationship":"They may exchange copies with Bae Chodam while maintaining procedural boundaries against requests for extensions lacking both sides'' stamps.","effects":[]},{"id":"preserve-blank-guarantee-fields","name":"Preserve Blank Guarantee Fields","description":"Bae Nagyeong treats the missing Im Hajun''s blank guarantor field as something that must not be filled with presumed consent.","behavior":"They set down the pen at signature fields lacking the superintendent and preserve Im Hajun''s guarantor field as blank.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She distinguishes ledger copies by ink color and rejects corrections confirmed by only one side. Numerical judgment and her temporary extra-door action in the cold snap are reflected, not authority to lead the settlement.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc30-d765-d574-88f5","name":"Heunghae Bae Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc30-d765-d574-88f5.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":10,"Force":-10,"Material":20,"Communal":35,"Principle":10,"Public":-30,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":20,"Risk":-5,"Display":-30,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Cross-Checking Food Ledger Copies","Rank":"Teacher","Title":"Food Ledger Copy Reconciliation Clerk","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 10 | Force −10 | Material 20 | Communal 35 | Principle 10 | Publicity −30 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 15 | Possessiveness 20 | Risk −5 | Display −30 | Endurance 25 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Bae Nagyeong grew up on the Yeongdeungpo underground passage night watch.\n- Bae Nagyeong''s work as Food Ledger Copy Reconciliation Clerk is connected to Cheonho 2-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Teacher. Title: Food Ledger Copy Reconciliation Clerk. She keeps the ink colors of the storeroom-side copy and the waiting-hall-side copy different, and does not file a correction signed by only one side.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"At Yeouido she exchanges the expiry copies and keeps the guarantor field of the missing Im Hajun blank.","Ambition":"She wants corrections to the winter food and fuel ledgers to remain valid only in the public ledger, so that a stronger party''s intervention cannot be disguised as an automatic correction.","Fear":"","Intervention":"She can expose a copy on which a stand-in signature was secretly applied and have the clerk replaced."},"biography":"When she sees a signature field with the Chief Steward''s seat vacant, she puts down her pen and rubs out with an eraser any wording that calls a proxy seal an extension. She confirms the expiry time by pump pressure rather than by what people say.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Cross-Checking Food Ledger Copies\n- Rank: Teacher\n- Title: Food Ledger Copy Reconciliation Clerk\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Bae Nagyeong grew up on the Yeongdeungpo underground passage night watch.\n- Bae Nagyeong''s work as Food Ledger Copy Reconciliation Clerk is connected to Cheonho 2-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Teacher. Title: Food Ledger Copy Reconciliation Clerk. She keeps the ink colors of the storeroom-side copy and the waiting-hall-side copy different, and does not file a correction signed by only one side.\n\n**Relationships.** At Yeouido she exchanges the expiry copies and keeps the guarantor field of the missing Im Hajun blank.\n\n**Ambition.** She wants corrections to the winter food and fuel ledgers to remain valid only in the public ledger, so that a stronger party''s intervention cannot be disguised as an automatic correction.\n\n**Intervention.** She can expose a copy on which a stand-in signature was secretly applied and have the clerk replaced.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 10 | Force −10 | Material 20 | Communal 35 | Principle 10 | Publicity −30 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Possessiveness 20 | Risk −5 | Display −30 | Endurance 25 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bae Na-gyeong","type":"Contract","to":"Han Somi","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0111","name":"배나경","title":"식량 장부 사본 대조 서기","position":"식량 장부 사본 대조 서기","characterId":"K110","rank":"교사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"식량 장부 사본 대조","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-04#인물-배나경","detailRoute":"/people/person-0111","birthDate":"2072-02-06","birthday":"02-06","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"contract","name":"식량 장부 사본 대조","rating":60},{"id":"closure","name":"위험 구간 폐쇄","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"reject-one-sided-extension-files","name":"한쪽 연장 철 거부","description":"배나경은 한쪽 날인이나 대행 날인을 계약 연장의 충분한 근거로 받아들이지 않는다.","behavior":"양쪽 사본의 잉크 색을 구분하고 한쪽만 날인된 연장은 철하지 않으며 대행 날인을 연장이라 부르는 문구를 지운다.","stress":"","relationship":"배초담과 사본을 교환하면서도 공동 날인 없는 연장을 요구하는 상대에게는 절차적 선을 지킬 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"preserve-blank-guarantee-fields","name":"빈 보증 칸 보존","description":"배나경은 실종된 임하준의 보증인 공란을 임의의 동의로 채워서는 안 된다고 여긴다.","behavior":"총관이 없는 서명란에서는 펜을 놓고 임하준의 보증인 칸을 공란으로 지킨다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"장부 사본을 잉크 색으로 구분하고 한쪽만 확인한 수정은 받아들이지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc30-d765-d574-88f5","name":"흥해 배씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc30-d765-d574-88f5.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":10,"무력":-10,"물질":20,"공동":35,"원칙":10,"공개":-30,"자격":25,"분산":15,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":20,"위험":-5,"과시":-30,"지속":25,"지향":"양성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"식량 장부 사본 대조","품계":"교사","직함":"식량 장부 사본 대조 서기","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 10 | 무력 −10 | 물질 20 | 공동 35 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −30 | 자격 25 | 분산 15 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 20 | 위험 −5 | 과시 −30 | 지속 25 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 배나경은 영등포 지하 통로 야간 당직에서 자랐다.\n- 배나경의 식량 장부 사본 대조 서기 업무는 천호2동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 교사. 직함은 식량 장부 사본 대조 서기. 창고 쪽 사본과 대합실 쪽 사본의 잉크 색을 다르게 두고, 한쪽만 서명된 수정은 철하지 않는다.","일화":"","관계":"여의도에서 만료 사본을 교환하고, 실종된 임하준의 보증인 칸을 공란으로 지킨다.","야망":"겨울 식량·연료 장부의 정정은 공개 원장에만 유효하게 남겨, 힘센 쪽의 개입이 자동 수정으로 위장되지 않게 한다.","공포":"","개입":"몰래 대신 서명된 사본을 폭로해 서기를 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"총관 빈자리가 있는 서명란을 보면 펜을 놓고, 대행 날인을 연장으로 부르는 문구를 지우개로 문지른다. 만료 시각을 사람 말보다 펌프 압력으로 확인한다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 식량 장부 사본 대조\n- 품계: 교사\n- 직함: 식량 장부 사본 대조 서기\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 배나경은 영등포 지하 통로 야간 당직에서 자랐다.\n- 배나경의 식량 장부 사본 대조 서기 업무는 천호2동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 교사. 직함은 식량 장부 사본 대조 서기. 창고 쪽 사본과 대합실 쪽 사본의 잉크 색을 다르게 두고, 한쪽만 서명된 수정은 철하지 않는다.\n\n**관계.** 여의도에서 만료 사본을 교환하고, 실종된 임하준의 보증인 칸을 공란으로 지킨다.\n\n**야망.** 겨울 식량·연료 장부의 정정은 공개 원장에만 유효하게 남겨, 힘센 쪽의 개입이 자동 수정으로 위장되지 않게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 몰래 대신 서명된 사본을 폭로해 서기를 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 10 | 무력 −10 | 물질 20 | 공동 35 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −30 | 자격 25 | 분산 15 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 20 | 위험 −5 | 과시 −30 | 지속 25 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"배나경","type":"계약","to":"한소미","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0112', 'b958-bb38-d654-67f3', '{"id":"person-0112","name":"Ryu Da-in","title":"Artisan Victim of Counterfeit Shutter Motor Parts","position":"Artisan Victim of Counterfeit Shutter Motor Parts","characterId":"K111","rank":"Teacher","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Managing Recovered Parts and the Victim Register","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-04#person-ryu-dain","detailRoute":"/people/person-0112","birthDate":"2081-09-02","birthday":"09-02","age":45,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"leak","name":"Shutter-motor joint inspection","rating":60},{"id":"evidence","name":"Preserving victim samples and registers","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"seal-retrieved-boxes","name":"Seal Retrieved Boxes","description":"Ryu Dain seeks to preserve the connection between defective retrieved parts and harm records by sealing them together.","behavior":"They place retrieved parts and the affected-person register in one box and open it for appraisal only before both an alley-pump mechanic and council messenger.","stress":"","relationship":"They may expect joint verification from Heo Gyeom and the council messenger and compare Jong Maru''s testimony with retrieved evidence.","effects":[]},{"id":"no-shifting-defect-costs","name":"No Shifting Defect Costs","description":"Ryu Dain rejects intermediaries who disguise responsibility for defective parts as cleanup costs to be passed on.","behavior":"They push cost-shifting intermediaries out of the workshop, ask Han Somi to halt shipments, and seek disclosure of the workshop that shipped fake parts.","stress":"They may press harder for origins and responsibility rather than accept forged stamps.","relationship":"They may expect Han Somi to respond to shipment-stop requests and find cooperation difficult with intermediaries who shift responsibility onto those affected.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Artisan Victim of Counterfeit Shutter Motor Parts.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b958-bb38-d654-67f3","name":"Munhwa Ryu Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b958-bb38-d654-67f3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":15,"Force":-25,"Material":10,"Communal":25,"Principle":20,"Public":-25,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":15,"Display":10,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Managing Recovered Parts and the Victim Register","Rank":"Teacher","Title":"Artisan Victim of Counterfeit Shutter Motor Parts","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 15 | Force −25 | Material 10 | Communal 25 | Principle 20 | Publicity −25 | Qualification 40 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving −5 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk 15 | Display 10 | Endurance −10 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Contractual Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Ryu Dain grew up on the Cheonho depot stove watch.\n- Ryu Dain''s work as Counterfeit Shutter Motor Parts Victim Artisan is connected to Amsa 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Teacher. Title: Artisan Victim of Counterfeit Shutter Motor Parts. He puts the recovered parts and the victim roll in the same box, and opens it for appraisal only when an Alley Pump mechanic and a Council messenger view it together.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"He testifies, together with Jongmaru of Guro, to both ends of the same counterfeit parts, leaves a scorched smell in Heo Gyeom''s Alley Pump log, and carries a debt from having demanded that Han Somi halt shipments.","Ambition":"Expose the dispatch workshop behind the counterfeit parts installed in the Amsa pumps, so that the joint maintenance-and-parts standard cannot become a shield for forged seals.","Fear":"","Intervention":"He can recover the forged seal master plate to justify halting his line, or expose whoever slipped an unregistered workshop into the roster, which would isolate the artisan."},"biography":"He smells the sweetness coming off the packing before he checks the standard seal, and he pushes brokers who pass defects off as cleanup costs out of the workshop. His hands are slow, but he always seals the recall crate.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Managing Recovered Parts and the Victim Register\n- Rank: Teacher\n- Title: Artisan Victim of Counterfeit Shutter Motor Parts\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Ryu Dain grew up on the Cheonho depot stove watch.\n- Ryu Dain''s work as Counterfeit Shutter Motor Parts Victim Artisan is connected to Amsa 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Teacher. Title: Artisan Victim of Counterfeit Shutter Motor Parts. He puts the recovered parts and the victim roll in the same box, and opens it for appraisal only when an Alley Pump mechanic and a Council messenger view it together.\n\n**Relationships.** He testifies, together with Jongmaru of Guro, to both ends of the same counterfeit parts, leaves a scorched smell in Heo Gyeom''s Alley Pump log, and carries a debt from having demanded that Han Somi halt shipments.\n\n**Ambition.** Expose the dispatch workshop behind the counterfeit parts installed in the Amsa pumps, so that the joint maintenance-and-parts standard cannot become a shield for forged seals.\n\n**Intervention.** He can recover the forged seal master plate to justify halting his line, or expose whoever slipped an unregistered workshop into the roster, which would isolate the artisan.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 15 | Force −25 | Material 10 | Community 25 | Principle 20 | Publicity −25 | Qualification 40 | Dispersion 15 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Monopoly −30 | Risk 15 | Display 10 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ryu Da-in","type":"Contract","to":"Heo Gyeom","basis":"leaving a burnt smell in Heo Gyeom''s alley pump log,"},{"from":"Ryu Da-in","type":"Contract","to":"Jong Maru","basis":"Testifies with Jong Maru of Guro to both ends of the same counterfeit part, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Jong Maru","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Da-in","basis":"Testifies with Ryu Dain of Amsa to both ends of the same counterfeit part"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0112","name":"류다인","title":"가짜 셔터 모터 부품 피해자 직공","position":"가짜 셔터 모터 부품 피해자 직공","characterId":"K111","rank":"교사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"회수 부품·피해 명부 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-04#인물-류다인","detailRoute":"/people/person-0112","birthDate":"2081-09-02","birthday":"09-02","age":45,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"leak","name":"셔터 모터 이음 점검","rating":60},{"id":"evidence","name":"피해 표본·명부 보존","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"seal-retrieved-boxes","name":"회수 상자 봉인","description":"류다인은 회수한 불량 부품과 피해 기록을 함께 봉인해 증거의 연결을 지키려 한다.","behavior":"회수 부품과 피해 명부를 같은 함에 넣고 골목펌프 정비사와 평의회 전령이 함께 볼 때만 감정을 위해 연다.","stress":"","relationship":"허겸과 평의회 전령에게 공동 확인을 기대하며 종마루의 증언과 회수 증거를 서로 대조하려 할 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"no-shifting-defect-costs","name":"불량 비용 전가 거부","description":"류다인은 불량 부품의 책임을 수습 비용이라는 말로 떠넘기는 중개인을 용납하지 않는다.","behavior":"불량 비용을 전가하는 중개인을 공방 밖으로 밀어내고 한소미에게 출고 중지를 요구하며 가짜 부품의 출고 공방 공개를 추진한다.","stress":"위조 도장보다 부품의 출처와 책임을 더 집요하게 물을 수 있다.","relationship":"한소미에게 출고 중지의 응답을 기대하고 책임을 피해자에게 넘기는 중개인과는 협력하기 어려울 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 가짜 셔터 모터 부품 피해자 직공.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b958-bb38-d654-67f3","name":"문화 류씨","crest":"clan-crests/b958-bb38-d654-67f3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":15,"무력":-25,"물질":10,"공동":25,"원칙":20,"공개":-25,"자격":40,"분산":15,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":-30,"위험":15,"과시":10,"지속":-10,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"회수 부품·피해 명부 관리","품계":"교사","직함":"가짜 셔터 모터 부품 피해자 직공","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 15 | 무력 −25 | 물질 10 | 공동 25 | 원칙 20 | 공개 −25 | 자격 40 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 −30 | 위험 15 | 과시 10 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 류다인은 천호 정비고 난로 당직에서 자랐다.\n- 류다인의 가짜 셔터 모터 부품 피해자 직공 업무는 암사1동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 교사. 직함은 가짜 셔터 모터 부품 피해자 직공. 회수 부품과 피해 명부를 같은 함에 넣고, 감정은 골목펌프 정비사와 평의회 전령이 함께 볼 때만 연다.","일화":"","관계":"구로의 종마루와 같은 가짜 부품의 양쪽 끝을 증언하고, 허겸의 골목펌프 일지에 단내를 남기며, 한소미에게 출고 중지를 요구해 온 빚이 있다.","야망":"암사 펌프에 들어간 가짜 부품의 출고 공방을 공개해, 정비·부품 공동규격이 위조 도장의 방패가 되지 않게 한다.","공포":"","개입":"위조 도장 원판을 회수해 그의 라인 중지를 정당화하거나, 명부에 없는 공방을 끼워 넣은 자를 밝혀 직공을 고립시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"패킹에서 나는 단내를 규격 도장보다 먼저 맡고, 불량을 수습 비용으로 넘기는 중개인을 공방 밖으로 밀어낸다. 손은 느려도 회수 상자는 봉인한다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 회수 부품·피해 명부 관리\n- 품계: 교사\n- 직함: 가짜 셔터 모터 부품 피해자 직공\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 류다인은 천호 정비고 난로 당직에서 자랐다.\n- 류다인의 가짜 셔터 모터 부품 피해자 직공 업무는 암사1동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 교사. 직함은 가짜 셔터 모터 부품 피해자 직공. 회수 부품과 피해 명부를 같은 함에 넣고, 감정은 골목펌프 정비사와 평의회 전령이 함께 볼 때만 연다.\n\n**관계.** 구로의 종마루와 같은 가짜 부품의 양쪽 끝을 증언하고, 허겸의 골목펌프 일지에 단내를 남기며, 한소미에게 출고 중지를 요구해 온 빚이 있다.\n\n**야망.** 암사 펌프에 들어간 가짜 부품의 출고 공방을 공개해, 정비·부품 공동규격이 위조 도장의 방패가 되지 않게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 위조 도장 원판을 회수해 그의 라인 중지를 정당화하거나, 명부에 없는 공방을 끼워 넣은 자를 밝혀 직공을 고립시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 15 | 무력 −25 | 물질 10 | 공동 25 | 원칙 20 | 공개 −25 | 자격 40 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 −30 | 위험 15 | 과시 10 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"류다인","type":"계약","to":"허겸","basis":"허겸의 골목펌프 일지에 단내를 남기며"},{"from":"류다인","type":"계약","to":"종마루","basis":"구로의 종마루와 같은 가짜 부품의 양쪽 끝을 증언하고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"종마루","type":"계약","to":"류다인","basis":"암사의 류다인과 같은 가짜 부품의 양쪽 끝을 증언한다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0113', 'c5c4-c601-c6d4', '{"id":"person-0113","name":"Eom Mi-rae","title":"Will Evidence Escort Herald","position":"Will Evidence Escort Herald","characterId":"K112","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Sealed Escort of Will Evidence","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-04#inmul-eommirae","detailRoute":"/people/person-0113","birthDate":"2078-08-21","birthday":"08-21","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"message","name":"Sealed-message delivery and checks","rating":60},{"id":"closure","name":"Hazardous-route closure","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"keep-sealed-until-arrival-is-confirmed","name":"Keep Sealed Until Arrival Is Confirmed","description":"Eom Mirae treats keeping evidence sealed until arrival confirmation as a delivery responsibility.","behavior":"They do not depart with loose seal knots or unseal evidence before arrival confirmation from transmission verification.","stress":"If the bag risks being opened in a transfer concourse and leaving only one copy, they may check seals and confirmation procedures more strictly.","relationship":"They may coordinate with Choi Jiwoo''s original-verification time but refuse a recipient''s request to open evidence without arrival confirmation.","effects":[]},{"id":"neutral-convoy-order","name":"Sealed Escort of Will Evidence","description":"Title: Will Evidence Escort Herald.","behavior":"Title: Will Evidence Escort Herald.","stress":"If a sole surviving copy could ignite unrest, they may prioritize equal evidence arrival over demands to broadcast one first.","relationship":"They may borrow Pyo Sanha''s messenger route while upholding lottery order and factual reporting against demands to deliver a favored original first.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She waits for arrival verification before opening evidence and closed a hazardous section. Sealed delivery and route judgment are supported, not combat escort.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-43130-S04","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K112","stateId":"S04","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s04","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-43130-S04","directLiegePersonId":"K423"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5c4-c601-c6d4","name":"Yeongwol Eom Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c5c4-c601-c6d4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":15,"Force":-10,"Material":20,"Communal":25,"Principle":5,"Public":5,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":50,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-15,"Display":-25,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Sealed Escort of Will Evidence","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Will Evidence Escort Herald","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 15 | Force −10 | Material 20 | Community 25 | Principle 5 | Publicity 5 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 15 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 50 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −15 | Display −25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Union Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 cohort. Eom Mirae grew up on the Sinnae transfer station watch. She took the post of Will Evidence Convoy Messenger by stopping an unticketed departing train.\n- Eom Mirae''s work as Will Evidence Convoy Messenger is linked to Amsa 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Will Evidence Escort Herald. The convoy order is drawn by lottery by the Council and the Records Audit, and she does not break the seal until the sender verification''s arrival confirmation comes.","Anecdote":"In 2125, Eom Mirae did not postpone the report of a collapse in a flooded section and closed it immediately. Because of this, the signature for the post of Will Evidence Convoy Messenger was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"She borrows the Council messenger route for the evidence convoy, times it to Choe Jiu''s original-verification hour, and swears not to put the maintenance-log fragments that Im Chowon can read into the same bag.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"She can open the transfer section to protect the sealed bag, or find the one sheet missing from the bag to either save or disqualify the messenger."},"biography":"If the knot of the sealing cord is loose, she does not depart, and she leaves no note outside the bag telling anyone to broadcast the original first. She keeps the route short and testifies only to facts.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Sealed Escort of Will Evidence\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Will Evidence Escort Herald\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 cohort. Eom Mirae grew up on the Sinnae transfer station watch. She took the post of Will Evidence Convoy Messenger by stopping an unticketed departing train.\n- Eom Mirae''s work as Will Evidence Convoy Messenger is linked to Amsa 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Will Evidence Escort Herald. The convoy order is drawn by lottery by the Council and the Records Audit, and she does not break the seal until the sender verification''s arrival confirmation comes.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, Eom Mirae did not postpone the report of a collapse in a flooded section and closed it immediately. Because of this, the signature for the post of Will Evidence Convoy Messenger was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** She borrows the Council messenger route for the evidence convoy, times it to Choe Jiu''s original-verification hour, and swears not to put the maintenance-log fragments that Im Chowon can read into the same bag.\n\n**Intervention.** She can open the transfer section to protect the sealed bag, or find the one sheet missing from the bag to either save or disqualify the messenger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 15 | Force −10 | Material 20 | Community 25 | Principle 5 | Publicity 5 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 15 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 50 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −15 | Display −25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Union Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Eom Mi-rae","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Timing it to Choe Jiu''s original-verification hour"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0113","name":"엄미래","title":"유언 증거 호송 전령","position":"유언 증거 호송 전령","characterId":"K112","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"유언 증거 봉함 호송","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-04#인물-엄미래","detailRoute":"/people/person-0113","birthDate":"2078-08-21","birthday":"08-21","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"message","name":"봉함 전갈 전달·대조","rating":60},{"id":"closure","name":"위험 구간 폐쇄","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"keep-sealed-until-arrival-is-confirmed","name":"도착 확인 전 봉함 유지","description":"엄미래는 증거 봉함을 도착 확인 전까지 유지해야 하는 전달 책임으로 여긴다.","behavior":"봉함 매듭이 느슨하면 출발하지 않고 송신 검증의 도착 확인이 오기 전에는 봉함을 풀지 않는다.","stress":"환승 대합실에서 가방이 열려 사본 한 장만 남을 우려가 커지면 봉함 상태와 확인 절차를 더 엄격히 점검할 수 있다.","relationship":"최지우의 원본 검증 시각에 맞추되 전달 상대가 도착 확인 없이 개봉을 요구하면 거절할 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"neutral-convoy-order","name":"유언 증거 호송 전령","description":"직함은 유언 증거 호송 전령.","behavior":"직함은 유언 증거 호송 전령.","stress":"한 사본만 남아 폭동의 불씨가 될 우려가 있으면 먼저 방송하라는 요구보다 증거의 동등한 도착을 우선할 수 있다.","relationship":"표산하의 전령로를 빌리면서도 특정 진본의 선행 전달을 요구하는 상대에게는 추첨과 사실 전달의 원칙을 지킬 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"증거 호송의 도착 확인을 기다리고 위험 구간을 폐쇄했다. 봉함 전달과 경로 판단을 평가하며 전투 호위는 원문에 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-43130-S04","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K112","stateId":"S04","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s04","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-43130-S04","directLiegePersonId":"K423"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5c4-c601-c6d4","name":"영월 엄씨","crest":"clan-crests/c5c4-c601-c6d4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":15,"무력":-10,"물질":20,"공동":25,"원칙":5,"공개":5,"자격":20,"분산":15,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":50,"독점":-20,"위험":-15,"과시":-25,"지속":0,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"유언 증거 봉함 호송","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"유언 증거 호송 전령","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 15 | 무력 −10 | 물질 20 | 공동 25 | 원칙 5 | 공개 5 | 자격 20 | 분산 15 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 50 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −15 | 과시 −25 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 엄미래는 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 엄미래는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 유언 증거 호송 전령 자리를 맡았다.\n- 엄미래의 유언 증거 호송 전령 업무는 암사1동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 유언 증거 호송 전령. 호송 순번은 평의회와 기록감사가 추첨하고, 송신 검증의 도착 확인이 오기 전에는 봉함을 풀지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 엄미래는 침수 구간 붕괴 보고를 미루지 않고 당장 폐쇄했다. 이 일로 유언 증거 호송 전령 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"평의회 전령로를 증거 호송에 빌리고, 최지우의 원본 검증 시각에 맞춘다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"환승 구간을 열어 봉함 가방을 지키거나, 가방에서 빠진 한 장을 찾아 전령을 구하거나 실격시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"봉함 끈의 매듭이 느슨하면 출발하지 않고, 진본을 먼저 방송하라는 쪽지를 가방 밖에 두지 않는다. 경로는 짧게, 증언은 사실만 전한다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 유언 증거 봉함 호송\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 유언 증거 호송 전령\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 엄미래는 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 엄미래는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 유언 증거 호송 전령 자리를 맡았다.\n- 엄미래의 유언 증거 호송 전령 업무는 암사1동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 유언 증거 호송 전령. 호송 순번은 평의회와 기록감사가 추첨하고, 송신 검증의 도착 확인이 오기 전에는 봉함을 풀지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 엄미래는 침수 구간 붕괴 보고를 미루지 않고 당장 폐쇄했다. 이 일로 유언 증거 호송 전령 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 평의회 전령로를 증거 호송에 빌리고, 최지우의 원본 검증 시각에 맞춘다.\n\n**개입.** 환승 구간을 열어 봉함 가방을 지키거나, 가방에서 빠진 한 장을 찾아 전령을 구하거나 실격시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 15 | 무력 −10 | 물질 20 | 공동 25 | 원칙 5 | 공개 5 | 자격 20 | 분산 15 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 50 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −15 | 과시 −25 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"엄미래","type":"계약","to":"최지우","basis":"최지우의 원본 검증 시각에 맞추며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0114', 'c5ec-c758-b839-4f59', '{"id":"person-0114","name":"Yeo Min-u","title":"Witness to the Discovery of the Encrypted Maintenance Log","position":"Witness to the Discovery of the Encrypted Maintenance Log","rank":"Teacher","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Sealing the Maintenance Log and Recording Its Discovery","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"S04","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0114","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}}}}', '{"id":"person-0114","name":"여민우","title":"암호화 정비일지 발견 증인","position":"암호화 정비일지 발견 증인","rank":"교사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"정비일지 봉인·발견 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"S04","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0114","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0115', 'ae30-d589-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0115","name":"Gi Ha-gyeom","title":"Militia Squad Leader","position":"Militia Squad Leader","characterId":"K114","rank":"Teacher","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Militia Duty Shift and Encampment Blocking","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-04#inmul-gihagyeom","detailRoute":"/people/person-0115","birthDate":"2073-08-07","birthday":"08-07","age":53,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"militia","name":"Militia shifts and billeting refusal","rating":60},{"id":"hearing","name":"Witness confrontation","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"no-outside-encampments","name":"No Outside Encampments","description":"Gi Hagyeom sees outside officers'' encampment and command as questions of local defense control rather than rescue.","behavior":"They block outside officers'' charging and encampment under council-veto entries and record passage requests before turning them back.","stress":"","relationship":"They may align shifts with Kim Boram''s pump-defense command.","effects":[]},{"id":"mobilize-citizens-by-lottery","name":"Mobilize Citizens by Lottery","description":"Gi Hagyeom ties militia mobilization to citizen representatives'' public lottery conditions rather than outside commanders'' demands.","behavior":"They initiate militia mobilization only through citizen representatives'' daytime lottery and align it with Kim Boram''s pump-defense shifts.","stress":"","relationship":"They may expect citizen representatives and Kim Boram to share responsibility for mobilization procedures and favor public verification when accounts conflict.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She blocks external officers’ billeting and uses citizen draws for militia shifts. Organization and refusal conditions are supported, not marksmanship or victories.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ae30-d589-c8fc","name":"Haengju Gi Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ae30-d589-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":5,"Openness":10,"Force":-25,"Material":10,"Communal":35,"Principle":10,"Public":-30,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-25,"Risk":0,"Display":10,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Militia Duty Shift and Encampment Blocking","Rank":"Teacher","Title":"Militia Squad Leader","Values":"Authority 5 | Openness 10 | Force −25 | Materiality 10 | Community 35 | Principle 10 | Publicity −30 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly −25 | Risk 0 | Display 10 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Opposite-Sex | Bonding Non-Exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Gi Hagyeom grew up on waiting-hall watch duty. Gi Hagyeom took the post of Militia Chief as a substitute watch after an unauthorized shift absence.\n- Gi Hagyeom''s duties as Militia Chief are tied to Cheonho 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Teacher. Title: Militia Squad Leader. She blocks outside officers'' charging and billeting in the compartments bearing the Council''s refusal, and opens militia mobilization only through the citizen representatives'' daytime lottery.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Under Kim Boram''s pump-defense command she aligns the militia shifts.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"By securing militia food and blockade supplies, you can sustain her refusal, or by finding evidence that the fire on the bridge was preemptive, you can replace the chief."},"biography":"She sends back the messenger who calls the officer''s banner at the bridge a rescue, and does not hand the Pump Defense night shift over to outside command. She hides her anger but does not withdraw the blockade barricade.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Militia Duty Shift and Encampment Blocking\n- Rank: Teacher\n- Title: Militia Squad Leader\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Gi Hagyeom grew up on waiting-hall watch duty. Gi Hagyeom took the post of Militia Chief as a substitute watch after an unauthorized shift absence.\n- Gi Hagyeom''s duties as Militia Chief are tied to Cheonho 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Teacher. Title: Militia Squad Leader. She blocks outside officers'' charging and billeting in the compartments bearing the Council''s refusal, and opens militia mobilization only through the citizen representatives'' daytime lottery.\n\n**Relations.** Under Kim Boram''s pump-defense command she aligns the militia shifts.\n\n**Intervention.** By securing militia food and blockade supplies, you can sustain her refusal, or by finding evidence that the fire on the bridge was preemptive, you can replace the chief.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness 10 | Force −25 | Materiality 10 | Community 35 | Principle 10 | Publicity −30 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly −25 | Risk 0 | Display 10 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Opposite-Sex | Bonding Non-Exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gi Ha-gyeom","type":"Command","to":"Kim Boram","basis":"aligning the militia shifts under Kim Boram''s pump-guard command"},{"from":"Gi Ha-gyeom","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Ga-on","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ryu Ga-on","type":"Contract","to":"Gi Ha-gyeom","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0115","name":"기하겸","title":"민병 조장","position":"민병 조장","characterId":"K114","rank":"교사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"민병 당직·숙영 차단","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-04#인물-기하겸","detailRoute":"/people/person-0115","birthDate":"2073-08-07","birthday":"08-07","age":53,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"militia","name":"민병 교대·숙영 차단","rating":60},{"id":"hearing","name":"증인 대질 진행","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"no-outside-encampments","name":"외부 숙영 거부","description":"기하겸은 외부 장교의 숙영과 지휘를 구원이 아니라 지역 수비의 통제 문제로 본다.","behavior":"평의회 거부가 붙은 칸에서 외부 장교의 충전과 숙영을 막고 통과 요청은 기록한 뒤 돌려보낸다.","stress":"","relationship":"김보람의 펌프수비 지휘에는 교대를 맞출 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"mobilize-citizens-by-lottery","name":"시민 추첨 동원","description":"기하겸은 민병 동원을 외부 지휘자의 요구가 아니라 시민대표의 공개된 추첨 조건에 묶는다.","behavior":"민병 동원은 시민대표의 낮 추첨으로만 열고 김보람의 펌프수비 교대와 맞춘다.","stress":"","relationship":"시민대표와 김보람에게 동원 절차의 공동 책임을 기대하며 말이 갈리는 경우 공개 확인을 선호할 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"외부 장교의 숙영을 막고 시민 추첨으로 민병 교대를 연다. 조직과 거부 조건은 확인되지만 사격·전투 승리는 확인되지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ae30-d589-c8fc","name":"행주 기씨","crest":"clan-crests/ae30-d589-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":5,"개방":10,"무력":-25,"물질":10,"공동":35,"원칙":10,"공개":-30,"자격":25,"분산":20,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-25,"위험":0,"과시":10,"지속":20,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"민병 당직·숙영 차단","품계":"교사","직함":"민병 조장","가치관":"권위 5 | 개방 10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 10 | 공동 35 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −30 | 자격 25 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −25 | 위험 0 | 과시 10 | 지속 20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 기하겸은 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 기하겸은 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 민병 조장 자리를 맡았다.\n- 기하겸의 민병 조장 업무는 천호1동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 교사. 직함은 민병 조장. 외부 장교의 충전과 숙영은 평의회 거부가 붙은 칸에서 막고, 민병 동원은 시민대표의 낮 추첨으로만 연다.","일화":"","관계":"김보람의 펌프수비 지휘 아래 민병 교대를 맞춘다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"민병 식량과 차단 물자를 구해 그의 거부를 유지하거나, 교량 사격의 선제 증거를 찾아 조장을 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"교량 쪽 장교 깃발을 구원으로 부르는 전령을 돌려보내고, 펌프수비의 야간 교대를 외부 지휘에 넘기지 않는다. 분노를 숨기되 차단 바리케이드는 거두지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 민병 당직·숙영 차단\n- 품계: 교사\n- 직함: 민병 조장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 기하겸은 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 기하겸은 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 민병 조장 자리를 맡았다.\n- 기하겸의 민병 조장 업무는 천호1동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 교사. 직함은 민병 조장. 외부 장교의 충전과 숙영은 평의회 거부가 붙은 칸에서 막고, 민병 동원은 시민대표의 낮 추첨으로만 연다.\n\n**관계.** 김보람의 펌프수비 지휘 아래 민병 교대를 맞춘다.\n\n**개입.** 민병 식량과 차단 물자를 구해 그의 거부를 유지하거나, 교량 사격의 선제 증거를 찾아 조장을 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 5 | 개방 10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 10 | 공동 35 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −30 | 자격 25 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −25 | 위험 0 | 과시 10 | 지속 20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"기하겸","type":"지휘","to":"김보람","basis":"김보람의 펌프수비 지휘 아래 민병 교대를 맞추고"},{"from":"기하겸","type":"계약","to":"류가온","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"류가온","type":"계약","to":"기하겸","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0116', 'bc30-d765-d574-88f5', '{"id":"person-0116","name":"Bae Ujin","title":"Commander of the Eastern Command","position":"Commander of the Eastern Command, the Arc''s hereditary rifle guard","characterId":"K115","rank":"Commander","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"Records Coordination","gender":"Male","stage":"Key","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#Person-Bae-Ujin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0116","birthDate":"2083-03-04","birthday":"03-04","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K143","recipientName":"Nam Hwi-gang","basis":"It overlaps with Bae Ujin''s guard network, but the bridge levers are held divided.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-05.json","anchor":"Person-Nam-Hwigang-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":12,"effective":12},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"k115-service-roster","name":"Service-roster handling","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k115-trait-1","name":"Service as the price","description":"Links parts exchange to service registration.","behavior":"Links parts exchange to service registration.","stress":"Retains the roster in military administration after the box is returned.","relationship":"Clashes with Gang Minseo and remains a borrower of I Hongwon’s gate.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Moving the rejected roster to military administration left an escort debt rather than citizenship. His command position does not confer I Hongwon’s gate authority.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s05","name":{"ko":"Amsa Station Demesne"},"holderPersonId":"K115","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S05","stationRef":{"stationId":"Amsa","stationName":"Amsa"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null},{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11740-S05","name":{"ko":"Gangdong-gu District Demesne"},"holderPersonId":"K115","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S05","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1174051500","name":"Gangil-dong"},{"id":"region:1174052500","name":"Sangilje 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1174052600","name":"Sangilje 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1174053000","name":"Myeongil 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1174054000","name":"Myeongil 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1174055000","name":"Godeok 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1174056000","name":"Godeok 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1174057000","name":"Amsa 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1174058000","name":"Amsa 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1174059000","name":"Amsa 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1174060000","name":"Cheonho 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1174061000","name":"Cheonho 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1174062000","name":"Cheonho 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1174064000","name":"Seongnae 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1174065000","name":"Seongnae 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1174066000","name":"Seongnae 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1174068500","name":"Gil-dong"},{"id":"region:1174069000","name":"Dunchon 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1174070000","name":"Dunchon 2-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11740-S05","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11740-S05","name":"Gangdong-gu District","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K115","basis":"Opening administrative scale group gu:11740(district) allocation · deterministic candidate selection","stateId":"S05","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1174051500","region:1174052500","region:1174052600","region:1174053000","region:1174054000","region:1174055000","region:1174056000","region:1174057000","region:1174058000","region:1174059000","region:1174060000","region:1174061000","region:1174062000","region:1174064000","region:1174065000","region:1174066000","region:1174068500","region:1174069000","region:1174070000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"Arc","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"bc30-d765-d574-88f5","name":"Heunghae Bae Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc30-d765-d574-88f5.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":70,"Openness":-50,"Force":70,"Material":20,"Communal":40,"Principle":-30,"Public":-50,"Eligibility":-20,"Dispersed":-60,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":50,"Monopoly":60,"Risk":40,"Display":30,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Records Coordination","Rank":"Commander","Title":"Commander of the Eastern Command"},"sections":{"Life":"Bae Ujin was born in 2083 into the hereditary Eastern Rifle Guard house of the Heunghae Bae clan. The house guards Amsa, Gangil-dong, Sangil 1-dong and 2-dong, and Myeongil 1-dong and 2-dong with rifles. The commander''s seat is hereditary in the house. Arc has no factory and no hospital, so broken machine bodies and rifle parts must be requested from Free City workshops, and every winter Bae Ujin counts fuel and parts stock personally. Light and heat draw outside machines, so Bae Ujin personally visits any post that breaks the light-out rule.","Offices":"Rank: Commander. Title: Commander of the Eastern Command, the Arc''s hereditary rifle guard. The Eastern Rifle Guard is Arc''s hereditary rifle guard. Livelihood: Records Coordination.","Anecdote":"","Houses":"The house keeps the post duty rotation and the winter fuel ledger together. The light-out inspection records are written by the duty guards separately from the house ledger.","Relationships":"Receives depot workshop parts from Han Jaemok and uses them to repair machine bodies. Often confers with the guards over the winter fuel share and the post duty rotation.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Records Coordination\n- Rank: Commander\n- Title: Commander of the Eastern Command\n- Bae Ujin handles the restoration-service register and parts-compensation coordination tied to Amsa 2-dong. Even in matters concerning the Amsa Station Demesne, I Hongwon manages the keys to the Changdong Bangho Clan''s blockade gate.\n- Bae Ujin personally checks the winter light-out records and fuel stock of the Amsa and Gangil-dong posts, and requests parts for broken machine bodies from Free City workshops.\n- Bae Ujin handles the military oversight of the Godeok base tied to Godeok 2-dong. Godeok Station and the base are different facilities."},"biography":"**Life.** Bae Ujin was born in 2083 into the hereditary Eastern Rifle Guard house of the Heunghae Bae clan. The house guards Amsa, Gangil-dong, Sangil 1-dong and 2-dong, and Myeongil 1-dong and 2-dong with rifles. The commander''s seat is hereditary in the house. Arc has no factory and no hospital, so broken machine bodies and rifle parts must be requested from Free City workshops, and every winter Bae Ujin counts fuel and parts stock personally. Light and heat draw outside machines, so Bae Ujin personally visits any post that breaks the light-out rule.\n**Office.** Rank: Commander. Title: Commander of the Eastern Command, the Arc''s hereditary rifle guard. The Eastern Rifle Guard is Arc''s hereditary rifle guard. Livelihood: Records Coordination.\n\n**House.** The house keeps the post duty rotation and the winter fuel ledger together. The light-out inspection records are written by the duty guards separately from the house ledger.\n**Relations.** Receives depot workshop parts from Han Jaemok and uses them to repair machine bodies. Often confers with the guards over the winter fuel share and the post duty rotation.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Records Coordination\n- Rank: Commander\n- Title: Commander of the Eastern Command, the Arc''s hereditary rifle guard\n- Bae Ujin handles the restoration-service roll and parts-payment coordination connected to Amsa 2-dong. Even in matters involving the Amsa Station directly managed land, Yi Hongwon manages the Changdong Guard House barrier gate key.\n- Bae Ujin personally checks the winter light-out records and fuel stock of the Amsa and Gangil-dong posts, and requests parts for broken machine bodies from Free City workshops.\n- Bae Ujin handles military oversight of the Godeok base connected to Godeok 2-dong. Godeok Station and the base are different facilities.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"Sin Jong-mok","type":"Command","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Former senior operative of the Eastern Command Special Recovery Team"},{"from":"Kim Uchan","type":"Command","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Receives command from the commander as an Eastern Command staff officer"},{"from":"Jeong Soyul","type":"Grudge","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Resentment at absorbing emergency oversight into the administrative ledger"},{"from":"I Yunseo","type":"Command","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Carries out command of the eastern bridge blockade"},{"from":"Jeong Harin","type":"Grudge","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Grudge Over the Military Oversight Demand"},{"from":"Gwon Mi-rae","type":"Grudge","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Delays censorship demands as technical faults"},{"from":"Jo Eunu","type":"Grudge","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Tracks jamming suspicions"},{"from":"Gang Taesan","type":"Grudge","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Resentment over the corridor with the Amsa Patrol"},{"from":"Seol Bom-i","type":"Contract","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Obeys Bae Ujin''s public disclosure of restoration results but refuses concealed power distribution"},{"from":"Geun Uram","type":"Oath","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Refuses Bae Ujin''s demand for family service at the bedside"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0116","name":"배우진","title":"동방사 사령관","position":"아크 세습 소총 근위대 동방사 사령관","characterId":"K115","rank":"사령관","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"기록 조정","gender":"남성","stage":"주요","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#인물-배우진","detailRoute":"/people/person-0116","birthDate":"2083-03-04","birthday":"03-04","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K143","recipientName":"남휘강","basis":"배우진의 호위망과 겹치지만, 교량 레버는 나누어 쥔다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-05.json","anchor":"인물-남휘강-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":12,"effective":12},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"k115-service-roster","name":"복무 명부 처리","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k115-trait-1","name":"복무를 대가로","description":"부품 거래에 복무 등록을 결부한다.","behavior":"부품 거래에 복무 등록을 결부한다.","stress":"상자가 돌아와도 명부를 병조에 남긴다.","relationship":"강민서와 충돌하고 이홍원의 차단문을 빌리는 관계에 머문다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"거부된 명부를 병조 함으로 옮긴 선택은 시민권이 아니라 호위의 빚을 남겼다. 사령관 지위가 이홍원의 차단문 권한까지 주지는 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s05","name":{"ko":"암사역 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K115","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S05","stationRef":{"stationId":"암사","stationName":"암사"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null},{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11740-S05","name":{"ko":"강동구 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K115","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S05","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1174051500","name":"강일동"},{"id":"region:1174052500","name":"상일제1동"},{"id":"region:1174052600","name":"상일제2동"},{"id":"region:1174053000","name":"명일1동"},{"id":"region:1174054000","name":"명일2동"},{"id":"region:1174055000","name":"고덕1동"},{"id":"region:1174056000","name":"고덕2동"},{"id":"region:1174057000","name":"암사1동"},{"id":"region:1174058000","name":"암사2동"},{"id":"region:1174059000","name":"암사3동"},{"id":"region:1174060000","name":"천호1동"},{"id":"region:1174061000","name":"천호2동"},{"id":"region:1174062000","name":"천호3동"},{"id":"region:1174064000","name":"성내1동"},{"id":"region:1174065000","name":"성내2동"},{"id":"region:1174066000","name":"성내3동"},{"id":"region:1174068500","name":"길동"},{"id":"region:1174069000","name":"둔촌1동"},{"id":"region:1174070000","name":"둔촌2동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11740-S05","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11740-S05","name":"강동구","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K115","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11740(district) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S05","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1174051500","region:1174052500","region:1174052600","region:1174053000","region:1174054000","region:1174055000","region:1174056000","region:1174057000","region:1174058000","region:1174059000","region:1174060000","region:1174061000","region:1174062000","region:1174064000","region:1174065000","region:1174066000","region:1174068500","region:1174069000","region:1174070000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"Arc","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"bc30-d765-d574-88f5","name":"흥해 배씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc30-d765-d574-88f5.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"권위":70,"개방":-50,"무력":70,"물질":20,"공동":40,"원칙":-30,"공개":-50,"자격":-20,"분산":-60,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":50,"독점":60,"위험":40,"과시":30,"지속":-10,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"기록 조정","품계":"사령관","직함":"동방사 사령관"},"sections":{"생애":"배우진은 2083년 흥해 배씨 동방사 세습 가문에서 태어났다. 가문은 암사와 강일동, 상일제1동·상일제2동, 명일1동·명일2동 일대를 소총으로 지킨다. 사령관 자리는 가문이 세습한다. Arc에는 공장도 병원도 없어서 부서진 기체와 총기의 부품은 자유도시 공방에 부탁해야 하고, 배우진은 겨울마다 연료와 부품 재고를 직접 센다. 불빛과 열은 바깥 기계를 불러들이므로, 소등 규칙을 어긴 초소는 직접 찾아가 점검한다.","관직":"품계 사령관. 직함은 동방사 사령관. 동방사는 아크의 세습 소총 근위대다. 생업은 기록 조정이다.","일화":"","가문":"가문은 초소 순번표와 겨울 연료 장부를 함께 맡는다. 소등 점검 기록은 당직 경비대가 가문의 장부와 따로 적는다.","관계":"한재목에게서 차량기지 공방의 부품을 받아 기체 수리에 쓴다. 겨울 연료 몫과 초소 당직 순번을 두고 경비대원들과 자주 의논한다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 기록 조정\n- 품계: 사령관\n- 직함: 동방사 사령관\n- 암사역 직영지와 관련된 일에서도 창동방호가 차단문 열쇠는 이홍원이 관리한다.\n- 배우진은 암사와 강일동 초소의 겨울 소등 기록과 연료 재고를 직접 확인하고, 부서진 기체 부품은 자유도시 공방에 요청한다.\n- 배우진은 고덕2동과 연결된 고덕기지 군사 감독을 맡는다. 고덕역과 기지는 서로 다른 시설이다."},"biography":"**생애.** 배우진은 2083년 흥해 배씨 동방사 세습 가문에서 태어났다. 가문은 암사와 강일동, 상일제1동·상일제2동, 명일1동·명일2동 일대를 소총으로 지킨다. 사령관 자리는 가문이 세습한다. Arc에는 공장도 병원도 없어서 부서진 기체와 총기의 부품은 자유도시 공방에 부탁해야 하고, 배우진은 겨울마다 연료와 부품 재고를 직접 센다. 불빛과 열은 바깥 기계를 불러들이므로, 소등 규칙을 어긴 초소는 직접 찾아가 점검한다.\n**관직.** 품계 사령관. 직함은 동방사 사령관. 동방사는 아크의 세습 소총 근위대다. 생업은 기록 조정이다.\n\n**가문.** 가문은 초소 순번표와 겨울 연료 장부를 함께 맡는다. 소등 점검 기록은 당직 경비대가 가문의 장부와 따로 적는다.\n**관계.** 한재목에게서 차량기지 공방의 부품을 받아 기체 수리에 쓴다. 겨울 연료 몫과 초소 당직 순번을 두고 경비대원들과 자주 의논한다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 기록 조정\n- 품계: 사령관\n- 직함: 동방사 사령관\n- 암사역 직영지와 관련된 일에서도 창동방호가 차단문 열쇠는 이홍원이 관리한다.\n- 배우진은 암사와 강일동 초소의 겨울 소등 기록과 연료 재고를 직접 확인하고, 부서진 기체 부품은 자유도시 공방에 요청한다.\n- 배우진은 고덕2동과 연결된 고덕기지 군사 감독을 맡는다. 고덕역과 기지는 서로 다른 시설이다.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"신종목","type":"지휘","to":"배우진","basis":"동방사 특수회수반 선임 공작원 출신"},{"from":"김우찬","type":"지휘","to":"배우진","basis":"동방사 참모로서 사령 지휘를 받음"},{"from":"정소율","type":"원한","to":"배우진","basis":"비상감독을 행정 원장에 받아 안는 원한"},{"from":"이윤서","type":"지휘","to":"배우진","basis":"동부 교량 봉쇄 지휘를 집행"},{"from":"정하린","type":"원한","to":"배우진","basis":"군사감독 요구에 대한 원한"},{"from":"권미래","type":"원한","to":"배우진","basis":"검열 요구를 기술 장애로 지연"},{"from":"조은우","type":"원한","to":"배우진","basis":"재밍 의혹을 추적"},{"from":"강태산","type":"원한","to":"배우진","basis":"암사 순찰대와 회랑을 둘러싼 원한"},{"from":"설봄이","type":"계약","to":"배우진","basis":"배우진의 복구 실적 공개에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"근우람","type":"맹세","to":"배우진","basis":"배우진의 가족 복무 요구를 침상 앞에서 거부한다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0117', 'ae40-acbd-c8fc-91d1', '{"id":"person-0117","name":"Kim Uchan","title":"Amsa Night Patrol Guard","position":"Arc Deputy Guard Chief","characterId":"K116","rank":"Guard","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Restoration Record Posting and Dispatch Management","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#inmul-gim-uchan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0117","birthDate":"2082-07-17","birthday":"07-17","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":10,"effective":10}},"skills":[{"id":"k116-dispatch-coordination","name":"Dispatch coordination","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k116-choice","name":"Amsa Night Patrol Guard","description":"He shares discipline and speed with Commander Bae Ujin, but his habit of seeing debate as weakness runs deeper. When a subordinate family''s fuel and food share falls behind, he walks the patrol route himself.","behavior":"Title: Amsa Night Patrol Guard.","stress":"Fear. That a single post light would draw outside machines in, and Arc, which has no factory, would lose machine bodies all at once. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Takes Bae Ujin''s orders at close range and shares the light-out rotation with fellow patrol guards.","effects":[]},{"id":"k116-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Guard. Title: Amsa night patrol guard. Records gaps where light leaks and machine-body repair bays where heat rises during patrol.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Guard. Title: Amsa night patrol guard. Records gaps where light leaks and machine-body repair bays where heat rises during patrol.","stress":"Fear. That a single post light would draw outside machines in, and Arc, which has no factory, would lose machine bodies all at once. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Takes Bae Ujin''s orders at close range and shares the light-out rotation with fellow patrol guards.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Amsa Night Patrol Guard.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ae40-acbd-c8fc-91d1","name":"Gyeongju Gim Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ae40-acbd-c8fc-91d1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":85,"Openness":-50,"Force":90,"Material":15,"Communal":25,"Principle":-20,"Public":-40,"Eligibility":-10,"Dispersed":-55,"Transformative":-25},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-5,"Risk":25,"Display":15,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Restoration Record Posting and Dispatch Management","Rank":"Guard","Title":"Arc Deputy Guard Chief","Values":"Authority 85 | Openness −50 | Force 90 | Material 15 | Communal 25 | Principle −20 | Publicity −40 | Qualification −10 | Dispersion −55 | Transformation −25","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness −5 | Risk 25 | Display 15 | Endurance −5 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Offices":"Rank: Guard. Title: Arc Deputy Guard Chief. He posts restoration results but bypasses dispatch and blockades through a secret officer network, and records defectors as traitors.\n\nAnecdote. In 2125, Gim Uchan seized an armed intruder outside the door and opened a re-check of the roll.","Relationships":"Takes Bae Ujin''s orders at close range and shares the light-out rotation with fellow patrol guards.","Ambition":"To bind the eastern patrol routes'' light-out checklists into one and rise to a place beside Bae Ujin where he is responsible for the patrol rotation.\n\nFear. Gim Uchan fears that a single post light will draw outside machines in and cost Arc its machine bodies all at once.","Intervention":"He can hand the secret officer roster over to the Records Office, or secure army provisions for the dispatch formation so that the chief of staff''s operations chart is carried out."},"biography":"Gim Uchan shares discipline and speed with the commander, but his habit of seeing debate as a weakness runs deeper. When a subordinate family''s fuel and food share is delayed, he walks the patrol route himself.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Restoration Record Posting and Dispatch Management\n- Rank: Guard\n- Title: Arc Deputy Guard Chief\nLife. Gim Uchan was born in the third generation. Gim Uchan grew up at the Amsa guard post. Gim Uchan''s Eastern Command chief of staff seat opened through catching an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- On the patrol route connected to Amsa 2-dong, Gim Uchan handles light-out checks and heat records for machine bodies.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guard. Title: Arc Deputy Guard Chief. He posts restoration results but bypasses dispatch and blockades through a secret officer network, and records defectors as traitors.\n\nAnecdote. In 2125, Gim Uchan seized an armed intruder outside the door and opened a re-check of the roll.\n\n**Relations.** Takes Bae Ujin''s orders at close range and shares the light-out rotation with fellow patrol guards.\n\n**Ambition.** To bind the eastern patrol routes'' light-out checklists into one and rise to a place beside Bae Ujin where he is responsible for the patrol rotation.\n\nFear. Gim Uchan fears that a single post light will draw outside machines in and cost Arc its machine bodies all at once.\n\n**Intervention.** He can hand the secret officer roster over to the Records Office, or secure army provisions for the dispatch formation so that the chief of staff''s operations chart is carried out.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 85 | Openness −50 | Force 90 | Material 15 | Communal 25 | Principle −20 | Publicity −40 | Qualification −10 | Dispersion −55 | Transformation −25\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness −5 | Risk 25 | Display 15 | Endurance −5 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Kim Uchan","type":"Command","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Receives command from the commander as an Eastern Command staff officer"},{"from":"Kim Uchan","type":"Rivalry","to":"Gim Tae-un","basis":"Compares night tunnel patrol methods and light-out checks with each other"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Jang Seogyun","type":"Command","to":"Kim Uchan","basis":"Translates the operations chart into officer training"},{"from":"Gim Tae-un","type":"Rivalry","to":"Kim Uchan","basis":"Compares night tunnel patrol methods and light-out checks with the Amsa guards"},{"from":"Ji Mokhyeon","type":"Command","to":"Kim Uchan","basis":"A command that carries Gim Uchan''s operations chart only in sealed form, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0117","name":"김우찬","title":"암사 야간 순찰 경비","position":"Arc 경비 부책임자","characterId":"K116","rank":"경비대원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"복구 실적 게시·배차 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#인물-김우찬","detailRoute":"/people/person-0117","birthDate":"2082-07-17","birthday":"07-17","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":10,"effective":10}},"skills":[{"id":"k116-dispatch-coordination","name":"배차 조정","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k116-choice","name":"암사 야간 순찰 경비","description":"규율과 속도를 사령관 배우진과 나누되, 토론을 약점으로 보는 버릇은 더 짙다. 부하 가족의 연료와 식량 몫이 밀리면 자신이 순찰 길을 돈다.","behavior":"직함은 암사 야간 순찰 경비.","stress":"공포. 초소 불빛 하나 때문에 바깥 기계가 몰려와, 공장 없는 Arc가 기체를 한꺼번에 잃는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 배우진의 지시를 가까이서 받으며, 순찰 동료들과 소등 순번을 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k116-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 경비대원. 직함은 암사 야간 순찰 경비. 순찰 중 불빛이 새는 틈과 열이 오르는 기체 정비 칸을 기록한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 경비대원. 직함은 암사 야간 순찰 경비. 순찰 중 불빛이 새는 틈과 열이 오르는 기체 정비 칸을 기록한다.","stress":"공포. 초소 불빛 하나 때문에 바깥 기계가 몰려와, 공장 없는 Arc가 기체를 한꺼번에 잃는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 배우진의 지시를 가까이서 받으며, 순찰 동료들과 소등 순번을 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 암사 야간 순찰 경비.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ae40-acbd-c8fc-91d1","name":"경주 김씨","crest":"clan-crests/ae40-acbd-c8fc-91d1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":85,"개방":-50,"무력":90,"물질":15,"공동":25,"원칙":-20,"공개":-40,"자격":-10,"분산":-55,"변혁":-25},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-5,"위험":25,"과시":15,"지속":-5,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"복구 실적 게시·배차 관리","품계":"경비대원","직함":"Arc 경비 부책임자","가치관":"권위 85 | 개방 −50 | 무력 90 | 물질 15 | 공동 25 | 원칙 −20 | 공개 −40 | 자격 −10 | 분산 −55 | 변혁 −25","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −5 | 위험 25 | 과시 15 | 지속 −5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"관직":"품계 경비대원. 직함은 Arc 경비 부책임자. 복구 실적을 게시하되 비밀 장교 인맥으로 배차와 봉쇄를 우회하고, 이탈자를 배신으로 기록한다.\n\n일화. 김우찬은 2125년 무장 난입자를 문 밖에서 붙들어 명부 재점검을 열었다.","관계":"배우진의 지시를 가까이서 받으며, 순찰 동료들과 소등 순번을 나눈다.","야망":"동부 순찰 길의 소등 점검표를 하나로 묶어, 배우진 곁에서 순찰 순번을 책임지는 자리에 오른다.\n\n공포. 김우찬은 초소 불빛 하나 때문에 바깥 기계가 몰려와 기체를 한꺼번에 잃는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"비밀 장교 명단을 기록청에 넘기거나, 파견 편성의 군량을 확보해 참모장의 작전표를 실행하게 할 수 있다."},"biography":"김우찬은 규율과 속도를 사령관과 나누되, 토론을 약점으로 보는 버릇은 더 짙다. 부하 가족의 연료와 식량 몫이 밀리면 자신이 순찰 길을 돈다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 복구 실적 게시·배차 관리\n- 품계: 경비대원\n- 직함: Arc 경비 부책임자\n생애. 김우찬은 3세대에 태어났다. 김우찬은 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 김우찬의 동방사 참모장 자리는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 김우찬은 암사2동과 이어진 순찰 길에서 소등 점검과 기체 열 기록을 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 경비대원. 직함은 Arc 경비 부책임자. 복구 실적을 게시하되 비밀 장교 인맥으로 배차와 봉쇄를 우회하고, 이탈자를 배신으로 기록한다.\n\n일화. 김우찬은 2125년 무장 난입자를 문 밖에서 붙들어 명부 재점검을 열었다.\n\n**관계.** 배우진의 지시를 가까이서 받으며, 순찰 동료들과 소등 순번을 나눈다.\n\n**야망.** 동부 순찰 길의 소등 점검표를 하나로 묶어, 배우진 곁에서 순찰 순번을 책임지는 자리에 오른다.\n\n공포. 김우찬은 초소 불빛 하나 때문에 바깥 기계가 몰려와 기체를 한꺼번에 잃는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 비밀 장교 명단을 기록청에 넘기거나, 파견 편성의 군량을 확보해 참모장의 작전표를 실행하게 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 85 | 개방 −50 | 무력 90 | 물질 15 | 공동 25 | 원칙 −20 | 공개 −40 | 자격 −10 | 분산 −55 | 변혁 −25\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −5 | 위험 25 | 과시 15 | 지속 −5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"김우찬","type":"지휘","to":"배우진","basis":"동방사 참모로서 사령 지휘를 받음"},{"from":"김우찬","type":"경쟁","to":"김태운","basis":"터널 야간 순찰 방식과 소등 점검을 서로 견줌"}],"incoming":[{"from":"장석윤","type":"지휘","to":"김우찬","basis":"작전표를 장교 훈련으로 번역"},{"from":"김태운","type":"경쟁","to":"김우찬","basis":"터널 야간 순찰 방식과 소등 점검을 암사 경비와 견줌"},{"from":"지목현","type":"지휘","to":"김우찬","basis":"김우찬의 작전표를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0118', 'c815-d574-c8fc-912d', '{"id":"person-0118","name":"Jeong Soyul","title":"Division Chief","position":"Amsa Machine-Body Inspection Division Chief","characterId":"K117","rank":"Division Chief","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Machine-Body Condition Records and Parts Stock Management","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#inmul-jeong-soyul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0118","birthDate":"2083-10-01","birthday":"10-01","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k117-water-ledger","name":"Machine-body parts ledger management","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k117-choice","name":"Division Chief","description":"Calculating and a keeper of rules, she hated the self whose voice dropped when army boots entered the inspection room. She saw trades that swapped parts shares for guard records as an insult.","behavior":"Title: Division Chief.","stress":"Fear. That in a winter when parts run out, another side would use machine-body repair as bait to take duty staff''s families away. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Submits machine-body condition records to Bae Ujin and checks parts that arrive from Han Jaemok''s workshop against the ledger.","effects":[]},{"id":"k117-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Division Chief. Title: Amsa machine-body inspection division chief. She posted machine-body condition and parts stock on the inspection board, but checked the guard''s urgent repair requests against the records the next morning.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Division Chief. Title: Amsa machine-body inspection division chief. She posted machine-body condition and parts stock on the inspection board, but checked the guard''s urgent repair requests against the records the next morning.","stress":"Fear. That in a winter when parts run out, another side would use machine-body repair as bait to take duty staff''s families away. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Submits machine-body condition records to Bae Ujin and checks parts that arrive from Han Jaemok''s workshop against the ledger.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Division Chief.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c815-d574-c8fc-912d","name":"Haeju Jeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c815-d574-c8fc-912d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":80,"Openness":-35,"Force":65,"Material":20,"Communal":35,"Principle":-10,"Public":-40,"Eligibility":-20,"Dispersed":-70,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":35,"Display":5,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Machine-Body Condition Records and Parts Stock Management","Rank":"Division Chief","Title":"Division Chief","Values":"Authority 80 | Openness −35 | Force 65 | Material 20 | Communal 35 | Principle −10 | Disclosure −40 | Credential −20 | Decentralization −70 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 5 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk 35 | Display 5 | Endurance −10 | Orientation Fluid | Union Monogamous"},"sections":{"Offices":"Rank: Division Chief. Title: Amsa Machine-Body Inspection Division Chief. She posts machine-body condition and parts stock on the inspection board, but checks the guard''s urgent repair requests against the records the next morning.","Relationships":"She submits machine-body condition records to Bae Ujin and checks parts arriving from Han Jaemok''s workshop against the ledger.","Ambition":"She means to put parts stock and repair order on one public ledger, so that records, not guard circumstances, decide the repair order.\n\nFear. Jeong Soyul fears that in a winter when parts run out, another side will use machine-body repair as bait to take duty staff''s families away.","Intervention":"By escorting the review vouchers, you can preserve the Director''s term-limit clause; or you can brand a withheld seal as betrayal and turn the Administration into an agent of the officers."},"biography":"Jeong Soyul is calculating and tries to keep the rules, but she hates how her voice drops whenever army boots enter the inspection room. She regards any deal that trades parts shares for guard records as an insult.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Machine-Body Condition Records and Parts Stock Management\n- Rank: Division Chief\n- Title: Amsa Machine-Body Inspection Division Chief\nLife. Jeong Soyul was born in 2083. Jeong Soyul grew up on duty in the machine-body inspection room. Jeong Soyul''s post as division chief opened as she kept taking substitute duty in the inspection room on winter nights.\n- In work connected with Amsa 2-dong, Jeong Soyul handles the machine-body condition board, the parts stock ledger, and the next-morning cross-check desk.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Division Chief. Title: Amsa Machine-Body Inspection Division Chief. She posts machine-body condition and parts stock on the inspection board, but checks the guard''s urgent repair requests against the records the next morning.\n\n**Relationships.** She submits machine-body condition records to Bae Ujin and checks parts arriving from Han Jaemok''s workshop against the ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** She means to put parts stock and repair order on one public ledger, so that records, not guard circumstances, decide the repair order.\n\nFear. Jeong Soyul fears that in a winter when parts run out, another side will use machine-body repair as bait to take duty staff''s families away.\n\n**Intervention.** By escorting the review vouchers, you can preserve the Director''s term-limit clause; or you can brand a withheld seal as betrayal and turn the Administration into an agent of the officers.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 80 | Openness −35 | Force 65 | Material 20 | Communal 35 | Principle −10 | Disclosure −40 | Credential −20 | Decentralization −70 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk 35 | Display 5 | Endurance −10 | Orientation Fluid | Union Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jeong Soyul","type":"Grudge","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Resentment at absorbing emergency oversight into the administrative ledger"},{"from":"Jeong Soyul","type":"Contract","to":"Han Jae-mok","basis":"Checked the machine-part stock records against the free city workshop''s exchange box list"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Choe Doyun","type":"Roster entrustment","to":"Jeong Soyul","basis":""},{"from":"Ju Dan-a","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Soyul","basis":"Checking Jeong Soyul''s parts stock ledger seals before the exchange"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0118","name":"정소율","title":"본부장","position":"암사 기체 점검 본부장","characterId":"K117","rank":"본부장","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"기체 상태 기록·부품 재고 관리","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#인물-정소율","detailRoute":"/people/person-0118","birthDate":"2083-10-01","birthday":"10-01","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k117-water-ledger","name":"기체 부품 장부 관리","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k117-choice","name":"본부장","description":"계산적이고 규칙을 지키려 하나, 군화가 점검실에 들어오면 목소리가 낮아지는 자신을 싫어한다. 부품 몫을 경비 실적과 바꾸는 거래를 모욕으로 본다.","behavior":"직함은 본부장.","stress":"공포. 부품이 떨어진 겨울에 다른 쪽이 기체 수리를 미끼로 당직자 가족을 데려가는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 배우진에게 기체 상태 기록을 올리고, 한재목의 공방에서 들어온 부품은 장부와 대조한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k117-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 본부장. 직함은 암사 기체 점검 본부장. 기체 상태와 부품 재고를 점검판에 공개하되, 경비대의 긴급 수리 요청은 다음 날 아침 기록과 대조한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 본부장. 직함은 암사 기체 점검 본부장. 기체 상태와 부품 재고를 점검판에 공개하되, 경비대의 긴급 수리 요청은 다음 날 아침 기록과 대조한다.","stress":"공포. 부품이 떨어진 겨울에 다른 쪽이 기체 수리를 미끼로 당직자 가족을 데려가는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 배우진에게 기체 상태 기록을 올리고, 한재목의 공방에서 들어온 부품은 장부와 대조한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 본부장.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c815-d574-c8fc-912d","name":"해주 정씨","crest":"clan-crests/c815-d574-c8fc-912d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":80,"개방":-35,"무력":65,"물질":20,"공동":35,"원칙":-10,"공개":-40,"자격":-20,"분산":-70,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":-30,"위험":35,"과시":5,"지속":-10,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"기체 상태 기록·부품 재고 관리","품계":"본부장","직함":"본부장","가치관":"권위 80 | 개방 −35 | 무력 65 | 물질 20 | 공동 35 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 −40 | 자격 −20 | 분산 −70 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 −30 | 위험 35 | 과시 5 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"관직":"품계 본부장. 직함은 암사 기체 점검 본부장. 기체 상태와 부품 재고를 점검판에 공개하되, 경비대의 긴급 수리 요청은 다음 날 아침 기록과 대조한다.","관계":"배우진에게 기체 상태 기록을 올리고, 한재목의 공방에서 들어온 부품은 장부와 대조한다.","야망":"부품 재고와 수리 순서를 한 장부에 공개해, 경비 사정이 아니라 기록이 수리 순서를 정하게 한다.\n\n공포. 정소율은 부품이 떨어진 겨울에 다른 쪽이 기체 수리를 미끼로 당직자 가족을 데려가는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"재심 전표를 호송해 청장의 기한 조항을 살리거나, 날인 보류를 배신으로 몰아 행정청을 장교 대행으로 바꿀 수 있다."},"biography":"정소율은 계산적이고 규칙을 지키려 하나, 군화가 점검실에 들어오면 목소리가 낮아지는 자신을 싫어한다. 부품 몫을 경비 실적과 바꾸는 거래를 모욕으로 본다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 기체 상태 기록·부품 재고 관리\n- 품계: 본부장\n- 직함: 암사 기체 점검 본부장\n생애. 정소율은 2083년에 태어났다. 정소율은 기체 점검실 당직에서 자랐다. 정소율의 본부장 자리는 겨울 밤 점검실 대체 당직을 이어 맡으며 열렸다.\n- 정소율은 암사2동과 이어진 업무에서 기체 상태 점검판과 부품 재고 장부, 다음 날 아침 대조 창구를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 본부장. 직함은 암사 기체 점검 본부장. 기체 상태와 부품 재고를 점검판에 공개하되, 경비대의 긴급 수리 요청은 다음 날 아침 기록과 대조한다.\n\n**관계.** 배우진에게 기체 상태 기록을 올리고, 한재목의 공방에서 들어온 부품은 장부와 대조한다.\n\n**야망.** 부품 재고와 수리 순서를 한 장부에 공개해, 경비 사정이 아니라 기록이 수리 순서를 정하게 한다.\n\n공포. 정소율은 부품이 떨어진 겨울에 다른 쪽이 기체 수리를 미끼로 당직자 가족을 데려가는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 재심 전표를 호송해 청장의 기한 조항을 살리거나, 날인 보류를 배신으로 몰아 행정청을 장교 대행으로 바꿀 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 80 | 개방 −35 | 무력 65 | 물질 20 | 공동 35 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 −40 | 자격 −20 | 분산 −70 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 −30 | 위험 35 | 과시 5 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"정소율","type":"원한","to":"배우진","basis":"비상감독을 행정 원장에 받아 안는 원한"},{"from":"정소율","type":"계약","to":"한재목","basis":"기체 부품 재고 기록을 자유도시 공방의 교환 상자 목록과 맞대어 봄"}],"incoming":[{"from":"최도윤","type":"명부 위탁","to":"정소율","basis":""},{"from":"주단아","type":"계약","to":"정소율","basis":"정소율의 부품 재고 장부 봉인을 교환 전에 확인하며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0119', 'c7a5-d765-b355', '{"id":"person-0119","name":"Jang Seogyun","title":"Godeok Rifle Guard Instructor","position":"Godeok Rifle Guard Instructor","characterId":"K118","rank":"Guard","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Rifle Guard Training and Instructor Notebook Management","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#inmul-jang-seokyun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0119","birthDate":"2095-09-18","birthday":"09-18","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":7,"effective":7}},"skills":[{"id":"k118-officer-training","name":"Officer corps training","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k118-choice","name":"Protection mixed with coercion","description":"He took responsibility for his men like family but never forgave desertion during training. He wanted to put service registration in place of parts into the standard manual.","behavior":"Anecdote. In the 2125 station fire he carried out the roster of lives first. By this deed the signature of the Godeok officer corps instructor post rose into the ledger.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. A command relation translating Kim Woochan''s operations table into training, trading barrier-gate tactics with Lee Gangmuk, the southwest guard captain.","effects":[]},{"id":"k118-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Guard. Title: Godeok Rifle Guard Instructor. He published training records and family rations together but kept the secret society''s codes only in the instructor''s notebook, bypassing the official order network.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Guard. Title: Godeok Rifle Guard Instructor. He published training records and family rations together but kept the secret society''s codes only in the instructor''s notebook, bypassing the official order network.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. A command relation translating Kim Woochan''s operations table into training, trading barrier-gate tactics with Lee Gangmuk, the southwest guard captain.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Anecdote. In the 2125 station fire he carried out the roster of lives first. By this deed the signature of the Godeok officer corps instructor post rose into the ledger. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c7a5-d765-b355","name":"Heungdeok Jang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c7a5-d765-b355.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":65,"Openness":-50,"Force":70,"Material":25,"Communal":35,"Principle":-20,"Public":-35,"Eligibility":-25,"Dispersed":-60,"Transformative":-25},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-10,"Display":25,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Rifle Guard Training and Instructor Notebook Management","Rank":"Guard","Title":"Godeok Rifle Guard Instructor","Values":"Authority 65 | Openness −50 | Force 70 | Material 25 | Communal 35 | Principle −20 | Disclosure −35 | Credential −25 | Decentralization −60 | Transformation −25","Desires":"Craving −5 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk −10 | Display 25 | Endurance −5 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Offices":"Rank: Guard. Title: Godeok Rifle Guard Instructor. He discloses training results and family rations together, but keeps secret society passwords only in the instructor''s notebook, bypassing the official chain of command.\n\nAnecdote. During the 2125 Station Fire, Jang Seok-yun carried out the register of lives first.","Relationships":"A command relationship in which he translates Kim Uchan''s operations sheets into training; he trades blocking-gate tactics with Southwest Guard Captain I Gangmuk.","Ambition":"He means to put the guards'' training rotation and winter duty rotation into one ledger, so no post is ever left short of people.\n\nFear. Jang Seok-yun fears a night when the Godeok training ground duty is short of people and kidnappers slip in between the posts.","Intervention":"You can expose the secret society roster in the instructor''s notebook, or bring a draft Voluntary Service Charter into the training ground to block the expansion of the register."},"biography":"Jang Seok-yun takes responsibility for his subordinates like family, but forgives no desertion during training. He wants service registration, rather than spare parts, written into the standard manual.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Rifle Guard Training and Instructor Notebook Management\n- Rank: Guard\n- Title: Godeok Rifle Guard Instructor\nLife. Jang Seok-yun was born in the 4th generation. Jang Seok-yun grew up on waiting-hall duty. Jang Seok-yun''s post as Godeok Officer Corps Instructor opened through covering shifts for unexcused absences.\n- In his work tied to Godeok 2-dong, Jang Seok-yun handles officer corps training and family rations, while keeping the secret instructor''s notebook separate.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guard. Title: Godeok Rifle Guard Instructor. He discloses training results and family rations together, but keeps secret society passwords only in the instructor''s notebook, bypassing the official chain of command.\n\nAnecdote. During the 2125 Station Fire, Jang Seok-yun carried out the register of lives first.\n\n**Relationships.** A command relationship in which he translates Kim Uchan''s operations sheets into training; he trades blocking-gate tactics with Southwest Guard Captain I Gangmuk.\n\n**Ambition.** He means to put the guards'' training rotation and winter duty rotation into one ledger, so no post is ever left short of people.\n\nFear. Jang Seok-yun fears a night when the Godeok training ground duty is short of people and kidnappers slip in between the posts.\n\n**Intervention.** You can expose the secret society roster in the instructor''s notebook, or bring a draft Voluntary Service Charter into the training ground to block the expansion of the register.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 65 | Openness −50 | Force 70 | Material 25 | Communal 35 | Principle −20 | Disclosure −35 | Credential −25 | Decentralization −60 | Transformation −25\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk −10 | Display 25 | Endurance −5 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jang Seogyun","type":"Command","to":"Kim Uchan","basis":"Translates the operations chart into officer training"},{"from":"Jang Seogyun","type":"Contract","to":"I Gangmuk","basis":"Trading Barrier-Gate Tactics with the Seonam Guard"},{"from":"Jang Seogyun","type":"Grudge","to":"Baek On","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"I Gangmuk","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Seogyun","basis":"Trading Barrier-Gate Tactics with a Godeok Officer"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0119","name":"장석윤","title":"고덕 소총 경비대 교관","position":"고덕 소총 경비대 교관","characterId":"K118","rank":"경비대원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"소총 경비 훈련·교관 수첩 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#인물-장석윤","detailRoute":"/people/person-0119","birthDate":"2095-09-18","birthday":"09-18","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":7,"effective":7}},"skills":[{"id":"k118-officer-training","name":"장교단 훈련","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k118-choice","name":"보호와 강제를 함께","description":"부하를 가족처럼 책임지되 훈련 중 이탈은 용서하지 않는다. 부품 대신 복무 등록을 표준 교범에 넣고 싶어 한다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 이 일로 고덕 장교단 교관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 김우찬의 작전표를 훈련으로 번역하는 지휘 관계이고, 서남 경비대장 이강묵과 차단문 전술을 거래한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k118-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 경비대원. 직함은 고덕 소총 경비대 교관. 훈련 실적과 가족 배급을 함께 공개하지만, 비밀 결사 암호는 교관 수첩에만 남겨 공식 명령망을 우회한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 경비대원. 직함은 고덕 소총 경비대 교관. 훈련 실적과 가족 배급을 함께 공개하지만, 비밀 결사 암호는 교관 수첩에만 남겨 공식 명령망을 우회한다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 김우찬의 작전표를 훈련으로 번역하는 지휘 관계이고, 서남 경비대장 이강묵과 차단문 전술을 거래한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일화. 2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 이 일로 고덕 장교단 교관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c7a5-d765-b355","name":"흥덕 장씨","crest":"clan-crests/c7a5-d765-b355.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":65,"개방":-50,"무력":70,"물질":25,"공동":35,"원칙":-20,"공개":-35,"자격":-25,"분산":-60,"변혁":-25},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":-15,"위험":-10,"과시":25,"지속":-5,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"소총 경비 훈련·교관 수첩 관리","품계":"경비대원","직함":"고덕 소총 경비대 교관","가치관":"권위 65 | 개방 −50 | 무력 70 | 물질 25 | 공동 35 | 원칙 −20 | 공개 −35 | 자격 −25 | 분산 −60 | 변혁 −25","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −10 | 과시 25 | 지속 −5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"관직":"품계 경비대원. 직함은 고덕 소총 경비대 교관. 훈련 실적과 가족 배급을 함께 공개하지만, 비밀 결사 암호는 교관 수첩에만 남겨 공식 명령망을 우회한다.\n\n일화. 장석윤은 2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다.","관계":"김우찬의 작전표를 훈련으로 번역하는 지휘 관계이고, 서남 경비대장 이강묵과 차단문 전술을 거래한다.","야망":"경비대원의 훈련 순번과 겨울 당직 순번을 한 장부에 올려, 어느 초소에서도 인원이 비지 않게 한다.\n\n공포. 장석윤은 인원이 모자라 고덕 훈련장 당직이 빈 밤에 납치범이 초소 사이로 들어오는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"교관 수첩의 결사 명단을 폭로하거나, 자발 복무 헌장 초안을 훈련장에 들여 호적 확대를 막을 수 있다."},"biography":"장석윤은 부하를 가족처럼 책임지되 훈련 중 이탈은 용서하지 않는다. 부품 대신 복무 등록을 표준 교범에 넣고 싶어 한다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 소총 경비 훈련·교관 수첩 관리\n- 품계: 경비대원\n- 직함: 고덕 소총 경비대 교관\n생애. 장석윤은 4세대에 태어났다. 장석윤은 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 장석윤의 고덕 장교단 교관 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 장석윤은 고덕2동과 연결된 업무에서 장교단 훈련과 가족 배급을 다루되 비밀 교관 수첩은 따로 둔다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 경비대원. 직함은 고덕 소총 경비대 교관. 훈련 실적과 가족 배급을 함께 공개하지만, 비밀 결사 암호는 교관 수첩에만 남겨 공식 명령망을 우회한다.\n\n일화. 장석윤은 2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다.\n\n**관계.** 김우찬의 작전표를 훈련으로 번역하는 지휘 관계이고, 서남 경비대장 이강묵과 차단문 전술을 거래한다.\n\n**야망.** 경비대원의 훈련 순번과 겨울 당직 순번을 한 장부에 올려, 어느 초소에서도 인원이 비지 않게 한다.\n\n공포. 장석윤은 인원이 모자라 고덕 훈련장 당직이 빈 밤에 납치범이 초소 사이로 들어오는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 교관 수첩의 결사 명단을 폭로하거나, 자발 복무 헌장 초안을 훈련장에 들여 호적 확대를 막을 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 65 | 개방 −50 | 무력 70 | 물질 25 | 공동 35 | 원칙 −20 | 공개 −35 | 자격 −25 | 분산 −60 | 변혁 −25\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −10 | 과시 25 | 지속 −5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"장석윤","type":"지휘","to":"김우찬","basis":"작전표를 장교 훈련으로 번역"},{"from":"장석윤","type":"계약","to":"이강묵","basis":"차단문 전술을 서남 경비와 거래"},{"from":"장석윤","type":"원한","to":"백온","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"이강묵","type":"계약","to":"장석윤","basis":"차단문 전술을 고덕 장교와 거래"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0120', 'c774-c5f0-c548-674e', '{"id":"person-0120","name":"I Yunseo","title":"Eastern Bridge Blockade Commander","position":"Eastern Bridge Blockade Commander","characterId":"K119","rank":"Guard","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Bridge Passage and Night Blockade Management","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#inmul-i-yunseo","detailRoute":"/people/person-0120","birthDate":"2089-07-17","birthday":"07-17","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"k119-ridge-patrol","name":"Ridge patrol","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k119-choice","name":"Keeps medical exceptions","description":"Direct and faithful, he disliked superiors who used exceptions to the patrol rotation as political gifts. He heard the echo of the tunnel under the bridge before footsteps.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125, on a ridge patrol, he read the ambush traces first and prevented the harm. By this deed the signature of the eastern bridge blockade chief post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That he would mistake the sound of an outside machine in the tunnel for a fellow patrol, and light and gunfire would spread all at once. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Bae Woojin''s bridge command and competed with Go Seojun''s ridge reconnaissance over passage.","effects":[]},{"id":"k119-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Guard. Title: Eastern Bridge Blockade Commander. He opened daytime passage with administrative gate-toll slips, recognized only escort code tags for the night blockade, and left the medical train the sole exception.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Guard. Title: Eastern Bridge Blockade Commander. He opened daytime passage with administrative gate-toll slips, recognized only escort code tags for the night blockade, and left the medical train the sole exception.","stress":"Fear. That he would mistake the sound of an outside machine in the tunnel for a fellow patrol, and light and gunfire would spread all at once. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Bae Woojin''s bridge command and competed with Go Seojun''s ridge reconnaissance over passage.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Anecdote. In 2125, on a ridge patrol, he read the ambush traces first and prevented the harm. By this deed the signature of the eastern bridge blockade chief post rose into the ledger. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c774-c5f0-c548-674e","name":"Yeonan I Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c774-c5f0-c548-674e.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":65,"Openness":-30,"Force":55,"Material":10,"Communal":30,"Principle":-30,"Public":-45,"Eligibility":-10,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":20,"Risk":5,"Display":15,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Bridge Passage and Night Blockade Management","Rank":"Guard","Title":"Eastern Bridge Blockade Commander","Values":"Authority 65 | Openness −30 | Force 55 | Material 10 | Communal 30 | Principle −30 | Publicity −45 | Credentials −10 | Dispersion −40 | Transformation −20","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly 20 | Risk 5 | Display 15 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Same-sex | Union None"},"sections":{"Offices":"Rank: Guard. Title: Eastern Bridge Blockade Commander. Opens daytime passage with administrative gate-toll slips, recognizes only Eastern Command cipher tags for the night blockade, and leaves only medical trains as an exception.\n\nAnecdote. During a ridge patrol in 2125, Yi Yunseo read the signs of an ambush first and prevented losses.","Relationships":"Carries out Bae Ujin''s bridge command and competes with Go Seojun''s ridge reconnaissance over passage.","Ambition":"Ties the eastern Han River bridges and outer approach roads to the Blockade Corps'' single clock.\n\nFear. Yi Yunseo fears mistaking the sound of an outside machine in the tunnel for a fellow patrol, and letting light and gunfire spread all at once.","Intervention":"Can uncover the cause of the damage to lift the blockade, or trace the smuggling route for medical-train weapons to eliminate the exception."},"biography":"Yi Yunseo is straightforward and loyal, but dislikes superiors who use exceptions to the patrol rotation as political gifts. Hears the echo of the tunnel under the bridge before footsteps.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Bridge Passage and Night Blockade Management\n- Rank: Guard\n- Title: Eastern Bridge Blockade Commander\nLife. Yi Yunseo was born in the 4th generation. Yi Yunseo grew up at an Amsa guard post. Yi Yunseo''s post as Eastern Bridge Blockade Commander opened up after catching an unauthorized night crossing.\n- In the bridge blockade work connected to Amsa 2-dong, Yi Yunseo hands over by distinguishing daytime gate-toll slips, night cipher tags, and medical-train exceptions.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guard. Title: Eastern Bridge Blockade Commander. Opens daytime passage with administrative gate-toll slips, recognizes only Eastern Command cipher tags for the night blockade, and leaves only medical trains as an exception.\n\nAnecdote. During a ridge patrol in 2125, Yi Yunseo read the signs of an ambush first and prevented losses.\n\n**Relationships.** Carries out Bae Ujin''s bridge command and competes with Go Seojun''s ridge reconnaissance over passage.\n\n**Ambition.** Ties the eastern Han River bridges and outer approach roads to the Blockade Corps'' single clock.\n\nFear. Yi Yunseo fears mistaking the sound of an outside machine in the tunnel for a fellow patrol, and letting light and gunfire spread all at once.\n\n**Intervention.** Can uncover the cause of the damage to lift the blockade, or trace the smuggling route for medical-train weapons to eliminate the exception.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 65 | Openness −30 | Force 55 | Material 10 | Communal 30 | Principle −30 | Publicity −45 | Credentials −10 | Dispersion −40 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly 20 | Risk 5 | Display 15 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Same-sex | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"I Yunseo","type":"Command","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Carries out command of the eastern bridge blockade"},{"from":"I Yunseo","type":"Rivalry","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Competes over ridge reconnaissance and bridge passage"},{"from":"I Yunseo","type":"Debt","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ma Gilsang","type":"Command","to":"I Yunseo","basis":"Receives command to hand over surveying to Yi Yunseo''s blockade clock"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0120","name":"이윤서","title":"동부 교량봉쇄대장","position":"동부 교량봉쇄대장","characterId":"K119","rank":"경비대원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"교량 통행·야간 봉쇄 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#인물-이윤서","detailRoute":"/people/person-0120","birthDate":"2089-07-17","birthday":"07-17","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"k119-ridge-patrol","name":"능선 초계","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k119-choice","name":"의료 예외 유지","description":"직선적이고 신의가 있으나 순찰 순번의 예외를 정치 선물로 쓰는 상관을 싫어한다. 다리 아래 터널의 울림을 발소리보다 먼저 듣는다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 능선 초계 중 매복 흔적을 먼저 읽어 피해를 막았다. 이 일로 동부 교량봉쇄대장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 터널에 들어온 바깥 기계의 소리를 동료 순찰로 착각해, 불빛과 총성이 한꺼번에 퍼지는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 배우진의 교량 지휘를 집행하고, 고서준의 능선 정찰과 통행을 경쟁한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k119-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 경비대원. 직함은 동부 교량봉쇄대장. 주간 통행은 행정 관문세 전표로 열고, 야간 봉쇄는 동방사 암호패만 인정하며 의료열차만 예외로 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 경비대원. 직함은 동부 교량봉쇄대장. 주간 통행은 행정 관문세 전표로 열고, 야간 봉쇄는 동방사 암호패만 인정하며 의료열차만 예외로 남긴다.","stress":"공포. 터널에 들어온 바깥 기계의 소리를 동료 순찰로 착각해, 불빛과 총성이 한꺼번에 퍼지는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 배우진의 교량 지휘를 집행하고, 고서준의 능선 정찰과 통행을 경쟁한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일화. 2125년 능선 초계 중 매복 흔적을 먼저 읽어 피해를 막았다. 이 일로 동부 교량봉쇄대장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c774-c5f0-c548-674e","name":"연안 이씨","crest":"clan-crests/c774-c5f0-c548-674e.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":65,"개방":-30,"무력":55,"물질":10,"공동":30,"원칙":-30,"공개":-45,"자격":-10,"분산":-40,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":20,"위험":5,"과시":15,"지속":-10,"지향":"동성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"교량 통행·야간 봉쇄 관리","품계":"경비대원","직함":"동부 교량봉쇄대장","가치관":"권위 65 | 개방 −30 | 무력 55 | 물질 10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 −45 | 자격 −10 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 20 | 위험 5 | 과시 15 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"관직":"품계 경비대원. 직함은 동부 교량봉쇄대장. 주간 통행은 행정 관문세 전표로 열고, 야간 봉쇄는 동방사 암호패만 인정하며 의료열차만 예외로 남긴다.\n\n일화. 이윤서는 2125년 능선 초계 중 매복 흔적을 먼저 읽어 피해를 막았다.","관계":"배우진의 교량 지휘를 집행하고, 고서준의 능선 정찰과 통행을 경쟁한다.","야망":"동부 한강 교량과 외곽 진입로를 봉쇄대 단일 시계로 묶는다.\n\n공포. 이윤서는 터널에 들어온 바깥 기계의 소리를 동료 순찰로 착각해 불빛과 총성이 한꺼번에 퍼지는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"파손 원인을 밝혀 봉쇄를 풀거나, 의료열차 무기 밀수 경로를 추적해 예외를 없앨 수 있다."},"biography":"이윤서는 직선적이고 신의가 있으나 순찰 순번의 예외를 정치 선물로 쓰는 상관을 싫어한다. 다리 아래 터널의 울림을 발소리보다 먼저 듣는다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 교량 통행·야간 봉쇄 관리\n- 품계: 경비대원\n- 직함: 동부 교량봉쇄대장\n생애. 이윤서는 4세대에 태어났다. 이윤서는 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 이윤서의 동부 교량봉쇄대장 자리는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 이윤서는 암사2동과 연결된 교량 봉쇄 업무에서 주간 관문세 전표, 야간 암호패, 의료열차 예외를 구분해 인계한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 경비대원. 직함은 동부 교량봉쇄대장. 주간 통행은 행정 관문세 전표로 열고, 야간 봉쇄는 동방사 암호패만 인정하며 의료열차만 예외로 남긴다.\n\n일화. 이윤서는 2125년 능선 초계 중 매복 흔적을 먼저 읽어 피해를 막았다.\n\n**관계.** 배우진의 교량 지휘를 집행하고, 고서준의 능선 정찰과 통행을 경쟁한다.\n\n**야망.** 동부 한강 교량과 외곽 진입로를 봉쇄대 단일 시계로 묶는다.\n\n공포. 이윤서는 터널에 들어온 바깥 기계의 소리를 동료 순찰로 착각해 불빛과 총성이 한꺼번에 퍼지는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 파손 원인을 밝혀 봉쇄를 풀거나, 의료열차 무기 밀수 경로를 추적해 예외를 없앨 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 65 | 개방 −30 | 무력 55 | 물질 10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 −45 | 자격 −10 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 20 | 위험 5 | 과시 15 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"이윤서","type":"지휘","to":"배우진","basis":"동부 교량 봉쇄 지휘를 집행"},{"from":"이윤서","type":"경쟁","to":"고서준","basis":"능선 정찰과 교량 통행을 겨룸"},{"from":"이윤서","type":"빚","to":"장세화","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"마길상","type":"지휘","to":"이윤서","basis":"이윤서의 봉쇄 시계에 측량을 넘기는 지휘를 받고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0121', 'bc15-bc00-c591', '{"id":"person-0121","name":"Bak Hayul","title":"Godeok Base Train Maintenance Chief","position":"Godeok Base Train Maintenance Chief","characterId":"K120","rank":"Guard","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Train Dispatch and Parts Specification Inspection","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#Person-Bak-Hayul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0121","birthDate":"2074-01-22","birthday":"01-22","age":52,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k120-wheel-inspection","name":"Wheel defect inspection","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"k120-choice","name":"Verifies before release","description":"Taciturn, she read a route''s lie from wheel wear.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125 she felt out a wheel defect just short of a siding derailment and stopped the train. By this deed the signature of the Godeok depot train maintenance chief post rose into the ledger.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Competing with Lee Juntaek''s Gunja maintenance standards over the eastern specs, seeing Gang Minseo as the needed parts supplier, and approving Kim Woochan''s secret dispatches at the maintenance window only at the last.","effects":[]},{"id":"k120-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Guard. Title: Godeok Base Train Maintenance Chief. She posted the repair order on the board in three columns, patrol, training, and spare parts, and used no screw with no recorded origin before measuring it separately.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Guard. Title: Godeok Base Train Maintenance Chief. She posted the repair order on the board in three columns, patrol, training, and spare parts, and used no screw with no recorded origin before measuring it separately.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Competing with Lee Juntaek''s Gunja maintenance standards over the eastern specs, seeing Gang Minseo as the needed parts supplier, and approving Kim Woochan''s secret dispatches at the maintenance window only at the last.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Anecdote. In 2125 she felt out a wheel defect just short of a siding derailment and stopped the train. By this deed the signature of the Godeok depot train maintenance chief post rose into the ledger. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc15-bc00-c591","name":"Miryang Bak Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc15-bc00-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":70,"Openness":-40,"Force":65,"Material":15,"Communal":40,"Principle":-30,"Public":-45,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":-50,"Transformative":-35},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":-15,"Display":-25,"Sustained":15,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Train Dispatch and Parts Specification Inspection","Rank":"Guard","Title":"Godeok Base Train Maintenance Chief","Values":"Authority 70 | Openness −40 | Force 65 | Material 15 | Communal 40 | Principle −30 | Publicity −45 | Credentials 0 | Dispersion −50 | Transformation −35","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly 30 | Risk −15 | Display −25 | Persistence 15 | Orientation None | Union Monogamous"},"sections":{"Offices":"Rank: Guard. Title: Godeok Base Train Maintenance Chief. Posts the repair order on the board in three columns, patrol, training, and spare parts, but does not use a screw with no recorded origin until it has been measured separately.\n\nAnecdote. In 2125, Bak Hayul felt out a wheel defect just before a derailment in the siding and stopped the train.","Relationships":"Competes over Gunja''s maintenance standards versus the eastern specifications, regards Gang Minseo as a necessary parts supplier, and approves Kim Uchan''s secret dispatches at the maintenance counter only at the very last.","Ambition":"Fixes the patrol trains and maintenance capacity of the Godeok siding to the eastern standard, so that the Gunja and Changdong specifications cannot run without Amsa.","Intervention":"Can smuggle in replacement wheels to keep maintenance alive, or expose the military conversion in the secret dispatches to get the depot chief replaced."},"biography":"Bak Hayul is taciturn and reads the falsehoods of a route from the wear on its wheels.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Train Dispatch and Parts Specification Inspection\n- Rank: Guard\n- Title: Godeok Base Train Maintenance Chief\nLife. Bak Hayul was born in the 3rd generation. Bak Hayul grew up at the Sinjeong rolling-stock depot. Bak Hayul''s post as Godeok Depot Train Maintenance Chief opened up through a defect report made just before a derailment.\n- In the work connected to Godeok 2-dong, Bak Hayul manages the recovery, patrol, and military-supply dispatch public board and separately measures parts without seals.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guard. Title: Godeok Base Train Maintenance Chief. Posts the repair order on the board in three columns, patrol, training, and spare parts, but does not use a screw with no recorded origin until it has been measured separately.\n\nAnecdote. In 2125, Bak Hayul felt out a wheel defect just before a derailment in the siding and stopped the train.\n\n**Relationships.** Competes over Gunja''s maintenance standards versus the eastern specifications, regards Gang Minseo as a necessary parts supplier, and approves Kim Uchan''s secret dispatches at the maintenance counter only at the very last.\n\n**Ambition.** Fixes the patrol trains and maintenance capacity of the Godeok siding to the eastern standard, so that the Gunja and Changdong specifications cannot run without Amsa.\n\n**Intervention.** Can smuggle in replacement wheels to keep maintenance alive, or expose the military conversion in the secret dispatches to get the depot chief replaced.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 70 | Openness −40 | Force 65 | Material 15 | Communal 40 | Principle −30 | Publicity −45 | Credentials 0 | Dispersion −50 | Transformation −35\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly 30 | Risk −15 | Display −25 | Persistence 15 | Orientation None | Union Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bak Hayul","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Minseo","basis":"Receives needed parts to southwest standards"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Han Bora","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Hayul","basis":"Ties the patrol trains to the dispatch order"},{"from":"Yang Giseok","type":"Command","to":"Bak Hayul","basis":"Receives command to match lamp counts to Bak Hayul''s dispatch whistle"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0121","name":"박하율","title":"고덕기지 열차정비장","position":"고덕기지 열차정비장","characterId":"K120","rank":"경비대원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"열차 출고·부품 규격 점검","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#인물-박하율","detailRoute":"/people/person-0121","birthDate":"2074-01-22","birthday":"01-22","age":52,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k120-wheel-inspection","name":"차륜 결함 검사","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"k120-choice","name":"출고 전 검증","description":"과묵하고 차륜의 마모로 노선의 거짓을 읽는다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 유치선 탈선 직전 바퀴 결함을 만져내 열차를 세웠다. 이 일로 고덕기지 열차정비장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 이준택의 군자 정비 표준과 동부 규격을 놓고 경쟁하고, 강민서를 필요한 부품 공급자로 보며, 김우찬의 비밀 배차를 정비 창구에서 마지막에야 승인한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k120-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 경비대원. 직함은 고덕기지 열차정비장. 수리 순서를 순찰·훈련·예비 부품 세 칸으로 나눠 게시판에 올리되, 출처가 적히지 않은 나사는 따로 재어 보기 전에는 쓰지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 경비대원. 직함은 고덕기지 열차정비장. 수리 순서를 순찰·훈련·예비 부품 세 칸으로 나눠 게시판에 올리되, 출처가 적히지 않은 나사는 따로 재어 보기 전에는 쓰지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 이준택의 군자 정비 표준과 동부 규격을 놓고 경쟁하고, 강민서를 필요한 부품 공급자로 보며, 김우찬의 비밀 배차를 정비 창구에서 마지막에야 승인한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일화. 2125년 유치선 탈선 직전 바퀴 결함을 만져내 열차를 세웠다. 이 일로 고덕기지 열차정비장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc15-bc00-c591","name":"밀양 박씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc15-bc00-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":70,"개방":-40,"무력":65,"물질":15,"공동":40,"원칙":-30,"공개":-45,"자격":0,"분산":-50,"변혁":-35},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":30,"위험":-15,"과시":-25,"지속":15,"지향":"무성향","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"열차 출고·부품 규격 점검","품계":"경비대원","직함":"고덕기지 열차정비장","가치관":"권위 70 | 개방 −40 | 무력 65 | 물질 15 | 공동 40 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 −45 | 자격 0 | 분산 −50 | 변혁 −35","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 30 | 위험 −15 | 과시 −25 | 지속 15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"관직":"품계 경비대원. 직함은 고덕기지 열차정비장. 수리 순서를 순찰·훈련·예비 부품 세 칸으로 나눠 게시판에 올리되, 출처가 적히지 않은 나사는 따로 재어 보기 전에는 쓰지 않는다.\n\n일화. 박하율은 2125년 유치선 탈선 직전 바퀴 결함을 만져내 열차를 세웠다.","관계":"군자 정비 표준과 동부 규격을 놓고 경쟁하고, 강민서를 필요한 부품 공급자로 보며, 김우찬의 비밀 배차를 정비 창구에서 마지막에야 승인한다.","야망":"고덕 유치선의 순찰열차와 정비 용량을 동부 표준으로 고정해, 군자·창동 규격이 암사 없이 돌아가지 않게 한다.","개입":"대체 차륜을 밀반입해 정비를 살리거나, 비밀 배차의 군수 개조를 폭로해 정비장을 교체하게 할 수 있다."},"biography":"박하율은 과묵하고 차륜의 마모로 노선의 거짓을 읽는다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 열차 출고·부품 규격 점검\n- 품계: 경비대원\n- 직함: 고덕기지 열차정비장\n생애. 박하율은 3세대에 태어났다. 박하율은 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 박하율의 고덕기지 열차정비장 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 박하율은 고덕2동과 연결된 업무에서 복구·순찰·군수 출고 공개판을 관리하고 도장 없는 부품을 따로 측정한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 경비대원. 직함은 고덕기지 열차정비장. 수리 순서를 순찰·훈련·예비 부품 세 칸으로 나눠 게시판에 올리되, 출처가 적히지 않은 나사는 따로 재어 보기 전에는 쓰지 않는다.\n\n일화. 박하율은 2125년 유치선 탈선 직전 바퀴 결함을 만져내 열차를 세웠다.\n\n**관계.** 군자 정비 표준과 동부 규격을 놓고 경쟁하고, 강민서를 필요한 부품 공급자로 보며, 김우찬의 비밀 배차를 정비 창구에서 마지막에야 승인한다.\n\n**야망.** 고덕 유치선의 순찰열차와 정비 용량을 동부 표준으로 고정해, 군자·창동 규격이 암사 없이 돌아가지 않게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 대체 차륜을 밀반입해 정비를 살리거나, 비밀 배차의 군수 개조를 폭로해 정비장을 교체하게 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 70 | 개방 −40 | 무력 65 | 물질 15 | 공동 40 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 −45 | 자격 0 | 분산 −50 | 변혁 −35\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 30 | 위험 −15 | 과시 −25 | 지속 15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"박하율","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"필요 부품을 서남 규격으로 공급받음"}],"incoming":[{"from":"한보라","type":"계약","to":"박하율","basis":"출고 순서에 순찰열차를 묶음"},{"from":"양기석","type":"지휘","to":"박하율","basis":"박하율의 출고 호각에 램프 횟수를 맞추는 지휘를 받고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0122', 'cd5c-d574-c8fc-5d14', '{"id":"person-0122","name":"Choe Doyun","title":"Eastern Light-Out Check Chief","position":"Eastern Light-Out Check Chief","characterId":"K121","rank":"Guard Chief","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Alley Ration Ticket and Citizen Roster Management","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#Person-Choe-Doyun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0122","birthDate":"2066-04-12","birthday":"04-12","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k121-ration-record","name":"Alley ration record management","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k121-choice","name":"Separates families from troops","description":"Merciful, he broke off compromise the moment family-unit rations were tied to service rosters. He refused efficiency talk that sent children to training grounds for the sake of order.","behavior":"Anecdote. Jang Seokyun''s registry demands the eastern alley ration tables and the service roll handed over as one bundle. Choi Doyun posts the ration tables in the alleys and sends the family-unit registration refusal list only to Jeong Soyul''s administration office, keeping it apart from the Eastern Command notebooks.","stress":"Fear. That a neighbor kidnapped on a winter night would remain as an empty slot on the duty roster and the name would finally be erased. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Allied with Baek On''s independent citizenship demand, and carrying a deep grudge against Jang Seokyun''s registry.","effects":[]},{"id":"k121-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Guard Chief. Title: eastern light-out check chief. He posted the alley light-out timetable on the board and kept the list of duties skipped for family reasons apart from the guards'' notebooks.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Guard Chief. Title: eastern light-out check chief. He posted the alley light-out timetable on the board and kept the list of duties skipped for family reasons apart from the guards'' notebooks.","stress":"Fear. That a neighbor kidnapped on a winter night would remain as an empty slot on the duty roster and the name would finally be erased. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Allied with Baek On''s independent citizenship demand, and carrying a deep grudge against Jang Seokyun''s registry.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Anecdote. Jang Seokyun''s registry demands the eastern alley ration tables and the service roll handed over as one bundle. Choi Doyun posts the ration tables in the alleys and sends the family-unit registration refusal list only to Jeong Soyul''s administration office, keeping it apart from the Eastern Command notebooks. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd5c-d574-c8fc-5d14","name":"Haeju Choe Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cd5c-d574-c8fc-5d14.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":50,"Openness":-45,"Force":65,"Material":20,"Communal":25,"Principle":-25,"Public":-50,"Eligibility":-30,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-25},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-30,"Display":-5,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Alley Ration Ticket and Citizen Roster Management","Rank":"Guard Chief","Title":"Eastern Light-Out Check Chief","Values":"Authority 50 | Openness −45 | Force 65 | Material 20 | Communal 25 | Principle −25 | Publicity −50 | Qualification −30 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −25","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Endurance 30 | Orientation Fluid | Union Monogamous"},"sections":{"Offices":"Rank: Guard Chief. Title: Eastern Light-Out Check Chief. Posts the alley light-out timetable on the board and keeps the list of duties skipped for family reasons apart from the guards'' notebooks.","Anecdote":"Jang Seogyun''s registry office demands that the eastern alley ration tickets and the service roster be handed over as a single bundle. Choe Doyun makes the ration tickets public in the alleys, and sends the list of households refusing family registration only to Jeong Soyul''s administrative office, keeping it separate from the Eastern Command notebook.","Relationships":"An ally to Baek On''s demand for independent civil rights; and holds a deep grudge against Jang Seogyun''s registry office.","Ambition":"He wants eastern residents'' night movements and family relocations kept on record, so that people do not remain mere numbers on the duty roster.\n\nFear. Choe Doyun fears that a neighbor kidnapped on a winter night will remain as an empty slot on the duty roster and the name will finally be erased.","Intervention":"The family roster can be retrieved from the administrative archive, or the refusal list can be handed over to the officers, driving the representative into a purge crisis."},"biography":"Choe Doyun is merciful, but he cuts off compromise the moment household rations are tied to the service roster. He rejects the efficiency argument of sending children to training grounds for the sake of public order.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Alley Ration Ticket and Citizen Roster Management\n- Rank: Guard Chief\n- Title: Eastern Light-Out Check Chief\nLife. Choe Doyun was born in 2066. Choe Doyun grew up on duty at the Amsa guard post. Choe Doyun''s post as Eastern Light-Out Check Chief opened after he put out all the post lights at once on a midwinter night.\n- In work connected with Amsa 1-dong, Choe Doyun makes the alley ration tickets public and keeps the list of families refusing registration only on the administrative side.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guard Chief. Title: Eastern Light-Out Check Chief. Posts the alley light-out timetable on the board and keeps the list of duties skipped for family reasons apart from the guards'' notebooks.\n\n**Anecdote.** Jang Seogyun''s registry office demands that the eastern alley ration tickets and the service roster be handed over as a single bundle. Choe Doyun makes the ration tickets public in the alleys, and sends the list of households refusing family registration only to Jeong Soyul''s administrative office, keeping it separate from the Eastern Command notebook.\n\n**Relations.** An ally to Baek On''s demand for independent civil rights; and holds a deep grudge against Jang Seogyun''s registry office.\n\n**Ambition.** He wants eastern residents'' night movements and family relocations kept on record, so that people do not remain mere numbers on the duty roster.\n\nFear. Choe Doyun fears that a neighbor kidnapped on a winter night will remain as an empty slot on the duty roster and the name will finally be erased.\n\n**Intervention.** The family roster can be retrieved from the administrative archive, or the refusal list can be handed over to the officers, driving the representative into a purge crisis.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 50 | Openness −45 | Force 65 | Material 20 | Communal 25 | Principle −25 | Publicity −50 | Qualification −30 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −25\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Endurance 30 | Orientation Fluid | Union Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Choe Doyun","type":"Roster entrustment","to":"Jeong Soyul","basis":""},{"from":"Choe Doyun","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":"Allied with the demand for independent civil rights"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0122","name":"최도윤","title":"동부 소등 점검 책임","position":"동부 소등 점검 책임","characterId":"K121","rank":"경비 책임자","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"골목 배급표·시민 명부 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#인물-최도윤","detailRoute":"/people/person-0122","birthDate":"2066-04-12","birthday":"04-12","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k121-ration-record","name":"골목 배급표 관리","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k121-choice","name":"가족과 병력을 분리","description":"자비롭지만 가족 단위 배급이 복무 명부와 묶이는 순간 타협을 끊는다. 치안을 이유로 아이를 훈련장에 보내는 효율론을 거부한다.","behavior":"일화. 장석윤의 등록소가 동부 골목 배급표와 복무 명부를 한 묶음으로 넘기라고 요구한다. 최도윤은 배급표를 골목에 공개하고, 가족 단위 등록 거부 명단은 정소율의 행정청으로만 보내 동방사 수첩과 갈라 둔다.","stress":"공포. 겨울 밤 납치된 이웃의 자리가 빈 당직표로 남고 그 이름이 끝내 지워지는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 백온의 독립 시민권 요구에 동맹이며, 장석윤의 등록소에는 깊은 원한이 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k121-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 경비 책임자. 직함은 동부 소등 점검 책임. 골목 소등 시각표를 게시판에 공개하고, 가족 사정으로 빠진 당직 명단은 경비대 수첩과 따로 적어 둔다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 경비 책임자. 직함은 동부 소등 점검 책임. 골목 소등 시각표를 게시판에 공개하고, 가족 사정으로 빠진 당직 명단은 경비대 수첩과 따로 적어 둔다.","stress":"공포. 겨울 밤 납치된 이웃의 자리가 빈 당직표로 남고 그 이름이 끝내 지워지는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 백온의 독립 시민권 요구에 동맹이며, 장석윤의 등록소에는 깊은 원한이 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일화. 장석윤의 등록소가 동부 골목 배급표와 복무 명부를 한 묶음으로 넘기라고 요구한다. 최도윤은 배급표를 골목에 공개하고, 가족 단위 등록 거부 명단은 정소율의 행정청으로만 보내 동방사 수첩과 갈라 둔다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd5c-d574-c8fc-5d14","name":"해주 최씨","crest":"clan-crests/cd5c-d574-c8fc-5d14.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":50,"개방":-45,"무력":65,"물질":20,"공동":25,"원칙":-25,"공개":-50,"자격":-30,"분산":-40,"변혁":-25},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-10,"위험":-30,"과시":-5,"지속":30,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"골목 배급표·시민 명부 관리","품계":"경비 책임자","직함":"동부 소등 점검 책임","가치관":"권위 50 | 개방 −45 | 무력 65 | 물질 20 | 공동 25 | 원칙 −25 | 공개 −50 | 자격 −30 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −25","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 30 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"관직":"품계 경비 책임자. 직함은 동부 소등 점검 책임. 골목 소등 시각표를 게시판에 공개하고, 가족 사정으로 빠진 당직 명단은 경비대 수첩과 따로 적어 둔다.","일화":"장석윤의 등록소가 동부 골목 배급표와 복무 명부를 한 묶음으로 넘기라고 요구한다. 최도윤은 배급표를 골목에 공개하고, 가족 단위 등록 거부 명단은 정소율의 행정청으로만 보내 동방사 수첩과 갈라 둔다.","관계":"백온의 독립 시민권 요구에 동맹이며, 장석윤의 등록소에는 깊은 원한이 있다.","야망":"동부 주민의 야간 이동과 가족 동반 이주를 기록에 남겨, 사람이 당직표의 숫자로만 남지 않게 한다.\n\n공포. 최도윤은 겨울 밤 납치된 이웃의 자리가 빈 당직표로 남고 그 이름이 끝내 지워지는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"가족 명부를 행정 서고에서 되찾거나, 거부 명단을 장교에게 넘겨 대표를 숙청 위기로 몰 수 있다."},"biography":"최도윤은 자비롭지만 가족 단위 배급이 복무 명부와 묶이는 순간 타협을 끊는다. 치안을 이유로 아이를 훈련장에 보내는 효율론을 거부한다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 골목 배급표·시민 명부 관리\n- 품계: 경비 책임자\n- 직함: 동부 소등 점검 책임\n생애. 최도윤은 2066년에 태어났다. 최도윤은 암사 초소 당직에서 자랐다. 최도윤의 동부 소등 점검 책임 자리는 한겨울 밤 초소 불빛을 한꺼번에 끈 일로 열렸다.\n- 최도윤은 암사1동과 연결된 업무에서 골목 배급표를 공개하고 가족 등록 거부 명단을 행정 쪽에만 보관한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 경비 책임자. 직함은 동부 소등 점검 책임. 골목 소등 시각표를 게시판에 공개하고, 가족 사정으로 빠진 당직 명단은 경비대 수첩과 따로 적어 둔다.\n\n**일화.** 장석윤의 등록소가 동부 골목 배급표와 복무 명부를 한 묶음으로 넘기라고 요구한다. 최도윤은 배급표를 골목에 공개하고, 가족 단위 등록 거부 명단은 정소율의 행정청으로만 보내 동방사 수첩과 갈라 둔다.\n\n**관계.** 백온의 독립 시민권 요구에 동맹이며, 장석윤의 등록소에는 깊은 원한이 있다.\n\n**야망.** 동부 주민의 야간 이동과 가족 동반 이주를 기록에 남겨, 사람이 당직표의 숫자로만 남지 않게 한다.\n\n공포. 최도윤은 겨울 밤 납치된 이웃의 자리가 빈 당직표로 남고 그 이름이 끝내 지워지는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 가족 명부를 행정 서고에서 되찾거나, 거부 명단을 장교에게 넘겨 대표를 숙청 위기로 몰 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 50 | 개방 −45 | 무력 65 | 물질 20 | 공동 25 | 원칙 −25 | 공개 −50 | 자격 −30 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −25\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 30 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"최도윤","type":"명부 위탁","to":"정소율","basis":""},{"from":"최도윤","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":"독립 시민권 요구에 동맹"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0123', 'c784-b098-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0123","name":"Im Gyeore","title":"Gate Tax Auditor","position":"Gate Tax Auditor","characterId":"K122","rank":"Guard","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Gate Tax Voucher Audit","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#inmul-imgyeore","detailRoute":"/people/person-0123","birthDate":"2081-05-28","birthday":"05-28","age":45,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k122-protection-audit","name":"Gate tax voucher audit","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k122-choice","name":"Gate Tax Voucher Audit","description":"Cold, he hated blanks in exit conditions.","behavior":"Title: Gate Tax Auditor.","stress":"Fear. That one forged gate-toll slip would cover the whole administrative ledger with the officers'' emergency stamp. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k122-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Guard. Title: Gate Tax Auditor. He closed passage for expired slips without the audit stamp.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Guard. Title: Gate Tax Auditor. He closed passage for expired slips without the audit stamp.","stress":"Fear. That one forged gate-toll slip would cover the whole administrative ledger with the officers'' emergency stamp. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Gate Tax Auditor.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c784-b098-c8fc","name":"Naju Im Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c784-b098-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":50,"Openness":-30,"Force":55,"Material":30,"Communal":30,"Principle":-10,"Public":-30,"Eligibility":-10,"Dispersed":-60,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":5,"Display":-45,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Gate Tax Voucher Audit","Rank":"Guard","Title":"Gate Tax Auditor","Values":"Authority 50 | Openness −30 | Force 55 | Material 30 | Communal 30 | Principle −10 | Publicity −30 | Qualification −10 | Decentralization −60 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly 30 | Risk 5 | Display −45 | Endurance 20 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Offices":"Rank: Guard. Title: Gate Tax Auditor. Closes passage for slips past their term without an audit seal.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"Fear. Im Gyeore fears that a single forged gate-toll slip will cover the entire administrative ledger with the officers'' emergency seal.","Intervention":"A draft of the term clause can be carried to the negotiations, or the issuer of the forged gate-toll slip can be exposed to bring the auditor down."},"biography":"Im Gyeore is cold, and loathes blanks in termination conditions.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Livelihood: Gate Tax Voucher Audit\n- Rank: Guard\n- Title: Gate Tax Auditor\nLife. Im Gyeore was born in the third generation. Im Gyeore grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. Im Gyeore''s position as Gate Toll Auditor opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- In work connected with Amsa 2-dong, Im Gyeore audits blank terms, expired gate tolls, and administrative review slips together.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guard. Title: Gate Tax Auditor. Closes passage for slips past their term without an audit seal.\n\nFear. Im Gyeore fears that a single forged gate-toll slip will cover the entire administrative ledger with the officers'' emergency seal.\n\n**Intervention.** A draft of the term clause can be carried to the negotiations, or the issuer of the forged gate-toll slip can be exposed to bring the auditor down.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 50 | Openness −30 | Force 55 | Material 30 | Communal 30 | Principle −10 | Publicity −30 | Qualification −10 | Decentralization −60 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly 30 | Risk 5 | Display −45 | Endurance 20 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Im Gyeore","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Yura","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ji Mokhyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Im Gyeore","basis":"a contract that delivers Im Gyeore''s term clause to the pharmacy, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0123","name":"임겨레","title":"관문세 감사관","position":"관문세 감사관","characterId":"K122","rank":"경비대원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"관문세 전표 감사","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#인물-임겨레","detailRoute":"/people/person-0123","birthDate":"2081-05-28","birthday":"05-28","age":45,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k122-protection-audit","name":"관문세 전표 감사","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k122-choice","name":"관문세 전표 감사","description":"냉정하고 종료 조건의 빈칸을 증오한다.","behavior":"직함은 관문세 감사관.","stress":"공포. 위조 관문세 전표 한 장이 행정 원장 전체를 장교 비상도장으로 덮는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k122-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 경비대원. 직함은 관문세 감사관. 기한 만료 전표는 감사 날인 없이 통행을 닫는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 경비대원. 직함은 관문세 감사관. 기한 만료 전표는 감사 날인 없이 통행을 닫는다.","stress":"공포. 위조 관문세 전표 한 장이 행정 원장 전체를 장교 비상도장으로 덮는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 관문세 감사관.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c784-b098-c8fc","name":"나주 임씨","crest":"clan-crests/c784-b098-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":50,"개방":-30,"무력":55,"물질":30,"공동":30,"원칙":-10,"공개":-30,"자격":-10,"분산":-60,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":30,"위험":5,"과시":-45,"지속":20,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"관문세 전표 감사","품계":"경비대원","직함":"관문세 감사관","가치관":"권위 50 | 개방 −30 | 무력 55 | 물질 30 | 공동 30 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 −30 | 자격 −10 | 분산 −60 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 30 | 위험 5 | 과시 −45 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"관직":"품계 경비대원. 직함은 관문세 감사관. 기한 만료 전표는 감사 날인 없이 통행을 닫는다.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"공포. 임겨레는 위조 관문세 전표 한 장이 행정 원장 전체를 장교 비상도장으로 덮는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"기한 조항 초안을 협의에 운반하거나, 위조 관문세 전표의 발급자를 밝혀 감사관을 실각시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"임겨레는 냉정하고 종료 조건의 빈칸을 증오한다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 관문세 전표 감사\n- 품계: 경비대원\n- 직함: 관문세 감사관\n생애. 임겨레는 3세대에 태어났다. 임겨레는 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 임겨레의 관문세 감사관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 임겨레는 암사2동과 연결된 업무에서 기간 공란, 만료 관문세, 행정 재심 전표를 함께 감사한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 경비대원. 직함은 관문세 감사관.\n\n공포. 임겨레는 위조 관문세 전표 한 장이 행정 원장 전체를 장교 비상도장으로 덮는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 기한 조항 초안을 협의에 운반하거나, 위조 관문세 전표의 발급자를 밝혀 감사관을 실각시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 50 | 개방 −30 | 무력 55 | 물질 30 | 공동 30 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 −30 | 자격 −10 | 분산 −60 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 30 | 위험 5 | 과시 −45 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"임겨레","type":"계약","to":"정유라","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"지목현","type":"계약","to":"임겨레","basis":"임겨레의 기한 조항을 약국에 배달하는 계약이며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0124', 'd55c-ccad-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0124","name":"Han Bora","title":"Eastern Patrol Train Chief","position":"Eastern Patrol Train Chief","characterId":"K123","rank":"Guard","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Patrol Train Dispatch and Freight Car Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#inmul-hanbora","detailRoute":"/people/person-0124","birthDate":"2089-01-20","birthday":"01-20","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"k123-wagon-check","name":"Patrol train wagon checking","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k123-choice","name":"Patrol Train Dispatch and Freight Car Verification","description":"Bold, she endured the night rails'' silence better than people. She tore up any note telling her to couple munitions freight cars disguised as a medical train to her own train.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125, on a ridge patrol, she read the ambush traces first and prevented the harm. By this deed the signature of the eastern patrol train master post rose into the ledger.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. A contract binding her train to Park Hayul''s release order, a debt trying not to dodge Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy on the rails, and a command conflict refusing Kim Woochan''s secret dispatch notes.","effects":[]},{"id":"k123-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Guard. Title: Eastern Patrol Train Chief. She put the release hours and freight lists on the Godeok board and coupled no car suspected of arms without the maintenance chief''s and the auditor''s double check.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Guard. Title: Eastern Patrol Train Chief. She put the release hours and freight lists on the Godeok board and coupled no car suspected of arms without the maintenance chief''s and the auditor''s double check.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. A contract binding her train to Park Hayul''s release order, a debt trying not to dodge Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy on the rails, and a command conflict refusing Kim Woochan''s secret dispatch notes.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Anecdote. In 2125, on a ridge patrol, she read the ambush traces first and prevented the harm. By this deed the signature of the eastern patrol train master post rose into the ledger. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d55c-ccad-c8fc","name":"Han Clan of Cheongju","crest":"clan-crests/d55c-ccad-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":65,"Openness":-55,"Force":75,"Material":20,"Communal":35,"Principle":-20,"Public":-35,"Eligibility":-30,"Dispersed":-60,"Transformative":-25},"desire":{"Longing":50,"Monopoly":-25,"Risk":10,"Display":-15,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Patrol Train Dispatch and Freight Car Verification","Rank":"Guard","Title":"Eastern Patrol Train Chief","Values":"Authority 65 | Openness −55 | Force 75 | Materialism 20 | Community 35 | Principle −20 | Publicity −35 | Qualification −30 | Dispersion −60 | Transformation −25","Desires":"Craving 50 | Monopoly −25 | Risk 10 | Display −15 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Multi-party"},"sections":{"Offices":"Rank: Guard. Title: Eastern Patrol Train Chief. Posts departure times and freight car lists on the Godeok bulletin board, and does not couple any suspected weapons car without double verification by the Maintenance Chief and the Auditor.\n\nAnecdote. In 2125, during a ridgeline patrol, Han Bora read the signs of an ambush first and prevented losses.","Relationships":"A contract binding the train to Bak Hayul''s departure order; a debt for avoiding Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy on the tracks; and command friction from refusing Kim Uchan''s secret dispatch notes.","Ambition":"Run the Eastern patrol trains only through public dispatches on the official chain of command, so that the secret officer network cannot seize the tracks.","Intervention":"You can reveal the true owner of smuggled freight cars."},"biography":"Han Bora is bold and endures the silence of the night tracks better than most people. Han Bora tears up a note ordering them to couple a munitions freight car, disguised as a medical train, to their own train.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Patrol Train Dispatch and Freight Car Verification\n- Rank: Guard\n- Title: Eastern Patrol Train Chief\nLife. Han Bora was born in the 4th generation. Han Bora grew up at the Amsa guard post. Han Bora''s post as Eastern Patrol Train Chief opened after catching an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- In duties linked to Godeok 2-dong, Han Bora runs the departure board, double-checks suspected weapons cars, and refuses secret dispatches.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guard. Title: Eastern Patrol Train Chief. Posts departure times and freight car lists on the Godeok bulletin board, and does not couple any suspected weapons car without double verification by the Maintenance Chief and the Auditor.\n\nAnecdote. In 2125, during a ridgeline patrol, Han Bora read the signs of an ambush first and prevented losses.\n\n**Relationships.** A contract binding the train to Bak Hayul''s departure order; a debt for avoiding Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy on the tracks; and command friction from refusing Kim Uchan''s secret dispatch notes.\n\n**Ambition.** Run the Eastern patrol trains only through public dispatches on the official chain of command, so that the secret officer network cannot seize the tracks.\n\n**Intervention.** You can reveal the true owner of smuggled freight cars.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 65 | Openness −55 | Force 75 | Materialism 20 | Community 35 | Principle −20 | Publicity −35 | Qualification −30 | Dispersion −60 | Transformation −25\n- Desires: Craving 50 | Monopoly −25 | Risk 10 | Display −15 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Multi-party\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Han Bora","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Hayul","basis":"Ties the patrol trains to the dispatch order"},{"from":"Han Bora","type":"Debt","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"a debt for avoiding Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy on the tracks"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Na Hyowon","type":"Command","to":"Han Bora","basis":"enforcing Han Bora''s departure times with platform chalk,"},{"from":"Ryu Ga-on","type":"Contract","to":"Han Bora","basis":"attaching a convoy car to Han Bora''s patrol train dispatch and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0124","name":"한보라","title":"동부 순찰열차장","position":"동부 순찰열차장","characterId":"K123","rank":"경비대원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"순찰열차 출고·화차 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-05#인물-한보라","detailRoute":"/people/person-0124","birthDate":"2089-01-20","birthday":"01-20","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"k123-wagon-check","name":"순찰열차 화차 확인","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k123-choice","name":"순찰열차 출고·화차 확인","description":"대담하고 야간 선로의 침묵을 사람보다 잘 견딘다. 의료열차로 위장한 군수 화차를 자기 열차에 붙이라는 쪽지를 찢어 버린다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 능선 초계 중 매복 흔적을 먼저 읽어 피해를 막았다. 이 일로 동부 순찰열차장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 박하율의 출고 순서에 열차를 묶는 계약이고, 장세화의 의료호송을 선로에서 피하려는 빚이며, 김우찬의 비밀 배차 쪽지를 거부해 지휘 갈등이 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k123-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 경비대원. 직함은 동부 순찰열차장. 출고 시각과 화차 목록을 고덕 게시판에 올리고, 무기 의심 화차는 정비장과 감사관의 이중 확인 없이 연결하지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 경비대원. 직함은 동부 순찰열차장. 출고 시각과 화차 목록을 고덕 게시판에 올리고, 무기 의심 화차는 정비장과 감사관의 이중 확인 없이 연결하지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 박하율의 출고 순서에 열차를 묶는 계약이고, 장세화의 의료호송을 선로에서 피하려는 빚이며, 김우찬의 비밀 배차 쪽지를 거부해 지휘 갈등이 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일화. 2125년 능선 초계 중 매복 흔적을 먼저 읽어 피해를 막았다. 이 일로 동부 순찰열차장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d55c-ccad-c8fc","name":"청주 한씨","crest":"clan-crests/d55c-ccad-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":65,"개방":-55,"무력":75,"물질":20,"공동":35,"원칙":-20,"공개":-35,"자격":-30,"분산":-60,"변혁":-25},"desire":{"갈망":50,"독점":-25,"위험":10,"과시":-15,"지속":0,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"순찰열차 출고·화차 확인","품계":"경비대원","직함":"동부 순찰열차장","가치관":"권위 65 | 개방 −55 | 무력 75 | 물질 20 | 공동 35 | 원칙 −20 | 공개 −35 | 자격 −30 | 분산 −60 | 변혁 −25","욕망":"갈망 50 | 독점 −25 | 위험 10 | 과시 −15 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"관직":"품계 경비대원. 직함은 동부 순찰열차장. 출고 시각과 화차 목록을 고덕 게시판에 올리고, 무기 의심 화차는 정비장과 감사관의 이중 확인 없이 연결하지 않는다.\n\n일화. 한보라는 2125년 능선 초계 중 매복 흔적을 먼저 읽어 피해를 막았다.","관계":"박하율의 출고 순서에 열차를 묶는 계약이고, 장세화의 의료호송을 선로에서 피하려는 빚이며, 김우찬의 비밀 배차 쪽지를 거부해 지휘 갈등이 있다.","야망":"동부 순찰열차를 공식 명령망의 공개 배차로만 움직여, 비밀 장교망이 선로를 빼앗지 못하게 한다.","개입":"밀수 화차의 실화주를 밝힐 수 있다."},"biography":"한보라는 대담하고 야간 선로의 침묵을 사람보다 잘 견딘다. 의료열차로 위장한 군수 화차를 자기 열차에 붙이라는 쪽지를 찢어 버린다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 순찰열차 출고·화차 확인\n- 품계: 경비대원\n- 직함: 동부 순찰열차장\n생애. 한보라는 4세대에 태어났다. 한보라는 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 한보라의 동부 순찰열차장 자리는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 한보라는 고덕2동과 연결된 업무에서 출고 게시판을 맡고 무기 의심 화차를 이중 확인하며 비밀 배차를 거부한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 경비대원. 직함은 동부 순찰열차장. 출고 시각과 화차 목록을 고덕 게시판에 올리고, 무기 의심 화차는 정비장과 감사관의 이중 확인 없이 연결하지 않는다.\n\n일화. 한보라는 2125년 능선 초계 중 매복 흔적을 먼저 읽어 피해를 막았다.\n\n**관계.** 박하율의 출고 순서에 열차를 묶는 계약이고, 장세화의 의료호송을 선로에서 피하려는 빚이며, 김우찬의 비밀 배차 쪽지를 거부해 지휘 갈등이 있다.\n\n**야망.** 동부 순찰열차를 공식 명령망의 공개 배차로만 움직여, 비밀 장교망이 선로를 빼앗지 못하게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 밀수 화차의 실화주를 밝힐 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 65 | 개방 −55 | 무력 75 | 물질 20 | 공동 35 | 원칙 −20 | 공개 −35 | 자격 −30 | 분산 −60 | 변혁 −25\n- 욕망: 갈망 50 | 독점 −25 | 위험 10 | 과시 −15 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"한보라","type":"계약","to":"박하율","basis":"출고 순서에 순찰열차를 묶음"},{"from":"한보라","type":"빚","to":"장세화","basis":"의료호송을 선로에서 피하려는 빚"}],"incoming":[{"from":"나효원","type":"지휘","to":"한보라","basis":"한보라의 출고 시각을 승강장 분필로 집행하며"},{"from":"류가온","type":"계약","to":"한보라","basis":"한보라의 순찰열차 배차에 호송 칸을 붙이고"}]}}');
