egion:1135071000","region:1135072000","region:1138051000","region:1138052000","region:1138053000","region:1138055100","region:1138055200","region:1138056000","region:1138057000","region:1138058000","region:1138059000","region:1138060000","region:1138062500","region:1138063100","region:1138063200","region:1138064000","region:1138065000","region:1138069000","region:1141052000","region:1141055500","region:1141056500","region:1141065500","region:1141066000","region:1141068500","region:1165051000","region:1165053000","region:1165053100","region:1174051500","region:1174052500","region:1174052600","region:1174053000","region:1174054000","region:1174055000","region:1174056000","region:1174057000","region:1174058000","region:1174059000","region:1174060000","region:1174061000","region:1174062000","region:1174064000","region:1174065000","region:1174066000","region:1174068500","region:1174069000","region:1174070000"],"basis":"Opening Area Route Decision (User Approval 2026-10-11)","parentTitle":null},{"id":"title:kingdom-geography:seoul:01","name":"Central Area","rank":"kingdom","holderPersonId":"K144","stateId":"S06","geographicTitleId":"geography:kingdom:seoul:01","basis":"Territorial Title Distribution of 2026-10-22 (owner:seoul-faction-consolidation-20261022). Former President of the Republic of Korea. Basis for holding the northern Gangbuk region centered on Cheongwadae and Gwanghwamun, and the Jongno District.","parentTitle":null}],"clan":{"id":"c724-d30c-d3c9","name":"Papyeong Yun Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c724-d30c-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-10,"Force":-30,"Material":-20,"Communal":10,"Principle":40,"Public":-30,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-40,"Display":-20,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"None","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Seal Box Sealing and Ratification Hold Management","Constitutional Body":"Former President of the Republic of Korea","Offices":"Former President of the Republic of Korea"},"sections":{"Life":"Yun Seorin is a former President of the Government. Around Gwanghwamun he personally kept the residents'' register and the winter food and fuel stockpile records. Forging records is forbidden. The government has hospitals, officers, heavy weapons and tanks but no medical technicians, so Yun Seorin kept a separate record of requests for medical personnel. Generation of 2126.","Offices":"Rank: Former President. Office: Former President of the Republic of Korea. Occupational alias: Records Bureau Chief (separate from the presidential post).","Anecdote":"","Houses":"Of the Paepyeong Yun clan. The family kept its household around Gwanghwamun, Cheongun-Hyoja-dong and Sajik-dong.","Relationships":"Rationing ledger exchange with Nam Yungyeong. Ratification rivalry with Jeong Yura.\n\n- Occupation:\n- Constitutional body: Former President of the Republic of Korea\n- Office: Former President of the Republic of Korea\n-\n- Yun Seorin''s handling of the Jongno and Jung-gu residents'' register and the rationing and ratification affairs at Cheongwadae is tied to Cheongun-hyoja-dong.\n- Yun Seorin''s care of the seal chest of the Bukhansan Bogungmun Records House is tied to the work of Jeongneung 4-dong.\n\nThe true power broker who actually runs the ratification, notarization, map and medical-transfer ledgers beside Records Bureau Chief Yun Seorin."},"biography":"**Life.** Yun Seorin is a former President of the Government. Around Gwanghwamun he personally kept the residents'' register and the winter food and fuel stockpile records. Forging records is forbidden. The government has hospitals, officers, heavy weapons and tanks but no medical technicians, so Yun Seorin kept a separate record of requests for medical personnel. Generation of 2126.\n**Office.** Rank: Former President. Office: Former President of the Republic of Korea. Occupational alias: Records Bureau Chief (separate from the presidential post).\n\n**House.** Of the Paepyeong Yun clan. The family kept its household around Gwanghwamun, Cheongun-Hyoja-dong and Sajik-dong.\n**Relations.** Rationing ledger exchange with Nam Yungyeong. Ratification rivalry with Jeong Yura.\n\n- Occupation:\n- Constitutional body: Former President of the Republic of Korea\n- Office: Former President of the Republic of Korea\n-\n- Yun Seorin''s handling of the Jongno and Jung-gu residents'' register and the rationing and ratification affairs at Cheongwadae is tied to Cheongun-hyoja-dong.\n- Yun Seorin''s care of the seal chest of the Bukhansan Bogungmun Records House is tied to the work of Jeongneung 4-dong.\n\nThe true power broker who actually runs the ratification, notarization, map and medical-transfer ledgers beside Records Bureau Chief Yun Seorin.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"Kim Yeongyu","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Keeps the government hall records and the residents'' roll copies checked against each other"},{"from":"Kim Yeongyu","type":"Rivalry","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Dispute over which copy should be the standard for the winter stockpile record"},{"from":"O Gyeongjae","type":"Rivalry","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":""},{"from":"Jeong Gaon","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":""},{"from":"Gang Ye-jun","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":""},{"from":"Jo Ha-rin","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":""},{"from":"Yun Ji-yul","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Medical Transfer Records of Yun Seorin''s Backers"},{"from":"O Seo-yul","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Audits the food stockpile ledger under delegated authority"},{"from":"Jeon Nagyeong","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Handing a copy of the ration ledger over to the Records Office"},{"from":"Jang Pil-gyu","type":"Rivalry","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Rivalry over which copy, the residents'' roll or the food ledger, is treated as the standard"},{"from":"Na Bomgyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Obeys Yun Seorin''s cross-verification but refuses concealed power distribution"},{"from":"Ryu Hanmoe","type":"Oath","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":""},{"from":"Hong Yejun","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Offering the clerk''s ledger to Yun Seorin''s ratification review, and"},{"from":"Seop Dalho","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Delivering voice-and-document cross copies to Yun Seorin, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0145","name":"윤서린","title":"전 대통령","position":"전 대한민국정부 대통령","characterId":"K144","rank":"전 대통령","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"도장함 봉인·인준 보류 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"주요","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-윤서린","detailRoute":"/people/person-0145","birthDate":"2099-02-11","birthday":"02-11","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K168","recipientName":"조이록","basis":"윤서린의 봉인 권한과 겹치지만, 공증 날인은 따로 둔다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-06.json","anchor":"인물-조이록-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":12,"effective":12},"stewardship":{"base":15,"effective":15},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":13,"effective":13},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k144-ratification-review","name":"인준 검토","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"k144-trait-1","name":"전 대통령","description":"직함은 전 대통령.","behavior":"직함은 전 대통령.","stress":"","relationship":"한재목·정유라와 효력 발급을 둘러싸고 다툰다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"기록의 지속과 계약 효력을 다루는 실무가 강점이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"hea