edger.\n- Comparing the handwriting on Gang Yejun''s will and reviewing its ratification is tied to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9). Assigned duties: Ratification Examiner.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Promised voice-and-document cross-verification with Hwang Eunseol.","Ambition":"He makes the winter fuel and food ledgers open for any neighbor to read and copy, so that no one can quietly alter the books.","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Sparing with words, and weighs the seal before the person. Believes that if a ratification once stamped is reversed, the whole of Seoul Station will be shaken.\n\n- Livelihood: Will Handwriting Comparison and Ratification Examination\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position and grade: The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)\n- Assigned duties: Ratification Examiner\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of ratification examiner opened up through the deletion of a single line from the double ledger.\n- Comparing the handwriting on Gang Yejun''s will and reviewing its ratification is tied to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Servant Position and Grade.** The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9). Assigned duties: Ratification Examiner.\n\n**Relationships.** Promised voice-and-document cross-verification with Hwang Eunseol.\n\n**Ambition.** He makes the winter fuel and food ledgers open for any neighbor to read and copy, so that no one can quietly alter the books.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −5 | Force −35 | Materiality −30 | Communality 10 | Principle 60 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion −30 | Transformation −35\n- Desires: Longing 10 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −30 | Display 10 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gang Ye-jun","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":""},{"from":"Gang Ye-jun","type":"Oath","to":"Hwang Eunseol","basis":"Promised voice-and-document cross-verification"},{"from":"Gang Ye-jun","type":"Contract","to":"Im Chowon","basis":"Examined the handover record of the copy box"},{"from":"Gang Ye-jun","type":"Rivalry","to":"Jeong Yura","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Hwang Eunseol","type":"Oath","to":"Gang Ye-jun","basis":"Swears cross-verification and ratification review"},{"from":"Yun Choa","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Ye-jun","basis":"Petitions the Records Office for citizenship ratification"},{"from":"Yang Haeon","type":"Command","to":"Gang Ye-jun","basis":"Is the commander who carries Gang Yejun''s declaration of review suspension only in sealed condition, and"},{"from":"Cha Se-on","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Gang Ye-jun","basis":"Is the aide who transfers Gang Yejun''s handwriting comparison into the ledger, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0146","name":"강예준","title":"인준 심사관","position":"인준 심사관","characterId":"K145","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"유언장 필적 대조·인준 심사","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName