,"원칙":60,"공개":-20,"자격":10,"분산":-30,"변혁":-35},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":0,"위험":-30,"과시":10,"지속":0,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"유언장 필적 대조·인준 심사","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"인준 심사관","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −5 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −30 | 공동 10 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −35","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 0 | 위험 −30 | 과시 10 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 인준 심사관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 강예준의 유언장 필적을 대조하고 인준을 심사하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 인준 심사관.","일화":"","관계":"황은설과 음성·문서 교차검증을 약속했다.","야망":"겨울 연료와 식량 장부를 이웃 누구나 열람하고 사본을 만들 수 있게 해, 장부를 몰래 고치는 일이 생기지 않게 한다.","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"말수를 아끼고 사람보다 도장을 먼저 따진다. 한 번 찍은 인준을 번복하면 서울역 전체가 흔들린다고 믿는다.\n\n- 생업: 유언장 필적 대조·인준 심사\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 인준 심사관\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 인준 심사관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 강예준의 유언장 필적을 대조하고 인준을 심사하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 인준 심사관.\n\n**관계.** 황은설과 음성·문서 교차검증을 약속했다.\n\n**야망.** 겨울 연료와 식량 장부를 이웃 누구나 열람하고 사본을 만들 수 있게 해, 장부를 몰래 고치는 일이 생기지 않게 한다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −5 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −30 | 공동 10 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −35\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 0 | 위험 −30 | 과시 10 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"강예준","type":"지휘","to":"윤서린","basis":""},{"from":"강예준","type":"맹세","to":"황은설","basis":"음성·문서 교차검증을 약속"},{"from":"강예준","type":"계약","to":"임초원","basis":"사본 함 인계 기록을 심사"},{"from":"강예준","type":"경쟁","to":"정유라","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"황은설","type":"맹세","to":"강예준","basis":"교차검증을 인준 심사와 맹세"},{"from":"윤초아","type":"계약","to":"강예준","basis":"시민권 인준을 기록청에 청구"},{"from":"양해온","type":"지휘","to":"강예준","basis":"강예준의 심사 정지 선언을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고"},{"from":"차세온","type":"스승과 제자","to":"강예준","basis":"강예준의 필적 대조를 원장으로 옮기는 실무원이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0147', 'c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99', '{"id":"person-0147","name":"Jo Ha-rin","title":"Archive Librarian","position":"Archive Librarian","characterId":"K146","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Archive Key and Reading Record Management","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-joharin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0147","birthDate":"2095-01-20","birthday":"01-20","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k146-access-log","name":"Access time logging","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k146-choice","name":"Keeps hold of originals","description":"Quiet, persistent, sensitive to humidity. She remembered even the finger marks of whoever borrowed a ledger.","behavior":"Title: Archive Librarian.","stress":"Fear. That on a night of cut power a candle would catch the archive''s paper and leave continuity as ash. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Owed Song Jaemin the keeping of the cipher original and disliked Gang Yejun''s midnight reading.","effects":[]},{"id":"k146-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: archive librarian. Reading opened only with two librarians'' keys together, and she wrote the removal hour to the minute on the wall.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: archive librarian. Reading opened only with two librarians'' keys together, and she wrote the removal hour to the minute on the wall.","stress":"Fear. That on a night of cut power a candle would catch the archive''s paper and leave continuity as ash. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Owed Song Jaemin the keeping of the cipher original and disliked Gang Yejun''s midnight reading.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Archive Librarian.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41820-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K146","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41820-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99","name":"Baecheon Jo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-20,"Force":-25,"Material":-40,"Communal":0,"Principle":50,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-45},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":10,"Display":20,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Archive Key and Reading Record Management","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Local Records Research Officer, or a Local Administrative Jusa or Local Administrative Jusabo whose grade fits a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post","Assigned Duties":"Archive Librarian","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −20 | Force −25 | Materialism −40 | Communality 0 | Principle 50 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −45","Desires":"Craving 10 | Exclusivity −35 | Risk 10 | Display 20 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The Archive Librarian post opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Jo Harin''s work of tending the archive keys and viewing records connects to the duties of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Local Records Research Officer, or a Local Administrative Jusa or Local Administrative Jusabo whose grade fits a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post. Duties: Archive Librarian.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Owes Song Jaemin a debt for safekeeping the cipher original, and dislikes Gang Yejun''s late-night viewings.","Ambition":"To put family records and emergency food lists into the same iron locker as a shared practice, so that the belongings of neighbors around Seoul Station are not scattered.","Fear":"On a night when the power ration is cut, a candle burns the archive''s hanji and continuity is left as ash.","Intervention":"Can obtain dehumidifier parts, or expose night entries that are not in the viewing ledger."},"biography":"Quiet and tenacious, and sensitive to humidity. Remembers even the hand grime of whoever borrowed a ledger.\n\n- Livelihood: Archive Key and Reading Record Management\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position/Grade: Local Records Research Officer, or a Local Administrative Jusa or Local Administrative Jusabo whose grade fits a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post\n- Duties: Archive Librarian\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The Archive Librarian post opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Jo Harin''s work of tending the archive keys and viewing records connects to the duties of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position/Grade.** Local Records Research Officer, or a Local Administrative Jusa or Local Administrative Jusabo whose grade fits a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post. Duties: Archive Librarian.\n\n**Relationships.** Owes Song Jaemin a debt for safekeeping the cipher original, and dislikes Gang Yejun''s late-night viewings.\n\n**Ambition.** To put family records and emergency food lists into the same iron locker as a shared practice, so that the belongings of neighbors around Seoul Station are not scattered.\n\n**Fear.** On a night when the power ration is cut, a candle burns the archive''s hanji and continuity is left as ash.\n\n**Intervention.** Can obtain dehumidifier parts, or expose night entries that are not in the viewing ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −20 | Force −25 | Materialism −40 | Communality 0 | Principle 50 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −45\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Exclusivity −35 | Risk 10 | Display 20 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jo Ha-rin","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":""},{"from":"Jo Ha-rin","type":"Debt","to":"Song Jaemin","basis":"Debt for Safekeeping the Cipher Original"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Hwang Eunseol","type":"Debt","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"Debt for Safekeeping the Cipher Original"},{"from":"Song Jaemin","type":"Contract","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"Cipher Original Chest Entrusted to the Archive"},{"from":"Yang Santae","type":"Contract","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"After screening out the forged copies, Yang Santae hands the safekept original and the receipt records over to Jo Harin. Jo Harin opens viewing with both librarians'' keys and records the removal time, so that the original does not vanish along with the discarded copies."},{"from":"Ji Seo-yun","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"is an aide who backs Jo Harin''s dual-key rule on site, and"},{"from":"Na Seonjae","type":"Command","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"enforces Jo Harin''s removal-time schedule through patrols, and"},{"from":"Cha Se-on","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":""},{"from":"Ji Hansol","type":"Command","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":""},{"from":"Eo Taesan","type":"Contract","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"matches the humidity and storage cycle of Jo Harin''s iron chest, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0147","name":"조하린","title":"문서고 사서","position":"문서고 사서","characterId":"K146","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"문서고 열쇠·열람 기록 관리","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-조하린","detailRoute":"/people/person-0147","birthDate":"2095-01-20","birthday":"01-20","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k146-access-log","name":"열람 시각 기록","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k146-choice","name":"원본을 놓지 않음","description":"조용하고 집요하며 습도에 민감하다. 장부를 빌려 간 사람의 손때까지 기억한다.","behavior":"직함은 문서고 사서.","stress":"공포. 전력 배급이 끊긴 밤에 촛불이 문서고 한지를 태워 연속성이 재로 남는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 송재민에게 암호문 원본 보관 빚이 있고, 강예준의 심야 열람을 꺼린다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k146-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 문서고 사서. 열람은 두 사서의 열쇠가 동시에 있어야 열고, 반출 시각을 분 단위로 벽에 적는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 문서고 사서. 열람은 두 사서의 열쇠가 동시에 있어야 열고, 반출 시각을 분 단위로 벽에 적는다.","stress":"공포. 전력 배급이 끊긴 밤에 촛불이 문서고 한지를 태워 연속성이 재로 남는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 송재민에게 암호문 원본 보관 빚이 있고, 강예준의 심야 열람을 꺼린다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 문서고 사서.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41820-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K146","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41820-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99","name":"배천 조씨","crest":"clan-crests/c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-20,"무력":-25,"물질":-40,"공동":0,"원칙":50,"공개":-10,"자격":10,"분산":-25,"변혁":-45},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-35,"위험":10,"과시":20,"지속":35,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"문서고 열쇠·열람 기록 관리","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"문서고 사서","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −40 | 공동 0 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −10 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −45","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −35 | 위험 10 | 과시 20 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 문서고 사서 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 조하린의 문서고 열쇠와 열람 기록을 돌보는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 문서고 사서.","일화":"","관계":"송재민에게 암호문 원본 보관 빚이 있고, 강예준의 심야 열람을 꺼린다.","야망":"가족 기록과 비상 식량 목록을 같은 철제 보관함에 넣어 두는 공용 방식을 만들어, 서울역 이웃들의 짐이 흩어지지 않게 한다.","공포":"전력 배급이 끊긴 밤에 촛불이 문서고 한지를 태워 연속성이 재로 남는 것.","개입":"제습 부품을 구하거나, 열람 장부에 없는 야간 출입을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"조용하고 집요하며 습도에 민감하다. 장부를 빌려 간 사람의 손때까지 기억한다.\n\n- 생업: 문서고 열쇠·열람 기록 관리\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 문서고 사서\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 문서고 사서 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 조하린의 문서고 열쇠와 열람 기록을 돌보는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 문서고 사서.\n\n**관계.** 송재민에게 암호문 원본 보관 빚이 있고, 강예준의 심야 열람을 꺼린다.\n\n**야망.** 가족 기록과 비상 식량 목록을 같은 철제 보관함에 넣어 두는 공용 방식을 만들어, 서울역 이웃들의 짐이 흩어지지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 전력 배급이 끊긴 밤에 촛불이 문서고 한지를 태워 연속성이 재로 남는 것.\n\n**개입.** 제습 부품을 구하거나, 열람 장부에 없는 야간 출입을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −40 | 공동 0 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −10 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −45\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −35 | 위험 10 | 과시 20 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"조하린","type":"지휘","to":"윤서린","basis":""},{"from":"조하린","type":"빚","to":"송재민","basis":"암호문 원본 보관 빚"}],"incoming":[{"from":"황은설","type":"빚","to":"조하린","basis":"암호문 원본 보관 빚"},{"from":"송재민","type":"계약","to":"조하린","basis":"암호 원본 함을 문서고에 맡김"},{"from":"양산태","type":"계약","to":"조하린","basis":"양산태는 위조 사본을 가린 뒤 보관한 원본과 인수 기록을 조하린에게 넘긴다. 조하린은 두 사서의 열쇠로 열람을 열고 반출 시각을 남겨, 원본이 사본 폐기와 함께 사라지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"지서윤","type":"스승과 제자","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 이중 열쇠 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고"},{"from":"나선재","type":"지휘","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 반출 시각표를 순찰로 집행하고"},{"from":"차세온","type":"스승과 제자","to":"조하린","basis":""},{"from":"지한솔","type":"지휘","to":"조하린","basis":""},{"from":"어태산","type":"계약","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 철제 함 습도와 보관 주기를 맞추며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0148', 'c724-d30c-d3c9', '{"id":"person-0148","name":"Yun Ji-yul","title":"Medical Transport Recorder","position":"Medical Transport Recorder","characterId":"K147","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medical Transport Dispatch Management by Severity","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-yunjiyul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0148","birthDate":"2064-07-24","birthday":"07-24","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k147-medical-dispatch","name":"Severity-based dispatch","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k147-choice","name":"Separates patients from troops","description":"Principled, but he folded procedure before patients. He saw leaving nameless dead in the ledger as his own calling.","behavior":"Title: Medical Transport Recorder.","stress":"Fear. That the transfer lists would merge with military registries and the refugees would remain as troop numbers alone. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Belonged to Yun Seorin''s endorsement faction and owed Ryu Eunbi the medicine-allocation ledger. Left Shin Boram''s family transfer as a priority record.","effects":[]},{"id":"k147-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Medical Transport Recorder. He published severity-order dispatches and cancelled a run at once whenever weapons and patients boarded one train.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Medical Transport Recorder. He published severity-order dispatches and cancelled a run at once whenever weapons and patients boarded one train.","stress":"Fear. That the transfer lists would merge with military registries and the refugees would remain as troop numbers alone. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Belonged to Yun Seorin''s endorsement faction and owed Ryu Eunbi the medicine-allocation ledger. Left Shin Boram''s family transfer as a priority record.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Posts severity-based dispatch and cancels mixed weapons and patient transport. Medical records and dispatch do not establish clinical expertise. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51110-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K147","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51110-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c724-d30c-d3c9","name":"Papyeong Yun Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c724-d30c-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-10,"Force":-35,"Material":-35,"Communal":10,"Principle":70,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-30,"Display":5,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical Transport Dispatch Management by Severity","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Local Health Section","Assigned Duties":"Medical Transport Recorder","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −35 | Materialism −35 | Communality 10 | Principle 70 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 40 | Exclusivity −30 | Risk −30 | Display 5 | Persistence 40 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The Medical Transport Recorder post opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Yun Jiyul''s work of dispatching medical transport by severity connects to the duties of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Local Health Section. Duties: Medical Transport Recorder.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Belongs to Yun Seorin''s backing faction and owes Ryu Eunbi the medicine allocation ledger.","Ambition":"","Fear":"That the transfer rosters merge with the military household register, leaving refugees remembered only as troop numbers.","Intervention":"Can escort a train carrying only patients, or separate out a transfer roster mixed with military household registers."},"biography":"Principled, yet sets procedure aside in front of a patient. Sees recording nameless corpses in the ledger as their duty.\n\n- Livelihood: Medical Transport Dispatch Management by Severity\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position and Grade: Local Health Section\n- Assigned Duties: Medical Transport Recorder\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The Medical Transport Recorder post opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Yun Jiyul''s work of dispatching medical transport by severity connects to the duties of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position/Rank.** Local Health Section. Duties: Medical Transport Recorder.\n\n**Relations.** Belongs to Yun Seorin''s backing faction and owes Ryu Eunbi the medicine allocation ledger.\n\n**Fear.** That the transfer rosters merge with the military household register, leaving refugees remembered only as troop numbers.\n\n**Intervention.** Can escort a train carrying only patients, or separate out a transfer roster mixed with military household registers.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −35 | Materialism −35 | Community 10 | Principle 70 | Publicity −15 | Credentials 15 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −30 | Display 5 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yun Ji-yul","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Medical Transfer Records of Yun Seorin''s Backers"},{"from":"Yun Ji-yul","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Owes the medicine allocation ledger to the Healing Guild"},{"from":"Yun Ji-yul","type":"Contract","to":"Sin Boram","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Seo Na-yeon","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"Allocates infirmary ice as a priority"},{"from":"Sin Boram","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":""},{"from":"Yeon Jiu","type":"Command","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"Takes direction to carry out Yun Jiyul''s transfer ledger at the bedside, and"},{"from":"Seol Dahin","type":"Command","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"Carries out Yun Jiyul''s dispatch cancellations on the platform, and"},{"from":"Yeon Taesol","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"is an aide who translates Yun Jiyul''s medical transport ledger into coordination tables, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0148","name":"윤지율","title":"의료이송 기록관","position":"의료이송 기록관","characterId":"K147","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"중증도별 의료이송 배차 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-윤지율","detailRoute":"/people/person-0148","birthDate":"2064-07-24","birthday":"07-24","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k147-medical-dispatch","name":"중증도 배차","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k147-choice","name":"환자를 병력과 분리","description":"원칙적이지만 환자 앞에서는 절차를 접는다. 이름 없는 시신을 장부에 남기는 일을 자신의 본분으로 본다.","behavior":"직함은 의료이송 기록관.","stress":"공포. 이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 추대 세력에 속하고 류은비에게 약품 배정 장부를 빚졌다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k147-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 의료이송 기록관. 중증도 순 배차를 공개하고, 무기와 환자가 한 열차에 타면 즉시 운행을 취소한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 의료이송 기록관. 중증도 순 배차를 공개하고, 무기와 환자가 한 열차에 타면 즉시 운행을 취소한다.","stress":"공포. 이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 추대 세력에 속하고 류은비에게 약품 배정 장부를 빚졌다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"중증도 배차를 공개하고 무기와 환자의 혼승을 취소한다. 의료 기록과 배차의 수행은 진료 전문성을 뜻하지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51110-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K147","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51110-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c724-d30c-d3c9","name":"파평 윤씨","crest":"clan-crests/c724-d30c-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-10,"무력":-35,"물질":-35,"공동":10,"원칙":70,"공개":-15,"자격":15,"분산":-40,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-30,"위험":-30,"과시":5,"지속":40,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"중증도별 의료이송 배차 관리","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방보건계","담당 업무":"의료이송 기록관","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −35 | 공동 10 | 원칙 70 | 공개 −15 | 자격 15 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 5 | 지속 40 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 의료이송 기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 윤지율의 중증도에 따라 의료이송을 배차하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방보건계. 담당 업무: 의료이송 기록관.","일화":"","관계":"윤서린의 추대 세력에 속하고 류은비에게 약품 배정 장부를 빚졌다.","야망":"","공포":"이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것.","개입":"환자만 태운 열차를 호송하거나, 군사호적이 섞인 이송 명단을 분리해 줄 수 있다."},"biography":"원칙적이지만 환자 앞에서는 절차를 접는다. 이름 없는 시신을 장부에 남기는 일을 자신의 본분으로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 중증도별 의료이송 배차 관리\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방보건계\n- 담당 업무: 의료이송 기록관\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 의료이송 기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 윤지율의 중증도에 따라 의료이송을 배차하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방보건계. 담당 업무: 의료이송 기록관.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린의 추대 세력에 속하고 류은비에게 약품 배정 장부를 빚졌다.\n\n**공포.** 이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것.\n\n**개입.** 환자만 태운 열차를 호송하거나, 군사호적이 섞인 이송 명단을 분리해 줄 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −35 | 공동 10 | 원칙 70 | 공개 −15 | 자격 15 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 5 | 지속 40 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"윤지율","type":"지휘","to":"윤서린","basis":"윤서린 추대 세력의 의료이송 기록"},{"from":"윤지율","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"약품 배정 장부를 치료길드에 빚짐"},{"from":"윤지율","type":"계약","to":"신보람","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"서나연","type":"계약","to":"윤지율","basis":"의무실 얼음을 우선 배정"},{"from":"신보람","type":"계약","to":"윤지율","basis":""},{"from":"연지우","type":"지휘","to":"윤지율","basis":"윤지율의 이송 장부를 침상에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"설다흰","type":"지휘","to":"윤지율","basis":"윤지율의 배차 취소를 승강장에서 집행하며"},{"from":"연태솔","type":"스승과 제자","to":"윤지율","basis":"윤지율의 의료이송 원장을 조정표로 번역하는 실무원이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0149', 'c624-d574-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0149","name":"O Seo-yul","title":"Contract Notary","position":"Contract Notary","characterId":"K148","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Notarizing Contract Termination Conditions and Witness Fields","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-oseoyul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0149","birthDate":"2067-11-29","birthday":"11-29","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k148-clause-checking","name":"Termination clause checking","rating":65},{"id":"k148-notarial-copy","name":"Notarial copy checking","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k148-choice","name":"Rejects empty clauses","description":"Quick of arithmetic, she hated blanks in wording. She repeated that a verbal promise was not a promise.","behavior":"Title: Contract Notary.","stress":"Fear. That a quantity she double-checked proves wrong and her neighbors at Seoul Station go hungry. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. She shares the double-checking of stockpile ledgers with neighboring merchants and agrees the order of quantity reports with the people of the market in front of Seoul Station.","effects":[]},{"id":"k148-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: contract notary. She forced exit conditions and witness lines into every clause and gave out copies only after the stamps dried.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: contract notary. She forced exit conditions and witness lines into every clause and gave out copies only after the stamps dried.","stress":"Fear. That a quantity she double-checked proves wrong and her neighbors at Seoul Station go hungry. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. She shares the double-checking of stockpile ledgers with neighboring merchants and agrees the order of quantity reports with the people of the market in front of Seoul Station.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Requires termination conditions and witnesses before releasing sealed copies. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51130-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K148","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51130-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c624-d574-c8fc","name":"Haeju O Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c624-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-15,"Force":-25,"Material":-25,"Communal":20,"Principle":45,"Public":-25,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":35,"Display":25,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Notarizing Contract Termination Conditions and Witness Fields","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Contract Notary","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness −15 | Force −25 | Materialism −25 | Community 20 | Principle 45 | Publicity −25 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly 25 | Risk 35 | Display 25 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Contract Notary opened up through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Notarizing O Seoyul''s contract termination conditions and witness columns connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A grade among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Clerk (Grade 8), and Assistant Clerk (Grade 9), whichever fits the post at a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office. Duties: Contract Notary.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"She shares the double-checking of stockpile ledgers with neighboring merchants and agrees the order of quantity reports with the people of the market in front of Seoul Station.","Ambition":"She gathers all winter food and fuel quantity reports into one public ledger in front of Seoul Station so that any neighbor can see the results of the check.","Fear":"That a quantity she double-checked proves wrong and her neighbors at Seoul Station go hungry.","Intervention":"They can bring a corrected draft that fixes the wrong quantities, or reveal the record of whoever quietly tampered with the ledger."},"biography":"Quick with numbers and hates blanks in the wording. Repeats that an oral promise is not a promise.\n\n- Livelihood: Notarizing Contract Termination Conditions and Witness Fields\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position/Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Duties: Contract Notary\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Contract Notary opened up through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Notarizing O Seoyul''s contract termination conditions and witness columns connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position/Rank.** A grade among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Clerk (Grade 8), and Assistant Clerk (Grade 9), whichever fits the post at a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office. Duties: Contract Notary.\n\n**Relations.** She shares the double-checking of stockpile ledgers with neighboring merchants and agrees the order of quantity reports with the people of the market in front of Seoul Station.\n\n**Ambition.** She gathers all winter food and fuel quantity reports into one public ledger in front of Seoul Station so that any neighbor can see the results of the check.\n\n**Fear.** That a quantity she double-checked proves wrong and her neighbors at Seoul Station go hungry.\n\n**Intervention.** They can bring a corrected draft that fixes the wrong quantities, or reveal the record of whoever quietly tampered with the ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness −15 | Force −25 | Materialism −25 | Community 20 | Principle 45 | Publicity −25 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly 25 | Risk 35 | Display 25 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"O Seo-yul","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Audits the food stockpile ledger under delegated authority"},{"from":"O Seo-yul","type":"Contract","to":"Han Jae-mok","basis":"Checked the food stockpile ledger audit side by side with the parts-and-food exchange"},{"from":"O Seo-yul","type":"Contract","to":"Eva Novakova","basis":"Trades Yongsan railway contract notarization"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Eva Novakova","type":"Contract","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"Entrusts railway contract notarization to the Records Office"},{"from":"Ma Dohan","type":"Contract","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"is a contract that transports only O Seoyul''s dried seals, and"},{"from":"Ma Eungyeol","type":"Contract","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"Verifies O Seoyul''s notarial seal before the auction, and"},{"from":"Chu Seoyun","type":"Oath","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"Backs O Seoyul''s notarization requests from the witness stand, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0149","name":"오서율","title":"계약 공증관","position":"계약 공증관","characterId":"K148","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"계약 종료 조건·증인란 공증","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-오서율","detailRoute":"/people/person-0149","birthDate":"2067-11-29","birthday":"11-29","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k148-clause-checking","name":"종료 조항 점검","rating":65},{"id":"k148-notarial-copy","name":"공증 사본 확인","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k148-choice","name":"빈 조항을 거부","description":"계산이 빠르고 문구의 빈칸을 싫어한다. 구두 약속은 약속이 아니라고 반복한다.","behavior":"직함은 계약 공증관.","stress":"공포. 자신이 검산한 수량이 틀려 서울역 이웃이 굶는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 이웃 상인들과 비축 장부의 검산을 나눠 맡고, 서울역 앞 시장 사람들과 수량 보고의 순서를 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k148-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 계약 공증관. 조항마다 종료 조건과 증인란을 강제하고, 인장이 마른 뒤에만 사본을 내준다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 계약 공증관. 조항마다 종료 조건과 증인란을 강제하고, 인장이 마른 뒤에만 사본을 내준다.","stress":"공포. 자신이 검산한 수량이 틀려 서울역 이웃이 굶는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 이웃 상인들과 비축 장부의 검산을 나눠 맡고, 서울역 앞 시장 사람들과 수량 보고의 순서를 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"종료 조건과 증인란을 요구하고 마른 인장 뒤에 사본을 내준다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51130-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K148","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51130-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c624-d574-c8fc","name":"해주 오씨","crest":"clan-crests/c624-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":-15,"무력":-25,"물질":-25,"공동":20,"원칙":45,"공개":-25,"자격":10,"분산":-30,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":25,"위험":35,"과시":25,"지속":-15,"지향":"동성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"계약 종료 조건·증인란 공증","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"계약 공증관","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −25 | 공동 20 | 원칙 45 | 공개 −25 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 25 | 위험 35 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 계약 공증관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 오서율의 계약 종료 조건과 증인란을 공증하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 계약 공증관.","일화":"","관계":"이웃 상인들과 비축 장부의 검산을 나눠 맡고, 서울역 앞 시장 사람들과 수량 보고의 순서를 맞춘다.","야망":"겨울 식량과 연료 수량 보고를 모두 서울역 앞 공개 장부 한 권에 모아, 이웃 누구나 검산 결과를 볼 수 있게 한다.","공포":"자신이 검산한 수량이 틀려 서울역 이웃이 굶는 것.","개입":"틀린 수량을 고친 수정본을 들고 오거나, 장부를 몰래 만진 사람의 기록을 공개할 수 있다."},"biography":"계산이 빠르고 문구의 빈칸을 싫어한다. 구두 약속은 약속이 아니라고 반복한다.\n\n- 생업: 계약 종료 조건·증인란 공증\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 계약 공증관\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 계약 공증관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 오서율의 계약 종료 조건과 증인란을 공증하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 계약 공증관.\n\n**관계.** 이웃 상인들과 비축 장부의 검산을 나눠 맡고, 서울역 앞 시장 사람들과 수량 보고의 순서를 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 겨울 식량과 연료 수량 보고를 모두 서울역 앞 공개 장부 한 권에 모아, 이웃 누구나 검산 결과를 볼 수 있게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 자신이 검산한 수량이 틀려 서울역 이웃이 굶는 것.\n\n**개입.** 틀린 수량을 고친 수정본을 들고 오거나, 장부를 몰래 만진 사람의 기록을 공개할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −25 | 공동 20 | 원칙 45 | 공개 −25 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 25 | 위험 35 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"오서율","type":"지휘","to":"윤서린","basis":"위임받아 식량 비축 장부를 검산"},{"from":"오서율","type":"계약","to":"한재목","basis":"식량 비축 장부 검산 결과를 부품·식량 교환 때 나란히 확인"},{"from":"오서율","type":"계약","to":"에바 노바코바","basis":"용산 철도계약 공증을 거래"}],"incoming":[{"from":"에바 노바코바","type":"계약","to":"오서율","basis":"철도계약 공증을 기록청에 맡김"},{"from":"마도한","type":"계약","to":"오서율","basis":"오서율의 마른 인장만 운송하는 계약이고"},{"from":"마은결","type":"계약","to":"오서율","basis":"오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전 확인하며"},{"from":"추서윤","type":"맹세","to":"오서율","basis":"오서율의 공증 청구를 증인석에서 받치고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0150', 'c11c-b2ec-c131', '{"id":"person-0150","name":"Seo Ra-on","title":"Map Restoration Librarian","position":"Map Restoration Librarian","characterId":"K149","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Underground Passage Surveying and Map Restoration","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-seoraon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0150","birthDate":"2080-06-20","birthday":"06-20","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k149-field-survey","name":"Field surveying","rating":65},{"id":"k149-map-crosscheck","name":"Map cross-checking","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k149-choice","name":"Marks uncertainty","description":"Curious, he could not stand people losing their way. He saw distributing a wrong map as close to murder.","behavior":"Title: Map Restoration Librarian.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Matched map-renewal times with Choi Jiwoo and received transmission tower coordinates from Gwon Mirae. Yun Seorin used his master plate as a ratification annex.","effects":[]},{"id":"k149-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Map Restoration Librarian. He drew field surveys overlaid with transmission bulletins and left roads with a single source only as dotted lines.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Map Restoration Librarian. He drew field surveys overlaid with transmission bulletins and left roads with a single source only as dotted lines.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Matched map-renewal times with Choi Jiwoo and received transmission tower coordinates from Gwon Mirae. Yun Seorin used his master plate as a ratification annex.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Cross-checks surveys with reports and marks single-source roads as dotted lines. No recovery of obsolete maps or territorial authority is established. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51150-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K149","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51150-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11c-b2ec-c131","name":"Dalseong Seo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c11c-b2ec-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-10,"Force":-35,"Material":-40,"Communal":5,"Principle":55,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-35,"Display":30,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Underground Passage Surveying and Map Restoration","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Local Records Research Officer, or a Local Administrative Jusa or Local Administrative Jusabo whose grade fits a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post","Assigned Duties":"Map Restoration Librarian","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −35 | Material −40 | Communal 5 | Principle 55 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion −40 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Longing 0 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −35 | Display 30 | Sustainability −15 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on the waiting-room watch. The Map Restoration Librarian post opened as a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Fitting the passage measurements Seo Raon takes in the field onto the map connects to updating the Seoul Station waiting-hall board.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post, among Local Records Researcher or Local Administrative Officer / Assistant Local Administrative Officer. Duties: Map Restoration Librarian.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Syncs map update times with Choe Jiu and receives transmission tower coordinates from Gwon Mirae. Yun Seorin uses their plate as a ratification attachment.","Ambition":"He gathers the blocked exits and the living passages onto a single public map so that anyone can confirm a safe route in winter.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can track down the print shop of a forged map plate."},"biography":"Curious, and cannot stand people getting lost. Considers distributing a wrong map close to murder.\n\n- Livelihood: Underground Passage Surveying and Map Restoration\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service organization\n- Position and grade: a grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post, among Local Records Researcher or Local Administrative Officer / Assistant Local Administrative Officer\n- Duties: Map Restoration Librarian\n**Life.** Grew up on the waiting-room watch. The Map Restoration Librarian post opened as a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Fitting the passage measurements Seo Raon takes in the field onto the map connects to updating the Seoul Station waiting-hall board.\n\n**Civil Service Position and Grade.** A grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post, among Local Records Researcher or Local Administrative Officer / Assistant Local Administrative Officer. Duties: Map Restoration Librarian.\n\n**Relations.** Syncs map update times with Choe Jiu and receives transmission tower coordinates from Gwon Mirae. Yun Seorin uses their plate as a ratification attachment.\n\n**Ambition.** He gathers the blocked exits and the living passages onto a single public map so that anyone can confirm a safe route in winter.\n\n**Intervention.** Can track down the print shop of a forged map plate.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −35 | Material −40 | Communal 5 | Principle 55 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion −40 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Longing 0 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −35 | Display 30 | Sustainability −15 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seo Ra-on","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Syncs map update times with transmissions"},{"from":"Seo Ra-on","type":"Contract","to":"Gwon Mi-rae","basis":"Receives transmission tower coordinates and attaches them to the plate"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gwon Mi-rae","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Ra-on","basis":"Passes transmission tower coordinates to the map plate"},{"from":"Jo Seowon","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Ra-on","basis":"Jo Seowon relays news of the closure of the flooded, collapsed section to Seo Raon. Seo Raon checks the field survey and the bulletin together to update the map, and leaves unconfirmed detour roads as dotted lines."},{"from":"Ju Rian","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Seo Ra-on","basis":"An aide who hands field coordinates to Seo Raon''s plate, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0150","name":"서라온","title":"지도 복구 사서","position":"지도 복구 사서","characterId":"K149","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"지하 통로 측량·지도 복구","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-서라온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0150","birthDate":"2080-06-20","birthday":"06-20","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k149-field-survey","name":"현장 측량","rating":65},{"id":"k149-map-crosscheck","name":"지도 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k149-choice","name":"불확실성을 표시","description":"호기심이 많고 길을 잃는 사람을 참지 못한다. 틀린 지도를 배포하는 일을 살인에 가깝다고 여긴다.","behavior":"직함은 지도 복구 사서.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 최지우과 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추고 권미래에게 송신탑 좌표를 받는다. 윤서린은 그의 원판을 인준 첨부물로 쓴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k149-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 지도 복구 사서. 현장 측량과 송신 속보를 겹쳐 그리고, 출처가 하나뿐인 도로는 점선으로만 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 지도 복구 사서. 현장 측량과 송신 속보를 겹쳐 그리고, 출처가 하나뿐인 도로는 점선으로만 남긴다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 최지우과 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추고 권미래에게 송신탑 좌표를 받는다. 윤서린은 그의 원판을 인준 첨부물로 쓴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"현장 측량과 속보를 대조하고 단일 출처 도로를 점선으로 남긴다. 낡은 지도를 회수한 결말이나 영토 결정권은 없다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51150-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K149","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51150-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11c-b2ec-c131","name":"달성 서씨","crest":"clan-crests/c11c-b2ec-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-10,"무력":-35,"물질":-40,"공동":5,"원칙":55,"공개":-10,"자격":20,"분산":-40,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-20,"위험":-35,"과시":30,"지속":-15,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"지하 통로 측량·지도 복구","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"지도 복구 사서","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −40 | 공동 5 | 원칙 55 | 공개 −10 | 자격 20 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −35 | 과시 30 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 지도 복구 사서 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 서라온이 현장에서 잰 통로 치수를 지도에 맞추는 일은 서울역 대합실 게시판의 갱신과 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 지도 복구 사서.","일화":"","관계":"최지우와 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추고 권미래에게 송신탑 좌표를 받는다. 윤서린은 그의 원판을 인준 첨부물로 쓴다.","야망":"막힌 출구와 살아 있는 통로를 한 장의 공개 지도로 모아, 누구나 겨울에 안전한 길을 확인하게 한다.","공포":"","개입":"위조 지도 원판의 인쇄소를 찾아낼 수 있다."},"biography":"호기심이 많고 길을 잃는 사람을 참지 못한다. 틀린 지도를 배포하는 일을 살인에 가깝다고 여긴다.\n\n- 생업: 지하 통로 측량·지도 복구\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 지도 복구 사서\n**생애.** 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 지도 복구 사서 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 서라온이 현장에서 잰 통로 치수를 지도에 맞추는 일은 서울역 대합실 게시판의 갱신과 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 지도 복구 사서.\n\n**관계.** 최지우와 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추고 권미래에게 송신탑 좌표를 받는다. 윤서린은 그의 원판을 인준 첨부물로 쓴다.\n\n**야망.** 막힌 출구와 살아 있는 통로를 한 장의 공개 지도로 모아, 누구나 겨울에 안전한 길을 확인하게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 위조 지도 원판의 인쇄소를 찾아낼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −40 | 공동 5 | 원칙 55 | 공개 −10 | 자격 20 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −35 | 과시 30 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"서라온","type":"계약","to":"최지우","basis":"지도 갱신 시각을 송신과 맞춤"},{"from":"서라온","type":"계약","to":"권미래","basis":"송신탑 좌표를 받아 원판에 붙임"}],"incoming":[{"from":"권미래","type":"계약","to":"서라온","basis":"송신탑 좌표를 지도 원판에 넘김"},{"from":"조서원","type":"계약","to":"서라온","basis":"조서원은 침수 붕괴 구간의 폐쇄 소식을 서라온에게 전달한다. 서라온은 현장 측량과 속보를 함께 확인해 지도를 갱신하고, 확인되지 않은 우회 도로는 점선으로 남긴다."},{"from":"주리안","type":"스승과 제자","to":"서라온","basis":"서라온의 원판에 현장 좌표를 넘기는 실무원이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0151', 'c9c0-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0151","name":"Ji Seo-yun","title":"Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician","position":"Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician","characterId":"K150","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Archive dehumidifier humidity and filter maintenance","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-ji-seoyun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0151","birthDate":"2096-09-19","birthday":"09-19","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k150-filter-maintenance","name":"Filter maintenance","rating":65},{"id":"k150-humidity-log","name":"Humidity logging","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k150-choice","name":"Checks component reliability","description":"She read humidity from the dehumidifier''s vibration and distrusted anyone who brought candles into the archive. She answered with filter-replacement noise rather than words.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125 she turned back a box of defective parts just before release. By this deed the signature of the Seoul Station archive dehumidification mechanic post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That on a ration-cut night the dehumidifier would stop and a candle would turn continuity into ash. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice backing Jo Harin''s double-key rule in the field, she matched dehumidification power to Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generators and inspected Gang Minseo''s filter standards.","effects":[]},{"id":"k150-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician. Each rotation she wrote humidity and filter thickness on the wall and fitted no part without the Record Bureau stamp.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician. Each rotation she wrote humidity and filter thickness on the wall and fitted no part without the Record Bureau stamp.","stress":"Fear. That on a ration-cut night the dehumidifier would stop and a candle would turn continuity into ash. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice backing Jo Harin''s double-key rule in the field, she matched dehumidification power to Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generators and inspected Gang Minseo''s filter standards.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Logs humidity and filter thickness and rejected defective parts. Inspection and power-cycle coordination do not imply universal engineering expertise. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51170-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K150","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51170-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c0-cda9-c8fc","name":"Chungju Ji Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c9c0-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":-10,"Force":-25,"Material":-25,"Communal":5,"Principle":40,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":-20,"Transformative":-45},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":-35,"Display":10,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Archive dehumidifier humidity and filter maintenance","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"A grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government business-office post, among Local Industrial Officer / Assistant Local Industrial Officer or Local Facilities Officer / Assistant Local Facilities Officer","Assigned Duties":"Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness −10 | Force −25 | Material −25 | Communal 5 | Principle 40 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 40 | Dispersion −20 | Transformation −45","Desires":"Longing 30 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −35 | Display 10 | Sustainability 5 | Orientation Fluid | Union Monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at Sinjeong Rail Depot. The post of Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician opened after a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Maintaining the humidity and dehumidifier filters of the archive that Ji Seoyun oversees connects to work in Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government business-office post, among Local Industrial Officer / Assistant Local Industrial Officer or Local Facilities Officer / Assistant Local Facilities Officer. Duties: Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician.","Anecdote":"In 2125, sent back a box of defective parts just before shipment. Because of this, the signature for the post of Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"An aide who supports Jo Harin''s double-key rule in the field, matches dehumidification power to Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation, and inspects Gang Minseo''s filter specifications.","Ambition":"","Fear":"A night when rations are cut off, the dehumidifiers stop, and candles turn continuity to ash.","Intervention":"Can obtain dehumidifier parts to save the stacks, or expose maintenance entries missing from the reading ledger."},"biography":"Reads humidity by the vibration of the dehumidifiers and distrusts anyone who brings a candle into the stacks. Answers with the noise of a filter change rather than with words.\n\n- Livelihood: Archive dehumidifier humidity and filter maintenance\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position and Grade: A grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government business-office post, among Local Industrial Officer / Assistant Local Industrial Officer or Local Facilities Officer / Assistant Local Facilities Officer\n- Assigned Duties: Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician\n**Life.** Grew up at Sinjeong Rail Depot. The post of Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician opened after a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Maintaining the humidity and dehumidifier filters of the archive that Ji Seoyun oversees connects to work in Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil service position and grade.** A grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government business-office post, among Local Industrial Officer / Assistant Local Industrial Officer or Local Facilities Officer / Assistant Local Facilities Officer. Duties: Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, sent back a box of defective parts just before shipment. Because of this, the signature for the post of Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** An aide who supports Jo Harin''s double-key rule in the field, matches dehumidification power to Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation, and inspects Gang Minseo''s filter specifications.\n\n**Fear.** A night when rations are cut off, the dehumidifiers stop, and candles turn continuity to ash.\n\n**Intervention.** Can obtain dehumidifier parts to save the stacks, or expose maintenance entries missing from the reading ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness −10 | Force −25 | Materialism −25 | Communal 5 | Principle 40 | Transparency −10 | Qualification 40 | Decentralization −20 | Transformation −45\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −35 | Display 10 | Persistence 5 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ji Seo-yun","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"is an aide who backs Jo Harin''s dual-key rule on site, and"},{"from":"Ji Seo-yun","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Na Bomgyeol","basis":"matching the dehumidification power to Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ji Hansol","type":"Command","to":"Ji Seo-yun","basis":"matching Ji Seoyun''s dehumidification cycle to the box temperature"},{"from":"Na Bomgyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Ji Seo-yun","basis":"matching output to Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifier"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0151","name":"지서윤","title":"서울역 문서고 제습 정비사","position":"서울역 문서고 제습 정비사","characterId":"K150","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"문서고 제습기 습도·필터 정비","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-지서윤","detailRoute":"/people/person-0151","birthDate":"2096-09-19","birthday":"09-19","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k150-filter-maintenance","name":"필터 정비","rating":65},{"id":"k150-humidity-log","name":"습도 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k150-choice","name":"부품 신뢰를 따짐","description":"제습기 진동으로 습도를 읽고, 촛불을 서고에 들이는 사람을 불신한다. 말보다 필터 교체 소음으로 대답한다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 배급이 끊긴 밤에 제습기가 멈추고 촛불이 연속성을 재로 만드는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 조하린의 이중 열쇠 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고, 나봄결의 비상 발전에 제습 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 필터 규격을 검수한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k150-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사. 교대마다 습도와 필터 두께를 벽에 쓰고, 기록청 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사. 교대마다 습도와 필터 두께를 벽에 쓰고, 기록청 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 배급이 끊긴 밤에 제습기가 멈추고 촛불이 연속성을 재로 만드는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 조하린의 이중 열쇠 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고, 나봄결의 비상 발전에 제습 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 필터 규격을 검수한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"교대마다 습도와 필터 두께를 기록하고 불량 부품을 돌려보냈다. 부품 검수와 전력 주기 협력을 만능 공학으로 확대하지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51170-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K150","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51170-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c0-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 지씨","crest":"clan-crests/c9c0-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":-10,"무력":-25,"물질":-25,"공동":5,"원칙":40,"공개":-10,"자격":40,"분산":-20,"변혁":-45},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-35,"위험":-35,"과시":10,"지속":5,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"문서고 제습기 습도·필터 정비","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"서울역 문서고 제습 정비사","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −25 | 공동 5 | 원칙 40 | 공개 −10 | 자격 40 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 −45","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −35 | 과시 10 | 지속 5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 지서윤이 맡는 문서고의 습도와 제습기 필터를 정비하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사.","일화":"2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"조하린의 이중 열쇠 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고, 나봄결의 비상 발전에 제습 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 필터 규격을 검수한다.","야망":"","공포":"배급이 끊긴 밤에 제습기가 멈추고 촛불이 연속성을 재로 만드는 것.","개입":"제습 부품을 구해 서고를 살리거나, 열람 장부에 없는 정비 출입을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"제습기 진동으로 습도를 읽고, 촛불을 서고에 들이는 사람을 불신한다. 말보다 필터 교체 소음으로 대답한다.\n\n- 생업: 문서고 제습기 습도·필터 정비\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사\n**생애.** 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 지서윤이 맡는 문서고의 습도와 제습기 필터를 정비하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 조하린의 이중 열쇠 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고, 나봄결의 비상 발전에 제습 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 필터 규격을 검수한다.\n\n**공포.** 배급이 끊긴 밤에 제습기가 멈추고 촛불이 연속성을 재로 만드는 것.\n\n**개입.** 제습 부품을 구해 서고를 살리거나, 열람 장부에 없는 정비 출입을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −25 | 공동 5 | 원칙 40 | 공개 −10 | 자격 40 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 −45\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −35 | 과시 10 | 지속 5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"지서윤","type":"스승과 제자","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 이중 열쇠 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고"},{"from":"지서윤","type":"스승과 제자","to":"나봄결","basis":"나봄결의 비상 발전에 제습 전력을 맞추며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"지한솔","type":"지휘","to":"지서윤","basis":"지서윤의 제습 주기와 함 온도를 맞추며"},{"from":"나봄결","type":"계약","to":"지서윤","basis":"지서윤의 제습기에 출력을 맞추고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0152', 'b9c8-c7a5-d765', '{"id":"person-0152","name":"Ma Dohan","title":"Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant","position":"Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant","characterId":"K151","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Notarized copy weighing and removal management","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-ma-dohan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0152","birthDate":"2071-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k151-copy-weighing","name":"Copy box weighing","rating":65},{"id":"k151-shipment-log","name":"Shipment logging","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k151-choice","name":"Records discrepancies in trade","description":"He called anyone who moved copies before the stamps dried a forger, and when a box''s weight differed from the ledger he swapped the scales at once. He ended bargains low and honored no verbal freight.","behavior":"Anecdote. A crate of copies with O Seoyul''s witness box empty and a weight that disagrees with the shipping ledger stands at the Seoul Station berth. Ma Dohan swaps the scale and weighs it again, notes the difference beside the release time, and keeps the crate outside the berth.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract carrying O Seoyul''s dry stamps only, split seals and order with Yang Haeon''s dispatches, and competed whenever O Haerin''s settlement right tried to swallow the notary freight.","effects":[]},{"id":"k151-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant. He wrote the morning scales and removal hours on the wall and took no copy with O Seoyul''s witness line empty into the berth.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant. He wrote the morning scales and removal hours on the wall and took no copy with O Seoyul''s witness line empty into the berth.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract carrying O Seoyul''s dry stamps only, split seals and order with Yang Haeon''s dispatches, and competed whenever O Haerin''s settlement right tried to swallow the notary freight.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Reweighed a box with missing witnesses and logged its discrepancy before keeping it off the berth. Ledger monopoly remains an ambition. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:barony-K151-sea","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"barony","holderPersonId":"K151","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:sea-K151","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false},{"id":"title:duchy-28710-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K151","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-28710-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b9c8-c7a5-d765","name":"Jangheung Ma Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b9c8-c7a5-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-10,"Force":-40,"Material":-20,"Communal":20,"Principle":35,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-35,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-25,"Display":-25,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Notarized copy weighing and removal management","Status":"Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"None","Livelihood Role":"Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness −10 | Force −40 | Materialism −20 | Communal 20 | Principle 35 | Transparency −10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −35 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −25 | Display −25 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant opened after a single line was deleted from a double ledger.\n- Weighing Ma Dohan''s notarized copies and checking their removal times connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Duty":"Official rank: Officer (Jusa). Livelihood title: Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant. Writes the morning weight and removal time on the wall, and does not admit to the handover zone any copy whose witness column from O Seoyul is empty.","Anecdote":"A copy box with an empty witness column from O Seoyul, and with a weight that also disagrees with the transport ledger, stops in front of the Seoul Station handover zone. Ma Dohan replaces the scale and weighs it again, writes the discrepancy beside the removal time, and leaves the box outside the handover zone.","Relationships":"A contract to transport only O Seoyul''s dried seals; shares turn order with Yang Haeon''s courier seals, and competes if O Haerin''s settlement authority tries to swallow the notarial freight charges.","Ambition":"He keeps copies of the lists of hauled goods so that, even if freight vanishes or is seized, neighbors can verify it.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can take on witness escort and resume copy transport, or expose unrecorded night removals."},"biography":"Calls anyone who moves a copy before the seal has dried a forger, and replaces the scale at once if a box''s weight differs from the ledger. Ends bargaining low and does not recognize verbal freight charges.\n\n- Livelihood: Notarized copy weighing and removal management\n- Status: Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)\n- Civil service position and grade: None\n- Livelihood role: Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant opened after a single line was deleted from a double ledger.\n- Weighing Ma Dohan''s notarized copies and checking their removal times connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Work.** Official rank: Officer (Jusa). Livelihood title: Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant. Writes the morning weight and removal time on the wall, and does not admit to the handover zone any copy whose witness column from O Seoyul is empty.\n\n**Anecdote.** A copy box with an empty witness column from O Seoyul, and with a weight that also disagrees with the transport ledger, stops in front of the Seoul Station handover zone. Ma Dohan replaces the scale and weighs it again, writes the discrepancy beside the removal time, and leaves the box outside the handover zone.\n\n**Relationships.** A contract to transport only O Seoyul''s dried seals; shares turn order with Yang Haeon''s courier seals, and competes if O Haerin''s settlement authority tries to swallow the notarial freight charges.\n\n**Ambition.** He keeps copies of the lists of hauled goods so that, even if freight vanishes or is seized, neighbors can verify it.\n\n**Intervention.** Can take on witness escort and resume copy transport, or expose unrecorded night removals.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness −10 | Force −40 | Materialism −20 | Communal 20 | Principle 35 | Transparency −10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −35 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −25 | Display −25 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ma Dohan","type":"Contract","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"is a contract that transports only O Seoyul''s dried seals, and"},{"from":"Ma Dohan","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"sharing turn order with Yang Haeon''s courier seals"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Yang Haeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ma Dohan","basis":"sharing turn order with Ma Dohan''s copy boxes by contract"},{"from":"Ma Eungyeol","type":"Command","to":"Ma Dohan","basis":"a contract that enforces Ma Dohan''s transport turn order by auction"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0152","name":"마도한","title":"서울역 공증사본 물류상","position":"서울역 공증사본 물류상","characterId":"K151","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"공증사본 계량·반출 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-마도한","detailRoute":"/people/person-0152","birthDate":"2071-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k151-copy-weighing","name":"사본 상자 계량","rating":65},{"id":"k151-shipment-log","name":"반출 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k151-choice","name":"차이를 남기는 거래","description":"인장이 마르기 전에 사본을 움직이는 사람을 위조로 부르고, 상자 무게가 장부와 다르면 즉시 저울을 갈아 끼운다. 흥정은 낮게 끝내고 구두 운임을 인정하지 않는다.","behavior":"일화. 오서율의 증인란이 비고 무게마저 운송 장부와 어긋나는 사본 상자가 서울역 선석 앞에 선다. 마도한은 저울을 갈아 끼워 다시 달고, 반출 시각 옆에 차이를 적은 뒤 상자를 선석 밖에 둔다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 오서율의 마른 인장만 운송하는 계약이고, 양해온의 전령 봉인과 순번을 나누며, 오해린의 결제권이 공증 운임을 삼키려 하면 경쟁한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k151-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 서울역 공증사본 물류상. 아침 저울과 반출 시각을 벽에 적고, 오서율의 증인란이 빈 사본은 선석에 들이지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 서울역 공증사본 물류상. 아침 저울과 반출 시각을 벽에 적고, 오서율의 증인란이 빈 사본은 선석에 들이지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 오서율의 마른 인장만 운송하는 계약이고, 양해온의 전령 봉인과 순번을 나누며, 오해린의 결제권이 공증 운임을 삼키려 하면 경쟁한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"빈 증인란과 무게 차이를 확인하고 상자를 선석 밖에 뒀다. 운송 거부는 확인되지만 원장 독점은 야망으로 남는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:barony-K151-sea","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"barony","holderPersonId":"K151","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:sea-K151","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false},{"id":"title:duchy-28710-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K151","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-28710-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b9c8-c7a5-d765","name":"장흥 마씨","crest":"clan-crests/b9c8-c7a5-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":-10,"무력":-40,"물질":-20,"공동":20,"원칙":35,"공개":-10,"자격":10,"분산":-35,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":-10,"위험":-25,"과시":-25,"지속":30,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"공증사본 계량·반출 관리","지위":"기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)","공무원 직위·직급":"없음","생업 역할":"서울역 공증사본 물류상","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −20 | 공동 20 | 원칙 35 | 공개 −10 | 자격 10 | 분산 −35 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −25 | 지속 30 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 서울역 공증사본 물류상 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 마도한의 공증사본을 달고 반출 시각을 확인하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","업무":"직무상 품계는 일반 시민. 생업상 직함은 서울역 공증사본 물류상. 아침 저울과 반출 시각을 벽에 적고, 오서율의 증인란이 빈 사본은 인계 구역에 들이지 않는다.","일화":"오서율의 증인란이 비고 무게마저 운송 장부와 어긋나는 사본 상자가 서울역 인계 구역 앞에 선다. 마도한은 저울을 갈아 끼워 다시 달고, 반출 시각 옆에 차이를 적은 뒤 상자를 인계 구역 밖에 둔다.","관계":"오서율의 마른 인장만 운송하는 계약이고, 양해온의 전령 봉인과 순번을 나누며, 오해린의 결제권이 공증 운임을 삼키려 하면 경쟁한다.","야망":"운반한 짐의 목록을 사본으로 남겨, 짐이 사라지거나 붙잡혀 가는 일이 생겨도 이웃이 확인할 수 있게 한다.","공포":"","개입":"증인 호송을 맡아 사본 운송을 재개하거나, 장부 없는 야간 반출을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"인장이 마르기 전에 사본을 움직이는 사람을 위조로 부르고, 상자 무게가 장부와 다르면 즉시 저울을 갈아 끼운다. 흥정은 낮게 끝내고 구두 운임을 인정하지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 공증사본 계량·반출 관리\n- 지위: 기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)\n- 공무원 직위·직급: 없음\n- 생업 역할: 서울역 공증사본 물류상\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 서울역 공증사본 물류상 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 마도한의 공증사본을 달고 반출 시각을 확인하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**업무.** 직무상 품계는 일반 시민. 생업상 직함은 서울역 공증사본 물류상. 아침 저울과 반출 시각을 벽에 적고, 오서율의 증인란이 빈 사본은 인계 구역에 들이지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 오서율의 증인란이 비고 무게마저 운송 장부와 어긋나는 사본 상자가 서울역 인계 구역 앞에 선다. 마도한은 저울을 갈아 끼워 다시 달고, 반출 시각 옆에 차이를 적은 뒤 상자를 인계 구역 밖에 둔다.\n\n**관계.** 오서율의 마른 인장만 운송하는 계약이고, 양해온의 전령 봉인과 순번을 나누며, 오해린의 결제권이 공증 운임을 삼키려 하면 경쟁한다.\n\n**야망.** 운반한 짐의 목록을 사본으로 남겨, 짐이 사라지거나 붙잡혀 가는 일이 생겨도 이웃이 확인할 수 있게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 증인 호송을 맡아 사본 운송을 재개하거나, 장부 없는 야간 반출을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −20 | 공동 20 | 원칙 35 | 공개 −10 | 자격 10 | 분산 −35 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −25 | 지속 30 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"마도한","type":"계약","to":"오서율","basis":"오서율의 마른 인장만 운송하는 계약이고"},{"from":"마도한","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"양해온의 전령 봉인과 순번을 나누며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"양해온","type":"계약","to":"마도한","basis":"마도한의 사본 상자와 순번을 계약으로 나누며"},{"from":"마은결","type":"지휘","to":"마도한","basis":"마도한의 운송 순번을 경매로 집행하는 계약이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0153', 'c5f0-ace1-c0b0', '{"id":"person-0153","name":"Yeon Jiu","title":"Seoul Station Infirmary Medic","position":"Seoul Station Infirmary Medic","characterId":"K152","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Infirmary bed assignment and medicine distribution","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-yeon-jiu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0153","birthDate":"2082-02-22","birthday":"02-22","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k152-bed-allocation","name":"Bed allocation","rating":60},{"id":"k152-medicine-allocation","name":"Medicine allocation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k152-choice","name":"Flexibility for severe cases","description":"She checked breath before the wrist tag of a nameless body and tore up any note telling her to load weapons and patients onto one train. Principled, she folded procedure before severity.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125, short of herbs, she halved the prescriptions and divided them among everyone. By this deed the signature of the Seoul Station infirmary medic post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That the transfer lists would merge with military registries and the refugees would remain as troop numbers alone. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to execute Yun Jiyul''s transfer ledger at the sickbed, she owed Ryu Eunbi bundles of medicine.","effects":[]},{"id":"k152-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Seoul Station infirmary medic. She published severity-order sickbeds and took patients with service contracts attached separately from the administrative roster.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Seoul Station infirmary medic. She published severity-order sickbeds and took patients with service contracts attached separately from the administrative roster.","stress":"Fear. That the transfer lists would merge with military registries and the refugees would remain as troop numbers alone. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to execute Yun Jiyul''s transfer ledger at the sickbed, she owed Ryu Eunbi bundles of medicine.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Checks breathing first and shared scarce medicine. This protects access to care; treatment success after reduced doses is unconfirmed. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51190-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K152","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51190-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5f0-ace1-c0b0","name":"Yeon of Goksan","crest":"clan-crests/c5f0-ace1-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":25,"Openness":0,"Force":-50,"Material":-20,"Communal":0,"Principle":70,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":50,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":25,"Display":-5,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Infirmary bed assignment and medicine distribution","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Local Health Section","Assigned Duties":"Seoul Station Infirmary Medic","Values":"Authority 25 | Openness 0 | Force −50 | Materialism −20 | Communal 0 | Principle 70 | Publicity −20 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion −30 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Craving 50 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk 25 | Display −5 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: opposite-sex | Bonding: non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"She grew up in the Jegi-dong infirmary. The post of Medical Officer at the Seoul Station Infirmary opened to her through the seal on a counterfeit medicine.\n- Assigning Yeon Jiu''s infirmary beds and distributing medicine ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Local Health Section. Duties: Medical Officer of the Seoul Station Infirmary.","Anecdote":"In 2125, when medicine ran short, she halved the prescribed doses and shared them among everyone. For this, her signature for the post of Medical Officer at the Seoul Station Infirmary was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"She takes direction from Yun Jiyul to carry out the transfer ledger at the bedside and owes Ryu Eunbi a bundle of medicines.","Ambition":"To place the field treatment of the central disaster medical coordination network under Records Bureau ratification, so that ambulance trains cannot be diverted to military supply.","Fear":"That the transfer rosters merge with the military household register, leaving refugees remembered only as troop numbers.","Intervention":"She can escort a train carrying only patients, or separate a bed roster mixed with military household registers."},"biography":"Checks for breath before the tag on the wrist of a nameless corpse, and tears up the note ordering weapons and patients onto the same train. She is a person of principle, but she sets procedure aside when faced with the critically ill.\n\n- Livelihood: Infirmary bed assignment and medicine distribution\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position and Grade: Local Health Section\n- Assigned Duties: Seoul Station Infirmary Medic\n**Life.** She grew up in the Jegi-dong infirmary. The post of Medical Officer at the Seoul Station Infirmary opened to her through the seal on a counterfeit medicine.\n- Assigning Yeon Jiu''s infirmary beds and distributing medicine ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Servant Position and Grade.** Local Health Section. Duties: Medical Officer of the Seoul Station Infirmary.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, when medicine ran short, she halved the prescribed doses and shared them among everyone. For this, her signature for the post of Medical Officer at the Seoul Station Infirmary was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** She takes direction from Yun Jiyul to carry out the transfer ledger at the bedside and owes Ryu Eunbi a bundle of medicines.\n\n**Ambition.** To place the field treatment of the central disaster medical coordination network under Records Bureau ratification, so that ambulance trains cannot be diverted to military supply.\n\n**Fear.** That the transfer rosters merge with the military household register, leaving refugees remembered only as troop numbers.\n\n**Intervention.** She can escort a train carrying only patients, or separate a bed roster mixed with military household registers.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 25 | Openness 0 | Force −50 | Materialism −20 | Communal 0 | Principle 70 | Publicity −20 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion −30 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Craving 50 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk 25 | Display −5 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: opposite-sex | Bonding: non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yeon Jiu","type":"Command","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"Takes direction to carry out Yun Jiyul''s transfer ledger at the bedside, and"},{"from":"Yeon Jiu","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"owes Ryu Eunbi a bundle of medicines"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gwon Harin","type":"Contract","to":"Yeon Jiu","basis":"Gwon Harin hands over the wounded she carried from the cleared transfer passage to Yeon Jiu. Yeon Jiu checks their breathing and severity, assigns beds, and does not push slow-moving patients aside through administrative records alone."},{"from":"Seol Dahin","type":"Contract","to":"Yeon Jiu","basis":"an ally who announces the lockdown of Yeon Jiu''s infirmary by broadcast, and"},{"from":"Yeon Taesol","type":"Contract","to":"Yeon Jiu","basis":"covers Yeon Jiu''s shortage of beds with train dispatches"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0153","name":"연지우","title":"서울역 의무실 의무원","position":"서울역 의무실 의무원","characterId":"K152","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"의무실 침상 배정·약재 배분","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-연지우","detailRoute":"/people/person-0153","birthDate":"2082-02-22","birthday":"02-22","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k152-bed-allocation","name":"침상 배정","rating":60},{"id":"k152-medicine-allocation","name":"약재 배분","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k152-choice","name":"중증 앞의 유연함","description":"이름 없는 시신의 손목 표보다 호흡을 먼저 확인하고, 무기와 환자를 한 열차에 태우라는 쪽지를 찢는다. 원칙적이지만 중증 앞에서는 절차를 접는다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 서울역 의무실 의무원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤지율의 이송 장부를 침상에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 류은비에게 약품 묶음을 빚진다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k152-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 서울역 의무실 의무원. 중증도 순 침상을 공개하고, 복무계약서가 붙은 환자는 행정 명부와 분리해 받는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 서울역 의무실 의무원. 중증도 순 침상을 공개하고, 복무계약서가 붙은 환자는 행정 명부와 분리해 받는다.","stress":"공포. 이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤지율의 이송 장부를 침상에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 류은비에게 약품 묶음을 빚진다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"호흡을 먼저 확인하고 부족한 약재를 나눴다. 치료 접근을 지키는 선택이며 처방량 감소의 치료 성공은 미확인이다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51190-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K152","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51190-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5f0-ace1-c0b0","name":"곡산 연씨","crest":"clan-crests/c5f0-ace1-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":25,"개방":0,"무력":-50,"물질":-20,"공동":0,"원칙":70,"공개":-20,"자격":10,"분산":-30,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":50,"독점":5,"위험":25,"과시":-5,"지속":10,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"의무실 침상 배정·약재 배분","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방보건계","담당 업무":"서울역 의무실 의무원","가치관":"권위 25 | 개방 0 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 70 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 50 | 독점 5 | 위험 25 | 과시 −5 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 서울역 의무실 의무원 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 연지우의 의무실 침상을 배정하고 약재를 나누는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방보건계. 담당 업무: 서울역 의무실 의무원.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 서울역 의무실 의무원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"윤지율의 이송 장부를 침상에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 류은비에게 약품 묶음을 빚진다.","야망":"중앙 재난의료 조정망의 현장 진료를 기록청 인준 아래 두어 구급 열차가 군수로 돌지 못하게 한다.","공포":"이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것.","개입":"환자만 태운 열차를 호송하거나, 군사호적이 섞인 침상 명단을 분리해 줄 수 있다."},"biography":"이름 없는 시신의 손목 표보다 호흡을 먼저 확인하고, 무기와 환자를 한 열차에 태우라는 쪽지를 찢는다. 원칙적이지만 중증 앞에서는 절차를 접는다.\n\n- 생업: 의무실 침상 배정·약재 배분\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방보건계\n- 담당 업무: 서울역 의무실 의무원\n**생애.** 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 서울역 의무실 의무원 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 연지우의 의무실 침상을 배정하고 약재를 나누는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방보건계. 담당 업무: 서울역 의무실 의무원.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 서울역 의무실 의무원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 윤지율의 이송 장부를 침상에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 류은비에게 약품 묶음을 빚진다.\n\n**야망.** 중앙 재난의료 조정망의 현장 진료를 기록청 인준 아래 두어 구급 열차가 군수로 돌지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것.\n\n**개입.** 환자만 태운 열차를 호송하거나, 군사호적이 섞인 침상 명단을 분리해 줄 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 25 | 개방 0 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 70 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 50 | 독점 5 | 위험 25 | 과시 −5 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"연지우","type":"지휘","to":"윤지율","basis":"윤지율의 이송 장부를 침상에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"연지우","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비에게 약품 묶음을 빚지며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"권하린","type":"계약","to":"연지우","basis":"권하린은 제설한 환승 통로에서 옮긴 부상자를 연지우에게 인계한다. 연지우는 호흡과 중증도를 확인해 침상을 배정하고 이동이 늦은 환자를 행정 기록만으로 밀어내지 않는다."},{"from":"설다흰","type":"계약","to":"연지우","basis":"연지우의 의무실 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고"},{"from":"연태솔","type":"계약","to":"연지우","basis":"연지우의 침상 부족을 배차로 메운다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0154', 'b098-b098-c8fc-7f85', '{"id":"person-0154","name":"Na Seonjae","title":"Archive Defense Patrol Squad Leader","position":"Archive Defense Patrol Squad Leader","characterId":"K153","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Archive key verification and defensive patrols","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#Character-Na-Seonjae","detailRoute":"/people/person-0154","birthDate":"2098-04-09","birthday":"04-09","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"k153-archive-patrol","name":"Archive patrol","rating":60},{"id":"k153-document-preservation","name":"Document preservation","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k153-choice","name":"Key rules also bind guards","description":"He gauges footsteps before the cold of the storeroom and sees night entries missing from the entry ledger as intent rather than accident. When a neighbor''s fuel share falls behind, he takes the night turn himself.","behavior":"Anecdote. On a midwinter platform he carefully dried frozen record papers and left a hand copy. After that his neighbors put his name on the night rotation list.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Executed Jo Harin''s removal schedule by patrol, split the archive-depot seals and rotations with Ji Hansol, and guarded Yun Seorin''s protocol routes.","effects":[]},{"id":"k153-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: archive defense patrol squad leader. He wrote the patrol hours on the wall, but even the inside patrol stopped unless the two librarians'' keys turned together.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: archive defense patrol squad leader. He wrote the patrol hours on the wall, but even the inside patrol stopped unless the two librarians'' keys turned together.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Executed Jo Harin''s removal schedule by patrol, split the archive-depot seals and rotations with Ji Hansol, and guarded Yun Seorin''s protocol routes.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Stops even internal patrol without both keys and preserved wet documents. Patrol responsibility is not evidence of war command or exceptional combat. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41150-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K153","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41150-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b098-b098-c8fc-7f85","name":"Naju Na Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b098-b098-c8fc-7f85.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-25,"Force":0,"Material":-35,"Communal":15,"Principle":40,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":20,"Display":-20,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Archive key verification and defensive patrols","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"A grade among Local Protection Clerk Assistant (Grade 9), Local Protection Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Protection Senior Clerk Assistant (Grade 7), matching a post at a Seoul Special City office","Assigned Duties":"Archive Defense Patrol Squad Leader","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness −25 | Force 0 | Materialism −35 | Communal 15 | Principle 40 | Publicity −15 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion −40 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 0 | Possessiveness 0 | Risk 20 | Display −20 | Persistence 30 | Orientation: bisexual | Bonding: contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"He grew up in the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Squad Leader of the Archive Guard Patrol opened to him through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Checking and patrolling Na Seonjae''s archive keys ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A grade among Local Protection Clerk Assistant (Grade 9), Local Protection Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Protection Senior Clerk Assistant (Grade 7), matching a post at a Seoul Special City office. Duties: Squad Leader of the Archive Guard Patrol.","Anecdote":"On a platform in midwinter, he carefully dried frozen record documents and preserved them as transcribed copies. After that, neighbors put his name on the night-turn roster.","Relationships":"He carries out Jo Harin''s removal timetable through patrols, shares shifts with the seal of Ji Hansol''s archive base, and protects Yun Seorin''s ceremonial route.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"He can trace the origin of the night entries and lift the lockdown, or hand over the cipher tablet leak and have the squad leader replaced."},"biography":"He gauges footsteps before the cold of the storeroom and sees night entries missing from the entry ledger as intent rather than accident. When a neighbor''s fuel share falls behind, he takes the night turn himself.\n\n- Livelihood: Archive key verification and defensive patrols\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position and grade: a grade among Local Protection Clerk Assistant (Grade 9), Local Protection Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Protection Senior Clerk Assistant (Grade 7), matching a post at a Seoul Special City office\n- Duties: Squad Leader of the Archive Guard Patrol\n**Life.** He grew up in the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Squad Leader of the Archive Guard Patrol opened to him through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Checking and patrolling Na Seonjae''s archive keys ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Servant Position and Grade.** A grade among Local Protection Clerk Assistant (Grade 9), Local Protection Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Protection Senior Clerk Assistant (Grade 7), matching a post at a Seoul Special City office. Duties: Squad Leader of the Archive Guard Patrol.\n\n**Anecdote.** On a platform in midwinter, he carefully dried frozen record documents and preserved them as transcribed copies. After that, neighbors put his name on the night-turn roster.\n\n**Relations.** He carries out Jo Harin''s removal timetable through patrols, shares shifts with the seal of Ji Hansol''s archive base, and protects Yun Seorin''s ceremonial route.\n\n**Intervention.** He can trace the origin of the night entries and lift the lockdown, or hand over the cipher tablet leak and have the squad leader replaced.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness −25 | Force 0 | Materialism −35 | Communal 15 | Principle 40 | Publicity −15 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion −40 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Possessiveness 0 | Risk 20 | Display −20 | Persistence 30 | Orientation: bisexual | Bonding: contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Na Seonjae","type":"Command","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"enforces Jo Harin''s removal-time schedule through patrols, and"},{"from":"Na Seonjae","type":"Command","to":"Ji Hansol","basis":"shares shifts with the seal of Ji Hansol''s archive base"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0154","name":"나선재","title":"문서고 수비 순찰대 조장","position":"문서고 수비 순찰대 조장","characterId":"K153","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"문서고 열쇠 확인·수비 순찰","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-나선재","detailRoute":"/people/person-0154","birthDate":"2098-04-09","birthday":"04-09","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"k153-archive-patrol","name":"서고 순찰","rating":60},{"id":"k153-document-preservation","name":"문서 보전","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k153-choice","name":"수비에도 열쇠 규칙","description":"보관창고 냉기보다 발소리를 먼저 가늠하고, 출입 장부에 없는 야간 출입을 사고보다 고의로 본다. 이웃의 연료 나눔이 밀리면 자신이 야간 순번을 선다.","behavior":"일화. 한겨울 승강장에서 얼어붙은 기록 문서를 조심스레 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이후 이웃들이 야간 순번 명단에 그의 이름을 올렸다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 조하린의 반출 시각표를 순찰로 집행하고, 지한솔의 서고기지 봉인과 교대를 나누며, 윤서린의 의전 경로를 지킨다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k153-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장. 순찰 시각을 벽에 쓰되, 두 사서의 열쇠가 동시에 열리지 않으면 내부 순찰도 멈춘다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장. 순찰 시각을 벽에 쓰되, 두 사서의 열쇠가 동시에 열리지 않으면 내부 순찰도 멈춘다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 조하린의 반출 시각표를 순찰로 집행하고, 지한솔의 서고기지 봉인과 교대를 나누며, 윤서린의 의전 경로를 지킨다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"열쇠 둘이 없으면 내부 순찰도 멈추고 젖은 문서를 보전했다. 순찰 책임은 전쟁 지휘나 뛰어난 개인 전투의 근거가 아니다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41150-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K153","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41150-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b098-b098-c8fc-7f85","name":"나주 나씨","crest":"clan-crests/b098-b098-c8fc-7f85.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":-25,"무력":0,"물질":-35,"공동":15,"원칙":40,"공개":-15,"자격":10,"분산":-40,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":0,"위험":20,"과시":-20,"지속":30,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"문서고 열쇠 확인·수비 순찰","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방방호서기보(9급)·지방방호서기(8급)·지방방호주사보(7급) 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"문서고 수비 순찰대 조장","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 −25 | 무력 0 | 물질 −35 | 공동 15 | 원칙 40 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 0 | 위험 20 | 과시 −20 | 지속 30 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 나선재의 문서고 열쇠를 확인하고 순찰하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방방호서기보(9급)·지방방호서기(8급)·지방방호주사보(7급) 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장.","일화":"한겨울 승강장에서 얼어붙은 기록 문서를 조심스레 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이후 이웃들이 야간 순번 명단에 그의 이름을 올렸다.","관계":"조하린의 반출 시각표를 순찰로 집행하고, 지한솔의 서고기지 봉인과 교대를 나누며, 윤서린의 의전 경로를 지킨다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"야간 출입의 진원을 밝혀 봉쇄를 풀거나, 암호패 유출을 넘겨 조장을 교체하게 할 수 있다."},"biography":"보관창고 냉기보다 발소리를 먼저 가늠하고, 출입 장부에 없는 야간 출입을 사고보다 고의로 본다. 이웃의 연료 나눔이 밀리면 자신이 야간 순번을 선다.\n\n- 생업: 문서고 열쇠 확인·수비 순찰\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방방호서기보(9급)·지방방호서기(8급)·지방방호주사보(7급) 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 나선재의 문서고 열쇠를 확인하고 순찰하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방방호서기보(9급)·지방방호서기(8급)·지방방호주사보(7급) 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장.\n\n**일화.** 한겨울 승강장에서 얼어붙은 기록 문서를 조심스레 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이후 이웃들이 야간 순번 명단에 그의 이름을 올렸다.\n\n**관계.** 조하린의 반출 시각표를 순찰로 집행하고, 지한솔의 서고기지 봉인과 교대를 나누며, 윤서린의 의전 경로를 지킨다.\n\n**개입.** 야간 출입의 진원을 밝혀 봉쇄를 풀거나, 암호패 유출을 넘겨 조장을 교체하게 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 −25 | 무력 0 | 물질 −35 | 공동 15 | 원칙 40 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 0 | 위험 20 | 과시 −20 | 지속 30 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"나선재","type":"지휘","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 반출 시각표를 순찰로 집행하고"},{"from":"나선재","type":"지휘","to":"지한솔","basis":"지한솔의 서고기지 봉인과 교대를 나누며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0155', 'c591-b0a8-c6d0-694a', '{"id":"person-0155","name":"Yang Haeon","title":"Ratification Review Herald","position":"Ratification Review Herald","characterId":"K154","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Delivery of ratification hold messages and custody confirmations","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#Character-Yang-Haeon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0155","birthDate":"2091-09-25","birthday":"09-25","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k154-sealed-delivery","name":"Sealed dispatch delivery","rating":65},{"id":"k154-delivery-order","name":"Dispatch sequencing","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k154-choice","name":"Departs after confirmation","description":"She refused departure whenever a seal cord sat loose and read any envoy who did not record verbal dispatches as a potential forger. Short of breath or not, she held two copies in one hand.","behavior":"Anecdote. Gang Yejun''s suspension of review and Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatch message end up in the courier bag on the same day.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Under command to carry Gang Yejun''s examination-suspension declaration only under seal, split boxes and order with Ma Dohan by contract, and weighed ratification timing against Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatches.","effects":[]},{"id":"k154-boundary","name":"Ratification Review Herald","description":"Title: Ratification Review Herald.","behavior":"Title: Ratification Review Herald.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Under command to carry Gang Yejun''s examination-suspension declaration only under seal, split boxes and order with Ma Dohan by contract, and weighed ratification timing against Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatches.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Obtains custody confirmation before a suspension notice and orders messages around approval timing. Delivery judgment is not independent diplomatic authority. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51210-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K154","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51210-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c591-b0a8-c6d0-694a","name":"Namwon Yang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c591-b0a8-c6d0-694a.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":10,"Force":-35,"Material":-30,"Communal":20,"Principle":60,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":-35,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":25,"Display":10,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Delivery of ratification hold messages and custody confirmations","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Ratification Review Herald","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness 10 | Force −35 | Materialism −30 | Communal 20 | Principle 60 | Publicity −10 | Credentials 0 | Decentralization −35 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 25 | Display 10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation: No Orientation | Bonding: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Raised at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The Approval Review Courier post opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Delivering Yang Haeon''s approval-hold messages and custody confirmations connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A grade suited to a post at the Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field offices, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9). Duties: Approval Review Courier.","Anecdote":"Gang Yejun''s review-suspension declaration and Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatch message end up in the courier bag on the same day. Yang Haeon first obtains Jo Harin''s custody confirmation and attaches the approval hold, then decides which of the two messages goes into the archive first by weighing the timing of approval.","Relationships":"A command role that carries Gang Yejun''s review-suspension declaration only in sealed condition, divides Ma Dohan''s copy boxes and turn order by contract, and weighs the timing of approval against Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatch message.","Ambition":"She gathers neighbors'' word of well-being and escort news into the delivery ledger she keeps, so that no news of a family member who was taken or cut off is buried.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can hunt down a forged message and protect the seal, or expose the hold documents in the bag to force approval through."},"biography":"If the seal cord is slack, she refuses to depart, and she suspects that a messenger who does not record oral messages may be a forgery. Even when out of breath, she holds two copies in one hand.\n\n- Livelihood: Delivery of ratification hold messages and custody confirmations\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service organization\n- Position and grade: A grade suited to a post at the Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field offices, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)\n- Duties: Approval Review Courier\n**Life.** Raised at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The Approval Review Courier post opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Delivering Yang Haeon''s approval-hold messages and custody confirmations connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position and Grade.** A grade suited to a post at the Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field offices, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9). Duties: Approval Review Courier.\n\n**Anecdote.** Gang Yejun''s review-suspension declaration and Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatch message end up in the courier bag on the same day. Yang Haeon first obtains Jo Harin''s custody confirmation and attaches the approval hold, then decides which of the two messages goes into the archive first by weighing the timing of approval.\n\n**Relations.** A command role that carries Gang Yejun''s review-suspension declaration only in sealed condition, divides Ma Dohan''s copy boxes and turn order by contract, and weighs the timing of approval against Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatch message.\n\n**Ambition.** She gathers neighbors'' word of well-being and escort news into the delivery ledger she keeps, so that no news of a family member who was taken or cut off is buried.\n\n**Intervention.** Can hunt down a forged message and protect the seal, or expose the hold documents in the bag to force approval through.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness 10 | Force −35 | Materialism −30 | Communal 20 | Principle 60 | Publicity −10 | Credentials 0 | Decentralization −35 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 25 | Display 10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation: No Orientation | Bonding: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yang Haeon","type":"Command","to":"Gang Ye-jun","basis":"Is the commander who carries Gang Yejun''s declaration of review suspension only in sealed condition, and"},{"from":"Yang Haeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ma Dohan","basis":"sharing turn order with Ma Dohan''s copy boxes by contract"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Im Bit-na","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"Im Bitna hands over the continuous record of approval receipt times and hold status to Yang Haeon. Yang Haeon checks the reviewer''s seal and the archive custody confirmation, and delivers a message with no omitted hold on the next shift."},{"from":"Ryu Dalhyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"Ryu Dalhyeon hands over to Yang Haeon the seal times and approval-hold order that she confirmed at each shift. Yang Haeon checks the review seal and the custody confirmation so that the hold status does not vanish from the next message."},{"from":"Mun Maeun","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"Mun Maeun hands over to Yang Haeon the copies under approval hold and the continuous record of the sections where validity has stopped. Yang Haeon checks the review seal and custody confirmation and links up messages with no omitted hold."},{"from":"Ma Dohan","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"sharing turn order with Yang Haeon''s courier seals"},{"from":"Sofia Rossi","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"Syncs timing with Yang Haeon''s approval messages"},{"from":"Seop Do-yun","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"Splits turn order with Yang Haeon''s approval messages"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0155","name":"양해온","title":"인준 심사 전령","position":"인준 심사 전령","characterId":"K154","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"인준 보류 전갈·보관 확인 전달","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-양해온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0155","birthDate":"2091-09-25","birthday":"09-25","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k154-sealed-delivery","name":"봉인 전갈 전달","rating":65},{"id":"k154-delivery-order","name":"전갈 순서 판단","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k154-choice","name":"확인을 받은 뒤 출발","description":"봉인 끈이 느슨하면 출발을 거부하고, 구두 전갈을 기록하지 않는 사신을 위조일 수 있다고 본다. 숨이 차도 사본 두 장을 한 손에 쥔다.","behavior":"일화. 강예준의 심사 정지 선언과 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈이 같은 날 전령 가방에 함께 든다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 강예준의 심사 정지 선언을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고, 마도한의 사본 상자와 순번을 계약으로 나누며, 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈과 인준 시점을 저울질한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k154-boundary","name":"인준 심사 전령","description":"직함은 인준 심사 전령.","behavior":"직함은 인준 심사 전령.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 강예준의 심사 정지 선언을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고, 마도한의 사본 상자와 순번을 계약으로 나누며, 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈과 인준 시점을 저울질한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"보관 확인을 먼저 받아 보류 통지를 달고 인준 시점을 따져 전갈 순서를 정한다. 전달 판단을 독립 외교권으로 바꾸지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51210-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K154","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51210-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c591-b0a8-c6d0-694a","name":"남원 양씨","crest":"clan-crests/c591-b0a8-c6d0-694a.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":10,"무력":-35,"물질":-30,"공동":20,"원칙":60,"공개":-10,"자격":0,"분산":-35,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-10,"위험":25,"과시":10,"지속":30,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"인준 보류 전갈·보관 확인 전달","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"인준 심사 전령","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −30 | 공동 20 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −10 | 자격 0 | 분산 −35 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −10 | 위험 25 | 과시 10 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 인준 심사 전령 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n-","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 인준 심사 전령.","일화":"강예준의 심사 정지 선언과 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈이 같은 날 전령 가방에 함께 든다.","관계":"강예준의 심사 정지 선언을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고, 마도한의 사본 상자와 순번을 계약으로 나누며, 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈과 인준 시점을 저울질한다.","야망":"이웃의 안부와 호송 소식을 자신이 맡은 전달 장부에 모아, 붙잡혀 가거나 길이 끊긴 가족의 소식이 누구에게도 묻히지 않게 한다.","공포":"","개입":"위조 전갈을 찾아 봉인을 지키거나, 가방 속 보류 문서를 폭로해 인준을 강제할 수 있다."},"biography":"봉인 끈이 느슨하면 출발을 거부하고, 구두 전갈을 기록하지 않는 사신을 위조일 수 있다고 본다. 숨이 차도 사본 두 장을 한 손에 쥔다.\n\n- 생업: 인준 보류 전갈·보관 확인 전달\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 인준 심사 전령\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 인준 심사 전령 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 인준 심사 전령.\n\n**일화.** 강예준의 심사 정지 선언과 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈이 같은 날 전령 가방에 함께 든다.\n\n**관계.** 강예준의 심사 정지 선언을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고, 마도한의 사본 상자와 순번을 계약으로 나누며, 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈과 인준 시점을 저울질한다.\n\n**야망.** 이웃의 안부와 호송 소식을 자신이 맡은 전달 장부에 모아, 붙잡혀 가거나 길이 끊긴 가족의 소식이 누구에게도 묻히지 않게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 위조 전갈을 찾아 봉인을 지키거나, 가방 속 보류 문서를 폭로해 인준을 강제할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −30 | 공동 20 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −10 | 자격 0 | 분산 −35 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −10 | 위험 25 | 과시 10 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"양해온","type":"지휘","to":"강예준","basis":"강예준의 심사 정지 선언을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고"},{"from":"양해온","type":"계약","to":"마도한","basis":"마도한의 사본 상자와 순번을 계약으로 나누며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"임빛나","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"임빛나는 인준 접수 시각과 보류 상태의 연속 기록을 양해온에게 넘긴다. 양해온은 심사관 날인과 문서고 보관 확인을 살펴 다음 교대에 보류가 누락되지 않은 전갈을 전한다."},{"from":"류달현","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"양해온은 심사 날인과 보관 확인을 살펴 보류 상태가 다음 전갈에서 사라지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"문마은","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"양해온은 심사 날인·보관 확인을 살펴 보류가 누락되지 않은 전갈을 잇는다."},{"from":"마도한","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"양해온의 전령 봉인과 순번을 나누며"},{"from":"소피아 로시","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"양해온의 인준 전갈과 시점을 맞춘다"},{"from":"섭도윤","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"양해온의 인준 전갈과 순번을 나누며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0156', 'c8fc-c2e0-c548', '{"id":"person-0156","name":"Ju Rian","title":"Underground Passage Surveyor","position":"Underground Passage Surveyor","characterId":"K155","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Passage warmth measuring and detour opening","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#Inmul-Jurian","detailRoute":"/people/person-0156","birthDate":"2078-07-29","birthday":"07-29","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k155-water-sampling","name":"Passage warmth measuring","rating":60},{"id":"k155-bypass-opening","name":"Detour passage opening","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k155-choice","name":"Responsibility for solid lines","description":"He read time from the temperature of cooled passages and saw anyone who drew a once-confirmed route as a solid line as close to a murderer. He counted a late survey a fault.","behavior":"Title: Underground Passage Surveyor.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice handing field coordinates to Seo Raon''s master plate, he matched map-renewal times with Choi Jiwoo and split bridge underside surveys and bypass dotted lines with Ma Gilsang by contract.","effects":[]},{"id":"k155-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Role. No rank (ordinary citizen). Title: underground passage surveyor. He drew warmth readings overlaid with vent wind records and left sections confirmed only once as dotted lines.","behavior":"Role. No rank (ordinary citizen). Title: underground passage surveyor. He drew warmth readings overlaid with vent wind records and left sections confirmed only once as dotted lines.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice handing field coordinates to Seo Raon''s master plate, he matched map-renewal times with Choi Jiwoo and split bridge underside surveys and bypass dotted lines with Ma Gilsang by contract.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Underground Passage Surveyor.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51230-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K155","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51230-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c8fc-c2e0-c548","name":"Sinan Ju Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c8fc-c2e0-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":0,"Force":-25,"Material":-30,"Communal":0,"Principle":45,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-30},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":0,"Display":-25,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Passage warmth measuring and detour opening","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Not applicable. An ordinary citizen with no government post or rank.","Assigned Duties":"Underground Passage Surveyor","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness 0 | Force −25 | Materialism −30 | Communality 0 | Principle 45 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −30","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness 15 | Risk 0 | Display −25 | Persistence 25 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Multi-partner"},"sections":{"Life":"Raised in the underground dwellings near Yongsan Station. His work as underground passage surveyor began on a midwinter night when a passage froze and he opened a detour without using heat.\n- Ju Ri-an''s passage warmth measurements and detour passage survey records are handed over to the Yongsan Station waiting-hall board.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Not applicable. An ordinary citizen with no government post or rank. Duties: underground passage surveyor.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Is the transcriber who hands field coordinates to Seo Ra-on''s master plate, syncs map update times with Choe Ji-u, and divides Ma Gil-sang''s under-bridge survey and bypass dotted lines by contract.","Ambition":"Gathers the blocked passages and the living ones through field surveys and leaves them as a single public map.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can track down the print shop that makes forged solid lines."},"biography":"Reads time from the temperature of cooled passages, and regards anyone who draws a once-confirmed route as a solid line as close to a murderer. Sees late surveying as a sin.\n\n- Livelihood: Passage warmth measuring and detour opening\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service organization\n- Position and rank: Not applicable. An ordinary citizen with no government post or rank\n- Duties: Underground Passage Surveyor\n**Life.** Raised in the underground dwellings near Yongsan Station. His work as underground passage surveyor began on a midwinter night when a passage froze and he opened a detour without using heat.\n- Ju Ri-an''s passage warmth measurements and detour passage survey records are handed over to the Yongsan Station waiting-hall board.\n\n**Civil Service Position and Rank.** Not applicable. An ordinary citizen with no government post or rank. Duties: underground passage surveyor.\n\n**Relationships.** Is the transcriber who hands field coordinates to Seo Ra-on''s master plate, syncs map update times with Choe Ji-u, and divides Ma Gil-sang''s under-bridge survey and bypass dotted lines by contract.\n\n**Ambition.** Gathers the blocked passages and the living ones through field surveys and leaves them as a single public map.\n\n**Intervention.** Can track down the print shop that makes forged solid lines.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness 0 | Force −25 | Materialism −30 | Communality 0 | Principle 45 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −30\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Possessiveness 15 | Risk 0 | Display −25 | Persistence 25 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ju Rian","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Seo Ra-on","basis":"An aide who hands field coordinates to Seo Raon''s plate, and"},{"from":"Ju Rian","type":"Contract","to":"Ma Gilsang","basis":"Divides Ma Gilsang''s bridge underside surveys and detour dotted lines by contract"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Patrick O''Connor","type":"Contract","to":"Ju Rian","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0156","name":"주리안","title":"지하 통로 탐사원","position":"지하 통로 탐사원","characterId":"K155","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"통로 온기 측정·우회로 개통","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-주리안","detailRoute":"/people/person-0156","birthDate":"2078-07-29","birthday":"07-29","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k155-water-sampling","name":"통로 온기 측정","rating":60},{"id":"k155-bypass-opening","name":"우회 통로 개통","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k155-choice","name":"실선의 책임","description":"식은 통로의 온도로 시간을 읽고, 확인이 한 번뿐인 길을 실선으로 그리는 사람을 살인에 가깝다고 여긴다. 늦은 측량을 죄로 본다.","behavior":"직함은 지하 통로 탐사원.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 서라온의 원판에 현장 좌표를 넘기는 필사자이고, 최지우과 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추며, 마길상의 교량 하부 측량과 우회 점선을 계약으로 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k155-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"역할. 직급 없음(일반 시민). 직함은 지하 통로 탐사원. 통로 온기 측정값과 환기구 바람 기록을 겹쳐 그리고, 확인이 한 번뿐인 구간은 점선으로만 남긴다.","behavior":"역할. 직급 없음(일반 시민). 직함은 지하 통로 탐사원. 통로 온기 측정값과 환기구 바람 기록을 겹쳐 그리고, 확인이 한 번뿐인 구간은 점선으로만 남긴다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 서라온의 원판에 현장 좌표를 넘기는 필사자이고, 최지우과 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추며, 마길상의 교량 하부 측량과 우회 점선을 계약으로 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 지하 통로 탐사원.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51230-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K155","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51230-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c8fc-c2e0-c548","name":"신안 주씨","crest":"clan-crests/c8fc-c2e0-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":0,"무력":-25,"물질":-30,"공동":0,"원칙":45,"공개":-15,"자격":20,"분산":-40,"변혁":-30},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":15,"위험":0,"과시":-25,"지속":25,"지향":"양성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"통로 온기 측정·우회로 개통","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"해당 없음. 일반 시민이며 정부 직위·직급이 없다.","담당 업무":"지하 통로 탐사원","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 0 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −30 | 공동 0 | 원칙 45 | 공개 −15 | 자격 20 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −30","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 15 | 위험 0 | 과시 −25 | 지속 25 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"용산역 부근 지하 거주 구역에서 자랐다. 지하 통로 탐사원 일은 한겨울 통로가 얼어붙은 밤, 열을 쓰지 않고 우회로를 연 일을 계기로 시작됐다.\n- 주리안의 통로 온기 측정과 우회 통로 측량 기록은 용산역 대합실 게시판에 인계한다.","공무원 직위·직급":"해당 없음. 일반 시민이며 정부 직위·직급이 없다. 담당 업무: 지하 통로 탐사원.","일화":"","관계":"서라온의 원판에 현장 좌표를 넘기는 필사자이고, 최지우와 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추며, 마길상의 교량 하부 측량과 우회 점선을 계약으로 나눈다.","야망":"막힌 통로와 살아 있는 통로를 현장 측량으로 모아 한 장의 공개 지도로 남긴다.","공포":"","개입":"위조 실선 인쇄소를 찾아낼 수 있다."},"biography":"식은 통로의 온도로 시간을 읽고, 확인이 한 번뿐인 길을 실선으로 그리는 사람을 살인에 가깝다고 여긴다. 늦은 측량을 죄로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 통로 온기 측정·우회로 개통\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 해당 없음. 일반 시민이며 정부 직위·직급이 없다.\n- 담당 업무: 지하 통로 탐사원\n**생애.** 용산역 부근 지하 거주 구역에서 자랐다. 지하 통로 탐사원 일은 한겨울 통로가 얼어붙은 밤, 열을 쓰지 않고 우회로를 연 일을 계기로 시작됐다.\n- 주리안의 통로 온기 측정과 우회 통로 측량 기록은 용산역 대합실 게시판에 인계한다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 해당 없음. 담당 업무: 지하 통로 탐사원.\n\n**관계.** 서라온의 원판에 현장 좌표를 넘기는 필사자이고, 최지우와 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추며, 마길상의 교량 하부 측량과 우회 점선을 계약으로 나눈다.\n\n**야망.** 막힌 통로와 살아 있는 통로를 현장 측량으로 모아 한 장의 공개 지도로 남긴다.\n\n**개입.** 위조 실선 인쇄소를 찾아낼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 0 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −30 | 공동 0 | 원칙 45 | 공개 −15 | 자격 20 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −30\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 15 | 위험 0 | 과시 −25 | 지속 25 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"주리안","type":"스승과 제자","to":"서라온","basis":"서라온의 원판에 현장 좌표를 넘기는 실무원이고"},{"from":"주리안","type":"계약","to":"마길상","basis":"마길상의 교량 하부 측량과 우회 점선을 계약으로 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"패트릭 오코너","type":"계약","to":"주리안","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0157', 'cc28-c5f0-c548', '{"id":"person-0157","name":"Cha Se-on","title":"Will Handwriting Recorder","position":"Will Handwriting Recorder","characterId":"K156","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Will handwriting and testimony comparison records","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#character-cha-se-on","detailRoute":"/people/person-0157","birthDate":"2101-04-05","birthday":"04-05","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k156-handwriting-record","name":"Handwriting record comparison","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k156-choice","name":"Keeps interpretation in margins","description":"She gauged handwriting from the slant of letters and read any ratification lacking two witnesses as a blank. She published the numbers but left the readings in the margin.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125, caught with a forged stamp, she burned the copies and kept the original column. By this deed the signature of the testament handwriting registrar post rose into the ledger.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k156-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Will Handwriting Recorder. She spread the public original and the private testimony on one desk and struck pages stuck together from the comparison.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Will Handwriting Recorder. She spread the public original and the private testimony on one desk and struck pages stuck together from the comparison.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Excludes damaged carbon sheets and compares wills with log handwriting. Destroyed forged copies support preservation, not identification of the forger. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51720-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K156","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51720-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc28-c5f0-c548","name":"Yeonan Cha Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cc28-c5f0-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":0,"Force":-20,"Material":-30,"Communal":15,"Principle":65,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":20,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":5,"Display":-10,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Will handwriting and testimony comparison records","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Will Handwriting Recorder","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness 0 | Force −20 | Materialism −30 | Communality 15 | Principle 65 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Craving 20 | Possessiveness −40 | Risk 5 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Multi-partner"},"sections":{"Life":"Raised at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Testamentary Handwriting Archivist opened through the deletion of a single line from a double ledger.\n- Collating and recording Cha Se-on''s testamentary handwriting and testimony connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Rank Ordinary Citizen. Duties: Testamentary Handwriting Archivist.","Anecdote":"In 2125, the forged seal was exposed; the copies were burned and the original column was protected. Because of this, the signature for the post of Testamentary Handwriting Archivist entered the ledger.","Relationships":"","Ambition":"She has neighbors'' wills and family records kept only in originals whose handwriting she has personally verified, so that forged records do not circulate among Seoul Station neighbors.","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Gauges handwriting by the slant of the letters, and treats a ratification lacking two witnesses as a blank. Numbers are made public, but interpretation is left in the margin.\n\n- Livelihood: Will handwriting and testimony comparison records\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service organization\n- Position and rank: Rank Ordinary Citizen\n- Duties: Testamentary Handwriting Archivist\n**Life.** Raised at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Testamentary Handwriting Archivist opened through the deletion of a single line from a double ledger.\n- Collating and recording Cha Se-on''s testamentary handwriting and testimony connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position and Rank.** Rank Ordinary Citizen. Duties: Testamentary Handwriting Archivist.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, the forged seal was exposed; the copies were burned and the original column was protected. Because of this, the signature for the post of Testamentary Handwriting Archivist entered the ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** She has neighbors'' wills and family records kept only in originals whose handwriting she has personally verified, so that forged records do not circulate among Seoul Station neighbors.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness 0 | Force −20 | Materialism −30 | Communality 15 | Principle 65 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Craving 20 | Possessiveness −40 | Risk 5 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Cha Se-on","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Gang Ye-jun","basis":"Is the aide who transfers Gang Yejun''s handwriting comparison into the ledger, and"},{"from":"Cha Se-on","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Jo Yejun","type":"Contract","to":"Cha Se-on","basis":"Jo Ye-jun brings testimony that diverged during the public confrontation to Cha Se-on to compare against the handwriting and testimony collation records. When Jo Ye-jun leaves a witness''s words, Cha Se-on lays the original and the testimony side by side and distinguishes where the words changed from where the documents conflict."},{"from":"Gwon Geumyun","type":"Contract","to":"Cha Se-on","basis":"Gwon Geum-yun takes the register of persons, saved from the fire and kept safe, to Cha Se-on. Cha Se-on examines the testimony about the register and the handwriting of the original, leaving a basis for distinguishing records lost during the rescue from records added later."},{"from":"Yang Katae","type":"Contract","to":"Cha Se-on","basis":"Yang Ka-tae takes the register of persons saved from the fire to Cha Se-on and reports the damaged condition of the records. Cha Se-on examines the original handwriting and the testimony, does not arbitrarily fill in the illegible parts, and leaves a basis for verification."},{"from":"Min Dahyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Cha Se-on","basis":"Min Da-hyeon takes testimony confirmed through the confrontation to Cha Se-on. Cha Se-on examines the original and the handwriting together and distinguishes where the testimony changed from what was added to the document afterward."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0157","name":"차세온","title":"유언 필적 기록관","position":"유언 필적 기록관","characterId":"K156","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"유언 필적·증언 대조 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-차세온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0157","birthDate":"2101-04-05","birthday":"04-05","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k156-handwriting-record","name":"필적 기록 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k156-choice","name":"해석을 난외에 남김","description":"글씨 기울기로 필적을 가늠하고, 증인 두 명이 차지 않은 인준을 빈칸으로 본다. 숫자는 공개하되 해석은 난외에 남긴다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 위조 도장을 들켜 사본을 불사르고 원본 칸을 지켰다. 이 일로 유언 필적 기록관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k156-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 유언 필적 기록관. 공개 원본과 비공개 증언을 같은 책상에 펼치고, 먹지가 들러붙은 장은 대조에서 제외한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 유언 필적 기록관. 공개 원본과 비공개 증언을 같은 책상에 펼치고, 먹지가 들러붙은 장은 대조에서 제외한다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"훼손된 먹지를 제외하고 일지 글씨와 유언을 대조한다. 위조 사본 폐기는 원본 보전의 근거지만 위조 제작자를 확정하지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51720-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K156","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51720-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc28-c5f0-c548","name":"연안 차씨","crest":"clan-crests/cc28-c5f0-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":0,"무력":-20,"물질":-30,"공동":15,"원칙":65,"공개":-10,"자격":10,"분산":-30,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":20,"독점":-40,"위험":5,"과시":-10,"지속":35,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"유언 필적·증언 대조 기록","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"유언 필적 기록관","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 0 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −30 | 공동 15 | 원칙 65 | 공개 −10 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 20 | 독점 −40 | 위험 5 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 유언 필적 기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 차세온의 유언 필적과 증언을 대조해 기록하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 유언 필적 기록관.","일화":"2125년 위조 도장을 들켜 사본을 불사르고 원본 칸을 지켰다. 이 일로 유언 필적 기록관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"","야망":"이웃의 유언과 가족 기록을 자신이 필적을 대조해 확인한 원본에만 남기게 해, 위조된 기록이 서울역 이웃 사이에 돌지 않게 한다.","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"글씨 기울기로 필적을 가늠하고, 증인 두 명이 차지 않은 인준을 빈칸으로 본다. 숫자는 공개하되 해석은 난외에 남긴다.\n\n- 생업: 유언 필적·증언 대조 기록\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 유언 필적 기록관\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 유언 필적 기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 차세온의 유언 필적과 증언을 대조해 기록하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 유언 필적 기록관.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 위조 도장을 들켜 사본을 불사르고 원본 칸을 지켰다. 이 일로 유언 필적 기록관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**야망.** 이웃의 유언과 가족 기록을 자신이 필적을 대조해 확인한 원본에만 남기게 해, 위조된 기록이 서울역 이웃 사이에 돌지 않게 한다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 0 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −30 | 공동 15 | 원칙 65 | 공개 −10 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 20 | 독점 −40 | 위험 5 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"차세온","type":"스승과 제자","to":"강예준","basis":"강예준의 필적 대조를 원장으로 옮기는 실무원이고"},{"from":"차세온","type":"스승과 제자","to":"조하린","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"조예준","type":"계약","to":"차세온","basis":"조예준은 공개 대질에서 갈린 증언을 차세온에게 전해 필적·증언 대조 기록과 맞춰 본다. 조예준이 증인의 말을 남기면 차세온은 원본과 증언을 나란히 펼쳐, 말이 달라진 부분과 문서가 어긋난 부분을 구분한다."},{"from":"권금윤","type":"계약","to":"차세온","basis":"권금윤은 화재에서 구해 보관한 인명 장부를 차세온에게 가져간다. 차세온은 장부에 관한 증언과 원본의 필적을 살펴, 구조 과정에서 사라진 기록과 나중에 덧쓴 기록을 구분할 근거를 남긴다."},{"from":"양카태","type":"계약","to":"차세온","basis":"양카태는 화재에서 구한 인명 장부를 차세온에게 가져가 기록의 손상 상태를 알린다. 차세온은 원본 필적과 증언을 살펴 읽히지 않는 부분을 임의로 채우지 않고 확인 근거를 남긴다."},{"from":"민다현","type":"계약","to":"차세온","basis":"민다현은 대질로 확인한 증언을 차세온에게 가져간다. 차세온은 원본과 필적을 함께 살펴 증언이 달라진 부분과 문서에 덧쓴 부분을 구분한다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0158', 'c124-c21c-cc3d', '{"id":"person-0158","name":"Seol Dahin","title":"Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster","position":"Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster","characterId":"K157","rank":"Stationmaster","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Concourse medical waiting tickets and notary window operations","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#character-seol-da-huin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0158","birthDate":"2083-12-14","birthday":"12-14","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k157-queue-posting","name":"Queue posting","rating":65},{"id":"k157-platform-announcement","name":"Platform announcements","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k157-choice","name":"Patients first","description":"He gauged crowds by platform humidity and heard as an insult any order to pull the protocol train ahead of the patient waiting line. Mild in manner, he took the broadcast himself whenever a transfer cancellation rose.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125 he sent a private petition back and passed it to the public window. By this deed the signature of the Seoul Station concourse stationmaster post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That a blackout and service rumor alone would blockade the concourse and scatter the refugees into smuggler boats. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. An alliance announcing Yeon Jiwoo''s infirmary lockdown by broadcast, he executed Yun Jiyul''s dispatch cancellations at the platform and kept Ma Dohan''s copy boxes in the concourse sealed rack.","effects":[]},{"id":"k157-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Stationmaster. Title: Seoul Station concourse stationmaster. He published the concourse care waiting lists and the notary window daily and coupled munitions cars to the platform only after the medical transfer had left.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Stationmaster. Title: Seoul Station concourse stationmaster. He published the concourse care waiting lists and the notary window daily and coupled munitions cars to the platform only after the medical transfer had left.","stress":"Fear. That a blackout and service rumor alone would blockade the concourse and scatter the refugees into smuggler boats. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. An alliance announcing Yeon Jiwoo''s infirmary lockdown by broadcast, he executed Yun Jiyul''s dispatch cancellations at the platform and kept Ma Dohan''s copy boxes in the concourse sealed rack.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Medical transfers precede military wagons, and private requests go to the public desk. An integrated hub remains an ambition. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51730-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K157","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51730-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c124-c21c-cc3d","name":"Sunchang Seol Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c124-c21c-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-15,"Force":-35,"Material":-40,"Communal":15,"Principle":50,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":-35,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-25,"Risk":35,"Display":30,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Concourse medical waiting tickets and notary window operations","Status":"Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"None","Livelihood Role":"Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −15 | Force −35 | Material −40 | Communal 15 | Principle 50 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 15 | Dispersal −35 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness −25 | Risk 35 | Display 30 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: heterosexual | Bonding: contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on concourse night duty. The Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster post opened as a replacement duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Running the concourse''s medical waiting tickets and notarization window, which Seol Dahin oversees, is tied to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Functional/Livelihood Role":"Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster. Not an office, position, or rank in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government.","Anecdote":"In 2125, sent a private solicitation back and redirected it to the public window. Because of this, the signature for the Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"An ally who announces Yeon Jiu''s infirmary lockdown over the broadcast, enforces Yun Jiyul''s dispatch cancellations at the platform, and keeps Ma Dohan''s copy boxes in the concourse''s sealed bay.","Ambition":"To make the Seoul Station concourse the Seoul Station Hub, where confirmation, treatment, and notarization are signed under one roof, and become the face-to-face window for downtown confirmation.","Fear":"That the concourse will be sealed off on a blackout and duty rumors alone, and the refugees scattered onto clandestine boats.","Intervention":"Can block the order to seal the waiting hall and defend the counter, or expose the manipulation of queue tickets and have the stationmaster demoted."},"biography":"Gauges the crowd by platform humidity and takes an order to pull a ceremonial train ahead of the patient queue as an insult. Gentle, but when a transfer cancellation appears, takes over the broadcast personally.\n\n- Livelihood: Concourse medical waiting tickets and notary window operations\n- Status: Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)\n- Civil Servant Position and Grade: None\n- Livelihood Role: Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster\n**Life.** Grew up on concourse night duty. The Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster post opened as a replacement duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Running the concourse''s medical waiting tickets and notarization window, which Seol Dahin oversees, is tied to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Functional/Livelihood Role.** Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster. Not an office, position, or rank in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, sent a private solicitation back and redirected it to the public window. Because of this, the signature for the Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** An ally who announces Yeon Jiu''s infirmary lockdown over the broadcast, enforces Yun Jiyul''s dispatch cancellations at the platform, and keeps Ma Dohan''s copy boxes in the concourse''s sealed bay.\n\n**Ambition.** To make the Seoul Station concourse the Seoul Station Hub, where confirmation, treatment, and notarization are signed under one roof, and become the face-to-face window for downtown confirmation.\n\n**Fear.** That the concourse will be sealed off on a blackout and duty rumors alone, and the refugees scattered onto clandestine boats.\n\n**Intervention.** Can block the order to seal the waiting hall and defend the counter, or expose the manipulation of queue tickets and have the stationmaster demoted.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −15 | Force −35 | Material −40 | Communal 15 | Principle 50 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 15 | Dispersal −35 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Possessiveness −25 | Risk 35 | Display 30 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: heterosexual | Bonding: contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seol Dahin","type":"Command","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"Carries out Yun Jiyul''s dispatch cancellations on the platform, and"},{"from":"Seol Dahin","type":"Contract","to":"Yeon Jiu","basis":"an ally who announces the lockdown of Yeon Jiu''s infirmary by broadcast, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"No Saho","type":"Contract","to":"Seol Dahin","basis":"No Saho passes to Seol Dahin the intake details and testimony of the solicitation redirected to the public window. Seol Dahin obtains the confirmations needed for the notarization window and the medical waiting tickets, so that no private transfer request is processed ahead of the patient queue."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0158","name":"설다흰","title":"서울역 대합실 역장","position":"서울역 대합실 역장","characterId":"K157","rank":"역장","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"대합실 의무 대기표·공증 창구 운영","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-설다흰","detailRoute":"/people/person-0158","birthDate":"2083-12-14","birthday":"12-14","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k157-queue-posting","name":"대기표 게시","rating":65},{"id":"k157-platform-announcement","name":"승강장 방송","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k157-choice","name":"환자 먼저","description":"승강장 습기로 인파를 가늠하고, 의전 열차를 환자 대기열 앞으로 끌어오라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 이송 취소가 뜨면 방송을 직접 잡는다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 대합실 역장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 정전과 복무 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 피난민이 밀선으로 흩어지는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 연지우의 의무실 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고, 윤지율의 배차 취소를 승강장에서 집행하며, 마도한의 사본 상자를 대합실 봉인 칸에 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k157-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 역장. 직함은 서울역 대합실 역장. 대합실 의무 대기표와 공증 창구를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의료 이송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 역장. 직함은 서울역 대합실 역장. 대합실 의무 대기표와 공증 창구를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의료 이송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","stress":"공포. 정전과 복무 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 피난민이 밀선으로 흩어지는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 연지우의 의무실 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고, 윤지율의 배차 취소를 승강장에서 집행하며, 마도한의 사본 상자를 대합실 봉인 칸에 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"의료 이송 뒤에 군수 화차를 붙이고 사적 청탁을 공개 창구로 돌린다. 창구 통합은 야망이지 이미 완성한 제도가 아니다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51730-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K157","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51730-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c124-c21c-cc3d","name":"순창 설씨","crest":"clan-crests/c124-c21c-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-15,"무력":-35,"물질":-40,"공동":15,"원칙":50,"공개":-20,"자격":15,"분산":-35,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-25,"위험":35,"과시":30,"지속":-10,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"대합실 의무 대기표·공증 창구 운영","지위":"기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)","공무원 직위·직급":"없음","생업 역할":"서울역 대합실 역장","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −40 | 공동 15 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −20 | 자격 15 | 분산 −35 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −25 | 위험 35 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 서울역 대합실 역장 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 설다흰이 맡는 대합실의 의무 대기표와 공증 창구를 운영하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","기능·생업 역할":"서울역 대합실 역장. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.","일화":"2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 대합실 역장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"연지우의 의무실 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고, 윤지율의 배차 취소를 승강장에서 집행하며, 마도한의 사본 상자를 대합실 봉인 칸에 둔다.","야망":"서울역 대합실을 인준·진료·공증이 한 지붕에서 서명되는 서울역 허브로 만들어 도심 인준의 대면 창구가 된다.","공포":"정전과 복무 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 피난민이 밀선으로 흩어지는 것.","개입":"대합실 봉쇄 명령을 막아 창구를 지키거나, 대기표 조작을 밝혀 역장을 강등시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"승강장 습기로 인파를 가늠하고, 의전 열차를 환자 대기열 앞으로 끌어오라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 이송 취소가 뜨면 방송을 직접 잡는다.\n\n- 생업: 대합실 의무 대기표·공증 창구 운영\n- 지위: 기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)\n- 공무원 직위·직급: 없음\n- 생업 역할: 서울역 대합실 역장\n**생애.** 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 서울역 대합실 역장 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 설다흰이 맡는 대합실의 의무 대기표와 공증 창구를 운영하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**기능·생업 역할.** 서울역 대합실 역장. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 대합실 역장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 연지우의 의무실 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고, 윤지율의 배차 취소를 승강장에서 집행하며, 마도한의 사본 상자를 대합실 봉인 칸에 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 서울역 대합실을 인준·진료·공증이 한 지붕에서 서명되는 서울역 허브로 만들어 도심 인준의 대면 창구가 된다.\n\n**공포.** 정전과 복무 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 피난민이 밀선으로 흩어지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대합실 봉쇄 명령을 막아 창구를 지키거나, 대기표 조작을 밝혀 역장을 강등시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −40 | 공동 15 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −20 | 자격 15 | 분산 −35 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −25 | 위험 35 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"설다흰","type":"지휘","to":"윤지율","basis":"윤지율의 배차 취소를 승강장에서 집행하며"},{"from":"설다흰","type":"계약","to":"연지우","basis":"연지우의 의무실 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"노사호","type":"계약","to":"설다흰","basis":"노사호는 공개 창구로 돌린 청탁의 접수 내용과 증언을 설다흰에게 전한다. 설다흰은 공증 창구와 의무 대기표에 필요한 확인을 받아, 사적인 이송 요청이 환자 대기열보다 먼저 처리되지 않게 한다."}]}}');
