tacks Base Supervisor","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness 0 | Force −40 | Material −20 | Communal 10 | Principle 50 | Publicity −30 | Qualification 5 | Dispersal −40 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Craving −5 | Possessiveness 20 | Risk −15 | Display 25 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: none | Bonding: monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Sinjeong Rail Depot. The Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor post opened with a defect report just before a derailment.\n- Supervising the archive chest temperatures and key rotations, which Ji Hansol oversees, is tied to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Post of Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5) in charge of the archive, Seoul Metropolitan Records Management Office. Assigned duty: Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor.","Anecdote":"In 2125, sent a box of defective parts back just before shipment. Because of this, the signature for the Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"You can obtain replacement storage batteries to protect the chest temperature, or expose the falsified logs to have the supervisor replaced."},"biography":"Reads overload from the temperature of the iron chests and burns the note ordering a compartment given to military supply storage over the will chest. Taciturn, and never trims the removal log.\n\n- Livelihood: Supervision of stacks vault temperature and key rotation\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service organization\n- Position/rank: Post of Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5) in charge of the archive, Seoul Metropolitan Records Management Office\n- Assigned duty: Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor\n**Life.** Grew up at the Sinjeong Rail Depot. The Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor post opened with a defect report just before a derailment.\n- Supervising the archive chest temperatures and key rotations, which Ji Hansol oversees, is tied to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position/Rank.** Post of Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5) in charge of the archive, Seoul Metropolitan Records Management Office. Assigned duty: Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, sent a box of defective parts back just before shipment. Because of this, the signature for the Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Intervention.** You can obtain replacement storage batteries to protect the chest temperature, or expose the falsified logs to have the supervisor replaced.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness 0 | Force −40 | Material −20 | Communal 10 | Principle 50 | Publicity −30 | Qualification 5 | Dispersal −40 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Possessiveness 20 | Risk −15 | Display 25 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: none | Bonding: monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ji Hansol","type":"Command","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":""},{"from":"Ji Hansol","type":"Command","to":"Ji Seo-yun","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Na Seonjae","type":"Command","to":"Ji Hansol","basis":"shares shifts with the seal of Ji Hansol''s archive base"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0159","name":"지한솔","title":"서울역 서고기지 감독","position":"서울역 서고기지 감독","characterId":"K158","rank":"역장","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"서고 함 온도·열쇠 교대 감독","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-지한솔","detailRoute":"/people/person-0159","birthDate":"2095-02-05","birthday":"02-05","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k158-archive-monitoring","name":"서고 함 점검","rating":65},{"id":"k158-parts-rejection","name":"부품 검수","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k158-choice","name":"보관 목적을 지킴","description":"철제 함의 온도로 과부하를 읽고, 유언함보다 군수 보관에 칸을 내주라는 쪽지를 태운다. 과묵하고 반출 일지를 깎지 않는다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 서고기지 감독 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k158-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 역장. 직함은 서울역 서고기지 감독. 함 온도와 열쇠 교대를 공개 칠판에 남기고, 군수 보관은 의료 이송 재고가 최저선을 넘을 때만 허용한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 역장. 직함은 서울역 서고기지 감독. 함 온도와 열쇠 교대를 공개 칠판에 남기고, 군수 보관은 의료 이송 재고가 최저선을 넘을 때만 허용한다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"불량 부품을 되돌리고 함 온도와 열쇠 교대를 남긴다. 기록 전용 보관을 지키지만 문화 창작이나 전투 경력은 없다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51750-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K158","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51750-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c0-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 지씨","crest":"clan-crests/c9c0-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":0,"무력":-40,"물질":-20,"공동":10,"원칙":50,"공개":-30,"자격":5,"분산":-40,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":20,"위험":-15,"과시":25,"지속":-15,"지향":"무성향","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"서고 함 온도·열쇠 교대 감독","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"서울특별시 기록관리 사업소 서고 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직","담당 업무":"서울역 서고기지 감독","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 0 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −30 | 자격 5 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 20 | 위험 −15 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 서울역 서고기지 감독 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 지한솔이 맡는 서고 함의 온도와 열쇠 교대를 감독하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"서울특별시 기록관리 사업소 서고 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직. 담당 업무: 서울역 서고기지 감독.","일화":"2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 서고기지 감독 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"대체 축전지를 구해 함 온도를 지키거나, 일지 조작을 폭로해 감독을 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"철제 함의 온도로 과부하를 읽고, 유언함보다 군수 보관에 칸을 내주라는 쪽지를 태운다. 과묵하고 반출 일지를 깎지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 서고 함 온도·열쇠 교대 감독\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 서울특별시 기록관리 사업소 서고 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직\n- 담당 업무: 서울역 서고기지 감독\n**생애.** 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 서울역 서고기지 감독 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 지한솔이 맡는 서고 함의 온도와 열쇠 교대를 감독하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 서울특별시 기록관리 사업소 서고 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직. 담당 업무: 서울역 서고기지 감독.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 서고기지 감독 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**개입.** 대체 축전지를 구해 함 온도를 지키거나, 일지 조작을 폭로해 감독을 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 0 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −30 | 자격 5 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 20 | 위험 −15 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"지한솔","type":"지휘","to":"조하린","basis":""},{"from":"지한솔","type":"지휘","to":"지서윤","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"나선재","type":"지휘","to":"지한솔","basis":"지한솔의 서고기지 봉인과 교대를 나누며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0160', 'b9c8-c7a5-d765', '{"id":"person-0160","name":"Ma Eungyeol","title":"Jongno Notarized Copy Market Auctioneer","position":"Jongno Notarized Copy Market Auctioneer","characterId":"K159","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Notarized copy seal verification and auctions","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-ma-eungyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0160","birthDate":"2064-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k159-copy-auction","name":"Notarized copy auction","rating":65},{"id":"k159-seal-check","name":"Notarial seal checking","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k159-choice","name":"Sets limits on prices","description":"He read copy prices faster than the river wind and struck out at once from the morning lottery any merchant who tried to put empty iron boxes up at high prices. He bargained like a song but never raised the price of testament copies.","behavior":"Anecdote. A trader who wants to push empty steel cases at will-copy prices enters the morning lottery at the Jongno notarized-copy market. Ma Eungyeol strikes that name from the lottery and loads onto Ma Dohan''s shipping order only the copies whose notarial seal from O Seoyul was checked before the auction.","stress":"Fear. That Garak''s price ledger would swallow the Jongno window. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract executing Ma Dohan''s transport order by auction, checked O Seoyul''s notary stamps before the auction, and sent Nam Yungyeong''s emergency price offer back as a grudge.","effects":[]},{"id":"k159-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Jongno Notarized Copy Market Auctioneer. He checked stamp stickers before the auction opened and let no copy with an empty witness line leave even after a winning bid.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Jongno Notarized Copy Market Auctioneer. He checked stamp stickers before the auction opened and let no copy with an empty witness line leave even after a winning bid.","stress":"Fear. That Garak''s price ledger would swallow the Jongno window. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract executing Ma Dohan''s transport order by auction, checked O Seoyul''s notary stamps before the auction, and sent Nam Yungyeong''s emergency price offer back as a grudge.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Excluded a trader pricing empty metal as copies and admitted only notarized copies to shipment. Market judgment establishes no investment career. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41310-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K159","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41310-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b9c8-c7a5-d765","name":"Jangheung Ma Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b9c8-c7a5-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-15,"Force":-30,"Material":-5,"Communal":5,"Principle":30,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-35,"Display":40,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Notarized copy seal verification and auctions","Status":"Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"None","Livelihood Role":"Jongno Notarized Copy Market Auctioneer","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness −15 | Force −30 | Materialism −5 | Community 5 | Principle 30 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk −35 | Display 40 | Endurance 20 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bond Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of Auctioneer of the Jongno Notarized Copy Market opened up when a single line of a double ledger was deleted.\n- Ma Eungyeol''s work of verifying the seals on notarized copies and opening auctions is connected to the affairs of Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong.","Functional/Livelihood Role":"Auctioneer of the Jongno Notarized Copy Market. This is not an office, position, or rank in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government.","Anecdote":"A merchant who tries to pass off empty ironware at the price of a will copy puts his name into the morning lottery at the Jongno Notarized Copy Market. Ma Eungyeol removes the name from the lottery and loads onto Ma Dohan''s transport queue only the copies whose notarial seals from O Seoyul were verified before the auction.","Relationships":"A contract that enforces Ma Dohan''s transport queue through auction; he verifies O Seoyul''s notarial seals before the auction and sends Nam Yungyeong''s emergency price proposal back as a grievance.","Ambition":"To open auctions of notarized copies and original map plates only together with the Records Office seal, so that Seoul Station''s prices become the public ledger of ratification.","Fear":"That Garak''s price ledger will swallow even the Jongno counter.","Intervention":"He can expose the smuggler-boat winning-bid ledger, or escort the sealed samples to protect his public auction."},"biography":"He reads copy prices faster than the river wind and immediately strikes from the morning lottery any merchant trying to sell empty ironware at a high price. He haggles like singing, but never raises the price of a will copy.\n\n- Livelihood: Notarized copy seal verification and auctions\n- Status: Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)\n- Civil Servant Position and Grade: None\n- Livelihood Role: Jongno Notarized Copy Market Auctioneer\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of Auctioneer of the Jongno Notarized Copy Market opened up when a single line of a double ledger was deleted.\n- Ma Eungyeol''s work of verifying the seals on notarized copies and opening auctions is connected to the affairs of Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong.\n\n**Functional/Livelihood Role.** Auctioneer of the Jongno Notarized Copy Market. This is not an office, position, or rank in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government.\n\n**Anecdote.** A merchant who tries to pass off empty ironware at the price of a will copy puts his name into the morning lottery at the Jongno Notarized Copy Market. Ma Eungyeol removes the name from the lottery and loads onto Ma Dohan''s transport queue only the copies whose notarial seals from O Seoyul were verified before the auction.\n\n**Relationships.** A contract that enforces Ma Dohan''s transport queue through auction; he verifies O Seoyul''s notarial seals before the auction and sends Nam Yungyeong''s emergency price proposal back as a grievance.\n\n**Ambition.** To open auctions of notarized copies and original map plates only together with the Records Office seal, so that Seoul Station''s prices become the public ledger of ratification.\n\n**Fear.** That Garak''s price ledger will swallow even the Jongno counter.\n\n**Intervention.** He can expose the smuggler-boat winning-bid ledger, or escort the sealed samples to protect his public auction.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness −15 | Force −30 | Materialism −5 | Community 5 | Principle 30 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk −35 | Display 40 | Endurance 20 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bond Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ma Eungyeol","type":"Contract","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"Verifies O Seoyul''s notarial seal before the auction, and"},{"from":"Ma Eungyeol","type":"Command","to":"Ma Dohan","basis":"a contract that enforces Ma Dohan''s transport turn order by auction"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ran Jiho","type":"Contract","to":"Ma Eungyeol","basis":"Hoping his rank will not become a commodity in Ma Eungyeol''s copy auction"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0160","name":"마은결","title":"종로 공증사본 시장 경매사","position":"종로 공증사본 시장 경매사","characterId":"K159","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"공증사본 인장 확인·경매","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-마은결","detailRoute":"/people/person-0160","birthDate":"2064-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k159-copy-auction","name":"공증 사본 경매","rating":65},{"id":"k159-seal-check","name":"공증 인장 확인","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k159-choice","name":"가격에도 경계","description":"사본 시세를 강바람보다 빨리 읽고, 빈 철제를 고가에 올리려는 상인을 아침 추첨에서 즉시 뺀다. 흥정을 노래처럼 하지만 유언 사본의 가격은 올리지 않는다.","behavior":"일화. 빈 철제를 유언 사본 값으로 올리려는 상인이 종로 공증사본 시장의 아침 추첨에 이름을 넣는다. 마은결은 그 이름을 추첨에서 빼고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전에 확인한 사본만 마도한의 운송 순번에 싣는다.","stress":"공포. 가락의 가격 원장이 종로 창구까지 삼키는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 마도한의 운송 순번을 경매로 집행하는 계약이고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전 확인하며, 남윤경의 비상 시세 제의를 원한으로 돌려보낸다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k159-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 종로 공증사본 시장 경매사. 경매 시작 전 인장 스티커를 확인하고, 증인란이 빈 사본은 낙찰이 되어도 반출시키지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 종로 공증사본 시장 경매사. 경매 시작 전 인장 스티커를 확인하고, 증인란이 빈 사본은 낙찰이 되어도 반출시키지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 가락의 가격 원장이 종로 창구까지 삼키는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 마도한의 운송 순번을 경매로 집행하는 계약이고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전 확인하며, 남윤경의 비상 시세 제의를 원한으로 돌려보낸다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"빈 철제를 사본 값으로 올리는 상인을 빼고 공증 사본만 운송 순번에 넣었다. 거래 제한과 시세 판단을 반영하되 투자 경력은 없다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41310-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K159","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41310-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b9c8-c7a5-d765","name":"장흥 마씨","crest":"clan-crests/b9c8-c7a5-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":-15,"무력":-30,"물질":-5,"공동":5,"원칙":30,"공개":-20,"자격":20,"분산":-30,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-15,"위험":-35,"과시":40,"지속":20,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"공증사본 인장 확인·경매","지위":"기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)","공무원 직위·직급":"없음","생업 역할":"종로 공증사본 시장 경매사","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −5 | 공동 5 | 원칙 30 | 공개 −20 | 자격 20 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 40 | 지속 20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 종로 공증사본 시장 경매사 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 마은결이 맡는 공증사본의 인장을 확인하고 경매를 여는 일은 종로1·2·3·4가동의 업무와 이어진다.","기능·생업 역할":"종로 공증사본 시장 경매사. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.","일화":"빈 철제를 유언 사본 값으로 올리려는 상인이 종로 공증사본 시장의 아침 추첨에 이름을 넣는다. 마은결은 그 이름을 추첨에서 빼고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전에 확인한 사본만 마도한의 운송 순번에 싣는다.","관계":"마도한의 운송 순번을 경매로 집행하는 계약이고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전 확인하며, 남윤경의 비상 시세 제의를 원한으로 돌려보낸다.","야망":"공증 사본과 지도 원판 경매를 기록청 봉인과 함께만 열어 서울역 시세가 인준의 공개 장부가 되게 한다.","공포":"가락의 가격 원장이 종로 창구까지 삼키는 것.","개입":"밀선 낙찰 장부를 폭로하거나, 봉인 표본을 호송해 그의 공개 경매를 지킬 수 있다."},"biography":"사본 시세를 강바람보다 빨리 읽고, 빈 철제를 고가에 올리려는 상인을 아침 추첨에서 즉시 뺀다. 흥정을 노래처럼 하지만 유언 사본의 가격은 올리지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 공증사본 인장 확인·경매\n- 지위: 기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)\n- 공무원 직위·직급: 없음\n- 생업 역할: 종로 공증사본 시장 경매사\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 종로 공증사본 시장 경매사 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 마은결이 맡는 공증사본의 인장을 확인하고 경매를 여는 일은 종로1·2·3·4가동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**기능·생업 역할.** 종로 공증사본 시장 경매사. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.\n\n**일화.** 빈 철제를 유언 사본 값으로 올리려는 상인이 종로 공증사본 시장의 아침 추첨에 이름을 넣는다. 마은결은 그 이름을 추첨에서 빼고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전에 확인한 사본만 마도한의 운송 순번에 싣는다.\n\n**관계.** 마도한의 운송 순번을 경매로 집행하는 계약이고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전 확인하며, 남윤경의 비상 시세 제의를 원한으로 돌려보낸다.\n\n**야망.** 공증 사본과 지도 원판 경매를 기록청 봉인과 함께만 열어 서울역 시세가 인준의 공개 장부가 되게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 가락의 가격 원장이 종로 창구까지 삼키는 것.\n\n**개입.** 밀선 낙찰 장부를 폭로하거나, 봉인 표본을 호송해 그의 공개 경매를 지킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −5 | 공동 5 | 원칙 30 | 공개 −20 | 자격 20 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 40 | 지속 20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"마은결","type":"계약","to":"오서율","basis":"오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전 확인하며"},{"from":"마은결","type":"지휘","to":"마도한","basis":"마도한의 운송 순번을 경매로 집행하는 계약이고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"란지호","type":"계약","to":"마은결","basis":"마은결의 사본 경매에서 자신의 관작이 물건이 되지 않기를 바라며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0161', 'c5f0-ace1-c0b0', '{"id":"person-0161","name":"Yeon Taesol","title":"Central Disaster Medicine Coordination Officer","position":"Central Disaster Medicine Coordination Officer","characterId":"K160","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Disaster medicine triage dispatch and medicine coordination","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-yeontaesol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0161","birthDate":"2101-02-19","birthday":"02-19","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k160-medical-coordination","name":"Medical dispatch coordination","rating":60},{"id":"k160-medicine-sharing","name":"Medicine portion allocation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k160-choice","name":"Rejects military scheduling","description":"She filled severity numbers before people and refused any note telling her to attach ambulance trains to munitions formations. Merciful, she cancelled a run whenever weapons and patients shared one car.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125, short of herbs, she halved the prescriptions and divided them among everyone. By this deed the signature of the central disaster-medical coordination duty officer post rose into the ledger.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice translating Yun Jiyul''s medical-transfer ledger into coordination tables, having filled Yeon Jiwoo''s sickbed shortage with dispatches.","effects":[]},{"id":"k160-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Central Disaster Medicine Coordination Officer. She posted severity-order dispatches and overlaid Ryu Eunbi''s contribution ledger and Yun Jiyul''s transfer ledger on one chalkboard.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Central Disaster Medicine Coordination Officer. She posted severity-order dispatches and overlaid Ryu Eunbi''s contribution ledger and Yun Jiyul''s transfer ledger on one chalkboard.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice translating Yun Jiyul''s medical-transfer ledger into coordination tables, having filled Yeon Jiwoo''s sickbed shortage with dispatches.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Combines transport and medicine records to adjust dispatch for bed shortages. Sharing scarce drugs proves neither medical diagnosis nor teaching. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51760-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K160","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51760-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5f0-ace1-c0b0","name":"Yeon of Goksan","crest":"clan-crests/c5f0-ace1-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-10,"Force":-25,"Material":-35,"Communal":5,"Principle":50,"Public":-30,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-35},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":0,"Display":25,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Disaster medicine triage dispatch and medicine coordination","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Local Health Section","Assigned Duties":"Central Disaster Medicine Coordination Officer","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −25 | Materialism −35 | Community 5 | Principle 50 | Publicity −30 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −35","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness 0 | Risk 0 | Display 25 | Endurance 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Jegi-dong Infirmary. The post of Central Disaster Medical Coordination Officer opened up through a seal on counterfeit medicine.\n- Yeon Taesol''s work of coordinating disaster-medical dispatch and medicine allocation is connected to the affairs of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Local Health Section. Duties: Central Disaster Medical Coordination Officer.","Anecdote":"In 2125, during a medicine shortage, she halved the prescribed doses and shared them among everyone. Because of this, her signature for the post of Central Disaster Medical Coordination Officer was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"A mentor who translates Yun Jiyul''s medical transport ledger into a coordination table and has made up for Yeon Jiu''s bed shortage with dispatches.","Ambition":"To place the disaster-medical coordination network under Records Office ratification.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Escort the medicine bundles to keep the coordination running, or uncover the munitions-trainset collusion and put the officer in jeopardy."},"biography":"Fills in the triage numbers before the people, and refuses notes ordering ambulance trains to be attached to munitions consists. Merciful, but cancels the run if weapons and patients share one car.\n\n- Livelihood: Disaster medicine triage dispatch and medicine coordination\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position and Grade: Local Health Section\n- Assigned Duties: Central Disaster Medicine Coordination Officer\n**Life.** Grew up at the Jegi-dong Infirmary. The post of Central Disaster Medical Coordination Officer opened up through a seal on counterfeit medicine.\n- Yeon Taesol''s work of coordinating disaster-medical dispatch and medicine allocation is connected to the affairs of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil service post and grade.** Local Health Section. Duties: Central Disaster Medical Coordination Officer.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, during a medicine shortage, she halved the prescribed doses and shared them among everyone. Because of this, her signature for the post of Central Disaster Medical Coordination Officer was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** A mentor who translates Yun Jiyul''s medical transport ledger into a coordination table and has made up for Yeon Jiu''s bed shortage with dispatches.\n\n**Ambition.** To place the disaster-medical coordination network under Records Office ratification.\n\n**Intervention.** Escort the medicine bundles to keep the coordination running, or uncover the munitions-trainset collusion and put the officer in jeopardy.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −25 | Materialism −35 | Communal 5 | Principle 50 | Publicity −30 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion −25 | Transformation −35\n- Desires: Longing 40 | Monopoly 0 | Risk 0 | Display 25 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yeon Taesol","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"is an aide who translates Yun Jiyul''s medical transport ledger into coordination tables, and"},{"from":"Yeon Taesol","type":"Contract","to":"Yeon Jiu","basis":"covers Yeon Jiu''s shortage of beds with train dispatches"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0161","name":"연태솔","title":"중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관","position":"중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관","characterId":"K160","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"재난의료 중증도 배차·약재 조정","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-연태솔","detailRoute":"/people/person-0161","birthDate":"2101-02-19","birthday":"02-19","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k160-medical-coordination","name":"의료 배차 조정","rating":60},{"id":"k160-medicine-sharing","name":"약재 분량 배분","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k160-choice","name":"군수 편성을 거부","description":"중증도 숫자를 사람보다 먼저 메우고, 구급 열차를 군수 편성에 붙이라는 쪽지를 거부한다. 자비롭지만 무기와 환자가 한 칸이면 운행을 취소한다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 윤지율의 의료이송 원장을 조정표로 번역하는 스승이고, 연지우의 침상 부족을 배차로 메워 왔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k160-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관. 중증도 순 배차를 게시하고, 류은비의 기여도 장부와 윤지율의 이송 원장을 같은 칠판에 겹친다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관. 중증도 순 배차를 게시하고, 류은비의 기여도 장부와 윤지율의 이송 원장을 같은 칠판에 겹친다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 윤지율의 의료이송 원장을 조정표로 번역하는 스승이고, 연지우의 침상 부족을 배차로 메워 왔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"이송 원장과 약품 장부를 겹쳐 침상 부족을 배차로 조정한다. 부족한 약재를 나눈 일화는 전문 진단이나 교육 능력을 증명하지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51760-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K160","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51760-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5f0-ace1-c0b0","name":"곡산 연씨","crest":"clan-crests/c5f0-ace1-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-10,"무력":-25,"물질":-35,"공동":5,"원칙":50,"공개":-30,"자격":10,"분산":-25,"변혁":-35},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":0,"위험":0,"과시":25,"지속":35,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"재난의료 중증도 배차·약재 조정","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방보건계","담당 업무":"중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −35 | 공동 5 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −30 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −35","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 0 | 위험 0 | 과시 25 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 연태솔의 재난의료 배차와 약재 배정을 조정하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방보건계. 담당 업무: 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"윤지율의 의료이송 원장을 조정표로 번역하는 스승이고, 연지우의 침상 부족을 배차로 메워 왔다.","야망":"재난의료 조정망을 기록청 인준 아래 둔다.","공포":"","개입":"약품 묶음을 호송해 조정을 유지하거나, 군수 편성 밀약을 찾아 실무관을 위태롭게 할 수 있다."},"biography":"중증도 숫자를 사람보다 먼저 메우고, 구급 열차를 군수 편성에 붙이라는 쪽지를 거부한다. 자비롭지만 무기와 환자가 한 칸이면 운행을 취소한다.\n\n- 생업: 재난의료 중증도 배차·약재 조정\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방보건계\n- 담당 업무: 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관\n**생애.** 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 연태솔의 재난의료 배차와 약재 배정을 조정하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방보건계. 담당 업무: 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 윤지율의 의료이송 원장을 조정표로 번역하는 스승이고, 연지우의 침상 부족을 배차로 메워 왔다.\n\n**야망.** 재난의료 조정망을 기록청 인준 아래 둔다.\n\n**개입.** 약품 묶음을 호송해 조정을 유지하거나, 군수 편성 밀약을 찾아 실무관을 위태롭게 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −35 | 공동 5 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −30 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −35\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 0 | 위험 0 | 과시 25 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"연태솔","type":"스승과 제자","to":"윤지율","basis":"윤지율의 의료이송 원장을 조정표로 번역하는 실무원이고"},{"from":"연태솔","type":"계약","to":"연지우","basis":"연지우의 침상 부족을 배차로 메운다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0162', 'b098-b098-c8fc-7f85', '{"id":"person-0162","name":"Na Bomgyeol","title":"Archive Emergency Power Chief Operator","position":"Archive Emergency Power Chief Operator","characterId":"K161","rank":"Stationmaster","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Archive generator fuel and output operation","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#Person-Na-Bomgyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0162","birthDate":"2093-03-25","birthday":"03-25","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k161-generator-operation","name":"Generator output operation","rating":65},{"id":"k161-document-copying","name":"Copying wet documents","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k161-choice","name":"Essential output first","description":"Sensitive to the smell of fuel, he hated verbal power routing. He took the political pressure to divert power from the dehumidifiers to the protocol lighting as an insult.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125 he dried ratification papers soaked on the platform and left a hand copy. By this deed the signature of the archive emergency generator operator post rose into the ledger.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Matched output to Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifiers, backed Ji Hansol''s box temperature from the generation side, and had obeyed Yun Seorin''s cross-verification but refused concealed power routing.","effects":[]},{"id":"k161-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Stationmaster. Title: Archive Emergency Power Chief Operator. Every shift he sealed the fuel remainder and output logs and sent them to Ji Hansol, and below minimum output he cut the protocol power even under the bureau chief''s urging.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Stationmaster. Title: Archive Emergency Power Chief Operator. Every shift he sealed the fuel remainder and output logs and sent them to Ji Hansol, and below minimum output he cut the protocol power even under the bureau chief''s urging.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Matched output to Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifiers, backed Ji Hansol''s box temperature from the generation side, and had obeyed Yun Seorin''s cross-verification but refused concealed power routing.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Cuts ceremonial power at minimum output and preserved wet approval papers through copying. A unified power network is a goal, not an invention. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51770-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K161","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51770-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b098-b098-c8fc-7f85","name":"Naju Na Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b098-b098-c8fc-7f85.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-15,"Force":-30,"Material":-35,"Communal":15,"Principle":60,"Public":-25,"Eligibility":5,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-35,"Display":5,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Archive generator fuel and output operation","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"A grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government business-office post, among Local Industrial Officer / Assistant Local Industrial Officer or Local Facilities Officer / Assistant Local Facilities Officer","Assigned Duties":"Archive Emergency Power Chief Operator","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −15 | Force −30 | Materialism −35 | Communal 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity −25 | Credentials 5 | Dispersion −25 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Longing 0 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −35 | Display 5 | Persistence 25 | Orientation None | Bond Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up in the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Archive Emergency Power Operations Chief opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Na Bomgyeol''s work of operating archive generator fuel and output connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A rank fitting a Seoul Metropolitan Government office post, among Local Industrial Officer and Assistant Local Industrial Officer, or Local Facilities Officer and Assistant Local Facilities Officer. Duties: Archive Emergency Power Operations Chief.","Anecdote":"In 2125, dried a water-soaked ratification document on the platform and preserved it as a transcribed copy. Because of this, the signature for the post of Archive Emergency Power Operations Chief went into the ledger.","Relationships":"Matches output to Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifier, supports Ji Hansol''s vault temperature from the generation side, and has obeyed Yun Seorin''s cross-verification but refused concealed power distribution.","Ambition":"Bind archive emergency power and infirmary power into a single public distribution network.","Fear":"","Intervention":"He can secure substitute fuel to open a dual distribution grid, or expose the tampering with the output logs so that the operations chief is replaced."},"biography":"Sensitive to the smell of fuel and hates verbal power distribution. Regards political pressure to divert power to ceremonial lighting rather than dehumidifiers as an insult.\n\n- Livelihood: Archive generator fuel and output operation\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position and Grade: A grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government business-office post, among Local Industrial Officer / Assistant Local Industrial Officer or Local Facilities Officer / Assistant Local Facilities Officer\n- Assigned Duties: Archive Emergency Power Chief Operator\n**Life.** Grew up in the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Archive Emergency Power Operations Chief opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Na Bomgyeol''s work of operating archive generator fuel and output connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil service post and grade.** A rank fitting a Seoul Metropolitan Government office post, among Local Industrial Officer and Assistant Local Industrial Officer, or Local Facilities Officer and Assistant Local Facilities Officer. Duties: Archive Emergency Power Operations Chief.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, dried a water-soaked ratification document on the platform and preserved it as a transcribed copy. Because of this, the signature for the post of Archive Emergency Power Operations Chief went into the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Matches output to Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifier, supports Ji Hansol''s vault temperature from the generation side, and has obeyed Yun Seorin''s cross-verification but refused concealed power distribution.\n\n**Ambition.** Bind archive emergency power and infirmary power into a single public distribution network.\n\n**Intervention.** He can secure substitute fuel to open a dual distribution grid, or expose the tampering with the output logs so that the operations chief is replaced.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −15 | Force −30 | Materialism −35 | Communal 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity −25 | Credentials 5 | Dispersion −25 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Longing 0 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −35 | Display 5 | Persistence 25 | Orientation None | Bond Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Na Bomgyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Obeys Yun Seorin''s cross-verification but refuses concealed power distribution"},{"from":"Na Bomgyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Ji Seo-yun","basis":"matching output to Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifier"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ji Seo-yun","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Na Bomgyeol","basis":"matching the dehumidification power to Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation"},{"from":"Pyeong Ye-jun","type":"Oath","to":"Na Bomgyeol","basis":"Syncing the time with Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation log"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0162","name":"나봄결","title":"문서고 비상발전 운전장","position":"문서고 비상발전 운전장","characterId":"K161","rank":"역장","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"문서고 발전 연료·출력 운전","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-나봄결","detailRoute":"/people/person-0162","birthDate":"2093-03-25","birthday":"03-25","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k161-generator-operation","name":"발전 출력 운전","rating":65},{"id":"k161-document-copying","name":"젖은 문서 필사","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k161-choice","name":"필수 출력 우선","description":"연료 냄새에 예민하고 구두 배전을 싫어한다. 제습기보다 의전 조명에 전력을 돌리라는 정치적 압박을 모욕으로 여긴다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 문서고 비상발전 운전장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 지서윤의 제습기에 출력을 맞추고, 지한솔의 함 온도를 발전 쪽에서 받치며, 윤서린의 교차검증에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k161-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 역장. 직함은 문서고 비상발전 운전장. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 지한솔에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 청장의 독촉이 있어도 의전 배전을 끊는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 역장. 직함은 문서고 비상발전 운전장. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 지한솔에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 청장의 독촉이 있어도 의전 배전을 끊는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 지서윤의 제습기에 출력을 맞추고, 지한솔의 함 온도를 발전 쪽에서 받치며, 윤서린의 교차검증에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"최저 출력에서 의전 배전을 끊고 젖은 인준 문서를 필사로 남겼다. 발전망 통합은 목표이며 발명 경력으로 보지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51770-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K161","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51770-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b098-b098-c8fc-7f85","name":"나주 나씨","crest":"clan-crests/b098-b098-c8fc-7f85.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-15,"무력":-30,"물질":-35,"공동":15,"원칙":60,"공개":-25,"자격":5,"분산":-25,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-15,"위험":-35,"과시":5,"지속":25,"지향":"무성향","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"문서고 발전 연료·출력 운전","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"문서고 비상발전 운전장","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −35 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −25 | 자격 5 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 5 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 문서고 비상발전 운전장 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 나봄결의 문서고 발전 연료와 출력을 운전하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 문서고 비상발전 운전장.","일화":"2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 문서고 비상발전 운전장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"지서윤의 제습기에 출력을 맞추고, 지한솔의 함 온도를 발전 쪽에서 받치며, 윤서린의 교차검증에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","야망":"문서고 비상 발전과 의무실 전력을 하나의 공개 배전망으로 묶는다.","공포":"","개입":"대체 연료를 구해 이중 배전을 열거나, 출력 일지 조작을 밝혀 운전장을 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"연료 냄새에 예민하고 구두 배전을 싫어한다. 제습기보다 의전 조명에 전력을 돌리라는 정치적 압박을 모욕으로 여긴다.\n\n- 생업: 문서고 발전 연료·출력 운전\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 문서고 비상발전 운전장\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 문서고 비상발전 운전장 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 나봄결의 문서고 발전 연료와 출력을 운전하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 문서고 비상발전 운전장.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 문서고 비상발전 운전장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 지서윤의 제습기에 출력을 맞추고, 지한솔의 함 온도를 발전 쪽에서 받치며, 윤서린의 교차검증에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.\n\n**야망.** 문서고 비상 발전과 의무실 전력을 하나의 공개 배전망으로 묶는다.\n\n**개입.** 대체 연료를 구해 이중 배전을 열거나, 출력 일지 조작을 밝혀 운전장을 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −35 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −25 | 자격 5 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 5 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"나봄결","type":"계약","to":"윤서린","basis":"윤서린의 교차검증에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"나봄결","type":"계약","to":"지서윤","basis":"지서윤의 제습기에 출력을 맞추고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"지서윤","type":"스승과 제자","to":"나봄결","basis":"나봄결의 비상 발전에 제습 전력을 맞추며"},{"from":"평예준","type":"맹세","to":"나봄결","basis":"나봄결의 비상 발전 일지와 시각을 맞추며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0163', 'd64d-b0a8-c591', '{"id":"person-0163","name":"Hong Yejun","title":"Will Verification Clerk","position":"Will Verification Clerk","characterId":"K162","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Will handwriting and waveform comparison verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#Person-Hong-Yejun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0163","birthDate":"2097-04-25","birthday":"04-25","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k162-will-crosscheck","name":"Will cross-checking","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k162-choice","name":"Withholds authenticity declarations","description":"She read ink smears before human words and counted one witness''s certainty as no record. Quiet, she did not rise from her seat for anything but a handwriting mismatch.","behavior":"Title: Will Verification Clerk.","stress":"Fear. That one edited fragment of voice would go out before the document ratification, and the clerk would become the procession of forgery. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Offered the clerk''s ledger to Yun Seorin''s ratification examination, moved Cha Seon''s handwriting margin by day, and took Ran Seon''s inside exposure only as sealed testimony.","effects":[]},{"id":"k162-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Will Verification Clerk. She laid handwriting and waveform overlaid in one book and covered the verification stamp with fewer than two independent testimonies.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Will Verification Clerk. She laid handwriting and waveform overlaid in one book and covered the verification stamp with fewer than two independent testimonies.","stress":"Fear. That one edited fragment of voice would go out before the document ratification, and the clerk would become the procession of forgery. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Offered the clerk''s ledger to Yun Seorin''s ratification examination, moved Cha Seon''s handwriting margin by day, and took Ran Seon''s inside exposure only as sealed testimony.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Will Verification Clerk.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51780-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K162","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51780-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d64d-b0a8-c591","name":"Namyang Hong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d64d-b0a8-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-5,"Force":-20,"Material":-25,"Communal":15,"Principle":55,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-30},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":10,"Display":-25,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Will handwriting and waveform comparison verification","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Will Verification Clerk","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −5 | Force −20 | Material −25 | Communal 15 | Principle 55 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion −25 | Transformation −30","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly −15 | Risk 10 | Display −25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: None | Union: Monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on waiting-room duty. The will-verification clerk post opened through a substitute duty shift for an unexcused absence.\n- Hong Yejun''s task of cross-checking the handwriting and waveforms of wills ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"The grade that fits a post at Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or offices among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5)·Local Administrative Assistant Director (Grade 6)·Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 7)·Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8)·Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9). Duties: Will-Verification Clerk.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Submits the clerk''s ledger to Yun Seorin''s ratification review, moves Cha Se-on''s handwriting marginalia in daylight, and accepts Ran Se-on''s internal exposé only as sealed testimony.","Ambition":"","Fear":"That an edited audio fragment goes out before the document''s ratification, making the clerk an accomplice to forgery.","Intervention":""},"biography":"Reads the carbon-paper smudge before what people say, and does not count one witness''s certainty as a record. Quiet, but if the handwriting does not match, will not rise from the seat.\n\n- Occupation: Will handwriting and waveform comparison verification\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service organization\n- Position and grade: The grade that fits a post at Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or offices among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5)·Local Administrative Assistant Director (Grade 6)·Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 7)·Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8)·Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)\n- Duties: Will-Verification Clerk\n**Life.** Grew up on waiting-room duty. The will-verification clerk post opened through a substitute duty shift for an unexcused absence.\n- Hong Yejun''s task of cross-checking the handwriting and waveforms of wills ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position and Grade.** The grade that fits a post at Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or offices among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5)·Local Administrative Assistant Director (Grade 6)·Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 7)·Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8)·Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9). Duties: Will-Verification Clerk.\n\n**Relationships.** Submits the clerk''s ledger to Yun Seorin''s ratification review, moves Cha Se-on''s handwriting marginalia in daylight, and accepts Ran Se-on''s internal exposé only as sealed testimony.\n\n**Fear.** That an edited audio fragment goes out before the document''s ratification, making the clerk an accomplice to forgery.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −5 | Force −20 | Material −25 | Communal 15 | Principle 55 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion −25 | Transformation −30\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly −15 | Risk 10 | Display −25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: None | Union: Monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Hong Yejun","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Offering the clerk''s ledger to Yun Seorin''s ratification review, and"},{"from":"Hong Yejun","type":"Contract","to":"Ranseon","basis":"Accepts Ran Se-on''s internal exposé only as sealed testimony"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ranseon","type":"Oath","to":"Hong Yejun","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0163","name":"홍예준","title":"유언 검증 서기","position":"유언 검증 서기","characterId":"K162","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"유언 필적·파형 대조 검증","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-홍예준","detailRoute":"/people/person-0163","birthDate":"2097-04-25","birthday":"04-25","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k162-will-crosscheck","name":"유언 교차검증","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k162-choice","name":"진본 선언을 보류","description":"먹지 번짐을 사람 말보다 먼저 읽고, 증인 한 명의 확신은 기록으로 치지 않는다. 조용하나 필적이 어긋나면 자리에서 일어나지 않는다.","behavior":"직함은 유언 검증 서기.","stress":"공포. 편집된 음성 한 조각이 문서 인준보다 먼저 나가 서기가 위조의 들러리가 되는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 인준 심사에 서기 원장을 바치고, 차세온의 필적 난외를 낮에 옮기며, 란세온의 내부 폭로를 봉인 증언으로만 받는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k162-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 유언 검증 서기. 필적과 파형을 같은 책에 겹쳐 두고, 독립 증언이 둘 미만이면 검증 도장을 덮는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 유언 검증 서기. 필적과 파형을 같은 책에 겹쳐 두고, 독립 증언이 둘 미만이면 검증 도장을 덮는다.","stress":"공포. 편집된 음성 한 조각이 문서 인준보다 먼저 나가 서기가 위조의 들러리가 되는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 인준 심사에 서기 원장을 바치고, 차세온의 필적 난외를 낮에 옮기며, 란세온의 내부 폭로를 봉인 증언으로만 받는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 유언 검증 서기.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51780-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K162","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51780-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d64d-b0a8-c591","name":"남양 홍씨","crest":"clan-crests/d64d-b0a8-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-5,"무력":-20,"물질":-25,"공동":15,"원칙":55,"공개":-15,"자격":20,"분산":-25,"변혁":-30},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-15,"위험":10,"과시":-25,"지속":0,"지향":"무성향","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"유언 필적·파형 대조 검증","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"유언 검증 서기","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −5 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 55 | 공개 −15 | 자격 20 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −30","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −15 | 위험 10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 유언 검증 서기 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 홍예준이 맡는 유언의 필적과 파형을 대조하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 유언 검증 서기.","일화":"","관계":"윤서린의 인준 심사에 서기 원장을 바치고, 차세온의 필적 난외를 낮에 옮기며, 란세온의 내부 폭로를 봉인 증언으로만 받는다.","야망":"","공포":"편집된 음성 한 조각이 문서 인준보다 먼저 나가 서기가 위조의 들러리가 되는 것.","개입":""},"biography":"먹지 번짐을 사람 말보다 먼저 읽고, 증인 한 명의 확신은 기록으로 치지 않는다. 조용하나 필적이 어긋나면 자리에서 일어나지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 유언 필적·파형 대조 검증\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 유언 검증 서기\n**생애.** 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 유언 검증 서기 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 홍예준이 맡는 유언의 필적과 파형을 대조하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 유언 검증 서기.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린의 인준 심사에 서기 원장을 바치고, 차세온의 필적 난외를 낮에 옮기며, 란세온의 내부 폭로를 봉인 증언으로만 받는다.\n\n**공포.** 편집된 음성 한 조각이 문서 인준보다 먼저 나가 서기가 위조의 들러리가 되는 것.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −5 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 55 | 공개 −15 | 자격 20 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −30\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −15 | 위험 10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"홍예준","type":"계약","to":"윤서린","basis":"윤서린의 인준 심사에 서기 원장을 바치고"},{"from":"홍예준","type":"계약","to":"란세온","basis":"란세온의 내부 폭로를 봉인 증언으로만 받는다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"란세온","type":"맹세","to":"홍예준","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0164', 'cd94-cd94-acc4', '{"id":"person-0164","name":"Chu Seoyun","title":"Food Exchange Witness","position":"Food Exchange Witness","characterId":"K163","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Food exchange claims and testimony comparison","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-chu-seoyun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0164","birthDate":"2069-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k163-claim-testimony","name":"Claim and testimony comparison","rating":60},{"id":"k163-bypass-operation","name":"Claim timestamp cross-checking","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k163-choice","name":"Rejects verbal extensions","description":"He counted expiry days on his fingers and sent down from the witness stand any envoy who proposed a verbal extension. He trusted numbers but not blank clauses.","behavior":"Title: Food Exchange Witness.","stress":"Fear. That testimony he signed would become a pardon for terms that starve his neighbors. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k163-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Role. No rank (ordinary citizen). Title: food exchange witness. He pasted claims and witness statements at the same hour and struck copies taken before the stamp ink dried from his testimony.","behavior":"Role. No rank (ordinary citizen). Title: food exchange witness. He pasted claims and witness statements at the same hour and struck copies taken before the stamp ink dried from his testimony.","stress":"Fear. That testimony he signed would become a pardon for terms that starve his neighbors. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Aligns claims with testimony timing and rejects verbal promises. Experience testifying in exchange disputes is recorded, but not any dispute resolution. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51790-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K163","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51790-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd94-cd94-acc4","name":"Chugye Chu Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cd94-cd94-acc4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":-20,"Force":-30,"Material":-20,"Communal":10,"Principle":70,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-20,"Transformative":-45},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":40,"Display":20,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Food exchange claims and testimony comparison","Status":"Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"None","Livelihood Role":"Food Exchange Witness","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness −20 | Force −30 | Material −20 | Communal 10 | Principle 70 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion −20 | Transformation −45","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 40 | Display 20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up in the underground dwellings near Yongsan Station. His work as food exchange witness began when he took over the midwinter exchange-post inspection duty.\n- Chu Seoyun''s task of cross-checking food exchange claims and testimony ties into the records on the Yongsan Station waiting-hall board.","Functional/Livelihood Role":"Food exchange witness. Not a government office, position, or rank.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"He fixes the end conditions of winter food exchanges through public testimony so that neither side can change its words later.","Fear":"That the testimony he signed becomes cover for a condition that starves his neighbors.","Intervention":"They can place a revised draft without the starving condition on the witness stand, or enter in the ledger the food gifts the witness received."},"biography":"Counts expiry dates on the fingers and sends envoys proposing verbal extensions down from the witness stand. Trusts numbers but not blank clauses.\n\n- Occupation: Food exchange claims and testimony comparison\n- Status: Functional/occupational role (not a government appointment)\n- Civil service position and grade: None\n- Occupational role: Food exchange witness\n**Life.** Grew up in the underground dwellings near Yongsan Station. His work as food exchange witness began when he took over the midwinter exchange-post inspection duty.\n- Chu Seoyun''s task of cross-checking food exchange claims and testimony ties into the records on the Yongsan Station waiting-hall board.\n\n**Functional/Occupational Role.** Food exchange witness. Not a government office, position, or rank.\n\n**Ambition.** He fixes the end conditions of winter food exchanges through public testimony so that neither side can change its words later.\n\n**Fear.** That the testimony he signed becomes cover for a condition that starves his neighbors.\n\n**Intervention.** They can place a revised draft without the starving condition on the witness stand, or enter in the ledger the food gifts the witness received.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness −20 | Force −30 | Material −20 | Communal 10 | Principle 70 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion −20 | Transformation −45\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 40 | Display 20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Chu Seoyun","type":"Oath","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"Backs O Seoyul''s notarization requests from the witness stand, and"},{"from":"Chu Seoyun","type":"Oath","to":"Han Jae-mok","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0164","name":"추서윤","title":"식량 교환 증언인","position":"식량 교환 증언인","characterId":"K163","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"식량 교환 청구서·증언 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-추서윤","detailRoute":"/people/person-0164","birthDate":"2069-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k163-claim-testimony","name":"청구서 증언 대조","rating":60},{"id":"k163-bypass-operation","name":"청구서 시각 대조","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k163-choice","name":"구두 연장을 거부","description":"만료일을 손가락으로 세고, 구두로 연장하자는 사신을 증인석에서 내려보낸다. 숫자는 믿되 빈칸 조항은 믿지 않는다.","behavior":"직함은 식량 교환 증언인.","stress":"공포. 자신이 서명한 증언이 이웃을 굶기는 조건의 면죄부가 되는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k163-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"역할. 직급 없음(일반 시민). 직함은 식량 교환 증언인. 청구서와 증인 진술을 같은 시각에 붙이고, 도장 잉크가 마르기 전의 사본은 증언에서 뺀다.","behavior":"역할. 직급 없음(일반 시민). 직함은 식량 교환 증언인. 청구서와 증인 진술을 같은 시각에 붙이고, 도장 잉크가 마르기 전의 사본은 증언에서 뺀다.","stress":"공포. 자신이 서명한 증언이 이웃을 굶기는 조건의 면죄부가 되는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"청구서와 증언의 시각을 맞추고 구두 약속을 배제한다. 교환 분쟁 증언 경험은 있지만 분쟁을 해결한 결과는 없다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51790-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K163","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51790-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd94-cd94-acc4","name":"추계 추씨","crest":"clan-crests/cd94-cd94-acc4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":-20,"무력":-30,"물질":-20,"공동":10,"원칙":70,"공개":-20,"자격":10,"분산":-20,"변혁":-45},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":40,"위험":40,"과시":20,"지속":-10,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"식량 교환 청구서·증언 대조","지위":"기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)","공무원 직위·직급":"없음","생업 역할":"식량 교환 증언인","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 70 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 −45","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 40 | 위험 40 | 과시 20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"용산역 부근 지하 거주 구역에서 자랐다. 식량 교환 증언인 일은 한겨울 교환소 점검 당번을 이어받으며 시작됐다.\n- 추서윤이 식량 교환 청구서와 증언을 대조하는 일은 용산역 대합실 게시판의 기록과 이어진다.","기능·생업 역할":"식량 교환 증언인. 정부 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"겨울 식량 교환의 종료 조건을 공개 증언으로 고정해, 어느 쪽도 나중에 말을 바꾸지 못하게 한다.","공포":"자신이 서명한 증언이 이웃을 굶기는 조건의 면죄부가 되는 것.","개입":"이웃을 굶기는 조건을 뺀 수정본을 증인석에 올리거나, 증인이 받은 식량 사례를 장부에 올릴 수 있다."},"biography":"만료일을 손가락으로 세고, 구두로 연장하자는 사신을 증인석에서 내려보낸다. 숫자는 믿되 빈칸 조항은 믿지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 식량 교환 청구서·증언 대조\n- 지위: 기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)\n- 공무원 직위·직급: 없음\n- 생업 역할: 식량 교환 증언인\n**생애.** 용산역 부근 지하 거주 구역에서 자랐다. 식량 교환 증언인 일은 한겨울 교환소 점검 당번을 이어받으며 시작됐다.\n- 추서윤이 식량 교환 청구서와 증언을 대조하는 일은 용산역 대합실 게시판의 기록과 이어진다.\n\n**기능·생업 역할.** 식량 교환 증언인. 정부 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.\n\n**야망.** 겨울 식량 교환의 종료 조건을 공개 증언으로 고정해, 어느 쪽도 나중에 말을 바꾸지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 자신이 서명한 증언이 이웃을 굶기는 조건의 면죄부가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 이웃을 굶기는 조건을 뺀 수정본을 증인석에 올리거나, 증인이 받은 식량 사례를 장부에 올릴 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 70 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 −45\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 40 | 위험 40 | 과시 20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"추서윤","type":"맹세","to":"오서율","basis":"오서율의 공증 청구를 증인석에서 받치고"},{"from":"추서윤","type":"맹세","to":"한재목","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0165', 'c5b4-d568-c885', '{"id":"person-0165","name":"Eo Taesan","title":"Ratification Custodian","position":"Ratification Custodian","characterId":"K164","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Management of ratification dates and post-hoc endorsement witnesses","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-eo-taesan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0165","birthDate":"2084-08-24","birthday":"08-24","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k164-approval-date-check","name":"Approval date checking","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k164-choice","name":"Ratification Custodian","description":"She kept her manners but never forgave a hand that changed a date.","behavior":"Title: Ratification Custodian.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Matched the humidity and custody cycles with Jo Harin''s iron box.","effects":[]},{"id":"k164-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Ratification Custodian.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Ratification Custodian.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Matched the humidity and custody cycles with Jo Harin''s iron box.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Protecting dates and originals establishes no international political career. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51800-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K164","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51800-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5b4-d568-c885","name":"Eo Clan of Hamjong","crest":"clan-crests/c5b4-d568-c885.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-15,"Force":-40,"Material":-25,"Communal":0,"Principle":65,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-35},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-40,"Display":20,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Management of ratification dates and post-hoc endorsement witnesses","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Ratification Custodian","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −15 | Force −40 | Material −25 | Communal 0 | Principle 65 | Publicity −20 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −35","Desires":"Yearning 25 | Exclusivity −30 | Risk −40 | Display 20 | Persistence 0 | Orientation None | Bonding Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up in the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Ratification Custodian opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Managing Eo Taesan''s ratification dates and after-the-fact endorsement witnesses connects with the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"The grade that fits a post in a headquarters or field office of the Seoul Metropolitan Government, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Secretary (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Secretary (Grade 9). Duties: Ratification Custodian.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Matches the humidity and storage cycle of Jo Harin''s iron chest.","Ambition":"To keep original ratifications valid only in the Seoul Station chest, so that the government''s ratification cannot be sold off through after-the-fact sealing.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can disclose the folded list to expose the debts."},"biography":"Courteous, but never forgiving of a hand that alters dates.\n\n- Livelihood: Management of ratification dates and post-hoc endorsement witnesses\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position and Grade: The grade that fits a post in a headquarters or field office of the Seoul Metropolitan Government, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Secretary (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Secretary (Grade 9)\n- Duties: Ratification Custodian\n**Life.** Grew up in the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Ratification Custodian opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Managing Eo Taesan''s ratification dates and after-the-fact endorsement witnesses connects with the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position and Grade.** The grade that fits a post in a headquarters or field office of the Seoul Metropolitan Government, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Secretary (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Secretary (Grade 9). Duties: Ratification Custodian.\n**Relationships.** Matches the humidity and storage cycle of Jo Harin''s iron chest.\n\n**Ambition.** To keep original ratifications valid only in the Seoul Station chest, so that the government''s ratification cannot be sold off through after-the-fact sealing.\n\n**Intervention.** Can disclose the folded list to expose the debts.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −15 | Force −40 | Material −25 | Communal 0 | Principle 65 | Publicity −20 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −35\n- Desires: Yearning 25 | Exclusivity −30 | Risk −40 | Display 20 | Persistence 0 | Orientation None | Bonding Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Eo Taesan","type":"Contract","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"matches the humidity and storage cycle of Jo Harin''s iron chest, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Min Sihyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Eo Taesan","basis":"Min Sihyeon takes the signature on the ledger where the double payment was corrected, along with the related ratification records, to Eo Taesan. Eo Taesan finds the ratification dates written on the wall and the stored originals to verify the dates, and if an after-the-fact endorsement is needed, summons the two witnesses of that time again so that no blank is covered over with retroactive sealing."},{"from":"Jo Saejun","type":"Contract","to":"Eo Taesan","basis":"Jo Saejun takes a transcript of the water-soaked ratification document, together with the original, to Eo Taesan. Eo Taesan finds the stored ratification date to confirm the smudged date, but does not retroactively alter the date on the late-arriving copy."},{"from":"Gwon Supyun","type":"Contract","to":"Eo Taesan","basis":"Gwon Supyun takes the signature that corrected a double payment, along with the related ratification records, to Eo Taesan. Eo Taesan checks the dates and witnesses on the stored originals to find where the same ratification became the basis for payment again under a different date."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0165","name":"어태산","title":"인준 보관인","position":"인준 보관인","characterId":"K164","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"인준일·사후 추인 증인 관리","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-어태산","detailRoute":"/people/person-0165","birthDate":"2084-08-24","birthday":"08-24","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k164-approval-date-check","name":"인준일 확인","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k164-choice","name":"인준 보관인","description":"예의는 지키되 날짜를 고치는 손은 용서하지 않는다.","behavior":"직함은 인준 보관인.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 조하린의 철제 함 습도와 보관 주기를 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k164-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 인준 보관인.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 인준 보관인.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 조하린의 철제 함 습도와 보관 주기를 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"원본과 날짜를 지키되 국제 정치 경력은 부여하지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51800-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K164","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51800-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5b4-d568-c885","name":"함종 어씨","crest":"clan-crests/c5b4-d568-c885.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-15,"무력":-40,"물질":-25,"공동":0,"원칙":65,"공개":-20,"자격":10,"분산":-30,"변혁":-35},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-30,"위험":-40,"과시":20,"지속":0,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"인준일·사후 추인 증인 관리","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"인준 보관인","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −25 | 공동 0 | 원칙 65 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −35","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −40 | 과시 20 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 인준 보관인 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 어태산의 인준일과 사후 추인 증인을 관리하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 인준 보관인.","일화":"","관계":"조하린의 철제 함 습도와 보관 주기를 맞춘다.","야망":"인준 원본을 서울역 함에만 유효하게 남겨 정부의 인준이 사후 날인으로 팔리지 않게 한다.","공포":"","개입":"접힌 목록을 공개해 빚을 드러낼 수 있다."},"biography":"예의는 지키되 날짜를 고치는 손은 용서하지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 인준일·사후 추인 증인 관리\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 인준 보관인\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 인준 보관인 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 어태산의 인준일과 사후 추인 증인을 관리하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 인준 보관인.\n\n**관계.** 조하린의 철제 함 습도와 보관 주기를 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 인준 원본을 서울역 함에만 유효하게 남겨 정부의 인준이 사후 날인으로 팔리지 않게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 접힌 목록을 공개해 빚을 드러낼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −25 | 공동 0 | 원칙 65 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −35\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −40 | 과시 20 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"어태산","type":"계약","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 철제 함 습도와 보관 주기를 맞추며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"민시현","type":"계약","to":"어태산","basis":"민시현은 이중 지급을 고친 장부의 서명과 관련 인준 기록을 어태산에게 가져간다. 어태산은 벽에 적힌 인준일과 보관 원본을 찾아 날짜를 확인하고, 사후 추인이 필요하면 당시 증인 두 명을 다시 불러 소급 날인으로 빈칸을 덮지 않게 한다."},{"from":"조새준","type":"계약","to":"어태산","basis":"조새준은 젖은 인준 문서의 필사본을 원본과 함께 어태산에게 가져간다. 어태산은 보관한 인준일을 찾아 지워진 날짜를 확인하되 늦게 온 사본의 날짜를 소급해 고치지 않는다."},{"from":"권숲윤","type":"계약","to":"어태산","basis":"권숲윤은 이중 지급을 바로잡은 서명과 관련 인준 기록을 어태산에게 가져간다. 어태산은 보관 원본의 날짜와 증인을 확인해 같은 인준이 다른 날짜로 다시 지급 근거가 된 곳을 찾는다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0166', 'creative-b780-b3c4-bd09', '{"id":"person-0166","name":"Ran Jiho","title":"Meritorious Subject Reward Roster Party","position":"Meritorious Subject Reward Roster Party","characterId":"K165","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Reconciling Meritorious Subject Reward Copies and Ration Tickets","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-ranjiho","detailRoute":"/people/person-0166","birthDate":"2095-07-21","birthday":"07-21","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k165-reward-comparison","name":"Reward copy comparison","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k165-choice","name":"Requires claimant attendance","description":"He could not forget the winter he received office and ration rights written on one line, and when the hereditary column stood empty he did not lower his voice. Mercy and anger breathed in the same rhythm.","behavior":"Anecdote. The evening check shows a name added to the hereditary box of the merit-compensation copy without the holder present. Ran Jiho files an objection to Yun Seorin''s custody of the merit roll and, before that copy reaches Ma Eungyeol''s auction table, rechecks their own name at Seol Dahuin''s concourse window.","stress":"Fear. That after his name was erased from the roster the stamp would remain, and he would become the guarantor of an office he no longer held. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Left an objection against Yun Seorin''s custody of the merit registry, hoped his own office would not become an item at Ma Eungyeol''s copy auction, and sought to raise his name again at Seol Dahyin''s concourse window.","effects":[]},{"id":"k165-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Meritorious Subject Reward Roster Party. He compared the compensation copies with the actual ration tables every evening and blocked hereditary add-ons from being written without the holder''s attendance.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Meritorious Subject Reward Roster Party. He compared the compensation copies with the actual ration tables every evening and blocked hereditary add-ons from being written without the holder''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That after his name was erased from the roster the stamp would remain, and he would become the guarantor of an office he no longer held. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Left an objection against Yun Seorin''s custody of the merit registry, hoped his own office would not become an item at Ma Eungyeol''s copy auction, and sought to raise his name again at Seol Dahyin''s concourse window.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Anecdote. The evening check shows a name added to the hereditary box of the merit-compensation copy without the holder present. Ran Jiho files an objection to Yun Seorin''s custody of the merit roll and, before that copy reaches Ma Eungyeol''s auction table, rechecks their own name at Seol Dahuin''s concourse window. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41360-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K165","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41360-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"creative-b780-b3c4-bd09","name":"Ran Clan of Dobong","crest":"clan-crests/creative-b780-b3c4-bd09.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":25,"Openness":-15,"Force":-20,"Material":-25,"Communal":15,"Principle":55,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-45},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-30,"Display":20,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Reconciling Meritorious Subject Reward Copies and Ration Tickets","Status":"Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"None","Livelihood Role":"Meritorious Subject Reward Roster Party","Values":"Authority 25 | Openness −15 | Force −20 | Material −25 | Communal 15 | Principle 55 | Publicity −15 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −45","Desires":"Yearning 45 | Exclusivity −10 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up in the Bogungmun refugee camp. The seat as party to the Meritorious Subject Reward Register opened through the orphan-register citizenship line.\n- Cross-checking Ran Jiho''s meritorious Subject reward copy against ration tickets connects with the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Functional/Livelihood Role":"Party to the Meritorious Subject Reward Register. Not an office, position, or grade in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government civil service.","Anecdote":"During the evening cross-check, it comes to light that a name has been added to the hereditary column of the meritorious Subject reward copy without the person attending. Ran Jiho files an objection to Yun Seorin''s custody of the Merit Roll, and before that copy goes up on Ma Eungyeol''s auction block, confirms their own name again at Seol Dahin''s waiting-room window.","Relationships":"Leaves an objection to Yun Seorin''s custody of the Merit Roll, hopes their title will not become a commodity at Ma Eungyeol''s copy auction, and tries to have their name entered again at Seol Dahin''s waiting-room window.","Ambition":"To reclaim from the Records Office ledger the ration columns that were cut for the sake of meritorious Subject rewards, so that the founding rewards do not remain only as the share of the inner guard.","Fear":"Even after the name is struck from the register, the seal remains, and the person becomes the guarantor of a title they no longer hold.","Intervention":"Can bring in a witness to fill an empty register slot, or erase the hereditary column to rescue the person from the ledger."},"biography":"Cannot forget the winter when office and ration rights were handed over written on a single line, and does not lower their voice when the hereditary column is empty. Mercy and anger come out in a single breath.\n\n- Livelihood: Reconciling Meritorious Subject Reward Copies and Ration Tickets\n- Status: Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)\n- Civil Servant Position and Grade: None\n- Livelihood Role: Meritorious Subject Reward Roster Party\n**Life.** Grew up in the Bogungmun refugee camp. The seat as party to the Meritorious Subject Reward Register opened through the orphan-register citizenship line.\n- Cross-checking Ran Jiho''s meritorious Subject reward copy against ration tickets connects with the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Functional/livelihood role.** Party to the Meritorious Subject Reward Register. Not an office, position, or grade in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government civil service.\n\n**Anecdote.** During the evening cross-check, it comes to light that a name has been added to the hereditary column of the meritorious Subject reward copy without the person attending. Ran Jiho files an objection to Yun Seorin''s custody of the Merit Roll, and before that copy goes up on Ma Eungyeol''s auction block, confirms their own name again at Seol Dahin''s waiting-room window.\n\n**Relationships.** Leaves an objection to Yun Seorin''s custody of the Merit Roll, hopes their title will not become a commodity at Ma Eungyeol''s copy auction, and tries to have their name entered again at Seol Dahin''s waiting-room window.\n\n**Ambition.** To reclaim from the Records Office ledger the ration columns that were cut for the sake of meritorious Subject rewards, so that the founding rewards do not remain only as the share of the inner guard.\n\n**Fear.** Even after the name is struck from the register, the seal remains, and the person becomes the guarantor of a title they no longer hold.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in a witness to fill an empty register slot, or erase the hereditary column to rescue the person from the ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 25 | Openness −15 | Force −20 | Materialism −25 | Community 15 | Principle 55 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −45\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation same-sex | Bonding polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ran Jiho","type":"Contract","to":"Ma Eungyeol","basis":"Hoping his rank will not become a commodity in Ma Eungyeol''s copy auction"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0166","name":"란지호","title":"공신 보상 명부 당사자","position":"공신 보상 명부 당사자","characterId":"K165","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"공신 보상 사본·배급표 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-란지호","detailRoute":"/people/person-0166","birthDate":"2095-07-21","birthday":"07-21","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k165-reward-comparison","name":"보상 사본 대조","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k165-choice","name":"당사자 출석 요구","description":"관직과 배급권을 한 줄에 적힌 채 받은 겨울을 잊지 못하고, 세습 칸이 비면 목소리를 낮추지 않는다. 자비와 분노를 한 호흡에 낸다.","behavior":"일화. 저녁 대조에서 공신 보상 사본의 세습 칸에 본인 출석 없이 이름 하나가 더해진 것이 드러난다. 란지호는 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 적어 올리고, 그 사본이 마은결의 경매대에 오르기 전에 설다흰의 대합실 창구에서 자기 이름을 다시 확인한다.","stress":"공포. 명부에서 이름이 지워진 뒤에도 도장이 남아 자신이 없는 관작의 보증인이 되는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 남기고, 마은결의 사본 경매에서 자신의 관작이 물건이 되지 않기를 바라며, 설다흰의 대합실 창구에 이름을 다시 올리려 한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k165-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 공신 보상 명부 당사자. 보상 사본과 실제 배급표를 저녁마다 대조하고, 세습 추가는 본인 출석 없이 적지 못하게 막는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 공신 보상 명부 당사자. 보상 사본과 실제 배급표를 저녁마다 대조하고, 세습 추가는 본인 출석 없이 적지 못하게 막는다.","stress":"공포. 명부에서 이름이 지워진 뒤에도 도장이 남아 자신이 없는 관작의 보증인이 되는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 남기고, 마은결의 사본 경매에서 자신의 관작이 물건이 되지 않기를 바라며, 설다흰의 대합실 창구에 이름을 다시 올리려 한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일화. 저녁 대조에서 공신 보상 사본의 세습 칸에 본인 출석 없이 이름 하나가 더해진 것이 드러난다. 란지호는 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 적어 올리고, 그 사본이 마은결의 경매대에 오르기 전에 설다흰의 대합실 창구에서 자기 이름을 다시 확인한다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41360-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K165","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41360-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"creative-b780-b3c4-bd09","name":"도봉 란씨","crest":"clan-crests/creative-b780-b3c4-bd09.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":25,"개방":-15,"무력":-20,"물질":-25,"공동":15,"원칙":55,"공개":-15,"자격":10,"분산":-25,"변혁":-45},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-10,"위험":-30,"과시":20,"지속":-15,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"공신 보상 사본·배급표 대조","지위":"기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)","공무원 직위·직급":"없음","생업 역할":"공신 보상 명부 당사자","가치관":"권위 25 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 55 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −45","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"보국문 피난 막사에서 자랐다. 공신 보상 명부 당사자 자리는 고아 명부 시민권 줄로 열렸다.\n- 란지호의 공신 보상 사본과 배급표를 대조하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","기능·생업 역할":"공신 보상 명부 당사자. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.","일화":"저녁 대조에서 공신 보상 사본의 세습 칸에 본인 출석 없이 이름 하나가 더해진 것이 드러난다. 란지호는 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 적어 올리고, 그 사본이 마은결의 경매대에 오르기 전에 설다흰의 대합실 창구에서 자기 이름을 다시 확인한다.","관계":"윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 남기고, 마은결의 사본 경매에서 자신의 관작이 물건이 되지 않기를 바라며, 설다흰의 대합실 창구에 이름을 다시 올리려 한다.","야망":"공신 보상에 깎인 배급 칸을 기록청 원장에서 되찾아 창건 보상이 친위 몫으로만 남지 않게 한다.","공포":"명부에서 이름이 지워진 뒤에도 도장이 남아 자신이 없는 관작의 보증인이 되는 것.","개입":"빈 명부 칸을 채울 증인을 데려오거나, 세습 칸을 지워 당사자를 원장에서 구출할 수 있다."},"biography":"관직과 배급권을 한 줄에 적힌 채 받은 겨울을 잊지 못하고, 세습 칸이 비면 목소리를 낮추지 않는다. 자비와 분노를 한 호흡에 낸다.\n\n- 생업: 공신 보상 사본·배급표 대조\n- 지위: 기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)\n- 공무원 직위·직급: 없음\n- 생업 역할: 공신 보상 명부 당사자\n**생애.** 보국문 피난 막사에서 자랐다. 공신 보상 명부 당사자 자리는 고아 명부 시민권 줄로 열렸다.\n- 란지호의 공신 보상 사본과 배급표를 대조하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**기능·생업 역할.** 공신 보상 명부 당사자. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.\n\n**일화.** 저녁 대조에서 공신 보상 사본의 세습 칸에 본인 출석 없이 이름 하나가 더해진 것이 드러난다. 란지호는 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 적어 올리고, 그 사본이 마은결의 경매대에 오르기 전에 설다흰의 대합실 창구에서 자기 이름을 다시 확인한다.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 남기고, 마은결의 사본 경매에서 자신의 관작이 물건이 되지 않기를 바라며, 설다흰의 대합실 창구에 이름을 다시 올리려 한다.\n\n**야망.** 공신 보상에 깎인 배급 칸을 기록청 원장에서 되찾아 창건 보상이 친위 몫으로만 남지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 명부에서 이름이 지워진 뒤에도 도장이 남아 자신이 없는 관작의 보증인이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 빈 명부 칸을 채울 증인을 데려오거나, 세습 칸을 지워 당사자를 원장에서 구출할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 25 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 55 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −45\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"란지호","type":"계약","to":"마은결","basis":"마은결의 사본 경매에서 자신의 관작이 물건이 되지 않기를 바라며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0167', 'c12d-acbd-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0167","name":"Seop Do-yun","title":"Government Council Record Courier of the Government","position":"Government of the Republic of Korea Council Records Courier","characterId":"K166","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Delivering Council Messages and Confirming Testimony","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#character-seop-doyun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0167","birthDate":"2089-11-29","birthday":"11-29","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k166-meeting-delivery","name":"Meeting dispatch delivery","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k166-choice","name":"Witnesses before rumor","description":"She confirmed council hours before the seals and stood at the door any envoy who tried to turn a verbal agreement into a dispatch. Short of breath or not, she carried two copies.","behavior":"Title: Government Council Record Courier of the Government.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Split order with Yang Haeon''s ratification dispatches.","effects":[]},{"id":"k166-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Government of the Republic of Korea Council Records Courier. She sent the dispatches to the Record Bureau and the council hall at once and raised assassination or bribery rumors into the ledger without witnesses never.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Government of the Republic of Korea Council Records Courier. She sent the dispatches to the Record Bureau and the council hall at once and raised assassination or bribery rumors into the ledger without witnesses never.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Split order with Yang Haeon''s ratification dispatches.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Government Council Record Courier of the Government.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51810-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K166","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51810-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c12d-acbd-c8fc","name":"Gyeongju Seop Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c12d-acbd-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":25,"Openness":10,"Force":-25,"Material":-35,"Communal":15,"Principle":75,"Public":-5,"Eligibility":5,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":20,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-40,"Display":10,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Delivering Council Messages and Confirming Testimony","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Government Council Record Courier of the Government","Values":"Authority 25 | Openness 10 | Force −25 | Materialism −35 | Community 15 | Principle 75 | Publicity −5 | Qualification 5 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 20 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −40 | Display 10 | Persistence 20 | Orientation bisexual | Bonding none"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Council Record Courier in the Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service opened through the deletion of a line in a double ledger.\n- Seop Doyun''s work of delivering council messages and witness confirmations is tied to the duties of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A grade among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 6), Assistant Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Registrar (Grade 8), and Assistant Local Administrative Registrar (Grade 9) suited to a post at a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office. Duties: Government Council Record Courier of the Government.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Shares turns with Yang Haeon''s ratification messages.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can expose the locked note, or escort a Joint Charter witness to protect the courier ledger."},"biography":"Checks the time of the council before the seal, and stands at the door any envoy who tries to turn a verbal agreement into a message. Even out of breath, there are always two copies.\n\n- Livelihood: Delivering Council Messages and Confirming Testimony\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Post/grade: A grade among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 6), Assistant Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Registrar (Grade 8), and Assistant Local Administrative Registrar (Grade 9) suited to a post at a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office\n- Duties: Government Council Record Courier of the Government\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Council Record Courier in the Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service opened through the deletion of a line in a double ledger.\n- Seop Doyun''s work of delivering council messages and witness confirmations is tied to the duties of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil service post/grade.** A grade among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 6), Assistant Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Registrar (Grade 8), and Assistant Local Administrative Registrar (Grade 9) suited to a post at a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office. Duties: Government Council Record Courier of the Government.\n\n**Relationships.** Shares turns with Yang Haeon''s ratification messages.\n\n**Intervention.** Can expose the locked note, or escort a Joint Charter witness to protect the courier ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 25 | Openness 10 | Force −25 | Materialism −35 | Community 15 | Principle 75 | Publicity −5 | Qualification 5 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 20 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −40 | Display 10 | Persistence 20 | Orientation bisexual | Bonding none\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seop Do-yun","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Yura","basis":""},{"from":"Seop Do-yun","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"Splits turn order with Yang Haeon''s approval messages"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Yang Seohyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Seop Do-yun","basis":"Yang Seohyeon passes to Seop Doyun a copy reporting the collapse and closure of flooded sections. Seop Doyun sends that copy to the Records Office and the council hall together, so that news of the closure does not remain on one side only and an escort does not enter a dangerous section."},{"from":"No Jua","type":"Contract","to":"Seop Do-yun","basis":"When No Jua finds a train missing its dispatch schedule or departure signature, he hands the copy to Seop Doyun. Seop Doyun delivers the omission to the Records Office and the council hall together, so that an unsigned departure is not mixed into the official messages on the strength of one side''s verbal confirmation alone."},{"from":"Min Yeon-u","type":"Contract","to":"Seop Do-yun","basis":"Min Yeonu passes to Seop Doyun the escort casualty ledger and copy taken from the raid. Seop Doyun sends the news to the Records Office and the council hall along with testimony to confirm the missing personnel, so that escort losses are not conveyed merely as cargo figures."},{"from":"Bak Ha-yun","type":"Contract","to":"Seop Do-yun","basis":"Bak Hayun passes to Seop Doyun the casualty ledger and copy that was protected during the escort. Seop Doyun conveys them to the Records Office and the council hall along with confirming testimony, so that human losses do not remain merely as cargo figures."},{"from":"Chu Uchan","type":"Contract","to":"Seop Do-yun","basis":"Lines up with Seop Doyun''s courier copy"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0167","name":"섭도윤","title":"정부 회의 기록 전령","position":"대한민국정부 회의 기록 전령","characterId":"K166","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"회의 전갈·증언 확인 전달","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-섭도윤","detailRoute":"/people/person-0167","birthDate":"2089-11-29","birthday":"11-29","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k166-meeting-delivery","name":"회의 전갈 전달","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k166-choice","name":"소문보다 증인","description":"회의 시각을 봉인보다 먼저 확인하고, 구두 합의를 전갈로 바꾸려는 사신을 문 앞에 세운다. 숨이 차도 사본은 두 장이다.","behavior":"직함은 정부 회의 기록 전령.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 양해온의 인준 전갈과 순번을 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k166-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 정부 회의 기록 전령. 전갈을 기록청과 회의장에 동시에 보내고, 암살·매수 소문은 증인 없이 원장에 올리지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 정부 회의 기록 전령. 전갈을 기록청과 회의장에 동시에 보내고, 암살·매수 소문은 증인 없이 원장에 올리지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 양해온의 인준 전갈과 순번을 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 정부 회의 기록 전령.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51810-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K166","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51810-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c12d-acbd-c8fc","name":"경주 섭씨","crest":"clan-crests/c12d-acbd-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":25,"개방":10,"무력":-25,"물질":-35,"공동":15,"원칙":75,"공개":-5,"자격":5,"분산":-25,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":20,"독점":-10,"위험":-40,"과시":10,"지속":20,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"회의 전갈·증언 확인 전달","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"정부 회의 기록 전령","가치관":"권위 25 | 개방 10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −35 | 공동 15 | 원칙 75 | 공개 −5 | 자격 5 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 20 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −40 | 과시 10 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직 회의 기록 전령 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 섭도윤의 회의 전갈과 증언 확인을 전하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 정부 회의 기록 전령.","일화":"","관계":"양해온의 인준 전갈과 순번을 나눈다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"잠긴 쪽지를 폭로하거나, 공동헌장 증인을 호송해 전령 원장을 지킬 수 있다."},"biography":"회의 시각을 봉인보다 먼저 확인하고, 구두 합의를 전갈로 바꾸려는 사신을 문 앞에 세운다. 숨이 차도 사본은 두 장이다.\n\n- 생업: 회의 전갈·증언 확인 전달\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 정부 회의 기록 전령\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직 회의 기록 전령 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 섭도윤의 회의 전갈과 증언 확인을 전하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 정부 회의 기록 전령.\n\n**관계.** 양해온의 인준 전갈과 순번을 나눈다.\n\n**개입.** 잠긴 쪽지를 폭로하거나, 공동헌장 증인을 호송해 전령 원장을 지킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 25 | 개방 10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −35 | 공동 15 | 원칙 75 | 공개 −5 | 자격 5 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 20 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −40 | 과시 10 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"섭도윤","type":"계약","to":"정유라","basis":""},{"from":"섭도윤","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"양해온의 인준 전갈과 순번을 나누며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"양서현","type":"계약","to":"섭도윤","basis":"양서현은 침수 구간의 붕괴와 폐쇄를 보고한 사본을 섭도윤에게 전달한다. 섭도윤은 그 사본을 기록청과 회의장에 함께 보내, 폐쇄 소식이 한쪽에만 남아 호송이 위험한 구간으로 들어가는 일을 막는다."},{"from":"노주아","type":"계약","to":"섭도윤","basis":"노주아는 배차표나 출발 서명이 빠진 열차를 발견하면 그 사본을 섭도윤에게 넘긴다. 섭도윤은 누락 내용을 기록청과 회의장에 함께 전달해, 한쪽의 구두 확인만으로 서명 없는 출발이 정식 전갈에 섞이지 않게 한다."},{"from":"민연우","type":"계약","to":"섭도윤","basis":"민연우는 습격에서 챙긴 호송 인명 장부와 사본을 섭도윤에게 전달한다. 섭도윤은 인원 누락을 확인할 증언과 함께 기록청과 회의장에 소식을 보내, 호송 손실이 화물 숫자로만 전해지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"박하윤","type":"계약","to":"섭도윤","basis":"박하윤은 호송에서 지킨 인명 장부와 사본을 섭도윤에게 전달한다. 섭도윤은 확인 증언과 함께 기록청·회의장에 전해 인명 손실이 화물 숫자로만 남지 않게 한다."},{"from":"추우찬","type":"계약","to":"섭도윤","basis":"섭도윤의 전령 사본과 줄을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0168', 'd3c9-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0168","name":"Pyeong Ye-jun","title":"Emergency Powers Return Witness","position":"Emergency Powers Return Witness","characterId":"K167","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Recording the Time and Jurisdiction of Emergency Powers Return","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#character-pyeong-yejun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0168","birthDate":"2079-09-13","birthday":"09-13","age":47,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k167-authority-return-log","name":"Emergency authority return logging","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k167-choice","name":"Preserves testimony context","description":"He still heard the stamp sounds of the Great Blackout night and could not bear speech that called unreturned emergency powers legitimacy. The longer the silence, the shorter the testimony.","behavior":"Title: Emergency Powers Return Witness.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Offered the Great Blackout logs to Yun Seorin''s cross-verification, matched hours with Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation logs, and made Ji Hansol''s box sealing hour the anchor of his testimony.","effects":[]},{"id":"k167-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Emergency Powers Return Witness. He wrote the return hours and the unreturned jurisdictions on one chalkboard and accepted later corrections only with the two duty hands of the day signing again.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Emergency Powers Return Witness. He wrote the return hours and the unreturned jurisdictions on one chalkboard and accepted later corrections only with the two duty hands of the day signing again.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Offered the Great Blackout logs to Yun Seorin''s cross-verification, matched hours with Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation logs, and made Ji Hansol''s box sealing hour the anchor of his testimony.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Emergency Powers Return Witness.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41250-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K167","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41250-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d3c9-cda9-c8fc","name":"Chungju Pyeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d3c9-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-10,"Force":-35,"Material":-30,"Communal":0,"Principle":50,"Public":-25,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-45},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":40,"Display":20,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Recording the Time and Jurisdiction of Emergency Powers Return","Status":"Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"None","Livelihood Role":"Emergency Powers Return Witness","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −35 | Materialism −30 | Community 0 | Principle 50 | Publicity −25 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −45","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly 35 | Risk 40 | Display 20 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Bisexual | Bonding: Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post of Emergency Authority Return Witness opened up through a substitute duty for an unauthorized shift absence.\n- Recording Pyeong Yejun''s emergency authority return times and unreturned jurisdictions connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Functional/Livelihood Role":"Emergency Authority Return Witness. Not an office, post, or grade in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Offers the Great Blackout log to Yun Seorin''s cross-verification, matches times against Na Bomgyeol''s emergency power-generation log, and uses the sealing time of Ji Hansol''s box as the anchor of the testimony.","Ambition":"By leaving public testimony on who returned emergency authority on the day of the Collapse, keeps disputes over orthodox legitimacy from growing as mere rumor.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can publish the list of unreturned jurisdictions, or recover severed fragments of testimony to protect the witness."},"biography":"Cannot stand it when unreturned emergency authority is called orthodox legitimacy. The longer the silence, the shorter the testimony.\n\n- Livelihood: Recording the Time and Jurisdiction of Emergency Powers Return\n- Status: Functional/livelihood role (not a government appointment)\n- Civil servant post/grade: None\n- Livelihood role: Emergency Authority Return Witness\n**Life.** Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post of Emergency Authority Return Witness opened up through a substitute duty for an unauthorized shift absence.\n- Recording Pyeong Yejun''s emergency authority return times and unreturned jurisdictions connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Functional/livelihood role.** Emergency Authority Return Witness. Not an office, post, or grade in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government.\n\n**Relationships.** Offers the Great Blackout log to Yun Seorin''s cross-verification, matches times against Na Bomgyeol''s emergency power-generation log, and uses the sealing time of Ji Hansol''s box as the anchor of the testimony.\n\n**Ambition.** By leaving public testimony on who returned emergency authority on the day of the Collapse, keeps disputes over orthodox legitimacy from growing as mere rumor.\n\n**Intervention.** Can publish the list of unreturned jurisdictions, or recover severed fragments of testimony to protect the witness.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −35 | Materialism −30 | Community 0 | Principle 50 | Publicity −25 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −45\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly 35 | Risk 40 | Display 20 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Bisexual | Bonding: Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Pyeong Ye-jun","type":"Oath","to":"Na Bomgyeol","basis":"Syncing the time with Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation log"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0168","name":"평예준","title":"비상권한 반환 증인","position":"비상권한 반환 증인","characterId":"K167","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"비상권한 반환 시각·관할 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-평예준","detailRoute":"/people/person-0168","birthDate":"2079-09-13","birthday":"09-13","age":47,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k167-authority-return-log","name":"비상권한 반환 기록","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k167-choice","name":"증언의 맥락 보전","description":"대정전 밤의 도장 소리를 아직도 듣고, 반환하지 않은 비상권한을 법통이라고 부르는 말을 참지 못한다. 침묵이 길수록 증언은 짧다.","behavior":"직함은 비상권한 반환 증인.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 교차검증에 대정전 일지를 바치고, 나봄결의 비상 발전 일지와 시각을 맞추며, 지한솔의 함 봉인 시각을 증언의 닻으로 삼는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k167-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 비상권한 반환 증인. 반환 시각과 미반환 관할을 같은 칠판에 적고, 후일 수정은 당시 당직 두 명의 재서명만 받는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 비상권한 반환 증인. 반환 시각과 미반환 관할을 같은 칠판에 적고, 후일 수정은 당시 당직 두 명의 재서명만 받는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 교차검증에 대정전 일지를 바치고, 나봄결의 비상 발전 일지와 시각을 맞추며, 지한솔의 함 봉인 시각을 증언의 닻으로 삼는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 비상권한 반환 증인.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41250-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K167","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41250-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d3c9-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 평씨","crest":"clan-crests/d3c9-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-10,"무력":-35,"물질":-30,"공동":0,"원칙":50,"공개":-25,"자격":10,"분산":-40,"변혁":-45},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":35,"위험":40,"과시":20,"지속":0,"지향":"양성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"비상권한 반환 시각·관할 기록","지위":"기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)","공무원 직위·직급":"없음","생업 역할":"비상권한 반환 증인","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −30 | 공동 0 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −25 | 자격 10 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −45","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 35 | 위험 40 | 과시 20 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 비상권한 반환 증인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 평예준의 비상권한 반환 시각과 미반환 관할을 기록하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","기능·생업 역할":"비상권한 반환 증인. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.","일화":"","관계":"윤서린의 교차검증에 대정전 일지를 바치고, 나봄결의 비상 발전 일지와 시각을 맞추며, 지한솔의 함 봉인 시각을 증언의 닻으로 삼는다.","야망":"붕괴 당일 누가 비상권한을 돌려놓았는지를 공개 증언으로 남겨 법통 다툼이 소문으로만 커지지 않게 한다.","공포":"","개입":"미반환 관할 목록을 공개하거나, 잘린 증언 조각을 되찾아 증인을 보호할 수 있다."},"biography":"반환하지 않은 비상권한을 법통이라고 부르는 말을 참지 못한다. 침묵이 길수록 증언은 짧다.\n\n- 생업: 비상권한 반환 시각·관할 기록\n- 지위: 기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)\n- 공무원 직위·직급: 없음\n- 생업 역할: 비상권한 반환 증인\n**생애.** 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 비상권한 반환 증인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 평예준의 비상권한 반환 시각과 미반환 관할을 기록하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**기능·생업 역할.** 비상권한 반환 증인. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린의 교차검증에 대정전 일지를 바치고, 나봄결의 비상 발전 일지와 시각을 맞추며, 지한솔의 함 봉인 시각을 증언의 닻으로 삼는다.\n\n**야망.** 붕괴 당일 누가 비상권한을 돌려놓았는지를 공개 증언으로 남겨 법통 다툼이 소문으로만 커지지 않게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 미반환 관할 목록을 공개하거나, 잘린 증언 조각을 되찾아 증인을 보호할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −30 | 공동 0 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −25 | 자격 10 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −45\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 35 | 위험 40 | 과시 20 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"평예준","type":"맹세","to":"나봄결","basis":"나봄결의 비상 발전 일지와 시각을 맞추며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0169', 'c870-cc3d-b155-66fa', '{"id":"person-0169","name":"Jo I-rok","title":"Records Notarization Auditor","position":"Records Notarization Auditor","characterId":"K168","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Verifying Original Hashes and Auditing Notarized Copies","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-joirok","detailRoute":"/people/person-0169","birthDate":"2099-08-20","birthday":"08-20","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K144","recipientName":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Overlaps with Yun Seorin''s sealing authority, but keeps notarial stamping separate.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-06.json","anchor":"inmul-jo-irok-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k168-hash-comparison","name":"Original hash comparison","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k168-choice","name":"Maintains independent certification","description":"She passed no spot where a notary stamp''s ink had smudged. She guarded one original''s hash over any grand ratification.","behavior":"Anecdote. A copy with a smudged notarial stamp comes to the audit desk carrying two original hashes. Jo Irok holds the copy until it is confirmed which hash points to the original, and meanwhile leaves blank the notarial box kept apart from Yun Seorin''s seal.","stress":"Fear. That smudged stamps would circulate as valid ratifications. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Overlapped with Yun Seorin''s seal authority, but kept the notary stamp separate.","effects":[]},{"id":"k168-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Records Notarization Auditor. She sent out no copy notarization before the original''s hash was confirmed.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Records Notarization Auditor. She sent out no copy notarization before the original''s hash was confirmed.","stress":"Fear. That smudged stamps would circulate as valid ratifications. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Overlapped with Yun Seorin''s seal authority, but kept the notary stamp separate.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Anecdote. A copy with a smudged notarial stamp comes to the audit desk carrying two original hashes. Jo Irok holds the copy until it is confirmed which hash points to the original, and meanwhile leaves blank the notarial box kept apart from Yun Seorin''s seal. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51820-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K168","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51820-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-cc3d-b155-66fa","name":"Changnyeong Jo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c870-cc3d-b155-66fa.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":25,"Openness":-5,"Force":-30,"Material":-40,"Communal":15,"Principle":60,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":20,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":35,"Display":-45,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Verifying Original Hashes and Auditing Notarized Copies","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management audit post, Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), corresponding to the functions of the Records Management Department and Records Management Policy Division of the National Archives of Korea under the Ministry of the Interior and Safety","Assigned Duties":"Records Notarization Auditor","Values":"Authority 25 | Openness −5 | Force −30 | Materialism −40 | Community 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Craving 20 | Monopoly 25 | Risk 35 | Display −45 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Bisexual | Bonding: Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Records Notarization Auditor opened up through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Verifying Jo Irok''s original hashes and auditing copy notarizations connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management audit post, Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), corresponding to the functions of the Records Management Department and Records Management Policy Division of the National Archives of Korea under the Ministry of the Interior and Safety. Duties: Records Notarization Auditor.","Anecdote":"A copy bearing a smeared-ink notarial seal comes up to the audit desk with two original hashes attached. Jo Irok holds the copy until it is confirmed which hash points to the original, and in the meantime leaves empty the notarial sealing slot kept separate from Yun Seorin''s seal.","Relationships":"Overlaps with Yun Seorin''s sealing authority, but keeps notarial stamping separate.","Ambition":"Fixes records notarization as a cross-sealing by auditor and clerk rather than the sole signature of the office head.","Fear":"A smeared seal circulating as a valid ratification.","Intervention":"Can point to the original among the two locked hashes, or widen the scope of access."},"biography":"Lets nothing pass where the ink of a notarial seal has smeared. Guards a single original hash over a grand ratification.\n\n- Livelihood: Verifying Original Hashes and Auditing Notarized Copies\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position and Grade: Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management audit post, Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), corresponding to the functions of the Records Management Department and Records Management Policy Division of the National Archives of Korea under the Ministry of the Interior and Safety\n- Assigned Duties: Records Notarization Auditor\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Records Notarization Auditor opened up through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Verifying Jo Irok''s original hashes and auditing copy notarizations connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil servant post/grade.** Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management audit post, Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), corresponding to the functions of the Records Management Department and Records Management Policy Division of the National Archives of Korea under the Ministry of the Interior and Safety. Duties: Records Notarization Auditor.\n\n**Anecdote.** A copy bearing a smeared-ink notarial seal comes up to the audit desk with two original hashes attached. Jo Irok holds the copy until it is confirmed which hash points to the original, and in the meantime leaves empty the notarial sealing slot kept separate from Yun Seorin''s seal.\n\n**Relationships.** Overlaps with Yun Seorin''s sealing authority, but keeps notarial stamping separate.\n\n**Ambition.** Fixes records notarization as a cross-sealing by auditor and clerk rather than the sole signature of the office head.\n\n**Fear.** A smeared seal circulating as a valid ratification.\n\n**Intervention.** Can point to the original among the two locked hashes, or widen the scope of access.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 25 | Openness −5 | Force −30 | Materialism −40 | Community 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Craving 20 | Monopoly 25 | Risk 35 | Display −45 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Bisexual | Bonding: Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0169","name":"조이록","title":"기록 공증 감사관","position":"기록 공증 감사관","characterId":"K168","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"원본 해시 확인·사본 공증 감사","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-조이록","detailRoute":"/people/person-0169","birthDate":"2099-08-20","birthday":"08-20","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K144","recipientName":"윤서린","basis":"윤서린의 봉인 권한과 겹치지만, 공증 날인은 따로 둔다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-06.json","anchor":"인물-조이록-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k168-hash-comparison","name":"원본 해시 대조","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k168-choice","name":"독립 날인 유지","description":"공증 도장의 잉크가 번진 자리는 통과시키지 않는다. 큰 인준보다 한 장의 원본 해시를 지킨다.","behavior":"일화. 잉크가 번진 공증 도장을 단 사본이 원본 해시 두 개를 달고 감사대에 오른다. 조이록은 어느 해시가 원본을 가리키는지 확인할 때까지 사본을 붙들어 두고, 윤서린의 봉인과 따로 두는 공증 날인 칸을 그동안 비워 둔다.","stress":"공포. 번진 도장이 유효한 인준처럼 유통되는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 봉인 권한과 겹치지만, 공증 날인은 따로 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k168-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 기록 공증 감사관. 사본 공증은 원본 해시가 확인되기 전에 내보내지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 기록 공증 감사관. 사본 공증은 원본 해시가 확인되기 전에 내보내지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 번진 도장이 유효한 인준처럼 유통되는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 봉인 권한과 겹치지만, 공증 날인은 따로 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일화. 잉크가 번진 공증 도장을 단 사본이 원본 해시 두 개를 달고 감사대에 오른다. 조이록은 어느 해시가 원본을 가리키는지 확인할 때까지 사본을 붙들어 두고, 윤서린의 봉인과 따로 두는 공증 날인 칸을 그동안 비워 둔다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51820-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K168","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51820-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-cc3d-b155-66fa","name":"창녕 조씨","crest":"clan-crests/c870-cc3d-b155-66fa.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":25,"개방":-5,"무력":-30,"물질":-40,"공동":15,"원칙":60,"공개":-15,"자격":10,"분산":-30,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":20,"독점":25,"위험":35,"과시":-45,"지속":-15,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"원본 해시 확인·사본 공증 감사","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"행정안전부 국가기록원 기록관리부·기록관리정책과 기능에 대응하는 서울특별시 기록관리 감사 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직","담당 업무":"기록 공증 감사관","가치관":"권위 25 | 개방 −5 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −40 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 20 | 독점 25 | 위험 35 | 과시 −45 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 기록 공증 감사관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 조이록의 원본 해시를 확인하고 사본 공증을 감사하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"행정안전부 국가기록원 기록관리부·기록관리정책과 기능에 대응하는 서울특별시 기록관리 감사 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직. 담당 업무: 기록 공증 감사관.","일화":"잉크가 번진 공증 도장을 단 사본이 원본 해시 두 개를 달고 감사대에 오른다. 조이록은 어느 해시가 원본을 가리키는지 확인할 때까지 사본을 붙들어 두고, 윤서린의 봉인과 따로 두는 공증 날인 칸을 그동안 비워 둔다.","관계":"윤서린의 봉인 권한과 겹치지만, 공증 날인은 따로 둔다.","야망":"기록 공증을 청장 단독 서명이 아니라 감사·서기 교차 날인으로 고정한다.","공포":"번진 도장이 유효한 인준처럼 유통되는 것.","개입":"잠긴 두 해시 중 원본을 가리키거나, 열람 범위를 넓힐 수 있다."},"biography":"공증 도장의 잉크가 번진 자리는 통과시키지 않는다. 큰 인준보다 한 장의 원본 해시를 지킨다.\n\n- 생업: 원본 해시 확인·사본 공증 감사\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 행정안전부 국가기록원 기록관리부·기록관리정책과 기능에 대응하는 서울특별시 기록관리 감사 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직\n- 담당 업무: 기록 공증 감사관\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 기록 공증 감사관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 조이록의 원본 해시를 확인하고 사본 공증을 감사하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 행정안전부 국가기록원 기록관리부·기록관리정책과 기능에 대응하는 서울특별시 기록관리 감사 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직. 담당 업무: 기록 공증 감사관.\n\n**일화.** 잉크가 번진 공증 도장을 단 사본이 원본 해시 두 개를 달고 감사대에 오른다. 조이록은 어느 해시가 원본을 가리키는지 확인할 때까지 사본을 붙들어 두고, 윤서린의 봉인과 따로 두는 공증 날인 칸을 그동안 비워 둔다.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린의 봉인 권한과 겹치지만, 공증 날인은 따로 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 기록 공증을 청장 단독 서명이 아니라 감사·서기 교차 날인으로 고정한다.\n\n**공포.** 번진 도장이 유효한 인준처럼 유통되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 잠긴 두 해시 중 원본을 가리키거나, 열람 범위를 넓힐 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 25 | 개방 −5 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −40 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 20 | 독점 25 | 위험 35 | 과시 −45 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0170', 'bc15-bc00-c591', '{"id":"person-0170","name":"Bak Tae-gyeom","title":"Stationmaster","position":"Stationmaster of Yongsan Station","characterId":"K169","rank":"Stationmaster","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"Managing and Publishing the Escort Dispatch Schedule","gender":"Male","stage":"Key","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#inmul-bak-taegyeom","detailRoute":"/people/person-0170","birthDate":"2071-01-09","birthday":"01-09","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K193","recipientName":"Kevin White","basis":"Carry Bak Taegyeom''s mediation plan out into the field, but do not hand over the track keys.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-07.json","anchor":"Person-Kevin-White-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":13,"effective":13},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":14,"effective":14},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k169-dispatch-disclosure","name":"Dispatch disclosure","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k169-trait-1","name":"Stationmaster","description":"Title: Stationmaster.","behavior":"Title: Stationmaster.","stress":"","relationship":"Shares scheduling with Jang Sehwa while keeping their duties distinct.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Stationmaster.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s07","name":{"ko":"Yongsan Station Directly Managed Land"},"holderPersonId":"K169","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S07","stationRef":{"stationId":"Yongsan","stationName":"Yongsan"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"clan":{"id":"bc15-bc00-c591","name":"Miryang Bak Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc15-bc00-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":20,"Force":-10,"Material":20,"Communal":-30,"Principle":-40,"Public":-40,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":-10,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":20,"Display":10,"Sustained":-20,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Stationmaster","Title":"Stationmaster of Yongsan Station","Livelihood":"Managing and Publishing the Escort Dispatch Schedule"},"sections":{"Life":"Bak Taegyeom, born in 2071, becomes Stationmaster of Yongsan Station in 2126. Bak worked entangled in Yongsan railway transshipment and garrison fence contract work. When an emergency convoy opens, the tracks move before the government does. The siding watch of the Yongsan Seonromun belongs to Jang Sehwa. The Itaewon interpreters share living space inside Yongsan Station. The lineage, with a Korean father and an Irish mother, is rooted in the Yongsan Hosongga''s living area. Bak Dohyeon went through the Great Blackout around 2026 at the Yongsan Hosongga, doing civilian contract work for the Yongsan railway and civilian lodging work in Itaewon. The family passed records of shelters and goods handovers down to the next generation, and Bak Taegyeom''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.","Offices":"Rank: Stationmaster. Title: Stationmaster of Yongsan Station. Trade nickname: Rail Coordinator.","Anecdote":"","Houses":"Of the Miryang Bak clan. A family rooted around Yongsan; he serves as Yongsan Station stationmaster and personally checks the station shutters and the emergency food list every winter.","Relationships":"Dispatch with Jang Sehwa. Im Hajun''s pump train.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Stationmaster\n- Title: Stationmaster of Yongsan Station\n- Trade: Managing and publishing convoy dispatch schedules\n- Bak Taegyeom''s duties as Stationmaster of Yongsan Station are tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\nThe Division Chief, dispatchers, and apprentices surrounding Rail Coordinator Bak Taegyeom."},"biography":"**Life.** Bak Taegyeom, born in 2071, becomes Stationmaster of Yongsan Station in 2126. Bak worked entangled in Yongsan railway transshipment and garrison fence contract work. When an emergency convoy opens, the tracks move before the government does. The siding watch of the Yongsan Seonromun belongs to Jang Sehwa. The Itaewon interpreters share living space inside Yongsan Station. The lineage, with a Korean father and an Irish mother, is rooted in the Yongsan Hosongga''s living area. Bak Dohyeon went through the Great Blackout around 2026 at the Yongsan Hosongga, doing civilian contract work for the Yongsan railway and civilian lodging work in Itaewon. The family passed records of shelters and goods handovers down to the next generation, and Bak Taegyeom''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n**Office.** Rank: Stationmaster. Title: Stationmaster of Yongsan Station. Trade nickname: Rail Coordinator.\n**Family.** Of the Miryang Bak clan. A family rooted around Yongsan; he serves as Yongsan Station stationmaster and personally checks the station shutters and the emergency food list every winter.\n**Relations.** Dispatch with Jang Sehwa. Im Hajun''s pump train.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Stationmaster\n- Title: Stationmaster of Yongsan Station\n- Trade: Managing and publishing convoy dispatch schedules\n- Bak Taegyeom''s duties as Stationmaster of Yongsan Station are tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\nThe Division Chief, dispatchers, and apprentices surrounding Rail Coordinator Bak Taegyeom.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"Yu Sejin","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Western Relay Dispatch Contract"},{"from":"Alexander Miller","type":"Rivalry","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Contests the appointment with the Stationmaster"},{"from":"Eva Novakova","type":"Command","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Operates the western railway contracts through dispatch"},{"from":"Isaac Walker","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Trains under the Stationmaster as a rail apprentice"},{"from":"Lucas Schneider","type":"Command","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Reports the warehouse lease ledger to the Stationmaster"},{"from":"Choe Han-gyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Lends the western repair train dispatch desk"},{"from":"Yu Minho","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Splits the relay window and outbound trains"},{"from":"Simon Kaminski","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Simon Kaminski passes the ledger of lives protected on convoys to Bak Taegyeom''s dispatch window. Bak Taegyeom checks actual arrivals and the departures of small convoys so that the handover of people is not dropped from the freight-car records."},{"from":"Jacob Thomas","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Jacob Thomas hands the ledger of lives protected on convoys to Bak Taegyeom''s window. Bak Taegyeom checks arrival headcounts and dispatch order so that people do not go missing from records of cargo-only arrivals."},{"from":"Mykola Bondarenko","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Backing Bak Taegyeom''s apprenticeship route at the window"},{"from":"Sofia Rossi","type":"Command","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":""},{"from":"Patrick O''Connor","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"an ally who hands Bak Taegyeom the detour coordinates,"},{"from":"Adeola Adeyemi","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"obeys Bak Taegyeom''s keeping of the relay but refuses concealed power distribution"},{"from":"Martin Horak","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"requests access to Bak Taegyeom''s dispatch ledger,"},{"from":"Ana Popescu","type":"Oath","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":""},{"from":"Seok Oreum","type":"Oath","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"takes the time of Bak Taegyeom''s dispatch inquiry as the benchmark at the witness stand"},{"from":"Cho Jinsol","type":"Oath","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0170","name":"박태겸","title":"역장","position":"용산역 역장","characterId":"K169","rank":"역장","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"호송 배차표 관리·공개","gender":"남성","stage":"주요","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-박태겸","detailRoute":"/people/person-0170","birthDate":"2071-01-09","birthday":"01-09","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K193","recipientName":"케빈 화이트","basis":"박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-07.json","anchor":"인물-케빈-화이트-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":13,"effective":13},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":14,"effective":14},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k169-dispatch-disclosure","name":"배차표 공개","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k169-trait-1","name":"역장","description":"직함은 역장.","behavior":"직함은 역장.","stress":"","relationship":"장세화와 배차를 나누며 서로의 당직을 구분한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 역장.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s07","name":{"ko":"용산역 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K169","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S07","stationRef":{"stationId":"용산","stationName":"용산"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"clan":{"id":"bc15-bc00-c591","name":"밀양 박씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc15-bc00-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"권위":10,"개방":20,"무력":-10,"물질":20,"공동":-30,"원칙":-40,"공개":-40,"자격":40,"분산":-10,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-40,"위험":20,"과시":10,"지속":-20,"지향":"양성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"역장","직함":"용산역 역장","생업":"호송 배차표 관리·공개"},"sections":{"생애":"2071년생인 박태겸은 2126년 용산역 역장을 맡는다. 용산 철도 환적과 주둔지 울타리 용역에 얽혀 일했다. 비상 호송이 열리면 선로가 정부보다 먼저 움직인다. 용산선로문의 유치선 당직은 장세화의 것이다. 이태원 통역은 용산역 안에서 거처를 나눠 쓴다. 한국계 아버지와 아일랜드계 어머니를 둔 가계는 용산호송가 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 박도헌은 약 2026년 용산호송가에서 용산 철도 민간 용역과 이태원 민간 숙박 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 박태겸의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.","관직":"품계 역장. 직함은 용산역 역장. 생업 별명은 철도조정관.","일화":"","가문":"밀양 박씨 집안. 용산 일대에 뿌리를 둔 집안으로, 용산역 역장을 맡아 겨울마다 역 셔터와 비상 식량 목록을 직접 확인한다.","관계":"장세화와 배차. 임하준의 펌프 열차.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 역장\n- 직함: 용산역 역장\n- 생업: 호송 배차표 관리·공개\n- 박태겸의 용산역 역장 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n철도조정관 박태겸을 둘러싼 본부장과 배차원·도제다."},"biography":"**생애.** 2071년생인 박태겸은 2126년 용산역 역장을 맡는다. 용산 철도 환적과 주둔지 울타리 용역에 얽혀 일했다. 비상 호송이 열리면 선로가 정부보다 먼저 움직인다. 용산선로문의 유치선 당직은 장세화의 것이다. 이태원 통역은 용산역 안에서 거처를 나눠 쓴다. 한국계 아버지와 아일랜드계 어머니를 둔 가계는 용산호송가 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 박도헌은 약 2026년 용산호송가에서 용산 철도 민간 용역과 이태원 민간 숙박 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 박태겸의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n**관직.** 품계 역장. 직함은 용산역 역장. 생업 별명은 철도조정관.\n**가문.** 밀양 박씨 집안. 용산 일대에 뿌리를 둔 집안으로, 용산역 역장을 맡아 겨울마다 역 셔터와 비상 식량 목록을 직접 확인한다.\n**관계.** 장세화와 배차. 임하준의 펌프 열차.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 역장\n- 직함: 용산역 역장\n- 생업: 호송 배차표 관리·공개\n- 박태겸의 용산역 역장 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n철도조정관 박태겸을 둘러싼 본부장과 배차원·도제다.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"유세진","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"서부 중계 배차 계약"},{"from":"알렉산더 밀러","type":"경쟁","to":"박태겸","basis":"임명을 두고 역장과 겨룸"},{"from":"에바 노바코바","type":"지휘","to":"박태겸","basis":"서부 철도계약을 배차에서 운용"},{"from":"아이작 워커","type":"스승과 제자","to":"박태겸","basis":"선로 도제로 역장 밑에서 수련"},{"from":"루카스 슈나이더","type":"지휘","to":"박태겸","basis":"창고 임대 장부를 역장에게 보고"},{"from":"최한결","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"서부 보수열차 배차 창구를 빌림"},{"from":"유민호","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"중계 창구와 외곽 열차를 나눔"},{"from":"시몬 카민스키","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"시몬 카민스키는 호송에서 지킨 인명 장부를 박태겸의 배차 창구에 전달한다. 박태겸은 실제 도착과 작은 호송의 출발을 확인해 사람의 인수가 화물 칸 기록에 빠지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"제이컵 토머스","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"제이컵 토머스는 호송에서 지킨 인명 장부를 박태겸의 창구에 넘긴다. 박태겸은 도착 인원·배차 순서를 확인해 화물만 도착한 기록에 사람이 빠지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"미콜라 본다렌코","type":"스승과 제자","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 도제 경로를 창에서 받치며"},{"from":"소피아 로시","type":"지휘","to":"박태겸","basis":""},{"from":"패트릭 오코너","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸에게 우회 좌표를 넘기는 동맹이고"},{"from":"아데올라 아데예미","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 중계 유지에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"마르틴 호라크","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 배차 원장 열람을 청구하고"},{"from":"아나 포페스쿠","type":"맹세","to":"박태겸","basis":""},{"from":"석오름","type":"맹세","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 배차 조사 시각을 증인석의 기준으로 삼는다"},{"from":"초진솔","type":"맹세","to":"박태겸","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0171', NULL, '{"id":"person-0171","name":"Alexander Miller","title":"Government Railway Division Chief","position":"Government Railway Division Chief","characterId":"K170","rank":"Division Chief","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Approving Track Blockades and Controlling Switches","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#Person-Alexander Miller","detailRoute":"/people/person-0171","birthDate":"2059-03-06","birthday":"03-06","age":67,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"switch-control","name":"Switch control","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k170-disposition","name":"Government Railway Division Chief","description":"Title: Government Railway Division Chief.","behavior":"Office. Rank: division chief. Title: government railway division chief.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Used Clara Bennett as the division-side dispatcher and set the Changdong wheel supply as a condition for Hwang Noeul.","effects":[]},{"id":"k170-choice","name":"Government Railway Division Chief","description":"Title: Government Railway Division Chief.","behavior":"Relations. Used Clara Bennett as the division-side dispatcher and set the Changdong wheel supply as a condition for Hwang Noeul.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Used Clara Bennett as the division-side dispatcher and set the Changdong wheel supply as a condition for Hwang Noeul.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Government Railway Division Chief.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":25,"Force":-10,"Material":20,"Communal":0,"Principle":0,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":35,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-25,"Display":-15,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Division Chief","Livelihood":"Approving Track Blockades and Controlling Switches","Title":"Government Railway Division Chief","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness 25 | Military Force −10 | Material 20 | Collective 0 | Principle 0 | Disclosure −15 | Qualification 35 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −25 | Display −15 | Persistence 30 | Orientation None | Bonding Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2059, Alexander Miller takes up the duties of Government Railway Division Chief in the opening period of 2126. He grew up on waiting-hall duty. His work as Government Railway Division Chief began with a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence. His European-American family line is rooted in the Yongsan-Itaewon living area. In 2026, James Miller handled U.S. Army supply work in Yongsan-Itaewon and went through the severing of communication lines. The family passed down records of their residence and goods handovers to the next generation, and Alexander Miller''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the daily ledgers of the time. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Alexander Miller''s work of approving track blockades and controlling switches is tied to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Division Chief. Title: Government Railway Division Chief.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Uses Clara Bennett as the division’s dispatcher, and makes the supply of Changdong wheels a condition for Hwang Noeul.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"He can steal the switch key."},"biography":"- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Division Chief\n- Occupation: Approving Track Blockades and Controlling Switches\n- Title: Government Railway Division Chief\n**Life.** Born in 2059, Alexander Miller takes up the duties of Government Railway Division Chief in the opening period of 2126. He grew up on waiting-hall duty. His work as Government Railway Division Chief began with a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence. His European-American family line is rooted in the Yongsan-Itaewon living area. In 2026, James Miller handled U.S. Army supply work in Yongsan-Itaewon and went through the severing of communication lines. The family passed down records of their residence and goods handovers to the next generation, and Alexander Miller''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the daily ledgers of the time. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Alexander Miller''s work of approving track blockades and controlling switches is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Division Chief. Title: Government Railway Division Chief.\n\n**Relationships.** Uses Clara Bennett as the division’s dispatcher, and makes the supply of Changdong wheels a condition for Hwang Noeul.\n\n**Intervention.** He can steal the switch key.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 25 | Force −10 | Material 20 | Communal 0 | Principle 0 | Disclosure −15 | Credentials 35 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −25 | Display −15 | Persistence 30 | Orientation None | Bonding Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relat