null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":25,"무력":-10,"물질":20,"공동":0,"원칙":0,"공개":-15,"자격":35,"분산":5,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-15,"위험":-25,"과시":-15,"지속":30,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"본부장","생업":"선로 봉쇄 승인·전환기 통제","직함":"정부 철도 본부장","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 25 | 무력 −10 | 물질 20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 35 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −15 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2059년생인 알렉산더 밀러는 2126년 개막기에 정부 철도 본부장 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 정부 철도 본부장 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 유럽계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 제임스 밀러는 2026년 용산·이태원에서 미 육군 보급 업무를 맡다가 연락망 단절을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 알렉산더 밀러의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 알렉산더 밀러의 선로 봉쇄 승인·전환기 통제 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 본부장. 직함은 정부 철도 본부장.","일화":"","관계":"클라라 베넷을 본부 측 배차로 부리고, 황노을에게는 창동 차륜 공급을 조건으로 건다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"전환기 열쇠를 훔칠 수 있다."},"biography":"- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 본부장\n- 생업: 선로 봉쇄 승인·전환기 통제\n- 직함: 정부 철도 본부장\n**생애.** 2059년생인 알렉산더 밀러는 2126년 개막기에 정부 철도 본부장 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 정부 철도 본부장 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 유럽계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 제임스 밀러는 2026년 용산·이태원에서 미 육군 보급 업무를 맡다가 연락망 단절을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 알렉산더 밀러의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 알렉산더 밀러의 선로 봉쇄 승인·전환기 통제 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 본부장. 직함은 정부 철도 본부장.\n\n**관계.** 클라라 베넷을 본부 측 배차로 부리고, 황노을에게는 창동 차륜 공급을 조건으로 건다.\n\n**개입.** 전환기 열쇠를 훔칠 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 25 | 무력 −10 | 물질 20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 35 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −15 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"알렉산더 밀러","type":"경쟁","to":"박태겸","basis":""},{"from":"알렉산더 밀러","type":"원한","to":"임초원","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"클라라 베넷","type":"지휘","to":"알렉산더 밀러","basis":"본부 배차 지휘를 받음"},{"from":"황노을","type":"계약","to":"알렉산더 밀러","basis":"차륜 공급 조건을 철도 본부와 거래"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0172', NULL, '{"id":"person-0172","name":"Eva Novakova","title":"Train Dispatcher","position":"Train Dispatcher","characterId":"K171","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Train Boarding Verification and Window Occupancy Dispatch","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#person-Eva Novakova","detailRoute":"/people/person-0172","birthDate":"2076-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"train-dispatch","name":"Train dispatch","rating":70},{"id":"boarding-verification","name":"Boarding verification","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k171-disposition","name":"Strict about timing","description":"Pragmatic, she dealt harshly with anyone who broke the timetable. Any faction''s train, if it kept its hour, she took without asking its face.","behavior":"Title: Train Dispatcher.","stress":"Fear. That fuel runs out and dispatch stops, and a train stands all night on the platform giving off light and heat that draws outside machines.","relationship":"Relations. Left the contract notarization to Oh Seoyul and split the warehouse transshipment order with Lukas Schneider.","effects":[]},{"id":"k171-choice","name":"Operating terms before faction","description":"Title: Train Dispatcher.","behavior":"Relations. Left the contract notarization to Oh Seoyul and split the warehouse transshipment order with Lukas Schneider.","stress":"Fear. That fuel runs out and dispatch stops, and a train stands all night on the platform giving off light and heat that draws outside machines.","relationship":"Relations. Left the contract notarization to Oh Seoyul and split the warehouse transshipment order with Lukas Schneider.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Train Dispatcher.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":10,"Force":0,"Material":25,"Communal":-5,"Principle":-5,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":-5,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":25,"Display":25,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Train Boarding Verification and Window Occupancy Dispatch","Title":"Train Dispatcher","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness 10 | Force 0 | Material 25 | Communal −5 | Principle −5 | Disclosure −15 | Credentials 40 | Dispersion −5 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 25 | Display 25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Monogamous Marriage"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2076, Eva Novakova takes up the duties of train dispatcher in the opening period of 2126. She grew up on Sinnae transfer duty. Her work as train dispatcher began with stopping a ticketless departing train. Her Czech family line is rooted in the Yongsan-Itaewon living area. Karel Novak worked in Itaewon lodging and private technical services in Yongsan-Itaewon around 2026 and lived through the Great Blackout. The family passed down records of their residence and goods handovers to the next generation, and Eva Novakova''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the daily ledgers of the time. They speak Czech at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Eva Novakova''s work of verifying train boarding proof and dispatching window occupancy is tied to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Train Dispatcher.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"She entrusts contract notarization to O Seoyul and shares the warehouse transshipment order with Lucas Schneider.","Ambition":"To bind Yongsan Station''s train timetable and fuel records onto one dispatch sheet, so that escort trains depart without fail.","Fear":"That fuel runs out and dispatch stops, and a train stands all night on the platform giving off light and heat that draws outside machines.","Intervention":"She can mediate platform-use disputes, or post on the station board the record of fuel that was quietly diverted."},"biography":"Pragmatic, but harsh on anyone who breaks the timetable. She shows no favoritism to any faction''s train as long as it keeps to time.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Occupation: Train Boarding Verification and Window Occupancy Dispatch\n- Title: Train Dispatcher\n**Life.** Born in 2076, Eva Novakova takes up the duties of train dispatcher in the opening period of 2126. She grew up on Sinnae transfer duty. Her work as train dispatcher began with stopping a ticketless departing train. Her Czech family line is rooted in the Yongsan-Itaewon living area. Karel Novak worked in Itaewon lodging and private technical services in Yongsan-Itaewon around 2026 and lived through the Great Blackout. The family passed down records of their residence and goods handovers to the next generation, and Eva Novakova''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the daily ledgers of the time. They speak Czech at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Eva Novakova''s work of verifying train boarding proof and dispatching window occupancy is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Train Dispatcher.\n\n**Relationships.** She entrusts contract notarization to O Seoyul and shares the warehouse transshipment order with Lucas Schneider.\n\n**Ambition.** To bind Yongsan Station''s train timetable and fuel records onto one dispatch sheet, so that escort trains depart without fail.\n\n**Fear.** That fuel runs out and dispatch stops, and a train stands all night on the platform giving off light and heat that draws outside machines.\n\n**Intervention.** She can mediate platform-use disputes, or post on the station board the record of fuel that was quietly diverted.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 10 | Force 0 | Material 25 | Communal −5 | Principle −5 | Disclosure −15 | Credentials 40 | Dispersion −5 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 25 | Display 25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Monogamous Marriage\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Eva Novakova","type":"Command","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":""},{"from":"Eva Novakova","type":"Contract","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"Entrusts railway contract notarization to the Records Office"}],"incoming":[{"from":"O Seo-yul","type":"Contract","to":"Eva Novakova","basis":"Trades Yongsan railway contract notarization"},{"from":"Isabel Garcia","type":"Contract","to":"Eva Novakova","basis":"Isabel Garcia reports an unsigned train departure to Eva Novakova. Eva Novakova checks the occupied window and the boarding proof, and does not record an entry lacking a departure handover as a completed run."},{"from":"Mateusz Kowalski","type":"Command","to":"Eva Novakova","basis":"Enforcing Eva Novakova''s dispatch order on the platform,"},{"from":"Ana Popescu","type":"Oath","to":"Eva Novakova","basis":"Posting testimony on Eva Novakova''s dispatch board, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0172","name":"에바 노바코바","title":"열차 배차원","position":"열차 배차원","characterId":"K171","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"열