-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":20,"Force":-10,"Material":15,"Communal":-5,"Principle":0,"Public":-30,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":-5,"Display":10,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Succession Trial Part Sampling and Transshipment Lot Sealing","Title":"Succession Trial Parts Accusation Assistant","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness 20 | Force −10 | Material 15 | Communal −5 | Principle 0 | Publicity −30 | Credentials 60 | Dispersal 10 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly −40 | Risk −5 | Display 10 | Endurance 35 | Orientation: Opposite sex | Union: Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2064, Oleksandr Shevchenko takes up the post of succession trial parts complaint aide in the opening period of 2126. He grew up at the Sinjeong rail depot. His work as succession trial parts complaint aide began with a defect report filed just before a derailment. His Ukrainian-descended family is rooted in the Dongdaemun-Yongsan civilian transport community. Ivan Shevchenko lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in the Dongdaemun-Yongsan civilian transport community, working night labor in Dongdaemun and freight handovers in Yongsan. The family passed its records of shelters and goods handovers down to the next generation, and Oleksandr Shevchenko''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. At home they speak Ukrainian; in daily life and at work they speak Korean.\n- Oleksandr Shevchenko''s work on succession trial parts samples and transshipment lot sealing is tied to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Succession Trial Parts Accusation Assistant. ","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"You can escort the sealed sample to Changdong, or expose the notes meant to put his name in the accomplice column."},"biography":"He is calm, but he cannot tolerate a foreman who hides samples.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Livelihood: Succession Trial Part Sampling and Transshipment Lot Sealing\n- Title: Succession Trial Parts Accusation Assistant\n**Life.** Born in 2064, Oleksandr Shevchenko takes up the post of succession trial parts complaint aide in the opening period of 2126. He grew up at the Sinjeong rail depot. His work as succession trial parts complaint aide began with a defect report filed just before a derailment. His Ukrainian-descended family is rooted in the Dongdaemun-Yongsan civilian transport community. Ivan Shevchenko lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in the Dongdaemun-Yongsan civilian transport community, working night labor in Dongdaemun and freight handovers in Yongsan. The family passed its records of shelters and goods handovers down to the next generation, and Oleksandr Shevchenko''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. At home they speak Ukrainian; in daily life and at work they speak Korean.\n- Oleksandr Shevchenko''s work on succession trial parts samples and transshipment lot sealing is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Succession Trial Parts Accusation Assistant. \n\n**Intervention.** You can escort the sealed sample to Changdong, or expose the notes meant to put his name in the accomplice column.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 20 | Force −10 | Material 15 | Communal −5 | Principle 0 | Publicity −30 | Credentials 60 | Dispersal 10 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly −40 | Risk −5 | Display 10 | Endurance 35 | Orientation: Opposite sex | Union: Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","type":"Contract","to":"Isaac Walker","basis":"Receives Isaac Walker''s maintenance log as grounds for an accusation, and"},{"from":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","type":"Contract","to":"Martin Horak","basis":"Attaches a specimen number to Mareutin Horakeu''s access request"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Martin Horak","type":"Contract","to":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","basis":""},{"from":"Chu Jihun","type":"Oath","to":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0193","name":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","title":"후계시험 부품 고발 보조","position":"후계시험 부품 고발 보조","characterId":"K192","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"후계시험 부품 표본·환적 로트 봉인","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-올렉산드르 셰우첸코","detailRoute":"/people/person-0193","birthDate":"2064-06-08","birthday":"06-08","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"part-sample-comparison","name":"부품 표본 대조","rating":70},{"id":"complaint-evidence-custody","name":"고발 표본 보관","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k192-disposition","name":"후계시험 부품 고발 보조","description":"직함은 후계시험 부품 고발 보조.","behavior":"직함은 후계시험 부품 고발 보조.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k192-choice","name":"후계시험 부품 고발 보조","description":"직함은 후계시험 부품 고발 보조.","behavior":"직함은 후계시험 부품 고발 보조.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 후계시험 부품 고발 보조.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":20,"무력":-10,"물질":15,"공동":-5,"원칙":0,"공개":-30,"자격":60,"분산":10,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-40,"위험":-5,"과시":10,"지속":35,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"주사","생업":"후계시험 부품 표본·환적 로트 봉인","직함":"후계시험 부품 고발 보조","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 20 | 무력 −10 | 물질 15 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −30 | 자격 60 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −40 | 위험 −5 | 과시 10 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2064년생인 올렉산드르 셰우첸코는 2126년 개막기에 후계시험 부품 고발 보조 업무를 맡는다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 후계시험 부품 고발 보조 업무는 탈선 직전 결함 보고를 계기로 시작됐다. 우크라이나계 가계는 동대문·용산 민간 운송 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 이반 셰우첸코는 약 2026년 동대문·용산 민간 운송 생활권에서 동대문 야간 공임과 용산 화물 인계 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 올렉산드르 셰우첸코의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 우크라이나어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 올렉산드르 셰우첸코의 후계시험 부품 표본·환적 로트 봉인 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 후계시험 부품 고발 보조.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"봉인 표본을 창동까지 호송하거나, 공범란에 이름을 넣으려는 쪽지를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 후계시험 부품 표본·환적 로트 봉인\n- 직함: 후계시험 부품 고발 보조\n**생애.** 2064년생인 올렉산드르 셰우첸코는 2126년 개막기에 후계시험 부품 고발 보조 업무를 맡는다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 후계시험 부품 고발 보조 업무는 탈선 직전 결함 보고를 계기로 시작됐다. 우크라이나계 가계는 동대문·용산 민간 운송 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 이반 셰우첸코는 약 2026년 동대문·용산 민간 운송 생활권에서 동대문 야간 공임과 용산 화물 인계 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 올렉산드르 셰우첸코의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 우크라이나어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 올렉산드르 셰우첸코의 후계시험 부품 표본·환적 로트 봉인 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 후계시험 부품 고발 보조.\n\n**개입.** 봉인 표본을 창동까지 호송하거나, 공범란에 이름을 넣으려는 쪽지를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 20 | 무력 −10 | 물질 15 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −30 | 자격 60 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −40 | 위험 −5 | 과시 10 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","type":"계약","to":"아이작 워커","basis":"아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 고발 근거로 받고"},{"from":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","type":"계약","to":"마르틴 호라크","basis":"마르틴 호라크의 열람 청구에 표본 번호를 붙인다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"마르틴 호라크","type":"계약","to":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","basis":""},{"from":"추지훈","type":"맹세","to":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0194', NULL, '{"id":"person-0194","name":"Kevin White","title":"Track Dispatch Arbitration Station","position":"Track Dispatch Arbitration Station","characterId":"K193","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Track Dispatch Written Objection Receipt and Arbitration","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#inmul-Kevin White","detailRoute":"/people/person-0194","birthDate":"2069-12-14","birthday":"12-14","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K169","recipientName":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Carry Bak Taegyeom''s mediation plan out into the field, but do not hand over the track keys.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-07.json","anchor":"Person-Kevin-White-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"dispatch-mediation","name":"Dispatch mediation","rating":70},{"id":"written-objection-review","name":"Written objection review","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k193-disposition","name":"Deferring oral pressure","description":"He read a dispatch sheet''s blanks first and asked whether the small convoys, more than the big trains, missed their hours. Even seated at the arbitration bench, he kept his voice low.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Clerk. Title: Track Dispatch Arbitration Station. He took dispatch objections in writing only and pushed verbal pressure to the next window.","stress":"Fear. That when an arbitration gap opened, the Yongsan turnaround line would become the Amsa convoy''s waiting line.","relationship":"Relations. Moved Park Taegyeom''s mediation plan into the field but passed over no rail key.","effects":[]},{"id":"k193-choice","name":"Checking small convoys first","description":"Anecdote. Spoken pressure invoking Park Taegyeom''s settlement plan comes to the arbitration seat asking for the track keys. Kevin White defers the pressure to the next window, puts only written objections on the dispatch sheet, and first checks whether the small escort train cleared on time.","behavior":"Relations. Moved Park Taegyeom''s mediation plan into the field but passed over no rail key.","stress":"Fear. That when an arbitration gap opened, the Yongsan turnaround line would become the Amsa convoy''s waiting line.","relationship":"Relations. Moved Park Taegyeom''s mediation plan into the field but passed over no rail key.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Keeps the keys despite pressure invoking the coordinator and checks written objections and small convoy departures. His mediation preserves authority boundaries.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":20,"Force":0,"Material":25,"Communal":0,"Principle":-5,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":-30,"Display":10,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Track Dispatch Written Objection Receipt and Arbitration","Title":"Track Dispatch Arbitration Station","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 20 | Force 0 | Material 25 | Communal 0 | Principle −5 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 35 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −30 | Display 10 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: Reason | Attachment: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2069, Kevin White takes up the duties of Track Dispatch Arbitrator in the opening period of 2126. He grew up on the Sinnae transfer night duty. His work as Track Dispatch Arbitrator began with stopping a ticketless departing train. His African American family line is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Samuel White lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in Itaewon lodging and private interpreting. The family passed down records of residences and goods handovers to the next generation, and Kevin White''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Kevin White''s work of receiving and arbitrating written track dispatch objections is linked to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Track Dispatch Arbitration Station. Dispatch objections are accepted in writing only, and verbal pressure is deferred to the next window.","Anecdote":"Verbal pressure backed by Bak Taegyeom''s mediation proposal enters the arbitration seat and asks for the track keys. Kevin White defers the pressure to the next window, enters only the written objection on the dispatch sheet, and first checks whether the small convoy train departed on time.","Relationships":"Carry Bak Taegyeom''s mediation plan out into the field, but do not hand over the track keys.","Ambition":"","Fear":"That if a gap opens in arbitration, the Yongsan turnback line will become the waiting queue for the Amsa convoy.","Intervention":"He can set up an arbitration witness or expose a hidden waiting train."},"biography":"He looks first at the blank cells of the dispatch sheet, and weighs whether the small convoy departs on time rather than the big trains. Even when seated in the arbitration seat, he keeps his voice low.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Livelihood: Track Dispatch Written Objection Receipt and Arbitration\n- Title: Track Dispatch Arbitration Station\n**Life.** Born in 2069, Kevin White takes up the duties of Track Dispatch Arbitrator in the opening period of 2126. He grew up on the Sinnae transfer night duty. His work as Track Dispatch Arbitrator began with stopping a ticketless departing train. His African American family line is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Samuel White lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in Itaewon lodging and private interpreting. The family passed down records of residences and goods handovers to the next generation, and Kevin White''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Kevin White''s work of receiving and arbitrating written track dispatch objections is linked to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Track Dispatch Arbitration Station. Dispatch objections are accepted in writing only, and verbal pressure is deferred to the next window.\n\n**Anecdote.** Verbal pressure backed by Bak Taegyeom''s mediation proposal enters the arbitration seat and asks for the track keys. Kevin White defers the pressure to the next window, enters only the written objection on the dispatch sheet, and first checks whether the small convoy train departed on time.\n\n**Relations.** Carry Bak Taegyeom''s mediation plan out into the field, but do not hand over the track keys.\n\n**Fear.** That if a gap opens in arbitration, the Yongsan turnback line will become the waiting queue for the Amsa convoy.\n\n**Intervention.** He can set up an arbitration witness or expose a hidden waiting train.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 20 | Force 0 | Material 25 | Communal 0 | Principle −5 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −30 | Display 10 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: Reason | Attachment: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0194","name":"케빈 화이트","title":"선로 배차 중재역","position":"선로 배차 중재역","characterId":"K193","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"선로 배차 이의 서면 접수·중재","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-케빈 화이트","detailRoute":"/people/person-0194","birthDate":"2069-12-14","birthday":"12-14","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K169","recipientName":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-07.json","anchor":"인물-케빈-화이트-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"dispatch-mediation","name":"배차 중재","rating":70},{"id":"written-objection-review","name":"서면 이의 확인","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k193-disposition","name":"구두 압박을 미룸","description":"배차표의 빈칸을 먼저 보고, 큰 열차보다 작은 호송이 제시간에 빠지는지를 따진다. 중재석에 앉아도 목소리는 낮게 둔다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 선로 배차 중재역. 배차 이의는 서면만 받고, 구두 압박은 다음 창으로 미룬다.","stress":"공포. 중재 공백이 생기면 용산 회차선이 암사 호송의 대기열이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k193-choice","name":"작은 호송 우선 확인","description":"일화. 박태겸의 조정안을 앞세운 구두 압박이 중재석에 들어와 선로 열쇠를 청한다. 케빈 화이트는 압박을 다음 창으로 미루고 서면 이의만 배차표에 올리며, 작은 호송 열차가 제시간에 빠졌는지부터 확인한다.","behavior":"관계. 박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 중재 공백이 생기면 용산 회차선이 암사 호송의 대기열이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"조정안을 앞세운 압박에도 열쇠를 내주지 않고 서면 이의와 작은 호송 출발을 확인했다. 권한 경계를 지키는 중재다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":20,"무력":0,"물질":25,"공동":0,"원칙":-5,"공개":-10,"자격":20,"분산":5,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":25,"위험":-30,"과시":10,"지속":10,"지향":"이성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"주사","생업":"선로 배차 이의 서면 접수·중재","직함":"선로 배차 중재역","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 20 | 무력 0 | 물질 25 | 공동 0 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −10 | 자격 20 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 25 | 위험 −30 | 과시 10 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2069년생인 케빈 화이트는 2126년 개막기에 선로 배차 중재역 업무를 맡는다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 선로 배차 중재역 업무는 무표 출발 열차 저지를 계기로 시작됐다. 아프리카계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 새뮤얼 화이트는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 숙박업과 민간 통역 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 케빈 화이트의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 케빈 화이트의 선로 배차 이의 서면 접수·중재 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 선로 배차 중재역. 배차 이의는 서면만 받고, 구두 압박은 다음 창으로 미룬다.","일화":"박태겸의 조정안을 앞세운 구두 압박이 중재석에 들어와 선로 열쇠를 청한다. 케빈 화이트는 압박을 다음 창으로 미루고 서면 이의만 배차표에 올리며, 작은 호송 열차가 제시간에 빠졌는지부터 확인한다.","관계":"박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.","야망":"","공포":"중재 공백이 생기면 용산 회차선이 암사 호송의 대기열이 되는 것.","개입":"중재 증인을 세우거나, 숨긴 대기 열차를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"배차표의 빈칸을 먼저 보고, 큰 열차보다 작은 호송이 제시간에 빠지는지를 따진다. 중재석에 앉아도 목소리는 낮게 둔다.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 선로 배차 이의 서면 접수·중재\n- 직함: 선로 배차 중재역\n**생애.** 2069년생인 케빈 화이트는 2126년 개막기에 선로 배차 중재역 업무를 맡는다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 선로 배차 중재역 업무는 무표 출발 열차 저지를 계기로 시작됐다. 아프리카계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 새뮤얼 화이트는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 숙박업과 민간 통역 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 케빈 화이트의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 케빈 화이트의 선로 배차 이의 서면 접수·중재 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 선로 배차 중재역. 배차 이의는 서면만 받고, 구두 압박은 다음 창으로 미룬다.\n\n**일화.** 박태겸의 조정안을 앞세운 구두 압박이 중재석에 들어와 선로 열쇠를 청한다. 케빈 화이트는 압박을 다음 창으로 미루고 서면 이의만 배차표에 올리며, 작은 호송 열차가 제시간에 빠졌는지부터 확인한다.\n\n**관계.** 박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.\n\n**공포.** 중재 공백이 생기면 용산 회차선이 암사 호송의 대기열이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 중재 증인을 세우거나, 숨긴 대기 열차를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 20 | 무력 0 | 물질 25 | 공동 0 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −10 | 자격 20 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 25 | 위험 −30 | 과시 10 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0195', 'c624-d574-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0195","name":"Oh Hae-rin","title":"Ledger","position":"Records Ledger Director at Namsan Tower","characterId":"K194","rank":"Ledger","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"Cold Storage Key and Auction Price Management","gender":"Female","stage":"Key","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#inmul-Oh-Haerin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0195","birthDate":"2078-11-27","birthday":"11-27","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":13,"effective":13},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":14,"effective":14},"learning":{"base":13,"effective":13},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k194-sealed-auction","name":"Sealed-auction handling","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k194-trait-1","name":"Price within the seal","description":"Uses a seal and price instead of ending trade.","behavior":"Uses a seal and price instead of ending trade.","stress":"Raises the price even when the sealed box contains suspect drugs.","relationship":"Acts differently from Ryu Eunbi’s refusal and competes with Nam Yungyeong in the market.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She is the Government''s records ledger keeper who preserves the Seoul observation records and the manual-signal log at Namsan Tower and has each station match their times. She raised the price of a sealed suspect-drug box rather than stopping medical trade. Conflicting prior livelihoods are not merged, and long record continuity grants neither omniscience nor unrestricted facility control.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s08","name":"Seoul Tower holding","holderPersonId":"K194","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S08","adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null,"landmarkRef":{"landmarkId":"n-seoul-tower","sourcePath":"lore/places/landmark-roles.json"}}],"clan":{"id":"c624-d574-c8fc","name":"Haeju O Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c624-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":40,"Force":-20,"Material":70,"Communal":-40,"Principle":-50,"Public":30,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":60,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":30,"Display":50,"Sustained":-30,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Ledger","Livelihood":"Cold Storage Key and Auction Price Management","Title":"Records Ledger Director at Namsan Tower"},"sections":{"Life":"Oh Haerin is the Government''s records ledger keeper, based at Namsan Tower, who holds the Seoul observation records and the manual-signal log. When a long winter blackout makes Namsan Tower''s manual signals late, she writes the signal times into one records ledger and has each station match them to the same hour, and marks only the mismatched bays in the auction price record so that neighbors can reckon the price again. Seoul Tower is directly held by Oh Haerin. She manages the warehouse keys of the Noryangjin Delivery House and the auction price records, while the cold-storage key of the Frozen Merchant Company is held by Gu Haon. Ice credit remains as neighbors'' debt.\nOffice. Rank: Ledger. Title: Records Ledger Director at Namsan Tower. Occupational alias: Frozen Merchant Representative.\nAnecdote. When fake medicine was put up at auction, she raised the price while keeping the box sealed, and Ryu Eunbi cut off trade that day.\nHouse. Haeju Oh clan. A family that does record preservation work at Namsan Tower.\nRelations. Dispute with Han Jaemok over price disclosure. Market rivalry with Nam Yungyeong.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Ledger\n- Occupation: Cold Storage Key and Auction Price Management\n- Title: Records Ledger Director at Namsan Tower\n- Oh Haerin checks Namsan Tower''s observation records in Yongsan 2-ga-dong and relays manual signals. Managing the Noryangjin cold-storage warehouse keys and auction prices, and directly holding Seoul Tower, are separate from this work.\n\nShe is the real power over auctions, convoys, and ice beside Frozen Merchant Representative Oh Haerin."},"biography":"**Life.** Oh Haerin is the Government''s records ledger keeper, based at Namsan Tower, who holds the Seoul observation records and the manual-signal log. When a long winter blackout makes Namsan Tower''s manual signals late, she writes the signal times into one records ledger and has each station match them to the same hour, and marks only the mismatched bays in the auction price record so that neighbors can reckon the price again. Seoul Tower is directly held by Oh Haerin. She manages the warehouse keys of the Noryangjin Delivery House and the auction price records, while the cold-storage key of the Frozen Merchant Company is held by Gu Haon. Ice credit remains as neighbors'' debt.\nOffice. Rank: Ledger. Title: Records Ledger Director at Namsan Tower. Occupational alias: Frozen Merchant Representative.\nAnecdote. When fake medicine was put up at auction, she raised the price while keeping the box sealed, and Ryu Eunbi cut off trade that day.\nHouse. Haeju Oh clan. A family that does record preservation work at Namsan Tower.\nRelations. Dispute with Han Jaemok over price disclosure. Market rivalry with Nam Yungyeong.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Ledger\n- Occupation: Cold Storage Key and Auction Price Management\n- Title: Records Ledger Director at Namsan Tower\n- Oh Haerin checks Namsan Tower''s observation records in Yongsan 2-ga-dong and relays manual signals. Managing the Noryangjin cold-storage warehouse keys and auction prices, and directly holding Seoul Tower, are separate from this work.\n\nShe is the real power over auctions, convoys, and ice beside Frozen Merchant Representative Oh Haerin.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"Jeong Mo-ran","type":"Rivalry","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Rivalry for the lead in food transport turns and refrigerated food escort"},{"from":"Jo Min-jae","type":"Command","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Redirects the frozen food warehouse power and cooling orders into frozen-goods escort operations"},{"from":"Yun Seo-ha","type":"Command","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Entrusted with the private auction of convoy rights"},{"from":"Sin Tae-san","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Enforce the merchant-house convoy contract on site"},{"from":"Seo Na-yeon","type":"Command","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Fill the collateral warehouse with ice"},{"from":"Peter Jansen","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Trade the Chamber Governance votes with the Shipowners'' Council"},{"from":"Oh Haneul","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Put the market price broadcast into guild time"},{"from":"Na Ru-hui","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Comply with Oh Haerin''s stock disclosure but refuse concealed power distribution"},{"from":"Mo Bongyong","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Refer to Oh Haerin''s market price broadcast during guild time"},{"from":"Bok Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Refer to Oh Haerin''s market price broadcast during market time only"},{"from":"Seop Da-eun","type":"Oath","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Add testimony to Oh Haerin''s stock disclosure, and"},{"from":"Eo Do-yun","type":"Oath","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Add first-year testimony"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0195","name":"오해린","title":"원장","position":"남산타워 기록 원장","characterId":"K194","rank":"원장","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"냉동 창고 열쇠·경매 가격 관리","gender":"여성","stage":"주요","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-오해린","detailRoute":"/people/person-0195","birthDate":"2078-11-27","birthday":"11-27","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":13,"effective":13},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":14,"effective":14},"learning":{"base":13,"effective":13},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k194-sealed-auction","name":"봉인 경매 처리","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k194-trait-1","name":"봉인 안의 가격","description":"거래를 끊는 대신 봉인과 가격을 함께 사용한다.","behavior":"거래를 끊는 대신 봉인과 가격을 함께 사용한다.","stress":"가짜 약이 나와도 봉한 상자의 값을 올린다.","relationship":"류은비의 거래 거부와 달리 움직이며 남윤경과 시장에서 경쟁한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"남산타워에 남은 서울 안 기록과 수동 신호 일지를 보존하고 역마다 시각을 대조하게 하는 정부 기록 원장이다. 가짜 약 상자를 봉한 채 값을 올려 의료 거래 중단과 다른 선택을 했다. 두 카드의 이전 생업은 합치지 않았으며 오랜 기록 연속성이 전지적 정보나 시설 통제권을 뜻하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s08","name":"서울타워 직영지","holderPersonId":"K194","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S08","adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null,"landmarkRef":{"landmarkId":"n-seoul-tower","sourcePath":"lore/places/landmark-roles.json"}}],"clan":{"id":"c624-d574-c8fc","name":"해주 오씨","crest":"clan-crests/c624-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"권위":0,"개방":40,"무력":-20,"물질":70,"공동":-40,"원칙":-50,"공개":30,"자격":0,"분산":20,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":60,"독점":-20,"위험":30,"과시":50,"지속":-30,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"원장","생업":"냉동 창고 열쇠·경매 가격 관리","직함":"남산타워 기록 원장"},"sections":{"생애":"오해린은 남산타워를 거점으로 서울 안 관측 기록과 수동 신호 일지를 맡는 정부 기록 원장이다. 겨울 정전이 길어져 남산타워의 수동 신호가 늦어지는 밤이면 받은 신호 시각을 기록 원장 한 권에 적어 역마다 같은 시각으로 대조하게 하고, 대조가 어긋난 칸만 경매 가격 기록에 따로 표시해 이웃이 값을 다시 따질 수 있게 한다. 서울타워는 오해린이 직접 보유한다. 노량진배달가의 창고 열쇠와 경매 가격 기록을 관리하고, 냉동상단의 냉고 열쇠는 구하온이 맡는다. 얼음 신용은 이웃 빚으로 남는다.\n관직. 품계 원장. 직함은 남산타워 기록 원장. 생업 별명은 냉동상인 대표.\n일화. 가짜 약이 경매에 올랐을 때 상자를 봉한 채 값을 올렸고, 류은비는 그날 거래를 끊었다.\n가문. 해주 오씨. 남산타워 기록 보존 일을 하는 집안이다.\n관계. 한재목과 가격 공개 다툼. 남윤경과 시장 경쟁.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 원장\n- 생업: 냉동 창고 열쇠·경매 가격 관리\n- 직함: 남산타워 기록 원장\n- 오해린은 용산2가동에서 남산타워의 관측 기록을 확인하고 수동 신호를 중계한다. 노량진 냉동 창고 열쇠·경매 가격 관리와 서울타워 직접 보유는 이 업무와 별개다.\n\n냉동상인 대표 오해린 곁의 경매·호송·얼음 실세다."},"biography":"**생애.** 오해린은 남산타워를 거점으로 서울 안 관측 기록과 수동 신호 일지를 맡는 정부 기록 원장이다. 겨울 정전이 길어져 남산타워의 수동 신호가 늦어지는 밤이면 받은 신호 시각을 기록 원장 한 권에 적어 역마다 같은 시각으로 대조하게 하고, 대조가 어긋난 칸만 경매 가격 기록에 따로 표시해 이웃이 값을 다시 따질 수 있게 한다. 서울타워는 오해린이 직접 보유한다. 노량진배달가의 창고 열쇠와 경매 가격 기록을 관리하고, 냉동상단의 냉고 열쇠는 구하온이 맡는다. 얼음 신용은 이웃 빚으로 남는다.\n관직. 품계 원장. 직함은 남산타워 기록 원장. 생업 별명은 냉동상인 대표.\n일화. 가짜 약이 경매에 올랐을 때 상자를 봉한 채 값을 올렸고, 류은비는 그날 거래를 끊었다.\n가문. 해주 오씨. 남산타워 기록 보존 일을 하는 집안이다.\n관계. 한재목과 가격 공개 다툼. 남윤경과 시장 경쟁.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 원장\n- 생업: 냉동 창고 열쇠·경매 가격 관리\n- 직함: 남산타워 기록 원장\n- 오해린은 용산2가동에서 남산타워의 관측 기록을 확인하고 수동 신호를 중계한다. 노량진 냉동 창고 열쇠·경매 가격 관리와 서울타워 직접 보유는 이 업무와 별개다.\n\n냉동상인 대표 오해린 곁의 경매·호송·얼음 실세다.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"정모란","type":"경쟁","to":"오해린","basis":"식량 운송 순번과 냉동 식량 호송의 주도권 경쟁"},{"from":"조민재","type":"지휘","to":"오해린","basis":"냉동 식량 창고의 전력·보냉 지시를 냉동 호송 실무로 돌림"},{"from":"윤서하","type":"지휘","to":"오해린","basis":"호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받음"},{"from":"신태산","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"상회 호송 계약을 현장에서 집행"},{"from":"서나연","type":"지휘","to":"오해린","basis":"담보 창고를 얼음으로 채움"},{"from":"피터 얀센","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"상회정 표를 운송선주 평의와 거래"},{"from":"오하늘","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"시세 방송을 길드 시간에 넣음"},{"from":"나루희","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"오해린의 재고 공개에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"모봉용","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"오해린의 시세 방송을 길드 시간에 참고한다"},{"from":"복용","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"오해린의 시세 방송을 시장 시간에만 참고한다"},{"from":"섭다은","type":"맹세","to":"오해린","basis":"오해린의 재고 공개에 증언을 보태고"},{"from":"어도윤","type":"맹세","to":"오해린","basis":"첫해 증언을 보태고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0196', 'c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99', '{"id":"person-0196","name":"Jo Min-jae","title":"Frozen Goods Merchant","position":"Frozen Goods Merchant","characterId":"K195","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Frozen Inventory Temperature and Weight Inspection","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#inmul-Jo-Minjae","detailRoute":"/people/person-0196","birthDate":"2100-02-02","birthday":"02-02","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"cold-stock-inspection","name":"Cold stock inspection","rating":65},{"id":"supply-contract-operation","name":"Supply contract operation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k195-disposition","name":"Intolerance of concealed losses","description":"He could not stand colleagues who hid losses and read warehouse states by smell before numbers. He smiled in bargaining, but his face hardened when the thermometer shook.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Frozen Goods Merchant. He published inventory temperature and tonnage at noon and stripped the auction license of any column caught with false inventory.","stress":"Fear. That one day of cut power would melt the cold warehouse''s credit.","relationship":"Relations. He splits frozen-food release hours with colleagues at the same station and quarrels with those who want to open the freezer door late to save fuel.","effects":[]},{"id":"k195-choice","name":"Credit alongside temperature","description":"Anecdote. When the blackout pushed the Cheongnyangni Samho warehouse''s temperature to the danger line, the merchants began moving inventory through the night.","behavior":"Relations. He splits frozen-food release hours with colleagues at the same station and quarrels with those who want to open the freezer door late to save fuel.","stress":"Fear. That one day of cut power would melt the cold warehouse''s credit.","relationship":"Relations. He splits frozen-food release hours with colleagues at the same station and quarrels with those who want to open the freezer door late to save fuel.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Publishes temperature and weight and removes false bays’ auction eligibility. Other merchants’ outage removals are not credited to him.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99","name":"Baecheon Jo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":35,"Force":-10,"Material":90,"Communal":-20,"Principle":-30,"Public":10,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-10,"Display":30,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Livelihood":"Frozen Inventory Temperature and Weight Inspection","Title":"Frozen Goods Merchant","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 35 | Force −10 | Material 90 | Communal −20 | Principle −30 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −10 | Display 30 | Endurance 40 | Orientation Unaligned | Bond Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Cheongnyangni Station freight platform. The Frozen Merchant post opened through a public scale recheck.\n- Jo Minjae handles frozen stock temperature and weight inspection in Cheongnyangni-dong.","Offices":"Rank Ordinary Citizen. Title: Frozen Goods Merchant. Publishes stock temperature and weight at noon, and strips the auction eligibility of any stall where false stock turns up.","Anecdote":"When the blackout drove the temperature of the Cheongnyangni Samho Warehouse up to the danger line, merchants began moving their stock overnight.","Relationships":"He splits frozen-food release hours with colleagues at the same station and quarrels with those who want to open the freezer door late to save fuel.","Ambition":"He binds ice blocks and short-term food stocks as collateral for Oh Haerin''s settlement authority, so that Cheongnyangni takes the lead in setting prices over Garak.","Fear":"That a single day without power could melt away the credit of the cold storage.","Intervention":"He can obtain generator parts to keep the freezers alive, or expose a ledger that recorded melted stock as if it were full."},"biography":"Cannot tolerate colleagues who hide losses, and reads the state of a warehouse by smell before numbers. Smiles during haggling, but his expression hardens when a thermometer wavers.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Occupation: Frozen Inventory Temperature and Weight Inspection\n- Title: Frozen Goods Merchant\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Cheongnyangni Station freight platform. The Frozen Merchant post opened through a public scale recheck.\n- Jo Minjae handles frozen stock temperature and weight inspection in Cheongnyangni-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank Ordinary Citizen. Title: Frozen Goods Merchant. Publishes stock temperature and weight at noon, and strips the auction eligibility of any stall where false stock turns up.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the blackout drove the temperature of the Cheongnyangni Samho Warehouse up to the danger line, merchants began moving their stock overnight.\n\n**Relations.** He splits frozen-food release hours with colleagues at the same station and quarrels with those who want to open the freezer door late to save fuel.\n\n**Ambition.** He binds ice blocks and short-term food stocks as collateral for Oh Haerin''s settlement authority, so that Cheongnyangni takes the lead in setting prices over Garak.\n\n**Fear.** That a single day without power could melt away the credit of the cold storage.\n\n**Intervention.** He can obtain generator parts to keep the freezers alive, or expose a ledger that recorded melted stock as if it were full.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 35 | Force −10 | Material 90 | Communal −20 | Principle −30 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −10 | Display 30 | Endurance 40 | Orientation Unaligned | Bond Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jo Min-jae","type":"Command","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Redirects the frozen food warehouse power and cooling orders into frozen-goods escort operations"},{"from":"Jo Min-jae","type":"Contract","to":"Lucas Schneider","basis":"Entrusted the frozen cargo to Yongsan transshipment"},{"from":"Jo Min-jae","type":"Rivalry","to":"Nam Yun-gyeong","basis":"Disputes the timing of price announcements with Garak"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ji Ma-ru","type":"Command","to":"Jo Min-jae","basis":"Receives orders to supply power for Jo Minjae''s temperature disclosures"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0196","name":"조민재","title":"냉동 상인","position":"냉동 상인","characterId":"K195","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"냉동 재고 온도·중량 검사","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-조민재","detailRoute":"/people/person-0196","birthDate":"2100-02-02","birthday":"02-02","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"cold-stock-inspection","name":"냉동 재고 검사","rating":65},{"id":"supply-contract-operation","name":"공급 계약 운용","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k195-disposition","name":"손실 은폐 불관용","description":"손실을 숨기는 동료를 참지 못하고, 숫자보다 냄새로 창고 상태를 먼저 읽는다. 흥정에서는 웃지만 온도계가 흔들리면 표정이 굳는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 냉동 상인. 재고 온도와 중량을 정오에 공개하고, 허위 재고가 나오면 해당 칸의 경매 자격을 박탈한다.","stress":"공포. 전력이 하루만 끊겨도 냉동창고의 신용이 녹아내리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 같은 역의 동료와 냉동 식량 출고 시각을 나누고, 연료를 아끼려 냉동실 문을 늦게 열자는 쪽과 다툰다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k195-choice","name":"신용과 온도를 함께","description":"일화. 정전으로 청량리 삼호 창고의 온도가 위험선까지 오르자 상인들이 재고를 밤사이에 옮기기 시작했다.","behavior":"관계. 같은 역의 동료와 냉동 식량 출고 시각을 나누고, 연료를 아끼려 냉동실 문을 늦게 열자는 쪽과 다툰다.","stress":"공포. 전력이 하루만 끊겨도 냉동창고의 신용이 녹아내리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 같은 역의 동료와 냉동 식량 출고 시각을 나누고, 연료를 아끼려 냉동실 문을 늦게 열자는 쪽과 다툰다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"온도·중량을 공개하며 허위 칸의 경매 자격을 뺀다. 정전 때 화물을 옮긴 상인의 행동을 그의 실적으로 쓰지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99","name":"배천 조씨","crest":"clan-crests/c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":35,"무력":-10,"물질":90,"공동":-20,"원칙":-30,"공개":10,"자격":10,"분산":20,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-30,"위험":-10,"과시":30,"지속":40,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"일반 시민","생업":"냉동 재고 온도·중량 검사","직함":"냉동 상인","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 35 | 무력 −10 | 물질 90 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 10 | 자격 10 | 분산 20 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −10 | 과시 30 | 지속 40 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 청량리역 화물 승강장에서 자랐다. 냉동 상인 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 조민재는 청량리동에서 냉동 재고 온도·중량 검사 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 냉동 상인. 재고 온도와 중량을 정오에 공개하고, 허위 재고가 나오면 해당 칸의 경매 자격을 박탈한다.","일화":"정전으로 청량리 삼호 창고의 온도가 위험선까지 오르자 상인들이 재고를 밤사이에 옮기기 시작했다.","관계":"같은 역의 동료와 냉동 식량 출고 시각을 나누고, 연료를 아끼려 냉동실 문을 늦게 열자는 쪽과 다툰다.","야망":"얼음 벽돌과 단기 식량 재고를 오해린의 결제권 담보로 묶어 가락의 가격 주도권을 청량리가 가져온다.","공포":"전력이 하루만 끊겨도 냉동창고의 신용이 녹아내리는 것.","개입":"발전 부품을 구해 냉동을 살리거나, 녹은 재고를 가득 찬 것처럼 적은 장부를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"손실을 숨기는 동료를 참지 못하고, 숫자보다 냄새로 창고 상태를 먼저 읽는다. 흥정에서는 웃지만 온도계가 흔들리면 표정이 굳는다.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 생업: 냉동 재고 온도·중량 검사\n- 직함: 냉동 상인\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 청량리역 화물 승강장에서 자랐다. 냉동 상인 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 조민재는 청량리동에서 냉동 재고 온도·중량 검사 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 냉동 상인. 재고 온도와 중량을 정오에 공개하고, 허위 재고가 나오면 해당 칸의 경매 자격을 박탈한다.\n\n**일화.** 정전으로 청량리 삼호 창고의 온도가 위험선까지 오르자 상인들이 재고를 밤사이에 옮기기 시작했다.\n\n**관계.** 같은 역의 동료와 냉동 식량 출고 시각을 나누고, 연료를 아끼려 냉동실 문을 늦게 열자는 쪽과 다툰다.\n\n**야망.** 얼음 벽돌과 단기 식량 재고를 오해린의 결제권 담보로 묶어 가락의 가격 주도권을 청량리가 가져온다.\n\n**공포.** 전력이 하루만 끊겨도 냉동창고의 신용이 녹아내리는 것.\n\n**개입.** 발전 부품을 구해 냉동을 살리거나, 녹은 재고를 가득 찬 것처럼 적은 장부를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 35 | 무력 −10 | 물질 90 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 10 | 자격 10 | 분산 20 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −10 | 과시 30 | 지속 40 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"조민재","type":"지휘","to":"오해린","basis":"냉동 식량 창고의 전력·보냉 지시를 냉동 호송 실무로 돌림"},{"from":"조민재","type":"계약","to":"루카스 슈나이더","basis":"냉동 화물을 용산 환적에 맡김"},{"from":"조민재","type":"경쟁","to":"남윤경","basis":"시세 발표 시각을 가락과 다툼"}],"incoming":[{"from":"지마루","type":"지휘","to":"조민재","basis":"조민재의 온도 공개에 전력을 대는 지휘를 받고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0197', 'c724-d30c-d3c9', '{"id":"person-0197","name":"Yun Seo-ha","title":"Auctioneer","position":"Auctioneer","characterId":"K196","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Auction Starting Price and Winning Bid Records","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#person-yun-seoha","detailRoute":"/people/person-0197","birthDate":"2088-05-10","birthday":"05-10","age":38,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"auction-administration","name":"Auction administration","rating":75},{"id":"price-recording","name":"Price recording","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k196-disposition","name":"Stopping wink deals","description":"Her voice was clear and fair to the point of cruelty. When bidders exchanged glances she postponed that lot to the next session at once.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: auctioneer. She wrote the opening and winning bids on the wall and ran the convoy right alone as a sealed-envelope auction.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Received mandate over the closed convoy-right auction from O Haerin and competed with Nam Yungyeong for price leadership. Often awarded Sin Taesan''s convoy bids.","effects":[]},{"id":"k196-choice","name":"Separating public prices and envelopes","description":"Anecdote. When Garak prices jumped on famine rumor alone, empty boxes began going for high prices on the Cheongnyangni auction floor too.","behavior":"Relations. Received mandate over the closed convoy-right auction from O Haerin and competed with Nam Yungyeong for price leadership. Often awarded Sin Taesan''s convoy bids.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Received mandate over the closed convoy-right auction from O Haerin and competed with Nam Yungyeong for price leadership. Often awarded Sin Taesan''s convoy bids.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Defers lots on collusive glances and separates public prices from sealed convoy rights. Fairness claims coexist with private delegated bidding.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c724-d30c-d3c9","name":"Papyeong Yun Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c724-d30c-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":5,"Openness":40,"Force":-15,"Material":85,"Communal":-10,"Principle":-40,"Public":15,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-10,"Display":45,"Sustained":15,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Livelihood":"Auction Starting Price and Winning Bid Records","Title":"Auctioneer","Values":"Authority 5 | Openness 40 | Force −15 | Material 85 | Communal −10 | Principle −40 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 0 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −10 | Display 45 | Endurance 15 | Orientation Unaligned | Bond Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Cheongnyangni Station freight platform. The Auctioneer post opened through a public scale recheck.\n- Yun Seoha handles the recording of auction starting prices and winning bids in Cheongnyangni-dong.","Offices":"Rank Ordinary Citizen. Title: Auctioneer. Writes the starting and winning prices on the wall, but only escort rights are run through a separate sealed-envelope auction.","Anecdote":"On a mere rumor of crop failure, Garak prices jumped, and at the Cheongnyangni auction floor too, empty boxes began to sell at high prices.","Relationships":"Was entrusted by O Haerin with the private auction of escort rights and competes with Nam Yungyeong for price leadership. Often awards the winning bid to Sin Taesan''s escort bids.","Ambition":"Makes power, fuel, and food contracts exchangeable on the same auction floor, cementing O Haerin''s common settlement authority as a market rule.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can disclose the actual stock before an auction, or steer military provisions bids toward a particular heir."},"biography":"Clear-voiced and cruelly fair. If bidders exchange glances, she immediately postpones that item to the next round.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Livelihood: Auction Starting Price and Winning Bid Records\n- Title: Auctioneer\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Cheongnyangni Station freight platform. The Auctioneer post opened through a public scale recheck.\n- Yun Seoha handles the recording of auction starting prices and winning bids in Cheongnyangni-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank Ordinary Citizen. Title: Auctioneer. Writes the starting and winning prices on the wall, but only escort rights are run through a separate sealed-envelope auction.\n\n**Anecdote.** On a mere rumor of crop failure, Garak prices jumped, and at the Cheongnyangni auction floor too, empty boxes began to sell at high prices.\n\n**Relations.** Was entrusted by O Haerin with the private auction of escort rights and competes with Nam Yungyeong for price leadership. Often awards the winning bid to Sin Taesan''s escort bids.\n\n**Ambition.** Makes power, fuel, and food contracts exchangeable on the same auction floor, cementing O Haerin''s common settlement authority as a market rule.\n\n**Intervention.** Can disclose the actual stock before an auction, or steer military provisions bids toward a particular heir.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness 40 | Force −15 | Material 85 | Communal −10 | Principle −40 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 0 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −10 | Display 45 | Persistence 15 | Orientation: None | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yun Seo-ha","type":"Command","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Entrusted with the private auction of convoy rights"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Oh Haneul","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-ha","basis":"Synchronized the auction bulletin times"},{"from":"Seol Cho-a","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-ha","basis":"Enforcing Yun Seoha''s auction order on the platform,"},{"from":"Hong Ji-hun","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-ha","basis":"Enforcing Yun Seoha''s auction rules on the commodity-price items, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0197","name":"윤서하","title":"경매사","position":"경매사","characterId":"K196","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"경매 시작가·낙찰가 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-윤서하","detailRoute":"/people/person-0197","birthDate":"2088-05-10","birthday":"05-10","age":38,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"auction-administration","name":"경매 운영","rating":75},{"id":"price-recording","name":"가격 기록","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k196-disposition","name":"눈짓 거래 중단","description":"목소리가 맑고 잔인할 만큼 공정하다. 입찰자가 눈짓을 교환하면 즉시 그 품목을 다음 회로 미룬다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 경매사. 시작가와 낙찰가를 벽에 쓰고, 호송권만은 별도 봉투 경매로 돌린다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 오해린에게 호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받았고 남윤경과 가격 주도권을 경쟁한다. 신태산의 호송 입찰을 자주 낙찰시킨다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k196-choice","name":"공개가와 봉투 분리","description":"일화. 흉작 소문만으로 가락 시세가 뛰자 청량리 경매판에도 빈 상자가 고가로 나가기 시작했다.","behavior":"관계. 오해린에게 호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받았고 남윤경과 가격 주도권을 경쟁한다. 신태산의 호송 입찰을 자주 낙찰시킨다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 오해린에게 호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받았고 남윤경과 가격 주도권을 경쟁한다. 신태산의 호송 입찰을 자주 낙찰시킨다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"담합 눈짓에 품목을 미루고 공개 가격과 비공개 호송권 봉투를 분리한다. 공정성 주장과 비공개 위임이 함께 있는 운영이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c724-d30c-d3c9","name":"파평 윤씨","crest":"clan-crests/c724-d30c-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":5,"개방":40,"무력":-15,"물질":85,"공동":-10,"원칙":-40,"공개":15,"자격":0,"분산":20,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":-10,"위험":-10,"과시":45,"지속":15,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"일반 시민","생업":"경매 시작가·낙찰가 기록","직함":"경매사","가치관":"권위 5 | 개방 40 | 무력 −15 | 물질 85 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 −40 | 공개 15 | 자격 0 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −10 | 과시 45 | 지속 15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 청량리역 화물 승강장에서 자랐다. 경매사 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 윤서하는 청량리동에서 경매 시작가·낙찰가 기록 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 경매사. 시작가와 낙찰가를 벽에 쓰고, 호송권만은 별도 봉투 경매로 돌린다.","일화":"흉작 소문만으로 가락 시세가 뛰자 청량리 경매판에도 빈 상자가 고가로 나가기 시작했다.","관계":"오해린에게 호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받았고 남윤경과 가격 주도권을 경쟁한다. 신태산의 호송 입찰을 자주 낙찰시킨다.","야망":"전력·연료·식량 계약을 같은 경매판에서 교환하게 만들어 오해린의 공통 결제권을 시장 규칙으로 굳힌다.","공포":"","개입":"실제 재고를 경매 전에 공개하거나, 특정 후계자에게 군량 입찰을 몰아줄 수 있다."},"biography":"목소리가 맑고 잔인할 만큼 공정하다. 입찰자가 눈짓을 교환하면 즉시 그 품목을 다음 회로 미룬다.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 생업: 경매 시작가·낙찰가 기록\n- 직함: 경매사\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 청량리역 화물 승강장에서 자랐다. 경매사 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 윤서하는 청량리동에서 경매 시작가·낙찰가 기록 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 경매사. 시작가와 낙찰가를 벽에 쓰고, 호송권만은 별도 봉투 경매로 돌린다.\n\n**일화.** 흉작 소문만으로 가락 시세가 뛰자 청량리 경매판에도 빈 상자가 고가로 나가기 시작했다.\n\n**관계.** 오해린에게 호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받았고 남윤경과 가격 주도권을 경쟁한다. 신태산의 호송 입찰을 자주 낙찰시킨다.\n\n**야망.** 전력·연료·식량 계약을 같은 경매판에서 교환하게 만들어 오해린의 공통 결제권을 시장 규칙으로 굳힌다.\n\n**개입.** 실제 재고를 경매 전에 공개하거나, 특정 후계자에게 군량 입찰을 몰아줄 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 5 | 개방 40 | 무력 −15 | 물질 85 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 −40 | 공개 15 | 자격 0 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −10 | 과시 45 | 지속 15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"윤서하","type":"지휘","to":"오해린","basis":"호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받음"}],"incoming":[{"from":"오하늘","type":"계약","to":"윤서하","basis":"경매 속보 시각을 맞춤"},{"from":"설초아","type":"지휘","to":"윤서하","basis":"윤서하의 경매 순서를 승강장에서 집행하며"},{"from":"홍지훈","type":"계약","to":"윤서하","basis":"윤서하의 경매 규칙을 물가 품목에서 집행하고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0198', 'c2e0-d3c9-c0b0', '{"id":"person-0198","name":"Sin Tae-san","title":"Escort Foreman","position":"Escort Foreman","characterId":"K197","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Escort Route and Arrival Weight Cross-Check","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#Person-Sin-Taesan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0198","birthDate":"2079-12-17","birthday":"12-17","age":47,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"convoy-route-operation","name":"Convoy route operation","rating":65},{"id":"arrival-weight-check","name":"Arrival weight checking","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k197-disposition","name":"Intolerance of cargo opening","description":"Taciturn and strong of faith. A member who opened freight mid-convoy he struck from the vigilante squad that same day.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Escort Foreman. He announced routes and arms only just before departure, and when arrival tonnage differed from departure he shaved the whole squad''s rations.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Held a convoy contract with O Haerin and took over at Song I-deun''s transshipment warehouse.","effects":[]},{"id":"k197-choice","name":"Shared responsibility for arrival loss","description":"Anecdote. A box with the Amsa seal came out of a convoy car, and the market vigilantes blocked the fleet''s departure.","behavior":"Relations. Held a convoy contract with O Haerin and took over at Song I-deun''s transshipment warehouse.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Held a convoy contract with O Haerin and took over at Song I-deun''s transshipment warehouse.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Limits route disclosure and checks arrival weight. Discovery and resolution of the sealed box or battle victory are not recorded.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c2e0-d3c9-c0b0","name":"Pyeongsan Sin Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c2e0-d3c9-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":5,"Openness":35,"Force":-25,"Material":60,"Communal":-15,"Principle":-25,"Public":25,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-30,"Display":-5,"Sustained":15,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Livelihood":"Escort Route and Arrival Weight Cross-Check","Title":"Escort Foreman","Values":"Authority 5 | Openness 35 | Force −25 | Material 60 | Communal −15 | Principle −25 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 0 | Dispersion 30 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Persistence 15 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up on duty at the Sinnae transfer station. The convoy foreman''s post opened up through stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- Sin Taesan handles reconciling convoy routes and arrival weights in Noryangjin 1-dong.\n- Sin Taesan handles reconciling convoy routes and arrival weights in Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank Ordinary Citizen. Title: Escort Foreman. Announces routes and armament only just before departure, and if the arrival weight differs from the departure weight, cuts the rations of the entire crew.","Anecdote":"A sealed box made in Amsa turned up in one convoy car, and the market self-defense corps blocked the convoy fleet''s departure.","Relationships":"Signed a convoy contract with O Haerin and hands cargo over at Song Ideun''s transshipment window.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can reveal the origin of the smuggled box, or force a convoy through."},"biography":"Taciturn and fiercely loyal. Any crew member who opens cargo during a convoy is removed from the self-defense corps that same day.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Occupation: Escort Route and Arrival Weight Cross-Check\n- Title: Escort Foreman\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up on duty at the Sinnae transfer station. The convoy foreman''s post opened up through stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- Sin Taesan handles reconciling convoy routes and arrival weights in Noryangjin 1-dong.\n- Sin Taesan handles reconciling convoy routes and arrival weights in Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank Ordinary Citizen. Title: Escort Foreman. Announces routes and armament only just before departure, and if the arrival weight differs from the departure weight, cuts the rations of the entire crew.\n\n**Anecdote.** A sealed box made in Amsa turned up in one convoy car, and the market self-defense corps blocked the convoy fleet''s departure.\n\n**Relations.** Signed a convoy contract with O Haerin and hands cargo over at Song Ideun''s transshipment window.\n\n**Intervention.** Can reveal the origin of the smuggled box, or force a convoy through.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness 35 | Force −25 | Material 60 | Communal −15 | Principle −25 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 0 | Dispersion 30 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Persistence 15 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sin Tae-san","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Enforce the merchant-house convoy contract on site"},{"from":"Sin Tae-san","type":"Contract","to":"Lucas Schneider","basis":"Handed over the convoy at the transshipment window"},{"from":"Sin Tae-san","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Lucas Schneider","type":"Contract","to":"Sin Tae-san","basis":"Coordinated the convoy arrival times"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0198","name":"신태산","title":"호송 반장","position":"호송 반장","characterId":"K197","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"호송 경로·도착 중량 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-신태산","detailRoute":"/people/person-0198","birthDate":"2079-12-17","birthday":"12-17","age":47,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"convoy-route-operation","name":"호송 경로 운영","rating":65},{"id":"arrival-weight-check","name":"도착 중량 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k197-disposition","name":"화물 개봉 불관용","description":"과묵하고 신의가 강하다. 호송 중에 화물을 열어본 대원은 그날로 자경대에서 뺀다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 호송 반장. 경로와 무장은 출발 직전에만 알리고, 도착 중량이 출발과 다르면 전 대원 배급을 깎는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 오해린과 호송 계약을 맺고 송이든의 환적 창에서 인계한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k197-choice","name":"도착 손실 공동 책임","description":"일화. 한 호송칸에서 암사에서 만든 봉인 상자가 나와 시장 자경대가 선단 출항을 막았다.","behavior":"관계. 오해린과 호송 계약을 맺고 송이든의 환적 창에서 인계한다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 오해린과 호송 계약을 맺고 송이든의 환적 창에서 인계한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"경로 공개 시점을 제한하고 도착 중량을 확인한다. 봉인 상자를 발견해 해결했다거나 전투에 이겼다는 기록은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c2e0-d3c9-c0b0","name":"평산 신씨","crest":"clan-crests/c2e0-d3c9-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":5,"개방":35,"무력":-25,"물질":60,"공동":-15,"원칙":-25,"공개":25,"자격":0,"분산":30,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":-20,"위험":-30,"과시":-5,"지속":15,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"일반 시민","생업":"호송 경로·도착 중량 대조","직함":"호송 반장","가치관":"권위 5 | 개방 35 | 무력 −25 | 물질 60 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 −25 | 공개 25 | 자격 0 | 분산 30 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 호송 반장 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 신태산은 노량진1동에서 호송 경로·도착 중량 대조 업무를 맡는다.\n- 신태산은 한강로동에서 호송 경로·도착 중량 대조 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 호송 반장. 경로와 무장은 출발 직전에만 알리고, 도착 중량이 출발과 다르면 전 대원 배급을 깎는다.","일화":"한 호송칸에서 암사에서 만든 봉인 상자가 나와 시장 자경대가 선단 출항을 막았다.","관계":"오해린과 호송 계약을 맺고 송이든의 환적 창에서 인계한다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"밀수 상자의 출처를 밝히거나, 호송을 강행할 수 있다."},"biography":"과묵하고 신의가 강하다. 호송 중에 화물을 열어본 대원은 그날로 자경대에서 뺀다.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 생업: 호송 경로·도착 중량 대조\n- 직함: 호송 반장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 호송 반장 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 신태산은 노량진1동에서 호송 경로·도착 중량 대조 업무를 맡는다.\n- 신태산은 한강로동에서 호송 경로·도착 중량 대조 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 호송 반장. 경로와 무장은 출발 직전에만 알리고, 도착 중량이 출발과 다르면 전 대원 배급을 깎는다.\n\n**일화.** 한 호송칸에서 암사에서 만든 봉인 상자가 나와 시장 자경대가 선단 출항을 막았다.\n\n**관계.** 오해린과 호송 계약을 맺고 송이든의 환적 창에서 인계한다.\n\n**개입.** 밀수 상자의 출처를 밝히거나, 호송을 강행할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 5 | 개방 35 | 무력 −25 | 물질 60 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 −25 | 공개 25 | 자격 0 | 분산 30 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"신태산","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"상회 호송 계약을 현장에서 집행"},{"from":"신태산","type":"계약","to":"루카스 슈나이더","basis":"환적 창에서 호송을 인계"},{"from":"신태산","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"루카스 슈나이더","type":"계약","to":"신태산","basis":"호송 도착 시각을 맞춤"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0199', 'c11c-b2ec-c131', '{"id":"person-0199","name":"Seo Na-yeon","title":"Ice Merchant","position":"Ice Merchant","characterId":"K198","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Ice Brick Weight and Production Time Engraving","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#Person-Seo-Nayeon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0199","birthDate":"2064-03-14","birthday":"03-14","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"ice-weight-marking","name":"Ice weight marking","rating":65},{"id":"ice-allocation","name":"Ice allocation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k198-disposition","name":"Sick children first","description":"Meticulous and seeming stingy, she opened the ice first for a sick child. She said credit melted before temperature did.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: ice merchant. She engraved brick weight and production hour and sent out of the market any merchant who matched weight with melted ice.","stress":"Fear. That exhaust heat leaking from the ice makers to the surface draws outside machines, forcing a shutdown and turning the ice ledger to scrap paper.","relationship":"Relations. Filled O Haerin''s collateral warehouse and shared temperature records with Jo Minjae. Assigned infirmary ice as priority to Yun Jiyul.","effects":[]},{"id":"k198-choice","name":"Rejecting melted weight fraud","description":"Anecdote. When the ice machines stopped on the first blackout day, merchants began cheating weights, refreezing melted water.","behavior":"Relations. Filled O Haerin''s collateral warehouse and shared temperature records with Jo Minjae. Assigned infirmary ice as priority to Yun Jiyul.","stress":"Fear. That exhaust heat leaking from the ice makers to the surface draws outside machines, forcing a shutdown and turning the ice ledger to scrap paper.","relationship":"Relations. Filled O Haerin''s collateral warehouse and shared temperature records with Jo Minjae. Assigned infirmary ice as priority to Yun Jiyul.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Marks ice production times and weight and gives priority to sick children and clinics. Standardization as a payment unit remains a goal.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11c-b2ec-c131","name":"Dalseong Seo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c11c-b2ec-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":40,"Force":-20,"Material":80,"Communal":-20,"Principle":-50,"Public":15,"Eligibility":-5,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":-10,"Display":50,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Livelihood":"Ice Brick Weight and Production Time Engraving","Title":"Ice Merchant","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Material 80 | Communal −20 | Principle −50 | Publicity 15 | Credentials −5 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 20","Desires":"Craving 35 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −10 | Display 50 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up on waiting-room night duty. The Ice Merchant post opened through a substitute duty shift covering an unexcused absence.\n- Seo Nayeon is in charge of engraving the weight and production time on ice bricks in Cheongnyangni-dong.","Offices":"Rank Ordinary Citizen. Title: Ice Merchant. Engraves the weight and production time on each brick, and expels from the market any merchant who made up the weight with melted ice.","Anecdote":"On the first day of the blackout, when the ice makers stopped, merchants began cheating on weight by refreezing melted water.","Relationships":"Fills Oh Haerin''s collateral warehouse and shares temperature records with Jo Minjae. Gives Yun Jiyul''s infirmary priority for ice.","Ambition":"Standardize ice bricks as a unit of payment so that the Cheongnyangni price holds for a full day even when power wavers.","Fear":"That exhaust heat leaking from the ice makers to the surface draws outside machines, forcing a shutdown and turning the ice ledger into scraps of paper.","Intervention":"Can bring in manual ice-making tools, or smash a fake-weight brick in front of everyone before an auction."},"biography":"Meticulous and seemingly stingy, but releases ice first to sick children. Says credit melts before temperature does.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Occupation: Ice Brick Weight and Production Time Engraving\n- Title: Ice Merchant\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up on waiting-room night duty. The Ice Merchant post opened through a substitute duty shift covering an unexcused absence.\n- Seo Nayeon is in charge of engraving the weight and production time on ice bricks in Cheongnyangni-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank Ordinary Citizen. Title: Ice Merchant. Engraves the weight and production time on each brick, and expels from the market any merchant who made up the weight with melted ice.\n\n**Anecdote.** On the first day of the blackout, when the ice makers stopped, merchants began cheating on weight by refreezing melted water.\n\n**Relations.** Fills Oh Haerin''s collateral warehouse and shares temperature records with Jo Minjae. Gives Yun Jiyul''s infirmary priority for ice.\n\n**Ambition.** Standardize ice bricks as a unit of payment so that the Cheongnyangni price holds for a full day even when power wavers.\n\n**Fear.** That exhaust heat leaking from the ice makers to the surface draws outside machines, forcing a shutdown and turning the ice ledger into scraps of paper.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in manual ice-making tools, or smash a fake-weight brick in front of everyone before an auction.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Material 80 | Communal −20 | Principle −50 | Publicity 15 | Credentials −5 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −10 | Display 50 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seo Na-yeon","type":"Command","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Fill the collateral warehouse with ice"},{"from":"Seo Na-yeon","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"Allocates infirmary ice as a priority"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Lucas Schneider","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"Received the ice bricks at the transshipment window"},{"from":"Hwang Serin","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"Inspects ice and food convoys"},{"from":"Natalya Sokolova","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"handing over Seo Nayeon''s ice bricks,"},{"from":"Ji Yun-jae","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"is an aide who backs Seo Nayeon''s brick engraving in the field, and"},{"from":"Dan No-eul","type":"Oath","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"points to the slot where Seo Nayeon''s brick engraving was changed overnight, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0199","name":"서나연","title":"얼음 상인","position":"얼음 상인","characterId":"K198","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"얼음 벽돌 무게·제작 시각 각인","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-서나연","detailRoute":"/people/person-0199","birthDate":"2064-03-14","birthday":"03-14","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"ice-weight-marking","name":"얼음 중량 각인","rating":65},{"id":"ice-allocation","name":"얼음 배정","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k198-disposition","name":"병든 아이 먼저","description":"꼼꼼하고 인색해 보이지만 병든 아이에게는 얼음을 먼저 푼다. 온도보다 신용이 먼저 녹는다고 말한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 얼음 상인. 벽돌 무게와 제작 시각을 각인하고, 녹은 얼음으로 중량을 맞춘 상인을 시장에서 내보낸다.","stress":"공포. 제빙기 배기열이 지상으로 새어 바깥 기계를 부르는 바람에 가동이 멈추고 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린의 담보 창고를 채우고 조민재와 온도 기록을 공유한다. 윤지율에게 의무실 얼음을 우선 배정한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k198-choice","name":"녹은 중량 거부","description":"일화. 정전 첫날 제빙기가 멈추자 상인들이 녹은 물을 다시 얼렸다며 중량을 속이기 시작했다.","behavior":"관계. 오해린의 담보 창고를 채우고 조민재와 온도 기록을 공유한다. 윤지율에게 의무실 얼음을 우선 배정한다.","stress":"공포. 제빙기 배기열이 지상으로 새어 바깥 기계를 부르는 바람에 가동이 멈추고 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린의 담보 창고를 채우고 조민재와 온도 기록을 공유한다. 윤지율에게 의무실 얼음을 우선 배정한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"얼음 제작 시각·무게를 새기고 병든 아이와 의무실에 먼저 배정한다. 얼음의 결제 단위 표준화는 아직 목표다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11c-b2ec-c131","name":"달성 서씨","crest":"clan-crests/c11c-b2ec-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":40,"무력":-20,"물질":80,"공동":-20,"원칙":-50,"공개":15,"자격":-5,"분산":20,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":0,"위험":-10,"과시":50,"지속":0,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"일반 시민","생업":"얼음 벽돌 무게·제작 시각 각인","직함":"얼음 상인","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 80 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −50 | 공개 15 | 자격 −5 | 분산 20 | 변혁 20","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 0 | 위험 −10 | 과시 50 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 얼음 상인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 서나연은 청량리동에서 얼음 벽돌 무게·제작 시각 각인 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 얼음 상인. 벽돌 무게와 제작 시각을 각인하고, 녹은 얼음으로 중량을 맞춘 상인을 시장에서 내보낸다.","일화":"정전 첫날 제빙기가 멈추자 상인들이 녹은 물을 다시 얼렸다며 중량을 속이기 시작했다.","관계":"오해린의 담보 창고를 채우고 조민재와 온도 기록을 공유한다. 윤지율에게 의무실 얼음을 우선 배정한다.","야망":"얼음 벽돌을 결제 단위로 표준화해 전력이 흔들려도 청량리 시세가 하루를 버티게 한다.","공포":"제빙기 배기열이 지상으로 새어 바깥 기계를 부르는 바람에 가동이 멈추고 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.","개입":"수동 제빙 도구를 들여오거나, 가짜 중량 벽돌을 경매 전에 깨 보일 수 있다."},"biography":"꼼꼼하고 인색해 보이지만 병든 아이에게는 얼음을 먼저 푼다. 온도보다 신용이 먼저 녹는다고 말한다.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 생업: 얼음 벽돌 무게·제작 시각 각인\n- 직함: 얼음 상인\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 얼음 상인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 서나연은 청량리동에서 얼음 벽돌 무게·제작 시각 각인 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 얼음 상인. 벽돌 무게와 제작 시각을 각인하고, 녹은 얼음으로 중량을 맞춘 상인을 시장에서 내보낸다.\n\n**일화.** 정전 첫날 제빙기가 멈추자 상인들이 녹은 물을 다시 얼렸다며 중량을 속이기 시작했다.\n\n**관계.** 오해린의 담보 창고를 채우고 조민재와 온도 기록을 공유한다. 윤지율에게 의무실 얼음을 우선 배정한다.\n\n**야망.** 얼음 벽돌을 결제 단위로 표준화해 전력이 흔들려도 청량리 시세가 하루를 버티게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 제빙기 배기열이 지상으로 새어 바깥 기계를 부르는 바람에 가동이 멈추고 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 수동 제빙 도구를 들여오거나, 가짜 중량 벽돌을 경매 전에 깨 보일 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 80 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −50 | 공개 15 | 자격 −5 | 분산 20 | 변혁 20\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 0 | 위험 −10 | 과시 50 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"서나연","type":"지휘","to":"오해린","basis":"담보 창고를 얼음으로 채움"},{"from":"서나연","type":"계약","to":"윤지율","basis":"의무실 얼음을 우선 배정"}],"incoming":[{"from":"루카스 슈나이더","type":"계약","to":"서나연","basis":"얼음 벽돌을 환적 창에서 받음"},{"from":"황세린","type":"계약","to":"서나연","basis":"얼음·식량 호송을 검수"},{"from":"나탈리야 소콜로바","type":"계약","to":"서나연","basis":"서나연의 얼음 벽돌을 인계하며"},{"from":"지윤재","type":"스승과 제자","to":"서나연","basis":"서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고"},{"from":"단노을","type":"맹세","to":"서나연","basis":"서나연의 벽돌 각인이 밤에 바뀐 칸을 가리키고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0200', NULL, '{"id":"person-0200","name":"Peter Jansen","title":"Transport Shipowners'' Council","position":"Transport Shipowners'' Council","characterId":"K199","rank":"Chief Engineer","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Departure Fuel and Remaining Ice Disclosure","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#person-Peter Jansen","detailRoute":"/people/person-0200","birthDate":"2072-05-24","birthday":"05-24","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"departure-reserve-check","name":"Departure reserve checking","rating":60},{"id":"share-negotiation","name":"Shipowner vote negotiation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k199-disposition","name":"Contempt for deferred losses","description":"He hid his expression well and moved notes like goods. He most despised people who pushed losses off to later.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Chief Engineer. Title: Transport Shipowners'' Council. Before departure he published fuel and ice remainder and suspended the quay use of shipowners whose unredeemed notes piled up.","stress":"Fear. That after unloading and food handovers on the Han River within Seoul stop, false inventory notes would exceed actual stocks and destroy the fleet and settlement credit.","relationship":"Relations. Traded the merchants'' council notes with O Haerin and disliked Han Jaemok''s waterway transport toll. Carried Sin Taesan''s convoy squad on the fleet.","effects":[]},{"id":"k199-choice","name":"Tying issuance to stakes","description":"Anecdote. When the power cut reduced the quay''s remaining catch to a day''s worth, the shipowners pressed to accelerate settlement-right issuance.","behavior":"Relations. Traded the merchants'' council notes with O Haerin and disliked Han Jaemok''s waterway transport toll. Carried Sin Taesan''s convoy squad on the fleet.","stress":"Fear. That after unloading and food handovers on the Han River within Seoul stop, false inventory notes would exceed actual stocks and destroy the fleet and settlement credit.","relationship":"Relations. Traded the merchants'' council notes with O Haerin and disliked Han Jaemok''s waterway transport toll. Carried Sin Taesan''s convoy squad on the fleet.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Publishes fuel and ice and suspends pier access for owners with unpaid tokens. Other owners’ pressure does not establish his issuance success.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":30,"Force":-30,"Material":70,"Communal":-20,"Principle":-40,"Public":15,"Eligibility":5,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-30,"Display":10,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Chief Engineer","Livelihood":"Departure Fuel and Remaining Ice Disclosure","Title":"Transport Shipowners'' Council","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material 70 | Communal −20 | Principle −40 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 5 | Dispersion 30 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −30 | Display 10 | Persistence 40 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Noryangjin pier. The post of Transport Shipowners'' Councilor opened through a public scale recheck.\nPeter Jansen was born in 2072. His Dutch-descended family line is rooted in the Yongsan north bank district. In 2126 he holds the duties of Transport Shipowners'' Councilor. Hendrik Jansen lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 on the north bank of Yongsan, working in civilian loading, unloading and warehouse operations on the Yongsan riverside. The family passed its residence and goods handover records on to the next generation, and Peter Jansen''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own day. Speaks Dutch at home and Korean in daily life and work.\n- Peter Jansen is in charge of disclosing remaining departure fuel and ice in Noryangjin 1-dong.\n- Peter Jansen is in charge of disclosing remaining departure fuel and ice in Hangang-ro-dong.","Offices":"Rank Chief Engineer. Title: Transport Shipowners'' Council. Discloses fuel and ice remaining before departure, and suspends dock use for shipowners with piled-up unredeemed tickets.","Anecdote":"When the power cut reduced the remaining catch at the docks to a single day''s worth, the shipowners pressed to bring forward the issuance of payment rights.","Relationships":"Trades Sang Hoejeong''s votes with Oh Haerin and resents Han Jaemok''s tolls on river transport. Puts Sin Taesan''s escort squad aboard the fleet.","Ambition":"Gather Sang Hoejeong''s votes on the shipowners'' side and bind Oh Haerin''s issuance of payment rights to shares in ships and escorts.","Fear":"That, after Han River unloading and food handovers within Seoul are cut off, false inventory tickets exceed the actual remaining stock and destroy the fleet and payment credit.","Intervention":"Can gather shipowner votes to push issuance through, or invalidate votes bought with false inventory."},"biography":"Hides his expressions well and moves votes around like goods. Holds those who push losses off until later in the deepest contempt.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Chief Engineer\n- Occupation: Departure Fuel and Remaining Ice Disclosure\n- Title: Transport Shipowners'' Council\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Noryangjin pier. The post of Transport Shipowners'' Councilor opened through a public scale recheck.\nPeter Jansen was born in 2072. His Dutch-descended family line is rooted in the Yongsan north bank district. In 2126 he holds the duties of Transport Shipowners'' Councilor. Hendrik Jansen lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 on the north bank of Yongsan, working in civilian loading, unloading and warehouse operations on the Yongsan riverside. The family passed its residence and goods handover records on to the next generation, and Peter Jansen''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own day. Speaks Dutch at home and Korean in daily life and work.\n- Peter Jansen is in charge of disclosing remaining departure fuel and ice in Noryangjin 1-dong.\n- Peter Jansen is in charge of disclosing remaining departure fuel and ice in Hangang-ro-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank Chief Engineer. Title: Transport Shipowners'' Council. Discloses fuel and ice remaining before departure, and suspends dock use for shipowners with piled-up unredeemed tickets.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the power cut reduced the remaining catch at the docks to a single day''s worth, the shipowners pressed to bring forward the issuance of payment rights.\n\n**Relations.** Trades Sang Hoejeong''s votes with Oh Haerin and resents Han Jaemok''s tolls on river transport. Puts Sin Taesan''s escort squad aboard the fleet.\n\n**Ambition.** Gather Sang Hoejeong''s votes on the shipowners'' side and bind Oh Haerin''s issuance of payment rights to shares in ships and escorts.\n\n**Fear.** That, after Han River unloading and food handovers within Seoul are cut off, false inventory tickets exceed the actual remaining stock and destroy the fleet and payment credit.\n\n**Intervention.** Can gather shipowner votes to push issuance through, or invalidate votes bought with false inventory.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material 70 | Communal −20 | Principle −40 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 5 | Dispersion 30 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −30 | Display 10 | Persistence 40 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Peter Jansen","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Trade the Chamber Governance votes with the Shipowners'' Council"},{"from":"Peter Jansen","type":"Grudge","to":"Han Jae-mok","basis":"Grudge against waterborne transport tolls"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Chu Bo-ram","type":"Contract","to":"Peter Jansen","basis":"filters Peter Jansen''s Sang Hoejeong votes out of the council convoy, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0200","name":"피터 얀센","title":"운송선주 평의","position":"운송선주 평의","characterId":"K199","rank":"수석기사","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-피터 얀센","detailRoute":"/people/person-0200","birthDate":"2072-05-24","birthday":"05-24","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"departure-reserve-check","name":"출항 잔량 확인","rating":60},{"id":"share-negotiation","name":"선주 표 교섭","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k199-disposition","name":"손실 유예 경멸","description":"표정을 잘 숨기고 표를 물건처럼 옮긴다. 손실을 나중으로 미루는 사람을 가장 경멸한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 수석기사. 직함은 운송선주 평의. 출항 전에 연료와 얼음 잔량을 공개하고, 미상환 표가 쌓인 선주의 부두 사용을 정지한다.","stress":"공포. 서울 안 한강 하역·식량 인계가 끊긴 뒤 허위 재고 표가 실제 잔량을 넘겨 선단과 결제 신용을 무너뜨리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린과 상회정 표를 거래하고 한재목의 수상 운송 통행세를 꺼린다. 신태산의 호송 반을 선단에 태운다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k199-choice","name":"지분으로 발행을 묶음","description":"일화. 전력 단절과 함께 부두 잔여 어획이 하루치로 줄자 선주들이 결제권 발행을 앞당기라고 압박했다.","behavior":"관계. 오해린과 상회정 표를 거래하고 한재목의 수상 운송 통행세를 꺼린다. 신태산의 호송 반을 선단에 태운다.","stress":"공포. 서울 안 한강 하역·식량 인계가 끊긴 뒤 허위 재고 표가 실제 잔량을 넘겨 선단과 결제 신용을 무너뜨리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린과 상회정 표를 거래하고 한재목의 수상 운송 통행세를 꺼린다. 신태산의 호송 반을 선단에 태운다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"연료·얼음을 공개하고 미상환 표가 쌓인 선주의 부두를 정지한다. 발행 압박은 선주들의 행동으로 발행 성공을 계산하지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":30,"무력":-30,"물질":70,"공동":-20,"원칙":-40,"공개":15,"자격":5,"분산":30,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":10,"위험":-30,"과시":10,"지속":40,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"수석기사","생업":"출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개","직함":"운송선주 평의","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 70 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −40 | 공개 15 | 자격 5 | 분산 30 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 10 | 지속 40 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 운송선주 평의 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n피터 얀센은 2072년에 태어났다. 네덜란드계 가계는 용산 북안 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 2126년에는 운송선주 평의 업무를 맡는다. 헨드릭 얀센은 약 2026년 용산 북안에서 용산 강변의 민간 하역·창고 업무 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 피터 얀센의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 네덜란드어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 피터 얀센은 노량진1동에서 출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개 업무를 맡는다.\n- 피터 얀센은 한강로동에서 출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 수석기사. 직함은 운송선주 평의. 출항 전에 연료와 얼음 잔량을 공개하고, 미상환 표가 쌓인 선주의 부두 사용을 정지한다.","일화":"전력 단절과 함께 부두 잔여 어획이 하루치로 줄자 선주들이 결제권 발행을 앞당기라고 압박했다.","관계":"오해린과 상회정 표를 거래하고 한재목의 수상 운송 통행세를 꺼린다. 신태산의 호송 반을 선단에 태운다.","야망":"상회정의 표를 선주 쪽으로 모아 오해린의 결제권 발행을 선박·호송 지분으로 묶는다.","공포":"서울 안 한강 하역·식량 인계가 끊긴 뒤 허위 재고 표가 실제 잔량을 넘겨 선단과 결제 신용을 무너뜨리는 것.","개입":"선주 표를 모아 발행을 통과시키거나, 허위 재고로 산 표를 무효로 만들 수 있다."},"biography":"표정을 잘 숨기고 표를 물건처럼 옮긴다. 손실을 나중으로 미루는 사람을 가장 경멸한다.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 수석기사\n- 생업: 출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개\n- 직함: 운송선주 평의\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 운송선주 평의 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n피터 얀센은 2072년에 태어났다. 네덜란드계 가계는 용산 북안 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 2126년에는 운송선주 평의 업무를 맡는다. 헨드릭 얀센은 약 2026년 용산 북안에서 용산 강변의 민간 하역·창고 업무 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 피터 얀센의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 네덜란드어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 피터 얀센은 노량진1동에서 출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개 업무를 맡는다.\n- 피터 얀센은 한강로동에서 출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수석기사. 직함은 운송선주 평의. 출항 전에 연료와 얼음 잔량을 공개하고, 미상환 표가 쌓인 선주의 부두 사용을 정지한다.\n\n**일화.** 전력 단절과 함께 부두 잔여 어획이 하루치로 줄자 선주들이 결제권 발행을 앞당기라고 압박했다.\n\n**관계.** 오해린과 상회정 표를 거래하고 한재목의 수상 운송 통행세를 꺼린다. 신태산의 호송 반을 선단에 태운다.\n\n**야망.** 상회정의 표를 선주 쪽으로 모아 오해린의 결제권 발행을 선박·호송 지분으로 묶는다.\n\n**공포.** 서울 안 한강 하역·식량 인계가 끊긴 뒤 허위 재고 표가 실제 잔량을 넘겨 선단과 결제 신용을 무너뜨리는 것.\n\n**개입.** 선주 표를 모아 발행을 통과시키거나, 허위 재고로 산 표를 무효로 만들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 70 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −40 | 공개 15 | 자격 5 | 분산 30 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 10 | 지속 40 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"피터 얀센","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"상회정 표를 운송선주 평의와 거래"},{"from":"피터 얀센","type":"원한","to":"한재목","basis":"수상 운송 통행세를 꺼리는 원한"}],"incoming":[{"from":"추보람","type":"계약","to":"피터 얀센","basis":"피터 얀센의 상회정 표를 회의 호송에서 거르고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0201', 'c9c0-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0201","name":"Ji Yun-jae","title":"Cheongnyangni Ice Machine Technician","position":"Cheongnyangni Ice Machine Technician","characterId":"K200","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Ice Machine Compression Temperature and Parts Inspection","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#person-Ji Yunjae","detailRoute":"/people/person-0201","birthDate":"2091-09-11","birthday":"09-11","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"ice-machine-inspection","name":"Ice machine inspection","rating":70},{"id":"seal-standard-review","name":"Seal standard review","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k200-disposition","name":"Rejecting unmarked parts","description":"She read ice-making cycles from the compressor''s vibration and struck from the rotation any assistant who left tools on the ice. Few of words, she answered with trial-run noise.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Cheongnyangni Ice Machine Technician. Each rotation she wrote compression temperature and brick weight on the chalkboard and fitted no part without the merchants'' council stamp.","stress":"Fear. That exhaust heat leaking from the ice makers to the surface draws outside machines, forcing a shutdown and turning the ice ledger to scrap paper.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice backing Seo Nayeon''s brick engravings in the field, she matched ice-making power to Na Ruhui''s generation and inspected Gang Minseo''s sealing standards.","effects":[]},{"id":"k200-choice","name":"Tool storage discipline","description":"Anecdote. In 2125 she turned back a box of defective parts just before release. By this deed the signature of the Cheongnyangni ice-machine mechanic post rose into the ledger.","behavior":"Relations. An apprentice backing Seo Nayeon''s brick engravings in the field, she matched ice-making power to Na Ruhui''s generation and inspected Gang Minseo''s sealing standards.","stress":"Fear. That exhaust heat leaking from the ice makers to the surface draws outside machines, forcing a shutdown and turning the ice ledger to scrap paper.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice backing Seo Nayeon''s brick engravings in the field, she matched ice-making power to Na Ruhui''s generation and inspected Gang Minseo''s sealing standards.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Checks compression vibration and temperature and returns faulty parts. Repeated seal and output coordination is supported, not ice-machine invention.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c0-cda9-c8fc","name":"Chungju Ji Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c9c0-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":45,"Force":-25,"Material":75,"Communal":-20,"Principle":-30,"Public":15,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":-10,"Display":20,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Livelihood":"Ice Machine Compression Temperature and Parts Inspection","Title":"Cheongnyangni Ice Machine Technician","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 45 | Force −25 | Material 75 | Communal −20 | Principle −30 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 25 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −10 | Display 20 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at Sinjeong Depot. The Cheongnyangni Ice Maker Technician post opened after a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Ji Yun-jae handles ice-maker compression-temperature and parts-inspection work in Cheongnyangni-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Cheongnyangni Ice Machine Technician. Every shift, writes the compression temperature and brick weight on the blackboard, and fits no part that lacks a merchant house''s stamp.","Anecdote":"In 2125, sent a box of defective parts back just before shipment. Because of this, the signature for the Cheongnyangni Ice Maker Technician post went into the ledger.","Relationships":"Stands in a mentor-disciple tie that backs Seo Na-yeon''s brick engraving on site, matches ice-making power to Na Ru-hui''s generation, and inspects Gang Min-seo''s seal specifications.","Ambition":"Ties ice makers and refrigeration compression cycles into a public maintenance table so that a day''s worth of ice remains even when power wavers.","Fear":"That exhaust heat leaking from the ice makers to the surface draws outside machines, forcing a shutdown and turning the ice ledger into scraps of paper.","Intervention":"Can bring in manual ice-making tools, or shake the technician by exposing who ordered the unstamped modifications."},"biography":"Reads the ice-making cycle from compressor vibration and removes from the shift any assistant who sets tools down on the ice. Speaks little and answers with test-run noise.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Livelihood: Ice Machine Compression Temperature and Parts Inspection\n- Title: Cheongnyangni Ice Machine Technician\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at Sinjeong Depot. The Cheongnyangni Ice Maker Technician post opened after a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Ji Yun-jae handles ice-maker compression-temperature and parts-inspection work in Cheongnyangni-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Cheongnyangni Ice Machine Technician. Every shift, writes the compression temperature and brick weight on the blackboard, and fits no part that lacks a merchant house''s stamp.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, sent a box of defective parts back just before shipment. Because of this, the signature for the Cheongnyangni Ice Maker Technician post went into the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Stands in a mentor-disciple tie that backs Seo Na-yeon''s brick engraving on site, matches ice-making power to Na Ru-hui''s generation, and inspects Gang Min-seo''s seal specifications.\n\n**Ambition.** Ties ice makers and refrigeration compression cycles into a public maintenance table so that a day''s worth of ice remains even when power wavers.\n\n**Fear.** Exhaust heat leaking from the ice makers to the surface draws outside machines, forcing a shutdown and turning the ice ledger into scraps of paper.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in manual ice-making tools, or shake the technician by exposing who ordered the unstamped modifications.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 45 | Force −25 | Material 75 | Communal −20 | Principle −30 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 25 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −10 | Display 20 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ji Yun-jae","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"is an aide who backs Seo Nayeon''s brick engraving in the field, and"},{"from":"Ji Yun-jae","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Na Ru-hui","basis":"matching ice-making power to Na Ru-hui''s generation"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Song Dohyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ji Yun-jae","basis":""},{"from":"Ji Ma-ru","type":"Command","to":"Ji Yun-jae","basis":"matching output to Ji Yun-jae''s ice-making test runs"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0201","name":"지윤재","title":"청량리 제빙기 정비사","position":"청량리 제빙기 정비사","characterId":"K200","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"제빙기 압축 온도·부품 점검","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-지윤재","detailRoute":"/people/person-0201","birthDate":"2091-09-11","birthday":"09-11","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"ice-machine-inspection","name":"제빙기 점검","rating":70},{"id":"seal-standard-review","name":"밀봉 규격 검수","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k200-disposition","name":"도장 없는 부품 거부","description":"압축기 진동으로 제빙 주기를 읽고, 공구를 얼음 위에 두는 조수를 교대에서 뺀다. 말수는 적고 시운전 소음으로 대답한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 청량리 제빙기 정비사. 교대마다 압축 온도와 벽돌 무게를 칠판에 쓰고, 상회 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 제빙기 배기열이 지상으로 새어 바깥 기계를 부르는 바람에 가동이 멈추고 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 스승과 제자이고, 나루희의 발전에 제빙 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 밀봉 규격을 검수한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k200-choice","name":"공구 보관 규율","description":"일화. 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 청량리 제빙기 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","behavior":"관계. 서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 스승과 제자이고, 나루희의 발전에 제빙 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 밀봉 규격을 검수한다.","stress":"공포. 제빙기 배기열이 지상으로 새어 바깥 기계를 부르는 바람에 가동이 멈추고 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 스승과 제자이고, 나루희의 발전에 제빙 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 밀봉 규격을 검수한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"압축 진동과 온도를 확인하고 불량 부품을 돌려보낸다. 밀봉·출력을 맞추는 반복 실무가 근거이며 제빙기 발명 경력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c0-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 지씨","crest":"clan-crests/c9c0-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":45,"무력":-25,"물질":75,"공동":-20,"원칙":-30,"공개":15,"자격":25,"분산":25,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":35,"위험":-10,"과시":20,"지속":20,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"일반 시민","생업":"제빙기 압축 온도·부품 점검","직함":"청량리 제빙기 정비사","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 45 | 무력 −25 | 물질 75 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 25 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 20 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 청량리 제빙기 정비사 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 지윤재는 청량리동에서 제빙기 압축 온도·부품 점검 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 청량리 제빙기 정비사. 교대마다 압축 온도와 벽돌 무게를 칠판에 쓰고, 상회 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 청량리 제빙기 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 스승과 제자이고, 나루희의 발전에 제빙 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 밀봉 규격을 검수한다.","야망":"제빙기와 냉동 압축 주기를 공개 정비표로 묶어 전력이 흔들려도 하루치 얼음이 남게 한다.","공포":"제빙기 배기열이 지상으로 새어 바깥 기계를 부르는 바람에 가동이 멈추고 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.","개입":"수동 제빙 도구를 들여오거나, 도장 없는 개조의 발주자를 밝혀 정비사를 흔들 수 있다."},"biography":"압축기 진동으로 제빙 주기를 읽고, 공구를 얼음 위에 두는 조수를 교대에서 뺀다. 말수는 적고 시운전 소음으로 대답한다.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 생업: 제빙기 압축 온도·부품 점검\n- 직함: 청량리 제빙기 정비사\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 청량리 제빙기 정비사 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 지윤재는 청량리동에서 제빙기 압축 온도·부품 점검 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 청량리 제빙기 정비사. 교대마다 압축 온도와 벽돌 무게를 칠판에 쓰고, 상회 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 청량리 제빙기 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 스승과 제자이고, 나루희의 발전에 제빙 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 밀봉 규격을 검수한다.\n\n**야망.** 제빙기와 냉동 압축 주기를 공개 정비표로 묶어 전력이 흔들려도 하루치 얼음이 남게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 제빙기 배기열이 지상으로 새어 바깥 기계를 부르는 바람에 가동이 멈추고 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 수동 제빙 도구를 들여오거나, 도장 없는 개조의 발주자를 밝혀 정비사를 흔들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 45 | 무력 −25 | 물질 75 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 25 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 20 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"지윤재","type":"스승과 제자","to":"서나연","basis":"서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고"},{"from":"지윤재","type":"스승과 제자","to":"나루희","basis":"나루희의 발전에 제빙 전력을 맞추며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"송도현","type":"계약","to":"지윤재","basis":""},{"from":"지마루","type":"지휘","to":"지윤재","basis":"지윤재의 제빙 시운전에 출력을 맞추며"}]}}');
