military orders, taking a hard line on missed deadlines.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"baa8-d568-d3c9","name":"Hampyeong Mo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/baa8-d568-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":10,"Force":-35,"Material":5,"Communal":10,"Principle":15,"Public":55,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":15,"Display":30,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Certified Parts Intake Weight and Dispatch Verification","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Certified Parts Merchant","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 10 | Force −35 | Material 5 | Communal 10 | Principle 15 | Transparency 55 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving −5 | Monopoly 30 | Risk 15 | Display 30 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Multilateral"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2088-07-05; the approved birth cohort is Cohort 4. Active at the opening of 2126. Grew up at the Noryangjin wharf. The post of Certified Parts Logistics Officer opened after the public re-inspection of the scales.\n- Mo Bongyong uses Yeouidong as her work district and handles certified parts receiving-weight and dispatch verification.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Certified Parts Merchant. Two witnesses observe the receiving weight.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Supplies maintenance parts to Dubong, and coordinates Mobong''s mountain transport and loads. Consults O Haerin''s market prices during council hours.","Ambition":"To fix certified parts and backup batteries at the Yeouido public market price.","Fear":"That a crate of parts will slip into the military column and halt exchange between the Yeouidong vault and the Yeongdeungpodong handover window.","Intervention":"You can disclose the mixed-in payment, or escort a load of backup batteries from the Yeouidong vault to the Yeongdeungpodong handover window."},"biography":"When she sees a ledger that fudges weights, the smile leaves her face, and if the wire does not arrive at the promised hour, she tears up the contract on the spot. She trusts invoice figures over rumors.\n\n- Livelihood: Certified Parts Intake Weight and Dispatch Verification\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Certified Parts Merchant\n**Life.** Born 2088-07-05; the approved birth cohort is Cohort 4. Active at the opening of 2126. Grew up at the Noryangjin wharf. The post of Certified Parts Logistics Officer opened after the public re-inspection of the scales.\n- Mo Bongyong uses Yeouidong as her work district and handles certified parts receiving-weight and dispatch verification.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Certified Parts Merchant. Two witnesses observe the receiving weight.\n\n**Relations.** Supplies maintenance parts to Dubong, and coordinates Mobong''s mountain transport and loads. Consults O Haerin''s market prices during council hours.\n\n**Ambition.** To fix certified parts and backup batteries at the Yeouido public market price.\n\n**Fear.** That a crate of parts will slip into the military column and halt exchange between the Yeouidong vault and the Yeongdeungpodong handover window.\n\n**Intervention.** You can disclose the mixed-in payment, or escort a load of backup batteries from the Yeouidong vault to the Yeongdeungpodong handover window.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 10 | Force −35 | Material 5 | Communal 10 | Principle 15 | Transparency 55 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation 