id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"Haeum Bong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":35,"Force":-60,"Material":-5,"Communal":10,"Principle":20,"Public":55,"Eligibility":5,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":50,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-5,"Display":5,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"None","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Vault On-Duty Treatment and Stimulant Use Records","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Vault On-Duty Medic","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −60 | Materialism −5 | Communal 10 | Principle 20 | Transparency 55 | Credentials 5 | Decentralization 20 | Reform −5","Desires":"Craving 50 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −5 | Display 5 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Unaligned | Union None"},"sections":{"Life":"The approved birth cohort for a birth on 2090-05-24 is Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. The post of Vault Night-Duty Medic opened through a forged medicine seal.\n- Bong So takes Yeoui-dong as a work district and handles vault night-duty care and stimulant use records.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Vault On-Duty Medic. Posts on-duty vital records on the infirmary door and forbids stimulant use without the signatures of two medics.","Anecdote":"On the night the editing gap was discovered, two on-duty staff collapsed and one line of the stimulant seal was missing.","Relationships":"Treats Gwon Mirae''s overnight team and stands by on Hwang Eunseol''s night of suspended appraisal. Owes Ryu Eunbi a debt for a fever-herb allocation.","Ambition":"To set up an independent infirmary at the Yeouido Vault and ledger repository.","Fear":"That counterfeit stimulants will spread through the duty line and forged currency will go out unchecked.","Intervention":"Can trace the missing seal, or have the infirmary key shared with the Investment Council."},"biography":"Checks the hand tremor of the night-working technician first. When saving a patient through silence, also postpones appraisal requests.\n\n- Livelihood: Vault On-Duty Treatment and Stimulant Use Records\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Vault On-Duty Medic\n**Life.** The approved birth cohort for a birth on 2090-05-24 is Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. The post of Vault Night-Duty Medic opened through a forged medicine seal.\n- Bong So takes Yeoui-dong as a work district and handles vault night-duty care and stimulant use records.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Vault On-Duty Medic. Posts on-duty vital records on the infirmary door and forbids stimulant use without the signatures of two medics.\n\n**Anecdote.** On the night the editing gap was discovered, two on-duty staff collapsed and one line of the stimulant seal was missing.\n\n**Relationships.** Treats Gwon Mirae''s overnight team and stands by on Hwang Eunseol''s night of suspended appraisal. Owes Ryu Eunbi a debt for a fever-herb allocation.\n\n**Ambition.** To set up an independent infirmary at the Yeouido Vault and ledger repository.\n\n**Fear.** That counterfeit stimulants will spread through the duty line and forged currency will go out unchecked.\n\n**Intervention.** Can trace the missing seal, or have the infirmary key shared with the Investment Council.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −60 | Materialism −5 | Communal 10 | Principle 20 | Transparency 55 | Credentials 5 | Decentralization 20 | Reform −5\n- Desires: Craving 50 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −5 | Display 5 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Unaligned | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bong So","type":"Contract","to":"Gwon Mi-rae","basis":"Treats Gwon Mirae''s all-night team, and"},{"from":"Bong So","type":"Contract","to":"Hwang Eunseol","basis":"Stands by on the night of Hwang Eunseol''s hold broadcast"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0228","name":"봉소","title":"송신조 당직 의무원","position":"금고 당직 의무원","characterId":"K227","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"금고 당직 진료·각성제 사용 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-봉소","detailRoute":"/people/person-0228","birthDate":"2090-05-24","birthday":"05-24","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"duty-care","name":"당직자 진료","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"duty-care-disposition","name":"송신조 당직 의무원","description":"손떨림을 먼저 본다.","behavior":"손떨림을 먼저 본다.","stress":"가짜 각성제 확산을 두려워한다.","relationship":"권미래의 밤샘 조를 진료하고, 황은설의 보류 감정 밤에 대기한다. 류은비에게 해열 약재 배정을 빚졌다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"보호를 위한 침묵","description":"환자를 살리기 위해 감정 요청을 미룬다.","behavior":"환자를 살리기 위해 감정 요청을 미룬다.","stress":"가짜 각성제가 당직 줄에 퍼져 위조 화폐가 그대로 나가는 것.","relationship":"권미래의 밤샘 조를 진료하고, 황은설의 보류 감정 밤에 대기한다. 류은비에게 해열 약재 배정을 빚졌다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"밤샘 조를 진료하고 각성제를 공동 서명에 묶는다. 보호를 위해 감정 요청도 미룬다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"하음 봉씨","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":35,"무력":-60,"물질":-5,"공동":10,"원칙":20,"공개":55,"자격":5,"분산":20,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":50,"독점":-10,"위험":-5,"과시":5,"지속":30,"지향":"무성향","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"금고 당직 진료·각성제 사용 기록","소속":"자유도시","품계":"서기","직함":"금고 당직 의무원","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −60 | 물질 −5 | 공동 10 | 원칙 20 | 공개 55 | 자격 5 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 50 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −5 | 과시 5 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2090-05-24 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 금고 당직 의무원 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 봉소는 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 금고 당직 진료·각성제 사용 기록 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 금고 당직 의무원. 당직 활력 기록을 의무실 문에 붙이고, 각성제 사용은 두 의무원의 서명 없이 금지한다.","일화":"편집 공백이 발견된 밤에 당직 두 명이 쓰러지고 각성제 봉인이 한 줄 빠져 있었다.","관계":"권미래의 밤샘 조를 진료하고, 황은설의 보류 감정 밤에 대기한다. 류은비에게 해열 약재 배정을 빚졌다.","야망":"여의도 금고와 장부 저장소에 독립 의무실을 둔다.","공포":"가짜 각성제가 당직 줄에 퍼져 위조 화폐가 그대로 나가는 것.","개입":"빠진 봉인을 추적하거나, 의무실 열쇠를 출자 평의회와 나눠 쥐게 할 수 있다."},"biography":"밤샘하는 기사의 손떨림을 먼저 본다. 침묵으로 환자를 살릴 때는 감정 요청도 미룬다.\n\n- 생업: 금고 당직 진료·각성제 사용 기록\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 금고 당직 의무원\n**생애.** 2090-05-24 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 금고 당직 의무원 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 봉소는 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 금고 당직 진료·각성제 사용 기록 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 금고 당직 의무원. 당직 활력 기록을 의무실 문에 붙이고, 각성제 사용은 두 의무원의 서명 없이 금지한다.\n\n**일화.** 편집 공백이 발견된 밤에 당직 두 명이 쓰러지고 각성제 봉인이 한 줄 빠져 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 권미래의 밤샘 조를 진료하고, 황은설의 보류 감정 밤에 대기한다. 류은비에게 해열 약재 배정을 빚졌다.\n\n**야망.** 여의도 금고와 장부 저장소에 독립 의무실을 둔다.\n\n**공포.** 가짜 각성제가 당직 줄에 퍼져 위조 화폐가 그대로 나가는 것.\n\n**개입.** 빠진 봉인을 추적하거나, 의무실 열쇠를 출자 평의회와 나눠 쥐게 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −60 | 물질 −5 | 공동 10 | 원칙 20 | 공개 55 | 자격 5 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 50 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −5 | 과시 5 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"봉소","type":"계약","to":"권미래","basis":"권미래의 밤샘 조를 진료하고"},{"from":"봉소","type":"계약","to":"황은설","basis":"황은설의 보류 방송 밤에 대기한다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0229', 'c6a9-d64d-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0229","name":"Yong Bok","title":"Transmission Tower Patrol, Jo Eunu''s Deputy","position":"Vault Patrol, Jo Eunu''s Deputy","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Vault Patrol Route and Escort Access Check","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"S09","stateName":"Free City","detailRoute":"/people/person-0229","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":6,"effective":6},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}}}}', '{"id":"person-0229","name":"용복","title":"송신탑 순찰대, 조은우의 실무 담당자","position":"금고 순찰대, 조은우의 실무 담당자","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"금고 순찰 경로·동행 접근 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"S09","stateName":"자유도시","detailRoute":"/people/person-0229","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":6,"effective":6},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0230', 'c18c-c9c4-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0230","name":"So Gam","title":"Organizing Messenger, Oh Haneul''s Deputy","position":"Investment Messenger, Oh Haneul''s Deputy","characterId":"K229","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Council Order Notices and Testimony Transfer","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#person-sogam","detailRoute":"/people/person-0230","birthDate":"2076-06-12","birthday":"06-12","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"notice-delivery","name":"Turn and testimony delivery","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"notice-delivery-disposition","name":"Trusts recorded promises","description":"Distrusts promises before recording.","behavior":"Distrusts promises before recording.","stress":"Fears the bag becoming an advertising channel.","relationship":"Carries O Haneul’s notices, checks Bongyong’s board and sends deferral copies to Yun Seorin.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Publishes bribery traces","description":"Posts bribery notes unchanged to the council board.","behavior":"Posts bribery notes unchanged to the council board.","stress":"Fears the bag becoming an advertising channel.","relationship":"Carries O Haneul’s notices, checks Bongyong’s board and sends deferral copies to Yun Seorin.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Records turns and testimony transport together and compares unrecorded times.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c18c-c9c4-c8fc","name":"Jinju So Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c18c-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":25,"Force":-20,"Material":-15,"Communal":0,"Principle":20,"Public":60,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":-10,"Display":-25,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Council Order Notices and Testimony Transfer","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Investment Messenger, Oh Haneul''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 25 | Force −20 | Materialism −15 | Communal 0 | Principle 20 | Transparency 60 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization 10 | Reform −10","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −10 | Display −25 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"The approved birth cohort for a birth on 2076-06-12 is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Grew up at the Sinnae Interchange duty post. The post of Investment Courier and Oh Haneul''s working-level aide opened when a ticketless departing train was stopped.\n- So Gam takes Yeoui-dong as a work district and handles council turn notices and testimony transfer.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Investment Messenger, Oh Haneul''s Deputy. Records turn notices and testimony transfer in the same ledger, and posts bribed notes as they are on the council bulletin board.","Anecdote":"When some clerks took fees and sold speaking turns, two slots with times absent from the courier ledger appeared.","Relationships":"Carries Oh Haneul''s council notices and aligns the blackboard in Bong Yong''s staffing office. Passes copies of the reasons for holds to Yun Seorin.","Ambition":"To make common time and cross-appraisal transfer a fixed courier route, enshrining an uncensored investment turn order as a right.","Fear":"That the courier bag will be swapped for advertisement notes, so that the investment turn order becomes the winner''s timetable.","Intervention":"Can expose the bribe notes, or fix common time onto the courier route."},"biography":"Remembers time down to the minute, and when an investment family overruns its speaking time, shoves a note in front of the chair. Does not trust verbal promises until they are copied into the courier ledger.\n\n- Livelihood: Council Order Notices and Testimony Transfer\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Investment Messenger, Oh Haneul''s Deputy\n**Life.** The approved birth cohort for a birth on 2076-06-12 is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Grew up at the Sinnae Interchange duty post. The post of Investment Courier and Oh Haneul''s working-level aide opened when a ticketless departing train was stopped.\n- So Gam takes Yeoui-dong as a work district and handles council turn notices and testimony transfer.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Investment Messenger, Oh Haneul''s Deputy. Records turn notices and testimony transfer in the same ledger, and posts bribed notes as they are on the council bulletin board.\n\n**Anecdote.** When some clerks took fees and sold speaking turns, two slots with times absent from the courier ledger appeared.\n\n**Relationships.** Carries Oh Haneul''s council notices and aligns the blackboard in Bong Yong''s staffing office. Passes copies of the reasons for holds to Yun Seorin.\n\n**Ambition.** To make common time and cross-appraisal transfer a fixed courier route, enshrining an uncensored investment turn order as a right.\n\n**Fear.** That the courier bag will be swapped for advertisement notes, so that the investment turn order becomes the winner''s timetable.\n\n**Intervention.** Can expose the bribe notes, or fix common time onto the courier route.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 25 | Force −20 | Materialism −15 | Communal 0 | Principle 20 | Transparency 60 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization 10 | Reform −10\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −10 | Display −25 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"So Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Haneul","basis":"delivering O Haneul''s scheduling notices,"},{"from":"So Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Bongyong","basis":"Aligns the blackboard in Bong Yong''s staffing office"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bongyong","type":"Contract","to":"So Gam","basis":"Syncs times with So Gam''s courier ledger"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0230","name":"소감","title":"편성 전령, 오하늘의 실무 담당자","position":"출자 전령, 오하늘의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K229","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"평의회 순번 통지·증언 이송","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-소감","detailRoute":"/people/person-0230","birthDate":"2076-06-12","birthday":"06-12","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"notice-delivery","name":"순번·증언 전달","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"notice-delivery-disposition","name":"기록된 약속 신뢰","description":"구두 약속은 원장에 옮기기 전 믿지 않는다.","behavior":"구두 약속은 원장에 옮기기 전 믿지 않는다.","stress":"가방이 광고 쪽지로 바뀔 것을 경계한다.","relationship":"오하늘의 평의회 통지를 나르고, 봉용의 서기실 칠판을 맞춘다. 윤서린에게 보류 사유의 사본을 전한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"매수 흔적 공개","description":"매수 쪽지를 평의회 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.","behavior":"매수 쪽지를 평의회 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.","stress":"전령 가방이 광고 쪽지로 바뀌어 출자 순번이 승자의 시간표가 되는 것.","relationship":"오하늘의 평의회 통지를 나르고, 봉용의 서기실 칠판을 맞춘다. 윤서린에게 보류 사유의 사본을 전한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"순번과 증언 이송을 같은 원장에 적고 장부에 없는 시각을 대조한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c18c-c9c4-c8fc","name":"진주 소씨","crest":"clan-crests/c18c-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":25,"무력":-20,"물질":-15,"공동":0,"원칙":20,"공개":60,"자격":10,"분산":10,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":35,"위험":-10,"과시":-25,"지속":10,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"평의회 순번 통지·증언 이송","소속":"자유도시","품계":"서기","직함":"출자 전령, 오하늘의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 25 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −15 | 공동 0 | 원칙 20 | 공개 60 | 자격 10 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 10 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2076-06-12 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 출자 전령, 오하늘의 실무 담당자 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 소감은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 평의회 순번 통지·증언 이송 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 출자 전령, 오하늘의 실무 담당자. 순번 통지와 증언 이송을 같은 원장에 적고, 매수된 쪽지는 평의회 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.","일화":"서기 일부가 수수료를 받고 발언 순번을 팔자 전령 원장에 없는 시각이 두 칸 생겼다.","관계":"오하늘의 평의회 통지를 나르고, 봉용의 서기실 칠판을 맞춘다. 윤서린에게 보류 사유의 사본을 전한다.","야망":"공동 시간과 교차 감정 이송을 고정 전령로로 만들어 검열 없는 출자 순번을 권리로 박는다.","공포":"전령 가방이 광고 쪽지로 바뀌어 출자 순번이 승자의 시간표가 되는 것.","개입":"매수 쪽지를 공개하거나, 공동 시간을 전령로에 고정할 수 있다."},"biography":"시간을 분 단위로 기억하고, 한 출자 가문이 발언 시간을 넘기면 쪽지를 의장 앞에 밀어 넣는다. 구두 약속은 전령 원장에 옮기기 전에 믿지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 평의회 순번 통지·증언 이송\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 출자 전령, 오하늘의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2076-06-12 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 출자 전령, 오하늘의 실무 담당자 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 소감은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 평의회 순번 통지·증언 이송 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 출자 전령, 오하늘의 실무 담당자. 순번 통지와 증언 이송을 같은 원장에 적고, 매수된 쪽지는 평의회 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.\n\n**일화.** 서기 일부가 수수료를 받고 발언 순번을 팔자 전령 원장에 없는 시각이 두 칸 생겼다.\n\n**관계.** 오하늘의 평의회 통지를 나르고, 봉용의 서기실 칠판을 맞춘다. 윤서린에게 보류 사유의 사본을 전한다.\n\n**야망.** 공동 시간과 교차 감정 이송을 고정 전령로로 만들어 검열 없는 출자 순번을 권리로 박는다.\n\n**공포.** 전령 가방이 광고 쪽지로 바뀌어 출자 순번이 승자의 시간표가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 매수 쪽지를 공개하거나, 공동 시간을 전령로에 고정할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 25 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −15 | 공동 0 | 원칙 20 | 공개 60 | 자격 10 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 10 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"소감","type":"계약","to":"오하늘","basis":"오하늘의 편성 통지를 나르고"},{"from":"소감","type":"계약","to":"봉용","basis":"봉용의 편성실 칠판을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"봉용","type":"계약","to":"소감","basis":"소감의 전령 원장과 시각을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0231', 'bcf5-ba74-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0231","name":"Bok Dumo","title":"Map Update Scout","position":"Exchange Route Update Scout","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Exchange Route Surveyed Coordinates and Update Records","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"S09","stateName":"Free City","detailRoute":"/people/person-0231","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":4,"effective":4},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}}}}', '{"id":"person-0231","name":"복두모","title":"지도 갱신 탐사원","position":"환전로 갱신 탐사원","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"환전로 실측 좌표·갱신 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"S09","stateName":"자유도시","detailRoute":"/people/person-0231","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":4,"effective":4},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0232', 'ad6d-b2f4-c591', '{"id":"person-0232","name":"Guk Dubong","title":"Verification Archivist, Hwang Eunseol''s Deputy","position":"Currency Appraisal Archivist, Hwang Eunseol''s Deputy","characterId":"K231","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Currency Appraisal Testimony Cross-Check and Transcription","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#person-gukdubong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0232","birthDate":"2101-08-08","birthday":"08-08","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"ledger-copy","name":"Testimony comparison and transcription","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"ledger-copy-disposition","name":"Hesitation before stamping","description":"Reads twice before stamping and stops copying without enough testimony.","behavior":"Reads twice before stamping and stops copying without enough testimony.","stress":"Closes the ledger when protection conflicts with recording duty.","relationship":"Copies under Hwang Eunseol, shares seals with Duyong and cross-checks documents with Yun Seorin.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Publishes deferral reasons","description":"Posts reasons for stopped transcription the same day.","behavior":"Posts reasons for stopped transcription the same day.","stress":"","relationship":"Copies under Hwang Eunseol, shares seals with Duyong and cross-checks documents with Yun Seorin.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Locked the transcription ledger over mismatched marks and handwriting, resisting use of personal handwriting to certify forgery.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"Damyang Guk Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":15,"Force":-25,"Material":-15,"Communal":-5,"Principle":30,"Public":65,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":20,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-30,"Display":0,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Currency Appraisal Testimony Cross-Check and Transcription","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Currency Appraisal Archivist, Hwang Eunseol''s Deputy","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 15 | Force −25 | Material −15 | Communal −5 | Principle 30 | Transparency 65 | Qualification 0 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 20 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −30 | Display 0 | Endurance 30 | Orientation None | Bonding Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2101-08-08; the approved birth cohort is Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of Currency Appraisal Archivist and Hwang Eunseol''s working-level aide opened through the deletion of a single line from a double ledger.\n- Guk Dubong takes Yeoui-dong as the work district and handles currency appraisal testimony collation and transcription.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Currency Appraisal Archivist, Hwang Eunseol''s Deputy. If there are fewer than two independent testimonies, suspends transcription and posts the reason for the suspension on the repository door the same day.","Anecdote":"The engraving and handwriting on a forged banknote diverged in only one section, so the transcription ledger was locked.","Relationships":"Under Hwang Eunseol''s command, moves the ledger and shares Du Yong''s repository keys and seals. Cross-checks currency and documents with Yun Seorin.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can bring in a second witness, or delay disclosure by a day to prevent a riot."},"biography":"Reads a sentence twice and lifts the seal only on the third reading. When the silence needed to save a person conflicts with the duty to preserve the facts, stops and closes the ledger.\n\n- Livelihood: Currency Appraisal Testimony Cross-Check and Transcription\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Currency Appraisal Archivist, Hwang Eunseol''s Deputy\n**Life.** Born 2101-08-08; the approved birth cohort is Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of Currency Appraisal Archivist and Hwang Eunseol''s working-level aide opened through the deletion of a single line from a double ledger.\n- Guk Dubong takes Yeoui-dong as the work district and handles currency appraisal testimony collation and transcription.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Currency Appraisal Archivist, Hwang Eunseol''s Deputy. If there are fewer than two independent testimonies, suspends transcription and posts the reason for the suspension on the repository door the same day.\n\n**Anecdote.** The engraving and handwriting on a forged banknote diverged in only one section, so the transcription ledger was locked.\n\n**Relationships.** Under Hwang Eunseol''s command, moves the ledger and shares Du Yong''s repository keys and seals. Cross-checks currency and documents with Yun Seorin.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in a second witness, or delay disclosure by a day to prevent a riot.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 15 | Force −25 | Material −15 | Communal −5 | Principle 30 | Transparency 65 | Qualification 0 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 20 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −30 | Display 0 | Endurance 30 | Orientation None | Bonding Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Guk Dubong","type":"Command","to":"Hwang Eunseol","basis":"Moves the ledger under Hwang Eunseol''s command, and"},{"from":"Guk Dubong","type":"Contract","to":"Du Yong","basis":"Shares Du Yong''s repository keys and seals"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Du Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Guk Dubong","basis":"Locks Guk Dubong''s transcription ledger"},{"from":"Chu Uchan","type":"Contract","to":"Guk Dubong","basis":"Moves the meeting transcript into Guk Dubong''s verification ledger and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0232","name":"국두봉","title":"검증 기록관, 황은설의 실무 담당자","position":"화폐 감정 기록관, 황은설의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K231","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"화폐 감정 증언 대조·필사","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-국두봉","detailRoute":"/people/person-0232","birthDate":"2101-08-08","birthday":"08-08","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"ledger-copy","name":"증언 대조·필사","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"ledger-copy-disposition","name":"도장 앞의 주저","description":"두 번 읽고 세 번째에야 도장을 들며 증언 부족 때 필사를 멈춘다.","behavior":"두 번 읽고 세 번째에야 도장을 들며 증언 부족 때 필사를 멈춘다.","stress":"보호와 기록 의무가 충돌하면 원장을 덮는다.","relationship":"황은설의 지휘로 원장을 옮기고, 두용의 저장소 열쇠와 봉인을 나눈다. 윤서린과 화폐·문서를 교차한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"보류 사유 공개","description":"필사를 멈춘 사유도 같은 날 붙인다.","behavior":"필사를 멈춘 사유도 같은 날 붙인다.","stress":"","relationship":"황은설의 지휘로 원장을 옮기고, 두용의 저장소 열쇠와 봉인을 나눈다. 윤서린과 화폐·문서를 교차한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"각인과 필적이 어긋나자 필사 원장을 잠갔다. 자기 필적이 위조 신용의 보증이 되는 일을 막는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"담양 국씨","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":15,"무력":-25,"물질":-15,"공동":-5,"원칙":30,"공개":65,"자격":0,"분산":15,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":20,"독점":-30,"위험":-30,"과시":0,"지속":30,"지향":"무성향","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"화폐 감정 증언 대조·필사","소속":"자유도시","품계":"서기","직함":"화폐 감정 기록관, 황은설의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 15 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −15 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 30 | 공개 65 | 자격 0 | 분산 15 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 20 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 0 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2101-08-08 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 화폐 감정 기록관, 황은설의 실무 담당자 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 국두봉은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 화폐 감정 증언 대조·필사 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 화폐 감정 기록관, 황은설의 실무 담당자. 독립 증언이 둘 미만이면 필사를 보류하고, 보류 사유도 같은 날 저장소 문에 붙인다.","일화":"위조 화폐의 각인과 필적이 한 구간에서만 어긋나자 필사 원장을 잠갔다.","관계":"황은설의 지휘로 원장을 옮기고, 두용의 저장소 열쇠와 봉인을 나눈다. 윤서린과 화폐·문서를 교차한다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"두 번째 증언을 데려오거나, 공개를 하루 늦춰 폭동을 막을 수 있다."},"biography":"문장을 두 번 읽고 세 번째에야 도장을 든다. 사람을 살릴 때의 침묵과 사실을 남길 의무가 충돌하면 손을 멈춘 채 원장을 덮는다.\n\n- 생업: 화폐 감정 증언 대조·필사\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 화폐 감정 기록관, 황은설의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2101-08-08 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 화폐 감정 기록관, 황은설의 실무 담당자 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 국두봉은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 화폐 감정 증언 대조·필사 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 화폐 감정 기록관, 황은설의 실무 담당자. 독립 증언이 둘 미만이면 필사를 보류하고, 보류 사유도 같은 날 저장소 문에 붙인다.\n\n**일화.** 위조 화폐의 각인과 필적이 한 구간에서만 어긋나자 필사 원장을 잠갔다.\n\n**관계.** 황은설의 지휘로 원장을 옮기고, 두용의 저장소 열쇠와 봉인을 나눈다. 윤서린과 화폐·문서를 교차한다.\n\n**개입.** 두 번째 증언을 데려오거나, 공개를 하루 늦춰 폭동을 막을 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 15 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −15 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 30 | 공개 65 | 자격 0 | 분산 15 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 20 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 0 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"국두봉","type":"지휘","to":"황은설","basis":"황은설의 지휘로 원장을 옮기고"},{"from":"국두봉","type":"계약","to":"두용","basis":"두용의 저장소 열쇠와 봉인을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"두용","type":"계약","to":"국두봉","basis":"국두봉의 필사 원장을 잠근다"},{"from":"추우찬","type":"계약","to":"국두봉","basis":"국두봉의 검증 원장에 회의 필사를 옮기고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0233', 'ac10-cc3d-c6d0', '{"id":"person-0233","name":"Gam Bong","title":"Sangam Transmission Tower Duty Chief","position":"Yeouido Vault Duty Chief","characterId":"K232","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Vault Duty Shift Change and Wind Speed Records","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#inmul-gambong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0233","birthDate":"2095-12-30","birthday":"12-30","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"duty-roster","name":"Duty and wind recording","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"duty-roster-disposition","name":"Strict shift timing","description":"Calls shift violators by time and asks to reduce windows in strong wind.","behavior":"Calls shift violators by time and asks to reduce windows in strong wind.","stress":"Fears duty becoming a foothold for military seizure.","relationship":"Shares maintenance windows with Dubong, receives Yongbok’s patrol routes and guards Choi Jiwoo’s issuance trials.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Reduces windows in wind","description":"First asks to reduce service windows in strong wind.","behavior":"First asks to reduce service windows in strong wind.","stress":"","relationship":"Shares maintenance windows with Dubong, receives Yongbok’s patrol routes and guards Choi Jiwoo’s issuance trials.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"After three-day blackout duty, posts names and wind speeds together. A vacant duty and open lock reveal limits of supervision.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ac10-cc3d-c6d0","name":"Changwon Gam Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ac10-cc3d-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-5,"Openness":20,"Force":-40,"Material":-15,"Communal":15,"Principle":25,"Public":60,"Eligibility":5,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":-10,"Display":-20,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Vault Duty Shift Change and Wind Speed Records","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Yeouido Vault Duty Chief","Values":"Authority −5 | Openness 20 | Force −40 | Material −15 | Communal 15 | Principle 25 | Transparency 60 | Qualification 5 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly 40 | Risk −10 | Display −20 | Endurance 25 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2095-12-30; the approved birth cohort is Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised at the Yeouido Vault Watch. The post of Yeouido Vault Watch Chief opened through keeping the vault running during the three-day blackout.\n- Gam Bong takes Yeoui-dong as the work district and handles vault watch shifts and wind-speed recording.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Yeouido Vault Duty Chief. Posts the watch names and wind-speed records on the same blackboard, and blocks external armed approach unless Jo Eunu accompanies them.","Anecdote":"At the moment the forged currency was caught, one watch line was empty and the vault lock was open.","Relationships":"Shares the maintenance window with Dubong, and receives the patrol route from beneath the vault. Keeps Choe Jiu''s issuance test day.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"You can find the empty watch slot, or change the vault lock to a double key."},"biography":"She treats the area beneath the vault as home, and she calls those who break the duty rotation by the hour instead of by name. When the wind is strong, she is the first to say the counters should be cut back.\n\n- Livelihood: Vault Duty Shift Change and Wind Speed Records\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Yeouido Vault Duty Chief\n**Life.** Born 2095-12-30; the approved birth cohort is Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised at the Yeouido Vault Watch. The post of Yeouido Vault Watch Chief opened through keeping the vault running during the three-day blackout.\n- Gam Bong takes Yeoui-dong as the work district and handles vault watch shifts and wind-speed recording.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Yeouido Vault Duty Chief. Posts the watch names and wind-speed records on the same blackboard, and blocks external armed approach unless Jo Eunu accompanies them.\n\n**Anecdote.** At the moment the forged currency was caught, one watch line was empty and the vault lock was open.\n\n**Relations.** Shares the maintenance window with Dubong, and receives the patrol route from beneath the vault. Keeps Choe Jiu''s issuance test day.\n\n**Intervention.** You can find the empty watch slot, or change the vault lock to a double key.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −5 | Openness 20 | Force −40 | Material −15 | Communal 15 | Principle 25 | Publicity 60 | Qualification 5 | Dispersion 30 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly 40 | Risk −10 | Display −20 | Persistence 25 | Orientation same-sex | Union monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gam Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Guards Choe Jiu''s multi-transmission test day"},{"from":"Gam Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Du Bong","basis":"Share the maintenance window with Dubong, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Du Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Gam Bong","basis":"Share Gambong''s tower duty"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0233","name":"감봉","title":"상암 송신탑 당직장","position":"여의도 금고 당직장","characterId":"K232","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"금고 당직 교대·풍속 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-감봉","detailRoute":"/people/person-0233","birthDate":"2095-12-30","birthday":"12-30","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"duty-roster","name":"당직·풍속 기록","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"duty-roster-disposition","name":"교대 시각 엄수","description":"교대를 어긴 사람을 이름 대신 시각으로 부르고 강풍 때 창구 축소를 요구한다.","behavior":"교대를 어긴 사람을 이름 대신 시각으로 부르고 강풍 때 창구 축소를 요구한다.","stress":"당직이 군사 압류의 발판이 될 것을 두려워한다.","relationship":"두봉과 정비 창을 나누고, 용복의 순찰 경로를 금고 밑에서 받는다. 최지우의 발행 시험 날을 지킨다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"강풍의 창구 축소","description":"바람이 심하면 창구를 줄이라고 먼저 말한다.","behavior":"바람이 심하면 창구를 줄이라고 먼저 말한다.","stress":"","relationship":"두봉과 정비 창을 나누고, 용복의 순찰 경로를 금고 밑에서 받는다. 최지우의 발행 시험 날을 지킨다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"정전 사흘 유지 경력 뒤 당직명과 풍속을 같은 칠판에 붙인다. 비어 있는 당직과 열린 잠금의 사고는 감독 범위의 한계를 드러낸다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ac10-cc3d-c6d0","name":"창원 감씨","crest":"clan-crests/ac10-cc3d-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-5,"개방":20,"무력":-40,"물질":-15,"공동":15,"원칙":25,"공개":60,"자격":5,"분산":30,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":40,"위험":-10,"과시":-20,"지속":25,"지향":"동성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"금고 당직 교대·풍속 기록","소속":"자유도시","품계":"서기","직함":"여의도 금고 당직장","가치관":"권위 −5 | 개방 20 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −15 | 공동 15 | 원칙 25 | 공개 60 | 자격 5 | 분산 30 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 40 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −20 | 지속 25 | 지향 동성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2095-12-30 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 여의도 금고 당직에서 자랐다. 여의도 금고 당직장 자리는 정전 사흘 금고 유지로 열렸다.\n- 감봉은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 금고 당직 교대·풍속 기록 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 여의도 금고 당직장. 당직 명과 풍속 기록을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 외부 무장 접근은 조은우의 동행 없이 막는다.","일화":"위조 화폐가 잡힌 시각에 당직 한 줄이 비어 있고 금고 잠금이 열려 있었다.","관계":"두봉과 정비 창을 나누고, 순찰 경로를 금고 밑에서 받는다. 최지우의 발행 시험 날을 지킨다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"빈 당직을 찾거나, 금고 잠금을 이중 열쇠로 바꿀 수 있다."},"biography":"금고 아래를 집처럼 여기고, 당직 교대를 어기는 사람을 이름 대신 시각으로 부른다. 바람이 심하면 창구를 줄이라고 먼저 말한다.\n\n- 생업: 금고 당직 교대·풍속 기록\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 여의도 금고 당직장\n**생애.** 2095-12-30 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 여의도 금고 당직에서 자랐다. 여의도 금고 당직장 자리는 정전 사흘 금고 유지로 열렸다.\n- 감봉은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 금고 당직 교대·풍속 기록 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 여의도 금고 당직장. 당직 명과 풍속 기록을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 외부 무장 접근은 조은우의 동행 없이 막는다.\n\n**일화.** 위조 화폐가 잡힌 시각에 당직 한 줄이 비어 있고 금고 잠금이 열려 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 두봉과 정비 창을 나누고, 순찰 경로를 금고 밑에서 받는다. 최지우의 발행 시험 날을 지킨다.\n\n**개입.** 빈 당직을 찾거나, 금고 잠금을 이중 열쇠로 바꿀 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −5 | 개방 20 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −15 | 공동 15 | 원칙 25 | 공개 60 | 자격 5 | 분산 30 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 40 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −20 | 지속 25 | 지향 동성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"감봉","type":"계약","to":"최지우","basis":"최지우의 다중 송신 시험 날을 지킨다"},{"from":"감봉","type":"계약","to":"두봉","basis":"두봉과 정비 창을 나누고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"두봉","type":"계약","to":"감봉","basis":"감봉과 탑 당직을 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0234', 'b450-b450-b989', '{"id":"person-0234","name":"Du Yong","title":"Records Depository Keykeeper, Song Jaemin''s Deputy","position":"Yeouido Vault Keykeeper, Song Jaemin''s Deputy","characterId":"K233","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Vault Key Box Splitting and Opening Check","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#inmul-duyong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0234","birthDate":"2095-01-28","birthday":"01-28","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"chest-custody","name":"Key-chest custody and opening checks","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"chest-custody-disposition","name":"Rejects curious opening","description":"Treats curious opening as equivalent to leakage.","behavior":"Treats curious opening as equivalent to leakage.","stress":"Fears keys turning the vault into a military secret store.","relationship":"Stores Song Jaemin’s key chests, locks Gukdubong’s ledger and supports Jeong Hojun’s public data relay.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Joint opening","description":"Blocks unilateral opening through three key pieces.","behavior":"Blocks unilateral opening through three key pieces.","stress":"Fears keys turning the vault into a military secret store.","relationship":"Stores Song Jaemin’s key chests, locks Gukdubong’s ledger and supports Jeong Hojun’s public data relay.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Records Depository Keykeeper, Song Jaemin''s Deputy.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:saetgang-concourse","name":{"ko":"Saetgang Waiting Hall"},"holderPersonId":"K233","directLiegePersonId":"K222","stateId":"S09","facilityRef":{"sourcePath":"lore/regions/station-interiors.json","stationName":"Saetgang","stationIdentity":{"district":"Yeongdeungpo District","lat":37.51736,"lon":126.92828},"siteSourcePath":"lore/regions/content/11560.json","siteAnchor":"osm:node:8401534578","layerId":"concourse","layerName":"Station Waiting Hall"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"clan":{"id":"b450-b450-b989","name":"Dureung Du Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b450-b450-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-5,"Openness":15,"Force":-35,"Material":-15,"Communal":5,"Principle":45,"Public":60,"Eligibility":5,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":-10,"Display":0,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Vault Key Box Splitting and Opening Check","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Yeouido Vault Keykeeper, Song Jaemin''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −5 | Openness 15 | Force −35 | Material −15 | Communal 5 | Principle 45 | Publicity 60 | Qualification 5 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 35 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −10 | Display 0 | Persistence 5 | Orientation fluid | Union none"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2095-01-28; approved birth cohort is Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of Yeouido Vault Keykeeper and Song Jae-min''s working-level officer opened through the deletion of one line in a double ledger.\n- Du Yong takes Yeouidong as his work district and handles key-box splitting and opening verification.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Yeouido Vault Keykeeper, Song Jaemin''s Deputy. He splits the key into three pieces, distributes them to the Investment Council, the appraiser, and an outside witness, and forbids opening by one person alone. Saetgang Waiting Hall is his facility holding, distinct from his vault key duties.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Keeps Song Jae-min''s vault key box and locks Guk Du-bong''s transcribed ledger. Supports Jeong Ho-jun''s public-data relay box by box.","Ambition":"He relays the Joint Technology Ledger''s verification data only through the vault box, ending the practice of holding researchers hostage by means of key authority.","Fear":"That the vault key falls into military hands and the Yeouido vault becomes a secret warehouse.","Intervention":"Can safely move one key piece, or expose the backdoor the military side demanded."},"biography":"He is silent and never lets the key leave his body. He regards opening a box out of curiosity as the same crime as leaking its contents.\n\n- Livelihood: Vault Key Box Splitting and Opening Check\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Yeouido Vault Keykeeper, Song Jaemin''s Deputy\n**Life.** Born 2095-01-28; approved birth cohort is Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of Yeouido Vault Keykeeper and Song Jae-min''s working-level officer opened through the deletion of one line in a double ledger.\n- Du Yong takes Yeouidong as his work district and handles key-box splitting and opening verification.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Yeouido Vault Keykeeper, Song Jaemin''s Deputy. He splits the key into three pieces, distributes them to the Investment Council, the appraiser, and an outside witness, and forbids opening by one person alone. Saetgang Waiting Hall is his facility holding, distinct from his vault key duties.\n\n**Relations.** Keeps Song Jae-min''s vault key box and locks Guk Du-bong''s transcribed ledger. Supports Jeong Ho-jun''s public-data relay box by box.\n\n**Ambition.** He relays the Joint Technology Ledger''s verification data only through the vault box, ending the practice of holding researchers hostage by means of key authority.\n\n**Fear.** That the vault key falls into military hands and the Yeouido vault becomes a secret warehouse.\n\n**Intervention.** Can safely move one key piece, or expose the backdoor the military side demanded.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −5 | Openness 15 | Force −35 | Material −15 | Communal 5 | Principle 45 | Publicity 60 | Qualification 5 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −10 | Display 0 | Persistence 5 | Orientation fluid | Union none\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K222","name":"Song Jaemin","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"Direct Subordinate","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Du Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Song Jaemin","basis":"keeping Song Jaemin''s cipher box safe,"},{"from":"Du Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Guk Dubong","basis":"Locks Guk Dubong''s transcription ledger"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Guk Dubong","type":"Contract","to":"Du Yong","basis":"Shares Du Yong''s repository keys and seals"},{"from":"Yongso","type":"Contract","to":"Du Yong","basis":"Matches the seal with Du Yong''s storage box"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0234","name":"두용","title":"기록 저장소 열쇠지기, 송재민의 실무 담당자","position":"여의도 금고 열쇠지기, 송재민의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K233","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"금고 키 함 분할·개함 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-두용","detailRoute":"/people/person-0234","birthDate":"2095-01-28","birthday":"01-28","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"chest-custody","name":"키 함 보관·개함 확인","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"chest-custody-disposition","name":"호기심 개함 거부","description":"호기심으로 함을 여는 일을 누설과 같은 죄로 본다.","behavior":"호기심으로 함을 여는 일을 누설과 같은 죄로 본다.","stress":"키가 군사 측에 넘어가 비밀 창고가 될 것을 두려워한다.","relationship":"송재민의 금고 키 함을 보관하고, 국두봉의 필사 원장을 잠근다. 정호준의 공개 자료 중계를 함 단위로 지지한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"공동 개함","description":"세 조각 키로 단독 개함을 막는다.","behavior":"세 조각 키로 단독 개함을 막는다.","stress":"금고 키가 군사 측에 넘어가 여의도 금고가 비밀 창고가 되는 것.","relationship":"송재민의 금고 키 함을 보관하고, 국두봉의 필사 원장을 잠근다. 정호준의 공개 자료 중계를 함 단위로 지지한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 기록 저장소 열쇠지기, 송재민의 실무 담당자.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:saetgang-concourse","name":{"ko":"샛강 대합실"},"holderPersonId":"K233","directLiegePersonId":"K222","stateId":"S09","facilityRef":{"sourcePath":"lore/regions/station-interiors.json","stationName":"샛강","stationIdentity":{"district":"영등포구","lat":37.51736,"lon":126.92828},"siteSourcePath":"lore/regions/content/11560.json","siteAnchor":"osm:node:8401534578","layerId":"concourse","layerName":"역사 대합실"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"clan":{"id":"b450-b450-b989","name":"두릉 두씨","crest":"clan-crests/b450-b450-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-5,"개방":15,"무력":-35,"물질":-15,"공동":5,"원칙":45,"공개":60,"자격":5,"분산":20,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":35,"위험":-10,"과시":0,"지속":5,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"금고 키 함 분할·개함 확인","소속":"자유도시","품계":"서기","직함":"여의도 금고 열쇠지기, 송재민의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −5 | 개방 15 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −15 | 공동 5 | 원칙 45 | 공개 60 | 자격 5 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 0 | 지속 5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2095-01-28 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 여의도 금고 열쇠지기, 송재민의 실무 담당자 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 두용은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 금고 키 함 분할·개함 확인 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 여의도 금고 열쇠지기, 송재민의 실무 담당자. 키를 세 조각으로 쪼개 출자 평의회·감정관·외부 증인에게 나누고, 단독 개함을 금지한다. 샛강 대합실은 그의 시설 보유지이며, 금고 열쇠 업무와는 구분된다.","일화":"","관계":"송재민의 금고 키 함을 보관하고, 국두봉의 필사 원장을 잠근다. 정호준의 공개 자료 중계를 함 단위로 지지한다.","야망":"공동기술원장의 검증 자료를 금고 함으로만 중계해, 연구자를 인질 삼는 관행을 열쇠 권한으로 끊는다.","공포":"금고 키가 군사 측에 넘어가 여의도 금고가 비밀 창고가 되는 것.","개입":"키 조각 하나를 안전하게 옮기거나, 군사 측이 요구한 뒷문을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"말이 없고 열쇠를 몸에서 떼지 않는다. 호기심으로 함을 여는 일을 누설과 같은 죄로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 금고 키 함 분할·개함 확인\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 여의도 금고 열쇠지기, 송재민의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2095-01-28 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 여의도 금고 열쇠지기, 송재민의 실무 담당자 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 두용은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 금고 키 함 분할·개함 확인 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 여의도 금고 열쇠지기, 송재민의 실무 담당자. 키를 세 조각으로 쪼개 출자 평의회·감정관·외부 증인에게 나누고, 단독 개함을 금지한다. 샛강 대합실은 그의 시설 보유지이며, 금고 열쇠 업무와는 구분된다.\n\n**관계.** 송재민의 금고 키 함을 보관하고, 국두봉의 필사 원장을 잠근다. 정호준의 공개 자료 중계를 함 단위로 지지한다.\n\n**야망.** 공동기술원장의 검증 자료를 금고 함으로만 중계해, 연구자를 인질 삼는 관행을 열쇠 권한으로 끊는다.\n\n**공포.** 금고 키가 군사 측에 넘어가 여의도 금고가 비밀 창고가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 키 조각 하나를 안전하게 옮기거나, 군사 측이 요구한 뒷문을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −5 | 개방 15 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −15 | 공동 5 | 원칙 45 | 공개 60 | 자격 5 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 0 | 지속 5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K222","name":"송재민","relationKind":"direct-vassal","ownerTerm":"직속 부하","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"두용","type":"계약","to":"송재민","basis":"송재민의 암호 함을 보관하고"},{"from":"두용","type":"계약","to":"국두봉","basis":"국두봉의 필사 원장을 잠근다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"국두봉","type":"계약","to":"두용","basis":"두용의 저장소 열쇠와 봉인을 나눈다"},{"from":"용소","type":"계약","to":"두용","basis":"두용의 저장소 함과 봉인을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0235', 'baa8-d568-d3c9', '{"id":"person-0235","name":"Mo Guk","title":"Exchange Records Clerk","position":"Exchange Records Clerk","characterId":"K234","rank":"Stationmaster","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Yeongjong Branch Exchange Log and Passage Register Records","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11410","stateName":"Seodaemun-gu","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#inmul-moguk","detailRoute":"/people/person-0235","birthDate":"2094-04-01","birthday":"04-01","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"exchange-record","name":"Exchange log and roster comparison","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"exchange-record-disposition","name":"Blank-intolerant operation","description":"Keeps passing merchants waiting over blank exchange entries.","behavior":"Keeps passing merchants waiting over blank exchange entries.","stress":"Fears the Huam-dong handover counter becoming a censorship checkpoint.","relationship":"Received Bok Dumo''s field coordinates and linked So Gam''s courier route at the Huam-dong everyday-cargo handover counter. Left Jang Sehwa''s medical handovers and exchange agreement as priorities.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Medical exchange priority","description":"Gives medical handovers and exchange agreements priority in the Huam-dong handover counter records.","behavior":"Gives medical handovers and exchange agreements priority in the Huam-dong handover counter records.","stress":"That the Huam-dong handover counter would become a censorship post and joint exchange would be blocked.","relationship":"Received Bok Dumo''s field coordinates and linked So Gam''s courier route at the Huam-dong everyday-cargo handover counter. Left Jang Sehwa''s medical handovers and exchange agreement as priorities.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Posts exchange logs with passage rosters and prioritizes medical exchange. Leakage of a forged mark is not rewritten as successful control.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11410-S09","name":{"ko":"Seodaemun-gu Government District Directly Held Territory"},"holderPersonId":"K234","directLiegePersonId":"K029","stateId":"S09","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1141058500","name":"Sinchon-dong"},{"id":"region:1141061500","name":"Yeonhui-dong"},{"id":"region:1141062000","name":"Hongje 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1141064000","name":"Hongje 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1141069000","name":"Namgajwa 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1141070000","name":"Namgajwa 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1141071000","name":"Bukgajwa 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1141072000","name":"Bukgajwa 2-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11410-S09","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11410-S09","name":"Seodaemun-gu Government","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K234","basis":"Opening administrative scale group gu:11410(district) allocation · deterministic candidate selection","stateId":"S09","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1141058500","region:1141061500","region:1141062000","region:1141064000","region:1141069000","region:1141070000","region:1141071000","region:1141072000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s02","name":"The Government","holderPersonId":"K029"}}],"clan":{"id":"baa8-d568-d3c9","name":"Hampyeong Mo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/baa8-d568-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":5,"Openness":20,"Force":-30,"Material":-20,"Communal":10,"Principle":20,"Public":55,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":5,"Display":-20,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Yeongjong Branch Exchange Log and Passage Register Records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Stationmaster","Title":"Exchange Records Clerk","Values":"Authority 5 | Openness 20 | Force −30 | Materialism −20 | Communality 10 | Principle 20 | Transparency 55 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly 0 | Risk 5 | Display −20 | Endurance 35 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Non-monopolistic"},"sections":{"Life":"The approved birth cohort, born 2094-04-01, is Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised on the Yeouido vault watch. The post of exchange records clerk opened through keeping the vault for three days of blackout.\n- Mo Guk cross-checks exchange records against the passage ledger at the Huam-dong living-cargo handover window and sees to Jang Sehwa''s medical-priority handover. Their jurisdiction as Stationmaster and the station dues owed to K029 are separate from this duty.\n- Mo Guk checks the exchange ledger in Namyeong-dong and matches it against the records of the Huam-dong living-cargo handover window.","Offices":"Rank: Stationmaster. Title: Exchange Records Clerk. Checks the shutters and entrances every morning and writes the station''s fuel and food stock on the wall. When the stock drops, she adds the reason in the same box the next day. She also keeps the patrol schedule for the roads around the station across Sinchon-dong, Yeonhui-dong, Hongje, and Namgajwa.","Anecdote":"A seal identical to the one on the forged currency leaked once through an exchange at the Huam-dong handover window.","Relationships":"Receives surveyed coordinates and connects Sogam''s courier route at the Huam-dong living-cargo handover window. Leaves Jang Sehwa''s medical-priority handover and the exchange accord as the priority.","Ambition":"","Fear":"That the Huam-dong handover counter turns into a censorship checkpoint and blocks common exchange.","Intervention":"Can block the origin of the leaked forged currency, or fix the medical-exchange priority clause into the branch ledger."},"biography":"Cannot tolerate blanks in the exchange ledger, and holds merchants who are merely passing through in the exchange ledger for a long time. Rumors without coordinates are not let out beyond the branch.\n\n- Livelihood: Yeongjong Branch Exchange Log and Passage Register Records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Stationmaster\n- Title: Exchange Records Clerk\n**Life.** The approved birth cohort, born 2094-04-01, is Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised on the Yeouido vault watch. The post of exchange records clerk opened through keeping the vault for three days of blackout.\n- Mo Guk cross-checks exchange records against the passage ledger at the Huam-dong living-cargo handover window and sees to Jang Sehwa''s medical-priority handover. Their jurisdiction as Stationmaster and the station dues owed to K029 are separate from this duty.\n- Mo Guk checks the exchange ledger in Namyeong-dong and matches it against the records of the Huam-dong living-cargo handover window.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Stationmaster. Title: Exchange Records Clerk. Checks the shutters and entrances every morning and writes the station''s fuel and food stock on the wall. When the stock drops, she adds the reason in the same box the next day. She also keeps the patrol schedule for the roads around the station across Sinchon-dong, Yeonhui-dong, Hongje, and Namgajwa.\n\n**Anecdote.** A seal identical to the one on the forged currency leaked once through an exchange at the Huam-dong handover window.\n\n**Relationships.** Receives surveyed coordinates and connects Sogam''s courier route at the Huam-dong living-cargo handover window. Leaves Jang Sehwa''s medical-priority handover and the exchange accord as the priority.\n\n**Fear.** That the Huam-dong handover counter turns into a censorship checkpoint and blocks common exchange.\n\n**Intervention.** Can block the origin of the leaked forged currency, or fix the medical-exchange priority clause into the branch ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness 20 | Force −30 | Materialism −20 | Communality 10 | Principle 20 | Transparency 55 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly 0 | Risk 5 | Display −20 | Endurance 35 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Non-monopolistic\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Mo Guk","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Leaves Jang Sehwa''s medical-bulletin accord as the relay priority"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Sun Hangyeol","type":"Oath","to":"Mo Guk","basis":"Testifies at Mo Guk''s northwest gate relay, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0235","name":"모국","title":"환전 기록 담당 서기","position":"환전 기록 담당 서기","characterId":"K234","rank":"역장","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"영종지점 환전 로그·통행 명부 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11410","stateName":"서대문구","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-모국","detailRoute":"/people/person-0235","birthDate":"2094-04-01","birthday":"04-01","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"exchange-record","name":"환전 로그·명부 대조","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"exchange-record-disposition","name":"빈칸을 붙잡는 운영","description":"빈 환전 칸을 참지 못해 통과 상인을 오래 붙잡아 둔다.","behavior":"빈 환전 칸을 참지 못해 통과 상인을 오래 붙잡아 둔다.","stress":"후암동 인계 창구가 검열 초소가 될 것을 두려워한다.","relationship":"복두모의 실측 좌표를 받고, 소감의 전령로를 후암동 생활 화물 인계 창구에서 잇는다. 장세화의 의료 우선 인계와 환전 협약을 우선으로 남긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"의료 환전 우선","description":"의료 우선 인계와 환전 협약을 후암동 인계 창구 기록에 우선 남긴다.","behavior":"의료 우선 인계와 환전 협약을 후암동 인계 창구 기록에 우선 남긴다.","stress":"후암동 인계 창구가 검열 초소로 바뀌어 공동 환전이 막히는 것.","relationship":"복두모의 실측 좌표를 받고, 소감의 전령로를 후암동 생활 화물 인계 창구에서 잇는다. 장세화의 의료 우선 인계와 환전 협약을 우선으로 남긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"환전 로그와 통행 명부를 함께 게시하고 의료 환전 협약을 우선한다. 위조 각인 유출은 통제의 성공으로 바꾸어 쓰지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11410-S09","name":{"ko":"서대문구 정부 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K234","directLiegePersonId":"K029","stateId":"S09","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1141058500","name":"신촌동"},{"id":"region:1141061500","name":"연희동"},{"id":"region:1141062000","name":"홍제1동"},{"id":"region:1141064000","name":"홍제3동"},{"id":"region:1141069000","name":"남가좌1동"},{"id":"region:1141070000","name":"남가좌2동"},{"id":"region:1141071000","name":"북가좌1동"},{"id":"region:1141072000","name":"북가좌2동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11410-S09","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11410-S09","name":"서대문구 정부","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K234","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11410(district) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S09","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1141058500","region:1141061500","region:1141062000","region:1141064000","region:1141069000","region:1141070000","region:1141071000","region:1141072000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s02","name":"정부","holderPersonId":"K029"}}],"clan":{"id":"baa8-d568-d3c9","name":"함평 모씨","crest":"clan-crests/baa8-d568-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":5,"개방":20,"무력":-30,"물질":-20,"공동":10,"원칙":20,"공개":55,"자격":10,"분산":20,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":0,"위험":5,"과시":-20,"지속":35,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"영종지점 환전 로그·통행 명부 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"역장","직함":"환전 기록 담당 서기","가치관":"권위 5 | 개방 20 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 20 | 공개 55 | 자격 10 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 0 | 위험 5 | 과시 −20 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2094-04-01 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 여의도 금고 당직에서 자랐다. 환전 기록 담당 서기 자리는 정전 사흘 금고 유지로 열렸다.\n- 모국은 후암동의 생활 화물 인계 창구에서 환전 기록과 통행 명부를 대조하고 장세화의 의료 우선 인계를 챙긴다. 역장으로서의 관할과 K029에게 지는 봉속은 이 업무와 별개다.\n- 모국은 남영동에서 환전 장부를 확인하고 후암동 생활 화물 인계 창구의 기록과 맞춘다.","관직":"품계 역장. 직함은 환전 기록 담당 서기. 매일 아침 셔터와 출입구를 점검하고 역 안 연료·식량 재고를 벽에 적는다. 재고가 줄면 다음 날 같은 칸에 이유를 덧붙여 적는다. 신촌동·연희동·홍제·남가좌 일대 역 주변 길의 순찰표도 함께 챙긴다.","일화":"위조 화폐와 같은 각인이 후암동 인계 창구의 환전에서 한 차례 새어 나갔다.","관계":"실측 좌표를 받고, 소감의 전령로를 후암동 생활 화물 인계 창구에서 잇는다. 장세화의 의료 우선 인계와 환전 협약을 우선으로 남긴다.","야망":"","공포":"후암동 인계 창구가 검열 초소로 바뀌어 공동 환전이 막히는 것.","개입":"새어 나간 위조 화폐의 원점을 막거나, 의료 환전 우선 조항을 지점 원장에 고정할 수 있다."},"biography":"환전 장부의 빈칸을 참지 못하고, 통과만 하는 상인을 환전 원장에 오래 붙잡아 둔다. 좌표 없는 소문은 지점 밖으로 내보내지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 영종지점 환전 로그·통행 명부 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 역장\n- 직함: 환전 기록 담당 서기\n**생애.** 2094-04-01 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 여의도 금고 당직에서 자랐다. 환전 기록 담당 서기 자리는 정전 사흘 금고 유지로 열렸다.\n- 모국은 후암동의 생활 화물 인계 창구에서 환전 기록과 통행 명부를 대조하고 장세화의 의료 우선 인계를 챙긴다. 역장으로서의 관할과 K029에게 지는 봉속은 이 업무와 별개다.\n- 모국은 남영동에서 환전 장부를 확인하고 후암동 생활 화물 인계 창구의 기록과 맞춘다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 역장. 직함은 환전 기록 담당 서기. 매일 아침 셔터와 출입구를 점검하고 역 안 연료·식량 재고를 벽에 적는다. 재고가 줄면 다음 날 같은 칸에 이유를 덧붙여 적는다. 신촌동·연희동·홍제·남가좌 일대 역 주변 길의 순찰표도 함께 챙긴다.\n\n**일화.** 위조 화폐와 같은 각인이 후암동 인계 창구의 환전에서 한 차례 새어 나갔다.\n\n**관계.** 실측 좌표를 받고, 소감의 전령로를 후암동 생활 화물 인계 창구에서 잇는다. 장세화의 의료 우선 인계와 환전 협약을 우선으로 남긴다.\n\n**공포.** 후암동 인계 창구가 검열 초소로 바뀌어 공동 환전이 막히는 것.\n\n**개입.** 새어 나간 위조 화폐의 원점을 막거나, 의료 환전 우선 조항을 지점 원장에 고정할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 5 | 개방 20 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 20 | 공개 55 | 자격 10 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 0 | 위험 5 | 과시 −20 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"모국","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 의료속보 협약을 중계 우선으로 남긴다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"순한결","type":"맹세","to":"모국","basis":"모국의 서북 관문 중계에서 증언하고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0236', 'bd09-d558-c74c', '{"id":"person-0236","name":"Bongyong","title":"Outpost Officer of the Channel Guild Formation Office, Aide to Oh Haneul","position":"Outpost Officer of the Channel Guild Formation Office, Aide to Oh Haneul","characterId":"K235","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Council Speaking-Time Chalkboard and Turn Order Management","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11440","stateName":"Mapo-gu","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#inmul-bongyong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0236","birthDate":"2083-06-02","birthday":"06-02","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"turn-board","name":"Speaking-turn board management","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"turn-board-disposition","name":"Cuts speeches with chalk","description":"Breaks chalk to cut overruns and crosses bribery traces rather than erasing them.","behavior":"Breaks chalk to cut overruns and crosses bribery traces rather than erasing them.","stress":"Fears the board being sold as advertising space.","relationship":"Maintains the board under O Haneul, matches Sogam’s times and includes O Haerin’s prices only during council time.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Time comparison","description":"Matches board times with messenger records.","behavior":"Matches board times with messenger records.","stress":"Fears the board being sold as advertising space.","relationship":"Maintains the board under O Haneul, matches Sogam’s times and includes O Haerin’s prices only during council time.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Allocates house speaking times and crosses out purchased turns, preserving the field record of veto arrangements.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11440-S09","name":{"ko":"Mapo District Workshop Domain Direct Holdings"},"holderPersonId":"K235","directLiegePersonId":"K029","stateId":"S09","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1144055500","name":"Ahyeon-dong"},{"id":"region:1144056500","name":"Gongdeok-dong"},{"id":"region:1144058500","name":"Dohwa-dong"},{"id":"region:1144059000","name":"Yonggang-dong"},{"id":"region:1144060000","name":"Daeheung-dong"},{"id":"region:1144061000","name":"Yeomni-dong"},{"id":"region:1144063000","name":"Sinsu-dong"},{"id":"region:1144065500","name":"Seogang-dong"},{"id":"region:1144066000","name":"Seogyo-dong"},{"id":"region:1144068000","name":"Hapjeong-dong"},{"id":"region:1144069000","name":"Mangwon 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1144070000","name":"Mangwon 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1144071000","name":"Yeonnam-dong"},{"id":"region:1144072000","name":"Seongsan 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1144073000","name":"Seongsan 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1144074000","name":"Sangam-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11440-S09","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11440-S09","name":"Mapo-gu District","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K235","basis":"Opening administrative scale group gu:11440(district) allocation · deterministic candidate selection","stateId":"S09","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1144055500","region:1144056500","region:1144058500","region:1144059000","region:1144060000","region:1144061000","region:1144063000","region:1144065500","region:1144066000","region:1144068000","region:1144069000","region:1144070000","region:1144071000","region:1144072000","region:1144073000","region:1144074000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s02","name":"The Government","holderPersonId":"K029"}}],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"Haeum Bong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-5,"Openness":10,"Force":-30,"Material":0,"Communal":-5,"Principle":10,"Public":50,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":20,"Risk":15,"Display":-25,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Council Speaking-Time Chalkboard and Turn Order Management","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Outpost Officer of the Channel Guild Formation Office, Aide to Oh Haneul","Values":"Authority −5 | Openness 10 | Force −30 | Materialism 0 | Communality −5 | Principle 10 | Transparency 50 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly 20 | Risk 15 | Display −25 | Endurance 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-monopolistic"},"sections":{"Life":"The approved birth cohort, born 2083-06-02, is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised on the waiting-hall watch. The post of Investment Council Clerk''s Office base duty officer, O Haneul''s duty officer, opened through a substitute watch for an unexcused shift absence.\n- Bong Yong makes Namyeong-dong the work district and handles the council speaking-time chalkboard and turn management.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Outpost Officer of the Channel Guild Formation Office, Aide to Oh Haneul. Divides each clan''s speaking time by lottery and appraisal score, and strikes through with chalk any turn showing traces of bribery. Holding the directly held land of the Mapo-gu District is separate from this clerk''s work.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Takes charge of the chalkboard under O Haneul''s command, and syncs times with Sogam''s courier ledger. Enters O Haerin''s rates only during council time.","Ambition":"","Fear":"The Clerk''s Office chalkboard being sold at advertising rates, leaving O Haneul''s veto an empty blank.","Intervention":"Can reveal the covered square, or pin communal time to the very top of the chalkboard."},"biography":"Sociable, but turns harsh at blanks on the chalkboard. When one investment clan speaks too long, snaps the chalk and cuts off the speech.\n\n- Livelihood: Council Speaking-Time Chalkboard and Turn Order Management\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Outpost Officer of the Channel Guild Formation Office, Aide to Oh Haneul\n**Life.** The approved birth cohort, born 2083-06-02, is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised on the waiting-hall watch. The post of Investment Council Clerk''s Office base duty officer, O Haneul''s duty officer, opened through a substitute watch for an unexcused shift absence.\n- Bong Yong makes Namyeong-dong the work district and handles the council speaking-time chalkboard and turn management.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Outpost Officer of the Channel Guild Formation Office, Aide to Oh Haneul. Divides each clan''s speaking time by lottery and appraisal score, and strikes through with chalk any turn showing traces of bribery. Holding the directly held land of the Mapo-gu District is separate from this clerk''s work.\n\n**Relationships.** Takes charge of the chalkboard under O Haneul''s command, and syncs times with Sogam''s courier ledger. Enters O Haerin''s rates only during council time.\n\n**Fear.** The Clerk''s Office chalkboard being sold at advertising rates, leaving O Haneul''s veto an empty blank.\n\n**Intervention.** Can reveal the covered square, or pin communal time to the very top of the chalkboard.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −5 | Openness 10 | Force −30 | Materialism 0 | Communality −5 | Principle 10 | Transparency 50 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly 20 | Risk 15 | Display −25 | Endurance 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-monopolistic\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bongyong","type":"Command","to":"Oh Haneul","basis":"Taking charge of the blackboard under O Haneul''s command, and"},{"from":"Bongyong","type":"Contract","to":"So Gam","basis":"Syncs times with So Gam''s courier ledger"}],"incoming":[{"from":"So Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Bongyong","basis":"Aligns the blackboard in Bong Yong''s staffing office"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0236","name":"봉용","title":"채널 길드 편성실 거점 실무 담당자, 오하늘의 실무 담당자","position":"출자 평의회 서기실 거점 실무 담당자, 오하늘의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K235","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"평의회 발언 시간 칠판·순번 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11440","stateName":"마포구","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-봉용","detailRoute":"/people/person-0236","birthDate":"2083-06-02","birthday":"06-02","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"turn-board","name":"발언 칠판 관리","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"turn-board-disposition","name":"분필로 끊는 발언","description":"가문이 오래 말하면 분필을 꺾어 끊고 매수 흔적을 지운 대신 가로지른다.","behavior":"가문이 오래 말하면 분필을 꺾어 끊고 매수 흔적을 지운 대신 가로지른다.","stress":"칠판이 광고 시세로 팔릴 것을 두려워한다.","relationship":"오하늘의 지휘로 칠판을 맡고, 소감의 전령 원장과 시각을 맞춘다. 오해린의 시세를 평의회 시간에만 넣는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"시각 대조","description":"칠판과 전령 원장의 시각을 맞춘다.","behavior":"칠판과 전령 원장의 시각을 맞춘다.","stress":"서기실 칠판이 광고 시세로 팔려 오하늘의 거부권이 빈 칸이 되는 것.","relationship":"오하늘의 지휘로 칠판을 맡고, 소감의 전령 원장과 시각을 맞춘다. 오해린의 시세를 평의회 시간에만 넣는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"가문 발언 시간을 배분하며 매수 순번을 칠판에서 가로지른다. 거부권의 현장 기록을 지키는 실무자다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11440-S09","name":{"ko":"마포구 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K235","directLiegePersonId":"K029","stateId":"S09","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1144055500","name":"아현동"},{"id":"region:1144056500","name":"공덕동"},{"id":"region:1144058500","name":"도화동"},{"id":"region:1144059000","name":"용강동"},{"id":"region:1144060000","name":"대흥동"},{"id":"region:1144061000","name":"염리동"},{"id":"region:1144063000","name":"신수동"},{"id":"region:1144065500","name":"서강동"},{"id":"region:1144066000","name":"서교동"},{"id":"region:1144068000","name":"합정동"},{"id":"region:1144069000","name":"망원1동"},{"id":"region:1144070000","name":"망원2동"},{"id":"region:1144071000","name":"연남동"},{"id":"region:1144072000","name":"성산1동"},{"id":"region:1144073000","name":"성산2동"},{"id":"region:1144074000","name":"상암동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11440-S09","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11440-S09","name":"마포구","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K235","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11440(district) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S09","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s02","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1144055500","region:1144056500","region:1144058500","region:1144059000","region:1144060000","region:1144061000","region:1144063000","region:1144065500","region:1144066000","region:1144068000","region:1144069000","region:1144070000","region:1144071000","region:1144072000","region:1144073000","region:1144074000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s02","name":"정부","holderPersonId":"K029"}}],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"하음 봉씨","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-5,"개방":10,"무력":-30,"물질":0,"공동":-5,"원칙":10,"공개":50,"자격":15,"분산":30,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":20,"위험":15,"과시":-25,"지속":35,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"평의회 발언 시간 칠판·순번 관리","소속":"정부","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"채널 길드 편성실 거점 실무 담당자, 오하늘의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −5 | 개방 10 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 10 | 공개 50 | 자격 15 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 20 | 위험 15 | 과시 −25 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2083-06-02 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 출자 평의회 서기실 거점 실무 담당자, 오하늘의 실무 담당자 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 봉용은 남영동을 업무동으로 삼아 평의회 발언 시간 칠판·순번 관리 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 출자 평의회 서기실 거점 실무 담당자, 오하늘의 실무 담당자. 가문별 발언 시간을 추첨과 감정 점수로 나누고, 매수 흔적이 있는 순번은 분필로 가로지른다. 마포구 직영지 보유와 이 서기 업무는 별개다.","일화":"","관계":"오하늘의 지휘로 칠판을 맡고, 소감의 전령 원장과 시각을 맞춘다. 오해린의 시세를 평의회 시간에만 넣는다.","야망":"","공포":"서기실 칠판이 광고 시세로 팔려 오하늘의 거부권이 빈 칸이 되는 것.","개입":"덮인 칸을 공개하거나, 공동 시간을 칠판 맨 위에 고정할 수 있다."},"biography":"사교적이나 칠판의 빈칸을 보면 가혹해진다. 한 출자 가문이 너무 오래 말하면 분필을 꺾어 발언을 끊는다.\n\n- 생업: 평의회 발언 시간 칠판·순번 관리\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 출자 평의회 서기실 거점 실무 담당자, 오하늘의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2083-06-02 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 출자 평의회 서기실 거점 실무 담당자, 오하늘의 실무 담당자 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 봉용은 남영동을 업무동으로 삼아 평의회 발언 시간 칠판·순번 관리 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 출자 평의회 서기실 거점 실무 담당자, 오하늘의 실무 담당자. 가문별 발언 시간을 추첨과 감정 점수로 나누고, 매수 흔적이 있는 순번은 분필로 가로지른다. 마포구 직영지 보유와 이 서기 업무는 별개다.\n\n**관계.** 오하늘의 지휘로 칠판을 맡고, 소감의 전령 원장과 시각을 맞춘다. 오해린의 시세를 평의회 시간에만 넣는다.\n\n**공포.** 서기실 칠판이 광고 시세로 팔려 오하늘의 거부권이 빈 칸이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 덮인 칸을 공개하거나, 공동 시간을 칠판 맨 위에 고정할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −5 | 개방 10 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 10 | 공개 50 | 자격 15 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 20 | 위험 15 | 과시 −25 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"봉용","type":"지휘","to":"오하늘","basis":"오하늘의 지휘로 칠판을 맡고"},{"from":"봉용","type":"계약","to":"소감","basis":"소감의 전령 원장과 시각을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"소감","type":"계약","to":"봉용","basis":"봉용의 편성실 칠판을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0237', 'c6a9-d64d-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0237","name":"Yongso","title":"Cipher Relay Booth Officer, Aide to Song Jaemin","position":"Vault Key Relay Booth Officer, Aide to Song Jaemin","characterId":"K236","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Vault Key Relay Booth Seals and Fragment Distribution","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#inmul-yongso","detailRoute":"/people/person-0237","birthDate":"2071-06-23","birthday":"06-23","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"relay-seals","name":"Relay sealing and piece distribution","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"relay-seals-disposition","name":"Guards against decoding curiosity","description":"Remembers piece weights and values booth silence over decoding.","behavior":"Remembers piece weights and values booth silence over decoding.","stress":"That the booth keys pass to the military side and the Yeouido Vault becomes Bae Ujin''s secret storehouse.","relationship":"Runs the booth under Song Jaemin, matches seals with Duyong and relays only Jeong Hojun’s public data.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Relays only public data","description":"Relays only Jeong Hojun’s public data.","behavior":"Relays only Jeong Hojun’s public data.","stress":"That the booth keys pass to the military side and the Yeouido Vault becomes Bae Ujin''s secret storehouse.","relationship":"Runs the booth under Song Jaemin, matches seals with Duyong and relays only Jeong Hojun’s public data.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Distributes key pieces and relays only public data. A blank seal-ledger line remains an unresolved access clue.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"Yong Clan of Hongcheon","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":10,"Force":-35,"Material":-5,"Communal":5,"Principle":15,"Public":40,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-30,"Display":5,"Sustained":-20,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Vault Key Relay Booth Seals and Fragment Distribution","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Vault Key Relay Booth Officer, Aide to Song Jaemin","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 10 | Force −35 | Material −5 | Communal 5 | Principle 15 | Transparency 40 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −30 | Display 5 | Persistence −20 | Orientation: Opposite sex | Bonding: Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2071-06-23; the approved birth cohort is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised on the Yeouido Vault night watch. The post of Vault Key Relay Booth Operative and Song Jaemin''s Aide opened through keeping the vault going during the three-day blackout.\n- Yong So uses Yeouidong as a workplace district and handles the sealing and fragment distribution of the Vault Key Relay Booth.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Titles: Vault Key Relay Booth Operative, Song Jaemin''s Aide. Divides the key fragments among Song Jaemin, Du Yong, and an outside witness, and forbids decrypting alone.","Anecdote":"When Magok proposed sending researchers on the condition of a vault key relay, a blank line appeared in the booth seal ledger.","Relationships":"Runs the booth under Song Jaemin''s command and matches seals with Du Yong''s storage chest. Puts only Jeong Hojun''s public materials up for relay.","Ambition":"Moves verification materials to the vault key relay while splitting the key, technically cutting off deals that hold researchers hostage.","Fear":"That the booth key will pass into military hands and the Yeouido Vault will become Bae Ujin''s secret storehouse.","Intervention":"Can bring in a witness to fill the blank line, or expose the backdoor that was demanded."},"biography":"Remembers the weight of the key fragments in the fingers and regards curiosity about decryption as a sin. Keeps the silence inside the relay booth more carefully than any cipher.\n\n- Livelihood: Vault Key Relay Booth Seals and Fragment Distribution\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Vault Key Relay Booth Officer, Aide to Song Jaemin\n**Life.** Born 2071-06-23; the approved birth cohort is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised on the Yeouido Vault night watch. The post of Vault Key Relay Booth Operative and Song Jaemin''s Aide opened through keeping the vault going during the three-day blackout.\n- Yong So uses Yeouidong as a workplace district and handles the sealing and fragment distribution of the Vault Key Relay Booth.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Titles: Vault Key Relay Booth Operative, Song Jaemin''s Aide. Divides the key fragments among Song Jaemin, Du Yong, and an outside witness, and forbids decrypting alone.\n\n**Anecdote.** When Magok proposed sending researchers on the condition of a vault key relay, a blank line appeared in the booth seal ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Runs the booth under Song Jaemin''s command and matches seals with Du Yong''s storage chest. Puts only Jeong Hojun''s public materials up for relay.\n\n**Ambition.** Moves verification materials to the vault key relay while splitting the key, technically cutting off deals that hold researchers hostage.\n\n**Fear.** That the booth key will pass into military hands and the Yeouido Vault will become Bae Ujin''s secret storehouse.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in a witness to fill the blank line, or expose the backdoor that was demanded.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 10 | Force −35 | Material −5 | Communal 5 | Principle 15 | Transparency 40 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −30 | Display 5 | Persistence −20 | Orientation: Opposite sex | Bonding: Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yongso","type":"Command","to":"Song Jaemin","basis":"running the booths under Song Jaemin''s direction,"},{"from":"Yongso","type":"Contract","to":"Du Yong","basis":"Matches the seal with Du Yong''s storage box"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0237","name":"용소","title":"암호 중계 부스 실무 담당자, 송재민의 실무 담당자","position":"금고 키 중계 부스 실무 담당자, 송재민의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K236","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"금고 키 중계 부스 봉인·조각 배분","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-용소","detailRoute":"/people/person-0237","birthDate":"2071-06-23","birthday":"06-23","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"relay-seals","name":"중계 봉인·조각 배분","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"relay-seals-disposition","name":"해독 호기심 경계","description":"조각의 무게를 기억하고 부스의 침묵을 해독보다 중히 지킨다.","behavior":"조각의 무게를 기억하고 부스의 침묵을 해독보다 중히 지킨다.","stress":"부스 키가 군사 측에 넘어갈 것을 두려워한다.","relationship":"송재민의 지휘로 부스를 돌리고, 두용의 저장소 함과 봉인을 맞춘다. 정호준의 공개 자료만 중계 대상으로 올린다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"공개 자료만 중계","description":"정호준의 공개 자료만 중계 대상으로 올린다.","behavior":"정호준의 공개 자료만 중계 대상으로 올린다.","stress":"부스 키가 군사 측에 넘어가 여의도 금고가 배우진의 비밀 창고가 되는 것.","relationship":"송재민의 지휘로 부스를 돌리고, 두용의 저장소 함과 봉인을 맞춘다. 정호준의 공개 자료만 중계 대상으로 올린다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"키 조각을 분산하고 공개 자료만 중계한다. 봉인 장부의 빈 줄은 무단 접근의 미해결 단서다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"홍천 용씨","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":10,"무력":-35,"물질":-5,"공동":5,"원칙":15,"공개":40,"자격":10,"분산":20,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-15,"위험":-30,"과시":5,"지속":-20,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"금고 키 중계 부스 봉인·조각 배분","소속":"자유도시","품계":"서기","직함":"금고 키 중계 부스 실무 담당자, 송재민의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −5 | 공동 5 | 원칙 15 | 공개 40 | 자격 10 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −30 | 과시 5 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2071-06-23 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 여의도 금고 당직에서 자랐다. 금고 키 중계 부스 실무 담당자, 송재민의 실무 담당자 자리는 정전 사흘 금고 유지로 열렸다.\n- 용소는 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 금고 키 중계 부스 봉인·조각 배분 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 금고 키 중계 부스 실무 담당자, 송재민의 실무 담당자. 키 조각을 송재민·두용·외부 증인에게 나누고, 단독 해독을 금지한다.","일화":"마곡이 금고 키 중계를 조건으로 연구자 파견을 제안하자 부스 봉인 장부에 빈 줄이 생겼다.","관계":"송재민의 지휘로 부스를 돌리고, 두용의 저장소 함과 봉인을 맞춘다. 정호준의 공개 자료만 중계 대상으로 올린다.","야망":"검증 자료를 금고 키 중계로 옮기되 키를 쪼개, 연구자를 인질 삼는 거래를 기술적으로 끊는다.","공포":"부스 키가 군사 측에 넘어가 여의도 금고가 배우진의 비밀 창고가 되는 것.","개입":"빈 줄을 채울 증인을 데려오거나, 요구된 뒷문을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"열쇠 조각의 무게를 손가락으로 기억하고, 해독 호기심을 죄로 본다. 중계 부스 안의 침묵을 암호보다 중히 지킨다.\n\n- 생업: 금고 키 중계 부스 봉인·조각 배분\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 금고 키 중계 부스 실무 담당자, 송재민의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2071-06-23 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 여의도 금고 당직에서 자랐다. 금고 키 중계 부스 실무 담당자, 송재민의 실무 담당자 자리는 정전 사흘 금고 유지로 열렸다.\n- 용소는 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 금고 키 중계 부스 봉인·조각 배분 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 금고 키 중계 부스 실무 담당자, 송재민의 실무 담당자. 키 조각을 송재민·두용·외부 증인에게 나누고, 단독 해독을 금지한다.\n\n**일화.** 마곡이 금고 키 중계를 조건으로 연구자 파견을 제안하자 부스 봉인 장부에 빈 줄이 생겼다.\n\n**관계.** 송재민의 지휘로 부스를 돌리고, 두용의 저장소 함과 봉인을 맞춘다. 정호준의 공개 자료만 중계 대상으로 올린다.\n\n**야망.** 검증 자료를 금고 키 중계로 옮기되 키를 쪼개, 연구자를 인질 삼는 거래를 기술적으로 끊는다.\n\n**공포.** 부스 키가 군사 측에 넘어가 여의도 금고가 배우진의 비밀 창고가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 빈 줄을 채울 증인을 데려오거나, 요구된 뒷문을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −5 | 공동 5 | 원칙 15 | 공개 40 | 자격 10 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −30 | 과시 5 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"용소","type":"지휘","to":"송재민","basis":"송재민의 지휘로 부스를 돌리고"},{"from":"용소","type":"계약","to":"두용","basis":"두용의 저장소 함과 봉인을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0238', 'creative-b780-b3c4-bd09', '{"id":"person-0238","name":"Ranseon","title":"False Transmission Inside Informant","position":"Counterfeit Currency Inside Informant","characterId":"K237","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Counterfeit Currency Internal Records and Testimony Cross-Check","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#inmul-ranseon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0238","birthDate":"2069-06-19","birthday":"06-19","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"internal-disclosure","name":"Internal-record disclosure","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"internal-disclosure-disposition","name":"Cross-checks before exposure","description":"Sends records to appraiser and council together and avoids unilateral exposure before two testimonies.","behavior":"Sends records to appraiser and council together and avoids unilateral exposure before two testimonies.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Simultaneous copy delivery","description":"Sends copies simultaneously to appraiser and council.","behavior":"Sends copies simultaneously to appraiser and council.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: False Transmission Inside Informant.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"creative-b780-b3c4-bd09","name":"Ran Clan of Dobong","crest":"clan-crests/creative-b780-b3c4-bd09.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":15,"Force":-20,"Material":-15,"Communal":0,"Principle":20,"Public":65,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":10,"Display":-25,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Counterfeit Currency Internal Records and Testimony Cross-Check","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Counterfeit Currency Inside Informant","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 15 | Force −20 | Material −15 | Communal 0 | Principle 20 | Transparency 65 | Credentials 15 | Dispersion 25 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 10 | Display −25 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: Both sexes | Bonding: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2069-06-19; the approved birth cohort is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised on the Yeouido Vault night watch. The post of Counterfeit Currency Internal Informant opened through keeping the vault going during the three-day blackout.\n- Ran Se-on uses Yeouidong as a workplace district and handles the cross-checking of internal records and testimony on counterfeit currency.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Counterfeit Currency Inside Informant. Hands copies of the records to the appraisers and the Investment Council at the same time, and does not post a solo exposure on the bulletin board before two testimonies are gathered.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"Discloses the internal records before the counterfeit currency goes out through official counters.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can escort the informant, or delay the records by a day to prevent a riot at the cost of leaving the risk of exposure."},"biography":"Listens to counterfeit engravings before people''s words, and tries to tell with the same hand when silence saves a life and when it covers up a fact. Skeptical, and reads each sentence twice.\n\n- Livelihood: Counterfeit Currency Internal Records and Testimony Cross-Check\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Counterfeit Currency Inside Informant\n**Life.** Born 2069-06-19; the approved birth cohort is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised on the Yeouido Vault night watch. The post of Counterfeit Currency Internal Informant opened through keeping the vault going during the three-day blackout.\n- Ran Se-on uses Yeouidong as a workplace district and handles the cross-checking of internal records and testimony on counterfeit currency.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Counterfeit Currency Inside Informant. Hands copies of the records to the appraisers and the Investment Council at the same time, and does not post a solo exposure on the bulletin board before two testimonies are gathered.\n\n**Ambition.** Discloses the internal records before the counterfeit currency goes out through official counters.\n\n**Intervention.** Can escort the informant, or delay the records by a day to prevent a riot at the cost of leaving the risk of exposure.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 15 | Force −20 | Material −15 | Communal 0 | Principle 20 | Transparency 65 | Credentials 15 | Dispersion 25 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 10 | Display −25 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: Both sexes | Bonding: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ranseon","type":"Oath","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Tests Choe Jiu''s public broadcast network from within, and"},{"from":"Ranseon","type":"Oath","to":"Hong Yejun","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Hong Yejun","type":"Contract","to":"Ranseon","basis":"Accepts Ran Se-on''s internal exposé only as sealed testimony"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0238","name":"란세온","title":"가짜 송신 내부 제보자","position":"위조 화폐 내부 제보자","characterId":"K237","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"위조 화폐 내부 기록·증언 교차","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-란세온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0238","birthDate":"2069-06-19","birthday":"06-19","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"internal-disclosure","name":"내부 기록 공개","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"internal-disclosure-disposition","name":"폭로 전 교차 확인","description":"기록을 감정관과 평의회에 함께 보내고 두 증언 전에는 단독 폭로를 하지 않는다.","behavior":"기록을 감정관과 평의회에 함께 보내고 두 증언 전에는 단독 폭로를 하지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"동시 사본 전달","description":"감정관과 평의회에 사본을 동시에 넘긴다.","behavior":"감정관과 평의회에 사본을 동시에 넘긴다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 가짜 송신 내부 제보자.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"creative-b780-b3c4-bd09","name":"도봉 란씨","crest":"clan-crests/creative-b780-b3c4-bd09.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":15,"무력":-20,"물질":-15,"공동":0,"원칙":20,"공개":65,"자격":15,"분산":25,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":10,"위험":10,"과시":-25,"지속":10,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"위조 화폐 내부 기록·증언 교차","소속":"자유도시","품계":"서기","직함":"위조 화폐 내부 제보자","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −15 | 공동 0 | 원칙 20 | 공개 65 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 10 | 위험 10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 10 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2069-06-19 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 여의도 금고 당직에서 자랐다. 위조 화폐 내부 제보자 자리는 정전 사흘 금고 유지로 열렸다.\n- 란세온은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 위조 화폐 내부 기록·증언 교차 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 위조 화폐 내부 제보자. 기록 사본을 감정관과 출자 평의회에 동시에 넘기고, 단독 폭로는 두 증언이 모이기 전에는 게시판에 올리지 않는다.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"위조 화폐가 공식 창구로 나가기 전에 내부 기록을 공개한다.","공포":"","개입":"제보자를 호송하거나, 기록을 하루 늦춰 폭동을 막는 대신 폭로 위험을 남길 수 있다."},"biography":"위조 각인을 사람 말보다 먼저 듣고, 침묵으로 사람을 살릴 때와 사실을 덮을 때를 같은 손으로 가르려 한다. 회의적이고 문장을 두 번 읽는다.\n\n- 생업: 위조 화폐 내부 기록·증언 교차\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 위조 화폐 내부 제보자\n**생애.** 2069-06-19 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 여의도 금고 당직에서 자랐다. 위조 화폐 내부 제보자 자리는 정전 사흘 금고 유지로 열렸다.\n- 란세온은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 위조 화폐 내부 기록·증언 교차 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 위조 화폐 내부 제보자. 기록 사본을 감정관과 출자 평의회에 동시에 넘기고, 단독 폭로는 두 증언이 모이기 전에는 게시판에 올리지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 위조 화폐가 공식 창구로 나가기 전에 내부 기록을 공개한다.\n\n**개입.** 제보자를 호송하거나, 기록을 하루 늦춰 폭동을 막는 대신 폭로 위험을 남길 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −15 | 공동 0 | 원칙 20 | 공개 65 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 10 | 위험 10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 10 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"란세온","type":"맹세","to":"최지우","basis":"최지우의 공개 방송망을 내부에서 시험하고"},{"from":"란세온","type":"맹세","to":"홍예준","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"홍예준","type":"계약","to":"란세온","basis":"란세온의 내부 폭로를 봉인 증언으로만 받는다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0239', 'c12d-acbd-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0239","name":"Seop Dalho","title":"Audio Record Recovery Courier","position":"Original Ledger Recovery Courier","characterId":"K238","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Original Ledger Box and Key Fragment Transport","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#character-Seopdalho","detailRoute":"/people/person-0239","birthDate":"2092-03-12","birthday":"03-12","age":34,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"original-dispatch","name":"Original chest and key dispatch","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"original-dispatch-disposition","name":"Dual-arrival checking","description":"Keeps two copies despite exertion and waits for both arrival confirmations before opening.","behavior":"Keeps two copies despite exertion and waits for both arrival confirmations before opening.","stress":"Fears military escorts opening the bag.","relationship":"Carries Song Jaemin’s chests and Yun Seorin’s copies, coordinating sequence so Im Chowon’s interpretation does not outrun disclosure.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Separate transport","description":"Sends keys and originals by different routes and checks both arrivals.","behavior":"Sends keys and originals by different routes and checks both arrivals.","stress":"Fears military escorts opening the bag.","relationship":"Carries Song Jaemin’s chests and Yun Seorin’s copies, coordinating sequence so Im Chowon’s interpretation does not outrun disclosure.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Audio Record Recovery Courier.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c12d-acbd-c8fc","name":"Gyeongju Seop Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c12d-acbd-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":10,"Force":-30,"Material":-15,"Communal":5,"Principle":35,"Public":65,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":10,"Display":-10,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Original Ledger Box and Key Fragment Transport","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Original Ledger Recovery Courier","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 10 | Force −30 | Materialism −15 | Communal 5 | Principle 35 | Publicity 65 | Merit 10 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly 5 | Risk 10 | Display −10 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2092-03-12, approved as Birth Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of Original Ledger Recovery Messenger opened when one line of the double ledger was deleted.\n- Seop Dalho uses Yeouidong as her work district and handles the transport of the original ledger case and key fragments.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Original Ledger Recovery Courier. She sends the key fragment and the original case by different routes, and records that the window is not to be opened until both arrival confirmations come in.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"She carries Song Jaemin''s vault key case along the messenger route, delivers the cross-copies of currency and documents to Yun Seorin, and sequences the handoffs so that Im Chowon''s interpretation of the maintenance log does not precede the ledger''s disclosure.","Ambition":"She carries the maintenance log that only Im Chowon can read and the original ledger along the same messenger route, so that the evidence arrives before the counterfeit currency.","Fear":"That the messenger bag is opened to the Military Escort Corps and the Yeouido vault becomes a subcontractor of the secret ledger.","Intervention":"She can carry a key fragment safely, or she can intercept the bag and shake up the timing of disclosure."},"biography":"She remembers the weight of the original case in her fingers, and never puts a note telling someone to decipher it by word of mouth into the bag. Even out of breath, there are two copies.\n\n- Livelihood: Original Ledger Box and Key Fragment Transport\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Original Ledger Recovery Courier\n**Life.** Born 2092-03-12, approved as Birth Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of Original Ledger Recovery Messenger opened when one line of the double ledger was deleted.\n- Seop Dalho uses Yeouidong as her work district and handles the transport of the original ledger case and key fragments.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Original Ledger Recovery Courier. She sends the key fragment and the original case by different routes, and records that the window is not to be opened until both arrival confirmations come in.\n\n**Relations.** She carries Song Jaemin''s vault key case along the messenger route, delivers the cross-copies of currency and documents to Yun Seorin, and sequences the handoffs so that Im Chowon''s interpretation of the maintenance log does not precede the ledger''s disclosure.\n\n**Ambition.** She carries the maintenance log that only Im Chowon can read and the original ledger along the same messenger route, so that the evidence arrives before the counterfeit currency.\n\n**Fear.** That the messenger bag is opened to the Military Escort Corps and the Yeouido vault becomes a subcontractor of the secret ledger.\n\n**Intervention.** She can carry a key fragment safely, or she can intercept the bag and shake up the timing of disclosure.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 10 | Force −30 | Materialism −15 | Communal 5 | Principle 35 | Publicity 65 | Merit 10 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 5 | Risk 10 | Display −10 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seop Dalho","type":"Contract","to":"Song Jaemin","basis":"moving Song Jaemin''s cipher box to the courier route,"},{"from":"Seop Dalho","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Delivering voice-and-document cross copies to Yun Seorin, and"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0239","name":"섭달호","title":"음성기록 회수 전령","position":"장부 원본 회수 전령","characterId":"K238","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"장부 원본 함·열쇠 조각 이송","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-섭달호","detailRoute":"/people/person-0239","birthDate":"2092-03-12","birthday":"03-12","age":34,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"original-dispatch","name":"원본 함·열쇠 이송","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"original-dispatch-disposition","name":"이중 도착 확인","description":"숨이 차도 사본 둘을 지키고 양쪽 도착 확인 전 창구를 열지 않는다.","behavior":"숨이 차도 사본 둘을 지키고 양쪽 도착 확인 전 창구를 열지 않는다.","stress":"가방이 군사 호위단에 열릴 것을 두려워한다.","relationship":"송재민의 금고 키 함을 전령로로 옮기고, 윤서린에게 화폐·문서 교차 사본을 전하며, 임초원의 정비일지 해석이 장부 공개보다 앞서지 않게 순번을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"분리 이송","description":"키와 원본 함을 다른 길로 보내고 둘의 도착을 확인한다.","behavior":"키와 원본 함을 다른 길로 보내고 둘의 도착을 확인한다.","stress":"전령 가방이 군사 호위단에 열려 여의도 금고가 비밀 장부의 하청이 되는 것.","relationship":"송재민의 금고 키 함을 전령로로 옮기고, 윤서린에게 화폐·문서 교차 사본을 전하며, 임초원의 정비일지 해석이 장부 공개보다 앞서지 않게 순번을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 음성기록 회수 전령.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c12d-acbd-c8fc","name":"경주 섭씨","crest":"clan-crests/c12d-acbd-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":10,"무력":-30,"물질":-15,"공동":5,"원칙":35,"공개":65,"자격":10,"분산":10,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":5,"위험":10,"과시":-10,"지속":-15,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"장부 원본 함·열쇠 조각 이송","소속":"자유도시","품계":"서기","직함":"장부 원본 회수 전령","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 10 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −15 | 공동 5 | 원칙 35 | 공개 65 | 자격 10 | 분산 10 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 5 | 위험 10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 −15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2092-03-12 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 장부 원본 회수 전령 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 섭달호는 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 장부 원본 함·열쇠 조각 이송 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 장부 원본 회수 전령. 열쇠 조각과 원본 함을 다른 길로 보내고, 도착 확인이 둘 다 오기 전에는 창구를 열지 않는다고 적는다.","일화":"","관계":"송재민의 금고 키 함을 전령로로 옮기고, 윤서린에게 화폐·문서 교차 사본을 전하며, 임초원의 정비일지 해석이 장부 공개보다 앞서지 않게 순번을 맞춘다.","야망":"임초원만 읽을 수 있는 정비일지와 장부 원본을 같은 전령로로 옮겨 위조 화폐보다 증거가 먼저 도착하게 한다.","공포":"전령 가방이 군사 호위단에 열려 여의도 금고가 비밀 장부의 하청이 되는 것.","개입":"열쇠 조각 하나를 안전하게 옮기거나, 가방을 가로채 공개 시점을 흔들 수 있다."},"biography":"원본 함의 무게를 손가락으로 기억하고, 구두로 해독하라는 쪽지를 가방에 넣지 않는다. 숨이 차도 사본은 두 장이다.\n\n- 생업: 장부 원본 함·열쇠 조각 이송\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 장부 원본 회수 전령\n**생애.** 2092-03-12 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 장부 원본 회수 전령 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 섭달호는 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 장부 원본 함·열쇠 조각 이송 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 장부 원본 회수 전령. 열쇠 조각과 원본 함을 다른 길로 보내고, 도착 확인이 둘 다 오기 전에는 창구를 열지 않는다고 적는다.\n\n**관계.** 송재민의 금고 키 함을 전령로로 옮기고, 윤서린에게 화폐·문서 교차 사본을 전하며, 임초원의 정비일지 해석이 장부 공개보다 앞서지 않게 순번을 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 임초원만 읽을 수 있는 정비일지와 장부 원본을 같은 전령로로 옮겨 위조 화폐보다 증거가 먼저 도착하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 전령 가방이 군사 호위단에 열려 여의도 금고가 비밀 장부의 하청이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 열쇠 조각 하나를 안전하게 옮기거나, 가방을 가로채 공개 시점을 흔들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 10 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −15 | 공동 5 | 원칙 35 | 공개 65 | 자격 10 | 분산 10 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 5 | 위험 10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 −15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"섭달호","type":"계약","to":"송재민","basis":"송재민의 암호 함을 전령로로 옮기고"},{"from":"섭달호","type":"계약","to":"윤서린","basis":"윤서린에게 음성·문서 교차 사본을 전하며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0240', 'd3c9-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0240","name":"Pyeong Jiu","title":"Witness to Pre-Disappearance Transmission Records","position":"Witness to Pre-Disappearance Ledger Records","characterId":"K239","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Vault Duty Roster and Record Timestamp Comparison","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#inmul-pyeong-jiu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0240","birthDate":"2092-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":34,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"record-gap","name":"Duty and timestamp gap comparison","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"record-gap-disposition","name":"Leaves blanks visible","description":"Trusts ledgers but not blank entries and passes gap locations to the original search.","behavior":"Trusts ledgers but not blank entries and passes gap locations to the original search.","stress":"","relationship":"Supports Gwon Mirae’s records with observation and passes gap locations to Choi Jiwoo’s original search, and testifies to the break in the ledger Im Hajun left last.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Preserves gaps","description":"Passes gap locations rather than filling them with announcement time.","behavior":"Passes gap locations rather than filling them with announcement time.","stress":"","relationship":"Supports Gwon Mirae’s records with observation and passes gap locations to Choi Jiwoo’s original search, and testifies to the break in the ledger Im Hajun left last.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Witness to Pre-Disappearance Transmission Records.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d3c9-cda9-c8fc","name":"Chungju Pyeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d3c9-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":10,"Force":-35,"Material":-20,"Communal":-5,"Principle":40,"Public":70,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":-35,"Display":-40,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Vault Duty Roster and Record Timestamp Comparison","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Witness to Pre-Disappearance Ledger Records","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 10 | Force −35 | Materialism −20 | Communal −5 | Principle 40 | Publicity 70 | Merit 0 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −35 | Display −40 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2092-07-30, approved as Birth Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of Pre-Disappearance Ledger Record Witness opened when one line of the double ledger was deleted.\n- Pyeong Jiu uses Yeouidong as his work district and handles the vault duty roster and record-time verification.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Witness to Pre-Disappearance Ledger Records. He pastes the duty names and record times on the same blackboard, and does not open a vault alone without the approval of the Investment Council.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"He supports Gwon Mirae''s vault records with his witness account, hands the blanks to Choe Jiu''s search for the original, and testifies to the break in the ledger that Im Hajun left last.","Ambition":"He leaves the blank in the ledger just before the Chief Steward''s disappearance as a public witness account, so that the disappearance is not consumed merely as an advertisement of governing failure.","Fear":"","Intervention":"He can recover the original ledger."},"biography":"He hears the noise of the all-night duty as a blank, and when two record entries are empty he stands a person there first. Though he calls the ledger honest, he does not trust its blanks.\n\n- Livelihood: Vault Duty Roster and Record Timestamp Comparison\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Witness to Pre-Disappearance Ledger Records\n**Life.** Born 2092-07-30, approved as Birth Cohort 4. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of Pre-Disappearance Ledger Record Witness opened when one line of the double ledger was deleted.\n- Pyeong Jiu uses Yeouidong as his work district and handles the vault duty roster and record-time verification.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Witness to Pre-Disappearance Ledger Records. He pastes the duty names and record times on the same blackboard, and does not open a vault alone without the approval of the Investment Council.\n\n**Relations.** He supports Gwon Mirae''s vault records with his witness account, hands the blanks to Choe Jiu''s search for the original, and testifies to the break in the ledger that Im Hajun left last.\n\n**Ambition.** He leaves the blank in the ledger just before the Chief Steward''s disappearance as a public witness account, so that the disappearance is not consumed merely as an advertisement of governing failure.\n\n**Intervention.** He can recover the original ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 10 | Force −35 | Materialism −20 | Communal −5 | Principle 40 | Publicity 70 | Merit 0 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −35 | Display −40 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Pyeong Jiu","type":"Oath","to":"Gwon Mi-rae","basis":"Backs Gwon Mirae''s transmission records with eyewitness testimony, and"},{"from":"Pyeong Jiu","type":"Oath","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0240","name":"평지우","title":"실종 전 송신 기록 목격자","position":"실종 전 장부 기록 목격자","characterId":"K239","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"금고 당직 명부·기록 시각 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-평지우","detailRoute":"/people/person-0240","birthDate":"2092-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":34,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"record-gap","name":"당직·시각 공백 대조","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"record-gap-disposition","name":"빈칸을 숨기지 않음","description":"장부를 믿으면서도 빈칸은 믿지 않고 공백 위치를 원본 탐색에 넘긴다.","behavior":"장부를 믿으면서도 빈칸은 믿지 않고 공백 위치를 원본 탐색에 넘긴다.","stress":"","relationship":"권미래의 금고 기록을 목격으로 받치고, 최지우의 원본 탐색에 빈 칸을 넘기며, 임하준이 마지막으로 남긴 장부의 끊김을 증언한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"공백 보존","description":"누락 칸을 발표 시간으로 메우지 않고 위치를 넘긴다.","behavior":"누락 칸을 발표 시간으로 메우지 않고 위치를 넘긴다.","stress":"","relationship":"권미래의 금고 기록을 목격으로 받치고, 최지우의 원본 탐색에 빈 칸을 넘기며, 임하준이 마지막으로 남긴 장부의 끊김을 증언한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 실종 전 송신 기록 목격자.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d3c9-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 평씨","crest":"clan-crests/d3c9-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":10,"무력":-35,"물질":-20,"공동":-5,"원칙":40,"공개":70,"자격":0,"분산":15,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-35,"위험":-35,"과시":-40,"지속":0,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"금고 당직 명부·기록 시각 대조","소속":"자유도시","품계":"서기","직함":"실종 전 장부 기록 목격자","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −20 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 40 | 공개 70 | 자격 0 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −40 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2092-07-30 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 실종 전 장부 기록 목격자 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 평지우는 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 금고 당직 명부·기록 시각 대조 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 실종 전 장부 기록 목격자. 당직 명과 기록 시각을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 단독 개함은 출자 평의회의 승인 없이 하지 않는다.","일화":"","관계":"권미래의 금고 기록을 목격으로 받치고, 최지우의 원본 탐색에 빈 칸을 넘기며, 임하준이 마지막으로 남긴 장부의 끊김을 증언한다.","야망":"총관 실종 직전 장부의 빈 칸을 공개 목격으로 남겨 실종이 통치 실패 광고로만 소비되지 않게 한다.","공포":"","개입":"장부 원본을 회수할 수 있다."},"biography":"밤샘 당직의 잡음을 빈 칸으로 듣고, 기록 두 칸이 비면 사람을 먼저 세운다. 장부를 정직하다고 말하면서도 빈칸은 믿지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 금고 당직 명부·기록 시각 대조\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 실종 전 장부 기록 목격자\n**생애.** 2092-07-30 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 4군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 실종 전 장부 기록 목격자 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 평지우는 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 금고 당직 명부·기록 시각 대조 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 실종 전 장부 기록 목격자. 당직 명과 기록 시각을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 단독 개함은 출자 평의회의 승인 없이 하지 않는다.\n\n**관계.** 권미래의 금고 기록을 목격으로 받치고, 최지우의 원본 탐색에 빈 칸을 넘기며, 임하준이 마지막으로 남긴 장부의 끊김을 증언한다.\n\n**야망.** 총관 실종 직전 장부의 빈 칸을 공개 목격으로 남겨 실종이 통치 실패 광고로만 소비되지 않게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 장부 원본을 회수할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −20 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 40 | 공개 70 | 자격 0 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −40 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"평지우","type":"맹세","to":"권미래","basis":"권미래의 송신 기록을 목격으로 받치고"},{"from":"평지우","type":"맹세","to":"최지우","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}');
