verity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c21c-ae08-ad6c-6df3","name":"Geumgu Sun Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c21c-ae08-ad6c-6df3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":5,"Force":-40,"Material":-15,"Communal":-10,"Principle":15,"Public":40,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":10,"Display":25,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Exchange Records and Passage Roster Comparison","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Bukhansan Bogungmun Procession Currency Exchange Witness","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 5 | Force −40 | Material −15 | Communal −10 | Principle 15 | Disclosure 40 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion 15 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 10 | Display 25 | Endurance −10 | Orientation Heterosexual | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"The approved birth cohort for a 2066-02-20 birth is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised on concourse watch. The Bukhansanbogukmun Procession Exchange Witness post opened through substitute duty for an unexcused shift absence.\n- Sun Hangyeol takes Yeongdeungpo-dong as his work district and handles exchange-record and passage-roster collation between the Yeouidong vault and the Yeongdeungpo-dong handover counter.\n- Sun Hangyeol takes Yeouidong as his work district and handles exchange-record and passage-roster collation between the Yeouidong vault and the Yeongdeungpo-dong handover counter.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Bukhansan Bogungmun Procession Currency Exchange Witness. Posts exchange records and passage rosters on the same wall, and does not raise the rate if there are fewer than two independent witnesses.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"Records the Bukhansanbogukmun Procession''s southward move only as a citizenship exchange record, so that the forced-registration announcement cannot seize the official counter first.","Fear":"That exchange records will be carved into a military convoy-guidance ledger, exposing the settlement.","Intervention":"Can block the origin of a leaked ledger, or fix the citizenship exchange clause in the branch ledger."},"biography":"Cannot tolerate blanks in the exchange ledger, and never lets a rate that counts family numbers as troops leave the branch. Does not even utter rumors without coordinates.\n\n- Occupation: Exchange Records and Passage Roster Comparison\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Bukhansan Bogungmun Procession Currency Exchange Witness\n**Life.** The approved birth cohort for a 2066-02-20 birth is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised on concourse watch. The Bukhansanbogukmun Procession Exchange Witness post opened through substitute duty for an unexcused shift absence.\n- Sun Hangyeol takes Yeongdeungpo-dong as his work district and handles exchange-record and passage-roster collation between the Yeouidong vault and the Yeongdeungpo-dong handover counter.\n- Sun Hangyeol takes Yeouidong as his work district and handles exchange-record and passage-roster collation between the Yeouidong vault and the Yeongdeungpo-dong handover counter.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Bukhansan Bogungmun Procession Currency Exchange Witness. Posts exchange records and passage rosters on the same wall, and does not raise the rate if there are fewer than two independent witnesses.\n\n**Ambition.** Records the Bukhansanbogukmun Procession''s southward move only as a citizenship exchange record, so that the forced-registration announcement cannot seize the official counter first.\n\n**Fear.** That exchange records will be carved into a military convoy-guidance ledger, exposing the settlement.\n\n**Intervention.** Can block the origin of a leaked ledger, or fix the citizenship exchange clause in the branch ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 5 | Force −40 | Material −15 | Communal −10 | Principle 15 | Disclosure 40 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion 15 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 10 | Display 25 | Endurance −10 | Orientation Heterosexual | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sun Hangyeol","type":"Oath","to":"Mo Guk","basis":""},{"from":"Sun Hangyeol","type":"Oath","to":"Eo Ha-eun","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0242","name":"순한결","title":"북한산보국문 행렬 속보 증인","position":"북한산보국문 행렬 환전 증인","characterId":"K241","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"환전 기록·통행 명부 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-순한결","detailRoute":"/people/person-0242","birthDate":"2066-02-20","birthday":"02-20","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"civil-exchange","name":"가족 환전 기록","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"civil-exchange-disposition","name":"가족과 병력 분리","description":"가족 숫자를 병력으로 세는 시세를 내보내지 않는다.","behavior":"가족 숫자를 병력으로 세는 시세를 내보내지 않는다.","stress":"환전 기록이 호송 유도 장부로 잘릴 것을 두려워한다.","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"독립 목격 요구","description":"독립 목격 둘 미만이면 시세를 올리지 않는다.","behavior":"독립 목격 둘 미만이면 시세를 올리지 않는다.","stress":"환전 기록이 군사 호송 유도 장부로 잘려 정착지가 노출되는 것.","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 북한산보국문 행렬 속보 증인.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c21c-ae08-ad6c-6df3","name":"금구 순씨","crest":"clan-crests/c21c-ae08-ad6c-6df3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":5,"무력":-40,"물질":-15,"공동":-10,"원칙":15,"공개":40,"자격":10,"분산":15,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":15,"위험":10,"과시":25,"지속":-10,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"환전 기록·통행 명부 대조","소속":"자유도시","품계":"서기","직함":"북한산보국문 행렬 환전 증인","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 5 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −15 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 15 | 공개 40 | 자격 10 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 15 | 위험 10 | 과시 25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2066-02-20 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 북한산보국문 행렬 환전 증인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 순한결은 영등포동을 업무동으로 삼아 여의동 금고와 영등포동 인계 창구 사이의 환전 기록·통행 명부 대조를 맡는다.\n- 순한결은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 여의동 금고와 영등포동 인계 창구 사이의 환전 기록·통행 명부 대조를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 북한산보국문 행렬 환전 증인. 환전 기록과 통행 명부를 같은 벽에 붙이고, 독립 목격이 둘 미만이면 시세를 올리지 않는다.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"북한산보국문 행렬의 남하를 시민권 환전 기록으로만 남겨 강제등록 발표가 공식 창구를 선점하지 못하게 한다.","공포":"환전 기록이 군사 호송 유도 장부로 잘려 정착지가 노출되는 것.","개입":"새어 나간 장부의 원점을 막거나, 시민권 환전 조항을 지점 원장에 고정할 수 있다."},"biography":"환전 장부의 빈칸을 참지 못하고, 가족 숫자를 병력으로 셈하는 시세를 지점 밖으로 내보내지 않는다. 좌표 없는 소문은 입에도 올리지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 환전 기록·통행 명부 대조\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 북한산보국문 행렬 환전 증인\n**생애.** 2066-02-20 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 북한산보국문 행렬 환전 증인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 순한결은 영등포동을 업무동으로 삼아 여의동 금고와 영등포동 인계 창구 사이의 환전 기록·통행 명부 대조를 맡는다.\n- 순한결은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 여의동 금고와 영등포동 인계 창구 사이의 환전 기록·통행 명부 대조를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 북한산보국문 행렬 환전 증인. 환전 기록과 통행 명부를 같은 벽에 붙이고, 독립 목격이 둘 미만이면 시세를 올리지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 북한산보국문 행렬의 남하를 시민권 환전 기록으로만 남겨 강제등록 발표가 공식 창구를 선점하지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 환전 기록이 군사 호송 유도 장부로 잘려 정착지가 노출되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 새어 나간 장부의 원점을 막거나, 시민권 환전 조항을 지점 원장에 고정할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 5 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −15 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 15 | 공개 40 | 자격 10 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 15 | 위험 10 | 과시 25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"순한결","type":"맹세","to":"모국","basis":""},{"from":"순한결","type":"맹세","to":"어하은","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0243', 'd64d-b0a8-c591', '{"id":"person-0243","name":"Hong Uchan","title":"Retransmission Origin Informant","position":"Counterfeit Currency Origin Informant","characterId":"K242","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Counterfeit Currency Origin Map and Patrol Time Records","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#inmul-hongucan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0243","birthDate":"2076-07-28","birthday":"07-28","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"origin-map","name":"Forgery-origin mapping","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"origin-map-disposition","name":"Blocking before disclosure","description":"Blocks before reporting and hands origin notes to tracers.","behavior":"Blocks before reporting and hands origin notes to tracers.","stress":"","relationship":"Handed the origin notes to Jo Eunwoo''s radio tracking, matched the hours with Yong Bok''s patrol between the Yeouido-dong vault and the Yeongdeungpo-dong handover counter, and overlaid the discovery hour of Soon Gaon''s medical car with the waveform.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Connects event times","description":"Connects forged marks with medical-car discovery time.","behavior":"Connects forged marks with medical-car discovery time.","stress":"","relationship":"Handed the origin notes to Jo Eunwoo''s radio tracking, matched the hours with Yong Bok''s patrol between the Yeouido-dong vault and the Yeongdeungpo-dong handover counter, and overlaid the discovery hour of Soon Gaon''s medical car with the waveform.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Mapped forged marks near the detained train against the medical-car discovery time. Connecting clues is documented, not omniscience.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d64d-b0a8-c591","name":"Namyang Hong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d64d-b0a8-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":20,"Force":-30,"Material":-15,"Communal":5,"Principle":15,"Public":75,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":-5,"Display":-5,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Counterfeit Currency Origin Map and Patrol Time Records","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Counterfeit Currency Origin Informant","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 20 | Force −30 | Materialism −15 | Community 5 | Principle 15 | Transparency 75 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 40 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −5 | Display −5 | Endurance 25 | Orientation None | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2076-07-28, the approved birth cohort is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised on the Yeouido vault watch. The post of counterfeit currency origin informant opened through keeping the vault for the three days of the blackout.\n- Hong U-chan takes Yeouidong as her work district and handles the counterfeit currency origin map and patrol-time records.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Counterfeit Currency Origin Informant. Posts patrol routes daily and permits access to the vault only with an escort of two patrols.","Anecdote":"On the night the black winter timetable opened, when counterfeit currency with the same engraving was seized near the detained train at Yongsan, Hong U-chan posted the origin map to the Investment Council.","Relationships":"Hands origin notes to Jo Eun-u''s counterfeit tracking, aligns patrols and times between the Yeouidong vault and the Yeongdeungpo-dong handover desk, and overlaps the discovery time of Sun Ga-on''s medical car with the engravings.","Ambition":"Keeps counterfeit currency with the same engraving as the same crime of forgery and military seizure.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can jointly search for the origin of the counterfeit currency, or denounce excessive blockade to the Investment Council."},"biography":"Points to counterfeit engravings faster than rumors spread, and when she sees an unauthorized approacher, she puts a person in place before a toolbox. Blunt, and blocks the road before reporting.\n\n- Livelihood: Counterfeit Currency Origin Map and Patrol Time Records\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Counterfeit Currency Origin Informant\n**Life.** Born 2076-07-28, the approved birth cohort is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised on the Yeouido vault watch. The post of counterfeit currency origin informant opened through keeping the vault for the three days of the blackout.\n- Hong U-chan takes Yeouidong as her work district and handles the counterfeit currency origin map and patrol-time records.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Counterfeit Currency Origin Informant. Posts patrol routes daily and permits access to the vault only with an escort of two patrols.\n\n**Anecdote.** On the night the black winter timetable opened, when counterfeit currency with the same engraving was seized near the detained train at Yongsan, Hong U-chan posted the origin map to the Investment Council.\n\n**Relationships.** Hands origin notes to Jo Eun-u''s counterfeit tracking, aligns patrols and times between the Yeouidong vault and the Yeongdeungpo-dong handover desk, and overlaps the discovery time of Sun Ga-on''s medical car with the engravings.\n\n**Ambition.** Keeps counterfeit currency with the same engraving as the same crime of forgery and military seizure.\n\n**Intervention.** Can jointly search for the origin of the counterfeit currency, or denounce excessive blockade to the Investment Council.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 20 | Force −30 | Materialism −15 | Community 5 | Principle 15 | Transparency 75 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −5 | Display −5 | Endurance 25 | Orientation None | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Hong Uchan","type":"Oath","to":"Jo Eunu","basis":"Passing the origin note to Jo Eunu''s signal tracing, and"},{"from":"Hong Uchan","type":"Oath","to":"Stefan Petrov","basis":"overlays Stefan Petrov''s discovery time in the medical car on the waveform"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0243","name":"홍우찬","title":"재송신 원점 제보자","position":"위조 화폐 원점 제보자","characterId":"K242","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"위조 화폐 원점 지도·순찰 시각 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-홍우찬","detailRoute":"/people/person-0243","birthDate":"2076-07-28","birthday":"07-28","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"origin-map","name":"위조 원점 지도 작성","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"origin-map-disposition","name":"먼저 막는 제보","description":"보고 전에 길을 막고 원점 쪽지를 추적조에 넘긴다.","behavior":"보고 전에 길을 막고 원점 쪽지를 추적조에 넘긴다.","stress":"","relationship":"조은우의 위조 추적에 원점 쪽지를 넘기고, 용복의 여의동 금고와 영등포동 인계 창구 사이 순찰과 시각을 맞추며, 순가온의 의료칸 발견 시각을 각인과 겹친다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"사건 시각 연결","description":"위조 각인과 의료칸 발견 시각을 겹친다.","behavior":"위조 각인과 의료칸 발견 시각을 겹친다.","stress":"","relationship":"조은우의 위조 추적에 원점 쪽지를 넘기고, 용복의 여의동 금고와 영등포동 인계 창구 사이 순찰과 시각을 맞추며, 순가온의 의료칸 발견 시각을 각인과 겹친다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"억류 열차 주변 위조 각인을 의료칸 발견 시각과 겹쳐 원점 지도로 게시했다. 단서 연결은 확인되지만 정보 전반을 아는 인물은 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d64d-b0a8-c591","name":"남양 홍씨","crest":"clan-crests/d64d-b0a8-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":20,"무력":-30,"물질":-15,"공동":5,"원칙":15,"공개":75,"자격":10,"분산":20,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":5,"위험":-5,"과시":-5,"지속":25,"지향":"무성향","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"위조 화폐 원점 지도·순찰 시각 기록","소속":"자유도시","품계":"서기","직함":"위조 화폐 원점 제보자","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 20 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −15 | 공동 5 | 원칙 15 | 공개 75 | 자격 10 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 5 | 위험 −5 | 과시 −5 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2076-07-28 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 여의도 금고 당직에서 자랐다. 위조 화폐 원점 제보자 자리는 정전 사흘 금고 유지로 열렸다.\n- 홍우찬은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 위조 화폐 원점 지도·순찰 시각 기록 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 위조 화폐 원점 제보자. 순찰 경로를 매일 게시하고, 금고 접근은 두 순찰의 동행만 허용한다.","일화":"겨울의 검은 배차표가 열리던 밤 용산 억류 열차 부근에서 같은 각인의 위조 화폐가 잡히자 홍우찬은 원점 지도를 출자 평의회에 붙였다.","관계":"조은우의 위조 추적에 원점 쪽지를 넘기고, 여의동 금고와 영등포동 인계 창구 사이 순찰과 시각을 맞추며, 순가온의 의료칸 발견 시각을 각인과 겹친다.","야망":"같은 각인의 위조 화폐를 위조와 군사 압류의 같은 죄로 남긴다.","공포":"","개입":"위조 화폐의 원점을 함께 찾거나, 과잉 봉쇄를 출자 평의회에 고발할 수 있다."},"biography":"위조 각인을 소문보다 빨리 가리키고, 무단 접근자를 보면 공구함보다 사람을 먼저 세운다. 직선적이고 보고 전에 길을 막는다.\n\n- 생업: 위조 화폐 원점 지도·순찰 시각 기록\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 위조 화폐 원점 제보자\n**생애.** 2076-07-28 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 여의도 금고 당직에서 자랐다. 위조 화폐 원점 제보자 자리는 정전 사흘 금고 유지로 열렸다.\n- 홍우찬은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 위조 화폐 원점 지도·순찰 시각 기록 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 위조 화폐 원점 제보자. 순찰 경로를 매일 게시하고, 금고 접근은 두 순찰의 동행만 허용한다.\n\n**일화.** 겨울의 검은 배차표가 열리던 밤 용산 억류 열차 부근에서 같은 각인의 위조 화폐가 잡히자 홍우찬은 원점 지도를 출자 평의회에 붙였다.\n\n**관계.** 조은우의 위조 추적에 원점 쪽지를 넘기고, 여의동 금고와 영등포동 인계 창구 사이 순찰과 시각을 맞추며, 순가온의 의료칸 발견 시각을 각인과 겹친다.\n\n**야망.** 같은 각인의 위조 화폐를 위조와 군사 압류의 같은 죄로 남긴다.\n\n**개입.** 위조 화폐의 원점을 함께 찾거나, 과잉 봉쇄를 출자 평의회에 고발할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 20 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −15 | 공동 5 | 원칙 15 | 공개 75 | 자격 10 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 5 | 위험 −5 | 과시 −5 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"홍우찬","type":"맹세","to":"조은우","basis":"조은우의 전파추적에 원점 쪽지를 넘기고"},{"from":"홍우찬","type":"맹세","to":"스테판 페트로프","basis":"스테판 페트로프의 의료칸 발견 시각을 파형과 겹친다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0244', 'cd94-cd94-acc4', '{"id":"person-0244","name":"Chu Uchan","title":"Eleven-Seat Meeting Relay Recorder","position":"Eleven-Seat Meeting Relay Recorder","characterId":"K243","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Council Speech Transcription and Testimony Comparison","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#person-chu-u-chan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0244","birthDate":"2086-02-16","birthday":"02-16","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"meeting-copy","name":"Meeting transcription and testimony comparison","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"meeting-copy-disposition","name":"Defers before signing","description":"Stops transcription without two testimonies and rereads sentences.","behavior":"Stops transcription without two testimonies and rereads sentences.","stress":"Fears an altered ledger surviving in personal handwriting.","relationship":"Copies meeting records into Gukdubong’s ledger, schedules Jeong Yura’s draft and compares Seop Doyun’s messenger copies.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Explains deferral the same day","description":"Posts testimony-deferral reasons on the store door that day.","behavior":"Posts testimony-deferral reasons on the store door that day.","stress":"","relationship":"Copies meeting records into Gukdubong’s ledger, schedules Jeong Yura’s draft and compares Seop Doyun’s messenger copies.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Deferred copying a one-witness speech and published reasons that day, seeking a second testimony in messenger copies.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd94-cd94-acc4","name":"Chugye Chu Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cd94-cd94-acc4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":15,"Force":-25,"Material":-20,"Communal":0,"Principle":30,"Public":55,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":-40,"Display":-35,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Council Speech Transcription and Testimony Comparison","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Eleven-Seat Meeting Relay Recorder","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 15 | Force −25 | Materialism −20 | Community 0 | Principle 30 | Transparency 55 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −40 | Display −35 | Endurance −15 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2086-02-16, the approved birth cohort is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised at the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Investment Council relay recorder opened through the deletion of one line from a double ledger.\n- Chu U-chan takes Yeouidong as their work district and handles the transcription of council statements and the cross-checking of testimony.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Eleven-Seat Meeting Relay Recorder. If independent testimonies number fewer than two, holds the transcription and posts the reason for the hold on the repository door the same day.","Anecdote":"A statement from the Investment Council comes up to the transcription desk with only one testimony attached. Chu U-chan holds the transcription, posts the reason on the repository door the same day, then lines up with Seop Do-yun''s courier copies to find a second testimony.","Relationships":"Copies meeting transcripts into Guk Du-bong''s verification ledger, places Jeong Yu-ra''s draft of the Joint Charter in the relay order, and lines up with Seop Do-yun''s courier copies.","Ambition":"Runs a public ledger that matches statements with two or more testimonies, so that rumors of internal bribery and assassination cannot swallow the record.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can bring in the second testimony, or expose the held transcription to hasten the breakdown of the meeting."},"biography":"Reads a sentence twice and picks up the seal only on the third time. When the silence needed to save a person clashes with the duty to preserve the facts, stops their hand and closes the ledger.\n\n- Livelihood: Council Speech Transcription and Testimony Comparison\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Eleven-Seat Meeting Relay Recorder\n**Life.** Born 2086-02-16, the approved birth cohort is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Raised at the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Investment Council relay recorder opened through the deletion of one line from a double ledger.\n- Chu U-chan takes Yeouidong as their work district and handles the transcription of council statements and the cross-checking of testimony.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Eleven-Seat Meeting Relay Recorder. If independent testimonies number fewer than two, holds the transcription and posts the reason for the hold on the repository door the same day.\n\n**Anecdote.** A statement from the Investment Council comes up to the transcription desk with only one testimony attached. Chu U-chan holds the transcription, posts the reason on the repository door the same day, then lines up with Seop Do-yun''s courier copies to find a second testimony.\n\n**Relationships.** Copies meeting transcripts into Guk Du-bong''s verification ledger, places Jeong Yu-ra''s draft of the Joint Charter in the relay order, and lines up with Seop Do-yun''s courier copies.\n\n**Ambition.** Runs a public ledger that matches statements with two or more testimonies, so that rumors of internal bribery and assassination cannot swallow the record.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in the second testimony, or expose the held transcription to hasten the breakdown of the meeting.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 15 | Force −25 | Materialism −20 | Community 0 | Principle 30 | Transparency 55 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −40 | Display −35 | Endurance −15 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Chu Uchan","type":"Contract","to":"Guk Dubong","basis":"Moves the meeting transcript into Guk Dubong''s verification ledger and"},{"from":"Chu Uchan","type":"Contract","to":"Seop Do-yun","basis":"Lines up with Seop Doyun''s courier copy"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0244","name":"추우찬","title":"열한 자리 회의 중계 기록원","position":"출자 평의회 중계 기록원","characterId":"K243","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"평의회 발언 필사·증언 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-추우찬","detailRoute":"/people/person-0244","birthDate":"2086-02-16","birthday":"02-16","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"meeting-copy","name":"회의 필사·증언 대조","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"meeting-copy-disposition","name":"서명 전에 보류","description":"증언 둘 미만이면 필사를 멈추며 문장을 거듭 읽는다.","behavior":"증언 둘 미만이면 필사를 멈추며 문장을 거듭 읽는다.","stress":"고쳐진 장부가 자기 필적으로 남을 것을 두려워한다.","relationship":"국두봉의 검증 원장에 회의 필사를 옮기고, 정유라의 공동헌장 초안을 중계 순번에 올리며, 섭도윤의 전령 사본과 줄을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"보류의 당일 설명","description":"증언 부족의 보류 사유를 당일 저장소 문에 붙인다.","behavior":"증언 부족의 보류 사유를 당일 저장소 문에 붙인다.","stress":"","relationship":"국두봉의 검증 원장에 회의 필사를 옮기고, 정유라의 공동헌장 초안을 중계 순번에 올리며, 섭도윤의 전령 사본과 줄을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"증언 하나뿐인 발언 필사를 보류하고 당일 사유를 게시했다. 전령 사본에서 두 번째 증언을 찾는 기록 실무가 강점이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd94-cd94-acc4","name":"추계 추씨","crest":"clan-crests/cd94-cd94-acc4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":15,"무력":-25,"물질":-20,"공동":0,"원칙":30,"공개":55,"자격":15,"분산":25,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":-35,"위험":-40,"과시":-35,"지속":-15,"지향":"양성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"평의회 발언 필사·증언 대조","소속":"자유도시","품계":"서기","직함":"출자 평의회 중계 기록원","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 15 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 30 | 공개 55 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −40 | 과시 −35 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2086-02-16 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 출자 평의회 중계 기록원 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 추우찬은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 평의회 발언 필사·증언 대조 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 출자 평의회 중계 기록원. 독립 증언이 둘 미만이면 필사를 보류하고, 보류 사유도 같은 날 저장소 문에 붙인다.","일화":"출자 평의회에서 나온 발언 하나가 증언 한 건만 단 채 필사대에 올라온다. 추우찬은 필사를 보류하고 그 사유를 같은 날 저장소 문에 붙인 뒤, 섭도윤의 전령 사본과 줄을 맞춰 두 번째 증언을 찾는다.","관계":"국두봉의 검증 원장에 회의 필사를 옮기고, 정유라의 공동헌장 초안을 중계 순번에 올리며, 섭도윤의 전령 사본과 줄을 맞춘다.","야망":"발언을 두 증언 이상으로 맞추는 공개 원장을 돌려 내부 매수와 암살 소문이 기록을 집어삼키지 못하게 한다.","공포":"","개입":"두 번째 증언을 데려오거나, 보류된 필사를 폭로해 회의 결렬을 앞당길 수 있다."},"biography":"문장을 두 번 읽고 세 번째에야 도장을 든다. 사람을 살릴 때의 침묵과 사실을 남길 의무가 충돌하면 손을 멈춘 채 원장을 덮는다.\n\n- 생업: 평의회 발언 필사·증언 대조\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 출자 평의회 중계 기록원\n**생애.** 2086-02-16 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 출자 평의회 중계 기록원 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 추우찬은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 평의회 발언 필사·증언 대조 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 출자 평의회 중계 기록원. 독립 증언이 둘 미만이면 필사를 보류하고, 보류 사유도 같은 날 저장소 문에 붙인다.\n\n**일화.** 출자 평의회에서 나온 발언 하나가 증언 한 건만 단 채 필사대에 올라온다. 추우찬은 필사를 보류하고 그 사유를 같은 날 저장소 문에 붙인 뒤, 섭도윤의 전령 사본과 줄을 맞춰 두 번째 증언을 찾는다.\n\n**관계.** 국두봉의 검증 원장에 회의 필사를 옮기고, 정유라의 공동헌장 초안을 중계 순번에 올리며, 섭도윤의 전령 사본과 줄을 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 발언을 두 증언 이상으로 맞추는 공개 원장을 돌려 내부 매수와 암살 소문이 기록을 집어삼키지 못하게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 두 번째 증언을 데려오거나, 보류된 필사를 폭로해 회의 결렬을 앞당길 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 15 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 30 | 공개 55 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −40 | 과시 −35 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"추우찬","type":"계약","to":"국두봉","basis":"국두봉의 검증 원장에 회의 필사를 옮기고"},{"from":"추우찬","type":"계약","to":"섭도윤","basis":"섭도윤의 전령 사본과 줄을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0245', 'b958-bb38-d654-67f3', '{"id":"person-0245","name":"Ryu Haedam","title":"Rumor Verification Writer","position":"Market Price Rumor Verification Writer","characterId":"K244","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Market Price Rumor Source Check and Cross-Verification Manuscript","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"Free City","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#person-ryu-hae-dam","detailRoute":"/people/person-0245","birthDate":"2065-09-15","birthday":"09-15","age":61,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K219","recipientName":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"It interlocks with Choe Jiu''s openness orientation, but the writers'' signature column is kept separate.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-09.json","anchor":"Character-Ryu-Haedam-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"rumor-verification","name":"Rumor-source verification","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"rumor-verification-disposition","name":"Rumor Verification Writer","description":"Separates claims sentence by sentence and withholds keys before verification.","behavior":"Separates claims sentence by sentence and withholds keys before verification.","stress":"","relationship":"Works alongside Choi Jiwoo’s disclosure preference but keeps the writers’ signature field separate.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Independent signature","description":"Protects the writers’ signature field independently of the chair.","behavior":"Protects the writers’ signature field independently of the chair.","stress":"Fears an unverified rumor going out as a surge in food prices.","relationship":"Works alongside Choi Jiwoo’s disclosure preference but keeps the writers’ signature field separate.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Rumor Verification Writer.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b958-bb38-d654-67f3","name":"Munhwa Ryu Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b958-bb38-d654-67f3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-5,"Openness":0,"Force":-20,"Material":-5,"Communal":5,"Principle":15,"Public":55,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-20,"Display":10,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Market Price Rumor Source Check and Cross-Verification Manuscript","Affiliation":"Free City","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Market Price Rumor Verification Writer","Values":"Authority −5 | Openness 0 | Force −20 | Materialism −5 | Community 5 | Principle 15 | Publicity 55 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −20 | Display 10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2065-09-15; the approved birth cohort is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Grew up on waiting hall duty. The price-rumor verification writer post opened up as a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Ryu Haedam takes Yeouidong as her work district and handles the work of rumor-source verification and cross-checking manuscripts for price quotes.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Market Price Rumor Verification Writer. Accepts anonymous tips, but does not hand over the vault key before verification is finished.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"It interlocks with Choe Jiu''s openness orientation, but the writers'' signature column is kept separate.","Ambition":"Fix the Yeouido Vault''s price-verification writers at two people who cross-check, rather than acting on the Chair''s directive.","Fear":"An unconfirmed rumor going out as a surge in food prices.","Intervention":""},"biography":"Cuts rumors up sentence by sentence and leaves unsourced sentences only in the margin. Reads once more before the price quote is posted.\n\n- Livelihood: Market Price Rumor Source Check and Cross-Verification Manuscript\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Market Price Rumor Verification Writer\n**Life.** Born 2065-09-15; the approved birth cohort is Cohort 3. Active at the 2126 opening. Grew up on waiting hall duty. The price-rumor verification writer post opened up as a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Ryu Haedam takes Yeouidong as her work district and handles the work of rumor-source verification and cross-checking manuscripts for price quotes.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Market Price Rumor Verification Writer. Accepts anonymous tips, but does not hand over the vault key before verification is finished.\n\n**Relations.** It interlocks with Choe Jiu''s openness orientation, but the writers'' signature column is kept separate.\n\n**Ambition.** Fix the Yeouido Vault''s price-verification writers at two people who cross-check, rather than acting on the Chair''s directive.\n\n**Fear.** An unconfirmed rumor going out as a surge in food prices.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −5 | Openness 0 | Force −20 | Materialism −5 | Community 5 | Principle 15 | Publicity 55 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −20 | Display 10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0245","name":"류해담","title":"소문 검증 필진","position":"시세 소문 검증 필진","characterId":"K244","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"시세 소문 출처 확인·교차 검증 원고","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-09#인물-류해담","detailRoute":"/people/person-0245","birthDate":"2065-09-15","birthday":"09-15","age":61,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K219","recipientName":"최지우","basis":"최지우의 공개 성향과 맞물리지만, 필진의 서명란은 따로 지킨다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-09.json","anchor":"인물-류해담-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"rumor-verification","name":"소문 출처 검증","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"rumor-verification-disposition","name":"소문 검증 필진","description":"제보를 문장 단위로 자르고 검증 전 금고 키를 넘기지 않는다.","behavior":"제보를 문장 단위로 자르고 검증 전 금고 키를 넘기지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"최지우의 공개 성향과 맞물리지만, 필진의 서명란은 따로 지킨다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"독립 서명","description":"의장의 공개 성향과 별도로 필진 서명란을 지킨다.","behavior":"의장의 공개 성향과 별도로 필진 서명란을 지킨다.","stress":"확인되지 않은 소문이 식량 값 폭등 시세로 나가는 것.","relationship":"최지우의 공개 성향과 맞물리지만, 필진의 서명란은 따로 지킨다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 소문 검증 필진.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b958-bb38-d654-67f3","name":"문화 류씨","crest":"clan-crests/b958-bb38-d654-67f3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-5,"개방":0,"무력":-20,"물질":-5,"공동":5,"원칙":15,"공개":55,"자격":15,"분산":20,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":10,"위험":-20,"과시":10,"지속":35,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"시세 소문 출처 확인·교차 검증 원고","소속":"자유도시","품계":"서기","직함":"시세 소문 검증 필진","가치관":"권위 −5 | 개방 0 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −5 | 공동 5 | 원칙 15 | 공개 55 | 자격 15 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 10 | 위험 −20 | 과시 10 | 지속 35 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2065-09-15 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 시세 소문 검증 필진 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 류해담은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 시세 소문 출처 확인·교차 검증 원고 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 시세 소문 검증 필진. 익명 제보는 받되, 금고 키는 검증이 끝나기 전에 넘기지 않는다.","일화":"","관계":"최지우의 공개 성향과 맞물리지만, 필진의 서명란은 따로 지킨다.","야망":"여의도 금고의 시세 검증 필진을 의장 지시가 아니라 교차 확인 두 명으로 고정한다.","공포":"확인되지 않은 소문이 식량 값 폭등 시세로 나가는 것.","개입":""},"biography":"소문을 문장 단위로 자르고, 출처가 없는 문장은 난외에만 남긴다. 시세를 올리기 전에 한 번 더 읽는다.\n\n- 생업: 시세 소문 출처 확인·교차 검증 원고\n- 소속: 자유도시\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 시세 소문 검증 필진\n**생애.** 2065-09-15 출생으로 승인된 출생군은 3군이다. 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 시세 소문 검증 필진 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 류해담은 여의동을 업무동으로 삼아 시세 소문 출처 확인·교차 검증 원고 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 시세 소문 검증 필진. 익명 제보는 받되, 금고 키는 검증이 끝나기 전에 넘기지 않는다.\n\n**관계.** 최지우의 공개 성향과 맞물리지만, 필진의 서명란은 따로 지킨다.\n\n**야망.** 여의도 금고의 시세 검증 필진을 의장 지시가 아니라 교차 확인 두 명으로 고정한다.\n\n**공포.** 확인되지 않은 소문이 식량 값 폭등 시세로 나가는 것.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −5 | 개방 0 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −5 | 공동 5 | 원칙 15 | 공개 55 | 자격 15 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 10 | 위험 −20 | 과시 10 | 지속 35 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0246', 'bc31-c218-c6d0', '{"id":"person-0246","name":"Baek On","title":"Bureau Chief","position":"Bureau Chief of Government Roster Transcription","characterId":"K245","rank":"Bureau Chief","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"Roster Transcription","gender":"Male","stage":"Key","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#inmul-baek-on","detailRoute":"/people/person-0246","birthDate":"2102-10-04","birthday":"10-04","age":24,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K270","recipientName":"Yun San-ho","basis":"","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-10.json","anchor":"inmul-yun-sanho-p5"}},{"recipientId":"K1015","recipientName":"Nargiza Yusupova","basis":"Key relations: cooperation with Baek On, Bureau Chief of Government Roster Transcription. Lodging contract with the Ttukseom Mobile Maintenance Crew","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/factions/Diaspora-Corridors.json","anchor":"inmul-nareugijeu-yusupoba-nargiz-yusupova-nareugijeu-list1"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":13,"effective":13},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k245-refugee-roster","name":"Refugee-roster copying","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k245-trait-1","name":"Blank fields still belong to people","description":"Seeks to include rather than discard blank roster entries.","behavior":"Seeks to include rather than discard blank roster entries.","stress":"Resents kidnapped people being traded as nothing more than bargaining chips.","relationship":"Supports citizenship with Gang Minseo, though inclusion’s legal effect is unresolved.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He entered even unnamed people who had been kidnapped or taken captive in the register and earned the support of Anguk Station''s people by guarding the register chest. His resentment over people traded as hostages underlies the work. The transcription work itself does not establish any legal status.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s10","name":{"ko":"Anguk Station Demesne"},"holderPersonId":"K245","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S10","stationRef":{"stationId":"Anguk","stationName":"Anguk"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:kingdom-geography:seoul:03","name":"Northwest Area","rank":"kingdom","holderPersonId":"K245","stateId":"S10","geographicTitleId":"geography:kingdom:seoul:03","basis":"2026-10-22 territorial title allocation (owner:seoul-faction-consolidation-20261022). Bureau Chief of Government Roster Transcription. Basis for holding the Eunpyeong·Seodaemun District, one of the three districts of the Northwest Area.","parentTitle":null}],"clan":{"id":"bc31-c218-c6d0","name":"Suwon Baek Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc31-c218-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":-60,"Openness":50,"Force":-50,"Material":-20,"Communal":50,"Principle":40,"Public":40,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":50,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":20,"Monopoly":-50,"Risk":-30,"Display":-40,"Sustained":50,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Roster Transcription","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Bureau Chief","Title":"Bureau Chief of Government Roster Transcription"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2102-10-04, active at the 2126 opening. Anguk Station is the base of the Government roster-transcription work. As Bureau Chief of Anguk Station, Baek On copies the names of people kidnapped, taken captive, or held as hostages into the register and guards the register chest. The roster-transcription work has no subordinate bodies and no army of its own. In winter he personally checks the heating and light-blocking of the room that holds the register chest.","Offices":"Rank: Bureau Chief. Title: Bureau Chief of Government Roster Transcription. Livelihood nickname: Register Copyist.","Anecdote":"","Houses":"Baek clan of Suwon.","Relationships":"Relations. Shares custody of the register chest keys with the relieving duty staff of Anguk Station and meets in person the families who come asking about hostages.\n\n- Livelihood: Roster Transcription\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Bureau Chief\n- Title: Bureau Chief of Government Roster Transcription\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Baek On''s register-copying work. Does not confirm current duty posting, or residence, holding, or ownership.\n\nThese are the clerk duties and the ration and corridor watches surrounding Baek On, the register copyist. Copied records and ledgers are preserved together."},"biography":"**Life.** Born 2102-10-04, active at the 2126 opening. Anguk Station is the base of the Government roster-transcription work. As Bureau Chief of Anguk Station, Baek On copies the names of people kidnapped, taken captive, or held as hostages into the register and guards the register chest. The roster-transcription work has no subordinate bodies and no army of its own. In winter he personally checks the heating and light-blocking of the room that holds the register chest.\n**Office.** Rank: Bureau Chief. Title: Bureau Chief of Government Roster Transcription. Livelihood nickname: Register Copyist.\n**House.** Baek clan of Suwon.\n**Relations.** Relations. Shares custody of the register chest keys with the relieving duty staff of Anguk Station and meets in person the families who come asking about hostages.\n\n- Livelihood: Roster Transcription\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Bureau Chief\n- Title: Bureau Chief of Government Roster Transcription\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Baek On''s register-copying work. Does not confirm current duty posting, or residence, holding, or ownership.\n\nThese are the clerk duties and the ration and corridor watches surrounding Baek On, the register copyist. Copied records and ledgers are preserved together.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"Im Ba-da","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":"An agreement to verify each other''s rolls of people taken captive"},{"from":"Sin Boram","type":"Oath","to":"Baek On","basis":""},{"from":"Hwang Serin","type":"Command","to":"Baek On","basis":"Enforces the public ration table"},{"from":"Gang Taesan","type":"Command","to":"Baek On","basis":"Keeps corridor scouting under the Bureau Chief''s command"},{"from":"Yun Choa","type":"Command","to":"Baek On","basis":""},{"from":"Kim Nayul","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":"Supports refugee citizenship with union votes"},{"from":"Han Jion","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":"Checks the roll of refugees arriving from the south against the roll of people taken captive"},{"from":"Jang Seogyun","type":"Grudge","to":"Baek On","basis":""},{"from":"Choe Doyun","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":"Allied with the demand for independent civil rights"},{"from":"Bong Du","type":"Oath","to":"Baek On","basis":""},{"from":"Go Morae","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":""},{"from":"Ryu Gyeore","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":"meets Baek On''s southward march from the Geumcheon side"},{"from":"Ran Min-jun","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":""},{"from":"Dan Yu-jin","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":""},{"from":"Beom Ongyeol","type":"Oath","to":"Baek On","basis":"Cross-checks Baek On''s register of southbound families."},{"from":"Tak Pilho","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":"Hands temporary passes to Baek On''s southbound families."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0246","name":"백온","title":"국장","position":"정부 명부 필사 국장","characterId":"K245","rank":"국장","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"명부 필사","gender":"남성","stage":"주요","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-백온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0246","birthDate":"2102-10-04","birthday":"10-04","age":24,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K270","recipientName":"윤산호","basis":"","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-10.json","anchor":"인물-윤산호-p5"}},{"recipientId":"K1015","recipientName":"나르기즈 유수포바","basis":"주요 관계: 정부 명부 필사 국장 백온과 협력. 뚝섬 기동 정비조와 숙소 계약","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/factions/Diaspora-Corridors.json","anchor":"인물-나르기즈-유수포바-nargiz-yusupova-나르기즈-list1"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":13,"effective":13},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k245-refugee-roster","name":"피난 명부 필사","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k245-trait-1","name":"빈 칸도 사람의 자리","description":"명부의 빈 칸을 버리지 않고 포함하려 한다.","behavior":"명부의 빈 칸을 버리지 않고 포함하려 한다.","stress":"납치된 사람의 줄이 거래 대상으로만 오가는 데 원한을 품는다.","relationship":"강민서와 시민권을 지지하지만 명부 편입의 법적 효과는 미확정이다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"납치되거나 붙잡혀 간 이름 없는 사람까지 명부에 올리고 명부함을 지켜 안국역 사람들의 지지를 얻었다. 인질로 거래되는 사람들에 대한 원한이 일의 바탕이다. 명부 필사 일이 곧 법적 지위의 취득을 뜻하지는 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s10","name":{"ko":"안국역 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K245","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S10","stationRef":{"stationId":"안국","stationName":"안국"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:kingdom-geography:seoul:03","name":"서북권","rank":"kingdom","holderPersonId":"K245","stateId":"S10","geographicTitleId":"geography:kingdom:seoul:03","basis":"2026-10-22 영토 배분(owner:seoul-faction-consolidation-20261022). 정부 명부 필사 국장. 서북권 세 자치구 가운데 은평·서대문 구 보유 근거.","parentTitle":null}],"clan":{"id":"bc31-c218-c6d0","name":"수원 백씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc31-c218-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"권위":-60,"개방":50,"무력":-50,"물질":-20,"공동":50,"원칙":40,"공개":40,"자격":40,"분산":50,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":20,"독점":-50,"위험":-30,"과시":-40,"지속":50,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"명부 필사","소속":"정부","품계":"국장","직함":"정부 명부 필사 국장"},"sections":{"생애":"2102-10-04 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 안국역은 정부 명부 필사 일의 근거지다. 백온은 안국역 국장으로서 납치되거나 붙잡혀 간 사람, 인질로 잡힌 사람의 이름을 명부에 옮겨 적고 명부함을 지킨다. 명부 필사 일에는 산하 세력이 없고 독자 병력이 없다. 겨울에는 명부함을 둔 방의 난방과 불빛 가림을 직접 확인한다.","관직":"품계 국장. 직함은 정부 명부 필사 국장. 생업 별명은 명부 필사.","일화":"","가문":"수원 백씨.","관계":"관계. 안국역 교대 당직자들과 명부함 열쇠를 나누어 관리하고, 인질 소식을 묻는 가족들을 직접 만난다.\n\n- 생업: 명부 필사\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 국장\n- 직함: 정부 명부 필사 국장\n- 백온의 명부 필사 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.\n\n명부 필사 백온을 둘러싼 주사와 배급·회랑 당직이다. 필사한 기록과 장부는 함께 보존한다."},"biography":"**생애.** 2102-10-04 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 안국역은 정부 명부 필사 일의 근거지다. 백온은 안국역 국장으로서 납치되거나 붙잡혀 간 사람, 인질로 잡힌 사람의 이름을 명부에 옮겨 적고 명부함을 지킨다. 명부 필사 일에는 산하 세력이 없고 독자 병력이 없다. 겨울에는 명부함을 둔 방의 난방과 불빛 가림을 직접 확인한다.\n**관직.** 품계 국장. 직함은 정부 명부 필사 국장. 생업 별명은 명부 필사.\n**가문.** 수원 백씨.\n**관계.** 관계. 안국역 교대 당직자들과 명부함 열쇠를 나누어 관리하고, 인질 소식을 묻는 가족들을 직접 만난다.\n\n- 생업: 명부 필사\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 국장\n- 직함: 정부 명부 필사 국장\n- 백온의 명부 필사 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.\n\n명부 필사 백온을 둘러싼 주사와 배급·회랑 당직이다. 필사한 기록과 장부는 함께 보존한다.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"임바다","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":"붙잡혀 간 사람의 명부를 서로 확인해 주는 약속"},{"from":"신보람","type":"맹세","to":"백온","basis":""},{"from":"황세린","type":"지휘","to":"백온","basis":"공개 배급표를 집행"},{"from":"강태산","type":"지휘","to":"백온","basis":"회랑 정찰을 국장 지휘로 지킴"},{"from":"윤초아","type":"지휘","to":"백온","basis":""},{"from":"김나율","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":"난민 시민권을 조합 표로 지지"},{"from":"한지온","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":"남쪽에서 온 피난민 명부를 붙잡혀 간 사람의 명부와 맞대어 봄"},{"from":"장석윤","type":"원한","to":"백온","basis":""},{"from":"최도윤","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":"독립 시민권 요구에 동맹"},{"from":"봉두","type":"맹세","to":"백온","basis":""},{"from":"고모래","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":""},{"from":"류겨레","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":"백온의 남하를 금천 쪽에서 맞으며"},{"from":"란민준","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":""},{"from":"단유진","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":""},{"from":"범온결","type":"맹세","to":"백온","basis":"백온의 남하 가족 명부를 대조한다"},{"from":"탁필호","type":"계약","to":"백온","basis":"백온의 남하 가족에게 임시표를 건넨다"}]}}');
