":"Yeongsan Sin Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c2e0-c601-c0b0-8f9b.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-90,"Openness":65,"Force":-30,"Material":-20,"Communal":90,"Principle":20,"Public":25,"Eligibility":35,"Dispersed":60,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":20,"Risk":35,"Display":-20,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Believer Roster Comparison and Ration Verification","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Refugee Roster Clerk","Values":"Authority −90 | Openness 65 | Force −30 | Material −20 | Community 90 | Principle 20 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 35 | Decentralization 60 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Longing 10 | Monopoly 20 | Risk 35 | Display −20 | Persistence 35 | Orientation bisexual | Union contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2078-08-14, active at the 2126 opening. Grew up in the Bogungmun refugee barracks. The Refugee Roster Clerk''s duty log records the orphan register line.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Sin Boram''s refugee roster cross-checking and ration confirmation work. Does not confirm any current posting, residence, holding, or ownership.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Refugee Roster Clerk. Before the evening ration, reads the refugee roster aloud, and halts rations if any name is missing.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Merciful, but the voice turns sharp toward officials who alter the register. Has torn up a ledger that left out a child''s name.\n\n- Livelihood: Believer Roster Comparison and Ration Verification\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Refugee Roster Clerk\n**Life.** Born 2078-08-14, active at the 2126 opening. Grew up in the Bogungmun refugee barracks. The Refugee Roster Clerk''s duty log records the orphan register line.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Sin Boram''s refugee roster cross-checking and ration confirmation work. Does not confirm any current posting, residence, holding, or ownership.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Refugee Roster Clerk. Before the evening ration, reads the refugee roster aloud, and halts rations if any name is missing.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −90 | Openness 65 | Force −30 | Material −20 | Community 90 | Principle 20 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 35 | Decentralization 60 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Longing 10 | Monopoly 20 | Risk 35 | Display −20 | Persistence 35 | Orientation bisexual | Union contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sin Boram","type":"Oath","to":"Baek On","basis":""},{"from":"Sin Boram","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Minseo","basis":""},{"from":"Sin Boram","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Yun Ji-yul","type":"Contract","to":"Sin Boram","basis":""},{"from":"So Du","type":"Contract","to":"Sin Boram","basis":""},{"from":"Gam Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Sin Boram","basis":""},{"from":"Eo Ha-eun","type":"Contract","to":"Sin Boram","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0247","name":"신보람","title":"피난 가족 대표","position":"피난 명부 주사","characterId":"K246","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"신도 명부 대조·배급 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-신보람","detailRoute":"/people/person-0247","birthDate":"2078-08-14","birthday":"08-14","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"member-roster","name":"피난 명부·배급 확인","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"member-roster-disposition","name":"피난 가족 대표","description":"직함은 피난 가족 대표.","behavior":"직함은 피난 가족 대표.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"피난 가족 대표","description":"직함은 피난 가족 대표.","behavior":"직함은 피난 가족 대표.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 피난 가족 대표.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c2e0-c601-c0b0-8f9b","name":"영산 신씨","crest":"clan-crests/c2e0-c601-c0b0-8f9b.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-90,"개방":65,"무력":-30,"물질":-20,"공동":90,"원칙":20,"공개":25,"자격":35,"분산":60,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":20,"위험":35,"과시":-20,"지속":35,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"신도 명부 대조·배급 확인","소속":"정부","품계":"주사","직함":"피난 명부 주사","가치관":"권위 −90 | 개방 65 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −20 | 공동 90 | 원칙 20 | 공개 25 | 자격 35 | 분산 60 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 20 | 위험 35 | 과시 −20 | 지속 35 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2078-08-14 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 보국문 피난 막사에서 자랐다. 피난 명부 주사 당직 기록에는 고아 명부 줄 일이 남아 있다.\n- 신보람의 피난 명부 대조·배급 확인 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 피난 명부 주사. 저녁 배급 전에 피난 명부를 소리 내어 읽고, 빠진 이름이 있으면 배급을 멈춘다.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"자비롭지만 명부를 고치는 관리에게는 목소리가 날카로워진다. 아이 이름을 빼먹은 장부를 찢어본 적이 있다.\n\n- 생업: 신도 명부 대조·배급 확인\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 주사\n- 직함: 피난 명부 주사\n**생애.** 2078-08-14 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 보국문 피난 막사에서 자랐다. 피난 명부 주사 당직 기록에는 고아 명부 줄 일이 남아 있다.\n- 신보람의 피난 명부 대조·배급 확인 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 피난 명부 주사. 저녁 배급 전에 피난 명부를 소리 내어 읽고, 빠진 이름이 있으면 배급을 멈춘다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −90 | 개방 65 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −20 | 공동 90 | 원칙 20 | 공개 25 | 자격 35 | 분산 60 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 20 | 위험 35 | 과시 −20 | 지속 35 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"신보람","type":"맹세","to":"백온","basis":""},{"from":"신보람","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":""},{"from":"신보람","type":"계약","to":"윤지율","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"윤지율","type":"계약","to":"신보람","basis":""},{"from":"소두","type":"계약","to":"신보람","basis":""},{"from":"감용","type":"계약","to":"신보람","basis":""},{"from":"어하은","type":"계약","to":"신보람","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0248', 'd669-c6b0-c8fc-9ec3', '{"id":"person-0248","name":"Hwang Serin","title":"Ration Monitor","position":"Ration Scale Clerk","characterId":"K247","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Ration Scale and Remaining Amount Disclosure","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#inmul-hwangserin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0248","birthDate":"2076-02-07","birthday":"02-07","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"ration-weighing","name":"Ration weighing and reserve recording","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"ration-weighing-disposition","name":"Counts hunger alongside numbers","description":"Weighs hunger alongside numbers but becomes rough over hidden food.","behavior":"Weighs hunger alongside numbers but becomes rough over hidden food.","stress":"","relationship":"Applies Baek On’s ration sheet, checks Seo Nayeon’s food escort and owes Ryu Eunbi for a medication audit.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Scale under two observers","description":"Weighs under two observers and writes reserves on the wall.","behavior":"Weighs under two observers and writes reserves on the wall.","stress":"","relationship":"Applies Baek On’s ration sheet, checks Seo Nayeon’s food escort and owes Ryu Eunbi for a medication audit.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Checks scales before two observers and writes reserves on walls. Pursues fairness but reacts physically to hidden food.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d669-c6b0-c8fc-9ec3","name":"Uju Hwang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d669-c6b0-c8fc-9ec3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-50,"Openness":45,"Force":-50,"Material":5,"Communal":65,"Principle":30,"Public":40,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":50,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":-10,"Display":10,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Ration Scale and Remaining Amount Disclosure","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Ration Scale Clerk","Values":"Authority −50 | Openness 45 | Force −50 | Materialism 5 | Communal 65 | Principle 30 | Transparency 40 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 50 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly 15 | Risk −10 | Display 10 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2076-02-07, active at the 2126 opening. Raised in the Yeongdeungpo station ration queue. The duty log of the Ration Scale Clerk records his countersigning the scale seal on a blackout night.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Hwang Serin''s ration-scale and remaining-stock disclosure work. It does not confirm a current posting, residence, domain or ownership.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Ration Scale Clerk. Two monitors watch the ration scale at the same time, and the remaining stock is chalked on the wall.","Anecdote":"Counterfeit medicine was found in the ration line, and the manufacturing crate bore a seal of unknown origin.","Relationships":"Enforces Baek On''s public ration ticket and inspects Seo Nayeon''s ice and food convoy. Owes Ryu Eunbi for the Bukhansan Bogungmun medicine ration audit.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"He can trace the counterfeit medicine crates."},"biography":"He tries to be fair, but his hand moves first when he sees hidden food. He puts numbers and hunger on the same scale.\n\n- Livelihood: Ration Scale and Remaining Amount Disclosure\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Ration Scale Clerk\n**Life.** Born 2076-02-07, active at the 2126 opening. Raised in the Yeongdeungpo station ration queue. The duty log of the Ration Scale Clerk records his countersigning the scale seal on a blackout night.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Hwang Serin''s ration-scale and remaining-stock disclosure work. It does not confirm a current posting, residence, domain or ownership.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Ration Scale Clerk. Two monitors watch the ration scale at the same time, and the remaining stock is chalked on the wall.\n\n**Anecdote.** Counterfeit medicine was found in the ration line, and the manufacturing crate bore a seal of unknown origin.\n\n**Relations.** Enforces Baek On''s public ration ticket and inspects Seo Nayeon''s ice and food convoy. Owes Ryu Eunbi for the Bukhansan Bogungmun medicine ration audit.\n\n**Intervention.** He can trace the counterfeit medicine crates.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −50 | Openness 45 | Force −50 | Materialism 5 | Communal 65 | Principle 30 | Transparency 40 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 50 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly 15 | Risk −10 | Display 10 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Hwang Serin","type":"Command","to":"Baek On","basis":"Enforces the public ration table"},{"from":"Hwang Serin","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"Inspects ice and food convoys"},{"from":"Hwang Serin","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Owes a debt for the Bukhansan Bogungmun medicine-ration audit"}],"incoming":[{"from":"O Han-gyeol","type":"Command","to":"Hwang Serin","basis":"Backing the ration monitoring with a militia"},{"from":"Du Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Hwang Serin","basis":"Tends the stove beside Hwang Serin''s ration warehouse"},{"from":"Bong Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Hwang Serin","basis":"Watches Hwang Serin''s medicine ration scale together"},{"from":"Mo Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Hwang Serin","basis":"Adds the medicinal herb share to Hwang Serin''s ration scale"},{"from":"Hong Eun-seo","type":"Contract","to":"Hwang Serin","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0248","name":"황세린","title":"배급 감시인","position":"배급 저울 주사","characterId":"K247","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"배급 저울·잔량 공개","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-황세린","detailRoute":"/people/person-0248","birthDate":"2076-02-07","birthday":"02-07","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"ration-weighing","name":"배급 검량·잔량 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"ration-weighing-disposition","name":"배고픔을 함께 셈","description":"숫자와 배고픔을 같은 저울에 올리되 숨긴 식량에는 거칠어진다.","behavior":"숫자와 배고픔을 같은 저울에 올리되 숨긴 식량에는 거칠어진다.","stress":"","relationship":"백온의 공개 배급표를 집행하고 서나연의 얼음·식량 호송을 검수한다. 류은비에게 북한산보국문 약품 배급 감사를 빚졌다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"두 눈의 저울","description":"두 감시인 앞에서 검량하고 잔량을 벽에 남긴다.","behavior":"두 감시인 앞에서 검량하고 잔량을 벽에 남긴다.","stress":"","relationship":"백온의 공개 배급표를 집행하고 서나연의 얼음·식량 호송을 검수한다. 류은비에게 북한산보국문 약품 배급 감사를 빚졌다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"두 감시인 앞에서 저울을 보고 잔량을 벽에 남긴다. 공정을 추구하지만 숨긴 식량에는 손이 먼저 나간다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d669-c6b0-c8fc-9ec3","name":"우주 황씨","crest":"clan-crests/d669-c6b0-c8fc-9ec3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-50,"개방":45,"무력":-50,"물질":5,"공동":65,"원칙":30,"공개":40,"자격":25,"분산":50,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":15,"위험":-10,"과시":10,"지속":20,"지향":"양성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"배급 저울·잔량 공개","소속":"정부","품계":"주사","직함":"배급 저울 주사","가치관":"권위 −50 | 개방 45 | 무력 −50 | 물질 5 | 공동 65 | 원칙 30 | 공개 40 | 자격 25 | 분산 50 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 15 | 위험 −10 | 과시 10 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2076-02-07 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 영등포 역 배급 줄에서 자랐다. 배급 저울 주사 당직 기록에는 정전 밤에 저울 봉인을 대신 서명한 일이 남아 있다.\n- 황세린의 배급 저울·잔량 공개 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 배급 저울 주사. 배급 저울을 두 감시인이 동시에 보고, 잔량을 벽에 분필로 남긴다.","일화":"가짜 약품이 배급 줄에서 발견되고 제조 상자가 출처 불명 봉인을 하고 있었다.","관계":"백온의 공개 배급표를 집행하고 서나연의 얼음·식량 호송을 검수한다. 류은비에게 북한산보국문 약품 배급 감사를 빚졌다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"가짜 약 상자를 추적할 수 있다."},"biography":"공정하려고 애쓰지만 숨긴 식량을 보면 손이 먼저 나간다. 숫자와 배고픔을 같은 저울에 올린다.\n\n- 생업: 배급 저울·잔량 공개\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 주사\n- 직함: 배급 저울 주사\n**생애.** 2076-02-07 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 영등포 역 배급 줄에서 자랐다. 배급 저울 주사 당직 기록에는 정전 밤에 저울 봉인을 대신 서명한 일이 남아 있다.\n- 황세린의 배급 저울·잔량 공개 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 배급 저울 주사. 배급 저울을 두 감시인이 동시에 보고, 잔량을 벽에 분필로 남긴다.\n\n**일화.** 가짜 약품이 배급 줄에서 발견되고 제조 상자가 출처 불명 봉인을 하고 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 백온의 공개 배급표를 집행하고 서나연의 얼음·식량 호송을 검수한다. 류은비에게 북한산보국문 약품 배급 감사를 빚졌다.\n\n**개입.** 가짜 약 상자를 추적할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −50 | 개방 45 | 무력 −50 | 물질 5 | 공동 65 | 원칙 30 | 공개 40 | 자격 25 | 분산 50 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 15 | 위험 −10 | 과시 10 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"황세린","type":"지휘","to":"백온","basis":"공개 배급표를 집행"},{"from":"황세린","type":"계약","to":"서나연","basis":"얼음·식량 호송을 검수"},{"from":"황세린","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"북한산보국문 약품 배급 감사를 빚짐"}],"incoming":[{"from":"오한결","type":"지휘","to":"황세린","basis":"배급 감시를 민병으로 뒷받침"},{"from":"두감","type":"계약","to":"황세린","basis":"황세린의 배급 창고 옆 난로를 맡는다"},{"from":"봉감","type":"계약","to":"황세린","basis":"황세린의 약품 배급 저울을 함께 본다"},{"from":"모감","type":"계약","to":"황세린","basis":"황세린의 배급 저울에 약초 몫을 올린다"},{"from":"홍은서","type":"계약","to":"황세린","basis":""}]}}');
