Gang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ac15-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-40,"Openness":60,"Force":-40,"Material":-20,"Communal":55,"Principle":35,"Public":35,"Eligibility":35,"Dispersed":50,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":-10,"Display":20,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Corridor Scouting Reports and Passage Verification","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Corridor Scouting Clerk","Values":"Authority −40 | Openness 60 | Force −40 | Materialism −20 | Communal 55 | Principle 35 | Transparency 35 | Qualification 35 | Decentralization 50 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly 15 | Risk −10 | Display 20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Fluid | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2077-12-20, active at the 2126 opening. Raised on the waiting-hall watch. The duty log of the Corridor Scouting Clerk records her taking a replacement watch after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Proposes Pyeongchang-dong as the reference point for Gang Taesan''s corridor scouting report and passage check work. It does not confirm a current posting, residence, domain or ownership.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Gang Taesan''s corridor scouting report and passage check work.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Corridor Scouting Clerk. Scouting reports go first to the Bureau Chief, and armed passage opens only with the token of the Refugee Roster Clerk.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Taciturn, she remembers terrain like a human face. She refuses orders that split families apart.\n\n- Occupation: Corridor Scouting Reports and Passage Verification\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Corridor Scouting Clerk\n**Life.** Born 2077-12-20, active at the 2126 opening. Raised on the waiting-hall watch. The duty log of the Corridor Scouting Clerk records her taking a replacement watch after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Proposes Pyeongchang-dong as the reference point for Gang Taesan''s corridor scouting report and passage check work. It does not confirm a current posting, residence, domain or ownership.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Gang Taesan''s corridor scouting report and passage check work.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Corridor Scouting Clerk. Scouting reports go first to the Bureau Chief, and armed passage opens only with the token of the Refugee Roster Clerk.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −40 | Openness 60 | Force −40 | Materialism −20 | Communal 55 | Principle 35 | Transparency 35 | Qualification 35 | Decentralization 50 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly 15 | Risk −10 | Display 20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Fluid | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gang Taesan","type":"Command","to":"Baek On","basis":""},{"from":"Gang Taesan","type":"Grudge","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gwon Do-ha","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Taesan","basis":""},{"from":"Mo Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Taesan","basis":""},{"from":"Yong Guk","type":"Command","to":"Gang Taesan","basis":""},{"from":"Bok Mo","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Taesan","basis":""},{"from":"Yongmo","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Taesan","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0249","name":"강태산","title":"산악 정찰 반장","position":"회랑 정찰 주사","characterId":"K248","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"회랑 정찰 보고·통행 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-강태산","detailRoute":"/people/person-0249","birthDate":"2077-12-20","birthday":"12-20","age":49,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"corridor-recon","name":"회랑 정찰","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"corridor-recon-disposition","name":"산악 정찰 반장","description":"직함은 산악 정찰 반장.","behavior":"직함은 산악 정찰 반장.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"산악 정찰 반장","description":"직함은 산악 정찰 반장.","behavior":"직함은 산악 정찰 반장.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 산악 정찰 반장.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ac15-c9c4-c8fc","name":"진주 강씨","crest":"clan-crests/ac15-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-40,"개방":60,"무력":-40,"물질":-20,"공동":55,"원칙":35,"공개":35,"자격":35,"분산":50,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":15,"위험":-10,"과시":20,"지속":-10,"지향":"유동","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"회랑 정찰 보고·통행 확인","소속":"정부","품계":"주사","직함":"회랑 정찰 주사","가치관":"권위 −40 | 개방 60 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −20 | 공동 55 | 원칙 35 | 공개 35 | 자격 35 | 분산 50 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 15 | 위험 −10 | 과시 20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2077-12-20 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 회랑 정찰 주사 당직 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 뒤 대체 당직을 맡은 일이 남아 있다.\n- 강태산의 회랑 정찰 보고·통행 확인 업무 기준점으로 평창동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.\n- 강태산의 회랑 정찰 보고·통행 확인 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 회랑 정찰 주사. 정찰 보고를 국장에게 먼저 올리고, 무장 통과는 피난 명부 주사의 표가 있어야 연다.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"과묵하고 지형을 사람 얼굴처럼 기억한다. 가족을 갈라놓는 명령을 거부한다.\n\n- 생업: 회랑 정찰 보고·통행 확인\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 주사\n- 직함: 회랑 정찰 주사\n**생애.** 2077-12-20 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 회랑 정찰 주사 당직 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 뒤 대체 당직을 맡은 일이 남아 있다.\n- 강태산의 회랑 정찰 보고·통행 확인 업무 기준점으로 평창동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.\n- 강태산의 회랑 정찰 보고·통행 확인 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 회랑 정찰 주사. 정찰 보고를 국장에게 먼저 올리고, 무장 통과는 피난 명부 주사의 표가 있어야 연다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −40 | 개방 60 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −20 | 공동 55 | 원칙 35 | 공개 35 | 자격 35 | 분산 50 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 15 | 위험 −10 | 과시 20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"강태산","type":"지휘","to":"백온","basis":""},{"from":"강태산","type":"원한","to":"배우진","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"권도하","type":"계약","to":"강태산","basis":""},{"from":"모봉","type":"계약","to":"강태산","basis":""},{"from":"용국","type":"지휘","to":"강태산","basis":""},{"from":"복모","type":"계약","to":"강태산","basis":""},{"from":"용모","type":"계약","to":"강태산","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0250', 'c724-d30c-d3c9', '{"id":"person-0250","name":"Yun Choa","title":"Relief Families Clerk","position":"Roster Copying Clerk","characterId":"K249","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Clan Vote Results and Relief Supply Source Records","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#inmul-yunchoa","detailRoute":"/people/person-0250","birthDate":"2084-04-17","birthday":"04-17","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"vote-provenance","name":"Vote and relief-provenance recording","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"vote-provenance-disposition","name":"Warm but strict in signing","description":"Treats oral relief as nonexistent before recording.","behavior":"Treats oral relief as nonexistent before recording.","stress":"","relationship":"Requests Kang Yejun’s ratification and consults Kang Minseo’s citizenship draft.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Provenance per box","description":"Records provenance for each relief box.","behavior":"Records provenance for each relief box.","stress":"","relationship":"Requests Kang Yejun’s ratification and consults Kang Minseo’s citizenship draft.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Posts community votes the same day, and records box provenance. Does not recognize unwritten relief promises.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c724-d30c-d3c9","name":"Papyeong Yun Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c724-d30c-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-70,"Openness":70,"Force":-40,"Material":-15,"Communal":90,"Principle":35,"Public":35,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":60,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":50,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":30,"Display":0,"Sustained":60,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Clan Vote Results and Relief Supply Source Records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Roster Copying Clerk","Values":"Authority −70 | Openness 70 | Force −40 | Material −15 | Communal 90 | Principle 35 | Publicity 35 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 60 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 50 | Possessiveness 10 | Risk 30 | Display 0 | Endurance 60 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Multi-partner"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2084-04-17, active at the 2126 opening. Grew up in the Bogukmun refugee barracks. The duty log of the Roster Copying Clerk records an incident concerning a line in the orphan register.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the baseline for Yun Choa''s work recording household vote results and relief supply sources. Does not confirm his current duty posting, residence, domain, or holdings.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Roster Copying Clerk. Posts household vote results the same day and writes down the source of relief supplies for every box.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Petition Gang Yejun for citizenship endorsement. Refer to Gang Minseo''s recovery-service citizenship draft.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Warm, but cold when it comes to signatures. Verbal relief pledges are treated as if they never happened unless they are copied into the ledger.\n\n- Livelihood: Clan Vote Results and Relief Supply Source Records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Roster Copying Clerk\n**Life.** Born 2084-04-17, active at the 2126 opening. Grew up in the Bogukmun refugee barracks. The duty log of the Roster Copying Clerk records an incident concerning a line in the orphan register.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the baseline for Yun Choa''s work recording household vote results and relief supply sources. Does not confirm his current duty posting, residence, domain, or holdings.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Roster Copying Clerk. Posts household vote results the same day and writes down the source of relief supplies for every box.\n\n**Relationships.** Petition Gang Yejun for citizenship endorsement. Refer to Gang Minseo''s recovery-service citizenship draft.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −70 | Openness 70 | Force −40 | Material −15 | Communal 90 | Principle 35 | Publicity 35 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 60 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 50 | Possessiveness 10 | Risk 30 | Display 0 | Endurance 60 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yun Choa","type":"Command","to":"Baek On","basis":""},{"from":"Yun Choa","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Ye-jun","basis":"Petitions the Records Office for citizenship ratification"},{"from":"Yun Choa","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Minseo","basis":"Consults the restoration-service citizenship text"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Cha Namwon","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Choa","basis":""},{"from":"Bak Geumeun","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Choa","basis":""},{"from":"No Geum-ho","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Choa","basis":""},{"from":"So Du","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Choa","basis":""},{"from":"Guk Bong","type":"Command","to":"Yun Choa","basis":""},{"from":"Eo Ha-eun","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Choa","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0250","name":"윤초아","title":"구호 가족 서기","position":"명부 필사 주사","characterId":"K249","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"문중 표 결과·구호 물자 출처 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-윤초아","detailRoute":"/people/person-0250","birthDate":"2084-04-17","birthday":"04-17","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"vote-provenance","name":"표결·구호 출처 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"vote-provenance-disposition","name":"따뜻하나 서명은 차가움","description":"구두 구호를 기록하기 전에는 없던 일로 돌린다.","behavior":"구두 구호를 기록하기 전에는 없던 일로 돌린다.","stress":"","relationship":"강예준에게 시민권 인준을 청구한다. 강민서의 복구복무 시민권 문안을 참고한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"상자별 출처","description":"구호 물자마다 출처를 적는다.","behavior":"구호 물자마다 출처를 적는다.","stress":"","relationship":"강예준에게 시민권 인준을 청구한다. 강민서의 복구복무 시민권 문안을 참고한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"가문 표를 당일 게시하고 상자마다 출처를 기록한다. 구호 약속은 필사되지 않으면 인정하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c724-d30c-d3c9","name":"파평 윤씨","crest":"clan-crests/c724-d30c-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-70,"개방":70,"무력":-40,"물질":-15,"공동":90,"원칙":35,"공개":35,"자격":25,"분산":60,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":50,"독점":10,"위험":30,"과시":0,"지속":60,"지향":"이성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"문중 표 결과·구호 물자 출처 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"주사","직함":"명부 필사 주사","가치관":"권위 −70 | 개방 70 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −15 | 공동 90 | 원칙 35 | 공개 35 | 자격 25 | 분산 60 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 50 | 독점 10 | 위험 30 | 과시 0 | 지속 60 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2084-04-17 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 보국문 피난 막사에서 자랐다. 명부 필사 주사 당직 기록에는 고아 명부 줄 일이 남아 있다.\n- 윤초아의 가문 표 결과·구호 물자 출처 기록 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 명부 필사 주사. 가문 표 결과를 당일 게시하고, 구호 물자 출처를 상자마다 적는다.","일화":"","관계":"강예준에게 시민권 인준을 청구한다. 강민서의 복구복무 시민권 문안을 참고한다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"따뜻하나 서명은 차갑다. 구두 구호 약속을 장부에 옮기지 않으면 없던 일로 돌린다.\n\n- 생업: 문중 표 결과·구호 물자 출처 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 주사\n- 직함: 명부 필사 주사\n**생애.** 2084-04-17 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 보국문 피난 막사에서 자랐다. 명부 필사 주사 당직 기록에는 고아 명부 줄 일이 남아 있다.\n- 윤초아의 가문 표 결과·구호 물자 출처 기록 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 명부 필사 주사. 가문 표 결과를 당일 게시하고, 구호 물자 출처를 상자마다 적는다.\n\n**관계.** 강예준에게 시민권 인준을 청구한다. 강민서의 복구복무 시민권 문안을 참고한다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −70 | 개방 70 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −15 | 공동 90 | 원칙 35 | 공개 35 | 자격 25 | 분산 60 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 50 | 독점 10 | 위험 30 | 과시 0 | 지속 60 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"윤초아","type":"지휘","to":"백온","basis":""},{"from":"윤초아","type":"계약","to":"강예준","basis":"시민권 인준을 기록청에 청구"},{"from":"윤초아","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"복구복무 시민권 문안을 참고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"차남원","type":"계약","to":"윤초아","basis":""},{"from":"박금은","type":"계약","to":"윤초아","basis":""},{"from":"노금호","type":"계약","to":"윤초아","basis":""},{"from":"소두","type":"계약","to":"윤초아","basis":""},{"from":"국봉","type":"지휘","to":"윤초아","basis":""},{"from":"어하은","type":"계약","to":"윤초아","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0251', 'c624-d574-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0251","name":"O Han-gyeol","title":"Militia Ration Oversight","position":"Ration Duty Clerk","characterId":"K250","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Separation of Ration and Armed Duty; Warehouse Key Control","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#person-ohangyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0251","birthDate":"2095-07-22","birthday":"07-22","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"duty-separation","name":"Ration and armed-duty separation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"duty-separation-disposition","name":"Militia Ration Oversight","description":"Title: Militia Ration Oversight.","behavior":"Title: Militia Ration Oversight.","stress":"","relationship":"Supports Hwang Serin’s ration oversight and shares corridor shifts with Kang Taesan.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Separate night keys","description":"Leaves night-store keys with copy duty.","behavior":"Leaves night-store keys with copy duty.","stress":"","relationship":"Supports Hwang Serin’s ration oversight and shares corridor shifts with Kang Taesan.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Separates distribution from armed duty and supports public ration oversight.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c624-d574-c8fc","name":"Haeju O Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c624-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-60,"Openness":60,"Force":-40,"Material":-5,"Communal":55,"Principle":10,"Public":25,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":10,"Display":5,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Separation of Ration and Armed Duty; Warehouse Key Control","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Ration Duty Clerk","Values":"Authority −60 | Openness 60 | Force −40 | Material −5 | Communal 55 | Principle 10 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 0 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk 10 | Display 5 | Endurance 0 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Multi-partner"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2095-07-22, active at the 2126 opening. Grew up in the Yeongdeungpo station ration queue. The duty log of the Ration Duty Clerk records an incident of countersigning a storehouse seal on a blackout night.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the baseline for Oh Hangyeol''s work on separating ration and armed duty and managing storehouse keys. Does not confirm her current duty posting, residence, domain, or holdings.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Ration Duty Clerk. Does not let the same person hold both armed duty and ration duty, and keeps the night storehouse keys only with the Roster Library transcription watch.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Backs Hwang Serin''s ration oversight with force. Shares corridor shifts with Gang Taesan.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Loyal, but sometimes cannot stop the hands of hungry members. When oath and survival collide, falls into long silence.\n\n- Occupation: Separation of Ration and Armed Duty; Warehouse Key Control\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Ration Duty Clerk\n**Life.** Born 2095-07-22, active at the 2126 opening. Grew up in the Yeongdeungpo station ration queue. The duty log of the Ration Duty Clerk records an incident of countersigning a storehouse seal on a blackout night.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the baseline for Oh Hangyeol''s work on separating ration and armed duty and managing storehouse keys. Does not confirm her current duty posting, residence, domain, or holdings.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Ration Duty Clerk. Does not let the same person hold both armed duty and ration duty, and keeps the night storehouse keys only with the Roster Library transcription watch.\n\n**Relationships.** Backs Hwang Serin''s ration oversight with force. Shares corridor shifts with Gang Taesan.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −60 | Openness 60 | Force −40 | Material −5 | Communal 55 | Principle 10 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk 10 | Display 5 | Endurance 0 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"O Han-gyeol","type":"Command","to":"Hwang Serin","basis":"Backing the ration monitoring with a militia"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Du Gam","type":"Contract","to":"O Han-gyeol","basis":"Sharing the fuel depot watch and tools with Oh Hangyeol, and"},{"from":"Yong Du","type":"Command","to":"O Han-gyeol","basis":"Guarding the fuel depot under Oh Hangyeol''s direction, and"},{"from":"Sun Ji-min","type":"Contract","to":"O Han-gyeol","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0251","name":"오한결","title":"민병 배급 감시","position":"배급 당직 주사","characterId":"K250","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"배급·무장 근무 분리·창고 열쇠 관리","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-오한결","detailRoute":"/people/person-0251","birthDate":"2095-07-22","birthday":"07-22","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"duty-separation","name":"배급·무장 교대 분리","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"duty-separation-disposition","name":"민병 배급 감시","description":"직함은 민병 배급 감시.","behavior":"직함은 민병 배급 감시.","stress":"","relationship":"황세린의 배급 감시를 무력으로 뒷받침한다. 강태산과 회랑 교대를 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"야간 열쇠 분리","description":"야간 창고 열쇠를 필사 당직에 둔다.","behavior":"야간 창고 열쇠를 필사 당직에 둔다.","stress":"","relationship":"황세린의 배급 감시를 무력으로 뒷받침한다. 강태산과 회랑 교대를 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"배급과 무장 근무를 분리하며 공개 배급 감시를 뒷받침한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c624-d574-c8fc","name":"해주 오씨","crest":"clan-crests/c624-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-60,"개방":60,"무력":-40,"물질":-5,"공동":55,"원칙":10,"공개":25,"자격":30,"분산":45,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":5,"위험":10,"과시":5,"지속":0,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"배급·무장 근무 분리·창고 열쇠 관리","소속":"정부","품계":"주사","직함":"배급 당직 주사","가치관":"권위 −60 | 개방 60 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −5 | 공동 55 | 원칙 10 | 공개 25 | 자격 30 | 분산 45 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 5 | 위험 10 | 과시 5 | 지속 0 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2095-07-22 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 영등포 역 배급 줄에서 자랐다. 배급 당직 주사 당직 기록에는 정전 밤에 창고 봉인을 대신 서명한 일이 남아 있다.\n- 오한결의 배급·무장 근무 분리·창고 열쇠 관리 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 배급 당직 주사. 무장 근무와 배급 근무를 같은 사람이 겸하지 못하게 하고, 야간 창고 열쇠는 명부 필사 당직에만 둔다.","일화":"","관계":"황세린의 배급 감시를 무력으로 뒷받침한다. 강태산과 회랑 교대를 나눈다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"충성스러우나 배고픈 대원의 손을 막지 못할 때가 있다. 맹세와 생존이 충돌하면 오래 침묵한다.\n\n- 생업: 배급·무장 근무 분리·창고 열쇠 관리\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 주사\n- 직함: 배급 당직 주사\n**생애.** 2095-07-22 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 영등포 역 배급 줄에서 자랐다. 배급 당직 주사 당직 기록에는 정전 밤에 창고 봉인을 대신 서명한 일이 남아 있다.\n- 오한결의 배급·무장 근무 분리·창고 열쇠 관리 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 배급 당직 주사. 무장 근무와 배급 근무를 같은 사람이 겸하지 못하게 하고, 야간 창고 열쇠는 명부 필사 당직에만 둔다.\n\n**관계.** 황세린의 배급 감시를 무력으로 뒷받침한다. 강태산과 회랑 교대를 나눈다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −60 | 개방 60 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −5 | 공동 55 | 원칙 10 | 공개 25 | 자격 30 | 분산 45 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 5 | 위험 10 | 과시 5 | 지속 0 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"오한결","type":"지휘","to":"황세린","basis":"배급 감시를 민병으로 뒷받침"}],"incoming":[{"from":"두감","type":"계약","to":"오한결","basis":"오한결의 연료고 당직과 공구를 나누고"},{"from":"용두","type":"지휘","to":"오한결","basis":"오한결의 지휘로 연료고를 지키고"},{"from":"순지민","type":"계약","to":"오한결","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0252', 'b450-b450-b989', '{"id":"person-0252","name":"Du Gam","title":"Stove Technician","position":"Stove Maintenance Clerk","characterId":"K251","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Stove and Flue Inspection Sheet Management","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#person-dugam","detailRoute":"/people/person-0252","birthDate":"2098-02-03","birthday":"02-03","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"heater-maintenance","name":"Heater and flue inspection","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"heater-maintenance-disposition","name":"Stove Technician","description":"Title: Stove Technician.","behavior":"Title: Stove Technician.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Stove Technician","description":"Title: Stove Technician.","behavior":"Title: Stove Technician.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Stove Technician.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b450-b450-b989","name":"Dureung Du Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b450-b450-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-45,"Openness":55,"Force":-50,"Material":-25,"Communal":55,"Principle":25,"Public":40,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":20,"Risk":0,"Display":-5,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Stove and Flue Inspection Sheet Management","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Stove Maintenance Clerk","Values":"Authority −45 | Openness 55 | Force −50 | Materialism −25 | Communal 55 | Principle 25 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 45 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 35 | Monopoly 20 | Risk 0 | Display −5 | Endurance −10 | Orientation: Opposite Sex | Bonding: Non-Exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2098-02-03, active at the 2126 opening. Grew up at Sinjeong Depot. The duty records of the Stove Maintenance Clerk include the reporting of a defect just before a derailment.\n- Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong is proposed as the reference point for Dugam''s work managing the stove-and-flue inspection sheets. Current duty assignment, residence, holding, and ownership are not confirmed.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Stove Maintenance Clerk. Reads the stove inspection sheets before the evening ration, and requires the joint signature of the clerk and the maintenance duty officer on flue incidents.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Falls quiet at the sight of cold ash, and makes whoever blocked a flue open it first, then holds that person accountable. Regards letting a broken stove last through the night as a breach of the oath.\n\n- Livelihood: Stove and Flue Inspection Sheet Management\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Stove Maintenance Clerk\n**Life.** Born 2098-02-03, active at the 2126 opening. Grew up at Sinjeong Depot. The duty records of the Stove Maintenance Clerk include the reporting of a defect just before a derailment.\n- Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong is proposed as the reference point for Dugam''s work managing the stove-and-flue inspection sheets. Current duty assignment, residence, holding, and ownership are not confirmed.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Stove Maintenance Clerk. Reads the stove inspection sheets before the evening ration, and requires the joint signature of the clerk and the maintenance duty officer on flue incidents.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −45 | Openness 55 | Force −50 | Materialism −25 | Communal 55 | Principle 25 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 45 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Monopoly 20 | Risk 0 | Display −5 | Endurance −10 | Orientation: Opposite Sex | Bonding: Non-Exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Du Gam","type":"Contract","to":"O Han-gyeol","basis":""},{"from":"Du Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Hwang Serin","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gam Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Du Gam","basis":""},{"from":"Yong Du","type":"Contract","to":"Du Gam","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0252","name":"두감","title":"난로 정비사","position":"난로 정비 주사","characterId":"K251","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"난로·연통 점검표 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-두감","detailRoute":"/people/person-0252","birthDate":"2098-02-03","birthday":"02-03","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"heater-maintenance","name":"난로·연통 점검","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"heater-maintenance-disposition","name":"난로 정비사","description":"직함은 난로 정비사.","behavior":"직함은 난로 정비사.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"난로 정비사","description":"직함은 난로 정비사.","behavior":"직함은 난로 정비사.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 난로 정비사.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b450-b450-b989","name":"두릉 두씨","crest":"clan-crests/b450-b450-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-45,"개방":55,"무력":-50,"물질":-25,"공동":55,"원칙":25,"공개":40,"자격":45,"분산":45,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":20,"위험":0,"과시":-5,"지속":-10,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"난로·연통 점검표 관리","소속":"정부","품계":"주사","직함":"난로 정비 주사","가치관":"권위 −45 | 개방 55 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −25 | 공동 55 | 원칙 25 | 공개 40 | 자격 45 | 분산 45 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 20 | 위험 0 | 과시 −5 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2098-02-03 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 난로 정비 주사 당직 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고 일이 남아 있다.\n- 두감의 난로·연통 점검표 관리 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 난로 정비 주사. 난로 점검표를 저녁 배급 전에 읽고, 연통 사고는 난로 정비 주사와 정비 당직의 서명을 함께 요구한다.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"찬 재를 보면 말이 줄고, 연통을 막은 사람을 연통부터 열게 하고 책임을 묻는다. 고장난 난로를 하룻밤 넘기는 일을 맹세 위반으로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 난로·연통 점검표 관리\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 주사\n- 직함: 난로 정비 주사\n**생애.** 2098-02-03 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 난로 정비 주사 당직 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고 일이 남아 있다.\n- 두감의 난로·연통 점검표 관리 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 난로 정비 주사. 난로 점검표를 저녁 배급 전에 읽고, 연통 사고는 난로 정비 주사와 정비 당직의 서명을 함께 요구한다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −45 | 개방 55 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −25 | 공동 55 | 원칙 25 | 공개 40 | 자격 45 | 분산 45 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 20 | 위험 0 | 과시 −5 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"두감","type":"계약","to":"오한결","basis":""},{"from":"두감","type":"계약","to":"황세린","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"감용","type":"계약","to":"두감","basis":""},{"from":"용두","type":"계약","to":"두감","basis":""}]}}');
