","crest":"clan-crests/c18c-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-65,"Openness":90,"Force":-35,"Material":-10,"Communal":75,"Principle":25,"Public":50,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-45,"Risk":0,"Display":-25,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Messaging and Roster Cross-Checking","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Courier Clerk, Sin Bo-ram''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −65 | Openness 90 | Force −35 | Material −10 | Community 75 | Principle 25 | Publicity 50 | Qualification 40 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly −45 | Risk 0 | Display −25 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2090-09-16; active at the 2126 opening. Grew up on the Sinnae transfer-station watch. Courier Clerk''s watch record includes the blocking of a ticketless departing train.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Sodu''s courier and register-checking work. Does not confirm any current posting, residence, domain, or property.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Courier Clerk, Sin Bo-ram''s Deputy. Reads the register aloud before the evening ration, and if any name is missing, stops delivering notes.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Has torn up a note that left out a child''s name, and treats a verbal relief promise as though it never happened unless it is transferred into the courier ledger. Warm, but cold when it comes to signatures.\n\n- Occupation: Messaging and Roster Cross-Checking\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Courier Clerk, Sin Bo-ram''s Deputy\n**Life.** Born 2090-09-16; active at the 2126 opening. Grew up on the Sinnae transfer-station watch. Courier Clerk''s watch record includes the blocking of a ticketless departing train.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Sodu''s courier and register-checking work. Does not confirm any current posting, residence, domain, or property.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Courier Clerk, Sin Bo-ram''s Deputy. Reads the register aloud before the evening ration, and if any name is missing, stops delivering notes.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −65 | Openness 90 | Force −35 | Material −10 | Community 75 | Principle 25 | Publicity 50 | Qualification 40 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly −45 | Risk 0 | Display −25 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"So Du","type":"Contract","to":"Sin Boram","basis":""},{"from":"So Du","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Choa","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Guk Bong","type":"Contract","to":"So Du","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0256","name":"소두","title":"전령, 신보람의 실무 담당자","position":"전령 주사, 신보람의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K255","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"전령·명부 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-소두","detailRoute":"/people/person-0256","birthDate":"2090-09-16","birthday":"09-16","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"assembly-messenger","name":"전령·명부 확인","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"assembly-messenger-disposition","name":"전령, 신보람의 실무 담당자","description":"직함은 전령, 신보람의 실무 담당자.","behavior":"직함은 전령, 신보람의 실무 담당자.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"전