line.\n- Proposes Pyeongchang-dong as the reference point for Bokmo''s detour surveying and highland coordinate management work. It does not confirm current posting, residence, holding, or ownership.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Bokmo''s detour surveying and highland coordinate management work.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Detour Survey Clerk. Keeps only surveyed roads as solid lines, and does not hand highland coordinates to outsiders without the consent of the Refugee Roster Clerk.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −70 | Openness 65 | Force −30 | Material −15 | Communal 80 | Principle 20 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 55 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Longing 45 | Possessiveness 20 | Risk −40 | Display −15 | Persistence 35 | Orientation same-sex | Union contractual cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bok Mo","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Taesan","basis":""},{"from":"Bok Mo","type":"Contract","to":"Du So","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Du So","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Mo","basis":""},{"from":"Sun Ji-min","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Mo","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0257","name":"복모","title":"피난로 탐사원","position":"우회로 실측 주사","characterId":"K256","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"우회로 실측·고지 좌표 관리","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-복모","detailRoute":"/people/person-0257","birthDate":"2101-06-19","birthday":"06-19","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"mountain-survey","name":"