 not confirm current duty assignment, residence, holding, or ownership.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Duty Clerk. Reads the evening roster aloud, and if any name is missing, halts both rations and entry together.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −55 | Openness 70 | Force −40 | Material −20 | Communal 85 | Principle 25 | Publicity 35 | Qualification 35 | Dispersion 55 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly −50 | Risk −25 | Display −5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gam Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Sin Boram","basis":""},{"from":"Gam Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Du Gam","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0259","name":"감용","title":"명부 거점장","position":"당직 주사","characterId":"K258","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"명부·출입 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-감용","detailRoute":"/people/person-0259","birthDate":"2091-01-12","birthday":"01-12","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"camp-duty","name":"명부·출입 확인","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"camp-duty-disposition","name":"명부 거점장","description":"직함은 명부 거점장.","behavior":"직함은 명부 거점장.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"명부 거점장","description":"직함은 명부 거점장.","behavior":"직함은 명부 거점장.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 명부 거점장.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":nu