ger Duty Chief records taking substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Duso''s passage-time and household-tally posting work. It does not confirm current duty assignment, residence, holding, or ownership.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Duty Chief. Title: Passage Ledger Duty Chief. Writes passage times and passes on the same board, and opens armed guidance only after Gang Taesan''s reconnaissance report.\n\n**Relations.** Receives Mobong''s mountain transport at the entrance and transfers Bongmo''s detour markings onto the milestones. Shares patrols and torch shifts with Yongguk.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −45 | Openness 55 | Force −40 | Material −25 | Communal 65 | Principle 25 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 40 | Display 10 | Persistence 40 | Orientation Fluid | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Du So","type":"Contract","to":"Mo Bong","basis":"Receives Mobong''s mountain transport at the entrance, and"},{"from":"Du So","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Mo","basis":"Transfers Bokmo''s detour markings onto the waymarkers"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bok Mo","type":"Contract","to":"Du So","basis":"Aligns markings with Duso''s corridor guide signs"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0260","name":"두소","title":"회랑 통행 안내 거점장","position":"통행 장부 당직장","characterId":"K259","rank":"당직장","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"통행 시각·신도 표 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-두소","detailRoute":"/people/person-0260","birthDate":"2087-10-13","birthday":"10-13","age":39,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},