king a substitute watch after an unexcused absence from a shift.\n- Proposes Pyeongchang-dong as the reference point for Bongdu''s highland torch-shift and access-record work. Does not confirm current duty posting, residence, domain, or ownership.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Bongdu''s highland torch-shift and access-record work.","Offices":"Rank: Duty Chief. Title: Highland Duty Chief. Records torch shifts together with passes, and blocks outside armed groups from approaching the highland unless Gang Taesan''s scouting report clears them.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Taciturn; counts torch intervals like a person''s breaths.\n\n- Occupation: Highland Torch Shift Changes and Approach Records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Duty Chief\n- Title: Highland Duty Chief\n**Life.** Born 2086-08-16; active at the 2126 opening. Raised on the waiting-hall watch. The Highland Watch Chief Seat''s duty log records taking a substitute watch after an unexcused absence from a shift.\n- Proposes Pyeongchang-dong as the reference point for Bongdu''s highland torch-shift and access-record work. Does not confirm current duty posting, residence, domain, or ownership.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Bongdu''s highland torch-shift and access-record work.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Duty Chief. Title: Highland Duty Chief. Records torch shifts together with passes, and blocks outside armed groups from approaching the highland unless Gang Taesan''s scouting report clears them.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −40 | Openness 55 | Force −50 | Materialism −20 | Communal 70 | Principle 40 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 30 | Dispersal 55 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 20 | Display 15 | Endurance 5 | Orientation None | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bong Du","type":"Oath","to":"Baek On","basis":""},{"from":"Bong Du","type":"Contract","to":"Yong Guk","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Yong Guk","type":"Contract","to":"Bong Du","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0262","name":"봉두","title":"방어 고지 거점장","position":"고지 당직장","characterId":"K261","rank":"당직장","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"고지 횃불 교대·접근 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-봉두","detailRoute":"/people/person-0262","birthDate":"2086-08-16","birthday":"08-16","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"torch-duty","name":"고지 횃불 교대 기록","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"torch-duty-disposition","name":"방어 고지 거점장","description":"직함은 방어 고지 거점장.","behavior":"직함은 방어 고지 거점장.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"외부 무장 제한","description":"보고 없는 외부 무장의 고지 접근을 막는다.","behavior":"보고 없는 외부 무장의 고지 접근을 막는다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"횃불 교대를 통행 표와 함께 기록하고 정찰 보고 없는 무장 접근을 막는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11410-S10","name":{"ko":"서대문구 정부 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K261","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S10","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1141065500","name":"홍제2동"},{"id":"region:1141066000","name":"홍은1동"},{"id