20 | 과시 15 | 지속 5 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"봉두","type":"맹세","to":"백온","basis":""},{"from":"봉두","type":"계약","to":"용국","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"용국","type":"계약","to":"봉두","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0263', 'c6a9-d64d-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0263","name":"Yong Du","title":"Heating Fuel Depot Post Chief, O Han-gyeol''s Deputy","position":"Fuel Depot Duty Chief, O Han-gyeol''s Deputy","characterId":"K262","rank":"Duty Chief","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Separation of Fuel Distribution and Night Key Control","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#person-yongdu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0263","birthDate":"2071-03-11","birthday":"03-11","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"fuel-dispatch","name":"Fuel dispatch and reserve comparison","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"fuel-dispatch-disposition","name":"Heating Fuel Depot Post Chief, O Han-gyeol''s Deputy","description":"Title: Heating Fuel Depot Post Chief, O Han-gyeol''s Deputy.","behavior":"Title: Heating Fuel Depot Post Chief, O Han-gyeol''s Deputy.","stress":"","relationship":"Guards fuel under O Hangyeol and matches Dugam’s heater checks with Hwang Serin’s reserve oversight.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"Separates duty and dispatch","description":"Prevents one person combining armed duty and fuel dispatch.","behavior":"Prevents one person combining armed duty and fuel dispatch.","stress":"","relationship":"Guards fuel under O Hangyeol and matches Dugam’s heater checks with Hwang Serin’s reserve oversight.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Separates armed duty from fuel dispatch and leaves night keys with copy duty.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"Yong Clan of Hongcheon","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-45,"Openness":55,"Force":-30,"Material":-30,"Communal":75,"Principle":25,"Public":30,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":55,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":30,"Display":-25,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Separation of Fuel Distribution and Night Key Control","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Duty Chief","Title":"Fuel Depot Duty Chief, O Han-gyeol''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −45 | Openness 55 | Martial −30 | Material −30 | Communal 75 | Principle 25 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 40 | Decentralization 55 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving −5 | Exclusivity 30 | Risk 30 | Display −25 | Endurance 20 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2071-03-11; active at the 2126 opening. Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The Fuel Depot Duty Chief''s duty record notes taking a substitute shift after an unexcused absence at shift change.\n- Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong is proposed as the reference point for Yongdu''s work of separating fuel issuance and managing the night key. It does not fix current duty postings, residence, domain, or ownership.","Offices":"Rank: Duty Chief. Title: Fuel Depot Duty Chief, O Han-gyeol''s Deputy. Ensures that armed duty and fuel issuance are never held by the same person, and keeps the night key only with Yun Choa''s scribal watch.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Guards the fuel depot under O Hangyeol''s command and writes release amounts on Dugam''s stove inspection sheet. Reconciles the remainder with Hwang Serin''s ration oversight.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Sometimes cannot stop the hands of loyal but hungry troops, so reads the scale twice. When oath and survival collide, never lets the key leave the body.\n\n- Livelihood: Separation of Fuel Distribution and Night Key Control\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Duty Chief\n- Title: Fuel Depot Duty Chief, O Han-gyeol''s Deputy\n**Life.** Born 2071-03-11; active at the 2126 opening. Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The Fuel Depot Duty Chief''s duty record notes taking a substitute shift after an unexcused absence at shift change.\n- Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong is proposed as the reference point for Yongdu''s work of separating fuel issuance and managing the night key. It does not fix current duty postings, residence, domain, or ownership.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Duty Chief. Title: Fuel Depot Duty Chief, O Han-gyeol''s Deputy. Ensures that armed duty and fuel issuance are never held by the same person, and keeps the night key only with Yun Choa''s scribal watch.\n\n**Relations.** Guards the fuel depot under O Hangyeol''s command and writes release amounts on Dugam''s stove inspection sheet. Reconciles the remainder with Hwang Serin''s ration oversight.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −45 | Openness 55 | Martial −30 | Material −30 | Communal 75 | Principle 25 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 40 | Decentralization 55 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Exclusivity 30 | Risk 30 | Display −25 | Endurance 20 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yong Du","type":"Command","to":"O Han-gyeol","basis":"Guarding the fuel depot under Oh Hangyeol''s direction, and"},{"from":"Yong Du","type":"Contract","to":"Du Gam","basis":"Records the issued quantity on Dugam''s stove inspection sheet"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0263","name":"용두","title":"난방 연료고 거점장, 오한결의 실무 담당자","position":"연료고 당직장, 오한결의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K262","rank":"당직장","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"연료 출고 분리·야간 열쇠 관리","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-용두","detailRoute":"/people/person-0263","birthDate":"2071-03-11","birthday":"03-11","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"fuel-dispatch","name":"연료 출고·잔량 대조","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"fuel-dispatch-disposition","name":"난방 연료고 거점장, 오한결의 실무 담당자","description":"직함은 난방 연료고 거점장, 오한결의 실무 담당자.","behavior":"직함은 난방 연료고 거점장, 오한결의 실무 담당자.","stress":"","relationship":"오한결의 지휘로 연료고를 지키고, 두감의 난로 점검표에 출고량을 적는다. 황세린의 배급 감시와 잔량을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-boundary","name":"근무와 출고 분리","description":"무장 근무와 연료 출고를 같은 사람이 겸하지 못하게 한다.","behavior":"무장 근무와 연료 출고를 같은 사람이 겸하지 못하게 한다.","stress":"","relationship":"오한결의 지휘로 연료고를 지키고, 두감의 난로 점검표에 출고량을 적는다. 황세린의 배급 감시와 잔량을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"무장 근무와 연료 출고를 분리하고 야간 키를 필사 당직에 둔다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"홍천 용씨","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-45,"개방":55,"무력":-30,"물질":-30,"공동":75,"원칙":25,"공개":30,"자격":40,"분산":55,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":30,"위험":30,"과시":-25,"지속":20,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"연료 출고 분리·야간 열쇠 관리","소속":"정부","품계":"당직장","직함":"연료고 당직장, 오한결의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −45 | 개방 55 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −30 | 공동 75 | 원칙 25 | 공개 30 | 자격 40 | 분산 55 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 30 | 위험 30 | 과시 −25 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2071-03-11 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 연료고 당직장 당직 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 뒤 대체 당직을 맡은 일이 남아 있다.\n- 용두의 연료 출고 분리·야간 열쇠 관리 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 당직장. 직함은 연료고 당직장, 오한결의 실무 담당자. 무장 근무와 연료 출고를 같은 사람이 겸하지 못하게 하고, 야간 열쇠는 윤초아의 필사 당직에만 둔다.","일화":"","관계":"오한결의 지휘로 연료고를 지키고, 두감의 난로 점검표에 출고량을 적는다. 황세린의 배급 감시와 잔량을 맞춘다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"충성스러우나 배고픈 대원의 손을 막지 못할 때가 있어 저울을 두 번 본다. 맹세와 생존이 충돌하면 열쇠를 몸에서 떼지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 연료 출고 분리·야간 열쇠 관리\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 당직장\n- 직함: 연료고 당직장, 오한결의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2071-03-11 출생, 2126년 개막에 활동했다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 연료고 당직장 당직 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 뒤 대체 당직을 맡은 일이 남아 있다.\n- 용두의 연료 출고 분리·야간 열쇠 관리 업무 기준점으로 종로1·2·3·4가동을 제안한다. 현재 근무 배치나 거주·영지·소유를 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 당직장. 직함은 연료고 당직장, 오한결의 실무 담당자. 무장 근무와 연료 출고를 같은 사람이 겸하지 못하게 하고, 야간 열쇠는 윤초아의 필사 당직에만 둔다.\n\n**관계.** 오한결의 지휘로 연료고를 지키고, 두감의 난로 점검표에 출고량을 적는다. 황세린의 배급 감시와 잔량을 맞춘다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −45 | 개방 55 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −30 | 공동 75 | 원칙 25 | 공개 30 | 자격 40 | 분산 55 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 30 | 위험 30 | 과시 −25 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"용두","type":"지휘","to":"오한결","basis":"오한결의 지휘로 연료고를 지키고"},{"from":"용두","type":"계약","to":"두감","basis":"두감의 난로 점검표에 출고량을 적는다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
