gistry line matter.\n- Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong is proposed as the reference point for Eo Ha-eun''s work of investigating omissions from the congregant registry and verifying rations. It does not fix current duty postings, residence, domain, or ownership.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Roster Incident Handler. Before the evening ration, reads the congregants'' names aloud, and if any name is missing, halts both rations and entry together.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −70 | Openness 80 | Martial −35 | Material −25 | Communal 85 | Principle 35 | Transparency 20 | Qualification 40 | Decentralization 60 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Exclusivity −55 | Risk −40 | Display −25 | Endurance 20 | Orientation Opposite sex | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Eo Ha-eun","type":"Contract","to":"Sin Boram","basis":""},{"from":"Eo Ha-eun","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Choa","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Sun Hangyeol","type":"Oath","to":"Eo Ha-eun","basis":""},{"from":"Seop Chaewon","type":"Contract","to":"Eo Ha-eun","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0264","name":"어하은","title":"난민 명부 사고 당사자","position":"명부 사고 담당","characterId":"K263","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"신도 명부 누락 조사·배급 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-어하은","detailRoute":"/people/person-0264","birthDate":"2065-12-10","birthday":"12-10","age":61,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"omission-check","name":"명부 누락 확인","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"omission-check-dispos