ounterfeit-medicine sealing job.\n- Proposes Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong as the reference point for Dan Yujin''s work of drafting negotiation texts and posting clan vote results. It does not confirm current duty assignment, residence, domain, or ownership.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Consultation Attendant. Posts the clan vote results at the meeting hall at the same time on the same day, and leaves bribe notes on the bulletin board as they are.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −65 | Openness 75 | Force −35 | Material −15 | Communal 80 | Principle 35 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 35 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Monopoly 0 | Risk 10 | Display 10 | Persistence 20 | Orientation same-sex | Bonding non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Dan Yu-jin","type":"Contract","to":"Baek On","basis":""},{"from":"Dan Yu-jin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Yura","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0268","name":"단유진","title":"난민 수행원","position":"협의 수행원","characterId":"K267","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"협의 문안·문중 표 결과 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-단유진","detailRoute":"/people/person-0268","birthDate":"2087-07-31","birthday":"07-31","age":39,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"meeting-support","name":"회의 문안·표결 게시","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"meeting-support-disposition","name":"난민 수행원","description":"직함은 난민 수행원.","behavior":"직함은 난민 수행원.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"recorded-bo