Shift Separation Testimony\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Forced Registration Deserter\n**Life.** Born 2074-05-13, active at the 2126 opening. Raised on waiting-hall duty. The duty record of the Forced-Registration Defector notes taking a substitute duty after an unauthorized absence from shift.\n- Pyeongchang-dong is proposed as the work reference point for Sun Jimin''s forced-registration defection records and shift-separation testimony. It does not confirm a current posting, residence, holding, or ownership.\n- Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong is proposed as the work reference point for Sun Jimin''s forced-registration defection records and shift-separation testimony.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Forced Registration Deserter. Writes the time of defection and the names of the remaining devotees on the same slip, and testifies that armed duty and ration duty must not be held by the same person.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −45 | Openness 40 | Force −50 | Material −20 | Communal 60 | Principle 35 | Publicity 35 | Qualification 35 | Dispersal 50 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Longing 30 | Exclusivity 5 | Risk 10 | Display 10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Fluid | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sun Ji-min","type":"Contract","to":"O Han-gyeol","basis":""},{"from":"Sun Ji-min","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Mo","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0269","name":"순지민","title":"강제등록 행렬 이탈자","position":"강제등록 이탈자","characterId":"K268","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"강제등록 이탈 기록·교대 분리 증언","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-10#인물-순지민","detailRoute":"/people/person-0269","birthDate":"2074-05-13","birthday":"05-13","age":52,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred