"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"baa8-d568-d3c9","name":"Hampyeong Mo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/baa8-d568-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":-15,"Force":-15,"Material":45,"Communal":20,"Principle":5,"Public":5,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":20,"Display":20,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Wheel and Steel Intake Weight, Dispatch Verification","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Arc Wheel and Scrap Iron Logistics Merchant","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness −15 | Force −15 | Materiality 45 | Communal 20 | Principle 5 | Publicity 5 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 20 | Display 20 | Continuity −15 | Orientation Fluid | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Raised at the Gangnam Station Depot. A defect report filed just before a derailment led to his post as an Arc wheel and scrap iron logistics merchant.\nMoso handles wheel and steel intake weights and dispatch checks in Yeoksam 1-dong. He processes machine-body maintenance samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signatures within the Yeoksam 1-dong work-and-living area next to Gangnam Station. The freight handover at the Yeoksam waiting hall is for reference only and does not confirm actual factory equipment, warehouse monopoly, or running trains. He matches dispatch against Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale and takes over lots at Bongguk''s recovery yard. He copies Gang Minseo''s repair-standard weight table onto the invoice","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Arc Wheel and Scrap Iron Logistics Merchant. ","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Regards shipping that falsifies weight as no different from shaving down the rails. Trusts the public scale over market price.\n\n- Livelihood: Wheel and Steel Intake Weight, Dispatch Verification\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Arc Wheel and Scrap Iron Logistics Merchant\n**Life.** Raised at the Gangnam Station Depot. A defect report filed just before a derailment led to his post as an Arc wheel and scrap iron logistics merchant.\nMoso handles wheel and steel intake weights and dispatch checks in Yeoksam 1-dong. He processes machine-body maintenance samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signatures within the Yeoksam 1-dong work-and-living area next to Gangnam Station. The freight handover at the Yeoksam waiting hall is for reference only and does not confirm actual factory equipment, warehouse monopoly, or running trains. He matches dispatch against Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale and takes over lots at Bongguk''s recovery yard. He copies Gang Minseo''s repair-standard weight table onto the invoice\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Arc Wheel and Scrap Iron Logistics Merchant. \n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness −15 | Force −15 | Materiality 45 | Communal 20 | Principle 5 | Publicity 5 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 20 | Display 20 | Continuity −15 | Orientation Fluid | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Moso","type":"Contract","to":"Hwang No-eul","basis":"Matching shipments to Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale"},{"from":"Moso","type":"Contract","to":"Bongguk","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bongguk","type":"Contract","to":"Moso","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0279","name":"모소","title":"차륜·철재 물류상","position":"Arc 차륜·철재 물류상","characterId":"K278","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"차륜·철재 입고 중량·출고 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-모소","detailRoute":"/people/person-0279","birthDate":"2099-04-18","birthday":"04-18","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k278-weight-invoice-recording","name":"중량 송장 작성","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k278-priority","name":"차륜·철재 물류상","description":"직함은 차륜·철재 물류상.","behavior":"직함은 차륜·철재 물류상.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k278-accountability","name":"차륜·철재 물류상","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"직함은 차륜·철재 물류상.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 차륜·철재 물류상.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"baa8-d568-d3c9","name":"함평 모씨","crest":"clan-crests/baa8-d568-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":-15,"무력":-15,"물질":45,"공동":20,"원칙":5,"공개":5,"자격":60,"분산":20,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":-20,"위험":20,"과시":20,"지속":-15,"지향":"유동","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"차륜·철재 입고 중량·출고 확인","소속":"Arc","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"Arc 차륜·철재 물류상","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −15 | 물질 45 | 공동 20 | 원칙 5 | 공개 5 | 자격 60 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 −20 | 위험 20 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 탈선 직전에 올린 결함 보고가 계기가 되어 Arc의 차륜·철재 물류상 자리를 맡게 되었다.\n모소는 역삼1동에서 차륜·철재 입고 중량·출고 확인 업무를 맡는다. 기계 몸체 정비용 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명을 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권에서 처리한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고일 뿐 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 황노을의 회수 저울과 출고를 맞추고, 봉국의 회수장에서 로트를 인수한다. 강민서의 수리 규격 중량표를 송장에 옮긴다","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 Arc 차륜·철재 물류상. ","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"무게를 속이는 출고를 선로를 깎는 일과 같다고 본다. 시세보다 공개 저울을 믿는다.\n\n- 생업: 차륜·철재 입고 중량·출고 확인\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: Arc 차륜·철재 물류상\n**생애.** 강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 탈선 직전에 올린 결함 보고가 계기가 되어 Arc의 차륜·철재 물류상 자리를 맡게 되었다.\n모소는 역삼1동에서 차륜·철재 입고 중량·출고 확인 업무를 맡는다. 기계 몸체 정비용 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명을 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권에서 처리한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고일 뿐 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 황노을의 회수 저울과 출고를 맞추고, 봉국의 회수장에서 로트를 인수한다. 강민서의 수리 규격 중량표를 송장에 옮긴다\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 Arc 차륜·철재 물류상. \n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −15 | 물질 45 | 공동 20 | 원칙 5 | 공개 5 | 자격 60 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 −20 | 위험 20 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"모소","type":"계약","to":"황노을","basis":"황노을의 회수 저울과 출고를 맞추고"},{"from":"모소","type":"계약","to":"봉국","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"봉국","type":"계약","to":"모소","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0280', 'bd09-d558-c74c', '{"id":"person-0280","name":"Bongbok","title":"Base Medical Officer","position":"Gangnam Station Residence Medical Officer","characterId":"K279","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Residence Accident Vitals Recording, First-Aid Record Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#inmul-bongbok","detailRoute":"/people/person-0280","birthDate":"2100-10-04","birthday":"10-04","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k279-injury-care","name":"Injury care","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k279-priority","name":"Injury first","description":"Bongbok treats crew and patrol injuries and posts accident vital signs. Extended overnight duty supports endurance, not an assessment of bodily health.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Residence Medical Officer. She pasted accident vital records on the infirmary door and started night first-aid only with the squad leader''s and the apprentice''s signatures together.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k279-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Title: Base Medical Officer.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Bongbok treats crew and patrol injuries and posts accident vital signs. Extended overnight duty supports endurance, not an assessment of bodily health.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"Haeum Bong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":5,"Force":-40,"Material":40,"Communal":25,"Principle":10,"Public":0,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":-10,"Display":-10,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Residence Accident Vitals Recording, First-Aid Record Verification","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Gangnam Station Residence Medical Officer","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness 5 | Force −40 | Materiality 40 | Communal 25 | Principle 10 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation −20","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −10 | Display −10 | Continuity 10 | Orientation Fluid | Union Single Marriage"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. The post of Gangnam Station Company Quarters medic opened up through a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Bongbok assists with machine-body checks and repair records in Seocho 2-dong. On cold nights she checks whether joint parts have frozen and enters the replaced parts in the ledger. On the days a free-city doctor stops by Seocho 2-dong, she first sorts out the list of people waiting to be seen. Personal residence or lodging ownership is not presumed","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Residence Medical Officer. Posts accident vitals records on the infirmary door, and night first-aid begins only when both the foreman''s and the apprentice''s signatures are present.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Takes on the injuries of Jo Uchan''s work crew and treats Gwon Doha''s north gate patrol shift. Keeps beds vacant for when Jeon Miri''s medical train stops at Gangnam Station.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Looks at the hand caught under the wheel first. Refuses talk that packages stimulants taken during test periods as proof of skill.\n\n- Livelihood: Residence Accident Vitals Recording, First-Aid Record Verification\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Gangnam Station Residence Medical Officer\n**Life.** Grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. The post of Gangnam Station Company Quarters medic opened up through a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Bongbok assists with machine-body checks and repair records in Seocho 2-dong. On cold nights she checks whether joint parts have frozen and enters the replaced parts in the ledger. On the days a free-city doctor stops by Seocho 2-dong, she first sorts out the list of people waiting to be seen. Personal residence or lodging ownership is not presumed\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Residence Medical Officer. Posts accident vitals records on the infirmary door, and night first-aid begins only when both the foreman''s and the apprentice''s signatures are present.\n\n**Relationships.** Takes on the injuries of Jo Uchan''s work crew and treats Gwon Doha''s north gate patrol shift. Keeps beds vacant for when Jeon Miri''s medical train stops at Gangnam Station.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness 5 | Force −40 | Material 40 | Communal 25 | Principle 10 | Publicity 0 | Credentials 60 | Dispersal 5 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Possessiveness −35 | Risk −10 | Display −10 | Endurance 10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bongbok","type":"Contract","to":"Jo U-chan","basis":"Takes charge of injuries in Jo Uchan''s work crew"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0280","name":"봉복","title":"기지 의무원","position":"강남역 사택 의무원","characterId":"K279","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"사택 사고 활력 기록·응급 처치 기록 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-봉복","detailRoute":"/people/person-0280","birthDate":"2100-10-04","birthday":"10-04","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k279-injury-care","name":"부상자 진료","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k279-priority","name":"부상 먼저","description":"봉복은 작업 조와 순찰 교대의 부상을 돌보고 사고 활력을 게시한다. 하룻밤 넘긴 당직은 체력 근거지만 신체 건강 판정은 아니다.","behavior":"사고 활력 기록을 의무실 문에 붙이고, 야간 응급 처치는 반장과 도제의 서명이 함께 있어야 시작한다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k279-accountability","name":"기지 의무원","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"직함은 기지 의무원.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"봉복은 작업 조와 순찰 교대의 부상을 돌보고 사고 활력을 게시한다. 하룻밤 넘긴 당직은 체력 근거지만 신체 건강 판정은 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"하음 봉씨","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":5,"무력":-40,"물질":40,"공동":25,"원칙":10,"공개":0,"자격":60,"분산":5,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-35,"위험":-10,"과시":-10,"지속":10,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"사택 사고 활력 기록·응급 처치 기록 확인","소속":"Arc","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"강남역 사택 의무원","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 5 | 무력 −40 | 물질 40 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 0 | 자격 60 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 강남역 사택 의무원 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 봉복은 서초2동에서 기계 몸 점검·수리 기록 업무를 돕는다. 한파 밤에는 관절 부품이 얼어붙었는지 살피고, 교체한 부품을 장부에 남긴다. 자유도시 의사가 서초2동에 들르는 날에는 진료를 기다리는 사람의 명단을 먼저 정리해 둔다. 개인 거주나 숙소 소유는 추정하지 않는다","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 강남역 사택 의무원. 사고 활력 기록을 의무실 문에 붙이고, 야간 응급 처치는 반장과 도제의 서명이 함께 있어야 시작한다.","일화":"","관계":"조우찬의 작업 조 부상을 맡고, 권도하의 북문 순찰 교대를 진료한다. 전미리의 의료열차가 강남역에 설 때 병상을 비워 둔다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"차륜 아래 끼인 손부터 본다. 시험 기간의 각성제를 숙련의 증명으로 포장하는 말을 거부한다.\n\n- 생업: 사택 사고 활력 기록·응급 처치 기록 확인\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 강남역 사택 의무원\n**생애.** 강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 강남역 사택 의무원 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 봉복은 서초2동에서 기계 몸 점검·수리 기록 업무를 돕는다. 한파 밤에는 관절 부품이 얼어붙었는지 살피고, 교체한 부품을 장부에 남긴다. 자유도시 의사가 서초2동에 들르는 날에는 진료를 기다리는 사람의 명단을 먼저 정리해 둔다. 개인 거주나 숙소 소유는 추정하지 않는다\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 강남역 사택 의무원. 사고 활력 기록을 의무실 문에 붙이고, 야간 응급 처치는 반장과 도제의 서명이 함께 있어야 시작한다.\n\n**관계.** 조우찬의 작업 조 부상을 맡고, 권도하의 북문 순찰 교대를 진료한다. 전미리의 의료열차가 강남역에 설 때 병상을 비워 둔다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 5 | 무력 −40 | 물질 40 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 0 | 자격 60 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"봉복","type":"계약","to":"조우찬","basis":"조우찬의 작업 조 부상을 맡고"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0281', 'c6a9-d64d-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0281","name":"Yongmo","title":"Northern Gate Patrol, Operations Aide to Gwon Doha","position":"Gangnam Station Northern Gate Patrol, Operations Aide to Gwon Doha","characterId":"K280","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Northern Gate Sortie Wheel Inspection, Armament Loading Verification","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#inmul-yongmo","detailRoute":"/people/person-0281","birthDate":"2069-05-31","birthday":"05-31","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"k280-patrol-signal-coordination","name":"Patrol signal coordination","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k280-priority","name":"Inspection discipline","description":"Yongmo aligns gate patrol with corridor torches and records escort times. Practical patrol work is distinct from group command.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Northern Gate Patrol, Operations Aide to Gwon Doha. He made wheel checks mandatory before sorties.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the north gate under Gwon Doha''s command and matched the corridor torches with Kang Taesan. Moved Jang Sehwa''s northern convoy hours onto the patrol chalkboard.","effects":[]},{"id":"k280-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Northern Gate Patrol, Operations Aide to Gwon Doha. He made wheel checks mandatory before sorties.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the north gate under Gwon Doha''s command and matched the corridor torches with Kang Taesan. Moved Jang Sehwa''s northern convoy hours onto the patrol chalkboard.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Yongmo aligns gate patrol with corridor torches and records escort times. Practical patrol work is distinct from group command.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"Yong Clan of Hongcheon","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-30,"Force":10,"Material":25,"Communal":10,"Principle":5,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":10,"Display":-25,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"None","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Northern Gate Sortie Wheel Inspection, Armament Loading Verification","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Gangnam Station Northern Gate Patrol, Operations Aide to Gwon Doha","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −30 | Force 10 | Material 25 | Communal 10 | Principle 5 | Publicity −10 | Credentials 55 | Dispersal 0 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 0 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk 10 | Display −25 | Endurance 30 | Orientation No leaning | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Amsa guard post. The post of Gangnam Station North Gate Patrol, practical aide to Gwon Doha, opened up through catching an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- Yongmo handles inspecting North Gate sortie wheels and verifying armament loading in Seocho 4-dong. Links the Gangnam Station headquarters bulletin boards, and the waiting-hall handover, entry and duty for living cargo, as neighborhood-level duty reference points. The North Gate is a Gangnam Station approach duty and does not create northern-region rule or a new fortress. Patrols the North Gate under Gwon Doha''s command and syncs corridor torches with Gang Taesan. Relays Jang Sehwa''s northern escort times onto the patrol blackboard","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Northern Gate Patrol, Operations Aide to Gwon Doha. Makes wheel inspection mandatory before sortie.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Patrols the North Gate under Gwon Doha''s command and syncs corridor torches with Gang Taesan. Relays Jang Sehwa''s northern escort times onto the patrol blackboard.","Ambition":"Ties the North Gate patrol to the northern route of the Gangnam Station escort, inspecting sortie wheels and armament loading according to the duty roster so that outside machines drawn by light and heat are stopped before the gate.","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Likes discipline and sees silence on the track as part of patrolling. Calls an assault without skill close to betrayal.\n\n- Livelihood: Northern Gate Sortie Wheel Inspection, Armament Loading Verification\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Gangnam Station Northern Gate Patrol, Operations Aide to Gwon Doha\n**Life.** Grew up at the Amsa guard post. The post of Gangnam Station North Gate Patrol, practical aide to Gwon Doha, opened up through catching an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- Yongmo handles inspecting North Gate sortie wheels and verifying armament loading in Seocho 4-dong. Links the Gangnam Station headquarters bulletin boards, and the waiting-hall handover, entry and duty for living cargo, as neighborhood-level duty reference points. The North Gate is a Gangnam Station approach duty and does not create northern-region rule or a new fortress. Patrols the North Gate under Gwon Doha''s command and syncs corridor torches with Gang Taesan. Relays Jang Sehwa''s northern escort times onto the patrol blackboard\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Northern Gate Patrol, Operations Aide to Gwon Doha. Makes wheel inspection mandatory before sortie.\n\n**Relationships.** Relays Jang Sehwa''s northern escort times onto the patrol blackboard.\n\n**Ambition.** Ties the North Gate patrol to the northern route of the Gangnam Station escort, inspecting sortie wheels and armament loading according to the duty roster so that outside machines drawn by light and heat are stopped before the gate.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −30 | Force 10 | Material 25 | Communal 10 | Principle 5 | Publicity −10 | Credentials 55 | Dispersal 0 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk 10 | Display −25 | Endurance 30 | Orientation No leaning | Bonding None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yongmo","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Taesan","basis":"Syncing the corridor torches with Gang Taesan"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Duguk","type":"Contract","to":"Yongmo","basis":"Shares Yongmo''s shift rotations and torches"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0281","name":"용모","title":"북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자","position":"강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K280","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"북문 출격 차륜 점검·무장 탑재 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-용모","detailRoute":"/people/person-0281","birthDate":"2069-05-31","birthday":"05-31","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"k280-patrol-signal-coordination","name":"순찰 신호 맞춤","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k280-priority","name":"점검 규율","description":"용모는 북문 순찰과 회랑 횃불을 맞추고 호송 시각을 옮긴다. 실무 순찰과 집단 지휘는 구분한다.","behavior":"출격 전에 차륜 점검을 의무화한다.","stress":"","relationship":"권도하의 지휘로 북문을 돌고, 강태산과 회랑 횃불을 맞춘다. 장세화의 북부 호송 시각을 순찰 칠판에 옮긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k280-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자. 출격 전에 차륜 점검을 의무화한다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 권도하의 지휘로 북문을 돌고, 강태산과 회랑 횃불을 맞춘다. 장세화의 북부 호송 시각을 순찰 칠판에 옮긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"용모는 북문 순찰과 회랑 횃불을 맞추고 호송 시각을 옮긴다. 실무 순찰과 집단 지휘는 구분한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"홍천 용씨","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-30,"무력":10,"물질":25,"공동":10,"원칙":5,"공개":-10,"자격":55,"분산":0,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":5,"위험":10,"과시":-25,"지속":30,"지향":"무성향","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"북문 출격 차륜 점검·무장 탑재 확인","소속":"Arc","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −30 | 무력 10 | 물질 25 | 공동 10 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −10 | 자격 55 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 5 | 위험 10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자 자리는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 용모는 서초4동에서 북문 출격 차륜 점검·무장 탑재 확인 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 권도하의 지휘로 북문을 돌고, 강태산과 회랑 횃불을 맞춘다. 장세화의 북부 호송 시각을 순찰 칠판에 옮긴다","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자. 출격 전에 차륜 점검을 의무화한다.","일화":"","관계":"권도하의 지휘로 북문을 돌고, 강태산과 회랑 횃불을 맞춘다. 장세화의 북부 호송 시각을 순찰 칠판에 옮긴다.","야망":"북문 순찰을 강남역 호송의 북문로로 묶어, 당직표에 따라 출격 차륜과 무장 탑재를 점검하고 빛과 열에 끌려온 외부 기계를 북문 앞에서 막는다.","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"규율을 좋아하고 선로 위의 침묵을 순찰의 일부로 본다. 숙련 없는 돌격을 배신에 가깝다고 말한다.\n\n- 생업: 북문 출격 차륜 점검·무장 탑재 확인\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자 자리는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 용모는 서초4동에서 북문 출격 차륜 점검·무장 탑재 확인 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 권도하의 지휘로 북문을 돌고, 강태산과 회랑 횃불을 맞춘다. 장세화의 북부 호송 시각을 순찰 칠판에 옮긴다\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자. 출격 전에 차륜 점검을 의무화한다.\n\n**야망.** 북문 순찰을 강남역 호송의 북문로로 묶어, 당직표에 따라 출격 차륜과 무장 탑재를 점검하고 빛과 열에 끌려온 외부 기계를 북문 앞에서 막는다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −30 | 무력 10 | 물질 25 | 공동 10 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −10 | 자격 55 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 5 | 위험 10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"용모","type":"계약","to":"강태산","basis":"강태산과 회랑 횃불을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"두국","type":"계약","to":"용모","basis":"용모의 교대와 횃불을 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0282', 'c18c-c9c4-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0282","name":"Sobong","title":"Hierophant''s Office Courier, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan","position":"Hierophant''s Office Courier, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan","characterId":"K281","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Work Crew, Accident Ledger Recording, Courier Duty","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#inmul-sobong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0282","birthDate":"2078-03-25","birthday":"03-25","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k281-operating-notice-delivery","name":"Operating notice delivery","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k281-priority","name":"Hierophant''s Office Courier, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan","description":"Sobong posts the lights-out notices and the fuel-use notices on the same wall. Her sense of responsibility for never missing a notice coexists with a caution about trusting word of mouth.","behavior":"Title: Hierophant''s Office Courier, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Carries the night patrol shift notices and posts the fuel-use notices side by side on the same wall. Puts the lights-out time up at the main gate first, before the residential doors.","effects":[]},{"id":"k281-accountability","name":"Hierophant''s Office Courier, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Title: Hierophant''s Office Courier, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Carries the night patrol shift notices and posts the fuel-use notices side by side on the same wall. Puts the lights-out time up at the main gate first, before the residential doors.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Sobong posts the lights-out notices and the fuel-use notices on the same wall. Her sense of responsibility for never missing a notice coexists with a caution about trusting word of mouth.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c18c-c9c4-c8fc","name":"Jinju So Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c18c-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":0,"Force":-5,"Material":25,"Communal":20,"Principle":0,"Public":15,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":20,"Display":25,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Work Crew, Accident Ledger Recording, Courier Duty","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Hierophant''s Office Courier, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness 0 | Force −5 | Material 25 | Communal 20 | Principle 0 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 55 | Dispersal 5 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 0 | Possessiveness 15 | Risk 20 | Display 25 | Endurance −10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Sinnae transfer duty post. The post of Hierophant''s office courier, practical aide to Jo Uchan, opened up through stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- Sobong handles courier duty and entry records in Seocho 4-dong. She posts lights-out times, fuel use and shift notices on the bulletin boards at the main gate and the residential area, and closes the entry record every night. Personal residence or lodging ownership is not presumed. She carries the night patrol shift notices and posts the fuel-use notices side by side on the same wall","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Hierophant''s Office Courier, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan. Records work-crew rotations and accident signatures in the same ledger.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Carries the night patrol shift notices and posts the fuel-use notices side by side on the same wall. Puts the lights-out time up at the main gate first, before the residential doors.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Remembers accident dates before people''s names, and will not open base operation until a verbal approval has been copied into the courier ledger.\n\n- Livelihood: Work Crew, Accident Ledger Recording, Courier Duty\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Hierophant''s Office Courier, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan\n**Life.** Grew up at the Sinnae transfer duty post. The post of Hierophant''s office courier, practical aide to Jo Uchan, opened up through stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- Sobong handles courier duty and entry records in Seocho 4-dong. She posts lights-out times, fuel use and shift notices on the bulletin boards at the main gate and the residential area, and closes the entry record every night. Personal residence or lodging ownership is not presumed. She carries the night patrol shift notices and posts the fuel-use notices side by side on the same wall\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Hierophant''s Office Courier, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan. Records work-crew rotations and accident signatures in the same ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Carries the night patrol shift notices and posts the fuel-use notices side by side on the same wall. Puts the lights-out time up at the main gate first, before the residential doors.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness 0 | Force −5 | Material 25 | Communal 20 | Principle 0 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 55 | Decentralization 5 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 20 | Display 25 | Endurance −10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sobong","type":"Contract","to":"Jo U-chan","basis":"Carries Jo Uchan''s restart notices"},{"from":"Sobong","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Jin-a","basis":"Posts Seo Jina''s fuel and food stock notice side by side on the same wall"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Mobok","type":"Contract","to":"Sobong","basis":"Pins Sobong''s courier slip and the shutter check sheet on the same nail."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0282","name":"소봉","title":"교주실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자","position":"교주실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K281","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"작업 조·사고 원장 기록·전령","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-소봉","detailRoute":"/people/person-0282","birthDate":"2078-03-25","birthday":"03-25","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k281-operating-notice-delivery","name":"가동 통지 전달","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k281-priority","name":"서면 승인 고수","description":"소봉은 소등 시각 공지와 연료 사용 공지를 같은 벽에 붙인다. 공지를 빠뜨리지 않으려는 책임과 입으로 전하는 말을 믿지 않는 신중함이 함께 있다.","behavior":"직함은 교주실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자.","stress":"","relationship":"밤 순찰 조의 교대 통지를 나르고, 연료 사용 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다. 소등 시각은 거주 구역 문보다 정문에 먼저 붙인다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k281-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"직함은 교주실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 밤 순찰 조의 교대 통지를 나르고, 연료 사용 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다. 소등 시각은 거주 구역 문보다 정문에 먼저 붙인다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"소봉은 소등 시각 공지와 연료 사용 공지를 같은 벽에 붙인다. 공지를 빠뜨리지 않으려는 책임과 입으로 전하는 말을 믿지 않는 신중함이 함께 있다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c18c-c9c4-c8fc","name":"진주 소씨","crest":"clan-crests/c18c-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":0,"무력":-5,"물질":25,"공동":20,"원칙":0,"공개":15,"자격":55,"분산":5,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":15,"위험":20,"과시":25,"지속":-10,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"작업 조·사고 원장 기록·전령","소속":"Arc","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"교주실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 0 | 무력 −5 | 물질 25 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 15 | 자격 55 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 15 | 위험 20 | 과시 25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 교주실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 소봉은 서초4동에서 전령과 출입 기록 업무를 맡는다. 정문과 거주 구역 게시판에 소등 시각, 연료 사용, 교대 통지를 붙이고, 출입 기록을 밤마다 마감한다. 개인 거주나 숙소 소유는 추정하지 않는다. 밤 순찰 조의 교대 통지를 나르고, 연료 사용 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 교주실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자. 작업 조 순환과 사고 서명을 같은 원장에 적는다.","일화":"","관계":"밤 순찰 조의 교대 통지를 나르고, 연료 사용 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다. 소등 시각은 거주 구역 문보다 정문에 먼저 붙인다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"사고 날짜를 사람 이름보다 먼저 기억하고, 구두 승인을 전령 원장에 옮기기 전에 기지 가동을 열지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 작업 조·사고 원장 기록·전령\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 교주실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 교주실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 소봉은 서초4동에서 전령과 출입 기록 업무를 맡는다. 정문과 거주 구역 게시판에 소등 시각, 연료 사용, 교대 통지를 붙이고, 출입 기록을 밤마다 마감한다. 개인 거주나 숙소 소유는 추정하지 않는다. 밤 순찰 조의 교대 통지를 나르고, 연료 사용 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 교주실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자. 작업 조 순환과 사고 서명을 같은 원장에 적는다.\n\n**관계.** 밤 순찰 조의 교대 통지를 나르고, 연료 사용 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다. 소등 시각은 거주 구역 문보다 정문에 먼저 붙인다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 0 | 무력 −5 | 물질 25 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 15 | 자격 55 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 15 | 위험 20 | 과시 25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"소봉","type":"계약","to":"조우찬","basis":"조우찬의 가동 통지를 나르고"},{"from":"소봉","type":"계약","to":"서진아","basis":"서진아의 연료·식량 재고 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"모복","type":"계약","to":"소봉","basis":"소봉의 전령 종이와 셔터 점검표를 같은 못에 꽂는다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0283', 'bcf5-ba74-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0283","name":"Bokdu","title":"Northern Track Scout","position":"Outer Workshop Track Scout","characterId":"K282","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Outer Track Survey, Sighting Cross-Check","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#inmul-bokdu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0283","birthDate":"2090-05-22","birthday":"05-22","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k282-track-surveying","name":"Track surveying","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k282-priority","name":"Direct verification","description":"Bokdu separates surveyed tracks from unverified dotted lines and passes gate detour information. A blank track section is not proof of a successful detour.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Outer Workshop Track Scout. He left unsurveyed lines only as dotted lines and raised nothing onto the master plate with fewer than two independent sightings.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Handed the north gate bypasses to Gwon Doha and moved field measurements onto Du Guk''s north gate chalkboard. Matched the track state to Jang Sehwa''s joint convoy hours.","effects":[]},{"id":"k282-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Outer Workshop Track Scout. He left unsurveyed lines only as dotted lines and raised nothing onto the master plate with fewer than two independent sightings.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Handed the north gate bypasses to Gwon Doha and moved field measurements onto Du Guk''s north gate chalkboard. Matched the track state to Jang Sehwa''s joint convoy hours.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Bokdu separates surveyed tracks from unverified dotted lines and passes gate detour information. A blank track section is not proof of a successful detour.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"Bok Clan of Myeoncheon","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":-15,"Force":-20,"Material":30,"Communal":20,"Principle":15,"Public":5,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-10,"Display":15,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Outer Track Survey, Sighting Cross-Check","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Northern Track Scout","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness −15 | Force −20 | Material 30 | Communal 20 | Principle 15 | Transparency 5 | Qualification 60 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −10 | Display 15 | Endurance 5 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post of northern track scout opened through a substitute shift for an unexcused absence.\nBokdu surveys the northern Seoul tracks from Yeoksam 1-dong and cross-checks them against sighting reports. He records the winter ice on the tracks and traces of outside machines drawn closer by light and heat, and compiles them into safe-route data for the Yeoksam 1-dong work-and-living area next to Gangnam Station. He hands the North Gate detour to Gwon Doha and copies his survey results onto Duguk''s North Gate stronghold blackboard. He matches Jang Sehwa''s Gangnam Station escort times against track conditions","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Northern Track Scout. Lines not surveyed are left only as dotted lines, and nothing goes onto the master plate with fewer than two independent sightings.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Hands the North Gate detour to Gwon Doha and transfers survey results onto Duguk''s North Gate stronghold blackboard. Matches Jang Sehwa''s Gangnam Station escort times with track conditions.","Ambition":"To bind the tunnel track''s detours to a public map, so that even if outside machines block one route, food and fuel transport is not cut off.","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"When he sees a closed tunnel, he heads there on foot first, and he despises drawing detours from rumor alone. If a flood mark is even a day old, he redraws the map.\n\n- Occupation: Outer Track Survey, Sighting Cross-Check\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Northern Track Scout\n**Life.** Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post of northern track scout opened through a substitute shift for an unexcused absence.\nBokdu surveys the northern Seoul tracks from Yeoksam 1-dong and cross-checks them against sighting reports. He records the winter ice on the tracks and traces of outside machines drawn closer by light and heat, and compiles them into safe-route data for the Yeoksam 1-dong work-and-living area next to Gangnam Station. He hands the North Gate detour to Gwon Doha and copies his survey results onto Duguk''s North Gate stronghold blackboard. He matches Jang Sehwa''s Gangnam Station escort times against track conditions\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Northern Track Scout. Lines not surveyed are left only as dotted lines, and nothing goes onto the master plate with fewer than two independent sightings.\n\n**Relationships.** Hands the North Gate detour to Gwon Doha and transfers survey results onto Duguk''s North Gate stronghold blackboard. Matches Jang Sehwa''s Gangnam Station escort times with track conditions.\n\n**Ambition.** To bind the tunnel track''s detours to a public map, so that even if outside machines block one route, food and fuel transport is not cut off.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness −15 | Force −20 | Material 30 | Communal 20 | Principle 15 | Transparency 5 | Qualification 60 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −10 | Display 15 | Endurance 5 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0283","name":"복두","title":"북부 선로 탐사원","position":"바깥 작업장 선로 탐사원","characterId":"K282","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"바깥 선로 실측·목격 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-복두","detailRoute":"/people/person-0283","birthDate":"2090-05-22","birthday":"05-22","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k282-track-surveying","name":"선로 실측","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k282-priority","name":"직접 확인","description":"복두는 실측 선과 미확인 점선을 구분해 북문 우회 정보를 넘긴다. 공백 선로의 발견은 우회 성공과 다르다.","behavior":"실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남기고, 독립 목격이 둘 미만이면 원판에 올리지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"권도하에게 북문 우회로를 넘기고, 두국의 북문 거점 칠판에 실측을 옮긴다. 장세화의 강남역 호송 시각과 선로 상태를 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k282-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 바깥 작업장 선로 탐사원. 실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남기고, 독립 목격이 둘 미만이면 원판에 올리지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 권도하에게 북문 우회로를 넘기고, 두국의 북문 거점 칠판에 실측을 옮긴다. 장세화의 강남역 호송 시각과 선로 상태를 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"복두는 실측 선과 미확인 점선을 구분해 북문 우회 정보를 넘긴다. 공백 선로의 발견은 우회 성공과 다르다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"면천 복씨","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":-15,"무력":-20,"물질":30,"공동":20,"원칙":15,"공개":5,"자격":60,"분산":15,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-30,"위험":-10,"과시":15,"지속":5,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"바깥 선로 실측·목격 대조","소속":"Arc","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"북부 선로 탐사원","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 30 | 공동 20 | 원칙 15 | 공개 5 | 자격 60 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −10 | 과시 15 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 북부 선로 탐사원 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n복두는 역삼1동에서 서울 북부 선로를 실측하고 목격 기록과 대조하는 일을 맡는다. 겨울 선로의 결빙 상태와 바깥 기계가 불빛과 열에 끌려 접근한 흔적을 기록해, 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권의 안전 경로 자료로 정리한다. 권도하에게 북문 우회로를 넘기고, 두국의 북문 거점 칠판에 실측을 옮긴다. 장세화의 강남역 호송 시각과 선로 상태를 맞춘다","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 북부 선로 탐사원. 실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남기고, 독립 목격이 둘 미만이면 원판에 올리지 않는다.","일화":"","관계":"권도하에게 북문 우회로를 넘기고, 두국의 북문 거점 칠판에 실측을 옮긴다. 장세화의 강남역 호송 시각과 선로 상태를 맞춘다.","야망":"터널 선로의 우회 길을 공개 지도에 묶어, 외부 기계가 한 길을 막아도 식량과 연료 수송이 끊기지 않게 한다.","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"닫힌 터널을 보면 발부터 향하고, 소문만으로 우회로를 그리는 일을 경멸한다. 침수 자국이 하루만 낡아도 지도를 다시 그린다.\n\n- 생업: 바깥 선로 실측·목격 대조\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 북부 선로 탐사원\n**생애.** 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 북부 선로 탐사원 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n복두는 역삼1동에서 서울 북부 선로를 실측하고 목격 기록과 대조하는 일을 맡는다. 겨울 선로의 결빙 상태와 바깥 기계가 불빛과 열에 끌려 접근한 흔적을 기록해, 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권의 안전 경로 자료로 정리한다. 권도하에게 북문 우회로를 넘기고, 두국의 북문 거점 칠판에 실측을 옮긴다. 장세화의 강남역 호송 시각과 선로 상태를 맞춘다\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 북부 선로 탐사원. 실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남기고, 독립 목격이 둘 미만이면 원판에 올리지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 터널 선로의 우회 길을 공개 지도에 묶어, 외부 기계가 한 길을 막아도 식량과 연료 수송이 끊기지 않게 한다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 30 | 공동 20 | 원칙 15 | 공개 5 | 자격 60 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −10 | 과시 15 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}');
