c74c","name":"Haeum Bong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-10,"Force":-5,"Material":35,"Communal":30,"Principle":15,"Public":0,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":30,"Display":-5,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Steel Salvage Weight Disclosure, Dispatch Verification","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Arc Steel Salvage Yard Outpost Chief, Operations Aide to Hwang Noeul","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Materialism 35 | Communality 30 | Principle 15 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving −5 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 30 | Display −5 | Continuity 30 | Orientation Heterosexual | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Raised at the waiting-hall watch. The post of Outpost Chief of the Arc Steel Salvage Yard and Hwang Noeul''s operations aide opened through a substitute watch after an unexcused shift absence.\nBongguk handles disclosure of recovered-steel weights and dispatch verification in Yeoksam 1-dong. In the Yeoksam 1-dong living sphere next to Gangnam Station, she records the weight, lot, field measurement, work crew, and incident signature for each load of salvaged steel, and sends out the steel used to repair machine bodies. She guards the scale under Hwang Noeul''s command and matches Moso''s logistics invoices to the lots. ","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Arc Steel Salvage Yard Outpost Chief, Operations Aide to Hwang Noeul. ","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Pragmatic, but harsh toward those who hide scrap metal. She regards cheating the scale as the same as shaving down the rails.\n\n- Occupation: Steel Salvage Weight Disclosure, Dispatch Verification\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Arc Steel Salvage Yard Outpost Chief, Operations Aide to Hwang Noeul\n**Life.** Raised at the waiting-hall watch. The post of Outpost Chief of the Arc Steel Salvage Yard and Hwang Noeul''s operations aide opened through a substitute watch after an unexcused shift absence.\nBongguk handles disclosure of recovered-steel weights and dispatch verification in Yeoksam 1-dong. In the Yeoksam 1-dong living sphere next to Gangnam Station, she records the weight, lot, field measurement, work crew, and incident signature for each load of salvaged steel, and sends out the steel used to repair machine bodies. She guards the scale under Hwang Noeul''s command and matches Moso''s logistics invoices to the lots. \n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Arc Steel Salvage Yard Outpost Chief, Operations Aide to Hwang Noeul. \n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Materialism 35 | Communality 30 | Principle 15 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 30 | Display −5 | Continuity 30 | Orientation Heterosexual | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bongguk","type":"Command","to":"Hwang No-eul","basis":"Guarding the scale under Hwang Noeul''s command"},{"from":"Bongguk","type":"Contract","to":"Moso","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Moso","type":"Contract","to":"Bongguk","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0288","name":"봉국","title":"철재 회수장 거점장, 황노을의 실무 담당자","position":"Arc 철재 회수장 거점장, 황노을의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K287","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"철재 회수 중량 공개·출고 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-봉국","detailRoute":"/people/person-0288","birthDate":"2080-12-26","birthday":"12-26","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"un