ll},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd94-cd94-acc4","name":"Chugye Chu Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cd94-cd94-acc4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-10,"Force":-5,"Material":30,"Communal":25,"Principle":0,"Public":5,"Eligibility":85,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":-30},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-30,"Display":20,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Wheel Maintenance Log, Defective Part Sample Disclosure","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Arc Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Material 30 | Communal 25 | Principle 0 | Publicity 5 | Credentials 85 | Dispersal 5 | Transformation −30","Desires":"Craving 35 | Possessiveness 10 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Endurance 25 | Orientation: None | Bonding: Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"She grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. The post of Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower opened up after a defect report just before a derailment.\nChu Jihun handles the disclosure of wheel maintenance logs and defective part samples in Yeoksam 1-dong. She organizes maintenance samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signatures as records of the Yeoksam 1-dong living zone adjacent to Gangnam Station. Parts handover at the Yeoksam concourse is for reference only and does not fix actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies, or running trains. ","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Arc Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"She regards pilfering others'' tools as the same crime as cheating on an exam, and cannot tolerate a foreman who hands over defect samples without cutting them. Her hands are quick and her words few.\n\n- Livelihood: Wheel Maintenance Log, Defective Part Sample Disclosure\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Arc Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower\n**Life.** She grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. The post of Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower opened up after a defect report just before a derailment.\nChu Jihun handles the disclosure of wheel maintenance logs and defective part samples in Yeoksam 1-dong. She organizes maintenance samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signatures as records of the Yeoksam 1-dong living zone adjacent to Gangnam Station. Parts handover at the Yeoksam concourse is for reference only and does not fix actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies, or running trains. \n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Arc Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Material 30 | Communal 25 | Principle 0 | Publicity 5 | Credentials 85 | Dispersal 5 | Transformation −30\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Possessiveness 10 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Endurance 25 | Orientation: None | Bonding: Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Chu Jihun","type":"Oath","to":"Song Ha-yul","basis":"Receives Song Hayul''s apprentice daily work as grounds for exposure"},{"from":"Chu Jihun","type":"Oath","to":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0290","name":"추지훈","title":"차륜 정비 불량 폭로자","position":"Arc 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자","characterId":"K289","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 공개","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-추지훈","detailRoute":"/people/person-0290","birthDate":"2105-10-20","birthday":"10-20","age":21,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k289-defect-lot-documentation","name":"결함 로트 증빙","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k289-priority","name":"차륜 정비 불량 폭로자","description":"직함은 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자.","behavior":"직함은 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k289-accountability","name":"차륜 정비 불량 폭로자","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"직함은 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd94-cd94-acc4","name":"추계 추씨","crest":"clan-crests/cd94-cd94-acc4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-10,"무력":-5,"물질":30,"공동":25,"원칙":0,"공개":5,"자격":85,"분산":5,"변혁":-30},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":10,"위험":-30,"과시":20,"지속":25,"지향":"무성향","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 공개","소속":"Arc","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"Arc 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 30 | 공동 25 | 원칙 0 | 공개 5 | 자격 85 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −30","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n추지훈은 역삼1동에서 차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 공개 업무를 맡는다. 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명을 강남역 인접 역삼1동 생활권 기록으로 정리한다. 역삼 대합실의 부품 인계는 참고일 뿐이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. ","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 Arc 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자. ","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"남의 공구를 빼돌리는 일을 시험 부정과 같은 죄로 보고, 결함 표본을 자르지 않고 넘기는 반장을 참지 못한다. 손이 빠르고 말은 적다.\n\n- 생업: 차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 공개\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: Arc 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자\n**생애.** 강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n추지훈은 역삼1동에서 차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 공개 업무를 맡는다. 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명을 강남역 인접 역삼1동 생활권 기록으로 정리한다. 역삼 대합실의 부품 인계는 참고일 뿐이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. \n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 Arc 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자. \n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 30 | 공동 25 | 원칙 0 | 공개 5 | 자격 85 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −30\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"추지훈","type":"맹세","to":"송하율","basis":"송하율의 도제 일과를 폭로 근거로 받고"},{"from":"추지훈","type":"맹세","to":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0291', 'c5b4-d568-c885', '{"id":"person-0291","name":"Eo Yerin","title":"Test Wheel Defect Witness","position":"Arc Test Wheel Defect Witness","characterId":"K290","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Test Wheel Defect Sample, Accident Signature Verification","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#character-eoyerin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0291","birthDate":"2094-05-06","birthday":"05-06","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k290-defect-testimony-recording","name":"Defect testimony recording","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k290-priority","name":"Test Wheel Defect Witness","description":"Title: Test Wheel Defect Witness.","behavior":"Title: Test Wheel Defect Witness.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k290-accountability","name":"Test Wheel Defect Witness","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Title: Test Wheel Defect Witness.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Test Wheel Defect Witness.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5b4-d568-c885","name":"Eo Clan of Hamjong","crest":"clan-crests/c5b4-d568-c885.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-15,"Force":-5,"Material":30,"Communal":25,"Principle":15,"Public":-5,"Eligibility":80,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":-25},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":5,"Display":-10,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Test Wheel Defect Sample, Accident Signature Verification","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Arc Test Wheel Defect Witness","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −15 | Force −5 | Materialism 30 | Communal 25 | Principle 15 | Publicity −5 | Credentials 80 | Decentralization 5 | Transformation −25","Desires":"Craving 30 | Exclusivity 30 | Risk 5 | Display −10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation None | Bonding Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"He grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. His post as Arc Test Wheel Defect Witness opened up after a defect report he filed just before a derailment.\nIn Yeoksam 1-dong, Eo Yerin handles the checking of test wheel defect samples and accident signatures. He verifies the sample, weight, measurement, work crew, and accident signature records used in Arc machine-body maintenance within the Yeoksam 1-dong living area next to Gangnam Station. The handover at the Yeoksam Concourse is for reference only and does not establish factory facilities, a hospital, or operating trains.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Arc Test Wheel Defect Witness. He requires the signatures of both the foreman and the apprentice for every accident, and writes the defective sample number on the same line.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"He remembers accident responsibility down to the date, and treats logs without signatures as though they never existed. He trusts the handwriting beneath the wheel more than any meeting.\n\n- Occupation: Test Wheel Defect Sample, Accident Signature Verification\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Arc Test Wheel Defect Witness\n**Life.** He grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. His post as Arc Test Wheel Defect Witness opened up after a defect report he filed just before a derailment.\nIn Yeoksam 1-dong, Eo Yerin handles the checking of test wheel defect samples and accident signatures. He verifies the sample, weight, measurement, work crew, and accident signature records used in Arc machine-body maintenance within the Yeoksam 1-dong living area next to Gangnam Station. The handover at the Yeoksam Concourse is for reference only and does not establish factory facilities, a hospital, or operating trains.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Arc Test Wheel Defect Witness. He requires the signatures of both the foreman and the apprentice for every accident, and writes the defective sample number on the same line.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −15 | Force −5 | Materialism 30 | Communal 25 | Principle 15 | Publicity −5 | Credentials 80 | Decentralization 5 | Transformation −25\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Exclusivity 30 | Risk 5 | Display −10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation None | Bonding Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Eo Yerin","type":"Oath","to":"Jo U-chan","basis":""},{"from":"Eo Yerin","type":"Oath","to":"Dumo","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0291","name":"어예린","title":"시험 차륜 결함 증인","position":"Arc 시험 차륜 결함 증인","characterId":"K290","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"시험 차륜 결함 표본·사고 서명 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-어예린","detailRoute":"/people/person-0291","birthDate":"2094-05-06","birthday":"05-06","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k290-defect-testimony-recording","name":"결함 증언 기록","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k290-priority","name":"시험 차륜 결함 증인","description":"직함은 시험 차륜 결함 증인.","behavior":"직함은 시험 차륜 결함 증인.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k290-accountability","name":"시험 차륜 결함 증인","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"직함은 시험 차륜 결함 증인.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 시험 차륜 결함 증인.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5b4-d568-c885","name":"함종 어씨","crest":"clan-crests/c5b4-d568-c885.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-15,"무력":-5,"물질":30,"공동":25,"원칙":15,"공개":-5,"자격":80,"분산":5,"변혁":-25},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":30,"위험":5,"과시":-10,"지속":30,"지향":"무성향","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"시험 차륜 결함 표본·사고 서명 확인","소속":"Arc","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"Arc 시험 차륜 결함 증인","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −5 | 물질 30 | 공동 25 | 원칙 15 | 공개 −5 | 자격 80 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −25","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 30 | 위험 5 | 과시 −10 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. Arc 시험 차륜 결함 증인 자리는 탈선 직전에 올린 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n어예린은 역삼1동에서 시험 차륜 결함 표본과 사고 서명 확인 업무를 맡는다. Arc 기계 몸체 정비에 쓰이는 표본·중량·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 기록을 강남역 인접 역삼1동 생활권에서 확인한다. 역삼 대합실의 인계는 참고일 뿐, 공장 설비나 병원, 운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 Arc 시험 차륜 결함 증인. 사고 한 건에 반장과 도제의 서명을 함께 요구하고, 불량 표본 번호를 같은 줄에 적는다.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"사고 책임을 날짜까지 기억하고, 서명 없는 일지를 없던 일로 돌린다. 회의보다 차륜 아래의 필적을 믿는다.\n\n- 생업: 시험 차륜 결함 표본·사고 서명 확인\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: Arc 시험 차륜 결함 증인\n**생애.** 강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. Arc 시험 차륜 결함 증인 자리는 탈선 직전에 올린 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n어예린은 역삼1동에서 시험 차륜 결함 표본과 사고 서명 확인 업무를 맡는다. Arc 기계 몸체 정비에 쓰이는 표본·중량·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 기록을 강남역 인접 역삼1동 생활권에서 확인한다. 역삼 대합실의 인계는 참고일 뿐, 공장 설비나 병원, 운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 Arc 시험 차륜 결함 증인. 사고 한 건에 반장과 도제의 서명을 함께 요구하고, 불량 표본 번호를 같은 줄에 적는다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −5 | 물질 30 | 공동 25 | 원칙 15 | 공개 −5 | 자격 80 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −25\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 30 | 위험 5 | 과시 −10 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"어예린","type":"맹세","to":"조우찬","basis":""},{"from":"어예린","type":"맹세","to":"두모","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0292', 'creative-b780-b3c4-bd09', '{"id":"person-0292","name":"Ran Jina","title":"Medical Train Northern Gate Mechanic","position":"Gangnam Station Medical Train Northern Gate Mechanic","characterId":"K291","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Pre-Departure Maintenance of the Contract Train that Carries Free City Doctors","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#person-ran-jina","detailRoute":"/people/person-0292","birthDate":"2067-10-25","birthday":"10-25","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k291-brake-maintenance","name":"Brake maintenance","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k291-priority","name":"Refuses unauthorized departure","description":"Ran Jina locked the brakes and refused departure after weapons were loaded aboard the medical train. Priority repair of patient cars is not combat proficiency.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Medical Train Northern Gate Mechanic. She made the pre-sortie inspection mandatory.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k291-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Medical Train Northern Gate Mechanic. She made the pre-sortie inspection mandatory.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Ran Jina locked the brakes and refused departure after weapons were loaded aboard the medical train. Priority repair of patient cars is not combat proficiency.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"creative-b780-b3c4-bd09","name":"Ran Clan of Dobong","crest":"clan-crests/creative-b780-b3c4-bd09.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-10,"Force":0,"Material":25,"Communal":10,"Principle":15,"Public":5,"Eligibility":80,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":-25},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-25,"Display":25,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Pre-Departure Maintenance of the Contract Train that Carries Free City Doctors","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Gangnam Station Medical Train Northern Gate Mechanic","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force 0 | Materialism 25 | Communal 10 | Principle 15 | Publicity 5 | Credentials 80 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −25","Desires":"Craving 40 | Exclusivity 10 | Risk −25 | Display 25 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"She grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. Her post as Gangnam Station Medical Train North Gate Mechanic opened up after a defect report made just before a derailment.\n- In Seocho 4-dong, Ran Jina handles pre-sortie maintenance inspection for the medical train. She links the Gangnam Station headquarters bulletin board with the concourse''s daily cargo handover, access, and duty rotation as a neighborhood-level work reference point. The North Gate is an access duty post for Gangnam Station and does not create dominion over the northern region or a new fortress. She matches the brakes to Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol car, overlaps the stop log with the time Sun Gaon discovered the medical car, and, when Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy halts at Gangnam Station, repairs only the patient car''s brakes first","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Medical Train Northern Gate Mechanic. She mandates pre-sortie inspections.","Anecdote":"In the Winter Black Timetable, when weapons were loaded onto the medical train, Ran Jina locked the brakes at the North Gate and refused to release it.","Relationships":"She matches the brakes to Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol car, overlaps the stop log with the time Sun Gaon discovered the medical car, and, when Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy halts at Gangnam Station, repairs only the patient car''s brakes first.","Ambition":"To tune the medical train''s North Gate brakes to the pre-departure inspection standard, so that the train carrying Free City doctors leaves Gangnam Station without delay.","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"She sends cavalry who have not inspected their wheels before sortie off with empty cars, and regards any release that skipped the brake inspection as the start of an accident. She likes discipline and considers silence on the tracks part of maintenance.\n\n- Occupation: Pre-Departure Maintenance of the Contract Train that Carries Free City Doctors\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Gangnam Station Medical Train Northern Gate Mechanic\n**Life.** She grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. Her post as Gangnam Station Medical Train North Gate Mechanic opened up after a defect report made just before a derailment.\n- In Seocho 4-dong, Ran Jina handles pre-sortie maintenance inspection for the medical train. She links the Gangnam Station headquarters bulletin board with the concourse''s daily cargo handover, access, and duty rotation as a neighborhood-level work reference point. The North Gate is an access duty post for Gangnam Station and does not create dominion over the northern region or a new fortress. She matches the brakes to Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol car, overlaps the stop log with the time Sun Gaon discovered the medical car, and, when Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy halts at Gangnam Station, repairs only the patient car''s brakes first\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Medical Train Northern Gate Mechanic. She mandates pre-sortie inspections.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the Winter Black Timetable, when weapons were loaded onto the medical train, Ran Jina locked the brakes at the North Gate and refused to release it.\n\n**Relationships.** She matches the brakes to Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol car, overlaps the stop log with the time Sun Gaon discovered the medical car, and, when Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy halts at Gangnam Station, repairs only the patient car''s brakes first.\n\n**Ambition.** To tune the medical train''s North Gate brakes to the pre-departure inspection standard, so that the train carrying Free City doctors leaves Gangnam Station without delay.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force 0 | Materialism 25 | Communal 10 | Principle 15 | Publicity 5 | Credentials 80 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −25\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Exclusivity 10 | Risk −25 | Display 25 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ran Jina","type":"Contract","to":"Stefan Petrov","basis":"while overlaying the stop log on Stefan Petrov''s discovery time in the medical car"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0292","name":"란진아","title":"의료열차 북문 정비원","position":"강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원","characterId":"K291","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"자유도시 의사를 태우는 계약 의료열차 출발 전 정비 점검","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-란진아","detailRoute":"/people/person-0292","birthDate":"2067-10-25","birthday":"10-25","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k291-brake-maintenance","name":"제동 정비","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k291-priority","name":"무단 출고 거부","description":"란진아는 의료열차에 무기가 실리자 제동을 잠그고 출고를 거부했다. 병상 칸 우선 정비를 전투 숙련으로 환산하지 않는다.","behavior":"출격 전 점검을 의무화한다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k291-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원. 출격 전 점검을 의무화한다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"란진아는 의료열차에 무기가 실리자 제동을 잠그고 출고를 거부했다. 병상 칸 우선 정비를 전투 숙련으로 환산하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"creative-b780-b3c4-bd09","name":"도봉 란씨","crest":"clan-crests/creative-b780-b3c4-bd09.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-10,"무력":0,"물질":25,"공동":10,"원칙":15,"공개":5,"자격":80,"분산":15,"변혁":-25},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":10,"위험":-25,"과시":25,"지속":-15,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"자유도시 의사를 태우는 계약 의료열차 출발 전 정비 점검","소속":"Arc","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 0 | 물질 25 | 공동 10 | 원칙 15 | 공개 5 | 자격 80 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −25","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 10 | 위험 −25 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 란진아는 서초4동에서 의료열차 출격 전 정비 점검 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 권도하의 북문 순찰차에 제동을 맞추고, 순가온의 의료칸 발견 시각에 정차 일지를 겹치며, 장세화의 의료호송이 강남역에 설 때 병상 칸의 제동만 우선 고친다","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원. 출격 전 점검을 의무화한다.","일화":"겨울의 검은 배차표에서 의료열차에 무기가 실리자 란진아는 북문에서 제동을 잠그고 출고를 거부했다.","관계":"권도하의 북문 순찰차에 제동을 맞추고, 순가온의 의료칸 발견 시각에 정차 일지를 겹치며, 장세화의 의료호송이 강남역에 설 때 병상 칸의 제동만 우선 고친다.","야망":"의료열차 북문의 제동 장치를 출발 전 점검 기준에 맞춰 손봐, 자유도시 의사들이 탄 열차가 강남역에서 지연 없이 떠나게 한다.","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"출격 전 차륜을 보지 않은 기병을 빈 칸으로 돌리고, 제동 점검을 건너뛴 출고를 사고의 시작으로 본다. 규율을 좋아하고 선로 위의 침묵을 정비의 일부로 여긴다.\n\n- 생업: 자유도시 의사를 태우는 계약 의료열차 출발 전 정비 점검\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원\n**생애.** 강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 란진아는 서초4동에서 의료열차 출격 전 정비 점검 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 권도하의 북문 순찰차에 제동을 맞추고, 순가온의 의료칸 발견 시각에 정차 일지를 겹치며, 장세화의 의료호송이 강남역에 설 때 병상 칸의 제동만 우선 고친다\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원. 출격 전 점검을 의무화한다.\n\n**일화.** 겨울의 검은 배차표에서 의료열차에 무기가 실리자 란진아는 북문에서 제동을 잠그고 출고를 거부했다.\n\n**야망.** 의료열차 북문의 제동 장치를 출발 전 점검 기준에 맞춰 손봐, 자유도시 의사들이 탄 열차가 강남역에서 지연 없이 떠나게 한다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 0 | 물질 25 | 공동 10 | 원칙 15 | 공개 5 | 자격 80 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −25\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 10 | 위험 −25 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"란진아","type":"계약","to":"스테판 페트로프","basis":"스테판 페트로프의 의료칸 발견 시각에 정차 일지를 겹치며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0293', 'c12d-acbd-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0293","name":"Seop Chaewon","title":"Bukhansan Bogungmun Procession Northern Gate Guide","position":"Gangnam Station Northern Gate Evacuation Guide","characterId":"K292","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Northern Gate Evacuation Passage Times, Family Ticket Guidance","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#person-seop-chaewon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0293","birthDate":"2064-11-25","birthday":"11-25","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k292-evacuation-queue-guidance","name":"Evacuation queue guidance","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k292-priority","name":"Family passage first","description":"He tries to keep the entry check from becoming a wall against people.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Northern Gate Evacuation Guide. He wrote the passage hours and the family tables on one chalkboard and opened armed guidance only after reconnaissance reports.","stress":"Fear. That the guidance chalkboard would be painted over as a military convoy signpost and the refugee road would be erased.","relationship":"Relations. Guided the column at Du Guk''s north gate convoy outpost and matched the hours with Kang Taesan''s corridor torches.","effects":[]},{"id":"k292-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Northern Gate Evacuation Guide. He wrote the passage hours and the family tables on one chalkboard and opened armed guidance only after reconnaissance reports.","stress":"Fear. That the guidance chalkboard would be painted over as a military convoy signpost and the refugee road would be erased.","relationship":"Relations. Guided the column at Du Guk''s north gate convoy outpost and matched the hours with Kang Taesan''s corridor torches.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He tries to keep the entry check from becoming a wall against people.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c12d-acbd-c8fc","name":"Gyeongju Seop Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c12d-acbd-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-20,"Force":-10,"Material":20,"Communal":20,"Principle":10,"Public":5,"Eligibility":65,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":35,"Display":30,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Northern Gate Evacuation Passage Times, Family Ticket Guidance","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Gangnam Station Northern Gate Evacuation Guide","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −20 | Force −10 | Material 20 | Communal 20 | Principle 10 | Publicity 5 | Credential 65 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation −20","Desires":"Craving 0 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk 35 | Display 30 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Bonding: Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on the waiting-hall watch. The post of Gangnam Station North Gate Evacuation Guide opened through a substitute watch after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Seop Chaewon handles North Gate evacuation passage-time and family-ticket guidance in Seocho 4-dong. He links the Gangnam Station headquarters noticeboard, and the waiting-hall handover of living cargo, access, and watch duty, as a dong-level duty reference point. The North Gate is a Gangnam Station access watch and does not establish control of the northern district or a new fortress. At Du Guk''s North Gate escort base he guides the processions and matches times with Gang Taesan''s corridor torches","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Northern Gate Evacuation Guide. He writes the passage times and family tickets on the same blackboard, and opens armed guidance only after a scouting report.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"At Du Guk''s North Gate escort base he guides the processions and matches times with Gang Taesan''s corridor torches.","Ambition":"","Fear":"That the guidance blackboard will be painted over as a military escort milestone and the evacuation route erased.","Intervention":"He can block an officer trying to set up the checkpoint line again, or leave the original times on the guidance blackboard as testimony."},"biography":"He remembers the blank spaces in the escort schedule as an insult, and sends down off the tracks any officer who offers a passage toll as a condition of passage. He divides the road with words rather than with a knife that shaves milestones.\n\n- Livelihood: Northern Gate Evacuation Passage Times, Family Ticket Guidance\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Gangnam Station Northern Gate Evacuation Guide\n**Life.** Grew up on the waiting-hall watch. The post of Gangnam Station North Gate Evacuation Guide opened through a substitute watch after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Seop Chaewon handles North Gate evacuation passage-time and family-ticket guidance in Seocho 4-dong. He links the Gangnam Station headquarters noticeboard, and the waiting-hall handover of living cargo, access, and watch duty, as a dong-level duty reference point. The North Gate is a Gangnam Station access watch and does not establish control of the northern district or a new fortress. At Du Guk''s North Gate escort base he guides the processions and matches times with Gang Taesan''s corridor torches\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Gangnam Station Northern Gate Evacuation Guide. He writes the passage times and family tickets on the same blackboard, and opens armed guidance only after a scouting report.\n\n**Relations.** At Du Guk''s North Gate escort base he guides the processions and matches times with Gang Taesan''s corridor torches.\n\n**Fear.** That the guidance blackboard will be painted over as a military escort milestone and the evacuation route erased.\n\n**Intervention.** He can block an officer trying to set up the checkpoint line again, or leave the original times on the guidance blackboard as testimony.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −20 | Force −10 | Material 20 | Communal 20 | Principle 10 | Publicity 5 | Credential 65 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk 35 | Display 30 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Bonding: Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seop Chaewon","type":"Contract","to":"Eo Ha-eun","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0293","name":"섭채원","title":"북한산보국문 행렬 북문 안내인","position":"강남역 북문 피난 안내인","characterId":"K292","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"북문 피난 통행 시각·가족 표 안내","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-섭채원","detailRoute":"/people/person-0293","birthDate":"2064-11-25","birthday":"11-25","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k292-evacuation-queue-guidance","name":"피난 행렬 안내","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k292-priority","name":"가족 통행 우선","description":"출입 확인이 사람을 막는 벽이 되지 않게 하려 한다.","behavior":"통행 시각과 가족 표를 같은 칠판에 적고, 무장 안내는 정찰 보고 뒤에만 연다.","stress":"안내 칠판이 군사 호송 이정표로 덧칠되어 피난로가 지워지는 것.","relationship":"두국의 북문 호송 거점에서 행렬을 안내하고, 강태산의 회랑 횃불과 시각을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k292-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 강남역 북문 피난 안내인. 통행 시각과 가족 표를 같은 칠판에 적고, 무장 안내는 정찰 보고 뒤에만 연다.","stress":"공포. 안내 칠판이 군사 호송 이정표로 덧칠되어 피난로가 지워지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 두국의 북문 호송 거점에서 행렬을 안내하고, 강태산의 회랑 횃불과 시각을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"출입 확인이 사람을 막는 벽이 되지 않게 하려 한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c12d-acbd-c8fc","name":"경주 섭씨","crest":"clan-crests/c12d-acbd-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-20,"무력":-10,"물질":20,"공동":20,"원칙":10,"공개":5,"자격":65,"분산":10,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":30,"위험":35,"과시":30,"지속":40,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"북문 피난 통행 시각·가족 표 안내","소속":"Arc","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"강남역 북문 피난 안내인","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −10 | 물질 20 | 공동 20 | 원칙 10 | 공개 5 | 자격 65 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 30 | 위험 35 | 과시 30 | 지속 40 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 강남역 북문 피난 안내인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 섭채원은 서초4동에서 북문 피난 통행 시각·가족 표 안내 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 두국의 북문 호송 거점에서 행렬을 안내하고, 강태산의 회랑 횃불과 시각을 맞춘다","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 강남역 북문 피난 안내인. 통행 시각과 가족 표를 같은 칠판에 적고, 무장 안내는 정찰 보고 뒤에만 연다.","일화":"","관계":"두국의 북문 호송 거점에서 행렬을 안내하고, 강태산의 회랑 횃불과 시각을 맞춘다.","야망":"","공포":"안내 칠판이 군사 호송 이정표로 덧칠되어 피난로가 지워지는 것.","개입":"검문 줄을 다시 치려는 장교를 막거나, 안내 칠판의 원본 시각을 증언으로 남길 수 있다."},"biography":"호송 시각의 빈칸을 모욕처럼 기억하고, 통행세를 통행 조건으로 내미는 장교를 선로에서 내려보낸다. 이정표를 깎는 칼보다 말로 길을 나눈다.\n\n- 생업: 북문 피난 통행 시각·가족 표 안내\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 강남역 북문 피난 안내인\n**생애.** 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 강남역 북문 피난 안내인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 섭채원은 서초4동에서 북문 피난 통행 시각·가족 표 안내 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 두국의 북문 호송 거점에서 행렬을 안내하고, 강태산의 회랑 횃불과 시각을 맞춘다\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 강남역 북문 피난 안내인. 통행 시각과 가족 표를 같은 칠판에 적고, 무장 안내는 정찰 보고 뒤에만 연다.\n\n**공포.** 안내 칠판이 군사 호송 이정표로 덧칠되어 피난로가 지워지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 검문 줄을 다시 치려는 장교를 막거나, 안내 칠판의 원본 시각을 증언으로 남길 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −10 | 물질 20 | 공동 20 | 원칙 10 | 공개 5 | 자격 65 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 30 | 위험 35 | 과시 30 | 지속 40 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"섭채원","type":"계약","to":"어하은","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0294', 'd3c9-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0294","name":"Pyeong Chaewon","title":"Cold-Night Heating Recorder","position":"Seocho 2-dong Heating Records","characterId":"K293","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Heating Fuel Use Records · Signature Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#person-pyeong-chaewon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0294","birthDate":"2080-10-12","birthday":"10-12","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k293-water-timing-testimony","name":"Stove ember timing testimony","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k293-priority","name":"Own testimony only","description":"Title: Cold-Night Heating Recorder.","behavior":"She wrote the hour the stove went out on the paper beside the kettle, took only her own signature in the confirmation box, and put it into the ledger box.","stress":"That her testimony would be used as a guarantee for someone else''s stove use, leaving her to bear the blame for heat leaking out and drawing outside machines.","relationship":"Relations. Reads the stove shift table together with her Seocho 2-dong neighbors and overlays it on the use times in the fuel ledger. Takes down separately the account of a neighbor who returned after being captured outside.","effects":[]},{"id":"k293-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"She wrote the hour the stove went out on the paper beside the kettle, took only her own signature in the confirmation box, and put it into the ledger box.","stress":"That her testimony would be used as a guarantee for someone else''s stove use, leaving her to bear the blame for heat leaking out and drawing outside machines.","relationship":"Relations. Reads the stove shift table together with her Seocho 2-dong neighbors and overlays it on the use times in the fuel ledger. Takes down separately the account of a neighbor who returned after being captured outside.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Cold-Night Heating Recorder.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d3c9-cda9-c8fc","name":"Chungju Pyeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d3c9-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-10,"Force":-5,"Material":20,"Communal":30,"Principle":20,"Public":-5,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-5,"Risk":10,"Display":20,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Heating Fuel Use Records · Signature Verification","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Seocho 2-dong Heating Records","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Material 20 | Communal 30 | Principle 20 | Publicity −5 | Credential 60 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation −20","Desires":"Craving 10 | Possessiveness −5 | Risk 10 | Display 20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on the Seocho 2-dong heating watch. She now guards her neighbors'' cold nights by recording stove embers and fuel-use times.\n- Pyeong Chaewon handles heating fuel use records and signature confirmation in Seocho 2-dong. She notes the times the stoves went out and the fuel drums were swapped, and checks them every night against the time the shutters closed. Personal residence or lodging ownership is not presumed. She reads the stove shift table together with her neighbors","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Seocho 2-dong Heating Records. She writes the time the stove went out on a sheet of paper beside the kettle, takes only her own signature in the confirmation box, and puts it into the ledger box.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"She reads the stove shift table together with her Seocho 2-dong neighbors and overlays it on the use times in the fuel ledger. She takes down separately the account of a neighbor who returned after being captured outside.","Ambition":"She means to leave on record, as testimony in the Seocho 2-dong ledger, the cold of the nights when fuel ran out, so that the stove-use order is never settled before the cooled kettle is heard.","Fear":"That her testimony will be used as a guarantee for someone else''s stove use, leaving her to bear the blame for heat leaking out and drawing outside machines.","Intervention":"She can leave the kettle''s time as public testimony, or forge handprints and bind stakeholders into negotiations as figureheads."},"biography":"\n\n- Livelihood: Heating Fuel Use Records · Signature Verification\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Seocho 2-dong Heating Records\n**Life.** Grew up on the Seocho 2-dong heating watch. She now guards her neighbors'' cold nights by recording stove embers and fuel-use times.\n- Pyeong Chaewon handles heating fuel use records and signature confirmation in Seocho 2-dong. She notes the times the stoves went out and the fuel drums were swapped, and checks them every night against the time the shutters closed. Personal residence or lodging ownership is not presumed. She reads the stove shift table together with her neighbors\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Seocho 2-dong Heating Records. She writes the time the stove went out on a sheet of paper beside the kettle, takes only her own signature in the confirmation box, and puts it into the ledger box.\n\n**Relations.** She reads the stove shift table together with her Seocho 2-dong neighbors and overlays it on the use times in the fuel ledger. She takes down separately the account of a neighbor who returned after being captured outside.\n\n**Ambition.** She means to leave on record, as testimony in the Seocho 2-dong ledger, the cold of the nights when fuel ran out, so that the stove-use order is never settled before the cooled kettle is heard.\n\n**Fear.** That her testimony will be used as a guarantee for someone else''s stove use, leaving her to bear the blame for heat leaking out and drawing outside machines.\n\n**Intervention.** She can leave the kettle''s time as public testimony, or forge handprints and bind stakeholders into negotiations as figureheads.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Material 20 | Communal 30 | Principle 20 | Publicity −5 | Credential 60 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Possessiveness −5 | Risk 10 | Display 20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Pyeong Chaewon","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Jin-a","basis":"and adding the party''s handprint to Seo Jina''s housing audit box"},{"from":"Pyeong Chaewon","type":"Contract","to":"Mobok","basis":"Read Mobok''s fuel ledger overlaid with the stove use time record"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0294","name":"평채원","title":"한파 밤 난방 기록 담당","position":"서초2동 난방 기록","characterId":"K293","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"난방 연료 사용 기록·서명 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-평채원","detailRoute":"/people/person-0294","birthDate":"2080-10-12","birthday":"10-12","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k293-water-timing-testimony","name":"난로 불씨 시각 증언","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k293-priority","name":"본인 증언 고수","description":"직함은 한파 밤 난방 기록 담당.","behavior":"난로 불이 꺼진 시각을 주전자 옆 종이에 적고, 확인란에는 본인 서명만 받아 장부 함에 넣는다.","stress":"자신의 증언이 남의 난로 사용을 보증하는 이름으로 쓰여, 열이 새어 외부 기계를 부르는 책임을 떠안는 것.","relationship":"서초2동 이웃과 난로 교대표를 맞춰 읽고, 연료 장부의 사용 시각과 겹쳐 본다. 외곽에서 붙잡혔다 돌아온 이웃의 증언은 따로 받아 적는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k293-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 서초2동 난방 기록. 난로 불이 꺼진 시각을 주전자 옆 종이에 적고, 확인란에는 본인 서명만 받아 장부 함에 넣는다.","stress":"공포. 자신의 증언이 남의 난로 사용을 보증하는 이름으로 쓰여, 열이 새어 외부 기계를 부르는 책임을 떠안는 것.","relationship":"관계. 서초2동 이웃과 난로 교대표를 맞춰 읽고, 연료 장부의 사용 시각과 겹쳐 본다. 외곽에서 붙잡혔다 돌아온 이웃의 증언은 따로 받아 적는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 한파 밤 난방 기록 담당.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d3c9-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 평씨","crest":"clan-crests/d3c9-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-10,"무력":-5,"물질":20,"공동":30,"원칙":20,"공개":-5,"자격":60,"분산":10,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-5,"위험":10,"과시":20,"지속":-15,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"난방 연료 사용 기록·서명 확인","소속":"Arc","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"서초2동 난방 기록","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 20 | 공동 30 | 원칙 20 | 공개 −5 | 자격 60 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −5 | 위험 10 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"서초2동 난방 당직에서 자랐다. 지금은 난로 불씨와 연료 사용 시각을 적는 일로 이웃의 한파 밤을 지킨다.\n- 평채원은 서초2동에서 난방 연료 사용 기록·서명 확인 업무를 맡는다. 난로가 꺼진 시각과 연료 통 교체 시각을 적고, 밤마다 셔터 닫는 시각과 맞춰 본다. 개인 거주나 숙소 소유는 추정하지 않는다. 이웃과 난로 교대표를 맞춰 읽는다","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 서초2동 난방 기록. 난로 불이 꺼진 시각을 주전자 옆 종이에 적고, 확인란에는 본인 서명만 받아 장부 함에 넣는다.","일화":"","관계":"서초2동 이웃과 난로 교대표를 맞춰 읽고, 연료 장부의 사용 시각과 겹쳐 본다. 외곽에서 붙잡혔다 돌아온 이웃의 증언은 따로 받아 적는다.","야망":"연료가 바닥난 밤의 추위를 서초2동 장부에 증언으로 남겨, 난로 사용 순서가 늘 식은 주전자보다 먼저 정해지지 않도록 한다.","공포":"자신의 증언이 남의 난로 사용을 보증하는 이름으로 쓰여, 열이 새어 외부 기계를 부르는 책임을 떠안는 것.","개입":"주전자 시각을 공개 증언으로 남기거나, 손도장을 위조해 당사자를 협상 들러리로 묶을 수 있다."},"biography":"먼저 일어선다.\n\n- 생업: 난방 연료 사용 기록·서명 확인\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 서초2동 난방 기록\n**생애.** 서초2동 난방 당직에서 자랐다. 지금은 난로 불씨와 연료 사용 시각을 적는 일로 이웃의 한파 밤을 지킨다.\n- 평채원은 서초2동에서 난방 연료 사용 기록·서명 확인 업무를 맡는다. 난로가 꺼진 시각과 연료 통 교체 시각을 적고, 밤마다 셔터 닫는 시각과 맞춰 본다. 개인 거주나 숙소 소유는 추정하지 않는다. 이웃과 난로 교대표를 맞춰 읽는다\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 서초2동 난방 기록. 난로 불이 꺼진 시각을 주전자 옆 종이에 적고, 확인란에는 본인 서명만 받아 장부 함에 넣는다.\n\n**관계.** 서초2동 이웃과 난로 교대표를 맞춰 읽고, 연료 장부의 사용 시각과 겹쳐 본다. 외곽에서 붙잡혔다 돌아온 이웃의 증언은 따로 받아 적는다.\n\n**야망.** 연료가 바닥난 밤의 추위를 서초2동 장부에 증언으로 남겨, 난로 사용 순서가 늘 식은 주전자보다 먼저 정해지지 않도록 한다.\n\n**공포.** 자신의 증언이 남의 난로 사용을 보증하는 이름으로 쓰여, 열이 새어 외부 기계를 부르는 책임을 떠안는 것.\n\n**개입.** 주전자 시각을 공개 증언으로 남기거나, 손도장을 위조해 당사자를 협상 들러리로 묶을 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 20 | 공동 30 | 원칙 20 | 공개 −5 | 자격 60 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −5 | 위험 10 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"평채원","type":"계약","to":"서진아","basis":"서진아의 주거 감사 함에 당사자 손도장을 보태고"},{"from":"평채원","type":"계약","to":"모복","basis":"모복의 연료 장부를 난로 사용 시각 기록과 겹쳐 읽는다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0295', 'b2e8-ac15-c74c', '{"id":"person-0295","name":"Dan Geonu","title":"Machine-Body Repair Technician","position":"Arc Outer Workshop Envoy Technician","characterId":"K294","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Outer Workshop Work Crew · Accident Ledger Record","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#person-dan-geonu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0295","birthDate":"2086-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k294-technical-clause-drafting","name":"Technical clause drafting","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k294-priority","name":"Machine-Body Repair Technician","description":"Title: Machine-Body Repair Technician.","behavior":"Title: Machine-Body Repair Technician.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k294-accountability","name":"Machine-Body Repair Technician","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Title: Machine-Body Repair Technician.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Machine-Body Repair Technician.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b2e8-ac15-c74c","name":"Gangeum Dan Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b2e8-ac15-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-10,"Force":-5,"Material":40,"Communal":25,"Principle":5,"Public":-5,"Eligibility":85,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":-30,"Display":-5,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Outer Workshop Work Crew · Accident Ledger Record","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Machine-Body Repair Technician","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Materiality 40 | Communal 25 | Principle 5 | Publicity −5 | Credentials 85 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Longing 30 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seocho 4-dong repair workshop. The habit of reviving worn parts led into the work of a machine-body repair technician.\nDan Geonu keeps the work-crew and accident ledger for the Arc outer workshop in Yeoksam 1-dong. He organizes machine-body maintenance samples, part weights, lots, measurements, and per-crew accident signatures precisely, based on the Yeoksam 1-dong living area next to Gangnam Station. He also logs separately the damage caused by outside machines drawn close by light and heat on winter nights. The supply handover at the Yeoksam waiting hall is for reference only; it is not confirmed that any factory, hospital, or similar facility stands there.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Machine-Body Repair Technician. Records work-crew rotations and parts use in the same ledger, and posts notes reporting parts shortages on the bulletin board exactly as they are.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"In the Arc, which has no factory, to make public the order for reviving worn parts, so that no one''s machine body stops for lack of parts.","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Remembers accident dates before people''s names, and does not open the base''s operations before transferring verbal approvals into the courier ledger.\n\n- Livelihood: Outer Workshop Work Crew · Accident Ledger Record\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Machine-body repair technician\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seocho 4-dong repair workshop. The habit of reviving worn parts led into the work of a machine-body repair technician.\nDan Geonu keeps the work-crew and accident ledger for the Arc outer workshop in Yeoksam 1-dong. He organizes machine-body maintenance samples, part weights, lots, measurements, and per-crew accident signatures precisely, based on the Yeoksam 1-dong living area next to Gangnam Station. He also logs separately the damage caused by outside machines drawn close by light and heat on winter nights. The supply handover at the Yeoksam waiting hall is for reference only; it is not confirmed that any factory, hospital, or similar facility stands there.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Machine-Body Repair Technician. Records work-crew rotations and parts use in the same ledger, and posts notes reporting parts shortages on the bulletin board exactly as they are.\n\n**Ambition.** In the Arc, which has no factory, to make public the order for reviving worn parts, so that no one''s machine body stops for lack of parts.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Materiality 40 | Communal 25 | Principle 5 | Publicity −5 | Credentials 85 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Longing 30 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Dan Geonu","type":"Contract","to":"Yi Hong-won","basis":""},{"from":"Dan Geonu","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Minseo","basis":"Transferring Gang Minseo''s repair standards into the text"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0295","name":"단건우","title":"기계 몸 정비 기술자","position":"Arc 바깥 작업장 사절 기술자","characterId":"K294","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"바깥 작업장 작업 조·사고 원장 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-단건우","detailRoute":"/people/person-0295","birthDate":"2086-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k294-technical-clause-drafting","name":"기술 문안 작성","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k294-priority","name":"기계 몸 정비 기술자","description":"직함은 기계 몸 정비 기술자.","behavior":"직함은 기계 몸 정비 기술자.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k294-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"직함은 기계 몸 정비 기술자.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 기계 몸 정비 기술자.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b2e8-ac15-c74c","name":"강음 단씨","crest":"clan-crests/b2e8-ac15-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-10,"무력":-5,"물질":40,"공동":25,"원칙":5,"공개":-5,"자격":85,"분산":20,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":0,"위험":-30,"과시":-5,"지속":0,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"바깥 작업장 작업 조·사고 원장 기록","소속":"Arc","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"기계 몸 정비 기술자","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 40 | 공동 25 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −5 | 자격 85 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 0 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 0 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"서초4동 정비 작업장에서 자랐다. 낡은 부품을 되살려 쓰는 손버릇이 기계 몸 정비 기술자 일로 이어졌다.\n단건우는 역삼1동에서 Arc 바깥 작업장의 작업 조·사고 원장 기록을 맡는다. 기계 몸체 정비 표본·부품 중량·로트·실측과 작업 조별 사고 서명을 강남역 인접 역삼1동 생활권 기준으로 정밀하게 정리한다. 겨울밤 불빛과 열에 끌려 다가온 바깥 기계로 인한 피해도 원장에 따로 적는다. 역삼 대합실의 물자 인계는 참고일 뿐, 그곳에 공장이나 병원 같은 설비가 있다고 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 기계 몸 정비 기술자. 작업 조 교대와 부품 사용을 같은 장부에 적고, 부품 부족을 알리는 쪽지는 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"공장이 없는 Arc에서 낡은 부품을 되살리는 수리 순서를 공개해, 누구의 기계 몸도 부품이 모자라 멈추지 않게 한다.","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"사고 날짜를 사람 이름보다 먼저 기억하고, 구두 승인을 전령 원장에 옮기기 전에 기지 가동을 열지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 바깥 작업장 작업 조·사고 원장 기록\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 기계 몸 정비 기술자\n**생애.** 서초4동 정비 작업장에서 자랐다. 낡은 부품을 되살려 쓰는 손버릇이 기계 몸 정비 기술자 일로 이어졌다.\n단건우는 역삼1동에서 Arc 바깥 작업장의 작업 조·사고 원장 기록을 맡는다. 기계 몸체 정비 표본·부품 중량·로트·실측과 작업 조별 사고 서명을 강남역 인접 역삼1동 생활권 기준으로 정밀하게 정리한다. 겨울밤 불빛과 열에 끌려 다가온 바깥 기계로 인한 피해도 원장에 따로 적는다. 역삼 대합실의 물자 인계는 참고일 뿐, 그곳에 공장이나 병원 같은 설비가 있다고 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 기계 몸 정비 기술자. 작업 조 교대와 부품 사용을 같은 장부에 적고, 부품 부족을 알리는 쪽지는 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.\n\n**야망.** 공장이 없는 Arc에서 낡은 부품을 되살리는 수리 순서를 공개해, 누구의 기계 몸도 부품이 모자라 멈추지 않게 한다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 40 | 공동 25 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −5 | 자격 85 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 0 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 0 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"단건우","type":"계약","to":"이홍원","basis":""},{"from":"단건우","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"강민서의 수리 규격을 문안에 옮기며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
