up on the Seocho 1-dong tunnel track maintenance watch. The work of verifying wheel intake and release at Seocho 1-dong grew out of a habit of saving worn parts.\nSun Hajun handles wheel intake-weight and dispatch testimony work in Yeoksam 1-dong. She organizes the samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signatures for salvaged wheels and parts within the Yeoksam 1-dong work-living area adjacent to Gangnam Station. The cargo handover at the Yeoksam waiting hall is for reference only and does not confirm actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies, or running trains. She overlays the weight logged on Hwang Noeul''s salvage scales with the intake weight, points to the same box as Chu Hangyeol''s Yongsan handover testimony, and witnesses the dispatch of the parts column Im Hajun guaranteed toward the Arc machine bodies.","Offices":"Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Arc Wheel Exchange Witness. Two witnesses check the intake weight, and a release slip whose weight does not match is not sent out before the ledger is straightened out.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"She overlays the weight logged on Hwang Noeul''s salvage scales with the intake weight, points to the same box as Chu Hangyeol''s Yongsan handover testimony, and witnesses the dispatch of the parts column Im Hajun guaranteed toward the Arc machine bodies.","Ambition":"","Fear":"That after the guarantor disappears, the exchange testimony will be cited only as grounds for military-exclusive dispatch.","Intervention":""},"biography":"Trusts the public scale over market prices.\n\n- Livelihood: Wheel Intake Weight · Dispatch Testimony\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Arc Wheel Exchange Witness\n**Life.** Grew up on the Seocho 1-dong tunnel track maintenance watch. The work of verifying wheel intake and release at Seocho 1-dong grew out of a habit of saving worn parts.\nSun Hajun handles wheel intake-weight and dispatch testimony work in Yeoksam 1-dong. She organizes the samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signatures for salvaged wheels and parts within the Yeoksam 1-dong work-living area adjacent to Gangnam Station. The cargo handover at the Yeoksam waiting hall is for reference only and does not confirm actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies, or running trains. She overlays the weight logged on Hwang Noeul''s salvage scales with the intake weight, points to the same box as Chu Hangyeol''s Yongsan handover testimony, and witnesses the dispatch of the parts column Im Hajun guaranteed toward the Arc machine bodies.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen. Title: Arc Wheel Exchange Witness. Two witnesses check the intake weight, and a release slip whose weight does not match is not sent out before the ledger is straightened out.\n\n**Fear.** That after the guarantor disappears, the exchange testimony will be cited only as grounds for military-exclusive dispatch.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 0 | Force −10 | Materiality 35 | Communal 10 | Principle 10 | Publicity −5 | Credentials 55 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Longing −10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 30 | Display 20 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sun Hajun","type":"Oath","to":"Hwang No-eul","basis":"Overlaying the agreed weight on Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale"},{"from":"Sun Hajun","type":"Oath","to":"Philipp Müller","basis":"Pointing to the same box as Philipp Müller''s Yongsan transshipment testimony"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0296","name":"순하준","title":"차륜 입출고 확인 담당","position":"Arc 차륜 교환 증인","characterId":"K295","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"차륜 입고 중량·출고 증언","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-순하준","detailRoute":"/people/person-0296","birthDate":"2064-03-06","birthday":"03-06","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k295-specification-and-weight-verification","name":"규격·중량 확인","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k295-priority","name":"교환의 증인","description":"직함은 차륜 입출고 확인 담당.","behavior":"입고 중량을 두 사람이 확인하고, 중량이 맞지 않는 출고서는 장부 정리 전에 내보내지 않는다.","stress":"보증인이 사라진 뒤 교환 증언이 군수 전용 출고의 근거로만 인용되는 것.","relationship":"황노을의 회수 저울에 기록된 중량을 입고 중량과 겹쳐 보고, 추한결의 용산 인계 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸이 Arc 기체 쪽으로 출고되는 것을 증언한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k295-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 Arc 차륜 교환 증인. 입고 중량을 두 사람이 확인하고, 중량이 맞지 않는 출고서는 장부 정리 전에 내보내지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 보증인이 사라진 뒤 교환 증언이 군수 전용 출고의 근거로만 인용되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 황노을의 회수 저울에 기록된 중량을 입고 중량과 겹쳐 보고, 추한결의 용산 인계 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸이 Arc 기체 쪽으로 출고되는 것을 증언한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 차륜 입출고 확인 담당.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c21c-d64d-c0b0","name":"홍산 순씨","crest":"clan-crests/c21c-d64d-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":0,"무력":-10,"물질":35,"공동":10,"원칙":10,"공개":-5,"자격":55,"분산":10,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":10,"위험":30,"과시":20,"지속":5,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"차륜 입고 중량·출고 증언","소속":"Arc","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"Arc 차륜 교환 증인","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 0 | 무력 −10 | 물질 35 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −5 | 자격 55 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 10 | 위험 30 | 과시 20 | 지속 5 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"서초1동 터널 선로 보수 당직에서 자랐다. 서초1동 차륜 입출고 확인 일은 낡은 부품을 아끼는 손버릇에서 이어졌다.\n순하준은 역삼1동에서 차륜 입고 중량·출고 증언 업무를 맡는다. 회수 차륜과 부품의 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명을 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권 안에서 정리한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고일 뿐 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 황노을의 회수 저울에 기록된 중량을 입고 중량과 겹쳐 보고, 추한결의 용산 인계 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸이 Arc 기체 쪽으로 출고되는 것을 증언한다.","관직":"품계 일반 시민. 직함은 Arc 차륜 교환 증인. 입고 중량을 두 사람이 확인하고, 중량이 맞지 않는 출고서는 장부 정리 전에 내보내지 않는다.","일화":"","관계":"황노을의 회수 저울에 기록된 중량을 입고 중량과 겹쳐 보고, 추한결의 용산 인계 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸이 Arc 기체 쪽으로 출고되는 것을 증언한다.","야망":"","공포":"보증인이 사라진 뒤 교환 증언이 군수 전용 출고의 근거로만 인용되는 것.","개입":""},"biography":"시세보다 공개 저울을 믿는다.\n\n- 생업: 차륜 입고 중량·출고 증언\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: Arc 차륜 교환 증인\n**생애.** 서초1동 터널 선로 보수 당직에서 자랐다. 서초1동 차륜 입출고 확인 일은 낡은 부품을 아끼는 손버릇에서 이어졌다.\n순하준은 역삼1동에서 차륜 입고 중량·출고 증언 업무를 맡는다. 회수 차륜과 부품의 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명을 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권 안에서 정리한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고일 뿐 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 황노을의 회수 저울에 기록된 중량을 입고 중량과 겹쳐 보고, 추한결의 용산 인계 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸이 Arc 기체 쪽으로 출고되는 것을 증언한다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 일반 시민. 직함은 Arc 차륜 교환 증인. 입고 중량을 두 사람이 확인하고, 중량이 맞지 않는 출고서는 장부 정리 전에 내보내지 않는다.\n\n**공포.** 보증인이 사라진 뒤 교환 증언이 군수 전용 출고의 근거로만 인용되는 것.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 0 | 무력 −10 | 물질 35 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −5 | 자격 55 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 10 | 위험 30 | 과시 20 | 지속 5 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"순하준","type":"맹세","to":"황노을","basis":"황노을의 회수 저울에 협약 중량을 겹치고"},{"from":"순하준","type":"맹세","to":"필리프 뮐러","basis":"필리프 뮐러의 용산 환적 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0297', 'c7a5-baa9-cc9c-5f35', '{"id":"person-0297","name":"Jang Sehwa","title":"Stationmaster","position":"Stationmaster of Sinnae Station","characterId":"K296","rank":"Stationmaster","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"Dispatch Duty Officer","gender":"Male","stage":"Key","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#person-jang-sehwa","detailRoute":"/people/person-0297","birthDate":"2098-08-11","birthday":"08-11","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K321","recipientName":"Seo Ongyeol","basis":"Interlocks with Jang Sehwa''s dispatch duty, but the stretcher key is drawn only from the duty box.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-12.json","anchor":"character-seoongyeol-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":12,"effective":12},"stewardship":{"base":15,"effective":15},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k296-seasonal-dispatch","name":"Seasonal dispatch","rating":75}],"traits":[{"id":"k296-trait-1","name":"Transfers fitted to the season","description":"Divides different train services by season.","behavior":"Divides different train services by season.","stress":"Draws up the operating conditions on the Sinnae Station dispatch board before each timetable change.","relationship":"Distinguishes Park Taegyeom’s schedule from his siding duty.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He separated ordinary and medical train times by season on the Sinnae Station dispatch board. Scheduling medical trains does not confer clinical skill.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s12","name":{"ko":"Sinnae Station Directly Held Land"},"holderPersonId":"K296","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S12","stationRef":{"stationId":"Sinnae","stationName":"Sinnae"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:kingdom-geography:seoul:02","name":"Northeast Area","rank":"kingdom","holderPersonId":"K296","stateId":"S12","geographicTitleId":"geography:kingdom:seoul:02","basis":"2026-10-22 territorial title allocation (owner:seoul-faction-consolidation-20261022). Stationmaster of Sinnae Station. Basis for holding the directly held land of Sinnae Station (Nowon) within the Northeast Area.","parentTitle":null}],"clan":{"id":"c7a5-baa9-cc9c-5f35","name":"Mokcheon Jang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c7a5-baa9-cc9c-5f35.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":40,"Force":-30,"Material":0,"Communal":20,"Principle":10,"Public":20,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":0,"Display":-10,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Dispatch Duty Officer","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Stationmaster","Title":"Stationmaster of Sinnae Station"},"sections":{},"biography":"Life. Jang Sehwa was born on 2098-08-11 and has carried on the duty records of the stations in the Sinnae area. At the opening of 2126, as Stationmaster of Sinnae Station, he checks the shutters, fuel, and food stock every day through the winter cold and coordinates the timing of patient transport and daily-goods handovers. Office. Rank: Stationmaster. Title: Stationmaster of Sinnae Station. Livelihood alias: Station Stock Duty. Anecdote. On the Sinnae Station duty board he split the times of general handovers and patient transport into separate boxes, and finalized the order after checking the patients'' condition and the duty confirmations. Relationships. He matches winter fuel stock tables with Bak Taegyeom, Stationmaster of Yongsan Station. Ambition. He intends to bind the time boxes for patient transport and daily-goods handovers into a public cross-reference table and confirm the order at every winter rotation.\n\n- Livelihood: Dispatch Duty Officer\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Stationmaster\n- Title: Stationmaster of Sinnae Station\n- The entrance, shutter, and fuel stock record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Jang Sehwa''s duty reference point. While the proposal is under review, only the records of baggage handover, food counts, and handcart waiting at the Sinnae Station waiting hall are cross-checked; running trains, new facilities, armament, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, holdings, and possession rights are not confirmed.\n\nJang Sehwa finalizes the dispatch order when the patient vitals sheet and the departmental seals match, and entries that conflict with Bak Taegyeom''s timetable are recorded side by side on the Sinnae Station dispatch board.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"An Dohan","type":"Command","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Handles transfer dispatch operations under the stationmaster''s command"},{"from":"Jeon Miri","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""},{"from":"Mun Sion","type":"Command","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""},{"from":"Ha Seon","type":"Command","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Enforces the light escort order"},{"from":"Nam Hoseong","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Shares medical escort with Sinnae Station"},{"from":"Mun Doyun","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""},{"from":"I Yunseo","type":"Debt","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""},{"from":"Han Bora","type":"Debt","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"a debt for avoiding Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy on the tracks"},{"from":"Sin Tae-san","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""},{"from":"Gwon Do-ha","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Aligned the northern escort timing"},{"from":"Cha Yun-mok","type":"Debt","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""},{"from":"Noah Davis","type":"Debt","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Taking on debt so as not to avoid Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy at the Yongsan depot"},{"from":"Yeon Eun-jae","type":"Debt","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"incurs debts so as not to avoid Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy in Noryangjin"},{"from":"Mo Guk","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""},{"from":"Stefan Petrov","type":"Oath","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""},{"from":"Cho Naru","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0297","name":"장세화","title":"역장","position":"신내역 역장","characterId":"K296","rank":"역장","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"배차의무관","gender":"남성","stage":"주요","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-장세화","detailRoute":"/people/person-0297","birthDate":"2098-08-11","birthday":"08-11","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K321","recipientName":"서온결","basis":"장세화의 배차 의무와 맞물리되, 들것 열쇠는 당직함에서만 꺼낸다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-12.json","anchor":"인물-서온결-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":12,"effective":12},"stewardship":{"base":15,"effective":15},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k296-seasonal-dispatch","name":"계절 배차","rating":75}],"traits":[{"id":"k296-trait-1","name":"계절에 맞춘 환승","description":"서로 다른 열차의 시간을 계절별로 나눈다.","behavior":"서로 다른 열차의 시간을 계절별로 나눈다.","stress":"시간표를 바꾸기 전에 운행 조건부터 신내역 배차판에 표로 마련한다.","relationship":"박태겸의 배차표와 자신의 유치선 당직을 구분한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일반 열차와 의료열차 시간을 계절별로 나누어 신내역 배차판에 올렸다. 의료열차를 배차한다고 진료 숙련을 가진 것은 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s12","name":{"ko":"신내역 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K296","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S12","stationRef":{"stationId":"신내","stationName":"신내"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:kingdom-geography:seoul:02","name":"동북권","rank":"kingdom","holderPersonId":"K296","stateId":"S12","geographicTitleId":"geography:kingdom:seoul:02","basis":"2026-10-22 영토 배분(owner:seoul-faction-consolidation-20261022). 신내역 역장. 동북권 안 신내역(노원) 직영지 보유 근거.","parentTitle":null}],"clan":{"id":"c7a5-baa9-cc9c-5f35","name":"목천 장씨","crest":"clan-crests/c7a5-baa9-cc9c-5f35.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"권위":-20,"개방":40,"무력":-30,"물질":0,"공동":20,"원칙":10,"공개":20,"자격":30,"분산":40,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-10,"위험":0,"과시":-10,"지속":30,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"배차의무관","소속":"정부","품계":"역장","직함":"신내역 역장"},"sections":{},"biography":"생애. 장세화는 2098-08-11에 태어나 신내 일대 역사의 당직 기록을 이어 왔다. 2126년 개막에는 신내역 역장으로서 겨울 한파 동안 셔터·연료·식량 재고를 매일 확인하고, 환자 이송과 생활 짐 인계 시각을 함께 조정한다. 관직. 품계 역장. 직함은 신내역 역장. 생업 별명은 역사 재고 당직. 일화. 신내역 당직판에 일반 인계와 환자 이송 시각을 칸을 나누어 적고, 환자 상태와 당직 확인을 거친 뒤 순서를 확정했다. 관계. 용산역 역장 박태겸과 겨울 연료 재고표를 맞춘다. 야망. 환자 이송과 생활 짐 인계의 시각 칸을 공개 대조표로 묶어 겨울 교대 때마다 순서를 확인하려 한다.\n\n- 생업: 배차의무관\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 역장\n- 직함: 신내역 역장\n- 신내1동의 출입구·셔터·연료 재고 기록대가 장세화의 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 제안 검토 동안에는 신내역 대합실의 짐 인계·식량 계수·손수레 대기 기록만 대조하며, 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n장세화는 환자 활력표와 부서 날인이 맞을 때 배차 순서를 확정하고, 박태겸의 배차표와 충돌한 칸은 신내역 배차판에 병기한다.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"안도한","type":"지휘","to":"장세화","basis":"환승 배차 실무를 역장 지휘로 맡음"},{"from":"전미리","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":""},{"from":"문시온","type":"지휘","to":"장세화","basis":""},{"from":"하세온","type":"지휘","to":"장세화","basis":"경량 호송 명령을 집행"},{"from":"남호성","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"의료호송을 신내역과 나눔"},{"from":"문도윤","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":""},{"from":"이윤서","type":"빚","to":"장세화","basis":""},{"from":"한보라","type":"빚","to":"장세화","basis":"의료호송을 선로에서 피하려는 빚"},{"from":"신태산","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":""},{"from":"권도하","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"북부 호송 시각을 맞춤"},{"from":"차윤목","type":"빚","to":"장세화","basis":""},{"from":"노아 데이비스","type":"빚","to":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 의료호송을 용산 창에서 피하지 않으려 빚을 지며"},{"from":"연은재","type":"빚","to":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 의료호송을 노량진에서 피하지 않으려 빚을 지며"},{"from":"모국","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":""},{"from":"스테판 페트로프","type":"맹세","to":"장세화","basis":""},{"from":"초나루","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0298', 'c548-c21c-d765', '{"id":"person-0298","name":"An Dohan","title":"Transfer Dispatch Crew Chief","position":"Transfer Dispatch Crew Chief","characterId":"K297","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Dispatch Schedule · Escort Roster Posting","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#character-andohan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0298","birthDate":"2082-02-01","birthday":"02-01","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k297-dispatch-personnel-allocation","name":"Dispatch personnel allocation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k297-priority","name":"Fills timetable gaps","description":"An Dohan publishes timetables and escort numbers and moved casualties through snow. His sole dispatch approval ambition conflicts with medical oversight.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Dispatch Crew Chief. He published the dispatch sheet and convoy personnel on one chalkboard, but honored the medical train''s priority only when Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp stood on it.","stress":"Fear. That light or heat leaking during a tunnel escort would draw outside machines and break the convoy apart.","relationship":"Relations. Held Jang Sehwa''s dispatch work, contested the approval order with Jeon Miri at every seasonal rotation, and depended on I Hongwon for the northern wheel-exchange hours.","effects":[]},{"id":"k297-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Dispatch Crew Chief. He published the dispatch sheet and convoy personnel on one chalkboard, but honored the medical train''s priority only when Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp stood on it.","stress":"Fear. That light or heat leaking during a tunnel escort would draw outside machines and break the convoy apart.","relationship":"Relations. Held Jang Sehwa''s dispatch work, contested the approval order with Jeon Miri at every seasonal rotation, and depended on I Hongwon for the northern wheel-exchange hours.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"An Dohan publishes timetables and escort numbers and moved casualties through snow. His sole dispatch approval ambition conflicts with medical oversight.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c548-c21c-d765","name":"Sunheung An Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c548-c21c-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":45,"Force":-25,"Material":10,"Communal":25,"Principle":0,"Public":15,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":-20,"Display":25,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Dispatch Schedule · Escort Roster Posting","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Transfer Dispatch Crew Chief","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 45 | Force −25 | Material 10 | Communal 25 | Principle 0 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −20 | Display 25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Multilateral"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2082-02-01. He grew up on Sinnae transfer duty. At the opening of 2126 he holds the post of Transfer Dispatch Squad Leader, and the record of his taking over the post notes that it opened up after he stopped a ticketless departing train.\n- The dispatch, rotation, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as An Dohan''s duty reference point for posting timetables and escort rosters. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the winter; running trains, new facilities, armament, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, holdings, and possession rights are not confirmed.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Dispatch Crew Chief. Posts the dispatch schedule and escort headcount on the same blackboard, but recognizes medical-train priority only when it bears the seal of Jang Sehwa''s department.","Anecdote":"In the heavy snow of 2125, cleared a transfer passage blocked by snow and moved the wounded out first. That record remained as a cross-check reference for the next duty shift.","Relationships":"He handled Jang Sehwa''s dispatch operations, contends with Jeon Miri over the approval order at every seasonal rotation, and depends on Yi Hongwon for the northern wheel-exchange times.","Ambition":"Seeks to fix Sinnae depot dispatch authority as a sole approval of the Dispatch Team.","Fear":"That light or heat leaks during a tunnel escort, drawing outside machines and breaking the convoy apart.","Intervention":"Can verify the actual cargo on the sealed holding track, or expose the Dispatch Team sole-approval proposal in front of the Medical Team."},"biography":"An Dohan, born 2082-02-01, cannot stand blanks in a timetable and corrects the blackboard before the seasonal rotation approval even arrives. Delays on the end-of-line routes are remembered as insults.\n\n- Livelihood: Dispatch Schedule · Escort Roster Posting\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Transfer Dispatch Crew Chief\n**Life.** Born on 2082-02-01. He grew up on Sinnae transfer duty. At the opening of 2126 he holds the post of Transfer Dispatch Squad Leader, and the record of his taking over the post notes that it opened up after he stopped a ticketless departing train.\n- The dispatch, rotation, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as An Dohan''s duty reference point for posting timetables and escort rosters. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the winter; running trains, new facilities, armament, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, holdings, and possession rights are not confirmed.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Dispatch Crew Chief. Posts the dispatch schedule and escort headcount on the same blackboard, but recognizes medical-train priority only when it bears the seal of Jang Sehwa''s department.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the heavy snow of 2125, cleared a transfer passage blocked by snow and moved the wounded out first. That record remained as a cross-check reference for the next duty shift.\n\n**Relations.** He handled Jang Sehwa''s dispatch operations, contends with Jeon Miri over the approval order at every seasonal rotation, and depends on Yi Hongwon for the northern wheel-exchange times.\n\n**Ambition.** Seeks to fix Sinnae depot dispatch authority as a sole approval of the Dispatch Team.\n\n**Fear.** That light or heat leaks during a tunnel escort, drawing outside machines and breaking the convoy apart.\n\n**Intervention.** Can verify the actual cargo on the sealed holding track, or expose the Dispatch Team sole-approval proposal in front of the Medical Team.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 45 | Force −25 | Material 10 | Communal 25 | Principle 0 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −20 | Display 25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Multi-party\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"An Dohan","type":"Command","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Handles transfer dispatch operations under the president''s command"},{"from":"An Dohan","type":"Contract","to":"Yi Hong-won","basis":"Depends on northern wheelset exchange times"}],"incoming":[{"from":"So Dugam","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"taking over An Dohan''s dispatch work at the holding track, and"},{"from":"Bok Bong","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"aligning the unloading order with An Dohan''s dispatch blackboard, and"},{"from":"Du Bok","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"carrying notes about the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan, and"},{"from":"Guk So","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"placing An Dohan''s dispatch schedule at the very top of the blackboard."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0298","name":"안도한","title":"환승 배차조장","position":"환승 배차조장","characterId":"K297","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"배차표·호송 인원 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-안도한","detailRoute":"/people/person-0298","birthDate":"2082-02-01","birthday":"02-01","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k297-dispatch-personnel-allocation","name":"배차 인원 배치","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k297-priority","name":"빈 시각표를 메움","description":"안도한은 시각표와 호송 인원을 공개하고 폭설 통로에서 부상자를 옮겼다. 배차조 단독 승인 야망은 의료조 견제와 충돌한다.","behavior":"배차표와 호송 인원을 같은 칠판에 공개하되, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인이 있을 때만 인정한다.","stress":"터널 호송 중 빛이나 열이 새어 바깥 기계를 부르고 호송 대열이 끊기는 것.","relationship":"장세화의 배차 실무를 맡았고, 전미리와는 계절 교대마다 승인 순서를 다투며, 이홍원에게 북부 차륜 교환 시각을 의존한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k297-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 배차조장. 배차표와 호송 인원을 같은 칠판에 공개하되, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인이 있을 때만 인정한다.","stress":"공포. 터널 호송 중 빛이나 열이 새어 바깥 기계를 부르고 호송 대열이 끊기는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화의 배차 실무를 맡았고, 전미리와는 계절 교대마다 승인 순서를 다투며, 이홍원에게 북부 차륜 교환 시각을 의존한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"안도한은 시각표와 호송 인원을 공개하고 폭설 통로에서 부상자를 옮겼다. 배차조 단독 승인 야망은 의료조 견제와 충돌한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c548-c21c-d765","name":"순흥 안씨","crest":"clan-crests/c548-c21c-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":45,"무력":-25,"물질":10,"공동":25,"원칙":0,"공개":15,"자격":20,"분산":40,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":35,"위험":-20,"과시":25,"지속":0,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"배차표·호송 인원 게시","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"환승 배차조장","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 45 | 무력 −25 | 물질 10 | 공동 25 | 원칙 0 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 40 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 35 | 위험 −20 | 과시 25 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2082-02-01에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 배차조장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 안도한의 배차표·호송 인원 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 배차조장. 배차표와 호송 인원을 같은 칠판에 공개하되, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인이 있을 때만 인정한다.","일화":"2125년 폭설에 막힌 환승 통로를 뚫어 부상자를 먼저 옮겼다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.","관계":"장세화의 배차 실무를 맡았고, 전미리와는 계절 교대마다 승인 순서를 다투며, 이홍원에게 북부 차륜 교환 시각을 의존한다.","야망":"신내 기지 배차권을 배차조 단독 승인으로 고정하려 한다.","공포":"터널 호송 중 빛이나 열이 새어 바깥 기계를 부르고 호송 대열이 끊기는 것.","개입":"봉쇄된 유치선의 실제 화물을 확인하거나, 배차조 단독 승인안을 의료조 앞에서 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"2082-02-01생인 안도한은 시각표의 빈칸을 참지 못하고, 계절 교대 결재가 오기 전에 이미 칠판을 고쳐 둔다. 말단 노선의 지연을 모욕처럼 기억한다.\n\n- 생업: 배차표·호송 인원 게시\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 환승 배차조장\n**생애.** 2082-02-01에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 배차조장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 안도한의 배차표·호송 인원 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 배차조장. 배차표와 호송 인원을 같은 칠판에 공개하되, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인이 있을 때만 인정한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 폭설에 막힌 환승 통로를 뚫어 부상자를 먼저 옮겼다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 장세화의 배차 실무를 맡았고, 전미리와는 계절 교대마다 승인 순서를 다투며, 이홍원에게 북부 차륜 교환 시각을 의존한다.\n\n**야망.** 신내 기지 배차권을 배차조 단독 승인으로 고정하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 터널 호송 중 빛이나 열이 새어 바깥 기계를 부르고 호송 대열이 끊기는 것.\n\n**개입.** 봉쇄된 유치선의 실제 화물을 확인하거나, 배차조 단독 승인안을 의료조 앞에서 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 45 | 무력 −25 | 물질 10 | 공동 25 | 원칙 0 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 40 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 35 | 위험 −20 | 과시 25 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"안도한","type":"지휘","to":"장세화","basis":"환승 배차 실무를 사장 지휘로 맡음"},{"from":"안도한","type":"계약","to":"이홍원","basis":"북부 차륜 교환 시각을 의존"}],"incoming":[{"from":"소두감","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"안도한의 배차 실무를 유치선에서 받고"},{"from":"복봉","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"안도한의 배차 칠판과 하역 순서를 맞추고"},{"from":"두복","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고"},{"from":"국소","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"안도한의 배차표를 칠판 맨 위에 둔다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0299', 'c804-c625-cc9c-5168', '{"id":"person-0299","name":"Jeon Miri","title":"Medical Crew Member","position":"Medical Crew Member","characterId":"K298","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Patient Severity · Transfer Time Record","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-jeonmiri","detailRoute":"/people/person-0299","birthDate":"2080-03-07","birthday":"03-07","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k298-prescription-allocation","name":"Prescription allocation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k298-priority","name":"Severity first","description":"Jeon Miri divided scarce prescriptions among everyone. She accepts dispatch requests after vital stabilization and puts stretcher order first.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Crew Member. She pasted the severity table and transfer hours in the medical crew''s duty room and took the dispatch crew''s empty-slot demands only after the patients'' vitals were stable.","stress":"Fear. That the patient cars would be mistaken for munitions cars and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. Checked An Dohan''s dispatch solo runs and borrowed sickbeds from Eun Chaeyun in Jegi-dong.","effects":[]},{"id":"k298-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Crew Member. She pasted the severity table and transfer hours in the medical crew''s duty room and took the dispatch crew''s empty-slot demands only after the patients'' vitals were stable.","stress":"Fear. That the patient cars would be mistaken for munitions cars and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. Checked An Dohan''s dispatch solo runs and borrowed sickbeds from Eun Chaeyun in Jegi-dong.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Jeon Miri divided scarce prescriptions among everyone. She accepts dispatch requests after vital stabilization and puts stretcher order first.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c804-c625-cc9c-5168","name":"Okcheon Jeon Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c804-c625-cc9c-5168.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":50,"Force":-30,"Material":0,"Communal":25,"Principle":20,"Public":15,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-10,"Display":-15,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Patient Severity · Transfer Time Record","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Medical Crew Member","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 50 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Communal 25 | Principle 20 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −10 | Display −15 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2080-03-07. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening holds the post of Medical Team Member, and the succession record notes that the post opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The records desk for dispatch, rotation, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty keys at Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Jeon Miri''s reference post for recording patient severity and transfer times. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records, and it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Crew Member. Posts the severity chart and transfer times in the Medical Team duty room, and accepts the Dispatch Team''s requests for empty slots only after the patients'' vital signs have stabilized.","Anecdote":"In 2125, with medicinal herbs in short supply, split the prescription amounts in half and shared them with everyone. That record remained as a cross-check reference for the next duty shift.","Relationships":"Checks An Dohan''s dispatch monopolizing, and borrows Jegi-dong''s admission beds from Eun Chaeyun.","Ambition":"Bind emergency transfers from Jungnang and Mangu to the Jegi-dong treatment contract in a single escort pass.","Fear":"That a patient car is mistaken for a military supply car and the entire escort convoy is disarmed.","Intervention":"Can cross-check the patient roster against the weapons loading record, or carry a draft of the medical escort pass to Jegi-dong."},"biography":"Jeon Miri, born 2080-03-07, looks at injury grade first. Trusts stretcher order.\n\n- Occupation: Patient Severity · Transfer Time Record\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Medical Crew Member\n**Life.** Born on 2080-03-07. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening holds the post of Medical Team Member, and the succession record notes that the post opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The records desk for dispatch, rotation, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty keys at Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Jeon Miri''s reference post for recording patient severity and transfer times. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records, and it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Crew Member. Posts the severity chart and transfer times in the Medical Team duty room, and accepts the Dispatch Team''s requests for empty slots only after the patients'' vital signs have stabilized.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, with medicinal herbs in short supply, split the prescription amounts in half and shared them with everyone. That record remained as a cross-check reference for the next duty shift.\n\n**Relations.** Checks An Dohan''s dispatch monopolizing, and borrows Jegi-dong''s admission beds from Eun Chaeyun.\n\n**Ambition.** Bind emergency transfers from Jungnang and Mangu to the Jegi-dong treatment contract in a single escort pass.\n\n**Fear.** That a patient car is mistaken for a military supply car and the entire escort convoy is disarmed.\n\n**Intervention.** Can cross-check the patient roster against the weapons loading record, or carry a draft of the medical escort pass to Jegi-dong.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 50 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Communal 25 | Principle 20 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −10 | Display −15 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jeon Miri","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"U Hajin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"U Hajin separately records the medical escort runs that were pushed out of the seasonal schedule into ordinary train cars and passes them to Jeon Miri. Jeon Miri checks patient severity and transfer times and reflects them in the Medical Team duty room, so that stretcher order is not erased just because the schedule changed."},{"from":"Jeong Da-eun","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"Jeong Daeun sorts the medical escort runs that diverge between the two dispatch schedules by actual escort signatures and hands them to Jeon Miri. Jeon Miri checks patient severity and transfer times so that a run that never departed is not treated as having handed over arriving patients."},{"from":"Nam Reumeun","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"Nam Reumeun hands Jeon Miri the medical-train patient list, recounted just before departure. Jeon Miri checks severity and transfer times, distinguishes ordinary transferring passengers from patients actually in the medical car, and keeps the stretcher order continuous."},{"from":"Guk Yong","type":"Command","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"carrying out the stretcher order under Jeon Miri''s command, and"},{"from":"Du Bok","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"carrying notes about the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan, and"},{"from":"Yong Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"receiving Jeon Miri''s stretcher order on the platform, and"},{"from":"Gammo","type":"Command","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"carrying out the extension of Jeon Miri''s Medical Team in the duty room, and"},{"from":"Beom Ongyeol","type":"Oath","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"backing Jeon Miri''s patient line at the witness stand, and"},{"from":"Chang Dahin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"placing the victims'' line on Jeon Miri''s severity chart, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0299","name":"전미리","title":"의료 조원","position":"의료 조원","characterId":"K298","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-전미리","detailRoute":"/people/person-0299","birthDate":"2080-03-07","birthday":"03-07","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k298-prescription-allocation","name":"처방량 배분","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k298-priority","name":"중증도 우선","description":"전미리는 부족한 처방량을 나눠 모두에게 배분했다. 활력 안정 뒤에 배차 요구를 받으며 들것 순서를 둔다.","behavior":"중증도 표와 이송 시각을 의료조 당직실에 붙이고, 배차조의 빈 슬롯 요구는 환자 활력이 안정된 뒤에만 받는다.","stress":"환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"안도한의 배차 독주를 견제하고, 은채윤에게 제기동 수용 병상을 빌려 쓴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k298-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 의료 조원. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 의료조 당직실에 붙이고, 배차조의 빈 슬롯 요구는 환자 활력이 안정된 뒤에만 받는다.","stress":"공포. 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"관계. 안도한의 배차 독주를 견제하고, 은채윤에게 제기동 수용 병상을 빌려 쓴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"전미리는 부족한 처방량을 나눠 모두에게 배분했다. 활력 안정 뒤에 배차 요구를 받으며 들것 순서를 둔다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c804-c625-cc9c-5168","name":"옥천 전씨","crest":"clan-crests/c804-c625-cc9c-5168.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":50,"무력":-30,"물질":0,"공동":25,"원칙":20,"공개":15,"자격":20,"분산":40,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-20,"위험":-10,"과시":-15,"지속":10,"지향":"유동","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"의료 조원","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 50 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 20 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −15 | 지속 10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2080-03-07에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료 조원 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 전미리의 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 의료 조원. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 의료조 당직실에 붙이고, 배차조의 빈 슬롯 요구는 환자 활력이 안정된 뒤에만 받는다.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.","관계":"안도한의 배차 독주를 견제하고, 은채윤에게 제기동 수용 병상을 빌려 쓴다.","야망":"중랑·망우 응급 이송을 제기동 치료계약과 한 장의 호송증으로 묶는다.","공포":"환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","개입":"환자 명부와 무기 적재 기록을 대조하거나, 의료 호송증 초안을 제기동까지 운반할 수 있다."},"biography":"2080-03-07생인 전미리는 부상 등급을 먼저 본다. 들것 순서를 믿는다.\n\n- 생업: 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 의료 조원\n**생애.** 2080-03-07에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료 조원 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 전미리의 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 의료 조원. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 의료조 당직실에 붙이고, 배차조의 빈 슬롯 요구는 환자 활력이 안정된 뒤에만 받는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 안도한의 배차 독주를 견제하고, 은채윤에게 제기동 수용 병상을 빌려 쓴다.\n\n**야망.** 중랑·망우 응급 이송을 제기동 치료계약과 한 장의 호송증으로 묶는다.\n\n**공포.** 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.\n\n**개입.** 환자 명부와 무기 적재 기록을 대조하거나, 의료 호송증 초안을 제기동까지 운반할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 50 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 20 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −15 | 지속 10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"전미리","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"우하진","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"우하진은 계절 배차표에서 일반 열차 칸으로 밀려난 의무호송 편을 따로 적어 전미리에게 전한다. 전미리는 환자 중증도와 이송 시각을 확인하고 의료조 당직실에 반영해, 배차표가 바뀌었다고 들것 순서가 지워지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"정다은","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"정다은은 두 배차표에서 엇갈린 의무호송 편을 실제 호송원 서명으로 가려 전미리에게 넘긴다. 전미리는 환자 중증도와 이송 시각을 확인해, 떠나지 않은 편이 도착할 환자를 인계한 것으로 처리되지 않게 한다."},{"from":"남름은","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"남름은은 출발 직전 다시 센 의료열차 환자 명단을 전미리에게 넘긴다. 전미리는 중증도와 이송 시각을 확인해 일반 환승객과 실제 의료칸 환자를 구분하며 들것 순서를 잇는다."},{"from":"국용","type":"지휘","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 지휘로 들것 순서를 집행하고"},{"from":"두복","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고"},{"from":"용봉","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 들것 순서를 승강장에서 받고"},{"from":"감모","type":"지휘","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 의료조 연장을 당직실에서 집행하고"},{"from":"범온결","type":"맹세","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 환자 줄을 증인석에서 받치고"},{"from":"창다흰","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 중증도 표에 피해자 줄을 올리고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0300', 'bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587', '{"id":"person-0300","name":"Mun Sion","title":"Passage Inspector","position":"Passage Inspector","characterId":"K299","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Identity Fragment · Cargo Seal Cross-check","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-munsion","detailRoute":"/people/person-0300","birthDate":"2075-05-26","birthday":"05-26","age":51,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k299-passage-evidence-checking","name":"Passage evidence checking","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k299-priority","name":"Double evidence","description":"Mun Sion cross-checks identity fragments and cargo seals, refusing external searches without joint seals. Snow rescue does not expand his inspection powers.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Passage Inspector. He checked identity slips and freight seals doubly.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Cross-checks identity fragments and cargo seals.","effects":[]},{"id":"k299-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Passage Inspector. He checked identity slips and freight seals doubly.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Cross-checks identity fragments and cargo seals.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Mun Sion cross-checks identity fragments and cargo seals, refusing external searches without joint seals. Snow rescue does not expand his inspection powers.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587","name":"Nampyeong Mun Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":40,"Force":-35,"Material":0,"Communal":10,"Principle":0,"Public":30,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":-30,"Display":-30,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Identity Fragment · Cargo Seal Cross-check","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Passage Inspector","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −35 | Materialism 0 | Community 10 | Principle 0 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving −5 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk −30 | Display −30 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2075-05-26. Raised on the waiting-hall night watch. At the 2126 opening holds the Passage Inspector watch, and the post handover record shows the post opened through a substitute watch covering an unexcused shift absence.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Mun Sion''s cross-checking of identity shards and cargo seals. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Passage Inspector. Double-checks identity shards and cargo seals.","Anecdote":"In the heavy snow of 2125, cleared a transfer passage blocked by snow and moved the wounded out first. That record remained as a cross-check reference for the next duty shift.","Relationships":"","Ambition":"Seeks to use inspection on the Northeast Outer Road to cut off the arbitrary searches of the Amsa Escort Corps.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can restore the back-gate seal ledger."},"biography":"Born 2075-05-26, Mun Sion speaks little and relentlessly cross-checks evidence. Holds in contempt the practice of turning escort-fee receipts into passes.\n\n- Livelihood: Identity Fragment · Cargo Seal Cross-check\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Passage Inspector\n**Life.** Born 2075-05-26. Raised on the waiting-hall night watch. At the 2126 opening holds the Passage Inspector watch, and the post handover record shows the post opened through a substitute watch covering an unexcused shift absence.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Mun Sion''s cross-checking of identity shards and cargo seals. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Passage Inspector. Double-checks identity shards and cargo seals.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the heavy snow of 2125, cleared a transfer passage blocked by snow and moved the wounded out first. That record remained as a cross-check reference for the next duty shift.\n\n**Ambition.** Seeks to use inspection on the Northeast Outer Road to cut off the arbitrary searches of the Amsa Escort Corps.\n\n**Intervention.** Can restore the back-gate seal ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −35 | Materialism 0 | Community 10 | Principle 0 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk −30 | Display −30 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Mun Sion","type":"Command","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gwak Taesan","type":"Oath","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Share the witnessing of the medical train seal"},{"from":"Gam Guk","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Verify Mun Sion''s inspection post seal on the road"},{"from":"Bok Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Hand the back-gate survey to Mun Sion, and"},{"from":"Bong Mo","type":"Command","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Move the inspection ledger under Mun Sion''s command, and"},{"from":"Gukgam","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Share the seal witnessing with Mun Sion"},{"from":"Tak Mireu","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Leave a statement at Mun Sion''s inspection post, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0300","name":"문시온","title":"통행 심사관","position":"통행 심사관","characterId":"K299","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"신분 조각·화물 봉인 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-문시온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0300","birthDate":"2075-05-26","birthday":"05-26","age":51,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k299-passage-evidence-checking","name":"통행 증빙 확인","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k299-priority","name":"이중 증빙","description":"문시온은 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 대조하며 공동 날인 없는 외부 검색을 거부한다. 폭설 구조가 심사관 권한을 늘리지는 않는다.","behavior":"신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 확인한다.","stress":"","relationship":"신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 대조한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k299-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 통행 심사관. 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 확인한다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 대조한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"문시온은 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 대조하며 공동 날인 없는 외부 검색을 거부한다. 폭설 구조가 심사관 권한을 늘리지는 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587","name":"남평 문씨","crest":"clan-crests/bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":40,"무력":-35,"물질":0,"공동":10,"원칙":0,"공개":30,"자격":15,"분산":35,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":30,"위험":-30,"과시":-30,"지속":5,"지향":"동성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"신분 조각·화물 봉인 대조","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"통행 심사관","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −35 | 물질 0 | 공동 10 | 원칙 0 | 공개 30 | 자격 15 | 분산 35 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −30 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2075-05-26에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 통행 심사관 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 문시온의 신분 조각·화물 봉인 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 통행 심사관. 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 확인한다.","일화":"2125년 폭설에 막힌 환승 통로를 뚫어 부상자를 먼저 옮겼다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.","관계":"","야망":"동북 외곽로 심사로 암사 호위단의 임의 검색을 끊으려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"후문 봉인 장부를 복원할 수 있다."},"biography":"2075-05-26생인 문시온은 말수가 적고 증빙을 집요하게 대조한다. 호송료 영수증을 통행증으로 바꾸는 관행을 경멸한다.\n\n- 생업: 신분 조각·화물 봉인 대조\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 통행 심사관\n**생애.** 2075-05-26에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 통행 심사관 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 문시온의 신분 조각·화물 봉인 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 통행 심사관. 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 확인한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 폭설에 막힌 환승 통로를 뚫어 부상자를 먼저 옮겼다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.\n\n**야망.** 동북 외곽로 심사로 암사 호위단의 임의 검색을 끊으려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 후문 봉인 장부를 복원할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −35 | 물질 0 | 공동 10 | 원칙 0 | 공개 30 | 자격 15 | 분산 35 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −30 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"문시온","type":"지휘","to":"장세화","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"곽태산","type":"맹세","to":"문시온","basis":"의료열차 봉인 입회를 공유"},{"from":"감국","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온의 심사대 봉인을 길에서 확인한다"},{"from":"복감","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온에게 후문 실측을 넘기고"},{"from":"봉모","type":"지휘","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온의 지휘로 심사 원장을 옮기고"},{"from":"국감","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유한다"},{"from":"탁미르","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온의 심사대에서 진술을 남기고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0301', 'd558-c9c4-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0301","name":"Ha Seon","title":"Light Escort Commander","position":"Light Escort Commander","characterId":"K300","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Medical · Cargo Escort Roster Assignment","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-haseon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0301","birthDate":"2095-03-17","birthday":"03-17","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"k300-escort-personnel-allocation","name":"Escort personnel allocation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k300-priority","name":"Restrains escalation","description":"Ha Seon distributes limited personnel along long trains and withholds fire before sealed orders. Closure is documented, victory over Amsa is not.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Light Escort Commander. She mixed convoy personnel into the medical cars and the freight cars and granted no firing authority before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Executed Jang Sehwa''s convoy orders, split sections with Nam Hoseong''s Jegi-dong medical convoy, and matched the north gate link with I Hongwon''s rail cavalry.","effects":[]},{"id":"k300-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Light Escort Commander. She mixed convoy personnel into the medical cars and the freight cars and granted no firing authority before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Executed Jang Sehwa''s convoy orders, split sections with Nam Hoseong''s Jegi-dong medical convoy, and matched the north gate link with I Hongwon''s rail cavalry.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Ha Seon distributes limited personnel along long trains and withholds fire before sealed orders. Closure is documented, victory over Amsa is not.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d558-c9c4-c8fc","name":"Jinju Ha Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d558-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":45,"Force":-30,"Material":0,"Communal":25,"Principle":10,"Public":15,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-35,"Display":10,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical · Cargo Escort Roster Assignment","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Light Escort Commander","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 45 | Force −30 | Materialism 0 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 25 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk −35 | Display 10 | Persistence −5 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: none"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2095-03-17. Raised on the Sinnae transfer watch. At the 2126 opening holds the Light Escort Captain watch, and the post handover record shows the post opened through stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Ha Seon''s staffing of medical and cargo escort personnel. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Light Escort Commander. Mixes escort personnel between the medical and cargo cars, and grants no firing authority before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.","Anecdote":"In 2125, did not delay a collapse report on a flooded section and closed it immediately. That record remained as a cross-checking basis for the next watch.","Relationships":"Carries out Jang Sehwa''s escort orders, divides sectors with Nam Hoseong''s Jegi-dong medical escort, and aligns the north gate connection with I Hongwon''s Rail Cavalry.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can pass along signal flags to avoid combat, or trace the party that forged the firing order."},"biography":"Born 2095-03-17, Ha Seon fills the gaps left by an optimistic superior in the field. Knows how to guard a long train with few troops.\n\n- Livelihood: Medical · Cargo Escort Roster Assignment\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Light Escort Commander\n**Life.** Born 2095-03-17. Raised on the Sinnae transfer watch. At the 2126 opening holds the Light Escort Captain watch, and the post handover record shows the post opened through stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Ha Seon''s staffing of medical and cargo escort personnel. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Light Escort Commander. Mixes escort personnel between the medical and cargo cars, and grants no firing authority before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, did not delay a collapse report on a flooded section and closed it immediately. That record remained as a cross-checking basis for the next watch.\n\n**Relations.** Carries out Jang Sehwa''s escort orders, divides sectors with Nam Hoseong''s Jegi-dong medical escort, and aligns the north gate connection with I Hongwon''s Rail Cavalry.\n\n**Intervention.** Can pass along signal flags to avoid combat, or trace the party that forged the firing order.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 45 | Force −30 | Materialism 0 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk −35 | Display 10 | Persistence −5 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: none\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ha Seon","type":"Command","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Enforces the light escort order"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gam Guk","type":"Command","to":"Ha Seon","basis":"Circle the outer road under Ha Seon''s command, and"},{"from":"Seok Bomu","type":"Contract","to":"Ha Seon","basis":"Split the crowd line with Ha Seon''s escort unit, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0301","name":"하세온","title":"경량 호송대장","position":"경량 호송대장","characterId":"K300","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"의료·화물 호송 인원 편성","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-하세온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0301","birthDate":"2095-03-17","birthday":"03-17","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"k300-escort-personnel-allocation","name":"호송 인원 배치","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k300-priority","name":"교전 억제","description":"하세온은 적은 인원을 긴 열차에 나누고 봉인 명령 전 발포를 막는다. 침수 구간 폐쇄는 확인되나 암사와의 교전 승리는 없다.","behavior":"호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"장세화의 호송 명령을 집행하고, 남호성의 제기동 의무호송과 구간을 나누며, 이홍원의 궤도기병과 북문 접속을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k300-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 경량 호송대장. 호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 장세화의 호송 명령을 집행하고, 남호성의 제기동 의무호송과 구간을 나누며, 이홍원의 궤도기병과 북문 접속을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"하세온은 적은 인원을 긴 열차에 나누고 봉인 명령 전 발포를 막는다. 침수 구간 폐쇄는 확인되나 암사와의 교전 승리는 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d558-c9c4-c8fc","name":"진주 하씨","crest":"clan-crests/d558-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":45,"무력":-30,"물질":0,"공동":25,"원칙":10,"공개":15,"자격":25,"분산":35,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-30,"위험":-35,"과시":10,"지속":-5,"지향":"동성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"의료·화물 호송 인원 편성","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"경량 호송대장","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 45 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −35 | 과시 10 | 지속 −5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2095-03-17에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 경량 호송대장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 하세온의 의료·화물 호송 인원 편성 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 경량 호송대장. 호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 침수 구간 붕괴 보고를 미루지 않고 당장 폐쇄했다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.","관계":"장세화의 호송 명령을 집행하고, 남호성의 제기동 의무호송과 구간을 나누며, 이홍원의 궤도기병과 북문 접속을 맞춘다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"교전을 피하도록 신호기를 전달하거나, 발포 명령을 위조한 쪽을 추적할 수 있다."},"biography":"2095-03-17생인 하세온은 낙관적인 상관의 공백을 현장에서 메운다. 적은 병력으로 긴 열차를 지키는 법을 안다.\n\n- 생업: 의료·화물 호송 인원 편성\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 경량 호송대장\n**생애.** 2095-03-17에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 경량 호송대장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 하세온의 의료·화물 호송 인원 편성 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 경량 호송대장. 호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 침수 구간 붕괴 보고를 미루지 않고 당장 폐쇄했다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 장세화의 호송 명령을 집행하고, 남호성의 제기동 의무호송과 구간을 나누며, 이홍원의 궤도기병과 북문 접속을 맞춘다.\n\n**개입.** 교전을 피하도록 신호기를 전달하거나, 발포 명령을 위조한 쪽을 추적할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 45 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −35 | 과시 10 | 지속 −5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"하세온","type":"지휘","to":"장세화","basis":"경량 호송 명령을 집행"}],"incoming":[{"from":"감국","type":"지휘","to":"하세온","basis":"하세온의 지휘로 외곽로를 돌고"},{"from":"석봄우","type":"계약","to":"하세온","basis":"하세온의 호송대와 인파 줄을 나누고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0302', 'acfd-d604-d48d', '{"id":"person-0302","name":"Gwak Taesan","title":"Medical Train Defense Commander","position":"Medical Train Defense Commander","characterId":"K301","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Medical Train Car Key · Weapons Locker Seal Management","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-gwaktaesan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0302","birthDate":"2086-05-03","birthday":"05-03","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":9,"effective":9}},"skills":[{"id":"k301-night-intrusion-restraint","name":"Night intrusion restraint","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k301-priority","name":"Restrained defense","description":"Gwak Taesan caught a night intruder and changed the token. Patient-car protection and separated keys keep defense from overshadowing escort.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Train Defense Commander. He kept the car keys and the weapons-box seal in separate custody and conducted searches only under the passage examiner''s attendance.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Shared the sealing attendance with Mun Sion, guarded Jeon Miri''s patient cars, and suspected the officer network Bae Woojin had planted.","effects":[]},{"id":"k301-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Train Defense Commander. He kept the car keys and the weapons-box seal in separate custody and conducted searches only under the passage examiner''s attendance.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Shared the sealing attendance with Mun Sion, guarded Jeon Miri''s patient cars, and suspected the officer network Bae Woojin had planted.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Gwak Taesan caught a night intruder and changed the token. Patient-car protection and separated keys keep defense from overshadowing escort.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"acfd-d604-d48d","name":"Hyeonpung Gwak Clan","crest":"clan-crests/acfd-d604-d48d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":20,"Force":-5,"Material":5,"Communal":20,"Principle":20,"Public":10,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":5,"Display":5,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical Train Car Key · Weapons Locker Seal Management","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Medical Train Defense Commander","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 20 | Force −5 | Material 5 | Community 20 | Principle 20 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 35 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 5 | Display 5 | Persistence 25 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2086-05-03. Raised at the Amsa guard post. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Medical Train Guard Captain, and the post handover record still notes that the post opened up after an unauthorized night river crossing was caught.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift, maintenance, transit inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk is proposed as the reference post for Gwak Taesan''s work managing medical train car keys and armory seals. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records, and it does not confirm operating trains, new facilities, armament, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Train Defense Commander. Keeps the car keys and the armory seals stored separately, and conducts searches only in the presence of a transit inspector.","Anecdote":"In 2125 he caught an unauthorized night crosser and replaced the guard cipher tags. That record remained as a basis for cross-checking at the next shift.","Relationships":"Shares seal witnessing with Mun Sion, protects Jeon Miri''s patient car, and is wary of the officer connections Bae Ujin has planted.","Ambition":"Wants to set the rotation so that one escort sees each winter patient transport through to the end, ending the handover breaks that happen when escorts change midway.","Fear":"","Intervention":"You can find the missing duty officer, or swap the armory seal and pin the incident on Amsa-side tampering."},"biography":"Born on 2086-05-03, Gwak Taesan is taciturn and blocks access to the cars with his own body. He dislikes the guard standing out more than the escort corps.\n\n- Livelihood: Medical Train Car Key · Weapons Locker Seal Management\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Medical Train Defense Commander\n**Life.** Born on 2086-05-03. Raised at the Amsa guard post. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Medical Train Guard Captain, and the post handover record still notes that the post opened up after an unauthorized night river crossing was caught.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift, maintenance, transit inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk is proposed as the reference post for Gwak Taesan''s work managing medical train car keys and armory seals. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records, and it does not confirm operating trains, new facilities, armament, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Train Defense Commander. Keeps the car keys and the armory seals stored separately, and conducts searches only in the presence of a transit inspector.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 he caught an unauthorized night crosser and replaced the guard cipher tags. That record remained as a basis for cross-checking at the next shift.\n\n**Relationships.** Shares seal witnessing with Mun Sion, protects Jeon Miri''s patient car, and is wary of the officer connections Bae Ujin has planted.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants to set the rotation so that one escort sees each winter patient transport through to the end, ending the handover breaks that happen when escorts change midway.\n\n**Intervention.** You can find the missing duty officer, or swap the armory seal and pin the incident on Amsa-side tampering.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 20 | Force −5 | Material 5 | Community 20 | Principle 20 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 35 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 5 | Display 5 | Persistence 25 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gwak Taesan","type":"Oath","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Share the witnessing of the medical train seal"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Nam Ramwon","type":"Contract","to":"Gwak Taesan","basis":"Nam Ramwon hands Gwak Taesan the patient car and escort car of the medical convoy, along with the times the escort was absent. Gwak Taesan checks the car keys and the armory seals separately so that taking over the escort does not get mixed up with taking over the patients."},{"from":"Gukgam","type":"Command","to":"Gwak Taesan","basis":"Takes charge of the guard depot under Gwak Taesan''s command, and"},{"from":"Tak Mireu","type":"Contract","to":"Gwak Taesan","basis":"Syncs times with Gwak Taesan''s guard duty shifts"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0302","name":"곽태산","title":"의료열차 수비대장","position":"의료열차 수비대장","characterId":"K301","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-곽태산","detailRoute":"/people/person-0302","birthDate":"2086-05-03","birthday":"05-03","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":9,"effective":9}},"skills":[{"id":"k301-night-intrusion-restraint","name":"야간 침입 제지","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k301-priority","name":"수비의 절제","description":"곽태산은 야간 침입자를 붙잡고 암호패를 갈았다. 환자 칸 보호와 열쇠 분리로 수비가 호송을 압도하지 않게 한다.","behavior":"칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.","stress":"","relationship":"문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유하고, 전미리의 환자 칸을 지키며, 배우진이 심은 장교 인맥을 의심한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k301-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 의료열차 수비대장. 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유하고, 전미리의 환자 칸을 지키며, 배우진이 심은 장교 인맥을 의심한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"곽태산은 야간 침입자를 붙잡고 암호패를 갈았다. 환자 칸 보호와 열쇠 분리로 수비가 호송을 압도하지 않게 한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"acfd-d604-d48d","name":"현풍 곽씨","crest":"clan-crests/acfd-d604-d48d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":20,"무력":-5,"물질":5,"공동":20,"원칙":20,"공개":10,"자격":25,"분산":35,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":40,"위험":5,"과시":5,"지속":25,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"의료열차 수비대장","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 20 | 무력 −5 | 물질 5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 20 | 공개 10 | 자격 25 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 40 | 위험 5 | 과시 5 | 지속 25 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2086-05-03에 태어났다. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료열차 수비대장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 곽태산의 의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 의료열차 수비대장. 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.","일화":"2125년 야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡아 경비 암호패를 갈았다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.","관계":"문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유하고, 전미리의 환자 칸을 지키며, 배우진이 심은 장교 인맥을 의심한다.","야망":"겨울 환자 이송 호송을 한 사람이 끝까지 맡도록 교대 순서를 정해, 도중에 호송원이 바뀌어 인계가 끊기는 일을 없애려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 무기함 봉인을 바꿔 사건을 암사 쪽 조작으로 몰 수 있다."},"biography":"2086-05-03생인 곽태산은 과묵하고 칸 출입을 몸으로 막는다. 수비대가 호송대보다 눈에 띄는 것을 싫어한다.\n\n- 생업: 의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 의료열차 수비대장\n**생애.** 2086-05-03에 태어났다. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료열차 수비대장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 곽태산의 의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 의료열차 수비대장. 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡아 경비 암호패를 갈았다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유하고, 전미리의 환자 칸을 지키며, 배우진이 심은 장교 인맥을 의심한다.\n\n**야망.** 겨울 환자 이송 호송을 한 사람이 끝까지 맡도록 교대 순서를 정해, 도중에 호송원이 바뀌어 인계가 끊기는 일을 없애려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 무기함 봉인을 바꿔 사건을 암사 쪽 조작으로 몰 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 20 | 무력 −5 | 물질 5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 20 | 공개 10 | 자격 25 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 40 | 위험 5 | 과시 5 | 지속 25 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"곽태산","type":"맹세","to":"문시온","basis":"의료열차 봉인 입회를 공유"}],"incoming":[{"from":"남람원","type":"계약","to":"곽태산","basis":"남람원은 의료호송의 환자 칸과 호위 칸, 호위가 빠진 시각을 곽태산에게 넘긴다. 곽태산은 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 따로 확인해 호위 인수가 환자 인수로 섞이지 않게 한다."},{"from":"국감","type":"지휘","to":"곽태산","basis":"곽태산의 지휘로 수비창을 맡고"},{"from":"탁미르","type":"계약","to":"곽태산","basis":"곽태산의 수비 당직과 시각을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0303', 'c18c-c9c4-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0303","name":"So Dugam","title":"Siding Mechanic, An Dohan''s Deputy","position":"Siding Mechanic, An Dohan''s Deputy","characterId":"K302","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Siding Dispatch Schedule · Maintenance Log Cross-check","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-so-dugam","detailRoute":"/people/person-0303","birthDate":"2101-11-10","birthday":"11-10","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k302-coupler-maintenance","name":"Coupler maintenance","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k302-priority","name":"Requires maintenance signatures","description":"Sodugam locked the release switch after weapons were found and maintains couplers. Dispatch approval cannot replace maintenance.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Siding Mechanic, An Dohan''s Deputy. He pasted the dispatch sheet and the maintenance log on one chalkboard and honored the medical train''s priority only when Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp and his maintenance signature stood together.","stress":"Fear. That an unchecked escort vehicle would depart as it was and stall in the middle of the tunnel.","relationship":"Relations. Received An Dohan''s dispatch work at the siding and shared the depot duty and tools with Guk So. Tuned the couplers to I Hongwon''s northern wheel-exchange hours.","effects":[]},{"id":"k302-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Siding Mechanic, An Dohan''s Deputy. He pasted the dispatch sheet and the maintenance log on one chalkboard and honored the medical train''s priority only when Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp and his maintenance signature stood together.","stress":"Fear. That an unchecked escort vehicle would depart as it was and stall in the middle of the tunnel.","relationship":"Relations. Received An Dohan''s dispatch work at the siding and shared the depot duty and tools with Guk So. Tuned the couplers to I Hongwon''s northern wheel-exchange hours.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Sodugam locked the release switch after weapons were found and maintains couplers. Dispatch approval cannot replace maintenance.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c18c-c9c4-c8fc","name":"Jinju So Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c18c-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":30,"Force":-25,"Material":15,"Communal":20,"Principle":5,"Public":30,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":-35,"Display":-25,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Siding Dispatch Schedule · Maintenance Log Cross-check","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Siding Mechanic, An Dohan''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −25 | Material 15 | Community 20 | Principle 5 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 40 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly 30 | Risk −35 | Display −25 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2101-11-10. Raised at the Sinjeong rail depot. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Siding Mechanic and An Dohan''s working-level aide, and the post handover record still notes that the post opened up after a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift, maintenance, transit inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk is proposed as the reference post for So Dugam''s work cross-checking siding dispatch sheets and maintenance logs. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records, and it does not confirm operating trains, new facilities, armament, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Siding Mechanic, An Dohan''s Deputy. Posts the dispatch sheet and the maintenance log on the same board, and recognizes medical train priority only when Jang Sehwa''s departmental seal and the maintenance signature are both present.","Anecdote":"When Amsa-made weapons turned up on a medical train, he sealed off the siding maintenance shop and locked the dispatch switch.","Relationships":"Takes over An Dohan''s dispatch duties at the siding, and shares depot duty and tools with Guk So. Services the couplers to match the time of Yi Hongwon''s northern wheel swap.","Ambition":"He means to open the maintenance of the Sinnae Depot''s stabling tracks with a maintenance signature, not on the dispatch crew''s say-so alone.","Fear":"That an unchecked escort vehicle departs as it is and stalls in the middle of the tunnel.","Intervention":"He can verify the real cargo on the sealed stabling track, or expose a release made with a forged maintenance signature."},"biography":"Born 2101-11-10, Sodugam cannot stand blanks in a timetable and remembers releases that skipped the brakes and couplers as an insult. He refuses any talk that dresses up delays on remote lines as political ranking.\n\n- Livelihood: Siding Dispatch Schedule · Maintenance Log Cross-check\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Siding Mechanic, An Dohan''s Deputy\n**Life.** Born on 2101-11-10. Raised at the Sinjeong rail depot. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Siding Mechanic and An Dohan''s working-level aide, and the post handover record still notes that the post opened up after a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift, maintenance, transit inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk is proposed as the reference post for So Dugam''s work cross-checking siding dispatch sheets and maintenance logs. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records, and it does not confirm operating trains, new facilities, armament, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Siding Mechanic, An Dohan''s Deputy. Posts the dispatch sheet and the maintenance log on the same board, and recognizes medical train priority only when Jang Sehwa''s departmental seal and the maintenance signature are both present.\n\n**Anecdote.** When Amsa-made weapons turned up on a medical train, he sealed off the siding maintenance shop and locked the dispatch switch.\n\n**Relations.** Takes over An Dohan''s dispatch duties at the siding, and shares depot duty and tools with Guk So. Services the couplers to match the time of Yi Hongwon''s northern wheel swap.\n\n**Ambition.** He means to open the maintenance of the Sinnae Depot''s stabling tracks with a maintenance signature, not on the dispatch crew''s say-so alone.\n\n**Fear.** That an unchecked escort vehicle departs as it is and stalls in the middle of the tunnel.\n\n**Intervention.** He can verify the real cargo on the sealed stabling track, or expose a release made with a forged maintenance signature.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −25 | Material 15 | Communal 20 | Principle 5 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 30 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk −35 | Display −25 | Persistence 20 | Orientation: same-sex | Union: contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"So Dugam","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"taking over An Dohan''s dispatch work at the holding track, and"},{"from":"So Dugam","type":"Contract","to":"Guk So","basis":"Shares tools with Guk So''s depot duty"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Min Gang-hyeon","type":"Contract","to":"So Dugam","basis":"Min Ganghyeon tells Sodugam the times the escort-duty cars stayed on the stabling track. Sodugam checks the dispatch sheet and maintenance log to distinguish time held for maintenance from the actual release time."},{"from":"Guk So","type":"Contract","to":"So Dugam","basis":"Shares duty with Sodugam''s maintenance bay, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0303","name":"소두감","title":"유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자","position":"유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K302","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"유치선 배차표·정비 일지 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-소두감","detailRoute":"/people/person-0303","birthDate":"2101-11-10","birthday":"11-10","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k302-coupler-maintenance","name":"연결기 정비","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k302-priority","name":"정비 서명 필요","description":"소두감은 무기 발견 뒤 출고 스위치를 잠그고 연결기를 손본다. 배차 승인만으로 정비를 건너뛰는 것을 거부한다.","behavior":"배차표와 정비 일지를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인과 정비 서명이 함께 있을 때만 인정한다.","stress":"공포. 점검하지 않은 호송 차량이 그대로 출발해 터널 한가운데에서 멈추는 것.","relationship":"안도한의 배차 실무를 유치선에서 받고, 국소의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다. 이홍원의 북부 차륜 교환 시각에 맞춰 연결기를 손본다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k302-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자. 배차표와 정비 일지를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인과 정비 서명이 함께 있을 때만 인정한다.","stress":"공포. 점검하지 않은 호송 차량이 그대로 출발해 터널 한가운데에서 멈추는 것.","relationship":"관계. 안도한의 배차 실무를 유치선에서 받고, 국소의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다. 이홍원의 북부 차륜 교환 시각에 맞춰 연결기를 손본다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"소두감은 무기 발견 뒤 출고 스위치를 잠그고 연결기를 손본다. 배차 승인만으로 정비를 건너뛰는 것을 거부한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c18c-c9c4-c8fc","name":"진주 소씨","crest":"clan-crests/c18c-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":30,"무력":-25,"물질":15,"공동":20,"원칙":5,"공개":30,"자격":30,"분산":40,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":30,"위험":-35,"과시":-25,"지속":20,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"유치선 배차표·정비 일지 대조","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −25 | 물질 15 | 공동 20 | 원칙 5 | 공개 30 | 자격 30 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 30 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −25 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2101-11-10에 태어났다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 소두감의 유치선 배차표·정비 일지 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자. 배차표와 정비 일지를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인과 정비 서명이 함께 있을 때만 인정한다.","일화":"의료열차에서 암사에서 만든 무기가 나오자 유치선 정비창을 봉쇄하고 출고 스위치를 잠갔다.","관계":"안도한의 배차 실무를 유치선에서 받고, 국소의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다. 이홍원의 북부 차륜 교환 시각에 맞춰 연결기를 손본다.","야망":"신내 기지 유치선의 정비를 배차조 단독이 아니라 정비 서명과 함께 열려 한다.","공포":"공포. 점검하지 않은 호송 차량이 그대로 출발해 터널 한가운데에서 멈추는 것.","개입":"봉쇄된 유치선의 실제 화물을 확인하거나, 정비 서명을 위조한 출고를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"2101-11-10생인 소두감은 시각표의 빈칸을 참지 못하고, 제동과 연결기를 건너뛴 출고를 모욕처럼 기억한다. 말단 노선의 지연을 정치 순위로 포장하는 말을 거부한다.\n\n- 생업: 유치선 배차표·정비 일지 대조\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2101-11-10에 태어났다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 소두감의 유치선 배차표·정비 일지 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자. 배차표와 정비 일지를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인과 정비 서명이 함께 있을 때만 인정한다.\n\n**일화.** 의료열차에서 암사에서 만든 무기가 나오자 유치선 정비창을 봉쇄하고 출고 스위치를 잠갔다.\n\n**관계.** 안도한의 배차 실무를 유치선에서 받고, 국소의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다. 이홍원의 북부 차륜 교환 시각에 맞춰 연결기를 손본다.\n\n**야망.** 신내 기지 유치선의 정비를 배차조 단독이 아니라 정비 서명과 함께 열려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 공포. 점검하지 않은 호송 차량이 그대로 출발해 터널 한가운데에서 멈추는 것.\n\n**개입.** 봉쇄된 유치선의 실제 화물을 확인하거나, 정비 서명을 위조한 출고를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −25 | 물질 15 | 공동 20 | 원칙 5 | 공개 30 | 자격 30 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 30 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −25 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"소두감","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"안도한의 배차 실무를 유치선에서 받고"},{"from":"소두감","type":"계약","to":"국소","basis":"국소의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"민강현","type":"계약","to":"소두감","basis":"민강현은 의무호송의 유치선 체류 시각을 소두감에게 전한다. 소두감은 배차표와 정비 일지를 확인해 정비로 머문 시간과 실제 출고 시간을 구분한다."},{"from":"국소","type":"계약","to":"소두감","basis":"소두감의 정비 창과 당직을 나누고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0304', 'bcf5-ba74-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0304","name":"Bok Bong","title":"Transfer Relay Merchant","position":"Transfer Relay Merchant","characterId":"K303","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Transfer Cargo Intake Weight · Invoice Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-bokbong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0304","birthDate":"2071-11-24","birthday":"11-24","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k303-transfer-invoice-recording","name":"Transfer invoice recording","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k303-priority","name":"Waits for patient stability","description":"Bokbong aligns unloading with dispatch and does not sell empty slots before patient stability. The cause of invoice weight gaps is unknown.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Relay Merchant. Two witnesses reported intake weights, and she blocked the unloading of any invoice suspected of arms loading until the medical crew posted it.","stress":"Fear. That the headcount and cargo count on the waybill would not match and no one could tell who had dropped out during the escort.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the unloading order with An Dohan''s dispatch chalkboard. She sold no empty slots before Jeon Miri''s patient vitals were stable.","effects":[]},{"id":"k303-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Relay Merchant. Two witnesses reported intake weights, and she blocked the unloading of any invoice suspected of arms loading until the medical crew posted it.","stress":"Fear. That the headcount and cargo count on the waybill would not match and no one could tell who had dropped out during the escort.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the unloading order with An Dohan''s dispatch chalkboard. She sold no empty slots before Jeon Miri''s patient vitals were stable.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Bokbong aligns unloading with dispatch and does not sell empty slots before patient stability. The cause of invoice weight gaps is unknown.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"Bok Clan of Myeoncheon","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":40,"Force":-20,"Material":20,"Communal":10,"Principle":-10,"Public":25,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-30,"Display":-25,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Transfer Cargo Intake Weight · Invoice Verification","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Transfer Relay Merchant","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Material 20 | Communal 10 | Principle −10 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 15 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk −30 | Display −25 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: opposite-sex | Union: non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2071-11-24. Raised in the Sangam transmission room. At the 2126 opening she holds the duty of Transfer Relay Logistics Merchant; the post-succession record notes that the post opened with keeping the transmission going through a three-day blackout.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo separation, weight, invoice, price and public testimony record desk of Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Bokbong''s duty reference point for checking inbound weights and invoices of transfer freight. This is a proposal for cross-checking handover records in the winter, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, holdings or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Relay Merchant. Two witnesses observe the inbound weight, and any invoice suspected of carrying weapons has its unloading blocked until the medical team posts its notice.","Anecdote":"When Amsa-made weapons turned up on a medical train, the relay invoices of the same hour showed two gaps in weight.","Relationships":"She aligns An Dohan''s dispatch blackboard with the unloading order. She does not sell empty slots until Jeon Miri''s patient vitals have stabilized.","Ambition":"","Fear":"That the headcount and cargo count on the waybill do not match and no one can tell who dropped out during the escort.","Intervention":"She can make the gapped invoices public."},"biography":"Born 2071-11-24, Bokbong puts the weight on an invoice and the seal on a patient car on the same scale, and despises merchants who write escort fees in as a condition of passage. She fixes the unloading order well before the season''s shift change.\n\n- Occupation: Transfer Cargo Intake Weight · Invoice Verification\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Transfer Relay Merchant\n**Life.** Born on 2071-11-24. Raised in the Sangam transmission room. At the 2126 opening she holds the duty of Transfer Relay Logistics Merchant; the post-succession record notes that the post opened with keeping the transmission going through a three-day blackout.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo separation, weight, invoice, price and public testimony record desk of Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Bokbong''s duty reference point for checking inbound weights and invoices of transfer freight. This is a proposal for cross-checking handover records in the winter, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, holdings or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Relay Merchant. Two witnesses observe the inbound weight, and any invoice suspected of carrying weapons has its unloading blocked until the medical team posts its notice.\n\n**Anecdote.** When Amsa-made weapons turned up on a medical train, the relay invoices of the same hour showed two gaps in weight.\n\n**Relations.** She aligns An Dohan''s dispatch blackboard with the unloading order. She does not sell empty slots until Jeon Miri''s patient vitals have stabilized.\n\n**Fear.** That the headcount and cargo count on the waybill do not match and no one can tell who dropped out during the escort.\n\n**Intervention.** She can make the gapped invoices public.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Material 20 | Communal 10 | Principle −10 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk −30 | Display −25 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: opposite-sex | Union: non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bok Bong","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"aligning the unloading order with An Dohan''s dispatch blackboard, and"},{"from":"Bok Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Yong","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Yong Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Bong","basis":"Shares the unloading order and the queue with Bokbong"},{"from":"Bok Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Bong","basis":"Matches Bokbong''s relay invoices to market prices, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0304","name":"복봉","title":"환승 중계 물류상","position":"환승 중계 물류상","characterId":"K303","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"환승 화물 입고 중량·송장 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-복봉","detailRoute":"/people/person-0304","birthDate":"2071-11-24","birthday":"11-24","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k303-transfer-invoice-recording","name":"중계 송장 작성","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k303-priority","name":"환자 안정 전 대기","description":"복봉은 하역과 배차를 맞추고 환자 활력 전 빈 슬롯을 팔지 않는다. 송장 무게 공백의 범인은 미확인이다.","behavior":"입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 무기 적재가 의심되는 송장은 의료조 게시 전까지 하역을 막는다.","stress":"송장의 사람 수와 짐 수가 어긋나 호송 중 누가 빠졌는지 알 수 없게 되는 것.","relationship":"안도한의 배차 칠판과 하역 순서를 맞춘다. 전미리의 환자 활력이 안정되기 전에는 빈 슬롯을 팔지 않는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k303-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 중계 물류상. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 무기 적재가 의심되는 송장은 의료조 게시 전까지 하역을 막는다.","stress":"공포. 송장의 사람 수와 짐 수가 어긋나 호송 중 누가 빠졌는지 알 수 없게 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 안도한의 배차 칠판과 하역 순서를 맞춘다. 전미리의 환자 활력이 안정되기 전에는 빈 슬롯을 팔지 않는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"복봉은 하역과 배차를 맞추고 환자 활력 전 빈 슬롯을 팔지 않는다. 송장 무게 공백의 범인은 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"면천 복씨","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":40,"무력":-20,"물질":20,"공동":10,"원칙":-10,"공개":25,"자격":20,"분산":40,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":-20,"위험":-30,"과시":-25,"지속":-10,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"환승 화물 입고 중량·송장 확인","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"환승 중계 물류상","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 25 | 자격 20 | 분산 40 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2071-11-24에 태어났다. 상암 송신실에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 중계 물류상 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 정전 사흘 송신 유지로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 복봉의 환승 화물 입고 중량·송장 확인 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 중계 물류상. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 무기 적재가 의심되는 송장은 의료조 게시 전까지 하역을 막는다.","일화":"의료열차에서 암사에서 만든 무기가 나오자 같은 시각의 중계 송장에 무게 공백이 두 칸 있었다.","관계":"안도한의 배차 칠판과 하역 순서를 맞춘다. 전미리의 환자 활력이 안정되기 전에는 빈 슬롯을 팔지 않는다.","야망":"","공포":"송장의 사람 수와 짐 수가 어긋나 호송 중 누가 빠졌는지 알 수 없게 되는 것.","개입":"공백 송장을 공개할 수 있다."},"biography":"2071-11-24생인 복봉은 송장의 무게와 환자 칸의 봉인을 같은 저울에 올리고, 호송료를 통행 조건으로 적는 상인을 경멸한다. 계절 교대 전에 이미 하역 순서를 고쳐 둔다.\n\n- 생업: 환승 화물 입고 중량·송장 확인\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 환승 중계 물류상\n**생애.** 2071-11-24에 태어났다. 상암 송신실에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 중계 물류상 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 정전 사흘 송신 유지로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 복봉의 환승 화물 입고 중량·송장 확인 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 중계 물류상. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 무기 적재가 의심되는 송장은 의료조 게시 전까지 하역을 막는다.\n\n**일화.** 의료열차에서 암사에서 만든 무기가 나오자 같은 시각의 중계 송장에 무게 공백이 두 칸 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 안도한의 배차 칠판과 하역 순서를 맞춘다. 전미리의 환자 활력이 안정되기 전에는 빈 슬롯을 팔지 않는다.\n\n**공포.** 송장의 사람 수와 짐 수가 어긋나 호송 중 누가 빠졌는지 알 수 없게 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 공백 송장을 공개할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 25 | 자격 20 | 분산 40 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"복봉","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"안도한의 배차 칠판과 하역 순서를 맞추고"},{"from":"복봉","type":"계약","to":"복용","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"용봉","type":"계약","to":"복봉","basis":"복봉의 하역 순서와 줄을 나눈다"},{"from":"복용","type":"계약","to":"복봉","basis":"복봉의 중계 송장과 시세를 맞추고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0305', 'ad6d-b2f4-c591', '{"id":"person-0305","name":"Guk Yong","title":"Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Jeon Miri''s Deputy","position":"Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Jeon Miri''s Deputy","characterId":"K304","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Transfer Patient Severity · Transfer Time Record","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-gugyong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0305","birthDate":"2071-08-05","birthday":"08-05","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k304-stretcher-ordering","name":"Stretcher ordering","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k304-priority","name":"Extends duty","description":"Gukyong extended duty and refused dispatch rotation when crowds accumulated. Patient priority does not establish a completed medical escort system.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Jeon Miri''s Deputy. He pasted the severity table and transfer hours in the duty room and opened no car suspected of arms loading without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That the patient cars would be mistaken for munitions cars and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. Executed the stretcher order under Jeon Miri''s command and shared the medical crew''s duty room and sickbeds with Gam Mo.","effects":[]},{"id":"k304-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Jeon Miri''s Deputy. He pasted the severity table and transfer hours in the duty room and opened no car suspected of arms loading without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That the patient cars would be mistaken for munitions cars and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. Executed the stretcher order under Jeon Miri''s command and shared the medical crew''s duty room and sickbeds with Gam Mo.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Gukyong extended duty and refused dispatch rotation when crowds accumulated. Patient priority does not establish a completed medical escort system.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"Damyang Guk Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":60,"Force":-50,"Material":0,"Communal":20,"Principle":15,"Public":15,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":30,"Display":-10,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Transfer Patient Severity · Transfer Time Record","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Jeon Miri''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 60 | Force −50 | Material 0 | Communal 20 | Principle 15 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 10 | Dispersal 45 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 25 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk 30 | Display −10 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: opposite-sex | Union: monogamous marriage"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2071-08-05. Raised in the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Transfer Duty Medical Orderly and Practical Aide to Jeon Miri; the post-succession record notes that the post opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, passage-inspection, stretcher-handover and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Gugyong''s duty reference point for recording transfer patients'' severity and transport times. This is a proposal for cross-checking handover records in the winter, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, holdings or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Jeon Miri''s Deputy. Posts the triage chart and transfer times in the duty room, and does not open any car suspected of carrying weapons without an inspector present.","Anecdote":"When the southbound procession from Bukhansan Bogungmun piled up on the Sinnae platform, he extended his duty shift and refused the dispatch crew''s shift change.","Relationships":"Under Jeon Miri''s command he enforces the stretcher order, and shares the duty room and sickbeds with Gam Mo''s medical team.","Ambition":"He wants to tie the emergency transfers coming in from Jungnang and Mangu into a single escort run to the Jegi-dong hospital, so that patients are handed over without a break from the duty room, even on midwinter nights.","Fear":"That a patient car is mistaken for a military supply car and the entire escort convoy is disarmed.","Intervention":"He can cross-check the patient roster against the weapons loading records, or copy a draft medical escort permit in the duty room."},"biography":"Born 2071-08-05, Gugyong looks at the grade of injury first. He trusts stretcher order, and does not accept the dispatch crew''s demand for empty slots until vitals have stabilized.\n\n- Livelihood: Transfer Patient Severity · Transfer Time Record\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Jeon Miri''s Deputy\n**Life.** Born on 2071-08-05. Raised in the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Transfer Duty Medical Orderly and Practical Aide to Jeon Miri; the post-succession record notes that the post opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, passage-inspection, stretcher-handover and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Gugyong''s duty reference point for recording transfer patients'' severity and transport times. This is a proposal for cross-checking handover records in the winter, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, holdings or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Jeon Miri''s Deputy. Posts the triage chart and transfer times in the duty room, and does not open any car suspected of carrying weapons without an inspector present.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the southbound procession from Bukhansan Bogungmun piled up on the Sinnae platform, he extended his duty shift and refused the dispatch crew''s shift change.\n\n**Relations.** Under Jeon Miri''s command he enforces the stretcher order, and shares the duty room and sickbeds with Gam Mo''s medical team.\n\n**Ambition.** He wants to tie the emergency transfers coming in from Jungnang and Mangu into a single escort run to the Jegi-dong hospital, so that patients are handed over without a break from the duty room, even on midwinter nights.\n\n**Fear.** That a patient car is mistaken for a military supply car and the entire escort convoy is disarmed.\n\n**Intervention.** He can cross-check the patient roster against the weapons loading records, or copy a draft medical escort permit in the duty room.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 60 | Force −50 | Material 0 | Communal 20 | Principle 15 | Disclosure 15 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk 30 | Display −10 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: Monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Guk Yong","type":"Command","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"carrying out the stretcher order under Jeon Miri''s command, and"},{"from":"Guk Yong","type":"Command","to":"Gammo","basis":"Shares the duty room and beds with Gammo''s medical squad"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gammo","type":"Command","to":"Guk Yong","basis":"Shares the stretcher order and beds with Gugyong"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0305","name":"국용","title":"환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자","position":"환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K304","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"환승 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-국용","detailRoute":"/people/person-0305","birthDate":"2071-08-05","birthday":"08-05","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k304-stretcher-ordering","name":"들것 순서 집행","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k304-priority","name":"당직을 연장함","description":"국용은 행렬이 쌓이자 당직을 연장하고 배차 교대를 거부했다. 환자 우선이지만 완료된 의료호송 제도는 아니다.","behavior":"중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실에 붙이고, 무기 적재 의심 칸은 심사관 입회 없이 열지 않는다.","stress":"환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"전미리의 지휘로 들것 순서를 집행하고, 감모의 의료조 당직실과 병상을 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k304-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실에 붙이고, 무기 적재 의심 칸은 심사관 입회 없이 열지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전미리의 지휘로 들것 순서를 집행하고, 감모의 의료조 당직실과 병상을 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"국용은 행렬이 쌓이자 당직을 연장하고 배차 교대를 거부했다. 환자 우선이지만 완료된 의료호송 제도는 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"담양 국씨","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":60,"무력":-50,"물질":0,"공동":20,"원칙":15,"공개":15,"자격":10,"분산":45,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-20,"위험":30,"과시":-10,"지속":10,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"환승 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 60 | 무력 −50 | 물질 0 | 공동 20 | 원칙 15 | 공개 15 | 자격 10 | 분산 45 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2071-08-05에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 국용의 환승 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실에 붙이고, 무기 적재 의심 칸은 심사관 입회 없이 열지 않는다.","일화":"북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 신내 승강장에 쌓이자 당직을 연장하고 배차조 교대를 거부했다.","관계":"전미리의 지휘로 들것 순서를 집행하고, 감모의 의료조 당직실과 병상을 나눈다.","야망":"중랑·망우에서 들어오는 응급 이송을 제기동 병원으로 가는 호송 한 건으로 묶어, 한겨울 밤에도 당직실에서 환자를 끊김 없이 넘기려 한다.","공포":"환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","개입":"환자 명부와 무기 적재 기록을 대조하거나, 의료 호송증 초안을 당직실에서 복사할 수 있다."},"biography":"2071-08-05생인 국용은 부상 등급을 먼저 본다. 들것 순서를 믿고, 배차조의 빈 슬롯 요구를 활력이 안정되기 전에는 받지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 환승 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2071-08-05에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 국용의 환승 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실에 붙이고, 무기 적재 의심 칸은 심사관 입회 없이 열지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 신내 승강장에 쌓이자 당직을 연장하고 배차조 교대를 거부했다.\n\n**관계.** 전미리의 지휘로 들것 순서를 집행하고, 감모의 의료조 당직실과 병상을 나눈다.\n\n**야망.** 중랑·망우에서 들어오는 응급 이송을 제기동 병원으로 가는 호송 한 건으로 묶어, 한겨울 밤에도 당직실에서 환자를 끊김 없이 넘기려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.\n\n**개입.** 환자 명부와 무기 적재 기록을 대조하거나, 의료 호송증 초안을 당직실에서 복사할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 60 | 무력 −50 | 물질 0 | 공동 20 | 원칙 15 | 공개 15 | 자격 10 | 분산 45 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"국용","type":"지휘","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 지휘로 들것 순서를 집행하고"},{"from":"국용","type":"지휘","to":"감모","basis":"감모의 의료조 당직실과 병상을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"감모","type":"지휘","to":"국용","basis":"국용의 들것 순서와 병상을 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0306', 'ac10-cc3d-c6d0', '{"id":"person-0306","name":"Gam Guk","title":"Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Ha Seon''s Deputy","position":"Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Ha Seon''s Deputy","characterId":"K305","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Outer Escort Roster · Firing Authority Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-gamguk","detailRoute":"/people/person-0306","birthDate":"2082-07-04","birthday":"07-04","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":7,"effective":7}},"skills":[{"id":"k305-escort-patrol-allocation","name":"Escort patrol allocation","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k305-priority","name":"Rejects boasts about firing","description":"Gamguk distributes personnel by car and blocks fire before sealed orders.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Ha Seon''s Deputy. She mixed convoy personnel into the medical cars and the freight cars and gave no firing authority before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the outer road under Ha Seon''s command and confirmed Mun Sion''s examination-stand seals on the road. ","effects":[]},{"id":"k305-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Ha Seon''s Deputy. She mixed convoy personnel into the medical cars and the freight cars and gave no firing authority before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the outer road under Ha Seon''s command and confirmed Mun Sion''s examination-stand seals on the road. ","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Gamguk distributes personnel by car and blocks fire before sealed orders.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ac10-cc3d-c6d0","name":"Changwon Gam Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ac10-cc3d-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":35,"Force":-15,"Material":5,"Communal":20,"Principle":0,"Public":25,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-35,"Display":20,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Outer Escort Roster · Firing Authority Verification","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Ha Seon''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 35 | Force −15 | Material 5 | Communal 20 | Principle 0 | Disclosure 25 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk −35 | Display 20 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2082-07-04. Raised at the Amsa guard post. At the 2126 opening she holds the duty post of Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Working-Level Aide to Ha Seon, and the post handover record still notes that the post opened through catching an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- The record desk of Sinnae 1-dong, covering dispatch, shift changes, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handovers and duty keys, is proposed as the service reference point for Gamguk''s verification of outer escort headcount and firing authority. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the winter; it does not fix running trains, new facilities, armaments, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Ha Seon''s Deputy. Mixes escort personnel between medical cars and freight cars, and grants no firing authority before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Patrols the outer road under Ha Seon''s command, and checks Mun Sion''s screening-desk seals on the road. ","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can pass along signal flags to avoid combat, or trace the party that forged the firing order."},"biography":"Born 2082-07-04, Gamguk fills in on site for the vacancy left by an optimistic superior, and knows the silence of guarding a long train with few troops. She takes anyone who boasts of firing off the escort.\n\n- Livelihood: Outer Escort Roster · Firing Authority Verification\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Ha Seon''s Deputy\n**Life.** Born on 2082-07-04. Raised at the Amsa guard post. At the 2126 opening she holds the duty post of Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Working-Level Aide to Ha Seon, and the post handover record still notes that the post opened through catching an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- The record desk of Sinnae 1-dong, covering dispatch, shift changes, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handovers and duty keys, is proposed as the service reference point for Gamguk''s verification of outer escort headcount and firing authority. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the winter; it does not fix running trains, new facilities, armaments, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Ha Seon''s Deputy. Mixes escort personnel between medical cars and freight cars, and grants no firing authority before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.\n\n**Relations.** Patrols the outer road under Ha Seon''s command, and checks Mun Sion''s screening-desk seals on the road. \n\n**Intervention.** Can pass along signal flags to avoid combat, or trace the party that forged the firing order.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 35 | Force −15 | Material 5 | Communal 20 | Principle 0 | Disclosure 25 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk −35 | Display 20 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gam Guk","type":"Command","to":"Ha Seon","basis":"Circle the outer road under Ha Seon''s command, and"},{"from":"Gam Guk","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Verify Mun Sion''s inspection post seal on the road"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0306","name":"감국","title":"동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자","position":"동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K305","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"외곽 호송 인원·발포 권한 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-감국","detailRoute":"/people/person-0306","birthDate":"2082-07-04","birthday":"07-04","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":7,"effective":7}},"skills":[{"id":"k305-escort-patrol-allocation","name":"호송 순찰 배치","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k305-priority","name":"발포 자랑 거부","description":"감국은 칸별 인원을 나누고 봉인 명령 전 발포를 막는다.","behavior":"호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"하세온의 지휘로 외곽로를 돌고, 문시온의 심사대 봉인을 길에서 확인한다. ","effects":[]},{"id":"k305-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자. 호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 하세온의 지휘로 외곽로를 돌고, 문시온의 심사대 봉인을 길에서 확인한다. ","effects":[]}],"narrative":"감국은 칸별 인원을 나누고 봉인 명령 전 발포를 막는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ac10-cc3d-c6d0","name":"창원 감씨","crest":"clan-crests/ac10-cc3d-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":35,"무력":-15,"물질":5,"공동":20,"원칙":0,"공개":25,"자격":20,"분산":45,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-15,"위험":-35,"과시":20,"지속":40,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"외곽 호송 인원·발포 권한 확인","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 35 | 무력 −15 | 물질 5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 25 | 자격 20 | 분산 45 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 20 | 지속 40 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2082-07-04에 태어났다. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 감국의 외곽 호송 인원·발포 권한 확인 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자. 호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.","일화":"","관계":"하세온의 지휘로 외곽로를 돌고, 문시온의 심사대 봉인을 길에서 확인한다. ","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"교전을 피하도록 신호기를 전달하거나, 발포 명령을 위조한 쪽을 추적할 수 있다."},"biography":"2082-07-04생인 감국은 낙관적인 상관의 공백을 현장에서 메우고, 적은 병력으로 긴 열차를 지키는 침묵을 안다. 발포를 자랑하는 사람을 호송에서 내린다.\n\n- 생업: 외곽 호송 인원·발포 권한 확인\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2082-07-04에 태어났다. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 감국의 외곽 호송 인원·발포 권한 확인 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자. 호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.\n\n**관계.** 하세온의 지휘로 외곽로를 돌고, 문시온의 심사대 봉인을 길에서 확인한다. \n\n**개입.** 교전을 피하도록 신호기를 전달하거나, 발포 명령을 위조한 쪽을 추적할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 35 | 무력 −15 | 물질 5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 25 | 자격 20 | 분산 45 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 20 | 지속 40 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"감국","type":"지휘","to":"하세온","basis":"하세온의 지휘로 외곽로를 돌고"},{"from":"감국","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온의 심사대 봉인을 길에서 확인한다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0307', 'b450-b450-b989', '{"id":"person-0307","name":"Du Bok","title":"Seasonal Rotation Messenger, Jeon Miri''s Deputy","position":"Seasonal Rotation Messenger, Jeon Miri''s Deputy","characterId":"K306","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Seasonal Rotation Notice · Patient Vital Signs Record","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-dubok","detailRoute":"/people/person-0307","birthDate":"2066-08-08","birthday":"08-08","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k306-shift-notice-recording","name":"Shift notice recording","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k306-priority","name":"Preserves approval order","description":"Dubok posts shift seals to both boards simultaneously and preserves inspection refusals. Actual movements for the missing two times remain unknown.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Seasonal Rotation Messenger, Jeon Miri''s Deputy. He wrote the rotation notices and the patient vital table in the same ledger and pasted bought notes on the duty-room door.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Carried the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan by note and pasted Jang Sehwa''s seasonal rotation stamp on both chalkboards at once. Left Mun Sion''s examination refusal as courier copies.","effects":[]},{"id":"k306-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Seasonal Rotation Messenger, Jeon Miri''s Deputy. He wrote the rotation notices and the patient vital table in the same ledger and pasted bought notes on the duty-room door.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Carried the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan by note and pasted Jang Sehwa''s seasonal rotation stamp on both chalkboards at once. Left Mun Sion''s examination refusal as courier copies.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Dubok posts shift seals to both boards simultaneously and preserves inspection refusals. Actual movements for the missing two times remain unknown.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b450-b450-b989","name":"Dureung Du Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b450-b450-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":40,"Force":-30,"Material":5,"Communal":20,"Principle":5,"Public":25,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":35,"Display":5,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Seasonal Rotation Notice · Patient Vital Signs Record","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Seasonal Rotation Messenger, Jeon Miri''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 40 | Force −30 | Material 5 | Communal 20 | Principle 5 | Disclosure 25 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk 35 | Display 5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2066-08-08. Raised on the Sinnae transfer watch. At the opening of 2126, he holds the post of Seasonal Shift Courier and Jeon Miri''s Working-Level Aide; the post handover record notes that it opened with halting a ticketless departing train.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Dubok''s duty reference point for seasonal shift notices and patient vital records. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Seasonal Rotation Messenger, Jeon Miri''s Deputy. Writes shift notices and patient vital charts in the same ledger, and posts bribed slips on the duty-room door.","Anecdote":"Right after the discovery of weapons on the medical train, two time slots that were absent from the shift slips appeared.","Relationships":"Carries notes on the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan, and posts Jang Sehwa''s seasonal shift seal on both blackboards at the same time. Keeps Mun Sion''s screening refusals as messenger copies.","Ambition":"Aims to keep the seasonal shifts of the dispatch team and the medical team on a fixed courier route so that escort fees outside the route license cannot buy the order of approvals.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can expose the bribed slip, or fix medical-team-first shifts on the courier route."},"biography":"Dubok, born 2066-08-08, remembers approval shift slips down to the minute and never alters the dispatch table before moving a verbal approval into the courier ledger. If the medical team''s and dispatch team''s orders are crammed onto a single sheet, he snaps his chalk.\n\n- Livelihood: Seasonal Rotation Notice · Patient Vital Signs Record\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Seasonal Rotation Messenger, Jeon Miri''s Deputy\n**Life.** Born on 2066-08-08. Raised on the Sinnae transfer watch. At the opening of 2126, he holds the post of Seasonal Shift Courier and Jeon Miri''s Working-Level Aide; the post handover record notes that it opened with halting a ticketless departing train.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Dubok''s duty reference point for seasonal shift notices and patient vital records. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Seasonal Rotation Messenger, Jeon Miri''s Deputy. Writes shift notices and patient vital charts in the same ledger, and posts bribed slips on the duty-room door.\n\n**Anecdote.** Right after the discovery of weapons on the medical train, two time slots that were absent from the shift slips appeared.\n\n**Relations.** Carries notes on the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan, and posts Jang Sehwa''s seasonal shift seal on both blackboards at the same time. Keeps Mun Sion''s screening refusals as messenger copies.\n\n**Ambition.** Aims to keep the seasonal shifts of the dispatch team and the medical team on a fixed courier route so that escort fees outside the route license cannot buy the order of approvals.\n\n**Intervention.** Can expose the bribed slip, or fix medical-team-first shifts on the courier route.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 40 | Force −30 | Materialism 5 | Community 20 | Principle 5 | Transparency 25 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Longing 30 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 35 | Display 5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Du Bok","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"carrying notes about the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan, and"},{"from":"Du Bok","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"carrying notes about the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan, and"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0307","name":"두복","title":"계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자","position":"계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K306","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"계절 교대 통지·환자 활력 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-두복","detailRoute":"/people/person-0307","birthDate":"2066-08-08","birthday":"08-08","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k306-shift-notice-recording","name":"교대 통지 기록","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k306-priority","name":"승인 순서 보존","description":"두복은 교대 날인을 양쪽 칠판에 동시에 붙이고 심사 거부를 사본으로 남긴다. 없는 시각 두 칸의 실제 이동은 미확인이다.","behavior":"교대 통지와 환자 활력 표를 같은 원장에 적고, 매수된 쪽지는 당직실 문에 붙인다.","stress":"","relationship":"전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고, 장세화의 계절 교대 날인을 양쪽 칠판에 동시에 붙인다. 문시온의 심사 거부를 전령 사본으로 남긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k306-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자. 교대 통지와 환자 활력 표를 같은 원장에 적고, 매수된 쪽지는 당직실 문에 붙인다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고, 장세화의 계절 교대 날인을 양쪽 칠판에 동시에 붙인다. 문시온의 심사 거부를 전령 사본으로 남긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"두복은 교대 날인을 양쪽 칠판에 동시에 붙이고 심사 거부를 사본으로 남긴다. 없는 시각 두 칸의 실제 이동은 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b450-b450-b989","name":"두릉 두씨","crest":"clan-crests/b450-b450-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":40,"무력":-30,"물질":5,"공동":20,"원칙":5,"공개":25,"자격":25,"분산":45,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-10,"위험":35,"과시":5,"지속":0,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"계절 교대 통지·환자 활력 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 40 | 무력 −30 | 물질 5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 5 | 공개 25 | 자격 25 | 분산 45 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −10 | 위험 35 | 과시 5 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2066-08-08에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 두복의 계절 교대 통지·환자 활력 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자. 교대 통지와 환자 활력 표를 같은 원장에 적고, 매수된 쪽지는 당직실 문에 붙인다.","일화":"의료열차 무기 발견 직후 교대 쪽지에 없는 시각이 두 칸 생겼다.","관계":"전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고, 장세화의 계절 교대 날인을 양쪽 칠판에 동시에 붙인다. 문시온의 심사 거부를 전령 사본으로 남긴다.","야망":"배차조와 의료조의 계절 교대를 고정 전령로로 남겨 노선 면허 밖의 호송료가 결재 순서를 사지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"매수 쪽지를 공개하거나, 의료조 우선 교대를 전령로에 고정할 수 있다."},"biography":"2066-08-08생인 두복은 결재 교대 쪽지를 분 단위로 기억하고, 구두 승인을 전령 원장에 옮기기 전에 배차표를 고치지 않는다. 의료조와 배차조의 순서를 한 장에 몰면 분필을 꺾는다.\n\n- 생업: 계절 교대 통지·환자 활력 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2066-08-08에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 두복의 계절 교대 통지·환자 활력 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자. 교대 통지와 환자 활력 표를 같은 원장에 적고, 매수된 쪽지는 당직실 문에 붙인다.\n\n**일화.** 의료열차 무기 발견 직후 교대 쪽지에 없는 시각이 두 칸 생겼다.\n\n**관계.** 전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고, 장세화의 계절 교대 날인을 양쪽 칠판에 동시에 붙인다. 문시온의 심사 거부를 전령 사본으로 남긴다.\n\n**야망.** 배차조와 의료조의 계절 교대를 고정 전령로로 남겨 노선 면허 밖의 호송료가 결재 순서를 사지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 매수 쪽지를 공개하거나, 의료조 우선 교대를 전령로에 고정할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 40 | 무력 −30 | 물질 5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 5 | 공개 25 | 자격 25 | 분산 45 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −10 | 위험 35 | 과시 5 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"두복","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고"},{"from":"두복","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고"}],"incoming":[]}}');
