handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Northeast Outer Road Surveyor. Unsurveyed lines are left only as dotted lines.","Anecdote":"The trace of an Amsa officer skipping the Sinnae screening desk and entering through the base''s back gate was blank in both the sealed ledger and the map.","Relationships":"Hands the back-gate survey to Mun Sion, and posts the coordinates on Bongmo''s screening-desk base blackboard.","Ambition":"Aims to bind the Northeast Outer Road and the back-gate bypass to the public master plate so that the Amsa Escort Corps'' arbitrary searches cannot skip the screening desk.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can restore the back-gate coordinates."},"biography":"Bokgam, born 2078-02-12, heads feet first whenever he sees a closed dead-end track, and despises drawing bypasses from rumor alone. If a seal mark is even a day stale, he redraws the map.\n\n- Occupation: Northeast Outer Road Measured Line · Search Warrant Record\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Northeast Outer Road Surveyor\n**Life.** Born on 2078-02-12. Raised on the waiting-room watch. At the opening of 2126, he holds the post of Northeast Outer Road Surveyor; the post handover record notes that it opened with a substitute watch for an unexcused shift absence.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Bokgam''s duty reference point for Northeast Outer Road survey lines and search warrant records. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Northeast Outer Road Surveyor. Unsurveyed lines are left only as dotted lines.\n\n**Anecdote.** The trace of an Amsa officer skipping the Sinnae screening desk and entering through the base''s back gate was blank in both the sealed ledger and the map.\n\n**Relations.** Hands the back-gate survey to Mun Sion, and posts the coordinates on Bongmo''s screening-desk base blackboard.\n\n**Ambition.** Aims to bind the Northeast Outer Road and the back-gate bypass to the public master plate so that the Amsa Escort Corps'' arbitrary searches cannot skip the screening desk.\n\n**Intervention.** Can restore the back-gate coordinates.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Materialism 10 | Community 15 | Principle 5 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Longing 50 | Monopoly −40 | Risk 35 | Display −5 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: Fluid | Union: Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bok Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Hand the back-gate survey to Mun Sion, and"},{"from":"Bok Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Bong Mo","basis":"Posts the coordinates on Bongmo''s screening-desk base blackboard"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bong Mo","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Gam","basis":"Writes Bokgam''s back-gate survey on the same line"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0308","name":"복감","title":"동북 외곽로 탐사원","position":"동북 외곽로 탐사원","characterId":"K307","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"동북 외곽로 실측 선·검색 영장 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-복감","detailRoute":"/people/person-0308","birthDate":"2078-02-12","birthday":"02-12","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k307-outer-route-surveying","name":"외곽로 실측","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k307-priority","name":"지도와 봉인 대조","description":"복감은 후문을 실측하고 좌표를 공개 칠판에 넘긴다. 지도와 봉인 공백은 확인하지만 검색 우회를 막은 성공은 없다.","behavior":"실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남긴다.","stress":"","relationship":"문시온에게 후문 실측을 넘기고, 봉모의 심사대 거점 칠판에 좌표를 붙인다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k307-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 동북 외곽로 탐사원. 실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남긴다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 문시온에게 후문 실측을 넘기고, 봉모의 심사대 거점 칠판에 좌표를 붙인다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"복감은 후문을 실측하고 좌표를 공개 칠판에 넘긴다. 지도와 봉인 공백은 확인하지만 검색 우회를 막은 성공은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"면천 복씨","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":40,"무력":-20,"물질":10,"공동":15,"원칙":5,"공개":15,"자격":20,"분산":35,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":50,"독점":-40,"위험":35,"과시":-5,"지속":35,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"동북 외곽로 실측 선·검색 영장 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"동북 외곽로 탐사원","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 10 | 공동 15 | 원칙 5 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 35 | 변혁 20","욕망":"갈망 50 | 독점 −40 | 위험 35 | 과시 −5 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2078-02-12에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 동북 외곽로 탐사원 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 복감의 동북 외곽로 실측 선·검색 영장 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 동북 외곽로 탐사원. 실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남긴다.","일화":"암사 장교가 신내 심사대를 건너뛰고 기지 후문으로 들어온 흔적이 봉인 장부와 지도에서 동시에 비었다.","관계":"문시온에게 후문 실측을 넘기고, 봉모의 심사대 거점 칠판에 좌표를 붙인다.","야망":"동북 외곽로와 후문 우회로를 공개 원판에 묶어 암사 호위단의 임의 검색이 심사대를 건너뛰지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"후문 좌표를 복원할 수 있다."},"biography":"2078-02-12생인 복감은 닫힌 말단 선로를 보면 발부터 향하고, 소문만으로 우회로를 그리는 일을 경멸한다. 봉인 자국이 하루만 낡아도 지도를 다시 그린다.\n\n- 생업: 동북 외곽로 실측 선·검색 영장 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 동북 외곽로 탐사원\n**생애.** 2078-02-12에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 동북 외곽로 탐사원 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 복감의 동북 외곽로 실측 선·검색 영장 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 동북 외곽로 탐사원. 실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남긴다.\n\n**일화.** 암사 장교가 신내 심사대를 건너뛰고 기지 후문으로 들어온 흔적이 봉인 장부와 지도에서 동시에 비었다.\n\n**관계.** 문시온에게 후문 실측을 넘기고, 봉모의 심사대 거점 칠판에 좌표를 붙인다.\n\n**야망.** 동북 외곽로와 후문 우회로를 공개 원판에 묶어 암사 호위단의 임의 검색이 심사대를 건너뛰지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 후문 좌표를 복원할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 10 | 공동 15 | 원칙 5 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 35 | 변혁 20\n- 욕망: 갈망 50 | 독점 −40 | 위험 35 | 과시 −5 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"복감","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온에게 후문 실측을 넘기고"},{"from":"복감","type":"계약","to":"봉모","basis":"봉모의 심사대 거점 칠판에 좌표를 붙인다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"봉모","type":"계약","to":"복감","basis":"복감의 후문 실측을 같은 줄에 적는다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0309', 'bd09-d558-c74c', '{"id":"person-0309","name":"Bong Mo","title":"Passage Inspection Recorder, Mun Sion''s Deputy","position":"Passage Inspection Recorder, Mun Sion''s Deputy","characterId":"K308","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Passage Identity Fragment · Cargo Seal Record","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-bongmo","detailRoute":"/people/person-0309","birthDate":"2074-05-29","birthday":"05-29","age":52,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k308-inspection-ledger-recording","name":"Inspection ledger recording","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k308-priority","name":"Ledger independence","description":"Bongmo records identity and seals with rear-gate coordinates on the same line.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Passage Inspection Recorder, Mun Sion''s Deputy. She recorded identity slips and freight seals doubly.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Moved the examination ledger under Mun Sion''s command and wrote Bok Gam''s rear-gate measurements on the same line. Left Gwak Taesan''s car-sealing attendance at the ledger''s tail.","effects":[]},{"id":"k308-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Passage Inspection Recorder, Mun Sion''s Deputy. She recorded identity slips and freight seals doubly.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Moved the examination ledger under Mun Sion''s command and wrote Bok Gam''s rear-gate measurements on the same line. Left Gwak Taesan''s car-sealing attendance at the ledger''s tail.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Bongmo records identity and seals with rear-gate coordinates on the same line.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"Haeum Bong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":30,"Force":-25,"Material":-10,"Communal":10,"Principle":30,"Public":30,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-30,"Display":-40,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Passage Identity Fragment · Cargo Seal Record","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Passage Inspection Recorder, Mun Sion''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 30 | Force −25 | Materialism −10 | Community 10 | Principle 30 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Longing 5 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −30 | Display −40 | Persistence 30 | Orientation: Fluid | Union: Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2074-05-29. Grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. At the opening of 2126, Bongmo holds the duty post of Transit Inspection Recorder and Mun Sion''s Working-Level Deputy, and the record of taking over the post shows that it opened with the deletion of a single line from the dual ledger.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, transit inspection, stretcher handover and duty-key record desk is proposed as Bongmo''s duty reference point for transit identity shards and cargo seal records. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the winter, and it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armaments, transit tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Passage Inspection Recorder, Mun Sion''s Deputy. Records identity shards and cargo seals twice over.","Anecdote":"When traces from the depot''s rear gate were left in the seal ledger, a line was found missing from the inspection ledger.","Relationships":"Moves the screening ledger under Mun Sion''s command and writes Bokgam''s back-gate survey on the same line. Leaves Gwak Taesan''s witnessing of the car seal at the end of the ledger.","Ambition":"Seeks to use the northeast outer road inspection in order to cut the Amsa Escort Corps'' arbitrary searches out of the ledger.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can restore the missing line, or pull out an entry document that used an inspection refusal as its pretext."},"biography":"Born 2074-05-29, Bongmo speaks little and tenaciously cross-checks evidence. Holds in contempt the practice of turning escort-fee receipts into passes.\n\n- Livelihood: Passage Identity Fragment · Cargo Seal Record\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Passage Inspection Recorder, Mun Sion''s Deputy\n**Life.** Born 2074-05-29. Grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. At the opening of 2126, Bongmo holds the duty post of Transit Inspection Recorder and Mun Sion''s Working-Level Deputy, and the record of taking over the post shows that it opened with the deletion of a single line from the dual ledger.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, transit inspection, stretcher handover and duty-key record desk is proposed as Bongmo''s duty reference point for transit identity shards and cargo seal records. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the winter, and it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armaments, transit tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Passage Inspection Recorder, Mun Sion''s Deputy. Records identity shards and cargo seals twice over.\n\n**Anecdote.** When traces from the depot''s rear gate were left in the seal ledger, a line was found missing from the inspection ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Moves the screening ledger under Mun Sion''s command and writes Bokgam''s back-gate survey on the same line. Leaves Gwak Taesan''s witnessing of the car seal at the end of the ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** Seeks to use the northeast outer road inspection in order to cut the Amsa Escort Corps'' arbitrary searches out of the ledger.\n\n**Intervention.** Can restore the missing line, or pull out an entry document that used an inspection refusal as its pretext.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 30 | Force −25 | Materialism −10 | Community 10 | Principle 30 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Longing 5 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −30 | Display −40 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bong Mo","type":"Command","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Move the inspection ledger under Mun Sion''s command, and"},{"from":"Bong Mo","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Gam","basis":"Writes Bokgam''s back-gate survey on the same line"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bok Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Bong Mo","basis":"Posts the coordinates on Bongmo''s screening-desk base blackboard"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0309","name":"봉모","title":"통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자","position":"통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K308","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"통행 신분 조각·화물 봉인 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-봉모","detailRoute":"/people/person-0309","birthDate":"2074-05-29","birthday":"05-29","age":52,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k308-inspection-ledger-recording","name":"심사 원장 기록","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k308-priority","name":"원장의 독립","description":"봉모는 신분·봉인을 기록하고 후문 좌표를 같은 줄에 적는다.","behavior":"신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 기록한다.","stress":"","relationship":"문시온의 지휘로 심사 원장을 옮기고, 복감의 후문 실측을 같은 줄에 적는다. 곽태산의 칸 봉인 입회를 원장 말미에 남긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k308-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자. 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 기록한다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 문시온의 지휘로 심사 원장을 옮기고, 복감의 후문 실측을 같은 줄에 적는다. 곽태산의 칸 봉인 입회를 원장 말미에 남긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"봉모는 신분·봉인을 기록하고 후문 좌표를 같은 줄에 적는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"하음 봉씨","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":30,"무력":-25,"물질":-10,"공동":10,"원칙":30,"공개":30,"자격":15,"분산":45,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":-30,"위험":-30,"과시":-40,"지속":30,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"통행 신분 조각·화물 봉인 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 30 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −10 | 공동 10 | 원칙 30 | 공개 30 | 자격 15 | 분산 45 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −40 | 지속 30 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2074-05-29에 태어났다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 봉모의 통행 신분 조각·화물 봉인 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자. 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 기록한다.","일화":"기지 후문 흔적이 봉인 장부에 남자 심사 원장의 한 줄이 빠져 있었다.","관계":"문시온의 지휘로 심사 원장을 옮기고, 복감의 후문 실측을 같은 줄에 적는다. 곽태산의 칸 봉인 입회를 원장 말미에 남긴다.","야망":"동북 외곽로 심사로 암사 호위단의 임의 검색을 원장에서 끊으려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"빠진 줄을 복원하거나, 심사 거부를 구실로 한 진입 문서를 빼낼 수 있다."},"biography":"2074-05-29생인 봉모는 말수가 적고 증빙을 집요하게 대조한다. 호송료 영수증을 통행증으로 바꾸는 관행을 경멸한다.\n\n- 생업: 통행 신분 조각·화물 봉인 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2074-05-29에 태어났다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 봉모의 통행 신분 조각·화물 봉인 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자. 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 기록한다.\n\n**일화.** 기지 후문 흔적이 봉인 장부에 남자 심사 원장의 한 줄이 빠져 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 문시온의 지휘로 심사 원장을 옮기고, 복감의 후문 실측을 같은 줄에 적는다. 곽태산의 칸 봉인 입회를 원장 말미에 남긴다.\n\n**야망.** 동북 외곽로 심사로 암사 호위단의 임의 검색을 원장에서 끊으려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 빠진 줄을 복원하거나, 심사 거부를 구실로 한 진입 문서를 빼낼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 30 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −10 | 공동 10 | 원칙 30 | 공개 30 | 자격 15 | 분산 45 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −40 | 지속 30 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"봉모","type":"지휘","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온의 지휘로 심사 원장을 옮기고"},{"from":"봉모","type":"계약","to":"복감","basis":"복감의 후문 실측을 같은 줄에 적는다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"복감","type":"계약","to":"봉모","basis":"봉모의 심사대 거점 칠판에 좌표를 붙인다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0310', 'c6a9-d64d-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0310","name":"Yong Bong","title":"Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief","position":"Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief","characterId":"K309","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Platform Queue · Severity Chart Posting","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#character-yongbong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0310","birthDate":"2096-10-09","birthday":"10-09","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k309-platform-queue-allocation","name":"Platform queue allocation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k309-priority","name":"Distinguishes people queues","description":"Yongbong separates stretcher and unloading order at the platform. Weapon-box rumors are not confirmed loading.","behavior":"Office. Rank: clerk. Title: Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief. He pasted the platform queue and the severity table on one chalkboard and stood no armed waiting line without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That the platform piled with the southward column of Bukhansan Bogukmun would be mistaken for munitions unloading.","relationship":"Relations. Received Jeon Miri''s stretcher order at the platform and split the queue with Bok Bong''s unloading order. ","effects":[]},{"id":"k309-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: clerk. Title: Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief. He pasted the platform queue and the severity table on one chalkboard and stood no armed waiting line without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That the platform piled with the southward column of Bukhansan Bogukmun would be mistaken for munitions unloading.","relationship":"Relations. Received Jeon Miri''s stretcher order at the platform and split the queue with Bok Bong''s unloading order. ","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Yongbong separates stretcher and unloading order at the platform. Weapon-box rumors are not confirmed loading.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"Yong Clan of Hongcheon","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":35,"Force":-25,"Material":-5,"Communal":25,"Principle":10,"Public":20,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":10,"Display":-15,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Platform Queue · Severity Chart Posting","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 35 | Force −25 | Materialism −5 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Transparency 20 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 40 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Longing 10 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 10 | Display −15 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Plural"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2096-10-09. Grew up on the Sinnae transfer duty roster. At the opening of 2126, Yongbong holds the duty post of Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief, and the record of taking over the post shows that it opened with the stopping of an unticketed departing train.\n- The Sangbong 1-dong Mangu transfer queue, patient, cargo classification, weight, invoice, market price and public testimony record desk is proposed as Yongbong''s duty reference point for posting platform queues and triage tags. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the winter, and it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armaments, transit tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief. Posts the platform queues and triage tags on the same blackboard, and does not set up an armed queue without an inspector present.","Anecdote":"When the southbound column from Bukhansan Bogukmun piled up on the Sinnae platform, rumors spread that even the queue on the Mangu side held crates full of weapons.","Relationships":"Receives Jeon Miri''s stretcher order on the platform and separates the queue from Bokbong''s unloading order. ","Ambition":"","Fear":"That the platform, crowded with the southbound column from Bukhansan Bogukmun, will be mistaken for a military unloading site.","Intervention":"Can have platform cargo inspected publicly, or separate the patient queue from the military supply queue."},"biography":"Born 2096-10-09, Yongbong remembers delays on the minor lines as an insult, and sends merchants who call the platform a loading yard down from it without a microphone. Can tell the patient queue and the cargo queue apart at a glance.\n\n- Livelihood: Platform Queue · Severity Chart Posting\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief\n**Life.** Born 2096-10-09. Grew up on the Sinnae transfer duty roster. At the opening of 2126, Yongbong holds the duty post of Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief, and the record of taking over the post shows that it opened with the stopping of an unticketed departing train.\n- The Sangbong 1-dong Mangu transfer queue, patient, cargo classification, weight, invoice, market price and public testimony record desk is proposed as Yongbong''s duty reference point for posting platform queues and triage tags. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the winter, and it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armaments, transit tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief. Posts the platform queues and triage tags on the same blackboard, and does not set up an armed queue without an inspector present.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the southbound column from Bukhansan Bogukmun piled up on the Sinnae platform, rumors spread that even the queue on the Mangu side held crates full of weapons.\n\n**Relations.** Receives Jeon Miri''s stretcher order on the platform and separates the queue from Bokbong''s unloading order. \n\n**Fear.** That the platform, crowded with the southbound column from Bukhansan Bogukmun, will be mistaken for a military unloading site.\n\n**Intervention.** Can have platform cargo inspected publicly, or separate the patient queue from the military supply queue.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 35 | Force −25 | Materialism −5 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Transparency 20 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 40 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Longing 10 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 10 | Display −15 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Plural\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yong Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"receiving Jeon Miri''s stretcher order on the platform, and"},{"from":"Yong Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Bong","basis":"Shares the unloading order and the queue with Bokbong"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0310","name":"용봉","title":"망우 환승 승강장 거점장","position":"망우 환승 승강장 거점장","characterId":"K309","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"승강장 대기열·중증도 표 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-용봉","detailRoute":"/people/person-0310","birthDate":"2096-10-09","birthday":"10-09","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k309-platform-queue-allocation","name":"승강장 줄 배치","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k309-priority","name":"사람 칸의 구분","description":"용봉은 들것과 하역 순서를 승강장에서 나눈다. 무기 상자 소문은 실제 적재 확인으로 바꾸지 않는다.","behavior":"승강장 줄과 중증도 표를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 무장 대기열은 심사관 입회 없이 세우지 않는다.","stress":"북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 쌓인 승강장이 군수 하역으로 오인되는 것.","relationship":"전미리의 들것 순서를 승강장에서 받고, 복봉의 하역 순서와 줄을 나눈다. ","effects":[]},{"id":"k309-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 서기. 직함은 망우 환승 승강장 거점장. 승강장 줄과 중증도 표를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 무장 대기열은 심사관 입회 없이 세우지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 쌓인 승강장이 군수 하역으로 오인되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전미리의 들것 순서를 승강장에서 받고, 복봉의 하역 순서와 줄을 나눈다. ","effects":[]}],"narrative":"용봉은 들것과 하역 순서를 승강장에서 나눈다. 무기 상자 소문은 실제 적재 확인으로 바꾸지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"홍천 용씨","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":35,"무력":-25,"물질":-5,"공동":25,"원칙":10,"공개":20,"자격":25,"분산":40,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-10,"위험":10,"과시":-15,"지속":-10,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"승강장 대기열·중증도 표 게시","소속":"정부","품계":"서기","직함":"망우 환승 승강장 거점장","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 35 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −5 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 20 | 자격 25 | 분산 40 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −10 | 위험 10 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2096-10-09에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 망우 환승 승강장 거점장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 용봉의 승강장 대기열·중증도 표 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 망우 환승 승강장 거점장. 승강장 줄과 중증도 표를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 무장 대기열은 심사관 입회 없이 세우지 않는다.","일화":"북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 신내 승강장에 쌓이자 망우 쪽 줄까지 무기가 든 상자처럼 소문이 퍼졌다.","관계":"전미리의 들것 순서를 승강장에서 받고, 복봉의 하역 순서와 줄을 나눈다. ","야망":"","공포":"북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 쌓인 승강장이 군수 하역으로 오인되는 것.","개입":"승강장 화물을 공개 검수하거나, 환자 줄을 군수 대기열과 분리할 수 있다."},"biography":"2096-10-09생인 용봉은 말단 노선의 지연을 모욕처럼 기억하고, 승강장을 하역장으로 부르는 상인을 마이크 없이 내려보낸다. 환자 줄과 화물 줄을 한눈에 나눈다.\n\n- 생업: 승강장 대기열·중증도 표 게시\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 망우 환승 승강장 거점장\n**생애.** 2096-10-09에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 망우 환승 승강장 거점장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 용봉의 승강장 대기열·중증도 표 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 망우 환승 승강장 거점장. 승강장 줄과 중증도 표를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 무장 대기열은 심사관 입회 없이 세우지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 신내 승강장에 쌓이자 망우 쪽 줄까지 무기가 든 상자처럼 소문이 퍼졌다.\n\n**관계.** 전미리의 들것 순서를 승강장에서 받고, 복봉의 하역 순서와 줄을 나눈다. \n\n**공포.** 북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 쌓인 승강장이 군수 하역으로 오인되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 승강장 화물을 공개 검수하거나, 환자 줄을 군수 대기열과 분리할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 35 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −5 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 20 | 자격 25 | 분산 40 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −10 | 위험 10 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"용봉","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 들것 순서를 승강장에서 받고"},{"from":"용봉","type":"계약","to":"복봉","basis":"복봉의 하역 순서와 줄을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0311', 'ad6d-b2f4-c591', '{"id":"person-0311","name":"Guk So","title":"Sinnae Depot Duty Chief","position":"Sinnae Depot Duty Chief","characterId":"K310","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Depot Duty Roster · Dispatch Time Posting","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-gukso","detailRoute":"/people/person-0311","birthDate":"2064-06-18","birthday":"06-18","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"k310-release-duty-recording","name":"Release duty recording","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k310-priority","name":"Guards external entry","description":"Gukso publishes duty and release times and checks rear-gate defense shifts. A missing roster line does not prove collusion.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Sinnae Depot Duty Chief. She pasted the duty roster and release hours on one chalkboard and blocked armed outside approach without Mun Sion''s escort.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Split the repair shop and duty with So Dugam and put An Dohan''s dispatch sheet at the top of the chalkboard. Confirmed Gwak Taesan''s defense rotations at the base rear gate.","effects":[]},{"id":"k310-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Sinnae Depot Duty Chief. She pasted the duty roster and release hours on one chalkboard and blocked armed outside approach without Mun Sion''s escort.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Split the repair shop and duty with So Dugam and put An Dohan''s dispatch sheet at the top of the chalkboard. Confirmed Gwak Taesan''s defense rotations at the base rear gate.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Gukso publishes duty and release times and checks rear-gate defense shifts. A missing roster line does not prove collusion.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"Damyang Guk Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":40,"Force":-20,"Material":0,"Communal":25,"Principle":10,"Public":15,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":40,"Display":5,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Depot Duty Roster · Dispatch Time Posting","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Sinnae Depot Duty Chief","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Materialism 0 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 0 | Exclusivity 0 | Risk 40 | Display 5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation same-sex | Bonding non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2064-06-18. Raised at Sinjeong Rail Depot. At the 2126 opening, holds the duty post of Sinnae Depot Duty Chief, and the post-handover record remains, opened by a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong record desk for dispatch, shift changes, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handovers and duty keys is proposed as the duty reference point for Guk So''s depot duty roster and departure-time postings. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or occupancy rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Sinnae Depot Duty Chief. Posts duty names and departure times on the same blackboard, and bars armed outsiders from approaching without Mun Si-on''s accompaniment.","Anecdote":"In the medical train''s weapons locker, ammunition stamped with the Amsa crest was found, and the depot duty roster was missing one line.","Relationships":"Separates duty from So Dugam''s maintenance bay, and places An Dohan''s dispatch sheet at the very top of the blackboard. Confirms Gwak Taesan''s guard rotation at the depot''s rear gate.","Ambition":"Wants the escort duty to take direct charge of the shutters and light control on Sinnae Station''s holding tracks so that light never leaks at night to draw outside machines.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can find the missing duty officer, or switch depot departures to a double-key system."},"biography":"Guk So, born 2064-06-18, treats holding-track duty like home and calls people who break shift changes by the time rather than by name. Locks the departure blackboard before the seasonal sign-off even arrives.\n\n- Livelihood: Depot Duty Roster · Dispatch Time Posting\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Sinnae Depot Duty Chief\n**Life.** Born on 2064-06-18. Raised at Sinjeong Rail Depot. At the 2126 opening, holds the duty post of Sinnae Depot Duty Chief, and the post-handover record remains, opened by a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong record desk for dispatch, shift changes, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handovers and duty keys is proposed as the duty reference point for Guk So''s depot duty roster and departure-time postings. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Sinnae Depot Duty Chief. Posts duty names and departure times on the same blackboard, and bars armed outsiders from approaching without Mun Si-on''s accompaniment.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the medical train''s weapons locker, ammunition stamped with the Amsa crest was found, and the depot duty roster was missing one line.\n\n**Relationships.** Separates duty from So Dugam''s maintenance bay, and places An Dohan''s dispatch sheet at the very top of the blackboard. Confirms Gwak Taesan''s guard rotation at the depot''s rear gate.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants the escort duty to take direct charge of the shutters and light control on Sinnae Station''s holding tracks so that light never leaks at night to draw outside machines.\n\n**Intervention.** Can find the missing duty officer, or switch depot departures to a double-key system.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Materialism 0 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Exclusivity 0 | Risk 40 | Display 5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation same-sex | Bonding non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Guk So","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"placing An Dohan''s dispatch schedule at the very top of the blackboard."},{"from":"Guk So","type":"Contract","to":"So Dugam","basis":"Shares duty with Sodugam''s maintenance bay, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"So Dugam","type":"Contract","to":"Guk So","basis":"Shares tools with Guk So''s depot duty"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0311","name":"국소","title":"신내 차량기지 당직장","position":"신내 차량기지 당직장","characterId":"K310","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"차량기지 당직 명부·출고 시각 게시","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-국소","detailRoute":"/people/person-0311","birthDate":"2064-06-18","birthday":"06-18","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"k310-release-duty-recording","name":"출고 당직 기록","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k310-priority","name":"외부 진입 경계","description":"국소는 당직과 출고 시각을 공개하고 후문 수비 교대를 확인한다. 빠진 명단 한 줄에서 공모를 확정하지 않는다.","behavior":"당직 명과 출고 시각을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 외부 무장 접근은 문시온의 동행 없이 막는다.","stress":"","relationship":"소두감의 정비 창과 당직을 나누고, 안도한의 배차표를 칠판 맨 위에 둔다. 곽태산의 수비 교대를 기지 후문에서 확인한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k310-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 신내 차량기지 당직장. 당직 명과 출고 시각을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 외부 무장 접근은 문시온의 동행 없이 막는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 소두감의 정비 창과 당직을 나누고, 안도한의 배차표를 칠판 맨 위에 둔다. 곽태산의 수비 교대를 기지 후문에서 확인한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"국소는 당직과 출고 시각을 공개하고 후문 수비 교대를 확인한다. 빠진 명단 한 줄에서 공모를 확정하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"담양 국씨","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":40,"무력":-20,"물질":0,"공동":25,"원칙":10,"공개":15,"자격":15,"분산":35,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":0,"위험":40,"과시":5,"지속":0,"지향":"동성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"차량기지 당직 명부·출고 시각 게시","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"신내 차량기지 당직장","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 0 | 위험 40 | 과시 5 | 지속 0 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2064-06-18에 태어났다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 신내 차량기지 당직장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 국소의 차량기지 당직 명부·출고 시각 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 신내 차량기지 당직장. 당직 명과 출고 시각을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 외부 무장 접근은 문시온의 동행 없이 막는다.","일화":"의료열차 무기함에서 암사 문장이 찍힌 탄약이 발견되고 기지 당직 명단이 한 줄 빠져 있었다.","관계":"소두감의 정비 창과 당직을 나누고, 안도한의 배차표를 칠판 맨 위에 둔다. 곽태산의 수비 교대를 기지 후문에서 확인한다.","야망":"신내역 유치선의 셔터와 불빛 통제를 호송원 당직이 직접 맡아, 밤에 빛이 새어 바깥 기계를 부르는 일이 없게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 기지 출고를 이중 열쇠로 바꿀 수 있다."},"biography":"2064-06-18생인 국소는 유치선 당직을 집처럼 여기고, 교대를 어기는 사람을 이름 대신 시각으로 부른다. 계절 결재가 오기 전에 이미 출고 칠판을 잠근다.\n\n- 생업: 차량기지 당직 명부·출고 시각 게시\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 신내 차량기지 당직장\n**생애.** 2064-06-18에 태어났다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 신내 차량기지 당직장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 국소의 차량기지 당직 명부·출고 시각 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 신내 차량기지 당직장. 당직 명과 출고 시각을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 외부 무장 접근은 문시온의 동행 없이 막는다.\n\n**일화.** 의료열차 무기함에서 암사 문장이 찍힌 탄약이 발견되고 기지 당직 명단이 한 줄 빠져 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 소두감의 정비 창과 당직을 나누고, 안도한의 배차표를 칠판 맨 위에 둔다. 곽태산의 수비 교대를 기지 후문에서 확인한다.\n\n**야망.** 신내역 유치선의 셔터와 불빛 통제를 호송원 당직이 직접 맡아, 밤에 빛이 새어 바깥 기계를 부르는 일이 없게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 기지 출고를 이중 열쇠로 바꿀 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 0 | 위험 40 | 과시 5 | 지속 0 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"국소","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"안도한의 배차표를 칠판 맨 위에 둔다"},{"from":"국소","type":"계약","to":"소두감","basis":"소두감의 정비 창과 당직을 나누고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"소두감","type":"계약","to":"국소","basis":"국소의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0312', 'bcf5-ba74-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0312","name":"Bok Yong","title":"Northeast Market Hub Chief","position":"Northeast Market Hub Chief","characterId":"K311","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Market price, inventory posting, and shipment release confirmation","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#people-Bok-Yong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0312","birthDate":"2090-10-28","birthday":"10-28","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k311-market-inventory-posting","name":"Market inventory posting","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k311-priority","name":"Emergency supplies first","description":"Bogyong posts prices and inventory and prioritizes medical supplies. Cruelty toward concealing merchants remains alongside public standards.","behavior":"Office. Rank: clerk. Title: Northeast Market Hub Chief. He wrote the prices and inventory on the wall and blocked the release of any order stamped with a weapons clause until the medical crew posted it.","stress":"Fear. That the market inventory would leave as munitions-only and the medical train''s supply would stop.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the prices with Bok Bong''s relay invoices and put emergency supplies first for Guk Yong''s duty infirmary. Consulted O Haerin''s price broadcasts only at market hours.","effects":[]},{"id":"k311-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: clerk. Title: Northeast Market Hub Chief. He wrote the prices and inventory on the wall and blocked the release of any order stamped with a weapons clause until the medical crew posted it.","stress":"Fear. That the market inventory would leave as munitions-only and the medical train''s supply would stop.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the prices with Bok Bong''s relay invoices and put emergency supplies first for Guk Yong''s duty infirmary. Consulted O Haerin''s price broadcasts only at market hours.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Bogyong posts prices and inventory and prioritizes medical supplies. Cruelty toward concealing merchants remains alongside public standards.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11260-S12","name":{"ko":"Jungnang-gu District Directly Administered Land"},"holderPersonId":"K311","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S12","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1126052000","name":"Myeonmok 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1126054000","name":"Myeonmok 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1126055000","name":"Myeonmok 5-dong"},{"id":"region:1126056500","name":"Myeonmok-bon-dong"},{"id":"region:1126057000","name":"Myeonmok 7-dong"},{"id":"region:1126057500","name":"Myeonmok 3·8-dong"},{"id":"region:1126058000","name":"Sangbong 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1126059000","name":"Sangbong 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1126060000","name":"Junghwa 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1126061000","name":"Junghwa 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1126062000","name":"Muk 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1126063000","name":"Muk 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1126065500","name":"Mangu-bon-dong"},{"id":"region:1126066000","name":"Mangu 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1126068000","name":"Sinnae 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1126069000","name":"Sinnae 2-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11260-S12","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11260-S12","name":"Jungnang-gu District","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K311","basis":"Opening administrative scale group gu:11260(district) allocation · decisive candidate selection","stateId":"S12","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1126052000","region:1126054000","region:1126055000","region:1126056500","region:1126057000","region:1126057500","region:1126058000","region:1126059000","region:1126060000","region:1126061000","region:1126062000","region:1126063000","region:1126065500","region:1126066000","region:1126068000","region:1126069000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"The Government","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"Bok Clan of Myeoncheon","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":45,"Force":-25,"Material":-5,"Communal":30,"Principle":15,"Public":15,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-15,"Display":-20,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Market price, inventory posting, and shipment release confirmation","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Northeast Market Hub Chief","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 45 | Force −25 | Materialism −5 | Community 30 | Principle 15 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 40 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 35 | Exclusivity 10 | Risk −15 | Display −20 | Persistence −5 | Orientation fluid | Bonding multi-partner"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2090-10-28. Raised at Noryangjin Wharf. At the 2126 opening, holds the post of Northeast Market Base Chief, and the post-handover record remains, opened by the public re-inspection of the scales.\n- The Sangbong 1-dong record desk for Mangu transfer queues, patient and cargo classification, weights, waybills, prices and public testimony is proposed as the duty reference point for Bok Yong''s market price posting, stock posting and shipment checking. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or occupancy rights.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Northeast Market Hub Chief. Writes prices and stock on the wall, and blocks shipment of order slips stamped with a weapons crest until the medical team posts them.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Matches Bok Bong''s relay waybills with market prices, and supplies emergency goods first to Guk Yong''s duty infirmary. Consults Oh Hae-rin''s price broadcasts only during market hours.","Ambition":"","Fear":"That market stock is diverted to military use only and the medical train''s supplies stop.","Intervention":"Can make the order slip public, or fix the emergency-supplies-first bay in the market ledger."},"biography":"Bok Yong, born 2090-10-28, presses merchants who hide prices hardest, and drives out of the market anyone who talks of putting patient-transport bays up for auction. Regards the public scale as credit.\n\n- Livelihood: Market price, inventory posting, and shipment release confirmation\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Northeast Market Hub Chief\n**Life.** Born on 2090-10-28. Raised at Noryangjin Wharf. At the 2126 opening, holds the post of Northeast Market Base Chief, and the post-handover record remains, opened by the public re-inspection of the scales.\n- The Sangbong 1-dong record desk for Mangu transfer queues, patient and cargo classification, weights, waybills, prices and public testimony is proposed as the duty reference point for Bok Yong''s market price posting, stock posting and shipment checking. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Northeast Market Hub Chief. Writes prices and stock on the wall, and blocks shipment of order slips stamped with a weapons crest until the medical team posts them.\n\n**Relationships.** Matches Bok Bong''s relay waybills with market prices, and supplies emergency goods first to Guk Yong''s duty infirmary. Consults Oh Hae-rin''s price broadcasts only during market hours.\n\n**Fear.** That market stock is diverted to military use only and the medical train''s supplies stop.\n\n**Intervention.** Can make the order slip public, or fix the emergency-supplies-first bay in the market ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 45 | Force −25 | Materialism −5 | Community 30 | Principle 15 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 40 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Exclusivity 10 | Risk −15 | Display −20 | Persistence −5 | Orientation fluid | Bonding multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bok Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Refer to Oh Haerin''s market price broadcast during market time only"},{"from":"Bok Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Bong","basis":"Matches Bokbong''s relay invoices to market prices, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bok Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Yong","basis":""},{"from":"Geun Sori","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Yong","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0312","name":"복용","title":"북동부 시장 거점장","position":"북동부 시장 거점장","characterId":"K311","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"시장 시세·재고 게시·출고 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-복용","detailRoute":"/people/person-0312","birthDate":"2090-10-28","birthday":"10-28","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k311-market-inventory-posting","name":"시장 재고 게시","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k311-priority","name":"응급 물자 우선","description":"복용은 시세와 재고를 공개하고 의무실 물자를 우선 댄다. 숨기는 상인에 대한 잔인함도 공공 기준과 함께 남는다.","behavior":"시세와 재고를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 의료조 게시 전까지 출고를 막는다.","stress":"시장 재고가 군수 전용으로 빠져 의료열차 보급이 멈추는 것.","relationship":"복봉의 중계 송장과 시세를 맞추고, 국용의 당직 의무실에 응급 물자를 우선 댄다. 오해린의 시세 방송을 시장 시간에만 참고한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k311-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 서기. 직함은 북동부 시장 거점장. 시세와 재고를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 의료조 게시 전까지 출고를 막는다.","stress":"공포. 시장 재고가 군수 전용으로 빠져 의료열차 보급이 멈추는 것.","relationship":"관계. 복봉의 중계 송장과 시세를 맞추고, 국용의 당직 의무실에 응급 물자를 우선 댄다. 오해린의 시세 방송을 시장 시간에만 참고한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"복용은 시세와 재고를 공개하고 의무실 물자를 우선 댄다. 숨기는 상인에 대한 잔인함도 공공 기준과 함께 남는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11260-S12","name":{"ko":"중랑구 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K311","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S12","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1126052000","name":"면목2동"},{"id":"region:1126054000","name":"면목4동"},{"id":"region:1126055000","name":"면목5동"},{"id":"region:1126056500","name":"면목본동"},{"id":"region:1126057000","name":"면목7동"},{"id":"region:1126057500","name":"면목3·8동"},{"id":"region:1126058000","name":"상봉1동"},{"id":"region:1126059000","name":"상봉2동"},{"id":"region:1126060000","name":"중화1동"},{"id":"region:1126061000","name":"중화2동"},{"id":"region:1126062000","name":"묵1동"},{"id":"region:1126063000","name":"묵2동"},{"id":"region:1126065500","name":"망우본동"},{"id":"region:1126066000","name":"망우3동"},{"id":"region:1126068000","name":"신내1동"},{"id":"region:1126069000","name":"신내2동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11260-S12","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11260-S12","name":"중랑구","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K311","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11260(district) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S12","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1126052000","region:1126054000","region:1126055000","region:1126056500","region:1126057000","region:1126057500","region:1126058000","region:1126059000","region:1126060000","region:1126061000","region:1126062000","region:1126063000","region:1126065500","region:1126066000","region:1126068000","region:1126069000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"정부","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"면천 복씨","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":45,"무력":-25,"물질":-5,"공동":30,"원칙":15,"공개":15,"자격":25,"분산":40,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":10,"위험":-15,"과시":-20,"지속":-5,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"시장 시세·재고 게시·출고 확인","소속":"정부","품계":"서기","직함":"북동부 시장 거점장","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 45 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −5 | 공동 30 | 원칙 15 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 10 | 위험 −15 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2090-10-28에 태어났다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 북동부 시장 거점장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 저울 재점검 공개로 열린 내력이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 복용의 시장 시세·재고 게시·출고 확인 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 북동부 시장 거점장. 시세와 재고를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 의료조 게시 전까지 출고를 막는다.","일화":"","관계":"복봉의 중계 송장과 시세를 맞추고, 국용의 당직 의무실에 응급 물자를 우선 댄다. 오해린의 시세 방송을 시장 시간에만 참고한다.","야망":"","공포":"시장 재고가 군수 전용으로 빠져 의료열차 보급이 멈추는 것.","개입":"주문서를 공개하거나, 응급 물자 우선 칸을 시장 원장에 고정할 수 있다."},"biography":"2090-10-28생인 복용은 가격을 숨기는 상인을 가장 잔인하게 몰아붙이고, 환자 이송 칸을 경매에 올리는 말을 시장에서 쫓아낸다. 공개 저울을 신용으로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 시장 시세·재고 게시·출고 확인\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 북동부 시장 거점장\n**생애.** 2090-10-28에 태어났다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 북동부 시장 거점장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 저울 재점검 공개로 열린 내력이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 복용의 시장 시세·재고 게시·출고 확인 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 북동부 시장 거점장. 시세와 재고를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 의료조 게시 전까지 출고를 막는다.\n\n**관계.** 복봉의 중계 송장과 시세를 맞추고, 국용의 당직 의무실에 응급 물자를 우선 댄다. 오해린의 시세 방송을 시장 시간에만 참고한다.\n\n**공포.** 시장 재고가 군수 전용으로 빠져 의료열차 보급이 멈추는 것.\n\n**개입.** 주문서를 공개하거나, 응급 물자 우선 칸을 시장 원장에 고정할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 45 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −5 | 공동 30 | 원칙 15 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 10 | 위험 −15 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"복용","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"오해린의 시세 방송을 시장 시간에만 참고한다"},{"from":"복용","type":"계약","to":"복봉","basis":"복봉의 중계 송장과 시세를 맞추고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"복봉","type":"계약","to":"복용","basis":""},{"from":"근솔이","type":"계약","to":"복용","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0313', 'ad6d-b2f4-c591', '{"id":"person-0313","name":"Gukgam","title":"Gwak Taesan''s practical aide, Chief of the Medical Train Defense Depot Outpost","position":"Gwak Taesan''s practical aide, Chief of the Medical Train Defense Depot Outpost","characterId":"K312","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Medical Train Car Key · Weapons Locker Seal Management","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#people-Guk-Gam","detailRoute":"/people/person-0313","birthDate":"2096-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":7,"effective":7}},"skills":[{"id":"k312-separate-carriage-seal-custody","name":"Separate carriage seal custody","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k312-priority","name":"Separates authority","description":"Gukgam separates carriage keys from weapon-box seals and insists on witnessed searches. The missing duty worker is not identified.","behavior":"Office. Rank: clerk. Title: Gwak Taesan''s practical aide, Chief of the Medical Train Defense Depot Outpost. He kept the car keys and the weapons-box seal in separate custody and conducted searches only under the passage examiner''s attendance.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Held the defense shop under Gwak Taesan''s command and shared the sealing attendance with Mun Sion. Shielded Jeon Miri''s patient cars on the shop side.","effects":[]},{"id":"k312-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: clerk. Title: Gwak Taesan''s practical aide, Chief of the Medical Train Defense Depot Outpost. He kept the car keys and the weapons-box seal in separate custody and conducted searches only under the passage examiner''s attendance.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Held the defense shop under Gwak Taesan''s command and shared the sealing attendance with Mun Sion. Shielded Jeon Miri''s patient cars on the shop side.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Gukgam separates carriage keys from weapon-box seals and insists on witnessed searches. The missing duty worker is not identified.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"Damyang Guk Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":30,"Force":-5,"Material":10,"Communal":35,"Principle":5,"Public":10,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":50,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":5,"Display":30,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical Train Car Key · Weapons Locker Seal Management","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Gwak Taesan''s practical aide, Chief of the Medical Train Defense Depot Outpost","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 30 | Force −5 | Material 10 | Community 35 | Principle 5 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 50 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 15 | Possessiveness 25 | Risk 5 | Display 30 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Heterosexual | Union Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2096-10-18. Raised at the Amsa guard post. At the 2126 opening holds the duty of Medical Train Guard Depot Post Chief, Gwak Taesan''s Working-Level Officer, and the post handover record notes that the post opened upon the detection of an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- The dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, transit-inspection, stretcher-handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Gukgam''s management of the medical train car keys and armory seal. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records and does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armament, transit fees, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Gwak Taesan''s practical aide, Chief of the Medical Train Defense Depot Outpost. Keeps the car keys and the armory seal stored separately, and searches only with a Transit Inspector present.","Anecdote":"Ammunition stamped with the Amsa crest was found in the medical train''s armory, and one line was missing from the guard duty roster.","Relationships":"Runs the Guard Depot under Gwak Taesan''s command and shares the seal witnessing with Mun Sion. Guards Jeon Miri''s patient car from the window side.","Ambition":"Wants the headcount, fuel, and food waybills to be written together on a single sheet before each escort departs, and the departure delayed if any box is empty.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can find the missing duty officer, or replace the armory seal to frame the incident as outside tampering."},"biography":"Born 2096-10-18, Gukgam is taciturn and physically bars entry to the cars. Gukgam dislikes the guard detail standing out more than the escort corps, and regards one person holding both the keys and the armory seal as an accident waiting to happen.\n\n- Livelihood: Medical Train Car Key · Weapons Locker Seal Management\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Gwak Taesan''s practical aide, Chief of the Medical Train Defense Depot Outpost\n**Life.** Born 2096-10-18. Raised at the Amsa guard post. At the 2126 opening holds the duty of Medical Train Guard Depot Post Chief, Gwak Taesan''s Working-Level Officer, and the post handover record notes that the post opened upon the detection of an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- The dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, transit-inspection, stretcher-handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Gukgam''s management of the medical train car keys and armory seal. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records and does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armament, transit fees, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Gwak Taesan''s practical aide, Chief of the Medical Train Defense Depot Outpost. Keeps the car keys and the armory seal stored separately, and searches only with a Transit Inspector present.\n\n**Anecdote.** Ammunition stamped with the Amsa crest was found in the medical train''s armory, and one line was missing from the guard duty roster.\n\n**Relations.** Runs the Guard Depot under Gwak Taesan''s command and shares the seal witnessing with Mun Sion. Guards Jeon Miri''s patient car from the window side.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants the headcount, fuel, and food waybills to be written together on a single sheet before each escort departs, and the departure delayed if any box is empty.\n\n**Intervention.** Can find the missing duty officer, or replace the armory seal to frame the incident as outside tampering.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 30 | Force −5 | Material 10 | Community 35 | Principle 5 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 50 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Possessiveness 25 | Risk 5 | Display 30 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Heterosexual | Union Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gukgam","type":"Command","to":"Gwak Taesan","basis":"Takes charge of the guard depot under Gwak Taesan''s command, and"},{"from":"Gukgam","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Share the seal witnessing with Mun Sion"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0313","name":"국감","title":"의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자","position":"의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K312","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-국감","detailRoute":"/people/person-0313","birthDate":"2096-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":7,"effective":7}},"skills":[{"id":"k312-separate-carriage-seal-custody","name":"칸 봉인 분리 보관","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k312-priority","name":"권한 분리","description":"국감은 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 나누고 입회 수색을 고수한다. 빠진 당직자는 아직 특정되지 않았다.","behavior":"칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.","stress":"","relationship":"곽태산의 지휘로 수비창을 맡고, 문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유한다. 전미리의 환자 칸을 창 쪽에서 지킨다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k312-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 서기. 직함은 의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자. 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 곽태산의 지휘로 수비창을 맡고, 문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유한다. 전미리의 환자 칸을 창 쪽에서 지킨다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"국감은 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 나누고 입회 수색을 고수한다. 빠진 당직자는 아직 특정되지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"담양 국씨","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":30,"무력":-5,"물질":10,"공동":35,"원칙":5,"공개":10,"자격":30,"분산":50,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":25,"위험":5,"과시":30,"지속":-10,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리","소속":"정부","품계":"서기","직함":"의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 30 | 무력 −5 | 물질 10 | 공동 35 | 원칙 5 | 공개 10 | 자격 30 | 분산 50 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 25 | 위험 5 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2096-10-18에 태어났다. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 국감의 의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자. 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.","일화":"의료열차 무기함에서 암사 문장이 찍힌 탄약이 발견되고 수비 당직 명단이 한 줄 빠져 있었다.","관계":"곽태산의 지휘로 수비창을 맡고, 문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유한다. 전미리의 환자 칸을 창 쪽에서 지킨다.","야망":"호송 출발 전 인원·연료·식량 송장을 한 장에 맞춰 적고, 빠진 칸이 있으면 출발을 미루게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 무기함 봉인을 바꿔 사건을 외부 조작으로 몰 수 있다."},"biography":"2096-10-18생인 국감은 과묵하고 칸 출입을 몸으로 막는다. 수비대가 호송대보다 눈에 띄는 것을 싫어하고, 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 한 사람이 쥐는 일을 사고로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2096-10-18에 태어났다. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 국감의 의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자. 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.\n\n**일화.** 의료열차 무기함에서 암사 문장이 찍힌 탄약이 발견되고 수비 당직 명단이 한 줄 빠져 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 곽태산의 지휘로 수비창을 맡고, 문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유한다. 전미리의 환자 칸을 창 쪽에서 지킨다.\n\n**야망.** 호송 출발 전 인원·연료·식량 송장을 한 장에 맞춰 적고, 빠진 칸이 있으면 출발을 미루게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 무기함 봉인을 바꿔 사건을 외부 조작으로 몰 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 30 | 무력 −5 | 물질 10 | 공동 35 | 원칙 5 | 공개 10 | 자격 30 | 분산 50 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 25 | 위험 5 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"국감","type":"지휘","to":"곽태산","basis":"곽태산의 지휘로 수비창을 맡고"},{"from":"국감","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유한다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0314', 'ac10-cc3d-c6d0', '{"id":"person-0314","name":"Gammo","title":"Chief of the Medical Team Duty Room Outpost","position":"Chief of the Medical Team Duty Room Outpost","characterId":"K313","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Medical team triage and transport time records","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#person-gammo","detailRoute":"/people/person-0314","birthDate":"2078-01-22","birthday":"01-22","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k313-transfer-timing-posting","name":"Transfer timing posting","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k313-priority","name":"Vital stability first","description":"Gammo posts severity and transfer times and implements medical duty extensions, rejecting the idea that extended duty substitutes for medicine.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Chief of the Medical Team Duty Room Outpost. She pasted the severity table and transfer hours on the duty-room door and corrected no arms-loading record without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That the duty room would be mistaken for a munitions waiting room and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Jeon Miri''s medical crew extension in the duty room and split the stretcher order and sickbeds with Guk Yong. Put Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp at the top of the duty ledger.","effects":[]},{"id":"k313-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Chief of the Medical Team Duty Room Outpost. She pasted the severity table and transfer hours on the duty-room door and corrected no arms-loading record without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That the duty room would be mistaken for a munitions waiting room and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Jeon Miri''s medical crew extension in the duty room and split the stretcher order and sickbeds with Guk Yong. Put Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp at the top of the duty ledger.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Gammo posts severity and transfer times and implements medical duty extensions, rejecting the idea that extended duty substitutes for medicine.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ac10-cc3d-c6d0","name":"Changwon Gam Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ac10-cc3d-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":35,"Force":-20,"Material":10,"Communal":40,"Principle":5,"Public":20,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":50,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-40,"Display":0,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical team triage and transport time records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Chief of the Medical Team Duty Room Outpost","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −20 | Material 10 | Community 40 | Principle 5 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion 40 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 50 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk −40 | Display 0 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2078-01-22. Raised at the Jegi-dong aid station. At the 2126 opening holds the duty of Medical Unit Duty Room Post Chief, and the post handover record notes that the post opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, transit-inspection, stretcher-handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Gammo''s recording of Medical Unit triage levels and transfer times. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records and does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armament, transit fees, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Chief of the Medical Team Duty Room Outpost. Posts the triage chart and transfer times on the duty room door, and does not alter weapons loading records without an inspector present.","Anecdote":"When the southbound procession of the Bukhansan Patriots'' Gate piled up on the platform, one duty room shift-change slip went missing.","Relationships":"Enforces Jeon Miri''s Medical Unit extensions in the duty room and shares stretcher order and beds with Gugyong. Places Jang Sehwa''s departmental seal at the top of the duty ledger.","Ambition":"Hopes to keep the Medical Unit duty room as one wing of the seasonal shift-change approval, so that emergency transfers without escort fees never stop.","Fear":"That the duty room is mistaken for a munitions waiting room and the entire escort corps is disarmed.","Intervention":"Can find the missing slip, or push a duty extension through in front of the Dispatch Unit."},"biography":"Born 2078-01-22, Gammo puts stretcher order first and accepts the Dispatch Unit''s demands for empty slots only after vitality has stabilized. Refuses any talk that packages a duty extension as medicine.\n\n- Livelihood: Medical team triage and transport time records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Chief of the Medical Team Duty Room Outpost\n**Life.** Born 2078-01-22. Raised at the Jegi-dong aid station. At the 2126 opening holds the duty of Medical Unit Duty Room Post Chief, and the post handover record notes that the post opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, transit-inspection, stretcher-handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Gammo''s recording of Medical Unit triage levels and transfer times. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records and does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armament, transit fees, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Chief of the Medical Team Duty Room Outpost. Posts the triage chart and transfer times on the duty room door, and does not alter weapons loading records without an inspector present.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the southbound procession of the Bukhansan Patriots'' Gate piled up on the platform, one duty room shift-change slip went missing.\n\n**Relations.** Enforces Jeon Miri''s Medical Unit extensions in the duty room and shares stretcher order and beds with Gugyong. Places Jang Sehwa''s departmental seal at the top of the duty ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** Hopes to keep the Medical Unit duty room as one wing of the seasonal shift-change approval, so that emergency transfers without escort fees never stop.\n\n**Fear.** That the duty room is mistaken for a munitions waiting room and the entire escort corps is disarmed.\n\n**Intervention.** Can find the missing slip, or push a duty extension through in front of the Dispatch Unit.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −20 | Material 10 | Community 40 | Principle 5 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion 40 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 50 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk −40 | Display 0 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gammo","type":"Command","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"carrying out the extension of Jeon Miri''s Medical Team in the duty room, and"},{"from":"Gammo","type":"Command","to":"Guk Yong","basis":"Shares the stretcher order and beds with Gugyong"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Guk Yong","type":"Command","to":"Gammo","basis":"Shares the duty room and beds with Gammo''s medical squad"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0314","name":"감모","title":"의료조 당직실 거점장","position":"의료조 당직실 거점장","characterId":"K313","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"의료조 중증도·이송 시각 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-감모","detailRoute":"/people/person-0314","birthDate":"2078-01-22","birthday":"01-22","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k313-transfer-timing-posting","name":"이송 시각 게시","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k313-priority","name":"활력 안정 우선","description":"감모는 중증도와 이송 시각을 게시하고 의료조 연장을 집행한다. 연장을 약으로 대신한다는 말을 거부한다.","behavior":"중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실 문에 붙이고, 무기 적재 기록은 심사관 입회 없이 고치지 않는다.","stress":"당직실이 군수 대기실로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"전미리의 의료조 연장을 당직실에서 집행하고, 국용의 들것 순서와 병상을 나눈다. 장세화의 부서 날인을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k313-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 의료조 당직실 거점장. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실 문에 붙이고, 무기 적재 기록은 심사관 입회 없이 고치지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 당직실이 군수 대기실로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전미리의 의료조 연장을 당직실에서 집행하고, 국용의 들것 순서와 병상을 나눈다. 장세화의 부서 날인을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"감모는 중증도와 이송 시각을 게시하고 의료조 연장을 집행한다. 연장을 약으로 대신한다는 말을 거부한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ac10-cc3d-c6d0","name":"창원 감씨","crest":"clan-crests/ac10-cc3d-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":35,"무력":-20,"물질":10,"공동":40,"원칙":5,"공개":20,"자격":10,"분산":40,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":50,"독점":-10,"위험":-40,"과시":0,"지속":0,"지향":"양성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"의료조 중증도·이송 시각 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"의료조 당직실 거점장","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −20 | 물질 10 | 공동 40 | 원칙 5 | 공개 20 | 자격 10 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 50 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −40 | 과시 0 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2078-01-22에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료조 당직실 거점장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 감모의 의료조 중증도·이송 시각 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 의료조 당직실 거점장. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실 문에 붙이고, 무기 적재 기록은 심사관 입회 없이 고치지 않는다.","일화":"북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 승강장에 쌓이자 당직실 교대 쪽지가 한 장 사라졌다.","관계":"전미리의 의료조 연장을 당직실에서 집행하고, 국용의 들것 순서와 병상을 나눈다. 장세화의 부서 날인을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","야망":"의료조 당직실을 계절 교대 결재의 한쪽 날개로 남겨 호송료 없는 응급 이송이 끊기지 않게 하려 한다.","공포":"당직실이 군수 대기실로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","개입":"사라진 쪽지를 찾거나, 당직 연장을 배차조 앞에서 관철할 수 있다."},"biography":"2078-01-22생인 감모는 들것 순서를 앞에 두고, 배차조의 빈 슬롯 요구를 활력이 안정된 뒤에만 받는다. 당직 연장을 약으로 포장하는 말을 거부한다.\n\n- 생업: 의료조 중증도·이송 시각 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 의료조 당직실 거점장\n**생애.** 2078-01-22에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료조 당직실 거점장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 감모의 의료조 중증도·이송 시각 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 의료조 당직실 거점장. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실 문에 붙이고, 무기 적재 기록은 심사관 입회 없이 고치지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 승강장에 쌓이자 당직실 교대 쪽지가 한 장 사라졌다.\n\n**관계.** 전미리의 의료조 연장을 당직실에서 집행하고, 국용의 들것 순서와 병상을 나눈다. 장세화의 부서 날인을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 의료조 당직실을 계절 교대 결재의 한쪽 날개로 남겨 호송료 없는 응급 이송이 끊기지 않게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 당직실이 군수 대기실로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.\n\n**개입.** 사라진 쪽지를 찾거나, 당직 연장을 배차조 앞에서 관철할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −20 | 물질 10 | 공동 40 | 원칙 5 | 공개 20 | 자격 10 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 50 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −40 | 과시 0 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"감모","type":"지휘","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 의료조 연장을 당직실에서 집행하고"},{"from":"감모","type":"지휘","to":"국용","basis":"국용의 들것 순서와 병상을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"국용","type":"지휘","to":"감모","basis":"감모의 의료조 당직실과 병상을 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0315', 'd0c1-ad11-c0b0', '{"id":"person-0315","name":"Tak Mireu","title":"Party involved in the transfer passage accident","position":"Party involved in the transfer passage accident","characterId":"K314","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Transfer accident time and cargo car records","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#person-tak-mireu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0315","birthDate":"2066-09-11","birthday":"09-11","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k314-collision-timing-testimony","name":"Collision timing testimony","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k314-priority","name":"Preserves participant testimony","description":"Tak Mireu records the time and number of the car he occupied during collision. The experience supplies no injury severity or function assessment.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Party involved in the transfer passage accident. He wrote the collision hours and car numbers on one chalkboard and moved no freight stamped with the Amsa mark without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Left a statement at Mun Sion''s examination stand and matched the hours with Gwak Taesan''s defense duty. He had refused any settlement without Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp.","effects":[]},{"id":"k314-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Party involved in the transfer passage accident. He wrote the collision hours and car numbers on one chalkboard and moved no freight stamped with the Amsa mark without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Left a statement at Mun Sion''s examination stand and matched the hours with Gwak Taesan''s defense duty. He had refused any settlement without Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Tak Mireu records the time and number of the car he occupied during collision. The experience supplies no injury severity or function assessment.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d0c1-ad11-c0b0","name":"Tak Clan of Gwangsan","crest":"clan-crests/d0c1-ad11-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-30,"Openness":45,"Force":-30,"Material":-10,"Communal":30,"Principle":10,"Public":20,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":-20,"Display":-15,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Transfer accident time and cargo car records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Party involved in the transfer passage accident","Values":"Authority −30 | Openness 45 | Force −30 | Materialism −10 | Communal 30 | Principle 10 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 35 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −20 | Display −15 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2066-09-11. Grew up on the Sinnae transfer watch. At the 2126 opening, holds the Transfer Passage Accident Party watch, and the post handover record notes that it began with stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient, cargo classification, weight, invoice, price and public testimony desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Tak Mir''s duty reference point for transfer accident times and cargo car records. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the winter, and it does not confirm operating trains, new facilities, armaments, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Party involved in the transfer passage accident. Writes the collision time and car number on the same blackboard, and does not move any cargo stamped with the Amsa crest without an inspector present.","Anecdote":"When winter''s black dispatch table opened, an Amsa-made weapon was found on a medical train, and the transfer car Tak Mir was riding collided with that train at the coupling.","Relationships":"Leaves a statement at Mun Sion''s inspection desk and aligns times with Gwak Taesan''s guard duty. Has refused agreements lacking Jang Sehwa''s departmental seal.","Ambition":"Intends to fix the party''s statement on the Mangu transfer collision in the escort ledger so that the cargo car can never again crash into the passenger car.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can escort the party''s statement to the Records Office, or find the dispatch slip that rigged the collision."},"biography":"Tak Mir, born 2066-09-11, remembers the shock of the platform coupling in the body and tears up slips insisting that an empty car was a medical car. Words are short, and times are exact.\n\n- Livelihood: Transfer accident time and cargo car records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Party involved in the transfer passage accident\n**Life.** Born on 2066-09-11. Grew up on the Sinnae transfer watch. At the 2126 opening, holds the Transfer Passage Accident Party watch, and the post handover record notes that it began with stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient, cargo classification, weight, invoice, price and public testimony desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Tak Mir''s duty reference point for transfer accident times and cargo car records. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the winter, and it does not confirm operating trains, new facilities, armaments, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Party involved in the transfer passage accident. Writes the collision time and car number on the same blackboard, and does not move any cargo stamped with the Amsa crest without an inspector present.\n\n**Anecdote.** When winter''s black dispatch table opened, an Amsa-made weapon was found on a medical train, and the transfer car Tak Mir was riding collided with that train at the coupling.\n\n**Relations.** Leaves a statement at Mun Sion''s inspection desk and aligns times with Gwak Taesan''s guard duty. Has refused agreements lacking Jang Sehwa''s departmental seal.\n\n**Ambition.** Intends to fix the party''s statement on the Mangu transfer collision in the escort ledger so that the cargo car can never again crash into the passenger car.\n\n**Intervention.** Can escort the party''s statement to the Records Office, or find the dispatch slip that rigged the collision.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −30 | Openness 45 | Force −30 | Materialism −10 | Communal 30 | Principle 10 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 35 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −20 | Display −15 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Tak Mireu","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Leave a statement at Mun Sion''s inspection post, and"},{"from":"Tak Mireu","type":"Contract","to":"Gwak Taesan","basis":"Syncs times with Gwak Taesan''s guard duty shifts"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0315","name":"탁미르","title":"환승 통행 사고 당사자","position":"환승 통행 사고 당사자","characterId":"K314","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"환승 사고 시각·화물칸 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-탁미르","detailRoute":"/people/person-0315","birthDate":"2066-09-11","birthday":"09-11","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k314-collision-timing-testimony","name":"충돌 시각 진술","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k314-priority","name":"당사자 진술 보존","description":"탁미르는 자신이 탄 칸의 충돌 시각과 번호를 기록한다. 충돌 경험을 부상 정도나 신체 기능 추정으로 바꾸지 않는다.","behavior":"충돌 시각과 칸 번호를 같은 칠판에 적고, 암사 문장이 찍힌 화물은 심사관 입회 없이 옮기지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"문시온의 심사대에서 진술을 남기고, 곽태산의 수비 당직과 시각을 맞춘다. 장세화의 부서 날인이 없는 합의서는 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k314-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 통행 사고 당사자. 충돌 시각과 칸 번호를 같은 칠판에 적고, 암사 문장이 찍힌 화물은 심사관 입회 없이 옮기지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 문시온의 심사대에서 진술을 남기고, 곽태산의 수비 당직과 시각을 맞춘다. 장세화의 부서 날인이 없는 합의서는 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"탁미르는 자신이 탄 칸의 충돌 시각과 번호를 기록한다. 충돌 경험을 부상 정도나 신체 기능 추정으로 바꾸지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d0c1-ad11-c0b0","name":"광산 탁씨","crest":"clan-crests/d0c1-ad11-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-30,"개방":45,"무력":-30,"물질":-10,"공동":30,"원칙":10,"공개":20,"자격":30,"분산":35,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":5,"위험":-20,"과시":-15,"지속":35,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"환승 사고 시각·화물칸 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"환승 통행 사고 당사자","가치관":"권위 −30 | 개방 45 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 10 | 공개 20 | 자격 30 | 분산 35 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 5 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −15 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2066-09-11에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 통행 사고 당사자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다는 내용이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 탁미르의 환승 사고 시각·화물칸 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 통행 사고 당사자. 충돌 시각과 칸 번호를 같은 칠판에 적고, 암사 문장이 찍힌 화물은 심사관 입회 없이 옮기지 않는다.","일화":"겨울의 검은 배차표가 열리자 의료열차에서 암사에서 만든 무기가 발견되고 탁미르가 탄 환승칸이 그 열차와 이음매에서 부딪쳤다.","관계":"문시온의 심사대에서 진술을 남기고, 곽태산의 수비 당직과 시각을 맞춘다. 장세화의 부서 날인이 없는 합의서는 거부해 왔다.","야망":"망우 환승 충돌의 당사자 진술을 호송 원장에 고정해 화물칸이 사람 칸을 다시 덮치지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"당사자 진술을 기록청까지 호송하거나, 충돌을 조작한 배차 쪽지를 찾아낼 수 있다."},"biography":"2066-09-11생인 탁미르는 승강장 이음매의 충격을 몸으로 기억하고, 빈 칸을 의료칸이라 우기는 쪽지를 찢는다. 말은 짧고 시각은 정확하다.\n\n- 생업: 환승 사고 시각·화물칸 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 환승 통행 사고 당사자\n**생애.** 2066-09-11에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 통행 사고 당사자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다는 내용이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 탁미르의 환승 사고 시각·화물칸 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 통행 사고 당사자. 충돌 시각과 칸 번호를 같은 칠판에 적고, 암사 문장이 찍힌 화물은 심사관 입회 없이 옮기지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 겨울의 검은 배차표가 열리자 의료열차에서 암사에서 만든 무기가 발견되고 탁미르가 탄 환승칸이 그 열차와 이음매에서 부딪쳤다.\n\n**관계.** 문시온의 심사대에서 진술을 남기고, 곽태산의 수비 당직과 시각을 맞춘다. 장세화의 부서 날인이 없는 합의서는 거부해 왔다.\n\n**야망.** 망우 환승 충돌의 당사자 진술을 호송 원장에 고정해 화물칸이 사람 칸을 다시 덮치지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 당사자 진술을 기록청까지 호송하거나, 충돌을 조작한 배차 쪽지를 찾아낼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −30 | 개방 45 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 10 | 공개 20 | 자격 30 | 분산 35 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 5 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −15 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"탁미르","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온의 심사대에서 진술을 남기고"},{"from":"탁미르","type":"계약","to":"곽태산","basis":"곽태산의 수비 당직과 시각을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0316', 'bc94-ae08-c131', '{"id":"person-0316","name":"Beom Ongyeol","title":"Passage witness at the northeastern outer gate","position":"Passage witness at the northeastern outer gate","characterId":"K315","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Outer gate passage time and stretcher count records","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-beom-ongyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0316","birthDate":"2069-09-07","birthday":"09-07","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k315-passage-headcount","name":"Passage headcount","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k315-priority","name":"Guards use of family counts","description":"Beom Ongyeol cross-checks family lists and passage counts and witnessed forced registration. Missing duty notes cause her to stop testimony.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Passage witness at the northeastern outer gate. She wrote the passage hours and stretcher counts in the same ledger and struck the Amsa escort''s searches from her testimony without the medical crew''s stamp.","stress":"Fear. That the family counts she tallied would become the numbers of a military-registry column.","relationship":"Relations. Backed Jeon Miri''s patient line from the witness stand and cross-checked Baek On''s southward family roster. When Gam Mo''s duty-room note vanished, she halted the testimony.","effects":[]},{"id":"k315-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Passage witness at the northeastern outer gate. She wrote the passage hours and stretcher counts in the same ledger and struck the Amsa escort''s searches from her testimony without the medical crew''s stamp.","stress":"Fear. That the family counts she tallied would become the numbers of a military-registry column.","relationship":"Relations. Backed Jeon Miri''s patient line from the witness stand and cross-checked Baek On''s southward family roster. When Gam Mo''s duty-room note vanished, she halted the testimony.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Beom Ongyeol cross-checks family lists and passage counts and witnessed forced registration. Missing duty notes cause her to stop testimony.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc94-ae08-c131","name":"Geumseong Beom Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc94-ae08-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":45,"Force":-20,"Material":-5,"Communal":10,"Principle":10,"Public":20,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":50,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":10,"Display":-30,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Outer gate passage time and stretcher count records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Passage witness at the northeastern outer gate","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 45 | Force −20 | Materialism −5 | Communality 10 | Principle 10 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 50 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly −30 | Risk 10 | Display −30 | Endurance −5 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2069-09-07. Raised on duty shifts in the waiting hall. At the opening of 2126, she holds the Northeast Outer Gate Passage Witness duty, and the post-handover record remains, opened by a substitute duty shift covering an unexcused absence at shift change.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo classification, weight, waybill, market price, and public testimony recording desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Beom Ongyeol''s records of outer gate passage times and stretcher counts. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the winter, and it does not fix running trains, new equipment, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Passage witness at the northeastern outer gate. She records passage times and stretcher counts in the same ledger, and omits the Amsa Guard Corps'' searches from her testimony unless they carry the medical corps'' seal.","Anecdote":"When the autumn procession through Bukhansan Bogungmun piled up on the Sinnae platform, Beom Ongyeol counted the people passing through and watched a forced-roster window open.","Relationships":"She backs Jeon Miri''s patient line from the witness stand and cross-checks Baek On''s roster of southbound families. When Gam Mo''s duty-room note disappeared, she stopped testifying.","Ambition":"She wants to preserve the passage counts of the southbound procession as public testimony, so that forced-service re-registration cannot swallow the platform.","Fear":"That the number of family members they counted becomes a figure in a column of the mobilization register.","Intervention":"She can stop any hand that tries to carry the witness ledger off to the representatives'' council."},"biography":"Born on 2069-09-07, Beom Ongyeol counts the faces in the line.\n\n- Livelihood: Outer gate passage time and stretcher count records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Passage witness at the northeastern outer gate\n**Life.** Born on 2069-09-07. Raised on duty shifts in the waiting hall. At the opening of 2126, she holds the Northeast Outer Gate Passage Witness duty, and the post-handover record remains, opened by a substitute duty shift covering an unexcused absence at shift change.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo classification, weight, waybill, market price, and public testimony recording desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Beom Ongyeol''s records of outer gate passage times and stretcher counts. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the winter, and it does not fix running trains, new equipment, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Passage witness at the northeastern outer gate. She records passage times and stretcher counts in the same ledger, and omits the Amsa Guard Corps'' searches from her testimony unless they carry the medical corps'' seal.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the autumn procession through Bukhansan Bogungmun piled up on the Sinnae platform, Beom Ongyeol counted the people passing through and watched a forced-roster window open.\n\n**Relationships.** She backs Jeon Miri''s patient line from the witness stand and cross-checks Baek On''s roster of southbound families. When Gam Mo''s duty-room note disappeared, she stopped testifying.\n\n**Ambition.** She wants to preserve the passage counts of the southbound procession as public testimony, so that forced-service re-registration cannot swallow the platform.\n\n**Fear.** That the number of family members they counted becomes a figure in a column of the mobilization register.\n\n**Intervention.** She can stop any hand that tries to carry the witness ledger off to the representatives'' council.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 45 | Force −20 | Materialism −5 | Communality 10 | Principle 10 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 50 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly −30 | Risk 10 | Display −30 | Endurance −5 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Beom Ongyeol","type":"Oath","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"backing Jeon Miri''s patient line at the witness stand, and"},{"from":"Beom Ongyeol","type":"Oath","to":"Baek On","basis":"Cross-checks Baek On''s register of southbound families."}],"incoming":[{"from":"Seok Raon","type":"Contract","to":"Beom Ongyeol","basis":"Match Beom Ongyeol''s passage counts against the stretcher counts"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0316","name":"범온결","title":"북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인","position":"북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인","characterId":"K315","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"외곽 관문 통과 시각·들것 수 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-범온결","detailRoute":"/people/person-0316","birthDate":"2069-09-07","birthday":"09-07","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k315-passage-headcount","name":"통행 인원 계수","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k315-priority","name":"가족 수의 용도 경계","description":"범온결은 가족 명부와 통과 인원을 대조하며 강제 명부 창구를 목격했다. 당직 쪽지가 사라지면 증언을 멈춘다.","behavior":"통과 시각과 들것 수를 같은 원장에 적고, 암사 호위단의 검색은 의료조 날인 없이 증언에서 뺀다.","stress":"자신이 센 가족 수가 동원 명부 칸의 숫자가 되는 것.","relationship":"전미리의 환자 줄을 증인석에서 받치고, 백온의 남하 가족 명부를 대조한다. 감모의 당직실 쪽지가 사라지자 증언을 멈췄다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k315-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인. 통과 시각과 들것 수를 같은 원장에 적고, 암사 호위단의 검색은 의료조 날인 없이 증언에서 뺀다.","stress":"공포. 자신이 센 가족 수가 동원 명부 칸의 숫자가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전미리의 환자 줄을 증인석에서 받치고, 백온의 남하 가족 명부를 대조한다. 감모의 당직실 쪽지가 사라지자 증언을 멈췄다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"범온결은 가족 명부와 통과 인원을 대조하며 강제 명부 창구를 목격했다. 당직 쪽지가 사라지면 증언을 멈춘다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc94-ae08-c131","name":"금성 범씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc94-ae08-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":45,"무력":-20,"물질":-5,"공동":10,"원칙":10,"공개":20,"자격":30,"분산":50,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":-30,"위험":10,"과시":-30,"지속":-5,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"외곽 관문 통과 시각·들것 수 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 45 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −5 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 20 | 자격 30 | 분산 50 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 −30 | 위험 10 | 과시 −30 | 지속 −5 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2069-09-07에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 범온결의 외곽 관문 통과 시각·들것 수 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인. 통과 시각과 들것 수를 같은 원장에 적고, 암사 호위단의 검색은 의료조 날인 없이 증언에서 뺀다.","일화":"가을의 북한산보국문 행렬이 신내 승강장에 쌓이자 범온결은 통행 인원을 세며 강제 명부 창구가 열리는 것을 보았다.","관계":"전미리의 환자 줄을 증인석에서 받치고, 백온의 남하 가족 명부를 대조한다. 감모의 당직실 쪽지가 사라지자 증언을 멈췄다.","야망":"남하 행렬의 통과 인원을 공개 증언으로 남겨 강제 복무 재등록이 승강장을 삼키지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"자신이 센 가족 수가 동원 명부 칸의 숫자가 되는 것.","개입":"증인 원장을 대표 회의로 가져가려는 손을 막을 수 있다."},"biography":"2069-09-07생인 범온결은 줄의 얼굴을 센다.\n\n- 생업: 외곽 관문 통과 시각·들것 수 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인\n**생애.** 2069-09-07에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 범온결의 외곽 관문 통과 시각·들것 수 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인. 통과 시각과 들것 수를 같은 원장에 적고, 암사 호위단의 검색은 의료조 날인 없이 증언에서 뺀다.\n\n**일화.** 가을의 북한산보국문 행렬이 신내 승강장에 쌓이자 범온결은 통행 인원을 세며 강제 명부 창구가 열리는 것을 보았다.\n\n**관계.** 전미리의 환자 줄을 증인석에서 받치고, 백온의 남하 가족 명부를 대조한다. 감모의 당직실 쪽지가 사라지자 증언을 멈췄다.\n\n**야망.** 남하 행렬의 통과 인원을 공개 증언으로 남겨 강제 복무 재등록이 승강장을 삼키지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 자신이 센 가족 수가 동원 명부 칸의 숫자가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 증인 원장을 대표 회의로 가져가려는 손을 막을 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 45 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −5 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 20 | 자격 30 | 분산 50 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 −30 | 위험 10 | 과시 −30 | 지속 −5 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"범온결","type":"맹세","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 환자 줄을 증인석에서 받치고"},{"from":"범온결","type":"맹세","to":"백온","basis":"백온의 남하 가족 명부를 대조한다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"석라온","type":"계약","to":"범온결","basis":"범온결의 통행 숫자와 들것 수를 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0317', 'cc3d-ac70-cc3d', '{"id":"person-0317","name":"Chang Dahin","title":"Representative of victims of the contaminated medicine transport","position":"Representative of victims of the contaminated medicine transport","characterId":"K316","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Medicine dosing time and fever records","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#person-chang-dahin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0317","birthDate":"2096-01-24","birthday":"01-24","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k316-dose-and-fever-record-review","name":"Dose and fever record review","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k316-priority","name":"Public harm records","description":"Chang Daheun matches dose times and fever records after family harm. A victims’ representative receives no prescription proficiency or presumed personal disease.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Representative of victims of the contaminated medicine transport. He overlaid dosage hours and fever records in one book and unloaded no box without origin inspection posts or the representative''s stamp.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Raised the victims'' line onto Jeon Miri''s severity table and matched names with Mae Haru''s Jegi-dong harm ledger. Made Ryu Eunbi''s care principles the last standard of the transfer cars.","effects":[]},{"id":"k316-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Representative of victims of the contaminated medicine transport. He overlaid dosage hours and fever records in one book and unloaded no box without origin inspection posts or the representative''s stamp.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Raised the victims'' line onto Jeon Miri''s severity table and matched names with Mae Haru''s Jegi-dong harm ledger. Made Ryu Eunbi''s care principles the last standard of the transfer cars.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Chang Daheun matches dose times and fever records after family harm. A victims’ representative receives no prescription proficiency or presumed personal disease.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc3d-ac70-cc3d","name":"Geochang Chang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cc3d-ac70-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":50,"Force":-30,"Material":0,"Communal":15,"Principle":0,"Public":20,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":60,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":-10,"Display":5,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicine dosing time and fever records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Representative of victims of the contaminated medicine transport","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 50 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Community 15 | Principle 0 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion 60 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving −5 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2096-01-24. Raised at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening, holds the duty post of Representative of Victims of Contaminated Medicine Transport, and the post-handover record shows it was opened by a fake-medicine seal.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, passage-inspection, stretcher-handover and duty-key record desks are proposed as Chang Dahuin''s duty reference point for medicine dose-time and fever records. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Representative of victims of the contaminated medicine transport. Overlay dose times and fever records in the same book, and never unload a crate that lacks an origin tally stake without the representative''s seal.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Put the victim lines on Jeon Miri''s severity table and match the names against Mae Haru''s Jegi-dong victim ledger. Treat Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principle as the final standard for the transport car.","Ambition":"Seeks to bind the list of transfers felled by contaminated medicine into a public victim ledger, so that fake medicine can never again board the transfer car.","Fear":"","Intervention":"May seize contaminated medicine crates to fill the ledger, or be drawn into a cover-up deal as the victims'' representative."},"biography":"Born on 2096-01-24, Chang Dahuin still carries the bitterness of the antipyretic on the tongue and never puts medicine with merely clean packaging on a stretcher. Gentle, but will not rise from the seat when a fever curve is out of line.\n\n- Livelihood: Medicine dosing time and fever records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Representative of victims of the contaminated medicine transport\n**Life.** Born on 2096-01-24. Raised at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening, holds the duty post of Representative of Victims of Contaminated Medicine Transport, and the post-handover record shows it was opened by a fake-medicine seal.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, passage-inspection, stretcher-handover and duty-key record desks are proposed as Chang Dahuin''s duty reference point for medicine dose-time and fever records. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Representative of victims of the contaminated medicine transport. Overlay dose times and fever records in the same book, and never unload a crate that lacks an origin tally stake without the representative''s seal.\n\n**Relationships.** Put the victim lines on Jeon Miri''s severity table and match the names against Mae Haru''s Jegi-dong victim ledger. Treat Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principle as the final standard for the transport car.\n\n**Ambition.** Seeks to bind the list of transfers felled by contaminated medicine into a public victim ledger, so that fake medicine can never again board the transfer car.\n\n**Intervention.** May seize contaminated medicine crates to fill the ledger, or be drawn into a cover-up deal as the victims'' representative.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 50 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Community 15 | Principle 0 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion 60 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Chang Dahin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"placing the victims'' line on Jeon Miri''s severity chart, and"},{"from":"Chang Dahin","type":"Contract","to":"Mae Haru","basis":"Match names against Mae Haru''s Jegi-dong victim ledger"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Mae Haru","type":"Contract","to":"Chang Dahin","basis":"Match names against Chang Dahuin''s transfer victim list, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0317","name":"창다흰","title":"약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표","position":"약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표","characterId":"K316","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"약재 복용 시각·열 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-창다흰","detailRoute":"/people/person-0317","birthDate":"2096-01-24","birthday":"01-24","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k316-dose-and-fever-record-review","name":"복용·열 기록 대조","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k316-priority","name":"피해 기록의 공개","description":"창다흰은 가족의 해열제 피해 뒤 복용 시각과 열 기록을 맞춘다. 피해자 대표에게 의료 처방 숙련이나 본인 질병은 부여하지 않는다.","behavior":"복용 시각과 열 기록을 같은 책에 겹치고, 원산지 말목이 없는 상자는 대표 날인 없이 내리지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"전미리의 중증도 표에 피해자 줄을 올리고, 매하루의 제기동 피해 원장과 이름을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 이송칸의 마지막 기준으로 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k316-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표. 복용 시각과 열 기록을 같은 책에 겹치고, 원산지 말목이 없는 상자는 대표 날인 없이 내리지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 전미리의 중증도 표에 피해자 줄을 올리고, 매하루의 제기동 피해 원장과 이름을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 이송칸의 마지막 기준으로 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"창다흰은 가족의 해열제 피해 뒤 복용 시각과 열 기록을 맞춘다. 피해자 대표에게 의료 처방 숙련이나 본인 질병은 부여하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc3d-ac70-cc3d","name":"거창 창씨","crest":"clan-crests/cc3d-ac70-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":50,"무력":-30,"물질":0,"공동":15,"원칙":0,"공개":20,"자격":10,"분산":60,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":5,"위험":-10,"과시":5,"지속":-15,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 복용 시각·열 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 50 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 15 | 원칙 0 | 공개 20 | 자격 10 | 분산 60 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 5 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2096-01-24에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 창다흰의 약재 복용 시각·열 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표. 복용 시각과 열 기록을 같은 책에 겹치고, 원산지 말목이 없는 상자는 대표 날인 없이 내리지 않는다.","일화":"","관계":"전미리의 중증도 표에 피해자 줄을 올리고, 매하루의 제기동 피해 원장과 이름을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 이송칸의 마지막 기준으로 둔다.","야망":"오염 약으로 쓰러진 이송 명단을 공개 피해 원장으로 묶어 가짜 약이 다시 환승칸에 타지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"오염 약 상자를 압수해 원장을 채우거나, 피해자 대표를 은폐 거래에 끌어들일 수 있다."},"biography":"2096-01-24생인 창다흰은 해열제 쓴맛을 아직도 혀에 남기고, 포장만 깨끗한 약을 들것에 올리지 않는다. 온화하나 열 곡선이 어긋나면 자리에서 일어나지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 복용 시각·열 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표\n**생애.** 2096-01-24에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 창다흰의 약재 복용 시각·열 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표. 복용 시각과 열 기록을 같은 책에 겹치고, 원산지 말목이 없는 상자는 대표 날인 없이 내리지 않는다.\n\n**관계.** 전미리의 중증도 표에 피해자 줄을 올리고, 매하루의 제기동 피해 원장과 이름을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 이송칸의 마지막 기준으로 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 오염 약으로 쓰러진 이송 명단을 공개 피해 원장으로 묶어 가짜 약이 다시 환승칸에 타지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 오염 약 상자를 압수해 원장을 채우거나, 피해자 대표를 은폐 거래에 끌어들일 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 50 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 15 | 원칙 0 | 공개 20 | 자격 10 | 분산 60 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 5 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"창다흰","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 중증도 표에 피해자 줄을 올리고"},{"from":"창다흰","type":"계약","to":"매하루","basis":"매하루의 제기동 피해 원장과 이름을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"매하루","type":"계약","to":"창다흰","basis":"창다흰의 이송 피해자 명단과 이름을 맞추고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0318', 'cd08-c131-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0318","name":"Cho Naru","title":"Escort Signing Clerk","position":"Escort Signing Clerk","characterId":"K317","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Escort signature and witness cross-check","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-chonaru","detailRoute":"/people/person-0318","birthDate":"2072-11-03","birthday":"11-03","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k317-agreement-transcription-review","name":"Draft transcription review","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k317-priority","name":"Escort Signing Clerk","description":"Title: Escort Signing Clerk.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Escort Signing Clerk. He wrote the signing hour and the witness names on one line and locked the box with fewer than two stamps.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k317-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Escort Signing Clerk. He wrote the signing hour and the witness names on one line and locked the box with fewer than two stamps.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Escort Signing Clerk.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd08-c131-c8fc","name":"Cho Clan of Seongju","crest":"clan-crests/cd08-c131-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":30,"Force":-30,"Material":-5,"Communal":30,"Principle":0,"Public":25,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-30,"Display":-15,"Sustained":-20,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Escort signature and witness cross-check","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Escort Signing Clerk","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material −5 | Community 30 | Principle 0 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 30 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −30 | Display −15 | Persistence −20 | Orientation Heterosexual | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2072-11-03. Raised at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening, holds the duty post of Escort Signing Clerk, and the post-handover record shows it was opened by a fake-medicine seal.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, passage-inspection, stretcher-handover and duty-key record desks are proposed as Cho Naru''s duty reference point for escort signing and witness verification. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Escort Signing Clerk. Write the signing time and the witness''s name on the same line, and lock the box if there are fewer than two seals.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"Seeks to keep the escort text valid only in the Sinnae clerk ledger, so that escort fees from outside the route license cannot buy the signature column.","Fear":"","Intervention":"May expose a locked note, or escort the signing witness to protect the clerk ledger."},"biography":"Born on 2072-11-03, Cho Naru does not count an oral agreement made before the ink dries as a record. Quiet, but sets down the brush whenever a clause number is missing.\n\n- Livelihood: Escort signature and witness cross-check\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Escort Signing Clerk\n**Life.** Born on 2072-11-03. Raised at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening, holds the duty post of Escort Signing Clerk, and the post-handover record shows it was opened by a fake-medicine seal.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, passage-inspection, stretcher-handover and duty-key record desks are proposed as Cho Naru''s duty reference point for escort signing and witness verification. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Escort Signing Clerk. Write the signing time and the witness''s name on the same line, and lock the box if there are fewer than two seals.\n\n**Ambition.** Seeks to keep the escort text valid only in the Sinnae clerk ledger, so that escort fees from outside the route license cannot buy the signature column.\n\n**Intervention.** May expose a locked note, or escort the signing witness to protect the clerk ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material −5 | Community 30 | Principle 0 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 30 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −30 | Display −15 | Persistence −20 | Orientation Heterosexual | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Cho Naru","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":""},{"from":"Cho Naru","type":"Contract","to":"Geun Juha","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Chang Haeon","type":"Contract","to":"Cho Naru","basis":""},{"from":"Geun Ba-reum","type":"Contract","to":"Cho Naru","basis":""},{"from":"Geun Juha","type":"Contract","to":"Cho Naru","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0318","name":"초나루","title":"호송 서명 서기","position":"호송 서명 서기","characterId":"K317","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"호송 서명·증인 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-초나루","detailRoute":"/people/person-0318","birthDate":"2072-11-03","birthday":"11-03","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k317-agreement-transcription-review","name":"문안 정서 대조","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k317-priority","name":"호송 서명 서기","description":"직함은 호송 서명 서기.","behavior":"서명 시각과 증인 이름을 같은 줄에 적고, 인장이 둘 미만이면 함을 잠근다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"k317-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 호송 서명 서기. 서명 시각과 증인 이름을 같은 줄에 적고, 인장이 둘 미만이면 함을 잠근다.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 호송 서명 서기.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd08-c131-c8fc","name":"성주 초씨","crest":"clan-crests/cd08-c131-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":30,"무력":-30,"물질":-5,"공동":30,"원칙":0,"공개":25,"자격":20,"분산":30,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":10,"위험":-30,"과시":-15,"지속":-20,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"호송 서명·증인 대조","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"호송 서명 서기","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −5 | 공동 30 | 원칙 0 | 공개 25 | 자격 20 | 분산 30 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2072-11-03에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 호송 서명 서기 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다는 내용이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 초나루의 호송 서명·증인 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 호송 서명 서기. 서명 시각과 증인 이름을 같은 줄에 적고, 인장이 둘 미만이면 함을 잠근다.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"호송 문안을 신내 서기 원장에만 유효하게 남겨 노선 면허 밖의 호송료가 서명란을 사지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"잠긴 쪽지를 폭로하거나, 서명 증인을 호송해 서기 원장을 지킬 수 있다."},"biography":"2072-11-03생인 초나루는 먹물이 마르기 전의 구두 합의를 서기로 치지 않는다. 조용하나 조항 번호가 비면 붓을 내려놓는다.\n\n- 생업: 호송 서명·증인 대조\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 호송 서명 서기\n**생애.** 2072-11-03에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 호송 서명 서기 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다는 내용이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 초나루의 호송 서명·증인 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 호송 서명 서기. 서명 시각과 증인 이름을 같은 줄에 적고, 인장이 둘 미만이면 함을 잠근다.\n\n**야망.** 호송 문안을 신내 서기 원장에만 유효하게 남겨 노선 면허 밖의 호송료가 서명란을 사지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 잠긴 쪽지를 폭로하거나, 서명 증인을 호송해 서기 원장을 지킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −5 | 공동 30 | 원칙 0 | 공개 25 | 자격 20 | 분산 30 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"초나루","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":""},{"from":"초나루","type":"계약","to":"근주하","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"창해온","type":"계약","to":"초나루","basis":""},{"from":"근바름","type":"계약","to":"초나루","basis":""},{"from":"근주하","type":"계약","to":"초나루","basis":""}]}}');
