.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Seok Bomu, born on 2072-08-07, counts empty houses before reading the writing on requisition slips. The longer the line grows, the lower her voice gets.\n\n- Livelihood: Conscription slip and entry headcount cross-check\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Squad Leader\n- Title: Conscripted Crowd Representative\n**Life.** Born on 2072-08-07. Raised on Waiting Hall duty. At the 2126 opening, she took the duty of Conscripted Crowd Representative; the post-handover record remains, opened as a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo classification, weight, waybill, price, and public testimony record desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Seok Bomu''s reference post for checking requisition slips against entry headcounts. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Squad Leader. Title: Conscripted Crowd Representative. Check the requisition slips against actual entry headcounts every evening.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 35 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly −35 | Risk 10 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Multilateral\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seok Bomu","type":"Contract","to":"Ha Seon","basis":""},{"from":"Seok Bomu","type":"Contract","to":"Chang Eunchan","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Heung Daon","type":"Contract","to":"Seok Bomu","basis":""},{"from":"Chang Ji-an","type":"Contract","to":"Seok Bomu","basis":""},{"from":"Chang Eunchan","type":"Contract","to":"Seok Bomu","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0319","na