−25 | 개방 35 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 25 | 자격 25 | 분산 45 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2072-08-07에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 징발 인파 대표 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다는 내용이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 석봄우의 징발 쪽지·출입 인원 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 반장. 직함은 징발 인파 대표. 징발 쪽지와 실제 출입 인원을 저녁마다 대조한다.","일화":"","관계":"","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"2072-08-07생인 석봄우는 징발 쪽지의 글씨보다 빈집을 먼저 센다. 줄이 길어질수록 목소리는 낮아진다.\n\n- 생업: 징발 쪽지·출입 인원 대조\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 반장\n- 직함: 징발 인파 대표\n**생애.** 2072-08-07에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 징발 인파 대표 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다는 내용이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 석봄우의 징발 쪽지·출입 인원 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 반장. 직함은 징발 인파 대표. 징발 쪽지와 실제 출입 인원을 저녁마다 대조한다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 35 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 25 | 자격 25 | 분산 45 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"석봄우","type":"계약","to":"하세온","basis":""},{"from":"석봄우","type":"계약","to":"창은찬","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"흥다온","type":"계약","to":"석봄우","basis":""},{"from":"창지안","type":"계약","to":"석봄우","basis":""},{"from":"창은찬","type":"계약","to":"석봄우","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0320', 'adfc-ccad-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0320","name":"Geun Sori","title":"Party involved in the failed auction at the market","position":"Party involved in the failed auction at the market","characterId":"K319","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Market auction failure time and highest bid posting","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-geunsori","detailRoute":"/people/person-0320","birthDate":"2085-02-01","birthday":"02-01","age":41,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k319-failed-auction-item-review","name":"Failed auction item review","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k319-priority","name":"Public reauction before preemption","description":"Geun Sori sealed military bids and published failed auction times and top offers, comparing external items without a confirmed sale.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Party involved in the failed auction at the market. He wrote the failed-bid hours and top bids on the wall and sealed any bid sheet stamped with a weapons clause until Bok Yong''s market posting.","stress":"Fear. That after the failed-bid records were erased he would become the guarantor of auctions he never saw.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the failed-bid bell with Bok Yong''s market prices and compared items with Heung Yena''s Garak failed-bid ledger. Consulted O Haerin''s price broadcasts only at market hours.","effects":[]},{"id":"k319-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Party involved in the failed auction at the market. He wrote the failed-bid hours and top bids on the wall and sealed any bid sheet stamped with a weapons clause until Bok Yong''s market posting.","stress":"Fear. That after the failed-bid records were erased he would become the guarantor of auctions he never saw.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the failed-bid bell with Bok Yong''s market prices and compared items with Heung Yena''s Garak failed-bid ledger. Consulted O Haerin''s price broadcasts only at market hours.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Geun Sori sealed military bids and published failed auction times and top offers, comparing external items without a confirmed sale.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"adfc-ccad-c8fc","name":"Geun Clan of Cheongju","crest":"clan-crests/adfc-ccad-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":30,"Force":-30,"Material":10,"Communal":20,"Principle":0,"Public":15,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-25,"Display":30,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Market auction failure time and highest bid posting","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Party involved in the failed auction at the market","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material 10 | Community 20 | Principle 0 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 15 | Dispersion 35 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −25 | Display 30 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2085-02-01. Raised at the Noryangjin pier. At the 2126 opening, he took the duty of Market Auction Failed-Bid Official; the post-handover record remains, opened with the public re-check of the scales.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo classification, weight, waybill, price, and public testimony record desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Geun Sori''s reference post for posting market failed-bid times and highest prices. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Party involved in the failed auction at the market. Write the failed-bid times and highest prices on the wall, and seal any bid bearing a weapon crest until Bok Yong''s market posting.","Anecdote":"A bid bearing a weapon crest comes in, offering to buy the entire compartment of emergency supplies that failed to sell. Geun Sori seals the bid to await Bok Yong''s market posting, writes the failed-bid time and highest price on the wall, then compares items with Heung Yena''s Garak failed-bid ledger.","Relationships":"Align the failed-bid bell with Bok Yong''s market prices, and compare items with Heung Yena''s Garak failed-bid ledger. Refer to Oh Haerin''s price broadcasts only during market hours.","Ambition":"He intends to release the unsold emergency-supply compartment only through open re-auction, so that outside pre-emptive purchase cannot buy up the floor price whole.","Fear":"That after the failed-bid records are erased, he will become the guarantor of a winning bid he had no part in.","Intervention":"He can make the failed-bid ledger public to block pre-emption, or seat an outside bid on the empty scale."},"biography":"Geunsol, born 2085-02-01, watches the empty scale longer than the failed-auction bell, and drives out brokers who dress up munitions-crest bids as market price. He reads the credit ledger before he reads a person''s face.\n\n- Livelihood: Market auction failure time and highest bid posting\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Party involved in the failed auction at the market\n**Life.** Born on 2085-02-01. Raised at the Noryangjin pier. At the 2126 opening, he took the duty of Market Auction Failed-Bid Official; the post-handover record remains, opened with the public re-check of the scales.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo classification, weight, waybill, price, and public testimony record desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Geun Sori''s reference post for posting market failed-bid times and highest prices. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Party involved in the failed auction at the market. Write the failed-bid times and highest prices on the wall, and seal any bid bearing a weapon crest until Bok Yong''s market posting.\n\n**Anecdote.** A bid bearing a weapon crest comes in, offering to buy the entire compartment of emergency supplies that failed to sell. Geun Sori seals the bid to await Bok Yong''s market posting, writes the failed-bid time and highest price on the wall, then compares items with Heung Yena''s Garak failed-bid ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Align the failed-bid bell with Bok Yong''s market prices, and compare items with Heung Yena''s Garak failed-bid ledger. Refer to Oh Haerin''s price broadcasts only during market hours.\n\n**Ambition.** He intends to release the unsold emergency-supply compartment only through open re-auction, so that outside pre-emptive purchase cannot buy up the floor price whole.\n\n**Fear.** That after the failed-bid records are erased, he will become the guarantor of a winning bid he had no part in.\n\n**Intervention.** He can make the failed-bid ledger public to block pre-emption, or seat an outside bid on the empty scale.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material 10 | Communal 20 | Principle 0 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk −25 | Display 30 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Geun Sori","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Yong","basis":"Matches Bok Yong''s market prices with the failed-bid bell, and"},{"from":"Geun Sori","type":"Contract","to":"Heung Yena","basis":"Compare items against Heung Yena''s Garak failed-auction ledger"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Heung Yena","type":"Contract","to":"Geun Sori","basis":"Compare items against Geunsol''s Sinnae failed-auction ledger"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0320","name":"근솔이","title":"시장 경매 유찰 관계자","position":"시장 경매 유찰 관계자","characterId":"K319","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"시장 유찰 시각·최고가 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-근솔이","detailRoute":"/people/person-0320","birthDate":"2085-02-01","birthday":"02-01","age":41,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k319-failed-auction-item-review","name":"유찰 품목 대조","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k319-priority","name":"선매보다 공개 재경매","description":"근솔이는 군수 입찰을 봉하고 유찰 시각과 최고가를 공개했다. 외부 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교하되 낙찰 결과는 미확인이다.","behavior":"유찰 시각과 최고가를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 입찰서는 복용의 시장 게시 전까지 봉한다.","stress":"유찰 기록이 지워진 뒤 자신이 없는 낙찰의 보증인이 되는 것.","relationship":"복용의 시장 시세와 유찰 종을 맞추고, 흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다. 오해린의 시세 방송은 시장 시간에만 참고한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k319-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 시장 경매 유찰 관계자. 유찰 시각과 최고가를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 입찰서는 복용의 시장 게시 전까지 봉한다.","stress":"공포. 유찰 기록이 지워진 뒤 자신이 없는 낙찰의 보증인이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 복용의 시장 시세와 유찰 종을 맞추고, 흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다. 오해린의 시세 방송은 시장 시간에만 참고한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"근솔이는 군수 입찰을 봉하고 유찰 시각과 최고가를 공개했다. 외부 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교하되 낙찰 결과는 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"adfc-ccad-c8fc","name":"청주 근씨","crest":"clan-crests/adfc-ccad-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":30,"무력":-30,"물질":10,"공동":20,"원칙":0,"공개":15,"자격":15,"분산":35,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-20,"위험":-25,"과시":30,"지속":-10,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"시장 유찰 시각·최고가 게시","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"시장 경매 유찰 관계자","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 10 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −25 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2085-02-01에 태어났다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 시장 경매 유찰 관계자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다는 내용이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 근솔이의 시장 유찰 시각·최고가 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 시장 경매 유찰 관계자. 유찰 시각과 최고가를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 입찰서는 복용의 시장 게시 전까지 봉한다.","일화":"무기 문장이 찍힌 입찰서가 유찰된 응급 물자 칸을 통째로 사겠다며 들어온다. 근솔이는 입찰서를 봉해 복용의 시장 게시를 기다리게 하고, 유찰 시각과 최고가를 벽에 적은 다음 흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다.","관계":"복용의 시장 시세와 유찰 종을 맞추고, 흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다. 오해린의 시세 방송은 시장 시간에만 참고한다.","야망":"유찰된 응급 물자 칸을 공개 재경매로만 풀어 외부 선매가 바닥 시세를 통째로 사지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"유찰 기록이 지워진 뒤 자신이 없는 낙찰의 보증인이 되는 것.","개입":"유찰 원장을 공개해 선매를 막거나, 빈 저울에 외부 입찰을 앉힐 수 있다."},"biography":"2085-02-01생인 근솔이는 유찰 종소리보다 빈 저울을 오래 본다. 외상 장부를 사람 얼굴보다 먼저 읽는다.\n\n- 생업: 시장 유찰 시각·최고가 게시\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 시장 경매 유찰 관계자\n**생애.** 2085-02-01에 태어났다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 시장 경매 유찰 관계자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다는 내용이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 근솔이의 시장 유찰 시각·최고가 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 시장 경매 유찰 관계자. 유찰 시각과 최고가를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 입찰서는 복용의 시장 게시 전까지 봉한다.\n\n**일화.** 무기 문장이 찍힌 입찰서가 유찰된 응급 물자 칸을 통째로 사겠다며 들어온다. 근솔이는 입찰서를 봉해 복용의 시장 게시를 기다리게 하고, 유찰 시각과 최고가를 벽에 적은 다음 흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다.\n\n**관계.** 복용의 시장 시세와 유찰 종을 맞추고, 흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다. 오해린의 시세 방송은 시장 시간에만 참고한다.\n\n**야망.** 유찰된 응급 물자 칸을 공개 재경매로만 풀어 외부 선매가 바닥 시세를 통째로 사지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 유찰 기록이 지워진 뒤 자신이 없는 낙찰의 보증인이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 유찰 원장을 공개해 선매를 막거나, 빈 저울에 외부 입찰을 앉힐 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 10 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −25 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"근솔이","type":"계약","to":"복용","basis":"복용의 시장 시세와 유찰 종을 맞추고"},{"from":"근솔이","type":"계약","to":"흥예나","basis":"흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"흥예나","type":"계약","to":"근솔이","basis":"근솔이의 신내 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0321', 'creative-d765-c218-c0c9', '{"id":"person-0321","name":"Heung Jiwan","title":"Representative of the transfer evacuation crowd","position":"Representative of the transfer evacuation crowd","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Evacuation time and jurisdiction return records","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"S12","stateName":"The Government","detailRoute":"/people/person-0321","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}}}}', '{"id":"person-0321","name":"흥지완","title":"환승 피난 인파 대표","position":"환승 피난 인파 대표","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"피난 시각·관할 반환 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"S12","stateName":"정부","detailRoute":"/people/person-0321","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0322', 'c11c-b2ec-c131', '{"id":"person-0322","name":"Seo Ongyeol","title":"Medical Transport Duty Officer","position":"Medical Transport Duty Officer","characterId":"K321","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Medical transport roster cross-check and door key handover","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-seoongyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0322","birthDate":"2089-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K296","recipientName":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Interlocks with Jang Sehwa''s dispatch duty, but the stretcher key is drawn only from the duty box.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-12.json","anchor":"character-seoongyeol-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k321-transfer-roster-reconciliation","name":"Transfer roster reconciliation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k321-priority","name":"Refuses unnamed transfers","description":"Seo Ongyeol recorded the time he returned an unnamed request and searched dispatch and duty lists for the name. Patient identification is distinct from treatment.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Transport Duty Officer. He took no unnamed transfer and opened the door only when two rosters matched.","stress":"Fear. That patient transport would mix into one line with quarantine waiting and the hours would be erased.","relationship":"Relations. Meshed with Jang Sehwa''s dispatch medical work, but drew the stretcher keys only from the duty box.","effects":[]},{"id":"k321-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Transport Duty Officer. He took no unnamed transfer and opened the door only when two rosters matched.","stress":"Fear. That patient transport would mix into one line with quarantine waiting and the hours would be erased.","relationship":"Relations. Meshed with Jang Sehwa''s dispatch medical work, but drew the stretcher keys only from the duty box.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Seo Ongyeol recorded the time he returned an unnamed request and searched dispatch and duty lists for the name. Patient identification is distinct from treatment.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11c-b2ec-c131","name":"Dalseong Seo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c11c-b2ec-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":55,"Force":-40,"Material":-10,"Communal":20,"Principle":10,"Public":25,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":5,"Display":15,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical transport roster cross-check and door key handover","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Medical Transport Duty Officer","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 55 | Force −40 | Material −10 | Communal 20 | Principle 10 | Transparency 25 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk 5 | Display 15 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Bonding: Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2089-10-18. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Medical Transfer Duty Officer, and the post-handover record remains, opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover and duty key record desk is proposed as Seo Ongyeol''s duty reference point for medical transfer roster cross-checks and door-key handovers. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, armaments, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings or tenure rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Transport Duty Officer. Takes no nameless transfers; opens the door only when two rosters match.","Anecdote":"A transfer request with a blank name field attaches itself to the end of the quarantine queue and asks for a stretcher. Seo Ongyeol writes down the minute the request was turned away, then lays Jang Sehwa''s dispatch roster and the duty roster side by side to find that patient''s name.","Relationships":"Interlocks with Jang Sehwa''s dispatch duty, but the stretcher key is drawn only from the duty box.","Ambition":"He wants to keep medical transfer duty as a separate single lane, apart from the transfer-window queue.","Fear":"The fear that patient escorts will be mixed into one line with the quarantine queue and the time will be erased.","Intervention":"You can find the roster of the patient who was turned away, or open the separate lane."},"biography":"Seo Ongyeol, born 2089-10-18, records transfer times to the minute and never leaves an empty stretcher at the station past the next window. Few words, long records.\n\n- Livelihood: Medical transport roster cross-check and door key handover\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Medical Transport Duty Officer\n**Life.** Born on 2089-10-18. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Medical Transfer Duty Officer, and the post-handover record remains, opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover and duty key record desk is proposed as Seo Ongyeol''s duty reference point for medical transfer roster cross-checks and door-key handovers. This is a proposal to cross-check winter handover records, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, armaments, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings or tenure rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Transport Duty Officer. Takes no nameless transfers; opens the door only when two rosters match.\n\n**Anecdote.** A transfer request with a blank name field attaches itself to the end of the quarantine queue and asks for a stretcher. Seo Ongyeol writes down the minute the request was turned away, then lays Jang Sehwa''s dispatch roster and the duty roster side by side to find that patient''s name.\n\n**Relations.** Interlocks with Jang Sehwa''s dispatch duty, but the stretcher key is drawn only from the duty box.\n\n**Ambition.** He wants to keep medical transfer duty as a separate single lane, apart from the transfer-window queue.\n\n**Fear.** The fear that patient escorts will be mixed into one line with the quarantine queue and the time will be erased.\n\n**Intervention.** You can find the roster of the patient who was turned away, or open the separate lane.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 55 | Force −40 | Material −10 | Communal 20 | Principle 10 | Transparency 25 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk 5 | Display 15 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Bonding: Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0322","name":"서온결","title":"의무 이송 당직관","position":"의무 이송 당직관","characterId":"K321","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"의무 이송 명부 대조·문 열쇠 인계","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-서온결","detailRoute":"/people/person-0322","birthDate":"2089-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K296","recipientName":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 배차 의무와 맞물리되, 들것 열쇠는 당직함에서만 꺼낸다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-12.json","anchor":"인물-서온결-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k321-transfer-roster-reconciliation","name":"이송 명부 대조","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k321-priority","name":"이름 없는 이송 거부","description":"서온결은 이름 없는 요청을 돌려보낸 시각을 적고 배차·당직 명부에서 이름을 찾았다. 환자를 찾는 확인 절차와 치료는 구분한다.","behavior":"이름 없는 이송은 받지 않고, 명부 두 장이 맞을 때만 문을 연다.","stress":"환자 호송이 검역 대기와 한 줄로 섞여 시간이 지워지는 것.","relationship":"장세화의 배차 의무와 맞물리되, 들것 열쇠는 당직함에서만 꺼낸다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k321-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 의무 이송 당직관. 이름 없는 이송은 받지 않고, 명부 두 장이 맞을 때만 문을 연다.","stress":"공포. 환자 호송이 검역 대기와 한 줄로 섞여 시간이 지워지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화의 배차 의무와 맞물리되, 들것 열쇠는 당직함에서만 꺼낸다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"서온결은 이름 없는 요청을 돌려보낸 시각을 적고 배차·당직 명부에서 이름을 찾았다. 환자를 찾는 확인 절차와 치료는 구분한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11c-b2ec-c131","name":"달성 서씨","crest":"clan-crests/c11c-b2ec-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":55,"무력":-40,"물질":-10,"공동":20,"원칙":10,"공개":25,"자격":30,"분산":30,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":30,"위험":5,"과시":15,"지속":5,"지향":"이성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"의무 이송 명부 대조·문 열쇠 인계","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"의무 이송 당직관","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 55 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −10 | 공동 20 | 원칙 10 | 공개 25 | 자격 30 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 30 | 위험 5 | 과시 15 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2089-10-18에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의무 이송 당직관 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 서온결의 의무 이송 명부 대조·문 열쇠 인계 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 의무 이송 당직관. 이름 없는 이송은 받지 않고, 명부 두 장이 맞을 때만 문을 연다.","일화":"이름 칸이 빈 이송 요청이 검역 대기 줄 끝에 붙어 들것을 청한다. 서온결은 요청을 돌려보낸 시각을 분 단위로 적고, 장세화의 배차 명부와 당직 명부 두 장을 맞대 그 환자의 이름을 찾는다.","관계":"장세화의 배차 의무와 맞물리되, 들것 열쇠는 당직함에서만 꺼낸다.","야망":"의무 이송 당직을 환승 창구의 대기열과 분리된 단독 차로로 남기려 한다.","공포":"환자 호송이 검역 대기와 한 줄로 섞여 시간이 지워지는 것.","개입":"돌려보낸 환자의 명부를 찾거나, 단독 차로를 열 수 있다."},"biography":"2089-10-18생인 서온결은 이송 시각을 분 단위로 적고, 빈 들것은 다음 창 전까지 역에 두지 않는다. 말은 짧게, 기록은 길게.\n\n- 생업: 의무 이송 명부 대조·문 열쇠 인계\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 의무 이송 당직관\n**생애.** 2089-10-18에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의무 이송 당직관 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다는 기록이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 서온결의 의무 이송 명부 대조·문 열쇠 인계 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 의무 이송 당직관. 이름 없는 이송은 받지 않고, 명부 두 장이 맞을 때만 문을 연다.\n\n**일화.** 이름 칸이 빈 이송 요청이 검역 대기 줄 끝에 붙어 들것을 청한다. 서온결은 요청을 돌려보낸 시각을 분 단위로 적고, 장세화의 배차 명부와 당직 명부 두 장을 맞대 그 환자의 이름을 찾는다.\n\n**관계.** 장세화의 배차 의무와 맞물리되, 들것 열쇠는 당직함에서만 꺼낸다.\n\n**야망.** 의무 이송 당직을 환승 창구의 대기열과 분리된 단독 차로로 남기려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 환자 호송이 검역 대기와 한 줄로 섞여 시간이 지워지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 돌려보낸 환자의 명부를 찾거나, 단독 차로를 열 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 55 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −10 | 공동 20 | 원칙 10 | 공개 25 | 자격 30 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 30 | 위험 5 | 과시 15 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0323', 'b958-bb38-d654-67f3', '{"id":"person-0323","name":"Ryu Eunbi","title":"Bureau Chief","position":"Leader of the Government Relief Corps (White Cross)","characterId":"K322","rank":"Bureau Chief","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"Relief Corps Leader: guards the university hospital buildings and medicine stores; first aid and transport only","gender":"Male","stage":"Key","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-ryueunbi","detailRoute":"/people/person-0323","birthDate":"2070-09-16","birthday":"09-16","age":56,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K347","recipientName":"Baek Yeoul","basis":"Cooperates with Ryu Eunbi''s healing guild, but does not disclose the brokerage fee ledger.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-13.json","anchor":"inmul-baekyeoul-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":15,"effective":15},"intrigue":{"base":14,"effective":14},"learning":{"base":14,"effective":14},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k322-bed-allocation","name":"Bed allocation","rating":70},{"id":"k322-drug-trade-review","name":"Drug-trade review","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k322-trait-1","name":"Beds before trade","description":"Stops suspect-drug trade to address risks to bed operations.","behavior":"Stops suspect-drug trade to address risks to bed operations.","stress":"Ends trade without waiting for the auction seal.","relationship":"Connects specimens with Jeong Hojun and clashes with Nam Yungyeong’s drug prices.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He maintains bed rosters and stopped trade when a suspect-drug box reached auction. The card’s severity and clinical opinion guide bed decisions. A conflicting reference to public contribution becomes neither a merit score nor a newly issued medical credential.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s13","name":{"ko":"Jegi-dong Station Directly Held Land"},"holderPersonId":"K322","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S13","stationRef":{"stationId":"Jegi-dong","stationName":"Jegi-dong"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"clan":{"id":"b958-bb38-d654-67f3","name":"Munhwa Ryu Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b958-bb38-d654-67f3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":-30,"Openness":30,"Force":-60,"Material":-20,"Communal":10,"Principle":50,"Public":30,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-40,"Display":-30,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Relief Corps Leader: guards the university hospital buildings and medicine stores; first aid and transport only","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Bureau Chief","Title":"Leader of the Government Relief Corps (White Cross)"},"sections":{},"biography":"Life. Ryu Eunbi, born 2070-09-16, is the leader of the White Cross first-aid corps and carried on the Jegi-dong herbal ledger and the Cheongnyangni bed duty roster. As of the 2126 opening, as commander of the White Cross Order, he assigns beds by severity rather than by a patient''s affiliation, and cross-checks records of herb inspection, market scales, quarantine and treatment contracts. Under winter across Seoul, the Government north of the Han River at Cheong Wa Dae, the Free Cities in the west south of the Han River, and Arc in the Gangnam area south of the Han River each keep their own center, and no single living sphere is monopolized by any of them.\n\n- Occupation: Relief Corps Leader: guards the university hospital buildings and medicine stores; first aid and transport only\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Bureau Chief\n- Title: Leader of the Government Relief Corps (White Cross)\n- The Jegi-dong herb inspection, market scale, severity assignment, quarantine, treatment contract and duty handover desk is Ryu Eunbi''s duty reference point. This duty reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings or tenure rights.\n\nRyu Eunbi sets the bed ledger of the Jegi-dong Patient Council beside the duty roster of the Cheongnyangni Healing Network, and seeks to bind herb allocation, treatment order and escort handover into a single public record.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"Sim Dalho","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Supply treatment materials as medicinal herbs"},{"from":"Eun Chaeyun","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Works at the guild as a first-aid officer''s assistant"},{"from":"Jeon Sol","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Share the Council of Deliberation vote with the commander"},{"from":"Yun Ji-yul","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Owes the medicine allocation ledger to the Healing Guild"},{"from":"Hwang Serin","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Owes a debt for the Bukhansan Bogungmun medicine-ration audit"},{"from":"Kim Sayeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Kim Sayeon stands beside the attending first-aid officer and reports the lower-acuity cases and clinical findings to Ryu Eunbi. Ryu Eunbi checks the bed-assignment order and continues treatment on clinical grounds rather than a patient''s affiliation or wealth."},{"from":"Yeon Jiu","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"owes Ryu Eunbi a bundle of medicines"},{"from":"Gabriel Johnson","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"owing depot medicine to Ryu Eunbi,"},{"from":"Su Hyoeun","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Obeys Ryu Eunbi''s priority on treatment supplies but refuses concealed distribution"},{"from":"Bae Seoyul","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"He entrusts the samples to Ryu Eunbi, and"},{"from":"Gi Seojin","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":""},{"from":"Pyeong Seo-a","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"demands efficacy verification from Ryu Eunbi,"},{"from":"Chang Haeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0323","name":"류은비","title":"국장","position":"정부 구호단(흰십자단) 단장","characterId":"K322","rank":"국장","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"정부 구호단 단장. 대학병원 건물과 약 창고를 지키고 응급 처치와 이송만 맡는다","gender":"남성","stage":"주요","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-류은비","detailRoute":"/people/person-0323","birthDate":"2070-09-16","birthday":"09-16","age":56,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K347","recipientName":"백여울","basis":"류은비의 치료 길드와 협력하되, 중개 수수료 장부는 공개하지 않는다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-13.json","anchor":"인물-백여울-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":15,"effective":15},"intrigue":{"base":14,"effective":14},"learning":{"base":14,"effective":14},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k322-bed-allocation","name":"병상 배정","rating":70},{"id":"k322-drug-trade-review","name":"약 거래 검토","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k322-trait-1","name":"거래보다 침상","description":"의심 약의 거래를 중단해 침상 운영의 위험에 대응한다.","behavior":"의심 약의 거래를 중단해 침상 운영의 위험에 대응한다.","stress":"경매 봉인을 기다리지 않고 거래를 끊는다.","relationship":"정호준과 표본을 연결하고 남윤경의 약 시세와 충돌한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"침상 명부를 유지하고 가짜 약 상자가 경매에 오르자 거래를 끊었다. 카드의 중증도·진료 소견을 병상 판단 근거로 삼는다. 공개 기여라는 다른 카드 표현을 공적 점수로 바꾸거나 의료 자격을 새로 발급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s13","name":{"ko":"제기동역 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K322","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S13","stationRef":{"stationId":"제기동","stationName":"제기동"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"clan":{"id":"b958-bb38-d654-67f3","name":"문화 류씨","crest":"clan-crests/b958-bb38-d654-67f3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"권위":-30,"개방":30,"무력":-60,"물질":-20,"공동":10,"원칙":50,"공개":30,"자격":20,"분산":20,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-20,"위험":-40,"과시":-30,"지속":40,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"정부 구호단 단장. 대학병원 건물과 약 창고를 지키고 응급 처치와 이송만 맡는다","소속":"정부","품계":"국장","직함":"정부 구호단(흰십자단) 단장"},"sections":{},"biography":"생애. 2070-09-16에 태어난 류은비는 제기동 약재 장부와 청량리 병상 당직표를 이어 온 치료자다. 2126년 개막 현재 흰십자단 단장으로서 환자의 소속보다 중증도를 앞세워 병상을 배정하고, 약재 검수·시장 저울·방역·치료 계약의 기록을 함께 대조한다. 서울 전역의 겨울 아래 청와대와 한강 북부의 정부, 한강 이남 서부의 자유도시, 한강 이남 강남지역의 Arc은 각자의 중심을 두며 어느 한 생활권도 독점하지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 정부 구호단 단장. 대학병원 건물과 약 창고를 지키고 응급 처치와 이송만 맡는다\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 국장\n- 직함: 정부 구호단(흰십자단) 단장\n- 제기동의 약재 검수·시장 저울·중증도 배정·방역·치료 계약·당직 인계 창구가 류은비의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n류은비는 제기동 환자회의의 병상 원장과 청량리 치료망의 당직표를 맞대어 약재 배정, 진료 순서, 호송 인계를 한 장의 공개 기록으로 묶으려 한다.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"심달호","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"치료 물자를 약재로 댐"},{"from":"은채윤","type":"스승과 제자","to":"류은비","basis":"응급처치원 조수로 길드에서 일함"},{"from":"전솔","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"의정회 표결을 단장와 공유"},{"from":"윤지율","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"약품 배정 장부를 치료길드에 빚짐"},{"from":"황세린","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"북한산보국문 약품 배급 감사를 빚짐"},{"from":"김사연","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"김사연은 담당 응급처치원 곁에서 적은 중증도·진료 소견을 류은비에게 올린다. 류은비는 병상 배정 순서를 확인해 환자의 소속이나 재산 대신 임상 근거로 치료를 잇는다."},{"from":"연지우","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비에게 약품 묶음을 빚지며"},{"from":"가브리엘 존슨","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비에게 창 약재를 빚지며"},{"from":"수효은","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비의 치료 물자 우선에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"배서율","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비에게 표본을 맡기고"},{"from":"기서진","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":""},{"from":"평서아","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비에게 약효 검증을 청구하며"},{"from":"창해온","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":""}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0324', 'c2ec-ccad-c1a1', '{"id":"person-0324","name":"Sim Dalho","title":"Medicine Dealer","position":"Medicine Identification Relief Worker","characterId":"K323","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medicine origin and release seal cross-check","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#Person-Sim-Dalho","detailRoute":"/people/person-0324","birthDate":"2085-09-30","birthday":"09-30","age":41,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"herbal-medicine-allocation","name":"Herbal medicine allocation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Patient allocation before advance purchase","description":"They divided scarce prescriptions and supply according to patient allocation. Apprenticeship is retained without turning the title into broad appraisal expertise.","behavior":"She spared words as much as the scale''s needle and remembered credit ledgers longer than faces. She did not count an envoy who recommended pre-buying as a guest.","stress":"Fear. That Amsa or Yeouisin would pre-buy the antibiotics and febrifuge herbs and lay the market floor bare.","relationship":"Relations. Staked care supplies for Ryu Eunbi, followed Jeon Sol''s patient allocation, and traded exchange ratios between Eun Taeho''s Garak prices and herbs.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicine Identification Relief Worker. Hangs the origin and drying date on the marker post, and a bulk dispatch takes effect only with the seal of the attending first-aid officer Jeon Sol and the Order Head''s treatment-allocation seal.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicine Identification Relief Worker. Hangs the origin and drying date on the marker post, and a bulk dispatch takes effect only with the seal of the attending first-aid officer Jeon Sol and the Order Head''s treatment-allocation seal.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That Amsa or Yeouisin would pre-buy the antibiotics and febrifuge herbs and lay the market floor bare.","relationship":"Relations. Staked care supplies for Ryu Eunbi, followed Jeon Sol''s patient allocation, and traded exchange ratios between Eun Taeho''s Garak prices and herbs.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"They divided scarce prescriptions and supply according to patient allocation. Apprenticeship is retained without turning the title into broad appraisal expertise.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c2ec-ccad-c1a1","name":"Cheongsong Sim Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c2ec-ccad-c1a1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":30,"Force":-45,"Material":-25,"Communal":25,"Principle":40,"Public":20,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-20,"Display":-10,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicine origin and release seal cross-check","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Relief Worker","Title":"Medicine Dealer","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Materialism −25 | Community 25 | Principle 40 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 30 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −20 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2085-09-30. As of the opening in 2126, she holds the herbalist''s duties and carries on the existing watch and records. The succession record for that post opened through a counterfeit-medicine seizure.\n- The herb origin and dispatch seal checking window in Jegidong is Sim Dalho''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicine Identification Relief Worker. Hangs the origin and drying date on the marker post, and a bulk dispatch takes effect only with the seal of the attending first-aid officer Jeon Sol and the Order Head''s treatment-allocation seal.","Anecdote":"In 2125, amid a herb shortage, she halved the prescription quantities and shared them out to everyone. That day''s record remained as handover evidence for the next watch to verify.","Relationships":"Supplies Ryu Eunbi''s treatment materials, follows Jeon Sol''s patient allocation, and trades Eun Taeho''s bundle prices and herb exchange ratios.","Ambition":"Wants to take the Cheongnyangni herb auction away from closed monopoly bidding and turn it into acuity-based allocation under the medical command.","Fear":"Fears that Amsa or Yeouisin will pre-purchase antibiotics and fever-reducing herbal medicines, leaving the market floor bare.","Intervention":"Can recover the pre-purchase ledger, or expose a private pre-purchase agent at the auction house."},"biography":"Sparing with words as a scale''s graduations are sparing, she remembers a credit ledger longer than a person''s face. She does not regard an envoy urging pre-purchase as a customer.\n\n- Livelihood: Medicine origin and release seal cross-check\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Relief Worker\n- Title: Medicine Identification Relief Worker\n**Life.** Born on 2085-09-30. As of the opening in 2126, she holds the herbalist''s duties and carries on the existing watch and records. The succession record for that post opened through a counterfeit-medicine seizure.\n- The herb origin and dispatch seal checking window in Jegidong is Sim Dalho''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicine Identification Relief Worker. Hangs the origin and drying date on the marker post, and a bulk dispatch takes effect only with the seal of the attending first-aid officer Jeon Sol and the Order Head''s treatment-allocation seal.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, amid a herb shortage, she halved the prescription quantities and shared them out to everyone. That day''s record remained as handover evidence for the next watch to verify.\n\n**Relationships.** Supplies Ryu Eunbi''s treatment materials, follows Jeon Sol''s patient allocation, and trades Eun Taeho''s bundle prices and herb exchange ratios.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants to take the Cheongnyangni herb auction away from closed monopoly bidding and turn it into acuity-based allocation under the medical command.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that Amsa or Yeouisin will pre-purchase antibiotics and fever-reducing herbal medicines, leaving the market floor bare.\n\n**Intervention.** Can recover the pre-purchase ledger, or expose a private pre-purchase agent at the auction house.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Materialism −25 | Community 25 | Principle 40 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 30 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −20 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sim Dalho","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Supply treatment materials as medicinal herbs"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Cheon Daum","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Sim Dalho","basis":"An aide who backs Sim Dalho''s origin marker post in the field, and"},{"from":"Dong Neulsol","type":"Contract","to":"Sim Dalho","basis":"Enters a transport contract with Sim Dalho, and"},{"from":"Dong Juha","type":"Command","to":"Sim Dalho","basis":"Enforces Sim Dalho''s auction rules at the scale, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0324","name":"심달호","title":"약재상","position":"약재 감별 구호원","characterId":"K323","rank":"구호원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"약재 원산지·출고 날인 대조","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-심달호","detailRoute":"/people/person-0324","birthDate":"2085-09-30","birthday":"09-30","age":41,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"herbal-medicine-allocation","name":"약재 배분","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"선매보다 환자 할당","description":"부족한 처방량을 나눴고 환자 할당에 따라 물자를 댄다. 도제 학습은 보존하되 직함만으로 감별 숙련을 확대하지 않는다.","behavior":"저울눈만큼 말을 아끼고, 외상 장부를 사람 얼굴보다 오래 기억한다. 선매를 권하는 사신을 손님으로 보지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 암사나 여의신이 항생제와 해열 생약을 선매해 시장 바닥이 드러나는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비의 치료 물자를 대고, 전솔의 환자 할당을 따르며, 은태호의 가락 가격과 약재 교환 비율을 거래한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 감별 구호원. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 응급처치원 전솔과 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 성립시킨다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 감별 구호원. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 응급처치원 전솔과 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 성립시킨다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 암사나 여의신이 항생제와 해열 생약을 선매해 시장 바닥이 드러나는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비의 치료 물자를 대고, 전솔의 환자 할당을 따르며, 은태호의 가락 가격과 약재 교환 비율을 거래한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"부족한 처방량을 나눴고 환자 할당에 따라 물자를 댄다. 도제 학습은 보존하되 직함만으로 감별 숙련을 확대하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c2ec-ccad-c1a1","name":"청송 심씨","crest":"clan-crests/c2ec-ccad-c1a1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":30,"무력":-45,"물질":-25,"공동":25,"원칙":40,"공개":20,"자격":20,"분산":30,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-20,"위험":-20,"과시":-10,"지속":35,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 원산지·출고 날인 대조","소속":"정부","품계":"구호원","직함":"약재상","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −25 | 공동 25 | 원칙 40 | 공개 20 | 자격 20 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2085-09-30에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재상 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 원산지·출고 날인 대조 창구가 심달호의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 감별 구호원. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 응급처치원 전솔과 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 성립시킨다.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.","관계":"류은비의 치료 물자를 대고, 전솔의 환자 할당을 따르며, 은태호의 가락 가격과 약재 교환 비율을 거래한다.","야망":"청량리 약재 경매를 비공개 독점 입찰에서 떼어내 의료 지휘부 중증도 배정으로 바꾼다.","공포":"암사나 여의신이 항생제와 해열 생약을 선매해 시장 바닥이 드러나는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"선매 장부를 되찾거나, 비공개 선매 대리인을 경매장에서 공개할 수 있다."},"biography":"저울눈만큼 말을 아끼고, 외상 장부를 사람 얼굴보다 오래 기억한다. 선매를 권하는 사신을 손님으로 보지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 원산지·출고 날인 대조\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 구호원\n- 직함: 약재상\n**생애.** 2085-09-30에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재상 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 원산지·출고 날인 대조 창구가 심달호의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 감별 구호원. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 응급처치원 전솔과 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 성립시킨다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 류은비의 치료 물자를 대고, 전솔의 환자 할당을 따르며, 은태호의 가락 가격과 약재 교환 비율을 거래한다.\n\n**야망.** 청량리 약재 경매를 비공개 독점 입찰에서 떼어내 의료 지휘부 중증도 배정으로 바꾼다.\n\n**공포.** 암사나 여의신이 항생제와 해열 생약을 선매해 시장 바닥이 드러나는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 선매 장부를 되찾거나, 비공개 선매 대리인을 경매장에서 공개할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −25 | 공동 25 | 원칙 40 | 공개 20 | 자격 20 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"심달호","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"치료 물자를 약재로 댐"}],"incoming":[{"from":"천다움","type":"스승과 제자","to":"심달호","basis":"심달호의 원산지 말목을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고"},{"from":"동늘솔","type":"계약","to":"심달호","basis":"심달호와 운송 계약을 맺고"},{"from":"동주하","type":"지휘","to":"심달호","basis":"심달호의 경매 규칙을 저울에서 집행하고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0325', 'c740-d589-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0325","name":"Eun Chaeyun","title":"Relief Worker","position":"Triage First-Aid Officer","characterId":"K324","rank":"First-Aid Officer","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Triage assignment and priority transport request report","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#Person-Eun-Chaeyun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0325","birthDate":"2094-02-23","birthday":"02-23","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"care-under-isolation","name":"Care under isolation","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Unbending treatment order","description":"Isolation of a suspected infectious patient did not end home visits, and officer priority requests are refused. Continuity of care and severity judgment are supported strengths.","behavior":"His hands moved gently, but he turned cold to any pressure to change the care order. An enemy''s wound stood in the same line before the severity table.","stress":"Fear. That the care room would become a war-booty sorting hall and Jegi-dong''s legitimacy would fall in a season.","relationship":"Relations. Worked as Ryu Eunbi''s apprentice, received Baek On''s refugees, and matched sickbeds with Jeon Miri''s Sinnae transfers.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Triage First-Aid Officer. He assigned beds with the severity table and clinical findings written side by side and reported an officer''s priority care request to the unit chief, declining it under the triage principle.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Triage First-Aid Officer. He assigned beds with the severity table and clinical findings written side by side and reported an officer''s priority care request to the unit chief, declining it under the triage principle.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the care room would become a war-booty sorting hall and Jegi-dong''s legitimacy would fall in a season.","relationship":"Relations. Worked as Ryu Eunbi''s apprentice, received Baek On''s refugees, and matched sickbeds with Jeon Miri''s Sinnae transfers.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Isolation of a suspected infectious patient did not end home visits, and officer priority requests are refused. Continuity of care and severity judgment are supported strengths.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c740-d589-c8fc","name":"Eun Clan of Haengju","crest":"clan-crests/c740-d589-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-30,"Openness":35,"Force":-65,"Material":-20,"Communal":10,"Principle":60,"Public":25,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":25,"Display":-5,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Triage assignment and priority transport request report","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"First-Aid Officer","Title":"Relief Worker","Values":"Authority −30 | Openness 35 | Force −65 | Material −20 | Communal 10 | Principle 60 | Publicity 25 | Credentials 15 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 0 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk 25 | Display −5 | Endurance 35 | Orientation None | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2094-02-23. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Triage First-Aid Officer, continuing the existing duty rota and records. The succession record of that post opened with a counterfeit medicine seal.\n- The triage assignment and priority-treatment request reporting desk in Jegidong is Eun Chaeyun''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or occupancy rights.","Offices":"Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Triage First-Aid Officer. Assigns patients by writing the triage chart and clinical findings side by side, and reports priority-treatment requests from armed duty chiefs to the Order Leader, then refuses them under the triage principle.","Anecdote":"In 2125, kept a suspected-contagion patient in an isolation compartment and never stopped making house calls. That day''s record remained as a handover basis for the next duty shift to verify.","Relationships":"Works as Ryu Eunbi''s apprentice, takes in Baek On''s refugees, and matches Sinnae transfer beds with Jeon Miri.","Ambition":"","Fear":"Fears that the clinic will become a sorting yard for spoils and that Jegidong''s legitimacy will collapse within a single season.","Intervention":""},"biography":"The hands are gentle, but cold toward pressure to change the treatment order. Even an enemy''s wounds are seen on the same line before the triage chart.\n\n- Occupation: Triage assignment and priority transport request report\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: First-Aid Officer\n- Title: Relief Worker\n**Life.** Born 2094-02-23. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Triage First-Aid Officer, continuing the existing duty rota and records. The succession record of that post opened with a counterfeit medicine seal.\n- The triage assignment and priority-treatment request reporting desk in Jegidong is Eun Chaeyun''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Triage First-Aid Officer. Assigns patients by writing the triage chart and clinical findings side by side, and reports priority-treatment requests from armed duty chiefs to the Order Leader, then refuses them under the triage principle.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, kept a suspected-contagion patient in an isolation compartment and never stopped making house calls. That day''s record remained as a handover basis for the next duty shift to verify.\n\n**Relationships.** Works as Ryu Eunbi''s apprentice, takes in Baek On''s refugees, and matches Sinnae transfer beds with Jeon Miri.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that the clinic will become a sorting yard for spoils and that Jegidong''s legitimacy will collapse within a single season.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −30 | Openness 35 | Force −65 | Material −20 | Communal 10 | Principle 60 | Publicity 25 | Credentials 15 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk 25 | Display −5 | Endurance 35 | Orientation None | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Eun Chaeyun","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Works at the guild as a Triage First-Aid Officer''s apprentice"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gu Reumgyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"Gureumgyeol redirects requests to change the treatment order to the public desk and passes the prescription records and request details to Eun Chaeyun. Eun Chaeyun assigns by clinical findings and the triage chart so that a request does not push aside the turn of a more critical patient."},{"from":"Kang Soljun","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"Gang Soljun redirects requests to change the treatment order to the public desk and passes the prescription records to Eun Chaeyun. Eun Chaeyun assigns by triage level and clinical findings so that a request does not push aside critical patients."},{"from":"Seong Sol-hyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"Seong Solhyeon hands the records of the reopened prescription duty over to Eun Chaeyun. Eun Chaeyun checks the triage level and clinical findings and continues the treatment of patients who were dropped during the shift-change gap."},{"from":"Bak Byeoryun","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"Bak Byeolyun redirects requests to change the treatment order to the public desk and passes the prescription records to Eun Chaeyun. Eun Chaeyun assigns by triage level and clinical findings so that a private request does not jump ahead of patients in line."},{"from":"Cha Bahwan","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"Cha Bahwan redirects treatment-order requests to the public desk and passes the prescription records to Eun Chaeyun. Eun Chaeyun assigns by triage level and clinical findings so that critical patients are not pushed aside by requests."},{"from":"Bang Hanul","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"a protégé who, as Eun Chaeyun''s apprentice, enforces the order of the sickbeds, and"},{"from":"Won Miru","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"receives the medicines on Eun Chaeyun''s shelf as reference samples"},{"from":"Bang Misan","type":"Command","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"divides the sickbeds under Eun Chaeyun''s command, and"},{"from":"Seok Raon","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"opens Eun Chaeyun''s sickbeds to the refugee line, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0325","name":"은채윤","title":"구호원","position":"중증도 응급처치원","characterId":"K324","rank":"응급처치원","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"중증도 배정·우선 이송 요청 보고","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-은채윤","detailRoute":"/people/person-0325","birthDate":"2094-02-23","birthday":"02-23","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"care-under-isolation","name":"격리 진료","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"치료 순서를 굽히지 않는다","description":"의심 환자를 격리하면서 왕진을 이어갔고 장교의 우선 요청을 거절한다. 치료 지속과 중증도 판단이 강점이다.","behavior":"손놀림은 부드러우나 치료 순서를 바꾸라는 압력에는 차갑다. 적의 부상도 중증도 표 앞에서는 같은 줄로 본다.","stress":"공포. 진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 제기동의 정통성이 한 계절에 무너지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비의 도제로 일하며, 백온의 피난민을 받고, 전미리와 신내 이송 병상을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 중증도 응급처치원. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 적어 배정하고, 장교의 우선 치료 요청은 단장에게 보고하고 중증도 원칙에 따라 거절한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 중증도 응급처치원. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 적어 배정하고, 장교의 우선 치료 요청은 단장에게 보고하고 중증도 원칙에 따라 거절한다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 제기동의 정통성이 한 계절에 무너지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비의 도제로 일하며, 백온의 피난민을 받고, 전미리와 신내 이송 병상을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"의심 환자를 격리하면서 왕진을 이어갔고 장교의 우선 요청을 거절한다. 치료 지속과 중증도 판단이 강점이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c740-d589-c8fc","name":"행주 은씨","crest":"clan-crests/c740-d589-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-30,"개방":35,"무력":-65,"물질":-20,"공동":10,"원칙":60,"공개":25,"자격":15,"분산":25,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-10,"위험":25,"과시":-5,"지속":35,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"중증도 배정·우선 이송 요청 보고","소속":"정부","품계":"응급처치원","직함":"구호원","가치관":"권위 −30 | 개방 35 | 무력 −65 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 60 | 공개 25 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 25 | 과시 −5 | 지속 35 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2094-02-23에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 치료사 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 중증도 배정·우선 치료 요청 보고 창구가 은채윤의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 응급처치원. 직함은 중증도 응급처치원. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 적어 배정하고, 무장 당직 책임자의 우선 치료 요청은 단장에게 보고하고 중증도 원칙에 따라 거절한다.","일화":"2125년 전염 의심 환자를 격리 칸에 두고 왕진을 멈추지 않았다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.","관계":"류은비의 도제로 일하며, 백온의 피난민을 받고, 전미리와 신내 이송 병상을 맞춘다.","야망":"","공포":"진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 제기동의 정통성이 한 계절에 무너지는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":""},"biography":"손놀림은 부드러우나 치료 순서를 바꾸라는 압력에는 차갑다. 적의 부상도 중증도 표 앞에서는 같은 줄로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 중증도 배정·우선 이송 요청 보고\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 응급처치원\n- 직함: 구호원\n**생애.** 2094-02-23에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 치료사 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 중증도 배정·우선 치료 요청 보고 창구가 은채윤의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 중증도 응급처치원. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 적어 배정하고, 무장 당직 책임자의 우선 치료 요청은 단장에게 보고하고 중증도 원칙에 따라 거절한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 전염 의심 환자를 격리 칸에 두고 왕진을 멈추지 않았다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 류은비의 도제로 일하며, 백온의 피난민을 받고, 전미리와 신내 이송 병상을 맞춘다.\n\n**공포.** 진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 제기동의 정통성이 한 계절에 무너지는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −30 | 개방 35 | 무력 −65 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 60 | 공개 25 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 25 | 과시 −5 | 지속 35 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"은채윤","type":"스승과 제자","to":"류은비","basis":"치료사 도제로 길드에서 일함"}],"incoming":[{"from":"구름결","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"구름결은 치료 순서를 바꿔 달라는 청탁을 공개 창구로 돌리고 은채윤에게 처방 기록과 요청 내용을 전한다. 은채윤은 진료 소견과 중증도 표로 배정해, 청탁이 더 위중한 환자의 순서를 밀어내지 않게 한다."},{"from":"강솔준","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"강솔준은 치료 순서를 바꾸라는 청탁을 공개 창구로 돌리고 은채윤에게 처방 기록을 전한다. 은채윤은 중증도와 진료 소견으로 배정해 청탁이 위중한 환자를 밀어내지 않게 한다."},{"from":"성솔현","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"성솔현은 다시 열린 처방 당직의 기록을 은채윤에게 넘긴다. 은채윤은 중증도와 진료 소견을 확인해 교대 공백 중 빠진 환자의 치료를 잇는다."},{"from":"박별윤","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"박별윤은 치료 순서를 바꾸라는 청탁을 공개 창구로 돌리고 은채윤에게 처방 기록을 전한다. 은채윤은 중증도와 진료 소견에 따라 배정해 사적 요청이 환자 순서를 앞지르지 않게 한다."},{"from":"차바환","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"차바환은 치료 순서 청탁을 공개 창구로 돌리고 은채윤에게 처방 기록을 전한다. 은채윤은 중증도·진료 소견으로 배정해 위중한 환자가 청탁에 밀리지 않게 한다."},{"from":"방한울","type":"스승과 제자","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 도제로서 침상 순서를 집행하는 제자이고"},{"from":"원미루","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 선반 약을 대조 표본으로 받는다"},{"from":"방미산","type":"지휘","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 지휘로 병상을 나누고"},{"from":"석라온","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 병상을 피난 줄에 열고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0326', 'b77c-ae08-c131-7f85', '{"id":"person-0326","name":"Ra Seyeong","title":"Epidemic Prevention Manager","position":"Epidemic Prevention First-Aid Officer","characterId":"K325","rank":"First-Aid Officer","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Quarantine entry stamp and release records","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-ra-seyeong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0326","birthDate":"2083-09-06","birthday":"09-06","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"isolation-access-control","name":"Isolation access control","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"No release before records","description":"She kept the temperature record of hypothermia patients unbroken until hospital transfer, and in a fire rescued the patient ledger first. Management of first aid and preservation of records are evaluated separately.","behavior":"She turned principles into numbers and trusted isolation days over rumor. She wrote a political blockade lift down as a cause of accidents.","stress":"Fear. That frostbite and hypothermia patients would arrive all at once while the route to the hospital was cut, leaving too few first-aid hands.","relationship":"Relations. Shared drug-efficacy verification with Jeong Hojun and carried a debt for demanding Ha Yunmok''s Achasan gate quarantine pass.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Epidemic Prevention First-Aid Officer. Takes each patient''s temperature and pulse, checks the triage chart twice, and sends patients on only after hospital admission is confirmed.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Epidemic Prevention First-Aid Officer. Takes each patient''s temperature and pulse, checks the triage chart twice, and sends patients on only after hospital admission is confirmed.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That frostbite and hypothermia patients would arrive all at once while the route to the hospital was cut, leaving too few first-aid hands.","relationship":"Relations. Shared drug-efficacy verification with Jeong Hojun and carried a debt for demanding Ha Yunmok''s Achasan gate quarantine pass.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She kept the temperature record of hypothermia patients unbroken until hospital transfer, and in a fire rescued the patient ledger first. Management of first aid and preservation of records are evaluated separately.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b77c-ae08-c131-7f85","name":"Ra Clan of Geumseong","crest":"clan-crests/b77c-ae08-c131-7f85.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":35,"Force":-70,"Material":-20,"Communal":20,"Principle":60,"Public":15,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":15,"Display":-30,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Quarantine entry stamp and release records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"First-Aid Officer","Title":"Epidemic Prevention Manager","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −70 | Material −20 | Communal 20 | Principle 60 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 15 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 45 | Possessiveness −35 | Risk 15 | Display −30 | Endurance 25 | Orientation Fluid | Union Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2083-09-06. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Epidemic Control Officer, continuing the existing duty rota and records. The succession record of that post opened with a replacement shift for an unexcused shift-change absence.\n- The quarantine entry stamp and release record desk in Jegidong is Ra Seyeong''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or occupancy rights.","Offices":"Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Epidemic Prevention First-Aid Officer. Takes each patient''s temperature and pulse, checks the triage chart twice, and sends patients on only after hospital admission is confirmed.","Anecdote":"In the 2125 station fire, carried out the register of lives first. That day''s record remained as a handover basis for the next duty shift to verify.","Relationships":"Shares efficacy verification with Jeong Hojun and owes a debt for having repeatedly demanded Ha Yunmok''s Achasan checkpoint quarantine pass.","Ambition":"To let the quarantine corps invoke the Dongdaemun-Cheongnyangni quarantine blockade authority on its own, preventing non-medical lifting.","Fear":"Fears frostbite and hypothermia patients arriving all at once while the route to the hospital is cut, leaving too few first-aid hands.","Intervention":"Can carry samples of the contamination source to Magok, or strike a deal to lift the blockade and resume shipments of medicinal herbs."},"biography":"Turns principles into numbers and trusts quarantine days over rumors. Writes political lifting of a blockade down as the cause of an accident.\n\n- Occupation: Quarantine entry stamp and release records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: First-Aid Officer\n- Title: Epidemic Prevention Manager\n**Life.** Born 2083-09-06. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Epidemic Control Officer, continuing the existing duty rota and records. The succession record of that post opened with a replacement shift for an unexcused shift-change absence.\n- The quarantine entry stamp and release record desk in Jegidong is Ra Seyeong''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Epidemic Prevention First-Aid Officer. Takes each patient''s temperature and pulse, checks the triage chart twice, and sends patients on only after hospital admission is confirmed.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the 2125 station fire, carried out the register of lives first. That day''s record remained as a handover basis for the next duty shift to verify.\n\n**Relationships.** Shares efficacy verification with Jeong Hojun and owes a debt for having repeatedly demanded Ha Yunmok''s Achasan checkpoint quarantine pass.\n\n**Ambition.** To let the quarantine corps invoke the Dongdaemun-Cheongnyangni quarantine blockade authority on its own, preventing non-medical lifting.\n\n**Fear.** Fears frostbite and hypothermia patients arriving all at once while the route to the hospital is cut, leaving too few first-aid hands.\n\n**Intervention.** Can carry samples of the contamination source to Magok, or strike a deal to lift the blockade and resume shipments of medicinal herbs.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −70 | Material −20 | Communal 20 | Principle 60 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 15 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Possessiveness −35 | Risk 15 | Display −30 | Endurance 25 | Orientation Fluid | Union Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"Sim Dahyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Sim Dahyeon, when handing over the duty shift, brings the patient entry records and a copy of the body temperature records to Ra Seyeong. Ra Seyeong checks the triage tags and transfer records, searches for omissions together with Sim Dahyeon, and decides on the transfer only after the hospital transfer signature arrives."},{"from":"Gu Sohui","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Gu Sohui brings the original patient triage tags and the entry seal to Ra Seyeong to check a suspicious copy. Ra Seyeong examines the triage and transfer records to confirm whether a forged seal got through, and does not finalize a transfer before the hospital transfer signature arrives."},{"from":"Gang Bayu","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Gang Bayu brings the original patient triage tags to Ra Seyeong to check a suspicious entry seal. Ra Seyeong examines the triage and transfer records so that frostbite patients are not left out of a transfer because of a forged copy, and waits for the hospital signature to arrive."},{"from":"Sim Pahyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Sim Pahyeon continues treating patients in the quarantine ward and hands the medicine management and entry records over to Ra Seyeong. Ra Seyeong checks the quarantine seal and release records so that the fact that house calls continued is not mistaken for a quarantine release."},{"from":"Sim Bahyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Sim Bahyeon brings the original quarantine records and the suspicious seal to Ra Seyeong. Ra Seyeong checks the quarantine entry and release records so that a forged copy is not used as grounds for release."},{"from":"Im Ba-na","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Im Bana hands the corrected quarantine ledger and the handover signature to Ra Seyeong. Ra Seyeong checks the quarantine entry and release records to distinguish duplicated lines from actual patient movement."},{"from":"Sim Nayang","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Sim Nayang delivers the preserved quarantine transcript to Ra Seyeong. Ra Seyeong checks the quarantine entry and release records so that an illegible seal is not used as grounds for release."},{"from":"O Taho","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"O Taho delivers the correction of the duplicate quarantine issuance and the signature to Ra Seyeong. Ra Seyeong checks the actual quarantine entries and releases to distinguish ledger duplication from patient movement."},{"from":"Su Choreong","type":"Command","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Circles the eastern alley under Ra Seyeong''s command and"},{"from":"Won Miru","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"is a contract to hand contamination coordinates to Ra Seyeong and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0326","name":"라세영","title":"방역 관리","position":"방역 응급처치원","characterId":"K325","rank":"응급처치원","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"격리 출입 도장·해제 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-라세영","detailRoute":"/people/person-0326","birthDate":"2083-09-06","birthday":"09-06","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"isolation-access-control","name":"격리 출입 관리","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"기록 전에는 해제하지 않는다","description":"저체온 환자는 병원 이송 전까지 체온 기록을 끊지 않았고, 화재에서는 환자 명부를 먼저 구했다. 응급처치 운영과 기록 보존을 분리해 평가한다.","behavior":"원칙을 숫자로 바꾸고, 소문보다 격리 일수를 믿는다. 정치적 봉쇄 해제를 사고 원인으로 적는다.","stress":"공포. 동상·저체온 환자가 한꺼번에 몰리는데 병원 이송 길이 끊겨 응급처치원 손이 모자라는 것.","relationship":"관계. 정호준과 약효 검증을 공유하고, 하윤목의 아차산 관문 검역 통과증을 요구해 온 빚이 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 방역 응급처치원. 환자의 체온과 맥을 재고 분류표를 두 번 확인하며, 이송은 병원 접수 확인이 온 뒤에만 보낸다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 방역 응급처치원. 환자의 체온과 맥을 재고 분류표를 두 번 확인하며, 이송은 병원 접수 확인이 온 뒤에만 보낸다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 동상·저체온 환자가 한꺼번에 몰리는데 병원 이송 길이 끊겨 응급처치원 손이 모자라는 것.","relationship":"관계. 정호준과 약효 검증을 공유하고, 하윤목의 아차산 관문 검역 통과증을 요구해 온 빚이 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"저체온 환자는 병원 이송 전까지 체온 기록을 끊지 않았고, 화재에서는 환자 명부를 먼저 구했다. 응급처치 운영과 기록 보존을 분리해 평가한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b77c-ae08-c131-7f85","name":"금성 라씨","crest":"clan-crests/b77c-ae08-c131-7f85.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":35,"무력":-70,"물질":-20,"공동":20,"원칙":60,"공개":15,"자격":15,"분산":15,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-35,"위험":15,"과시":-30,"지속":25,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"격리 출입 도장·해제 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"응급처치원","직함":"방역 관리","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −70 | 물질 −20 | 공동 20 | 원칙 60 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 15 | 과시 −30 | 지속 25 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2083-09-06에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 방역 관리 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 격리 출입 도장·해제 기록 창구가 라세영의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 응급처치원. 직함은 방역 응급처치원. 환자의 체온과 맥을 재고 분류표를 두 번 확인하며, 이송은 병원 접수 확인이 온 뒤에만 보낸다.","일화":"2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.","관계":"정호준과 약효 검증을 공유하고, 하윤목의 아차산 관문 검역 통과증을 요구해 온 빚이 있다.","야망":"동대문·청량리 방역 봉쇄권을 방역대가 단독 발동하게 해 비의료적 해제를 막는다.","공포":"동상·저체온 환자가 한꺼번에 몰리는데 병원 이송 길이 끊겨 응급처치원 손이 모자라는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"오염원 표본을 마곡으로 나르거나, 봉쇄를 풀어 약재 출하를 재개시키는 거래를 할 수 있다."},"biography":"원칙을 숫자로 바꾸고, 소문보다 격리 일수를 믿는다. 정치적 봉쇄 해제를 사고 원인으로 적는다.\n\n- 생업: 격리 출입 도장·해제 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 응급처치원\n- 직함: 방역 관리\n**생애.** 2083-09-06에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 방역 관리 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 격리 출입 도장·해제 기록 창구가 라세영의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 방역 응급처치원. 환자의 체온과 맥을 재고 분류표를 두 번 확인하며, 이송은 병원 접수 확인이 온 뒤에만 보낸다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 정호준과 약효 검증을 공유하고, 하윤목의 아차산 관문 검역 통과증을 요구해 온 빚이 있다.\n\n**야망.** 동대문·청량리 방역 봉쇄권을 방역대가 단독 발동하게 해 비의료적 해제를 막는다.\n\n**공포.** 동상·저체온 환자가 한꺼번에 몰리는데 병원 이송 길이 끊겨 응급처치원 손이 모자라는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 오염원 표본을 마곡으로 나르거나, 봉쇄를 풀어 약재 출하를 재개시키는 거래를 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −70 | 물질 −20 | 공동 20 | 원칙 60 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 15 | 과시 −30 | 지속 25 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"심다현","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"심다현은 당직을 넘길 때 환자 출입 기록과 체온 기록 사본을 라세영에게 가져간다. 라세영은 분류표와 이송 기록을 확인하며 심다현과 함께 누락을 찾고, 병원 이송 서명이 도착한 뒤 이송을 판단한다."},{"from":"구소희","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"구소희는 환자 분류표 원본과 출입 도장을 라세영에게 가져가 의심스러운 사본을 확인한다. 라세영은 분류와 이송 기록을 살펴 위조 도장이 통과했는지 확인하고, 병원 이송 서명이 도착하기 전에는 이송을 확정하지 않는다."},{"from":"강바유","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"강바유는 환자 분류표 원본을 라세영에게 가져가 의심스러운 출입 도장을 확인한다. 라세영은 분류와 이송 기록을 살펴 위조 사본 때문에 동상 환자가 이송에서 빠지지 않게 하고 병원 서명의 도착을 기다린다."},{"from":"심파현","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"심파현은 격리 칸의 환자 진료를 이어가며 약재 관리와 출입 기록을 라세영에게 넘긴다. 라세영은 격리 도장과 해제 기록을 확인해 왕진이 계속된 사실을 격리 해제로 오인하지 않게 한다."},{"from":"심바현","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"심바현은 방역 원본과 의심 날인을 라세영에게 가져간다. 라세영은 격리 출입·해제 기록을 확인해 위조 사본이 해제 근거로 쓰이지 않게 한다."},{"from":"임바나","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"임바나는 정정한 방역 장부와 인수 서명을 라세영에게 넘긴다. 라세영은 격리 출입과 해제 기록을 확인해 중복된 줄을 실제 환자 이동과 구분한다."},{"from":"심나양","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"심나양은 보존한 방역 필사본을 라세영에게 전한다. 라세영은 격리 출입·해제 기록을 확인해 읽히지 않는 날인이 해제 근거로 쓰이지 않게 한다."},{"from":"오타호","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"오타호는 방역 중복 지급 정정과 서명을 라세영에게 전한다. 라세영은 실제 격리 출입·해제를 확인해 장부 중복과 환자 이동을 구분한다."},{"from":"수초롱","type":"지휘","to":"라세영","basis":"라세영의 지휘로 동측 골목을 돌고"},{"from":"원미루","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"라세영에게 오염 좌표를 넘기는 계약이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0327', 'b0a8-c758-b839', '{"id":"person-0327","name":"Nam Hoseong","title":"Medical Escort Captain","position":"Medical Escort First-Aid Officer","characterId":"K326","rank":"First-Aid Officer","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-nam-hoseong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0327","birthDate":"2089-11-08","birthday":"11-08","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"medical-transport-coordination","name":"Medical transport coordination","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Late destination disclosure","description":"Section changes and bridge permissions are coordinated each time, with destinations disclosed late. Route confidentiality and patient allocation do not prove combat performance.","behavior":"His faith was strong, but he did not announce convoy routes in advance. He refused armed escort inside the care cars.","stress":"Fear. That a convoy train would be mistaken for a munitions train and stopped on the Guui bridge.","relationship":"Relations. Split medical convoys with Jang Sehwa, exchanged section rotations with Ha Seon, and took Go Seojun''s bridge passage permit fresh each time.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Medical Escort First-Aid Officer. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the convoy pass.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Medical Escort First-Aid Officer. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the convoy pass.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That a convoy train would be mistaken for a munitions train and stopped on the Guui bridge.","relationship":"Relations. Split medical convoys with Jang Sehwa, exchanged section rotations with Ha Seon, and took Go Seojun''s bridge passage permit fresh each time.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Section changes and bridge permissions are coordinated each time, with destinations disclosed late. Route confidentiality and patient allocation do not prove combat performance.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b0a8-c758-b839","name":"Uiryeong Nam Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b0a8-c758-b839.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":50,"Force":-65,"Material":-25,"Communal":15,"Principle":60,"Public":25,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-5,"Risk":15,"Display":-25,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"First-Aid Officer","Title":"Medical Escort Captain","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 50 | Force −65 | Material −25 | Community 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly −5 | Risk 15 | Display −25 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: Positive | Attachment: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2089-11-08. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Medical Convoy Captain, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with a forged medicine seal.\n- The desk in Cheongnyangni-dong that records patients and medicine weights on medical convoy passes is Nam Hoseong''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or tenure.","Offices":"Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Medical Escort First-Aid Officer. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the convoy pass.","Anecdote":"In 2125, amid a herb shortage, he halved the prescription quantities and shared them out to everyone. That day''s record remained as handover evidence for the next watch to verify.","Relationships":"Shares medical convoys with Jang Sehwa, takes turns on sections with Ha Seon, and obtains Go Seojun''s bridge-crossing permit anew each time.","Ambition":"Fixes the Sinnae–Jegidong–Achasan triangular medical convoy route.","Fear":"Fears the convoy train being mistaken for a munitions train and blocked at the Guui bridge.","Intervention":"Can correct the misidentification signal, or reroute the convoy."},"biography":"Strongly faithful to their word, yet does not announce the convoy route in advance. Refuses to admit armed escorts into the treatment car.\n\n- Livelihood: Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: First-Aid Officer\n- Title: Medical Escort Captain\n**Life.** Born on 2089-11-08. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Medical Convoy Captain, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with a forged medicine seal.\n- The desk in Cheongnyangni-dong that records patients and medicine weights on medical convoy passes is Nam Hoseong''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or tenure.\n\n**Office.** Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Medical Escort First-Aid Officer. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the convoy pass.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, amid a herb shortage, he halved the prescription quantities and shared them out to everyone. That day''s record remained as handover evidence for the next watch to verify.\n\n**Relationships.** Shares medical convoys with Jang Sehwa, takes turns on sections with Ha Seon, and obtains Go Seojun''s bridge-crossing permit anew each time.\n\n**Ambition.** Fixes the Sinnae–Jegidong–Achasan triangular medical convoy route.\n\n**Fear.** Fears the convoy train being mistaken for a munitions train and blocked at the Guui bridge.\n\n**Intervention.** Can correct the misidentification signal, or reroute the convoy.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 50 | Force −65 | Material −25 | Community 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly −5 | Risk 15 | Display −25 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: Positive | Attachment: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Nam Hoseong","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Shares patient transfer escort with Sinnae Station"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Pan Handeul","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Receives Nam Hoseong''s convoy stop at the platform and"},{"from":"Cheon Daol","type":"Command","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Takes the dispatch duty under Nam Hoseong''s command and"},{"from":"Yeong Seogon","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Copies Nam Hoseong''s convoy pass into the duty ledger"},{"from":"Yeong Han-moe","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Uses Nam Hoseong''s medical convoy for arrival confirmation"},{"from":"Beom Choi","type":"Command","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Boarded the car under Nam Hoseong''s convoy order and"},{"from":"Heung Daon","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Separates Nam Hoseong''s medical convoy from the crowd lines and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0327","name":"남호성","title":"의무호송대장","position":"의무호송 응급처치원","characterId":"K326","rank":"응급처치원","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-남호성","detailRoute":"/people/person-0327","birthDate":"2089-11-08","birthday":"11-08","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"medical-transport-coordination","name":"의무호송 조정","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"목적지를 늦게 밝힌다","description":"구간 교대와 교량 허가를 매번 맞추며 목적지를 늦게 공개한다. 경로 기밀과 환자 배분은 전투 수행을 증명하지 않는다.","behavior":"신의가 강하지만 호송 경로를 미리 말하지 않는다. 무장 호위를 치료 칸에 들이는 것을 거부한다.","stress":"공포. 호송 열차가 군수 열차로 오인되어 구의 교량에서 막히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화와 의료호송을 나누고, 하세온과 구간 교대를 하며, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 매번 새로 받는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 의무호송 응급처치원. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 의무호송 응급처치원. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 호송 열차가 군수 열차로 오인되어 구의 교량에서 막히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화와 의료호송을 나누고, 하세온과 구간 교대를 하며, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 매번 새로 받는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"구간 교대와 교량 허가를 매번 맞추며 목적지를 늦게 공개한다. 경로 기밀과 환자 배분은 전투 수행을 증명하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b0a8-c758-b839","name":"의령 남씨","crest":"clan-crests/b0a8-c758-b839.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":50,"무력":-65,"물질":-25,"공동":15,"원칙":60,"공개":25,"자격":25,"분산":20,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-5,"위험":15,"과시":-25,"지속":-10,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"응급처치원","직함":"의무호송대장","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 50 | 무력 −65 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 25 | 자격 25 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −5 | 위험 15 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2089-11-08에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의무호송대장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록 창구가 남호성의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 응급처치원. 직함은 의무호송 응급처치원. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적는다.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.","관계":"장세화와 의료호송을 나누고, 하세온과 구간 교대를 하며, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 매번 새로 받는다.","야망":"신내·제기동·아차산 삼각 의무호송 노선을 못 박는다.","공포":"호송 열차가 군수 열차로 오인되어 구의 교량에서 막히는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"오인 신호를 바로잡거나, 호송을 우회시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"신의가 강하지만 호송 경로를 미리 말하지 않는다. 무장 호위를 치료 칸에 들이는 것을 거부한다.\n\n- 생업: 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 응급처치원\n- 직함: 의무호송대장\n**생애.** 2089-11-08에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의무호송대장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록 창구가 남호성의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 의무호송 응급처치원. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 장세화와 의료호송을 나누고, 하세온과 구간 교대를 하며, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 매번 새로 받는다.\n\n**야망.** 신내·제기동·아차산 삼각 의무호송 노선을 못 박는다.\n\n**공포.** 호송 열차가 군수 열차로 오인되어 구의 교량에서 막히는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 오인 신호를 바로잡거나, 호송을 우회시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 50 | 무력 −65 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 25 | 자격 25 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −5 | 위험 15 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"남호성","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"환자 이송 호송을 신내역과 나눔"}],"incoming":[{"from":"판한들","type":"계약","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 호송 정차를 승강장에서 받고"},{"from":"천다올","type":"지휘","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 지휘로 출고 당직을 맡고"},{"from":"영석온","type":"계약","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 호송증을 당직 원장에 옮긴다"},{"from":"영한뫼","type":"계약","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 의무호송을 도착 확인에 쓴다"},{"from":"범초이","type":"지휘","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 호송 명령 아래 칸에 탔고"},{"from":"흥다온","type":"계약","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 의무호송과 인파 줄을 나누고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0328', 'c804-cc9c-c548', '{"id":"person-0328","name":"Jeon Sol","title":"Patient Representative of the Medical Affairs Council","position":"Triage First-Aid Officer","characterId":"K327","rank":"First-Aid Officer","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Hospital bed waiting list and confidential first aid contract review","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-jeon-sol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0328","birthDate":"2093-01-07","birthday":"01-07","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"triage-care","name":"Triage care","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"First-aid officer defending the right to care","description":"Dividing scarce prescriptions preserves access while triage constrains refusal of care. Clinical judgment and allocation are supported; combat experience is not recorded.","behavior":"Quiet of voice, she did not step back at a vote. She liked to recast the guild''s charity as a right.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Shared the vote with Ryu Eunbi, watched Sim Dalho''s pre-buying, and promised Baek On the Bukhansan Bogukmun sickbed allocation.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Triage First-Aid Officer. Posts the bed waitlist roster at the market entrance and declares private treatment contracts void without the clinical approval of the attending first-aid officer and the corps leader.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Triage First-Aid Officer. Posts the bed waitlist roster at the market entrance and declares private treatment contracts void without the clinical approval of the attending first-aid officer and the corps leader.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Shared the vote with Ryu Eunbi, watched Sim Dalho''s pre-buying, and promised Baek On the Bukhansan Bogukmun sickbed allocation.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Dividing scarce prescriptions preserves access while triage constrains refusal of care. Clinical judgment and allocation are supported; combat experience is not recorded.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c804-cc9c-c548","name":"Cheonan Jeon Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c804-cc9c-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-45,"Openness":35,"Force":-70,"Material":-25,"Communal":15,"Principle":40,"Public":15,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":-10,"Display":25,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"None","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Hospital bed waiting list and confidential first aid contract review","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"First-Aid Officer","Title":"Patient Representative of the Medical Affairs Council","Values":"Authority −45 | Openness 35 | Force −70 | Materialism −25 | Community 15 | Principle 40 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −10 | Display 25 | Persistence −5 | Orientation: none | Bonding: none"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2093-01-07. As of the 2126 opening, Jeon Sol holds the post of Patient Representative of the Medical Council, continuing the existing watch and its records. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unauthorized absence at shift change.\n- The bed waitlist roster and private treatment contract review desk in Jegi-dong is Jeon Sol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Triage First-Aid Officer. Posts the bed waitlist roster at the market entrance and declares private treatment contracts void without the clinical approval of the attending first-aid officer and the corps leader.","Anecdote":"In 2125, amid a herb shortage, she halved the prescription quantities and shared them out to everyone. That day''s record remained as handover evidence for the next watch to verify.","Relationships":"Shares votes with Ryu Eunbi, watches Sim Dalho''s pre-emptive purchases, and promised Baek On bed allocations at Bukhansan Bogungmun.","Ambition":"Keeps the attending first-aid officer''s right to refuse care tied to the triage-first principle.","Fear":"Fears being branded a favored patient and expelled from the medical command.","Intervention":"Can expose the handwriting on a forged consent form, or publicly back Jeon Sol''s right to refuse care to prevent confusion in the medical command."},"biography":"Even with a quiet voice, Jeon Sol never backs down on clinical judgment and likes to rephrase medical principle as a right.\n\n- Livelihood: Hospital bed waiting list and confidential first aid contract review\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: First-Aid Officer\n- Title: Patient Representative of the Medical Affairs Council\n**Life.** Born on 2093-01-07. As of the 2126 opening, Jeon Sol holds the post of Patient Representative of the Medical Council, continuing the existing watch and its records. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unauthorized absence at shift change.\n- The bed waitlist roster and private treatment contract review desk in Jegi-dong is Jeon Sol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Triage First-Aid Officer. Posts the bed waitlist roster at the market entrance and declares private treatment contracts void without the clinical approval of the attending first-aid officer and the corps leader.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, amid a herb shortage, she halved the prescription quantities and shared them out to everyone. That day''s record remained as handover evidence for the next watch to verify.\n\n**Relationships.** Shares votes with Ryu Eunbi, watches Sim Dalho''s pre-emptive purchases, and promised Baek On bed allocations at Bukhansan Bogungmun.\n\n**Ambition.** Keeps the attending first-aid officer''s right to refuse care tied to the triage-first principle.\n\n**Fear.** Fears being branded a favored patient and expelled from the medical command.\n\n**Intervention.** Can expose the handwriting on a forged consent form, or publicly back Jeon Sol''s right to refuse care to prevent confusion in the medical command.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −45 | Openness 35 | Force −70 | Materialism −25 | Community 15 | Principle 40 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −10 | Display 25 | Persistence −5 | Orientation: none | Bonding: none\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jeon Sol","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Share the Council of Deliberation vote with the commander"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Sin Seungmin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Sin Seungmin cross-checks prescription records against Jeon Sol''s bed waitlist roster to distinguish requests that came in through private solicitation from the actual treatment order. Requests whose records do not match are verified with Jeon Sol, so that even when medicinal herbs run short, treatment by severity is not pushed aside by solicitation."},{"from":"Mun Cheolmin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Mun Cheolmin hands over the ledger of lives rescued from the fire, together with the prescription records, to Jeon Sol. Jeon Sol finds the patients missing from the bed waitlist roster and confirms the treatment order by severity, so that no one is dropped from treatment merely because the ledger was lost."},{"from":"Sim Tae-yang","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Sim Taeyang hands over the ledger of lives rescued from the fire and the prescription records to Jeon Sol. Jeon Sol identifies the patients missing from the bed waitlist roster and sets the treatment order by severity, so that the loss of records does not lead to anyone being dropped from treatment."},{"from":"Sin Bungmin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Sin Bungmin confronts the conflicting testimonies about a prescription and relays the result to Jeon Sol. Jeon Sol reviews the bed roster and severity, so that a message passed on wrongly does not change the treatment order."},{"from":"Yang Namtae","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Yang Namtae hands over the patient roster and prescription records he has kept to Jeon Sol. Jeon Sol checks the bed waitlist and severity to find the missing names, so that the loss of records does not lead to anyone being dropped from treatment."},{"from":"Seo Dalseo","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Seo Dalseo passes the patient roster and prescription records he has kept to Jeon Sol. Jeon Sol checks the bed waitlist and severity to find the patients who were left out because of the lost records."},{"from":"Bae Summin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Bae Summin verifies conflicting testimonies about prescriptions through confrontation and relays them to Jeon Sol. Jeon Sol checks the sickbed roster and severity levels so that wrongly relayed words do not change the order of treatment."},{"from":"Seon Nahwi","type":"Command","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Under orders to carry Jeon Sol''s voting slips only in a sealed state,"},{"from":"Yeong Neulbit","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"is the disciple who transfers Jeon Sol''s veto into the ledger, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0328","name":"전솔","title":"의정회 환자대표","position":"중증도 응급처치원","characterId":"K327","rank":"응급처치원","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"병상 대기 명부·비공개 응급 처치 계약 심사","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-전솔","detailRoute":"/people/person-0328","birthDate":"2093-01-07","birthday":"01-07","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"triage-care","name":"중증도 진료","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"진료권을 지키는 응급처치원","description":"처방량을 나눠 치료 접근을 유지하고 진료 거부권을 중증도 원칙에 묶는다. 임상 판단과 배분은 확인되지만 전투 경력은 없다.","behavior":"목소리가 작아도 임상 판단에서 물러서지 않는다. 진료 원칙을 권리로 바꿔 말하길 좋아한다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 류은비와 표결을 공유하고, 심달호의 선매를 감시하며, 백온에게 북한산보국문 병상 할당을 약속했다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 중증도 응급처치원. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약은 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 임상 승인 없이 무효라고 선언한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 중증도 응급처치원. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약은 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 임상 승인 없이 무효라고 선언한다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 류은비와 표결을 공유하고, 심달호의 선매를 감시하며, 백온에게 북한산보국문 병상 할당을 약속했다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"처방량을 나눠 치료 접근을 유지하고 진료 거부권을 중증도 원칙에 묶는다. 임상 판단과 배분은 확인되지만 전투 경력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c804-cc9c-c548","name":"천안 전씨","crest":"clan-crests/c804-cc9c-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-45,"개방":35,"무력":-70,"물질":-25,"공동":15,"원칙":40,"공개":15,"자격":30,"분산":30,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":5,"위험":-10,"과시":25,"지속":-5,"지향":"무성향","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"병상 대기 명부·비공개 응급 처치 계약 심사","소속":"정부","품계":"응급처치원","직함":"의정회 환자대표","가치관":"권위 −45 | 개방 35 | 무력 −70 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 40 | 공개 15 | 자격 30 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 5 | 위험 −10 | 과시 25 | 지속 −5 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2093-01-07에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의정회 환자대표 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 병상 대기 명부·비공개 치료 계약 심사 창구가 전솔의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 응급처치원. 직함은 중증도 응급처치원. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약은 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 임상 승인 없이 무효라고 선언한다.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.","관계":"류은비와 표결을 공유하고, 심달호의 선매를 감시하며, 백온에게 북한산보국문 병상 할당을 약속했다.","야망":"담당 응급처치원의 진료 거부권을 중증도 우선 원칙으로 남긴다.","공포":"자신이 특혜 환자로 낙인찍혀 의료 지휘부에서 축출되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"허위 동의서의 필적을 가리거나, 전솔의 진료 거부권을 공개 지지해 진료 지휘 혼선을 막을 수 있다."},"biography":"목소리가 작아도 임상 판단에서 물러서지 않는다. 진료 원칙을 권리로 바꿔 말하길 좋아한다.\n\n- 생업: 병상 대기 명부·비공개 응급 처치 계약 심사\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 응급처치원\n- 직함: 의정회 환자대표\n**생애.** 2093-01-07에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의정회 환자대표 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 병상 대기 명부·비공개 치료 계약 심사 창구가 전솔의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 중증도 응급처치원. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약은 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 임상 승인 없이 무효라고 선언한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 류은비와 표결을 공유하고, 심달호의 선매를 감시하며, 백온에게 북한산보국문 병상 할당을 약속했다.\n\n**야망.** 담당 응급처치원의 진료 거부권을 중증도 우선 원칙으로 남긴다.\n\n**공포.** 자신이 특혜 환자로 낙인찍혀 의료 지휘부에서 축출되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 허위 동의서의 필적을 가리거나, 전솔의 진료 거부권을 공개 지지해 진료 지휘 혼선을 막을 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −45 | 개방 35 | 무력 −70 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 40 | 공개 15 | 자격 30 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 5 | 위험 −10 | 과시 25 | 지속 −5 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"전솔","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"의정회 표결을 단장와 공유"}],"incoming":[{"from":"신승민","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"신승민은 처방 기록을 전솔의 병상 대기 명부와 대조해 사적 청탁으로 들어온 요청과 진료 순서를 구분한다. 기록이 맞지 않는 요청은 전솔에게 확인하여, 약재가 부족한 때에도 중증도에 따른 치료가 청탁에 밀리지 않게 한다."},{"from":"문철민","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"문철민은 화재에서 구한 인명 장부를 처방 기록과 함께 전솔에게 넘긴다. 전솔은 병상 대기 명부에서 빠진 환자를 찾아 중증도로 진료 순서를 확인하고, 장부가 소실됐다는 이유만으로 치료에서 누락되지 않게 한다."},{"from":"심태양","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"심태양은 화재에서 구한 인명 장부와 처방 기록을 전솔에게 인계한다. 전솔은 병상 대기 명부에서 빠진 환자를 확인하고 중증도에 따라 진료 순서를 잡아, 기록 손실이 치료 누락으로 이어지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"신북민","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"신북민은 처방에 관한 갈린 증언을 대질로 확인해 전솔에게 전한다. 전솔은 병상 명부와 중증도를 살펴 잘못 전달된 말이 치료 순서를 바꾸지 않게 한다."},{"from":"양남태","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"양남태는 보관한 환자 명부와 처방 기록을 전솔에게 넘긴다. 전솔은 병상 대기와 중증도를 확인해 빠진 이름을 찾고 기록 손실이 진료 누락으로 이어지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"서달서","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"서달서는 보관한 환자 명부와 처방 기록을 전솔에게 전한다. 전솔은 병상 대기와 중증도를 확인해 기록 손실 때문에 빠진 환자를 찾는다."},{"from":"배숲민","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"배숲민은 처방에 관한 갈린 증언을 대질로 확인해 전솔에게 전한다. 전솔은 병상 명부와 중증도를 확인해 잘못 전해진 말이 진료 순서를 바꾸지 않게 한다."},{"from":"선나휘","type":"지휘","to":"전솔","basis":"전솔의 표결 쪽지를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"영늘빛","type":"스승과 제자","to":"전솔","basis":"전솔의 거부권을 원장으로 옮기는 제자이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0329', 'cc9c-c601-c591', '{"id":"person-0329","name":"Cheon Daum","title":"Medicine dryer mechanic, Sim Dalho''s practical aide","position":"Medicinal Herb Drying Management Relief Worker","characterId":"K328","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medicinal Herb Drying Temperature and Filter Log","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-cheondaum","detailRoute":"/people/person-0329","birthDate":"2069-03-17","birthday":"03-17","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"drying-room-condition-logging","name":"Drying room condition logging","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"No skipped seal check","description":"Temperature and filters are logged each shift; a missing seal check stops shipment. Two absent log days are not recast as successful repairs.","behavior":"He heard the drying room''s temperature and fan sound before human words and took a repair later than the posted date as an insult. If the tool-box seal skipped even one day, he stopped that day''s release.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice backing Sim Dalho''s origin inspection posts in the field, he matched drying power to Su Hyoeun''s emergency generators. Opened the drying room before Ryu Eunbi''s care supplies ran dry.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Drying Management Relief Worker. Writes the temperature and filter thickness on the tally stake every shift, and does not install any part lacking a medical-duty stamp.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Drying Management Relief Worker. Writes the temperature and filter thickness on the tally stake every shift, and does not install any part lacking a medical-duty stamp.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice backing Sim Dalho''s origin inspection posts in the field, he matched drying power to Su Hyoeun''s emergency generators. Opened the drying room before Ryu Eunbi''s care supplies ran dry.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Temperature and filters are logged each shift; a missing seal check stops shipment. Two absent log days are not recast as successful repairs.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc9c-c601-c591","name":"Yeongyang Cheon Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cc9c-c601-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":25,"Force":-40,"Material":-5,"Communal":20,"Principle":30,"Public":10,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":-15,"Display":20,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicinal Herb Drying Temperature and Filter Log","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Relief Worker","Title":"Medicine dryer mechanic, Sim Dalho''s practical aide","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 25 | Force −40 | Material −5 | Communal 20 | Principle 30 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 45 | Dispersion 25 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly 30 | Risk −15 | Display 20 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Bisexual | Bond Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2069-03-17. As of the 2126 opening, holds the duties of herb dryer mechanic and Sim Dalho''s practical aide, carrying on the existing duty rosters and records. In the succession record for that post, it opened through a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The herb-drying temperature and filter record desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Cheon Daum''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or right of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Drying Management Relief Worker. Writes the temperature and filter thickness on the tally stake every shift, and does not install any part lacking a medical-duty stamp.","Anecdote":"When counterfeit summer medicine flowed out through Bukhansan Bogungmun, the temperature log for one drying room was blank for two days.","Relationships":"He is the field aide who backs Sim Dalho''s origin-marking stake, and he matches drying power to Su Hyoeun''s emergency generation. He opens the drying room before Ryu Eunbi''s treatment supplies dry out.","Ambition":"He wants to bind the Cheongnyangni dryers under the Medical Command''s public maintenance schedule, so that private pre-purchases cannot sweep up the damp raw herbs at a low price.","Fear":"","Intervention":"He can identify who entered during the blank log, or find replacement parts to bring drying back."},"biography":"He listens to the drying room''s temperature and fan sounds before he listens to people, and he regards any repair later than the date written on the marker stake as an insult. If the toolbox seal is skipped even for a single day, he halts that day''s shipment.\n\n- Livelihood: Medicinal Herb Drying Temperature and Filter Log\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Relief Worker\n- Title: Medicine dryer mechanic, Sim Dalho''s practical aide\n**Life.** Born on 2069-03-17. As of the 2126 opening, holds the duties of herb dryer mechanic and Sim Dalho''s practical aide, carrying on the existing duty rosters and records. In the succession record for that post, it opened through a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The herb-drying temperature and filter record desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Cheon Daum''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or right of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Drying Management Relief Worker. Writes the temperature and filter thickness on the tally stake every shift, and does not install any part lacking a medical-duty stamp.\n\n**Anecdote.** When counterfeit summer medicine flowed out through Bukhansan Bogungmun, the temperature log for one drying room was blank for two days.\n\n**Relationships.** He is the field aide who backs Sim Dalho''s origin-marking stake, and he matches drying power to Su Hyoeun''s emergency generation. He opens the drying room before Ryu Eunbi''s treatment supplies dry out.\n\n**Ambition.** He wants to bind the Cheongnyangni dryers under the Medical Command''s public maintenance schedule, so that private pre-purchases cannot sweep up the damp raw herbs at a low price.\n\n**Intervention.** He can identify who entered during the blank log, or find replacement parts to bring drying back.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 25 | Force −40 | Materialism −5 | Community 20 | Principle 30 | Transparency 10 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly 30 | Risk −15 | Display 20 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: bisexual | Bonding: non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Cheon Daum","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Sim Dalho","basis":"An aide who backs Sim Dalho''s origin marker post in the field, and"},{"from":"Cheon Daum","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Su Hyoeun","basis":"He matches drying power to Su Hyoeun''s emergency generation."}],"incoming":[{"from":"Su Hyoeun","type":"Contract","to":"Cheon Daum","basis":"He matches output to Cheon Daum''s dryer, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0329","name":"천다움","title":"약재 건조기 정비사, 심달호의 실무 담당자","position":"약재 건조 관리 구호원","characterId":"K328","rank":"구호원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"약재 건조 온도·필터 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-천다움","detailRoute":"/people/person-0329","birthDate":"2069-03-17","birthday":"03-17","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"drying-room-condition-logging","name":"건조실 상태 기록","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"봉인을 건너뛰지 않는다","description":"교대마다 온도와 필터를 기록하고 봉인 공백에는 출하를 멈춘다. 이틀의 빈 일지는 정비 성공으로 바꾸지 않는다.","behavior":"건조실 온도와 팬 소리를 사람 말보다 먼저 듣고, 말목에 적힌 일자보다 늦은 수리를 모욕으로 본다. 공구함 봉인을 하루라도 건너뛰면 그날 출하를 멈춘다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 심달호의 원산지 말목을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고, 수효은의 비상 발전에 건조 전력을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 물자가 마르기 전에 건조실을 연다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 건조 관리 구호원. 교대마다 온도와 필터 두께를 말목에 쓰고, 진료 당직 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 건조 관리 구호원. 교대마다 온도와 필터 두께를 말목에 쓰고, 진료 당직 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 심달호의 원산지 말목을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고, 수효은의 비상 발전에 건조 전력을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 물자가 마르기 전에 건조실을 연다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"교대마다 온도와 필터를 기록하고 봉인 공백에는 출하를 멈춘다. 이틀의 빈 일지는 정비 성공으로 바꾸지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc9c-c601-c591","name":"영양 천씨","crest":"clan-crests/cc9c-c601-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":25,"무력":-40,"물질":-5,"공동":20,"원칙":30,"공개":10,"자격":45,"분산":25,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":30,"위험":-15,"과시":20,"지속":0,"지향":"양성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 건조 온도·필터 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"구호원","직함":"약재 건조기 정비사, 심달호의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 25 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 30 | 공개 10 | 자격 45 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 30 | 위험 −15 | 과시 20 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2069-03-17에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 건조기 정비사, 심달호의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 약재 건조 온도·필터 기록 창구가 천다움의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 건조 관리 구호원. 교대마다 온도와 필터 두께를 말목에 쓰고, 진료 당직 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","일화":"여름 가짜 약이 북한산보국문으로 흘러가자 건조실 한 칸의 온도 일지가 이틀분 비어 있었다.","관계":"심달호의 원산지 말목을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고, 수효은의 비상 발전에 건조 전력을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 물자가 마르기 전에 건조실을 연다.","야망":"청량리 건조기를 의료 지휘부 공개 정비표 아래로 묶어 비공개 선매가 습기 많은 생약을 싸게 쓸어가지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"빈 일지의 출입자를 밝히거나, 대체 부품을 구해 건조를 되살릴 수 있다."},"biography":"건조실 온도와 팬 소리를 사람 말보다 먼저 듣고, 말목에 적힌 일자보다 늦은 수리를 모욕으로 본다. 공구함 봉인을 하루라도 건너뛰면 그날 출하를 멈춘다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 건조 온도·필터 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 구호원\n- 직함: 약재 건조기 정비사, 심달호의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2069-03-17에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 건조기 정비사, 심달호의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 약재 건조 온도·필터 기록 창구가 천다움의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 건조 관리 구호원. 교대마다 온도와 필터 두께를 말목에 쓰고, 진료 당직 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 여름 가짜 약이 북한산보국문으로 흘러가자 건조실 한 칸의 온도 일지가 이틀분 비어 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 심달호의 원산지 말목을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고, 수효은의 비상 발전에 건조 전력을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 물자가 마르기 전에 건조실을 연다.\n\n**야망.** 청량리 건조기를 의료 지휘부 공개 정비표 아래로 묶어 비공개 선매가 습기 많은 생약을 싸게 쓸어가지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 빈 일지의 출입자를 밝히거나, 대체 부품을 구해 건조를 되살릴 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 25 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 30 | 공개 10 | 자격 45 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 30 | 위험 −15 | 과시 20 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"천다움","type":"스승과 제자","to":"심달호","basis":"심달호의 원산지 말목을 현장에서 받치는 실무원이고"},{"from":"천다움","type":"스승과 제자","to":"수효은","basis":"수효은의 비상 발전에 건조 전력을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"수효은","type":"계약","to":"천다움","basis":"천다움의 건조기에 출력을 맞추고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0330', 'b3d9-ad11-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0330","name":"Dong Neulsol","title":"Medicinal Herb Transport Logistics Merchant","position":"Medicinal Herb Transport Relief Worker","characterId":"K329","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medicinal Herb Intake Weight and Outbound Invoice Check","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-dongneulsol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0330","birthDate":"2075-03-13","birthday":"03-13","age":51,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"shipment-weight-reconciliation","name":"Shipment weight reconciliation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"No verbal freight rates","description":"Receiving weight is checked before two witnesses and unsealed invoices are not loaded. The cause of missing weights is not established.","behavior":"She put box weights and drying dates on the same scales and did not admit as a guest any envoy who arrived with pre-buying receipts alone. She cut bargains short and honored no verbal freight.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Held a transport contract with Sim Dalho and matched weights on Dong Juha''s market scales. Wrote the exchange ratio between Eun Taeho''s Garak food and herbs into the invoice tail.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Transport Relief Worker. Two witnesses observe the incoming weight, and a bulk outgoing invoice is not loaded until it bears the treatment-allocation seal of the attending first-aid officer and the Order''s chief.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Transport Relief Worker. Two witnesses observe the incoming weight, and a bulk outgoing invoice is not loaded until it bears the treatment-allocation seal of the attending first-aid officer and the Order''s chief.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Held a transport contract with Sim Dalho and matched weights on Dong Juha''s market scales. Wrote the exchange ratio between Eun Taeho''s Garak food and herbs into the invoice tail.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Receiving weight is checked before two witnesses and unsealed invoices are not loaded. The cause of missing weights is not established.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b3d9-ad11-cc9c","name":"Gwangcheon Dong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b3d9-ad11-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":35,"Force":-45,"Material":5,"Communal":15,"Principle":40,"Public":30,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":10,"Display":-10,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicinal Herb Intake Weight and Outbound Invoice Check","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Relief Worker","Title":"Medicinal Herb Transport Logistics Merchant","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 35 | Force −45 | Materialism 5 | Community 15 | Principle 40 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 10 | Display −10 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: fluid | Bonding: non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2075-03-13. As of the 2126 opening, she holds the post of herb transport logistics merchant, continuing the existing duty rota and records. The succession record for that post opened through the counterfeit medicine seal.\n- The desk for checking incoming herb weights and outgoing invoices in Jegi-dong is Dong Neulsol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Transport Relief Worker. Two witnesses observe the incoming weight, and a bulk outgoing invoice is not loaded until it bears the treatment-allocation seal of the attending first-aid officer and the Order''s chief.","Anecdote":"On the day the pre-purchase ledger vanished, the transport invoice for the same hour had three weight gaps.","Relationships":"Holds a transport contract with Sim Dalho and matches weights to Dong Juha''s market scale. Writes the exchange ratio between Eun Taeho''s Garak grain and medicinal herbs at the end of the invoice.","Ambition":"Wants to open Jegi-dong and Cheongnyangni herb transport only at public market prices and severity-assigned weights, so that private monopoly bids cannot buy up the carts.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can make the gap invoices public, or stop a private pre-purchase agent''s cart in front of the scale."},"biography":"Puts the weight of each crate and its drying date on the same scale, and does not admit as a guest any envoy who comes holding only a pre-purchase receipt. Haggling is kept short, and verbal freight charges are not recognized.\n\n- Livelihood: Medicinal Herb Intake Weight and Outbound Invoice Check\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Relief Worker\n- Title: Medicinal Herb Transport Relief Worker\n**Life.** Born on 2075-03-13. As of the 2126 opening, she holds the post of herb transport logistics merchant, continuing the existing duty rota and records. The succession record for that post opened through the counterfeit medicine seal.\n- The desk for checking incoming herb weights and outgoing invoices in Jegi-dong is Dong Neulsol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Transport Relief Worker. Two witnesses observe the incoming weight, and a bulk outgoing invoice is not loaded until it bears the treatment-allocation seal of the attending first-aid officer and the Order''s chief.\n\n**Anecdote.** On the day the pre-purchase ledger vanished, the transport invoice for the same hour had three weight gaps.\n\n**Relationships.** Holds a transport contract with Sim Dalho and matches weights to Dong Juha''s market scale. Writes the exchange ratio between Eun Taeho''s Garak grain and medicinal herbs at the end of the invoice.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants to open Jegi-dong and Cheongnyangni herb transport only at public market prices and severity-assigned weights, so that private monopoly bids cannot buy up the carts.\n\n**Intervention.** Can make the gap invoices public, or stop a private pre-purchase agent''s cart in front of the scale.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 35 | Force −45 | Materialism 5 | Community 15 | Principle 40 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 10 | Display −10 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: fluid | Bonding: non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Dong Neulsol","type":"Contract","to":"Sim Dalho","basis":"Enters a transport contract with Sim Dalho, and"},{"from":"Dong Neulsol","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Matches weights to Dong Juha''s market scale"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Dong Juha","type":"Command","to":"Dong Neulsol","basis":"Sets Dong Neulsol''s transport weights to the same scale marks"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0330","name":"동늘솔","title":"약재 운송 물류상","position":"약재 운송 구호원","characterId":"K329","rank":"구호원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"약재 입고 중량·출고 송장 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-동늘솔","detailRoute":"/people/person-0330","birthDate":"2075-03-13","birthday":"03-13","age":51,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"shipment-weight-reconciliation","name":"운송 중량 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"구두 운임을 인정하지 않는다","description":"두 증인 앞에서 입고 중량을 확인하고 날인 없는 송장을 싣지 않는다. 무게 공백의 원인 규명은 아직 없다.","behavior":"상자 무게와 건조 일자를 같은 저울에 올리고, 선매 영수증만 들고 온 사신을 손님으로 들이지 않는다. 흥정은 짧게 끝내고 구두 운임을 인정하지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 심달호와 운송 계약을 맺고, 동주하의 시장 저울에 무게를 맞춘다. 은태호의 가락 식량과 약재 교환 비율을 송장 말미에 적는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 운송 구호원. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 대량 출고 송장은 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있기 전에는 싣지 않는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 운송 구호원. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 대량 출고 송장은 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있기 전에는 싣지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 심달호와 운송 계약을 맺고, 동주하의 시장 저울에 무게를 맞춘다. 은태호의 가락 식량과 약재 교환 비율을 송장 말미에 적는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"두 증인 앞에서 입고 중량을 확인하고 날인 없는 송장을 싣지 않는다. 무게 공백의 원인 규명은 아직 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b3d9-ad11-cc9c","name":"광천 동씨","crest":"clan-crests/b3d9-ad11-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":35,"무력":-45,"물질":5,"공동":15,"원칙":40,"공개":30,"자격":20,"분산":15,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":10,"위험":10,"과시":-10,"지속":40,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 입고 중량·출고 송장 확인","소속":"정부","품계":"구호원","직함":"약재 운송 물류상","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 35 | 무력 −45 | 물질 5 | 공동 15 | 원칙 40 | 공개 30 | 자격 20 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 10 | 위험 10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 40 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2075-03-13에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 운송 물류상 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 입고 중량·출고 송장 확인 창구가 동늘솔의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 운송 구호원. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 대량 출고 송장은 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있기 전에는 싣지 않는다.","일화":"선매 장부가 사라진 날, 같은 시각의 운송 송장에 무게 공백이 세 칸 있었다.","관계":"심달호와 운송 계약을 맺고, 동주하의 시장 저울에 무게를 맞춘다. 은태호의 가락 식량과 약재 교환 비율을 송장 말미에 적는다.","야망":"제기동·청량리 약재 운송을 공개 시세와 중증도 배정 무게로만 열어 비공개 독점 입찰이 마차를 사지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"공백 송장을 공개하거나, 비공개 선매 대리인의 마차를 저울 앞에서 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"상자 무게와 건조 일자를 같은 저울에 올리고, 선매 영수증만 들고 온 사신을 손님으로 들이지 않는다. 흥정은 짧게 끝내고 구두 운임을 인정하지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 입고 중량·출고 송장 확인\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 구호원\n- 직함: 약재 운송 물류상\n**생애.** 2075-03-13에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 운송 물류상 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 입고 중량·출고 송장 확인 창구가 동늘솔의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 운송 구호원. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 대량 출고 송장은 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있기 전에는 싣지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 선매 장부가 사라진 날, 같은 시각의 운송 송장에 무게 공백이 세 칸 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 심달호와 운송 계약을 맺고, 동주하의 시장 저울에 무게를 맞춘다. 은태호의 가락 식량과 약재 교환 비율을 송장 말미에 적는다.\n\n**야망.** 제기동·청량리 약재 운송을 공개 시세와 중증도 배정 무게로만 열어 비공개 독점 입찰이 마차를 사지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 공백 송장을 공개하거나, 비공개 선매 대리인의 마차를 저울 앞에서 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 35 | 무력 −45 | 물질 5 | 공동 15 | 원칙 40 | 공개 30 | 자격 20 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 10 | 위험 10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 40 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"동늘솔","type":"계약","to":"심달호","basis":"심달호와 운송 계약을 맺고"},{"from":"동늘솔","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"동주하의 시장 저울에 무게를 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"동주하","type":"지휘","to":"동늘솔","basis":"동늘솔의 운송 무게를 같은 눈금에 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0331', 'bc29-c628-c591', '{"id":"person-0331","name":"Bang Hanul","title":"Triage First-Aid Post Medical Officer, Eun Chaeyun''s Working-Level Aide","position":"Triage First-Aid Post Relief Worker","characterId":"K330","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Triage Chart and First-Aid Findings Posting","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-banghanul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0331","birthDate":"2093-01-06","birthday":"01-06","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"bed-order-administration","name":"Bed order administration","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Stops priority pressure","description":"Priority requests wait for the attending first-aid officer and bed order is enforced. Discovery of medicine on a shelf does not establish successful identification.","behavior":"Quiet of hand, he locked the sickbeds whenever he received a note to change the care order. An enemy''s wound stood in the same line before the severity table.","stress":"Fear. That the care room would become a war-booty sorting hall and the severity table he stamped would become scrap paper in a season.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice executing the sickbed order as Eun Chaeyun''s apprentice, he shared sickbeds with Bang Misan''s clinic. Put Ryu Eunbi''s care principles at the top of the duty ledger.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Triage First-Aid Post Relief Worker. He pasted the severity table and clinical findings side by side and accepted no officer''s priority care note before the attending first-aid officer approved it.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Triage First-Aid Post Relief Worker. He pasted the severity table and clinical findings side by side and accepted no officer''s priority care note before the attending first-aid officer approved it.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the care room would become a war-booty sorting hall and the severity table he stamped would become scrap paper in a season.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice executing the sickbed order as Eun Chaeyun''s apprentice, he shared sickbeds with Bang Misan''s clinic. Put Ryu Eunbi''s care principles at the top of the duty ledger.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Priority requests wait for the attending first-aid officer and bed order is enforced. Discovery of medicine on a shelf does not establish successful identification.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc29-c628-c591","name":"Onyang Bang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc29-c628-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":40,"Force":-60,"Material":-15,"Communal":15,"Principle":60,"Public":30,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":-10,"Display":5,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Triage Chart and First-Aid Findings Posting","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Relief Worker","Title":"Triage First-Aid Post Medical Officer, Eun Chaeyun''s Working-Level Aide","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −60 | Material −15 | Communal 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 30 | Dispersal 15 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly −40 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Endurance 40 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2093-01-06. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Triage Medical Officer, working-level aide to Eun Chaeyun, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with a counterfeit-drug seal.\n- The triage chart and clinical findings posting window in Jegi-dong is Bang Hanul''s working reference point. This working reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, domain, or right of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Triage First-Aid Post Relief Worker. Posts triage charts and clinical findings side by side, and does not accept an armed duty chief''s priority-treatment note until the attending first-aid officer approves it.","Anecdote":"After a counterfeit fever reducer was used on a child of Bukhansan Bogukmun, another tin of the same capsule-shaped medicine turned up on the clinic shelf.","Relationships":"As Eun Chaeyun''s apprentice, a disciple who enforces the bed order, and shares Bang Misan''s clinic beds. Puts Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principle at the top of the duty ledger.","Ambition":"","Fear":"Fears the clinic turning into a plunder-sorting yard, so that the triage charts they stamped become scrap paper within a season.","Intervention":""},"biography":"Quiet-handed, but locks the bed whenever handed a note ordering the treatment sequence changed. Even an enemy''s wounds stand on the same line before the triage chart.\n\n- Livelihood: Triage Chart and First-Aid Findings Posting\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Relief Worker\n- Title: Triage First-Aid Post Relief Worker\n**Life.** Born on 2093-01-06. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Triage Medical Officer, working-level aide to Eun Chaeyun, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with a counterfeit-drug seal.\n- The triage chart and clinical findings posting window in Jegi-dong is Bang Hanul''s working reference point. This working reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, domain, or right of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Triage First-Aid Post Relief Worker. Posts triage charts and clinical findings side by side, and does not accept an armed duty chief''s priority-treatment note until the attending first-aid officer approves it.\n\n**Anecdote.** After a counterfeit fever reducer was used on a child of Bukhansan Bogukmun, another tin of the same capsule-shaped medicine turned up on the clinic shelf.\n\n**Relations.** As Eun Chaeyun''s apprentice, a disciple who enforces the bed order, and shares Bang Misan''s clinic beds. Puts Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principle at the top of the duty ledger.\n\n**Fear.** Fears the clinic turning into a plunder-sorting yard, so that the triage charts they stamped become scrap paper within a season.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −60 | Material −15 | Communal 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 30 | Dispersal 15 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly −40 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Endurance 40 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bang Hanul","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"a protégé who, as Eun Chaeyun''s apprentice, enforces the order of the sickbeds, and"},{"from":"Bang Hanul","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Bang Misan","basis":"Shares Bang Misan''s clinic beds"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bang Misan","type":"Contract","to":"Bang Hanul","basis":"Posts Bang Hanul''s duty ledger on the door"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0331","name":"방한울","title":"중증도 응급 처치 의무원, 은채윤의 실무 담당자","position":"중증도 구호원","characterId":"K330","rank":"구호원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"중증도 표·응급 처치 소견 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-방한울","detailRoute":"/people/person-0331","birthDate":"2093-01-06","birthday":"01-06","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"bed-order-administration","name":"병상 순서 집행","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"우선 치료 압박을 멈춘다","description":"담당 응급처치원의 승인 전 우선 요청을 막고 침상 순서를 집행한다. 선반 약의 발견이 감별 성공을 뜻하지 않는다.","behavior":"손놀림은 조용하나 치료 순서를 바꾸라는 쪽지를 받으면 침상을 잠근다. 적의 부상도 중증도 표 앞에서는 같은 줄로 본다.","stress":"공포. 진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 자신이 찍은 중증도 표가 한 계절에 휴지가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 은채윤의 도제로서 침상 순서를 집행하는 제자이고, 방미산의 진료소 병상을 나눈다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 중증도 구호원. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 붙이고, 장교의 우선 치료 쪽지는 담당 응급처치원의 승인 전까지 받지 않는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 중증도 구호원. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 붙이고, 장교의 우선 치료 쪽지는 담당 응급처치원의 승인 전까지 받지 않는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 자신이 찍은 중증도 표가 한 계절에 휴지가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 은채윤의 도제로서 침상 순서를 집행하는 제자이고, 방미산의 진료소 병상을 나눈다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"담당 응급처치원의 승인 전 우선 요청을 막고 침상 순서를 집행한다. 선반 약의 발견이 감별 성공을 뜻하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc29-c628-c591","name":"온양 방씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc29-c628-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":40,"무력":-60,"물질":-15,"공동":15,"원칙":60,"공개":30,"자격":30,"분산":15,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-40,"위험":-10,"과시":5,"지속":40,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"중증도 표·응급 처치 소견 게시","소속":"정부","품계":"구호원","직함":"중증도 응급 처치 의무원, 은채윤의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −60 | 물질 −15 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 30 | 자격 30 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −40 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 40 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2093-01-06에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 중증도 진료 의무원, 은채윤의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 중증도 표·진료 소견 게시 창구가 방한울의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 구호원. 직함은 중증도 구호원. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 붙이고, 무장 당직 책임자의 우선 치료 쪽지는 담당 응급처치원의 승인 전까지 받지 않는다.","일화":"가짜 해열제가 북한산보국문 어린이에게 쓰인 뒤, 같은 캡슐 모양의 약이 진료소 선반에서 한 통 더 나왔다.","관계":"은채윤의 도제로서 침상 순서를 집행하는 제자이고, 방미산의 진료소 병상을 나눈다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","야망":"","공포":"진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 자신이 찍은 중증도 표가 한 계절에 휴지가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":""},"biography":"손놀림은 조용하나 치료 순서를 바꾸라는 쪽지를 받으면 침상을 잠근다. 적의 부상도 중증도 표 앞에서는 같은 줄로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 중증도 표·응급 처치 소견 게시\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 구호원\n- 직함: 중증도 응급 처치 의무원, 은채윤의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2093-01-06에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 중증도 진료 의무원, 은채윤의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 중증도 표·진료 소견 게시 창구가 방한울의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 구호원. 직함은 중증도 구호원. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 붙이고, 무장 당직 책임자의 우선 치료 쪽지는 담당 응급처치원의 승인 전까지 받지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 가짜 해열제가 북한산보국문 어린이에게 쓰인 뒤, 같은 캡슐 모양의 약이 진료소 선반에서 한 통 더 나왔다.\n\n**관계.** 은채윤의 도제로서 침상 순서를 집행하는 제자이고, 방미산의 진료소 병상을 나눈다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.\n\n**공포.** 진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 자신이 찍은 중증도 표가 한 계절에 휴지가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −60 | 물질 −15 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 30 | 자격 30 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −40 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 40 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"방한울","type":"스승과 제자","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 도제로서 침상 순서를 집행하는 제자이고"},{"from":"방한울","type":"스승과 제자","to":"방미산","basis":"방미산의 진료소 병상을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"방미산","type":"계약","to":"방한울","basis":"방한울의 당직 원장을 문에 붙인다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0332', 'c218-d55c-c591', '{"id":"person-0332","name":"Su Choreong","title":"Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, Ra Seyeong''s Working-Level Aide","position":"Jegi-dong Quarantine Relief Worker","characterId":"K331","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Quarantine Check and Release Patrol","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-su-chorong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0332","birthDate":"2098-03-16","birthday":"03-16","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sanitation-patrol","name":"Sanitation patrol","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, Ra Seyeong''s Working-Level Aide","description":"Title: Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, Ra Seyeong''s Working-Level Aide.","behavior":"She trusted isolation days over rumor and wrote a political blockade lift into the patrol log as a cause of accidents. When an entry stamp ran faint, she turned back at the alley.","stress":"Fear. That in a cold snap blankets and fuel would run short while relief requests flooded in all at once, so that she could not see any single area through to the end.","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the east-side alleys under Ra Seyeong''s command and checked Ha Yunmok''s Achasan quarantine passes on the road. She pulled no inspection post before Seon Nahwi''s blockade dispatch arrived.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Jegi-dong Quarantine Relief Worker. Checks the waiting-hall shutters and heating twice, and makes the blanket and food rounds only after the stock records are matched.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Jegi-dong Quarantine Relief Worker. Checks the waiting-hall shutters and heating twice, and makes the blanket and food rounds only after the stock records are matched.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That in a cold snap blankets and fuel would run short while relief requests flooded in all at once, so that she could not see any single area through to the end.","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the east-side alleys under Ra Seyeong''s command and checked Ha Yunmok''s Achasan quarantine passes on the road. She pulled no inspection post before Seon Nahwi''s blockade dispatch arrived.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, Ra Seyeong''s Working-Level Aide.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"Hanyang Su Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":30,"Force":-45,"Material":-20,"Communal":30,"Principle":45,"Public":15,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":-20,"Display":-20,"Sustained":-20,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Quarantine Check and Release Patrol","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Relief Worker","Title":"Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, Ra Seyeong''s Working-Level Aide","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Material −20 | Communal 30 | Principle 45 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 20 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 40 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −20 | Display −20 | Endurance −20 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2098-03-16. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of working-level aide to Ra Seyeong in the Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with the catching of an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- The quarantine confirmation and release patrol window in Jegi-dong is Su Chorong''s working reference point. This working reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, domain, or right of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Jegi-dong Quarantine Relief Worker. Checks the waiting-hall shutters and heating twice, and makes the blanket and food rounds only after the stock records are matched.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Patrols the east-side alleys under Ra Seyeong''s command and cross-checks Ha Yunmok''s Achasan quarantine pass on the road. Does not pull the stakes until Seon Nahwi''s blockade message arrives.","Ambition":"Has the patrol alone trigger the on-site activation of the Dongdaemun–Cheongnyangni quarantine blockade, preventing its non-medical lifting.","Fear":"Fears that in a cold snap blankets and fuel will run short while relief requests flood in all at once, so that she cannot see any single area through to the end.","Intervention":"Can carry contamination-source samples to Magok, or pull the blockade stakes to restart medicinal herb shipments."},"biography":"Trusts quarantine days over rumors and records the political lifting of a blockade as the cause of the incident in the patrol log. If an entry stamp is smudged, turns back through the alley.\n\n- Livelihood: Quarantine Check and Release Patrol\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Relief Worker\n- Title: Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, Ra Seyeong''s Working-Level Aide\n**Life.** Born on 2098-03-16. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of working-level aide to Ra Seyeong in the Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with the catching of an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- The quarantine confirmation and release patrol window in Jegi-dong is Su Chorong''s working reference point. This working reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, domain, or right of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Jegi-dong Quarantine Relief Worker. Checks the waiting-hall shutters and heating twice, and makes the blanket and food rounds only after the stock records are matched.\n\n**Relations.** Patrols the east-side alleys under Ra Seyeong''s command and cross-checks Ha Yunmok''s Achasan quarantine pass on the road. Does not pull the stakes until Seon Nahwi''s blockade message arrives.\n\n**Ambition.** Has the patrol alone trigger the on-site activation of the Dongdaemun–Cheongnyangni quarantine blockade, preventing its non-medical lifting.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that in a cold snap blankets and fuel will run short while relief requests flood in all at once, so that she cannot see any single area through to the end.\n\n**Intervention.** Can carry contamination-source samples to Magok, or pull the blockade stakes to restart medicinal herb shipments.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Material −20 | Communal 30 | Principle 45 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 20 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −20 | Display −20 | Endurance −20 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Su Choreong","type":"Command","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Circles the eastern alley under Ra Seyeong''s command and"},{"from":"Su Choreong","type":"Contract","to":"Seon Nahwi","basis":"I do not pull the stakes until Seon Nahwi''s blockade message arrives."}],"incoming":[{"from":"Sin Nabin","type":"Contract","to":"Su Choreong","basis":"Sin Nabin passes Su Chorong the signature that corrected the double entry in the rounds ledger. Su Chorong examines the blanket, fuel and food distribution records and on-site checks to find places where the same share was recorded twice, and does not make the next rounds before the corrected signature."},{"from":"Mun Baeun","type":"Contract","to":"Su Choreong","basis":"Mun Baeun hands the preserved quarantine transcript to Su Chorong''s entry check. Su Chorong checks the quarantine screens and stamps on site and does not accept blurred records as grounds for release."},{"from":"Jin Sup-hyeok","type":"Contract","to":"Su Choreong","basis":"Jin Suphyeok hands Su Chorong the duplicate-payment correction and the takeover signature for the quarantine records. Su Chorong checks the on-site entry stamps and quarantine status to find places where the same entry was recorded twice."},{"from":"Ryu Doryeon","type":"Contract","to":"Su Choreong","basis":"Ryu Dolyeon hands the quarantine transcript over to Su Chorong. Su Chorong checks the quarantine screens and entry stamps on site so that blurred records are not used as grounds for release."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0332","name":"수초롱","title":"제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자","position":"제기동 방역 구호원","characterId":"K331","rank":"구호원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"격리 확인·해제 순찰","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-수초롱","detailRoute":"/people/person-0332","birthDate":"2098-03-16","birthday":"03-16","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sanitation-patrol","name":"방역 순찰","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자","description":"직함은 제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자.","behavior":"소문보다 격리 일수를 믿고, 정치적 봉쇄 해제를 사고 원인으로 순찰 일지에 적는다. 출입 도장이 흐리면 골목을 되돌아간다.","stress":"공포. 한파 속에 담요와 연료가 모자라는데 구호 요청이 한꺼번에 몰려 구호원이 어느 칸도 끝까지 돌보지 못하는 것.","relationship":"관계. 라세영의 지휘로 동측 골목을 돌고, 하윤목의 아차산 검역 통과증을 길에서 대조한다. 선나휘의 봉쇄 전갈이 오기 전에는 말목을 뽑지 않는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 제기동 방역 구호원. 대합실 셔터와 난방 상태를 두 번 확인하고, 담요와 식량을 나누는 순회는 재고 기록을 맞춘 뒤에만 돈다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 제기동 방역 구호원. 대합실 셔터와 난방 상태를 두 번 확인하고, 담요와 식량을 나누는 순회는 재고 기록을 맞춘 뒤에만 돈다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 한파 속에 담요와 연료가 모자라는데 구호 요청이 한꺼번에 몰려 구호원이 어느 칸도 끝까지 돌보지 못하는 것.","relationship":"관계. 라세영의 지휘로 동측 골목을 돌고, 하윤목의 아차산 검역 통과증을 길에서 대조한다. 선나휘의 봉쇄 전갈이 오기 전에는 말목을 뽑지 않는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"한양 수씨","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":30,"무력":-45,"물질":-20,"공동":30,"원칙":45,"공개":15,"자격":20,"분산":20,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":0,"위험":-20,"과시":-20,"지속":-20,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"격리 확인·해제 순찰","소속":"정부","품계":"구호원","직함":"제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −20 | 공동 30 | 원칙 45 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 0 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2098-03-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 격리 확인·해제 순찰 창구가 수초롱의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 구호원. 직함은 제기동 방역 구호원. 대합실 셔터와 난방 상태를 두 번 확인하고, 담요와 식량을 나누는 순회는 재고 기록을 맞춘 뒤에만 돈다.","일화":"","관계":"라세영의 지휘로 동측 골목을 돌고, 하윤목의 아차산 검역 통과증을 길에서 대조한다. 선나휘의 봉쇄 전갈이 오기 전에는 말목을 뽑지 않는다.","야망":"동대문·청량리 방역 봉쇄의 현장 발동을 순찰대가 단독으로 걸어 비의료적 해제를 막는다.","공포":"한파 속에 담요와 연료가 모자라는데 구호 요청이 한꺼번에 몰려 구호원이 어느 칸도 끝까지 돌보지 못하는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"오염원 표본을 마곡으로 나르거나, 봉쇄 말목을 뽑아 약재 출하를 재개시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"소문보다 격리 일수를 믿고, 정치적 봉쇄 해제를 사고 원인으로 순찰 일지에 적는다. 출입 도장이 흐리면 골목을 되돌아간다.\n\n- 생업: 격리 확인·해제 순찰\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 구호원\n- 직함: 제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2098-03-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 격리 확인·해제 순찰 창구가 수초롱의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 구호원. 직함은 제기동 방역 구호원. 대합실 셔터와 난방 상태를 두 번 확인하고, 담요와 식량을 나누는 순회는 재고 기록을 맞춘 뒤에만 돈다.\n\n**관계.** 라세영의 지휘로 동측 골목을 돌고, 하윤목의 아차산 검역 통과증을 길에서 대조한다. 선나휘의 봉쇄 전갈이 오기 전에는 말목을 뽑지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 동대문·청량리 방역 봉쇄의 현장 발동을 순찰대가 단독으로 걸어 비의료적 해제를 막는다.\n\n**공포.** 한파 속에 담요와 연료가 모자라는데 구호 요청이 한꺼번에 몰려 구호원이 어느 칸도 끝까지 돌보지 못하는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 오염원 표본을 마곡으로 나르거나, 봉쇄 말목을 뽑아 약재 출하를 재개시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −20 | 공동 30 | 원칙 45 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 0 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"수초롱","type":"지휘","to":"라세영","basis":"라세영의 지휘로 동측 골목을 돌고"},{"from":"수초롱","type":"계약","to":"선나휘","basis":"선나휘의 봉쇄 전갈이 오기 전에는 말목을 뽑지 않는다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"신나빈","type":"계약","to":"수초롱","basis":"신나빈은 순회 장부의 이중 기록을 정정한 서명을 수초롱에게 전한다. 수초롱은 담요·연료·식량 나눔 기록과 현장 확인을 살펴 같은 몫이 중복 기록된 곳을 찾고, 정정 서명 전에는 다음 순회를 돌지 않는다."},{"from":"문바은","type":"계약","to":"수초롱","basis":"문바은은 보존한 방역 필사본을 수초롱의 출입 확인에 넘긴다. 수초롱은 현장의 격리 막과 도장을 확인해 흐린 기록을 해제 근거로 받아들이지 않는다."},{"from":"진숲혁","type":"계약","to":"수초롱","basis":"진숲혁은 방역 기록의 중복 지급 정정과 인수 서명을 수초롱에게 넘긴다. 수초롱은 현장 출입 도장과 격리 상태를 확인해 같은 출입이 두 번 기록된 곳을 찾는다."},{"from":"류돌연","type":"계약","to":"수초롱","basis":"류돌연은 방역 필사본을 수초롱에게 인계한다. 수초롱은 현장의 격리 막과 출입 도장을 확인해 흐린 기록이 해제 근거로 쓰이지 않게 한다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0333', 'c120-bcf4-c131', '{"id":"person-0333","name":"Seon Nahwi","title":"Medical Council Vote Messenger, Jeon Sol''s Working-Level Aide","position":"Medical Directive Messenger Relief Worker","characterId":"K332","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medical Message and Contract Notice Delivery","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#character-seon-nahwi","detailRoute":"/people/person-0333","birthDate":"2071-05-13","birthday":"05-13","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sealed-notice-delivery","name":"Sealed notice delivery","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Medical Council Vote Messenger, Jeon Sol''s Working-Level Aide","description":"Title: Medical Council Vote Messenger, Jeon Sol''s Working-Level Aide.","behavior":"Title: Medical Council Vote Messenger, Jeon Sol''s Working-Level Aide.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Under command to carry Jeon Sol''s vote notes only under seal, she shared order with Yeong Neulbit''s council ledger. Pasted Sim Dalho''s voided pre-buying at the market gate.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medical Directive Messenger Relief Worker. Posts messages simultaneously on the clinic duty board and the clinic waiting list, and locks private treatment-contract notices in the bag unless they bear the seals of the attending first-aid officer and the Order Head.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medical Directive Messenger Relief Worker. Posts messages simultaneously on the clinic duty board and the clinic waiting list, and locks private treatment-contract notices in the bag unless they bear the seals of the attending first-aid officer and the Order Head.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Under command to carry Jeon Sol''s vote notes only under seal, she shared order with Yeong Neulbit''s council ledger. Pasted Sim Dalho''s voided pre-buying at the market gate.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Medical Council Vote Messenger, Jeon Sol''s Working-Level Aide.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c120-bcf4-c131","name":"Seon Clan of Boseong","crest":"clan-crests/c120-bcf4-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":30,"Force":-50,"Material":-30,"Communal":10,"Principle":35,"Public":40,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-30,"Display":-5,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical Message and Contract Notice Delivery","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Relief Worker","Title":"Medical Council Vote Messenger, Jeon Sol''s Working-Level Aide","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −50 | Material −30 | Communal 10 | Principle 35 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 30 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Multi-partner"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2071-05-13. As of the 2126 opening, holds the posts of Council Vote Messenger and Jeon Sol''s operations aide, continuing the existing duty and records. In the succession record of that post, the position opened when a ticketless departing train was stopped.\n- The window for delivering medical messages and contract notices in Jegi-dong is Seon Nahwi''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, domain, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medical Directive Messenger Relief Worker. Posts messages simultaneously on the clinic duty board and the clinic waiting list, and locks private treatment-contract notices in the bag unless they bear the seals of the attending first-aid officer and the Order Head.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Takes command from Jeon Sol to carry vote slips only under seal, and shares turns with Yeong Neulbit''s council ledger. Posts Sim Dalho''s pre-purchase nullification at the market entrance.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can find the forged message and protect the seal, or expose the withheld document in the bag to neutralize the right to refuse treatment."},"biography":"If the seal cord is loose, refuses to depart, and does not accept a verbal consent in the name of the attending first-aid officer as a message. Even out of breath, holds two copies in one hand.\n\n- Livelihood: Medical Message and Contract Notice Delivery\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Relief Worker\n- Title: Medical Directive Messenger Relief Worker\n**Life.** Born on 2071-05-13. As of the 2126 opening, holds the posts of Council Vote Messenger and Jeon Sol''s operations aide, continuing the existing duty and records. In the succession record of that post, the position opened when a ticketless departing train was stopped.\n- The window for delivering medical messages and contract notices in Jegi-dong is Seon Nahwi''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, domain, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medical Directive Messenger Relief Worker. Posts messages simultaneously on the clinic duty board and the clinic waiting list, and locks private treatment-contract notices in the bag unless they bear the seals of the attending first-aid officer and the Order Head.\n\n**Relationships.** Takes command from Jeon Sol to carry vote slips only under seal, and shares turns with Yeong Neulbit''s council ledger. Posts Sim Dalho''s pre-purchase nullification at the market entrance.\n\n**Intervention.** Can find the forged message and protect the seal, or expose the withheld document in the bag to neutralize the right to refuse treatment.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −50 | Material −30 | Communal 10 | Principle 35 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 30 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seon Nahwi","type":"Command","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Under orders to carry Jeon Sol''s voting slips only in a sealed state,"},{"from":"Seon Nahwi","type":"Command","to":"Yeong Neulbit","basis":"Shares turns with Yeong Neulbit''s council ledger"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Su Choreong","type":"Contract","to":"Seon Nahwi","basis":"I do not pull the stakes until Seon Nahwi''s blockade message arrives."},{"from":"Yeong Neulbit","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Seon Nahwi","basis":"Leaves a copy of Seon Nahwi''s message on the same line"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0333","name":"선나휘","title":"의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자","position":"의료 지침 전령 구호원","characterId":"K332","rank":"구호원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"의료 전갈·계약 통지 배달","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-선나휘","detailRoute":"/people/person-0333","birthDate":"2071-05-13","birthday":"05-13","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sealed-notice-delivery","name":"봉인 전갈 전달","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자","description":"직함은 의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자.","behavior":"직함은 의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 전솔의 표결 쪽지를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영늘빛의 의정 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 심달호의 선매 무효를 시장 입구에 붙인다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 의료 지침 전령 구호원. 전갈을 진료 당직 게시판과 진료 대기 명부에 동시에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약 통지는 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 날인 없이 가방에 잠근다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 의료 지침 전령 구호원. 전갈을 진료 당직 게시판과 진료 대기 명부에 동시에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약 통지는 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 날인 없이 가방에 잠근다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 전솔의 표결 쪽지를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영늘빛의 의정 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 심달호의 선매 무효를 시장 입구에 붙인다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c120-bcf4-c131","name":"보성 선씨","crest":"clan-crests/c120-bcf4-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":30,"무력":-50,"물질":-30,"공동":10,"원칙":35,"공개":40,"자격":20,"분산":30,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":10,"위험":-30,"과시":-5,"지속":10,"지향":"이성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"의료 전갈·계약 통지 배달","소속":"정부","품계":"구호원","직함":"의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −30 | 공동 10 | 원칙 35 | 공개 40 | 자격 20 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2071-05-13에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 의료 전갈·계약 통지 배달 창구가 선나휘의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 구호원. 직함은 의료 지침 전령 구호원. 전갈을 진료 당직 게시판과 진료 대기 명부에 동시에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약 통지는 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 날인 없이 가방에 잠근다.","일화":"","관계":"전솔의 표결 쪽지를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영늘빛의 의정 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 심달호의 선매 무효를 시장 입구에 붙인다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"위조 전갈을 찾아 봉인을 지키거나, 가방 속 보류 문서를 폭로해 진료 거부권을 무력화할 수 있다."},"biography":"봉인 끈이 느슨하면 출발을 거부하고, 담당 응급처치원 명의의 구두 동의를 전갈로 인정하지 않는다. 숨이 차도 사본 두 장을 한 손에 쥔다.\n\n- 생업: 의료 전갈·계약 통지 배달\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 구호원\n- 직함: 의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2071-05-13에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 의료 전갈·계약 통지 배달 창구가 선나휘의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 구호원. 직함은 의료 지침 전령 구호원. 전갈을 진료 당직 게시판과 진료 대기 명부에 동시에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약 통지는 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 날인 없이 가방에 잠근다.\n\n**관계.** 전솔의 표결 쪽지를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영늘빛의 의정 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 심달호의 선매 무효를 시장 입구에 붙인다.\n\n**개입.** 위조 전갈을 찾아 봉인을 지키거나, 가방 속 보류 문서를 폭로해 진료 거부권을 무력화할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −30 | 공동 10 | 원칙 35 | 공개 40 | 자격 20 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"선나휘","type":"지휘","to":"전솔","basis":"전솔의 표결 쪽지를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"선나휘","type":"지휘","to":"영늘빛","basis":"영늘빛의 의정 원장과 순번을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"수초롱","type":"계약","to":"선나휘","basis":"선나휘의 봉쇄 전갈이 오기 전에는 말목을 뽑지 않는다"},{"from":"영늘빛","type":"스승과 제자","to":"선나휘","basis":"선나휘의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0334', 'c6d0-c6d0-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0334","name":"Won Miru","title":"Origin and Counterfeit Medicine Surveyor","position":"Counterfeit Medicine Identification Relief Worker","characterId":"K333","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Counterfeit Medicine Identification and Origin Record","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#character-won-miru","detailRoute":"/people/person-0334","birthDate":"2070-08-28","birthday":"08-28","age":56,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"field-surveying","name":"Field surveying","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Dotted lines before measurement","description":"Title: Origin and Counterfeit Medicine Surveyor.","behavior":"He read origins from the smell of crude herbs and the seams of capsules and despised drawing an origin as a solid line from rumor alone. He counted a late specimen a fault.","stress":"Fear. That the survey specimens would vanish with the pre-buying ledger, and the counterfeit drugs would be fixed as the children''s medicine of Bukhansan Bogukmun.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract handing contamination coordinates to Ra Seyeong and received Eun Chaeyun''s shelf drugs as comparison specimens. Moved Baek On''s Bukhansan Bogukmun testimony into the margin of the master plate.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Counterfeit Medicine Identification Relief Worker. Origins that have not been physically surveyed remain only as dotted lines, and a capsule seal becomes a solid line only when it overlaps with Jeong Hojun''s efficacy records.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Counterfeit Medicine Identification Relief Worker. Origins that have not been physically surveyed remain only as dotted lines, and a capsule seal becomes a solid line only when it overlaps with Jeong Hojun''s efficacy records.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the survey specimens would vanish with the pre-buying ledger, and the counterfeit drugs would be fixed as the children''s medicine of Bukhansan Bogukmun.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract handing contamination coordinates to Ra Seyeong and received Eun Chaeyun''s shelf drugs as comparison specimens. Moved Baek On''s Bukhansan Bogukmun testimony into the margin of the master plate.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Origin and Counterfeit Medicine Surveyor.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6d0-c6d0-c8fc","name":"Won Clan of Wonju","crest":"clan-crests/c6d0-c6d0-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":30,"Force":-55,"Material":-20,"Communal":15,"Principle":45,"Public":25,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":5,"Display":25,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Counterfeit Medicine Identification and Origin Record","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Relief Worker","Title":"Origin and Counterfeit Medicine Surveyor","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 30 | Force −55 | Materialism −20 | Communal 15 | Principle 45 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly −40 | Risk 5 | Display 25 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: Opposite Sex | Bonding: Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2070-08-28. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Origin and Counterfeit Medicine Surveyor, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post was opened with a fake-medicine seal.\n- The counterfeit medicine identification and origin record desk in Jegi-dong is Won Miru''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Counterfeit Medicine Identification Relief Worker. Origins that have not been physically surveyed remain only as dotted lines, and a capsule seal becomes a solid line only when it overlaps with Jeong Hojun''s efficacy records.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"A contract to hand contamination coordinates to Ra Seyeong, in return for receiving Eun Chaeyun''s shelf medicines as comparison samples. Transcribes Baek On''s testimony about Bukhansanbogukmun into the margin of the master plate.","Ambition":"","Fear":"Fears that the survey samples will vanish along with the advance-purchase ledger, and that the fake medicine will be confirmed as Bukhansanbogukmun children''s medicine.","Intervention":"Can keep the dotted line of the counterfeit origin."},"biography":"Reads provenance from the smell of herbal medicines and the seams of capsules, and despises drawing an origin as a solid line on rumor alone. Regards a late sample as a sin.\n\n- Livelihood: Counterfeit Medicine Identification and Origin Record\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Relief Worker\n- Title: Origin and Counterfeit Medicine Surveyor\n**Life.** Born 2070-08-28. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Origin and Counterfeit Medicine Surveyor, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post was opened with a fake-medicine seal.\n- The counterfeit medicine identification and origin record desk in Jegi-dong is Won Miru''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Counterfeit Medicine Identification Relief Worker. Origins that have not been physically surveyed remain only as dotted lines, and a capsule seal becomes a solid line only when it overlaps with Jeong Hojun''s efficacy records.\n\n**Relations.** A contract to hand contamination coordinates to Ra Seyeong, in return for receiving Eun Chaeyun''s shelf medicines as comparison samples. Transcribes Baek On''s testimony about Bukhansanbogukmun into the margin of the master plate.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that the survey samples will vanish along with the advance-purchase ledger, and that the fake medicine will be confirmed as Bukhansanbogukmun children''s medicine.\n\n**Intervention.** Can keep the dotted line of the counterfeit origin.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 30 | Force −55 | Materialism −20 | Communal 15 | Principle 45 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly −40 | Risk 5 | Display 25 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: Opposite Sex | Bonding: Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Won Miru","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"is a contract to hand contamination coordinates to Ra Seyeong and"},{"from":"Won Miru","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"receives the medicines on Eun Chaeyun''s shelf as reference samples"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gu Jahui","type":"Contract","to":"Won Miru","basis":"Gu Jahui seals suspect medicinal herbs and hands them to Won Miru along with custody records. Won Miru examines the samples and capsule seals, investigates the distribution route, and leaves unconfirmed origins as dotted lines."},{"from":"Ju Kain","type":"Contract","to":"Won Miru","basis":"Ju Kain seals suspect medicinal herbs and hands them to Won Miru along with custody records. Won Miru examines the samples and capsule seals, investigates the route, and leaves unidentified origins as dotted lines."},{"from":"Gang Payu","type":"Contract","to":"Won Miru","basis":"Gang Payu hands the sealed suspect medicinal herbs to Won Miru along with custody records. Won Miru examines the capsule seals and samples, investigates the distribution route, and leaves unidentified origins as dotted lines."},{"from":"Nam Bichwon","type":"Contract","to":"Won Miru","basis":"Nam Bichwon hands the sealed suspect medicinal herbs to Won Miru along with custody records. Won Miru examines the capsule seals and samples, investigates the route, and leaves unidentified origins as dotted lines."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0334","name":"원미루","title":"원산지·위조약 탐사원","position":"위조약 감별 구호원","characterId":"K333","rank":"구호원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"위조약 감별·산지 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-원미루","detailRoute":"/people/person-0334","birthDate":"2070-08-28","birthday":"08-28","age":56,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"field-surveying","name":"현장 측량","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"측정 전에는 점선","description":"직함은 원산지·위조약 탐사원.","behavior":"생약의 냄새와 캡슐 이음새로 출처를 읽고, 소문만으로 원산지를 실선으로 그리는 일을 경멸한다. 늦은 표본을 죄로 본다.","stress":"공포. 탐사 표본이 선매 장부와 함께 사라져 가짜 약이 북한산보국문 어린이 약으로 확정되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 라세영에게 오염 좌표를 넘기는 계약이고, 은채윤의 선반 약을 대조 표본으로 받는다. 백온의 북한산보국문 증언을 원판 여백에 옮긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 위조약 감별 구호원. 실측하지 않은 산지는 점선으로만 남기고, 캡슐 인장은 정호준의 약효 기록과 겹쳐야 실선이 된다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 위조약 감별 구호원. 실측하지 않은 산지는 점선으로만 남기고, 캡슐 인장은 정호준의 약효 기록과 겹쳐야 실선이 된다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 탐사 표본이 선매 장부와 함께 사라져 가짜 약이 북한산보국문 어린이 약으로 확정되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 라세영에게 오염 좌표를 넘기는 계약이고, 은채윤의 선반 약을 대조 표본으로 받는다. 백온의 북한산보국문 증언을 원판 여백에 옮긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 원산지·위조약 탐사원.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6d0-c6d0-c8fc","name":"원주 원씨","crest":"clan-crests/c6d0-c6d0-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":30,"무력":-55,"물질":-20,"공동":15,"원칙":45,"공개":25,"자격":10,"분산":25,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":-40,"위험":5,"과시":25,"지속":35,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"위조약 감별·산지 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"구호원","직함":"원산지·위조약 탐사원","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 30 | 무력 −55 | 물질 −20 | 공동 15 | 원칙 45 | 공개 25 | 자격 10 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 −40 | 위험 5 | 과시 25 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2070-08-28에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 원산지·위조약 탐사원 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 위조약 감별·산지 기록 창구가 원미루의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 구호원. 직함은 위조약 감별 구호원. 실측하지 않은 산지는 점선으로만 남기고, 캡슐 인장은 정호준의 약효 기록과 겹쳐야 실선이 된다.","일화":"","관계":"라세영에게 오염 좌표를 넘기는 계약이고, 은채윤의 선반 약을 대조 표본으로 받는다. 백온의 북한산보국문 증언을 원판 여백에 옮긴다.","야망":"","공포":"탐사 표본이 선매 장부와 함께 사라져 가짜 약이 북한산보국문 어린이 약으로 확정되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"위조 산지 점선을 지킬 수 있다."},"biography":"생약의 냄새와 캡슐 이음새로 출처를 읽고, 소문만으로 원산지를 실선으로 그리는 일을 경멸한다. 늦은 표본을 죄로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 위조약 감별·산지 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 구호원\n- 직함: 원산지·위조약 탐사원\n**생애.** 2070-08-28에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 원산지·위조약 탐사원 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 위조약 감별·산지 기록 창구가 원미루의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 구호원. 직함은 위조약 감별 구호원. 실측하지 않은 산지는 점선으로만 남기고, 캡슐 인장은 정호준의 약효 기록과 겹쳐야 실선이 된다.\n\n**관계.** 라세영에게 오염 좌표를 넘기는 계약이고, 은채윤의 선반 약을 대조 표본으로 받는다. 백온의 북한산보국문 증언을 원판 여백에 옮긴다.\n\n**공포.** 탐사 표본이 선매 장부와 함께 사라져 가짜 약이 북한산보국문 어린이 약으로 확정되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 위조 산지 점선을 지킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 30 | 무력 −55 | 물질 −20 | 공동 15 | 원칙 45 | 공개 25 | 자격 10 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 −40 | 위험 5 | 과시 25 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"원미루","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"라세영에게 오염 좌표를 넘기는 계약이고"},{"from":"원미루","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 선반 약을 대조 표본으로 받는다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"구자희","type":"계약","to":"원미루","basis":"구자희는 의심 약재를 봉인해 원미루에게 관리 기록과 함께 넘긴다. 원미루는 표본과 캡슐 인장을 살펴 유통 경로를 조사하고 확인되지 않은 산지는 점선으로 남긴다."},{"from":"주카인","type":"계약","to":"원미루","basis":"주카인은 의심 약재를 봉인해 원미루에게 관리 기록과 함께 넘긴다. 원미루는 표본·캡슐 인장을 살펴 경로를 조사하고 미확인 산지는 점선으로 남긴다."},{"from":"강파유","type":"계약","to":"원미루","basis":"강파유는 봉인한 의심 약재를 관리 기록과 함께 원미루에게 넘긴다. 원미루는 캡슐 인장·표본을 살펴 유통 경로를 조사하고 미확인 산지는 점선으로 남긴다."},{"from":"남빛원","type":"계약","to":"원미루","basis":"남빛원은 봉인한 의심 약재를 원미루에게 관리 기록과 함께 넘긴다. 원미루는 캡슐 인장·표본을 살펴 경로를 조사하고 미확인 산지는 점선으로 남긴다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0335', 'c601-c601-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0335","name":"Yeong Neulbit","title":"Medical Council Sickbed Recorder, Jeon Sol''s Working-Level Aide","position":"Sickbed Record Relief Worker","characterId":"K334","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Sickbed Waiting List and Contract Margin Notes","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-yeongneulbit","detailRoute":"/people/person-0335","birthDate":"2078-09-23","birthday":"09-23","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"bed-ledger-administration","name":"Bed ledger administration","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Suspect papers in the margin","description":"A false consent entry goes into the margin and sealing waits for comparison. Document administration is the strength, not an additional claim of clinical ability.","behavior":"She filled the waiting list''s blanks before the people and called any merchant who kept private care contracts off the ledger a violator. She published the numbers but left the readings in the margin.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice moving Jeon Sol''s veto into the ledger, she left Seon Nahwi''s dispatch copies on the same line. Put Ryu Eunbi''s vote stamp at the top of the ledger.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Sickbed Record Relief Worker. Posts the bed waiting list simultaneously at