30 | Principle 50 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation −20","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −10 | Display −30 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: Multi-partner"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2078-09-23. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Deliberative Council Bed Recorder and Jeon Sol''s working-level aide, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post was opened by the deletion of a single line from a double ledger.\n- The sickbed waiting list and contract margin-note record desk in Jegi-dong is Yeong Neulbit''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Sickbed Record Relief Worker. Posts the bed waiting list simultaneously at the market entrance and the clinic duty room, and records any contract lacking the seals of the attending first-aid officer and the order''s commander in the void margin.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"A disciple who transfers Jeon Sol''s veto into the ledger, and leaves a copy of Seon Nahwi''s message on the same line. Places Ryu Eunbi''s voting seal at the very top of the ledger.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can publish the marginal handwriting, or erase one ledger line to leave the right to refuse treatment blank."},"biography":"Fills the blanks in the waiting list before the people, and calls undisclosed buyers who do not enter private treatment contracts into the ledger violators. Publishes the numbers but leaves interpretation in the margin.\n\n- Livelihood: Sickbed Waiting List and Contract Margin Notes\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Relief Worker\n- Title: Sickbed Record Relief Worker\n**Life.** Born 2078-09-23. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Deliberative Council Bed Recorder and Jeon Sol''s working-level aide, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post was opened by the deletion of a single line from a double ledger.\n- The sickbed waiting list and contract margin-note record desk in Jegi-dong is Yeong Neulbit''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Sickbed Record Relief Worker. Posts the bed waiting list simultaneously at the market entrance and the clinic duty room, and records any contract lacking the seals of the attending first-aid officer and the order''s commander in the void margin.\n\n**Relations.** A disciple who transfers Jeon Sol''s veto into the ledger, and leaves a copy of Seon Nahwi''s message on the same line. Places Ryu Eunbi''s voting seal at the very top of the ledger.\n\n**Intervention.** Can publish the marginal handwriting, or erase one ledger line to leave the right to refuse treatment blank.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −50 | Materialism −30 | Communal 30 | Principle 50 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −10 | Display −30 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yeong Neulbit","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"is the disciple who transfers Jeon Sol''s veto into the ledger, and"},{"from":"Yeong Neulbit","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Seon Nahwi","basis":"Leaves a copy of Seon Nahwi''s message on the same line"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Seon Nahwi","type":"Command","to":"Yeong Neulbit","basis":"Shares turns with Yeong Neulbit''s council ledger"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0335","name":"영늘빛","title":"의정회 병상 기록관, 전솔의 실무 담당자","position":"병상 기록 구호원","characterId":"K334","rank":"구호원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"병상 대기 명부·계약 난외 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-영늘빛","detailRoute":"/people/person-0335","birthDate":"2078-09-23","birthday":"09-23","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"bed-ledger-administration","name":"병상 원장 정리","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"의심 문서는 난외로","description":"허위 동의서 줄을 난외로 내리고 대조 전 날인을 보류한다. 문서 운영이 강점이며 임상 능력을 같은 근거로 올리지 않는다.","behavior":"대기 명부의 빈칸을 사람보다 먼저 메우고, 비공개 치료 계약을 원장에 올리지 않는 외부 구매자를 위반자로 부른다. 숫자는 공개하되 해석은 난외에 남긴다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 전솔의 거부권을 원장으로 옮기는 제자이고, 선나휘의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다. 류은비의 표결 날인을 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 병상 기록 구호원. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구와 진료 당직실에 동시에 붙이고, 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 날인 없는 계약은 무효 난외에 적는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 병상 기록 구호원. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구와 진료 당직실에 동시에 붙이고, 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 날인 없는 계약은 무효 난외에 적는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 전솔의 거부권을 원장으로 옮기는 제자이고, 선나휘의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다. 류은비의 표결 날인을 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"허위 동의서 줄을 난외로 내리고 대조 전 날인을 보류한다. 문서 운영이 강점이며 임상 능력을 같은 근거로 올리지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c601-c601-cc9c","name":"영천 영씨","crest":"clan-crests/c601-c601-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":35,"무력":-50,"물질":-30,"공동":30,"원칙":50,"공개":15,"자격":15,"분산":10,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":-15,"위험":-10,"과시":-30,"지속":0,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"병상 대기 명부·계약 난외 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"구호원","직함":"의정회 병상 기록관, 전솔의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −30 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −30 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2078-09-23에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의정회 병상 기록관, 전솔의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 병상 대기 명부·계약 난외 기록 창구가 영늘빛의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 구호원. 직함은 병상 기록 구호원. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구와 진료 당직실에 동시에 붙이고, 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 날인 없는 계약은 무효 난외에 적는다.","일화":"","관계":"전솔의 거부권을 원장으로 옮기는 제자이고, 선나휘의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다. 류은비의 표결 날인을 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"난외 필적을 공개하거나, 원장 한 줄을 지워 진료 거부권을 빈칸으로 만들 수 있다."},"biography":"대기 명부의 빈칸을 사람보다 먼저 메우고, 비공개 치료 계약을 원장에 올리지 않는 비공개 구매자를 위반자로 부른다. 숫자는 공개하되 해석은 난외에 남긴다.\n\n- 생업: 병상 대기 명부·계약 난외 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 구호원\n- 직함: 의정회 병상 기록관, 전솔의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2078-09-23에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의정회 병상 기록관, 전솔의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 병상 대기 명부·계약 난외 기록 창구가 영늘빛의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 구호원. 직함은 병상 기록 구호원. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구와 진료 당직실에 동시에 붙이고, 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 날인 없는 계약은 무효 난외에 적는다.\n\n**관계.** 전솔의 거부권을 원장으로 옮기는 제자이고, 선나휘의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다. 류은비의 표결 날인을 원장 맨 위에 둔다.\n\n**개입.** 난외 필적을 공개하거나, 원장 한 줄을 지워 진료 거부권을 빈칸으로 만들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −30 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −30 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"영늘빛","type":"스승과 제자","to":"전솔","basis":"전솔의 거부권을 원장으로 옮기는 제자이고"},{"from":"영늘빛","type":"스승과 제자","to":"선나휘","basis":"선나휘의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"선나휘","type":"지휘","to":"영늘빛","basis":"영늘빛의 의정 원장과 순번을 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0336', 'd310-d574-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0336","name":"Pan Handeul","title":"Cheongnyangni Station Concourse Outpost Chief","position":"Cheongnyangni Concourse First-Aid Officer","characterId":"K335","rank":"First-Aid Officer","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Concourse Medical Waiting Tickets and Medicinal Herb Unloading Order Posting","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-panhandeul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0336","birthDate":"2094-12-30","birthday":"12-30","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"waiting-hall-scheduling","name":"Waiting hall scheduling","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Patient lines first","description":"Published queues and unloading order put military freight behind medical transport. The record does not establish that the mixed-in crate was resolved.","behavior":"He gauged patient crowds by platform humidity and heard the order to pull munitions cars ahead of the medical convoy as an insult. Mild in manner, he took the broadcast himself whenever a counterfeit-drug rumor rose.","stress":"Fear. That the summer counterfeit-drug rumor alone would blockade the concourse and scatter the patients into back-gate handcars.","relationship":"Relations. Received Nam Hoseong''s convoy stops at the platform and split the queue with Dong Juha''s market unloading. Put Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy hours at the top of the chalkboard.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Cheongnyangni Concourse First-Aid Officer. Publishes the medical queue tickets and medicine unloading order every day, and couples military wagons to the platform only after the medical convoy has departed.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Cheongnyangni Concourse First-Aid Officer. Publishes the medical queue tickets and medicine unloading order every day, and couples military wagons to the platform only after the medical convoy has departed.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the summer counterfeit-drug rumor alone would blockade the concourse and scatter the patients into back-gate handcars.","relationship":"Relations. Received Nam Hoseong''s convoy stops at the platform and split the queue with Dong Juha''s market unloading. Put Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy hours at the top of the chalkboard.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Published queues and unloading order put military freight behind medical transport. The record does not establish that the mixed-in crate was resolved.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d310-d574-c8fc","name":"Pan Clan of Haeju","crest":"clan-crests/d310-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":30,"Force":-55,"Material":-20,"Communal":25,"Principle":50,"Public":30,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":20,"Display":5,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Concourse Medical Waiting Tickets and Medicinal Herb Unloading Order Posting","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"First-Aid Officer","Title":"Cheongnyangni Station Concourse Outpost Chief","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 30 | Force −55 | Materialism −20 | Community 25 | Principle 50 | Publicity 30 | Credentials 20 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 20 | Display 5 | Persistence 20 | Orientation bisexual | Union contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2094-12-30. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Cheongnyangni Station Waiting Hall Chief, continuing the existing duty shifts and records. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence from rotation.\n- The window in Cheongnyangni-dong where medical queue tickets and the medicine unloading order are posted is Pan Handeul''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Cheongnyangni Concourse First-Aid Officer. Publishes the medical queue tickets and medicine unloading order every day, and couples military wagons to the platform only after the medical convoy has departed.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Receives Nam Hoseong''s convoy stops at the platform and shares the line with Dong Juha''s market unloading. Puts Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy times at the top of the blackboard.","Ambition":"Aims to keep the Cheongnyangni waiting hall as an eastern medical window where medicine auctions, treatment, and convoys are all signed under one roof, so that no private pre-purchase window can be opened on the platform.","Fear":"Fears that a summer fake-medicine rumor alone will get the waiting hall sealed off and the patients scattered onto back-gate handcarts.","Intervention":"Can openly inspect waiting hall cargo, or separate the patient line from the military queue."},"biography":"Gauges the patient crowd by the humidity on the platform, and hears an order to bring military wagons ahead of the medical convoy as an insult. Mild-mannered, but takes over the broadcast himself when a fake-medicine rumor surfaces.\n\n- Livelihood: Concourse Medical Waiting Tickets and Medicinal Herb Unloading Order Posting\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: First-Aid Officer\n- Title: Cheongnyangni Concourse First-Aid Officer\n**Life.** Born on 2094-12-30. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Cheongnyangni Station Waiting Hall Chief, continuing the existing duty shifts and records. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence from rotation.\n- The window in Cheongnyangni-dong where medical queue tickets and the medicine unloading order are posted is Pan Handeul''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Cheongnyangni Concourse First-Aid Officer. Publishes the medical queue tickets and medicine unloading order every day, and couples military wagons to the platform only after the medical convoy has departed.\n\n**Relationships.** Receives Nam Hoseong''s convoy stops at the platform and shares the line with Dong Juha''s market unloading. Puts Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy times at the top of the blackboard.\n\n**Ambition.** Aims to keep the Cheongnyangni waiting hall as an eastern medical window where medicine auctions, treatment, and convoys are all signed under one roof, so that no private pre-purchase window can be opened on the platform.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a summer fake-medicine rumor alone will get the waiting hall sealed off and the patients scattered onto back-gate handcarts.\n\n**Intervention.** Can openly inspect waiting hall cargo, or separate the patient line from the military queue.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 30 | Force −55 | Materialism −20 | Community 25 | Principle 50 | Publicity 30 | Credentials 20 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 20 | Display 5 | Persistence 20 | Orientation bisexual | Union contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Pan Handeul","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Receives Nam Hoseong''s convoy stop at the platform and"},{"from":"Pan Handeul","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Shares the line with Dong Juha''s market unloading"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Cheon Daol","type":"Contract","to":"Pan Handeul","basis":"Aligns stop times with Pan Handeul''s waiting hall stops"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0336","name":"판한들","title":"청량리역 대합실 거점장","position":"청량리 대합실 응급처치원","characterId":"K335","rank":"응급처치원","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"대합실 의무 대기표·약재 하역 순서 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-판한들","detailRoute":"/people/person-0336","birthDate":"2094-12-30","birthday":"12-30","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"waiting-hall-scheduling","name":"대합실 일정 조정","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"환자 줄 우선","description":"의무 대기표와 하역 순서를 공개하고 군수 화차를 뒤로 둔다. 혼입 상자를 해결한 결과까지는 기록되지 않았다.","behavior":"승강장 습기로 환자 인파를 가늠하고, 군수 화차를 의무호송 앞으로 끌어오라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 가짜 약 소문이 뜨면 방송을 직접 잡는다.","stress":"공포. 여름 가짜 약 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 환자들이 후문 밀차로 흩어지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 호송 정차를 승강장에서 받고, 동주하의 시장 하역과 줄을 나눈다. 장세화의 의료호송 시각을 칠판 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 청량리 대합실 응급처치원. 대합실 의무 대기표와 약재 하역 순서를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의무호송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 청량리 대합실 응급처치원. 대합실 의무 대기표와 약재 하역 순서를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의무호송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 여름 가짜 약 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 환자들이 후문 밀차로 흩어지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 호송 정차를 승강장에서 받고, 동주하의 시장 하역과 줄을 나눈다. 장세화의 의료호송 시각을 칠판 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"의무 대기표와 하역 순서를 공개하고 군수 화차를 뒤로 둔다. 혼입 상자를 해결한 결과까지는 기록되지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d310-d574-c8fc","name":"해주 판씨","crest":"clan-crests/d310-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":30,"무력":-55,"물질":-20,"공동":25,"원칙":50,"공개":30,"자격":20,"분산":25,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":15,"위험":20,"과시":5,"지속":20,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"대합실 의무 대기표·약재 하역 순서 게시","소속":"정부","품계":"응급처치원","직함":"청량리역 대합실 거점장","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 30 | 무력 −55 | 물질 −20 | 공동 25 | 원칙 50 | 공개 30 | 자격 20 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 15 | 위험 20 | 과시 5 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2094-12-30에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 청량리역 대합실 거점장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 대합실 의무 대기표·약재 하역 순서 게시 창구가 판한들의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 응급처치원. 직함은 청량리 대합실 응급처치원. 대합실 의무 대기표와 약재 하역 순서를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의무호송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","일화":"","관계":"남호성의 호송 정차를 승강장에서 받고, 동주하의 시장 하역과 줄을 나눈다. 장세화의 의료호송 시각을 칠판 맨 위에 둔다.","야망":"청량리 대합실을 약재 경매·진료·호송이 한 지붕에서 서명되는 동부 의료 창구로 남겨 비공개 선매 창구를 승강장에 열지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"여름 가짜 약 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 환자들이 후문 밀차로 흩어지는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"대합실 화물을 공개 검수하거나, 환자 줄을 군수 대기열과 분리할 수 있다."},"biography":"승강장 습기로 환자 인파를 가늠하고, 군수 화차를 의무호송 앞으로 끌어오라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 가짜 약 소문이 뜨면 방송을 직접 잡는다.\n\n- 생업: 대합실 의무 대기표·약재 하역 순서 게시\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 응급처치원\n- 직함: 청량리역 대합실 거점장\n**생애.** 2094-12-30에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 청량리역 대합실 거점장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 대합실 의무 대기표·약재 하역 순서 게시 창구가 판한들의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 청량리 대합실 응급처치원. 대합실 의무 대기표와 약재 하역 순서를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의무호송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.\n\n**관계.** 남호성의 호송 정차를 승강장에서 받고, 동주하의 시장 하역과 줄을 나눈다. 장세화의 의료호송 시각을 칠판 맨 위에 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 청량리 대합실을 약재 경매·진료·호송이 한 지붕에서 서명되는 동부 의료 창구로 남겨 비공개 선매 창구를 승강장에 열지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 여름 가짜 약 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 환자들이 후문 밀차로 흩어지는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 대합실 화물을 공개 검수하거나, 환자 줄을 군수 대기열과 분리할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 30 | 무력 −55 | 물질 −20 | 공동 25 | 원칙 50 | 공개 30 | 자격 20 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 15 | 위험 20 | 과시 5 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"판한들","type":"계약","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 호송 정차를 승강장에서 받고"},{"from":"판한들","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"동주하의 시장 하역과 줄을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"천다올","type":"계약","to":"판한들","basis":"판한들의 대합실 정차와 시각을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0337', 'cc9c-c601-c591', '{"id":"person-0337","name":"Cheon Daol","title":"Medical Escort Base Duty Chief, Nam Hoseong''s Working-Level Aide","position":"Medical Escort Duty Relief Worker","characterId":"K336","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-cheon-daol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0337","birthDate":"2095-06-03","birthday":"06-03","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"pump-shaft-replacement","name":"Pump shaft replacement","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Separates care from weapons","description":"Replacing one worn shaft restarted a pump; dispatch checks accompany transport duty. The repair does not become medical escort combat experience.","behavior":"She kept in the field a superior''s silence that never announced convoy routes. She burned any note that told her to bring armed guards into the care cars.","stress":"Fear. That a convoy out of the base would be stopped on the Guui bridge and the patient cars stamped munitions cars.","relationship":"Relations. Held the release duty under Nam Hoseong''s command and confirmed Go Seojun''s bridge passage permit before release. Matched hours with Pan Handeul''s concourse stops.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medical Escort Duty Relief Worker. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the convoy pass. Keeps armed guards separate from the treatment car key.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medical Escort Duty Relief Worker. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the convoy pass. Keeps armed guards separate from the treatment car key.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That a convoy out of the base would be stopped on the Guui bridge and the patient cars stamped munitions cars.","relationship":"Relations. Held the release duty under Nam Hoseong''s command and confirmed Go Seojun''s bridge passage permit before release. Matched hours with Pan Handeul''s concourse stops.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Replacing one worn shaft restarted a pump; dispatch checks accompany transport duty. The repair does not become medical escort combat experience.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc9c-c601-c591","name":"Yeongyang Cheon Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cc9c-c601-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":30,"Force":-80,"Material":-10,"Communal":30,"Principle":50,"Public":15,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-20,"Display":15,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Relief Worker","Title":"Medical Escort Base Duty Chief, Nam Hoseong''s Working-Level Aide","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −80 | Materialism −10 | Community 30 | Principle 50 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 25 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −20 | Display 15 | Persistence −15 | Orientation bisexual | Union polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2095-06-03. As of the 2126 opening, holds the posts of Medical Convoy Depot Shift Chief and Nam Hoseong''s working-level aide, continuing the existing duty shifts and records. The succession record for that post opened with a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The window in Cheongnyangni-dong for recording patient and medicine weights on medical convoy passes is Cheon Daol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medical Escort Duty Relief Worker. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the convoy pass. Keeps armed guards separate from the treatment car key.","Anecdote":"In 2125 took apart a pump that had stopped, ground down just one worn shaft, and ran it again. That day''s record remained as the handover basis for the next shift to verify.","Relationships":"Takes the dispatch duty under Nam Hoseong''s command, and confirms Go Seojun''s bridge passage permit before dispatch. Aligns stop times with Pan Handeul''s waiting hall stops.","Ambition":"Aims to keep the depot dispatch of the Sinnae–Jegi-dong–Achasan triangular medical convoy as working practice, ending the mistaking of medical convoys for military trains.","Fear":"Fears that a convoy leaving the depot will be stopped at the Guui bridge and its patient car stamped as a military car.","Intervention":"Can correct the misidentified signal on the depot blackboard, or reroute the convoy."},"biography":"Keeps, on the ground, the silence of a superior who does not announce the convoy route in advance. Burns a note telling the staff to let armed guards into the treatment car.\n\n- Livelihood: Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Relief Worker\n- Title: Medical Escort Base Duty Chief, Nam Hoseong''s Working-Level Aide\n**Life.** Born on 2095-06-03. As of the 2126 opening, holds the posts of Medical Convoy Depot Shift Chief and Nam Hoseong''s working-level aide, continuing the existing duty shifts and records. The succession record for that post opened with a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The window in Cheongnyangni-dong for recording patient and medicine weights on medical convoy passes is Cheon Daol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medical Escort Duty Relief Worker. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the convoy pass. Keeps armed guards separate from the treatment car key.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 took apart a pump that had stopped, ground down just one worn shaft, and ran it again. That day''s record remained as the handover basis for the next shift to verify.\n\n**Relations.** Takes the dispatch duty under Nam Hoseong''s command, and confirms Go Seojun''s bridge passage permit before dispatch. Aligns stop times with Pan Handeul''s waiting hall stops.\n\n**Ambition.** Aims to keep the depot dispatch of the Sinnae–Jegi-dong–Achasan triangular medical convoy as working practice, ending the mistaking of medical convoys for military trains.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a convoy leaving the depot will be stopped at the Guui bridge and its patient car stamped as a military car.\n\n**Intervention.** Can correct the misidentified signal on the depot blackboard, or reroute the convoy.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −80 | Material −10 | Communal 30 | Principle 50 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Longing 45 | Exclusivity −15 | Risk −20 | Display 15 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Cheon Daol","type":"Command","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Takes the dispatch duty under Nam Hoseong''s command and"},{"from":"Cheon Daol","type":"Contract","to":"Pan Handeul","basis":"Aligns stop times with Pan Handeul''s waiting hall stops"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0337","name":"천다올","title":"의무호송 기지 당직장, 남호성의 실무 담당자","position":"의무호송 당직 구호원","characterId":"K336","rank":"구호원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-천다올","detailRoute":"/people/person-0337","birthDate":"2095-06-03","birthday":"06-03","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"pump-shaft-replacement","name":"펌프 축 교체","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"치료 칸과 무장을 분리","description":"마모 축 하나를 바꿔 펌프를 재가동했고 호송 출고를 확인한다. 확인된 수리를 의료호송 전투 경력으로 바꾸지 않는다.","behavior":"호송 경로를 미리 말하지 않는 상관의 침묵을 현장에서 지킨다. 치료 칸에 무장 수비를 들이라는 쪽지를 태운다.","stress":"공포. 기지에서 나간 호송이 구의 교량에서 막혀 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 찍히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 지휘로 출고 당직을 맡고, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 출고 전에 확인한다. 판한들의 대합실 정차와 시각을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 의무호송 당직 구호원. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적는다. 무장 수비는 치료 칸 열쇠와 분리한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 의무호송 당직 구호원. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적는다. 무장 수비는 치료 칸 열쇠와 분리한다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 기지에서 나간 호송이 구의 교량에서 막혀 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 찍히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 지휘로 출고 당직을 맡고, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 출고 전에 확인한다. 판한들의 대합실 정차와 시각을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"마모 축 하나를 바꿔 펌프를 재가동했고 호송 출고를 확인한다. 확인된 수리를 의료호송 전투 경력으로 바꾸지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc9c-c601-c591","name":"영양 천씨","crest":"clan-crests/cc9c-c601-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":30,"무력":-80,"물질":-10,"공동":30,"원칙":50,"공개":15,"자격":25,"분산":10,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-15,"위험":-20,"과시":15,"지속":-15,"지향":"양성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"구호원","직함":"의무호송 기지 당직장, 남호성의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −80 | 물질 −10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −20 | 과시 15 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2095-06-03에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의무호송 기지 당직장, 남호성의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록 창구가 천다올의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 구호원. 직함은 의무호송 당직 구호원. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적는다. 무장 수비는 치료 칸 열쇠와 분리한다.","일화":"2125년 정지했던 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 갈아 다시 돌렸다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.","관계":"남호성의 지휘로 출고 당직을 맡고, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 출고 전에 확인한다. 판한들의 대합실 정차와 시각을 맞춘다.","야망":"신내·제기동·아차산 삼각 의무호송의 기지 출고를 실무로 남겨 군수 열차 오인을 끊는다.","공포":"기지에서 나간 호송이 구의 교량에서 막혀 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 찍히는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"오인 신호를 기지 칠판에서 바로잡거나, 호송을 우회시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"호송 경로를 미리 말하지 않는 상관의 침묵을 현장에서 지킨다. 치료 칸에 무장 수비를 들이라는 쪽지를 태운다.\n\n- 생업: 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 구호원\n- 직함: 의무호송 기지 당직장, 남호성의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2095-06-03에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의무호송 기지 당직장, 남호성의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록 창구가 천다올의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 구호원. 직함은 의무호송 당직 구호원. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적는다. 무장 수비는 치료 칸 열쇠와 분리한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 정지했던 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 갈아 다시 돌렸다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 남호성의 지휘로 출고 당직을 맡고, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 출고 전에 확인한다. 판한들의 대합실 정차와 시각을 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 신내·제기동·아차산 삼각 의무호송의 기지 출고를 실무로 남겨 군수 열차 오인을 끊는다.\n\n**공포.** 기지에서 나간 호송이 구의 교량에서 막혀 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 찍히는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 오인 신호를 기지 칠판에서 바로잡거나, 호송을 우회시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −80 | 물질 −10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −20 | 과시 15 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"천다올","type":"지휘","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 지휘로 출고 당직을 맡고"},{"from":"천다올","type":"계약","to":"판한들","basis":"판한들의 대합실 정차와 시각을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0338', 'b3d9-ad11-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0338","name":"Dong Juha","title":"Jegi-dong Market Scale Outpost Chief","position":"Jegi-dong Medicinal Herb Inspection First-Aid Officer","characterId":"K337","rank":"First-Aid Officer","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Medicinal Herb Origin and Drying Date Inspection","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-dong-juha","detailRoute":"/people/person-0338","birthDate":"2089-01-31","birthday":"01-31","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"herbal-cargo-inspection","name":"Herbal cargo inspection","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Refusal at the scales","description":"Reading provenance and weight supports withholding shipments pending clinical seals. Recovery of ledgers lost during closure is not established.","behavior":"He read origin inspection posts and box weights at a glance and sent away from the scales any envoy who recommended pre-buying. He remembered credit ledgers longer than faces.","stress":"Fear. That counterfeit drugs would flow, together with the scale marks, toward Bukhansan Bogukmun and the market would be sealed for a season.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Sim Dalho''s auction rules at the scales and matched Dong Neulsol''s transport weights on the same graduation. Pasted Jeon Sol''s patient allocation onto the release order.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Jegi-dong Medicinal Herb Inspection First-Aid Officer. Hangs origin and drying date on the tally post, and opens the scale for bulk dispatch only with the treatment assignment seal of the attending first-aid officer and the Corps chief.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Jegi-dong Medicinal Herb Inspection First-Aid Officer. Hangs origin and drying date on the tally post, and opens the scale for bulk dispatch only with the treatment assignment seal of the attending first-aid officer and the Corps chief.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That counterfeit drugs would flow, together with the scale marks, toward Bukhansan Bogukmun and the market would be sealed for a season.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Sim Dalho''s auction rules at the scales and matched Dong Neulsol''s transport weights on the same graduation. Pasted Jeon Sol''s patient allocation onto the release order.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Reading provenance and weight supports withholding shipments pending clinical seals. Recovery of ledgers lost during closure is not established.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11230-S13","name":{"ko":"Dongdaemun-gu District Directly Administered Land"},"holderPersonId":"K337","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S13","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1123051500","name":"Sinseol-dong"},{"id":"region:1123053300","name":"Yongdu-dong"},{"id":"region:1123054500","name":"Jegi-dong"},{"id":"region:1123056000","name":"Jeonnong 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1123057000","name":"Jeonnong 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1123060000","name":"Dapsimni 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1123061000","name":"Dapsimni 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1123065000","name":"Jangan 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1123066000","name":"Jangan 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1123070500","name":"Cheongnyangni-dong"},{"id":"region:1123071000","name":"Hoegi-dong"},{"id":"region:1123072000","name":"Hwigyeong 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1123073000","name":"Hwigyeong 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1123074000","name":"Imun 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1123075000","name":"Imun 2-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11230-S13","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11230-S13","name":"Dongdaemun-gu District","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K337","basis":"Opening administrative scale group gu:11230(district) allocation · decisive candidate selection","stateId":"S13","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1123051500","region:1123053300","region:1123054500","region:1123056000","region:1123057000","region:1123060000","region:1123061000","region:1123065000","region:1123066000","region:1123070500","region:1123071000","region:1123072000","region:1123073000","region:1123074000","region:1123075000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"The Government","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"b3d9-ad11-cc9c","name":"Gwangcheon Dong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b3d9-ad11-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":30,"Force":-45,"Material":-25,"Communal":40,"Principle":35,"Public":25,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-10,"Display":-25,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicinal Herb Origin and Drying Date Inspection","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"First-Aid Officer","Title":"Jegi-dong Market Scale Outpost Chief","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Material −25 | Communal 40 | Principle 35 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Longing 0 | Exclusivity −10 | Risk −10 | Display −25 | Persistence 20 | Orientation: Fluid | Union: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2089-01-31. As of the 2126 opening, takes up the post of Jegi-dong Market Scale Station Chief, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post opened with the public re-check of the scales.\n- The medicinal herb origin and drying date inspection desk in Jegi-dong is Dong Juha''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Jegi-dong Medicinal Herb Inspection First-Aid Officer. Hangs origin and drying date on the tally post, and opens the scale for bulk dispatch only with the treatment assignment seal of the attending first-aid officer and the Corps chief.","Anecdote":"That summer, when counterfeit medicine flowed out through the Bukhansan Boguk Gate, Yakjae-dong blockaded itself, and the advance-purchase ledger and the scale seal vanished together.","Relationships":"Enforces Sim Dalho''s auction rules at the scale, and matches Dong Neulsol''s transport weights to the same markings. Ties Jeon Sol''s patient allocations to the dispatch order.","Ambition":"Wants to keep the Jegi-dong Market auction scale as the public face of the medical command''s severity-based allocation, so that closed monopoly bidding cannot buy up the floor price.","Fear":"Fears that counterfeit medicine will flow out through the Bukhansan Boguk Gate along with the scale markings, and the market will be blockaded for a season.","Intervention":"Can recover the scale seal, or expose the hidden advance-purchase agents at the auction floor."},"biography":"Reads the origin tally post and the crate weight at a glance, and turns away emissaries urging advance purchases right at the scale. Remembers the credit ledger longer than a person''s face.\n\n- Livelihood: Medicinal Herb Origin and Drying Date Inspection\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: First-Aid Officer\n- Title: Jegi-dong Medicinal Herb Inspection First-Aid Officer\n**Life.** Born on 2089-01-31. As of the 2126 opening, takes up the post of Jegi-dong Market Scale Station Chief, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post opened with the public re-check of the scales.\n- The medicinal herb origin and drying date inspection desk in Jegi-dong is Dong Juha''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Jegi-dong Medicinal Herb Inspection First-Aid Officer. Hangs origin and drying date on the tally post, and opens the scale for bulk dispatch only with the treatment assignment seal of the attending first-aid officer and the Corps chief.\n\n**Anecdote.** That summer, when counterfeit medicine flowed out through the Bukhansan Boguk Gate, Yakjae-dong blockaded itself, and the advance-purchase ledger and the scale seal vanished together.\n\n**Relations.** Enforces Sim Dalho''s auction rules at the scale, and matches Dong Neulsol''s transport weights to the same markings. Ties Jeon Sol''s patient allocations to the dispatch order.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants to keep the Jegi-dong Market auction scale as the public face of the medical command''s severity-based allocation, so that closed monopoly bidding cannot buy up the floor price.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that counterfeit medicine will flow out through the Bukhansan Boguk Gate along with the scale markings, and the market will be blockaded for a season.\n\n**Intervention.** Can recover the scale seal, or expose the hidden advance-purchase agents at the auction floor.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Material −25 | Communal 40 | Principle 35 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Longing 0 | Exclusivity −10 | Risk −10 | Display −25 | Persistence 20 | Orientation: Fluid | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Dong Juha","type":"Command","to":"Sim Dalho","basis":"Enforces Sim Dalho''s auction rules at the scale, and"},{"from":"Dong Juha","type":"Command","to":"Dong Neulsol","basis":"Sets Dong Neulsol''s transport weights to the same scale marks"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gang Daryu","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Gang Daryu brings the origins and drying dates of the medicinal herbs he manages to Dong Juha for inspection. Dong Juha checks the dates and origins on the tally posts and verifies the treatment assignment seal, so that herbs meant for quarantined patients are not mixed into unverified bulk dispatches."},{"from":"Sin Habin","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Sin Habin hands the custody records of the medicinal herbs used in emergency care to Dong Juha and has the next supply inspected. Dong Juha checks origin and drying date and arranges the dispatch order to match the treatment assignment seal, so that care after the blackout is not cut off again by a shortage of herbs."},{"from":"An Cha-min","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"An Chamin hands the herb usage amounts and the remaining custody records to Dong Juha. Dong Juha checks origin, drying date, and the treatment assignment seal, and bridges the shortfall with verified supply in the next dispatch."},{"from":"Heo Tau","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Heo Tau hands the custody records of the herbs for quarantined patients to Dong Juha. Dong Juha checks origin, drying date, and the treatment assignment seal, and inspects the supply needed for house calls."},{"from":"An Seomin","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"An Seomin hands the herb usage amounts and the remaining custody records to Dong Juha. Dong Juha checks origin, drying date, and the treatment assignment seal, and inspects the next supply."},{"from":"Dong Neulsol","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Matches weights to Dong Juha''s market scale"},{"from":"Pan Handeul","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Shares the line with Dong Juha''s market unloading"},{"from":"Tak Eunsol","type":"Oath","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"overlapping Dong Juha''s scale seal with the testimony, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0338","name":"동주하","title":"제기동시장 저울 거점장","position":"제기동 약재 검수 응급처치원","characterId":"K337","rank":"응급처치원","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"약재 원산지·건조 일자 검수","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-동주하","detailRoute":"/people/person-0338","birthDate":"2089-01-31","birthday":"01-31","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"herbal-cargo-inspection","name":"약재 검수","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"저울 앞의 거절","description":"출처와 중량을 읽고 진료 배정 날인 전 출고를 막는다. 봉쇄 중 사라진 장부를 되찾았다는 근거는 없다.","behavior":"원산지 말목과 상자 무게를 한눈에 읽고, 선매를 권하는 사신을 저울 앞에서 돌려보낸다. 외상 장부를 사람 얼굴보다 오래 기억한다.","stress":"공포. 가짜 약이 저울 눈금과 함께 북한산보국문으로 흘러 시장이 한 계절에 봉쇄되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 심달호의 경매 규칙을 저울에서 집행하고, 동늘솔의 운송 무게를 같은 눈금에 맞춘다. 전솔의 환자 할당을 출하 순서로 붙인다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 제기동 약재 검수 응급처치원. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 저울을 연다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 제기동 약재 검수 응급처치원. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 저울을 연다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 가짜 약이 저울 눈금과 함께 북한산보국문으로 흘러 시장이 한 계절에 봉쇄되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 심달호의 경매 규칙을 저울에서 집행하고, 동늘솔의 운송 무게를 같은 눈금에 맞춘다. 전솔의 환자 할당을 출하 순서로 붙인다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"출처와 중량을 읽고 진료 배정 날인 전 출고를 막는다. 봉쇄 중 사라진 장부를 되찾았다는 근거는 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11230-S13","name":{"ko":"동대문구 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K337","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S13","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1123051500","name":"신설동"},{"id":"region:1123053300","name":"용두동"},{"id":"region:1123054500","name":"제기동"},{"id":"region:1123056000","name":"전농1동"},{"id":"region:1123057000","name":"전농2동"},{"id":"region:1123060000","name":"답십리1동"},{"id":"region:1123061000","name":"답십리2동"},{"id":"region:1123065000","name":"장안1동"},{"id":"region:1123066000","name":"장안2동"},{"id":"region:1123070500","name":"청량리동"},{"id":"region:1123071000","name":"회기동"},{"id":"region:1123072000","name":"휘경1동"},{"id":"region:1123073000","name":"휘경2동"},{"id":"region:1123074000","name":"이문1동"},{"id":"region:1123075000","name":"이문2동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11230-S13","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11230-S13","name":"동대문구","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K337","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11230(district) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S13","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1123051500","region:1123053300","region:1123054500","region:1123056000","region:1123057000","region:1123060000","region:1123061000","region:1123065000","region:1123066000","region:1123070500","region:1123071000","region:1123072000","region:1123073000","region:1123074000","region:1123075000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"정부","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"b3d9-ad11-cc9c","name":"광천 동씨","crest":"clan-crests/b3d9-ad11-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":30,"무력":-45,"물질":-25,"공동":40,"원칙":35,"공개":25,"자격":10,"분산":15,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-10,"위험":-10,"과시":-25,"지속":20,"지향":"유동","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 원산지·건조 일자 검수","소속":"정부","품계":"응급처치원","직함":"제기동시장 저울 거점장","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −25 | 공동 40 | 원칙 35 | 공개 25 | 자격 10 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2089-01-31에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 제기동시장 저울 거점장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 원산지·건조 일자 검수 창구가 동주하의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 응급처치원. 직함은 제기동 약재 검수 응급처치원. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 저울을 연다.","일화":"여름 가짜 약이 북한산보국문으로 흘러가자 약재동이 자체 봉쇄되고 선매 장부와 저울 봉인이 함께 사라졌다.","관계":"심달호의 경매 규칙을 저울에서 집행하고, 동늘솔의 운송 무게를 같은 눈금에 맞춘다. 전솔의 환자 할당을 출하 순서로 붙인다.","야망":"제기동시장 경매 저울을 의료 지휘부 중증도 배정의 얼굴로 남겨 비공개 독점 입찰이 바닥 시세를 사지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"가짜 약이 저울 눈금과 함께 북한산보국문으로 흘러 시장이 한 계절에 봉쇄되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"저울 봉인을 되찾거나, 비공개 선매 대리인을 경매장에서 공개할 수 있다."},"biography":"원산지 말목과 상자 무게를 한눈에 읽고, 선매를 권하는 사신을 저울 앞에서 돌려보낸다. 외상 장부를 사람 얼굴보다 오래 기억한다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 원산지·건조 일자 검수\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 응급처치원\n- 직함: 제기동시장 저울 거점장\n**생애.** 2089-01-31에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 제기동시장 저울 거점장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 원산지·건조 일자 검수 창구가 동주하의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 제기동 약재 검수 응급처치원. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 응급처치원와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 저울을 연다.\n\n**일화.** 여름 가짜 약이 북한산보국문으로 흘러가자 약재동이 자체 봉쇄되고 선매 장부와 저울 봉인이 함께 사라졌다.\n\n**관계.** 심달호의 경매 규칙을 저울에서 집행하고, 동늘솔의 운송 무게를 같은 눈금에 맞춘다. 전솔의 환자 할당을 출하 순서로 붙인다.\n\n**야망.** 제기동시장 경매 저울을 의료 지휘부 중증도 배정의 얼굴로 남겨 비공개 독점 입찰이 바닥 시세를 사지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 가짜 약이 저울 눈금과 함께 북한산보국문으로 흘러 시장이 한 계절에 봉쇄되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 저울 봉인을 되찾거나, 비공개 선매 대리인을 경매장에서 공개할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −25 | 공동 40 | 원칙 35 | 공개 25 | 자격 10 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"동주하","type":"지휘","to":"심달호","basis":"심달호의 경매 규칙을 저울에서 집행하고"},{"from":"동주하","type":"지휘","to":"동늘솔","basis":"동늘솔의 운송 무게를 같은 눈금에 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"강달유","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"강달유는 관리하는 약재의 출처와 건조 일자를 동주하에게 가져가 검수받는다. 동주하는 말목의 날짜와 원산지를 살피고 진료 배정 날인을 확인해, 격리 환자에게 쓸 약재가 확인되지 않은 대량 출고에 섞이지 않게 한다."},{"from":"신하빈","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"신하빈은 응급 처치에 쓴 약재의 관리 기록을 동주하에게 넘겨 다음 공급을 검수받는다. 동주하는 원산지와 건조 일자를 확인하고 진료 배정 날인에 맞춰 출하 순서를 잡아 정전 뒤의 진료가 약재 공백으로 다시 끊기지 않게 한다."},{"from":"안차민","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"안차민은 약재 사용량과 남은 관리 기록을 동주하에게 넘긴다. 동주하는 원산지·건조 일자와 진료 배정 날인을 확인해 부족한 물자를 다음 출하에서 확인된 공급으로 잇는다."},{"from":"허타우","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"허타우는 격리 환자에게 쓸 약재의 관리 기록을 동주하에게 넘긴다. 동주하는 원산지·건조 일자와 진료 배정 날인을 확인해 왕진에 필요한 공급을 검수한다."},{"from":"안서민","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"안서민은 약재 사용량과 남은 관리 기록을 동주하에게 넘긴다. 동주하는 원산지·건조 일자와 진료 배정 날인을 확인해 다음 공급을 검수한다."},{"from":"동늘솔","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"동주하의 시장 저울에 무게를 맞춘다"},{"from":"판한들","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"동주하의 시장 하역과 줄을 나눈다"},{"from":"탁은솔","type":"맹세","to":"동주하","basis":"동주하의 저울 봉인과 증언을 겹치고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0339', 'bc29-b0a8-c591-623f', '{"id":"person-0339","name":"Bang Misan","title":"Cheongnyangni First-Aid Post Outpost Chief, Eun Chaeyun''s Working-Level Aide","position":"Cheongnyangni First-Aid Officer","characterId":"K338","rank":"First-Aid Officer","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Triage Chart and First-Aid Findings Posting","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-bang-misan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0339","birthDate":"2084-01-16","birthday":"01-16","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"triage-bed-allocation","name":"Triage bed allocation","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Enemies remain patients","description":"Enemy casualties enter by severity and beds open on clinical judgment.","behavior":"She took even an enemy''s wounded in by severity alone and tore up any note that called the clinic a war-booty window. She pasted the contribution-labor table at the foot of the sickbeds.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Divided the sickbeds under Eun Chaeyun''s command and pasted Bang Hanul''s duty roster on the door. Received Baek On''s refugees in severity order.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Cheongnyangni First-Aid Officer. The severity chart and clinical findings are posted side by side, and a priority-treatment request opens a bed only after the attending first-aid officer''s clinical judgment.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Cheongnyangni First-Aid Officer. The severity chart and clinical findings are posted side by side, and a priority-treatment request opens a bed only after the attending first-aid officer''s clinical judgment.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Divided the sickbeds under Eun Chaeyun''s command and pasted Bang Hanul''s duty roster on the door. Received Baek On''s refugees in severity order.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Enemy casualties enter by severity and beds open on clinical judgment.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc29-b0a8-c591-623f","name":"Namyang Bang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc29-b0a8-c591-623f.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":40,"Force":-60,"Material":-15,"Communal":25,"Principle":40,"Public":15,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":20,"Display":-15,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Triage Chart and First-Aid Findings Posting","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"First-Aid Officer","Title":"Cheongnyangni First-Aid Post Outpost Chief, Eun Chaeyun''s Working-Level Aide","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 40 | Force −60 | Material −15 | Communal 25 | Principle 40 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly 35 | Risk 20 | Display −15 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2084-01-16. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Cheongnyangni Clinic Site Chief and Eun Chaeyun''s working-level officer, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unexcused shift absence.\n- The severity chart and clinical findings posting desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Bang Misan''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holdings, or tenure rights.","Offices":"Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Cheongnyangni First-Aid Officer. The severity chart and clinical findings are posted side by side, and a priority-treatment request opens a bed only after the attending first-aid officer''s clinical judgment.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Under Eun Chaeyun''s command the beds are divided, and Bang Hanul''s duty ledger is posted on the door. Baek On''s refugees are admitted in order of severity.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Posts the clinical findings chart at the foot of each bed.\n\n- Livelihood: Triage Chart and First-Aid Findings Posting\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: First-Aid Officer\n- Title: Cheongnyangni First-Aid Officer\n**Life.** Born on 2084-01-16. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Cheongnyangni Clinic Site Chief and Eun Chaeyun''s working-level officer, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unexcused shift absence.\n- The severity chart and clinical findings posting desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Bang Misan''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holdings, or tenure rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: First-Aid Officer. Title: Cheongnyangni First-Aid Officer. The severity chart and clinical findings are posted side by side, and a priority-treatment request opens a bed only after the attending first-aid officer''s clinical judgment.\n\n**Relations.** Under Eun Chaeyun''s command the beds are divided, and Bang Hanul''s duty ledger is posted on the door. Baek On''s refugees are admitted in order of severity.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 40 | Force −60 | Material −15 | Communal 25 | Principle 40 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 35 | Risk 20 | Display −15 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bang Misan","type":"Command","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"divides the sickbeds under Eun Chaeyun''s command, and"},{"from":"Bang Misan","type":"Contract","to":"Bang Hanul","basis":"Posts Bang Hanul''s duty ledger on the door"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bang Hanul","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Bang Misan","basis":"Shares Bang Misan''s clinic beds"},{"from":"Mae Haru","type":"Contract","to":"Bang Misan","basis":"Reviews Bang Misan''s clinic sealing cord together"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0339","name":"방미산","title":"청량리 응급 처치소 거점장, 은채윤의 실무 담당자","position":"청량리 응급처치원","characterId":"K338","rank":"응급처치원","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"중증도 표·응급 처치 소견 게시","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-방미산","detailRoute":"/people/person-0339","birthDate":"2084-01-16","birthday":"01-16","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"triage-bed-allocation","name":"중증도 병상 배정","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"적도 환자로 본다","description":"적의 부상자를 중증도로 받고 임상 판단으로 병상을 연다.","behavior":"적의 부상도 중증도만으로 들이고, 진료소를 전리품 창구로 부르라는 쪽지를 찢는다. 진료 소견 표를 침상 발치에 붙인다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 은채윤의 지휘로 병상을 나누고, 방한울의 당직 원장을 문에 붙인다. 백온의 피난민을 중증도 순으로 받는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 청량리 응급처치원. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 게시하고, 우선 치료 요청은 담당 응급처치원의 임상 판단을 거친 뒤에만 침상을 연다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 청량리 응급처치원. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 게시하고, 우선 치료 요청은 담당 응급처치원의 임상 판단을 거친 뒤에만 침상을 연다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 은채윤의 지휘로 병상을 나누고, 방한울의 당직 원장을 문에 붙인다. 백온의 피난민을 중증도 순으로 받는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"적의 부상자를 중증도로 받고 임상 판단으로 병상을 연다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc29-b0a8-c591-623f","name":"남양 방씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc29-b0a8-c591-623f.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":40,"무력":-60,"물질":-15,"공동":25,"원칙":40,"공개":15,"자격":25,"분산":20,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":35,"위험":20,"과시":-15,"지속":35,"지향":"양성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"중증도 표·응급 처치 소견 게시","소속":"정부","품계":"응급처치원","직함":"청량리 응급 처치소 거점장, 은채윤의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 40 | 무력 −60 | 물질 −15 | 공동 25 | 원칙 40 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 35 | 위험 20 | 과시 −15 | 지속 35 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2084-01-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 청량리 진료소 거점장, 은채윤의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 중증도 표·진료 소견 게시 창구가 방미산의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 응급처치원. 직함은 청량리 응급처치원. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 게시하고, 우선 치료 요청은 담당 응급처치원의 임상 판단을 거친 뒤에만 침상을 연다.","일화":"","관계":"은채윤의 지휘로 병상을 나누고, 방한울의 당직 원장을 문에 붙인다. 백온의 피난민을 중증도 순으로 받는다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"적의 부상도 중증도만으로 들이고, 진료소를 전리품 창구로 부르라는 쪽지를 찢는다. 진료 소견 표를 침상 발치에 붙인다.\n\n- 생업: 중증도 표·응급 처치 소견 게시\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 응급처치원\n- 직함: 청량리 응급 처치소 거점장, 은채윤의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2084-01-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 청량리 진료소 거점장, 은채윤의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 중증도 표·진료 소견 게시 창구가 방미산의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 응급처치원. 직함은 청량리 응급처치원. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 게시하고, 우선 치료 요청은 담당 응급처치원의 임상 판단을 거친 뒤에만 침상을 연다.\n\n**관계.** 은채윤의 지휘로 병상을 나누고, 방한울의 당직 원장을 문에 붙인다. 백온의 피난민을 중증도 순으로 받는다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 40 | 무력 −60 | 물질 −15 | 공동 25 | 원칙 40 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 35 | 위험 20 | 과시 −15 | 지속 35 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"방미산","type":"지휘","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 지휘로 병상을 나누고"},{"from":"방미산","type":"계약","to":"방한울","basis":"방한울의 당직 원장을 문에 붙인다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"방한울","type":"스승과 제자","to":"방미산","basis":"방미산의 진료소 병상을 나눈다"},{"from":"매하루","type":"계약","to":"방미산","basis":"방미산의 진료소 봉인 끈을 함께 본다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0340', 'c218-d55c-c591', '{"id":"person-0340","name":"Su Hyoeun","title":"Medicinal Herb Drying and Refrigeration Emergency Generator Operator","position":"Medicinal Herb Storage Relief Worker","characterId":"K339","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medicinal Herb Storage Output Log and Seal","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-suhyoeun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0340","birthDate":"2090-03-18","birthday":"03-18","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"emergency-power-allocation","name":"Emergency power allocation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Reserves power for care","description":"During an outage they preserved power for drying and care and switched off auction lighting. Fuel and output records support the allocation judgment.","behavior":"Sensitive to the smell of fuel, he hated verbal power routing. He took the pressure to divert power from the dryers to the auction lighting as an insult.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Matched output to Cheon Daum''s dryers and kept Bang Misan''s clinic power on the same log. He had obeyed Ryu Eunbi''s care-supply priority but refused concealed power routing.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Storage Relief Worker. Every shift he sealed the fuel remainder and output logs and sent them to Cheon Daum, and below minimum output he cut the auction power even under the merchants'' urging.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Storage Relief Worker. Every shift he sealed the fuel remainder and output logs and sent them to Cheon Daum, and below minimum output he cut the auction power even under the merchants'' urging.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Matched output to Cheon Daum''s dryers and kept Bang Misan''s clinic power on the same log. He had obeyed Ryu Eunbi''s care-supply priority but refused concealed power routing.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"During an outage they preserved power for drying and care and switched off auction lighting. Fuel and output records support the allocation judgment.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"Hanyang Su Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":25,"Force":-40,"Material":-10,"Communal":30,"Principle":50,"Public":10,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-40,"Display":10,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicinal Herb Storage Output Log and Seal","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Relief Worker","Title":"Medicinal Herb Drying and Refrigeration Emergency Generator Operator","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 25 | Force −40 | Material −10 | Communal 30 | Principle 50 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −40 | Display 10 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Bisexual | Union None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2090-03-18. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Herb Drying and Cold-Storage Emergency Generator Operations Chief, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post opened with a counterfeit-drug seal.\n- The herb storage output log and sealing desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Su Hyoeun''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holdings, or tenure rights.","Offices":"Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Storage Relief Worker. Seals the fuel remainder and output log every shift and sends it to Cheon Daum, and if output falls below the minimum, cuts auction power distribution even under pressure from other duty lines.","Anecdote":"When the blackout struck in the week the presale ledger vanished, Su Hyoeun locked the emergency generation to the drying room and the clinic and switched off the auction lighting.","Relationships":"Matches output to Cheon Daum''s dryers and records Bang Misan''s clinic power in the same log. Has obeyed Ryu Eunbi''s priority for treatment supplies but has refused concealed power distribution.","Ambition":"Intends to bind the drying room and clinic power into a single public distribution grid.","Fear":"","Intervention":"He can secure substitute fuel to open a dual distribution grid, or expose the tampering with the output logs so that the operations chief is replaced."},"biography":"Sensitive to the smell of fuel and dislikes verbal power allocation. Regards pressure to divert power to the auction lighting rather than the dryers as an insult.\n\n- Livelihood: Medicinal Herb Storage Output Log and Seal\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Relief Worker\n- Title: Medicinal Herb Drying and Refrigeration Emergency Generator Operator\n**Life.** Born on 2090-03-18. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Herb Drying and Cold-Storage Emergency Generator Operations Chief, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post opened with a counterfeit-drug seal.\n- The herb storage output log and sealing desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Su Hyoeun''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holdings, or tenure rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Storage Relief Worker. Seals the fuel remainder and output log every shift and sends it to Cheon Daum, and if output falls below the minimum, cuts auction power distribution even under pressure from other duty lines.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the blackout struck in the week the presale ledger vanished, Su Hyoeun locked the emergency generation to the drying room and the clinic and switched off the auction lighting.\n\n**Relations.** Matches output to Cheon Daum''s dryers and records Bang Misan''s clinic power in the same log. Has obeyed Ryu Eunbi''s priority for treatment supplies but has refused concealed power distribution.\n\n**Ambition.** Intends to bind the drying room and clinic power into a single public distribution grid.\n\n**Intervention.** He can secure substitute fuel to open a dual distribution grid, or expose the tampering with the output logs so that the operations chief is replaced.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 25 | Force −40 | Material −10 | Communal 30 | Principle 50 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −40 | Display 10 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Bisexual | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Su Hyoeun","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Obeys Ryu Eunbi''s priority on treatment supplies but refuses concealed distribution"},{"from":"Su Hyoeun","type":"Contract","to":"Cheon Daum","basis":"He matches output to Cheon Daum''s dryer, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Mun Dongeun","type":"Contract","to":"Su Hyoeun","basis":"Mun Dongeun informs Su Hyoeun of the herbs used in emergency care and their storage condition after the blackout. Su Hyoeun checks the fuel remainder and output log to review the supply to the drying room and clinic, and Mun Dongeun records in the management log that damaged herbs must not be mixed into later treatment."},{"from":"Jo Awon","type":"Contract","to":"Su Hyoeun","basis":"Jo Awon informs Su Hyoeun of the condition of the herbs under her care and the quantity needed during treatment. Su Hyoeun checks the drying room and clinic output logs to find where a gap in storage power led to herb damage."},{"from":"Cheon Daum","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Su Hyoeun","basis":"He matches drying power to Su Hyoeun''s emergency generation."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0340","name":"수효은","title":"약재 건조·냉장 비상발전 운전장","position":"약재 보관 구호원","characterId":"K339","rank":"구호원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"약재 보관 출력 일지·봉인","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-수효은","detailRoute":"/people/person-0340","birthDate":"2090-03-18","birthday":"03-18","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"emergency-power-allocation","name":"비상 배전","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"치료 전력을 먼저 잠근다","description":"정전 때 건조실과 진료소 전력을 남기고 경매 조명을 껐다. 연료·출력 기록과 우선 배전 판단에 근거한다.","behavior":"연료 냄새에 예민하고 구두 배전을 싫어한다. 건조기보다 경매 조명에 전력을 돌리라는 압박을 모욕으로 여긴다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 천다움의 건조기에 출력을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 전력을 같은 일지에 남긴다. 류은비의 치료 물자 우선에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 보관 구호원. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 천다움에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 외부 독촉이 있어도 경매 배전을 끊는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 보관 구호원. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 천다움에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 외부 독촉이 있어도 경매 배전을 끊는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 천다움의 건조기에 출력을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 전력을 같은 일지에 남긴다. 류은비의 치료 물자 우선에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"정전 때 건조실과 진료소 전력을 남기고 경매 조명을 껐다. 연료·출력 기록과 우선 배전 판단에 근거한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"한양 수씨","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":25,"무력":-40,"물질":-10,"공동":30,"원칙":50,"공개":10,"자격":15,"분산":25,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-10,"위험":-40,"과시":10,"지속":0,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 보관 출력 일지·봉인","소속":"정부","품계":"구호원","직함":"약재 건조·냉장 비상발전 운전장","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 25 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 10 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −40 | 과시 10 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2090-03-18에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 건조·냉장 비상발전 운전장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 약재 보관 출력 일지·봉인 창구가 수효은의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 보관 구호원. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 천다움에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 다른 당직선 독촉이 있어도 경매 배전을 끊는다.","일화":"선매 장부가 사라진 주 정전이 겹치자 수효은은 비상 발전을 건조실과 진료소에 잠그고 경매 조명을 껐다.","관계":"천다움의 건조기에 출력을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 전력을 같은 일지에 남긴다. 류은비의 치료 물자 우선에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","야망":"건조실과 진료소 전력을 하나의 공개 배전망으로 묶는다.","공포":"","개입":"대체 연료를 구해 이중 배전을 열거나, 출력 일지 조작을 밝혀 운전장을 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"연료 냄새에 예민하고 구두 배전을 싫어한다. 건조기보다 경매 조명에 전력을 돌리라는 압박을 모욕으로 여긴다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 보관 출력 일지·봉인\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 구호원\n- 직함: 약재 건조·냉장 비상발전 운전장\n**생애.** 2090-03-18에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 건조·냉장 비상발전 운전장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 약재 보관 출력 일지·봉인 창구가 수효은의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 보관 구호원. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 천다움에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 다른 당직선 독촉이 있어도 경매 배전을 끊는다.\n\n**일화.** 선매 장부가 사라진 주 정전이 겹치자 수효은은 비상 발전을 건조실과 진료소에 잠그고 경매 조명을 껐다.\n\n**관계.** 천다움의 건조기에 출력을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 전력을 같은 일지에 남긴다. 류은비의 치료 물자 우선에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.\n\n**야망.** 건조실과 진료소 전력을 하나의 공개 배전망으로 묶는다.\n\n**개입.** 대체 연료를 구해 이중 배전을 열거나, 출력 일지 조작을 밝혀 운전장을 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 25 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 10 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −40 | 과시 10 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"수효은","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비의 치료 물자 우선에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"수효은","type":"계약","to":"천다움","basis":"천다움의 건조기에 출력을 맞추고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"문동은","type":"계약","to":"수효은","basis":"문동은은 응급 처치 때 쓴 약재와 정전 뒤의 보관 상태를 수효은에게 알린다. 수효은은 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 확인해 건조실·진료소 공급을 살피고, 문동은은 손상된 약재가 다음 진료에 섞이지 않도록 관리 기록에 남긴다."},{"from":"조아원","type":"계약","to":"수효은","basis":"조아원은 관리하는 약재의 상태와 진료 중 필요한 양을 수효은에게 알린다. 수효은은 건조실·진료소 출력 일지를 확인해 보관 전력 공백이 약재 손상으로 이어진 곳을 찾는다."},{"from":"천다움","type":"스승과 제자","to":"수효은","basis":"수효은의 비상 발전에 건조 전력을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0341', 'b9e4-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0341","name":"Mae Haru","title":"Medicinal Herb Contamination Victims'' Representative","position":"Medicinal Herb Contamination First Aid Relief Worker","characterId":"K340","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medicinal Herb Contamination Dosage and Fever Record","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-maeharu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0341","birthDate":"2082-03-21","birthday":"03-21","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"affected-patient-documentation","name":"Affected patient documentation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Brings affected people to the scales","description":"They organized affected people to stop advance-purchase weighing and post dose histories and fever curves. Anger and care are present; treatment outcomes are not recorded.","behavior":"She remembered even the grains of a bitter powder and let no box with a clean package clause alone into the care cars. Mercy and anger breathed in the same rhythm.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Matched names with Chang Da-huin''s transfer victim list and watched the seal cord of Bang Misan''s clinic together. Made Ryu Eunbi''s care principles the frame of the harm ledger.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Contamination First Aid Relief Worker. Posts dosage records and fever curves at the foot of each bed, and does not open any crate with a blank origin without Ryu Eunbi''s seal.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Contamination First Aid Relief Worker. Posts dosage records and fever curves at the foot of each bed, and does not open any crate with a blank origin without Ryu Eunbi''s seal.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Matched names with Chang Da-huin''s transfer victim list and watched the seal cord of Bang Misan''s clinic together. Made Ryu Eunbi''s care principles the frame of the harm ledger.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"They organized affected people to stop advance-purchase weighing and post dose histories and fever curves. Anger and care are present; treatment outcomes are not recorded.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b9e4-cda9-c8fc","name":"Chungju Mae Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b9e4-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":35,"Force":-55,"Material":-15,"Communal":25,"Principle":45,"Public":20,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":-25,"Display":25,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicinal Herb Contamination Dosage and Fever Record","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Relief Worker","Title":"Medicinal Herb Contamination Victims'' Representative","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 35 | Force −55 | Materialism −15 | Communal 25 | Principle 45 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −25 | Display 25 | Endurance 10 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2082-03-21. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Representative of Herb-Contamination Victims, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opens with a fake-medicine seal.\n- The herb-contamination dosage and fever record desk in Jegidong is Mae Haru''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or tenure rights.","Offices":"Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Contamination First Aid Relief Worker. Posts dosage records and fever curves at the foot of each bed, and does not open any crate with a blank origin without Ryu Eunbi''s seal.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Matches names against Chang Dahin''s list of transferred victims, and examines Bang Misan''s clinic seal cord together with her. Takes Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principles as the backbone of the victim ledger.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can hand the victim ledger over to the Magok Inspection Network, or bribe an official to lift the blockade."},"biography":"Remembers even the particles of the bitter powder, and admits no crate into the treatment ward whose only clean part is its packaging statement. Mercy and anger coexist.\n\n- Livelihood: Medicinal Herb Contamination Dosage and Fever Record\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Relief Worker\n- Title: Medicinal Herb Contamination First Aid Relief Worker\n**Life.** Born 2082-03-21. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Representative of Herb-Contamination Victims, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opens with a fake-medicine seal.\n- The herb-contamination dosage and fever record desk in Jegidong is Mae Haru''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or tenure rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medicinal Herb Contamination First Aid Relief Worker. Posts dosage records and fever curves at the foot of each bed, and does not open any crate with a blank origin without Ryu Eunbi''s seal.\n\n**Relationships.** Matches names against Chang Dahin''s list of transferred victims, and examines Bang Misan''s clinic seal cord together with her. Takes Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principles as the backbone of the victim ledger.\n\n**Intervention.** Can hand the victim ledger over to the Magok Inspection Network, or bribe an official to lift the blockade.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 35 | Force −55 | Materialism −15 | Communal 25 | Principle 45 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −25 | Display 25 | Endurance 10 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Mae Haru","type":"Contract","to":"Bang Misan","basis":"Reviews Bang Misan''s clinic sealing cord together"},{"from":"Mae Haru","type":"Contract","to":"Chang Dahin","basis":"Match names against Chang Dahuin''s transfer victim list, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Chang Dahin","type":"Contract","to":"Mae Haru","basis":"Match names against Mae Haru''s Jegi-dong victim ledger"},{"from":"Mae Riul","type":"Contract","to":"Mae Haru","basis":"Hopes that Mae Haru''s list of contaminated-medicine victims will not get mixed in with the Garak crates."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0341","name":"매하루","title":"약재 오염 피해자 대표","position":"약재 오염 구호원","characterId":"K340","rank":"구호원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"약재 오염 복용·열 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-매하루","detailRoute":"/people/person-0341","birthDate":"2082-03-21","birthday":"03-21","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"affected-patient-documentation","name":"피해 환자 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"피해자를 저울 앞에 세운다","description":"피해자 줄을 세워 선매 저울을 멈추게 하고 복용 기록과 열 곡선을 붙인다. 분노와 돌봄은 있지만 치료 결과는 적혀 있지 않다.","behavior":"쓴 가루의 입자까지 기억하고, 포장 문장만 깨끗한 상자를 치료 칸에 들이지 않는다. 자비와 분노가 함께 있다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 창다흰의 이송 피해자 명단과 이름을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 봉인 끈을 함께 본다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 피해 원장의 뼈대로 삼는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 오염 구호원. 복용 기록과 열 곡선을 침상 발치에 붙이고, 원산지가 빈 상자는 류은비의 날인 없이 열지 않는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 오염 구호원. 복용 기록과 열 곡선을 침상 발치에 붙이고, 원산지가 빈 상자는 류은비의 날인 없이 열지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 창다흰의 이송 피해자 명단과 이름을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 봉인 끈을 함께 본다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 피해 원장의 뼈대로 삼는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"피해자 줄을 세워 선매 저울을 멈추게 하고 복용 기록과 열 곡선을 붙인다. 분노와 돌봄은 있지만 치료 결과는 적혀 있지 않다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b9e4-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 매씨","crest":"clan-crests/b9e4-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":35,"무력":-55,"물질":-15,"공동":25,"원칙":45,"공개":20,"자격":25,"분산":35,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":25,"위험":-25,"과시":25,"지속":10,"지향":"이성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 오염 복용·열 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"구호원","직함":"약재 오염 피해자 대표","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 35 | 무력 −55 | 물질 −15 | 공동 25 | 원칙 45 | 공개 20 | 자격 25 | 분산 35 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 25 | 위험 −25 | 과시 25 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2082-03-21에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 오염 피해자 대표 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 오염 복용·열 기록 창구가 매하루의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 오염 구호원. 복용 기록과 열 곡선을 침상 발치에 붙이고, 원산지가 빈 상자는 류은비의 날인 없이 열지 않는다.","일화":"","관계":"창다흰의 이송 피해자 명단과 이름을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 봉인 끈을 함께 본다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 피해 원장의 뼈대로 삼는다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"피해 원장을 마곡 검사망에 넘기거나, 담당자를 매수해 봉쇄를 풀 수 있다."},"biography":"쓴 가루의 입자까지 기억하고, 포장 문장만 깨끗한 상자를 치료 칸에 들이지 않는다. 자비와 분노가 함께 있다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 오염 복용·열 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 구호원\n- 직함: 약재 오염 피해자 대표\n**생애.** 2082-03-21에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 오염 피해자 대표 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 오염 복용·열 기록 창구가 매하루의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 구호원. 직함은 약재 오염 구호원. 복용 기록과 열 곡선을 침상 발치에 붙이고, 원산지가 빈 상자는 류은비의 날인 없이 열지 않는다.\n\n**관계.** 창다흰의 이송 피해자 명단과 이름을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 봉인 끈을 함께 본다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 피해 원장의 뼈대로 삼는다.\n\n**개입.** 피해 원장을 마곡 검사망에 넘기거나, 담당자를 매수해 봉쇄를 풀 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 35 | 무력 −55 | 물질 −15 | 공동 25 | 원칙 45 | 공개 20 | 자격 25 | 분산 35 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 25 | 위험 −25 | 과시 25 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"매하루","type":"계약","to":"방미산","basis":"방미산의 진료소 봉인 끈을 함께 본다"},{"from":"매하루","type":"계약","to":"창다흰","basis":"창다흰의 이송 피해자 명단과 이름을 맞추고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"창다흰","type":"계약","to":"매하루","basis":"매하루의 제기동 피해 원장과 이름을 맞춘다"},{"from":"매리울","type":"계약","to":"매하루","basis":"매하루의 오염 약 명단이 가락 상자에 섞이지 않기를 바란다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0342', 'd0c1-ad11-c0b0', '{"id":"person-0342","name":"Tak Eunsol","title":"Fake Medicine Distribution Witness","position":"Counterfeit Medicine Identification Relief Worker","characterId":"K341","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Counterfeit Medicine Distribution Time and Witness Record","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-tak-eunsol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0342","birthDate":"2090-08-29","birthday":"08-29","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"distribution-testimony-recording","name":"Distribution testimony recording","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Waits for two witnesses","description":"They notice capsule misalignment, pair time with weight, and close the stamp without enough witnesses. A sighting is not expanded into a completed investigation.","behavior":"He read the misalignment of capsule seams at a glance and sent down from the witness stand any broker who proposed changing the origin verbally. He trusted numbers but not blank clauses.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Overlaid testimony with Dong Juha''s scales seal and made Jeong Hojun''s public counterfeit-medicine screenings the standard of the witness stand. Allowed Choi Jiwoo''s exposure only after the testimony.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Counterfeit Medicine Identification Relief Worker. Records the distribution time and crate weight in the same book, and covers the stamp if there are fewer than two independent witnesses.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Counterfeit Medicine Identification Relief Worker. Records the distribution time and crate weight in the same book, and covers the stamp if there are fewer than two independent witnesses.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Overlaid testimony with Dong Juha''s scales seal and made Jeong Hojun''s public counterfeit-medicine screenings the standard of the witness stand. Allowed Choi Jiwoo''s exposure only after the testimony.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"They notice capsule misalignment, pair time with weight, and close the stamp without enough witnesses. A sighting is not expanded into a completed investigation.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d0c1-ad11-c0b0","name":"Tak Clan of Gwangsan","crest":"clan-crests/d0c1-ad11-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":35,"Force":-50,"Material":-20,"Communal":30,"Principle":30,"Public":20,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":5,"Display":25,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Counterfeit Medicine Distribution Time and Witness Record","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Relief Worker","Title":"Fake Medicine Distribution Witness","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −50 | Materialism −20 | Communal 30 | Principle 30 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 40 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 5 | Display 25 | Endurance 0 | Orientation None | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2090-08-29. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Fake-Medicine Distribution Witness, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opens with a fake-medicine seal.\n- The counterfeit-medicine distribution time and witness record desk in Jegidong is Tak Eunsol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not confirm residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or tenure rights.","Offices":"Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Counterfeit Medicine Identification Relief Worker. Records the distribution time and crate weight in the same book, and covers the stamp if there are fewer than two independent witnesses.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Overlaps their testimony with Dong Juha''s scale seal, and sets Jeong Hojun''s public counterfeit-medicine screenings as the standard of the witness stand. Permits Choe Jiu''s exposé timing only after the testimony.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can escort a second witness."},"biography":"Reads the misalignment of a capsule seam at a glance and sends down from the witness stand any broker who proposes changing the origin by word of mouth. Trusts numbers, but not sentences with blanks.\n\n- Livelihood: Counterfeit Medicine Distribution Time and Witness Record\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Relief Worker\n- Title: Fake Medicine Distribution Witness\n**Life.** Born 2090-08-29. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Fake-Medicine Distribution Witness, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opens with a fake-medicine seal.\n- The counterfeit-medicine distribution time and witness record desk in Jegidong is Tak Eunsol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not confirm residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or tenure rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Counterfeit Medicine Identification Relief Worker. Records the distribution time and crate weight in the same book, and covers the stamp if there are fewer than two independent witnesses.\n\n**Relations.** Overlaps their testimony with Dong Juha''s scale seal, and sets Jeong Hojun''s public counterfeit-medicine screenings as the standard of the witness stand. Permits Choe Jiu''s exposé timing only after the testimony.\n\n**Intervention.** Can escort a second witness.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −50 | Material −20 | Communal 30 | Principle 30 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 5 | Display 25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation None | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Tak Eunsol","type":"Oath","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"overlapping Dong Juha''s scale seal with the testimony, and"},{"from":"Tak Eunsol","type":"Oath","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Setting Jeong Hojun''s public screening of counterfeit medicines as the standard for the witness stand"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0342","name":"탁은솔","title":"가짜 약 유통 증인","position":"위조약 감별 구호원","characterId":"K341","rank":"구호원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"위조약 유통 시각·증인 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-탁은솔","detailRoute":"/people/person-0342","birthDate":"2090-08-29","birthday":"08-29","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"distribution-testimony-recording","name":"유통 증언 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"두 증인을 기다린다","description":"캡슐 어긋남을 읽고 시각과 무게를 함께 적으며 증인이 부족하면 날인을 덮는다. 보았다는 진술을 완결된 수사로 확대하지 않는다.","behavior":"캡슐 이음매의 어긋남을 한눈에 읽고, 구두로 원산지를 바꾸자는 중개인을 증인석에서 내려보낸다. 숫자는 믿되 빈칸 문장은 믿지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 동주하의 저울 봉인과 증언을 겹치고, 정호준의 위조약 공개 감별을 증인석의 기준으로 둔다. 최지우의 폭로 시점을 증언 뒤에만 허용한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 위조약 감별 구호원. 유통 시각과 상자 무게를 같은 책에 적고, 독립 증인이 둘 미만이면 도장을 덮는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 위조약 감별 구호원. 유통 시각과 상자 무게를 같은 책에 적고, 독립 증인이 둘 미만이면 도장을 덮는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 동주하의 저울 봉인과 증언을 겹치고, 정호준의 위조약 공개 감별을 증인석의 기준으로 둔다. 최지우의 폭로 시점을 증언 뒤에만 허용한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"캡슐 어긋남을 읽고 시각과 무게를 함께 적으며 증인이 부족하면 날인을 덮는다. 보았다는 진술을 완결된 수사로 확대하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d0c1-ad11-c0b0","name":"광산 탁씨","crest":"clan-crests/d0c1-ad11-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":35,"무력":-50,"물질":-20,"공동":30,"원칙":30,"공개":20,"자격":20,"분산":20,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":40,"위험":5,"과시":25,"지속":0,"지향":"무성향","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"위조약 유통 시각·증인 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"구호원","직함":"가짜 약 유통 증인","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −20 | 공동 30 | 원칙 30 | 공개 20 | 자격 20 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 40 | 위험 5 | 과시 25 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2090-08-29에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 가짜 약 유통 증인 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 위조약 유통 시각·증인 기록 창구가 탁은솔의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 구호원. 직함은 위조약 감별 구호원. 유통 시각과 상자 무게를 같은 책에 적고, 독립 증인이 둘 미만이면 도장을 덮는다.","일화":"","관계":"동주하의 저울 봉인과 증언을 겹치고, 정호준의 위조약 공개 감별을 증인석의 기준으로 둔다. 최지우의 폭로 시점을 증언 뒤에만 허용한다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":"두 번째 증인을 호송할 수 있다."},"biography":"캡슐 이음매의 어긋남을 한눈에 읽고, 구두로 원산지를 바꾸자는 중개인을 증인석에서 내려보낸다. 숫자는 믿되 빈칸 문장은 믿지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 위조약 유통 시각·증인 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 구호원\n- 직함: 가짜 약 유통 증인\n**생애.** 2090-08-29에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 가짜 약 유통 증인 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 위조약 유통 시각·증인 기록 창구가 탁은솔의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 구호원. 직함은 위조약 감별 구호원. 유통 시각과 상자 무게를 같은 책에 적고, 독립 증인이 둘 미만이면 도장을 덮는다.\n\n**관계.** 동주하의 저울 봉인과 증언을 겹치고, 정호준의 위조약 공개 감별을 증인석의 기준으로 둔다. 최지우의 폭로 시점을 증언 뒤에만 허용한다.\n\n**개입.** 두 번째 증인을 호송할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −20 | 공동 30 | 원칙 30 | 공개 20 | 자격 20 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 40 | 위험 5 | 과시 25 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"탁은솔","type":"맹세","to":"동주하","basis":"동주하의 저울 봉인과 증언을 겹치고"},{"from":"탁은솔","type":"맹세","to":"정호준","basis":"정호준의 위조약 공개 감별을 증인석의 기준으로 둔다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0343', 'bc94-ae08-c131', '{"id":"person-0343","name":"Beom Choi","title":"Medical Escort Accident Party","position":"Medical Escort Relief Worker","characterId":"K342","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-beom-choi","detailRoute":"/people/person-0343","birthDate":"2076-05-04","birthday":"05-04","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"medical-transport-handover","name":"Medical transport handover","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Keeps the patient carriage key","description":"When transport was mistaken for hostile movement, they stopped while keeping the key. Field handover and endurance under pressure do not imply a combat victory.","behavior":"She remembered the tremor of a stop on the bridge with her body and burned any note that told her to call the care cars munitions cars. Taciturn, she locked the door whenever the convoy pass came up light.","stress":"Fear. That the patient cars would be stamped hostile movement and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. She rode the car under Nam Hoseong''s convoy orders and matched the hours with Mae Seodam''s gate testimony. When Go Seojun''s bridge permit ran late, she halted the statement.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medical Escort Relief Worker. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the escort pass.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medical Escort Relief Worker. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the escort pass.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the patient cars would be stamped hostile movement and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. She rode the car under Nam Hoseong''s convoy orders and matched the hours with Mae Seodam''s gate testimony. When Go Seojun''s bridge permit ran late, she halted the statement.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"When transport was mistaken for hostile movement, they stopped while keeping the key. Field handover and endurance under pressure do not imply a combat victory.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc94-ae08-c131","name":"Geumseong Beom Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc94-ae08-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":30,"Force":-70,"Material":-30,"Communal":25,"Principle":50,"Public":15,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":35,"Display":-15,"Sustained":-20,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Relief Worker","Title":"Medical Escort Accident Party","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −70 | Material −30 | Communal 25 | Principle 50 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 35 | Display −15 | Persistence −20 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2076-05-04. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Medical Escort Incident Party, continuing the existing duty shifts and records. The succession record for that post opened with the counterfeit-drug seal.\n- The medical escort pass patient and medicine weight record desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Beom Choi''s work reference point. This work reference point does not establish residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or right of occupancy.","Offices":"Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medical Escort Relief Worker. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the escort pass.","Anecdote":"During the winter''s Black Timetable investigation, when the medical escort was mistaken for a hostile movement on the Achasan bridge, Beom Choi stopped with the treatment car key held to the chest.","Relationships":"Boarded the car under Nam Hoseong''s escort order, and aligns times with Mae Seodam''s gate testimony. Stopped giving their statement when Go Seojun''s bridge-crossing permit came late.","Ambition":"Wants to preserve the party''s statement about the escort blocked at the Guui bridge as working practice, so that mistaken fire does not happen again.","Fear":"Fears that the patient car will be marked as a hostile movement and the entire escort convoy disarmed.","Intervention":"Can correct the mistaken signal through the party''s statement, or divert the escort."},"biography":"Remembers in the body the sway of the stop on the bridge, and burns the note telling them to call the treatment car a supply car. Taciturn, but locks the door if the escort pass weight is short.\n\n- Occupation: Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Relief Worker\n- Title: Medical Escort Relief Worker\n**Life.** Born on 2076-05-04. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Medical Escort Incident Party, continuing the existing duty shifts and records. The succession record for that post opened with the counterfeit-drug seal.\n- The medical escort pass patient and medicine weight record desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Beom Choi''s work reference point. This work reference point does not establish residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or right of occupancy.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Medical Escort Relief Worker. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the escort pass.\n\n**Anecdote.** During the winter''s Black Timetable investigation, when the medical escort was mistaken for a hostile movement on the Achasan bridge, Beom Choi stopped with the treatment car key held to the chest.\n\n**Relations.** Boarded the car under Nam Hoseong''s escort order, and aligns times with Mae Seodam''s gate testimony. Stopped giving their statement when Go Seojun''s bridge-crossing permit came late.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants to preserve the party''s statement about the escort blocked at the Guui bridge as working practice, so that mistaken fire does not happen again.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that the patient car will be marked as a hostile movement and the entire escort convoy disarmed.\n\n**Intervention.** Can correct the mistaken signal through the party''s statement, or divert the escort.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −70 | Material −30 | Communal 25 | Principle 50 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 35 | Display −15 | Persistence −20 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Beom Choi","type":"Command","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Boarded the car under Nam Hoseong''s convoy order and"},{"from":"Beom Choi","type":"Contract","to":"Mae Seo-dam","basis":"Aligns times with Mae Seodam''s gate testimony"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Mae Seo-dam","type":"Oath","to":"Beom Choi","basis":"Aligns times with Beom Choi''s statement on the escort incident"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0343","name":"범초이","title":"의무호송 사고 당사자","position":"의무호송 구호원","characterId":"K342","rank":"구호원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-범초이","detailRoute":"/people/person-0343","birthDate":"2076-05-04","birthday":"05-04","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"medical-transport-handover","name":"의무호송 인계","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"환자 칸 열쇠를 지킨다","description":"적대 이동으로 오인된 호송에서 열쇠를 품고 정차했다. 현장 인계와 긴장 감내를 반영하되 교전 승리를 만들지 않는다.","behavior":"교량 위 정차의 흔들림을 몸으로 기억하고, 치료 칸을 군수 칸으로 부르라는 쪽지를 태운다. 과묵하나 호송증 무게가 비면 문을 잠근다.","stress":"공포. 환자 칸이 적대 이동으로 찍혀 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 호송 명령 아래 칸에 탔고, 매서담의 관문 증언과 시각을 맞춘다. 고서준의 교량 통과 허가가 늦자 진술을 멈췄다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 의무호송 구호원. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 구호원. 직함은 의무호송 구호원. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 환자 칸이 적대 이동으로 찍혀 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 호송 명령 아래 칸에 탔고, 매서담의 관문 증언과 시각을 맞춘다. 고서준의 교량 통과 허가가 늦자 진술을 멈췄다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"적대 이동으로 오인된 호송에서 열쇠를 품고 정차했다. 현장 인계와 긴장 감내를 반영하되 교전 승리를 만들지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc94-ae08-c131","name":"금성 범씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc94-ae08-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":30,"무력":-70,"물질":-30,"공동":25,"원칙":50,"공개":15,"자격":10,"분산":15,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":10,"위험":35,"과시":-15,"지속":-20,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"구호원","직함":"의무호송 사고 당사자","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −70 | 물질 −30 | 공동 25 | 원칙 50 | 공개 15 | 자격 10 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 10 | 위험 35 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2076-05-04에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의무호송 사고 당사자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록 창구가 범초이의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 구호원. 직함은 의무호송 구호원. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적는다.","일화":"겨울의 검은 배차표 조사 중 의무호송이 아차산 교량에서 적대 이동으로 오인되자 범초이는 치료 칸 열쇠를 품고 정차했다.","관계":"남호성의 호송 명령 아래 칸에 탔고, 매서담의 관문 증언과 시각을 맞춘다. 고서준의 교량 통과 허가가 늦자 진술을 멈췄다.","야망":"구의 교량에서 막힌 호송의 당사자 진술을 실무로 남겨 오인 발포가 다시 나지 않게 하려 한다.","공포":"환자 칸이 적대 이동으로 찍혀 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"당사자 진술로 오인 신호를 바로잡거나, 호송을 우회시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"교량 위 정차의 흔들림을 몸으로 기억하고, 치료 칸을 군수 칸으로 부르라는 쪽지를 태운다. 과묵하나 호송증 무게가 비면 문을 잠근다.\n\n- 생업: 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 구호원\n- 직함: 의무호송 사고 당사자\n**생애.** 2076-05-04에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의무호송 사고 당사자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록 창구가 범초이의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 구호원. 직함은 의무호송 구호원. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적는다.\n\n**일화.** 겨울의 검은 배차표 조사 중 의무호송이 아차산 교량에서 적대 이동으로 오인되자 범초이는 치료 칸 열쇠를 품고 정차했다.\n\n**관계.** 남호성의 호송 명령 아래 칸에 탔고, 매서담의 관문 증언과 시각을 맞춘다. 고서준의 교량 통과 허가가 늦자 진술을 멈췄다.\n\n**야망.** 구의 교량에서 막힌 호송의 당사자 진술을 실무로 남겨 오인 발포가 다시 나지 않게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 환자 칸이 적대 이동으로 찍혀 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 당사자 진술로 오인 신호를 바로잡거나, 호송을 우회시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −70 | 물질 −30 | 공동 25 | 원칙 50 | 공개 15 | 자격 10 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 10 | 위험 35 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"범초이","type":"지휘","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 호송 명령 아래 칸에 탔고"},{"from":"범초이","type":"계약","to":"매서담","basis":"매서담의 관문 증언과 시각을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"매서담","type":"맹세","to":"범초이","basis":"범초이의 호송 사고 진술과 시각을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0344', 'cc3d-cc3d-b155-660c', '{"id":"person-0344","name":"Chang Haeon","title":"Signing Clerk","position":"Clerk Relief Worker","characterId":"K343","rank":"Relief Worker","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Signature and Seal Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-chang-haeon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0344","birthDate":"2090-08-27","birthday":"08-27","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"charter-clause-comparison","name":"Signature and Seal Verification","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Signing Clerk","description":"Document comparison and preservation of wording are supported.","behavior":"Short of breath or not, she carried two copies.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Clerk Relief Worker. Writes the signing time and the Order Chief''s seal on the same line, and locks the case if the seals of the attending first-aid officer and the Order Chief are missing.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Relief Worker. Title: Clerk Relief Worker. Writes the signing time and the Order Chief''s seal on the same line, and locks the case if the seals of the attending first-aid officer and the Order Chief are missing.","stress":"","relationship":"","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Document comparison and preservation of wording are supported.","heal