uid | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2100-05-17. As of the 2126 opening, she holds the post of The Government Bridge Overseer and carries on the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification. The earlier history of how the post was filled and handed over is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The Guui 3-dong desk for pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification is An Gijun''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or rights of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Company Commander. Title: The Government Bridge Supervisor. She handles the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification, along with duty handovers, within the scope of her current post.","Anecdote":"In 2125 she stopped an armed intruder outside the door and opened a re-check of the roster. The records left from that day became the handover evidence for the next duty shift to collate.","Relationships":"She verifies Sim Gaeun''s scout reports.","Ambition":"In her post as The Government Bridge Overseer, An Gijun intends to mesh the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification with the public handover table.","Fear":"","Intervention":"She can prove the cause of the damage from the pier side. By collating An Gijun''s ledger of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification, she can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"An Gijun is The Government figure practiced in the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification. She trusts an inspection hammer more than a contract, but regards a blockade without grounds as a waste of troops. She remembers pier cracks the way one remembers people''s names.\n\n- Occupation: Pier Crack, Transit Weight Disclosure, and Double Seal Verification\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Company Commander\n- Title: The Government Bridge Supervisor\n**Life.** Born on 2100-05-17. As of the 2126 opening, she holds the post of The Government Bridge Overseer and carries on the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification. The earlier history of how the post was filled and handed over is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The Guui 3-dong desk for pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification is An Gijun''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or rights of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Company Commander. Title: The Government Bridge Supervisor. She handles the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification, along with duty handovers, within the scope of her current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 she stopped an armed intruder outside the door and opened a re-check of the roster. The records left from that day became the handover evidence for the next duty shift to collate.\n\n**Relations.** She verifies Sim Gaeun''s scout reports.\n\n**Ambition.** In her post as The Government Bridge Overseer, An Gijun intends to mesh the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification with the public handover table.\n\n**Intervention.** She can prove the cause of the damage from the pier side. By collating An Gijun''s ledger of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification, she can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 45 | Openness −25 | Force 35 | Material 15 | Communal 30 | Principle 0 | Publicity −15 | Qualification −10 | Dispersal −25 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly −35 | Risk 30 | Display −10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"An Gijun","type":"Command","to":"Go Seojun","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"Won Yena","type":"Command","to":"An Gijun","basis":"is a contract that enforces An Gijun''s bridge schedule in cargo order,"},{"from":"Dong Saebom","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"An Gijun","basis":"writes the names of An Gijun''s pier cracks in the margin of the original plate,"},{"from":"Su Ji-wan","type":"Contract","to":"An Gijun","basis":"copies An Gijun''s bridge schedule onto the platform chalkboard, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0351","name":"안기준","title":"교량 감독","position":"정부 교량 감독","characterId":"K350","rank":"중대장","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-안기준","detailRoute":"/people/person-0351","birthDate":"2100-05-17","birthday":"05-17","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":9,"effective":9}},"skills":[{"id":"bridge-inspection","name":"교량 점검","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"근거 없는 봉쇄를 싫어한다","description":"균열과 무게를 공개하며 무장 난입자를 붙들어 명부를 재점검했다. 교량 검증과 제한된 현장 제압은 보이나 대규모 전투는 없다.","behavior":"점검 해머를 계약서보다 믿지만, 근거 없는 봉쇄는 병력 낭비라고 본다. 교각 균열을 사람 이름처럼 기억한다.","stress":"공포. 균열을 숨긴 방벽이 겨울 동결에 갈라져 지상 출입구가 한꺼번에 열리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 심가은의 척후 보고를 검증한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 중대장. 직함은 정부 교량 감독. 방벽과 셔터의 균열, 동결 상태를 매일 적어 공개하고, 지상 통행은 당직 확인이 있어야 허락한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 중대장. 직함은 정부 교량 감독. 방벽과 셔터의 균열, 동결 상태를 매일 적어 공개하고, 지상 통행은 당직 확인이 있어야 허락한다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 균열을 숨긴 방벽이 겨울 동결에 갈라져 지상 출입구가 한꺼번에 열리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 심가은의 척후 보고를 검증한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"균열과 무게를 공개하며 무장 난입자를 붙들어 명부를 재점검했다. 교량 검증과 제한된 현장 제압은 보이나 대규모 전투는 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c548-c21c-d765","name":"순흥 안씨","crest":"clan-crests/c548-c21c-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":45,"개방":-25,"무력":35,"물질":15,"공동":30,"원칙":0,"공개":-15,"자격":-10,"분산":-25,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-35,"위험":30,"과시":-10,"지속":30,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인","소속":"정부","품계":"중대장","직함":"정부 교량 감독","가치관":"권위 45 | 개방 −25 | 무력 35 | 물질 15 | 공동 30 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −35 | 위험 30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 30 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2100-05-17에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 교량 감독 직무를 맡아 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 창구가 안기준의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 중대장. 직함은 정부 교량 감독. 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"2125년 무장 난입자를 문 밖에서 붙들어 명부 재점검을 열었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"심가은의 척후 보고를 검증한다.","야망":"안기준은 정부 교량 감독 직무에서 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"파손 원인을 교각 쪽에서 증명할 수 있다. 안기준의 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"안기준은 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 인물이다. 점검 해머를 계약서보다 믿지만, 근거 없는 봉쇄는 병력 낭비라고 본다. 교각 균열을 사람 이름처럼 기억한다.\n\n- 생업: 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 중대장\n- 직함: 정부 교량 감독\n**생애.** 2100-05-17에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 교량 감독 직무를 맡아 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 창구가 안기준의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 중대장. 직함은 정부 교량 감독. 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 무장 난입자를 문 밖에서 붙들어 명부 재점검을 열었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 심가은의 척후 보고를 검증한다.\n\n**야망.** 안기준은 정부 교량 감독 직무에서 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 파손 원인을 교각 쪽에서 증명할 수 있다. 안기준의 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 45 | 개방 −25 | 무력 35 | 물질 15 | 공동 30 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −35 | 위험 30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 30 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"안기준","type":"지휘","to":"고서준","basis":""}],"incoming":[{"from":"원예나","type":"지휘","to":"안기준","basis":"안기준의 교량 일정을 화물 순서로 집행하는 계약이고"},{"from":"동새봄","type":"스승과 제자","to":"안기준","basis":"안기준의 교각 균열 이름을 원판 여백에 적는다"},{"from":"수지완","type":"계약","to":"안기준","basis":"안기준의 교량 일정을 승강장 칠판에 옮기고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0352', 'd558-c9c4-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0352","name":"Ha Yunmok","title":"Gate Tax Collector","position":"Gate Tax Collector","characterId":"K351","rank":"Staff Officer","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Intake Goods and Fuel Ledger Inspection","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#person-ha-yunmok","detailRoute":"/people/person-0352","birthDate":"2099-11-21","birthday":"11-21","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"transit-tax-calculation","name":"Transit tax calculation","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Wary of blank exemptions","description":"Goods and fuel and food share one ledger; private requests go to the public desk. Ledger work does not become military authority.","behavior":"He liked numbers and stamps and remembered officers who shaved headcounts by force as an insult. He read empty exemption columns as danger signals.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Sought to put Jeong Yura''s loss-compensation clause into the tariff and linked Ra Seyoung''s quarantine stamps to the toll arithmetic.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Gate Tax Collector. Writes incoming goods and fuel and food in the same ledger and honors only travel permits bearing a duty-confirmation line.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Gate Tax Collector. Writes incoming goods and fuel and food in the same ledger and honors only travel permits bearing a duty-confirmation line.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Sought to put Jeong Yura''s loss-compensation clause into the tariff and linked Ra Seyoung''s quarantine stamps to the toll arithmetic.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Goods and fuel and food share one ledger; private requests go to the public desk. Ledger work does not become military authority.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d558-c9c4-c8fc","name":"Jinju Ha Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d558-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":45,"Openness":-10,"Force":35,"Material":5,"Communal":25,"Principle":-5,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":-20,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":0,"Display":-30,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Intake Goods and Fuel Ledger Inspection","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Staff Officer","Title":"Gate Tax Collector","Values":"Authority 45 | Openness −10 | Force 35 | Material 5 | Communal 25 | Principle −5 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 0 | Dispersal −20 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving −5 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 0 | Display −30 | Persistence −5 | Orientation None | Bonding Plural"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2099-11-21. As of the 2126 opening, he holds the post of Intake Goods Ledger Staff Officer of Guui Station and carries on the records of the intake goods and fuel ledger and travel permit inspection. The earlier history of how the post was filled and handed over is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The Guui 1-dong desk for the intake goods and fuel ledger and travel permit inspection is Ha Yunmok''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or rights of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Gate Tax Collector. He handles the records of the intake goods and fuel ledger and travel permit inspection, along with duty handovers, within the scope of his current post.","Anecdote":"In 2125 he turned away a private solicitation and sent it to the public desk. The records left from that day became the handover evidence for the next duty shift to collate.","Relationships":"He seeks to build Jeong Yura''s loss-compensation clause into the tax rate and ties Ra Seyeong''s quarantine seal to the tax calculation.","Ambition":"In his post at Guui Station''s intake goods ledger, Ha Yunmok intends to mesh the records of the intake goods and fuel ledger and travel permit inspection with the public handover table.","Fear":"","Intervention":"When an intake list and a travel permit do not match, he can identify the authentic copy. By collating Ha Yunmok''s intake goods and fuel ledger with the permit inspection ledger, he can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Ha Yunmok is a Government figure practiced in the records of the intake goods and fuel ledger and travel permit inspection. He likes numbers and seals, and treats a missing midwinter fuel entry as a warning sign. A blank permit field is also a warning sign.\n\n- Occupation: Intake Goods and Fuel Ledger Inspection\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Staff Officer\n- Title: Gate Tax Collector\n**Life.** Born on 2099-11-21. As of the 2126 opening, he holds the post of Intake Goods Ledger Staff Officer of Guui Station and carries on the records of the intake goods and fuel ledger and travel permit inspection. The earlier history of how the post was filled and handed over is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The Guui 1-dong desk for the intake goods and fuel ledger and travel permit inspection is Ha Yunmok''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, ranks, holdings, or rights of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Gate Tax Collector. He handles the records of the intake goods and fuel ledger and travel permit inspection, along with duty handovers, within the scope of his current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 he turned away a private solicitation and sent it to the public desk. The records left from that day became the handover evidence for the next duty shift to collate.\n\n**Relations.** He seeks to build Jeong Yura''s loss-compensation clause into the tax rate and ties Ra Seyeong''s quarantine seal to the tax calculation.\n\n**Ambition.** In his post at Guui Station''s intake goods ledger, Ha Yunmok intends to mesh the records of the intake goods and fuel ledger and travel permit inspection with the public handover table.\n\n**Intervention.** When an intake list and a travel permit do not match, he can identify the authentic copy. By collating Ha Yunmok''s intake goods and fuel ledger with the permit inspection ledger, he can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 45 | Openness −10 | Force 35 | Material 5 | Communal 25 | Principle −5 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 0 | Dispersal −20 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 0 | Display −30 | Persistence −5 | Orientation None | Bonding Plural\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ha Yunmok","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Yura","basis":"seeks to build the loss-compensation clause into the gate tax rate"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Cheon Choyun","type":"Command","to":"Ha Yunmok","basis":"takes orders to carry Ha Yunmok''s gate ledger only under seal,"},{"from":"Bang Ma-reum","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Ha Yunmok","basis":"is an aide who transfers Ha Yunmok''s tax calculations into the ledger"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0352","name":"하윤목","title":"관문 세리","position":"관문 세리","characterId":"K351","rank":"실무원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"반입 물자·연료 장부 검사","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-하윤목","detailRoute":"/people/person-0352","birthDate":"2099-11-21","birthday":"11-21","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"transit-tax-calculation","name":"통과세 계산","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"빈 면제 칸을 경계","description":"반입 물자와 연료·식량을 같은 장부에 적고, 사적 청탁은 공개 창구로 보낸다. 장부 실무를 군사 권한으로 바꾸지 않는다.","behavior":"숫자와 인장을 좋아하고, 무력으로 세를 깎는 장교를 모욕으로 기억한다. 빈 면제 칸을 위험 신호로 본다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 정유라의 손실보상 조항을 세율에 넣으려 하고, 라세영의 검역 도장을 세 계산에 연동한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 실무원. 직함은 관문 세리. 반입 물자와 연료·식량을 같은 장부에 적고, 통행 허가증은 당직 확인 문구가 있는 것만 인정한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 실무원. 직함은 관문 세리. 반입 물자와 연료·식량을 같은 장부에 적고, 통행 허가증은 당직 확인 문구가 있는 것만 인정한다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 정유라의 손실보상 조항을 세율에 넣으려 하고, 라세영의 검역 도장을 세 계산에 연동한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"반입 물자와 연료·식량을 같은 장부에 적고, 사적 청탁은 공개 창구로 보낸다. 장부 실무를 군사 권한으로 바꾸지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d558-c9c4-c8fc","name":"진주 하씨","crest":"clan-crests/d558-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":45,"개방":-10,"무력":35,"물질":5,"공동":25,"원칙":-5,"공개":-15,"자격":0,"분산":-20,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":-20,"위험":0,"과시":-30,"지속":-5,"지향":"무성향","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"반입 물자·연료 장부 검사","소속":"정부","품계":"실무원","직함":"관문 세리","가치관":"권위 45 | 개방 −10 | 무력 35 | 물질 5 | 공동 25 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −15 | 자격 0 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 −20 | 위험 0 | 과시 −30 | 지속 −5 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2099-11-21에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 구의역 반입 물자 장부 실무원 직무를 맡아 반입 물자·연료 장부와 통행 허가증 검사 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 장부에 보존한다.\n- 구의1동의 반입 물자·연료 장부와 통행 허가증 검사 창구가 하윤목의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 실무원. 직함은 관문 세리. 반입 물자·연료 장부와 통행 허가증 검사 기록, 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"정유라의 손실보상 조항을 세율에 넣으려 하고, 라세영의 검역 도장을 세 계산에 연동한다.","야망":"하윤목은 구의역 반입 물자 장부 직무에서 반입 물자·연료 장부와 통행 허가증 검사 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"반입 목록과 통행 허가증이 어긋나면 진본을 가려 낼 수 있다. 하윤목의 반입 물자·연료 장부와 허가증 검사 장부를 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"하윤목은 반입 물자·연료 장부와 통행 허가증 검사 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 인물이다. 숫자와 인장을 좋아하고, 한겨울 연료 반입이 한 칸 비는 것을 위험 신호로 본다. 빈 허가증 칸도 위험 신호로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 반입 물자·연료 장부 검사\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 실무원\n- 직함: 관문 세리\n**생애.** 2099-11-21에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 구의역 반입 물자 장부 실무원 직무를 맡아 반입 물자·연료 장부와 통행 허가증 검사 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 장부에 보존한다.\n- 구의1동의 반입 물자·연료 장부와 통행 허가증 검사 창구가 하윤목의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 실무원. 직함은 관문 세리. 반입 물자·연료 장부와 통행 허가증 검사 기록, 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 정유라의 손실보상 조항을 세율에 넣으려 하고, 라세영의 검역 도장을 세 계산에 연동한다.\n\n**야망.** 하윤목은 구의역 반입 물자 장부 직무에서 반입 물자·연료 장부와 통행 허가증 검사 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 반입 목록과 통행 허가증이 어긋나면 진본을 가려 낼 수 있다. 하윤목의 반입 물자·연료 장부와 허가증 검사 장부를 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 45 | 개방 −10 | 무력 35 | 물질 5 | 공동 25 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −15 | 자격 0 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 −20 | 위험 0 | 과시 −30 | 지속 −5 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"하윤목","type":"계약","to":"정유라","basis":"손실보상 조항을 관문 세율에 넣으려 함"}],"incoming":[{"from":"천초윤","type":"지휘","to":"하윤목","basis":"하윤목의 관문 원장을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"방마름","type":"스승과 제자","to":"하윤목","basis":"하윤목의 세 계산을 원장으로 옮기는 실무원이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0353', 'acfd-d604-d48d', '{"id":"person-0353","name":"Gwak Minjae","title":"Garrison Commander, Guui Station","position":"Garrison Commander for Shutter and Fuel Checks, Guui Station","characterId":"K352","rank":"Garrison Commander","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Shutter, Fuel, and Patrol Record Checks","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#person-gwak-minjae","detailRoute":"/people/person-0353","birthDate":"2068-12-02","birthday":"12-02","age":58,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"residual-pressure-calculation","name":"Shutter and fuel record checking","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Garrison Commander, Guui Station","description":"Station management and technical judgment are clear strengths.","behavior":"He loved procedure and read the mountain militia''s speed as a cause of accidents.","stress":"Fear. That the entrances would be opened and closed alone without duty confirmation and the winter fuel records would break off.","relationship":"Relations. Contested authority with Go Seojun.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Garrison Commander. Title: Garrison Commander for Shutter and Fuel Checks, Guui Station. Posts the shutter condition and fuel stock on the board and blocks solitary opening and closing of the entrances through the duty-confirmation procedure. Allows patrol changes only after records are checked.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Garrison Commander. Title: Garrison Commander for Shutter and Fuel Checks, Guui Station. Posts the shutter condition and fuel stock on the board and blocks solitary opening and closing of the entrances through the duty-confirmation procedure. Allows patrol changes only after records are checked.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the entrances would be opened and closed alone without duty confirmation and the winter fuel records would break off.","relationship":"Relations. Contested authority with Go Seojun.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Station management and technical judgment are clear strengths.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"acfd-d604-d48d","name":"Hyeonpung Gwak Clan","crest":"clan-crests/acfd-d604-d48d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":35,"Openness":-15,"Force":35,"Material":10,"Communal":30,"Principle":5,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":-30,"Display":-30,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Shutter, Fuel, and Patrol Record Checks","Affiliation":"Guui Garrison","Rank":"Garrison Commander","Title":"Garrison Commander for Shutter and Fuel Checks, Guui Station","Values":"Authority 35 | Openness −15 | Force 35 | Material 10 | Community 30 | Principle 5 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −25 | Change −20","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly 40 | Risk −30 | Display −30 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2068-12-02. As of the opening of 2126, he holds the post of Garrison Commander of Guui Station and carries on the records of shutter, fuel, and patrol record checks. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The desk for shutter, fuel, and patrol record checks in Guui 3-dong is Gwak Minjae''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, domain, or right of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Garrison Commander. Title: Garrison Commander for Shutter and Fuel Checks, Guui Station. Handles the checks of shutter, fuel, and patrol records and the handover of watches within the scope of his current duties.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"He contends with Go Seojun over authority.","Ambition":"In his post as Garrison Commander of Guui Station, Gwak Minjae seeks to make the records of shutter, fuel, and patrol checks mesh with the public handover table.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Using the fuel records, he can establish whether shutter damage came from ice or from an outside strike, or refuse to hand over the entrance keys without duty confirmation. By cross-checking Gwak Minjae''s ledger of shutter, fuel, and patrol records, he can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Gwak Minjae is a Guui Station garrison figure practiced in checking shutter, fuel, and patrol records. He loves procedure and sees hasty entrance openings as a cause of accidents. He does not accept orders without a fuel figure.\n\n- Livelihood: Shutter, Fuel, and Patrol Record Checks\n- Affiliation: Guui Garrison\n- Rank: Garrison Commander\n- Title: Garrison Commander, Guui Station\n**Life.** Born on 2068-12-02. As of the opening of 2126, he holds the post of Garrison Commander of Guui Station and carries on the records of shutter, fuel, and patrol record checks. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The desk for shutter, fuel, and patrol record checks in Guui 3-dong is Gwak Minjae''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, domain, or right of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Garrison Commander. Title: Garrison Commander for Shutter and Fuel Checks, Guui Station. Handles the checks of shutter, fuel, and patrol records and the handover of watches within the scope of his current duties.\n\n**Relationships.** He contends with Go Seojun over authority.\n\n**Ambition.** In his post as Garrison Commander of Guui Station, Gwak Minjae seeks to make the records of shutter, fuel, and patrol checks mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Intervention.** Using the fuel records, he can establish whether shutter damage came from ice or from an outside strike, or refuse to hand over the entrance keys without duty confirmation. By cross-checking Gwak Minjae''s ledger of shutter, fuel, and patrol records, he can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 35 | Openness −15 | Force 35 | Material 10 | Community 30 | Principle 5 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −25 | Change −20\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly 40 | Risk −30 | Display −30 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gwak Minjae","type":"Rivalry","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Contests authority over Guui Station''s tunnel patrol roster and closure decisions"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Seon Soru","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Gwak Minjae","basis":""},{"from":"Beom Han-deul","type":"Oath","to":"Gwak Minjae","basis":"backs Gwak Minjae''s shutter and fuel inspection with the stock table from the witness stand, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0353","name":"곽민재","title":"구의역 수비대장","position":"구의역 수비대 셔터·연료 점검 수비대장","characterId":"K352","rank":"수비대장","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"셔터·연료·순찰 기록 점검","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-곽민재","detailRoute":"/people/person-0353","birthDate":"2068-12-02","birthday":"12-02","age":58,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"residual-pressure-calculation","name":"셔터·연료 기록 점검","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"구의역 수비대장","description":"역 운영과 기술 판단이 명확한 강점이다.","behavior":"절차를 사랑하고 산악 민병의 속도를 사고 원인으로 본다.","stress":"공포. 출입구 개폐가 당직 확인 없이 단독으로 이루어져 겨울 연료 기록이 끊기는 것.","relationship":"관계. 고서준과 권한을 다툰다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수비대장. 직함은 구의역 수비대장. 셔터 상태와 연료 재고를 게시판에 붙이고, 출입구의 단독 개폐는 당직 확인 절차로 막는다. 순찰 변경은 기록을 확인한 뒤에만 허락한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수비대장. 직함은 구의역 수비대장. 셔터 상태와 연료 재고를 게시판에 붙이고, 출입구의 단독 개폐는 당직 확인 절차로 막는다. 순찰 변경은 기록을 확인한 뒤에만 허락한다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 출입구 개폐가 당직 확인 없이 단독으로 이루어져 겨울 연료 기록이 끊기는 것.","relationship":"관계. 고서준과 권한을 다툰다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"역 운영과 기술 판단이 명확한 강점이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"acfd-d604-d48d","name":"현풍 곽씨","crest":"clan-crests/acfd-d604-d48d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":35,"개방":-15,"무력":35,"물질":10,"공동":30,"원칙":5,"공개":-15,"자격":10,"분산":-25,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":40,"위험":-30,"과시":-30,"지속":35,"지향":"이성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"셔터·연료·순찰 기록 점검","소속":"구의수비대","품계":"수비대장","직함":"구의역 수비대장","가치관":"권위 35 | 개방 −15 | 무력 35 | 물질 10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 40 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −30 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2068-12-02에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 구의역 수비대장 직무를 맡아 셔터·연료·순찰 기록 점검 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 장부에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 셔터·연료·순찰 기록 점검 창구가 곽민재의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수비대장. 직함은 구의역 수비대장. 셔터·연료·순찰 기록 점검과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"","관계":"고서준과 권한을 다툰다.","야망":"곽민재는 구의역 수비대장 직무에서 셔터·연료·순찰 기록 점검 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"연료 기록으로 셔터 파손이 얼음 때문인지 외부 타격인지 밝히거나, 출입구 열쇠를 당직 확인 없이는 넘기지 않는다. 곽민재의 셔터·연료·순찰 기록 장부를 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"곽민재는 셔터·연료·순찰 기록 점검을 손에 익힌 구의역 수비 인물이다. 절차를 사랑하고 서두른 출입구 개방을 사고의 원인으로 본다. 연료 숫자 없는 명령을 받지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 셔터·연료·순찰 기록 점검\n- 소속: 구의수비대\n- 품계: 수비대장\n- 직함: 구의역 수비대장\n**생애.** 2068-12-02에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 구의역 수비대장 직무를 맡아 셔터·연료·순찰 기록 점검 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 장부에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 셔터·연료·순찰 기록 점검 창구가 곽민재의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수비대장. 직함은 구의역 수비대장. 셔터·연료·순찰 기록 점검과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**관계.** 고서준과 권한을 다툰다.\n\n**야망.** 곽민재는 구의역 수비대장 직무에서 셔터·연료·순찰 기록 점검 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 연료 기록으로 셔터 파손이 얼음 때문인지 외부 타격인지 밝히거나, 출입구 열쇠를 당직 확인 없이는 넘기지 않는다. 곽민재의 셔터·연료·순찰 기록 장부를 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 35 | 개방 −15 | 무력 35 | 물질 10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 40 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −30 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"곽민재","type":"경쟁","to":"고서준","basis":"구의역 터널 순찰 편성과 폐쇄 판단의 권한을 다툼"}],"incoming":[{"from":"선솔우","type":"스승과 제자","to":"곽민재","basis":""},{"from":"범한들","type":"맹세","to":"곽민재","basis":"곽민재의 셔터·연료 점검을 증인석에서 재고표로 받치고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0354', 'c2ec-ccad-c1a1', '{"id":"person-0354","name":"Sim Gaeun","title":"Bridge Scout Captain","position":"The Government Bridge Scout Captain","characterId":"K353","rank":"Sergeant","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Sighting and Inference Distinction Record and Wisi Sighting Report","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#person-sim-gaeun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0354","birthDate":"2081-09-16","birthday":"09-16","age":45,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"scout-reporting","name":"Scout reporting","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Fast reports and interpretive tension","description":"A poacher was caught and passwords changed; reports separate observation and inference. A habit of adding interpretation coexists with fear of mistaken reporting.","behavior":"She wrote reports fast but had a habit of adding interpretation. She sought to repay Go Seojun''s trust.","stress":"Fear. That one mistaken report would spread into an eastern-bridge war and she would become its object of grudges.","relationship":"Relations. Reported directly to Go Seojun, obstructed An Giun''s bridge schedule, and exchanged transfer information with Jang Sehwa.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Sergeant. Title: The Government Bridge Scout Captain. She had sightings and conjectures written in different inks, but in a crisis she erased the conjecture column and raised sightings only.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Sergeant. Title: The Government Bridge Scout Captain. She had sightings and conjectures written in different inks, but in a crisis she erased the conjecture column and raised sightings only.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That one mistaken report would spread into an eastern-bridge war and she would become its object of grudges.","relationship":"Relations. Reported directly to Go Seojun, obstructed An Giun''s bridge schedule, and exchanged transfer information with Jang Sehwa.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"A poacher was caught and passwords changed; reports separate observation and inference. A habit of adding interpretation coexists with fear of mistaken reporting.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c2ec-ccad-c1a1","name":"Cheongsong Sim Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c2ec-ccad-c1a1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-5,"Force":30,"Material":0,"Communal":15,"Principle":0,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":-15,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":20,"Display":-15,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Sighting and Inference Distinction Record and Wisi Sighting Report","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Sergeant","Title":"The Government Bridge Scout Captain","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness −5 | Force 30 | Material 0 | Community 15 | Principle 0 | Publicity −15 | Qualification −15 | Decentralization −25 | Change −10","Desires":"Craving 40 | Monopoly −15 | Risk 20 | Display −15 | Persistence 20 | Orientation: Fluid | Union: Contractual cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2081-09-16. As of the opening of 2126, holds the post of The Government Bridge Scout Captain and carries on the records of sighting/inference distinction and Wisi sighting reports. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The window for sighting/inference distinction records and Wisi sighting reports in Guui 3-dong is Sim Gaeun''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, domain, or right of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Sergeant. Title: The Government Bridge Scout Captain. Handles the records of sighting/inference distinction and Wisi sighting reports, and the handover of watches, within the scope of current duties.","Anecdote":"In 2125, caught an unauthorized night crosser and changed the guard cipher tags. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next watch to cross-check.","Relationships":"Reports directly to Go Seojun, obstructs An Gijun''s bridge schedule, and trades transfer information with Jang Sehwa.","Ambition":"In the post of The Government Bridge Scout Captain, Sim Gaeun seeks to make the records of sighting/inference distinction and Wisi sighting reports mesh with the public handover table.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can make the original of the inference column public, or cover up a misreport and accelerate one side''s expansion of command. By cross-checking Sim Gaeun''s ledger of sighting/inference distinction records and Wisi sighting reports, can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Sim Gaeun is The Government figure practiced in keeping records that separate sightings from assumptions, and in Wish sighting reports. Sim Gaeun writes reports quickly but has a habit of adding interpretation. Sim Gaeun wants to repay Go Seojun''s good faith.\n\n- Livelihood: Sighting and Inference Distinction Record and Wisi Sighting Report\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Sergeant\n- Title: The Government Bridge Scout Captain\n**Life.** Born on 2081-09-16. As of the opening of 2126, holds the post of The Government Bridge Scout Captain and carries on the records of sighting/inference distinction and Wisi sighting reports. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The window for sighting/inference distinction records and Wisi sighting reports in Guui 3-dong is Sim Gaeun''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, domain, or right of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Sergeant. Title: The Government Bridge Scout Captain. Handles the records of sighting/inference distinction and Wisi sighting reports, and the handover of watches, within the scope of current duties.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, caught an unauthorized night crosser and changed the guard cipher tags. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next watch to cross-check.\n\n**Relations.** Reports directly to Go Seojun, obstructs An Gijun''s bridge schedule, and trades transfer information with Jang Sehwa.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of The Government Bridge Scout Captain, Sim Gaeun seeks to make the records of sighting/inference distinction and Wisi sighting reports mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Intervention.** Can make the original of the inference column public, or cover up a misreport and accelerate one side''s expansion of command. By cross-checking Sim Gaeun''s ledger of sighting/inference distinction records and Wisi sighting reports, can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness −5 | Force 30 | Materialism 0 | Communal 15 | Principle 0 | Transparency −15 | Credentials −15 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk 20 | Display −15 | Endurance 20 | Orientation: Fluid | Union: Contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sim Gaeun","type":"Command","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Reports bridge scouting directly to the captain"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Dong Saebom","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Sim Gaeun","basis":"is a mentor–protégé pair who translate Sim Gaeun''s scout reports into coordinates, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0354","name":"심가은","title":"교량 척후대장","position":"정부 교량 척후대장","characterId":"K353","rank":"병장","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-심가은","detailRoute":"/people/person-0354","birthDate":"2081-09-16","birthday":"09-16","age":45,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"scout-reporting","name":"척후 보고","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"빠른 보고와 해석의 긴장","description":"도꾼을 붙잡아 암호패를 갈았고 목격·추정 구분을 지시한다. 해석을 보태는 버릇과 오인 보고 공포를 함께 남긴다.","behavior":"보고를 빨리 쓰지만 해석을 보태는 버릇이 있다. 고서준의 신의에 보답하려 한다.","stress":"공포. 오인 보고 한 장이 동부 교량 전쟁으로 번져 자신이 원한의 대상이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 고서준에게 직보하고, 안기준의 교량 일정을 방해하며, 장세화의 환승 정보를 맞교환한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 교량 척후대장. 목격과 추정을 다른 색 먹으로 적게 하지만, 위기 때는 추정 칸을 지우고 목격만 올린다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 교량 척후대장. 목격과 추정을 다른 색 먹으로 적게 하지만, 위기 때는 추정 칸을 지우고 목격만 올린다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 오인 보고 한 장이 동부 교량 전쟁으로 번져 자신이 원한의 대상이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 고서준에게 직보하고, 안기준의 교량 일정을 방해하며, 장세화의 환승 정보를 맞교환한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"도꾼을 붙잡아 암호패를 갈았고 목격·추정 구분을 지시한다. 해석을 보태는 버릇과 오인 보고 공포를 함께 남긴다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c2ec-ccad-c1a1","name":"청송 심씨","crest":"clan-crests/c2ec-ccad-c1a1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":-5,"무력":30,"물질":0,"공동":15,"원칙":0,"공개":-15,"자격":-15,"분산":-25,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-15,"위험":20,"과시":-15,"지속":20,"지향":"유동","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고","소속":"정부","품계":"병장","직함":"정부 교량 척후대장","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 −5 | 무력 30 | 물질 0 | 공동 15 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −15 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 20 | 과시 −15 | 지속 20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2081-09-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 교량 척후대장 직무를 맡아 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 창구가 심가은의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 병장. 직함은 정부 교량 척후대장. 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"2125년 야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡아 경비 암호패를 갈았다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"고서준에게 직보하고, 안기준의 교량 일정을 방해하며, 장세화의 환승 정보를 맞교환한다.","야망":"심가은은 정부 교량 척후대장 직무에서 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"추정 칸의 원본을 공개하거나, 오인 보고를 덮어 일방의 지휘권 확대를 가속할 수 있다. 심가은의 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"심가은은 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 인물이다. 보고를 빨리 쓰지만 해석을 보태는 버릇이 있다. 고서준의 신의에 보답하려 한다.\n\n- 생업: 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 병장\n- 직함: 정부 교량 척후대장\n**생애.** 2081-09-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 교량 척후대장 직무를 맡아 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 창구가 심가은의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 교량 척후대장. 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡아 경비 암호패를 갈았다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 고서준에게 직보하고, 안기준의 교량 일정을 방해하며, 장세화의 환승 정보를 맞교환한다.\n\n**야망.** 심가은은 정부 교량 척후대장 직무에서 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 추정 칸의 원본을 공개하거나, 오인 보고를 덮어 일방의 지휘권 확대를 가속할 수 있다. 심가은의 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 −5 | 무력 30 | 물질 0 | 공동 15 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −15 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 20 | 과시 −15 | 지속 20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"심가은","type":"지휘","to":"고서준","basis":"교량 척후를 대장에게 직보"}],"incoming":[{"from":"동새봄","type":"스승과 제자","to":"심가은","basis":"심가은의 척후 보고를 좌표로 번역하는 스승과 제자이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0355', 'c120-bcf4-c131', '{"id":"person-0355","name":"Seon Soru","title":"Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide","position":"Guui Garrison Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide","characterId":"K354","rank":"Garrison Soldier","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Pump Room Wear Chart and Maintenance Key Management","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#inmul-seonsolu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0355","birthDate":"2078-04-11","birthday":"04-11","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"pump-wear-inspection","name":"Pump wear inspection","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide","description":"Title: Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide.","behavior":"He read impeller-tooth wear with his fingers. He knew the pier''s metal sound by heart as a packing-replacement order.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. When Go Seojun''s gate repairs borrowed the pump-room key, he left a blank in the wear table.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: Garrison Soldier. Title: Guui Garrison Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide. He hangs the wear chart and lubrication dates on the wall.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: Garrison Soldier. Title: Guui Garrison Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide. He hangs the wear chart and lubrication dates on the wall.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. When Go Seojun''s gate repairs borrowed the pump-room key, he left a blank in the wear table.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c120-bcf4-c131","name":"Seon Clan of Boseong","crest":"clan-crests/c120-bcf4-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":45,"Openness":-20,"Force":45,"Material":10,"Communal":15,"Principle":0,"Public":-5,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-15,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":25,"Display":-20,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Pump Room Wear Chart and Maintenance Key Management","Affiliation":"Guui Garrison","Rank":"Garrison Soldier","Title":"Guui Garrison Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide","Values":"Authority 45 | Openness −20 | Force 45 | Materialism 10 | Communal 15 | Principle 0 | Transparency −5 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −15 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk 25 | Display −20 | Endurance 25 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2078-04-11. As of the 2126 opening, Seon Solu holds the post of Guui Garrison''s Guui Pump Room Mechanic and Gwak Minjae''s Working-Level Aide and continues the records of pump-room wear charts and maintenance key management. The prior selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The pump-room wear chart and maintenance key management desk in Guui 3-dong is Seon Solu''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, domain, or occupancy rights.","Offices":"Rank: Garrison Soldier. Title: Guui Garrison Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide. Handles the pump-room wear chart and maintenance key management records and watch handovers within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"When Go Seojun''s gate repairs borrow the pump room key, leaves a blank on the wear chart.","Ambition":"In the post of Guui Garrison''s Guui Pump Room Mechanic and Gwak Minjae''s Working-Level Aide, Seon Solu aims to make the pump-room wear chart and maintenance key management records mesh with the public handover table.","Fear":"","Intervention":"By cross-checking Seon Solu''s ledger of pump-room wear charts and maintenance key management, can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Seon Solu is a Guui Garrison figure practiced in keeping pump-room wear charts and managing maintenance keys. Seon Solu reads the wear on impeller teeth by finger, and never hangs a verbally ordered opening or closing on the key peg. Memorizes the metallic sounds of the bridge piers as the packing replacement sequence.\n\n- Occupation: Pump Room Wear Chart and Maintenance Key Management\n- Affiliation: Guui Garrison\n- Rank: Garrison Soldier\n- Title: Guui Garrison Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide\n**Life.** Born on 2078-04-11. As of the 2126 opening, Seon Solu holds the post of Guui Garrison''s Guui Pump Room Mechanic and Gwak Minjae''s Working-Level Aide and continues the records of pump-room wear charts and maintenance key management. The prior selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The pump-room wear chart and maintenance key management desk in Guui 3-dong is Seon Solu''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, domain, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Garrison Soldier. Title: Guui Garrison Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide. Handles the pump-room wear chart and maintenance key management records and watch handovers within the scope of the current post.\n\n**Relations.** When Go Seojun''s gate repairs borrow the pump room key, leaves a blank on the wear chart.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of Guui Garrison''s Guui Pump Room Mechanic and Gwak Minjae''s Working-Level Aide, Seon Solu aims to make the pump-room wear chart and maintenance key management records mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Intervention.** By cross-checking Seon Solu''s ledger of pump-room wear charts and maintenance key management, can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 45 | Openness −20 | Force 45 | Materialism 10 | Communal 15 | Principle 0 | Transparency −5 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −15 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk 25 | Display −20 | Endurance 25 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seon Soru","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Gwak Minjae","basis":""},{"from":"Seon Soru","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Hayul","basis":"Adjusts opening and closing times to fit Mun Hayul''s ridge surveillance schedule"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Pan Cho-dam","type":"Contract","to":"Seon Soru","basis":"matches output to Seon Solu''s pump, and"},{"from":"Tak Yun-jae","type":"Contract","to":"Seon Soru","basis":""}]}}', '{"id":"person-0355","name":"선솔우","title":"구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자","position":"구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K354","rank":"수비대원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-선솔우","detailRoute":"/people/person-0355","birthDate":"2078-04-11","birthday":"04-11","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContact