nt experience alone does not establish injury status.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d0c1-ad11-c0b0","name":"Tak Clan of Gwangsan","crest":"clan-crests/d0c1-ad11-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":50,"Openness":-25,"Force":35,"Material":5,"Communal":25,"Principle":5,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":-5,"Dispersed":-15,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":20,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":20,"Display":-25,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Logging Collision Times","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Staff Officer","Title":"Party to the Bridge Passage Accident","Values":"Authority 50 | Openness −25 | Force 35 | Material 5 | Communal 25 | Principle 5 | Publicity −10 | Qualification −5 | Dispersion −15 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 20 | Monopoly 30 | Risk 20 | Display −25 | Persistence −5 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2065-05-03. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Bridge Passage Accident Party, continuing the log records of collision times. The prior selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The collision time log-recording counter in Guui 3-dong is Tak Yunjae''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Party to the Bridge Passage Accident. Handles the log records of collision times, as well as duty handovers, within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Keeps the fuel-accident line from overlapping with the stretcher line of Yeong Han-moe''s emergency waiting post.","Ambition":"In the post of Bridge Passage Accident Party, Tak Yunjae seeks to make the log records of collision times mesh with the public handover table.","Fear":"","Intervention":"By cross-checking Tak Yunjae''s ledger of collision-time log records, she can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Tak Yun-jae is a government station-office working figure at Guui Station, practiced in keeping logs of burst times and remaining fuel. Her words are short and her footsteps exact.\n\n- Livelihood: Logging Collision Times\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Staff Officer\n- Title: Party to the Bridge Passage Accident\n**Life.** Born on 2065-05-03. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Bridge Passage Accident Party, continuing the log records of collision times. The prior selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The collision time log-recording counter in Guui 3-dong is Tak Yunjae''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Party to the Bridge Passage Accident. Handles the log records of collision times, as well as duty handovers, within the scope of the current post.\n\n**Relations.** Keeps the fuel-accident line from overlapping with the stretcher line of Yeong Han-moe''s emergency waiting post.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of Bridge Passage Accident Party, Tak Yunjae seeks to make the log records of collision times mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Intervention.** By cross-checking Tak Yunjae''s ledger of collision-time log records, she can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 50 | Openness −25 | Force 35 | Material 5 | Communal 25 | Principle 5 | Publicity −10 | Qualification −5 | Dispersion −15 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 20 | Monopoly 30 | Risk 20 | Display −25 | Persistence −5 | Orientation: bisexual | Union: polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Tak Yun-jae","type":"Contract","to":"Seon Soru","basis":""},{"from":"Tak Yun-jae","type":"Contract","to":"Yeong Han-moe","basis":"Divides Yeong Han-moe''s aid station stretchers and the casualty queue"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0368","name":"탁윤재","title":"교량 통행 사고 당사자","position":"교량 통행 사고 당사자","characterId":"K367","rank":"실무원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"충돌 시각 일지 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-탁윤재","detailRoute":"/people/person-0368","birthDate":"2065-05-03","birthday":"05-03","age":61,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"accident-log-reconciliation","name":"사고 일지 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"교량 통행 사고 당사자","description":"사고 경험만으로 손상 상태를 추정하지 않는다.","behavior":"말은 짧고 발자국은 정확하다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 영한뫼의 응급 대기소 들것 줄과 연료 사고 줄이 겹치지 않게 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 실무원. 직함은 교량 통행 사고 당사자. 충돌 시각을 일지에 적는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 실무원. 직함은 교량 통행 사고 당사자. 충돌 시각을 일지에 적는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 영한뫼의 응급 대기소 들것 줄과 연료 사고 줄이 겹치지 않게 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"사고 경험만으로 손상 상태를 추정하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d0c1-ad11-c0b0","name":"광산 탁씨","crest":"clan-crests/d0c1-ad11-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":50,"개방":-25,"무력":35,"물질":5,"공동":25,"원칙":5,"공개":-10,"자격":-5,"분산":-15,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":20,"독점":30,"위험":20,"과시":-25,"지속":-5,"지향":"양성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"충돌 시각 일지 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"실무원","직함":"교량 통행 사고 당사자","가치관":"권위 50 | 개방 −25 | 무력 35 | 물질 5 | 공동 25 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −10 | 자격 −5 | 분산 −15 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 20 | 독점 30 | 위험 20 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −5 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2065-05-03에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 교량 통행 사고 당사자 직무를 맡아 충돌 시각 일지 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 충돌 시각 일지 기록 창구가 탁윤재의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 실무원. 직함은 교량 통행 사고 당사자. 충돌 시각 일지 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"","관계":"영한뫼의 응급 대기소 들것 줄과 연료 사고 줄이 겹치지 않게 나눈다.","야망":"탁윤재는 교량 통행 사고 당사자 직무에서 충돌 시각 일지 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"탁윤재의 충돌 시각 일지 기록 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"탁윤재는 터진 시각·남은 연료량 일지 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 구의역 실무 인물이다. 말은 짧고 발자국은 정확하다.\n\n- 생업: 충돌 시각 일지 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 실무원\n- 직함: 교량 통행 사고 당사자\n**생애.** 2065-05-03에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 교량 통행 사고 당사자 직무를 맡아 충돌 시각 일지 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 충돌 시각 일지 기록 창구가 탁윤재의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 실무원. 직함은 교량 통행 사고 당사자. 충돌 시각 일지 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**관계.** 영한뫼의 응급 대기소 들것 줄과 연료 사고 줄이 겹치지 않게 나눈다.\n\n**야망.** 탁윤재는 교량 통행 사고 당사자 직무에서 충돌 시각 일지 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 탁윤재의 충돌 시각 일지 기록 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 50 | 개방 −25 | 무력 35 | 물질 5 | 공동 25 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −10 | 자격 −5 | 분산 −15 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 20 | 독점 30 | 위험 20 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −5 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"탁윤재","type":"계약","to":"선솔우","basis":""},{"from":"탁윤재","type":"계약","to":"영한뫼","basis":"영한뫼의 의무소 들것과 사고 줄을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0369', 'bc94-ae08-c131', '{"id":"person-0369","name":"Beom Han-deul","title":"Stock Check Duty","position":"Yongsan Station Stock Check Duty","characterId":"K368","rank":"Staff Officer","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Cross-checking fuel and food stock tables","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#inmul-beomhandeul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0369","birthDate":"2096-08-04","birthday":"08-04","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"leaking-joint-inspection","name":"Joint inspection","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Reads expiry alongside remaining supply","description":"Title: Stock Check Duty.","behavior":"He counted expiry dates on his fingers. He trusted numbers but not blank clauses.","stress":"Fear. That testimony he signed would become an absolution for a collective ransom bargain.","relationship":"Relations. Matches stock tables with the station office staff and uses the inspection marks left on stretches where records broke off as the frame of his checks. He reads Han Jaemok''s parts allocation draft aloud but puts off the stamp.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Livelihood. Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Yongsan Station stock check duty. He pastes the fuel and food stock tables in one book and strikes from his checks any copy taken before the stamps dried.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Livelihood. Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Yongsan Station stock check duty. He pastes the fuel and food stock tables in one book and strikes from his checks any copy taken before the stamps dried.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That testimony he signed would become an absolution for a collective ransom bargain.","relationship":"Relations. Matches stock tables with the station office staff and uses the inspection marks left on stretches where records broke off as the frame of his checks. He reads Han Jaemok''s parts allocation draft aloud but puts off the stamp.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Stock Check Duty.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc94-ae08-c131","name":"Geumseong Beom Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc94-ae08-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":35,"Openness":-15,"Force":35,"Material":10,"Communal":20,"Principle":0,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":-20,"Dispersed":-15,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":-20,"Display":-20,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Cross-checking fuel and food stock tables","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Staff Officer","Title":"Yongsan Station Stock Check Duty","Values":"Authority 35 | Openness −15 | Force 35 | Material 10 | Communal 20 | Principle 0 | Publicity −15 | Qualification −20 | Dispersion −15 | Transformation −20","Desires":"Craving 40 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −20 | Display −20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: bisexual | Union: contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2096-08-04. As of the 2126 opening, he holds the post of stock check duty at Yongsan Station and continues the records of cross-checking fuel and food stock tables. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The stock table cross-check desk at the Yongsan Station office is Beom Han-deul''s working reference point. This working reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or rights of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Yongsan Station stock check duty. He handles the records of cross-checking fuel and food stock tables and the duty-watch handover within the scope of his current post.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"He matches stock tables with the station office staff, and uses the inspection marks left on stretches where records broke off as the backbone of his checks. He reads Han Jaemok''s parts allocation draft aloud but postpones sealing it.","Ambition":"In the post of stock check duty at Yongsan Station, Beom Han-deul wants to mesh the records of cross-checking fuel and food stock tables with the public handover table.","Fear":"","Intervention":"He can bring to the check desk a revised stock table with blanks left in it, or enter into the ledger the gratuity goods he received. By cross-checking Beom Han-deul''s ledger of fuel and food stock table records, he can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Beom Han-deul is a government station-office working figure at Yongsan Station, practiced in cross-checking fuel and food stock tables. He counts the stock on his fingers and sends back from the check desk any courier who claims the count was settled by word of mouth. He trusts numbers but not blank entries.\n\n- Occupation: Cross-checking fuel and food stock tables\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Staff Officer\n- Title: Yongsan Station stock check duty\n**Life.** Born on 2096-08-04. As of the 2126 opening, he holds the post of stock check duty at Yongsan Station and continues the records of cross-checking fuel and food stock tables. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The stock table cross-check desk at the Yongsan Station office is Beom Han-deul''s working reference point. This working reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or rights of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Yongsan Station stock check duty. He handles the records of cross-checking fuel and food stock tables and the duty-watch handover within the scope of his current post.\n\n**Relations.** He matches stock tables with the station office staff, and uses the inspection marks left on stretches where records broke off as the backbone of his checks. He reads Han Jaemok''s parts allocation draft aloud but postpones sealing it.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of stock check duty at Yongsan Station, Beom Han-deul wants to mesh the records of cross-checking fuel and food stock tables with the public handover table.\n\n**Intervention.** He can bring to the check desk a revised stock table with blanks left in it, or enter into the ledger the gratuity goods he received. By cross-checking Beom Han-deul''s ledger of fuel and food stock table records, he can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 35 | Openness −15 | Force 35 | Material 10 | Communal 20 | Principle 0 | Publicity −15 | Qualification −20 | Dispersion −15 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −20 | Display −20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: bisexual | Union: contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Beom Han-deul","type":"Oath","to":"Gwak Minjae","basis":"backs Gwak Minjae''s shutter and fuel inspection with the stock table from the witness stand, and"},{"from":"Beom Han-deul","type":"Oath","to":"Im Hajun","basis":"Bases testimony on the expiry marks left after Im Hajun''s disappearance"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Heung Miri","type":"Contract","to":"Beom Han-deul","basis":"Aligns dates with Beom Handeul''s gate expiry testimony"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0369","name":"범한들","title":"재고 확인 담당","position":"용산역 재고 확인 담당","characterId":"K368","rank":"실무원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"연료·식량 재고표 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-범한들","detailRoute":"/people/person-0369","birthDate":"2096-08-04","birthday":"08-04","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"leaking-joint-inspection","name":"이음매 점검","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"만료와 잔량을 함께 읽는다","description":"직함은 재고 확인 담당.","behavior":"만료일을 손가락으로 센다. 숫자는 믿되 빈칸 조항은 믿지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 자신이 서명한 증언이 집단 납치 몸값 협상의 면죄부가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 사무소 사람들과 재고표를 맞추고, 기록이 끊긴 구간의 점검 표시를 확인 기록의 뼈대로 삼는다. 한재목의 부품 배분 문안을 읽어 주되 날인은 미룬다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"생업. 품계 실무원. 직함은 용산역 재고 확인 담당. 연료와 식량의 재고표를 같은 책에 붙이고, 인장이 마르기 전의 사본은 확인 기록에서 뺀다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 생업. 품계 실무원. 직함은 용산역 재고 확인 담당. 연료와 식량의 재고표를 같은 책에 붙이고, 인장이 마르기 전의 사본은 확인 기록에서 뺀다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 자신이 서명한 증언이 집단 납치 몸값 협상의 면죄부가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 사무소 사람들과 재고표를 맞추고, 기록이 끊긴 구간의 점검 표시를 확인 기록의 뼈대로 삼는다. 한재목의 부품 배분 문안을 읽어 주되 날인은 미룬다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"직함은 재고 확인 담당.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc94-ae08-c131","name":"금성 범씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc94-ae08-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":35,"개방":-15,"무력":35,"물질":10,"공동":20,"원칙":0,"공개":-15,"자격":-20,"분산":-15,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":25,"위험":-20,"과시":-20,"지속":-15,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"연료·식량 재고표 대조","소속":"정부","품계":"실무원","직함":"용산역 재고 확인 담당","가치관":"권위 35 | 개방 −15 | 무력 35 | 물질 10 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −20 | 분산 −15 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 25 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2096-08-04에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 용산역 재고 확인 담당 직무를 맡아 연료·식량 재고표 대조 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 용산역 사무소의 재고표 대조 자리가 범한들의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 실무원. 직함은 용산역 재고 확인 담당. 연료·식량 재고표 대조 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"","관계":"사무소 사람들과 재고표를 맞추고, 기록이 끊긴 구간의 점검 표시를 확인 기록의 뼈대로 삼는다. 한재목의 부품 배분 문안을 읽어 주되 날인은 미룬다.","야망":"범한들은 용산역 재고 확인 담당 직무에서 연료·식량 재고표 대조 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"","개입":"빈칸이 남은 재고표 수정본을 확인대에 올리거나, 받은 사례 물품을 원장에 올릴 수 있다. 범한들의 연료·식량 재고표 대조 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"범한들은 연료·식량 재고표 대조 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 용산역 실무 인물이다. 재고 수량을 손가락으로 세고, 구두로 수량을 맞췄다고 전하는 전령을 확인대에서 돌려보낸다. 숫자는 믿되 빈칸은 믿지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 연료·식량 재고표 대조\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 실무원\n- 직함: 용산역 재고 확인 담당\n**생애.** 2096-08-04에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 용산역 재고 확인 담당 직무를 맡아 연료·식량 재고표 대조 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 용산역 사무소의 재고표 대조 자리가 범한들의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 실무원. 직함은 용산역 재고 확인 담당. 연료·식량 재고표 대조 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**관계.** 사무소 사람들과 재고표를 맞추고, 기록이 끊긴 구간의 점검 표시를 확인 기록의 뼈대로 삼는다. 한재목의 부품 배분 문안을 읽어 주되 날인은 미룬다.\n\n**야망.** 범한들은 용산역 재고 확인 담당 직무에서 연료·식량 재고표 대조 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**개입.** 빈칸이 남은 재고표 수정본을 확인대에 올리거나, 받은 사례 물품을 원장에 올릴 수 있다. 범한들의 연료·식량 재고표 대조 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 35 | 개방 −15 | 무력 35 | 물질 10 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −20 | 분산 −15 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 25 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"범한들","type":"맹세","to":"곽민재","basis":"곽민재의 셔터·연료 점검을 증인석에서 재고표로 받치고"},{"from":"범한들","type":"맹세","to":"임하준","basis":"임하준의 실종 뒤에 남은 만료 표시를 증언의 바탕으로 삼는다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"흥미리","type":"계약","to":"범한들","basis":"범한들의 관문 만료 증언과 날짜를 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0370', 'cc3d-cc3d-b155-660c', '{"id":"person-0370","name":"Chang Ji-an","title":"Representative of Requisitioned Refugees","position":"Representative of Externally Requisitioned Refugees","characterId":"K369","rank":"Staff Officer","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Verifying Requisition Slips and Cross-Checking Passage Headcounts","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#inmul-changjian","detailRoute":"/people/person-0370","birthDate":"2100-03-01","birthday":"03-01","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"transit-headcount-reconciliation","name":"Transit headcount reconciliation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Verifying Requisition Slips and Cross-Checking Passage Headcounts","description":"Title: Representative of Requisitioned Refugees.","behavior":"The longer the line grew, the lower his voice fell.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Split the crowd queue with Mun Hayul''s outpost duty.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Livelihood. Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Representative of Externally Requisitioned Refugees. He checks the number of people who came in through the tunnels against the actual sleeping spaces and food every evening and does not send people out before the station office''s confirmation comes down.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Livelihood. Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Representative of Externally Requisitioned Refugees. He checks the number of people who came in through the tunnels against the actual sleeping spaces and food every evening and does not send people out before the station office''s confirmation comes down.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Split the crowd queue with Mun Hayul''s outpost duty.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Representative of Requisitioned Refugees.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc3d-cc3d-b155-660c","name":"Changnyeong Chang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cc3d-cc3d-b155-660c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-5,"Force":35,"Material":15,"Communal":30,"Principle":10,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":-20,"Dispersed":-5,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":50,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":10,"Display":-5,"Sustained":45,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Verifying Requisition Slips and Cross-Checking Passage Headcounts","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Staff Officer","Title":"Representative of Externally Requisitioned Refugees","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −5 | Force 35 | Material 15 | Communal 30 | Principle 10 | Publicity −20 | Qualification −20 | Dispersion −5 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 50 | Monopoly 5 | Risk 10 | Display −5 | Persistence 45 | Orientation bisexual | Bonding monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2100-03-01. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of External Requisition Refugee Crowd Representative, continuing the records of requisition slips and headcount reconciliation. The prior history of selection and handover for the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The requisition slip and headcount reconciliation desk in Guui 1-dong is Chang Ji-an''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Representative of Externally Requisitioned Refugees. Handles the records of requisition slips and headcount reconciliation, as well as watch handovers, within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Shares the checkpoint watch and the crowd line with Mun Ha-yul.","Ambition":"In the post of External Requisition Refugee Crowd Representative, Chang Ji-an seeks to make the records of requisition slips and headcount reconciliation mesh with the public handover table.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can reconcile Chang Ji-an''s ledger of requisition slips and headcount reconciliation to establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Chang Ji-an is a government station-office working figure at Cheonho Station, practiced in the records of intake rosters, sleeping-space counts, and station office confirmation. He counts the empty beds first and writes down separately the names of people searching for family members who were taken away. The longer the line grows, the lower his voice becomes.\n\n- Occupation: Verifying Requisition Slips and Cross-Checking Passage Headcounts\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Staff Officer\n- Title: Representative of Externally Requisitioned Refugees\n**Life.** Born 2100-03-01. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of External Requisition Refugee Crowd Representative, continuing the records of requisition slips and headcount reconciliation. The prior history of selection and handover for the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The requisition slip and headcount reconciliation desk in Guui 1-dong is Chang Ji-an''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Representative of Externally Requisitioned Refugees. Handles the records of requisition slips and headcount reconciliation, as well as watch handovers, within the scope of the current post.\n\n**Relations.** Shares the checkpoint watch and the crowd line with Mun Ha-yul.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of External Requisition Refugee Crowd Representative, Chang Ji-an seeks to make the records of requisition slips and headcount reconciliation mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Intervention.** Can reconcile Chang Ji-an''s ledger of requisition slips and headcount reconciliation to establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −5 | Force 35 | Material 15 | Communal 30 | Principle 10 | Publicity −20 | Qualification −20 | Dispersion −5 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 50 | Monopoly 5 | Risk 10 | Display −5 | Persistence 45 | Orientation bisexual | Bonding monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Chang Ji-an","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Hayul","basis":"divides the crowd lines with Mun Hayul''s post watch"},{"from":"Chang Ji-an","type":"Contract","to":"Seok Bomu","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0370","name":"창지안","title":"징발 피난 인파 대표","position":"외부 징발 피난 인파 대표","characterId":"K369","rank":"실무원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"징발 쪽지·통행 인원 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-창지안","detailRoute":"/people/person-0370","birthDate":"2100-03-01","birthday":"03-01","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base"