and unwitnessed rumor filtering desk in Guui 1-dong is Cho Tae-on''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holdings, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Gate Witness of the Consultation. Handles the records of passage messages and filtering out unwitnessed rumors, as well as watch handovers, within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Matches times with Geun Ju-ha''s signed ledger.","Ambition":"In the post of Consultation Gate Witness, Cho Tae-on seeks to make the records of passage messages and filtering out unwitnessed rumors mesh with the public handover table.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Can expose the note in the slot that was set aside, or escort the Joint Charter witness to protect the gate ledger. Can reconcile Cho Tae-on''s ledger of passage messages and filtering out unwitnessed rumors to establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Cho Taeon is a member of The Government, practiced in the records of pass messages and the filtering out of unwitnessed rumors. At the gate, Cho checks the passage time of a council escort before checking the seal, and keeps any envoy who tries to turn a verbal agreement into a travel pass standing at the door. Cho observes courtesy but forgives no hand that alters a date.\n\n- Livelihood: Screening Passage Messages and Rumors Without Witnesses\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Staff Officer\n- Title: Gate Witness of the Consultation\n**Life.** Born 2101-06-13. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Consultation Gate Witness, continuing the records of passage messages and filtering out unwitnessed rumors. The prior history of selection and handover for the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The passage message and unwitnessed rumor filtering desk in Guui 1-dong is Cho Tae-on''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holdings, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff Officer. Title: Gate Witness of the Consultation. Handles the records of passage messages and filtering out unwitnessed rumors, as well as watch handovers, within the scope of the current post.\n\n**Relationships.** Matches times with Geun Ju-ha''s signed ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of Consultation Gate Witness, Cho Tae-on seeks to make the records of passage messages and filtering out unwitnessed rumors mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Intervention.** Can expose the note in the slot that was set aside, or escort the Joint Charter witness to protect the gate ledger. Can reconcile Cho Tae-on''s ledger of passage messages and filtering out unwitnessed rumors to establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 45 | Openness −10 | Force 50 | Material 10 | Communal 15 | Principle 5 | Publicity −10 | Credentials −15 | Dispersal −10 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk 15 | Display 20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Cho Tae-on","type":"Oath","to":"Jeong Yura","basis":""},{"from":"Cho Tae-on","type":"Oath","to":"Geun Juha","basis":"Matches times with Geun Juha''s signature ledger"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0371","name":"초태온","title":"관문 증인","position":"협의 관문 증인","characterId":"K370","rank":"실무원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"통과 전갈·증인 없는 소문 걸러내기","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-초태온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0371","birthDate":"2101-06-13","birthday":"06-13","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":