ons taken and their testimony from that day together on the relevant line of the station ledger.","Relationships":"Suspects Nam Yungyeong''s undisclosed emergency rations, records Bae Ujin''s releases of eastern military grain, and shares a key with Jeon Nagyeong.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"In their work as Keeper of the Myeongdong Station Register, Ra Jinu first cross-checks the records of station register custody and records assistance.\n\n- Livelihood: Station Register Custody · Records Assistance\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Keeper of the Myeongdong Station Register\n**Life.** Born on 2066-04-24, Ra Jinu serves as the keeper of the Myeongdong Station register at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Ra Jinu serves as the keeper of the Myeongdong Station register at the Myeongdong Station office in the Myeongdong administrative dong. This duty anchor does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, title, holding, or tenure.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Keeper of the Myeongdong Station Register. Handles custody of the station register and records assistance.\n\n**Anecdote.** During the historic fire of 2125, they carried out the ledger of names first. They recorded the actions taken and their testimony from that day together on the relevant line of the station ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Suspects Nam Yungyeong''s undisclosed emergency rations, records Bae Ujin''s releases of eastern military grain, and shares a key with Jeon Nagyeong.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness 35 | Force −20 | Material 40 | Communal −25 | Principle −45 | Publicity −30 | Qualification 0 | Dispersion 0 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −10 | Display −30 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Unoriented | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ra Jinu","type":"Command","to":"Nam Yun-gyeong","basis":"Guards the non-public emergency 