ry tickets to Baek On''s southbound family.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"In his work as Myeongdong Station Relief Distributor, Jeon Nagyeong first cross-checks the records of relief supply distribution and records assistance.\n\n- Livelihood: Relief Supply Distribution · Records Assistance\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Myeongdong Station Relief Distributor\n**Life.** Born on 2075-07-04, Jeon Nagyeong serves as Myeongdong Station Relief Distributor at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Jeon Nagyeong serves as Myeongdong Station Relief Distributor at the Myeongdong Station office in Myeongdong administrative district. This duty reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Relief Distributor. Handles relief supply distribution and records assistance.\n\n**Relations.** Hands a copy of the ration ledger to Yun Seorin, goes against Nam Yungyeong''s secret military grain, and gives temporary tickets to Baek On''s southbound family.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 35 | Force −15 | Material 65 | Communal −30 | Principle −50 | Publicity −20 | Qualification −10 | Dispersion −5 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly 15 | Risk −15 | Display 10 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Unoriented | Bonding Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jeon Nagyeong","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Handing a copy of the ration ledger over to the Records Office"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bang Neuljae","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Nagyeong","basis":"shares Jeon Nagyeong''s emergency ration line and cot, and"},{"from":"Cheon Solbit","type":"Command","to":"Jeon Nagyeong","basis":"enforces the plaza line under Jeon Nagyeong''s command, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0377","name":"전나경","title":"비상배급원","position":"명동역 구휼 배급 담당","characterId":"K376","