 that day together on the relevant line of the station ledger.","Relationships":"Shares the item meeting with Nam Yungyeong, and avoids tying produce to O Haerin''s seafood prices.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"In her work as the Myeongdong Station Records Clerk, Nam Siyun first cross-checks the station records.\n\n- Livelihood: Station Records Keeping\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Myeongdong Station Records Clerk\n**Life.** Nam Siyun, born on 2080-02-16, serves as the Myeongdong Station Records Clerk at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Nam Siyun serves as the Myeongdong Station Records Clerk at the Myeongdong Station office in Myeongdong administrative district. This work reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or tenure.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Records Clerk. She keeps the station records.\n\n**Anecdote.** During the historic fire of 2125, they carried out the ledger of names first. They recorded the actions taken and their testimony from that day together on the relevant line of the station ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Shares the item meeting with Nam Yungyeong, and avoids tying produce to O Haerin''s seafood prices.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 25 | Force −15 | Material 70 | Communal −15 | Principle −60 | Publicity −25 | Qualification 0 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Exclusivity 0 | Risk 15 | Display 5 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Nam Siyun","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Yun-gyeong","basis":"Shares produce-item meetings"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Dong Yesol","type":"Command","to":"Nam Siyun","basis":"Enforces Nam Siyun''s merchant council votes in the market, and"},{"from":"Cho Siram","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Siyun","basis":"Asks that Nam Siyun''s merchant council not refer to certificates by item number"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0378","name":"남시윤","title":"청과 상인회의 대표","position":"명동역 기록 담당","characterId":"K377","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"역 기록 보관","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-15#인물-남시윤","detailRoute":"/people/person-0378","birthDate":"2080-02-16","birthday":"02-16","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"record-comparison","name":"기록 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"기록 우선","description":"화재에서 인명 장부를 먼저 꺼낸다. 청과 조항을 요구하지만 수산 시세와 묶이는 것은 피하려 한다.","behavior":"확인된 선택: 기록 우선. 다른 상황까지 불변 성향으로 확정하지 않는다.","stress":"서명이 의심받을 때 원본 보관에 매달릴 수 있다.","relationship":"남윤경과 회의를 공유하되 오해린의 시세와는 거리를 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"handover-continuity","name":"기록 단절 경계","description":"직함은 청과 상인회의 대표.","behavior":"맡은 기록과 서명의 연결을 확인하려 한다.","stress":"","relationship":"남윤경과 회의를 공유하되 오해린의 시세와는 거리를 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"화재에서 인명 장부를 먼저 꺼낸다. 청과 조항을 요구하지만 수산 시세와 묶이는 것은 피하려 한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b0a8-c758-b839","name":"의령 남씨","crest":"clan-crests/b0a8-c758-b839.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":25,"무력":-15,"물질":70,"공동":-15,"원칙":-60,"공개":-25,"자격":0,"분산":20,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":0,"위험":15,"과시":5,"지속":10,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"역 기록 보관","소속":"정부","품계":"주사","직함":"명동역 기록 담당","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 25 | 무력 −15 | 물질 70 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 −60 | 공개 −25 | 자격 0 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 0 | 위험 15 | 과시 5 | 지속 10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2080-02-16에 태어난 남시윤은 겨울의 명동역 사무소에서 명동역 기록 담당 일을 맡는다.\n- 남시윤은 명동 행정동의 명동역 사무소에서 명동역 기록 담당 업무를 맡는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 명동역 기록 담당. 역 기록 보관 업무를 맡는다.","일화":"2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 그날의 조치와 증언을 역 장부의 해당 줄에 함께 남겼다.","관계":"남윤경과 품목 회의를 공유하고, 오해린의 수산 시세에 청과를 묶지 않으려 한다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"남시윤은 명동역 기록 담당 업무에서 역 기록 보관 기록을 먼저 대조한다.\n\n- 생업: 역 기록 보관\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 주사\n- 직함: 명동역 기록 담당\n**생애.** 2080-02-16에 태어난 남시윤은 겨울의 명동역 사무소에서 명동역 기록 담당 일을 맡는다.\n- 남시윤은 명동 행정동의 명동역 사무소에서 명동역 기록 담당 업무를 맡는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 명동역 기록 담당. 역 기록 보관 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 그날의 조치와 증언을 역 장부의 해당 줄에 함께 남겼다.\n\n**관계.** 남윤경과 품목 회의를 공유하고, 오해린의 수산 시세에 청과를 묶지 않으려 한다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 25 | 무력 −15 | 물질 70 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 −60 | 공개 −25 | 자격 0 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 0 | 위험 15 | 과시 5 | 지속 10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"남시윤","type":"계약","to":"남윤경","basis":"청과 품목 회의를 공유"}],"incoming":[{"from":"동예솔","type":"지휘","to":"남시윤","basis":"남시윤의 상인회의 표를 시장에서 집행하고"},{"from":"초시람","type":"계약","to":"남시윤","basis":"남시윤의 상인회의가 증서를 물건 번호로 부르지 않기를 청한다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0379', 'bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587', '{"id":"person-0379","name":"Mun Doyun","title":"Convoy Bid Coordination","position":"Myeongdong Station Procedure Overseer","characterId":"K378","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Procedure Oversight · Assistance","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-15#inmul-mun-doyun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0379","birthDate":"2067-01-31","birthday":"01-31","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"arrival-verification","name":"Arrival verification","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"Reports danger promptly","description":"Closes a flooded section without delaying the collapse report. Adds escort terms to bids and uses dispatch seals to verify arrivals.","behavior":"Shown in the confirmed choice: Reports danger promptly. It is not established as an invariable disposition in other situations.","stress":"May choose closure over continued use when danger appears.","relationship":"Connects Jang Sehwa’s escort proposal with Ra Jinwoo’s seals.","effects":[]},{"id":"handover-continuity","name":"Concern for record continuity","description":"Title: Convoy Bid Coordination.","behavior":"Seeks to check the continuity of assigned records and signatures.","stress":"","relationship":"Connects Jang Sehwa’s escort proposal with Ra Jinwoo’s seals.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Closes a flooded section without delaying the collapse report. Adds escort terms to bids and uses dispatch seals to verify arrivals.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587","name":"Nampyeong Mun Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":20,"Force":-10,"Material":45,"Communal":-20,"Principle":-40,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":-10,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":20,"Risk":-30,"Display":5,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Procedure Oversight · Assistance","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Myeongdong Station Procedure Overseer","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness 20 | Force −10 | Material 45 | Communal −20 | Principle −40 | Publicity −15 | Qualification −10 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 10 | Exclusivity 20 | Risk −30 | Display 5 | Persistence 5 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Mun Doyun, born on 2067-01-31, serves as the Myeongdong Station Procedure Overseer at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Mun Doyun serves as the Myeongdong Station Procedure Overseer at the Myeongdong Station office in Myeongdong administrative district. This work reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or tenure.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Procedure Overseer. He carries out procedure inspection and assistance work.","Anecdote":"In 2125, he did not delay the collapse report for the flooded section and closed it immediately. He recorded the measures taken that day and his testimony together on the corresponding line of the station ledger.","Relationships":"Plants Jang Sehwa''s escort plan into the bid conditions, prefers Ha Seon''s light escort, and uses Ra Jinu''s dispatch seal for arrival confirmation.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"In his work as the Myeongdong Station Procedure Overseer, Mun Doyun first cross-checks the procedure inspection and assistance records.\n\n- Livelihood: Procedure Oversight · Assistance\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Myeongdong Station Procedure Overseer\n**Life.** Mun Doyun, born on 2067-01-31, serves as the Myeongdong Station Procedure Overseer at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Mun Doyun serves as the Myeongdong Station Procedure Overseer at the Myeongdong Station office in Myeongdong administrative district. This work reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or tenure.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Procedure Overseer. He carries out procedure inspection and assistance work.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, he did not delay the collapse report for the flooded section and closed it immediately. He recorded the measures taken that day and his testimony together on the corresponding line of the station ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Plants Jang Sehwa''s escort plan into the bid conditions, prefers Ha Seon''s light escort, and uses Ra Jinu''s dispatch seal for arrival confirmation.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 20 | Force −10 | Material 45 | Communal −20 | Principle −40 | Publicity −15 | Qualification −10 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Exclusivity 20 | Risk −30 | Display 5 | Persistence 5 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Mun Doyun","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Plants the escort plan in the bid conditions"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Seon Dasom",