. Records military carts at night; broader combat and command success are unrecorded.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"Hanyang Su Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":25,"Openness":20,"Force":5,"Material":55,"Communal":-25,"Principle":-30,"Public":-25,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-30,"Display":-10,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Night Guard · Assistance","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Myeongdong Station Night Guard","Values":"Authority 25 | Openness 20 | Force 5 | Material 55 | Communal −25 | Principle −30 | Publicity −25 | Qualification 10 | Dispersal 10 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −30 | Display −10 | Persistence 20 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Contractual Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2086-03-19, Su Hanbyeol serves as Myeongdong Station Night Guard at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Su Hanbyeol handles the work of Myeongdong Station Night Guard at the Myeongdong Station office in the Myeongdong administrative district. This work reference point does not determine a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Night Guard. He handles night guard and assistance work.","Anecdote":"In 2125, he caught a night trespasser and replaced the guard code tag. He recorded that day''s measures and his testimony together on the relevant line of the station ledger.","Relationships":"Takes command from Ra Jinu, who rotates the warehouse turn order with a rod, and shares base duty and knot direction with Won Juon. When Bae Ujin''s eastern provisions cart stops in the night slot, he marks it in chalk.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Su Hanbyeol, in the work of Myeongdong Station Night Guard, first cross-checks the night guard and assistance records.\n\n- Livelihood: Night Guard · Assistance\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Myeongdong Station Night Guard\n**Life.** Born on 2086-03-19, Su Hanbyeol serves as Myeongdong Station Night Guard at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Su Hanbyeol handles the work of Myeongdong Station Night Guard at the Myeongdong Station office in the Myeongdong administrative district. This work reference point does not determine a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Night Guard. He handles night guard and assistance work.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, he caught a night trespasser and replaced the guard code tag. He recorded that day''s measures and his testimony together on the relevant line of the station ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Takes command from Ra Jinu, who rotates the warehouse turn order with a rod, and shares base duty and knot direction with Won Juon. When Bae Ujin''s eastern provisions cart stops in the night slot, he marks it in chalk.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 25 | Openness 20 | Force 5 | Material 55 | Communal −25 | Principle −30 | Publicity −25 | Qualification 10 | Dispersal 10 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −30 | Display −10 | Persistence 20 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Contractual Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Su Hanbyeol","type":"Command","to":"Ra Jinu","basis":"under the command that turns Ra Jinu''s warehouse order with a baton, and"},{"from":"Su Hanbyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Won Juon","basis":"Shares base duty and knot direction with Won Juon"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Pan Hyodam","type":"Command","to":"Su Hanbyeol","basis":"Shares patrols and locks with Su Hanbyeol"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0383","name":"수한별","title":"창고 경비 순찰대, 라진우의 실무 담당자","position":"명동역 야간 경비 담당","characterId":"K382","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"야간 경비·보좌","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-15#인물-수한별","detailRoute":"/people/person-0383","birthDate":"2086-03-19","birthday":"03-19","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":10,"effective":10}},"skills":[{"id":"intruder-restraint","name":"침입자 제지","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"야간 흔적을 남김","description":"야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡고 암호패를 교체했다. 야간 군량 수레를 기록하지만 전투나 부대 지휘 전반의 성과는 없다.","behavior":"확인된 선택: 야간 흔적을 남김. 다른 상황까지 불변 성향으로 확정하지 않는다.","stress":"무단 접근 뒤 경비 확인이 엄격해질 수 있다.","relationship":"라진우의 순번 지휘를 받고 원주온과 당직을 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"handover-continuity","name":"기록 단절 경계","description":"직함은 창고 경비 순찰대, 라진우의 실무 담당자.","behavior":"맡은 기록과 서명의 연결을 확인하려 한다.","stress":"","relationship":"라진우의 순번 지휘를 받고 원주온과 당직을 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡고 암호패를 교체했다. 야간 군량 수레를 기록하지만 전투나 부대 지휘 전반의 성과는 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"한양 수씨","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":25,"개방":20,"무력":5,"물질":55,"공동":-25,"원칙":-30,"공개":-25,"자격":10,"분산":10,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-15,"위험":-30,"과시":-10,"지속":20,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"야간 경비·보좌","소속":"정부","품계":"주사","직함":"명동역 야간 경비 담당","가치관":"권위 25 | 개방 20 | 무력 5 | 물질 55 | 공동 −25 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 −25 | 자격 10 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2086-03-19에 태어난 수한별은 겨울의 명동역 사무소에서 명동역 야간 경비 담당 일을 맡는다.\n- 수한별은 명동 행정동의 명동역 사무소에서 명동역 야간 경비 담당 업무를 맡는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 명동역 야간 경비 담당. 야간 경비·보좌 업무를 맡는다.","일화":"2125년 야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡아 경비 암호패를 갈았다. 그날의 조치와 증언을 역 장부의 해당 줄에 함께 남겼다.","관계":"라진우의 창고 순번을 막대로 돌리는 지휘를 받고, 원주온의 기지 당직과 매듭 방향을 나눈다. 배우진의 동부 군량 수레가 야간 칸에 서면 분필로 남긴다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"수한별은 명동역 야간 경비 담당 업무에서 야간 경비·보좌 기록을 먼저 대조한다.\n\n- 생업: 야간 경비·보좌\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 주사\n- 직함: 명동역 야간 경비 담당\n**생애.** 2086-03-19에 태어난 수한별은 겨울의 명동역 사무소에서 명동역 야간 경비 담당 일을 맡는다.\n- 수한별은 명동 행정동의 명동역 사무소에서 명동역 야간 경비 담당 업무를 맡는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 명동역 야간 경비 담당. 야간 경비·보좌 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡아 경비 암호패를 갈았다. 그날의 조치와 증언을 역 장부의 해당 줄에 함께 남겼다.\n\n**관계.** 라진우의 창고 순번을 막대로 돌리는 지휘를 받고, 원주온의 기지 당직과 매듭 방향을 나눈다. 배우진의 동부 군량 수레가 야간 칸에 서면 분필로 남긴다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 25 | 개방 20 | 무력 5 | 물질 55 | 공동 −25 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 −25 | 자격 10 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"수한별","type":"지휘","to":"라진우","basis":"라진우의 창고 순번을 막대로 돌리는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"수한별","type":"계약","to":"원주온","basis":"원주온의 기지 당직과 매듭 방향을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"판효담","type":"지휘","to":"수한별","basis":"수한별의 순찰과 자물쇠를 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0384', 'c120-bcf4-c131', '{"id":"person-0384","name":"Seon Dasom","title":"Convoy Bid Winner Messenger, Mun Doyun''s Operations Aide","position":"Myeongdong Station Summons Messenger","characterId":"K383","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Station Summons Delivery · Assistance","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-15#inmul-seondasom","detailRoute":"/people/person-0384","birthDate":"2075-03-03","birthday":"03-03","age":51,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sealed-messages","name":"Sealed message delivery","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"Withholds delivery when needed","description":"Locks away military messages after relief transport fails to attract bids. Carries sealed terms while adding escort proposals.","behavior":"Shown in the confirmed choice: Withholds delivery when needed. It is not established as an invariable disposition in other situations.","stress":"May halt delivery when awards favor one side.","relationship":"Works under Mun Doyun and shares message order with Yeong Migyeol.","effects":[]},{"id":"handover-continuity","name":"Concern for record continuity","description":"Title: Convoy Bid Winner Messenger, Mun Doyun''s Operations Aide.","behavior":"Seeks to check the continuity of assigned records and signatures.","stress":"","relationship":"Works under Mun Doyun and shares message order with Yeong Migyeol.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Locks away military messages after relief transport fails to attract bids. Carries sealed terms while adding escort proposals.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c120-bcf4-c131","name":"Seon Clan of Boseong","crest":"clan-crests/c120-bcf4-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":5,"Openness":35,"Force":0,"Material":45,"Communal":-20,"Principle":-50,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":-10,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":10,"Display":10,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Station Summons Delivery · Assistance","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Myeongdong Station Summons Messenger","Values":"Authority 5 | Openness 35 | Force 0 | Material 45 | Communal −20 | Principle −50 | Publicity −10 | Qualification −10 | Dispersal 0 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly 5 | Risk 10 | Display 10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Non-Exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2075-03-03, Seon Dasom serves as Myeongdong Station Summons Messenger at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Seon Dasom handles the work of Myeongdong Station Summons Messenger at the Myeongdong Station office in the Myeongdong administrative district. This work reference point does not determine a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Summons Messenger. She handles station summons delivery and assistance work.","Anecdote":"The day after the warehouse blockade, only the army provisions escort sold at a high price while the emergency ration wagon went unsold, so Seon Dasom locked the provisions message in her bag. She recorded that day''s measures and her testimony together on the relevant line of the station ledger.","Relationships":"Takes command from Mun Doyun to carry his bid conditions only in sealed state, and shares turn order with Yeongmigyeol''s bid ledger. Plants Jang Sehwa''s escort proposal at the end of the message.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Seon Dasom first cross-checks the Station Summons Messenger/Assistant records in the duties of Myeongdong Station Summons Messenger.\n\n- Livelihood: Station Summons Delivery · Assistance\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Myeongdong Station Summons Messenger\n**Life.** Born on 2075-03-03, Seon Dasom serves as Myeongdong Station Summons Messenger at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Seon Dasom handles the work of Myeongdong Station Summons Messenger at the Myeongdong Station office in the Myeongdong administrative district. This work reference point does not determine a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Summons Messenger. She handles station summons delivery and assistance work.\n\n**Anecdote.** The day after the warehouse blockade, only the army provisions escort sold at a high price while the emergency ration wagon went unsold, so Seon Dasom locked the provisions message in her bag. She recorded that day''s measures and her testimony together on the relevant line of the station ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Takes command from Mun Doyun to carry his bid conditions only in sealed state, and shares turn order with Yeongmigyeol''s bid ledger. Plants Jang Sehwa''s escort proposal at the end of the message.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness 35 | Force 0 | Materialism 45 | Communality −20 | Principle −50 | Publicity −10 | Qualification −10 | Decentralization 0 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly 5 | Risk 10 | Display 10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: bisexual | Bonding: non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seon Dasom","type":"Command","to":"Mun Doyun","basis":"Receives orders to carry Mun Doyun''s bid conditions only in a sealed state,"},{"from":"Seon Dasom","type":"Command","to":"Yeong Migyeol","basis":"Shares the bid ledger and turn order with Yeong Migyeol"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bang Neuljae","type":"Contract","to":"Seon Dasom","basis":"Coordinates supplies with Seon Dasom''s medical post"},{"from":"Yeong Migyeol","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Seon Dasom","basis":"Leaves Seon Dasom''s winning-bid message on the same line"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0384","name":"선다솜","title":"호송 낙찰 전령, 문도윤의 실무 담당자","position":"명동역 소집 전령","characterId":"K383","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"역 소집 전령·보좌","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-15#인물-선다솜","detailRoute":"/people/person-0384","birthDate":"2075-03-03","birthday":"03-03","age":51,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sealed-messages","name":"봉인 전갈 운송","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"전달을 보류할 줄 앎","description":"비상배급 호송이 유찰되자 군량 전갈을 잠갔다. 봉인 상태로 조건을 운반하면서 호송안도 전갈에 넣는다.","behavior":"확인된 선택: 전달을 보류할 줄 앎. 다른 상황까지 불변 성향으로 확정하지 않는다.","stress":"편중된 낙찰 앞에서 전달을 멈출 수 있다.","relationship":"문도윤의 지휘 아래 영미결과 전갈 순번을 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"handover-continuity","name":"기록 단절 경계","description":"직함은 호송 낙찰 전령, 문도윤의 실무 담당자.","behavior":"맡은 기록과 서명의 연결을 확인하려 한다.","stress":"","relationship":"문도윤의 지휘 아래 영미결과 전갈 순번을 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"비상배급 호송이 유찰되자 군량 전갈을 잠갔다. 봉인 상태로 조건을 운반하면서 호송안도 전갈에 넣는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c120-bcf4-c131","name":"보성 선씨","crest":"clan-crests/c120-bcf4-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":5,"개방":35,"무력":0,"물질":45,"공동":-20,"원칙":-50,"공개":-10,"자격":-10,"분산":0,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":5,"위험":10,"과시":10,"지속":35,"지향":"양성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"역 소집 전령·보좌","소속":"정부","품계":"주사","직함":"명동역 소집 전령","가치관":"권위 5 | 개방 35 | 무력 0 | 물질 45 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −50 | 공개 −10 | 자격 −10 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 5 | 위험 10 | 과시 10 | 지속 35 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2075-03-03에 태어난 선다솜은 겨울의 명동역 사무소에서 명동역 소집 전령 일을 맡는다.\n- 선다솜은 명동 행정동의 명동역 사무소에서 명동역 소집 전령 업무를 맡는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 명동역 소집 전령. 역 소집 전령·보좌 업무를 맡는다.","일화":"창고 봉쇄 다음 날 군량 호송만 고가에 낙찰되고 비상배급 마차는 유찰되자 선다솜은 군량 전갈을 가방에 잠갔다. 그날의 조치와 증언을 역 장부의 해당 줄에 함께 남겼다.","관계":"문도윤의 입찰 조건을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영미결의 입찰 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 장세화의 호송안을 전갈 말미에 심는다.","야망":"","공포":"","개입":""},"biography":"선다솜은 명동역 소집 전령 업무에서 역 소집 전령·보좌 기록을 먼저 대조한다.\n\n- 생업: 역 소집 전령·보좌\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 주사\n- 직함: 명동역 소집 전령\n**생애.** 2075-03-03에 태어난 선다솜은 겨울의 명동역 사무소에서 명동역 소집 전령 일을 맡는다.\n- 선다솜은 명동 행정동의 명동역 사무소에서 명동역 소집 전령 업무를 맡는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 명동역 소집 전령. 역 소집 전령·보좌 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**일화.** 창고 봉쇄 다음 날 군량 호송만 고가에 낙찰되고 비상배급 마차는 유찰되자 선다솜은 군량 전갈을 가방에 잠갔다. 그날의 조치와 증언을 역 장부의 해당 줄에 함께 남겼다.\n\n**관계.** 문도윤의 입찰 조건을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영미결의 입찰 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 장세화의 호송안을 전갈 말미에 심는다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 5 | 개방 35 | 무력 0 | 물질 45 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −50 | 공개 −10 | 자격 −10 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 5 | 위험 10 | 과시 10 | 지속 35 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"선다솜","type":"지휘","to":"문도윤","basis":"문도윤의 입찰 조건을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"선다솜","type":"지휘","to":"영미결","basis":"영미결의 입찰 원장과 순번을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"방늘재","type":"계약","to":"선다솜","basis":"선다솜의 의료 거점과 물자를 맞춘다"},{"from":"영미결","type":"스승과 제자","to":"선다솜","basis":"선다솜의 낙찰 전갈을 같은 줄에 남긴다"}]}}');
