rts.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Testifies about military seals opened from inside and missing duty names. Puts relief carts first in dispatch, without a recorded solution to the breach.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d310-d574-c8fc","name":"Pan Clan of Haeju","crest":"clan-crests/d310-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":25,"Force":-5,"Material":40,"Communal":-15,"Principle":-40,"Public":-30,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":-40,"Display":-20,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Storage-Box Duty · Records Assistance","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Myeongdong Station Storage-Box Duty Officer","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness 25 | Force −5 | Materialism 40 | Communal −15 | Principle −40 | Publicity −30 | Credentials 0 | Decentralization 0 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Longing 45 | Possessiveness 15 | Risk −40 | Display −20 | Endurance 35 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2086-01-15, Pan Hyodam serves as Myeongdong Station Storage-Box Duty Officer of Myeongdong Station at the Myeongdong Station office during the winter.\n- Pan Hyodam handles Myeongdong Station Storage-Box Duty Officer duties at the Myeongdong Station office in the Myeongdong administrative dong. This duty reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Storage-Box Duty Officer. Handles storage-box duty and records-assistance work.","Anecdote":"On the night the merchants blockaded the warehouse, only the seal on the military-provisions compartment was opened from the inside, and one line was missing from the depot duty roster. That day''s measures and testimony were recorded together on the corresponding line of the station ledger.","Relationships":"Enforces Ra Jinu''s inventory ledger at the depot, and shares patrols and locks with Su Hanbyeol. Places Jeon Nagyeong''s emergency ration cart at the top of the dispatch list.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"In the duties of the Myeongdong Station Storage-Box Duty Officer, Pan Hyodam first cross-checks storage-box duty and records-assistance records.\n\n- Livelihood: Storage-Box Duty · Records Assistance\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Myeongdong Station Storage-Box Duty Officer\n**Life.** Born on 2086-01-15, Pan Hyodam serves as Myeongdong Station Storage-Box Duty Officer of Myeongdong Station at the Myeongdong Station office during the winter.\n- Pan Hyodam handles Myeongdong Station Storage-Box Duty Officer duties at the Myeongdong Station office in the Myeongdong administrative dong. This duty reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Storage-Box Duty Officer. Handles storage-box duty and records-assistance work.\n\n**Anecdote.** On the night the merchants blockaded the warehouse, only the seal on the military-provisions compartment was opened from the inside, and one line was missing from the depot duty roster. That day''s measures and testimony were recorded together on the corresponding line of the station ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Enforces Ra Jinu''s inventory ledger at the depot, and shares patrols and locks with Su Hanbyeol. Places Jeon Nagyeong''s emergency ration cart at the top of the dispatch list.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Nu