cking and records-assistance work.","Anecdote":"In the week prices surged, emergency ration lines filled the Jamsil assembly point, and when the Merchants'' Council demanded a halt to rationing, Cheon Solbit did not take down the plaza ledger. That day''s measures and testimony were recorded together on the corresponding line of the station ledger.","Relationships":"Enforces the plaza line under Jeon Nagyeong''s command, and divides the queue with Bang Neuljae''s clinic tent. Gives temporary tickets to Baek On''s southbound family.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Cheon Solbit first cross-checks the station-register and records-assistance records in the work of the Myeongdong Station Register Cross-Check Clerk.\n\n- Livelihood: Station Register Cross-Check · Records Assistance\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Myeongdong Station Register Cross-Check Clerk\n**Life.** Born on 2090-03-28, Cheon Solbit serves as Myeongdong Station Register Cross-Check Clerk at the Myeongdong Station office during the winter.\n- Cheon Solbit handles Myeongdong Station Register Cross-Check Clerk duties at the Myeongdong Station office in the Myeongdong administrative dong. This duty reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Register Cross-Check Clerk. Handles station-register cross-checking and records-assistance work.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the week prices surged, emergency ration lines filled the Jamsil assembly point, and when the Merchants'' Council demanded a halt to rationing, Cheon Solbit did not take down the plaza ledger. That day''s measures and testimony were recorded together on the corresponding line of the station ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Enforces the plaza line under Jeon Nagyeong''s command, and divides the queue with Bang Neuljae''s clinic tent. Gives temporary tickets to Baek On''s southbound family.\n\n::: detail