: polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2086-03-12, Dong Yesol handles the work of Myeongdong Station Sealing Clerk at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Dong Yesol handles the work of Myeongdong Station Sealing Clerk at the Myeongdong Station office in Myeongdong administrative district. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or tenure.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Sealing Clerk. Handles sealing and records assistance.","Anecdote":"When rumors of a bad harvest spread, the Merchants'' Council cast votes in favor of a warehouse blockade, and Dong Yesol locked the scales of Cheonggwa-dong for three days. The measures and testimony of that day were entered together on the corresponding line of the station ledger.","Relationships":"Enforces Nam Siyun''s Merchants'' Council votes in the market, and matches items with Cheon Nasol''s scales.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Dong Yesol first cross-checks the sealing and records-assistance records in the work of Myeongdong Station Sealing Clerk.\n\n- Livelihood: Sealing · Records Assistance\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Myeongdong Station Sealing Clerk\n**Life.** Born on 2086-03-12, Dong Yesol handles the work of Myeongdong Station Sealing Clerk at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Dong Yesol handles the work of Myeongdong Station Sealing Clerk at the Myeongdong Station office in Myeongdong administrative district. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or tenure.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Sealing Clerk. Handles sealing and records assistance.\n\n**Anecdote.** When rumors of a bad harvest spread, the Merchants'' Council cast votes in favor of a warehouse blockade, and Dong Yesol locked the scales of Cheonggwa-dong for three days. The measures and testimony of that day were entered together on the corresponding line of the station ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Enforces Nam Siyun''s Merchants'' Council votes in the market, and matches items with Cheon Nasol''s scales.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness 30 | Force −10 | Material 50 | Communal −10 | Principle −35 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 0 | Dispersion −5 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Monopoly 20 | Risk 20 | Display 25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: bisexual | Union: polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Dong Yesol","type":"Command","to":"Nam Siyun","basis":"Enforces Nam Siyun''s merchant council votes in the market, and"},{"from":"Dong Yesol","type":"Command","to":"Cheon Nasol","basis":"Matches Cheon Nasol''s scale and items"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Mae Riul","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Yesol","basis":"Shares the cold-storage compartment with Dong Yesol''s produce scales, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0389","name":"동예솔","title":"청과동 시장 거점장, 남시윤의 실무 담당자","position":"명동역 봉인 담당","characterId":"K388","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"봉인·기록 보좌","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-15#인물-동예솔","detailRoute":"/people/person-0389","birthDate":"2086-03-12","birthday":"03-12","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"seal-management","name":"봉인 관리","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"표결 집행 중시","description":"봉쇄 표결 뒤 청과 저울을 사흘 잠갔다. 품목을 맞추고 교섭 조항을 찾지만 봉쇄가 구휼에 미친 결과는 기록되지 않았다.","behavior":"확인된 선택: 표결 집행 중시. 다른 상황까지 불변 성향으로 확정하지 않는다.","stress":"흉작 소문 앞에