"When the warehouse blockade and the blackout overlapped, Bang Seokdam locked emergency power to the civilian ration compartments and switched off the military-provisions lighting. The measures and testimony of that day were entered together on the corresponding line of the station ledger.","Relationships":"Matches output to Pan Hyodam''s warehouse depot, and shares power with the plaza lighting of Cheon Solbit. Has submitted to Nam Yungyeong''s public auction, but has refused concealed power distribution.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Bang Seokdam first cross-checks the station equipment inspection and records assistance records in her work as the Myeongdong Station Equipment Operator.\n\n- Livelihood: Station Equipment Inspection · Records Assistance\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Myeongdong Station Equipment Operator\n**Life.** Born on 2064-08-06, Bang Seokdam handles the work of Myeongdong Station Equipment Operator at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Bang Seokdam handles the work of Myeongdong Station Equipment Operator at the Myeongdong Station office in Myeongdong administrative district. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or tenure.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Equipment Operator. Handles station equipment inspection and records assistance.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the warehouse blockade and the blackout overlapped, Bang Seokdam locked emergency power to the civilian ration compartments and switched off the military-provisions lighting. The measures and testimony of that day were entered together on the corresponding line of the station ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Matches output to Pan Hyodam''s warehouse depot, and shares power with the plaza lighting of Cheon Solbit. Has submitted to Nam Yungyeong''s public auction, but has refused concealed power distribution.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n