d into the Garak crates. She consults Oh Haerin''s market broadcasts only during auction hours.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Maeriul first cross-checks the station supplies inspection and assistance records in her work as Myeongdong Station Supplies Inspection Clerk.\n\n- Livelihood: Station Supplies Inspection · Assistant\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Myeongdong Station Supplies Inspection Clerk\n**Life.** Born on 2101-06-10, Mae Riul serves as the Myeongdong Station Supplies Inspection Clerk at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Mae Riul serves as the Myeongdong Station Supplies Inspection Clerk at the Myeongdong Station office in Myeongdong administrative district. This work reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or a right of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Supplies Inspection Clerk. She handles station supplies inspection and assistance.\n\n**Relations.** She divides the produce scales and freezer compartments with Dong Yesol, and hopes that Mae Haru''s list of contaminated medicine will not get mixed into the Garak crates. She consults Oh Haerin''s market broadcasts only during auction hours.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 20 | Force −15 | Materialism 60 | Community −30 | Principle −50 | Publicity −15 | Qualification −10 | Decentralization 5 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Possessiveness 20 | Risk −35 | Display 30 | Persistence −20 | Orientation: bisexual | Union: contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Mae Riul","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Yesol","basis":"Shares the cold-storage compartment with Dong Yesol''s produce scales, and"},{"from":"Mae Riul","type":"Contract","to":"Mae Haru","basis":"Hopes that Mae Haru''s list of contaminated-medicine victims will not get mixed in with the Garak crates."}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0392","name":"매리울","title":"냉동재고 유찰 관계자","position":"명동역 물자 검수 담당","characterId":"K391","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"역 물자 검수·보좌","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-15#인물-매리울","detailRoute":"/people/person-0392","birthDate":"2101-06-10","birthday":"06-10","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"stock-inspection","name":"재고 검수","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"이상 재고 보류","description":"오염 약과 식량 상자가 섞이는 것을 경계한다.","behavior":"확인된 선택: 이상 재고 보류. 다른 상황까지 불변 성향으로 확정하지 않는다.","stress":"부패 징후 때 유통을 멈추는 쪽으로 기울 수 있다.","relationship":"동예솔과 냉동 칸을 나누고 오해린 방송은 제한적으로 참고한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"handover-continuity","name":"기록 단절 경계","description":"직함은 냉동재고 유찰 관계자.","behavior":"맡은 기록과 서명의 연결을 확인하려 한다.","stress":"","relationship":"동예솔과 냉동 칸을 나누고 오해린 방송은 제한적으로 참고한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"오염 약과 식량 상자가 섞이는 것을 경계한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b9e4-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 매씨","crest":"clan-crests/b9e4-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":20,"무력":-15,"물질":60,"공동":-30,"원칙":-50,"공개":-15,"자격":-10,"분산":5,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":20,"위험":-35,"과시":30,"지속":-20,"지향"