chase back out of grudge.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"Beom Chaeon first cross-checks the relief distribution and station record-keeping files in her work as Myeongdong Station''s relief distribution clerk.\n\n- Livelihood: Relief Distribution · Station Records Keeper\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Myeongdong Station Relief Distribution Clerk\n**Life.** Born on 2067-11-18, Beom Chaeon serves as Myeongdong Station Relief Distribution Clerk at the Myeongdong Station office in the winter.\n- Beom Chaeon serves as Myeongdong Station Relief Distribution Clerk at the Myeongdong Station office in Myeongdong administrative dong. This work reference point does not establish a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Myeongdong Station Relief Distribution Clerk. She handles relief distribution and safekeeping of the station''s voting records.\n\n**Relationships.** She shares Ra Jinu''s stock ledger and the crowd queue. She sends Bae Ujin''s military grain pre-purchase back out of grudge.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness 25 | Force −5 | Material 45 | Communal −15 | Principle −40 | Publicity −20 | Credentials 5 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 30 | Risk −5 | Display −20 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: opposite sex | Union: monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Beom Chaeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Jinu","basis":"splits the crowd line with Ra Jinu''s inventory ledger, and"},{"from":"Beom Chaeon","type":"Contract","to":"Heung Daon","basis":""}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0394","name":"범채온","title":"군량 징발 인파 대표","position":"명동역 구휼 배분 담당","characterId":"K393","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"구휼 배분·역 기록 보관","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-15#인물-범채온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0394","b