consults Baek On’s citizenship list.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Publishes voter lists and attendance but deletes family fields after a hostage-list leak. Opens ratification voting only after forms and audits arrive.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c548-c21c-d765","name":"Sunheung An Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c548-c21c-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-30,"Openness":40,"Force":-30,"Material":0,"Communal":10,"Principle":30,"Public":35,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":30,"Display":-5,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Voter Roll · Attendance Disclosure · Ratification Vote Management","Affiliation":"Arc","Community Role":"Guild Member","Duty":"Guild Members'' Election Commission Clerk","Values":"Authority −30 | Openness 40 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Communal 10 | Principle 30 | Transparency 35 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving 15 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk 30 | Display −5 | Endurance −10 | Orientation None | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2086-06-13, An Taegyeong serves as clerk of the Union Member Election Commission at the Suseo Station Union Workshop in the winter. An checks direct union member elections and public vote records, and distinguishes offices conferred by the Government from community duties.\n- An Taegyeong serves as clerk of the Union Member Election Commission at the Suseo Station Union Workshop in Suseo-dong. This work reference point does not establish residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or possession rights.","Duty":"The community role is guild member, and the duty is patrol rotation roster clerk. This duty is an internal function of the Arc and is neither a Government of the Republic of Korea civil service office nor a rank.","Anecdote":"In 2125, when the hostage roll leaked, An erased the family column first. That day''s actions and testimony remain in the same work ledger.","Relationships":"An Taegyeong''s existing relationship records are as follows: An coordinates dual-assembly practice with Ha Seojin and Gwak Eunjae, consults Baek On''s independent citizenship register for lottery eligibility.","Goals":"An Taegyeong seeks to keep the signing, handover, and disclosure procedures of the Union Member Election Commission clerk''s work verifiable in the Suseo Station union ledger.","Fear":"The signature or handover records of the Union Member Election Commission clerk''s work being altered, so that An Taegyeong''s scope of responsibility and the union members'' disclosure procedures collapse together.","Intervention":"An Taegyeong can cross-check the relevant signatures and handover times and make the records public, but cannot grant new offices, ranks, rights, or holdings."},"biography":"At the Samseong 2-dong workshop in the winter, An Taegyeong first cross-checks the patrol shift roster clerk''s work records against the shift signatures. On days when fuel, food and patrol schedules overlap, An leaves the receipt times and handover order in the same ledger.\n\n- Livelihood: Voter Roll · Attendance Disclosure · Ratification Vote Management\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Community Role: Guild Member\n- Duty: Guild Members'' Election Commission Clerk\n**Life.** Born on 2086-06-13, An Taegyeong serves as clerk of the Union Member Election Commission at the Suseo Station Union Workshop in the winter. An checks direct union member elections and public vote records, and distinguishes offices conferred by the Government from community duties.\n- An Taegyeong serves as clerk of the Union Member Election Commission at the Suseo Station Union Workshop in Suseo-dong. This work reference point does not establish residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or possession rights.\n\n**Duty.** The community role is guild member, and the duty is patrol rotation roster clerk. This duty is an internal function of the Arc and is neither a Government of the Republic of Korea civil service office nor a rank.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, when the hostage roll leaked, An erased the family column first. That day''s actions and testimony remain in the same work ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** An Taegyeong''s existing relationship records are as follows: An coordinates dual-assembly practice with Ha Seojin and Gwak Eunjae, consults Baek On''s independent citizenship register for lottery eligibility.\n\n**Goal.** An Taegyeong seeks to keep the signing, handover, and disclosure procedures of the Union Member Election Commission clerk''s work verifiable in the Suseo Station union ledger.\n\n**Fear.** The signature or handover records of the Union Member Election Commission clerk''s work being altered, so that An Taegyeong''s scope of responsibility and the union members'' disclosure procedures collapse together.\n\n**Intervention.** An Taegyeong can cross-check the relevant signatures and handover times and make the records public, but cannot grant new offices, ranks, rights, or holdings.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −30 | Openness 40 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Communal 10 | Principle 30 | Transparency 35 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk 30 | Display −5 | Endurance −10 | Orientation None | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"An Taegyeong","type":"Contract","to":"Ha Seojin","basis":"Aligns dual-council practice with the contract clerk"}],"incoming":[{"from":"An Kamin","type":"Contract","to":"An Taegyeong","basis":"An Kamin hands An Taegyeong a duplicate-and-omission sheet that compares each faction''s union member roster against the original. When disclosing the voting roll and attendance, An Taegyeong checks those discrepancies so that faction rosters do not stand in for the voting record of the union membership as a whole."},{"from":"Pan Jisol","type":"Command","to":"An Taegyeong","basis":"takes orders to carry An Taegyeong''s lottery slips only in sealed condition, and"},{"from":"Bang Mabit","type":"Command","to":"An Taegyeong","basis":"carries out An Taegyeong''s lottery attendance on the platform, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0404","name":"안태경","title":"시민추첨회의 서기","position":"조합원 선거관리회 서기","characterId":"K403","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"투표 명부·출석 공개·비준 투표 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-16#인물-안태경","detailRoute":"/people/person-0404","birthDate":"2086-06-13","birthday":"06-13","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"voter-register-control","name":"투표 명부 관리","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"대표성과 보호를 구분","description":"명부와 출석을 공개하되 인질 명부 유출 때 가족 칸을 지웠다. 서식과 감사표가 와야 비준 투표를 연다.","behavior":"확인된 선택: 대표성과 보호를 구분. 다른 상황까지 불변 성향으로 확정하지 않는다.","stress":"호적 혼입 때 투표를 늦출 수 있다.","relationship":"하서진과 곽은재의 자료를 기다리며 백온의 시민권 명부를 참고한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"handover-continuity","name":"기록 단절 경계","description":"직함은 시민추첨회의 서기.","behavior":"맡은 기록과 서명의 연결을 확인하려 한다.","stress":"","relationship":"하서진과 곽은재의 자료를 기다리며 백온의 시민권 명부를 참고한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"명부와 출석을 공개하되 인질 명부 유출 때 가족 칸을 지웠다. 서식과 감사표가 와야 비준 투표를 연다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c548-c21c-d765","name":"순흥 안씨","crest":"clan-crests/c548-c21c-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-30,"개방":40,"무력":-30,"물질":0,"공동":10,"원칙":30,"공개":35,"자격":20,"분산":35,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":30,"위험":30,"과시":-5,"지속":-10,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"투표 명부·출석 공개·비준 투표 관리","소속":"Arc","공동체 역할":"조합원","직무":"조합원 선거관리회 서기","가치관":"권위 −30 | 개방 40 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 10 | 원칙 30 | 공개 35 | 자격 20 | 분산 35 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 30 | 위험 30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 −10 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2086-06-13에 태어난 안태경은 겨울의 수서역 조합 작업장에서 조합원 선거관리회 서기 업무를 맡는다. 조합원 직접선거와 공개 표결 기록을 확인하며 대한민국 정부가 수여하는 관직과 공동체 직무를 구분한다.\n- 안태경은 수서동의 수서역 조합 작업장에서 조합원 선거관리회 서기 업무를 맡는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","직무":"공동체 역할은 조합원이며 직무는 순찰 교대 명부 서기이다. 이 직무는 Arc 내부 기능이고 대한민국 정부 공무원 관직이나 품계가 아니다.","일화":"2125년 인질 명부가 새어 나가자 가족 칸부터 지웠다. 그날의 조치와 증언은 같은 업무 장부에 남아 있다.","관계":"안태경의 기존 관계 기록은 다음과 같다. 하서진·곽은재와 이중 의회 실무를 맞추고, 백온의 독립 시민권 명부를 추첨 자격에 참고한다.","목표":"안태경은 조합원 선거관리회 서기 업무의 서명·인계·공개 절차를 수서역 조합 장부에서 검증 가능하게 유지하려 한다.","공포":"조합원 선거관리회 서기 업무의 서명이나 인계 기록이 바뀌어 안태경의 책임 범위와 조합원 공개 절차가 함께 무너지는 것.","개입":"안태경은 관련 서명과 인계 시각을 대조하고 기록을 공개할 수 있지만 새 관직·품계·권리·영지를 부여할 수는 없다."},"biography":"안태경은 겨울의 삼성2동 작업장에서 순찰 교대 명부 서기 업무 기록과 교대 서명을 먼저 대조한다. 연료·식량·순찰 일정이 겹치는 날에는 접수 시각과 인계 순서를 같은 장부에 남긴다.\n\n- 생업: 투표 명부·출석 공개·비준 투표 관리\n- 소속: Arc\n- 공동체 역할: 조합원\n- 직무: 조합원 선거관리회 서기\n**생애.** 2086-06-13에 태어난 안태경은 겨울의 수서역 조합 작업장에서 조합원 선거관리회 서기 업무를 맡는다. 조합원 직접선거와 공개 표결 기록을 확인하며 대한민국 정부가 수여하는 관직과 공동체 직무를 구분한다.\n- 안태경은 수서동의 수서역 조합 작업장에서 조합원 선거관리회 서기 업무를 맡는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**직무.** 공동체 역할은 조합원이며 직무는 순찰 교대 명부 서기이다. 이 직무는 Arc 내부 기능이고 대한민국 정부 공무원 관직이나 품계가 아니다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 인질 명부가 새어 나가자 가족 칸부터 지웠다. 그날의 조치와 증언은 같은 업무 장부에 남아 있다.\n\n**관계.** 안태경의 기존 관계 기록은 다음과 같다. 하서진·곽은재와 이중 의회 실무를 맞추고, 백온의 독립 시민권 명부를 추첨 자격에 참고한다.\n\n**목표.** 안태경은 조합원 선거관리회 서기 업무의 서명·인계·공개 절차를 수서역 조합 장부에서 검증 가능하게 유지하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 조합원 선거관리회 서기 업무의 서명이나 인계 기록이 바뀌어 안태경의 책임 범위와 조합원 공개 절차가 함께 무너지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 안태경은 관련 서명과 인계 시각을 대조하고 기록을 공개할 수 있지만 새 관직·품계·권리·영지를 부여할 수는 없다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −30 | 개방 40 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 10 | 원칙 30 | 공개 35 | 자격 20 | 분산 35 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 30 | 위험 30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 −10 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"안태경","type":"계약","to":"하서진","basis":"이중 의회 실무를 계약 서기와 맞춤"}],"incoming":[{"from":"안카민","type":"계약","to":"안태경","basis":"안카민은 파벌별 조합원 명단을 원본과 대조한 중복·누락표를 안태경에게 넘긴다. 안태경은 투표 명부와 출석을 공개할 때 그 차이를 확인해, 파벌 명단이 조합원 전체의 투표 기록을 대신하지 않게 한다."},{"from":"판지솔","type":"지휘","to":"안태경","basis":"안태경의 추첨 쪽지를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"방마빛","type":"지휘","to":"안태경","basis":"안태경의 추첨 출석을 승강장에서 집행하고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0405', 'c218-d55c-c591', '{"id":"person-0405","name":"Su Neulgyeol","title":"Suseo Depot Mechanic, Practical Aide to Eun Boram","position":"Suseo Depot Mechanic, Practical Aide to Eun Boram","characterId":"K404","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Vehicle maintenance recommendations, posting exam scores, managing dispatch switches","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-16#Person-Su-Neulgyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0405","birthDate":"2095-05-09","birthday":"05-09","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"defect-reporting","name":"Maintenance defect reporting","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"Protects public testing","description":"Has a recorded pre-derailment defect report and posts examination scores.","behavior":"Shown in the confirmed choice: Protects public testing. It is not established as an invariable disposition in other situations.","stress":"","relationship":"Supports Eun Boram’s rules in practice and shares tools with Won Choon.","effects":[]},{"id":"handover-continuity","name":"Concern for record continuity","description":"Turns recommendations of skilled staff for the Suseo Station Union Vehicle Workshop into public skill tests and maintenance signatures, breaking the factions'' monopoly on recommendations before the stationmaster''s countersignature.","behavior":"Seeks to check the continuity of assigned records and signatures.","stress":"","relationship":"Supports Eun Boram’s rules in practice and shares tools with Won Choon.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Has a recorded pre-derailment defect report and posts examination scores.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"Hanyang Su Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":35,"Force":-20,"Material":0,"Communal":5,"Principle":35,"Public":25,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":5,"Display":30,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Vehicle maintenance recommendations, posting exam scores, managing dispatch switches","Affiliation":"Arc","Community Role":"Guild Member","Duty":"Suseo Station Union Vehicle Workshop Mechanic, Practical Aide to Eun Boram","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 35 | Force −20 | Materiality 0 | Communal 5 | Principle 35 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 40 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 20","Desires":"Longing 15 | Monopoly 0 | Risk 5 | Display 30 | Persistence 25 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2095-05-09, Su Neulgyeol works at the Suseo Station Guild workshop in the winter as Working-Level Aide to Eun Boram, Mechanic at the Suseo Station Guild Vehicle Maintenance Shop. Su checks the members'' direct elections and public vote records, and distinguishes offices conferred by the Government from communal duties.\n- Su Neulgyeol works at the Suseo Station Guild workshop in Suseo-dong as Working-Level Aide to Eun Boram, Mechanic at the Suseo Station Guild Vehicle Maintenance Shop. This duty reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or tenure rights.","Duty":"The communal role is guild member, and the duty is Working-Level Aide to Eun Boram, Mechanic at the Suseo Station Guild Vehicle Maintenance Shop. This duty is an internal function of the Arc and is not an office in the civil service of the Government or a rank.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Su Neulgyeol''s existing relationship records are as follows. Su is a protégé who supports Eun Boram''s recommendation rules in the field, and shares tools with Won Choon''s base duty. Su reflects Jeong Hojun''s plan for a joint technical institute director on the exam blackboard.","Goals":"Su Neulgyeol seeks to keep the signatures, handovers, and public procedures of the duty of Working-Level Aide to Eun Boram, Mechanic at the Suseo Station Guild Vehicle Maintenance Shop, verifiable in the Suseo Station Guild ledger.","Fear":"The signature or handover records of the duty of Working-Level Aide to Eun Boram, Mechanic at the Suseo Station Guild Vehicle Maintenance Shop, being altered, so that Su Neulgyeol''s scope of responsibility and the members'' public procedures collapse together.","Intervention":"Su Neulgyeol can cross-check the relevant signatures and handover times and make the records public, but cannot grant new offices, ranks, rights, or holdings."},"biography":"At the Suseo-dong workshop in the winter, Su Neulgyeol first cross-checks the duty records of the machine-body and cart mechanic against the shift signatures. On days when fuel, food and patrol schedules overlap, Su records the receipt times and handover order in the same ledger.\n\n- Livelihood: Vehicle maintenance recommendations, posting exam scores, managing dispatch switches\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Communal role: guild member\n- Duty: Working-Level Aide to Eun Boram, Mechanic at the Suseo Station Guild Vehicle Maintenance Shop\n**Life.** Born on 2095-05-09, Su Neulgyeol works at the Suseo Station Guild workshop in the winter as Working-Level Aide to Eun Boram, Mechanic at the Suseo Station Guild Vehicle Maintenance Shop. Su checks the members'' direct elections and public vote records, and distinguishes offices conferred by the Government from communal duties.\n- Su Neulgyeol works at the Suseo Station Guild workshop in Suseo-dong as Working-Level Aide to Eun Boram, Mechanic at the Suseo Station Guild Vehicle Maintenance Shop. This duty reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or tenure rights.\n\n**Duty.** The communal role is guild member, and the duty is Working-Level Aide to Eun Boram, Mechanic at the Suseo Station Guild Vehicle Maintenance Shop. This duty is an internal function of the Arc and is not an office in the civil service of the Government or a rank.\n\n**Relationships.** Su Neulgyeol''s existing relationship records are as follows. Su is a protégé who supports Eun Boram''s recommendation rules in the field, and shares tools with Won Choon''s base duty. Su reflects Jeong Hojun''s plan for a joint technical institute director on the exam blackboard.\n\n**Goal.** Su Neulgyeol seeks to keep the signatures, handovers, and public procedures of the duty of Working-Level Aide to Eun Boram, Mechanic at the Suseo Station Guild Vehicle Maintenance Shop, verifiable in the Suseo Station Guild ledger.\n\n**Fear.** The signature or handover records of the duty of Working-Level Aide to Eun Boram, Mechanic at the Suseo Station Guild Vehicle Maintenance Shop, being altered, so that Su Neulgyeol''s scope of responsibility and the members'' public procedures collapse together.\n\n**Intervention.** Su Neulgyeol can cross-check the relevant signatures and handover times and make the records public, but cannot grant new offices, ranks, rights, or holdings.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 35 | Force −20 | Materiality 0 | Communal 5 | Principle 35 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 40 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Longing 15 | Monopoly 0 | Risk 5 | Display 30 | Persistence 25 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Su Neulgyeol","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Eun Boram","basis":"is a protégé who supports Eun Boram''s recommendation rules on the ground, and"},{"from":"Su Neulgyeol","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Won Choon","basis":"Shares tools with Won Choon''s base duty"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Won Choon","type":"Contract","to":"Su Neulgyeol","basis":"Shares Su Neulgyeol''s maintenance bay and duty shifts, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0405","name":"수늘결","title":"수서 기지 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자","position":"수서 기지 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K404","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"차량정비 추천·시험 점수 게시·출고 스위치 관리","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-16#인물-수늘결","detailRoute":"/people/person-0405","birthDate":"2095-05-09","birthday":"05-09","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"defect-reporting","name":"정비 결함 보고","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"공개 시험을 지킴","description":"탈선 직전 결함을 보고한 생애와 시험 점수 게시가 있다.","behavior":"확인된 선택: 공개 시험을 지킴. 다른 상황까지 불변 성향으로 확정하지 않는다.","stress":"","relationship":"은보람의 규칙을 실무로 받치며 원초온과 공구를 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"handover-continuity","name":"기록 단절 경계","description":"수서역 조합 차량정비소 전문 인력 추천을 공개 숙련 시험과 정비 서명으로 바꿔 역장의 확인 서명 앞에서 파벌의 독점 추천을 깨뜨린다.","behavior":"맡은 기록과 서명의 연결을 확인하려 한다.","stress":"","relationship":"은보람의 규칙을 실무로 받치며 원초온과 공구를 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"탈선 직전 결함을 보고한 생애와 시험 점수 게시가 있다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"한양 수씨","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":35,"무력":-20,"물질":0,"공동":5,"원칙":35,"공개":25,"자격":40,"분산":45,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":0,"위험":5,"과시":30,"지속":25,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"차량정비 추천·시험 점수 게시·출고 스위치 관리","소속":"Arc","공동체 역할":"조합원","직무":"수서역 조합 차량정비소 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 35 | 무력 −20 | 물질 0 | 공동 5 | 원칙 35 | 공개 25 | 자격 40 | 분산 45 | 변혁 20","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 0 | 위험 5 | 과시 30 | 지속 25 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2095-05-09에 태어난 수늘결은 겨울의 수서역 조합 작업장에서 수서역 조합 차량정비소 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자 업무를 맡는다. 조합원 직접선거와 공개 표결 기록을 확인하며 대한민국 정부가 수여하는 관직과 공동체 직무를 구분한다.\n- 수늘결은 수서동의 수서역 조합 작업장에서 수서역 조합 차량정비소 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자 업무를 맡는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","직무":"공동체 역할은 조합원이며 직무는 수서역 조합 차량정비소 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자이다. 이 직무는 Arc 내부 기능이고 대한민국 정부 공무원 관직이나 품계가 아니다.","일화":"","관계":"수늘결의 기존 관계 기록은 다음과 같다. 은보람의 추천 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 제자이고, 원초온의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다. 정호준의 공동기술원장 구상을 시험 칠판에 반영한다.","목표":"수늘결은 수서역 조합 차량정비소 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자 업무의 서명·인계·공개 절차를 수서역 조합 장부에서 검증 가능하게 유지하려 한다.","공포":"수서역 조합 차량정비소 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자 업무의 서명이나 인계 기록이 바뀌어 수늘결의 책임 범위와 조합원 공개 절차가 함께 무너지는 것.","개입":"수늘결은 관련 서명과 인계 시각을 대조하고 기록을 공개할 수 있지만 새 관직·품계·권리·영지를 부여할 수는 없다."},"biography":"수늘결은 겨울의 수서동 작업장에서 기계 몸·수레 정비사 업무 기록과 교대 서명을 먼저 대조한다. 연료·식량·순찰 일정이 겹치는 날에는 접수 시각과 인계 순서를 같은 장부에 남긴다.\n\n- 생업: 차량정비 추천·시험 점수 게시·출고 스위치 관리\n- 소속: Arc\n- 공동체 역할: 조합원\n- 직무: 수서역 조합 차량정비소 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2095-05-09에 태어난 수늘결은 겨울의 수서역 조합 작업장에서 수서역 조합 차량정비소 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자 업무를 맡는다. 조합원 직접선거와 공개 표결 기록을 확인하며 대한민국 정부가 수여하는 관직과 공동체 직무를 구분한다.\n- 수늘결은 수서동의 수서역 조합 작업장에서 수서역 조합 차량정비소 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자 업무를 맡는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**직무.** 공동체 역할은 조합원이며 직무는 수서역 조합 차량정비소 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자이다. 이 직무는 Arc 내부 기능이고 대한민국 정부 공무원 관직이나 품계가 아니다.\n\n**관계.** 수늘결의 기존 관계 기록은 다음과 같다. 은보람의 추천 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 제자이고, 원초온의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다. 정호준의 공동기술원장 구상을 시험 칠판에 반영한다.\n\n**목표.** 수늘결은 수서역 조합 차량정비소 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자 업무의 서명·인계·공개 절차를 수서역 조합 장부에서 검증 가능하게 유지하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 수서역 조합 차량정비소 정비사, 은보람의 실무 담당자 업무의 서명이나 인계 기록이 바뀌어 수늘결의 책임 범위와 조합원 공개 절차가 함께 무너지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 수늘결은 관련 서명과 인계 시각을 대조하고 기록을 공개할 수 있지만 새 관직·품계·권리·영지를 부여할 수는 없다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 35 | 무력 −20 | 물질 0 | 공동 5 | 원칙 35 | 공개 25 | 자격 40 | 분산 45 | 변혁 20\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 0 | 위험 5 | 과시 30 | 지속 25 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"수늘결","type":"스승과 제자","to":"은보람","basis":"은보람의 추천 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 제자이고"},{"from":"수늘결","type":"스승과 제자","to":"원초온","basis":"원초온의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"원초온","type":"계약","to":"수늘결","basis":"수늘결의 정비 창과 당직을 나누고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0406', 'c120-bcf4-c131', '{"id":"person-0406","name":"Seon Chobyeol","title":"Nonhyeon 2-dong food and firewood porter","position":"Nonhyeon 2-dong food and firewood porter","characterId":"K405","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Hauling food and firewood around Nonhyeon 2-dong","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11680","stateName":"Gangnam-gu","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-16#inmul-seon-chobyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0406","birthDate":"2101-08-31","birthday":"08-31","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"document-transport","name":"Document transport control","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"Withholds release before comparison","description":"When loads pile up on snowed-in routes, he matches weights and turns first and only then sends them out. He writes down the fuel and food shares to check them.","behavior":"Shown in the confirmed choice: Withholds release before comparison. It is not established as an invariable disposition in other situations.","stress":"May stop transport over inconsistent boxes.","relationship":"Shares turns with neighbors hauling the same loads and shows the carry log to the station duty staff.","effects":[]},{"id":"handover-continuity","name":"Concern for record continuity","description":"Has the carrying turn and release time written in only one public transport ledger, so that neighbors can check where a load went against the same ledger.","behavior":"Seeks to check the continuity of assigned records and signatures.","stress":"That the ledger is swapped, the whereabouts of loads no longer match, and the neighbors'' food and firewood shares vanish.","relationship":"Shares turns with neighbors hauling the same loads and shows the carry log to the station duty staff.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"When loads pile up on snowed-in routes, he matches weights and turns first and only then sends them out. He writes down the fuel and food shares to check them.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11680-S16","name":{"ko":"Gangnam-gu Arc District Domain Direct Holdings"},"holderPersonId":"K405","directLiegePersonId":"K423","stateId":"S16","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1168053100","name":"Nonhyeon 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1168054500","name":"Apgujeong-dong"},{"id":"region:1168056500","name":"Cheongdam-dong"},{"id":"region:1168058000","name":"Samseong 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1168059000","name":"Samseong 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1168060000","name":"Daechi 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1168063000","name":"Daechi 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1168064000","name":"Yeoksam 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1168065000","name":"Yeoksam 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1168065500","name":"Dogok 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1168065600","name":"Dogok 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1168066000","name":"Gaepo 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1168067000","name":"Gaepo 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1168067500","name":"Gaepo 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1168069000","name":"Gaepo 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1168070000","name":"Segok-dong"},{"id":"region:1168072000","name":"Ilwonbon-dong"},{"id":"region:1168073000","name":"Ilwon 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1168075000","name":"Suseo-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11680-S16","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11680-S16","name":"Gangnam-gu Arc District","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K405","basis":"Opening administrative-scale group gu:11680 (district) allocation · Deterministic candidate selection","stateId":"S16","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s04","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1168053100","region:1168054500","region:1168056500","region:1168058000","region:1168059000","region:1168060000","region:1168063000","region:1168064000","region:1168065000","region:1168065500","region:1168065600","region:1168066000","region:1168067000","region:1168067500","region:1168069000","region:1168070000","region:1168072000","region:1168073000","region:1168075000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s04","name":"Arc","holderPersonId":"K423"}}],"clan":{"id":"c120-bcf4-c131","name":"Seon Clan of Boseong","crest":"clan-crests/c120-bcf4-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":40,"Force":-35,"Material":30,"Communal":15,"Principle":25,"Public":20,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":-30,"Display":-10,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Hauling food and firewood around Nonhyeon 2-dong","Affiliation":"Arc","Community Role":"Ordinary Citizen","Duty":"Hauling food and firewood around Nonhyeon 2-dong","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −35 | Materiality 30 | Communal 15 | Principle 25 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 40 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Longing 25 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −30 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: Heterosexual | Union: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2101-08-31, Seon Chobyeol carries loads of food and firewood through the alleys of Nonhyeon 2-dong in the winter. Seon learns the carrying routes over snow and ice, and distinguishes offices conferred by the Government from communal duties.\nSeon Chobyeol carries loads of food and firewood in Nonhyeon 2-dong. This duty reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or tenure rights.","Duty":"The communal role is ordinary citizen, and carrying everyday cargo is mutual help among neighbors. This work is not an office or a rank in the civil service of the Government.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Seon Chobyeol sorts out and hands over the order of loads on the same route with Ha Seojin, and shares carrying turns with Yeong Maon. Seon owes Ha Yunmok for having shown the carry log first.","Goals":"Seon Chobyeol seeks to keep the carrying routes open so that food and firewood reach each neighboring household in Nonhyeon 2-dong on time, without interruption throughout the winter.","Fear":"That loads of food and firewood are cut off on the road in the bitter cold so that neighbors starve or freeze, and that outside machines are drawn closer by the light and heat of the loads being carried.","Intervention":"Seon Chobyeol can cross-check the relevant signatures and handover times and make the records public, but cannot grant new offices, ranks, rights, or holdings."},"biography":"In the winter around Nonhyeon 2-dong, Seon Chobyeol carries food and firewood loads and first cross-checks weight and turn on paper. On days when loads overlap, the intake time and handover order go into the same ledger.\n\n- Livelihood: Hauling food and firewood around Nonhyeon 2-dong\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Community Role: Ordinary Citizen\n- Duty: Hauling food and firewood around Nonhyeon 2-dong\n**Life.** Born on 2101-08-31, Seon Chobyeol carries loads of food and firewood through the alleys of Nonhyeon 2-dong in the winter. Seon learns the carrying routes over snow and ice, and distinguishes offices conferred by the Government from communal duties.\nSeon Chobyeol carries loads of food and firewood in Nonhyeon 2-dong. This duty reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, holding, or tenure rights.\n\n**Duty.** The communal role is ordinary citizen, and carrying everyday cargo is mutual help among neighbors. This work is not an office or a rank in the civil service of the Government.\n\n**Relationships.** Seon Chobyeol sorts out and hands over the order of loads on the same route with Ha Seojin, and shares carrying turns with Yeong Maon. Seon owes Ha Yunmok for having shown the carry log first.\n\n**Goal.** Seon Chobyeol seeks to keep the carrying routes open so that food and firewood reach each neighboring household in Nonhyeon 2-dong on time, without interruption throughout the winter.\n\n**Fear.** That loads of food and firewood are cut off on the road in the bitter cold so that neighbors starve or freeze, and that outside machines are drawn closer by the light and heat of the loads being carried.\n\n**Intervention.** Seon Chobyeol can cross-check the relevant signatures and handover times and make the records public, but cannot grant new offices, ranks, rights, or holdings.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −35 | Materialism 30 | Communal 15 | Principle 25 | Transparency 20 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 40 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk −30 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seon Chobyeol","type":"Command","to":"Ha Seojin","basis":"Hands over the sorted order of loads on the same route, and"},{"from":"Seon Chobyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Yeong Maon","basis":"Shares carrying turns with Yeong Maon"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0406","name":"선초별","title":"논현2동 식량·장작 운반","position":"논현2동 식량·장작 짐꾼","characterId":"K405","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"논현2동 식량·장작 운반","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11680","stateName":"강남구","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-16#인물-선초별","detailRoute":"/people/person-0406","birthDate":"2101-08-31","birthday":"08-31","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"document-transport","name":"문서 운송 통제","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"비교 전 반출 보류","description":"눈이 쌓인 길에서 짐이 한꺼번에 몰리면 무게와 차례를 먼저 맞춘 뒤에 반출한다. 연료와 식량의 몫은 종이에 적어 확인한다.","behavior":"확인된 선택: 비교 전 반출 보류. 다른 상황까지 불변 성향으로 확정하지 않는다.","stress":"불일치 상자 앞에서 운송을 멈출 수 있다.","relationship":"같은 짐을 나르는 이웃과 순번을 나누고, 역 당직자에게 반출 일지를 보여 준다.","effects":[]},{"id":"handover-continuity","name":"기록 단절 경계","description":"운반 순번과 반출 시각을 공개 운송 장부 한 곳에만 적게 해, 이웃이 같은 장부로 짐의 행방을 확인하게 한다.","behavior":"맡은 기록과 서명의 연결을 확인하려 한다.","stress":"장부가 바뀌어 짐의 행방이 어긋나고 이웃의 식량과 땔감 몫이 사라지는 것.","relationship":"같은 짐을 나르는 이웃과 순번을 나누고, 역 당직자에게 반출 일지를 보여 준다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"눈이 쌓인 길에서 짐이 한꺼번에 몰리면 무게와 차례를 먼저 맞춘 뒤에 반출한다. 연료와 식량의 몫은 종이에 적어 확인한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11680-S16","name":{"ko":"강남구 Arc 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K405","directLiegePersonId":"K423","stateId":"S16","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1168053100","name":"논현2동"},{"id":"region:1168054500","name":"압구정동"},{"id":"region:1168056500","name":"청담동"},{"id":"region:1168058000","name":"삼성1동"},{"id":"region:1168059000","name":"삼성2동"},{"id":"region:1168060000","name":"대치1동"},{"id":"region:1168063000","name":"대치4동"},{"id":"region:1168064000","name":"역삼1동"},{"id":"region:1168065000","name":"역삼2동"},{"id":"region:1168065500","name":"도곡1동"},{"id":"region:1168065600","name":"도곡2동"},{"id":"region:1168066000","name":"개포1동"},{"id":"region:1168067000","name":"개포2동"},{"id":"region:1168067500","name":"개포3동"},{"id":"region:1168069000","name":"개포4동"},{"id":"region:1168070000","name":"세곡동"},{"id":"region:1168072000","name":"일원본동"},{"id":"region:1168073000","name":"일원1동"},{"id":"region:1168075000","name":"수서동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11680-S16","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11680-S16","name":"강남구 Arc","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K405","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11680(district) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S16","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s04","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1168053100","region:1168054500","region:1168056500","region:1168058000","region:1168059000","region:1168060000","region:1168063000","region:1168064000","region:1168065000","region:1168065500","region:1168065600","region:1168066000","region:1168067000","region:1168067500","region:1168069000","region:1168070000","region:1168072000","region:1168073000","region:1168075000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s04","name":"Arc","holderPersonId":"K423"}}],"clan":{"id":"c120-bcf4-c131","name":"보성 선씨","crest":"clan-crests/c120-bcf4-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":40,"무력":-35,"물질":30,"공동":15,"원칙":25,"공개":20,"자격":10,"분산":40,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":5,"위험":-30,"과시":-10,"지속":35,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"논현2동 식량·장작 운반","소속":"Arc","공동체 역할":"일반 시민","직무":"논현2동 식량·장작 운반","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −35 | 물질 30 | 공동 15 | 원칙 25 | 공개 20 | 자격 10 | 분산 40 | 변혁 15","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 5 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2101-08-31에 태어난 선초별은 겨울의 논현2동 골목에서 식량과 장작 짐을 나르는 일을 맡는다. 눈길과 얼음길의 운반 경로를 익히며 대한민국 정부가 수여하는 관직과 공동체 직무를 구분한다.\n선초별은 논현2동에서 식량과 장작 짐을 나르는 일을 맡는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","직무":"공동체 역할은 일반 시민이며 생활 화물을 나르는 일은 이웃 사이의 품앗이이다. 이 일은 대한민국 정부 공무원 관직이나 품계가 아니다.","일화":"","관계":"선초별은 같은 길의 짐 순번을 하서진과 정리해 넘기고, 영마온과 운반 순번을 나눈다. 하윤목에게는 반출 일지를 먼저 보여 준 신세가 있다.","목표":"선초별은 논현2동의 식량과 장작이 겨울 내내 끊기지 않고 이웃 집마다 제때 닿도록 운반 길을 지키려 한다.","공포":"혹한 속에 식량과 장작 짐이 길에서 끊겨 이웃이 굶거나 얼어붙는 것, 그리고 짐 나르는 불빛과 열에 이끌려 바깥 기계가 다가오는 것.","개입":"선초별은 관련 서명과 인계 시각을 대조하고 기록을 공개할 수 있지만 새 관직·품계·권리·영지를 부여할 수는 없다."},"biography":"선초별은 겨울의 논현2동 일대에서 식량과 땔감 짐을 나르며 무게와 차례를 종이에 먼저 대조한다. 짐이 겹치는 날에는 접수 시각과 인계 순서를 같은 장부에 남긴다.\n\n- 생업: 논현2동 식량·장작 운반\n- 소속: Arc\n- 공동체 역할: 일반 시민\n- 직무: 논현2동 식량·장작 운반\n**생애.** 2101-08-31에 태어난 선초별은 겨울의 논현2동 골목에서 식량과 장작 짐을 나르는 일을 맡는다. 눈길과 얼음길의 운반 경로를 익히며 대한민국 정부가 수여하는 관직과 공동체 직무를 구분한다.\n선초별은 논현2동에서 식량과 장작 짐을 나르는 일을 맡는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**직무.** 공동체 역할은 일반 시민이며 생활 화물을 나르는 일은 이웃 사이의 품앗이이다. 이 일은 대한민국 정부 공무원 관직이나 품계가 아니다.\n\n**관계.** 선초별은 같은 길의 짐 순번을 하서진과 정리해 넘기고, 영마온과 운반 순번을 나눈다. 하윤목에게는 반출 일지를 먼저 보여 준 신세가 있다.\n\n**목표.** 선초별은 논현2동의 식량과 장작이 겨울 내내 끊기지 않고 이웃 집마다 제때 닿도록 운반 길을 지키려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 혹한 속에 식량과 장작 짐이 길에서 끊겨 이웃이 굶거나 얼어붙는 것, 그리고 짐 나르는 불빛과 열에 이끌려 바깥 기계가 다가오는 것.\n\n**개입.** 선초별은 관련 서명과 인계 시각을 대조하고 기록을 공개할 수 있지만 새 관직·품계·권리·영지를 부여할 수는 없다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −35 | 물질 30 | 공동 15 | 원칙 25 | 공개 20 | 자격 10 | 분산 40 | 변혁 15\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 5 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"선초별","type":"지휘","to":"하서진","basis":"같은 길의 짐 순번을 정리해 넘기는 사이이고"},{"from":"선초별","type":"계약","to":"영마온","basis":"영마온과 운반 순번을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0407', 'c6d0-c6d0-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0407","name":"Won Saeul","title":"Doctor Visit Day Order Keeping","position":"Doctor Visit Day Order Keeping","characterId":"K406","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Posting triage charts, coordinating council first aid","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11650","stateName":"Seocho-gu","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-16#inmul-won-saeul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0407","birthDate":"2097-01-20","birthday":"01-20","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"care-queue-coordination","name":"Care queue coordination","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"Rejects exclusive beds","description":"Keeps the waiting order for visiting doctors and refused a reserved place even to people who demanded the front by claiming urgency. Clinical outcomes are unrecorded.","behavior":"Shown in the confirmed choice: Rejects exclusive beds. It is not established as an invariable disposition in other situations.","stress":"May withhold access when special treatment is demanded.","relationship":"Links Sim Yuri’s mediation room with Bang Mabit’s waiting queue.","effects":[]},{"id":"handover-continuity","name":"Concern for record continuity","description":"Keeps on-site care during the Suseo Station stationmaster''s inspection rounds.","behavior":"Seeks to check the continuity of assigned records and signatures.","stress":"That the waiting order will be pushed aside by the demands of influential neighbors, the line will scatter, and the blame will fall on him.","relationship":"Links Sim Yuri’s mediation room with Bang Mabit’s waiting queue.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Title: Doctor Visit Day Order Keeping.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11650-S16","name":{"ko":"Seocho-gu Arc District Domain Direct Holdings"},"holderPersonId":"K406","directLiegePersonId":"K423","stateId":"S16","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1165054000","name":"Jamwon-dong"},{"id":"region:1165055000","name":"Banpobon-dong"},{"id":"region:1165056000","name":"Banpo 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1165057000","name":"Banpo 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1165058000","name":"Banpo 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1165058100","name":"Banpo 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1165059000","name":"Bangbaebon-dong"},{"id":"region:1165060000","name":"Bangbae 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1165061000","name":"Bangbae 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1165062000","name":"Bangbae 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1165062100","name":"Bangbae 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1165065200","name":"Yangjae 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1165066000","name":"Naegok-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11650-S16","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11650-S16","name":"Seocho District Arc","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K406","basis":"Opening administrative-scale group gu:11650(district) allocation · deterministic candidate selection","stateId":"S16","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s04","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1165054000","region:1165055000","region:1165056000","region:1165057000","region:1165058000","region:1165058100","region:1165059000","region:1165060000","region:1165061000","region:1165062000","region:1165062100","region:1165065200","region:1165066000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s04","name":"Arc","holderPersonId":"K423"}}],"clan":{"id":"c6d0-c6d0-c8fc","name":"Won Clan of Wonju","crest":"clan-crests/c6d0-c6d0-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":30,"Force":-50,"Material":0,"Communal":10,"Principle":35,"Public":25,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":5,"Display":15,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Posting triage charts, coordinating council first aid","Affiliation":"Arc","Community Role":"Ordinary Citizen","Duty":"Doctor Visit Day Order Keeping","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 30 | Force −50 | Materialism 0 | Communal 10 | Principle 35 | Transparency 25 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 20","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk 5 | Display 15 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2097-01-20, Won Saeul helps sort the waiting order on the days a free-city doctor visits Banpo Bondong in the winter. Checking waiting-line records and signatures, Won distinguishes offices conferred by the Government from help among neighbors.\n- Won Saeul helps with order keeping on doctor visit days in Banpo Bondong. This duty reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or possession rights.","Duty":"The community role is ordinary citizen, and sorting the order on doctor visit days is help among neighbors. This is help within the Arc and is neither a public office of the Government of the Republic of Korea nor a rank.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Won Saeul''s existing relationship records are as follows. Looks after the bed next to Sim Yuri''s mediation room, and shares the waiting-room queue and line with Bang Mabit.","Goals":"Won Saeul intends to keep the signature, handover and disclosure procedures of order keeping on doctor visit days verifiable in the Banpo Bondong ledger.","Fear":"That the order records for doctor visit days will be altered, so that Won Saeul''s scope of responsibility and the order disclosed to neighbors collapse together.","Intervention":"Won Saeul can cross-check the relevant signatures and handover times and make the records public, but cannot grant new offices, ranks, rights, or holdings."},"biography":"Before anything else, Won Saeul cross-checks the order records and shift signatures for doctor visit days in Banpo Bondong in the winter. On days when fuel, food and visit schedules overlap, the intake time and handover order go into the same ledger.\n\n- Livelihood: Posting triage charts, coordinating council first aid\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Community Role: Ordinary Citizen\n- Duty: Doctor Visit Day Order Keeping\n**Life.** Born on 2097-01-20, Won Saeul helps sort the waiting order on the days a free-city doctor visits Banpo Bondong in the winter. Checking waiting-line records and signatures, Won distinguishes offices conferred by the Government from help among neighbors.\n- Won Saeul helps with order keeping on doctor visit days in Banpo Bondong. This duty reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or possession rights.\n\n**Duty.** The community role is ordinary citizen, and sorting the order on doctor visit days is help among neighbors. This is help within the Arc and is neither a public office of the Government of the Republic of Korea nor a rank.\n\n**Relationships.** Won Saeul''s existing relationship records are as follows. Looks after the bed next to Sim Yuri''s mediation room, and shares the waiting-room queue and line with Bang Mabit.\n\n**Goal.** Won Saeul intends to keep the signature, handover and disclosure procedures of order keeping on doctor visit days verifiable in the Banpo Bondong ledger.\n\n**Fear.** That the order records for doctor visit days will be altered, so that Won Saeul''s scope of responsibility and the order disclosed to neighbors collapse together.\n\n**Intervention.** Won Saeul can cross-check the relevant signatures and handover times and make the records public, but cannot grant new offices, ranks, rights, or holdings.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 30 | Force −50 | Materialism 0 | Communal 10 | Principle 35 | Transparency 25 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk 5 | Display 15 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Won Saeul","type":"Contract","to":"Sim Yuri","basis":"takes charge of the bed next to Sim Yuri''s mediation room, and"},{"from":"Won Saeul","type":"Contract","to":"Bang Mabit","basis":"Shares the waiting-room queue and line with Bang Mabit"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0407","name":"원새울","title":"의사 방문일 순서 정리","position":"의사 방문일 순서 정리","characterId":"K406","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"중증도 표 게시·회의 응급 처치 조정","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11650","stateName":"서초구","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-16#인물-원새울","detailRoute":"/people/person-0407","birthDate":"2097-01-20","birthday":"01-20","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"care-queue-coordination","name":"진료 대기 조정","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"전용 침상 거부","description":"방문 진료의 대기 순서를 맞추고, 급