5057000","region:1165058000","region:1165058100","region:1165059000","region:1165060000","region:1165061000","region:1165062000","region:1165062100","region:1165065200","region:1165066000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s04","name":"Arc","holderPersonId":"K423"}}],"clan":{"id":"c6d0-c6d0-c8fc","name":"원주 원씨","crest":"clan-crests/c6d0-c6d0-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":30,"무력":-50,"물질":0,"공동":10,"원칙":35,"공개":25,"자격":30,"분산":45,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-10,"위험":5,"과시":15,"지속":0,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"중증도 표 게시·회의 응급 처치 조정","소속":"Arc","공동체 역할":"일반 시민","직무":"의사 방문일 순서 정리","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 30 | 무력 −50 | 물질 0 | 공동 10 | 원칙 35 | 공개 25 | 자격 30 | 분산 45 | 변혁 20","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −10 | 위험 5 | 과시 15 | 지속 0 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2097-01-20에 태어난 원새울은 겨울의 반포본동에서 자유도시 의사가 오는 날 대기 순서 정리를 돕는다. 대기 줄 기록과 서명을 확인하며 정부가 수여하는 관직와 이웃 사이의 도움을 구분한다.\n- 원새울은 반포본동에서 의사 방문일 순서 정리를 돕는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","직무":"공동체 역할은 일반 시민이며 의사 방문일 순서 정리는 이웃 사이의 도움이다. 이 일은 Arc 내부의 도움이고 대한민국 정부 공무원 관직이나 품계가 아니다.","일화":"","관계":"원새울의 기존 관계 기록은 다음과 같다. 심유리의 중재실 옆 침상을 맡고, 방마빛의 대합실 대기와 줄을 나눈다.","목표":"원새울은 의사 방문일 순서 정리의 서명·인계·공개 절차를 반포본동 장부에서 검증 가능하게 유지하려 한다.","공포":"의사 방문일 순서 기록이 바뀌어 원새울의 책임 범위와 이웃에게 공개한 순서가 함께 무너지는 것.","개입":"원새울은 관련 서명과 인계 시각을 대조하고 기록을 공개할 수 있지만 새 관직·품계·권리·영지를 부여할 수는 없다."},"biography":"원새울은 겨울의 반포본동에서 의사 방문일 순서 기록과 교대 서명을 먼저 대조한다. 연료·식량·방문 일정이 겹치는 날에는 접수 시각과 인계 순서를 같은 장부에 남긴다.\n\n- 생업: 중증도 표 게시·회의 응급 처치 조정\n- 소속: Arc\n- 공동체 역할: 일반 시민\n- 직무: 의사 방문일 순서 정리\n**생애.** 2097-01-20에 태어난 원새울은 겨울의 반포본동에서 자유도시 의사가 오는 날 대기 순서 정리를 돕는다. 대기 줄 기록과 서명을 확인하며 정부가 수여하는 관직와 이웃 사이의 도움을 구분한다.\n- 원새울은 반포본동에서 의사 방문일 순서 정리를 돕는다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·직위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**직무.** 공동체 역할은 일반 시민이며 의사 방문일 순서 정리는 이웃 사이의 도움이다. 이 일은 Arc 내부의 도움이고 대한민국 정부 공무원 관직이나 품계가 아니다.\n\n**관계.** 원새울의 기존 관계 기록은 다음과 같다. 심유리의 중재실 옆 침상을 맡고, 방마빛의 대합실 대기와 줄을 나눈다.\n\n**목표.** 원새울은 의사 방문일 순서 정리의 서명·인계·공개 절차를 반포본동 장부에서 검증 가능하게 유지하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 의사 방문일 순서 기록이 바뀌어 원새울의 책임 범위와 이웃에게 공개한 순서가 함께 무너지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 원새울은 관련 서명과 인계 시각을 대조하고 기록을 공개할 수 있지만 새 관직·품계·권리·영지를 부여할 수는 없다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 30 | 무력 −50 | 물질 0 | 공동 10 | 원칙 35 | 공개 25 | 자격 30 | 분산 45 | 변혁 20\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −10 | 위험 5 | 과시 15 | 지속 0 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"원새울","type":"계약","to":"심유리","basis":"심유리의 중재실 옆 침상을 맡고"},{"from":"원새울","type":"계약","to":"방마빛","basis":"방마빛의 대합실 대기와 줄을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0408', 'c601-c601-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0408","name":"Yeong Maon","title":"Southern Outskirts Patrol","position":"Southern Outskirts Patrol","characterId":"K407","rank":"Guild Member","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Assigning escort personnel, verifying authority to fire","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-16#inmul-yeong-maon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0408","birthDate":"2086-09-13","birthday":"09-13","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"escort-deployment","name":"Escort deployment","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"evidenced-choice","name":"Restrains escalation","description":"Deploys escort personnel and withholds firing authority before sealed orders. Removes those who boast about shooting from escorts.","behavior":"Shown in the confirmed choice: Restrains escalation. It is not established as an invariable disposition in other situations.","stress":"May check orders first when armed envoys approach.","relationship":"Shares shifts with Seon Hansom and protects Ha Seojin’s drafts on the road.","effects":[]},{"id":"handover-continuity","name":"Concern for record continuity","description":"Assigning escort personnel, verifying authority to fire","behavior":"Seeks to check the continuity of assigned records and signatures.","stress":"","relationship":"Shares shifts with Seon Hansom and protects Ha Seojin’s drafts on the road.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Deploys escort personnel and withholds firing authority before sealed orders. Removes those who boast about shooting from escorts.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c601-c601-cc9c","name":"Yeongcheon Yeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c601-c601-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":30,"Force":-20,"Material":5,"Communal":15,"Principle":35,"Public":30,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":5,"Display":-25,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Assigning escort personnel, verifying authority to fire","Affiliation":"Arc","Community Role":"Guild Member","Duty":"Southern Outskirts Patrol","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 30 | Force −20 | Materialism 5 | Communal 15 | Principle 35 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 20","Desires":"Craving −10 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk 5 | Display −25 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Fluid | Union None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2086-09-13, Yeong Maon handles the duties of the Southern Outskirts Patrol at the Suseo Station union workshop in the winter. Checking direct union-member elections and open-vote records, Yeong distinguishes offices conferred by the Government from community duties.\n- Yeong Maon handles the duties of the Southern Outskirts Patrol at the Suseo Station union workshop in Suseo-dong. This duty reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or possession rights.","Duty":"The community role is guild member, and the duty is outer tunnel patrol. This duty is an internal function of the Arc and is neither an official post of the Republic of Korea government nor a rank.","Anecdote":"","Relationships":"Yeong Maon''s existing relationship record is as follows. Enforces Ha Seojin''s draft escort on the road, and shares rotations with Seon Hansom''s underground defense. Supports Jang Sehwa''s consultation preparations on the Outer Road.","Goals":"Yeong Maon intends to keep the signing, handover, and disclosure procedures of the Southern Outskirts Patrol''s work verifiable in the Suseo Station union ledger.","Fear":"The signature or handover records of the Southern Outskirts Patrol''s work being altered, so that Yeong Maon''s scope of responsibility and the union members'' disclosure procedure collapse together.","Intervention":"Yeong Maon can cross-check the relevant signatures and handover times and make the records public, but cannot grant new offices, ranks, rights, or holdings."},"biography":"At the Daechi 1-dong workshop in the winter, Yeong Maon first cross-checks the outer tunnel patrol work records against the shift signatures. On days when fuel, food and patrol schedules overlap, the receipt times and handover order are recorded in the same ledger.\n\n- Livelihood: Assigning escort personnel, verifying authority to fire\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Community Role: Guild Member\n- Duty: Southern Outskirts Patrol\n**Life.** Born on 2086-09-13, Yeong Maon handles the duties of the Southern Outskirts Patrol at the Suseo Station union workshop in the winter. Checking direct union-member elections and open-vote records, Yeong distinguishes offices conferred by the Government from community duties.\n- Yeong Maon handles the duties of the Southern Outskirts Patrol at the Suseo Station union workshop in Suseo-dong. This duty reference point does not fix a residence, exact facility boundaries, a rank, a holding, or possession rights.\n\n**Duty.** The community role is guild member, and the duty is outer tunnel patrol. This duty is an internal function of the Arc and is neither an official post of the Republic of Korea government nor a rank.\n\n**Relationships.** Yeong Maon''s existing relationship record is as follows. Enforces Ha Seojin''s draft escort on the road, and shares rotations with Seon Hansom''s underground defense. Supports Jang Sehwa''s consultation preparations on the Outer Road.\n\n**Goal.** Yeong Maon intends to keep the signing, handover, and disclosure procedures of the Southern Outskirts Patrol''s work verifiable in the Suseo Station union ledger.\n\n**Fear.** The signature or handover records of the Southern Outskirts Patrol''s work being altered, so that Yeong Maon''s scope of responsibility and the union members'' disclosure procedure collapse together.\n\n**Intervention.** Yeong Maon can cross-check the relevant signatures and handover times and make the records public, but cannot grant new offices, ranks, rights, or holdings.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 30 | Force −20 | Materialism 5 | Communality 15 | Principle 35 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly 5 | Risk 5 | Display −25 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yeong Maon","type":"Command","to":"Ha Seojin","basis":"enforces Ha Seojin''s draft escort on the road, and"},{"from":"Yeong Maon","type":"Command","to":"Seon Hansom","basis":"Shares rotations with Seon Hansom''s underground defense"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Seon Chobyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Yeong Maon","basis":"Shares the order of turns with Yeong Maon''s comparison table"},{"from":"Cheon Neuru","type":"Contract","to":"Yeong Maon","basis":"Hands the rear-gate survey over to Yeong Maon, and"},{"from":"Seon Hansom","type":"Contract","to":"Yeong Maon","basis":"Shares rotations with Yeong Maon''s outer patrol"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0408","name":"영마온","title":"남부 외곽 순찰대","position":"남부 외곽 순찰대","characterId":"K407","rank":"