a rank.\n\n**Relationships.** Won Choon''s existing relationship records are as follows. Shares duty with Su Neulgyeol''s maintenance bay, and places Eun Boram''s recommendation bulletin board at the very top of the blackboard.\n\n**Goal.** Won Choon aims to keep the signing, handover, and disclosure procedures of the Suseo Station Guild Vehicle Depot Duty Chief work verifiable in the Suseo Station Guild ledger.\n\n**Fear.** That the signatures or handover records of the Suseo Station Guild Vehicle Depot Duty Chief work will be altered, so that Won Choon''s scope of responsibility and the members'' disclosure procedure collapse together.\n\n**Intervention.** Won Choon can cross-check the relevant signatures and handover times and make the records public, but cannot grant new offices, ranks, rights, or holdings.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −25 | Materialism 10 | Community 20 | Principle 20 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 40 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 15 | Display 20 | Persistence 30 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Bonding: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Won Choon","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Boram","basis":"places Eun Boram''s recommendation board at the very top of the blackboard"},{"from":"Won Choon","type":"Contract","to":"Su Neulgyeol","basis":"Shares Su Neulgyeol''s maintenance bay and duty shifts, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Su Neulgyeol","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Won Choon","basis":"Shares tools with Won Choon''s base duty"},{"from":"Cho Jinsol","type":"Oath","to":"Won Choon","basis":"Overlapping Won Choon''s depot duty blackboard with testimony, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0414","name":"원초온","title":"수서 차량기지 당직장","position":"수서 차량기지 당직장","characterId":"K413","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"차량정비소 당직 명부·출고 시각 게시","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-16#인