de the receipt time but writes it in the next shift ledger and passes it on to his successor.","Anecdote":"In 2125, upon receiving a report that the sleepers had sunk from a leak beneath the frozen track in Oryu 2-dong, he immediately closed the dispatch section. Because of this, the signature for the Work Crew Courier post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Bak Doyun is Lee Ilseop''s direct courier, in charge of delivering messages and confirming receipt.","Ambition":"","Fear":"","Intervention":""},"biography":"\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Transfer Message Delivery\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Work Crew Courier\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Raised in the Sinnae transfer watch. The Work Crew Courier post opened when he stopped a ticketless departing train.\n- Work location: Oryu 2-dong. If a message is late in the frozen passage, he does not hide the receipt time but writes it in the next shift ledger and passes it on to his successor.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Work Crew Courier.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, upon receiving a report that the sleepers had sunk from a leak beneath the frozen track in Oryu 2-dong, he immediately closed the dispatch section. Because of this, the signature for the Work Crew Courier post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Bak Doyun is Lee Ilseop''s direct courier, in charge of delivering messages and confirming receipt.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 30 | Force −10 | Material 35 | Communal 35 | Principle 10 | Publicity 45 | Qualification 40 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −15 | Display −20 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: None\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K998","name":"I Ilseop","courtId":"court:K998","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bak Doyun","type":"Command","to":"I Ilseop","basis":"Serves as Lee Ilseop''s direct courier, in charge of delivering 