ion records and separates the labor records to be put on the Council agenda from the military household register copy the Guard Corps demands.","Ambition":"","Fear":"That the citizenship copy will be mixed with the military household register demand and Kim Nayul''s shift records will be misused.","Intervention":"The player can cross-check Cha Yewon''s citizenship copy against the registry original, or mark names missing from Kim Nayul''s shift chalkboard."},"biography":"Cha Yewon marks omissions in the citizenship copy without mixing military household register demands with labor shifts.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Registration & Records\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Restoration Service Registrar\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. The Restoration Service Records Officer post opened through the deletion of a single line from the double ledger.\n- Work location: Guro 2-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Ordinary Citizen.\n\n**Relationships.** Gim Nayul checks the actual shift and registration records and separates the labor records to be put on the Council agenda from the military household register copy the Guard Corps demands.\n\n**Fear.** That the citizenship copy will be mixed with the military household register demand and Kim Nayul''s shift records will be misused.\n\n**Intervention.** The player can cross-check Cha Yewon''s citizenship copy against the registry original, or mark names missing from Kim Nayul''s shift chalkboard.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 15 | Force −10 | Material 35 | Communal 30 | Principle 20 | Publicity 45 | Qualification 50 | Dispersal 30 | Transformation 25\n- Desires: Craving −20 | Monopoly −30 | Risk 30 | Display −45 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Cha Yewon","type":"Contract","to":"Kim Nayul","basis":"Gim Nayul checks the actual shift and registration records and separates the labor records to be put on the Council agenda from the military household register copy the Guard Corps demands."}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0457","name":"차예원","title":"복구복무 기록관","position":"복구복무 기록관","characterId":"K457","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"등기·기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S4","state":"geography:duchy:11620","stateName":"관악구","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-차예원","detailRoute":"/people/person-0457","birthDate":"2098-10-29","birthday":"10-29","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k457-citizenship-register-check","name":"시민권 등기 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k457-action-priority","name":"복구복무 기록관","description":"직함은 복구복무 기록관.","behavior":"직함은 복구복무 기록관.","stress":"수리 기록 당직이 비면 고장 난 난방과 셔터가 방치되어 한파에 사람이 얼어 죽는 것.","relationship":"같은 생활권 선배 당직과 인수인계로 묶인다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k457-bounded-handover","name":"기록으로 잇는 당직","description":"열쇠와 기록을 다음 당직에 넘기며 권한을 늘리지 않는다.","behavior":"열쇠와 기록을 다음 당직에 넘기며 권한을 늘리지 않는다.","stress":"수리 기록 당직이 비면 고장 난 난방과 셔터가 방치되어 한파에 사람이 얼어 죽는 것.","relationship":"같은 생활권 선배 당직과 인수인계로 묶인다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"짧은 행위와 인수인계가 근거여서 다른 분야의 숙련이나 보정은 발급하지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11620-S02","name":{"k