Id":"holding:opening-barony-gu-44133-S02","directLiegePersonId":"K998"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d55c-ccad-c8fc","name":"Han Clan of Cheongju","crest":"clan-crests/d55c-ccad-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":20,"Force":-20,"Material":35,"Communal":50,"Principle":10,"Public":45,"Eligibility":50,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":-10,"Display":-25,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Transfer Message Delivery","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Work Crew Courier","Work Location":"Guro 5-dong. Han Hyeonu matches the workshop release slips to be submitted to the Guro 5-dong council against the dispatch sheet. As on the watch that stopped the unsigned train, this time too she returns slips missing receipt confirmation and writes the handover time for the next messenger.","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 20 | Force −20 | Material 35 | Communal 50 | Principle 10 | Publicity 45 | Credentials 50 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 20","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly 15 | Risk −10 | Display −25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation None | Bonding Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in the 2126 generation. Raised on the Sinnae transfer watch. The Work Crew Messenger post opened through stopping an unticketed departing train.\n- Work location: Guro 5-dong. Han Hyeonu matches the workshop release slips to be submitted to the Guro 5-dong council against the dispatch sheet. As on the watch that stopped the unsigned train, this time too she returns slips missing receipt confirmation and writes the handover time for the next messenger.","Offices":"Rank: Guild Member. Title: Work Crew Courier. As on the watch that stopped the unsigned train, this time too she returns slips missing receipt confirmation and writes the handover time for the next messenger.","Anecdote":"In 2125 she stopped a train without a dispatch sheet and prevented an unsigned departure. Because of this, the signature for the Work Crew Messenger post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Han Hyeonu carries the work crew''s transfer messages to Pyo Yedam''s holding-track dispatch board. On finding a departure without a dispatch sheet, Han Hyeonu reports what the missing signature covers, so that no unverified train cuts into the maintenance, engineering, and ration order Pyo Yedam has published.","Ambition":"Han Hyeonu intends to deliver only messages that have both a dispatch sheet and a receipt signature, so that no unverified train departs.","Fear":"That a departure on the dispatch board is confirmed by a message without a receipt signature, letting an unverified train cut in.","Intervention":"The player can match workshop release slips against the dispatch sheet with Han Hyeonu, or return unsigned slips and write the handover time."},"biography":"Han Hyeonu would rather hand a message over late at the next shift than send one missing its receipt signature.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Livelihood: Transfer Message Delivery\n- Rank: Guild Member\n- Title: Work Crew Courier\n**Life.** Born in the 2126 generation. Raised on the Sinnae transfer watch. The Work Crew Messenger post opened through stopping an unticketed departing train.\n- Work location: Guro 5-dong. Han Hyeonu matches the workshop release slips to be submitted to the Guro 5-dong council against the dispatch sheet. As on the watch that stopped the unsigned train, this time too she returns slips missing receipt confirmation and writes the handover time for the next messenger.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Guild Member. Title: Work Crew Courier.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 she stopped a train without a dispatch sheet and prevented an unsigned departure. Because of this, the signature for the Work Crew Messenger post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Han Hyeonu carries the work crew''s transfer messages to Pyo Yedam''s holding-track dispatch board. On finding a departure without a dispatch sheet, Han Hyeonu reports what the missing signature covers, so that no unverified train cuts into the maintenance, engineering, and ration order Pyo Yedam has published.\n\n**Ambition.** Han Hyeonu intends to deliver only messages that have both a dispatch sheet and a receipt signature, so that no unverified train departs.\n\n**Fear.** That a departure on the dispatch board is confirmed by a message without a receipt signature, letting an unverified train cut in.\n\n**Intervention.** The player can match workshop release slips against the dispatch sheet with Han Hyeonu, or return unsigned slips and write the handover time.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 20 | Force −20 | Material 35 | Communal 50 | Principle 10 | Publicity 45 | Credentials 50 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly 15 | Risk −10 | Display −25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation None | Bonding Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Han Hyeonu","type":"Contract","to":"Pyo Yedam","basis":"Han Hyeonu carries the work crew''s transfer messages to Pyo Yedam''s holding-track dispatch board. On finding a departure without a dispatch sheet, Han Hyeonu reports what the missing signature covers, so that no unverified train cuts into the maintenance, engineering, and ration order Pyo Yedam has published."}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0473","name":"한현우","title":"작업반 전령","position":"작업반 전령","characterId":"K473","rank":"조합원","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"환승 전갈 전달","gender":"여성","stage":"S4","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-한현우","detailRoute":"/people/person-0473","birthDate":"2098-07-28","birthday":"07-28","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmissi