disassembled a stopped pump and replaced one worn shaft. Specific repair is supported, not comprehensive manufacture or invention.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-43730-S04","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K507","stateId":"S04","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s04","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-43730-S04","directLiegePersonId":"K423"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c815-acbd-c8fc-912d","name":"Gyeongju Jeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c815-acbd-c8fc-912d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":5,"Openness":0,"Force":-30,"Material":40,"Communal":40,"Principle":-10,"Public":-25,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":40,"Display":10,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"Wheel & Pump Maintenance","Rank":"Ordinary Citizen","Title":"Parts Logistics Merchant","Values":"Authority 5 | Openness 0 | Force −30 | Materialism 40 | Community 40 | Principle −10 | Publicity −25 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 5 | Possessiveness 40 | Risk 40 | Display 10 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Jeong Bajun grew up at Sinjeong Depot. Jeong Bajun took the Parts Logistics Officer post after reporting a defect just before a derailment.\n- Jeong Bajun''s Parts Logistics Officer duties are connected to Cheonho 3-dong.","Offices":"Jeong Bajun hands over only the keys and records attached to her own post. She does not invent authority that does not exist.","Anecdote":"In 2125, Jeong Bajun took apart a stalled pump, replaced just one worn shaft, and got it running again. Because of this, the signature for the Parts Logistics Officer post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Jeong Bajun is bound by handover to a senior watch keeper from the same living area.","Ambition":"On the Parts Logistics Officer watch, Jeong Bajun wants to keep the Arc''s ledger connected without a break.","Fear":"","Intervention":"Jeong Bajun can bring in a witness to the watch handover or expose an empty key."},"biography":"Jeong Bajun chooses first not to break the watch. Jeong Bajun trusts a single line in the ledger over loud talk.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: Wheel & Pump Maintenance\n- Rank: Ordinary Citizen\n- Title: Parts Logistics Merchant\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Jeong Bajun grew up at Sinjeong Depot. Jeong Bajun took the Parts Logistics Officer post after reporting a defect just before a derailment.\n- Jeong Bajun''s Parts Logistics Officer duties are connected to Cheonho 3-dong.\n\n**Office.** Jeong Bajun hands over only the keys and records attached to her own post. She does not invent authority that does not exist.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, Jeong Bajun took apart a stalled pump, replaced just one worn shaft, and got it running again. Because of this, the signature for the Parts Logistics Officer post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Jeong Bajun is bound by handover to a senior watch keeper from the same living area.\n\n**Ambition.** On the Parts Logistics Officer watch, Jeong Bajun wants to keep the Arc''s ledger connected without a break.\n\n**Intervention.** Jeong Bajun can bring in a witness to the watch handover or expose an empty key.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness 0 | Force −30 | Materialism 40 | Community 40 | Principle −10 | Publicity −25 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Possessiveness 40 | Risk 40 | Display 10 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0507","name":"정바준","title":"부품 물류상","position":"부품 물류상","characterId":"K507","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"차륜·펌프 정비","gender":"여성","stage":"S4","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-04#인물-정바준","detailRoute":"/people/person-0507","birthDate":"2096-05-19","birthday":"05-19","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"pump","name":"펌프 분해·축 교체","rating":55},{"id":"wheel","name":"차륜 결함 점검","rating":40}],"traits":[{"id":"replace-only-worn-axles","name":"마모 축만 교체","description":"정바준은 확인된 마모 부위에 수리를 한정하는 실용적 성향을 보인다.","behavior":"멈춘 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 교체하고 다시 가동했다.","stress":"","relationship":"선배 당직과 인계할 때는 교체한 축처럼 확인된 작업 내용을 중심으로 설명할 수 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"duty-continuity-through-maintenance","name":"정비로 당직 연결","description":"정바준은 구체적 정비를 당직과 장부의 연속성을 지키는 수단으로 여긴다.","behavior":"펌프를 재가동하는 수리로 중단을 해소하고 자기 직위의 열쇠와 기록을 넘긴다.","stress":"","relationship":"선배 당직과는 수리 결과와 직위 기록을 이어 주는 인계를 통해 협력하려 할 수 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"정지 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나를 갈았다. 구체적 정비 수행만 평가하며 제조·발명 전체 능력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-43730-S04","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K507","stateId":"S04","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s04","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-43730-S04","directLiegePersonId":"K423"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c815-acbd-c8fc-912d","name":"경주 정씨","crest":"clan-crests/c815-acbd-c8fc-912d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":5,"개방":0,"무력":-30,"물질":40,"공동":40,"원칙":-10,"공개":-25,"자격":25,"분산":25,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":40,"위험":40,"과시":10,"지속":10,"지향":"양성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"Arc","생업":"차륜·펌프 정비","품계":"일반 시민","직함":"부품 물류상","가치관":"권위 5 | 개방 0 | 무력 −30 | 물질 40 | 공동 40 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 −25 | 자격 25 | 분산 25 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 40 | 위험 40 | 과시 10 | 지속 10 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 정바준은 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 정바준은 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 부품 물류상 자리를 맡았다.\n- 정바준의 부품 물류상 업무는 천호3동과 연결된다.","관직":"정바준은 자신의 직위에 딸린 열쇠와 기록만 인계한다. 없는 권한은 만들지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 정바준은 정지했던 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 갈아 다시 돌렸다. 이 일로 부품 물류상 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"정바준은 같은 생활권 선배 당직자와 인수인계로 묶인다.","야망":"정바준은 부품 물류상 당직에서 Arc의 장부를 끊기지 않게 잇고자 한다.","공포":"","개입":"정바준은 당직 인수 증인을 세우거나 빈 열쇠를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"정바준은 당직을 끊지 않는 쪽을 먼저 고른다. 정바준은 큰소리보다 장부 한 줄을 믿는다.\n\n- 소속: Arc\n- 생업: 차륜·펌프 정비\n- 품계: 일반 시민\n- 직함: 부품 물류상\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 정바준은 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 정바준은 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 부품 물류상 자리를 맡았다.\n- 정바준의 부품 물류상 업무는 천호3동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 정바준은 자신의 직위에 딸린 열쇠와 기록만 인계한다. 없는 권한은 만들지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 정바준은 정지했던 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 갈아 다시 돌렸다. 이 일로 부품 물류상 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 정바준은 같은 생활권 선배 당직자와 인수인계로 묶인다.\n\n**야망.** 정바준은 부품 물류상 당직에서 Arc의 장부를 끊기지 않게 잇고자 한다.\n\n**개입.** 정바준은 당직 인수 증인을 세우거나 빈 열쇠를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 5 | 개방 0 | 무력 −30 | 물질 40 | 공동 40 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 −25 | 자격 25 | 분산 25 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 40 | 위험 40 | 과시 10 | 지속 10 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0508', 'ac15-c9c4-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0508","name":"Kang Hajun","title":"Eastern Command Guard Squad","position":"Eastern Patrol","rank":"Guard","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Night Patrol & Guard Code Tag Replacement","gender":"Male","stage":"S4","state":"S05","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0508","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":6,"effective":6},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":5,"effective":5},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}}}}', '{"id":"person-0508","name":"강하준","title":"동방사 경비조","position":"동부 순찰대","rank":"경비대원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"야간 순찰·경비 암호패 교체","gender":"남성","stage":"S4","state":"S05","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0508","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":6,"effective":6},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":5,"effective":5},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0509', 'c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99', '{"id":"person-0509","name":"Jo Saejun","title":"Ratification Registrar","position":"Ratification Registrar","characterId":"K509","rank":"Ordinary Citizen","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Drying and Transcribing Water-Damaged Ratification Documents","gender":"Female","stage":"S4","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-jo-saejun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0509","birthDate":"2088-12-18","birthday":"12-18","age":38,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":3,"effective":3},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k509-document-copy","name":"Document drying and copying","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k509-choice","name":"Preserves wet documents","description":"Anecdote. In 2125 she dried ratification papers soaked on the platform and left a hand copy. By this deed the signature of the ratification registrar post rose into the ledger. A lasting disposition beyond this choice is unconfirmed.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125 she dried ratification papers soaked on the platform and left a hand copy. By this deed the signature of the ratification registrar post rose into the ledger.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Bound by handover to the senior duty line of the same living quarters.","effects":[]},{"id":"k509-boundary","name":"Values duty continuity","description":"The source favors unbroken shifts and written records. Repeated wording does not establish a distinctive exceptional virtue.","behavior":"She chose the side that kept the duty line unbroken first. She trusted one line of the ledger more than a loud voice.","stress":"","relationship":"Relations. Bound by handover to the senior duty line of the same living quarters.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Anecdote. In 2125 she dried ratification papers soaked on the platform and left a hand copy. By this deed the signature of the ratification registrar post rose into the ledger. Only one anecdote and repeated duty wording are available; enduring disposition, broader experience, and later results remain unconfirmed.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-28177-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K509","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-28177-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99","name":"Baecheon Jo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-20,"Force":-20,"Material":-20,"Communal":10,"Principle":75,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-35},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":-25,"Display":-40,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Drying and Transcribing Water-Damaged Ratification Documents","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Ratification Registrar","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness −20 | Force −20 | Materialism −20 | Community 10 | Principle 75 | Publicity −15 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −35","Desires":"Craving −5 | Exclusivity 40 | Risk −25 | Display −40 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Opposite sex | Union None"},"sections":{"Life":"Raised at the Seoul Station registry office. The Ratification Records Officer post opened through the deletion of a single line from a double ledger.\n- Jo Saejun''s work of drying and transcribing wet ratification documents is connected to Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"The grade appropriate to a headquarters or field-office post in the Seoul Metropolitan Government, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Assistant Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Assistant Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 9). Duties: Confirmation Records Officer.","Anecdote":"In 2125, on a platform, she dried water-soaked ratification documents and preserved them as transcribed copies. Because of this, the signature for the Ratification Records Officer post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Through the handover of the work of drying and transcribing wet ratification documents, she is connected to a senior watch member of the same living sphere.","Ambition":"From the Ratification Records Officer post, she continues the records of drying and transcribing wet ratification documents so that the ledger of the Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Servants'' Organization is not broken between watches.","Fear":"","Intervention":"She can bring in a witness to the watch handover of the work of drying and transcribing wet ratification documents, or expose the empty key of that post."},"biography":"She chooses not to let records break, even when the ratification documents are wet. She trusts a transcribed copy preserved by drying more than loud talk.\n\n- Livelihood: Drying and Transcribing Water-Damaged Ratification Documents\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position and Grade: The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)\n- Assigned Duties: Ratification Registrar\n**Life.** Raised at the Seoul Station registry office. The Ratification Records Officer post opened through the deletion of a single line from a double ledger.\n- Jo Saejun''s work of drying and transcribing wet ratification documents is connected to Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Servant Position and Grade.** The grade appropriate to a headquarters or field-office post in the Seoul Metropolitan Government, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Assistant Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Assistant Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 9). Duties: Confirmation Records Officer.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, on a platform, she dried water-soaked ratification documents and preserved them as transcribed copies. Because of this, the signature for the Ratification Records Officer post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Through the handover of the work of drying and transcribing wet ratification documents, she is connected to a senior watch member of the same living sphere.\n\n**Ambition.** From the Ratification Records Officer post, she continues the records of drying and transcribing wet ratification documents so that the ledger of the Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Servants'' Organization is not broken between watches.\n\n**Intervention.** She can bring in a witness to the watch handover of the work of drying and transcribing wet ratification documents, or expose the empty key of that post.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness −20 | Force −20 | Materialism −20 | Community 10 | Principle 75 | Publicity −15 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −35\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Exclusivity 40 | Risk −25 | Display −40 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Opposite sex | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jo Saejun","type":"Contract","to":"Eo Taesan","basis":"Jo Saejun takes a transcript of the water-soaked ratification document, together with the original, to Eo Taesan. Eo Taesan finds the stored ratification date to confirm the smudged date, but does not retroactively alter the date on the late-arriving copy."}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0509","name":"조새준","title":"인준 기록관","position":"인준 기록관","characterId":"K509","rank":"일반 시민","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"젖은 인준 문서 건조·필사","gender":"여성","stage":"S4","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-조새준","detailRoute":"/people/person-0509","birthDate":"2088-12-18","birthday":"12-18","age":38,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":3,"effective":3},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k509-document-copy","name":"문서 건조 필사","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k509-choice","name":"젖은 문서를 남김","description":"일화. 2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 인준 기록관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다. 이 선택을 넘어선 지속 성향은 미확인이다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 인준 기록관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 같은 생활권 선배 당직과 인수인계로 묶인다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k509-boundary","name":"당직 연속성을 중시","description":"당직 공백을 피하고 기록을 믿는 원문 성향이다. 반복 문구이므로 개인의 특별한 장점으로 확대하지 않는다.","behavior":"당직을 끊지 않는 쪽을 먼저 고른다. 큰소리보다 장부 한 줄을 믿는다.","stress":"","relationship":"관계. 같은 생활권 선배 당직과 인수인계로 묶인다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일화. 2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 인준 기록관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다. 단일 일화와 반복 당직 문구만 있어 장기 성향·광범위 경력·후속 결과는 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-28177-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K509","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-28177-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99","name":"배천 조씨","crest":"clan-crests/c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":-20,"무력":-20,"물질":-20,"공동":10,"원칙":75,"공개":-15,"자격":10,"분산":-25,"변혁":-35},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":40,"위험":-25,"과시":-40,"지속":-10,"지향":"이성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"젖은 인준 문서 건조·필사","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"인준 기록관","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 75 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −35","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 40 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −40 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 인준 기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 조새준의 젖은 인준 문서 건조·필사 업무는 회현동과 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 인준 기록관.","일화":"2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 인준 기록관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"젖은 인준 문서 건조·필사 업무의 인수인계를 통해 같은 생활권의 선배 당직과 이어진다.","야망":"인준 기록관 자리에서 젖은 인준 문서 건조·필사 기록을 이어 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직의 장부가 당직 사이에 끊기지 않게 한다.","공포":"","개입":"젖은 인준 문서 건조·필사 업무의 당직 인수 증인을 세우거나, 그 직위의 빈 열쇠를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"젖은 인준 문서라도 기록이 끊기게 두지 않는 쪽을 택한다. 큰소리보다 말려 남긴 필사본을 믿는다.\n\n- 생업: 젖은 인준 문서 건조·필사\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 인준 기록관\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 인준 기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 조새준의 젖은 인준 문서 건조·필사 업무는 회현동과 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 인준 기록관.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 인준 기록관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 젖은 인준 문서 건조·필사 업무의 인수인계를 통해 같은 생활권의 선배 당직과 이어진다.\n\n**야망.** 인준 기록관 자리에서 젖은 인준 문서 건조·필사 기록을 이어 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직의 장부가 당직 사이에 끊기지 않게 한다.\n\n**개입.** 젖은 인준 문서 건조·필사 업무의 당직 인수 증인을 세우거나, 그 직위의 빈 열쇠를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 75 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −35\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 40 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −40 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"조새준","type":"계약","to":"어태산","basis":"조새준은 젖은 인준 문서의 필사본을 원본과 함께 어태산에게 가져간다. 어태산은 보관한 인준일을 찾아 지워진 날짜를 확인하되 늦게 온 사본의 날짜를 소급해 고치지 않는다."}],"incoming":[]}}');
